export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"partcraft","name":"PartCraft","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","brave":"Brave","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"whats-new","scope":"partcraft","title":"What's new in 0.10","summary":"Big parts open without freezing the window, an assembly over the part limit says how many parts it places, and fixes for DXF units, the Design toolbar and Library items.","section":"start","order":5,"keywords":["whats new","what's new","0.10","release notes","changelog","changes","version","new features","big parts","freeze","holes","plate","large assembly","part limit","50000 parts","instance list","dxf","inches","units","design toolbar","enter","library","ifc class","pro layouts","trackpad","swipe","tour"],"headings":[{"id":"new","text":"New","level":2},{"id":"fixed","text":"Fixed","level":2},{"id":"in-every-app","text":"In every app","level":2},{"id":"said-plainly","text":"Said plainly","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThis is what changed in PartCraft 0.10, compared with 0.9. It is a small release for this app, about big parts and big assemblies.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"new\"\u003ENew\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBig parts open without freezing.\u003C/strong\u003E The longest freeze on opening a 1,600-hole plate went from 7.9 s to 0.16 s. The work moved off the page; the total time is about the same.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELarge assemblies.\u003C/strong\u003E A file over the 50,000-part limit now says how many parts it places, instead of &quot;The assembly has no instance list.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fixed\"\u003EFixed\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDXF files from PartCraft were read as inches in other programs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe Design toolbar wrapped to two rows at 1440 px, and a single digit typed for the selected feature was not set by \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELibrary items were written without an IFC class.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"in-every-app\"\u003EIn every app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDocking tool groups.\u003C/strong\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, a group of tools can be docked as a palette beside the part. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/dock-tool-groups\" data-topic=\"basics/dock-tool-groups\"\u003EDock a group of tools\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFour Pro layouts\u003C/strong\u003E (Ribbon, Workbench, Review, Studio) in an optional Pro skin, in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA two-finger trackpad swipe pans\u003C/strong\u003E the sketch and the sheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETour tips\u003C/strong\u003E have one \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E button; the X closes the tour.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"said-plainly\"\u003ESaid plainly\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAssemblies open up to 50,000 parts and 100,000 joints; raising the limits waits on a browser measurement.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every slow path on a big part has moved off the page yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDocking tool groups has not been tried on two monitors.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe new tools were checked by automated tests in a browser, not yet by a person on a real project.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELanguages beyond English are machine drafts, and some words new in 0.10 are still English only.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor the version before this one, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/whats-new-0-9\" data-topic=\"partcraft/whats-new-0-9\"\u003EWhat&#039;s new in 0.9\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"This is what changed in PartCraft 0.10, compared with 0.9. It is a small release for this app, about big parts and big assemblies. New Big parts open without freezing. The longest freeze on opening a 1,600-hole plate went from 7.9 s to 0.16 s. The work moved off the page; the total time is about the same. Large assemblies. A file over the 50,000-part limit now says how many parts it places, instead of \"The assembly has no instance list.\" Fixed DXF files from PartCraft were read as inches in other programs. The Design toolbar wrapped to two rows at 1440 px, and a single digit typed for the selected feature was not set by Enter. Library items were written without an IFC class. In every app Docking tool groups. In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, a group of tools can be docked as a palette beside the part. See Dock a group of tools. Four Pro layouts (Ribbon, Workbench, Review, Studio) in an optional Pro skin, in Settings › Global › Layout. A two-finger trackpad swipe pans the sketch and the sheet. Tour tips have one Next button; the X closes the tour. Said plainly Assemblies open up to 50,000 parts and 100,000 joints; raising the limits waits on a browser measurement. Not every slow path on a big part has moved off the page yet. Docking tool groups has not been tried on two monitors. The new tools were checked by automated tests in a browser, not yet by a person on a real project. Languages beyond English are machine drafts, and some words new in 0.10 are still English only. For the version before this one, see What's new in 0.9.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-9","scope":"partcraft","title":"Waxa cusub ee 0.9 (hore)","summary":"PartCraft 0.9 wuxuu ku daraa fillets ka dhexeeya wejiyada iyo ka-dhigista dhumuc jidh, isku-dhisyo ka badan kun qayb, kaydka Dokumentiyada oo leh noocyo, add-on-ka Solid FEM ee xoogga, toban habka qaansooyinka, cabbirrada birta UK, marxalada daabacaadda iyo add-ons-ka daabacaadda resin-ka.","section":"start","order":6,"keywords":["waxa cusub 0.9","nooca hore","waxa cusub","waxa cusub","xogta nooca","changelog","0.9","fillet ka dhexeeya wejiyada","rolling ball","fillet geesaha badan","thicken","solid ka wejiyada","step shell","iges solid","scan fillets","isku-dhis weyn","muuqaal fudud","20000 qayb","dokumentiyo","vault","check out","revision","release","meesha la isticmaalo","Rhino link","grasshopper","3dm","cursors","factory floor","job queue","solid fem","finite element","von mises","natural frequency","arc methods","3-point arc","uk steel sections","blue book","print stage","resin","goo","ctb","bed","lay flat","waxa cusub","release notes","changelog","isbeddel","0.8","0.8.1","nooca","astaamaha cusub","live analysis","update while editing","break it","what breaks first","load factor","nonlinear","yield","plastic strain","contact","calculix","motion study","clearance","surfaces","nurbs","fair","hull","zebra","engineer","generator","generated body","sketch from a photo","scale for printing","split for printing","shrinkage","nested sheets","g-code","drawing","dimension holes","assistant","mcp","luuqadaha","toolbar rows"],"headings":[{"id":"cusub-0-9-1","text":"Cusub 0.9.1","level":2},{"id":"cusub","text":"Cusub","level":2},{"id":"wejiyada-iyo-jidhadka","text":"Wejiyada iyo jidhadka","level":3},{"id":"isku-dhisyada-dokumentiyada-iyo-xiriirrada","text":"Isku-dhisyada, dokumentiyada iyo xiriirrada","level":3},{"id":"falanqaynta-iyo-qaybaha","text":"Falanqaynta iyo qaybaha","level":3},{"id":"daabacaadda","text":"Daabacaadda","level":3},{"id":"dhammaan-apps-ka","text":"Dhammaan apps-ka","level":2},{"id":"la-hagaajiyay","text":"La hagaajiyay","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadaha-run-ahaan","text":"Xaddidaadaha run ahaan","level":2},{"id":"hore-0-8-iyo-0-8-1","text":"Hore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1","level":2},{"id":"cusub-2","text":"Cusub","level":3},{"id":"hagaajiyay-0-8-1","text":"Hagaajiyay 0.8.1","level":3},{"id":"weli-nooca-tan-kuma-jiro","text":"Weli nooca tan kuma jiro","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETani waa waxa ka isbeddelay PartCraft 0.9, marka laga barbar dhigo 0.8.1. Dusha qalloocan hadda way isku xidhaan jidho adag, isku-dhisyada oo ka badan kun qayb ayay wali isticmaal ku noqdaan, Dokumentiyada vault-ku noocyada ayuu hayaa, add-on-ka Solid FEM-na xoogga qaybta ayuu hubiyaa. Wax kasta waxa uu sheegayaa meesha laga helayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub-0-9-1\"\u003ECusub 0.9.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExact STEP export.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E hadda way shaqeeyaan. Godyada, bosses-ka, fillets-ka, koonada, kubbadaha iyo torus-ka waxay ku qoran yihiin wejiyadooda dhabta ah, iyada oo wareegyada dhabta ah ay yihiin geesaha, si barnaamij CAD ama CAM kale u aqoonsado godka sida god. Spline sides, dhuunto la moodelay iyo meshes la soo dhoofiyay waxay ku sii jiraan facets toosan isla jidhka adag. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files#for-other-cad-programs-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\" data-hash=\"for-other-cad-programs-step\"\u003EExport for printing, STEP and DXF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTEP in, exact STEP out.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylka STEP ee aad furto wuxuu ilaaliyaa wejiyadiisa toosan, silindarrada, koonada, kubbadaha iyo torus-ka, sidaas darteed \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib ugu qoraa sida wejiyo dhab ah halkii uu ka qori lahaa facets: biim ay ku jiraan godyo boolood ah oo uu ka yimid mashiinka wax-iibiyaha wuxuu u baxaa isla wejiyadii uu ku soo galay, iyo wixii aad ku jartay. Wejiyada spline, la xoqay iyo revolve-ka faylka waxay ku sii jiraan facets, sidaas oo kale bodies-ka STL, OBJ iyo 3MF. Faylka STEP mar kale fur qaybta la kaydiyay hore. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EOpen a STEP file and build on it\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrue circles in the face DXF.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF of the sketch or flat face\u003C/span\u003E oo wejig sinaan ah la doortay hadda wuxuu godyada wareega u qoraa wareeg, oo leh bartiisa iyo radius-kiisa, miis laser, plasma ama waterjet ah. Geesaha wareegsan ee kale weli facets ayay yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExact STEP for the shop.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EManufacture\u003C/span\u003E ku jira, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExact STEP (work coordinates)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaybta ku qoraa asalkeeda asalka shaqada setup-ka iyo Z tiirka qalabka, isku-xidhka uu G-code-ku isticmaalo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture#exact-step-for-the-shop\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\" data-hash=\"exact-step-for-the-shop\"\u003EMake toolpaths and G-code\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"wejiyada-iyo-jidhadka\"\u003EWejiyada iyo jidhadka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFillet between faces.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurfaces\u003C/span\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet between faces\u003C/span\u003E. Dooro labada wejig ee hal jidh, qor radius-ka (iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadius at the end (mm, 0 = the same)\u003C/span\u003E radius-ka oo ku beddelma geeska dhererka). Safka natiijada wuxuu sheegayaa intee le&#039;eg fillet-ku uga fog yahay rolling ball-ka sida mithaal, radius-ka aan ku habboonayn waa la diidaa iyo wejiga la magacaabay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet several edges\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geesaha badan hal jeer wareegaa; calaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECorners (sphere patch where three meet)\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hesho geesta kubbadda meesha saddex geesood oo wareegsan oo wejiyo sinaan ah ay isku kulmaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nurbs-surfaces\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nurbs-surfaces\"\u003EFreeform surfaces (NURBS)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThicken into a solid.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThicken into a solid\u003C/span\u003E isla shaqadaas wuxuu wejiga siiyaa dhumuc; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOther side\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku kordhiyaa dhinaca kale. Foldka ama isgoyska is-gudbiya waa la diidaa iyada oo wejiga iyo meesha la magacaabay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESolids from surfaces.\u003C/strong\u003E Wejiyada la jaray waa la isku xidhi karaa union, subtract iyo intersect, waxaana qaybta lagu dhejiyaa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-celin ah. STEP wuxuu jidhka adag u qoraa hal shell xidhan, IGES-na hal solid; labaduba waxay soo akhrisaan sida solid. Haddii wejiyadu aanay ku dhigmin geesood ilaa geesood, faylku wuxuu helaa wejiyo kala go&#039;an, safka xaaladda ayaa sheegaya. Solids-ka waxaa kale oo lagu samayn karaa node editor-ka; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nodes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nodes\"\u003ENode editor\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERim and variable fillets in scans.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka aad surfaces ku habayso scan, rim fillets (tori) iyo variable-radius fillets geesta toosan ku wareegsan ayaa la raadiyaa oo la liisanayaa radius-keeda. Waxaa lagu tijaabiyay scans la sameeyay oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"isku-dhisyada-dokumentiyada-iyo-xiriirrada\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada, dokumentiyada iyo xiriirrada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELarge assemblies.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybaha ah nuqul waxay wadaagaan hal mesh, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELightweight display\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sanduuqyo ku sawiraa si muuqaalku u sii socdo (wuu iska shido isku-dhisyada aad u weyn; dhaqdhaqaaqyada iyo isku-xirku wali qaybaha dhabta ah ayay isticmaalaan). Geedka qaybaha wuxuu muujinayaa safafkiisa ugu horreeya iyo badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow 700 more\u003C/span\u003E ee kuwa kale. Faylasha isku-dhisyada waxay haysan karaan ilaa 50,000 instances iyo 100,000 joints. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003EBuild an assembly\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDocuments.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDocuments…\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EFile\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu furaa sanduuq ku saabsan folder-ka mashruuca: check out iyo check in, xarfaha noocyada, xaaladaha (shaqada socota, loo baahan yahay in la eego, la sii daayay, la soo afjaray), taariikhda, meesha la isticmaalo iyo liiska agabka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/documents-walkthrough\" data-topic=\"partcraft/documents-walkthrough\"\u003EDocuments and revisions (the vault)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELive Rhino link.\u003C/strong\u003E Hal script, \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/code\u003E, wuxuu daawadaa dokumentiga Rhino ama Grasshopper oo wuxuu PartCraft u riixaa kaliya wixii isbeddelay, halkaas oo astaamaha la soo dhoofiyay ku dhisma qaabka cusub. Hal jihe ayuu yahay, wuxuuna u baahan yahay Studio. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/live-3dm-link\" data-topic=\"partcraft/live-3dm-link\"\u003ELive .3dm link\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESee each other&#039;s cursors.\u003C/strong\u003E Shaqada wadaagga ah, cursor-ka qof kasta wuxuu muuqdaa magacyadiisa iyo astaamaha uu dooranayo. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/work-live\" data-topic=\"partcraft/work-live\"\u003EWork live with others\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFactory floor.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku shid add-on-ka Factory floor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E. Marka aad barnaamij ku daabacdo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EManufacture\u003C/span\u003E, tab-kiisa wuxuu awoodaa inuu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to the factory job queue\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as a job file\u003C/span\u003E. Mar weligeed ma diro mashiinna ma bilaabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"falanqaynta-iyo-qaybaha\"\u003EFalanqaynta iyo qaybaha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESolid FEM add-on.\u003C/strong\u003E Ku shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolid FEM\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E (wuu damaan yahay ilaa aad shido) oo tab \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolid FEM\u003C/span\u003E ayaa ka soo muuqanaya panel-ka midig. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMesh the part\u003C/span\u003E, dooro wejiyada go&#039;an iyo culeysyada muuqaalka 3D, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolve\u003C/span\u003E, oo muuji displacement, von Mises stress ama mode shape adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow on the model\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-fem-check\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-fem-check\"\u003ESolid FEM: a stress check\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EArc in sketches, ten ways.\u003C/strong\u003E Fallaadha ku xigta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E qalab-sanduuqa sketch-ka ayaa liisanaysa 3-Point, Start Center End, Start Center Angle, Start Center Length, Start End Angle, Start End Direction, Start End Radius, Center Start End, Center Start Angle, Center Start Length iyo Continue. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-arc-methods\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-arc-methods\"\u003EDraw an arc by ten methods\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUK steel sizes.\u003C/strong\u003E Weldments waxay isticmaali karaan 976 UK sections (UB, UC, PFC, EA, UEA, CHS, SHS, RHS); ku qor cabbir sida \u003Ccode\u003E305x165x40 UB\u003C/code\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/structural-members\" data-topic=\"partcraft/structural-members\"\u003EStructural members\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"daabacaadda\"\u003EDaabacaadda\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPrint stage.\u003C/strong\u003E Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrint stage\u003C/span\u003E qalab-sanduuqa (add-on 3D Print, oo furan caadi ahaan) wuxuu jidhadka qaybtaada ku dhigaa sariir la jarjaray: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELay flat\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETurn 90°\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange on the bed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit all on the bed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreview layers\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend to 3D printer\u003C/span\u003E oo ku dhex mara USB, Klipper (Moonraker), OctoPrint ama PrusaLink. Waxba lama diro ilaa aad xaqiijiso, qaybtaadana weligeed ma beddelmayso. Haddii aad doonto faylka STL ama 3MF, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/print-3d\"\u003EGet a part ready for 3D printing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EResin printing.\u003C/strong\u003E Add-ons \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E, oo dhammaantood damaan ilaa aad shido: slicer resin ah, imtixaan exposure ah, iyo qaabka faylalka Elegoo GOO, SL1, Chitubox CBDDLP/CTB iyo Anycubic. Slicing-ku wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa worker thread, sidaas darteed bogga waa jawaabaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhammaan-apps-ka\"\u003EDhammaan apps-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHover hint kasta waa Bootstrap tooltip.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart tip-ka wuxuu leeyahay badhanka xidhista; wuu xirnaan doonaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafka tab-yada panel-ka oo aan ku habboonayn wuxuu u socdaa dhinac ahaan halkii uu ka go&#039;i lahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETab-ka browser-ka wuxuu muujiyaa magaca dokumentiga furan ka hor PartCraft | CadCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa workspace \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E sida liis hoos-u-dhac ah oo doorashooyin, sanduuqa luuqadaha wuxuu liistaa luuqad kasta oo dhisme ku jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiisaanka iyo Heerkulka waa nooc unit ah oo ku jira dejinta Units.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-hagaajiyay\"\u003ELa hagaajiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenu-ga Arc ee sketch-ka hadda wuxuu liistaa habka kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta add-on-ka iyo magaca tab-ka browser-ka waa la saxay 2026-11-09.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadaha-run-ahaan\"\u003EXaddidaadaha run ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExact STEP waxa dib loo akhriyay OpenCascade (solids sax ah, mugga oo la mid ah kuwa gacanta lagu xisaabiyay). Weli ma furna barnaamij kasta oo CAD ama CAM ah, isku-dhisyada ma qoro exact STEP.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWeli wax lagu daabacay printer dhab ah ma jiro. Slicing, G-code iyo faylalka resin waxaa akhriyay barnaamijyadeenna ama printer-ka lagu beddelay; mid ka mid ah qaababka resin lama soo dejin printer dhab ah, cabbirrada printer-ka iyo exposures-ku waa bilow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESolid FEM waa toosan, isotropic, elastic, hal material qaybtiisa, aan contact, yielding ama buckling lahayn. Stress-ka meelaha go&#039;an iyo geesaha dhaqsan wuxuu ku xidhan yahay mesh-ka. Waa caawin hubin, ma aha mid injineer dib u eegay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaqtiyada isku-dhisyada weyn server aan GPU lahayn ayaa laga helay; frame buuxa oo faahfaahin buuxa leh oo ah 20,000 qayb weli wuxuu qaadaa dhowr ilbiriqsi halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFillets waxay ku shaqeeyaan labada wejig; ma jiro vertex blend guud ama fillet ka dhexeeya wejiyo aan isku kulmin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERhino link-ka weligiis lama socodsiin Rhino ama Grasshopper dhab ah. Documents waxaa isticmaalay laba barnaamij oo ku jira hal folder, ma aha laba qof oo ku jira shabakad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalloocinta wejiyada scan dhab ah laguma sameyn gacanta. Luuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qabyo mashiin ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWindows installers-ka lama saxiixin code-ka, macOS disk image-ka lama notarize gareyn. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003ETroubleshooting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbeddellada hore waxay ku jiraan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"partcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003EWhat&#039;s new in 0.7\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hore-0-8-iyo-0-8-1\"\u003EHore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETani waa waxa ka isbeddelay PartCraft 0.8 iyo 0.8.1, marka laga barbar dhigo 0.7. Simulasho waxay ku jawaabaysaa intaad wax beddelayso oo waxay kuu sheegaysaa waxa marka hore jabi doona; isku-dhisyadu waxay helaan daraasadaha dhaqdhaqaaqa, workspaces-ka cusubi waxay sameeyaan dusha qalloocan iyo qaybo cabbirkooda laga helay fiisigisku. 0.8.1 waa sii-deyn yar oo hagaajin ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cusub-2\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESimulasho\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUpdate while I edit.\u003C/strong\u003E Calaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdate while I edit\u003C/span\u003E qaybta Solve oo jawaabaha ayaa raacaya tafatirkaaga. Beddel cabbir, culeys ama agab oo jawaab degdeg ah, oo lagu sameeyay elements afar jeer ka weyn, ayaa isla markiiba soo muuqda; markaad joogsato qiyaastii hal ilbiriqsi, jawaabta daraasadda ee la hagaajiyay ayaa beddelaysa kii hore. Natiijooyinku waxay sheegaan kii aad eegayso. Cantilever bir ah, jawaabta degdega ahi waxay ku dhowayd 1 % deflection iyo qiyaastii 4 % stress ee jawaabta la hagaajiyay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation#update-while-you-edit-live\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\" data-hash=\"update-while-you-edit-live\"\u003ECheck stress and deflection\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat breaks first.\u003C/strong\u003E Daraasad static ama buckling ah, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat breaks first?\u003C/span\u003E qaybta \u003Cstrong\u003EBreak it\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu culeysyada u qiyaasaa ilaa qaybtu ka jabto. Wuxuu liisanayaa, kan ugu xun marka hore, load factor-ka ilaa yield-ka koowaad (calaamad cas oo meesha stress-ku kor u kacayo) iyo load factor-ka ilaa buckling. Factor ka yar 1 wuxuu macnaheedu yahay qaybtu horey ugu jabtay sida loo culeysiyay, Problems wuxuu muujiyaa khalad. Factor-yadu waxay ka yimaadaan daraasad toosan, sidaas darteed waxay sax yihiin sida ay daraasadu sax tahay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation#find-out-what-breaks-first-break-it\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\" data-hash=\"find-out-what-breaks-first-break-it\"\u003ECheck stress and deflection\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYielding and contact.\u003C/strong\u003E Laba nooc oo daraasad oo dheeraad ah: mid aan toosnayn oo agabku raacayo xadkiisa toosan ilaa yield stress, ka dibna jilicsan, oo plastic strain la sawiro; iyo mid contact ah oo qaybo kala go&#039;an ku riixaan midba midka kale (aan is-diidin) ama ku sii adkaadaan (bonded). Tallaabo culeys oo aan degi karin, ama qaybo aad uga dhex-galaan midba midka kale, waxay muuqdaan panel-ka Problems. Friction, socod weyn, wareeg weyn, deflections weyn iyo fatigue lama xalin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation#yielding-and-contact-nonlinear-studies\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\" data-hash=\"yielding-and-contact-nonlinear-studies\"\u003ECheck stress and deflection\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDecks for CalculiX.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalculiX deck (.inp)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu daraasadda u kaydiyaa CalculiX, barnaamij kale oo aad rakibto oo aad shaqeyso; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalculiX results (.frd)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu faylka natiijadiisa ku akhriyaa isla meshka. PartCraft ma bilaabo barnaamijkaas, waxayna sheegtaa haddii qaybtu isbeddelay tan iyo markii la kaydiyay deck-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhisyada\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMotion studies.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMotion\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wadaa hal isku-xirka qiimihiisa wakhti aad siisay (xawaare joogto ah, dhowaad, sine, ama soo-baxa iyo dib-u-noqoshada), isku-dhisyada wuxuu ku dhigaa tallaabo kasta isku-xirkiisa iyo loops-ka xidhan, wuxuuna sheegaa waxa is-dhex galaya iyo sida ay u dhowyihiin qaybaha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a point\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sawiraa booska dhibicda, xawaaraha iyo kordhinta, qiimaha isku-xirka iyo clearance-ka wakhtiga ka sokow; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave CSV\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave plot\u003C/span\u003E ayaa qoraa. Ka dib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E, Step through the run bar wuxuu isku-dhisyada u raraa tallaabo kasta. Dejinta daraasadda waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhisyada. Xawaaraha iyo kordhinta waxa laga xisaabiyaa booska la duubay, sidaas darteed isticmaal tallaabo badan haddii dhibic degdeg ah ay hooseysan tahay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/check-assembly#a-motion-study\" data-topic=\"partcraft/check-assembly\" data-hash=\"a-motion-study\"\u003ECheck an assembly for clashes and motion\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWejiyada iyo qaybaha physics-ka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA Surfaces workspace.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurfaces\u003C/span\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo ka soo qaad NURBS curves iyo surfaces qaybta ag: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurve\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatch\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZebra\u003C/span\u003E, oo leh continuity (G0, G1 ama G2) lagu cabbiray wejiyada saxda ah, iyo geesta ka xun intii aad codsatay oo lagu liistay Problems oo leh Match fix. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFair\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu cabbiraa hull lines inflections iyo curvature jumps wuxuuna dib u dhisaa kuwa aan fiicnayn tolerance-kaaga dhexdiisa. Wejiyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta ma beddelayaan astaamaha qaybta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nurbs-surfaces\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nurbs-surfaces\"\u003EFreeform surfaces (NURBS)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe Engineer workspace.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngineer\u003C/span\u003E sanduuqa workspace-ka, dooro generator oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E: script ayaa qaybta ka cabbiraa waxa ay u baahan tahay inay sameyso (kulayl u guurin, socodyo, cadaadis, agab, habka daabacaadda) iyada oo adeegsanaya qaacidooyinka buugga, kadibna dhisaa, ka dibna dib u siiya tirooyinka uu isticmaalay ilaha ay ka yimaadeen, hubinta wax-soo-saarka iyo faylalka qalabka falanqaynta. Isla gelinta waxay siiyaa isla qaybta kombiyuutar kasta. Generator-ka waxa lagu hayaa qaybta, furidda qaybta mar kasta ma socodsiiso script-ka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/engineer-generators\" data-topic=\"partcraft/engineer-generators\"\u003EParts from physics: generators\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/write-a-generator\" data-topic=\"partcraft/write-a-generator\"\u003EWrite a generator\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadaynta, drawings iyo samaynta\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA sketch from a photo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFeatures\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch from a photo…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu raacaa sawir qaybta toosan oo dhulka caadiga ah (dhinaca iyo godyada) ama sawir qalin ah oo lagu beddelo xariiqyo, qaansooyin iyo wareegyo. Hal dherer ayaa la siiyaa, horudhaca ayaa la hubiyaa, kadibna sketch-ka ayaa la sameeyaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics#a-sketch-from-a-photo\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-hash=\"a-sketch-from-a-photo\"\u003ESketching basics\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScale and split for printing.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale for printing (STL or 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu miisaanka u beddelaa tirooyinka mid kasta oo tiir ah iyada oo aan qaybta la beddelin, tusaale ahaan iyada oo lagu daro dhaaftida yaraanta. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplit for printing (a zip of pieces)…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaybta weyn ee aan ku habboonayn sariirkaaga u jaraa qaybo tiro leh oo ku xidhma pegs, keys, dovetails, dowel holes ama magnet pockets. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/print-3d\"\u003EPrint in 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENested sheets to G-code.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENested sheets to G-code\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa DXF la habeeyay wuxuuna sameeyaa barnaamij kasta oo saxan ah iyada oo loo marayo post-ka aad doorato: godyada iyo goynta marka hore, kadibna geesaha. Ma qorsheeyo lead-ins, amarka goynta ama geesaha la wadaago. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nest-flat-parts#cut-the-sheets-g-code\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nest-flat-parts\" data-hash=\"cut-the-sheets-g-code\"\u003ENest flat parts on sheets\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDrawings that do more themselves.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheet\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutomatic\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu doortaa xaashida A-cabbirka ugu yar oo ku hayn muuqaalada miisaanka caadiga ah ee ugu weyn ilaa 1:1. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension the holes\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu calaamad dhexe ku dhigaa godkasta, hal callout cabbir kasta, iyo booska laga bilaabo geeska hoose ee bidix ee muuqaalka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003EMake a drawing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaan apps-ka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELanguages.\u003C/strong\u003E Apps-ku waxay yimaadaan 54 luuqadood. Kuwa ka sarreeya Ingiriisiga waa qabyo mashiin ah ilaa uu hadal-hayn dabiici ah akhriyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EToolbar rows.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar rows\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu doortaa Wrap (sida hore), 2 safafka ama 1 safka; bar aan ku habboonayn wuxuu u socdaa dhinac ahaan. Feature ribbon-ka PartCraft wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka ugu badan ee weyn, oo kuwa kale wuxuu ku qariyaa badhanka kala-qaybsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Studio waa xarunta lagu xidhayo caawiye aad leedahay dhammaan siddeed apps-ka, oo leh ogolaansho akhris, soo-jeedin ama tafatir app kasta. Caawiye xidhan ayaa qaybta ka dhigi kara sentence sida bracket culeys ahaan, muujisa shaqadiisa iyo hubinta oo dhan, oo dhisaa; wuxuu sheegaa waxa aanu hubin (stress concentration, fatigue, creep ee plastics-ka). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-topic=\"partcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\"\u003EUse PartCraft with an AI assistant\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"hagaajiyay-0-8-1\"\u003EHagaajiyay 0.8.1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen cursor freeze.\u003C/strong\u003E Hover pick-ka hadda waa la xakameeyay. Sababta waa akhrintayada ugu fiican ee aanu haysano, lamana xaqiijin shaqsiga soo sheegay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELanguage at run time.\u003C/strong\u003E Studio iyo nooca lagu xidhay wuxuu beddeli karaa luuqada inta uu socdo; hore Ingiriisi kaliya ayuu ahaa. Weli lama tijaabin dhammaan madbacadaha: noo sheeg haddii luuqadu ka bedelmin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"weli-nooca-tan-kuma-jiro\"\u003EWeli nooca tan kuma jiro\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EConnect your AI weli lama dhammeeyin: ku xidh mid-hal gujid gudaha Studio, isku xidhka bogga ee browser AI, furaha API-gaaga gudaha Studio iyo xirmada MCP ee la daabacay lama balan qaaday. Studio ma lahan AI u gaar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio lama saxiixin code-ka: Windows wuu digi karaa, macOS wuxuu kugu weydiinayaa right-click kadibna Open. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003ETroubleshooting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStack-ups weli waxay yihiin hal jihe: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/tolerance-stackup\" data-topic=\"partcraft/tolerance-stackup\"\u003ETolerance stack-ups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta kale waxa lagu liistay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWhat is not built yet\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsbeddellada hore waxay ku jiraan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/whats-new-0-7\" data-topic=\"partcraft/whats-new-0-7\"\u003EWhat&#039;s new in 0.7\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tani waa waxa ka isbeddelay PartCraft 0.9, marka laga barbar dhigo 0.8.1. Dusha qalloocan hadda way isku xidhaan jidho adag, isku-dhisyada oo ka badan kun qayb ayay wali isticmaal ku noqdaan, Dokumentiyada vault-ku noocyada ayuu hayaa, add-on-ka Solid FEM-na xoogga qaybta ayuu hubiyaa. Wax kasta waxa uu sheegayaa meesha laga helayo. Cusub 0.9.1 Exact STEP export. Export › STEP AP242 (exact solid) iyo STEP AP214 (exact solid) hadda way shaqeeyaan. Godyada, bosses-ka, fillets-ka, koonada, kubbadaha iyo torus-ka waxay ku qoran yihiin wejiyadooda dhabta ah, iyada oo wareegyada dhabta ah ay yihiin geesaha, si barnaamij CAD ama CAM kale u aqoonsado godka sida god. Spline sides, dhuunto la moodelay iyo meshes la soo dhoofiyay waxay ku sii jiraan facets toosan isla jidhka adag. Eeg Export for printing, STEP and DXF. STEP in, exact STEP out. Faylka STEP ee aad furto wuxuu ilaaliyaa wejiyadiisa toosan, silindarrada, koonada, kubbadaha iyo torus-ka, sidaas darteed Export › STEP AP242 (exact solid) wuxuu dib ugu qoraa sida wejiyo dhab ah halkii uu ka qori lahaa facets: biim ay ku jiraan godyo boolood ah oo uu ka yimid mashiinka wax-iibiyaha wuxuu u baxaa isla wejiyadii uu ku soo galay, iyo wixii aad ku jartay. Wejiyada spline, la xoqay iyo revolve-ka faylka waxay ku sii jiraan facets, sidaas oo kale bodies-ka STL, OBJ iyo 3MF. Faylka STEP mar kale fur qaybta la kaydiyay hore. Eeg Open a STEP file and build on it. True circles in the face DXF. Export › DXF of the sketch or flat face oo wejig sinaan ah la doortay hadda wuxuu godyada wareega u qoraa wareeg, oo leh bartiisa iyo radius-kiisa, miis laser, plasma ama waterjet ah. Geesaha wareegsan ee kale weli facets ayay yihiin. Exact STEP for the shop. Manufacture ku jira, Exact STEP (work coordinates) wuxuu qaybta ku qoraa asalkeeda asalka shaqada setup-ka iyo Z tiirka qalabka, isku-xidhka uu G-code-ku isticmaalo. Eeg Make toolpaths and G-code. Cusub Wejiyada iyo jidhadka Fillet between faces. Dooro Surfaces sanduuqa Workspace, kadibna Fillet between faces. Dooro labada wejig ee hal jidh, qor radius-ka (iyo Radius at the end (mm, 0 = the same) radius-ka oo ku beddelma geeska dhererka). Safka natiijada wuxuu sheegayaa intee le'eg fillet-ku uga fog yahay rolling ball-ka sida mithaal, radius-ka aan ku habboonayn waa la diidaa iyo wejiga la magacaabay. Fillet several edges wuxuu geesaha badan hal jeer wareegaa; calaamee Corners (sphere patch where three meet) si aad u hesho geesta kubbadda meesha saddex geesood oo wareegsan oo wejiyo sinaan ah ay isku kulmaan. Eeg Freeform surfaces (NURBS). Thicken into a solid. Thicken into a solid isla shaqadaas wuxuu wejiga siiyaa dhumuc; Other side wuxuu ku kordhiyaa dhinaca kale. Foldka ama isgoyska is-gudbiya waa la diidaa iyada oo wejiga iyo meesha la magacaabay. Solids from surfaces. Wejiyada la jaray waa la isku xidhi karaa union, subtract iyo intersect, waxaana qaybta lagu dhejiyaa hal tallaabo oo dib-u-celin ah. STEP wuxuu jidhka adag u qoraa hal shell xidhan, IGES-na hal solid; labaduba waxay soo akhrisaan sida solid. Haddii wejiyadu aanay ku dhigmin geesood ilaa geesood, faylku wuxuu helaa wejiyo kala go'an, safka xaaladda ayaa sheegaya. Solids-ka waxaa kale oo lagu samayn karaa node editor-ka; eeg Node editor. Rim and variable fillets in scans. Marka aad surfaces ku habayso scan, rim fillets (tori) iyo variable-radius fillets geesta toosan ku wareegsan ayaa la raadiyaa oo la liisanayaa radius-keeda. Waxaa lagu tijaabiyay scans la sameeyay oo keliya. Isku-dhisyada, dokumentiyada iyo xiriirrada Large assemblies. Qaybaha ah nuqul waxay wadaagaan hal mesh, Views › Lightweight display wuxuu sanduuqyo ku sawiraa si muuqaalku u sii socdo (wuu iska shido isku-dhisyada aad u weyn; dhaqdhaqaaqyada iyo isku-xirku wali qaybaha dhabta ah ayay isticmaalaan). Geedka qaybaha wuxuu muujinayaa safafkiisa ugu horreeya iyo badhanka Show 700 more ee kuwa kale. Faylasha isku-dhisyada waxay haysan karaan ilaa 50,000 instances iyo 100,000 joints. Eeg Build an assembly. Documents. Documents… kooxda File wuxuu furaa sanduuq ku saabsan folder-ka mashruuca: check out iyo check in, xarfaha noocyada, xaaladaha (shaqada socota, loo baahan yahay in la eego, la sii daayay, la soo afjaray), taariikhda, meesha la isticmaalo iyo liiska agabka. Eeg Documents and revisions (the vault). Live Rhino link. Hal script, cadcraft_link.py, wuxuu daawadaa dokumentiga Rhino ama Grasshopper oo wuxuu PartCraft u riixaa kaliya wixii isbeddelay, halkaas oo astaamaha la soo dhoofiyay ku dhisma qaabka cusub. Hal jihe ayuu yahay, wuxuuna u baahan yahay Studio. Eeg Live .3dm link. See each other's cursors. Shaqada wadaagga ah, cursor-ka qof kasta wuxuu muuqdaa magacyadiisa iyo astaamaha uu dooranayo. Eeg Work live with others. Factory floor. Ku shid add-on-ka Factory floor Settings › Add-ons. Marka aad barnaamij ku daabacdo Manufacture, tab-kiisa wuxuu awoodaa inuu Add to the factory job queue ama Save as a job file. Mar weligeed ma diro mashiinna ma bilaabo. Falanqaynta iyo qaybaha Solid FEM add-on. Ku shid Solid FEM Settings › Add-ons (wuu damaan yahay ilaa aad shido) oo tab Solid FEM ayaa ka soo muuqanaya panel-ka midig. Mesh the part, dooro wejiyada go'an iyo culeysyada muuqaalka 3D, Solve, oo muuji displacement, von Mises stress ama mode shape adigoo isticmaalaya Show on the model. Eeg Solid FEM: a stress check. Arc in sketches, ten ways. Fallaadha ku xigta Arc qalab-sanduuqa sketch-ka ayaa liisanaysa 3-Point, Start Center End, Start Center Angle, Start Center Length, Start End Angle, Start End Direction, Start End Radius, Center Start End, Center Start Angle, Center Start Length iyo Continue. Eeg Draw an arc by ten methods. UK steel sizes. Weldments waxay isticmaali karaan 976 UK sections (UB, UC, PFC, EA, UEA, CHS, SHS, RHS); ku qor cabbir sida 305x165x40 UB. Eeg Structural members. Daabacaadda Print stage. Badhanka Print stage qalab-sanduuqa (add-on 3D Print, oo furan caadi ahaan) wuxuu jidhadka qaybtaada ku dhigaa sariir la jarjaray: Lay flat, Turn 90°, Arrange on the bed, Fit all on the bed, Preview layers, kadibna Send to 3D printer oo ku dhex mara USB, Klipper (Moonraker), OctoPrint ama PrusaLink. Waxba lama diro ilaa aad xaqiijiso, qaybtaadana weligeed ma beddelmayso. Haddii aad doonto faylka STL ama 3MF, eeg Get a part ready for 3D printing. Resin printing. Add-ons Settings › Add-ons, oo dhammaantood damaan ilaa aad shido: slicer resin ah, imtixaan exposure ah, iyo qaabka faylalka Elegoo GOO, SL1, Chitubox CBDDLP/CTB iyo Anycubic. Slicing-ku wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa worker thread, sidaas darteed bogga waa jawaabaya. Dhammaan apps-ka Hover hint kasta waa Bootstrap tooltip. Start tip-ka wuxuu leeyahay badhanka xidhista; wuu xirnaan doonaa. Safka tab-yada panel-ka oo aan ku habboonayn wuxuu u socdaa dhinac ahaan halkii uu ka go'i lahaa. Tab-ka browser-ka wuxuu muujiyaa magaca dokumentiga furan ka hor PartCraft | CadCraft. Settings wuxuu muujiyaa workspace Layout sida liis hoos-u-dhac ah oo doorashooyin, sanduuqa luuqadaha wuxuu liistaa luuqad kasta oo dhisme ku jirta. Miisaanka iyo Heerkulka waa nooc unit ah oo ku jira dejinta Units. La hagaajiyay Menu-ga Arc ee sketch-ka hadda wuxuu liistaa habka kasta. Qaybta add-on-ka iyo magaca tab-ka browser-ka waa la saxay 2026-11-09. Xaddidaadaha run ahaan Exact STEP waxa dib loo akhriyay OpenCascade (solids sax ah, mugga oo la mid ah kuwa gacanta lagu xisaabiyay). Weli ma furna barnaamij kasta oo CAD ama CAM ah, isku-dhisyada ma qoro exact STEP. Weli wax lagu daabacay printer dhab ah ma jiro. Slicing, G-code iyo faylalka resin waxaa akhriyay barnaamijyadeenna ama printer-ka lagu beddelay; mid ka mid ah qaababka resin lama soo dejin printer dhab ah, cabbirrada printer-ka iyo exposures-ku waa bilow. Solid FEM waa toosan, isotropic, elastic, hal material qaybtiisa, aan contact, yielding ama buckling lahayn. Stress-ka meelaha go'an iyo geesaha dhaqsan wuxuu ku xidhan yahay mesh-ka. Waa caawin hubin, ma aha mid injineer dib u eegay. Waqtiyada isku-dhisyada weyn server aan GPU lahayn ayaa laga helay; frame buuxa oo faahfaahin buuxa leh oo ah 20,000 qayb weli wuxuu qaadaa dhowr ilbiriqsi halkaas. Fillets waxay ku shaqeeyaan labada wejig; ma jiro vertex blend guud ama fillet ka dhexeeya wejiyo aan isku kulmin. Rhino link-ka weligiis lama socodsiin Rhino ama Grasshopper dhab ah. Documents waxaa isticmaalay laba barnaamij oo ku jira hal folder, ma aha laba qof oo ku jira shabakad. Qalloocinta wejiyada scan dhab ah laguma sameyn gacanta. Luuqadaha aan Ingiriisi ahayn waa qabyo mashiin ah. Windows installers-ka lama saxiixin code-ka, macOS disk image-ka lama notarize gareyn. Eeg Troubleshooting. Isbeddellada hore waxay ku jiraan What's new in 0.7. Hore: 0.8 iyo 0.8.1 Tani waa waxa ka isbeddelay PartCraft 0.8 iyo 0.8.1, marka laga barbar dhigo 0.7. Simulasho waxay ku jawaabaysaa intaad wax beddelayso oo waxay kuu sheegaysaa waxa marka hore jabi doona; isku-dhisyadu waxay helaan daraasadaha dhaqdhaqaaqa, workspaces-ka cusubi waxay sameeyaan dusha qalloocan iyo qaybo cabbirkooda laga helay fiisigisku. 0.8.1 waa sii-deyn yar oo hagaajin ah. Cusub Simulasho Update while I edit. Calaamee Update while I edit qaybta Solve oo jawaabaha ayaa raacaya tafatirkaaga. Beddel cabbir, culeys ama agab oo jawaab degdeg ah, oo lagu sameeyay elements afar jeer ka weyn, ayaa isla markiiba soo muuqda; markaad joogsato qiyaastii hal ilbiriqsi, jawaabta daraasadda ee la hagaajiyay ayaa beddelaysa kii hore. Natiijooyinku waxay sheegaan kii aad eegayso. Cantilever bir ah, jawaabta degdega ahi waxay ku dhowayd 1 % deflection iyo qiyaastii 4 % stress ee jawaabta la hagaajiyay. Eeg Check stress and deflection. What breaks first. Daraasad static ama buckling ah, What breaks first? qaybta Break it wuxuu culeysyada u qiyaasaa ilaa qaybtu ka jabto. Wuxuu liisanayaa, kan ugu xun marka hore, load factor-ka ilaa yield-ka koowaad (calaamad cas oo meesha stress-ku kor u kacayo) iyo load factor-ka ilaa buckling. Factor ka yar 1 wuxuu macnaheedu yahay qaybtu horey ugu jabtay sida loo culeysiyay, Problems wuxuu muujiyaa khalad. Factor-yadu waxay ka yimaadaan daraasad toosan, sidaas darteed waxay sax yihiin sida ay daraasadu sax tahay. Eeg Check stress and deflection. Yielding and contact. Laba nooc oo daraasad oo dheeraad ah: mid aan toosnayn oo agabku raacayo xadkiisa toosan ilaa yield stress, ka dibna jilicsan, oo plastic strain la sawiro; iyo mid contact ah oo qaybo kala go'an ku riixaan midba midka kale (aan is-diidin) ama ku sii adkaadaan (bonded). Tallaabo culeys oo aan degi karin, ama qaybo aad uga dhex-galaan midba midka kale, waxay muuqdaan panel-ka Problems. Friction, socod weyn, wareeg weyn, deflections weyn iyo fatigue lama xalin. Eeg Check stress and deflection. Decks for CalculiX. Export › CalculiX deck (.inp) wuxuu daraasadda u kaydiyaa CalculiX, barnaamij kale oo aad rakibto oo aad shaqeyso; Export › CalculiX results (.frd) wuxuu faylka natiijadiisa ku akhriyaa isla meshka. PartCraft ma bilaabo barnaamijkaas, waxayna sheegtaa haddii qaybtu isbeddelay tan iyo markii la kaydiyay deck-ka. Isku-dhisyada Motion studies. Assembly › Motion wuxuu wadaa hal isku-xirka qiimihiisa wakhti aad siisay (xawaare joogto ah, dhowaad, sine, ama soo-baxa iyo dib-u-noqoshada), isku-dhisyada wuxuu ku dhigaa tallaabo kasta isku-xirkiisa iyo loops-ka xidhan, wuxuuna sheegaa waxa is-dhex galaya iyo sida ay u dhowyihiin qaybaha. Add a point wuxuu sawiraa booska dhibicda, xawaaraha iyo kordhinta, qiimaha isku-xirka iyo clearance-ka wakhtiga ka sokow; Save CSV iyo Save plot ayaa qoraa. Ka dib Run, Step through the run bar wuxuu isku-dhisyada u raraa tallaabo kasta. Dejinta daraasadda waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhisyada. Xawaaraha iyo kordhinta waxa laga xisaabiyaa booska la duubay, sidaas darteed isticmaal tallaabo badan haddii dhibic degdeg ah ay hooseysan tahay. Eeg Check an assembly for clashes and motion. Wejiyada iyo qaybaha physics-ka A Surfaces workspace. Dooro Surfaces sanduuqa Workspace oo ka soo qaad NURBS curves iyo surfaces qaybta ag: Curve, Loft, Sweep, Match iyo Zebra, oo leh continuity (G0, G1 ama G2) lagu cabbiray wejiyada saxda ah, iyo geesta ka xun intii aad codsatay oo lagu liistay Problems oo leh Match fix. Fair wuxuu cabbiraa hull lines inflections iyo curvature jumps wuxuuna dib u dhisaa kuwa aan fiicnayn tolerance-kaaga dhexdiisa. Wejiyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta ma beddelayaan astaamaha qaybta. Eeg Freeform surfaces (NURBS). The Engineer workspace. Dooro Engineer sanduuqa workspace-ka, dooro generator oo riix New: script ayaa qaybta ka cabbiraa waxa ay u baahan tahay inay sameyso (kulayl u guurin, socodyo, cadaadis, agab, habka daabacaadda) iyada oo adeegsanaya qaacidooyinka buugga, kadibna dhisaa, ka dibna dib u siiya tirooyinka uu isticmaalay ilaha ay ka yimaadeen, hubinta wax-soo-saarka iyo faylalka qalabka falanqaynta. Isla gelinta waxay siiyaa isla qaybta kombiyuutar kasta. Generator-ka waxa lagu hayaa qaybta, furidda qaybta mar kasta ma socodsiiso script-ka. Eeg Parts from physics: generators iyo Write a generator. Naqshadaynta, drawings iyo samaynta A sketch from a photo. Features › More › Sketch from a photo… wuxuu raacaa sawir qaybta toosan oo dhulka caadiga ah (dhinaca iyo godyada) ama sawir qalin ah oo lagu beddelo xariiqyo, qaansooyin iyo wareegyo. Hal dherer ayaa la siiyaa, horudhaca ayaa la hubiyaa, kadibna sketch-ka ayaa la sameeyaa. Eeg Sketching basics. Scale and split for printing. Export › Scale for printing (STL or 3MF)… wuxuu miisaanka u beddelaa tirooyinka mid kasta oo tiir ah iyada oo aan qaybta la beddelin, tusaale ahaan iyada oo lagu daro dhaaftida yaraanta. Export › Split for printing (a zip of pieces)… wuxuu qaybta weyn ee aan ku habboonayn sariirkaaga u jaraa qaybo tiro leh oo ku xidhma pegs, keys, dovetails, dowel holes ama magnet pockets. Eeg Print in 3D. Nested sheets to G-code. Export › Nested sheets to G-code wuxuu akhrinayaa DXF la habeeyay wuxuuna sameeyaa barnaamij kasta oo saxan ah iyada oo loo marayo post-ka aad doorato: godyada iyo goynta marka hore, kadibna geesaha. Ma qorsheeyo lead-ins, amarka goynta ama geesaha la wadaago. Eeg Nest flat parts on sheets. Drawings that do more themselves. Sheet › Automatic wuxuu doortaa xaashida A-cabbirka ugu yar oo ku hayn muuqaalada miisaanka caadiga ah ee ugu weyn ilaa 1:1. Dimension the holes wuxuu calaamad dhexe ku dhigaa godkasta, hal callout cabbir kasta, iyo booska laga bilaabo geeska hoose ee bidix ee muuqaalka. Eeg Make a drawing. Dhammaan apps-ka Languages. Apps-ku waxay yimaadaan 54 luuqadood. Kuwa ka sarreeya Ingiriisiga waa qabyo mashiin ah ilaa uu hadal-hayn dabiici ah akhriyo. Toolbar rows. Settings › General › Toolbar rows wuxuu doortaa Wrap (sida hore), 2 safafka ama 1 safka; bar aan ku habboonayn wuxuu u socdaa dhinac ahaan. Feature ribbon-ka PartCraft wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka ugu badan ee weyn, oo kuwa kale wuxuu ku qariyaa badhanka kala-qaybsan. Connect your AI. Studio waa xarunta lagu xidhayo caawiye aad leedahay dhammaan siddeed apps-ka, oo leh ogolaansho akhris, soo-jeedin ama tafatir app kasta. Caawiye xidhan ayaa qaybta ka dhigi kara sentence sida bracket culeys ahaan, muujisa shaqadiisa iyo hubinta oo dhan, oo dhisaa; wuxuu sheegaa waxa aanu hubin (stress concentration, fatigue, creep ee plastics-ka). Eeg Use PartCraft with an AI assistant. Hagaajiyay 0.8.1 Full-screen cursor freeze. Hover pick-ka hadda waa la xakameeyay. Sababta waa akhrintayada ugu fiican ee aanu haysano, lamana xaqiijin shaqsiga soo sheegay. Language at run time. Studio iyo nooca lagu xidhay wuxuu beddeli karaa luuqada inta uu socdo; hore Ingiriisi kaliya ayuu ahaa. Weli lama tijaabin dhammaan madbacadaha: noo sheeg haddii luuqadu ka bedelmin. Weli nooca tan kuma jiro Connect your AI weli lama dhammeeyin: ku xidh mid-hal gujid gudaha Studio, isku xidhka bogga ee browser AI, furaha API-gaaga gudaha Studio iyo xirmada MCP ee la daabacay lama balan qaaday. Studio ma lahan AI u gaar ah. Studio lama saxiixin code-ka: Windows wuu digi karaa, macOS wuxuu kugu weydiinayaa right-click kadibna Open. Eeg Troubleshooting. Stack-ups weli waxay yihiin hal jihe: eeg Tolerance stack-ups. Qaybta kale waxa lagu liistay What is not built yet. Isbeddellada hore waxay ku jiraan What's new in 0.7.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"whats-new-0-7","scope":"partcraft","title":"Waxa cusub ee 0.7 (hore)","summary":"PartCraft 0.7 wuxuu soo kordhiyay workspace-ka Illustrate ee buugaagta, faylalka STEP, STL, OBJ, 3MF iyo .3dm ee loo furo sida jidh adag, frameyo ka samaysan birta, lilmo xidhan, qaybo leh boqolaal astaamood, xirmada kala duwanaanshaha habaynteeda, post-yo la wax ka beddeli karo iyo qalab maktabad, shaqada-hadhaaga ee nest-yada, barnaamijyada laser-ka, dhoofinta USD iyo qalabyo caawiye AI.","section":"start","order":7,"keywords":["waxa cusub 0.7","sii-deyn hore","sii-deyn","faahfaahin","changelog","isbeddelo","0.7","nooca","astaamo cusub","illustrate","buug","sawir farsamo","muuqaal kala-furan","balloons","liiska qaybaha","tilmaamo","3d kaab","step","stp","stl","obj","3mf","3dm","mesh loo beddelo jidh","mesh furan","weldment","qayb qaab-dhismeed","liiska jarista","lilmo xidhan","linkage","four-bar","qayb weyn","astaamo badan","xirmada kala duwanaanshaha","kala duwanaansho","habeeye","post processor","edit post","cpost","parallel","scallop","dhamaystirka 3d","maktabadda qalabyada","agab","hadhaag","laser","usd","usdz","caawiye","mcp","qaabeyn dhow","cutubyo","Boortaqiis"],"headings":[{"id":"cusub","text":"Cusub","level":2},{"id":"buugaag-naqshadaada-ka","text":"Buugaag naqshadaada ka","level":3},{"id":"furista-faylal-kale","text":"Furista faylal kale","level":3},{"id":"qaybaha-iyo-isku-dhisyada","text":"Qaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada","level":3},{"id":"samaynta","text":"Samaynta","level":3},{"id":"caawiyayaasha","text":"Caawiyayaasha","level":3},{"id":"waa-la-beddelay","text":"Waa la beddelay","level":2},{"id":"app-kasta","text":"App kasta","level":2},{"id":"weli-ma-jiraan-nooca-hadda","text":"Weli ma jiraan nooca hadda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWaa waxa isbeddelay PartCraft 0.7, marka la barbardhigo 0.6. Qaybaha waxay ka imanayaan faylal badan, workspace cusub wuxuuna sameeyaa buugaag naqshadaada ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusub\"\u003ECusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"buugaag-naqshadaada-ka\"\u003EBuugaag naqshadaada ka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace-ka Illustrate.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIllustrate\u003C/span\u003E beddelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeel shaqo\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuug\u003C/span\u003E: buugu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaybta ama isku-dhiska furan, isku-dhis la kaydiyay, ama fayl glTF, OBJ, STL ama 3MF (geedkiisa iyo magacyadiisa way ilaalinayaan; nuqulada qayb isku mid ah waxay noqdaan hal qayb oo tiro leh). Buugu waa fayl gaar ah (\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-manual.json\u003C/code\u003E) oo leh nuqul qaybaha, sidaas darteed dukumentiga wuu sii socdaa naqshaddu intay socoto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate\"\u003EBilow buug Illustrate\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalada iyo muuqyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Qari, ghost, kala saar ama midab kale u beddel qaybaha, ciyaar muuqaal kala-furan, jar qayb ama sanduuq ka jar moodelka, ku dar muraayad weyn, oo dhammaan keydi sidii muuqaal. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-views\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-views\"\u003EMuuqaalada, muuqyada, jarista iyo muraayadda weyn\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBalloons iyo liis qaybaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Hal riix ayaa balloon ku sameeyaa qayb kasta oo muuqaalku muujinayo; lambarada waxay la joogaan qaybahooda oo waligood dib looma isticmaalo. Liiska wuxuu ku jiri karaa muuqaalka oo wuxuu u kaydiyaa CSV. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-parts-list\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-parts-list\"\u003ELiiska qaybaha iyo balloons\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaallo la xidhan yahay:\u003C/strong\u003E calaamado iyo callout-yo buuxiya lambarka, magaca, agabka ama tirada qaybta, fallaadho, masaafooyin, xagal iyo radii la qiyaasay qaybaha, qaabab iyo sawirro. Way raacaan qaybtooda marka ay kala furanto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-annotations\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-annotations\"\u003EFaallooyinka la xidhan yahay\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir khad, tilmaamo iyo fayl 3D.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhoofi muuqaal kasta sidii sawir khad vector (SVG ama PDF) oo leh khado qarsan iyo jarista xarriijinta, ama sidii PNG; u beddel muuqaalada tilmaamo tallaabo-tallaabo ah PDF ama hal bog HTML; ama kaydi hal fayl HTML oo laga furi karo browser kasta markii aan internet lahayn, oo leh muuqaalada, liiska qaybaha iyo animation-ka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-line-art\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-line-art\"\u003ESawirrada farsamada\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-instructions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-instructions\"\u003EDukumentiyada tilmaamaha\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-interactive\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-interactive\"\u003EFaylka 3D ee wada-falka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAnimation iyo cusboonaysiin.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybaha iyo kamarada fur, muuqaalka kala-furan ku duub tallaabo-tallaabo, oo kaydi fiidiyo. Marka naqshaddu beddesho, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusbooneysii naqshadda…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa waxa dhaqaaqay, beddelay, yimid ama baxay ka hor inta aan waxba la beddelin, oo wuxuu hayaa muuqaalada, faallooyinka, balloons-ka iyo furayaasha qaybahooda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-animation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-animation\"\u003EAnimation-ka buugga\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-update\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-update\"\u003ECusbooneysii buugga naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"furista-faylal-kale\"\u003EFurista faylal kale\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylalka STEP waxay furmaan jidh adag.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhriyaa AP203, AP214 iyo AP242 STEP iyada oo aan exact kernel-ka lahayn. Dusha fidsan waxay fidsan yihiin, dusha qalooca ahna waxay noqdaan wax badan oo fidsan yar yar, isku-dhiskuna wuxuu imanayaa hal jidh oo qayb kasta meesha faylku dhigayo. Ku sawir dusha fidsan, jar oo ku dar. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EFur faylka STEP oo ku dhis\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMesh-yada STL, OBJ iyo 3MF waxay noqdaan jidh adag.\u003C/strong\u003E Fur ama ka soo rid faylka: PartCraft wuxuu isku xidhaa geeso laba-jibbaaran, xidhaa godad yaryar, buuxiyaa godadka oo wuxuu rogaa saddex-geeska u jeeda jihada qaldan, kadibna wuxuu sheegaa waxa sameeyay iyo haddii mesh-ku hadda xidhan yahay. Dooro unit-yada iyo jihada kor, jidhka waxa uu imanayaa sida \u003Cstrong\u003EImported1\u003C/strong\u003E, dusha fidsanna waxay noqonayaan wejiyo lagu sawiro. Mesh aan xidhmi karin wuxuu sheegaa inta furan ee harsan, mana darto wax. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EFur STL, OBJ ama 3MF sida jidh adag\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylalka .3dm waxay furmaan hal jidh.\u003C/strong\u003E Meshes-ka, polysurfaces-ka, extrusions-ka iyo meelaynta blockyada ee fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E waxay imanayaan hal jidh adag, oo ka mid ah meshes-ka lagu kaydiyay faylka ama PartCraft ayaa u jeexay, iyada oo la marayo isla saxid iyo hubinta &quot;xidhan?&quot; sida mesh. Curves, qoraal, SubD objects, layers iyo midabada waa laga tagay, wadahadaluhuna wuu sheegaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003EFur moodel .3dm sida jidh adag\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"qaybaha-iyo-isku-dhisyada\"\u003EQaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFrameyo ka samaysan birta.\u003C/strong\u003E Samee frame khadad ahaan, hal sawir-gacmeed ama dhowr si frame 3D ah, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXubin qaab-dhismeed\u003C/span\u003E: qaybta ka timid miiska AISC ama EN 10365 waxay socotaa khad kasta dhexdiisa. Geesaha waa la xardhay ama la kala jaray, xubnaha ku kulma T ama saddex geesta ayaa loo jaray in ay ku habboonaadaan, dhammaadyada xoraa waxay heli karaan qolof iyo geesaha gusset-ka, liiska jarista wuxuu siinayaa dherer kasta oo qayb ah iyo xagalka dhammaadka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi liiska jarista (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/structural-members\" data-topic=\"partcraft/structural-members\"\u003EFrameyo ka samaysan qaybaha birta\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELilmo xidhan oo isku-dhisyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybaha la isku xidhay giraan ah (four-bar linkage, crank iyo slider, frame la xiray) hadda way xidhmaan: jiid ama qor qiime lilmada, kuwa kale ayaa raacaa, hubinta dhaqdhaqaaqana wuxuu isla sidaas u maraa lilmada. Isku-xidhka weli dhaqaaqi karo waa buluug, lilmo aan xidhmi karin waa casaan wuxuuna sheegaa intii uu ka fogyahay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly#closed-loops-linkages\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\" data-hash=\"closed-loops-linkages\"\u003ELilmaha xidhan: linkages\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha leh boqolaal astaamood.\u003C/strong\u003E PartCraft wuxuu hayaa jidhka uu ku jiray taariikhda dhexdeeda, sidaas darteed isbedel dambe taariikhda wuxuu dib u dhisaa oo kaliya astaamaha ka dambeeya, jarista iyo bossesyada aan taabanin ayaa si wada jir ah loo dhaqmaa. Waxa lagu tijaabiyay qayb leh 750 astaamood. Daaqada Halbeegyada waxay la socotaa boqolaal isle&#039;eg, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa 200 tallaabo haddii aysan xoogga badan xusuusta isticmaalin (waligeed ka yar 20). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/edit-history#parts-with-hundreds-of-features\" data-topic=\"partcraft/edit-history\" data-hash=\"parts-with-hundreds-of-features\"\u003EQaybaha leh boqolaal astaamood\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXirmada kala duwanaanshaha habaynteeda.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXirmada kala duwanaanshaha…\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EHabayn\u003C/strong\u003E ee tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E waxay dhisaysaa habayn kasta, ama kuwa aad calaamaddo, hal zip: STEP, IFC, xaashi naqshad DWG iyo muuqaal kasta, miis halbeegyadooda (CSV iyo JSON), iyo qaybta oo ah hal shay maktabad leh kala duwanaanshaheeda. Habayn aan la dhisi karin waa la taxay oo waa laga tagaa. Sadarka amarka wuxuu sameeyaa isku mid oo leh \u003Ccode\u003Epartcraft variants\u003C/code\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003ESamee xirmada kala duwanaanshaha habaynteeda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"samaynta\"\u003ESamaynta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPost processors-ka aad wax ka beddeli karto.\u003C/strong\u003E Posts-ka sida Fanuc, GRBL iyo LinuxCNC ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax soo saarka\u003C/span\u003E hadda waa fayl qoraal gaagaaban oo ku jira qaabka post-ka PartCraft laftiisa, wuxuuna weli qorayaa wax kasta sidii hore. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel post…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa nuqulkaaga mid ka mid ah (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPost cusub…\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo gali faylka post…\u003C/span\u003E sidoo kale), wuxuu sheegaa khadka qaldan, wuxuuna muujinayaa G-code-ka uu qorayo markaad qorayso. Posts-ka waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta iyo sidii faylal \u003Ccode\u003E.cpost\u003C/code\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EPost processors-ka aad wax ka beddeli karto\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaystirka 3D: Parallel iyo Scallop.\u003C/strong\u003E Dusha moodel oo dhan ku dhamaystir kubbad, bull-nose ama flat end mill, khado isku-tiir ah xagal kasta, ama marooyin meel fog oo la go&#039;aamiyay ka dhexeeya si uu buurtu ka dhexeeya u yeelo dherer aad weydiisay (ma aha flat end mill). Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003EDhamaystirka 3D: parallel iyo scallop\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabadda qalabyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaydi qalabyada browser-kan qayb kasta, oo dhoofi ama soo geli sida fayl JSON si aad ugu raro kombiyuutar kale. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/tool-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/tool-library\"\u003EMaktabadda qalabyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka iyo moodelka midabka.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji agabka la simulated\u003C/strong\u003E uu furan yahay, agabku waa cagaar moodelka dushiisa, casaan meesha qalabku ku jaray, jaalaha ilaa cawlaha meesha agabku ka harsan yahay, furaha panel-ka ku jira. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture#simulate\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\" data-hash=\"simulate\"\u003ESimulate\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha hadhay ee u dhexeeya nest-yada.\u003C/strong\u003E Nest kadib, wixii ka harsan saxan kasta wuxuu noqon karaa hadhaag lambar leh oo leh agabkiisa iyo dhumuciisa. Nest-ka xiga ee isla agab iyo dhumuc wuxuu marka hore isticmaalaa hadhaagga, kadibna saxanka buuxa; liiska agabka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka iyo sidii CSV, DXF-na wuxuu calaamadiyaa hadhaag kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nest-offcuts\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nest-offcuts\"\u003EKaydi oo dib u isticmaal qaybaha hadhay\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarnaamijyada laser-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarnaamijka laser…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaadaa khadadka ka yimid faylka DXF oo wuxuu dejiyaa waxa lakab kasta sameeyo (jarid, score, engrave, fill), wuxuu muujiyaa dhaqdhaqaaqa madaxa, wuxuuna kaydiyaa G-code-ka GRBL laser-mode. Chrome iyo Edge waxay sidoo kale qaabeyn karaan shaqada iyada oo laser-ku damaa, kadibna waxay u dirtaa USB. Dejinta waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/laser-cutting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/laser-cutting\"\u003ENaqshad u dir laser-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofinta USD.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhmada USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa qaybta oo leh agabkeeda, mugeeda iyo culeyskeeda, ama isku-dhis oo qayb kasta mar keliya lagu qoro oo nuqul kasta la dhigo, mitir oo Z kor u taagan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"partcraft/usd\"\u003EDhoofi qayb ama isku-dhis USD ahaan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"caawiyayaasha\"\u003ECaawiyayaasha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabyo caawiyahaaga AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka lagu shido \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaaliyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E, caawiye la xiriiray CadCraft Studio wuxuu akhrin karaa astaamaha, halbeegyada iyo sifooyinka culeyska, wuxuu dejin karaa halbeeg oo dib u dhisi karaa (hal tallaabo oo ka noqod), wuxuu orodsiin karaa script CraftScript, Lua ama Python sida workspace-ka Script u sameeyo, wuxuu dhoofin karaa STL, 3MF, STEP fasedyo ama USD, wuxuu kaydin karaa, wuxuuna dhoofin karaa buug sidii PDF, SVG, tilmaamo ama faylka 3D ee wada-falka. Server-ka faylalka iyo sadarka amarka \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E isku mid ayay sameeyaan qaybaha iyo buugaagta la kaydiyay. PartCraft ma leh AI. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\" data-topic=\"partcraft/use-with-ai-assistants\"\u003EIsticmaal PartCraft oo leh caawiye AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waa-la-beddelay\"\u003EWaa la beddelay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQayb oo jidh ka faylka ah waxa loo kaydiyaa nooca qaybta 5.\u003C/strong\u003E Qayb leh jidh STEP, STL, OBJ, 3MF ama \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E waxay haysaa saddex-geesaha la saxay gudaha faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, sidaas darteed faylkii asalka ahaa uma baahnid mar kale. PartCraft 0.6 wuxuu diidaa nooca 5 oo wuxuu isticmaalaa fariintiisa &quot;nooc cusub&quot; halkii uu qaldan ku furi lahaa. Qaybaha kale waxa loo kaydiyaa sidii hore. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/file-formats#the-partcraft-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/file-formats\" data-hash=\"the-partcraft-files\"\u003EFaylalka PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPosts-ka aad qorto waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta. PartCraft hore oo furta qayb noocaas ah wuxuu tirtiraa posts-ka markuu mar kale kaydiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"app-kasta\"\u003EApp kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECutubyada.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E waxa uu leeyahay liis kala gooya dherer, aag, mugga, xagal iyo jiifka, oo cabbirrada saxda ah ee qeexidaha cutubyadu siiyaan (US survey foot waa cutub gaar ah). Cutubyada aadan waligaa isticmaalin demi, liisaska cutubyada way ka baxaan; mid calaamadee, shuqullada cusub ayaa ku bilaabmaa. Faylku had iyo jeer wuxuu hayaa cutubkiisa. Sanduuqyada gaarka ah ee PartCraft ma raacaan liisaska ama calaamadda hadda: qaybaha wali waxay muujiyaan mm. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003ECutubyada, qiyamka qoran iyo liisaska cutubyada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabeyn dhow iyo panel-yo la nadiifiyo.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbirka qaabeynta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKooban\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wax badan ku habeeyaa shaashadda (shaashadaha taabashada iyo telefoonada waxay haystaan badhamadooda waaweyn). Panel kasta oo dhinac ah wuxuu leeyahay bar cinwaan khafiif ah: jiid si aad u xidho ama u kala go&#039;do panel-ka, ka soo rid bar panel kale si aad u wadaagto hal qolof oo tabs ah, ku xidh si uu u siibto geeska, ama qari oo dib u soo celi geeska. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#make-the-layout-denser\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"make-the-layout-denser\"\u003EHagid panel-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWada-hadallada way dhaqaaqaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Jiid wada-hadal ka bar cinwaanka si aad uga fogaato naqshadda; wuxuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa meeshii aad ka tagtay. Laba jeer riix bar cinwaanka si aad mar kale dhexda ugu dhigto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels#move-a-dialog\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\" data-hash=\"move-a-dialog\"\u003EWada-hadalka dhaqaaq\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECuntooyinka caawiyayaasha AI.\u003C/strong\u003E Toban codsi oo la shaqeeyay caawiyahaaga (nadiifi naqshad, samee set, hubi naqshadaha, weydii moodelka su&#039;aalo, isku geyso xisaabinta qadarka, isku day kala duwanaansho qayb…), mid kastaa leh qalabyada uu wicayo iyo ogolaanshaha uu u baahan yahay, mid kastaana tijaabooyinkeenna ayaa dib u ciyaaray. Apps-ka ma lahan AI. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ECuntooyinka caawiyayaasha AI\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELuuqadaha.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Portugal)\u003C/strong\u003E waa cusub \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELuuqad\u003C/span\u003E. Iyada, \u003Cstrong\u003EPortuguês (Brasil)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEspañol (México)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBahasa Indonesia\u003C/strong\u003E hadda waxay leeyihiin erayada apps-ka oo dhan, iyagoo ah qabyo aan weli dhigan qof af-ka-hooyo ah. Mawduucyada caawinta waxay ku qoran yihiin Ingiriisi, mid ka mid ahna Isbaanish.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sheegaa sababta hubinta cusboonaysiinta u fashilantay (weli fayl kuu ah nidaamkaaga ma jiro, shabakad ma jirto, saxiixa xun), halkii uu ku odhan lahaa &quot;Dhammaystir&quot;, wuxuuna joojiyaa soo celinta kaarka Waxa cusub ee aad xidhay ilaa nooc cusub la sii daayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-ma-jiraan-nooca-hadda\"\u003EWeli ma jiraan nooca hadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.7 lama saxiixin code-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Saxiixa, iyo xirmada Microsoft Store, waxay u guureen 0.8 sababtoo ah xaqiijinta shahaadada weli ma imaan. Hubi SHA-256 ee ku xigta fayl kasta getcadcraft.com/download. Windows, haddii SmartScreen joojiyo installer-ka, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacluumaad dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu orod si kasta\u003C/span\u003E. Mac, markii ugu horaysa, midig-riix CadCraft Studio oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E. CadCraft Studio weli ma ku jirto app store, iPad ama iPhone build weli ma jiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiisaska xagalka iyo jiifka ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECutubyada\u003C/span\u003E waa la kaydiyaa, laakiin ma jiro sanduuq ka akhrisa weli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJidhadka ka yimid STEP, mesh iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E ma leeyihiin taariikh, dusha qalooca ahna waa dusha fidsan ee fasedyo. Midabada, magacyada qaybaha iyo geedka isku-dhisku ma akhrin STEP-ka; curves, SubD objects, qoraal, layers iyo midabada ma akhrin \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E. Akhriyaha \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E waxaa lagu hubiyay faylal ay qoreen qalabka qaabka laftiisa, weli ma aha faylal ay barnaamijka naqshaddu kaydiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIllustrate weli ma furo faylalka STEP \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl kale ka…\u003C/span\u003E (fur STEP-ka naqshadda oo bilow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybta furan\u003C/span\u003E), ModelCraft iyo BimCraft ma geyn karaan moodel si toos ah, sawirada heerka path tracer-ka lama bixiyo. Dhoofinta fiidiyaha iyo faylka wada-falka weli lama hubin telefoonada iyo taabletyada dhabta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarnaamijyada laser-ka waxay qaadaan khadadka faylalka DXF oo kaliya: qaabka fidsan ee qaybaha birta xaashida ah wuxuu u baahan yahay exact kernel. CadCraft Studio weli ma leh Web Serial, sidaas darteed halkaas kaydi G-code-ka oo u dir barnaamijka laser-kaaga. G-code-ka laser-ka iyo sadda post-ka ee la dhex dhisay weli lama caddeyn mishiin dhab ah: hubi barnaamij kasta simulator-ka xakameyntaada marka hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaystirka 3D waa Parallel iyo Scallop oo keliya: ma jiro 3D roughing, waterline, pencil ama rest machining, ma jiro turning. Maktabadda qalabyada waxa lagu hayaa browser-kan, lama isku waafaqsiiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBogga habeeyaha, halka obbiyaashu ku doortaan kala duwanaansho goobta oo ay soo dejiyaan, waa muuqaal shaqaalaha oo keliya ilaa badhanka goobta la shido. Ports (barta xiriirka) PartCraft kama dejinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXubnaha qaab-dhismeedka waxay raacaan khadad toosan oo keliya, waxayna yihiin hal jidh oo aan lahayn laxaamad (weld beads).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabka menu-ga ribbon-ka PartCraft wali wuxuu sawiraa badhan kasta cabbir buuxa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagnetics: magnet joogta ah waa 2-D oo keliya; mootooyin, bir la buuxiyey iyo mesher-ka qaybaha qalooca weli lama dhisin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax kasta oo kale waxa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waa waxa isbeddelay PartCraft 0.7, marka la barbardhigo 0.6. Qaybaha waxay ka imanayaan faylal badan, workspace cusub wuxuuna sameeyaa buugaag naqshadaada ka. Cusub Buugaag naqshadaada ka Workspace-ka Illustrate. Dooro Illustrate beddelka Meel shaqo, kadibna Cusub kooxda Buug: buugu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaybta ama isku-dhiska furan, isku-dhis la kaydiyay, ama fayl glTF, OBJ, STL ama 3MF (geedkiisa iyo magacyadiisa way ilaalinayaan; nuqulada qayb isku mid ah waxay noqdaan hal qayb oo tiro leh). Buugu waa fayl gaar ah (.partcraft-manual.json) oo leh nuqul qaybaha, sidaas darteed dukumentiga wuu sii socdaa naqshaddu intay socoto. Eeg Bilow buug Illustrate. Muuqaalada iyo muuqyada. Qari, ghost, kala saar ama midab kale u beddel qaybaha, ciyaar muuqaal kala-furan, jar qayb ama sanduuq ka jar moodelka, ku dar muraayad weyn, oo dhammaan keydi sidii muuqaal. Eeg Muuqaalada, muuqyada, jarista iyo muraayadda weyn. Balloons iyo liis qaybaha. Hal riix ayaa balloon ku sameeyaa qayb kasta oo muuqaalku muujinayo; lambarada waxay la joogaan qaybahooda oo waligood dib looma isticmaalo. Liiska wuxuu ku jiri karaa muuqaalka oo wuxuu u kaydiyaa CSV. Eeg Liiska qaybaha iyo balloons. Faallo la xidhan yahay: calaamado iyo callout-yo buuxiya lambarka, magaca, agabka ama tirada qaybta, fallaadho, masaafooyin, xagal iyo radii la qiyaasay qaybaha, qaabab iyo sawirro. Way raacaan qaybtooda marka ay kala furanto. Eeg Faallooyinka la xidhan yahay. Sawir khad, tilmaamo iyo fayl 3D. Dhoofi muuqaal kasta sidii sawir khad vector (SVG ama PDF) oo leh khado qarsan iyo jarista xarriijinta, ama sidii PNG; u beddel muuqaalada tilmaamo tallaabo-tallaabo ah PDF ama hal bog HTML; ama kaydi hal fayl HTML oo laga furi karo browser kasta markii aan internet lahayn, oo leh muuqaalada, liiska qaybaha iyo animation-ka. Eeg Sawirrada farsamada, Dukumentiyada tilmaamaha iyo Faylka 3D ee wada-falka. Animation iyo cusboonaysiin. Qaybaha iyo kamarada fur, muuqaalka kala-furan ku duub tallaabo-tallaabo, oo kaydi fiidiyo. Marka naqshaddu beddesho, Cusbooneysii naqshadda… wuxuu muujinayaa waxa dhaqaaqay, beddelay, yimid ama baxay ka hor inta aan waxba la beddelin, oo wuxuu hayaa muuqaalada, faallooyinka, balloons-ka iyo furayaasha qaybahooda. Eeg Animation-ka buugga iyo Cusbooneysii buugga naqshadda. Furista faylal kale Faylalka STEP waxay furmaan jidh adag. Fur wuxuu akhriyaa AP203, AP214 iyo AP242 STEP iyada oo aan exact kernel-ka lahayn. Dusha fidsan waxay fidsan yihiin, dusha qalooca ahna waxay noqdaan wax badan oo fidsan yar yar, isku-dhiskuna wuxuu imanayaa hal jidh oo qayb kasta meesha faylku dhigayo. Ku sawir dusha fidsan, jar oo ku dar. Eeg Fur faylka STEP oo ku dhis. Mesh-yada STL, OBJ iyo 3MF waxay noqdaan jidh adag. Fur ama ka soo rid faylka: PartCraft wuxuu isku xidhaa geeso laba-jibbaaran, xidhaa godad yaryar, buuxiyaa godadka oo wuxuu rogaa saddex-geeska u jeeda jihada qaldan, kadibna wuxuu sheegaa waxa sameeyay iyo haddii mesh-ku hadda xidhan yahay. Dooro unit-yada iyo jihada kor, jidhka waxa uu imanayaa sida Imported1, dusha fidsanna waxay noqonayaan wejiyo lagu sawiro. Mesh aan xidhmi karin wuxuu sheegaa inta furan ee harsan, mana darto wax. Eeg Fur STL, OBJ ama 3MF sida jidh adag. Faylalka .3dm waxay furmaan hal jidh. Meshes-ka, polysurfaces-ka, extrusions-ka iyo meelaynta blockyada ee fayl .3dm waxay imanayaan hal jidh adag, oo ka mid ah meshes-ka lagu kaydiyay faylka ama PartCraft ayaa u jeexay, iyada oo la marayo isla saxid iyo hubinta \"xidhan?\" sida mesh. Curves, qoraal, SubD objects, layers iyo midabada waa laga tagay, wadahadaluhuna wuu sheegaa. Eeg Fur moodel .3dm sida jidh adag. Qaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada Frameyo ka samaysan birta. Samee frame khadad ahaan, hal sawir-gacmeed ama dhowr si frame 3D ah, kadibna Wax dheeraad ah › Xubin qaab-dhismeed: qaybta ka timid miiska AISC ama EN 10365 waxay socotaa khad kasta dhexdiisa. Geesaha waa la xardhay ama la kala jaray, xubnaha ku kulma T ama saddex geesta ayaa loo jaray in ay ku habboonaadaan, dhammaadyada xoraa waxay heli karaan qolof iyo geesaha gusset-ka, liiska jarista wuxuu siinayaa dherer kasta oo qayb ah iyo xagalka dhammaadka (Kaydi liiska jarista (CSV)). Eeg Frameyo ka samaysan qaybaha birta. Lilmo xidhan oo isku-dhisyada. Qaybaha la isku xidhay giraan ah (four-bar linkage, crank iyo slider, frame la xiray) hadda way xidhmaan: jiid ama qor qiime lilmada, kuwa kale ayaa raacaa, hubinta dhaqdhaqaaqana wuxuu isla sidaas u maraa lilmada. Isku-xidhka weli dhaqaaqi karo waa buluug, lilmo aan xidhmi karin waa casaan wuxuuna sheegaa intii uu ka fogyahay. Eeg Lilmaha xidhan: linkages. Qaybaha leh boqolaal astaamood. PartCraft wuxuu hayaa jidhka uu ku jiray taariikhda dhexdeeda, sidaas darteed isbedel dambe taariikhda wuxuu dib u dhisaa oo kaliya astaamaha ka dambeeya, jarista iyo bossesyada aan taabanin ayaa si wada jir ah loo dhaqmaa. Waxa lagu tijaabiyay qayb leh 750 astaamood. Daaqada Halbeegyada waxay la socotaa boqolaal isle'eg, Ka noqo wuxuu hayaa 200 tallaabo haddii aysan xoogga badan xusuusta isticmaalin (waligeed ka yar 20). Eeg Qaybaha leh boqolaal astaamood. Xirmada kala duwanaanshaha habaynteeda. Xirmada kala duwanaanshaha… hoosta Habayn ee tab-ka Halbeegyada waxay dhisaysaa habayn kasta, ama kuwa aad calaamaddo, hal zip: STEP, IFC, xaashi naqshad DWG iyo muuqaal kasta, miis halbeegyadooda (CSV iyo JSON), iyo qaybta oo ah hal shay maktabad leh kala duwanaanshaheeda. Habayn aan la dhisi karin waa la taxay oo waa laga tagaa. Sadarka amarka wuxuu sameeyaa isku mid oo leh partcraft variants. Eeg Samee xirmada kala duwanaanshaha habaynteeda. Samaynta Post processors-ka aad wax ka beddeli karto. Posts-ka sida Fanuc, GRBL iyo LinuxCNC ee Wax soo saarka hadda waa fayl qoraal gaagaaban oo ku jira qaabka post-ka PartCraft laftiisa, wuxuuna weli qorayaa wax kasta sidii hore. Wax ka beddel post… wuxuu furaa nuqulkaaga mid ka mid ah (Post cusub… iyo Soo gali faylka post… sidoo kale), wuxuu sheegaa khadka qaldan, wuxuuna muujinayaa G-code-ka uu qorayo markaad qorayso. Posts-ka waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta iyo sidii faylal .cpost. Eeg Post processors-ka aad wax ka beddeli karto. Dhamaystirka 3D: Parallel iyo Scallop. Dusha moodel oo dhan ku dhamaystir kubbad, bull-nose ama flat end mill, khado isku-tiir ah xagal kasta, ama marooyin meel fog oo la go'aamiyay ka dhexeeya si uu buurtu ka dhexeeya u yeelo dherer aad weydiisay (ma aha flat end mill). Eeg Dhamaystirka 3D: parallel iyo scallop. Maktabadda qalabyada. Kaydi qalabyada browser-kan qayb kasta, oo dhoofi ama soo geli sida fayl JSON si aad ugu raro kombiyuutar kale. Eeg Maktabadda qalabyada. Agabka iyo moodelka midabka. Marka Muuji agabka la simulated uu furan yahay, agabku waa cagaar moodelka dushiisa, casaan meesha qalabku ku jaray, jaalaha ilaa cawlaha meesha agabku ka harsan yahay, furaha panel-ka ku jira. Eeg Simulate. Qaybaha hadhay ee u dhexeeya nest-yada. Nest kadib, wixii ka harsan saxan kasta wuxuu noqon karaa hadhaag lambar leh oo leh agabkiisa iyo dhumuciisa. Nest-ka xiga ee isla agab iyo dhumuc wuxuu marka hore isticmaalaa hadhaagga, kadibna saxanka buuxa; liiska agabka waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka iyo sidii CSV, DXF-na wuxuu calaamadiyaa hadhaag kasta. Eeg Kaydi oo dib u isticmaal qaybaha hadhay. Barnaamijyada laser-ka. Dhoofi › Barnaamijka laser… wuxuu qaadaa khadadka ka yimid faylka DXF oo wuxuu dejiyaa waxa lakab kasta sameeyo (jarid, score, engrave, fill), wuxuu muujiyaa dhaqdhaqaaqa madaxa, wuxuuna kaydiyaa G-code-ka GRBL laser-mode. Chrome iyo Edge waxay sidoo kale qaabeyn karaan shaqada iyada oo laser-ku damaa, kadibna waxay u dirtaa USB. Dejinta waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka. Eeg Naqshad u dir laser-ka. Dhoofinta USD. Dhoofi › Xidhmada USD (.usdz) wuxuu qoraa qaybta oo leh agabkeeda, mugeeda iyo culeyskeeda, ama isku-dhis oo qayb kasta mar keliya lagu qoro oo nuqul kasta la dhigo, mitir oo Z kor u taagan. Eeg Dhoofi qayb ama isku-dhis USD ahaan. Caawiyayaasha Qalabyo caawiyahaaga AI. Marka lagu shido Dejinta › PartCraft › Kaaliyayaasha, caawiye la xiriiray CadCraft Studio wuxuu akhrin karaa astaamaha, halbeegyada iyo sifooyinka culeyska, wuxuu dejin karaa halbeeg oo dib u dhisi karaa (hal tallaabo oo ka noqod), wuxuu orodsiin karaa script CraftScript, Lua ama Python sida workspace-ka Script u sameeyo, wuxuu dhoofin karaa STL, 3MF, STEP fasedyo ama USD, wuxuu kaydin karaa, wuxuuna dhoofin karaa buug sidii PDF, SVG, tilmaamo ama faylka 3D ee wada-falka. Server-ka faylalka iyo sadarka amarka cadcraft isku mid ayay sameeyaan qaybaha iyo buugaagta la kaydiyay. PartCraft ma leh AI. Eeg Isticmaal PartCraft oo leh caawiye AI. Waa la beddelay Qayb oo jidh ka faylka ah waxa loo kaydiyaa nooca qaybta 5. Qayb leh jidh STEP, STL, OBJ, 3MF ama .3dm waxay haysaa saddex-geesaha la saxay gudaha faylka .partcraft.json, sidaas darteed faylkii asalka ahaa uma baahnid mar kale. PartCraft 0.6 wuxuu diidaa nooca 5 oo wuxuu isticmaalaa fariintiisa \"nooc cusub\" halkii uu qaldan ku furi lahaa. Qaybaha kale waxa loo kaydiyaa sidii hore. Eeg Faylalka PartCraft. Posts-ka aad qorto waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta. PartCraft hore oo furta qayb noocaas ah wuxuu tirtiraa posts-ka markuu mar kale kaydiyo. App kasta Cutubyada. Dejinta › Guud › Cutubyada waxa uu leeyahay liis kala gooya dherer, aag, mugga, xagal iyo jiifka, oo cabbirrada saxda ah ee qeexidaha cutubyadu siiyaan (US survey foot waa cutub gaar ah). Cutubyada aadan waligaa isticmaalin demi, liisaska cutubyada way ka baxaan; mid calaamadee, shuqullada cusub ayaa ku bilaabmaa. Faylku had iyo jeer wuxuu hayaa cutubkiisa. Sanduuqyada gaarka ah ee PartCraft ma raacaan liisaska ama calaamadda hadda: qaybaha wali waxay muujiyaan mm. Eeg Cutubyada, qiyamka qoran iyo liisaska cutubyada. Qaabeyn dhow iyo panel-yo la nadiifiyo. Dejinta › Guud › Cabbirka qaabeynta › Kooban wuxuu wax badan ku habeeyaa shaashadda (shaashadaha taabashada iyo telefoonada waxay haystaan badhamadooda waaweyn). Panel kasta oo dhinac ah wuxuu leeyahay bar cinwaan khafiif ah: jiid si aad u xidho ama u kala go'do panel-ka, ka soo rid bar panel kale si aad u wadaagto hal qolof oo tabs ah, ku xidh si uu u siibto geeska, ama qari oo dib u soo celi geeska. Eeg Hagid panel-yada. Wada-hadallada way dhaqaaqaan. Jiid wada-hadal ka bar cinwaanka si aad uga fogaato naqshadda; wuxuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa meeshii aad ka tagtay. Laba jeer riix bar cinwaanka si aad mar kale dhexda ugu dhigto. Eeg Wada-hadalka dhaqaaq. Cuntooyinka caawiyayaasha AI. Toban codsi oo la shaqeeyay caawiyahaaga (nadiifi naqshad, samee set, hubi naqshadaha, weydii moodelka su'aalo, isku geyso xisaabinta qadarka, isku day kala duwanaansho qayb…), mid kastaa leh qalabyada uu wicayo iyo ogolaanshaha uu u baahan yahay, mid kastaana tijaabooyinkeenna ayaa dib u ciyaaray. Apps-ka ma lahan AI. Eeg Cuntooyinka caawiyayaasha AI. Luuqadaha. Português (Portugal) waa cusub Dejinta › Guud › Luuqad. Iyada, Português (Brasil), Español (México) iyo Bahasa Indonesia hadda waxay leeyihiin erayada apps-ka oo dhan, iyagoo ah qabyo aan weli dhigan qof af-ka-hooyo ah. Mawduucyada caawinta waxay ku qoran yihiin Ingiriisi, mid ka mid ahna Isbaanish. CadCraft Studio wuxuu sheegaa sababta hubinta cusboonaysiinta u fashilantay (weli fayl kuu ah nidaamkaaga ma jiro, shabakad ma jirto, saxiixa xun), halkii uu ku odhan lahaa \"Dhammaystir\", wuxuuna joojiyaa soo celinta kaarka Waxa cusub ee aad xidhay ilaa nooc cusub la sii daayo. Weli ma jiraan nooca hadda 0.7 lama saxiixin code-ka. Saxiixa, iyo xirmada Microsoft Store, waxay u guureen 0.8 sababtoo ah xaqiijinta shahaadada weli ma imaan. Hubi SHA-256 ee ku xigta fayl kasta getcadcraft.com/download. Windows, haddii SmartScreen joojiyo installer-ka, dooro Macluumaad dheeraad ah, kadibna Ku orod si kasta. Mac, markii ugu horaysa, midig-riix CadCraft Studio oo dooro Fur. CadCraft Studio weli ma ku jirto app store, iPad ama iPhone build weli ma jiro. Liisaska xagalka iyo jiifka ee Cutubyada waa la kaydiyaa, laakiin ma jiro sanduuq ka akhrisa weli. Jidhadka ka yimid STEP, mesh iyo .3dm ma leeyihiin taariikh, dusha qalooca ahna waa dusha fidsan ee fasedyo. Midabada, magacyada qaybaha iyo geedka isku-dhisku ma akhrin STEP-ka; curves, SubD objects, qoraal, layers iyo midabada ma akhrin .3dm. Akhriyaha .3dm waxaa lagu hubiyay faylal ay qoreen qalabka qaabka laftiisa, weli ma aha faylal ay barnaamijka naqshaddu kaydiyay. Illustrate weli ma furo faylalka STEP Fayl kale ka… (fur STEP-ka naqshadda oo bilow Qaybta furan), ModelCraft iyo BimCraft ma geyn karaan moodel si toos ah, sawirada heerka path tracer-ka lama bixiyo. Dhoofinta fiidiyaha iyo faylka wada-falka weli lama hubin telefoonada iyo taabletyada dhabta ah. Barnaamijyada laser-ka waxay qaadaan khadadka faylalka DXF oo kaliya: qaabka fidsan ee qaybaha birta xaashida ah wuxuu u baahan yahay exact kernel. CadCraft Studio weli ma leh Web Serial, sidaas darteed halkaas kaydi G-code-ka oo u dir barnaamijka laser-kaaga. G-code-ka laser-ka iyo sadda post-ka ee la dhex dhisay weli lama caddeyn mishiin dhab ah: hubi barnaamij kasta simulator-ka xakameyntaada marka hore. Dhamaystirka 3D waa Parallel iyo Scallop oo keliya: ma jiro 3D roughing, waterline, pencil ama rest machining, ma jiro turning. Maktabadda qalabyada waxa lagu hayaa browser-kan, lama isku waafaqsiiyo. Bogga habeeyaha, halka obbiyaashu ku doortaan kala duwanaansho goobta oo ay soo dejiyaan, waa muuqaal shaqaalaha oo keliya ilaa badhanka goobta la shido. Ports (barta xiriirka) PartCraft kama dejinayo. Xubnaha qaab-dhismeedka waxay raacaan khadad toosan oo keliya, waxayna yihiin hal jidh oo aan lahayn laxaamad (weld beads). Qaabka menu-ga ribbon-ka PartCraft wali wuxuu sawiraa badhan kasta cabbir buuxa. Magnetics: magnet joogta ah waa 2-D oo keliya; mootooyin, bir la buuxiyey iyo mesher-ka qaybaha qalooca weli lama dhisin. Wax kasta oo kale waxa ku jira Waxa weli aan la dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"partcraft","title":"Bilow PartCraft","summary":"Waxa PartCraft-ku hadda sameeyo, waxa browser-kaagu u baahan yahay, iyo qayb hore oo daqiiqado toban ah, laga bilaabo sketch ilaa fayl la kaydiyay.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["bilow","ku bilow","bilaabid","hordhac","casharka","qaybta ugu horreysa","saxan","parametric","qaybta modeler"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-u-baahan-tahay","text":"Waxa aad u baahan tahay","level":2},{"id":"fur-partcraft","text":"Fur PartCraft","level":2},{"id":"qaybtaadii-ugu-horreysay-saxan-leh-god","text":"Qaybtaadii ugu horreysay: saxan leh god","level":2},{"id":"sketch-garee-qaabka","text":"Sketch-garee qaabka","level":3},{"id":"siiso-cabbirro","text":"Siiso cabbirro","level":3},{"id":"soo-saar","text":"Soo saar","level":3},{"id":"ku-dar-godka","text":"Ku dar godka","level":3},{"id":"kaydi","text":"Kaydi","level":3},{"id":"meesha-aad-u-tagi-karto-marka-xigta","text":"Meesha aad u tagi karto marka xigta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft waa app-ka qaybta parametric-ka iyo isku-dhiska ee qoyska CadCraft. Waxaad sawirtaa sketch 2D, waxaad ku xidhaa xidhiidh iyo cabbirro, waxaad u beddeshaa jidh adag feature-yo sida extrude, revolve iyo hole, waxaadna bedeli kartaa tiro kasta markasta: qaybtu waxay dib u dhisaa taariikhdeeda. Qaybaha ka dib waxay galaan isku-dhiska (assemblies), halkaas oo joints ay meeshooda geliyaan oo ay kuu ogolaadaan inaad hubiso dhaqdhaqaaqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa dhismahan hadda sameeya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EShaqada\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad heleysid\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESketches\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo, laabyo, goobo, qaloocyo, barooyin iyo xariiqyo dhexe, oo leh xidhiidh iyo cabbirro, iyo xaalad toos ah: hoos, buuxa ama ka badan go&#039;an\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESolid features\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrude, cut, revolve, revolved cut, godad fudud iyo kuwa counterbore ah, qaabab toos ah iyo wareeg, mirror, fillet iyo chamfer geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya dusha siman, iyo shell iyo draft dusha siman. Sweep, loft iyo feature-yada kale ee u baahan kernel saxda ah weli lama dhisin nooca hadda: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan wali la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHistory\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir tirooyinka feature kasta, dami, dib u celi, dib u dalbo iyo tirtir, oo leh undo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAssemblies\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybo ku xidhan rigid, revolute iyo slider joints, hubin isku dhac iyo hubin dhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrawings\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet A3 oo leh saddex muuqaal, isometric, qayb (section), muuqaal faahfaahin, cabbirrada guud, datums, feature control frames iyo calaamadaha dhammaystirka dusha, oo loo dhoofiyay PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFiles\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylalkeeda qaybta iyo isku-dhiska; soo dhoofinta STL, 3MF, STEP saxda ah, DXF iyo PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax walba browser-kaaga ayay ku shaqeeyaan, kombuyuutarkaaga. \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba lama soo dirin.\u003C/strong\u003E Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/files\"\u003EFaylalka: fur, kaydi iyo dhoofi\u003C/a\u003E si aad u ogaato halka faylalku tagaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-u-baahan-tahay\"\u003EWaxa aad u baahan tahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChrome, Edge, Firefox ama Safari oo casri ah oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003EWebGL\u003C/strong\u003E (grafikada 3D) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EWebAssembly\u003C/strong\u003E la shido. Labaduba way shidan yihiin caadi ahaan. Kernel-ka adagga waxaa dhisa WebAssembly mesh kernel oo app-ka la soo rarto: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMouse-ka ayaa ugu fudud. Trackpad-ku wuu shaqeeyaa, shaashadaha taabashada ayaa u shaqeeya muuqaalka iyo sketch-ka fudud: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\" data-topic=\"partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\"\u003ETrackpad, taabasho iyo shaashadaha yaryar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballac ah ayaa muujinaysa toolbar-ka oo dhan hal safar. Daaqadaha ka yar waxay toolbar-ka u rogaan dhinac; telefoonka, panelada waxay u furmaan sida xaashi bar hoose ka bilaabanaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWixii ku saabsan browser-yada: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowsers iyo kombuyuutarrada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka, iyo desktop-ka gudaha CadCraft Studio. Kaydinta daruurta weli ma diyaar aha: fayl-ka kumbuyuutarkaaga ayaad ka furtaa qaybaha, oona ku kaydisaa sida faylal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-partcraft\"\u003EFur PartCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug inta shaashaddu tidhi &quot;Kernel-ka adagga ayaa la soo rarayaa…&quot;. Tani waxay qaadataa wakhti marka ugu horreysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxaad aragtaa muuqaal 3D oo madhan oo leh saddex diyaarad oo salka ah, taariikhda bidix (&quot;Part1&quot;, kadibna Front plane, Top plane, Right plane) iyo sanduuq muuqaalka ku qoran &quot;Start a part&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChip-ka ku yaal dhamaadka midig ee status bar-ka wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Mesh kernel&quot;: PartCraft wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel nooca hadda, sidaas darteed wareegyada dusha waa dhaqaaqyo laga dhigay. Waad bilaabi kartaa naqshadeynta isla markiiba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii muuqaalku sheego in browser-ku aanu 3D tusi karin, ama kernel-ku soo rarmin, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting#the-app-does-not-start\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"the-app-does-not-start\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaybtaadii-ugu-horreysay-saxan-leh-god\"\u003EQaybtaadii ugu horreysay: saxan leh god\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad samayn doontaa saxan 60 × 40 mm ah, dhumuc 10 mm ah, leh god 6 mm ah oo dhex mara. Unugyadu waa millimeter.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sketch-garee-qaabka\"\u003ESketch-garee qaabka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhagsii \u003Cstrong\u003EFront plane\u003C/strong\u003E taariikhda bidix. Diyaaraddu waa la iftiimiyaa muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Muuqaalku wuxuu u jeedaa diyaaraddii toos, qalabka Line ayaa firfircoon.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u isticmaasho qalabka Rectangle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqdhaqaaq taxanaha xagga asalka (goobta cas ee yar ee jaranjarada leh). Laba jaad oo yar ayaa tilmaamaya inuu ku dhejiyo. Dhagsii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKor u dhaqaaq oo midig u dhaqaaq, markaas mar kale dhagsii. Waxaad heshay laaban. Xariiqyadiisu waa buluug: buluug macnaheedu waa inay weli dhaqaaqi karaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"siiso-cabbirro\"\u003ESiiso cabbirro\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u isticmaasho qalabka Dimension.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhagsii xariiqda sare, kadibna dhagsii wax yar oo ka sarreeya. Sanduuq tiro ayaa furmaya oo muujinaya dhererka hadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Ccode\u003E60\u003C/code\u003E kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Laabyadu waxay noqotaa 60 mm ballac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhagsii xariiqda bidix, kadibna dhagsii wax yar oo bidix ah. Qor \u003Ccode\u003E40\u003C/code\u003E kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChip-ka geeska sare ee bidix ee muuqaalka hadda wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EFully defined\u003C/strong\u003E xariiqyadana waxay noqdaan ink (madow theme-ka Paper, cad theme-ka Model). Dhammaan barooyinka iyo cabbirrada way go&#039;an yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad laabta ka bilaabatay meel ka fog asalka, chip-ku wuu sii sheegi doonaa &quot;Under defined · 2 degrees of freedom&quot;. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dooratid Select, dhagsii hal geeso, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+dhagsii asalka, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Coincident\u003C/span\u003E panelka midig. Lacaggaa: &quot;• Isku-meel&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"soo-saar\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExit\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa sketch-ku xirmo (badanaa laba jeer).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtrude\u003C/span\u003E. Jidh adag oo 10 mm ah ayaa soo muuqda. &quot;Extrude1&quot; wuxuu ku daraa taariikhda, &quot;Sketch1&quot; ayaa hoos ka soo gashay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka midig wuxuu muujinayaa dejinta extrude-ka. Si aad u beddesho dhumucda, qor tiro cusub sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EDepth (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Qaybtu isla markiiba dib ayay u dhismaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ku-dar-godka\"\u003EKu dar godka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhagsii dusha siman ee weyn ee hore ee saxanka (dhamaadka extrusion-ka). Dusha oo dhan ayaa iftiimaya, panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EFace\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch on this face\u003C/span\u003E panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u isticmaasho qalabka Point, kadibna dhagsii meel u dhow bartamaha dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHole\u003C/span\u003E. God 6 mm ah ayaa saxanka dhex mara. Haddii aad rabto, beddel \u003Cstrong\u003EDiameter (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EPart\u003C/strong\u003E ee bidix hoose hadda wuxuu akhrinayaa mugga, balaadhka dusha, cabbirka (60 × 40 × 10 mm) iyo &quot;Through holes: 1&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kaydi\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrowser-kaagu wuxuu soo dejinayaa \u003Ccode\u003EPart1.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E meeshii download-yada ku jirto. Faylku wuxuu haysaa taariikhda oo dhan: mar kale fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E si aad u sii tafatirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad marka hore magaca qaybta u beddesho, dhagsii meel bannaan muuqaalka si aan wax loo dooran, kadibna qor \u003Cstrong\u003EName\u003C/strong\u003E cusub panelka midig.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-aad-u-tagi-karto-marka-xigta\"\u003EMeesha aad u tagi karto marka xigta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\"\u003ESketch-kaaga ugu horreeya sawir\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003ESketch si buuxa u go&#039;ay\u003C/a\u003E waxay si habboon u sharxayaan sketcher-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/edit-history\" data-topic=\"partcraft/edit-history\"\u003EBeddel qayb taariikhdeeda\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu tusayaa sida aad wax u tafatirto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EWareeg, jar iyo qodi\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003ESamee sawir\u003C/a\u003E ayaa dhammeeya qaybta. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan wali la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu liistaa waxa nooca hadda aan samayn, sida sweeps iyo lofts.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"partcraft/coming-from\"\u003EKa timaada naqshadeeye parametric kale\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu liistaa caadooyinka halkan si kale u shaqeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"partcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E waa liiska oo dhan ee shortcut-yada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/help\" data-topic=\"basics/help\"\u003EIsticmaalka bogan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"PartCraft waa app-ka qaybta parametric-ka iyo isku-dhiska ee qoyska CadCraft. Waxaad sawirtaa sketch 2D, waxaad ku xidhaa xidhiidh iyo cabbirro, waxaad u beddeshaa jidh adag feature-yo sida extrude, revolve iyo hole, waxaadna bedeli kartaa tiro kasta markasta: qaybtu waxay dib u dhisaa taariikhdeeda. Qaybaha ka dib waxay galaan isku-dhiska (assemblies), halkaas oo joints ay meeshooda geliyaan oo ay kuu ogolaadaan inaad hubiso dhaqdhaqaaqa. Waxa dhismahan hadda sameeya: Shaqada Waxa aad heleysid Sketches Xariiqyo, laabyo, goobo, qaloocyo, barooyin iyo xariiqyo dhexe, oo leh xidhiidh iyo cabbirro, iyo xaalad toos ah: hoos, buuxa ama ka badan go'an Solid features Extrude, cut, revolve, revolved cut, godad fudud iyo kuwa counterbore ah, qaabab toos ah iyo wareeg, mirror, fillet iyo chamfer geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya dusha siman, iyo shell iyo draft dusha siman. Sweep, loft iyo feature-yada kale ee u baahan kernel saxda ah weli lama dhisin nooca hadda: eeg Waxa aan wali la dhisin History Tafatir tirooyinka feature kasta, dami, dib u celi, dib u dalbo iyo tirtir, oo leh undo Assemblies Qaybo ku xidhan rigid, revolute iyo slider joints, hubin isku dhac iyo hubin dhaqdhaqaaq Drawings Sheet A3 oo leh saddex muuqaal, isometric, qayb (section), muuqaal faahfaahin, cabbirrada guud, datums, feature control frames iyo calaamadaha dhammaystirka dusha, oo loo dhoofiyay PDF Files Faylalkeeda qaybta iyo isku-dhiska; soo dhoofinta STL, 3MF, STEP saxda ah, DXF iyo PDF Wax walba browser-kaaga ayay ku shaqeeyaan, kombuyuutarkaaga. Waxba lama soo dirin. Eeg Faylalka: fur, kaydi iyo dhoofi si aad u ogaato halka faylalku tagaan. Waxa aad u baahan tahay Chrome, Edge, Firefox ama Safari oo casri ah oo leh WebGL (grafikada 3D) iyo WebAssembly la shido. Labaduba way shidan yihiin caadi ahaan. Kernel-ka adagga waxaa dhisa WebAssembly mesh kernel oo app-ka la soo rarto: eeg Mesh kernel-ka. Mouse-ka ayaa ugu fudud. Trackpad-ku wuu shaqeeyaa, shaashadaha taabashada ayaa u shaqeeya muuqaalka iyo sketch-ka fudud: eeg Trackpad, taabasho iyo shaashadaha yaryar. Shaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballac ah ayaa muujinaysa toolbar-ka oo dhan hal safar. Daaqadaha ka yar waxay toolbar-ka u rogaan dhinac; telefoonka, panelada waxay u furmaan sida xaashi bar hoose ka bilaabanaya. Wixii ku saabsan browser-yada: Browsers iyo kombuyuutarrada. PartCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa browser-ka, iyo desktop-ka gudaha CadCraft Studio. Kaydinta daruurta weli ma diyaar aha: fayl-ka kumbuyuutarkaaga ayaad ka furtaa qaybaha, oona ku kaydisaa sida faylal. Fur PartCraft Fur PartCraft. Sug inta shaashaddu tidhi \"Kernel-ka adagga ayaa la soo rarayaa…\". Tani waxay qaadataa wakhti marka ugu horreysa. Waxaad aragtaa muuqaal 3D oo madhan oo leh saddex diyaarad oo salka ah, taariikhda bidix (\"Part1\", kadibna Front plane, Top plane, Right plane) iyo sanduuq muuqaalka ku qoran \"Start a part\". Chip-ka ku yaal dhamaadka midig ee status bar-ka wuxuu leeyahay \"Mesh kernel\": PartCraft wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel nooca hadda, sidaas darteed wareegyada dusha waa dhaqaaqyo laga dhigay. Waad bilaabi kartaa naqshadeynta isla markiiba. Haddii muuqaalku sheego in browser-ku aanu 3D tusi karin, ama kernel-ku soo rarmin, eeg Dhibaatooyinka. Qaybtaadii ugu horreysay: saxan leh god Waxaad samayn doontaa saxan 60 × 40 mm ah, dhumuc 10 mm ah, leh god 6 mm ah oo dhex mara. Unugyadu waa millimeter. Sketch-garee qaabka Dhagsii Front plane taariikhda bidix. Diyaaraddu waa la iftiimiyaa muuqaalka. Dooro Sketch toolbar-ka, ama riix S. Muuqaalku wuxuu u jeedaa diyaaraddii toos, qalabka Line ayaa firfircoon. Riix R si aad u isticmaasho qalabka Rectangle. Dhaqdhaqaaq taxanaha xagga asalka (goobta cas ee yar ee jaranjarada leh). Laba jaad oo yar ayaa tilmaamaya inuu ku dhejiyo. Dhagsii. Kor u dhaqaaq oo midig u dhaqaaq, markaas mar kale dhagsii. Waxaad heshay laaban. Xariiqyadiisu waa buluug: buluug macnaheedu waa inay weli dhaqaaqi karaan. Siiso cabbirro Riix D si aad u isticmaasho qalabka Dimension. Dhagsii xariiqda sare, kadibna dhagsii wax yar oo ka sarreeya. Sanduuq tiro ayaa furmaya oo muujinaya dhererka hadda. Qor 60 kadibna riix Enter. Laabyadu waxay noqotaa 60 mm ballac. Dhagsii xariiqda bidix, kadibna dhagsii wax yar oo bidix ah. Qor 40 kadibna riix Enter. Chip-ka geeska sare ee bidix ee muuqaalka hadda wuxuu leeyahay Fully defined xariiqyadana waxay noqdaan ink (madow theme-ka Paper, cad theme-ka Model). Dhammaan barooyinka iyo cabbirrada way go'an yihiin. Haddii aad laabta ka bilaabatay meel ka fog asalka, chip-ku wuu sii sheegi doonaa \"Under defined · 2 degrees of freedom\". Riix S si aad u dooratid Select, dhagsii hal geeso, Shift+dhagsii asalka, kadibna dooro • Coincident panelka midig. Lacaggaa: \"• Isku-meel\". Soo saar Dooro Exit toolbar-ka, ama riix Esc ilaa sketch-ku xirmo (badanaa laba jeer). Dooro Extrude. Jidh adag oo 10 mm ah ayaa soo muuqda. \"Extrude1\" wuxuu ku daraa taariikhda, \"Sketch1\" ayaa hoos ka soo gashay. Panelka midig wuxuu muujinayaa dejinta extrude-ka. Si aad u beddesho dhumucda, qor tiro cusub sanduuqa Depth (mm) kadibna riix Enter ama Tab. Qaybtu isla markiiba dib ayay u dhismaysaa. Ku dar godka Dhagsii dusha siman ee weyn ee hore ee saxanka (dhamaadka extrusion-ka). Dusha oo dhan ayaa iftiimaya, panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay Face. Dooro Sketch on this face panelka midig. Riix P si aad u isticmaasho qalabka Point, kadibna dhagsii meel u dhow bartamaha dusha. Dooro Exit. Dooro Hole. God 6 mm ah ayaa saxanka dhex mara. Haddii aad rabto, beddel Diameter (mm) panelka midig. Sanduuqa Part ee bidix hoose hadda wuxuu akhrinayaa mugga, balaadhka dusha, cabbirka (60 × 40 × 10 mm) iyo \"Through holes: 1\". Kaydi Riix Ctrl+S ama dooro Save. Browser-kaagu wuxuu soo dejinayaa Part1.partcraft.json meeshii download-yada ku jirto. Faylku wuxuu haysaa taariikhda oo dhan: mar kale fur Open si aad u sii tafatirto. Si aad marka hore magaca qaybta u beddesho, dhagsii meel bannaan muuqaalka si aan wax loo dooran, kadibna qor Name cusub panelka midig. Meesha aad u tagi karto marka xigta Sketch-kaaga ugu horreeya sawir iyo Sketch si buuxa u go'ay waxay si habboon u sharxayaan sketcher-ka. Beddel qayb taariikhdeeda wuxuu tusayaa sida aad wax u tafatirto. Wareeg, jar iyo qodi iyo Samee sawir ayaa dhammeeya qaybta. Waxa aan wali la dhisin wuxuu liistaa waxa nooca hadda aan samayn, sida sweeps iyo lofts. Ka timaada naqshadeeye parametric kale wuxuu liistaa caadooyinka halkan si kale u shaqeeya. Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka waa liiska oo dhan ee shortcut-yada. Isticmaalka bogan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"partcraft","title":"Shaashadda PartCraft","summary":"Safar ku wareegaysa kasta toolbar-ka iyo sida uu u beddelmo, taariikhda, xaqiiqooyinka qaybta, muuqaalka 3D, panel-ka sifooyinka iyo bar-ka xaaladda.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["shaashad","qaabeyn","toolbar","taariikhda","geedka astaamaha","sifooyin","panel","bar-ka xaaladda","interface","ui","safar","shaashad buuxda"],"headings":[{"id":"app-bar-ka","text":"App bar-ka","level":2},{"id":"toolbar-ka","text":"Toolbar-ka","level":2},{"id":"taariikhda-bidix","text":"Taariikhda (bidix)","level":2},{"id":"xaqiiqooyinka-qaybta","text":"Xaqiiqooyinka qaybta","level":3},{"id":"muuqaalka-3d-dhexe","text":"Muuqaalka 3D (dhexe)","level":2},{"id":"markaad-geesaha-ama-wejiyada-dooranayso","text":"Markaad geesaha ama wejiyada dooranayso","level":3},{"id":"xaashiga-naqshadda","text":"Xaashiga naqshadda","level":3},{"id":"markii-sawir-gacmeed-la-furay","text":"Markii sawir-gacmeed la furay","level":3},{"id":"panel-ka-sifooyinka-midig","text":"Panel-ka sifooyinka (midig)","level":2},{"id":"bar-ka-xaaladda-hoose","text":"Bar-ka xaaladda (hoose)","level":2},{"id":"shaashad-cidhiidhi-ah","text":"Shaashad cidhiidhi ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EShaashaddu waxa ay leedahay shan qaybood: toolbar-ka sare, taariikhda bidix, muuqaalka 3D dhexe, panel-ka sifooyinka midig iyo bar-ka xaaladda hoose. Dhammaantood ka sarreeya waa CadCraft app bar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"app-bar-ka\"\u003EApp bar-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBar-ka khafiifka ah ee ugu sarreeya wuxuu leeyahay goobta CadCraft, ma aha PartCraft laftiisa. Wuxuu muujinayaa magaca app-ka iyo meesha uu ka shaqeeyo, menu-ga nooca, \u003Cstrong\u003EKu saabsan PartCraft\u003C/strong\u003E, badhanka habka shaashadda iyo beddelka mawduuca Paper / Model.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaper\u003C/strong\u003E waa khadad madow xaashi cad ah. \u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E waa khadad cad background madow ah. Midabyada sawir-gacmeedku waxay raacaan mawduuca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (giraanta, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) waxa uu leeyahay tab \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E: badhanka mouse-ka ee wareejiya muuqaalka, mouse wheel ama trackpad, iyo xiriirrada intii aad sawirayso. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka habka shaashadda, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, wuxuu wareegaa caadi, shaashad buuxda, iyo shaashad buuxda oo bar-yada la qariyay. Markii bar-yada la qariyay, tilmaameha u qaad geeska sare (ama taabo halkaas) si aad dib ugu soo celiso. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa caadiga. Furahan waa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Mac-kaba, ma aha ⌘.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"toolbar-ka\"\u003EToolbar-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EToolbar-ka waa la kooxeeyay. Wuu isbeddelaa siday tahay waxa aad sameynayso, sidaas darteed hal saf ku habboon:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKooxda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhamada\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaa la muujiyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E (menu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHad iyo jeer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeed\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkii sawir-gacmeed aan la furin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeed\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bax\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfar-geesle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka dhexe\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya markii sawir-gacmeed la furay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAstaanno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToosan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareegsan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuraayad\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E (menu: Goo wareeg, Diyaarad, Dhidib, Bar, Sweep, Loft, Qabyo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta ku jirta, ma aha markii sawir-gacmeed ama naqshadda la furay. Fillet iyo Chamfer waxay ka shaqeeyaan geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba weji oo fidsan; Shell iyo Qabyo wejiyada fidsan. Sweep iyo Loft weli lama dhisin nooca hadda (waxay u baahan yihiin exact kernel); riixida mid waa sheegtaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAstaanno\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaystir\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya markaad dooranayso geesaha ama wejiyada fillet, chamfer, shell ama qabyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta ku jirta (waa la isticmaali karaa marka qaybtu leedahay jidh)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatum\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrame\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaystir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya xaashiga naqshadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-dhis\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhis\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta ku jirta (waa la isticmaali karaa marka qaybtu leedahay jidh)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-dhis\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar nuqul\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoint\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhac\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel qayb\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya isku-dhiska\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-dhis\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIntaad qayb ka isku-dhis ka wax beddelayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E (menu: Goo, Koobiyee, Dhaji, Dhaji meesha, Nuqul, Tirtir, Dooro dhammaan, Dooro midna)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHad iyo jeer; mid kasta wuxuu shaqeeyaa sawir-gacmeedka, taariikhda ama isku-dhiska aad ku jirto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJihada u jeedso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalada\u003C/span\u003E (menu: Qiyaas, Sifooyinka culeyska, Goyn, Qabyo, Zebra, Curvature, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaaradaha aasaasiga ah\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna Isometric, Hore, Dib, Sare, Hoose, Midig, Bidix)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHad iyo jeer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dul-dhaaf badhan si aad u ogaato waxa uu sameeyo iyo furihiisa. Badhanka midabka boodhka leh ma isticmaali karo hadda: tusaale ahaan badhamada astaamaha intii sawir-gacmeed la furay, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoint\u003C/span\u003E ka hor intaysan isku-dhisku lahayn laba qayb.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMenu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda Wax ka beddel wuxuu taxayaa falka wax-beddel kasta iyo furihiisa. Waxa koobiyeynta iyo dhajintu ku dhaqmaan waxay raacaan meesha aad joogto; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"partcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul\u003C/a\u003E. Tooltip-ka shayga midabka boodhka leh wuxuu sheegaa sababta uusan hadda shaqayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMenu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL, daabacaadda 3D\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3MF, daabacaadda 3D\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (jidh adag oo saxda ah)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (jidh adag oo saxda ah)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (xabbado, kernel-ka mesh)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad (PDF): muuqaallada, qaybta, faahfaahinta, GD&amp;T\u003C/span\u003E. Shayyada STEP ee saxda ah waxay qoraan dusha wareegga dhabta ah sida dusheedu yahay; kuwa fasedyada ah waxay qoraan sida fasedyo fidsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taariikhda-bidix\"\u003ETaariikhda (bidix)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel-ka bidix waa taariikhda astaamaha qaybta, liiska PartCraft ku dib u dhisa sare ilaa hoos.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECinwaanka waa magaca qaybta (&quot;Part1&quot; ilaa aad magaciisa beddesho).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaarada Hore\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaarada Sare\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaarada Midig\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa hore u yimaadda. Riix mid si aad u doorato; muuqaalka wuu iftiimaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosteeda waxaa ah astaamahaaga siday loo sameeyay. Sawir-gacmeed uu astaan isticmaalo ayaa lagu jiidaa hoosta astaantaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamad ku taal dhammaadka midig ee safka ayaa kuu sheegta xaaladdeeda:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(midna)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la dhisay, sawir-gacmeedkana si buuxda ayaa loo qeexay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E−\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeed aan si buuxda loo qeexin (wali wuu dhaqaaqi karaa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeed aad u qeexan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la dhisay, digniin ku jirta (ku dheji si aad u akhrido)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠ error\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAstaanta waa fashilantay. Ku dheji si aad u ogaato sababta, ama riix\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠ not built\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAstaanta waxay u baahan tahay mid kale oo fashilmay ama damaysan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la joojiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAstaan kasta wuxuu muujinayaa lambarkiisa ugu muhiimsan magaciisa ka dib, sida &quot;25 mm&quot; extrude ahaan ama &quot;Ø6.6 thru&quot; god ahaan. Laba jeer riix lambarka, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F2\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E safka, si aad halkaas u beddesho. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/change-sizes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/change-sizes\"\u003EBeddel cabbirrada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix astaan si aad ugu tafatirto midig. Laba jeer riix sawir-gacmeed si aad u furto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkaad dib u laabato, safka \u003Cstrong\u003ERollback bar · roll forward\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa ku jira liiska. Astaamaha ka hooseeya waa midabka boodhka leh oo lama dhisin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka safka xuduudda uu leeyahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay u dhaqaaqaan safafka dhexdooda, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↑\"\u003E⌥↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↓\"\u003E⌥↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay dhaqdhaqaaqiyaan astaanta laftiisa, meesha taariikhdu ogolaato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhis ahaan, panel-ka isla markaana wuxuu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E (kan koowaad waxa lagu calaamadiyay &quot;grounded&quot;) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-xidhyada\u003C/strong\u003E halkii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"xaqiiqooyinka-qaybta\"\u003EXaqiiqooyinka qaybta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta taariikhda, sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EQayb\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EMugga\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EAagga dusha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka (X × Y × Z)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EGodadka dhex-maro\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhadka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESaddex-geesaha\u003C/strong\u003E, tirada \u003Cstrong\u003EAstaanno\u003C/strong\u003E iyo inta \u003Cstrong\u003EFashilanta\u003C/strong\u003E. Mugga iyo aagga waa jidhka fasedyada ah ee mesh kernel-ka dhisay, wax yar ka yar qiimaha saxda ah ee foomamka wareega (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/features#curves-resolution\" data-topic=\"partcraft/features\" data-hash=\"curves-resolution\"\u003EAstaamaha iyo ikhtiyaarradoodu\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhis ahaan sanduuqa madaxiisa waa \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhis\u003C/strong\u003E: Qaybaha, Tusaalooyinka, Isku-xidhyada, Aan isku xidhnayn iyo Is-dhex-galid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-3d-dhexe\"\u003EMuuqaalka 3D (dhexe)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalku wuxuu muujinayaa jidhka, diyaaradaha aasaasiga ah iyo sawir-gacmeed kasta oo astaan aan weli isticmaalin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDiyaaradaha aasaasiga ah waxay si buuxa loo sawiraa intii qaybtu madhan tahay. Markii ay jidh yeelato way dib u dhacaan: waxay u muuqdaan si khafiif ah, si aysan qaybta u daboolin, riixidooduna waxay u gudbaan qaybta. Waxay dib u soo buuxaan markaad dooranayso meesha aad ku sawirayso (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/span\u003E aan wax la dooran) iyo markaad mid ka doorato taariikhda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalada\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiyaaradaha aasaasiga ah\u003C/span\u003E waxay qarisaa dhammaantood; wali way muuqdaan intaad dooranayso meesha aad ku sawirayso. PartCraft waa xusuustaa doorashadaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid si aad u wareejiso qaybta, midig-jiid ama dhexe-jiid si aad u raacdo, wareeji wheel-ka si aad u weynaysid tilmaameha. Faahfaahin ku jirta \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"partcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dul-dhaaf wejiga, geesta ama diyaarada si aad u aragto iftiinka. Riix si aad u doorato. Wejiyada oo dhan ayaa iftiimaya, geesaha waa la sawiraa oo oo dhan ayaa la doortaa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+riix wuxuu soo ururiyaa geesas ama wejiyo badan. Waa la calaamadiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaabka muuqaalka ee geeska midig ee sare wuxuu wareegaa qaybta: riix wejiga, geesta ama xagga si aad uga eegto meeshaas, jiidi si aad u wareejiso, badhanka guriga wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa bilowga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/view-cube\" data-topic=\"partcraft/view-cube\"\u003EKaabka muuqaalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo saar la doortay wuxuu muujinayaa fallaadh oranji ah wejigiisa dhammaadka, Wareeg fallaadh qalloocan oo dhamaadka wareegiisa: jiid si aad u beddesho qotodheerka ama xagasha, ama qor sanduuqa ku dhinac. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/change-sizes#drag-it-in-the-view\" data-topic=\"partcraft/change-sizes\" data-hash=\"drag-it-in-the-view\"\u003EBeddel cabbirrada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka qaybtu madhan tahay, sanduuq madaxiisa \u003Cstrong\u003EBilow qayb\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa tallaabooyinka ugu horreeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa soo rid faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E meel kasta muuqaalka si aad u furto. Faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stl\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E oo halkaas la soo ridayo wuxuu furmaa sida jidh adag.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"markaad-geesaha-ama-wejiyada-dooranayso\"\u003EMarkaad geesaha ama wejiyada dooranayso\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKadib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E aan wax la dooran (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro geesaha\u003C/span\u003E astaan noocaas ah), qaybtu waxay muujinaysaa siduu ahaa ka hor astaantaas. Riix geesaha ama wejiyada si aad ugu darto ama ka saarto; calaamadahooda ayaa muujinaya kuwa ku jira. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaystir\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dhammaysta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EMudi, jeex-jeex iyo daloolin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"xaashiga-naqshadda\"\u003EXaashiga naqshadda\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa muuqaalka 3D xaashiga naqshadda A3. Wheel-ku wuu weynaysiiyaa, midig ama dhexe jiid wuu raacaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu habeeyaa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003ESamee naqshad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"markii-sawir-gacmeed-la-furay\"\u003EMarkii sawir-gacmeed la furay\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalku wuxuu wareegaa si toosan u eego diyaarada sawir-gacmeedka, sawir-gacmeed 2D ah wuxuu soo muuqdaa kor ku dhigan. Qaybtu waxay muujinaysaa kaliya astaamaha la sameeyay ka hor sawir-gacmeedkan. Xariijin geeska bidix sare wuxuu muujinayaa calaamadda xaaladda sawir-gacmeedka (&quot;Fully defined&quot;, &quot;Under defined · 3 degrees of freedom&quot; iyo kuwa kale) iyo magaciisa, sida &quot;Sketch2 on a face of Extrude1&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panel-ka-sifooyinka-midig\"\u003EPanel-ka sifooyinka (midig)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel-ka midig wuxuu muujinayaa waxa la doortay, madaxiisana magaciisa ayuu sheegaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQayb\u003C/strong\u003E (waxba la dooran): \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E qaybta iyo dejinta \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDiyaarad: badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu sawir\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeji\u003C/strong\u003E: nooca (Flat face, Cylinder oo leh radius iyo dhidib, Cone, Sphere ama Torus), aagga, astaanta dhisay, iyo weji fidsan ahaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed wejiggan ku yaal\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJihada u jeedso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoofi wejigga DXF\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa soo saar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu jar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod halkan\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/extrude-and-cut#pull-or-push-a-whole-face\" data-topic=\"partcraft/extrude-and-cut\" data-hash=\"pull-or-push-a-whole-face\"\u003EJiid ama riix wejiga oo dhan\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta\u003C/strong\u003E: noocda (toosan, wareeg oo leh bartiisa iyo radius-kiisa, ama qalooc), dherereheeda, labada weji ee ay ku dhex jirto (sida &quot;Extrude1 end face and Extrude1 side&quot;), oo leh badhamada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesas ama wejiyo badan oo la doortay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: intooda, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E geesaha, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAstaan\u003C/strong\u003E: lambarradeeda iyo ikhtiyaarradeeda, cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedkeeda, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoojiso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu celi halkan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKor u dhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoos u dhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir-gacmeed furan\u003C/strong\u003E: xaaladdiisa, xiriirrada aad ku dari karto xulashada, liiska xiriirrada iyo cabbirrada, \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar iskuduwayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bax sawirka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoofi DXF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXaashiga naqshadda: dejinta qaybta iyo faahfaahinta, ama calaamadda GD&amp;T ee la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-dhis ahaan: isku-dhisku, qaybta la doortay, ama isku-xidhka la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuq kasta oo lambar ah wuxuu shaqeeyaa markaad riixdo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama markaad riixdo meel kale. Qaybtu isla markiiba dib ayay u dhisaa; ma jiro badhanka Hagaag. Isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad dib ugu noqoto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bar-ka-xaaladda-hoose\"\u003EBar-ka xaaladda (hoose)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBidix, kuduwayaasha tilmaameha ee sawir-gacmeedka (kaliya markii sawir-gacmeed la furay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhexda, fariimo: waxa xiga ee la sameeyo, iyo sababta wax loo diiday. Akhri markii wax ka dhacayo ma eeg.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhinaca midig, chip-ka kernel-ka: had iyo jeer &quot;Mesh kernel&quot; nooca hadda. Ku dul-dhaaf si aad u ogaato macnaha. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidig, chip: &quot;Rebuilding…&quot; intaa qaybtu dib u dhisayo, kadibna &quot;Rebuilt in … ms&quot; marka wax kasta fiican yahay, ama &quot;1 feature failing&quot;. Isku-dhis ahaan wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Placed in … ms&quot; ama wuxuu tiriyaa dhibaatooyinka isku-xidhka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate\"\u003EBilow buug Illustrate\u003C/a\u003E: workspace-ka oo ka sameeya buugaagta isku-dhisyada qaybahaaga iyo isku-dhisyadaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashad-cidhiidhi-ah\"\u003EShaashad cidhiidhi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlaa 760 pixel ballac, sida telefoonka, muuqaalku wuu ilaaliyaa shaashadda: toolbar-ka waa hal saf oo dhinac ahaan u dhaqaaqa, panel-yaduna waxay furmaan sida xaashi bar-ka hoose. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qariyaa toolbar-ka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geeyaa hoose. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\" data-topic=\"partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\"\u003ETrackpad, taabashada iyo shaashadaha yaryar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Shaashaddu waxa ay leedahay shan qaybood: toolbar-ka sare, taariikhda bidix, muuqaalka 3D dhexe, panel-ka sifooyinka midig iyo bar-ka xaaladda hoose. Dhammaantood ka sarreeya waa CadCraft app bar. App bar-ka Bar-ka khafiifka ah ee ugu sarreeya wuxuu leeyahay goobta CadCraft, ma aha PartCraft laftiisa. Wuxuu muujinayaa magaca app-ka iyo meesha uu ka shaqeeyo, menu-ga nooca, Ku saabsan PartCraft, badhanka habka shaashadda iyo beddelka mawduuca Paper / Model. Paper waa khadad madow xaashi cad ah. Model waa khadad cad background madow ah. Midabyada sawir-gacmeedku waxay raacaan mawduuca. Dejinta (giraanta, ama Ctrl+,) waxa uu leeyahay tab PartCraft: badhanka mouse-ka ee wareejiya muuqaalka, mouse wheel ama trackpad, iyo xiriirrada intii aad sawirayso. Eeg Dejinta PartCraft. Badhanka habka shaashadda, ama Ctrl+Shift+F, wuxuu wareegaa caadi, shaashad buuxda, iyo shaashad buuxda oo bar-yada la qariyay. Markii bar-yada la qariyay, tilmaameha u qaad geeska sare (ama taabo halkaas) si aad dib ugu soo celiso. Esc wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa caadiga. Furahan waa Ctrl+Shift+F Mac-kaba, ma aha ⌘. Toolbar-ka Toolbar-ka waa la kooxeeyay. Wuu isbeddelaa siday tahay waxa aad sameynayso, sidaas darteed hal saf ku habboon: Kooxda Badhamada Waa la muujiyaa Fayl Cusub, Fur, Kaydi, Dhoofi (menu) Had iyo jeer Sawir-gacmeed Naqshad Markii sawir-gacmeed aan la furin Sawir-gacmeed Ka bax, Xarriiq, Afar-geesle, Goobo, Qaanso, Bar, Khadka dhexe, Fillet, Cabbir, Dhismaha Kaliya markii sawir-gacmeed la furay Astaanno Soo saar, Goo, Wareeg, God, Toosan, Wareegsan, Muraayad, Fillet, Chamfer, Shell, Wax dheeraad ah (menu: Goo wareeg, Diyaarad, Dhidib, Bar, Sweep, Loft, Qabyo) Qaybta ku jirta, ma aha markii sawir-gacmeed ama naqshadda la furay. Fillet iyo Chamfer waxay ka shaqeeyaan geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba weji oo fidsan; Shell iyo Qabyo wejiyada fidsan. Sweep iyo Loft weli lama dhisin nooca hadda (waxay u baahan yihiin exact kernel); riixida mid waa sheegtaa Astaanno Dhammaystir Kaliya markaad dooranayso geesaha ama wejiyada fillet, chamfer, shell ama qabyo Naqshad Naqshad Qaybta ku jirta (waa la isticmaali karaa marka qaybtu leedahay jidh) Naqshad Datum, Frame, Dhammaystir, Faahfaahin, PDF, Dib Kaliya xaashiga naqshadda Isku-dhis Isku-dhis Qaybta ku jirta (waa la isticmaali karaa marka qaybtu leedahay jidh) Isku-dhis Ku dar nuqul, Geli, Joint, Isku-dhac, Wax ka beddel qayb, Xir Kaliya isku-dhiska Isku-dhis Dib Intaad qayb ka isku-dhis ka wax beddelayso Wax ka beddel Ka noqo, Samee mar kale, Koobiyee, Dhaji, Wax dheeraad ah (menu: Goo, Koobiyee, Dhaji, Dhaji meesha, Nuqul, Tirtir, Dooro dhammaan, Dooro midna) Had iyo jeer; mid kasta wuxuu shaqeeyaa sawir-gacmeedka, taariikhda ama isku-dhiska aad ku jirto Muuqaal Ku habee, Jihada u jeedso, Muuqaalada (menu: Qiyaas, Sifooyinka culeyska, Goyn, Qabyo, Zebra, Curvature, Diyaaradaha aasaasiga ah, kadibna Isometric, Hore, Dib, Sare, Hoose, Midig, Bidix) Had iyo jeer Ku dul-dhaaf badhan si aad u ogaato waxa uu sameeyo iyo furihiisa. Badhanka midabka boodhka leh ma isticmaali karo hadda: tusaale ahaan badhamada astaamaha intii sawir-gacmeed la furay, ama Joint ka hor intaysan isku-dhisku lahayn laba qayb. Menu-ga Wax dheeraad ah ee kooxda Wax ka beddel wuxuu taxayaa falka wax-beddel kasta iyo furihiisa. Waxa koobiyeynta iyo dhajintu ku dhaqmaan waxay raacaan meesha aad joogto; eeg Koobiyee, dhaji iyo nuqul. Tooltip-ka shayga midabka boodhka leh wuxuu sheegaa sababta uusan hadda shaqayn. Menu-ga Dhoofi wuxuu hayaa STL, daabacaadda 3D, 3MF, daabacaadda 3D, STEP AP242 (jidh adag oo saxda ah), STEP AP214 (jidh adag oo saxda ah), STEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh), STEP AP214 (xabbado, kernel-ka mesh), DXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah iyo Naqshad (PDF): muuqaallada, qaybta, faahfaahinta, GD&T. Shayyada STEP ee saxda ah waxay qoraan dusha wareegga dhabta ah sida dusheedu yahay; kuwa fasedyada ah waxay qoraan sida fasedyo fidsan. Taariikhda (bidix) Panel-ka bidix waa taariikhda astaamaha qaybta, liiska PartCraft ku dib u dhisa sare ilaa hoos. Cinwaanka waa magaca qaybta (\"Part1\" ilaa aad magaciisa beddesho). Diyaarada Hore, Diyaarada Sare iyo Diyaarada Midig ayaa hore u yimaadda. Riix mid si aad u doorato; muuqaalka wuu iftiimaa. Hoosteeda waxaa ah astaamahaaga siday loo sameeyay. Sawir-gacmeed uu astaan isticmaalo ayaa lagu jiidaa hoosta astaantaas. Calaamad ku taal dhammaadka midig ee safka ayaa kuu sheegta xaaladdeeda: Calaamad Macnaha (midna) Waa la dhisay, sawir-gacmeedkana si buuxda ayaa loo qeexay − Sawir-gacmeed aan si buuxda loo qeexin (wali wuu dhaqaaqi karaa) + Sawir-gacmeed aad u qeexan ⚠ Waa la dhisay, digniin ku jirta (ku dheji si aad u akhrido) ⚠ error Astaanta waa fashilantay. Ku dheji si aad u ogaato sababta, ama riix ⚠ not built Astaanta waxay u baahan tahay mid kale oo fashilmay ama damaysan off Waa la joojiyay Astaan kasta wuxuu muujinayaa lambarkiisa ugu muhiimsan magaciisa ka dib, sida \"25 mm\" extrude ahaan ama \"Ø6.6 thru\" god ahaan. Laba jeer riix lambarka, ama riix F2 safka, si aad halkaas u beddesho. Eeg Beddel cabbirrada. Riix astaan si aad ugu tafatirto midig. Laba jeer riix sawir-gacmeed si aad u furto. Markaad dib u laabato, safka Rollback bar · roll forward ayaa ku jira liiska. Astaamaha ka hooseeya waa midabka boodhka leh oo lama dhisin. Marka safka xuduudda uu leeyahay, ↑ iyo ↓ waxay u dhaqaaqaan safafka dhexdooda, Alt+↑ / Alt+↓ waxay dhaqdhaqaaqiyaan astaanta laftiisa, meesha taariikhdu ogolaato. Isku-dhis ahaan, panel-ka isla markaana wuxuu liistaa Qaybaha (kan koowaad waxa lagu calaamadiyay \"grounded\") iyo Isku-xidhyada halkii. Xaqiiqooyinka qaybta Hoosta taariikhda, sanduuqa Qayb wuxuu liistaa Mugga, Aagga dusha, Cabbirka (X × Y × Z), Godadka dhex-maro, Jidhadka, Saddex-geesaha, tirada Astaanno iyo inta Fashilanta. Mugga iyo aagga waa jidhka fasedyada ah ee mesh kernel-ka dhisay, wax yar ka yar qiimaha saxda ah ee foomamka wareega (eeg Astaamaha iyo ikhtiyaarradoodu). Isku-dhis ahaan sanduuqa madaxiisa waa Isku-dhis: Qaybaha, Tusaalooyinka, Isku-xidhyada, Aan isku xidhnayn iyo Is-dhex-galid. Muuqaalka 3D (dhexe) Muuqaalku wuxuu muujinayaa jidhka, diyaaradaha aasaasiga ah iyo sawir-gacmeed kasta oo astaan aan weli isticmaalin. Diyaaradaha aasaasiga ah waxay si buuxa loo sawiraa intii qaybtu madhan tahay. Markii ay jidh yeelato way dib u dhacaan: waxay u muuqdaan si khafiif ah, si aysan qaybta u daboolin, riixidooduna waxay u gudbaan qaybta. Waxay dib u soo buuxaan markaad dooranayso meesha aad ku sawirayso (Naqshad aan wax la dooran) iyo markaad mid ka doorato taariikhda. Muuqaalada › Diyaaradaha aasaasiga ah waxay qarisaa dhammaantood; wali way muuqdaan intaad dooranayso meesha aad ku sawirayso. PartCraft waa xusuustaa doorashadaas. Jiid si aad u wareejiso qaybta, midig-jiid ama dhexe-jiid si aad u raacdo, wareeji wheel-ka si aad u weynaysid tilmaameha. Faahfaahin ku jirta Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka. Ku dul-dhaaf wejiga, geesta ama diyaarada si aad u aragto iftiinka. Riix si aad u doorato. Wejiyada oo dhan ayaa iftiimaya, geesaha waa la sawiraa oo oo dhan ayaa la doortaa. Shift+riix wuxuu soo ururiyaa geesas ama wejiyo badan. Waa la calaamadiyaa. Kaabka muuqaalka ee geeska midig ee sare wuxuu wareegaa qaybta: riix wejiga, geesta ama xagga si aad uga eegto meeshaas, jiidi si aad u wareejiso, badhanka guriga wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa bilowga. Eeg Kaabka muuqaalka. Soo saar la doortay wuxuu muujinayaa fallaadh oranji ah wejigiisa dhammaadka, Wareeg fallaadh qalloocan oo dhamaadka wareegiisa: jiid si aad u beddesho qotodheerka ama xagasha, ama qor sanduuqa ku dhinac. Eeg Beddel cabbirrada. Marka qaybtu madhan tahay, sanduuq madaxiisa Bilow qayb wuxuu liistaa tallaabooyinka ugu horreeya. Ka soo rid faylka .partcraft.json ama .partcraft-asm.json meel kasta muuqaalka si aad u furto. Faylka .step, .stp, .stl, .obj, .3mf ama .3dm oo halkaas la soo ridayo wuxuu furmaa sida jidh adag. Markaad geesaha ama wejiyada dooranayso Kadib Fillet, Chamfer ama Shell aan wax la dooran (ama Dooro geesaha astaan noocaas ah), qaybtu waxay muujinaysaa siduu ahaa ka hor astaantaas. Riix geesaha ama wejiyada si aad ugu darto ama ka saarto; calaamadahooda ayaa muujinaya kuwa ku jira. Dhammaystir ama Esc ayaa dhammaysta. Eeg Mudi, jeex-jeex iyo daloolin. Xaashiga naqshadda Naqshad wuxuu beddelaa muuqaalka 3D xaashiga naqshadda A3. Wheel-ku wuu weynaysiiyaa, midig ama dhexe jiid wuu raacaa, F wuu habeeyaa. Eeg Samee naqshad. Markii sawir-gacmeed la furay Muuqaalku wuxuu wareegaa si toosan u eego diyaarada sawir-gacmeedka, sawir-gacmeed 2D ah wuxuu soo muuqdaa kor ku dhigan. Qaybtu waxay muujinaysaa kaliya astaamaha la sameeyay ka hor sawir-gacmeedkan. Xariijin geeska bidix sare wuxuu muujinayaa calaamadda xaaladda sawir-gacmeedka (\"Fully defined\", \"Under defined · 3 degrees of freedom\" iyo kuwa kale) iyo magaciisa, sida \"Sketch2 on a face of Extrude1\". Panel-ka sifooyinka (midig) Panel-ka midig wuxuu muujinayaa waxa la doortay, madaxiisana magaciisa ayuu sheegaa: Qayb (waxba la dooran): Magaca qaybta iyo dejinta Qalloocyada. Diyaarad: badhanka Ku sawir. Weji: nooca (Flat face, Cylinder oo leh radius iyo dhidib, Cone, Sphere ama Torus), aagga, astaanta dhisay, iyo weji fidsan ahaan Sawir-gacmeed wejiggan ku yaal, Jihada u jeedso, U dhoofi wejigga DXF, Ka soo saar, Ku jar iyo God halkan (eeg Jiid ama riix wejiga oo dhan). Geesta: noocda (toosan, wareeg oo leh bartiisa iyo radius-kiisa, ama qalooc), dherereheeda, labada weji ee ay ku dhex jirto (sida \"Extrude1 end face and Extrude1 side\"), oo leh badhamada Fillet iyo Chamfer. Geesas ama wejiyo badan oo la doortay Shift: intooda, iyo Fillet iyo Chamfer geesaha, iyo Nadiifi. Astaan: lambarradeeda iyo ikhtiyaarradeeda, cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedkeeda, kadibna Joojiso, Ku celi halkan, Kor u dhaqaaq, Hoos u dhaqaaq, Tirtir iyo Magaca. Sawir-gacmeed furan: xaaladdiisa, xiriirrada aad ku dari karto xulashada, liiska xiriirrada iyo cabbirrada, Ku dar iskuduwayaasha, iyo Ka bax sawirka, Ku habee iyo U dhoofi DXF. Xaashiga naqshadda: dejinta qaybta iyo faahfaahinta, ama calaamadda GD&T ee la doortay. Isku-dhis ahaan: isku-dhisku, qaybta la doortay, ama isku-xidhka la doortay. Sanduuq kasta oo lambar ah wuxuu shaqeeyaa markaad riixdo Enter ama Tab, ama markaad riixdo meel kale. Qaybtu isla markiiba dib ayay u dhisaa; ma jiro badhanka Hagaag. Isticmaal Ctrl+Z si aad dib ugu noqoto. Bar-ka xaaladda (hoose) Bidix, kuduwayaasha tilmaameha ee sawir-gacmeedka (kaliya markii sawir-gacmeed la furay). Dhexda, fariimo: waxa xiga ee la sameeyo, iyo sababta wax loo diiday. Akhri markii wax ka dhacayo ma eeg. Dhinaca midig, chip-ka kernel-ka: had iyo jeer \"Mesh kernel\" nooca hadda. Ku dul-dhaaf si aad u ogaato macnaha. Eeg Mesh kernel-ka. Midig, chip: \"Rebuilding…\" intaa qaybtu dib u dhisayo, kadibna \"Rebuilt in … ms\" marka wax kasta fiican yahay, ama \"1 feature failing\". Isku-dhis ahaan wuxuu leeyahay \"Placed in … ms\" ama wuxuu tiriyaa dhibaatooyinka isku-xidhka. Eeg sidoo kale Bilow buug Illustrate: workspace-ka oo ka sameeya buugaagta isku-dhisyada qaybahaaga iyo isku-dhisyadaaga. Shaashad cidhiidhi ah Ilaa 760 pixel ballac, sida telefoonka, muuqaalku wuu ilaaliyaa shaashadda: toolbar-ka waa hal saf oo dhinac ahaan u dhaqaaqa, panel-yaduna waxay furmaan sida xaashi bar-ka hoose. Qalabka wuxuu qariyaa toolbar-ka, Wareeji wuxuu geeyaa hoose. Eeg Trackpad, taabashada iyo shaashadaha yaryar.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"files","scope":"partcraft","title":"Faylalka: fur, kaydi iyo dhoof","summary":"Faylalka qaybta iyo isku-dhisnaha ee PartCraft furo oo kaydiyo, dhoofin kasta iyo waxa uu hayo, meesha faylalku tagaan, iyo waxa isbeddela marka aan khadka lagu jirin ama browser-ka kala duwan.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["fur","kaydi","dhoofi","soo deji","fayl","partcraft.json","faylka isku-dhisnaha","stl","3mf","step","dxf","pdf","faylalkaygu meeyaan yihiin","khadka ka baxsan","kaydi sida"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-partcraft-furo","text":"Waxa PartCraft furo","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta","text":"Kaydinta","level":2},{"id":"dhoofinta","text":"Dhoofinta","level":2},{"id":"shaqada-aan-la-kaydin","text":"Shaqada aan la kaydin","level":2},{"id":"online-iyo-offline","text":"Online iyo offline","level":2},{"id":"browser-yada-kala-duwan","text":"Browser-yada kala duwan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa faylalka kombiyuutarkaaga. Qayb ma soo gudbiyo, akoon ma jiro, kaydinta gudaha ma jirto. Kaydinta cloud weli ma diyaar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-partcraft-furo\"\u003EWaxa PartCraft furo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKordhinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESidee\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dhig dhinaca 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-dhisnaha PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla sidaas: PartCraft wuu ogaadaa nooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP solid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidh adag oo loo akhriyo saddex-geesood: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EFur faylka STEP oo ku dhis\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylalka STL, OBJ iyo 3MF waxay sidoo kale furmaan sida jidhadka adag (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EFur STL, OBJ ama 3MF\u003C/a\u003E), oo sidaas oo kale faylalka \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003EFur moodel .3dm\u003C/a\u003E). DXF, IGES iyo faylalka qaybaha barnaamijyada kale lama furi karo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXeerarka markii la furayo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagaca faylka qaybta ama isku-dhisnaha waa inuu ku dhammaadaa \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E, faylkuna waa inuu ka yaraado 50 MB.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylalka waa la hubiyaa ka hor inta aan wax la muujin. Fayl dhacay ama la tafatiray waa la diidaa, sabab fudud oo lagu sheegay, tusaale ahaan &quot;This is not a PartCraft file.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFayl ka yimid PartCraft cusub waa la diidaa: &quot;This file was saved by a newer PartCraft (file version 3); this one reads version 2.&quot; Faylalka hore way furmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii qaybta shaashadda ku jirta ay leedahay isbeddello aan la kaydin, PartCraft wuu marka hore weydiiyaa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIska tir isbeddellada\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarka hore kaydi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta\"\u003EKaydinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa waxa shaashadda ku jira:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayb ahaan: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part name&gt;.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, taariikhda oo dhan (sawir-gacmeedyada, xiriirada, cabbirrada, features, booska rollback-ka), qoraallada qaybta naqshadda, faahfaahinta iyo GD&amp;T, iyo qoraalka oo dhan ee STEP solid kasta oo dhisme hore laga soo dhoofiyay. Features-ka nooca hadda aan dhisi karin ayaa lagu kaydiyaa siduu yahay. Jidhka ma kaydsana; PartCraft wuu dib u dhisaa taariikhda marka faylku furmo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-dhisnaha: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;assembly name&gt;.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E, oo \u003Cstrong\u003Eqayb kasta ku jirta gudaheeda\u003C/strong\u003E. Hal fayl ayaa qaadaya isku-dhisnaha oo dhan, sidaas darteed waad u diri kartaa keligiis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydintu waa \u003Cstrong\u003Esoo dejin\u003C/strong\u003E. Browser-kaagu wuxuu faylka u dhigaa folder-ka soo dejinta, ama wuxuu weydiin karaa meesha la geeyo haddii aad u dejiso inuu weydiiyo. Mar kale kaydinta waxay samaysaa soo dejin cusub; browser-ku wuxuu magaca u bedeli karaa \u003Ccode\u003EPart1 (1).partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E halkii uu ku beddeli lahaa kii hore. Magacyada ama meesha faylalka ku dhaqaaqi \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Emaareeyaha faylalkaaga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E sida aad rabto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagaca qaybta xarfaha aan ahayn xarfo, tiro, space, \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E waxay noqdaan \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E magaca faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowser-ka badankiis wuxuu leeyahay dejin weydiiso meesha loo kaydinayo soo dejin kasta: hagaaji haddii aad rabto doorashada &quot;Save as&quot; mar kasta: Chrome iyo Edge waxay ku jirtaa Downloads settings-ka; Firefox General, Files and Applications; Safari General, File download location.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax dheeraad ah oo ku saabsan meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo sida faylalkaaga loo ilaaliyo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EMeesha faylalkaagu tagaan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofinta\"\u003EDhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMenu-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa qaababka kale. Mid kasta waa soo dejin, magaceeda waxaa lagu magacaabaa qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa menu-ka ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ku jira\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL, daabacaadda 3D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.stl\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL binary oo saddex-geesoodka jidhka, millimitir, \u003Cstrong\u003EZ sare\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3MF, daabacaadda 3D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.3mf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3MF oo jidhka ku jira hal object, millimitir, \u003Cstrong\u003EZ sare\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (jidh adag oo saxda ah)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal jidh adag oo saxda ah, millimitir, Z sare: wejiyada wareegsan sida silinder, koonn, kubbad iyo torus oo run ah. STEP-ka loo isticmaalo barnaamijyada CAD iyo CAM kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (jidh adag oo saxda ah)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla jidhka adag ee saxda ah schema-ga hore AP214\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidh ka samaysan wejiyo toosan oo mesh-ka ka yimid: \u003Cstrong\u003Ewejiyada wareegsan waa facets yar yar\u003C/strong\u003E. Millimitir, axes-ka PartCraft (Y sare). Barnaamij diida faylka saxda ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt; - &lt;sketch&gt;.dxf\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt; - face.dxf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDXF R12. Sawir-gacmeed: xariiqyo, qaansooyin, goobo iyo barar isku-xirnaanta sawir-gacmeedka, oo ku jira layers PROFILE, CONSTRUCTION iyo POINTS. Wejig toosan la doortay: qaabkiisa oo polyline xidhan (geesaha wareegsan sida facets)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad (PDF): muuqaallada, qaybta, faahfaahinta, GD&amp;T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt; - drawing.pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashida naqshadda A3: saddex muuqaal, isometric, qaybta iyo faahfaahinta haddii la dejiyo, cabbirrada guud, calaamadaha GD&amp;T, blokka cinwaanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (jidh adag oo saxda ah)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa godad, bosses, fillets, koonno, kubbado iyo torusyo wejigooda run ah, si barnaamij kale u dooran karo god sida silinder; \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E ma beddelayso. Geesaha spline-ka, xarka la moodeelay iyo meshes-ka la soo dhoofiyay ma leeyihiin wejig saxda ah oo waxay ku sii jiraan facets isla jidhka; xaaladda xagga hoose waxay tirinaysaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa wejiyada wareegsan oo dhan sida facets.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhoofinta waa qaybta shaashadda ku jirta. Dhoofintu waa la damiyay isku-dhisnaha; ma jiro dhoofin isku-dhisnaha weli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESTL, 3MF, STEP-ka facet iyo DXF-ka wejiga had iyo jeer waxay ka samaysan yihiin facets. Dejinta \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E (panelka midig marka waxba la dooran) ayaa go&#039;aaminta inta ay fiican yihiin, 32 ilaa 256 facet wareeg kasta. Dooro Fiican ama Aad u fiican ka hor inta aadan dhoofin STL ama 3MF si uu daabacaadu u siman yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadda PDF waxay isticmaashaa font-ka Helvetica ee akhriyuhu ku dhex jiro. Xarfaha aan muuqan karin waxay daabacaan &quot;?&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETallaab tallaab: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\"\u003EDhoofinta daabacaadda, STEP iyo DXF\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003ESamee xaashi naqshad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaqada-aan-la-kaydin\"\u003EShaqada aan la kaydin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPartCraft wuxuu hayaa nuqul soo kabasho ah oo qaybta ama isku-dhisnaha furan browser-kan wakhti yar kadib isbeddel kasta, sidaas darteed crash ama tab la xidhay shaqada ma lumiyo: markii dambe ee aad furto PartCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa &quot;Recover your work?&quot;. Taasi ma aha kaydin: ku kaydi fayl si aad shaqadaadu u ilaaliso. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003ESoo kabso shaqada aan la kaydin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aad isku dayayso inaad tab-ka xidho ama dib u soo rogto isbeddello aan la kaydin, browser-ku wuxuu weydiinayaa &quot;Leave site?&quot;. Taasi waa sanduuqa browser-ka laftiisa; PartCraft ma beddeli karo qoraalkiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E iyo xidhida isku-dhisnaha waxay weydiiyaan ka hor intaysan tirtirin isbeddellada aan la kaydin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"online-iyo-offline\"\u003EOnline iyo offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa oo dhan kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ka dhacaan: mesh kernel-ka (barnaamij WebAssembly ah) waxa lagu soo dejiyaa app-ka oo geometry-ga wuxuu dhisaa kombiyuutarkaaga, faylalkana waxaa laga akhriyaa oo lagu qoraa diskkaaga. Xog qaybeed ma marto shabakadda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u shaqeyso xidhiidh la&#039;aan, kaydi PartCraft si loo isticmaalo offline markaad online tahay: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E app bar-ka oo sug inta ay tirinayso (&quot;Saving 40 of 212&quot;) ilaa ay tidhi \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline ready\u003C/strong\u003E. Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu ku jiraa maktabadda 3D iyo mesh kernel-ka, sidaas darteed kadibna modeling, kaydinta, dhoofinta oo dhan iyo naqshadaha oo dhan way shaqeeyaan offline. Haddii ay tidhi \u003Cstrong\u003ECould not save\u003C/strong\u003E, guji si aad mar kale isku daydo markaad online tahay; \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline not available\u003C/strong\u003E macnaheedu waa daaqadan browser-ka ma kaydin karto nuqul (daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kombiyuutarrada la maamulo qaarkood). Nuqulka la kaydiyay markaad guujiso \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline ready\u003C/strong\u003E, wuxuu soo bandhigaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E. Faahfaahin: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqada offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaad online tahay. Xitaa haddii aanad kaydin offline isticmaalka, markii PartCraft uu soo dejiyo oo status bar chip-ku yidhi &quot;Mesh kernel&quot;, wali waad shaqayn kartaa xidhiidhku haddii uu go&#039;o. Bogga ha dib u soo rogin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaad offline tahay. Haddii PartCraft hore loo furay, wali shaqayn kartaa; kaydinta iyo dhoofintu weli way shaqeeyaan. Haddii app bar-ku yidhi \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline ready\u003C/strong\u003E, PartCraft wuxuu sidoo kale bilaabmaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan; haddii kale ha dib u soo rogin tab-kan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-yada-kala-duwan\"\u003EBrowser-yada kala duwan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoo dejinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Browser kasta wuxuu leeyahay folder soo dejin gaar ah iyo habkiisa weydiinta. Haddii browser-ku weydiiyo inuu site-kani soo dejin karo faylal, oggolow, haddii kale kaydinta iyo dhoofintu ma shaqayn karaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid oo dhig\u003C/strong\u003E fayl dhinaca muuqaalka wuxuu shaqeeyaa Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylalka telefoon ama tablet-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E iPhone iyo iPad, Fur wuxuu muujiyaa app-ka Files; faylalka la kaydiyay waxay tagaan Files, Downloads. Android, waxay tagaan folder-ka Downloads.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrowser-yada ama nidaamyada hawlgalka kala duwan, waxa faylalku ka kooban yihiin isma duwana.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"PartCraft wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa faylalka kombiyuutarkaaga. Qayb ma soo gudbiyo, akoon ma jiro, kaydinta gudaha ma jirto. Kaydinta cloud weli ma diyaar. Waxa PartCraft furo Faylka Kordhinta Sidee Qayb PartCraft .partcraft.json Fur, Ctrl+O, ama dhig dhinaca 3D Isku-dhisnaha PartCraft .partcraft-asm.json Isla sidaas: PartCraft wuu ogaadaa nooca STEP solid .step, .stp Jidh adag oo loo akhriyo saddex-geesood: Fur faylka STEP oo ku dhis Faylalka STL, OBJ iyo 3MF waxay sidoo kale furmaan sida jidhadka adag (Fur STL, OBJ ama 3MF), oo sidaas oo kale faylalka .3dm (Fur moodel .3dm). DXF, IGES iyo faylalka qaybaha barnaamijyada kale lama furi karo (eeg Waxa weli aan la dhisin). Xeerarka markii la furayo: Magaca faylka qaybta ama isku-dhisnaha waa inuu ku dhammaadaa .json, faylkuna waa inuu ka yaraado 50 MB. Faylalka waa la hubiyaa ka hor inta aan wax la muujin. Fayl dhacay ama la tafatiray waa la diidaa, sabab fudud oo lagu sheegay, tusaale ahaan \"This is not a PartCraft file.\" Fayl ka yimid PartCraft cusub waa la diidaa: \"This file was saved by a newer PartCraft (file version 3); this one reads version 2.\" Faylalka hore way furmaan. Haddii qaybta shaashadda ku jirta ay leedahay isbeddello aan la kaydin, PartCraft wuu marka hore weydiiyaa: Jooji, Iska tir isbeddellada ama Marka hore kaydi. Kaydinta Kaydi ama Ctrl+S wuxuu kaydiyaa waxa shaashadda ku jira: Qayb ahaan: \u003Cpart name\u003E.partcraft.json, taariikhda oo dhan (sawir-gacmeedyada, xiriirada, cabbirrada, features, booska rollback-ka), qoraallada qaybta naqshadda, faahfaahinta iyo GD&T, iyo qoraalka oo dhan ee STEP solid kasta oo dhisme hore laga soo dhoofiyay. Features-ka nooca hadda aan dhisi karin ayaa lagu kaydiyaa siduu yahay. Jidhka ma kaydsana; PartCraft wuu dib u dhisaa taariikhda marka faylku furmo. Isku-dhisnaha: \u003Cassembly name\u003E.partcraft-asm.json, oo qayb kasta ku jirta gudaheeda. Hal fayl ayaa qaadaya isku-dhisnaha oo dhan, sidaas darteed waad u diri kartaa keligiis. Kaydintu waa soo dejin. Browser-kaagu wuxuu faylka u dhigaa folder-ka soo dejinta, ama wuxuu weydiin karaa meesha la geeyo haddii aad u dejiso inuu weydiiyo. Mar kale kaydinta waxay samaysaa soo dejin cusub; browser-ku wuxuu magaca u bedeli karaa Part1 (1).partcraft.json halkii uu ku beddeli lahaa kii hore. Magacyada ama meesha faylalka ku dhaqaaqi Finder / File Explorer / maareeyaha faylalkaaga sida aad rabto. Magaca qaybta xarfaha aan ahayn xarfo, tiro, space, _, . iyo - waxay noqdaan _ magaca faylka. Browser-ka badankiis wuxuu leeyahay dejin weydiiso meesha loo kaydinayo soo dejin kasta: hagaaji haddii aad rabto doorashada \"Save as\" mar kasta: Chrome iyo Edge waxay ku jirtaa Downloads settings-ka; Firefox General, Files and Applications; Safari General, File download location. Wax dheeraad ah oo ku saabsan meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo sida faylalkaaga loo ilaaliyo: Meesha faylalkaagu tagaan. Dhoofinta Menu-ka Dhoofi wuxuu qoraa qaababka kale. Mid kasta waa soo dejin, magaceeda waxaa lagu magacaabaa qaybta. Waxa menu-ka ku jira Faylka Waxa ku jira STL, daabacaadda 3D \u003Cname\u003E.stl STL binary oo saddex-geesoodka jidhka, millimitir, Z sare 3MF, daabacaadda 3D \u003Cname\u003E.3mf 3MF oo jidhka ku jira hal object, millimitir, Z sare STEP AP242 (jidh adag oo saxda ah) \u003Cname\u003E.step Hal jidh adag oo saxda ah, millimitir, Z sare: wejiyada wareegsan sida silinder, koonn, kubbad iyo torus oo run ah. STEP-ka loo isticmaalo barnaamijyada CAD iyo CAM kale STEP AP214 (jidh adag oo saxda ah) \u003Cname\u003E.step Isla jidhka adag ee saxda ah schema-ga hore AP214 STEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh) \u003Cname\u003E.step Jidh ka samaysan wejiyo toosan oo mesh-ka ka yimid: wejiyada wareegsan waa facets yar yar. Millimitir, axes-ka PartCraft (Y sare). Barnaamij diida faylka saxda ah DXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah \u003Cname\u003E - \u003Csketch\u003E.dxf ama \u003Cname\u003E - face.dxf DXF R12. Sawir-gacmeed: xariiqyo, qaansooyin, goobo iyo barar isku-xirnaanta sawir-gacmeedka, oo ku jira layers PROFILE, CONSTRUCTION iyo POINTS. Wejig toosan la doortay: qaabkiisa oo polyline xidhan (geesaha wareegsan sida facets) Naqshad (PDF): muuqaallada, qaybta, faahfaahinta, GD&T \u003Cname\u003E - drawing.pdf Xaashida naqshadda A3: saddex muuqaal, isometric, qaybta iyo faahfaahinta haddii la dejiyo, cabbirrada guud, calaamadaha GD&T, blokka cinwaanka STEP AP242 (jidh adag oo saxda ah) wuxuu qoraa godad, bosses, fillets, koonno, kubbado iyo torusyo wejigooda run ah, si barnaamij kale u dooran karo god sida silinder; Qalloocyada ma beddelayso. Geesaha spline-ka, xarka la moodeelay iyo meshes-ka la soo dhoofiyay ma leeyihiin wejig saxda ah oo waxay ku sii jiraan facets isla jidhka; xaaladda xagga hoose waxay tirinaysaa. STEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh) wuxuu qoraa wejiyada wareegsan oo dhan sida facets. Dhoofinta waa qaybta shaashadda ku jirta. Dhoofintu waa la damiyay isku-dhisnaha; ma jiro dhoofin isku-dhisnaha weli. STL, 3MF, STEP-ka facet iyo DXF-ka wejiga had iyo jeer waxay ka samaysan yihiin facets. Dejinta Qalloocyada (panelka midig marka waxba la dooran) ayaa go'aaminta inta ay fiican yihiin, 32 ilaa 256 facet wareeg kasta. Dooro Fiican ama Aad u fiican ka hor inta aadan dhoofin STL ama 3MF si uu daabacaadu u siman yahay. Naqshadda PDF waxay isticmaashaa font-ka Helvetica ee akhriyuhu ku dhex jiro. Xarfaha aan muuqan karin waxay daabacaan \"?\". Tallaab tallaab: Dhoofinta daabacaadda, STEP iyo DXF iyo Samee xaashi naqshad. Shaqada aan la kaydin PartCraft wuxuu hayaa nuqul soo kabasho ah oo qaybta ama isku-dhisnaha furan browser-kan wakhti yar kadib isbeddel kasta, sidaas darteed crash ama tab la xidhay shaqada ma lumiyo: markii dambe ee aad furto PartCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa \"Recover your work?\". Taasi ma aha kaydin: ku kaydi fayl si aad shaqadaadu u ilaaliso. Eeg Soo kabso shaqada aan la kaydin. Haddii aad isku dayayso inaad tab-ka xidho ama dib u soo rogto isbeddello aan la kaydin, browser-ku wuxuu weydiinayaa \"Leave site?\". Taasi waa sanduuqa browser-ka laftiisa; PartCraft ma beddeli karo qoraalkiisa. Cusub, Fur iyo xidhida isku-dhisnaha waxay weydiiyaan ka hor intaysan tirtirin isbeddellada aan la kaydin. Online iyo offline Waxa oo dhan kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ka dhacaan: mesh kernel-ka (barnaamij WebAssembly ah) waxa lagu soo dejiyaa app-ka oo geometry-ga wuxuu dhisaa kombiyuutarkaaga, faylalkana waxaa laga akhriyaa oo lagu qoraa diskkaaga. Xog qaybeed ma marto shabakadda. Eeg Mesh kernel-ka. Si aad u shaqeyso xidhiidh la'aan, kaydi PartCraft si loo isticmaalo offline markaad online tahay: dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan app bar-ka oo sug inta ay tirinayso (\"Saving 40 of 212\") ilaa ay tidhi Offline ready. Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu ku jiraa maktabadda 3D iyo mesh kernel-ka, sidaas darteed kadibna modeling, kaydinta, dhoofinta oo dhan iyo naqshadaha oo dhan way shaqeeyaan offline. Haddii ay tidhi Could not save, guji si aad mar kale isku daydo markaad online tahay; Offline not available macnaheedu waa daaqadan browser-ka ma kaydin karto nuqul (daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kombiyuutarrada la maamulo qaarkood). Nuqulka la kaydiyay markaad guujiso Offline ready, wuxuu soo bandhigaa Mar kale kaydi (hel nooca ugu dambeeya) iyo Ka saar nuqulka khadka ka baxsan. Faahfaahin: Shaqada offline. Waad online tahay. Xitaa haddii aanad kaydin offline isticmaalka, markii PartCraft uu soo dejiyo oo status bar chip-ku yidhi \"Mesh kernel\", wali waad shaqayn kartaa xidhiidhku haddii uu go'o. Bogga ha dib u soo rogin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay. Waad offline tahay. Haddii PartCraft hore loo furay, wali shaqayn kartaa; kaydinta iyo dhoofintu weli way shaqeeyaan. Haddii app bar-ku yidhi Offline ready, PartCraft wuxuu sidoo kale bilaabmaa xidhiidh la'aan; haddii kale ha dib u soo rogin tab-kan. Browser-yada kala duwan Soo dejinta. Browser kasta wuxuu leeyahay folder soo dejin gaar ah iyo habkiisa weydiinta. Haddii browser-ku weydiiyo inuu site-kani soo dejin karo faylal, oggolow, haddii kale kaydinta iyo dhoofintu ma shaqayn karaan. Jiid oo dhig fayl dhinaca muuqaalka wuxuu shaqeeyaa Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari. Faylalka telefoon ama tablet-ka. iPhone iyo iPad, Fur wuxuu muujiyaa app-ka Files; faylalka la kaydiyay waxay tagaan Files, Downloads. Android, waxay tagaan folder-ka Downloads. Browser-yada ama nidaamyada hawlgalka kala duwan, waxa faylalku ka kooban yihiin isma duwana.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"solid-kernels","scope":"partcraft","title":"Kernel-ka mesh-ka","summary":"Nooca PartCraft ee hadda wuxuu dhisaa qayb kasta kernel mesh ah oo ku socda browser-kaaga. Waxa ay ka dhigan tahay wejiyada wareegsan, mugga iyo faylasha, sida loo ogaado inuu shaqeynayo, iyo astaamaha ku sugan kernel saxda ah.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["kernel","mesh","manifold","saxda ah","b-rep","dhinacyo leh","qalooc","opencascade","occt","fillet waxay u baahan tahay saxda ah","weli lama dhisin","khadka ka baxsan","webassembly"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-sugaya-kernel-saxda-ah","text":"Waxa sugaya kernel saxda ah","level":2},{"id":"wejiyada-wareegsan-iyo-curves","text":"Wejiyada wareegsan iyo Curves","level":2},{"id":"online-iyo-offline","text":"Online iyo offline","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKernel-ka joomatariga waa mishiinka wuxuu taariikhdaada u beddelaa jir. Nooca PartCraft ee hadda wuxuu leeyahay mid: \u003Cstrong\u003Emesh kernel\u003C/strong\u003E (manifold-3d). Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa kombiyuutarkaaga sidii barnaamij yar oo WebAssembly wuuna diyaar yahay wakhti kooban ka dib markii app-ku furmo. Waxba oo ku saabsan qaybtaada looma diro meel kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMesh kernel\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabab wareegsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinacyo fidsan. \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E guddiga qaybta ayaa dejiya sida ay u fiicnaato\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMugga iyo dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEe jirka dhinacyada leh, wuxuu ka hooseeyaa xoogaa qaybaha wareegsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshadaha, soo saar, goyn, wareeg, godyo, qaababka, muraayad, diyaaradaha tixraaca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet iyo Chamfer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya wejiyada fidsan; wareegyada kulma waa la xardhaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQolof iyo Qabyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQolof wuxuu furaa wejiyada fidsan (dhumuc derbiga saxda ah); Qabyo wuxuu u janjeeyaa wejiyada fidsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL, 3MF, STEP (saxda ah: wejiyada wareegsan waxay ku qoran yihiin dusha runta ah; ama dhinacyo leh), PDF-ka sawirka iyo DXF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalada sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaa laga sawiraa dhinacyada, oo ay ku jiraan muuqaalada qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada iyo geesaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagacyo lagu siiyey oo lagu garto nooca (fidsan, silinder, koon, kura, torus; toosan, goobo), laga soo qaatay naqshadaha: goobaha Simulation, Generative iyo Manufacture, Cabbir, dooritaanka iyo miiska godyada ayaa isticmaala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaadhka ku sar-dhowaad dhamaadka midig ee status bar-ka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EMesh kernel\u003C/strong\u003E intuu qaybtaada dhisayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-sugaya-kernel-saxda-ah\"\u003EWaxa sugaya kernel saxda ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKernel saxda ah (B-rep) wuxuu hayaa goobooyin, silinderro iyo koonno runta ah, iyo fillet siman geesaha kasta, sweep, loft, dusha, sheet metal, ribs, jirro badan iyo STEP import oo wejiyada wareegsan saxda ku jira, dhamaantood ayaa lagu dhisaa. (Dhoofinta STEP ee saxda ah ma sugto: mesh kernel-ku wuxuu ka yaqaanaa dusha run ah ee wejig kasta naqshadda, dhoofintuna way qortaa.) Dhismayaasha lab-ka ee hore ee PartCraft waxay u isticmaaleen OpenCascade. Shatiga (LGPL) kama haboon sii-deyntan, halka app kasta yahay Apache-2.0 oo kaliya maktabado ogolaansho fudud leh isticmaala, sidaas darteed lama soo daro. Waxba halkan ma leh taariikh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlaa markaas astaamahaas waxay leeyihiin \u003Cstrong\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/strong\u003E markaad doorato: status bar-ku wuxuu siiyaa sababta, tooltip-ka badhamadoodu wuxuu ku dhammaadaa &quot;weli lama dhisin (wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah)&quot;. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu liis ka dhigaa mid kasta oo leh waxa lagu samayn karo halkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb lagu sameeyay dhismihii hore weli way furmaa. Astaamahaas waxay sii jiraan taariikhda oo lagu calaamadeeyay weli lama dhisin (dul-marso mid si aad sababta u aragto), qaybta intiisa kale way dhismaa, kaydintuna waxay ilaalisaa iyaga oo aan isbeddelin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wejiyada-wareegsan-iyo-curves\"\u003EWejiyada wareegsan iyo Curves\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMesh kernel-ku goobo wuxuu ka sawiraa poligon. \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E guddiga qaybta wuxuu dejiyaa inta dhinac ee goobo buuxda heleyso; dhinac badan waxay muuqdaan kuwo siman oo waxay u dhow yihiin qiimaha runta ah, laakiin way qaadanayaan wakhti dheer si loo dhiso. Mugga, dusha iyo masaafooyinka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbir\u003C/span\u003E waa kuwa jirkan dhinacyada leh: godka ama boss-ka way yar yihiin marka loo barbar dhigo kan wareegsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"online-iyo-offline\"\u003EOnline iyo offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMesh kernel-ku waa qayb ka mid ah soo-dejinta app-ka laftiisa. Si aad ugu shaqeyso adigoon xiriir lahayn, u kaydi PartCraft isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan intaad online tahay: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E app bar-ka oo sug ilaa uu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaar khadka ka baxsan\u003C/strong\u003E. Faahfaahin: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqaynta khadka ka baxsan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kernel-ka joomatariga waa mishiinka wuxuu taariikhdaada u beddelaa jir. Nooca PartCraft ee hadda wuxuu leeyahay mid: mesh kernel (manifold-3d). Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa kombiyuutarkaaga sidii barnaamij yar oo WebAssembly wuuna diyaar yahay wakhti kooban ka dib markii app-ku furmo. Waxba oo ku saabsan qaybtaada looma diro meel kasta. Mesh kernel Qaabab wareegsan Dhinacyo fidsan. Curves guddiga qaybta ayaa dejiya sida ay u fiicnaato Mugga iyo dusha Ee jirka dhinacyada leh, wuxuu ka hooseeyaa xoogaa qaybaha wareegsan Naqshadaha, soo saar, goyn, wareeg, godyo, qaababka, muraayad, diyaaradaha tixraaca Haa Fillet iyo Chamfer Geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya wejiyada fidsan; wareegyada kulma waa la xardhaa Qolof iyo Qabyo Qolof wuxuu furaa wejiyada fidsan (dhumuc derbiga saxda ah); Qabyo wuxuu u janjeeyaa wejiyada fidsan Dhoofinta STL, 3MF, STEP (saxda ah: wejiyada wareegsan waxay ku qoran yihiin dusha runta ah; ama dhinacyo leh), PDF-ka sawirka iyo DXF Muuqaalada sawirka Waxaa laga sawiraa dhinacyada, oo ay ku jiraan muuqaalada qaybta Wejiyada iyo geesaha Magacyo lagu siiyey oo lagu garto nooca (fidsan, silinder, koon, kura, torus; toosan, goobo), laga soo qaatay naqshadaha: goobaha Simulation, Generative iyo Manufacture, Cabbir, dooritaanka iyo miiska godyada ayaa isticmaala Kaadhka ku sar-dhowaad dhamaadka midig ee status bar-ka wuxuu leeyahay Mesh kernel intuu qaybtaada dhisayo. Waxa sugaya kernel saxda ah Kernel saxda ah (B-rep) wuxuu hayaa goobooyin, silinderro iyo koonno runta ah, iyo fillet siman geesaha kasta, sweep, loft, dusha, sheet metal, ribs, jirro badan iyo STEP import oo wejiyada wareegsan saxda ku jira, dhamaantood ayaa lagu dhisaa. (Dhoofinta STEP ee saxda ah ma sugto: mesh kernel-ku wuxuu ka yaqaanaa dusha run ah ee wejig kasta naqshadda, dhoofintuna way qortaa.) Dhismayaasha lab-ka ee hore ee PartCraft waxay u isticmaaleen OpenCascade. Shatiga (LGPL) kama haboon sii-deyntan, halka app kasta yahay Apache-2.0 oo kaliya maktabado ogolaansho fudud leh isticmaala, sidaas darteed lama soo daro. Waxba halkan ma leh taariikh. Ilaa markaas astaamahaas waxay leeyihiin Weli lama dhisin markaad doorato: status bar-ku wuxuu siiyaa sababta, tooltip-ka badhamadoodu wuxuu ku dhammaadaa \"weli lama dhisin (wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah)\". Waxa weli aan la dhisin wuxuu liis ka dhigaa mid kasta oo leh waxa lagu samayn karo halkeeda. Qayb lagu sameeyay dhismihii hore weli way furmaa. Astaamahaas waxay sii jiraan taariikhda oo lagu calaamadeeyay weli lama dhisin (dul-marso mid si aad sababta u aragto), qaybta intiisa kale way dhismaa, kaydintuna waxay ilaalisaa iyaga oo aan isbeddelin. Wejiyada wareegsan iyo Curves Mesh kernel-ku goobo wuxuu ka sawiraa poligon. Curves guddiga qaybta wuxuu dejiyaa inta dhinac ee goobo buuxda heleyso; dhinac badan waxay muuqdaan kuwo siman oo waxay u dhow yihiin qiimaha runta ah, laakiin way qaadanayaan wakhti dheer si loo dhiso. Mugga, dusha iyo masaafooyinka Cabbir waa kuwa jirkan dhinacyada leh: godka ama boss-ka way yar yihiin marka loo barbar dhigo kan wareegsan. Online iyo offline Mesh kernel-ku waa qayb ka mid ah soo-dejinta app-ka laftiisa. Si aad ugu shaqeyso adigoon xiriir lahayn, u kaydi PartCraft isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan intaad online tahay: dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan app bar-ka oo sug ilaa uu leeyahay Diyaar khadka ka baxsan. Faahfaahin: Shaqaynta khadka ka baxsan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sketch-basics","scope":"partcraft","title":"Naqshadda ugu horreysa","summary":"Fur naqshad diyaarad ama wejig fidsan, samee xariiro, afar-geesle, goobo, qaanso, bar iyo khadka dhexe, geesta wareeg, dooro, jiid oo tirtir.","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["naqshad","sawir","xarriiq","afar-geesle","goobo","qaanso","bar","khadka dhexe","dhismaha","fillet","naqshad fillet","geesta wareeg","isku-dhejin","dooro","daaqad","jiid","profile"],"headings":[{"id":"bilow-naqshad","text":"Bilow naqshad","level":2},{"id":"qalabyada-sawirka","text":"Qalabyada sawirka","level":2},{"id":"qor-cabbirka-intaad-sawirayso","text":"Qor cabbirka intaad sawirayso","level":3},{"id":"isku-dhejinta","text":"Isku dhejinta","level":3},{"id":"geesta-wareeg","text":"Geesta wareeg","level":2},{"id":"joomatariga-dhismaha","text":"Joomatariga dhismaha","level":2},{"id":"dooro-jiid-oo-tirtir","text":"Dooro, jiid oo tirtir","level":2},{"id":"weynee-iyo-guuri-naqshadda","text":"Weynee iyo guuri naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"xidh-naqshadda","text":"Xidh naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"maxay-profile-wanaagsan-u-tahay","text":"Maxay profile wanaagsan u tahay","level":2},{"id":"naqshad-sawir-ka-soo-baxday","text":"Naqshad sawir ka soo baxday","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EJir kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa naqshad: sawir fidsan oo ku yaal diyaarad. Casharkan wuxuu daboolayaa qalabyada sawirka. Si naqshadda loo xidho iyada oo ay ku jiraan xiriirro iyo cabbirro, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003ENaqshad si buuxda loogu qeexo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilow-naqshad\"\u003EBilow naqshad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad ku sawiri kartaa diyaarad aasaas ah ama wejig fidsan oo qaybta ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro meesha aad ku sawirayso:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ediyaarad aasaas: guji \u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaarada hore\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaarada sare\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaarada midig\u003C/strong\u003E taariikhda, ama guji diyaarada muuqaalka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ewejig fidsan: guji wejiga muuqaalka. Wejiga oo dhan ayaa iftiimaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/span\u003E qalabka ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. (Haddii wejig la doortay, waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed wejiggan ku yaal\u003C/span\u003E dhinaca midig; diyaarad la doortay, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu sawir\u003C/span\u003E.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalku wuxuu u jeedaa si toosan diyaarada, qalabyada naqshadda ayaa soo muuqda qalabka, qalabka Xarriiqna wuu diyaar yahay. Haddii aad riixdo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/span\u003E iyada oo wax aan la dooran, diyaaradaha aasaasiga ah ayaa soo muuqda, status bar-kuna wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Guji diyaarad ama wejig fidsan si aad ugu sawirto. Esc wuu joogsadaa.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWejig wareegsan ma qaadi karo naqshad: &quot;Wejigaasi wareegsan yahay. Dooro wejig fidsan ama diyaarad si aad ugu sawirto.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshad ku taal wejig ayaa raacda wejigaas.\u003C/strong\u003E Haddii wejigu ka abuuray geesta naqshad ama dhamaadka soo saar, naqshadda cusub way guuraysaa marka astaanta la beddelo (god qoto dheer ayaa naqshadda ku qaadda sagxadeeda). Haddii guddiga uu leeyahay wejiga waa &quot;Meel lagu hagaajiyay halka la doortay&quot;, naqshaddu waxay ku sii jirtaa meesha wejigu hadda ku yaal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabyada-sawirka\"\u003EQalabyada sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab kasta wuxuu leeyahay badhan qalabka iyo fure. Dooro badhanka isla markiiba mar kale, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad ugu noqoto Dooro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFure\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESida loo sawiro\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji bilowga, kadibna guji siduu kasta oo xiga. Xariiqyada waxay isku xiran yihiin dhamaad ilaa dhamaad. Dhammee silsiladda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, midig-guji ama laba jeer guji. Guji bar hore loo sameeyay wuu dhammeeyaa sidoo kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfar-geesle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji hal geesle, kadibna geesta ka soo horjeedda. Waxaad heleysaa afar xariiro oo ku xidhan geeska, laba fidsan iyo laba istaag\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji dhexe, kadibna guji meel ku taal wareegga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji dhexe, kadibna bilowga, kadibna dhamaadka. Qaansada waxay socotaa jihada aad tusaha u wareejiso dhexe ku wareegsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBar\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji. Bar keligeed waxay calaamad u tahay dhexda god ee loogu talagalay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka dhexe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida xariirka, hal qayb mar. Waxaa lagu sawiraa dhibcooyin; waa joomatari dhismo, loo isticmaalo sida dhidib wareeg ama tixraac\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji geesta ay laba xariiro ku kulmaan, qor radius-ka, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplayn\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji dhibcaha ay qalooca mareyso; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu dhammeeyaa, guji dhibcaha koowaad wuu xiraa. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-tools\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-tools\"\u003ESplaynada, jarista, kala-raris iyo qalabyada kale ee naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji qaybta qalooca la rabo in laga saaro, ilaa isgoysyada ugu dhow\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbir\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003ENaqshad si buuxda loogu qeexo\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntaad sawirayso, sanduuq yar oo ku dhow tusaha ayaa muujinaya dherer, baaxad, dhexroor ama radius.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"qor-cabbirka-intaad-sawirayso\"\u003EQor cabbirka intaad sawirayso\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad marka hore gujiso xariir, afar-geesle, goobo ama qaanso, waxaad qori kartaa baaxadda halkii aad ku gujin lahayd. Qorista lambar ayaa furta sanduuqa tusaha dhinaciisa oo lambarkaas ku jira:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESanduuqyada (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu u gudbaa kan xiga)\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa dhaca marka \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la riixo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXarriiq\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka dhexe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer, kadibna Xagal (°) laga bilaabo dhidibka X ee naqshadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariirka waa la sawiraa dherer sidaas oo kale, u socda tusaha ama xagal la qoray; silsiladdu waxay ka sii socotaa dhamaadkeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAfar-geesle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBallac, kadibna Joog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAfar-geeslaha waa la sawiraa laga bilaabo geeska koowaad ee tusaha; baaxad aadan qorin waxay ka timaadaa tusaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoobo\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexroor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobada waa la sawiraa dhexroorkaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadius ka dib dhexe, kadibna Xagal qaanso (°) ka dib bilowga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBilowgu wuxuu ka fogaadaa dhexe masaafadaas; kadibna qaansadu wuxuu wareegaa masaafadaas, jihada aad tusaha u dhaqaaqday\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaaxad kasta oo aad qortay waxay noqotaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecabbir wadaad\u003C/strong\u003E isla tallaabada, sidaas darteed naqshaddu waxay soo baxaysaa iyadoo leh cabbirrada. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka qaadaa qaabka iyo cabbirradiisa wada. Gujinta halkii aad riixi lahayd \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay hayaa waxa aad qortay, waxa kale wuxuu ka qaadanayaa gujinta. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu xidhaa sanduuqa wuuna ku laabtaa tusaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDemi tan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir intaad sawirayso\u003C/strong\u003E haddii aad rabto inaad ku sawirto gujinta keliya. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, dhamaadka qalabyada naqshadda, waxay ku jiraan splaynada barta-xakamaynta, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaadhi\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala-raris\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuraayad\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoligon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlot\u003C/span\u003E, qaababka naqshadda iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeesta mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-tools\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-tools\"\u003ESplaynada, jarista, kala-raris iyo qalabyada kale ee naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"isku-dhejinta\"\u003EIsku dhejinta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku dhejintu waxay kuu darsataa xiriirro, si naqshaddu isku xidhan ugu sii jirto markay dhaqaaqdo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaad-bar ama \u003Cstrong\u003Easal\u003C/strong\u003E, laba-geesle yar ayaa muuqda. Barta cusub waxaa loo samaynayaa inay isku meel la socoto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariir, goobo ama qaanso, calaamad yar oo iska jaar ah ayaa muuqda. Barta cusub waxaa lagu dhejiyaa qalooca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariir ku dhow 3 darajo oo fidsan ama istaag ah ayaa isku dhejma oo heli doona xiriir fidsan ama istaag. Calaamaddu waxay muujinaysaa &quot;H&quot; ama &quot;V&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad uga fogaato isku dhejinta, kor u weyneey si aad uga gujiso meel ka fog barta ama qalooca.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geesta-wareeg\"\u003EGeesta wareeg\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta geesta ay laba xariiro ku kulmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuq ayaa furmaya oo radius la soo jeediyay ayuu leeyahay. Qor radius-ka oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba xariirba waa la jaray oo waxaa isku xidha qaanso taabasho ah oo leh cabbir radius. Fariimaha aad arki karto: &quot;Fillet waxay u baahan tahay geesta uu laba xariiro oo kaliya ku kulmaan.&quot; iyo &quot;Radius-kaasi waa weyn yahay xariirradan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFillet naqshad wuxuu wareejiyaa geesta profile-ka, sidaas darteed soo saarku wuxuu helaa geesaha toosan ee wareegsan. Si aad u wareejiso geesaha jirka laftiisa (tusaale, geesaha sare ee saxanka), isticmaal astaanta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E ee qaybta: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EWareeg, bevel iyo godaan\u003C/a\u003E. Naqshadda gudaheeda, Fillet ee qalabka waa qalabka naqshadda; qaybta gudaheeda, waa astaanta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"joomatariga-dhismaha\"\u003EJoomatariga dhismaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiradda dhismaha, goobooyinka iyo qaansooyinka waxaa lagu sawiraa dhibcooyin oo midab cawl ah. Waxay hagaan naqshadda laakiin ma aha qayb ka mid ah profile-ka la soo saaro ama la wareejiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro xariiradda, goobooyinka ama qaansooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E. Mar kale riix si aad ugu celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-jiid-oo-tirtir\"\u003EDooro, jiid oo tirtir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa qalab aan shaqeynayn) si aad u doorato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji bar, xariir, goobo, qaanso, calaamadda xiriirka ama cabbir si aad u doorato. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji wuxuu ku daraa doorashada ama wuxuu ka qaadaa. Windows iyo Linux \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji wuxuu sameeyaa isla; Mac-ka, ⌘+guji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid meel banaan si aad u sawirto daaqad: wax kasta oo gudaha ku buuxa ayaa la doortaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid bar ama xariir si aad u guurto. Xallinta wuxuu hayaa xiriir kasta iyo cabbir markuu dhaqaaqo, sidaas darteed kaliya joomatariga xor ah ayaa dhaqaaqa. Jiid geesta goobo si aad u beddesho radius-keeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid lambarka cabbirka si aad u guurto calaamadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E guddiga midig si aad u tirto doorashada. Tirtirka joomatarigu wuxuu tirtiraa xiriirrada ku jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weynee-iyo-guuri-naqshadda\"\u003EWeynee iyo guuri naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareeji curiyaha si aad u weyneyso tusaha dhinaciisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid adigoo isticmaalaya badhanka dhexe ama midig si aad u guurto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E qalabka ama guddiga midig ayaa ku habeeya naqshadda muuqaalka. Naqshadda gudaheeda furaha \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa qalabka Fillet, ma aha Ku habee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xidh-naqshadda\"\u003EXidh naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bax\u003C/span\u003E qalabka ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bax sawirka\u003C/span\u003E guddiga midig, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa naqshaddu xirmo. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kasta marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa wax socda, kadibna wuxuu ku laabtaa Dooro, kadibna wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada, ka dibna mid kale wuxuu xirayaa naqshadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshaddu way sii dooratay, sidaas darteed \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E xiga ayaa isticmaala.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maxay-profile-wanaagsan-u-tahay\"\u003EMaxay profile wanaagsan u tahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E waxay isticmaalaan \u003Cstrong\u003Ewareeg xiran kasta\u003C/strong\u003E oo ka mid ah xariirrada, goobooyinka, qaansooyinka iyo splaynada jirka naqshadda (ee aan ahayn dhismo). Wareegyada gudaha wareegyada ayaa noqda godyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhammaan dhamaadyada waa inay kulmaan mid kale oo kaliya. &quot;Profile-ku waa furan: dhamaadka (12.5, 40) lama xidhna wax kale.&quot; wuxuu magacaabayaa meesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaddex dhamaad midkoodna ma kulmi karaan hal barta: &quot;Profile-ku wuxuu u kala bar-bixiyaa (0, 20): in ka badan laba dhamaad ayaa halkaas kulma.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProfile-ku ma tixgeliyo barta iyo joomatariga dhismaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiga: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003ENaqshad si buuxda ula qeex xiriirro iyo cabbirro\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshad-sawir-ka-soo-baxday\"\u003ENaqshad sawir ka soo baxday\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAstaamaha › Wax dheeraad ah › Naqshad sawir ka soo baxday…\u003C/strong\u003E (ama kooxda Naqshad ee Feature tree ribbon) waxay raacdaa sawir qayb fidsan oo ku taal dhul sahlan (geesteeda iyo godyadeeda) ama sawir qalin ah oo loo beddelo naqshad xariiro, qaansooyin iyo goobooyin ah. Hal dherer qor (ballac, joog ama geesta ugu dheer) si naqshaddu u helo baaxadda saxda ah, hubi waxa ay heshay hordhaca, kadibna dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E; waxay sidoo kale ku soo saari kartaa, isla tallaabo ka noqoshada. Waxaa lagu raacaa kombiyuutarkan. Radius-ka geesaha ayaa soo noqda qiyaastii 5 % dhexdooda, faahfaahin pixel ama laba ayaa lumaa, sawirka oo xagal ah ama oo leh hadhow ku dul marsan qaybta lama toosinayo: sawirka qaybta si toosan ugu qaad, iftiin siman.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Jir kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa naqshad: sawir fidsan oo ku yaal diyaarad. Casharkan wuxuu daboolayaa qalabyada sawirka. Si naqshadda loo xidho iyada oo ay ku jiraan xiriirro iyo cabbirro, eeg Naqshad si buuxda loogu qeexo. Bilow naqshad Waxaad ku sawiri kartaa diyaarad aasaas ah ama wejig fidsan oo qaybta ah. Dooro meesha aad ku sawirayso: diyaarad aasaas: guji Diyaarada hore, Diyaarada sare ama Diyaarada midig taariikhda, ama guji diyaarada muuqaalka; wejig fidsan: guji wejiga muuqaalka. Wejiga oo dhan ayaa iftiimaya. Dooro Naqshad qalabka ama riix S. (Haddii wejig la doortay, waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa Sawir-gacmeed wejiggan ku yaal dhinaca midig; diyaarad la doortay, Ku sawir.) Muuqaalku wuxuu u jeedaa si toosan diyaarada, qalabyada naqshadda ayaa soo muuqda qalabka, qalabka Xarriiqna wuu diyaar yahay. Haddii aad riixdo Naqshad iyada oo wax aan la dooran, diyaaradaha aasaasiga ah ayaa soo muuqda, status bar-kuna wuxuu leeyahay \"Guji diyaarad ama wejig fidsan si aad ugu sawirto. Esc wuu joogsadaa.\" Wejig wareegsan ma qaadi karo naqshad: \"Wejigaasi wareegsan yahay. Dooro wejig fidsan ama diyaarad si aad ugu sawirto.\" Naqshad ku taal wejig ayaa raacda wejigaas. Haddii wejigu ka abuuray geesta naqshad ama dhamaadka soo saar, naqshadda cusub way guuraysaa marka astaanta la beddelo (god qoto dheer ayaa naqshadda ku qaadda sagxadeeda). Haddii guddiga uu leeyahay wejiga waa \"Meel lagu hagaajiyay halka la doortay\", naqshaddu waxay ku sii jirtaa meesha wejigu hadda ku yaal. Qalabyada sawirka Qalab kasta wuxuu leeyahay badhan qalabka iyo fure. Dooro badhanka isla markiiba mar kale, riix S, ama riix Esc si aad ugu noqoto Dooro. Qalab Fure Sida loo sawiro Xarriiq L Guji bilowga, kadibna guji siduu kasta oo xiga. Xariiqyada waxay isku xiran yihiin dhamaad ilaa dhamaad. Dhammee silsiladda Esc, Enter, midig-guji ama laba jeer guji. Guji bar hore loo sameeyay wuu dhammeeyaa sidoo kale Afar-geesle R Guji hal geesle, kadibna geesta ka soo horjeedda. Waxaad heleysaa afar xariiro oo ku xidhan geeska, laba fidsan iyo laba istaag Goobo C Guji dhexe, kadibna guji meel ku taal wareegga Qaanso A Guji dhexe, kadibna bilowga, kadibna dhamaadka. Qaansada waxay socotaa jihada aad tusaha u wareejiso dhexe ku wareegsan Bar P Guji. Bar keligeed waxay calaamad u tahay dhexda god ee loogu talagalay God Khadka dhexe N Sida xariirka, hal qayb mar. Waxaa lagu sawiraa dhibcooyin; waa joomatari dhismo, loo isticmaalo sida dhidib wareeg ama tixraac Fillet F Guji geesta ay laba xariiro ku kulmaan, qor radius-ka, riix Enter Splayn B Guji dhibcaha ay qalooca mareyso; Enter wuu dhammeeyaa, guji dhibcaha koowaad wuu xiraa. Eeg Splaynada, jarista, kala-raris iyo qalabyada kale ee naqshadda Jar T Guji qaybta qalooca la rabo in laga saaro, ilaa isgoysyada ugu dhow Cabbir D Eeg Naqshad si buuxda loogu qeexo Intaad sawirayso, sanduuq yar oo ku dhow tusaha ayaa muujinaya dherer, baaxad, dhexroor ama radius. Qor cabbirka intaad sawirayso Markaad marka hore gujiso xariir, afar-geesle, goobo ama qaanso, waxaad qori kartaa baaxadda halkii aad ku gujin lahayd. Qorista lambar ayaa furta sanduuqa tusaha dhinaciisa oo lambarkaas ku jira: Qalab Sanduuqyada (Tab wuxuu u gudbaa kan xiga) Waxa dhaca marka Enter la riixo Xarriiq, Khadka dhexe Dherer, kadibna Xagal (°) laga bilaabo dhidibka X ee naqshadda Xariirka waa la sawiraa dherer sidaas oo kale, u socda tusaha ama xagal la qoray; silsiladdu waxay ka sii socotaa dhamaadkeeda Afar-geesle Ballac, kadibna Joog Afar-geeslaha waa la sawiraa laga bilaabo geeska koowaad ee tusaha; baaxad aadan qorin waxay ka timaadaa tusaha Goobo Dhexroor Goobada waa la sawiraa dhexroorkaas Qaanso Radius ka dib dhexe, kadibna Xagal qaanso (°) ka dib bilowga Bilowgu wuxuu ka fogaadaa dhexe masaafadaas; kadibna qaansadu wuxuu wareegaa masaafadaas, jihada aad tusaha u dhaqaaqday Baaxad kasta oo aad qortay waxay noqotaa cabbir wadaad isla tallaabada, sidaas darteed naqshaddu waxay soo baxaysaa iyadoo leh cabbirrada. Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka qaadaa qaabka iyo cabbirradiisa wada. Gujinta halkii aad riixi lahayd Enter waxay hayaa waxa aad qortay, waxa kale wuxuu ka qaadanayaa gujinta. Esc wuu xidhaa sanduuqa wuuna ku laabtaa tusaha. Demi tan Dejinta › PartCraft › Cabbir intaad sawirayso haddii aad rabto inaad ku sawirto gujinta keliya. Eeg Dejinta PartCraft. Wax dheeraad ah, dhamaadka qalabyada naqshadda, waxay ku jiraan splaynada barta-xakamaynta, Ballaadhi, Kala-raris, Muraayad, Poligon, Slot, qaababka naqshadda iyo Geesta mashruuca: eeg Splaynada, jarista, kala-raris iyo qalabyada kale ee naqshadda. Isku dhejinta Isku dhejintu waxay kuu darsataa xiriirro, si naqshaddu isku xidhan ugu sii jirto markay dhaqaaqdo: Dhamaad-bar ama asal, laba-geesle yar ayaa muuqda. Barta cusub waxaa loo samaynayaa inay isku meel la socoto. Xariir, goobo ama qaanso, calaamad yar oo iska jaar ah ayaa muuqda. Barta cusub waxaa lagu dhejiyaa qalooca. Xariir ku dhow 3 darajo oo fidsan ama istaag ah ayaa isku dhejma oo heli doona xiriir fidsan ama istaag. Calaamaddu waxay muujinaysaa \"H\" ama \"V\". Si aad uga fogaato isku dhejinta, kor u weyneey si aad uga gujiso meel ka fog barta ama qalooca. Geesta wareeg Riix F ama dooro Fillet. Guji barta geesta ay laba xariiro ku kulmaan. Sanduuq ayaa furmaya oo radius la soo jeediyay ayuu leeyahay. Qor radius-ka oo riix Enter. Laba xariirba waa la jaray oo waxaa isku xidha qaanso taabasho ah oo leh cabbir radius. Fariimaha aad arki karto: \"Fillet waxay u baahan tahay geesta uu laba xariiro oo kaliya ku kulmaan.\" iyo \"Radius-kaasi waa weyn yahay xariirradan.\" Fillet naqshad wuxuu wareejiyaa geesta profile-ka, sidaas darteed soo saarku wuxuu helaa geesaha toosan ee wareegsan. Si aad u wareejiso geesaha jirka laftiisa (tusaale, geesaha sare ee saxanka), isticmaal astaanta Fillet ee qaybta: eeg Wareeg, bevel iyo godaan. Naqshadda gudaheeda, Fillet ee qalabka waa qalabka naqshadda; qaybta gudaheeda, waa astaanta. Joomatariga dhismaha Xariiradda dhismaha, goobooyinka iyo qaansooyinka waxaa lagu sawiraa dhibcooyin oo midab cawl ah. Waxay hagaan naqshadda laakiin ma aha qayb ka mid ah profile-ka la soo saaro ama la wareejiyo. Dooro xariiradda, goobooyinka ama qaansooyinka. Riix Q ama dooro Dhismaha. Mar kale riix si aad ugu celiso. Dooro, jiid oo tirtir Riix S (ama Esc ilaa qalab aan shaqeynayn) si aad u doorato. Guji bar, xariir, goobo, qaanso, calaamadda xiriirka ama cabbir si aad u doorato. Shift+guji wuxuu ku daraa doorashada ama wuxuu ka qaadaa. Windows iyo Linux Ctrl+guji wuxuu sameeyaa isla; Mac-ka, ⌘+guji. Jiid meel banaan si aad u sawirto daaqad: wax kasta oo gudaha ku buuxa ayaa la doortaa. Jiid bar ama xariir si aad u guurto. Xallinta wuxuu hayaa xiriir kasta iyo cabbir markuu dhaqaaqo, sidaas darteed kaliya joomatariga xor ah ayaa dhaqaaqa. Jiid geesta goobo si aad u beddesho radius-keeda. Jiid lambarka cabbirka si aad u guurto calaamadda. Riix Delete ama Backspace, ama dooro Delete guddiga midig si aad u tirto doorashada. Tirtirka joomatarigu wuxuu tirtiraa xiriirrada ku jira. Weynee iyo guuri naqshadda Wareeji curiyaha si aad u weyneyso tusaha dhinaciisa. Jiid adigoo isticmaalaya badhanka dhexe ama midig si aad u guurto. Ku habee qalabka ama guddiga midig ayaa ku habeeya naqshadda muuqaalka. Naqshadda gudaheeda furaha F waa qalabka Fillet, ma aha Ku habee. Xidh naqshadda Dooro Ka bax qalabka ama Ka bax sawirka guddiga midig, ama riix Esc ilaa naqshaddu xirmo. Esc kasta marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa wax socda, kadibna wuxuu ku laabtaa Dooro, kadibna wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada, ka dibna mid kale wuxuu xirayaa naqshadda. Naqshaddu way sii dooratay, sidaas darteed Soo saar ama Wareeg xiga ayaa isticmaala. Maxay profile wanaagsan u tahay Soo saar iyo Wareeg waxay isticmaalaan wareeg xiran kasta oo ka mid ah xariirrada, goobooyinka, qaansooyinka iyo splaynada jirka naqshadda (ee aan ahayn dhismo). Wareegyada gudaha wareegyada ayaa noqda godyo. Dhammaan dhamaadyada waa inay kulmaan mid kale oo kaliya. \"Profile-ku waa furan: dhamaadka (12.5, 40) lama xidhna wax kale.\" wuxuu magacaabayaa meesha. Saddex dhamaad midkoodna ma kulmi karaan hal barta: \"Profile-ku wuxuu u kala bar-bixiyaa (0, 20): in ka badan laba dhamaad ayaa halkaas kulma.\" Profile-ku ma tixgeliyo barta iyo joomatariga dhismaha. Xiga: Naqshad si buuxda ula qeex xiriirro iyo cabbirro. Naqshad sawir ka soo baxday Astaamaha › Wax dheeraad ah › Naqshad sawir ka soo baxday… (ama kooxda Naqshad ee Feature tree ribbon) waxay raacdaa sawir qayb fidsan oo ku taal dhul sahlan (geesteeda iyo godyadeeda) ama sawir qalin ah oo loo beddelo naqshad xariiro, qaansooyin iyo goobooyin ah. Hal dherer qor (ballac, joog ama geesta ugu dheer) si naqshaddu u helo baaxadda saxda ah, hubi waxa ay heshay hordhaca, kadibna dooro Samee naqshadda; waxay sidoo kale ku soo saari kartaa, isla tallaabo ka noqoshada. Waxaa lagu raacaa kombiyuutarkan. Radius-ka geesaha ayaa soo noqda qiyaastii 5 % dhexdooda, faahfaahin pixel ama laba ayaa lumaa, sawirka oo xagal ah ama oo leh hadhow ku dul marsan qaybta lama toosinayo: sawirka qaybta si toosan ugu qaad, iftiin siman.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"view-cube","scope":"partcraft","title":"Kaabka muuqaalka","summary":"Riix wejiga, geesta ama xagga kaabka geeska muuqaalka si aad uga eegto meeshaas, jiid si aad u wareegto, leff giraanta jihada, u wareeg muuqaal wejiga-hor ah, oo u noqo guriga.","section":"tasks","order":11,"keywords":["kaabka muuqaalka","viewcube","kaab","giraanta jihada","waqooyi","muuqaalka guriga","muuqaalada caadiga ah","sare","hore","midig","iso","xagag","geesta","wareeg","wareejinta muuqaalka","astaanta dhidibka","calaamadda geeska","hagid"],"headings":[{"id":"eeg-dhinac-geesta-ama-xagag","text":"Eeg dhinac, geesta ama xagag","level":2},{"id":"wareeg-adigoo-jiidaya-kaabka","text":"Wareeg adigoo jiidaya kaabka","level":2},{"id":"giraanta-jihada","text":"Giraanta jihada","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalada-wejiga-hor-ah-fallaadho","text":"Muuqaalada wejiga-hor ah: fallaadho","level":2},{"id":"guriga","text":"Guriga","level":2},{"id":"kiiboodhka","text":"Kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"astaanta-dhidibka-ama-waxba","text":"Astaanta dhidibka ama waxba","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKaabka muuqaalka wuxuu fadhiyaa geeska midig ee sare ee muuqaalka 3D-ga (ma aha markii la sawirayo ama xaashiga naqshadda). Wuu wareegaa muuqaalka, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer wuxuu muujinayaa jihada aad eegayso: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E waa dhinaca +Y ee qaybta (diyaarada Sare), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E waa dhinaca +Z (diyaarada Hore ayaa kuu jeedda marka aad eegto), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidig\u003C/span\u003E waa dhinaca +X. Waa hufan yahay ilaa aad isku tuso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-dhinac-geesta-ama-xagag\"\u003EEeg dhinac, geesta ama xagag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETilmaan kaabka. Qaybta ka hoosaysa tilmaameha ayaa iftiimaysa: bartilmaameedka wejiga, geesta (waxay iftiimaysaa labada wejiba ee wadaagaan) ama xagagga (dhammaan saddexda wejiba).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix. Muuqaalka wuu wareegaa si uu uga eego meeshaas, isagoo ilaalinaya isla dhexda iyo weynaynta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa jira 26 meel oo la riixi karo: 6 wejiyo (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoose\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBidix\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidig\u003C/span\u003E), 12 geeso iyo 8 xagag. Xagga waxay bixisaa muuqaalka caadiga ah ee saddex-meelood-meel; geeska waxay eegaysaa badhkii u dhexeeya laba wejiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidig\u003C/span\u003E waxay siinaysaa muuqaalada isku mid ah sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalada\u003C/span\u003E ee toolbar-ka, laakiin aan weynaynta la habeynin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wareeg-adigoo-jiidaya-kaabka\"\u003EWareeg adigoo jiidaya kaabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJiid kaabka si aad muuqaalka u wareejiso, isku mid sida wareegga muuqaalka laftiisa. Jiidista looma tixgeliyo riix, sidaas darteed kaabka meel kasta ayaad qabsan kartaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"giraanta-jihada\"\u003EGiraanta jihada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGiraanta hoos kaabka waxay leedahay N, E, S iyo W.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid giraanta\u003C/strong\u003E si aad moodelka ugu wareejiso dhidibka toosan, sidii inuu ku taagan yahay miis wareegta. Giraanta waxay raacdaa tilmaameha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix xaraf\u003C/strong\u003E si aad uga eegto dhinacaas, iyadoo la ilaalinayo sida aad u hoos u eegayso. Muuqaal ka sare toosan, xarafka aad riixdo wuxuu u gudbaa hoosta shaashadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalada-wejiga-hor-ah-fallaadho\"\u003EMuuqaalada wejiga-hor ah: fallaadho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka aad si toos ah u eegto wejiga, fallaadho yaryar ayaa soo muuqda wareegga kaabka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfarta \u003Cstrong\u003Esaddex-geesle\u003C/strong\u003E wejiga dhinacaas hore u keena: saddex-geeska ka sarreeya kaabka wuxuu muujinayaa wejiga ku jiray sare, iyo sidaas oo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELabada \u003Cstrong\u003Efallaadh qalloocan\u003C/strong\u003E ee geeska midig ee sare ayaa sawirka u wareejiya rubuc wareeg saacadda ama ka soo horjeeda, iyada oo aan la beddelin wejiga aad eegayso. Isticmaal si aad u wareejiso qorshe si derbi dheer uu u socdo shaashadda dhexdeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guriga\"\u003EGuriga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka guriga ee geeska bidix ee sare ee kaabka wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa muuqaalka saddex-meelood-meel wuxuuna qaybta ku habeeyaa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa isku mid markii kaabku xoogga keyboard-ka ku leeyahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kiiboodhka\"\u003EKiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa kaabka, kadib:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edooro dhinac, geesta ama xagag ku wareegsan kaabka, tallaabooyin ah siddeed-meel-wareeg (akhriyayaasha shaashadda ayaa sheegaa kee)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edooro mid ka sarreeya ama ka hoosreeya, ilaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E ama ilaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoose\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eeeg meeshii la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift ←\"\u003E⇧←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift →\"\u003E⇧→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewareeji muuqaalka rubuc wareeg dhidibka toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emuuqaalka guriga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eka bax kaabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha lagu riixo kaabka waxay ku joogaan kaabka: looma bilaabo qalabyada PartCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"astaanta-dhidibka-ama-waxba\"\u003EAstaanta dhidibka ama waxba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E, oo deji \u003Cstrong\u003ECalaamadda geeska\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaabka muuqaalka\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAstaanta dhidibka\u003C/span\u003E (calaamad yar oo X, Y, Z ah geeska hoose ee bidix: X casaan, Y cagaar, Z buluug) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidna\u003C/span\u003E. Browser-kan wuxuu xusuustaa doorashada. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings#corner-indicator\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\" data-hash=\"corner-indicator\"\u003EDejinta PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaabku wuxuu muujinayaa qaybta sida PartCraft u dhisayo: Y kor u taagan, sidaas darteed \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare\u003C/span\u003E ee kaabka waa diyaarada Sare. Xarfaha giraanta waxay u yihiin wareegga kaliya; qayb ma leh waqooyi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Kaabka muuqaalka wuxuu fadhiyaa geeska midig ee sare ee muuqaalka 3D-ga (ma aha markii la sawirayo ama xaashiga naqshadda). Wuu wareegaa muuqaalka, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer wuxuu muujinayaa jihada aad eegayso: Sare waa dhinaca +Y ee qaybta (diyaarada Sare), Hore waa dhinaca +Z (diyaarada Hore ayaa kuu jeedda marka aad eegto), Midig waa dhinaca +X. Waa hufan yahay ilaa aad isku tuso. Eeg dhinac, geesta ama xagag Tilmaan kaabka. Qaybta ka hoosaysa tilmaameha ayaa iftiimaysa: bartilmaameedka wejiga, geesta (waxay iftiimaysaa labada wejiba ee wadaagaan) ama xagagga (dhammaan saddexda wejiba). Riix. Muuqaalka wuu wareegaa si uu uga eego meeshaas, isagoo ilaalinaya isla dhexda iyo weynaynta. Waxaa jira 26 meel oo la riixi karo: 6 wejiyo (Sare, Hoose, Hore, Dib, Bidix, Midig), 12 geeso iyo 8 xagag. Xagga waxay bixisaa muuqaalka caadiga ah ee saddex-meelood-meel; geeska waxay eegaysaa badhkii u dhexeeya laba wejiyo. Riix Hore, Sare ama Midig waxay siinaysaa muuqaalada isku mid ah sida Muuqaalada ee toolbar-ka, laakiin aan weynaynta la habeynin. Wareeg adigoo jiidaya kaabka Jiid kaabka si aad muuqaalka u wareejiso, isku mid sida wareegga muuqaalka laftiisa. Jiidista looma tixgeliyo riix, sidaas darteed kaabka meel kasta ayaad qabsan kartaa. Giraanta jihada Giraanta hoos kaabka waxay leedahay N, E, S iyo W. Jiid giraanta si aad moodelka ugu wareejiso dhidibka toosan, sidii inuu ku taagan yahay miis wareegta. Giraanta waxay raacdaa tilmaameha. Riix xaraf si aad uga eegto dhinacaas, iyadoo la ilaalinayo sida aad u hoos u eegayso. Muuqaal ka sare toosan, xarafka aad riixdo wuxuu u gudbaa hoosta shaashadda. Muuqaalada wejiga-hor ah: fallaadho Marka aad si toos ah u eegto wejiga, fallaadho yaryar ayaa soo muuqda wareegga kaabka: Afarta saddex-geesle wejiga dhinacaas hore u keena: saddex-geeska ka sarreeya kaabka wuxuu muujinayaa wejiga ku jiray sare, iyo sidaas oo kale. Labada fallaadh qalloocan ee geeska midig ee sare ayaa sawirka u wareejiya rubuc wareeg saacadda ama ka soo horjeeda, iyada oo aan la beddelin wejiga aad eegayso. Isticmaal si aad u wareejiso qorshe si derbi dheer uu u socdo shaashadda dhexdeeda. Guriga Badhanka guriga ee geeska bidix ee sare ee kaabka wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa muuqaalka saddex-meelood-meel wuxuuna qaybta ku habeeyaa. Home wuxuu sameeyaa isku mid markii kaabku xoogga keyboard-ka ku leeyahay. Kiiboodhka Tab ilaa kaabka, kadib: Furaha Waxa uu sameeyaa ← / → dooro dhinac, geesta ama xagag ku wareegsan kaabka, tallaabooyin ah siddeed-meel-wareeg (akhriyayaasha shaashadda ayaa sheegaa kee) ↑ / ↓ dooro mid ka sarreeya ama ka hoosreeya, ilaa Sare ama ilaa Hoose Enter ama Space eeg meeshii la doortay Shift+← / Shift+→ wareeji muuqaalka rubuc wareeg dhidibka toosan Home muuqaalka guriga Esc ka bax kaabka Furayaasha lagu riixo kaabka waxay ku joogaan kaabka: looma bilaabo qalabyada PartCraft. Astaanta dhidibka ama waxba Fur Dejinta (Ctrl+,), tab-ka PartCraft, oo deji Calaamadda geeska ilaa Kaabka muuqaalka (bilowga), Astaanta dhidibka (calaamad yar oo X, Y, Z ah geeska hoose ee bidix: X casaan, Y cagaar, Z buluug) ama Midna. Browser-kan wuxuu xusuustaa doorashada. Eeg Dejinta PartCraft. Kaabku wuxuu muujinayaa qaybta sida PartCraft u dhisayo: Y kor u taagan, sidaas darteed Sare ee kaabka waa diyaarada Sare. Xarfaha giraanta waxay u yihiin wareegga kaliya; qayb ma leh waqooyi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sketch-tools","scope":"partcraft","title":"Splaynada, jarista, kala-raris iyo qalabyada naqshadda kale","summary":"Samee splaynada barta-xakamaynta iyo barta-ku-habaynta, jar oo ballaadhi qalooca, kala-raris silsilad, muraayad ku dhig xariir dhexe, ku dar poligon iyo slot, qaababka naqshadda, oo mashruuc geesaha moodelka.","section":"tasks","order":15,"keywords":["splayn","barta ku-habaynta","barta xakamaynta","b-spline","nurbs","qalooc","jar","ballaadhi","kala-raris","muraayad","isku-ekaan","poligon","lix-geesle","slot","qaab","qaab toosan","qaab wareegsan","mashruuc","geesta mashruuca","ku dar","beddel unugyada"],"headings":[{"id":"splaynada","text":"Splaynada","level":2},{"id":"jar-iyo-ballaadhin","text":"Jar iyo ballaadhin","level":2},{"id":"kala-raris","text":"Kala-raris","level":2},{"id":"muraayad","text":"Muraayad","level":2},{"id":"poligonnada-iyo-slot-yada","text":"Poligonnada iyo slot-yada","level":2},{"id":"qaababka-naqshadda","text":"Qaababka naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"geesaha-qaybta-ee-mashruuca","text":"Geesaha qaybta ee mashruuca","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQalabyadan waxay shaqeeyaan naqshad furan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplayn\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku jiraan qalabka. Kuwa kale waxay ku jiraan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E dhamaadka qalabyada naqshadda. Qalab kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqoshada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa. Qalabyada sawirka aasaasiga ah eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\"\u003ENaqshadda ugu horreysa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"splaynada\"\u003ESplaynada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESplayn waa qalooc siman. Laba nooc ayaa jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFure\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESida loo sawiro\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplayn\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji dhibcaha ay qaloocdu mareyso. Dhammee \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, midig-guji ama laba jeer guji. Guji dhibcaha koowaad mar kale si aad u xidho splayn-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESplayn barta-xakamaynta\u003C/span\u003E (hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji barta xakamaynta. Qalooca waa la jiidaa ugu wareegta, laakiin wuxuu taabanayaa oo keliya kii hore iyo kii ugu dambeeya. Poligon-ka xakamaynta ee jajaban wuxuu muuqdaa intaad sawirayso iyo kadib\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarooyinku waa barooyin naqshad.\u003C/strong\u003E Jiid iyaga, ama ku sii xiriir iyo cabbir sida barta kale kasta. Barta koowaad ee splayn-ka ayaa lagu isku dhejin karaa dhamaadka xariir, taasoo isku xidhta xiriir isku meel ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETaabasho dhamaadka.\u003C/strong\u003E Dooro xariir, qaanso ama splayn ku kulma hal dhamaad oo splayn, kadibna splayn-ka, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ET Taabasho\u003C/span\u003E. Jihada dhamaadka splayn-ka ayaa markaas raacaysa xariirka. Taabasho ka fog dhamaadka splayn-ka waa la diidaa: &quot;Taabasho splayn ahaan waxay u baahan tahay xariir, qaanso ama splayn ku kulma hal dhamaad oo ka mid ah.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaadyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Xiriir taabasho lama hayo, dhamaadyada splayn ku-habaynta waa dabiici (ma jiro qallooc dhamaadka ugu dambeeya). Qalooca waa sadex-darajo oo wuxuu mareyaa dhibic kasta, masaafada u dhaxaysa barooyinka ayaa dhigaysa fogaantooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESplaynada xiran\u003C/strong\u003E waxay sameeyaan profile keligood. Splaynada furan waxay isku xidhaan xariirrada iyo qaansooyinka wareeg xiran sida qalooca kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirtirka barta ku jirta splayn-ka waxay tirtirtaa bartaas oo waxay ilaaliyaa splayn-ka, inta uu weli leeyahay ugu yaraan laba barood (saddex marka uu xiran yahay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo saar iyo wareeg splayn-ka waxay ka dhisaan xariiro gaaban oo toosan iyada oo loo isticmaalayo mesh kernel (qalooca dhabta ah wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah: weli lama dhisin nooca hadda). Dhoofinta DXF wuxuu qoraa splayn sida polyline oo ku jira 0.01 mm qalooca, sababtoo ah DXF R12 ma lahan unug splayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jar-iyo-ballaadhin\"\u003EJar iyo ballaadhin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFure\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESida\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta qalooca: qaybta ka baxda ayaa cas, ilaa isgoysyada ugu dhow. Guji si aad u saarto. Qalooca aan wax gooyin ma sameynin waa la saaraa oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBallaadhi\u003C/span\u003E (hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji xariir ama qaanso oo u dhow dhamaadka si aad u ballaadhiso. Wuxuu ku kordhaa ilaa qalooca xiga ee uu la kulmo. &quot;Waxba ma jiro oo dhamaadkaas gaadhsiiya.&quot; marka wax jid ah aan jirin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJar iyo Ballaadhin waxay ku shaqeeyaan xariiro, qaansooyin, goobooyin iyo splayn (Ballaadhin: xariiro iyo qaansooyin).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoobo\u003C/strong\u003E la jaray wuxuu noqdaa qaanso. Cabbirka radius-ka ama dhexroorkeeda wuxuu u guurayaa qaansada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJarista dhexda xariir waxay ka tagtaa laba xariir oo ku sii jira isla xariirka toosan. Jarista dhexda qaanso waxay ka tagtaa laba qaanso oo isku dhexe ah iyo xiriir siman.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESplayn\u003C/strong\u003E la jaray wuxuu noqdaa splayn barta-xakamaynta oo si sax ah u raacda qalooca hore. Xiriirka taabashada dhamaadka ee la ilaaliyo ayaa sii jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaadka cusub waxaa lagu dhejiyaa qalooca gooyay (xariirka, qaansada ama goobada, ama isku meel la socda dhamaadkiisa). Splaynadu ma hayn karaan bar, sidaas darteed splayn gooya ma darto xiriir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXiriirrada aan waxba u qaadan waa la tirtiraa\u003C/strong\u003E, status bar-kana wuxuu sheegaa tirada. Tusaale ahaan, cabbirka dherer ee xariir la jaray waa la tirtiraa, laakiin xiriirrada fidsan ama isu-dhigan way sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-raris\"\u003EKala-raris\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKala-raris\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji xariir, qaanso, goobo ama splayn. Silsiladdiisa oo dhan ayaa iftiimaya: qalooc kasta oo dhamaad-ilaa-dhamaad isku xidhan, ilaa barta uu saddex ama ka badan ku kulmaan. Si aad uga kala-rarto qayb kaliya silsilad, marka hore dooro qalooca, kadibna dooro Kala-raris oo guji mid ka mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETusaha u dhaqaaji dhinaca ay nuqulku u tagayso. Hordhac dhibcooyin ah ayaa raacda. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E labada dhinac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji, qor masaafada, oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiro iyo qaansooyin waa la kala-rarayaa si sax ah. Geesaha waa la ballaadhiyaa ama la jaraa ilaa ay kulmaan. Nuqulku wuxuu leeyahay hal cabbir \u003Cstrong\u003EKala-raris\u003C/strong\u003E, qaybaha kale way raacaan: laba jeer guji cabbirka si aad u beddesho nuqulka oo dhan. Masaafo weyn silsiladda aan lagu oggolaan, tusaale &quot;Masaafadaas weyn bay u tahay silsiladdan: dhinac wuxuu u rogi lahaa gudaha oo dibadda ku soo baxa.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESplayn\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa lagu kala-raraa splayn ku-habayn cusub oo ku jira 0.001 mm kala-rarka runta ah. Nuqulkan waa go&#039;an: ma raacayo isbeddelada soo socda, wayna lahayn cabbir Kala-raris. Splayn silsilad ku jirta waxay u baahan tahay isku xidhmo siman (taabasho) dhamaadkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muraayad\"\u003EMuraayad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro, si aad u doorato wax la muraayadeynayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuraayad\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji xariirka ama khadka dhexe ee lagu muraayadeynayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBar kasta oo la muraayadeeyey wuxuu helaa xiriir \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-ekaan\u003C/strong\u003E oo ay la leedahay asalkeeda, sidaas darteed nuqulku wuxuu raacaa marka asalku beddelo. Barooyinka ku taal xariirka muraayadda waa la wadaagaa, goobooyinka la muraayadeeyey waxay helaan xiriir Siman. Haddii wax la dooran waynay, guji waxyaabaha la muraayadeynayo, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kadibna guji xariirka muraayadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"poligonnada-iyo-slot-yada\"\u003EPoligonnada iyo slot-yada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESida\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoligon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji dhexe, kadibna geesle, kadibna qor tirada dhinacyada (3 ilaa 64). Dhinacyadu waa isle&#039;eg, geesuhuna waxay ku yaalaan goobo dhismo. Goobada cabbir si aad u sizeeyso poligonka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlot\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji dhexda hal dhamaad, kadibna dhexda dhamaadka kale, kadibna guji si aad u dejiso ballaca. Laba xariir, oo taabanaya laba nus-goobo oo isle&#039;eg\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaababka-naqshadda\"\u003EQaababka naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka hore dooro joomatariga, kadibna:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaab toosan\u003C/span\u003E: guji bar bilow, kadibna meesha nuqulka koowaad tagayso, kadibna qor tirada nuqullada (oo ay ku jirto asalka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaab wareegsan\u003C/span\u003E: guji dhexe, kadibna qor tirada nuqullada, si siman loo kala faafiyo wareeg buuxa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqullada waxay la socdaan xiriirrada u dhexeeya joomatariga la doortay (qaab wareegsan wuxuu ka tagaa kuwa fidsan iyo istaagga). Nuqullada lama xidhna asalka: mid beddel, kuwa kale way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geesaha-qaybta-ee-mashruuca\"\u003EGeesaha qaybta ee mashruuca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeesta mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesta toosan ama wareega qaybta ee naqshadda ka dambeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeesta waa la koobiyeeyaa diyaarada naqshadda si sax ah oo waa go&#039;an tahay (xiriirka Hagaaji). Ma raacayso isbeddelada dambe ee qaybta. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad uga dhigto joomatari dhismo. Goobo la janjeeyey diyaarada naqshadda waxay u noqon lahayd ellipse, sidaas darteed waa la diidaa. Sidaas oo kale geesaha xor u ah iyo geesaha toos uga soo baxa naqshadda ka baxa. Mashruucu wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah: weli lama dhisin nooca hadda.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qalabyadan waxay shaqeeyaan naqshad furan. Splayn iyo Jar waxay ku jiraan qalabka. Kuwa kale waxay ku jiraan Wax dheeraad ah dhamaadka qalabyada naqshadda. Qalab kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqoshada, Esc wuu joojiyaa. Qalabyada sawirka aasaasiga ah eeg Naqshadda ugu horreysa. Splaynada Splayn waa qalooc siman. Laba nooc ayaa jira. Qalab Fure Sida loo sawiro Splayn B Guji dhibcaha ay qaloocdu mareyso. Dhammee Enter, Esc, midig-guji ama laba jeer guji. Guji dhibcaha koowaad mar kale si aad u xidho splayn-ka Splayn barta-xakamaynta (hoosta Wax dheeraad ah) Guji barta xakamaynta. Qalooca waa la jiidaa ugu wareegta, laakiin wuxuu taabanayaa oo keliya kii hore iyo kii ugu dambeeya. Poligon-ka xakamaynta ee jajaban wuxuu muuqdaa intaad sawirayso iyo kadib Barooyinku waa barooyin naqshad. Jiid iyaga, ama ku sii xiriir iyo cabbir sida barta kale kasta. Barta koowaad ee splayn-ka ayaa lagu isku dhejin karaa dhamaadka xariir, taasoo isku xidhta xiriir isku meel ah. Taabasho dhamaadka. Dooro xariir, qaanso ama splayn ku kulma hal dhamaad oo splayn, kadibna splayn-ka, kadibna dooro T Taabasho. Jihada dhamaadka splayn-ka ayaa markaas raacaysa xariirka. Taabasho ka fog dhamaadka splayn-ka waa la diidaa: \"Taabasho splayn ahaan waxay u baahan tahay xariir, qaanso ama splayn ku kulma hal dhamaad oo ka mid ah.\" Dhamaadyada. Xiriir taabasho lama hayo, dhamaadyada splayn ku-habaynta waa dabiici (ma jiro qallooc dhamaadka ugu dambeeya). Qalooca waa sadex-darajo oo wuxuu mareyaa dhibic kasta, masaafada u dhaxaysa barooyinka ayaa dhigaysa fogaantooda. Splaynada xiran waxay sameeyaan profile keligood. Splaynada furan waxay isku xidhaan xariirrada iyo qaansooyinka wareeg xiran sida qalooca kale. Tirtirka barta ku jirta splayn-ka waxay tirtirtaa bartaas oo waxay ilaaliyaa splayn-ka, inta uu weli leeyahay ugu yaraan laba barood (saddex marka uu xiran yahay). Soo saar iyo wareeg splayn-ka waxay ka dhisaan xariiro gaaban oo toosan iyada oo loo isticmaalayo mesh kernel (qalooca dhabta ah wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah: weli lama dhisin nooca hadda). Dhoofinta DXF wuxuu qoraa splayn sida polyline oo ku jira 0.01 mm qalooca, sababtoo ah DXF R12 ma lahan unug splayn. Jar iyo ballaadhin Qalab Fure Sida Jar T Barta qalooca: qaybta ka baxda ayaa cas, ilaa isgoysyada ugu dhow. Guji si aad u saarto. Qalooca aan wax gooyin ma sameynin waa la saaraa oo dhan Ballaadhi (hoosta Wax dheeraad ah) E Guji xariir ama qaanso oo u dhow dhamaadka si aad u ballaadhiso. Wuxuu ku kordhaa ilaa qalooca xiga ee uu la kulmo. \"Waxba ma jiro oo dhamaadkaas gaadhsiiya.\" marka wax jid ah aan jirin Jar iyo Ballaadhin waxay ku shaqeeyaan xariiro, qaansooyin, goobooyin iyo splayn (Ballaadhin: xariiro iyo qaansooyin). Goobo la jaray wuxuu noqdaa qaanso. Cabbirka radius-ka ama dhexroorkeeda wuxuu u guurayaa qaansada. Jarista dhexda xariir waxay ka tagtaa laba xariir oo ku sii jira isla xariirka toosan. Jarista dhexda qaanso waxay ka tagtaa laba qaanso oo isku dhexe ah iyo xiriir siman. Splayn la jaray wuxuu noqdaa splayn barta-xakamaynta oo si sax ah u raacda qalooca hore. Xiriirka taabashada dhamaadka ee la ilaaliyo ayaa sii jira. Dhamaadka cusub waxaa lagu dhejiyaa qalooca gooyay (xariirka, qaansada ama goobada, ama isku meel la socda dhamaadkiisa). Splaynadu ma hayn karaan bar, sidaas darteed splayn gooya ma darto xiriir. Xiriirrada aan waxba u qaadan waa la tirtiraa, status bar-kana wuxuu sheegaa tirada. Tusaale ahaan, cabbirka dherer ee xariir la jaray waa la tirtiraa, laakiin xiriirrada fidsan ama isu-dhigan way sii jiraan. Kala-raris Dooro Kala-raris hoosta Wax dheeraad ah ama riix O. Guji xariir, qaanso, goobo ama splayn. Silsiladdiisa oo dhan ayaa iftiimaya: qalooc kasta oo dhamaad-ilaa-dhamaad isku xidhan, ilaa barta uu saddex ama ka badan ku kulmaan. Si aad uga kala-rarto qayb kaliya silsilad, marka hore dooro qalooca, kadibna dooro Kala-raris oo guji mid ka mid ah. Tusaha u dhaqaaji dhinaca ay nuqulku u tagayso. Hordhac dhibcooyin ah ayaa raacda. Riix B labada dhinac. Guji, qor masaafada, oo riix Enter. Xariiro iyo qaansooyin waa la kala-rarayaa si sax ah. Geesaha waa la ballaadhiyaa ama la jaraa ilaa ay kulmaan. Nuqulku wuxuu leeyahay hal cabbir Kala-raris, qaybaha kale way raacaan: laba jeer guji cabbirka si aad u beddesho nuqulka oo dhan. Masaafo weyn silsiladda aan lagu oggolaan, tusaale \"Masaafadaas weyn bay u tahay silsiladdan: dhinac wuxuu u rogi lahaa gudaha oo dibadda ku soo baxa.\" Splayn waxaa lagu kala-raraa splayn ku-habayn cusub oo ku jira 0.001 mm kala-rarka runta ah. Nuqulkan waa go'an: ma raacayo isbeddelada soo socda, wayna lahayn cabbir Kala-raris. Splayn silsilad ku jirta waxay u baahan tahay isku xidhmo siman (taabasho) dhamaadkeeda. Muraayad Dooro, si aad u doorato wax la muraayadeynayo. Dooro Muraayad hoosta Wax dheeraad ah ama riix M. Guji xariirka ama khadka dhexe ee lagu muraayadeynayo. Bar kasta oo la muraayadeeyey wuxuu helaa xiriir Isku-ekaan oo ay la leedahay asalkeeda, sidaas darteed nuqulku wuxuu raacaa marka asalku beddelo. Barooyinka ku taal xariirka muraayadda waa la wadaagaa, goobooyinka la muraayadeeyey waxay helaan xiriir Siman. Haddii wax la dooran waynay, guji waxyaabaha la muraayadeynayo, riix Enter, kadibna guji xariirka muraayadda. Poligonnada iyo slot-yada Qalab Sida Poligon Guji dhexe, kadibna geesle, kadibna qor tirada dhinacyada (3 ilaa 64). Dhinacyadu waa isle'eg, geesuhuna waxay ku yaalaan goobo dhismo. Goobada cabbir si aad u sizeeyso poligonka Slot Guji dhexda hal dhamaad, kadibna dhexda dhamaadka kale, kadibna guji si aad u dejiso ballaca. Laba xariir, oo taabanaya laba nus-goobo oo isle'eg Qaababka naqshadda Marka hore dooro joomatariga, kadibna: Qaab toosan: guji bar bilow, kadibna meesha nuqulka koowaad tagayso, kadibna qor tirada nuqullada (oo ay ku jirto asalka). Qaab wareegsan: guji dhexe, kadibna qor tirada nuqullada, si siman loo kala faafiyo wareeg buuxa. Nuqullada waxay la socdaan xiriirrada u dhexeeya joomatariga la doortay (qaab wareegsan wuxuu ka tagaa kuwa fidsan iyo istaagga). Nuqullada lama xidhna asalka: mid beddel, kuwa kale way sii joogaan sidii ay ahaayeen. Geesaha qaybta ee mashruuca Dooro Geesta mashruuca hoosta Wax dheeraad ah. Guji geesta toosan ama wareega qaybta ee naqshadda ka dambeeya. Geesta waa la koobiyeeyaa diyaarada naqshadda si sax ah oo waa go'an tahay (xiriirka Hagaaji). Ma raacayso isbeddelada dambe ee qaybta. Riix Q si aad uga dhigto joomatari dhismo. Goobo la janjeeyey diyaarada naqshadda waxay u noqon lahayd ellipse, sidaas darteed waa la diidaa. Sidaas oo kale geesaha xor u ah iyo geesaha toos uga soo baxa naqshadda ka baxa. Mashruucu wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah: weli lama dhisin nooca hadda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sketch-arc-methods","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qaanso ku sawir toban hab","summary":"Dooro sida qaansada loo qeexayo (saddex barood, bilow iyo dhamaad oo leh radiyas, dhexe iyo bilow oo leh xagal, iyo wax dheeraad ah), guji ama ku qor qiimayaasha, oo ku sii wad xariiqda ama qaansada u dambeysay.","section":"tasks","order":16,"keywords":["qaanso","saddex barood","3 point arc","three point arc","bilow dhexe dhamaad","start center end","bilow dhamaad radiyas","start end radius","qaanso taabasho","sii wad","chord","xagal dhex jira","sketch arc","habab qaanso"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyin","text":"Tallaabooyin","level":2},{"id":"qoraallo","text":"Qoraallo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaanso ku sawir sawir-gacmeed habka la jaan qaadaya waxa aad ogtahay: saddex barood oo ku yaal, dhexdeeda, radiyaskeeda, xagalka ay ku wareegto ama jihada ay ka baxayso. Qiimayaasha waa la gujin karaa ama la qori karaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyin\"\u003ETallaabooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuro sawir-gacmeed (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\"\u003EAasaaska sawir-gacmeedka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbar-ka sawir-gacmeedka, fur liiska ku xiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro hab, tusaale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso: Bilow, Dhamaad, Radiyas\u003C/span\u003E. Hababka waa Saddex-barood; Bilow, Dhexe, Dhamaad; Bilow, Dhexe, Xagal; Bilow, Dhexe, Dherer; Bilow, Dhamaad, Xagal; Bilow, Dhamaad, Jihada; Bilow, Dhamaad, Radiyas; Dhexe, Bilow, Dhamaad; Dhexe, Bilow, Xagal; Dhexe, Bilow, Dherer; iyo Sii wad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaac status bar-ka, kaas oo magacaabaa habka oo sheegaya waxa aad siinayso xiga: guji barta bilowga, barta dhexe, barta labaad ee qaansada ama barta dhamaadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHalka prompt-ku leeyahay &quot;or type&quot;, ku qor lambar oo taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: xagalka dhexe ee darajooyinka (taban waa jihada saacadda), dhererka chord-ka, jihada tangent-ka bilowga ee darajooyinka, ama radiyaska (taban waa wareegga dheer).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaansada waa la sawiray. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso: Sii wad\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bilaabaa qaansada xigta ee dhamaadka xariiqda ama qaanso u dambeysay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qoraallo\"\u003EQoraallo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaansooyinku waxay hayaan dhexdooda, bilowga iyo dhamaadka, sidaas darteed xidhiidhada iyo cabbirrada ayaa shaqeeya sida hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStatus bar-ku diidaa geliska aan suurtagal ahayn wuxuuna sheegaa sababta, tusaale saddex barood oo xariiq mid ah, ama radiyas aad u yar oo aan gaadhi karin labada barood dhamaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaanso: Sii wad\u003C/span\u003E oo aan waxba la sawirin wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Ma jiro meel laga sii wado: marka hore sawir xariiq ama qaanso.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Qaanso ku sawir sawir-gacmeed habka la jaan qaadaya waxa aad ogtahay: saddex barood oo ku yaal, dhexdeeda, radiyaskeeda, xagalka ay ku wareegto ama jihada ay ka baxayso. Qiimayaasha waa la gujin karaa ama la qori karaa. Tallaabooyin Furo sawir-gacmeed (eeg Aasaaska sawir-gacmeedka). Toolbar-ka sawir-gacmeedka, fur liiska ku xiga Qaanso oo dooro hab, tusaale Qaanso: Bilow, Dhamaad, Radiyas. Hababka waa Saddex-barood; Bilow, Dhexe, Dhamaad; Bilow, Dhexe, Xagal; Bilow, Dhexe, Dherer; Bilow, Dhamaad, Xagal; Bilow, Dhamaad, Jihada; Bilow, Dhamaad, Radiyas; Dhexe, Bilow, Dhamaad; Dhexe, Bilow, Xagal; Dhexe, Bilow, Dherer; iyo Sii wad. Raac status bar-ka, kaas oo magacaabaa habka oo sheegaya waxa aad siinayso xiga: guji barta bilowga, barta dhexe, barta labaad ee qaansada ama barta dhamaadka. Halka prompt-ku leeyahay \"or type\", ku qor lambar oo taabo Enter: xagalka dhexe ee darajooyinka (taban waa jihada saacadda), dhererka chord-ka, jihada tangent-ka bilowga ee darajooyinka, ama radiyaska (taban waa wareegga dheer). Qaansada waa la sawiray. Qaanso: Sii wad wuxuu bilaabaa qaansada xigta ee dhamaadka xariiqda ama qaanso u dambeysay. Qoraallo Qaansooyinku waxay hayaan dhexdooda, bilowga iyo dhamaadka, sidaas darteed xidhiidhada iyo cabbirrada ayaa shaqeeya sida hore. Status bar-ku diidaa geliska aan suurtagal ahayn wuxuuna sheegaa sababta, tusaale saddex barood oo xariiq mid ah, ama radiyas aad u yar oo aan gaadhi karin labada barood dhamaad. Qaanso: Sii wad oo aan waxba la sawirin wuxuu leeyahay \"Ma jiro meel laga sii wado: marka hore sawir xariiq ama qaanso.\"","lang":"so"},{"slug":"relations-dimensions","scope":"partcraft","title":"Si buuxda u qeex sawir-gacmeed xiriirro iyo cabbirro","summary":"Ku dar xiriirro panelka midig iyo cabbirro qalabka Cabbir, akhri midabyada hoos loo qeexay, si buuxda loo qeexay iyo dhaaf loo qeexay, oo hagaaji sawir-gacmeed dhaaf loo qeexay.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["xiriirro","xayiraad","cabbirro","cabbir caqli","si buuxda loo qeexay","hoos loo qeexay","dhaaf loo qeexay","darajooyinka xorriyadda","isku meel","toosan","bannaan","jajab","taabasho","isku mid","dhexe","hagaaji","iska hor imaad","xad-dhaaf"],"headings":[{"id":"akhri-xaaladda-sawir-gacmeedka","text":"Akhri xaaladda sawir-gacmeedka","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-cabbir","text":"Ku dar cabbir","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-xiriir","text":"Ku dar xiriir","level":2},{"id":"tusaale-shaqo-profile-bracket-oo-l-ah","text":"Tusaale shaqo: profile bracket oo L ah","level":2},{"id":"hagaaji-sawir-gacmeed-dhaaf-loo-qeexay","text":"Hagaaji sawir-gacmeed dhaaf loo qeexay","level":2},{"id":"jiid-si-aad-u-hesho-waxa-xor-ah","text":"Jiid si aad u hesho waxa xor ah","level":2},{"id":"liiska-xiriirrada","text":"Liiska xiriirrada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESawir-gacmeed waxa uu \u003Cstrong\u003Esi buuxda loo qeexay\u003C/strong\u003E marka bar kasta iyo cabbir kasta ay xiriirro iyo cabbirro hagaajiyaan. Sawir-gacmeed si buuxda loo qeexay wuxuu isbeddelaa oo keliya markaad lambar beddesho, sidaas darteed qaybtu si saadaalin ah ayay u dhaqmaysaa markaad dib u tafatirto. PartCraft ma ku qasbo inaad sawir-gacmeed si buuxda u qeexdo, laakiin had iyo jeer wuxuu muujinayaa sida aad u dhow tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-xaaladda-sawir-gacmeedka\"\u003EAkhri xaaladda sawir-gacmeedka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaaladdu waxay ka muuqataa saddex meelood: chip-ka xagga bidix sare ee aragga, fariinta xagga sare ee panelka midig, iyo calaamadda taariikhda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXaalad\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EChip\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMidabka geometry-ga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHoos loo qeexay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Under defined · 3 degrees of freedom&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuluug\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeometry-qaar wali way dhaqaaqi karaa. Jiid geometry-ga buluug si aad u aragto jihada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESi buuxda loo qeexay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fully defined&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInk (madow marka Paper, cad marka Model)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar kasta iyo cabbir kasta waa la hagaajiyey\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaaf loo qeexay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Over defined&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECasaan xiriirrada ku lug leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXiriirro qaarkood way iska hor imanayaan, ama mid horay ayaa loo caddeeyey kuwa kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeometry-ga dhismaha waa midab cawl oo jeexjeexan xaalad kasta. Walxaha la doortay waa liin. &quot;Darajada xorriyadda&quot; waa hal jihada ay wax wali u dhaqmi karaan: bar xor ah wuxuu leeyahay laba (bidix-midig iyo sare-hoos), goobo xor ah wuxuu leeyahay saddex (dhexdhexaadkeeda, radiyeeskeeda).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESharaxa hoos fariinta panelka midig ayaa ku celinaya midabada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-cabbir\"\u003EKu dar cabbir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDimension\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji waxa aad rabto inaad cabbirto:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ehal xarriiq\u003C/strong\u003E: dhererkeeda;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ehal goobo\u003C/strong\u003E: dhexroorkeeda; \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal qalloocan\u003C/strong\u003E: radiyeeskeeda;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Elaba bar\u003C/strong\u003E (dhamaadka, dhexdhexaadka, bar xor ah ama origin-ka): masaafada ka dhexeysa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ebar iyo xarriiq\u003C/strong\u003E: masaafada ka dhexeysa barta iyo xarriiqa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Elaba xarriiq isbarbar ah\u003C/strong\u003E: masaafada ka dhexeysa; \u003Cstrong\u003Elaba xarriiq xagal ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E: xagasha ka dhexeysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShay kadib, status bar-ka wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Click a second item, or click where the dimension goes.&quot; Guji shay labaad, ama guji meel bannaan oo aad rabto lambarka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuq lambar ayaa furmaya oo ku muujinaya qiimaha hadda. Ku qor cabbirka oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu hayaa qiimihii la cabbiray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeesha aad lambarka dhigtid ayaa go&#039;aamisa nooca\u003C/strong\u003E xarriiq jeexan ama laba bar: dhig sare ama hoos si aad u hesho masaafo bannaan, bidix ama midig si aad u hesho masaafo dhidib, meel kale si aad u hesho masaafada dhabta ah (isla jihada).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqa wuxuu aqbalaa lambaro caadi ah oo millimitir ama darajo, sida \u003Ccode\u003E25\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E1e3\u003C/code\u003E. ⌀, Ø ama R bilow ahaan, ama mm ama ° dabada ayaa la iska dhaafaa. Xagasha waxay u dhexeeyaan 0 ilaa 180 darajo. Xisaabta sida \u003Ccode\u003E20+5\u003C/code\u003E lama aqbalo; si aad cabbir ugu xidhiidhiso doorsoome ama qaacido, ku bilow \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad cabbir dambe u beddesho, laba jeer guji lambarkeeda sawir-gacmeedka, ama dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/strong\u003E isagoo ku taal liiska panelka midig.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale marka hore dooro geometry-ga (qalabka Select) oo dooro badhanka cabbirka ee panelka midig: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDistance\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHorizontal distance\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVertical distance\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadius\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiameter\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E. Kuwa ku habboon xulashada ayaa keliya la muujinayaa. Tanu waa habka aad goobo ugu siiso radius halkii diameter.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-xiriir\"\u003EKu dar xiriir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiriirrada waxaa lagu daraa panelka midig, ma aha qalab.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u doorato Select.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji hal shay, kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji shay labaad haddii xiriirku u baahan yahay laba. Bar asalka ayaa sidoo kale la dooran karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka midig wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Selected: line l3, point p1&quot; wuxuuna muujinayaa badhan kasta oo xiriir ku habboon, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E∥ Isbarbar\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Isku meel\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro badhanka. Sawir-gacmeedku isla markiiba wuu xallinayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii xiriir aan ku habboon jirin, panelka wuxuu leeyahay &quot;No relation fits this selection. Select one or two items (Shift+click adds).&quot; › &quot;Xiriir ma ku habboon xulashadan. Dooro hal ama laba shay (Shift+guji ayaa ku daraa).&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska buuxa ee xiriirrada, waxa ay u baahan yihiin iyo waxa ay sameeyaan, waxaa ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-relations\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-relations\"\u003ESketch relations and dimensions\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiriirrada sawir-gacmeedka ku muuqdaan calaamado yar oo ku dhow geometry-ga (H, V, ∥, ⊥, T, =, ◎, M, ⚓). Calaamadaha dhibcaha isku meel waa la qariyaa illaa geometry-ga la doortay ama xiriirku dhibaato ku jiro. Guji calaamadda si aad xiriirka u doorato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tusaale-shaqo-profile-bracket-oo-l-ah\"\u003ETusaale shaqo: profile bracket oo L ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sawir-gacmeed \u003Cstrong\u003EFront plane\u003C/strong\u003E. Qalabka Line ku bilow origin-ka, kadibna guji lix geesood oo L ah, oo ku dhammaysta origin-ka mar kale. Silsiladu waxay dhammaataa marka aad guujiso barta koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXarriiqyada lagu sawiray u dhow bannaan ama toosan horay ayay u leeyihiin xiriirrada H iyo V, marka laga reebo tan ugu dambaysa: xarriiq ku dhammaysa bar hore ah ma helo xiriir otomaatig ah. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, guji xarriiqaas ugu dambeeya oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EV Toosan\u003C/span\u003E panelka midig. Chip-ku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Under defined · 4 degrees of freedom&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Guji xarriiqa hoose, guji hoosta, ku qor \u003Ccode\u003E80\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji xarriiqa bidix, guji bidixda, ku qor \u003Ccode\u003E60\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu cabbir xarriiqa gaaban ee sare \u003Ccode\u003E20\u003C/code\u003E iyo xarriiqa gudaha ee toosan \u003Ccode\u003E45\u003C/code\u003E sidii oo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChip-ku hadda wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003ESi buuxda loo qeexay\u003C/strong\u003E oo L-ga oo dhan wuxuu noqdaa ink.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hagaaji-sawir-gacmeed-dhaaf-loo-qeexay\"\u003EHagaaji sawir-gacmeed dhaaf loo qeexay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka xiriir ama cabbir cusub uu kuwa kale iska hor imaado, PartCraft ma dhaqdho wax. Geometry-gu waa sidii uu ahaa, xiriirrada ku lug leh waxay noqdaan casaan, status bar-kuna wuxuu magacaabaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Over defined: Horizontal, Distance 40 cannot all be met. Undo, or delete one of them.&quot; Xiriirrada way iska hor imanayaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Over defined: Parallel is already implied. Delete it.&quot; Xiriirku wax ku darayo ma jiro: kuwa kale horay ayay u qasbayaan. (Tusaale ahaan, dhinacyada rectangle-ka horay ayay isbarbar u yihiin.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u hagaajiso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad uga noqoto isbeddelka ugu dambeeya, ama\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHel shayga casaanka ah liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EXiriirrada iyo cabbirrada\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig (koox ku jirta ayaa furmaysa, magaceeda casaan) oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir\u003C/strong\u003E ku xiga. Waxaad sidoo kale guji calaamadda ama lambarka sawir-gacmeedka oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca dhismaha kan ma leh cabbirro &quot;driven&quot; (tixraac). Cabbir kasta oo kaliya warbixinta cabbir horay xiriirrada kale u hagaajiyaan waxa loo tixgeliyaa dhaaf loo qeexay. Ku akhri cabbirrada panelka: dooro xarriiq oo fiiri badhamada cabbirka, ama hubi xogta qaybta kadib extrude.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir-gacmeed dhaaf loo qeexay oo leh iska hor imaad dhab ah ayaa ka dhigaysa astaamaha isticmaala fashil (&quot;Over defined: 1 relation cannot all be met.&quot;), taariikhduna wuxuu calaamadiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003E⚠ khalad\u003C/strong\u003E. Sawir-gacmeed kaliya xad-dhaaf ah wali wuu dhisaa, oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003E⚠ digniin\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiid-si-aad-u-hesho-waxa-xor-ah\"\u003EJiid si aad u hesho waxa xor ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESelect-ka dhexdiisa jiid bar buluug ah ama xarriiq kasta. Xallinta waxay u dhaqaajisaa wax yar ilaa ay ilaalineyso xiriirrada oo dhan. Haddii jiidistu jebiso xiriir, geometry-gu wuu soo noqdaa meeshiisii. Tanu waa habka ugu dhaqsaha badan si aad u aragto cabbirka maqan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"liiska-xiriirrada\"\u003ELiiska xiriirrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad wax aan dooran, panelka midig wuxuu liiskaa \u003Cstrong\u003EXiriirrada iyo cabbirrada\u003C/strong\u003E. Safka kasta wuxuu leeyahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/strong\u003E (cabbirrada keliya): furaa sanduuqa lambarka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu doortaa sawir-gacmeedka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir\u003C/strong\u003E: wuu tirtiraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiriirrada nooc isku mid ah oo ka badan hal jeer muuqda waxay wadaagaan hal safka, sida &quot;Coincident × 5&quot; rectangle-ka ku xiran origin-ka. Guji safka si aad u furto: xiriir kasta waxa lagu liiskaa waxa uu xidhiidhiyo (&quot;point p2, point p4&quot;) oo leeyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir\u003C/strong\u003E u gaar ah. Safka laftiisu wuxuu leeyahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu doortaa dhammaantood sawir-gacmeedka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirtir dhammaan\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu tirtiraa dhammaantood hal tallaabo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaya).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoox ka kooban xiriir dhaaf loo qeexay ayaa iskiis u furmaysa, magaceeda casaan. Cabbirrada mar walba waxaa lagu liiskaa hal hal safka, qiimahooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad geometry dooratay, liiska wuxuu muujinayaa oo keliya \u003Cstrong\u003EXiriirrada xulashada\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sawir-gacmeed waxa uu si buuxda loo qeexay marka bar kasta iyo cabbir kasta ay xiriirro iyo cabbirro hagaajiyaan. Sawir-gacmeed si buuxda loo qeexay wuxuu isbeddelaa oo keliya markaad lambar beddesho, sidaas darteed qaybtu si saadaalin ah ayay u dhaqmaysaa markaad dib u tafatirto. PartCraft ma ku qasbo inaad sawir-gacmeed si buuxda u qeexdo, laakiin had iyo jeer wuxuu muujinayaa sida aad u dhow tahay. Akhri xaaladda sawir-gacmeedka Xaaladdu waxay ka muuqataa saddex meelood: chip-ka xagga bidix sare ee aragga, fariinta xagga sare ee panelka midig, iyo calaamadda taariikhda. Xaalad Chip Midabka geometry-ga Macnaha Hoos loo qeexay \"Under defined · 3 degrees of freedom\" Buluug Geometry-qaar wali way dhaqaaqi karaa. Jiid geometry-ga buluug si aad u aragto jihada Si buuxda loo qeexay \"Fully defined\" Ink (madow marka Paper, cad marka Model) Bar kasta iyo cabbir kasta waa la hagaajiyey Dhaaf loo qeexay \"Over defined\" Casaan xiriirrada ku lug leh Xiriirro qaarkood way iska hor imanayaan, ama mid horay ayaa loo caddeeyey kuwa kale Geometry-ga dhismaha waa midab cawl oo jeexjeexan xaalad kasta. Walxaha la doortay waa liin. \"Darajada xorriyadda\" waa hal jihada ay wax wali u dhaqmi karaan: bar xor ah wuxuu leeyahay laba (bidix-midig iyo sare-hoos), goobo xor ah wuxuu leeyahay saddex (dhexdhexaadkeeda, radiyeeskeeda). Sharaxa hoos fariinta panelka midig ayaa ku celinaya midabada. Ku dar cabbir Riix D ama dooro Dimension. Guji waxa aad rabto inaad cabbirto: hal xarriiq: dhererkeeda; hal goobo: dhexroorkeeda; hal qalloocan: radiyeeskeeda; laba bar (dhamaadka, dhexdhexaadka, bar xor ah ama origin-ka): masaafada ka dhexeysa; bar iyo xarriiq: masaafada ka dhexeysa barta iyo xarriiqa; laba xarriiq isbarbar ah: masaafada ka dhexeysa; laba xarriiq xagal ku jira: xagasha ka dhexeysa. Shay kadib, status bar-ka wuxuu leeyahay \"Click a second item, or click where the dimension goes.\" Guji shay labaad, ama guji meel bannaan oo aad rabto lambarka. Sanduuq lambar ayaa furmaya oo ku muujinaya qiimaha hadda. Ku qor cabbirka oo riix Enter. Esc wuxuu hayaa qiimihii la cabbiray. Meesha aad lambarka dhigtid ayaa go'aamisa nooca xarriiq jeexan ama laba bar: dhig sare ama hoos si aad u hesho masaafo bannaan, bidix ama midig si aad u hesho masaafo dhidib, meel kale si aad u hesho masaafada dhabta ah (isla jihada). Sanduuqa wuxuu aqbalaa lambaro caadi ah oo millimitir ama darajo, sida 25, 12.5 ama 1e3. ⌀, Ø ama R bilow ahaan, ama mm ama ° dabada ayaa la iska dhaafaa. Xagasha waxay u dhexeeyaan 0 ilaa 180 darajo. Xisaabta sida 20+5 lama aqbalo; si aad cabbir ugu xidhiidhiso doorsoome ama qaacido, ku bilow =. Si aad cabbir dambe u beddesho, laba jeer guji lambarkeeda sawir-gacmeedka, ama dooro Wax ka beddel isagoo ku taal liiska panelka midig. Waxaad sidoo kale marka hore dooro geometry-ga (qalabka Select) oo dooro badhanka cabbirka ee panelka midig: Distance, Horizontal distance, Vertical distance, Radius, Diameter ama Angle. Kuwa ku habboon xulashada ayaa keliya la muujinayaa. Tanu waa habka aad goobo ugu siiso radius halkii diameter. Ku dar xiriir Xiriirrada waxaa lagu daraa panelka midig, ma aha qalab. Riix S si aad u doorato Select. Guji hal shay, kadibna Shift+guji shay labaad haddii xiriirku u baahan yahay laba. Bar asalka ayaa sidoo kale la dooran karaa. Panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay \"Selected: line l3, point p1\" wuxuuna muujinayaa badhan kasta oo xiriir ku habboon, sida ∥ Isbarbar ama • Isku meel. Dooro badhanka. Sawir-gacmeedku isla markiiba wuu xallinayaa. Haddii xiriir aan ku habboon jirin, panelka wuxuu leeyahay \"No relation fits this selection. Select one or two items (Shift+click adds).\" › \"Xiriir ma ku habboon xulashadan. Dooro hal ama laba shay (Shift+guji ayaa ku daraa).\" Liiska buuxa ee xiriirrada, waxa ay u baahan yihiin iyo waxa ay sameeyaan, waxaa ku jira Sketch relations and dimensions. Xiriirrada sawir-gacmeedka ku muuqdaan calaamado yar oo ku dhow geometry-ga (H, V, ∥, ⊥, T, =, ◎, M, ⚓). Calaamadaha dhibcaha isku meel waa la qariyaa illaa geometry-ga la doortay ama xiriirku dhibaato ku jiro. Guji calaamadda si aad xiriirka u doorato. Tusaale shaqo: profile bracket oo L ah Ku sawir-gacmeed Front plane. Qalabka Line ku bilow origin-ka, kadibna guji lix geesood oo L ah, oo ku dhammaysta origin-ka mar kale. Silsiladu waxay dhammaataa marka aad guujiso barta koowaad. Xarriiqyada lagu sawiray u dhow bannaan ama toosan horay ayay u leeyihiin xiriirrada H iyo V, marka laga reebo tan ugu dambaysa: xarriiq ku dhammaysa bar hore ah ma helo xiriir otomaatig ah. Riix S, guji xarriiqaas ugu dambeeya oo dooro V Toosan panelka midig. Chip-ku wuxuu leeyahay \"Under defined · 4 degrees of freedom\". Riix D. Guji xarriiqa hoose, guji hoosta, ku qor 80, Enter. Guji xarriiqa bidix, guji bidixda, ku qor 60, Enter. Ku cabbir xarriiqa gaaban ee sare 20 iyo xarriiqa gudaha ee toosan 45 sidii oo kale. Chip-ku hadda wuxuu leeyahay Si buuxda loo qeexay oo L-ga oo dhan wuxuu noqdaa ink. Hagaaji sawir-gacmeed dhaaf loo qeexay Marka xiriir ama cabbir cusub uu kuwa kale iska hor imaado, PartCraft ma dhaqdho wax. Geometry-gu waa sidii uu ahaa, xiriirrada ku lug leh waxay noqdaan casaan, status bar-kuna wuxuu magacaabaa: \"Over defined: Horizontal, Distance 40 cannot all be met. Undo, or delete one of them.\" Xiriirrada way iska hor imanayaan. \"Over defined: Parallel is already implied. Delete it.\" Xiriirku wax ku darayo ma jiro: kuwa kale horay ayay u qasbayaan. (Tusaale ahaan, dhinacyada rectangle-ka horay ayay isbarbar u yihiin.) Si aad u hagaajiso: Riix Ctrl+Z si aad uga noqoto isbeddelka ugu dambeeya, ama Hel shayga casaanka ah liiska Xiriirrada iyo cabbirrada panelka midig (koox ku jirta ayaa furmaysa, magaceeda casaan) oo dooro Tirtir ku xiga. Waxaad sidoo kale guji calaamadda ama lambarka sawir-gacmeedka oo riix Delete. Nooca dhismaha kan ma leh cabbirro \"driven\" (tixraac). Cabbir kasta oo kaliya warbixinta cabbir horay xiriirrada kale u hagaajiyaan waxa loo tixgeliyaa dhaaf loo qeexay. Ku akhri cabbirrada panelka: dooro xarriiq oo fiiri badhamada cabbirka, ama hubi xogta qaybta kadib extrude. Sawir-gacmeed dhaaf loo qeexay oo leh iska hor imaad dhab ah ayaa ka dhigaysa astaamaha isticmaala fashil (\"Over defined: 1 relation cannot all be met.\"), taariikhduna wuxuu calaamadiyaa ⚠ khalad. Sawir-gacmeed kaliya xad-dhaaf ah wali wuu dhisaa, oo leh ⚠ digniin. Jiid si aad u hesho waxa xor ah Select-ka dhexdiisa jiid bar buluug ah ama xarriiq kasta. Xallinta waxay u dhaqaajisaa wax yar ilaa ay ilaalineyso xiriirrada oo dhan. Haddii jiidistu jebiso xiriir, geometry-gu wuu soo noqdaa meeshiisii. Tanu waa habka ugu dhaqsaha badan si aad u aragto cabbirka maqan. Liiska xiriirrada Markaad wax aan dooran, panelka midig wuxuu liiskaa Xiriirrada iyo cabbirrada. Safka kasta wuxuu leeyahay: Wax ka beddel (cabbirrada keliya): furaa sanduuqa lambarka; Dooro: wuxuu doortaa sawir-gacmeedka; Tirtir: wuu tirtiraa. Xiriirrada nooc isku mid ah oo ka badan hal jeer muuqda waxay wadaagaan hal safka, sida \"Coincident × 5\" rectangle-ka ku xiran origin-ka. Guji safka si aad u furto: xiriir kasta waxa lagu liiskaa waxa uu xidhiidhiyo (\"point p2, point p4\") oo leeyo Dooro iyo Tirtir u gaar ah. Safka laftiisu wuxuu leeyahay: Dooro: wuxuu doortaa dhammaantood sawir-gacmeedka; Tirtir dhammaan: wuxuu tirtiraa dhammaantood hal tallaabo (Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaya). Koox ka kooban xiriir dhaaf loo qeexay ayaa iskiis u furmaysa, magaceeda casaan. Cabbirrada mar walba waxaa lagu liiskaa hal hal safka, qiimahooda. Markaad geometry dooratay, liiska wuxuu muujinayaa oo keliya Xiriirrada xulashada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"add-by-coordinates","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ku dar geometry sawir-gacmeed adigoo qoraya isku-xidhka","summary":"Isticmaal Ku dar isku-xidhka qaybta sawir-gacmeedka si aad xariiqyo, khadad dhexe, gaashaanno, goobo iyo bar ugu dhigto meelo sax ah, adigoo kiiboodhka keliya isticmaalaya.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["isku-xidhka","gelinta qoraalka","gelinta furayaasha","gelinta tirooyinka","booska saxda ah","x y","isku-xidhka buuxa","helitaanka","aan mouse lahayn"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-qaab","text":"Ku dar qaab","level":2},{"id":"tusaale-qolof-sahan-oo-la-qoray","text":"Tusaale: qolof sahan oo la qoray","level":2},{"id":"geometry-la-qoray-waa-la-meel-dhigay-laakiin-lama-xidhin","text":"Geometry la qoray waa la meel dhigay, laakiin lama xidhin","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadyo","text":"Xaddidaadyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka aad tirooyinka ogtahay, qorida ayaa ka dhakhso badan riix-riixidda iyo cabbirinta. \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar isku-xidhka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku yaal qaybta midig mar kasta oo sawir-gacmeed la furan yahay. Waxaa kale oo ku siinaysa inaad sawir-gacmeed dhistid adigoo aan wax pointer ah isticmaalin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-xidhka waxaa lagu qoraa millimitir, oo ku jira dhuraha sawir-gacmeedka laftiisa: x waa midig, y waa sare marka aad sawir-gacmeedka eegayso, iyadoo (0, 0) ay tahay asalka (goobta cas ee leh far).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-qaab\"\u003EKu dar qaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur sawir-gacmeed (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\"\u003ESamee sawir-gacmeedkaaga ugu horreeya\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta midig, u dhaqaaq ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar isku-xidhka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaabka \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar\u003C/strong\u003E dhexdiisa: Xarriiq, Khadka dhexe, Gaashaan, Goobo ama Bar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBuuxi sanduuqyada:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESanduuqyada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXarriiq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo x, y\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa x, y\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo x, y\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa x, y\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGaashaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta x, y\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EGeeska ka soo horjeeda x, y\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda x, y\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ERadius\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu taal x, y\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sanduuq kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka ayaa soo muuqda, farriinta xaaladdana waxay tusaysa, tusaale ahaan, &quot;Gaashaan ayaa la daray.&quot; Sanduuqyadii way madhanaadaan, diyaar u ah kii xiga. Mid kasta oo la daro waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQor laba tiro oo ay kala saaran tahay koom ama meel bannaan, tusaale ahaan: \u003Ccode\u003E0, 0\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E25 -10\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E12.5,40\u003C/code\u003E. Tirooyinka taban iyo kuwa tobanka ah way fiican yihiin. Radius-ku waa inuu ka weyn yahay eber. Haddii wax aan tiro ahayn la qoro, farriinta xaaladda ayaa tusaysa: &#039;Isku-xidhka ku qor &quot;x, y&quot; iyo radius ka weyn eber.&#039;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tusaale-qolof-sahan-oo-la-qoray\"\u003ETusaale: qolof sahan oo la qoray\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur sawir-gacmeed ku yaal \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha hore\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar\u003C/strong\u003E: Gaashaan. \u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta x, y\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E-50, -30\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EGeeska ka soo horjeeda x, y\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E50, 30\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar\u003C/strong\u003E: Goobo. \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda x, y\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E-30, 0\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003ERadius\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E5\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda x, y\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E30, 0\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003ERadius\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E5\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bax sawirka\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E: lakabka 100 × 60 mm oo leh laba god oo 10 mm ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geometry-la-qoray-waa-la-meel-dhigay-laakiin-lama-xidhin\"\u003EGeometry la qoray waa la meel dhigay, laakiin lama xidhin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-xidhka la qoray wuxuu geometry-ga geeyaa meesha saxda ah, laakiin \u003Cstrong\u003Ema aha xidhiidh\u003C/strong\u003E. Qaababka waxay ku sii jiraan buluug (aan si buuxda loo qeexin) waxayna dhaqaajin karaan haddii aad jiidto ama aad cabbir kale beddesho:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Egaashaan la qoray wuxuu leeyahay geeskiisa, xidhiidhka jiifka iyo kan istaagga, sida mid la sawiray, laakiin wax ma xidhayo asalka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Exarriiq la qoray ma leh xidhiidh jiif ama istaag, xitaa haddii aad qortay xarriiq sinaba u jirta;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edhexda goobta la qoray waa xor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi sawir-gacmeedku u noqdo mid si buuxda loo qeexay, dabadeed ku dar cabbirro iyo xidhiidho (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003ESi buuxda u qeex sawir-gacmeed\u003C/a\u003E). Tusaale ahaan, dooro geesta gaashaanka iyo asalka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Isku-meel\u003C/span\u003E, ama cabbir dhexda goobaha asalka ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPointer la&#039;aan waxaad ilaa halkan gaari kartaa: u dhaqaaq safka dusha ee taariikhda adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo furayaasha fallaadha, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u doorato, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u sawirto, ku dar qaababka halkan, kadibna gaar \u003Cstrong\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/strong\u003E ee cabbir kasta oo aad \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bax sawirka\u003C/span\u003E ku dhammayso \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Geometry-ga doorashada, iyo sidaas darteed xidhiidhyada ama cabbirrada cusub, wali waxay u baahan tahay riix ama taabasho dhibic dhexdeeda dhismahan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadyo\"\u003EXaddidaadyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQowsyada weli lama qori karo. Iska dhig qalabka Arc, ama qor goobo oo isticmaal xidhiidhyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa jiraan isku-xidhyo xeeladda ah (laga bilaabo barta u dambaysa) ama isku-xidhyo xagal iyo dherer ah (dherer iyo xagal) sanduuqan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeometry-ga la qoray ma isku-dhaho barta jirta. Qor isku-xidhka isla barta jirta, kadibna ku dar xidhiidh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Isku-meel\u003C/span\u003E inta u dhexeysa haddii ay tahay inay isku xirnaadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Marka aad tirooyinka ogtahay, qorida ayaa ka dhakhso badan riix-riixidda iyo cabbirinta. Ku dar isku-xidhka wuxuu ku yaal qaybta midig mar kasta oo sawir-gacmeed la furan yahay. Waxaa kale oo ku siinaysa inaad sawir-gacmeed dhistid adigoo aan wax pointer ah isticmaalin. Isku-xidhka waxaa lagu qoraa millimitir, oo ku jira dhuraha sawir-gacmeedka laftiisa: x waa midig, y waa sare marka aad sawir-gacmeedka eegayso, iyadoo (0, 0) ay tahay asalka (goobta cas ee leh far). Ku dar qaab Fur sawir-gacmeed (eeg Samee sawir-gacmeedkaaga ugu horreeya). Qaybta midig, u dhaqaaq ilaa Ku dar isku-xidhka. Dooro qaabka Ku dar dhexdiisa: Xarriiq, Khadka dhexe, Gaashaan, Goobo ama Bar. Buuxi sanduuqyada: Qaabka Sanduuqyada Xarriiq Laga bilaabo x, y iyo Ilaa x, y Khadka dhexe Laga bilaabo x, y iyo Ilaa x, y Gaashaan Geesta x, y iyo Geeska ka soo horjeeda x, y Goobo Dhexda x, y iyo Radius Bar Ku taal x, y Dooro Ku dar, ama riix Enter sanduuq kasta. Qaabka ayaa soo muuqda, farriinta xaaladdana waxay tusaysa, tusaale ahaan, \"Gaashaan ayaa la daray.\" Sanduuqyadii way madhanaadaan, diyaar u ah kii xiga. Mid kasta oo la daro waa hal tallaabo oo Ctrl+Z ah. Qor laba tiro oo ay kala saaran tahay koom ama meel bannaan, tusaale ahaan: 0, 0, 25 -10 ama 12.5,40. Tirooyinka taban iyo kuwa tobanka ah way fiican yihiin. Radius-ku waa inuu ka weyn yahay eber. Haddii wax aan tiro ahayn la qoro, farriinta xaaladda ayaa tusaysa: 'Isku-xidhka ku qor \"x, y\" iyo radius ka weyn eber.' Tusaale: qolof sahan oo la qoray Fur sawir-gacmeed ku yaal Dusha hore. Ku dar: Gaashaan. Geesta x, y: -50, -30. Geeska ka soo horjeeda x, y: 50, 30. Enter. Ku dar: Goobo. Dhexda x, y: -30, 0. Radius: 5. Enter. Dhexda x, y: 30, 0. Radius: 5. Enter. Dooro Ka bax sawirka, kadibna Soo saar: lakabka 100 × 60 mm oo leh laba god oo 10 mm ah. Geometry la qoray waa la meel dhigay, laakiin lama xidhin Isku-xidhka la qoray wuxuu geometry-ga geeyaa meesha saxda ah, laakiin ma aha xidhiidh. Qaababka waxay ku sii jiraan buluug (aan si buuxda loo qeexin) waxayna dhaqaajin karaan haddii aad jiidto ama aad cabbir kale beddesho: gaashaan la qoray wuxuu leeyahay geeskiisa, xidhiidhka jiifka iyo kan istaagga, sida mid la sawiray, laakiin wax ma xidhayo asalka; xarriiq la qoray ma leh xidhiidh jiif ama istaag, xitaa haddii aad qortay xarriiq sinaba u jirta; dhexda goobta la qoray waa xor. Si sawir-gacmeedku u noqdo mid si buuxda loo qeexay, dabadeed ku dar cabbirro iyo xidhiidho (eeg Si buuxda u qeex sawir-gacmeed). Tusaale ahaan, dooro geesta gaashaanka iyo asalka oo dooro • Isku-meel, ama cabbir dhexda goobaha asalka ka. Pointer la'aan waxaad ilaa halkan gaari kartaa: u dhaqaaq safka dusha ee taariikhda adigoo isticmaalaya Tab iyo furayaasha fallaadha, riix Enter si aad u doorato, riix S si aad u sawirto, ku dar qaababka halkan, kadibna gaar Wax ka beddel ee cabbir kasta oo aad Ka bax sawirka ku dhammayso Tab. Geometry-ga doorashada, iyo sidaas darteed xidhiidhyada ama cabbirrada cusub, wali waxay u baahan tahay riix ama taabasho dhibic dhexdeeda dhismahan. Xaddidaadyo Qowsyada weli lama qori karo. Iska dhig qalabka Arc, ama qor goobo oo isticmaal xidhiidhyo. Ma jiraan isku-xidhyo xeeladda ah (laga bilaabo barta u dambaysa) ama isku-xidhyo xagal iyo dherer ah (dherer iyo xagal) sanduuqan. Geometry-ga la qoray ma isku-dhaho barta jirta. Qor isku-xidhka isla barta jirta, kadibna ku dar xidhiidh • Isku-meel inta u dhexeysa haddii ay tahay inay isku xirnaadaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"extrude-and-cut","scope":"partcraft","title":"Soo saar bosska oo ku jar dhexdiisa","summary":"Ka dhig naqshadda jidh adag oo leh Soo saar, deji qoto heer ah, dhexda naqshadda, ilaa-wejigga ama laba-jihood, taper, ama hal kontuur oo naqshadda, kadibna naqshad wejig oo Goo qodob ama god jaran.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["soo saar","boss","bossyada la soo saaray","goo","godka la goray","qodob","dhammaan oo dhan","heer ah","dhexda naqshadda","rogi","qoto","cut-extrude","boss-extrude","pad","ilaa wejiga","xiga","ilaa geeska","kala fogaansho wejiga","jihada 2","laba jihood","taper","kontuur","gobol","kontuurada la doortay"],"headings":[{"id":"soo-saar-boss","text":"Soo saar boss","level":2},{"id":"deji-qotada-iyo-jihada","text":"Deji qotada iyo jihada","level":3},{"id":"ilaa-wejig-wejigga-xiga-ama-geesta","text":"Ilaa wejig, wejigga xiga ama geesta","level":3},{"id":"laba-jihood-taper-hal-kontuur","text":"Laba jihood, taper, hal kontuur","level":3},{"id":"qodob-godka","text":"Qodob godka","level":2},{"id":"riix-ama-jiid-wejig-oo-dhan","text":"Riix ama jiid wejig oo dhan","level":2},{"id":"profiles-leh-jasiiro","text":"Profiles leh jasiiro","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-tafatir","text":"Dib u tafatir","level":2},{"id":"fariimaha-caadiga-ah","text":"Fariimaha caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu naqshadda profile xidhan ee sawir-gacmeedka si toosan uga soo riixa qorshihiisa si uu u sameeyo agab. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sidaas oo kale sameeyaa laakiin agabka ayuu ka saaraa. Labaduba waa isla feature gudaha; mar dambe midkood ayaad u beddeli kartaa kan kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-saar-boss\"\u003ESoo saar boss\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshad profile xidhan oo xir sawir-gacmeedka (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\"\u003ENaqshadda kowaad ee sawir-gacmeedka\u003C/a\u003E). Wuxuu weli dooran yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJidh 10 mm ah ayaa soo muuqda, &quot;Extrude1&quot; wuxuu ku biiraa taariikhda sawir-gacmeedkiisa oo hoos ku jira, xaaladda xagga hoose waxay tidhi &quot;Extrude1 added. Change its numbers on the right.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir-gacmeedka la isticmaalo:\u003C/strong\u003E sawir-gacmeedka aad markii dambe xirtay, ama kan taariikhda laga doortay. Haddii waxba la dooran, PartCraft wuxuu qaadanayaa sawir-gacmeedka ugu dambeeya ee aan feature uu isticmaalin. Haddii midna jirin: &quot;Make a sketch first: pick a plane, Sketch, draw a closed profile, Exit.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"deji-qotada-iyo-jihada\"\u003EDeji qotada iyo jihada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka midig:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHawlgal\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss (ku dar agab), Cut (ka saar agab), Intersect (hay&#039;ad isku dhafan), New body (weli lama dhisin nooca hadda: wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaad\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeer ah (qoto), Dhexda naqshadda (labada dhinac), Dhammaan oo dhan, Ilaa wejiga ama qorshaha, Ilaa wejiga xiga, Ilaa geeska, Kala fogaansho wejiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeer ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoto (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir kasta oo ka weyn eber (waxaa muuqda Heer ah iyo Dhexda naqshadda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERogi jihada\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ku koraa dhinaca kale ee qorshaha sawir-gacmeedka (lama muujiyo Dhexda naqshadda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELambar qor oo taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: qaybtu dib ayay u dhismaysaa isla markiiba. \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qoto badhkiisa dhinac kasta u dhigaa sawir-gacmeedka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ilaa-wejig-wejigga-xiga-ama-geesta\"\u003EIlaa wejig, wejigga xiga ama geesta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELama dhisin nooca hadda: kala fogaansho kasta oo &quot;ilaa&quot; ah waxay u baahan tahay kernel saxda ah, feature-ku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Extruding up to a face, the next face or a vertex: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel).&quot; Isticmaal Heer ah oo aad cabbirtay. Kernel saxda ah leh dhamaadyadu sidan ayay u shaqeeyaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa wejiga ama qorshaha\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaataa wejig toosan (Dooro, kadibna guji) ama qorshe tixraac ah. Wejig la siman sawir-gacmeedka wuxuu siinayaa qoto saxda ah; wejig janjeersan dhamaadka ayuu ka jaraa dhulka. Haddii wejiga uu ka danbeeyo sawir-gacmeedka: &quot;… Try Reverse direction.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa wejigga xiga\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu joogsadaa wejigga toosan ee ugu horreeya ee jidhka uu soo saaridu la kulanto (wejiyada wareegsan lama taageero halkan, waa lagu sheegaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa geeska\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu joogsadaa heerka geesta (guji meel u dhow dhamaadka geesta) ama feature-ka barta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala fogaansho wejiga\u003C/strong\u003E: sida Ilaa wejiga, laakiin wuxuu joogsadaa \u003Cstrong\u003EKala fogaansho (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ka hor wejiga (lagu cabbiray xagga toosan ee wejiga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"laba-jihood-taper-hal-kontuur\"\u003ELaba jihood, taper, hal kontuur\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJihada labaad\u003C/strong\u003E (Heer ah): wuxuu sidoo kale soo saaraa \u003Cstrong\u003EQotada labaad (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca kale ee sawir-gacmeedka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETaper (°)\u003C/strong\u003E: dhinacyadu way janjeeraan marka ay socdaan, sida draft-ka (xuduudda ka baxsan: dibadda); hal jihood oo keliya. Lama dhisin nooca hadda (wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah): ka tag 0.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGobollada\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro gobollada\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna guji gudaha loop-yada si loo soo saaro; kaliya gobollada la doortay ayaa la isticmaalaa (goob ku jirta laba-jibbaarka: guji gudaha goobta si aad u hesho silinder, ama inta u dhexaysa si aad u hesho saxan leh god). \u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaan\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku celiyaa dhammaan loop-yada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoostooda, \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E waxay liistaa cabbirrada wadaha sawir-gacmeedka, si aad u beddeli karto cabbirrada profile-ka adigoo aan sawir-gacmeedka furin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThrough all waa kaliya goynta.\u003C/strong\u003E Boss oo loo dejiyay Through all wuxuu u fashilmaa fariinta &quot;Through all is for cuts. Use a depth for a boss.&quot; Feature-ka oo laga beddelo Cut oo loo celiyo Boss, Through all wuxuu isbedelaa Heer ah adigoo aan la socon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qodob-godka\"\u003EQodob godka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wejiga toosan ee aad ku jaraysid. Wuu iftiimaa, panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EWejig\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed wejiggan ku yaal\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu samee qaabka qodobka, tusaale ahaan laaf, oo cabbir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bax\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoo\u003C/span\u003E. Wuxuu ku bilaabmaa \u003Cstrong\u003EThrough all\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu ka saaraa agabka qaybta oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQodob ahaan, deji \u003Cstrong\u003EDhamaad\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EHeer ah (qoto)\u003C/strong\u003E oo qor \u003Cstrong\u003EQoto (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoynta waxay gashaa agabka, u jeeda meel ka fog wejigii aad ku sawirtay. Haddii statusbar-ku yidhi &quot;There is nothing to cut on that side of the sketch. Try the other direction.&quot;, calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003ERogi jihada\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir-gacmeed ku yaal sagxadda qodobka wuxuu raacaa sagxadda: beddel qotada qodobka sawir-gacmeeduna wuu u dhaqaaqaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"riix-ama-jiid-wejig-oo-dhan\"\u003ERiix ama jiid wejig oo dhan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi wejig uu uga soo baxo ama uu u dhex galo, ma u baahnid inaad qaabkiisa sawirto. Guji wejiga toosan, kadibna panelka midig:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa soo saar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wejiga soo jiidaa: PartCraft wuxuu ku daraa sawir-gacmeed wejiga saaran oo qaabkiisa leh (godadka wejiga ku jira ayaa godad ah) iyo Extrude 10 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu jar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wejiga dhex riixaa: isla sawir-gacmeedka iyo Cut ilaa badhka jidhka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabadaba hal tallaab ayay yihiin: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa sawir-gacmeedka iyo feature-ka labadaba. Feature-ka cusub waa la doortay, sidaas darteed qor lambar isla markiiba oo taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qotadiisa. Qaabka waa la koobiyeeyay sida xariiq iyo qaansoo go&#039;an: uma raacayo isbeddelada dambe ee wejiga. Haddii qayb qaabka ah aan la koobiyeyn karin (qallooc bilaa xadeed), sawir-gacmeedka ayaa furmaya oo wuxuu leeyahay waxa la koobiyeyay; dhammeee, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bax\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"profiles-leh-jasiiro\"\u003EProfiles leh jasiiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir-gacmeed wuxuu leeyahay loop xidhan oo badan. Loop-yada isku taageera waxay noqdaan boss-yo kala go&#039; (ama goyn); loop gudaha kale waxay noqotaa god dhex mara boss-ka. Tusaale ahaan, laaf leh laba goob gudaha ah wuxuu soo saaraa saxan leh laba god.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u isticmaasho qaar ka mid ah loop-yada oo keliya, dooro iyaga \u003Cstrong\u003EGobollada\u003C/strong\u003E (sare); feature kale wuxuu isticmaali karaa loop-yada kale ee sawir-gacmeedka isku mid ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-tafatir\"\u003EDib u tafatir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji &quot;Extrude1&quot; taariikhda si aad dejinta dib ugu soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba-jeer guji sawir-gacmeedkiisa (kaas oo hoos ku jira) si aad u furto; xirto si aad dib u dhisto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/edit-history\" data-topic=\"partcraft/edit-history\"\u003EBeddel qaybta taariikhdeeda\u003C/a\u003E xagga jooji, dib u celin, dib u habayn iyo tirtirid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fariimaha-caadiga-ah\"\u003EFariimaha caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The sketch has no closed profile to extrude.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeedku ma leeyahay loop xidhan oo xariiqyo adag. Xidh godadka, ama dib u beddel xariiqyada dhismaha adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The profile is open: an end at (x, y) is not joined to anything.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFuro sawir-gacmeedka oo ku xir dhamaadkaas xariiqda xigta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;There is nothing to cut yet.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoynta waxay u baahan tahay jidh la gooyo. Marka hore sameey boss\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Nothing is left of the part after this.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoynta wax walba ayay ka saartay. Hubi cabbirkeeda iyo jihadeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax dheeraad ah: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Soo saar wuxuu naqshadda profile xidhan ee sawir-gacmeedka si toosan uga soo riixa qorshihiisa si uu u sameeyo agab. Goo wuxuu sidaas oo kale sameeyaa laakiin agabka ayuu ka saaraa. Labaduba waa isla feature gudaha; mar dambe midkood ayaad u beddeli kartaa kan kale. Soo saar boss Naqshad profile xidhan oo xir sawir-gacmeedka (eeg Naqshadda kowaad ee sawir-gacmeedka). Wuxuu weli dooran yahay. Dooro Soo saar. Jidh 10 mm ah ayaa soo muuqda, \"Extrude1\" wuxuu ku biiraa taariikhda sawir-gacmeedkiisa oo hoos ku jira, xaaladda xagga hoose waxay tidhi \"Extrude1 added. Change its numbers on the right.\" Sawir-gacmeedka la isticmaalo: sawir-gacmeedka aad markii dambe xirtay, ama kan taariikhda laga doortay. Haddii waxba la dooran, PartCraft wuxuu qaadanayaa sawir-gacmeedka ugu dambeeya ee aan feature uu isticmaalin. Haddii midna jirin: \"Make a sketch first: pick a plane, Sketch, draw a closed profile, Exit.\" Deji qotada iyo jihada Panelka midig: Dejinta Doorashooyinka Caadi Hawlgal Boss (ku dar agab), Cut (ka saar agab), Intersect (hay'ad isku dhafan), New body (weli lama dhisin nooca hadda: wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah) Boss Dhamaad Heer ah (qoto), Dhexda naqshadda (labada dhinac), Dhammaan oo dhan, Ilaa wejiga ama qorshaha, Ilaa wejiga xiga, Ilaa geeska, Kala fogaansho wejiga Heer ah Qoto (mm) Cabbir kasta oo ka weyn eber (waxaa muuqda Heer ah iyo Dhexda naqshadda) 10 Rogi jihada Wuxuu ku koraa dhinaca kale ee qorshaha sawir-gacmeedka (lama muujiyo Dhexda naqshadda) Off Lambar qor oo taabo Enter ama Tab: qaybtu dib ayay u dhismaysaa isla markiiba. Dhexda naqshadda wuxuu qoto badhkiisa dhinac kasta u dhigaa sawir-gacmeedka. Ilaa wejig, wejigga xiga ama geesta Lama dhisin nooca hadda: kala fogaansho kasta oo \"ilaa\" ah waxay u baahan tahay kernel saxda ah, feature-ku wuxuu leeyahay \"Extruding up to a face, the next face or a vertex: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel).\" Isticmaal Heer ah oo aad cabbirtay. Kernel saxda ah leh dhamaadyadu sidan ayay u shaqeeyaan: Ilaa wejiga ama qorshaha: Ilaa wuxuu qaataa wejig toosan (Dooro, kadibna guji) ama qorshe tixraac ah. Wejig la siman sawir-gacmeedka wuxuu siinayaa qoto saxda ah; wejig janjeersan dhamaadka ayuu ka jaraa dhulka. Haddii wejiga uu ka danbeeyo sawir-gacmeedka: \"… Try Reverse direction.\" Ilaa wejigga xiga: wuxuu joogsadaa wejigga toosan ee ugu horreeya ee jidhka uu soo saaridu la kulanto (wejiyada wareegsan lama taageero halkan, waa lagu sheegaa). Ilaa geeska: wuxuu joogsadaa heerka geesta (guji meel u dhow dhamaadka geesta) ama feature-ka barta. Kala fogaansho wejiga: sida Ilaa wejiga, laakiin wuxuu joogsadaa Kala fogaansho (mm) ka hor wejiga (lagu cabbiray xagga toosan ee wejiga). Laba jihood, taper, hal kontuur Jihada labaad (Heer ah): wuxuu sidoo kale soo saaraa Qotada labaad (mm) dhinaca kale ee sawir-gacmeedka. Taper (°): dhinacyadu way janjeeraan marka ay socdaan, sida draft-ka (xuduudda ka baxsan: dibadda); hal jihood oo keliya. Lama dhisin nooca hadda (wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah): ka tag 0. Gobollada: Dooro gobollada, kadibna guji gudaha loop-yada si loo soo saaro; kaliya gobollada la doortay ayaa la isticmaalaa (goob ku jirta laba-jibbaarka: guji gudaha goobta si aad u hesho silinder, ama inta u dhexaysa si aad u hesho saxan leh god). Dhammaan wuxuu ku celiyaa dhammaan loop-yada. Hoostooda, Cabbirrada naqshadda waxay liistaa cabbirrada wadaha sawir-gacmeedka, si aad u beddeli karto cabbirrada profile-ka adigoo aan sawir-gacmeedka furin. Through all waa kaliya goynta. Boss oo loo dejiyay Through all wuxuu u fashilmaa fariinta \"Through all is for cuts. Use a depth for a boss.\" Feature-ka oo laga beddelo Cut oo loo celiyo Boss, Through all wuxuu isbedelaa Heer ah adigoo aan la socon. Qodob godka Guji wejiga toosan ee aad ku jaraysid. Wuu iftiimaa, panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay Wejig. Dooro Sawir-gacmeed wejiggan ku yaal (ama Naqshad qalabka sare). Ku samee qaabka qodobka, tusaale ahaan laaf, oo cabbir. Dooro Ka bax. Dooro Goo. Wuxuu ku bilaabmaa Through all: wuxuu ka saaraa agabka qaybta oo dhan. Qodob ahaan, deji Dhamaad Heer ah (qoto) oo qor Qoto (mm). Goynta waxay gashaa agabka, u jeeda meel ka fog wejigii aad ku sawirtay. Haddii statusbar-ku yidhi \"There is nothing to cut on that side of the sketch. Try the other direction.\", calaamadee Rogi jihada. Sawir-gacmeed ku yaal sagxadda qodobka wuxuu raacaa sagxadda: beddel qotada qodobka sawir-gacmeeduna wuu u dhaqaaqaa. Riix ama jiid wejig oo dhan Si wejig uu uga soo baxo ama uu u dhex galo, ma u baahnid inaad qaabkiisa sawirto. Guji wejiga toosan, kadibna panelka midig: Ka soo saar wuxuu wejiga soo jiidaa: PartCraft wuxuu ku daraa sawir-gacmeed wejiga saaran oo qaabkiisa leh (godadka wejiga ku jira ayaa godad ah) iyo Extrude 10 mm. Ku jar wuxuu wejiga dhex riixaa: isla sawir-gacmeedka iyo Cut ilaa badhka jidhka. Labadaba hal tallaab ayay yihiin: Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka saaraa sawir-gacmeedka iyo feature-ka labadaba. Feature-ka cusub waa la doortay, sidaas darteed qor lambar isla markiiba oo taabo Enter qotadiisa. Qaabka waa la koobiyeeyay sida xariiq iyo qaansoo go'an: uma raacayo isbeddelada dambe ee wejiga. Haddii qayb qaabka ah aan la koobiyeyn karin (qallooc bilaa xadeed), sawir-gacmeedka ayaa furmaya oo wuxuu leeyahay waxa la koobiyeyay; dhammeee, kadibna dooro Ka bax iyo Soo saar ama Goo. Profiles leh jasiiro Sawir-gacmeed wuxuu leeyahay loop xidhan oo badan. Loop-yada isku taageera waxay noqdaan boss-yo kala go' (ama goyn); loop gudaha kale waxay noqotaa god dhex mara boss-ka. Tusaale ahaan, laaf leh laba goob gudaha ah wuxuu soo saaraa saxan leh laba god. Si aad u isticmaasho qaar ka mid ah loop-yada oo keliya, dooro iyaga Gobollada (sare); feature kale wuxuu isticmaali karaa loop-yada kale ee sawir-gacmeedka isku mid ah. Dib u tafatir Guji \"Extrude1\" taariikhda si aad dejinta dib ugu soo celiso. Laba-jeer guji sawir-gacmeedkiisa (kaas oo hoos ku jira) si aad u furto; xirto si aad dib u dhisto. Eeg Beddel qaybta taariikhdeeda xagga jooji, dib u celin, dib u habayn iyo tirtirid. Fariimaha caadiga ah Fariinta Waxa la sameeyo \"The sketch has no closed profile to extrude.\" Sawir-gacmeedku ma leeyahay loop xidhan oo xariiqyo adag. Xidh godadka, ama dib u beddel xariiqyada dhismaha adigoo isticmaalaya Q \"The profile is open: an end at (x, y) is not joined to anything.\" Furo sawir-gacmeedka oo ku xir dhamaadkaas xariiqda xigta \"There is nothing to cut yet.\" Goynta waxay u baahan tahay jidh la gooyo. Marka hore sameey boss \"Nothing is left of the part after this.\" Goynta wax walba ayay ka saartay. Hubi cabbirkeeda iyo jihadeeda Wax dheeraad ah: Dhibaatooyinka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"revolve","scope":"partcraft","title":"Wareeji qayb wareegsan","summary":"Naqshadee nus profile ah oo ku taal khadka dhexe, ku wareeji qayb wareegsan, dooro dhidibka iyo xagasha, oo isticmaal jar wareeg si loo sameeyo kab.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["wareeg","revolved boss","jar wareeg","qayb wareegsan","lathe","shaft","dhidib","khadka dhexe","kab","xagal","rev cut"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-wareeji-shaft-ka-tallaabo-tallaabo","text":"Ku wareeji shaft-ka tallaabo-tallaabo","level":2},{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":2},{"id":"jar-kab","text":"Jar kab","level":2},{"id":"qayb-wareegsan-oo-isku-dhisyada-ku-jirta","text":"Qayb wareegsan oo isku-dhisyada ku jirta","level":2},{"id":"curves-dhab-ah-iyo-facets","text":"Curves dhab ah iyo facets","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERevolve\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku wareejiyaa profile dhidib ku wareegaya, sida qayb laga sameeyo lathe: shafts, pulleys, flanges, knobs. Revolved cut (menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda Features) wuxuu ku wareejiyaa profile si uu alaab uga saaro, kabaha iyo godadka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-wareeji-shaft-ka-tallaabo-tallaabo\"\u003EKu wareeji shaft-ka tallaabo-tallaabo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadee \u003Cstrong\u003EFront plane\u003C/strong\u003E dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo doorso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECenterline\u003C/span\u003E. Bilow bilowga, ka dibna guji barta si toos ah u midig, tusaale ahaan 100 mm. Tani waa dhidibka. Waa jajab: geesta dhismaha ma ahan qayb profile-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo doorso Line. Sawir \u003Cstrong\u003Enus\u003C/strong\u003E profile-ka khadka dhexe kor ku jira sida hal wareeg xidhan: bilow khadka dhexe, u kac sare, ka dibna u soo noqo khadka dhexe, ka dibna ugu soo noqo bilowga. Dhamaadyadiisu waa inay kulmaan: wareegga waa inuu xidhan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECabbir radiuska (dhererka kor ka khadka dhexe) iyo dhererrada. Dhererka 10 kor ka khadka dhexe wuxuu sameeyaa diameter 20.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERevolve\u003C/span\u003E. Shaft-ku wuu muuqdaa, wareeg buuxa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EProfile-ka waa inuu ku sii jiraa hal dhinac oo dhidibka ah. Haddii uu jaro: &quot;The profile crosses the axis. Keep it on one side of the centerline.&quot; Geesta profile-ka waxay ku jiri kartaa dhidibka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameyso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiimaha caadiga\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOperation\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss (ku dar alaab), Cut (ka saar alaab), Intersect (ilaali isku-dhaca), ama New body\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERevolve\u003C/span\u003E ah, Cut \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERevolved cut\u003C/span\u003E ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAngle (°)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIntee wareeg la rogayo, laga bilaabo wax ka badan 0 ilaa 360\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E360\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAxis\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka dhexe ee kowaad, ama khad kasta ama khadka dhexe ee naqshadda, oo liistaha &quot;Centerline 1 (l1)&quot; ama &quot;Line 3 (l3)&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka dhexe ee kowaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXagal qayb ah wuxuu sameeyaa qayb laba-jibbaaran, oo laga rogo dusha naqshadda hal jihood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii naqshadda aan khadka dhexe lahayn oo aad ka tagto \u003Cstrong\u003EAxis\u003C/strong\u003E khadka dhexe ee kowaad: &quot;Draw a centerline (a construction line) in the sketch to revolve about.&quot; Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa khad adag oo profile-ka ah inuu noqdo dhidibka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jar-kab\"\u003EJar kab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka shaft-ka la dhiso, fur naqshad cusub \u003Cstrong\u003EFront plane\u003C/strong\u003E dusha (isla dusha ee naqshadda shaft-ka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee khadka dhexe ee isla dhidibka: bilow bilowga, ka dibna u hayso toosan si uu H u helo, ama ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd by coordinates\u003C/strong\u003E (tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E0, 0\u003C/code\u003E ilaa \u003Ccode\u003E100, 0\u003C/code\u003E). Naqshad cusub kuma xidhmi karto khadadka naqshad kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee rectangle xidhan oo yar oo ku dul fariisanaya geesta shaft-ka meesha kabka uu tagayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExit\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERevolved cut\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qayb-wareegsan-oo-isku-dhisyada-ku-jirta\"\u003EQayb wareegsan oo isku-dhisyada ku jirta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWareeg wuxuu leeyahay dhidib ay sifooyinka kale iyo isku-dhisyadu isticmaali karaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enuqulka \u003Cstrong\u003ECircular\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa dhidibka wareegga ugu dambeeya sida caadiga ah (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/patterns-mirror\" data-topic=\"partcraft/patterns-mirror\"\u003ESifooyinka nuqulka iyo muraayadda\u003C/a\u003E);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eisku-dhis dhexdiisa, isku-xidhka u dhexeeya wejiyada ay sameeyeen wareegyada wuxuu bilaabmaa isku-xidh \u003Cstrong\u003Erevolute\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ECentre on\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu bixiyaa &quot;Axis of Revolve1&quot; (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003ESamee isku-dhis\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"curves-dhab-ah-iyo-facets\"\u003ECurves dhab ah iyo facets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu wareeg ku dhisaa mesh kernel (chip-ka status bar-ka wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Mesh kernel&quot;): qaabab wareegsan waa facets siman, 64 wareeg kasta sida caadiga ah, mugagana way ka yar yihiin qiimaha dhabta ah wax yar (qiyaastii 0.16 % 64 ku). Muuqaalka, STL, 3MF iyo dhoofinta STEP waxay ka samaysan yihiin facets-kaas: deji \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E (guji meel bannaan, ka dibna panelka midig) Fine (128) ama Very fine (256) si ay u noqdaan kuwo siman. Silinderyo, kone iyo torus dhab ah u baahan yihiin kernel saxda ah: weli lama dhisin nooca kan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Revolve wuxuu ku wareejiyaa profile dhidib ku wareegaya, sida qayb laga sameeyo lathe: shafts, pulleys, flanges, knobs. Revolved cut (menu-ga More ee kooxda Features) wuxuu ku wareejiyaa profile si uu alaab uga saaro, kabaha iyo godadka. Ku wareeji shaft-ka tallaabo-tallaabo Naqshadee Front plane dusha. Riix N oo doorso Centerline. Bilow bilowga, ka dibna guji barta si toos ah u midig, tusaale ahaan 100 mm. Tani waa dhidibka. Waa jajab: geesta dhismaha ma ahan qayb profile-ka. Riix L oo doorso Line. Sawir nus profile-ka khadka dhexe kor ku jira sida hal wareeg xidhan: bilow khadka dhexe, u kac sare, ka dibna u soo noqo khadka dhexe, ka dibna ugu soo noqo bilowga. Dhamaadyadiisu waa inay kulmaan: wareegga waa inuu xidhan yahay. Cabbir radiuska (dhererka kor ka khadka dhexe) iyo dhererrada. Dhererka 10 kor ka khadka dhexe wuxuu sameeyaa diameter 20. Dooro Exit. Dooro Revolve. Shaft-ku wuu muuqdaa, wareeg buuxa. Profile-ka waa inuu ku sii jiraa hal dhinac oo dhidibka ah. Haddii uu jaro: \"The profile crosses the axis. Keep it on one side of the centerline.\" Geesta profile-ka waxay ku jiri kartaa dhidibka. Dejinta Dejin Waxa ay sameyso Qiimaha caadiga Operation Boss (ku dar alaab), Cut (ka saar alaab), Intersect (ilaali isku-dhaca), ama New body Boss Revolve ah, Cut More › Revolved cut ah Angle (°) Intee wareeg la rogayo, laga bilaabo wax ka badan 0 ilaa 360 360 Axis Khadka dhexe ee kowaad, ama khad kasta ama khadka dhexe ee naqshadda, oo liistaha \"Centerline 1 (l1)\" ama \"Line 3 (l3)\" Khadka dhexe ee kowaad Xagal qayb ah wuxuu sameeyaa qayb laba-jibbaaran, oo laga rogo dusha naqshadda hal jihood. Haddii naqshadda aan khadka dhexe lahayn oo aad ka tagto Axis khadka dhexe ee kowaad: \"Draw a centerline (a construction line) in the sketch to revolve about.\" Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa khad adag oo profile-ka ah inuu noqdo dhidibka. Jar kab Marka shaft-ka la dhiso, fur naqshad cusub Front plane dusha (isla dusha ee naqshadda shaft-ka). Samee khadka dhexe ee isla dhidibka: bilow bilowga, ka dibna u hayso toosan si uu H u helo, ama ku qor Add by coordinates (tusaale ahaan 0, 0 ilaa 100, 0). Naqshad cusub kuma xidhmi karto khadadka naqshad kale. Samee rectangle xidhan oo yar oo ku dul fariisanaya geesta shaft-ka meesha kabka uu tagayo. Dooro Exit, ka dibna More › Revolved cut. Qayb wareegsan oo isku-dhisyada ku jirta Wareeg wuxuu leeyahay dhidib ay sifooyinka kale iyo isku-dhisyadu isticmaali karaan: nuqulka Circular wuxuu isticmaalaa dhidibka wareegga ugu dambeeya sida caadiga ah (eeg Sifooyinka nuqulka iyo muraayadda); isku-dhis dhexdiisa, isku-xidhka u dhexeeya wejiyada ay sameeyeen wareegyada wuxuu bilaabmaa isku-xidh revolute, Centre on wuxuu bixiyaa \"Axis of Revolve1\" (eeg Samee isku-dhis). Curves dhab ah iyo facets PartCraft wuxuu wareeg ku dhisaa mesh kernel (chip-ka status bar-ka wuxuu leeyahay \"Mesh kernel\"): qaabab wareegsan waa facets siman, 64 wareeg kasta sida caadiga ah, mugagana way ka yar yihiin qiimaha dhabta ah wax yar (qiyaastii 0.16 % 64 ku). Muuqaalka, STL, 3MF iyo dhoofinta STEP waxay ka samaysan yihiin facets-kaas: deji Curves (guji meel bannaan, ka dibna panelka midig) Fine (128) ama Very fine (256) si ay u noqdaan kuwo siman. Silinderyo, kone iyo torus dhab ah u baahan yihiin kernel saxda ah: weli lama dhisin nooca kan. Eeg Mesh kernel.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"nest-offcuts","scope":"partcraft","title":"Kaydi oo dib u isticmaal hadhaagyada","summary":"Ka dib ku rarista, wixii ka haray saxan kasta waxa uu noqdaa hadhaag lambar leh liiska kaydka; ku rarista xigta waxay marka hore isticmaashaa hadhaagyada, ka dibna saxanka buuxa.","section":"tasks","order":52,"keywords":["ku rarista","hadhaag","hadhaagyo","kaydka","wixii ka haray","saxan","xaashi","dib u isticmaal","agabka","dhumucda","CSV"],"headings":[{"id":"dib-u-isticmaal","text":"Dib u isticmaal","level":2},{"id":"waxa-loo-tirinayo-hadhaag","text":"Waxa loo tirinayo hadhaag","level":2},{"id":"naqshadda-ku-jirta","text":"Naqshadda ku jirta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka aad qayb ku rarto saxanka birta, wixii ka haray saxan kasta oo la isticmaali karo (aan ahayn jajabyo yar) waxa lagu kaydin karaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ehadhaag\u003C/strong\u003E: qaab geesood oo lambar leh (R-0001, R-0002 …) oo leh agabka, dhumucda, cabbirkiisa iyo shaqada uu ka yimid. Liiska waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka, waxana lagu kaydin karaa sidii CSV.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-isticmaal\"\u003EDib u isticmaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeli \u003Cstrong\u003Eagabka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Edhumucda\u003C/strong\u003E, ka daa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarka hore isticmaal hadhaagyada\u003C/span\u003E oo ku rari. Hadhaagyada agab iyo dhumuc isku mid ah ayaa marka hore la isku dayaa, ugu yar marka hore; qaybaha ku habboon waxay ku dhigmaan, gudaha geesaha hadhaagga laftiisa oo ka fog geeskiisa; wixii aan ku habboonayn waxay ku dhigmaan saxan cusub. Warbixinta shaqada waxay sheegaysaa hadhaagyada la isticmaalay iyo wixii ka haray. Marka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi hadhaagyada sida hadhaag\u003C/span\u003E la furo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar shaqadan kaydka\u003C/span\u003E ka dib waxay ku qorta liiska kaydka: hadhaag la isticmaalay waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003ELa isticmaalay\u003C/strong\u003E (oo shaqadii ku jirta) oo mar kale looma soo bandhigo; wixii ka hadhay waxa noqda hadhaag cusub oo xusaya asalkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-loo-tirinayo-hadhaag\"\u003EWaxa loo tirinayo hadhaag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWixii ka haray waxa lagu cabbiraa masaafada aad dejisay (qayb midna ma dhowaato jarista ka dhow masaafadaas). Xariiqyada ka ballaaran 1/20 saxanka iyo jajabyada ka yar 2 % dhammaantiis waa qashin; beddel labada xad haddii dukaankaagu hayo qaybo yar. Godadka gudaha qaybaha waa kuwa qaybaha laftooda, lamana kaydiyo. Rooll ma laha hadhaag.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshadda-ku-jirta\"\u003ENaqshadda ku jirta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDXF-ka ku rarista wuxuu sawiraa geesaha hadhaag kasta lakabka REMNANTS, lambarkiisana dhexdiisa, si qaybahaas loo calaamayn karo marka la jarayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeli lama dhisin: jihada jilka hadhaagga, xaashi bar-code ama sumad, hadhaagyada roolka, kaydka la wadaago mashaariicda.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Marka aad qayb ku rarto saxanka birta, wixii ka haray saxan kasta oo la isticmaali karo (aan ahayn jajabyo yar) waxa lagu kaydin karaa hadhaag: qaab geesood oo lambar leh (R-0001, R-0002 …) oo leh agabka, dhumucda, cabbirkiisa iyo shaqada uu ka yimid. Liiska waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka, waxana lagu kaydin karaa sidii CSV. Dib u isticmaal Geli agabka iyo dhumucda, ka daa Marka hore isticmaal hadhaagyada oo ku rari. Hadhaagyada agab iyo dhumuc isku mid ah ayaa marka hore la isku dayaa, ugu yar marka hore; qaybaha ku habboon waxay ku dhigmaan, gudaha geesaha hadhaagga laftiisa oo ka fog geeskiisa; wixii aan ku habboonayn waxay ku dhigmaan saxan cusub. Warbixinta shaqada waxay sheegaysaa hadhaagyada la isticmaalay iyo wixii ka haray. Marka Kaydi hadhaagyada sida hadhaag la furo, Ku dar shaqadan kaydka ka dib waxay ku qorta liiska kaydka: hadhaag la isticmaalay waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa La isticmaalay (oo shaqadii ku jirta) oo mar kale looma soo bandhigo; wixii ka hadhay waxa noqda hadhaag cusub oo xusaya asalkeeda. Waxa loo tirinayo hadhaag Wixii ka haray waxa lagu cabbiraa masaafada aad dejisay (qayb midna ma dhowaato jarista ka dhow masaafadaas). Xariiqyada ka ballaaran 1/20 saxanka iyo jajabyada ka yar 2 % dhammaantiis waa qashin; beddel labada xad haddii dukaankaagu hayo qaybo yar. Godadka gudaha qaybaha waa kuwa qaybaha laftooda, lamana kaydiyo. Rooll ma laha hadhaag. Naqshadda ku jirta DXF-ka ku rarista wuxuu sawiraa geesaha hadhaag kasta lakabka REMNANTS, lambarkiisana dhexdiisa, si qaybahaas loo calaamayn karo marka la jarayo. Weli lama dhisin: jihada jilka hadhaagga, xaashi bar-code ama sumad, hadhaagyada roolka, kaydka la wadaago mashaariicda.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"check-this-frame","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hubi qaabkan","summary":"Qaybaha birta ah ee weldment (skid, taageero, frame oo tuubooyin iyo qaybo ah), dhig qalabka cagahiisa iyo taageerada sagxadda, oo eeg inta qayb kasta iyo weld kasta la isticmaalay ee AISC 360-16 ama EN 1993 hoostooda. Caawin ilaa injineer uu dib u eego.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["frame","weldment","skid","pump skid","structural member","weld","welds","check","AISC 360","EN 1993","utilisation","utilization","support","equipment","load","hollow section","HSS","RHS","CHS","engineer"],"headings":[{"id":"samee","text":"Samee","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-hesho","text":"Waxa aad hesho","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-hubiyo","text":"Waxa la hubiyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck this frame\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaybaha birta toosan ee weldment-ka qaadaa, frame ka dhisaa iyaga, wuxuu xallaa miisaanka birta iyo qalabka aad ku dhigtay, wuxuuna tijaabiyaa qayb kasta iyo weld kasta oo qaybaha isku kulmaan. Hal orod, hal miis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecaawin ilaa injineer uu dib u eego\u003C/strong\u003E. Ma aha taariikh, saxnaan ma aha, tijaabo lagu guuleystay ma aha naqshad. Wuxuu adeegsadaa xariiqyada dhexe ee qaybaha sida loo sawiray, wuxuu u qaadaa weld-ka wareega qayb kasta oo dhan, wuxuuna qaybta fillet-ka ka qaadaa darbiga qaybta (ilaa 8 mm) haddii aanad dejin, wuxuuna ma hubinayo boolal, qaybo bir ah, saldhigyo bir ah, anchors, bearing, block shear, fatigue ama qaadista.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee\"\u003ESamee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybaha sawir \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStructural member\u003C/span\u003E (qaybaha waxa laga helaa miiska qaybaha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck this frame\u003C/span\u003E. Sheeg meesha frame-ku taagan yahay (\u003Cstrong\u003Etaageero\u003C/strong\u003E cagaha kasta: pinned, fixed ama roller; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinned supports at the feet\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa mid qayb hoose kasta oo ugu hooseeya) iyo waxa dushiisa saaran (\u003Cstrong\u003Eqalab\u003C/strong\u003E: miisaan, bartiisa culeyska, meelaha lagu boolaysto, iyo cadaadis fogaan ah oo ikhtiyaari ah).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro koodka: \u003Cstrong\u003EASCE 7 + AISC 360-16\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EEN 1990 + EN 1993\u003C/strong\u003E. Dejiso darajada birta iyo, AISC ahaan, xoogga birta weld-ka (482.6 MPa waa E70).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the report as CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa miis kasta, iyo sadarka aan la dib u eegin marka hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFrame-ka waxa lagu akhriyaa millimitir, iyada oo dhererka toosan ee qaybta uu sare u yahay. Meelaha taageerada iyo qalabka waxa lagu qoraa x y z isla frame-kaas, z waa dhererka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta qayb-dhamaadka ee ku dhacda dhexda qayb kale waxay kaa jartaa qaybta halkaas, sidaas oo kale cagta ama barta boolka ee ku taal xariiqa qayb. Miisaanka waxa lagu wadaagaa barta boolka sida jidh adag; xudunta culeyska ee ka baxsan cagaha, ama xoogga kor u qaadista ee cag, waa la sheegaa, marna lama qariyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-hesho\"\u003EWaxa aad hesho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShayga ugu badan ee la isticmaalay iyo in wax fashil yihiin. Shayada hubin karin (qayb aan ku jirin miiska, ama birta aan qiimo lahayn koodkeeda) waa la tiriyaa oo magac baa la siiyaa, weligiin laguma tiriyo guul.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal safka qayb kasta iyo weld group kasta: intee la isticmaalay, hubinta xukunta iyo qodobka, iyo isku-darka culeyska ee xukumay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiisaska isku mid ah ee warbixinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-hubiyo\"\u003EWaxa la hubiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETuubooyin xoog leh (RHS, SHS, CHS, pipe) iyo qaybaha I ee tension, compression, bending, shear iyo isku-xidhkooda; fillet iyo full-penetration welds iyada oo la adeegsanayo habka vector-ka ee elastic. Darbiyada isku-dhafan ee bending keliya ayaa hoose kaliya ee tuubooyinka xoogga leh; darbiyada dhuuban waa la sheegaa in aan la hubin. Qaar ka mid ah joogtaysyada waxa laga qoray heshiiskii, weli lama barbar dhigin buug la daabacay; warbixintu waxay liistaa isha kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/structural-members\" data-topic=\"partcraft/structural-members\"\u003EFrames from steel sections\u003C/a\u003E si aad u sawirto qaybaha iyo liiska goynta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Check this frame wuxuu qaybaha birta toosan ee weldment-ka qaadaa, frame ka dhisaa iyaga, wuxuu xallaa miisaanka birta iyo qalabka aad ku dhigtay, wuxuuna tijaabiyaa qayb kasta iyo weld kasta oo qaybaha isku kulmaan. Hal orod, hal miis. Waa caawin ilaa injineer uu dib u eego. Ma aha taariikh, saxnaan ma aha, tijaabo lagu guuleystay ma aha naqshad. Wuxuu adeegsadaa xariiqyada dhexe ee qaybaha sida loo sawiray, wuxuu u qaadaa weld-ka wareega qayb kasta oo dhan, wuxuuna qaybta fillet-ka ka qaadaa darbiga qaybta (ilaa 8 mm) haddii aanad dejin, wuxuuna ma hubinayo boolal, qaybo bir ah, saldhigyo bir ah, anchors, bearing, block shear, fatigue ama qaadista. Samee Qaybaha sawir Structural member (qaybaha waxa laga helaa miiska qaybaha). Fur Views › Check this frame. Sheeg meesha frame-ku taagan yahay (taageero cagaha kasta: pinned, fixed ama roller; Pinned supports at the feet wuxuu dhigaa mid qayb hoose kasta oo ugu hooseeya) iyo waxa dushiisa saaran (qalab: miisaan, bartiisa culeyska, meelaha lagu boolaysto, iyo cadaadis fogaan ah oo ikhtiyaari ah). Dooro koodka: ASCE 7 + AISC 360-16 ama EN 1990 + EN 1993. Dejiso darajada birta iyo, AISC ahaan, xoogga birta weld-ka (482.6 MPa waa E70). Riix Check. Save the report as CSV wuxuu qoraa miis kasta, iyo sadarka aan la dib u eegin marka hore. Frame-ka waxa lagu akhriyaa millimitir, iyada oo dhererka toosan ee qaybta uu sare u yahay. Meelaha taageerada iyo qalabka waxa lagu qoraa x y z isla frame-kaas, z waa dhererka. Qaybta qayb-dhamaadka ee ku dhacda dhexda qayb kale waxay kaa jartaa qaybta halkaas, sidaas oo kale cagta ama barta boolka ee ku taal xariiqa qayb. Miisaanka waxa lagu wadaagaa barta boolka sida jidh adag; xudunta culeyska ee ka baxsan cagaha, ama xoogga kor u qaadista ee cag, waa la sheegaa, marna lama qariyo. Waxa aad hesho Shayga ugu badan ee la isticmaalay iyo in wax fashil yihiin. Shayada hubin karin (qayb aan ku jirin miiska, ama birta aan qiimo lahayn koodkeeda) waa la tiriyaa oo magac baa la siiyaa, weligiin laguma tiriyo guul. Hal safka qayb kasta iyo weld group kasta: intee la isticmaalay, hubinta xukunta iyo qodobka, iyo isku-darka culeyska ee xukumay. Miisaska isku mid ah ee warbixinta. Waxa la hubiyo Tuubooyin xoog leh (RHS, SHS, CHS, pipe) iyo qaybaha I ee tension, compression, bending, shear iyo isku-xidhkooda; fillet iyo full-penetration welds iyada oo la adeegsanayo habka vector-ka ee elastic. Darbiyada isku-dhafan ee bending keliya ayaa hoose kaliya ee tuubooyinka xoogga leh; darbiyada dhuuban waa la sheegaa in aan la hubin. Qaar ka mid ah joogtaysyada waxa laga qoray heshiiskii, weli lama barbar dhigin buug la daabacay; warbixintu waxay liistaa isha kasta. Eeg Frames from steel sections si aad u sawirto qaybaha iyo liiska goynta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"use-with-ai-assistants","scope":"partcraft","title":"Isticmaal PartCraft oo leh caawiye AI","summary":"Ogolow caawiyahaaga AI ama script-ka uu ka shaqeeyo qaybta furan: akhri astaamaha, halbeegyada iyo culeyska, beddel halbeeg oo dib u dhis, orod script, dhoofi oo kaydi. Waa damaan ilaa aad furto.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["ai","caawiye","wakiil","mcp","model context protocol","script","otomatig","halbeegyada","sifooyinka culeyska","stl","step","3mf","ogolaansho","ka jooji","waxqabadka","galalka"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontid","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid","level":2},{"id":"shid","text":"Shid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-caawiyuhu-weydiin-karo","text":"Waxa caawiyuhu weydiin karo","level":2},{"id":"adigu-ayaad-maamulaysaa","text":"Adigu ayaad maamulaysaa","level":2},{"id":"iyada-oo-aan-la-furin-partcraft","text":"Iyada oo aan la furin PartCraft","level":2},{"id":"hadday-wax-shaqayn-waayaan","text":"Hadday wax shaqayn waayaan","level":2},{"id":"eeg-sidoo-kale","text":"Eeg sidoo kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESida loo ogolaado caawiye AI (ama script aad qortay) inuu eego qaybta aad furtay, beddelo halbeegyadeeda, orod script oo dhoofiyo, iyo sida aad go&#039;aamiso waxa ay taaban karto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft \u003Cstrong\u003Ema lahan AI gaar ah\u003C/strong\u003E mana diro wax meel kasta. Caawiyaha waxaad keentaa adigu: barnaamij kasta oo ku hadla Model Context Protocol (MCP). PartCraft waxa kaliya oo uu siiyaa qalabyo, adigu baad dooratay kuwa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shid\"\u003EShid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E (giraanta bar-ka app-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo tag tabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaaliyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E, calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EOggolow caawiyayaasha AI iyo scripts-ka inay isticmaalaan PartCraft\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa la damiyay ilaa aad samayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa ay samayn karto. \u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa markii hore la calaamadiyay; kuwa kale calaamadi kaliya markaad u baahan tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi ay u dhoofiyo oo u kaydiso gal, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar gal…\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EGalalka ay isticmaali karto\u003C/strong\u003E, oo dooro galka wada-hadalka Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawiyayaashu waxay ku xiriiraan \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E kombiyuutarkaaga: Studio wuxuu muujinayaa cinwaanka iyo tokenka lagu dhejiyo caawiyaha. Tab-ka browser-ka ma furi karo xiriir caawiye.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-caawiyuhu-weydiin-karo\"\u003EWaxa caawiyuhu weydiin karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQalab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOgolaansho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_describe\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeatures_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAstaamaha iyagoo ku taxan dalbaga ah, oo leh waxa dhisay iyo waxa fashilmay, agabka, mugga iyo cabbirka jidhka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eparams_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalbeegyada iyo lambar kasta oo isle&#039;eg wadi karo, oo leh qiyamkooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emass_properties\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMugga, dusha, dhexe-culeyska, inertia-ga ku saabsan; culeyska haddii qaybtu leedahay agab\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eparam_set\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDejiya halbeeg ama lambarka astaamaha oo dib u dhis. Hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Escript_run\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOrodsii script CraftScript, Lua ama Python sida workspace-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScript\u003C/span\u003E u sameeyo: la xidhay, faylal iyo shabakad la&#039;aan. Qaybtu ma beddelmayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL, 3MF, STEP ama OpenUSD (.usdz, .usda, .usdc), sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E u qorto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elink_push\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECusboonaysii moodel laga xiriiriyay barnaamij kale (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/live-3dm-link\" data-topic=\"partcraft/live-3dm-link\"\u003EIlaali moodel .3dm oo nool\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elink_status\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu sheegaa in moodelka xiriiran weli jiro iyo markii ugu dambeysay ee cusboonaaday\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E gaarka PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eillustrate_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuug laga helo workspace-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIllustrate\u003C/span\u003E oo ah PDF ama SVG line art ee muuqaalkiisa, ama faylka 3D ee wada-falka, ama tilmaamihiisa oo ah PDF ama bog web, sida menu-yada workspace-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilmaamaha\u003C/span\u003E u qoraan (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate\"\u003EBuugaagta\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhismahan wuxuu isticmaalaa kernel-ka mesh: mugga waxaa laga helaa xagagga (wax yar ka yar jidh gobol run ah), STEP waxaa loo qoraa fasedyo, oo leh xagag halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd dusha saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"adigu-ayaad-maamulaysaa\"\u003EAdigu ayaad maamulaysaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod\u003C/strong\u003E, lagu calaamadiyay caawiyaha, tusaale &quot;Caawiye: deji l = 45&quot;. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaad ogaan kartaa marka uu xiriiray.\u003C/strong\u003E Badhanka ku jira bar-ka app-ka ayaa magacaabaya caawiyaha intii uu xiriiran yahay. Riix si aad u aragto waxa uu samayn karo, ama si aad \u003Cstrong\u003Euga jootid xiriirka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxqabadka.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaaliyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxqabadka\u003C/span\u003E waxa ku taxan wac kasta oo la sameeyay; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi diiwaanka\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu keydiyaa nuqul.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGalalka.\u003C/strong\u003E Wuxuu akhrinayaa oo qorayaa faylal kaliya galalka aad ku darto; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu galka dib u qaadaa isla markiiba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"iyada-oo-aan-la-furin-partcraft\"\u003EIyada oo aan la furin PartCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EServer-ka faylalka CadCraft ee caawiyayaasha (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp\u003C/code\u003E) iyo sadarka amarka \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E waxay furaan qaybaha \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E iyagoo isticmaalaya koodka PartCraft laftiisa iyo kernel-ka mesh-ka, iyada oo aan daaqad la furin: isla qalabyada akhrinta, dejinta halbeegyada, script-yada CraftScript, dhoofinta (OpenUSD sidoo kale) iyo kaydinta. \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert bracket.partcraft.json bracket.stl\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu dhisaa qayb oo wuxuu qoraa sadarka amarka. Buugaagta (\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-manual.json\u003C/code\u003E) waxa laga dhoofin karaa halkaas sidoo kale: \u003Ccode\u003Eillustrate_export\u003C/code\u003E, ama \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert linkage.partcraft-manual.json linkage.pdf\u003C/code\u003E (ku dar \u003Ccode\u003E--instructions\u003C/code\u003E tilmaamaha).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hadday-wax-shaqayn-waayaan\"\u003EHadday wax shaqayn waayaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;needs the edit permission&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaaliyayaasha\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna mar kale weydii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;driven by the equation&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E lambarkaasi wuxuu raacaa halbeeg; weydii caawiyaha inuu halkii deeyo halbeegga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddelkiisu waa qalad:\u003C/strong\u003E riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-sidoo-kale\"\u003EEeg sidoo kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ECuntooyinka caawiyayaasha AI\u003C/a\u003E: tusaalooyin la sameeyay, mid kastaa leh qalabyada uu wicayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid Sida loo ogolaado caawiye AI (ama script aad qortay) inuu eego qaybta aad furtay, beddelo halbeegyadeeda, orod script oo dhoofiyo, iyo sida aad go'aamiso waxa ay taaban karto. PartCraft ma lahan AI gaar ah mana diro wax meel kasta. Caawiyaha waxaad keentaa adigu: barnaamij kasta oo ku hadla Model Context Protocol (MCP). PartCraft waxa kaliya oo uu siiyaa qalabyo, adigu baad dooratay kuwa. Shid Fur Dejinta (giraanta bar-ka app-ka, ama Ctrl+,) oo tag tabka PartCraft. Hoosta Kaaliyayaasha, calaamadi Oggolow caawiyayaasha AI iyo scripts-ka inay isticmaalaan PartCraft. Waa la damiyay ilaa aad samayso. Dooro waxa ay samayn karto. Akhri ayaa markii hore la calaamadiyay; kuwa kale calaamadi kaliya markaad u baahan tahay. Si ay u dhoofiyo oo u kaydiso gal, dooro Ku dar gal… hoosta Galalka ay isticmaali karto, oo dooro galka wada-hadalka Studio. Caawiyayaashu waxay ku xiriiraan CadCraft Studio kombiyuutarkaaga: Studio wuxuu muujinayaa cinwaanka iyo tokenka lagu dhejiyo caawiyaha. Tab-ka browser-ka ma furi karo xiriir caawiye. Waxa caawiyuhu weydiin karo Qalab Ogolaansho Waxa uu sameeyo part_describe, features_list Akhri Astaamaha iyagoo ku taxan dalbaga ah, oo leh waxa dhisay iyo waxa fashilmay, agabka, mugga iyo cabbirka jidhka params_list Akhri Halbeegyada iyo lambar kasta oo isle'eg wadi karo, oo leh qiyamkooda mass_properties Akhri Mugga, dusha, dhexe-culeyska, inertia-ga ku saabsan; culeyska haddii qaybtu leedahay agab param_set Wax ka beddel Dejiya halbeeg ama lambarka astaamaha oo dib u dhis. Hal tallaabo oo aad ka noqon karto script_run Wax ka beddel Orodsii script CraftScript, Lua ama Python sida workspace-ka Script u sameeyo: la xidhay, faylal iyo shabakad la'aan. Qaybtu ma beddelmayso part_export Dhoofi STL, 3MF, STEP ama OpenUSD (.usdz, .usda, .usdc), sida Fayl › Dhoofi u qorto link_push Wax ka beddel Cusboonaysii moodel laga xiriiriyay barnaamij kale (eeg Ilaali moodel .3dm oo nool) link_status Akhri Wuxuu sheegaa in moodelka xiriiran weli jiro iyo markii ugu dambeysay ee cusboonaaday part_save Kaydi Kaydi gaarka PartCraft illustrate_export Dhoofi Buug laga helo workspace-ka Illustrate oo ah PDF ama SVG line art ee muuqaalkiisa, ama faylka 3D ee wada-falka, ama tilmaamihiisa oo ah PDF ama bog web, sida menu-yada workspace-ka Dhoofi iyo Tilmaamaha u qoraan (Buugaagta) Dhismahan wuxuu isticmaalaa kernel-ka mesh: mugga waxaa laga helaa xagagga (wax yar ka yar jidh gobol run ah), STEP waxaa loo qoraa fasedyo, oo leh xagag halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd dusha saxda ah. Adigu ayaad maamulaysaa Isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod, lagu calaamadiyay caawiyaha, tusaale \"Caawiye: deji l = 45\". Riix Ctrl+Z si aad u soo celiso. Waad ogaan kartaa marka uu xiriiray. Badhanka ku jira bar-ka app-ka ayaa magacaabaya caawiyaha intii uu xiriiran yahay. Riix si aad u aragto waxa uu samayn karo, ama si aad uga jootid xiriirka. Waxqabadka. Dejinta › PartCraft › Kaaliyayaasha › Waxqabadka waxa ku taxan wac kasta oo la sameeyay; Kaydi diiwaanka wuxuu keydiyaa nuqul. Galalka. Wuxuu akhrinayaa oo qorayaa faylal kaliya galalka aad ku darto; Ka saar wuxuu galka dib u qaadaa isla markiiba. Iyada oo aan la furin PartCraft Server-ka faylalka CadCraft ee caawiyayaasha (npx @getcadcraft/mcp) iyo sadarka amarka cadcraft waxay furaan qaybaha .partcraft.json iyagoo isticmaalaya koodka PartCraft laftiisa iyo kernel-ka mesh-ka, iyada oo aan daaqad la furin: isla qalabyada akhrinta, dejinta halbeegyada, script-yada CraftScript, dhoofinta (OpenUSD sidoo kale) iyo kaydinta. cadcraft convert bracket.partcraft.json bracket.stl wuxuu dhisaa qayb oo wuxuu qoraa sadarka amarka. Buugaagta (.partcraft-manual.json) waxa laga dhoofin karaa halkaas sidoo kale: illustrate_export, ama cadcraft convert linkage.partcraft-manual.json linkage.pdf (ku dar --instructions tilmaamaha). Hadday wax shaqayn waayaan \"needs the edit permission\": calaamadi Wax ka beddel hoosta Kaaliyayaasha, kadibna mar kale weydii. \"driven by the equation\": lambarkaasi wuxuu raacaa halbeeg; weydii caawiyaha inuu halkii deeyo halbeegga. Isbeddelkiisu waa qalad: riix Ctrl+Z. Eeg sidoo kale Cuntooyinka caawiyayaasha AI: tusaalooyin la sameeyay, mid kastaa leh qalabyada uu wicayo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"holes","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ka qodo godad iyo counterbore-yo barta sketch-ka","summary":"Dhig barooyin sketch-ka dusha, samee godad fudud, counterbore, countersink ama tapped (ISO metric) barta kasta, deji dhexroorka iyo qoto dheeraanta, kana saxaa godad jihada khaldan lagu qodo.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["god","hole wizard","qodid","thread la moodelay","daabacaadda 3D","counterbore","cbore","countersink","csink","god la tapped","thread","tap drill","dherer thread metric","M6","through all","blind hole","god boolka","barooyin","dhexda godka"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-qodid-godad-dusha","text":"Ku qodid godad dusha","level":2},{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":2},{"id":"godka-boolta-ee-counterbore-leh","text":"Godka boolta ee counterbore leh","level":2},{"id":"goob-wareeg-bolt-circle","text":"Goob wareeg (bolt circle)","level":2},{"id":"marka-godadku-jihada-khaldan-u-qodaan","text":"Marka godadku jihada khaldan u qodaan","level":2},{"id":"godadka-isku-dhiska","text":"Godadka isku-dhiska","level":2},{"id":"godad-countersunk-ah","text":"Godad countersunk ah","level":2},{"id":"godad-la-tapped","text":"Godad la tapped","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHole\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qodaa hal god barta kasta oo sketch-ka ah oo go&#039;an. Barta go&#039;an waa mid lagu sameeyay qalabka Point, ma aha dhamaadka xariiq ama bartamaha goobo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-qodid-godad-dusha\"\u003EKu qodid godad dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhagsii dusha siman ee laga qodayo, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch on this face\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo dhagsii meesha god kasta ku jiri doonto. Cabbir barooyinka geesaha ama asalka haddii booska ay muhiim tahay (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003ESketch si buuxa u go&#039;ay\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHole\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGodadku waxay gudbaan qaybta, 6 mm ballac ah. Panelka midig wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EHoles\u003C/strong\u003E: inta la sameeyay, &quot;hal god barta sketch kasta&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal god, si dhakhso ah:\u003C/strong\u003E dhagsii dusha siman meesha godka tagaya oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHole here\u003C/span\u003E panelka midig. PartCraft wuxuu ku daraa sketch dusha ah oo leh hal barta meesha aad dhagsatay, iyo Hole qaybta oo dhan gudbaysa, hal tallaabo. Isla markiiba tiro qor oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E dhexroorkiisa. Si aad si sax ah ugu dhigto, fur sketch-ka cusub oo cabbir barta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESketch-ka la isticmaalo:\u003C/strong\u003E sketch-ka aad hadda xirtay ama kii la doortay; haddii kale, sketch-ka ugu dambeeya ee aan la isticmaalin oo leh barooyin go&#039;an. Haddii midna ma jirto: &quot;Marka hore samee sketch barooyin ku yaal meesha godadka ka tagaya (Sketch on a face, kadibna Point).&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi ahaan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESimple, Counterbore, Countersink, Tapped (ISO metric)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESimple\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiameter (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexroorka godka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThrough all\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadi: gudub qaybta oo dhan. Ka saar si aad u sameyso god indha-la&#039;aan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDepth (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la muujiyaa marka Through all la saaro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECounterbore ⌀\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la muujiyaa Counterbore: dhexroorka qodida ballaadhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECounterbore depth\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la muujiyaa Counterbore\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EReverse direction\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu qodaa dhinaca kale ee diyaarada sketch-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDamaysan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGodadku waxay gudaan maaddada, toos ugu sketch-ka. Qoto dheeraanta godka indha-la&#039;aan waxaa laga cabbiraa diyaarada sketch-ka; hoosteedu waa siman tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"godka-boolta-ee-counterbore-leh\"\u003EGodka boolta ee counterbore leh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee godadka sida kor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E ka ah \u003Cstrong\u003ECounterbore\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EDiameter (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E ah \u003Ccode\u003E6.6\u003C/code\u003E (meel bannaan oo boolta M6 ah), \u003Cstrong\u003ECounterbore ⌀\u003C/strong\u003E ah \u003Ccode\u003E11\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ECounterbore depth\u003C/strong\u003E ah \u003Ccode\u003E6.5\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECounterbore-ku waa inuu ka ballaadhan yahay godka (&quot;The counterbore must be wider than the hole.&quot;), iyo godka indha-la&#039;aan, waa inuu ka hooseeyaa (&quot;The counterbore must be shallower than the hole.&quot;).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goob-wareeg-bolt-circle\"\u003EGoob wareeg (bolt circle)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGodad si siman loogu kala fogeeyay bartamaha hal bartamaha, \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal\u003C/strong\u003E god samee oo qaab u samee: dooro feature-ka Hole, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircular\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/patterns-mirror\" data-topic=\"partcraft/patterns-mirror\"\u003EPattern and mirror features\u003C/a\u003E). Qaabku wuu raacaa marka cabbirka godka la beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-godadku-jihada-khaldan-u-qodaan\"\u003EMarka godadku jihada khaldan u qodaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;There is nothing to drill on that side of the sketch. Try reversing the direction.&quot; Dhinaca sketch-ka waxba lagu qodi karo. Isku day inaad jihada rogto. Sketch-ku wuxuu ku yaal dhinaca kale ee alaabta. Calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EReverse direction\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Put sketch points where the holes go (Point tool), then make the hole.&quot; Sketch-ka ma leh barooyin go&#039;an. Dhamaadka xariiqyada iyo bartamaha goobaha ma tirinayaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;There is nothing to drill yet.&quot; God wuxuu u baahan yahay jidh adag. Marka hore samee boss.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"godadka-isku-dhiska\"\u003EGodadka isku-dhiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGodad kastaa wuxuu leeyahay tiir. Isku-dhiskiisa, \u003Cstrong\u003ECentre on\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu joint ku dhigi karaa tiirka godka, oo lagu magacaabo &quot;Hole1, hole 2&quot;, si pin ama boolta qayb ay ula safanto. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003ESamee isku-dhis\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"godad-countersunk-ah\"\u003EGodad countersunk ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E ka ah \u003Cstrong\u003ECountersink\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ECountersink ⌀\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ECountersink angle\u003C/strong\u003E: 90° (boolaha madaxa-fidsan ee ISO metric) ama 82° (boolaha inch-ka). Dhexroorka countersink-ka ka qaado xogta soo saaraha boolta (wax yar oo ka weyn dhexroorka madaxa boolta). Wejiga koonka waxaa lagu magacaabaa &quot;countersink&quot; panelada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"godad-la-tapped\"\u003EGodad la tapped\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E ka ah \u003Cstrong\u003ETapped (ISO metric)\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EThread\u003C/strong\u003E, M2 ilaa M24 coarse. Godka waxaa lagu qodaa cabbirka tap drill ee shaxda hoose (dhexroorka magaca ka dhimaya pitch-ka, ilaa taxanaha qodista, sida ISO 2306 u sheegto thread 6H); sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EDiameter (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E looma isticmaalo. Godka indha-la&#039;aan, \u003Cstrong\u003EThread depth (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu deynayaa inta thread-ku gaadho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EThread\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM2\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM2.5\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM3\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM4\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM5\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM6\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM8\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM10\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM12\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM14\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM16\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM18\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM20\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM22\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EM24\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPitch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.4\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.45\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.7\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.8\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.25\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.75\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETap drill ⌀\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.6\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.05\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3.3\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4.2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6.8\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10.2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E14\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E15.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E19.5\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E21\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThread-ku marka hore waa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecosmetic\u003C/strong\u003E: moodelku wuxuu leeyahay godka la qodey, muuqaalku wuxuu thread-ka dhexroorkiisa weyn ku sawiraa wareegyo jeexjeexan, sheetka sawirku wuxuu callout-ka ku qoraa sida fiiro, sida &quot;4× M8×1.25 - 6H, thread through&quot;. STEP wuxuu dhoofiyaa godka la qodey oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EModelled\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u gooydo thread helical dhab ah godka, daabacaadda 3D ahaan. \u003Cstrong\u003EClearance (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa mid ka weyn meel walba, si boolta daabacan u qanaco: 0.1 ilaa 0.2 mm ayaa ku habboon printer-yada badankood. Callout-ka markaas wuxuu ku dhammaadaa &quot;(modelled)&quot;. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/threads\" data-topic=\"partcraft/threads\"\u003EThreads on shafts and bores, drawn or modelled\u003C/a\u003E, kaas oo sidoo kale thread-yada shaftyada saarayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGodad counterdrilled ah, thread-yada inch-ka iyo thread-yada tuubada weli lama dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Hole wuxuu qodaa hal god barta kasta oo sketch-ka ah oo go'an. Barta go'an waa mid lagu sameeyay qalabka Point, ma aha dhamaadka xariiq ama bartamaha goobo. Ku qodid godad dusha Dhagsii dusha siman ee laga qodayo, kadibna dooro Sketch on this face. Riix P oo dhagsii meesha god kasta ku jiri doonto. Cabbir barooyinka geesaha ama asalka haddii booska ay muhiim tahay (eeg Sketch si buuxa u go'ay). Dooro Exit. Dooro Hole. Godadku waxay gudbaan qaybta, 6 mm ballac ah. Panelka midig wuxuu muujinayaa Holes: inta la sameeyay, \"hal god barta sketch kasta\". Hal god, si dhakhso ah: dhagsii dusha siman meesha godka tagaya oo dooro Hole here panelka midig. PartCraft wuxuu ku daraa sketch dusha ah oo leh hal barta meesha aad dhagsatay, iyo Hole qaybta oo dhan gudbaysa, hal tallaabo. Isla markiiba tiro qor oo riix Enter dhexroorkiisa. Si aad si sax ah ugu dhigto, fur sketch-ka cusub oo cabbir barta. Sketch-ka la isticmaalo: sketch-ka aad hadda xirtay ama kii la doortay; haddii kale, sketch-ka ugu dambeeya ee aan la isticmaalin oo leh barooyin go'an. Haddii midna ma jirto: \"Marka hore samee sketch barooyin ku yaal meesha godadka ka tagaya (Sketch on a face, kadibna Point).\" Dejinta Dejinta Doorashooyin Caadi ahaan Type Simple, Counterbore, Countersink, Tapped (ISO metric) Simple Diameter (mm) Dhexroorka godka 6 Through all Calaamadi: gudub qaybta oo dhan. Ka saar si aad u sameyso god indha-la'aan Calaamadi Depth (mm) Waa la muujiyaa marka Through all la saaro 10 Counterbore ⌀ Waa la muujiyaa Counterbore: dhexroorka qodida ballaadhan 11 Counterbore depth Waa la muujiyaa Counterbore 6 Reverse direction Wuxuu qodaa dhinaca kale ee diyaarada sketch-ka Damaysan Godadku waxay gudaan maaddada, toos ugu sketch-ka. Qoto dheeraanta godka indha-la'aan waxaa laga cabbiraa diyaarada sketch-ka; hoosteedu waa siman tahay. Godka boolta ee counterbore leh Samee godadka sida kor. Deji Type ka ah Counterbore. Deji Diameter (mm) ah 6.6 (meel bannaan oo boolta M6 ah), Counterbore ⌀ ah 11 iyo Counterbore depth ah 6.5. Counterbore-ku waa inuu ka ballaadhan yahay godka (\"The counterbore must be wider than the hole.\"), iyo godka indha-la'aan, waa inuu ka hooseeyaa (\"The counterbore must be shallower than the hole.\"). Goob wareeg (bolt circle) Godad si siman loogu kala fogeeyay bartamaha hal bartamaha, hal god samee oo qaab u samee: dooro feature-ka Hole, kadibna dooro Circular (eeg Pattern and mirror features). Qaabku wuu raacaa marka cabbirka godka la beddelo. Marka godadku jihada khaldan u qodaan \"There is nothing to drill on that side of the sketch. Try reversing the direction.\" Dhinaca sketch-ka waxba lagu qodi karo. Isku day inaad jihada rogto. Sketch-ku wuxuu ku yaal dhinaca kale ee alaabta. Calaamadi Reverse direction. \"Put sketch points where the holes go (Point tool), then make the hole.\" Sketch-ka ma leh barooyin go'an. Dhamaadka xariiqyada iyo bartamaha goobaha ma tirinayaan. \"There is nothing to drill yet.\" God wuxuu u baahan yahay jidh adag. Marka hore samee boss. Godadka isku-dhiska Godad kastaa wuxuu leeyahay tiir. Isku-dhiskiisa, Centre on wuxuu joint ku dhigi karaa tiirka godka, oo lagu magacaabo \"Hole1, hole 2\", si pin ama boolta qayb ay ula safanto. Eeg Samee isku-dhis. Godad countersunk ah Deji Type ka ah Countersink, kadibna Countersink ⌀ (dusha) iyo Countersink angle: 90° (boolaha madaxa-fidsan ee ISO metric) ama 82° (boolaha inch-ka). Dhexroorka countersink-ka ka qaado xogta soo saaraha boolta (wax yar oo ka weyn dhexroorka madaxa boolta). Wejiga koonka waxaa lagu magacaabaa \"countersink\" panelada. Godad la tapped Deji Type ka ah Tapped (ISO metric) oo dooro Thread, M2 ilaa M24 coarse. Godka waxaa lagu qodaa cabbirka tap drill ee shaxda hoose (dhexroorka magaca ka dhimaya pitch-ka, ilaa taxanaha qodista, sida ISO 2306 u sheegto thread 6H); sanduuqa Diameter (mm) looma isticmaalo. Godka indha-la'aan, Thread depth (mm) wuxuu deynayaa inta thread-ku gaadho. Thread M2 M2.5 M3 M4 M5 M6 M8 M10 M12 M14 M16 M18 M20 M22 M24 Pitch 0.4 0.45 0.5 0.7 0.8 1 1.25 1.5 1.75 2 2 2.5 2.5 2.5 3 Tap drill ⌀ 1.6 2.05 2.5 3.3 4.2 5 6.8 8.5 10.2 12 14 15.5 17.5 19.5 21 Thread-ku marka hore waa cosmetic: moodelku wuxuu leeyahay godka la qodey, muuqaalku wuxuu thread-ka dhexroorkiisa weyn ku sawiraa wareegyo jeexjeexan, sheetka sawirku wuxuu callout-ka ku qoraa sida fiiro, sida \"4× M8×1.25 - 6H, thread through\". STEP wuxuu dhoofiyaa godka la qodey oo keliya. Calaamadi Modelled si aad u gooydo thread helical dhab ah godka, daabacaadda 3D ahaan. Clearance (mm) wuxuu ka dhigaa mid ka weyn meel walba, si boolta daabacan u qanaco: 0.1 ilaa 0.2 mm ayaa ku habboon printer-yada badankood. Callout-ka markaas wuxuu ku dhammaadaa \"(modelled)\". Eeg Threads on shafts and bores, drawn or modelled, kaas oo sidoo kale thread-yada shaftyada saarayo. Godad counterdrilled ah, thread-yada inch-ka iyo thread-yada tuubada weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"laser-cutting","scope":"partcraft","title":"U dir sawir laser-ka","summary":"Dooro waxa layer kasta samaynayo (gooy, score, qor, buuxi, sawir), hubi dhaqdhaqaaqa madaxa, kaydi laser-mode G-code oo GRBL ah, ama u dir browser-ka kadib markaad qaabayso shaqada.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["laser","jarista laser-ka","qorista laser-ka","GRBL","G-code","qorid","buuxin","dither","qorida sawirka","score","gooy","Web Serial","Linux","qaabee shaqada","awoodda","xawaaraha","mararka"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-waxa-layer-kasta-samaynayo","text":"Dooro waxa layer kasta samaynayo","level":2},{"id":"hor-eeg-kadibna-kaydi","text":"Hor eeg, kadibna kaydi","level":2},{"id":"u-dir-browser-ka","text":"U dir browser-ka","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPanel-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaser\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu layers-ka sawirka u beddelaa barnaamij laser ah oo socda GRBL (inta badan kontoroolada laser-ka ee hobby-ga iyo shirkadaha yaryar ee diode iyo CO2). PartCraft gudahiisa, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaser program…\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd outlines from a DXF…\u003C/span\u003E: geesaha iyo godadka ayaa soo gala layer-ka CUT. Qaybaha sheet metal-ka ee flat patterns-ka (oo leh khadadka foorarka ee layer-ka BEND) waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah, taas oo nooca hadda ma leh. Dejinta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta ama assembly-ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETijaabi dejin kasta xaashi qashin ah marka hore, ilaali indhahaaga oo daboolo, dhig daboolka xidh meel kasta oo uu leeyahay, mana tagto laser socda oo keli ah. Tirooyinka layer kasta ku bilaabato waa meelo ku meel gaar ah, ma aha talo ee alaabta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-waxa-layer-kasta-samaynayo\"\u003EDooro waxa layer kasta samaynayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayer kasta oo sawirka ka mid ah waa hal safaf. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDoes\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u dejiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003ECut\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EScore\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEngrave lines\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EFill shapes\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EEngrave picture\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ENot sent\u003C/strong\u003E, oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPower %\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed mm/min\u003C/span\u003E iyo tiro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPasses\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFill\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu gubaa gudaha qaabab xidhan oo xariiqyo ah, oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine spacing\u003C/span\u003E ka fogaaday, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E ku jira, labada jihoo ama mid keliya, oo leh overscan si madaxu u dhaqso marka laser-ku shido; cross-hatch wuxuu ku daraa mar labaad oo 90°. Qaabka leh god wuxuu ku sii furan yahay godka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEngrave picture\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sawirka u beddelaa dhibcooyin (Floyd–Steinberg, Atkinson, ordered, ama madow iyo cad oo heer xad ah), ama, \u003Cem\u003EGrey levels\u003C/em\u003E la doortay, awood isbedeleysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDalabka: sawirrada iyo buuxinta marka hore, kadibna qorida xariiqyada, kadibna scores, kadibna gooyada, si qaybta la gooyay aanay u dhaqdhaqmin markay la qoraysanayo. Layer kasta gudahiisa jidadku waxay socdaan \u003Cstrong\u003Einside-first\u003C/strong\u003E (god hore qaybta ku jirta), kadibna kan ugu dhow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hor-eeg-kadibna-kaydi\"\u003EHor eeg, kadibna kaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHor eeg wuxuu muujinayaa waxa madaxu sameeyo: xariiqyada gubaya midab, dhaqdhaqaaqyada degdegga ah midab cawl, iyo sanduuq cagaar ah oo ku wareegsan wax kasta oo gubaya. Hoosteeda waxaa ah cabbirka, dherer gubista iyo qiyaas waqti (aan xisaabin xawaarihii la kordhiyay; mashiin dhab ah waa ka dheer). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave G-code…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa GRBL laser-mode G-code: \u003Ccode\u003E$32=1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EM4\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003EM3\u003C/code\u003E) oo leh qiimayaasha S, dhaqdhaqaaqyada \u003Ccode\u003EG0\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EG1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EM5\u003C/code\u003E dhamaadka. X0 Y0 waa geeska hoose ee bidix ee shaqada, haddii aadan dooran asalka sawirka: dejinta zero-ga mashiinkaaga halkaas. G-code-ku wuxuu raacaa laser mode-ka GRBL ee dukumeentiga; weli lama isticmaalin laser dhab ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-dir-browser-ka\"\u003EU dir browser-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome iyo Edge, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kugu weydiinayaa inaad dooratid port-ka USB ee laser-ka. Waxba ma xidhmo ama u dirmo ilaa aad badhan riixdo. Marka hore riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrame the job\u003C/span\u003E: madaxu wuxuu raadiyaa sanduuqa shaqada iyadoo laser-ku \u003Cstrong\u003Edamaysan\u003C/strong\u003E yahay (ama awood hooseeya oo aad u dejisay tilmaame), si aad u aragto meesha uu gubi doono. Markaas kaliya ayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend job\u003C/span\u003E furmaa, wuuna dib u xirmaa haddii aad wax badashid. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPause\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu madaxa hakiyaa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop\u003C/span\u003E wuu hakiyaa, dib u dejiyaa kontoroolka (laser-ku wuu damaa) wuuna diraa \u003Ccode\u003EM5\u003C/code\u003E. Meelaha Web Serial aanu jirin (Firefox, Safari, iyo CadCraft Studio, kaas oo web view-kiisu weli lahayn), kaydi G-code-ka oo u dir barnaamijka laser-kaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaababka kontoroolada kale (Ruida, Marlin lasers, faylasha iibiyaha), tabs iyo lead-ins, kerf offset, maktabadaha alaabta, rotary iyo Z axes, isku-hagaajinta kamarada.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Panel-ka Laser wuxuu layers-ka sawirka u beddelaa barnaamij laser ah oo socda GRBL (inta badan kontoroolada laser-ka ee hobby-ga iyo shirkadaha yaryar ee diode iyo CO2). PartCraft gudahiisa, dooro Export › Laser program…, kadibna Add outlines from a DXF…: geesaha iyo godadka ayaa soo gala layer-ka CUT. Qaybaha sheet metal-ka ee flat patterns-ka (oo leh khadadka foorarka ee layer-ka BEND) waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah, taas oo nooca hadda ma leh. Dejinta waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta ama assembly-ga. Tijaabi dejin kasta xaashi qashin ah marka hore, ilaali indhahaaga oo daboolo, dhig daboolka xidh meel kasta oo uu leeyahay, mana tagto laser socda oo keli ah. Tirooyinka layer kasta ku bilaabato waa meelo ku meel gaar ah, ma aha talo ee alaabta. Dooro waxa layer kasta samaynayo Layer kasta oo sawirka ka mid ah waa hal safaf. Does wuxuu u dejiyaa Cut, Score, Engrave lines, Fill shapes, Engrave picture ama Not sent, oo leh Power %, Speed mm/min iyo tiro Passes. Fill wuxuu gubaa gudaha qaabab xidhan oo xariiqyo ah, oo Line spacing ka fogaaday, Angle ku jira, labada jihoo ama mid keliya, oo leh overscan si madaxu u dhaqso marka laser-ku shido; cross-hatch wuxuu ku daraa mar labaad oo 90°. Qaabka leh god wuxuu ku sii furan yahay godka. Engrave picture wuxuu sawirka u beddelaa dhibcooyin (Floyd–Steinberg, Atkinson, ordered, ama madow iyo cad oo heer xad ah), ama, Grey levels la doortay, awood isbedeleysa. Dalabka: sawirrada iyo buuxinta marka hore, kadibna qorida xariiqyada, kadibna scores, kadibna gooyada, si qaybta la gooyay aanay u dhaqdhaqmin markay la qoraysanayo. Layer kasta gudahiisa jidadku waxay socdaan inside-first (god hore qaybta ku jirta), kadibna kan ugu dhow. Hor eeg, kadibna kaydi Hor eeg wuxuu muujinayaa waxa madaxu sameeyo: xariiqyada gubaya midab, dhaqdhaqaaqyada degdegga ah midab cawl, iyo sanduuq cagaar ah oo ku wareegsan wax kasta oo gubaya. Hoosteeda waxaa ah cabbirka, dherer gubista iyo qiyaas waqti (aan xisaabin xawaarihii la kordhiyay; mashiin dhab ah waa ka dheer). Save G-code… wuxuu qoraa GRBL laser-mode G-code: $32=1, M4 (ama M3) oo leh qiimayaasha S, dhaqdhaqaaqyada G0 iyo G1, M5 dhamaadka. X0 Y0 waa geeska hoose ee bidix ee shaqada, haddii aadan dooran asalka sawirka: dejinta zero-ga mashiinkaaga halkaas. G-code-ku wuxuu raacaa laser mode-ka GRBL ee dukumeentiga; weli lama isticmaalin laser dhab ah. U dir browser-ka Chrome iyo Edge, Connect… wuxuu kugu weydiinayaa inaad dooratid port-ka USB ee laser-ka. Waxba ma xidhmo ama u dirmo ilaa aad badhan riixdo. Marka hore riix Frame the job: madaxu wuxuu raadiyaa sanduuqa shaqada iyadoo laser-ku damaysan yahay (ama awood hooseeya oo aad u dejisay tilmaame), si aad u aragto meesha uu gubi doono. Markaas kaliya ayaa Send job furmaa, wuuna dib u xirmaa haddii aad wax badashid. Pause wuxuu madaxa hakiyaa, Stop wuu hakiyaa, dib u dejiyaa kontoroolka (laser-ku wuu damaa) wuuna diraa M5. Meelaha Web Serial aanu jirin (Firefox, Safari, iyo CadCraft Studio, kaas oo web view-kiisu weli lahayn), kaydi G-code-ka oo u dir barnaamijka laser-kaaga. Weli lama dhisin Qaababka kontoroolada kale (Ruida, Marlin lasers, faylasha iibiyaha), tabs iyo lead-ins, kerf offset, maktabadaha alaabta, rotary iyo Z axes, isku-hagaajinta kamarada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"threads","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dhuumooyinka shaft-ka iyo godka, la sawiray ama la moodelay","summary":"Dhig dhuumo metric ISO ama trapezoidal wejig wareeg kasta, shaft ama bore. Ka dhig cosmetic sawirrada, ama moodel dhuumada helical ee runta ah daabacaadda 3D, oo leh cidhiidhi si qaybaha la daabacay ay ugu habboon yihiin.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["dhuumo","dhuumooyin","dhuumo moodel","helical","helix","qalab-qaboojin","boolt","qallooc","shaft","bore","dhuumo dibadda","dhuumo gudaha","dhuumo cosmetic","dhuumo metric","trapezoidal","acme","lead screw","Tr16x4","M10","daabacaad 3D","daabac","cidhiidhi","ku habboon","gacanta bidix","godka dhuumaysan"],"headings":[{"id":"dhuumee-shaft-ama-bore","text":"Dhuumee shaft ama bore","level":2},{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":2},{"id":"dhuumooyinka-moodelka-ah-ee-daabacaadda-3d","text":"Dhuumooyinka moodelka ah ee daabacaadda 3D","level":2},{"id":"godka-dhuumaysan","text":"Godka dhuumaysan","level":2},{"id":"marka-dhuumadu-aan-dhisin","text":"Marka dhuumadu aan dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThread\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhigaa dhuumo wejiyada wareega: dibadda shaft-ka (dhuumo dibadda) ama gudaha bore-ka (dhuumo gudaha). PartCraft wuxuu ka ogaadaa wejiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhuumadu wuxuu ku bilaabmaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecosmetic\u003C/strong\u003E: wejigu wuu sii yahay, aragtidu waxay dhuumada ku sawirtaa goobo dashed ah, sawir-xaashiyada ayaa xusa, sida &quot;M10×1.5 - 6g, dhuumo 20 dheer&quot;. Calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EModelled\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u gooyso dhuumada helical ee runta ah qaybta, daabacaadda 3D ama moodel u baahan inuu si sax ah u muuqdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhuumee-shaft-ama-bore\"\u003EDhuumee shaft ama bore\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee shaft ama bore cabbirka dhuumada: shaft Ø10 ah boolt M10 ah, ama bore Ø8.5 (tap drill) ah nut M10 ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wejiga wareega, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThread\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii wejig wareeg aan la dooranin, PartCraft wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa inaad wejiyada gujiso, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka midig, hubi \u003Cstrong\u003ESize\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EFit to the face\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu cabbirka ku doortaa isaga: shaft-ka, cabbirka diameter-keedu weyn yahay sida shaft-ka; bore-ka, cabbirka diameter-keeda yar uu ku habboon yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhuumadu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhamaadka furan ee wejiga, meesha qaybtu aan ku sii socon jiifka tooska ah: dhamaadka xor ah ee shaft-ka, afka bore-ka. \u003Cstrong\u003EStart at the other end\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa beddelaya taas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIkhtiyaarada\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadiga\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EForm\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO metric (60°), M1.6 ilaa M64 coarse; trapezoidal (Tr, 30°), Tr8×1.5 ilaa Tr60×9\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO metric\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESize\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFit to the face, ama hal cabbir oo liiska ka mid ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFit to the face\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe whole face\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar si aad \u003Cstrong\u003ELength (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E u bixiso, oo laga bilaabo bilowga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa calaamadiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStart at the other end\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhuumadu wuxuu ka socdaa dhamaadka kale ee wejiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDamiyey\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHand\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGacanta midig ama gacanta bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGacanta midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModelled\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGooy dhuumada helical ee runta ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDamiyey\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EClearance (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuu muuqdaa markii Modelled la calaamadiyo: intee in le&#039;eg ayey dhuumada shaft-ku yar tahay, iyo intee in le&#039;eg ayey dhuumada bore-ku u weyn tahay, dhinac kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0.1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbir aan ku habboonayn wejiga ayaa weli la dhisaa, la gooyey wejiga, panelkuna wuu sheegayaa, sida &quot;Shaft Ø12 mm maaha Ø10 mm ee M10&quot;. Dhowr wejood ayaa wadaagi kara hal feature Thread; \u003Cstrong\u003EFit to the face\u003C/strong\u003E ku jirta, mid kasta cabbir u gaar ah ayuu helaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhuumooyinka-moodelka-ah-ee-daabacaadda-3d\"\u003EDhuumooyinka moodelka ah ee daabacaadda 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhuumo moodel ah wuxuu raacaa profile-ka aasaasiga ah ee caadiga ah: ISO 68-1 metric (dhabbo iyo xidid toosan, dhinacyada 60°), ISO 2901 trapezoidal (dhinacyada 30°). \u003Cstrong\u003EClearance\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa profile-ka oo dhan gudaha (shaft) ama dibadda (bore) si qaybaha la daabacay ay isku qabsadaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0.1 ilaa 0.2 mm\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku habboon yahay printer-yada badan. Marka hore daabac tijaabo bolt iyo nut ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E0\u003C/strong\u003E waa profile-ka caadiga ah, qaybaha la shiinay ama la hubinayo fit-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBolt iyo nut oo leh cidhiidhi isku mid ah weligood ma taabtaan dhinacyadooda: farqiga u dhexeeya waa laba jeer cidhiidhiga, dhinac kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPitch-yada yar si xun ayey u daabacmaan: M3 iyo ka yar, ama pitch ka hooseeya 0.5 mm, waa ku dhow waxa nozzle 0.4 mm ku dhajin karo. Qaybaha waaweyn moodel, yaryarna isticmaal heat-set insert ama godka dhuumaysan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhuumo moodel ah waa qayb ka mid ah solid-ka: STL, 3MF iyo STEP exports way qaadaan, Measure wuu cabbiraa. Waxay qaybta ka dhigaysaa mid miisaan badan oo dib loo dhiso: dhuumo M10 oo 20 dheer wuxuu qiyaastii yahay 150,000 triangles.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"godka-dhuumaysan\"\u003EGodka dhuumaysan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGod \u003Cstrong\u003ETapped (ISO metric)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EModelled\u003C/strong\u003E switch oo isku mid ah, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EClearance\u003C/strong\u003E isku mid ah. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/holes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/holes\"\u003EGodaha iyo counterbores-ka ee dhibcaha sawir-gacmeedka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-dhuumadu-aan-dhisin\"\u003EMarka dhuumadu aan dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Dhuumo wuxuu ku yimaadaa wejiga wareega (silinda): shaft ama bore.&quot; Wejiga la doortay waa toos ama si kale ayuu u qalloocan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Cabbir ISO ah oo aan ku habboonayn wejiga wareega ee Ø0.6 mm: dooro cabbir.&quot; Fit to the face ma helin midna 12 % dhexdeeda. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ESize\u003C/strong\u003E, ama beddel wejiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Wejigii dhuumadu ku saabsanaa wuu maqan yahay (…). Mar kale dooro.&quot; Isbeddel hore ayaa wejiga ka saaray. Guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick faces\u003C/span\u003E oo mar kale guji wejiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhuumooyinka inch-ka (UNC, UNF), dhuumooyinka tuubada, dhuumooyinka tapered, dhamaadka dhuumada (run-outs) iyo bilowga dhuumada ee chamfer-ka weli lama dhisin. Exact kernel wuxuu u muujiyaa dhuumo moodel ah sida cosmetic.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Thread wuxuu dhigaa dhuumo wejiyada wareega: dibadda shaft-ka (dhuumo dibadda) ama gudaha bore-ka (dhuumo gudaha). PartCraft wuxuu ka ogaadaa wejiga. Dhuumadu wuxuu ku bilaabmaa cosmetic: wejigu wuu sii yahay, aragtidu waxay dhuumada ku sawirtaa goobo dashed ah, sawir-xaashiyada ayaa xusa, sida \"M10×1.5 - 6g, dhuumo 20 dheer\". Calaamadi Modelled si aad u gooyso dhuumada helical ee runta ah qaybta, daabacaadda 3D ama moodel u baahan inuu si sax ah u muuqdo. Dhuumee shaft ama bore Samee shaft ama bore cabbirka dhuumada: shaft Ø10 ah boolt M10 ah, ama bore Ø8.5 (tap drill) ah nut M10 ah. Guji wejiga wareega, kadibna dooro More › Thread. Haddii wejig wareeg aan la dooranin, PartCraft wuxuu kaa weydiinayaa inaad wejiyada gujiso, kadibna Done. Panelka midig, hubi Size. Fit to the face wuxuu cabbirka ku doortaa isaga: shaft-ka, cabbirka diameter-keedu weyn yahay sida shaft-ka; bore-ka, cabbirka diameter-keeda yar uu ku habboon yahay. Dhuumadu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa dhamaadka furan ee wejiga, meesha qaybtu aan ku sii socon jiifka tooska ah: dhamaadka xor ah ee shaft-ka, afka bore-ka. Start at the other end ayaa beddelaya taas. Dejinta Dejinta Ikhtiyaarada Caadiga Form ISO metric (60°), M1.6 ilaa M64 coarse; trapezoidal (Tr, 30°), Tr8×1.5 ilaa Tr60×9 ISO metric Size Fit to the face, ama hal cabbir oo liiska ka mid ah Fit to the face The whole face Ka saar si aad Length (mm) u bixiso, oo laga bilaabo bilowga La calaamadiyay Start at the other end Dhuumadu wuxuu ka socdaa dhamaadka kale ee wejiga Damiyey Hand Gacanta midig ama gacanta bidix Gacanta midig Modelled Gooy dhuumada helical ee runta ah Damiyey Clearance (mm) Wuu muuqdaa markii Modelled la calaamadiyo: intee in le'eg ayey dhuumada shaft-ku yar tahay, iyo intee in le'eg ayey dhuumada bore-ku u weyn tahay, dhinac kasta 0.1 Cabbir aan ku habboonayn wejiga ayaa weli la dhisaa, la gooyey wejiga, panelkuna wuu sheegayaa, sida \"Shaft Ø12 mm maaha Ø10 mm ee M10\". Dhowr wejood ayaa wadaagi kara hal feature Thread; Fit to the face ku jirta, mid kasta cabbir u gaar ah ayuu helaa. Dhuumooyinka moodelka ah ee daabacaadda 3D Dhuumo moodel ah wuxuu raacaa profile-ka aasaasiga ah ee caadiga ah: ISO 68-1 metric (dhabbo iyo xidid toosan, dhinacyada 60°), ISO 2901 trapezoidal (dhinacyada 30°). Clearance wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa profile-ka oo dhan gudaha (shaft) ama dibadda (bore) si qaybaha la daabacay ay isku qabsadaan: 0.1 ilaa 0.2 mm wuxuu ku habboon yahay printer-yada badan. Marka hore daabac tijaabo bolt iyo nut ah. 0 waa profile-ka caadiga ah, qaybaha la shiinay ama la hubinayo fit-ka. Bolt iyo nut oo leh cidhiidhi isku mid ah weligood ma taabtaan dhinacyadooda: farqiga u dhexeeya waa laba jeer cidhiidhiga, dhinac kasta. Pitch-yada yar si xun ayey u daabacmaan: M3 iyo ka yar, ama pitch ka hooseeya 0.5 mm, waa ku dhow waxa nozzle 0.4 mm ku dhajin karo. Qaybaha waaweyn moodel, yaryarna isticmaal heat-set insert ama godka dhuumaysan. Dhuumo moodel ah waa qayb ka mid ah solid-ka: STL, 3MF iyo STEP exports way qaadaan, Measure wuu cabbiraa. Waxay qaybta ka dhigaysaa mid miisaan badan oo dib loo dhiso: dhuumo M10 oo 20 dheer wuxuu qiyaastii yahay 150,000 triangles. Godka dhuumaysan God Tapped (ISO metric) wuxuu leeyahay Modelled switch oo isku mid ah, iyo Clearance isku mid ah. Eeg Godaha iyo counterbores-ka ee dhibcaha sawir-gacmeedka. Marka dhuumadu aan dhisin \"Dhuumo wuxuu ku yimaadaa wejiga wareega (silinda): shaft ama bore.\" Wejiga la doortay waa toos ama si kale ayuu u qalloocan yahay. \"Cabbir ISO ah oo aan ku habboonayn wejiga wareega ee Ø0.6 mm: dooro cabbir.\" Fit to the face ma helin midna 12 % dhexdeeda. Dooro Size, ama beddel wejiga. \"Wejigii dhuumadu ku saabsanaa wuu maqan yahay (…). Mar kale dooro.\" Isbeddel hore ayaa wejiga ka saaray. Guji Pick faces oo mar kale guji wejiga. Dhuumooyinka inch-ka (UNC, UNF), dhuumooyinka tuubada, dhuumooyinka tapered, dhamaadka dhuumada (run-outs) iyo bilowga dhuumada ee chamfer-ka weli lama dhisin. Exact kernel wuxuu u muujiyaa dhuumo moodel ah sida cosmetic.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"reference-geometry","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dusha tixraac, dhidibyada iyo barar","summary":"Samee dusha ka fogaada wejiga, xagal ahaan, saddex bar ku dhex maro, dhexe ahaan, taabasho silinda, jajab geesta ama geesta iyo bar ku dhex maro; dhidibyada; barar dhexe geesaha, isgoyska iyo geesaha dusha; sawir-gacmeed ku sam oo isticmaal sida dhidibyada revolve, jihooyinka pattern iyo dushaha mirror.","section":"tasks","order":65,"keywords":["datum","dhexdhexaad","dhexe","barta isgoyska","dusha geesta iyo barta ku dhex maro","dusha tixraaca","dusha shaqada","dusha dhismaha","dusha datum","dusha ka fogaaday","dusha xagal","dusha dhexe","dusha taabashada","dhidibka tixraaca","dhidibka dhismaha","dhidibka datum","barta tixraaca","barta shaqada","sawir-gacmeed dushaha ku sam"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-dusha","text":"Samee dusha","level":2},{"id":"sawir-gacmeed-dusha-ku-sam","text":"Sawir-gacmeed dusha ku sam","level":2},{"id":"dhidibyo-iyo-barar","text":"Dhidibyo iyo barar","level":2},{"id":"marka-tixraac-baabi-o","text":"Marka tixraac baabi'o","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EGeometry-ga tixraaca waa shaqsashada aad astaamaha ku dhistid: \u003Cstrong\u003Edusha\u003C/strong\u003E aad ku sawir-gacmeyso meel aan wejhi jirin, \u003Cstrong\u003Edhidib\u003C/strong\u003E aad ku revolve ama ku pattern-tid, \u003Cstrong\u003Ebar\u003C/strong\u003E aad ku joojiso extrude. Ma leh walxo gaar ah. Dushaha aragga waxay u muuqdaan sida labajibaaqyo cadcad, dhidibyada sida xarriiqyo jeexjeexan, barta sida calaamado jeex ah; kulligood waxay ku biiraan taariikhda, waxayna raacaan waxa laga sameeyay markaad beddesho cabbirka hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay ku jiraan menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda Features: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlane\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoint\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-dusha\"\u003ESamee dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wejiga siman, ama dusha aasaasiga ah taariikhda, si aad uga bilowdo (ikhtiyaari).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlane\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay ku bilaabmaysaa sida dusha ka fogaatay 20 % cabbirka qaybta meesha aad doorashay (ama dusha sare).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka midig dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E iyo tixraacyadeeda:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETixraacyada\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELambarada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa fogaanta dusha ama wejiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo dusha\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFogaanta (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, togan haddii ay tahay dhinaca kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal ilaa geesta ama dhidibka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo dusha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKu wareeg\u003C/strong\u003E (dhidib adduunka, astaam dhidib, ama geesta toosan ee la doortay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXagal (°)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex bar ku dhex maro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBarta 1\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta 2\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta 3\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexe ka dhexeeya laba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha 1aad\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha 2aad\u003C/strong\u003E (isbarbar ahaan: badhka dhexe; isgoyska: dusha xagasha labadood u qaybiya)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaabasho silinda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESilinda\u003C/strong\u003E (wejiga silindarka), \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta u dhow\u003C/strong\u003E (dhinaca)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJajab geesta, barta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha waxay mariyaa barta geesta ee u dhow, iyo barta sidoo kale)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesta iyo bar ku dhex maro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta toosan\u003C/strong\u003E (ama dhidib), \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta ku dhex maro\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJajab geesta badhkeeda dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta\u003C/strong\u003E (badhka dhexe, jajab geesta halkaas), ama geesla la&#039;aan \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta 1\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta 2\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha ka dhexeeya)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E—\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETixraac kasta wuxuu leeyahay badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E: riix, kadibna guji aragga. Slot-ka dushu wuxuu qaadanayaa dusha aasaasiga ah, dusha tixraaca ama wejiga siman; slot-ka barta wuxuu qaadanayaa dhamaadka geesta (guji meel ku dhow dhamaadkaas), astaamaha barta ama meel wejiga ku taal; slot-ka geesta wuxuu qaadanayaa geesta. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu joojiyaa dooritaanka. \u003Cstrong\u003ERog jihada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu rogaa dusha (sawir-gacmeedka ku taal wuxuu u jeedaa dhinaca kale).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca hadda, slot-ka u baahan geesta ama wejiga silindarka (Taabasho silinda iyo slot-yada Geesta) wuxuu leeyahay &quot;weli lama dhisin&quot;: isticmaal barar ama dhidib halkeeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-gacmeed-dusha-ku-sam\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed dusha ku sam\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro dusha (taariikhda ama guji murabbaca aragga) oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshad ku sam\u003C/strong\u003E panelkiisa. Sawir-gacmeedku wuxuu raacaa dusha: beddel cabbirka dusha iyo sawir-gacmeedka, iyo astaam kasta oo ku yaal, ayaa sidoo kale dhaqaaqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhidibyo-iyo-barar\"\u003EDhidibyo iyo barar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis\u003C/span\u003E: laba bar ku dhex maro, dhidibka silinda ama koonka, meesha laba dusha isgoyaan, geesta toosan ku dhex (ama dhidibka geesta wareega), ama jajab wejiga ku taal barta ku dhex maro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPoint\u003C/span\u003E: ku meel-yaal, bar sawir-gacmeed ama geesta, ama dhexe geesta wareega, iyo barar &quot;ku dhex dhexaad&quot; (between objects):\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca barta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETixraacyada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexe geesta (ama ku dhex laba bar)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta\u003C/strong\u003E (badhka dhererka, sidoo kale qalloocyada iyo jeexyada), ama geesla la&#039;aan \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta 1\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBarta 2\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalka geesta ama dhidibku wejiga ama dusha kula kulmo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta\u003C/strong\u003E (toosan ama qalloocan) ama dhidib, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EMeets plane\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha ama wejiga siman) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EOr a face\u003C/strong\u003E (wejiga siman ama silinda). Goobo dusha waa laba jeer lagu gudbaa, xarriiqna silinda waa laba jeer lagu gudbaa: \u003Cstrong\u003EThe other crossing\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaadaa kii labaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalka saddex dusha ay kulmaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFirst\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESecond\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EThird plane\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha ama wejiga siman)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMid kasta wuxuu fashilmaa fariin fudud marka tixraacyadiisu waafaqin: xarriiq la dhigan dushaha, xarriiq ka maqan silinda, geesta aan gaarin dusha, saddex dusha oo aan ku kulmin hal bar, ama bar xarriiqa saaran oo ay tahay inuu dusha ku hagaajiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu isticmaal shaqooyinka kale:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeesha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESidee\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERevolve\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAxis\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro astaamaha dhidibka liiska ka (waa inuu ku jiraa dusha sawir-gacmeedka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECircular pattern\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAxis\u003C/strong\u003E: astaamaha dhidibka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear pattern\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDirection\u003C/strong\u003E: astaamaha dhidibka, ama dusha (caadiga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMirror\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMirror plane\u003C/strong\u003E: dusha tixraaca\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrude\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEnd\u003C/strong\u003E: Ilaa wejiga ama dusha, Ilaa geeska (astaamaha barta). Nooca hadda weli lama dhisin (waxay u baahan tahay kernel sax ah)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENeutral plane\u003C/strong\u003E: dusha dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-tixraac-baabi-o\"\u003EMarka tixraac baabi&#039;o\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha laga sameeyay wejiga aan jirin mar dambe wuxuu fashilmaa fariin magacaabaysa, sida &quot;Wejiga uu saaran yahay ayaa ka maqan Extrude1.&quot; Weligeed lama wareejiyo wejiga kale. Sawir-gacmeedyada iyo astaamaha ku yaal waxay calaamadsan yihiin &quot;aan la dhisin&quot; ilaa aad tixraac cusub dooratid; qaybta intiisa kale way sii jirtaa sidii ay ahayd.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca hadda qayb kasta wuxuu ku dhisaa kernel-ka mesh, kaas oo dusha, dhidibyada iyo baraarka ka sameeya dushaha aasaasiga ah, wejiyada siman ee Extrude ama Revolve sameeyey, barar sawir-gacmeed, kaliya-jiifyada iyo astaamaha tixraaca kale. Wax u baahan geesta, dhamaadka geesta ama wejiga qalloocan waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah: weli lama dhisin nooca hadda (&quot;It uses a face or edge of the solid, which only an exact kernel can find: not built yet in this version.&quot;).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Geometry-ga tixraaca waa shaqsashada aad astaamaha ku dhistid: dusha aad ku sawir-gacmeyso meel aan wejhi jirin, dhidib aad ku revolve ama ku pattern-tid, bar aad ku joojiso extrude. Ma leh walxo gaar ah. Dushaha aragga waxay u muuqdaan sida labajibaaqyo cadcad, dhidibyada sida xarriiqyo jeexjeexan, barta sida calaamado jeex ah; kulligood waxay ku biiraan taariikhda, waxayna raacaan waxa laga sameeyay markaad beddesho cabbirka hore. Waxay ku jiraan menu-ga More ee kooxda Features: Plane, Axis, Point. Samee dusha Guji wejiga siman, ama dusha aasaasiga ah taariikhda, si aad uga bilowdo (ikhtiyaari). Dooro More, kadibna Plane. Waxay ku bilaabmaysaa sida dusha ka fogaatay 20 % cabbirka qaybta meesha aad doorashay (ama dusha sare). Panelka midig dooro Type iyo tixraacyadeeda: Nooca Tixraacyada Lambarada Ka fogaanta dusha ama wejiga Laga bilaabo dusha Fogaanta (mm), togan haddii ay tahay dhinaca kale Xagal ilaa geesta ama dhidibka Laga bilaabo dusha, Ku wareeg (dhidib adduunka, astaam dhidib, ama geesta toosan ee la doortay) Xagal (°) Saddex bar ku dhex maro Barta 1, Barta 2, Barta 3 — Dhexe ka dhexeeya laba Dusha 1aad, Dusha 2aad (isbarbar ahaan: badhka dhexe; isgoyska: dusha xagasha labadood u qaybiya) — Taabasho silinda Silinda (wejiga silindarka), Barta u dhow (dhinaca) — Jajab geesta, barta Geesta, Barta (dusha waxay mariyaa barta geesta ee u dhow, iyo barta sidoo kale) — Geesta iyo bar ku dhex maro Geesta toosan (ama dhidib), Barta ku dhex maro — Jajab geesta badhkeeda dhexe Geesta (badhka dhexe, jajab geesta halkaas), ama geesla la'aan Barta 1 iyo Barta 2 (dusha ka dhexeeya) — Tixraac kasta wuxuu leeyahay badhanka Dooro: riix, kadibna guji aragga. Slot-ka dushu wuxuu qaadanayaa dusha aasaasiga ah, dusha tixraaca ama wejiga siman; slot-ka barta wuxuu qaadanayaa dhamaadka geesta (guji meel ku dhow dhamaadkaas), astaamaha barta ama meel wejiga ku taal; slot-ka geesta wuxuu qaadanayaa geesta. Esc wuu joojiyaa dooritaanka. Rog jihada wuxuu rogaa dusha (sawir-gacmeedka ku taal wuxuu u jeedaa dhinaca kale). Nooca hadda, slot-ka u baahan geesta ama wejiga silindarka (Taabasho silinda iyo slot-yada Geesta) wuxuu leeyahay \"weli lama dhisin\": isticmaal barar ama dhidib halkeeda. Sawir-gacmeed dusha ku sam Dooro dusha (taariikhda ama guji murabbaca aragga) oo dooro Sketch, ama Naqshad ku sam panelkiisa. Sawir-gacmeedku wuxuu raacaa dusha: beddel cabbirka dusha iyo sawir-gacmeedka, iyo astaam kasta oo ku yaal, ayaa sidoo kale dhaqaaqa. Dhidibyo iyo barar Axis: laba bar ku dhex maro, dhidibka silinda ama koonka, meesha laba dusha isgoyaan, geesta toosan ku dhex (ama dhidibka geesta wareega), ama jajab wejiga ku taal barta ku dhex maro. Point: ku meel-yaal, bar sawir-gacmeed ama geesta, ama dhexe geesta wareega, iyo barar \"ku dhex dhexaad\" (between objects): Nooca barta Tixraacyada Dhexe geesta (ama ku dhex laba bar) Geesta (badhka dhererka, sidoo kale qalloocyada iyo jeexyada), ama geesla la'aan Barta 1 iyo Barta 2 Halka geesta ama dhidibku wejiga ama dusha kula kulmo Geesta (toosan ama qalloocan) ama dhidib, iyo Meets plane (dusha ama wejiga siman) ama Or a face (wejiga siman ama silinda). Goobo dusha waa laba jeer lagu gudbaa, xarriiqna silinda waa laba jeer lagu gudbaa: The other crossing wuxuu qaadaa kii labaad Halka saddex dusha ay kulmaan First, Second iyo Third plane (dusha ama wejiga siman) Mid kasta wuxuu fashilmaa fariin fudud marka tixraacyadiisu waafaqin: xarriiq la dhigan dushaha, xarriiq ka maqan silinda, geesta aan gaarin dusha, saddex dusha oo aan ku kulmin hal bar, ama bar xarriiqa saaran oo ay tahay inuu dusha ku hagaajiyo. Ku isticmaal shaqooyinka kale: Meesha Sidee Revolve Axis: dooro astaamaha dhidibka liiska ka (waa inuu ku jiraa dusha sawir-gacmeedka) Circular pattern Axis: astaamaha dhidibka Linear pattern Direction: astaamaha dhidibka, ama dusha (caadiga) Mirror Mirror plane: dusha tixraaca Extrude End: Ilaa wejiga ama dusha, Ilaa geeska (astaamaha barta). Nooca hadda weli lama dhisin (waxay u baahan tahay kernel sax ah) Draft Neutral plane: dusha dhexe Marka tixraac baabi'o Dusha laga sameeyay wejiga aan jirin mar dambe wuxuu fashilmaa fariin magacaabaysa, sida \"Wejiga uu saaran yahay ayaa ka maqan Extrude1.\" Weligeed lama wareejiyo wejiga kale. Sawir-gacmeedyada iyo astaamaha ku yaal waxay calaamadsan yihiin \"aan la dhisin\" ilaa aad tixraac cusub dooratid; qaybta intiisa kale way sii jirtaa sidii ay ahayd. Nooca hadda qayb kasta wuxuu ku dhisaa kernel-ka mesh, kaas oo dusha, dhidibyada iyo baraarka ka sameeya dushaha aasaasiga ah, wejiyada siman ee Extrude ama Revolve sameeyey, barar sawir-gacmeed, kaliya-jiifyada iyo astaamaha tixraaca kale. Wax u baahan geesta, dhamaadka geesta ama wejiga qalloocan waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah: weli lama dhisin nooca hadda (\"It uses a face or edge of the solid, which only an exact kernel can find: not built yet in this version.\").","lang":"so"},{"slug":"patterns-mirror","scope":"partcraft","title":"Sifooyinka nuqulka iyo muraayadda","summary":"Ku celi sifooyinka safka ah adigoo isticmaalaya Toosan, ku wareeg dhidib adigoo isticmaalaya Wareegsan, iyo ku koobiyee sifooyinka ama jidhka oo dhan dhinac dusha adigoo isticmaalaya Muraayad.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["nuqul","nuqulka toosan","nuqulka wareegsan","qaabka wareegga","array","muraayad","simmetrik","koobiyee sifooyinka","goobta boolta","bilow","muraayadda jidhka"],"headings":[{"id":"nuqulka-toosan","text":"Nuqulka toosan","level":2},{"id":"geeska-u-isticmaal-jihada","text":"Geeska u isticmaal jihada","level":3},{"id":"nuqulka-wareegsan","text":"Nuqulka wareegsan","level":2},{"id":"tusaale-sideed-godka-boolta-ee-flange","text":"Tusaale: sideed godka boolta ee flange","level":3},{"id":"muraayad","text":"Muraayad","level":2},{"id":"fariimaha","text":"Fariimaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENuqullada iyo muraayadaha waxay koobiyeeyaan sifooyinka aad hore u dhisay. Nuqullada waxay qayb ka yihiin taariikhda: haddii aad asalka beddesho, nuqullada ayaa raacaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa la koobiyeeyo waa waxa sifadu sameyso: nuqulka boss wuxuu ku daraa alaab, nuqulka jar ama god wuxuu ka saaraa. Nuqullada waa la nuquli karaa mar kale, waana la muraayadeyn karaa mar kale. Jidh STEP ah oo la soo dejiyey ayaa sidoo kale la koobiyeyn karaa; fillets, chamfers iyo shells ma la koobiyeyn karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuqulka-toosan\"\u003ENuqulka toosan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro sifada la koobiyeynayo taariikhda (tusaale ahaan Hole ama Cut). Haddii wax aan la doorán, sifada adag ee ugu dambaysay ayaa la isticmaalaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E. Saddex nuqul ayaa soo muuqda, oo 20 mm kala fog oo ku yaal dhidibka X.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka midig, deji:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameyso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiimaha caadiga\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFeatures to copy\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadee sifo kasta oo la koobiyeynayo. Kaliya sifooyinka ka sarreeya nuqulka ayaa la liisanayaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifada la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDirection\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhidibka X, dhidibka Y, dhidibka Z, khad ama khad dhexe naqshad hore ka timid, dhidibka wareegga, ama geesta la qaadday\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhidibka X\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESpacing (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFogaanta u dhaxaysa deriska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECount\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada guud, \u003Cstrong\u003Eoo ku jirta asalka\u003C/strong\u003E (1 ilaa 1000)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EReverse direction\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqulada waxay u socdaan jihada kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDamiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"geeska-u-isticmaal-jihada\"\u003EGeeska u isticmaal jihada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix geesta toosan ee qaybta ku jirta muuqaalka. Panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EEdge\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuuna muujinayaa dhererka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E: nuqulku wuxuu ku socdaa geeskaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma dooro nuqulka, qaad geesta, oo dooro &quot;Picked edge (use the one picked now)&quot; ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EDirection\u003C/strong\u003E. Geesta la qaaday waa go&#039;an tahay meel bannaan: ma raacdo isbeddelada dambe. Khadka naqshadda wuxuu raacaa naqshaddiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuqulka-wareegsan\"\u003ENuqulka wareegsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro sifada la koobiyeynayo (tusaale ahaan hal god oo ku dhow geesta gaar).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircular\u003C/span\u003E. Lix nuqul ayaa soo muuqda, oo si siman looga wareegayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameyso\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQiimaha caadiga\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFeatures to copy\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida Linear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifada la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAxis\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhidibka X, Y ama Z, khad naqshad, dhidibka wareegga, ama geesta la qaaday\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhidibka wareegga ee ugu dambeeya haddii uu jiro, haddii kale dhidibka Y\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAngle (°)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E360 wuxuu nuqullada si siman ugu kala fogeeyaa wareeg oo dhan. Ka yar wuxuu ku kala firdhiyaa xagalkaas, midka koowaad iyo midka ugu dambeeya dhamaadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E360\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECount\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada guud, oo ku jirta asalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EReverse direction\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu u wareegaa jihada kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDamiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhidibyada adduunka waxay ka gudbaan bilowga (origin). Haddii disk-ku aan ku dhex jirin bilowga, isticmaal khad dhexe oo naqshad ah ama dhidibka wareegga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tusaale-sideed-godka-boolta-ee-flange\"\u003ETusaale: sideed godka boolta ee flange\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareeji flange-ka (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/revolve\" data-topic=\"partcraft/revolve\"\u003EWareeji qayb wareegsan\u003C/a\u003E) dhidibka Y.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadee dusha sare ee falaaska flange-ka, dhig hal bar oo ku yaal goobta boolta, oo samee Hole.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdigoo Hole la doortay, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircular\u003C/span\u003E. Dhidibka horey ayuu u yahay &quot;Dhidibka Revolve1&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003ECount\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa \u003Ccode\u003E8\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muraayad\"\u003EMuraayad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro sifada la muraayadeynayo taariikhda, ama ha dooran wax si aad u muraayadeyso \u003Cstrong\u003Ejidhka oo dhan sida ay ilaa hadda u dhisan tahay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMirror\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay muraayadeysaa \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha midig\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad jidhka oo dhan dhinac wajiga qaybta ugu muraayadeyso, marka hore riix wajigaas go&#039;an, ka dib dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMirror\u003C/span\u003E. (Riixida wajiga waxay tirtirtaa doorashada taariikhda, sidaas darteed tani had iyo jeer waxay muraayadeysaa jidhka oo dhan.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta panelka midig:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMirror\u003C/strong\u003E: calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EThe whole body (as built so far)\u003C/strong\u003E, ama ka saar oo calaamadee sifooyinka la koobiyeynayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMirror plane\u003C/strong\u003E: Dusha hore, Dusha sare, Dusha midig, wajiga uu hadda isticmaalayo (&quot;Wajiga Extrude1&quot; ama &quot;Dusha go&#039;an&quot;), ama &quot;Wajiga la qaaday hadda&quot;. Si aad sifooyinka la doortay ugu muraayadeyso wajig: dooro Mirror taariikhda, riix wajiga muuqaalka, oo dooro &quot;Wajiga la qaaday hadda&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuraayadeynta jidhka oo dhan dhinac wajig ayaa qaybta laba jibbaarinaysa, tusaale ahaan bracket nus ah oo loo beddelo mid buuxa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fariimaha\"\u003EFariimaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Marka hore dhis sifo si aad u nuqusho.&quot; ama &quot;Marka hore dhis jidh adag.&quot; Weli ma jiro wax adag oo la koobiyeyn karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Dooro sifooyinka la koobiyeynayo.&quot; Sanduuqa kasta \u003Cstrong\u003EFeatures to copy\u003C/strong\u003E waa la faragelisay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Extrude2 ma lahan jidh adag oo la koobiyeyn karo.&quot; Sifadaasi way fashilantay ama waa la joojiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Fillet1 wuxuu beddelaa geesaha ama darbiyada jidhka; ma la koobiyeyn karo. Koobiyee sifooyinka samaya jidhadka adag (extrudes, revolves, holes, imports).&quot; Fillets, chamfers iyo shells ma la nuqli karo ama ma la muraayadeyn karo; marka hore nuqul, ka dib fillet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Weli ma jiro jidh la muraayadeyn karo.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqulada lama dhex-gudbin karo mid mid. Nuqulku ma raaci karo curve naqshad. Nuqullada naqshadaha iyo muraayadaha weli lama dhisin: naqshadee joomitari soo noqnoqda gacanta, ama adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar koorarka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Nuqullada iyo muraayadaha waxay koobiyeeyaan sifooyinka aad hore u dhisay. Nuqullada waxay qayb ka yihiin taariikhda: haddii aad asalka beddesho, nuqullada ayaa raacaya. Waxa la koobiyeeyo waa waxa sifadu sameyso: nuqulka boss wuxuu ku daraa alaab, nuqulka jar ama god wuxuu ka saaraa. Nuqullada waa la nuquli karaa mar kale, waana la muraayadeyn karaa mar kale. Jidh STEP ah oo la soo dejiyey ayaa sidoo kale la koobiyeyn karaa; fillets, chamfers iyo shells ma la koobiyeyn karo. Nuqulka toosan Dooro sifada la koobiyeynayo taariikhda (tusaale ahaan Hole ama Cut). Haddii wax aan la doorán, sifada adag ee ugu dambaysay ayaa la isticmaalaa. Dooro Linear. Saddex nuqul ayaa soo muuqda, oo 20 mm kala fog oo ku yaal dhidibka X. Panelka midig, deji: Dejin Waxa ay sameyso Qiimaha caadiga Features to copy Calaamadee sifo kasta oo la koobiyeynayo. Kaliya sifooyinka ka sarreeya nuqulka ayaa la liisanayaa Sifada la doortay Direction Dhidibka X, dhidibka Y, dhidibka Z, khad ama khad dhexe naqshad hore ka timid, dhidibka wareegga, ama geesta la qaadday Dhidibka X Spacing (mm) Fogaanta u dhaxaysa deriska 20 Count Tirada guud, oo ku jirta asalka (1 ilaa 1000) 3 Reverse direction Nuqulada waxay u socdaan jihada kale Damiyay Geeska u isticmaal jihada Riix geesta toosan ee qaybta ku jirta muuqaalka. Panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay Edge wuxuuna muujinayaa dhererka. Dooro Linear: nuqulku wuxuu ku socdaa geeskaas. Ama dooro nuqulka, qaad geesta, oo dooro \"Picked edge (use the one picked now)\" ku jira Direction. Geesta la qaaday waa go'an tahay meel bannaan: ma raacdo isbeddelada dambe. Khadka naqshadda wuxuu raacaa naqshaddiisa. Nuqulka wareegsan Dooro sifada la koobiyeynayo (tusaale ahaan hal god oo ku dhow geesta gaar). Dooro Circular. Lix nuqul ayaa soo muuqda, oo si siman looga wareegayo. Deji: Dejin Waxa ay sameyso Qiimaha caadiga Features to copy Sida Linear Sifada la doortay Axis Dhidibka X, Y ama Z, khad naqshad, dhidibka wareegga, ama geesta la qaaday Dhidibka wareegga ee ugu dambeeya haddii uu jiro, haddii kale dhidibka Y Angle (°) 360 wuxuu nuqullada si siman ugu kala fogeeyaa wareeg oo dhan. Ka yar wuxuu ku kala firdhiyaa xagalkaas, midka koowaad iyo midka ugu dambeeya dhamaadka 360 Count Tirada guud, oo ku jirta asalka 6 Reverse direction Wuxuu u wareegaa jihada kale Damiyay Dhidibyada adduunka waxay ka gudbaan bilowga (origin). Haddii disk-ku aan ku dhex jirin bilowga, isticmaal khad dhexe oo naqshad ah ama dhidibka wareegga. Tusaale: sideed godka boolta ee flange Wareeji flange-ka (eeg Wareeji qayb wareegsan) dhidibka Y. Naqshadee dusha sare ee falaaska flange-ka, dhig hal bar oo ku yaal goobta boolta, oo samee Hole. Adigoo Hole la doortay, dooro Circular. Dhidibka horey ayuu u yahay \"Dhidibka Revolve1\". Deji Count ilaa 8. Muraayad Dooro sifada la muraayadeynayo taariikhda, ama ha dooran wax si aad u muraayadeyso jidhka oo dhan sida ay ilaa hadda u dhisan tahay. Dooro Mirror. Waxay muraayadeysaa Dusha midig. Si aad jidhka oo dhan dhinac wajiga qaybta ugu muraayadeyso, marka hore riix wajigaas go'an, ka dib dooro Mirror. (Riixida wajiga waxay tirtirtaa doorashada taariikhda, sidaas darteed tani had iyo jeer waxay muraayadeysaa jidhka oo dhan.) Dejinta panelka midig: Mirror: calaamadee The whole body (as built so far), ama ka saar oo calaamadee sifooyinka la koobiyeynayo. Mirror plane: Dusha hore, Dusha sare, Dusha midig, wajiga uu hadda isticmaalayo (\"Wajiga Extrude1\" ama \"Dusha go'an\"), ama \"Wajiga la qaaday hadda\". Si aad sifooyinka la doortay ugu muraayadeyso wajig: dooro Mirror taariikhda, riix wajiga muuqaalka, oo dooro \"Wajiga la qaaday hadda\". Muraayadeynta jidhka oo dhan dhinac wajig ayaa qaybta laba jibbaarinaysa, tusaale ahaan bracket nus ah oo loo beddelo mid buuxa. Fariimaha \"Marka hore dhis sifo si aad u nuqusho.\" ama \"Marka hore dhis jidh adag.\" Weli ma jiro wax adag oo la koobiyeyn karo. \"Dooro sifooyinka la koobiyeynayo.\" Sanduuqa kasta Features to copy waa la faragelisay. \"Extrude2 ma lahan jidh adag oo la koobiyeyn karo.\" Sifadaasi way fashilantay ama waa la joojiyay. \"Fillet1 wuxuu beddelaa geesaha ama darbiyada jidhka; ma la koobiyeyn karo. Koobiyee sifooyinka samaya jidhadka adag (extrudes, revolves, holes, imports).\" Fillets, chamfers iyo shells ma la nuqli karo ama ma la muraayadeyn karo; marka hore nuqul, ka dib fillet. \"Weli ma jiro jidh la muraayadeyn karo.\" Nuqulada lama dhex-gudbin karo mid mid. Nuqulku ma raaci karo curve naqshad. Nuqullada naqshadaha iyo muraayadaha weli lama dhisin: naqshadee joomitari soo noqnoqda gacanta, ama adigoo isticmaalaya Ku dar koorarka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"magnet-study","scope":"partcraft","title":"Daraasad magnetka oo sawir ah","summary":"Beddel jidhadka xidhan ee sawirradaada moodeel magnetic oo fidsan (bir, magnet, coil), arag goobta, akhri xoogga iyo torque-ka jidh.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["magnet","magnetic","magnetostatic","goob","flux density","xoog","torque","coil","yoke","bir","B-H curve","permanent magnet","actuator","motor","solenoid","maxwell"],"headings":[{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-doontid","text":"Waxa aad arki doontid","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan","text":"Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan","level":2},{"id":"xiga","text":"Xiga","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ee toolbar-ka Features › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagnet study of sketches…\u003C/span\u003E qayb leh sawirro. Jidh kasta oo xidhan oo ku jira sawirrada aad calaamaysay waa hal gobol oo moodeel fidsan; daraasaddu wuxuu xisaabiyaa goobta magnetic-ka B, xoogga iyo torque-ka jidhka aad doorato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJidhadka u rawso sida shakloo xidhan oo sawirrada ku jira: yoke bir ah, magnet, coil. Jidhadka isku taabtaa waxay wadaagaan geeso, sidaas darteed ku dhig sawiro kala duwan; jidhadka kala fog, ama kuwa ku jira midba kan kale (daaqad ku jirta yoke), waxay wadaagi karaan mid. Sawirrada ku hay isla diyaarad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur daraasadda oo calaamee sawirrada la isticmaali doono. Mid kasta u sheeg waxa uu yahay: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIron\u003C/span\u003E (permeability, ama B–H curve oo lagu qoro lammaano B tesla iyo H A/m), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPermanent magnet\u003C/span\u003E (Br tesla, jihadiisa xagal ka bilaabata x axis-ka sawirka, iyo recoil permeability-kiisa) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECoil\u003C/span\u003E (xaddiga wadarta ah ee shidaalka profile-kiisa, turns × amperes; calaamaddu waxay sheegaysaa jihada uu socdo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForce and torque on this body\u003C/span\u003E jidhadka aad rabto inay leeyihiin. Bixi qoto dheerida qaybta ee sawirka ka baxda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro mesh-ka iyo hawada ku wareegsan moodeelka, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad arki doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhufashada goobta |B| ee moodeelka, buluug qoto dheer oo hoose ilaa casaan oo sare, profile-yadana lambar la siiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoobta ugu xoogga badan iyo meesha ay ku taal, tirada triangle-yada, iyo jidh kasta aad calaamaysay: xoogga x iyo y iyo torque-ka bartamaheeda, iyadoo loo eegayo qoto dheerida aad bixisay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave results (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa tirooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wanaagsan-in-la-yaqaan\"\u003EWaxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaa moodeel fidsan oo joogto ah: wax kasta waxaa loo qiyaasay mitir qoto dheer, iyadoo aan lahayn eddy currents iyo hysteresis, magnetku waana khad recoil toosan (ma dumin karo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodeelku wuxuu ku jiraa sanduuq hawo ah oo geeskiisu yahay derbi. Isbarbar dhig labo cabbir oo sanduuqa hawada ah, iyo mesh-yada Normal iyo Fine: xoog laga qaatay goobta ku wareegsan jidh waxa uu ka wanaagsan yahay mesh-ka halkaas oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBir oo leh permeability keliya marna ma buuxo. Goobtu markay 2 T gudubto, daraasaddu waxay dhigaysaa ⚠ liiska Problems: siiyo birta B–H curve. Tirooyinka safka cusub waa tusaalooyin (bir μr 2000, magnet 1.2 T), ma aha xogta warqadda shirkadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJidhku wuxuu u baahan yahay meel ku wareegsan si uu xoogga u qaato: haddii jidh kale aad ugu dhow yahay, daraasaddu way sheegaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalab hagid ah, ma aha ansixin injineernimo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiga\"\u003EXiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\"\u003EGoobaha magnetic-ka 2-D (casharka)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Isticmaal More ee toolbar-ka Features › Magnet study of sketches… qayb leh sawirro. Jidh kasta oo xidhan oo ku jira sawirrada aad calaamaysay waa hal gobol oo moodeel fidsan; daraasaddu wuxuu xisaabiyaa goobta magnetic-ka B, xoogga iyo torque-ka jidhka aad doorato. Tallaabooyinka Jidhadka u rawso sida shakloo xidhan oo sawirrada ku jira: yoke bir ah, magnet, coil. Jidhadka isku taabtaa waxay wadaagaan geeso, sidaas darteed ku dhig sawiro kala duwan; jidhadka kala fog, ama kuwa ku jira midba kan kale (daaqad ku jirta yoke), waxay wadaagi karaan mid. Sawirrada ku hay isla diyaarad. Fur daraasadda oo calaamee sawirrada la isticmaali doono. Mid kasta u sheeg waxa uu yahay: Air, Iron (permeability, ama B–H curve oo lagu qoro lammaano B tesla iyo H A/m), Permanent magnet (Br tesla, jihadiisa xagal ka bilaabata x axis-ka sawirka, iyo recoil permeability-kiisa) ama Coil (xaddiga wadarta ah ee shidaalka profile-kiisa, turns × amperes; calaamaddu waxay sheegaysaa jihada uu socdo). Calaamee Force and torque on this body jidhadka aad rabto inay leeyihiin. Bixi qoto dheerida qaybta ee sawirka ka baxda. Dooro mesh-ka iyo hawada ku wareegsan moodeelka, kadibna Run. Waxa aad arki doontid Dhufashada goobta |B| ee moodeelka, buluug qoto dheer oo hoose ilaa casaan oo sare, profile-yadana lambar la siiyay. Goobta ugu xoogga badan iyo meesha ay ku taal, tirada triangle-yada, iyo jidh kasta aad calaamaysay: xoogga x iyo y iyo torque-ka bartamaheeda, iyadoo loo eegayo qoto dheerida aad bixisay. Save results (CSV) wuxuu qoraa tirooyinka. Waxa wanaagsan in la yaqaan Waa moodeel fidsan oo joogto ah: wax kasta waxaa loo qiyaasay mitir qoto dheer, iyadoo aan lahayn eddy currents iyo hysteresis, magnetku waana khad recoil toosan (ma dumin karo). Moodeelku wuxuu ku jiraa sanduuq hawo ah oo geeskiisu yahay derbi. Isbarbar dhig labo cabbir oo sanduuqa hawada ah, iyo mesh-yada Normal iyo Fine: xoog laga qaatay goobta ku wareegsan jidh waxa uu ka wanaagsan yahay mesh-ka halkaas oo keliya. Bir oo leh permeability keliya marna ma buuxo. Goobtu markay 2 T gudubto, daraasaddu waxay dhigaysaa ⚠ liiska Problems: siiyo birta B–H curve. Tirooyinka safka cusub waa tusaalooyin (bir μr 2000, magnet 1.2 T), ma aha xogta warqadda shirkadda. Jidhku wuxuu u baahan yahay meel ku wareegsan si uu xoogga u qaato: haddii jidh kale aad ugu dhow yahay, daraasaddu way sheegaysaa. Qalab hagid ah, ma aha ansixin injineernimo. Xiga Goobaha magnetic-ka 2-D (casharka)","lang":"so"},{"slug":"bodies","scope":"partcraft","title":"Isku dar, guuri iyo miisaan jidhka; qaabka jidka","summary":"Samee jidho kala go'an, kadibna isku xir, goo ama iska gooo kadib, guuri, wareeji, iswaafajiso ama nuqul ka samee, miisaan u dhig si siman ama X, Y iyo Z, oo nuqul astaamo ama jidho dhex-marka jid.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["jidh","jidho","multi-body","jidh cusub","isku dar","boolean","isku xir","goo","isgoyn","kala jar","union","ilaali qalabka","guuri jidhka","nuqul jidhka","wareeji jidhka","iswaafajiso","translate","miisaan","miisaan aan siman","stretch","affine","qaab jid","qaab dhex marka khad","qaab jid"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-jidh-kala-go-an","text":"Samee jidh kala go'an","level":2},{"id":"magac-u-bedel-ama-qari-jidh","text":"Magac u bedel ama qari jidh","level":2},{"id":"isku-dar-jidho","text":"Isku dar jidho","level":2},{"id":"guuri-ama-nuqul-jidh","text":"Guuri ama nuqul jidh","level":2},{"id":"miisaan-jidh","text":"Miisaan jidh","level":2},{"id":"nuqul-ka-samee-jid","text":"Nuqul ka samee jid","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadyo","text":"Xaddidaadyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeli lama dhisin nooca hadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Shaqada jidho badan waxay u baahan tahay kernel joogto ah oo juhdi sax ah, taas oo nooca PartCraft-kan aan lahayn: wuxuu dhisaa qayb kasta isticmaalaa mesh kernel. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sharaxayaa waxa lagu samayn karo halkii. Qaybta kale ee bogga waxay sharaxaysaa sida ay u shaqaynayso kernel sax ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb wuxuu leeyahay in ka badan hal jidh. Jidh kasta oo kala go&#039;an waa \u003Cstrong\u003Ejidh\u003C/strong\u003E. Astaamaha badankoodu waxay ku daraan ama ka goyaan jidh kasta oo ay taabanayaan; qalabyada bogga kanu waxay ka shaqeeyaan jidho oo buuxa oo aad dooratid. Waxay ku yaalaan menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda Astaamaha: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku dar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri jidhka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan jidhka\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaab jid\u003C/span\u003E. Dhammaantood waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah (OpenCascade).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-jidh-kala-go-an\"\u003ESamee jidh kala go&#039;an\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EHawlgalka\u003C/strong\u003E ee extrude ama revolve ee qaybtiisa midig oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EJidh cusub\u003C/strong\u003E (sweep iyo loft ayaa leh sidaas oo kale). Jidhka cusub wuxuu ka go&#039;an yahay xitaa meesha uu ku walaaqo kuwa kale. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsgoyn\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa oo keliya walaaqa qaabka cusub iyo waxa jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJidhadu waxay ku magacaabmaan astaanta ka bilowday: &quot;Extrude2&quot;. Nuqulka waxaa lagu magacaabaa asalkiisa iyo astaanta nuqulka sameysay: &quot;Extrude2, nuqul 1 oo ka mid ah Move1&quot;. Magacyadu way joogaan markaad cabbirrada hore u beddesho, sidaas darteed astaamaha isticmaala jidhka way helaan. Haddii laba jidh ama ka badan jiraan, qaybta qaybta (guji meel bannaan) waxay liistaa iyaga iyo mugooyinkooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"magac-u-bedel-ama-qari-jidh\"\u003EMagac u bedel ama qari jidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji meel bannaan muuqaalka si aad u aragto qaybta. Liiska jidhadka (oo muuqda marka qaybtu leedahay laba jidh ama ka badan) wuxuu safar kasta leeyahay sanduuq magac iyo badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQari\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagac u bedel:\u003C/strong\u003E qor magac cusub sanduuqa oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji meel kale. Dhammaan panel-ka markaas ayaa isticmaala: Isku dar, Guuri jidhka, qaababka. Sanduuqa nadiifi si aad ugu noqoto magaca astaanta sameysay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQari:\u003C/strong\u003E guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQari\u003C/span\u003E safarkiisa. Jidhku wuu ka baxaa muuqaalka, guujyadu waxay u gudbaan, sidaas darteed waxaad dooran kartaa wejiyada ka dambeeya. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji\u003C/span\u003E wuu soo celiyaa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo celiyaa jidho kasta oo la qariyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQarinta waxay beddeshaa muuqaalka oo kaliya. Jidh la qariyay weli waa la dhisaa, waa la tiriyaa mugga iyo cabbiridda, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa dhoofinta STL, 3MF iyo STEP. Magacyada iyo jidhadka la qariyay waxay ku kaydsan yihiin faylka qaybta, isbeddel kastana waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-dar-jidho\"\u003EIsku dar jidho\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShift+guji wejiga jidhka \u003Cstrong\u003Ebartilmaameedka\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna wejiga jidh kasta oo \u003Cstrong\u003Eqalab\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku dar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta qaybta midig dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EHawlgalka\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHawlgal\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatiijada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku xir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBartilmaameedka iyo qalabka waxay noqdaan hal jidh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalabyada waa la gooyaa bartilmaameedka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWalaaq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOo keliya qaybta bartilmaameedka iyo qalab kasta wadaagaan ayaa la ilaaliyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka bartilmaameedka\u003C/strong\u003E waa kan ilaaliya magaciisa. Calaamadee ama ka saar calaamadda \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhadka qalabka\u003C/strong\u003E, ama isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro muuqaalka\u003C/strong\u003E oo guji wejiyadooda. \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaali jidhadka qalabka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka tegaa qalabka meesha sidoo kale (waxtar leh qaabka iyo qalabka qaabka). Haddii jidh qalab hore loo isticmaalay Isku dar, panel-ka ayaa sidaas u sheegaa halkii uu jidh kale dooran lahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"guuri-ama-nuqul-jidh\"\u003EGuuri ama nuqul jidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuuri jidhka\u003C/span\u003E. Jidhka ugu cusub waa la calaamadeeyay; calaamadee kuwa aad rabto inaad guurisid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro nooca \u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGuuri\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad dejinayso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EΔX\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EΔY\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EΔZ\u003C/strong\u003E millimitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta ilaa barta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa\u003C/strong\u003E: guji meel u dhow dhamaadka xarafka, astaamaha barta, ama meel wejiga ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji dhidib ku wareegsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhidib\u003C/strong\u003E (X, Y, Z, astaamaha dhidibka, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E: xarafka toosan, goobada ama silindarka) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EXagal (°)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIswaafajiso wejiga wejiga ama diyaarad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWejiga la guurayo\u003C/strong\u003E (wejiga siman ee jidhka), \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dhufo\u003C/strong\u003E (wejiga siman ama diyaarad)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIswaafajinta waxay jidhka wareejinaysaa si wejigiisu ugu jiifo wejiga kale, wejig ilaa wejig, kadibna waxay ku siibaysaa oo keliya jihada wejigaas. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku jihada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u wareejiyaa si ka soo horjeeda. \u003Cstrong\u003ENuqul\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa asalka oo wuxuu ku daraa nuqulka la guuray jidh cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miisaan-jidh\"\u003EMiisaan jidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiisaan jidhka\u003C/span\u003E, oo calaamadee jidhadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan\u003C/strong\u003E, ama ka saar \u003Cstrong\u003ESiman\u003C/strong\u003E oo qor \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan X\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan Y\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan Z\u003C/strong\u003E (dhidibbada adduunka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu wareegsan\u003C/strong\u003E waa barta ku jirta meeshay: dhexda sanduuqa jidhadka, ama barta aad dooratid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiisaanka siman waa sax. Miisaanka aan siman wuxuu wareegyada ka dhigaa goobo: silindar wuxuu noqdaa silindar ellipse ah, oo uusan surface analytic ah hayn, sidaas darteed wejiyada wareegsan waxay noqdaan wejiyo B-spline oo ku dhow 0.0000004 mm dhabta; wejiyada siman iyo xarafyada toosan waxay ku sii jiraan sax. Panel-ku wuxuu sheegaa wixii dhacay. Qiyaasaha miisaanka waa in ka weyn eber (ku dhufo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuraayad\u003C/span\u003E halkii).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuqul-ka-samee-jid\"\u003ENuqul ka samee jid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro astaamaha la koobiyeynayo taariikhda, ama ha wax dooran si aad u nuqusho jidhka ugu cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaab jid\u003C/span\u003E. Sawirka ugu cusub ee aan la isticmaalin ayaa loo qaadaa jid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta qaybta midig deji:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameysa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENuqul\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidhadka (nuqul kasta oo jidh cusub) ama Astaamaha (lagu xidhay ama lagu goyay sida asalka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJid\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadee sawirrada, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro geesaha moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E; qaybaha waa inay isku xidhmaan dhamaad ilaa dhamaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETirada\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWadarta oo dhan, oo ay ku jiro asalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFogaanta\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiman (si siman oo jidka furan dhamaadkiisa ilaa, ama dhammaan wareegga jidka xidhan) ama masaafo la dejiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJihaynta\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERaac jidka (nuqul kasta wuu u wareegaa) ama Go&#039;an (nuqullada way is barbar joogaan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJihada rogaysa\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU socod jidka dhinac kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqullada waxay bilaabaan meesha jidka uu asalka ugu dhow yahay, waxaana loo fogeeyaa dhererka dhinaca curve-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka toosan iyo kan wareegsan waxay sidoo kale nuqul ka samayn karaan jidhadka: calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003ENuqul jidhadka\u003C/strong\u003E panel-kooda oo dooro jidhadka; nuqul kasta waa jidh cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadyo\"\u003EXaddidaadyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJidhadku waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah; mesh kernel wuxuu ilaaliyaa hal jidh kaliya wuxuuna sheegaa taas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiisaan aan siman wuxuu wejiyada wareegsan ka dhigaa B-spline ku dhow (eeg sare), ma aha silindar ama koon sax ah; wejiyada offset-ka lama miisaami karo habkaas weli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaacida jidka curve 3D oo wareeg ah wuxuu nuqulka u qaadaa iyada oo aan la wareegin; jidadka siman, wareegu waa sax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku dar wuxuu shaqeeyaa oo keliya jidhadka adag. Jidhadka dusha waxaa lagu isku xiraa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStitch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/reference-geometry\" data-topic=\"partcraft/reference-geometry\"\u003EDhismaha, dhidibada iyo barta\u003C/a\u003E barta iyo diyaarada &quot;dhexdooda ah&quot;, iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/patterns-mirror\" data-topic=\"partcraft/patterns-mirror\"\u003EAstaamaha qaabka iyo muraayada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Weli lama dhisin nooca hadda. Shaqada jidho badan waxay u baahan tahay kernel joogto ah oo juhdi sax ah, taas oo nooca PartCraft-kan aan lahayn: wuxuu dhisaa qayb kasta isticmaalaa mesh kernel. Waxa weli lama dhisin wuxuu sharaxayaa waxa lagu samayn karo halkii. Qaybta kale ee bogga waxay sharaxaysaa sida ay u shaqaynayso kernel sax ah. Qayb wuxuu leeyahay in ka badan hal jidh. Jidh kasta oo kala go'an waa jidh. Astaamaha badankoodu waxay ku daraan ama ka goyaan jidh kasta oo ay taabanayaan; qalabyada bogga kanu waxay ka shaqeeyaan jidho oo buuxa oo aad dooratid. Waxay ku yaalaan menu-ga Wax dheeraad ah ee kooxda Astaamaha: Isku dar, Guuri jidhka, Miisaan jidhka iyo Qaab jid. Dhammaantood waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah (OpenCascade). Samee jidh kala go'an Deji Hawlgalka ee extrude ama revolve ee qaybtiisa midig oo dooro Jidh cusub (sweep iyo loft ayaa leh sidaas oo kale). Jidhka cusub wuxuu ka go'an yahay xitaa meesha uu ku walaaqo kuwa kale. Isgoyn wuxuu ilaaliyaa oo keliya walaaqa qaabka cusub iyo waxa jira. Jidhadu waxay ku magacaabmaan astaanta ka bilowday: \"Extrude2\". Nuqulka waxaa lagu magacaabaa asalkiisa iyo astaanta nuqulka sameysay: \"Extrude2, nuqul 1 oo ka mid ah Move1\". Magacyadu way joogaan markaad cabbirrada hore u beddesho, sidaas darteed astaamaha isticmaala jidhka way helaan. Haddii laba jidh ama ka badan jiraan, qaybta qaybta (guji meel bannaan) waxay liistaa iyaga iyo mugooyinkooda. Magac u bedel ama qari jidh Guji meel bannaan muuqaalka si aad u aragto qaybta. Liiska jidhadka (oo muuqda marka qaybtu leedahay laba jidh ama ka badan) wuxuu safar kasta leeyahay sanduuq magac iyo badhanka Qari. Magac u bedel: qor magac cusub sanduuqa oo riix Enter ama guji meel kale. Dhammaan panel-ka markaas ayaa isticmaala: Isku dar, Guuri jidhka, qaababka. Sanduuqa nadiifi si aad ugu noqoto magaca astaanta sameysay. Qari: guji Qari safarkiisa. Jidhku wuu ka baxaa muuqaalka, guujyadu waxay u gudbaan, sidaas darteed waxaad dooran kartaa wejiyada ka dambeeya. Muuji wuu soo celiyaa; Muuji dhammaan wuxuu soo celiyaa jidho kasta oo la qariyay. Qarinta waxay beddeshaa muuqaalka oo kaliya. Jidh la qariyay weli waa la dhisaa, waa la tiriyaa mugga iyo cabbiridda, waxaana lagu kaydiyaa dhoofinta STL, 3MF iyo STEP. Magacyada iyo jidhadka la qariyay waxay ku kaydsan yihiin faylka qaybta, isbeddel kastana waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo ah. Isku dar jidho Shift+guji wejiga jidhka bartilmaameedka, kadibna wejiga jidh kasta oo qalab. Dooro Wax dheeraad ah, kadibna Isku dar. Hoosta qaybta midig dooro Hawlgalka: Hawlgal Natiijada Isku xir Bartilmaameedka iyo qalabka waxay noqdaan hal jidh Goo Qalabyada waa la gooyaa bartilmaameedka Walaaq Oo keliya qaybta bartilmaameedka iyo qalab kasta wadaagaan ayaa la ilaaliyaa Jidhka bartilmaameedka waa kan ilaaliya magaciisa. Calaamadee ama ka saar calaamadda Jidhadka qalabka, ama isticmaal Dooro muuqaalka oo guji wejiyadooda. Ilaali jidhadka qalabka wuxuu ka tegaa qalabka meesha sidoo kale (waxtar leh qaabka iyo qalabka qaabka). Haddii jidh qalab hore loo isticmaalay Isku dar, panel-ka ayaa sidaas u sheegaa halkii uu jidh kale dooran lahaa. Guuri ama nuqul jidh Dooro Wax dheeraad ah, kadibna Guuri jidhka. Jidhka ugu cusub waa la calaamadeeyay; calaamadee kuwa aad rabto inaad guurisid. Dooro nooca Guuri: Guuri Waxa aad dejinayso Wareeji ΔX, ΔY, ΔZ millimitir Barta ilaa barta Laga bilaabo iyo Ilaa: guji meel u dhow dhamaadka xarafka, astaamaha barta, ama meel wejiga ah Wareeji dhidib ku wareegsan Dhidib (X, Y, Z, astaamaha dhidibka, ama Dooro: xarafka toosan, goobada ama silindarka) iyo Xagal (°) Iswaafajiso wejiga wejiga ama diyaarad Wejiga la guurayo (wejiga siman ee jidhka), Ku dhufo (wejiga siman ama diyaarad) Iswaafajinta waxay jidhka wareejinaysaa si wejigiisu ugu jiifo wejiga kale, wejig ilaa wejig, kadibna waxay ku siibaysaa oo keliya jihada wejigaas. Isku jihada wuxuu u wareejiyaa si ka soo horjeeda. Nuqul wuxuu ilaaliyaa asalka oo wuxuu ku daraa nuqulka la guuray jidh cusub. Miisaan jidh Dooro Wax dheeraad ah, kadibna Miisaan jidhka, oo calaamadee jidhadka. Qor Miisaan, ama ka saar Siman oo qor Miisaan X, Miisaan Y iyo Miisaan Z (dhidibbada adduunka). Ku wareegsan waa barta ku jirta meeshay: dhexda sanduuqa jidhadka, ama barta aad dooratid. Miisaanka siman waa sax. Miisaanka aan siman wuxuu wareegyada ka dhigaa goobo: silindar wuxuu noqdaa silindar ellipse ah, oo uusan surface analytic ah hayn, sidaas darteed wejiyada wareegsan waxay noqdaan wejiyo B-spline oo ku dhow 0.0000004 mm dhabta; wejiyada siman iyo xarafyada toosan waxay ku sii jiraan sax. Panel-ku wuxuu sheegaa wixii dhacay. Qiyaasaha miisaanka waa in ka weyn eber (ku dhufo Muraayad halkii). Nuqul ka samee jid Dooro astaamaha la koobiyeynayo taariikhda, ama ha wax dooran si aad u nuqusho jidhka ugu cusub. Dooro Wax dheeraad ah, kadibna Qaab jid. Sawirka ugu cusub ee aan la isticmaalin ayaa loo qaadaa jid. Hoosta qaybta midig deji: Dejinta Waxa ay sameysa Nuqul Jidhadka (nuqul kasta oo jidh cusub) ama Astaamaha (lagu xidhay ama lagu goyay sida asalka) Jid Calaamadee sawirrada, ama Dooro geesaha moodeelka; qaybaha waa inay isku xidhmaan dhamaad ilaa dhamaad Tirada Wadarta oo dhan, oo ay ku jiro asalka Fogaanta Siman (si siman oo jidka furan dhamaadkiisa ilaa, ama dhammaan wareegga jidka xidhan) ama masaafo la dejiyay Jihaynta Raac jidka (nuqul kasta wuu u wareegaa) ama Go'an (nuqullada way is barbar joogaan) Jihada rogaysa U socod jidka dhinac kale Nuqullada waxay bilaabaan meesha jidka uu asalka ugu dhow yahay, waxaana loo fogeeyaa dhererka dhinaca curve-ka. Qaabka toosan iyo kan wareegsan waxay sidoo kale nuqul ka samayn karaan jidhadka: calaamadee Nuqul jidhadka panel-kooda oo dooro jidhadka; nuqul kasta waa jidh cusub. Xaddidaadyo Jidhadku waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah; mesh kernel wuxuu ilaaliyaa hal jidh kaliya wuxuuna sheegaa taas. Miisaan aan siman wuxuu wejiyada wareegsan ka dhigaa B-spline ku dhow (eeg sare), ma aha silindar ama koon sax ah; wejiyada offset-ka lama miisaami karo habkaas weli. Raacida jidka curve 3D oo wareeg ah wuxuu nuqulka u qaadaa iyada oo aan la wareegin; jidadka siman, wareegu waa sax. Isku dar wuxuu shaqeeyaa oo keliya jidhadka adag. Jidhadka dusha waxaa lagu isku xiraa Stitch. Eeg sidoo kale Dhismaha, dhidibada iyo barta barta iyo diyaarada \"dhexdooda ah\", iyo Astaamaha qaabka iyo muraayada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"tolerance-stackup","scope":"partcraft","title":"Isu-dhiska tolerance-ka","summary":"Dooro silsilad wejiyo ah oo ka mid ah qaybaha isku-dhiska, oo arag inta ay farqiga ku dhamaadka silsiladda u kala duwanaan karto, worst case iyo RSS, iyadoo cabbirrada ugu muhiimsan ay kowaad ku taal.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["isu-dhiska tolerance-ka","stackup","falanqaynta tolerance-ka","silsiladda tolerance-ka","silsiladda cabbirka","loop","farqiga","cidhiidhi","worst case","rss","root sum square","tolerance-ka tirakoobka","contributors","sensitivity","gd&t","general tolerance","iso 2768"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-silsiladda","text":"Dooro silsiladda","level":2},{"id":"ku-sii-tolerance-ka-xidhiid-kasta","text":"Ku sii tolerance-ka xidhiid kasta","level":2},{"id":"akhri-natiijooyinka","text":"Akhri natiijooyinka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStack-up\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isku daraa cabbirrada silsiladda ka dhex-marta qaybo badan si uu u arko inta ay farqiga — badanaa gap — u kala duwanaan karto marka qayb kasta la sameeyo meel kasta oo gudaha tolerance-keeda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-silsiladda\"\u003EDooro silsiladda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur isku-dhis oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStack-up\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Assembly. Kaar ayaa furmaya aragtida dushiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa silsiladdu \u003Cstrong\u003Elagu\u003C/strong\u003E cabbiro: X, Y ama Z ee isku-dhiska, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe first face&#039;s normal\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick the chain\u003C/span\u003E oo guji wejiyada silsiladdu ka dhex-marto, \u003Cstrong\u003Esi tartiib ah\u003C/strong\u003E: ka bilow hal dhinac oo farqiga ah, dhex mari qaybaha, oo ku dhamaad dhinaca kale ee farqiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E ama Enter. Backspace wuxuu dib u qaadaa gujinta ugu dambeysa; Esc waa joojiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba guji oo isla qayb ah ayaa dhigaya cabbirka qaybtaas (masaafadeeda silsiladda). Guji qayb kale wuxuu sameeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Einterface\u003C/strong\u003E u dhexeeya qaybaha, meesha ay kulmaan; ma laha tolerance haddii aadan qorin mid. Xidhiidhadu waxay ku daraan ama ka jaraan siday silsiladdu u socoto, waxayna xidhaan loop-ka: nominal gap waa waxa moodeelku tusayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a link\u003C/span\u003E gacanta, oo qortid nominal-kiisa, tolerance-kiisa, iyo inuu ku dareeyo (+) ama ka jaro (−).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-sii-tolerance-ka-xidhiid-kasta\"\u003EKu sii tolerance-ka xidhiid kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXidhiid kasta waxaa leh \u003Cstrong\u003Eupper\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Elower\u003C/strong\u003E deviation (tusaale +0.1 iyo −0.05). \u003Cstrong\u003ETolerance laga helo\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa iyaga qaybta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeneral tolerance\u003C/strong\u003E: goobta title block-ka ee qaybta Tolerance (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003EDrawing to PDF\u003C/a\u003E), markay akhrinayso ±0.1, +0.2/-0.1 ama ISO 2768-f, -m, -c ama -v (ISO 2768-1 tolerances-ka toosan, sida cabbirka xidhiidhka). General tolerance-ka qaybta ayaa si degdeg ah loo isticmaalaa markii silsiladda la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGD&amp;T\u003C/strong\u003E: wax kasta oo feature control frame ah oo ku yaal sawirka qaybta. Goobaha Position, profile iyo runout waxay bixiyaan ± nus tolerance-ka. Tolerance-ka orientation ama form wuxuu badanaa ku jiraa tolerance-ka cabbirka hore: ku dar kaliya meesha silsiladdu ay kulanto wejiga la xakameeyay. Ⓜ ama Ⓛ ka dib, goobta waxaa loo qaadaa cabbirkeeda la sheegay; tolerance-ka bonus-ka lama tirinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETyped\u003C/strong\u003E: lambarada aad qortid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-natiijooyinka\"\u003EAkhri natiijooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGap, nominal\u003C/strong\u003E iyo, marka tolerances-ku kala duwan yihiin, \u003Cstrong\u003EGap, mean\u003C/strong\u003E — +0.2/−0 iyo +0/−0.1 waxay dhaqaajiyaan dhexda kala duwanaanshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWorst case\u003C/strong\u003E: dhammaan tolerances ay isku mar gaadhaan xaddigooda. Farqiga weligiis kama bixi karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERSS\u003C/strong\u003E (root sum square): tolerance kasta waxaa loo qaadaa sida saddex deviation oo caadi ah oo ka mid ah faafid caadi ah, waxaana lagu daraa sida isku xidhka fargadaadka ee wadarta. Inta badan isku-dhisyada waxay ku jiraan worst case-ka; tani waa qiyaasta caadiga ah qaybaha la sameeyo tiro badan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBixi \u003Cstrong\u003EGap at least\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EGap at most\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u aragto in worst case-ku had iyo jeer ku jiro xaddiga, iyo inta isku-dhis ee milyan ka mid ah RSS uu filayo inay ka baxaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiirka \u003Cstrong\u003E#\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu u kala saaraa xidhiidhada iyadoo la eegayo \u003Cstrong\u003Eshare\u003C/strong\u003E-kooda RSS: adkee kuwa hore si aad u sameysid farqiga ugu weyn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa xidhiidhada, qaybahooda iyo natiijooyinka. Stack-ups-ka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhiska, isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStack-up waa hal jihooyin. Ma raacayo xagal ama leexasho silsiladda, mana akhrinayo tolerances-ka cabbirka ee sketches-ka: ku qor kuwaas sida typed tolerances ama title block-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Stack-up wuxuu isku daraa cabbirrada silsiladda ka dhex-marta qaybo badan si uu u arko inta ay farqiga — badanaa gap — u kala duwanaan karto marka qayb kasta la sameeyo meel kasta oo gudaha tolerance-keeda ah. Dooro silsiladda Fur isku-dhis oo dooro Stack-up kooxda Assembly. Kaar ayaa furmaya aragtida dushiisa. Dooro waxa silsiladdu lagu cabbiro: X, Y ama Z ee isku-dhiska, ama The first face's normal. Riix Pick the chain oo guji wejiyada silsiladdu ka dhex-marto, si tartiib ah: ka bilow hal dhinac oo farqiga ah, dhex mari qaybaha, oo ku dhamaad dhinaca kale ee farqiga. Riix Done ama Enter. Backspace wuxuu dib u qaadaa gujinta ugu dambeysa; Esc waa joojiyaa. Laba guji oo isla qayb ah ayaa dhigaya cabbirka qaybtaas (masaafadeeda silsiladda). Guji qayb kale wuxuu sameeyaa interface u dhexeeya qaybaha, meesha ay kulmaan; ma laha tolerance haddii aadan qorin mid. Xidhiidhadu waxay ku daraan ama ka jaraan siday silsiladdu u socoto, waxayna xidhaan loop-ka: nominal gap waa waxa moodeelku tusayo. Waxaad sidoo kale Add a link gacanta, oo qortid nominal-kiisa, tolerance-kiisa, iyo inuu ku dareeyo (+) ama ka jaro (−). Ku sii tolerance-ka xidhiid kasta Xidhiid kasta waxaa leh upper iyo lower deviation (tusaale +0.1 iyo −0.05). Tolerance laga helo wuxuu buuxiyaa iyaga qaybta: General tolerance: goobta title block-ka ee qaybta Tolerance (eeg Drawing to PDF), markay akhrinayso ±0.1, +0.2/-0.1 ama ISO 2768-f, -m, -c ama -v (ISO 2768-1 tolerances-ka toosan, sida cabbirka xidhiidhka). General tolerance-ka qaybta ayaa si degdeg ah loo isticmaalaa markii silsiladda la doortay. GD&T: wax kasta oo feature control frame ah oo ku yaal sawirka qaybta. Goobaha Position, profile iyo runout waxay bixiyaan ± nus tolerance-ka. Tolerance-ka orientation ama form wuxuu badanaa ku jiraa tolerance-ka cabbirka hore: ku dar kaliya meesha silsiladdu ay kulanto wejiga la xakameeyay. Ⓜ ama Ⓛ ka dib, goobta waxaa loo qaadaa cabbirkeeda la sheegay; tolerance-ka bonus-ka lama tirinayo. Typed: lambarada aad qortid. Akhri natiijooyinka Gap, nominal iyo, marka tolerances-ku kala duwan yihiin, Gap, mean — +0.2/−0 iyo +0/−0.1 waxay dhaqaajiyaan dhexda kala duwanaanshaha. Worst case: dhammaan tolerances ay isku mar gaadhaan xaddigooda. Farqiga weligiis kama bixi karo. RSS (root sum square): tolerance kasta waxaa loo qaadaa sida saddex deviation oo caadi ah oo ka mid ah faafid caadi ah, waxaana lagu daraa sida isku xidhka fargadaadka ee wadarta. Inta badan isku-dhisyada waxay ku jiraan worst case-ka; tani waa qiyaasta caadiga ah qaybaha la sameeyo tiro badan. Bixi Gap at least iyo Gap at most si aad u aragto in worst case-ku had iyo jeer ku jiro xaddiga, iyo inta isku-dhis ee milyan ka mid ah RSS uu filayo inay ka baxaan. Tiirka # wuxuu u kala saaraa xidhiidhada iyadoo la eegayo share-kooda RSS: adkee kuwa hore si aad u sameysid farqiga ugu weyn. Save CSV wuxuu qoraa xidhiidhada, qaybahooda iyo natiijooyinka. Stack-ups-ka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhiska, isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo Ctrl+Z. Stack-up waa hal jihooyin. Ma raacayo xagal ama leexasho silsiladda, mana akhrinayo tolerances-ka cabbirka ee sketches-ka: ku qor kuwaas sida typed tolerances ama title block-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sweep-loft-draft","scope":"partcraft","title":"Sweep, loft iyo draft","summary":"Sweep profile xirran oo ku dhaqaaqa waddo ah xariijimaha sawir-gacmeedka ama geesaha moodeelka, loft oo ku dhex mara qaybo ku yaal diyaaradaha kala duwan, iyo draft oo lagu daro wejiyada; iyo ikhtiyaarada, natiijooyinka saxda ah iyo fariimaha.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["sweep","boss sweep","goyn sweep","tuubo","waddo","loft","boss loft","qaybo isku xidhan","toosan","draft","xagal draft","wejiyada taper","diyaarada dhexe","jihada jiidista","foom"],"headings":[{"id":"sweep","text":"Sweep","level":2},{"id":"loft","text":"Loft","level":2},{"id":"waddooyinka-hagaha","text":"Waddooyinka hagaha","level":3},{"id":"draft","text":"Draft","level":2},{"id":"fariimaha","text":"Fariimaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooca hadda\u003C/strong\u003E sweep iyo loft lama dhisin: waxay u baahan yihiin kernel joomatari saxda ah, taas oo nooca PartCraft-kan aan lahayn. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan weli la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa waxa lagu sameeyo halkeeda; qaybaha Sweep iyo Loft waxay sharxayaan sida ay u shaqeeyaan kernel saxda ah. \u003Cstrong\u003EDraft wuu shaqeeyaa\u003C/strong\u003E wejiyada siman: kernel-ka mesh ayaa dhisa, natiijadana waa tan uu bixin lahaa kernel saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddexdaba waxay ku jiraan kooxda Features ee menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EKernel-ka mesh\u003C/a\u003E). Mid kasta wuxuu ku biiri karaa walxaha, wuu ka goyn karaa, ama kaliya wuxuu hayaa isku-dhafka (\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhafka\u003C/strong\u003E) ama wuxuu sameeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EJidh cusub\u003C/strong\u003E (sweep iyo loft: \u003Cstrong\u003EHawlgalka\u003C/strong\u003E ee panelka).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sweep\"\u003ESweep\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESweep wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa profile xirran waddo: tuubooyin, gacmo-qabasho, buundooyin silig, rails.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir \u003Cstrong\u003Ewaddada\u003C/strong\u003E sawir-gacmeed keli ah: xariiqyo iyo qalooc isku xidhan dhamaadka ilaa dhamaadka (ama isticmaal geesaha moodeelka, hoose).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir \u003Cstrong\u003Eprofile-ka\u003C/strong\u003E sawir-gacmeed kale oo diyaaradeeda ku gudubta mid ka mid ah dhamaadka waddada, tusaale ahaan goobo ku taal diyaarada sare bilowga waddo lagu sawiray diyaarada hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro sawir-gacmeedka profile-ka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E. Sawir-gacmeedka kale ee ugu dambeeya wuxuu noqonayaa waddada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameyso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPath\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadi sawir-gacmeedyada samaynaya waddada (dhowr sawir-gacmeed ayaa isku xidha hal waddo 3D ah); \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro geesaha moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku daraa geesaha qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOrientation\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERaac waddada (caadi), Frenet, Go&#039;an (qaybtu waxay ahaadaan barablan profile-ka), Ilaali jihada, Iyadoo la raacayo khadka hagaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEnd scale\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProfile-ku wuxuu kordhaa ama yaraadaa si toos ah ilaa cabbirkan dhamaadka (1 = joogto)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeesaha adag ee waddada waa la jaray (mitred). Goobo radius 5 ah oo lagu dhaqaajiyey xariiq 100 mm ah waa silinda oo saxan 2500π mm³; qaybta qalooca ah ee radius 50 wuxuu noqdaa rubuc torus ah oo 625π² mm³.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"loft\"\u003ELoft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELoft wuxuu isku dhafaa laba ama ka badan goyn ku yaal diyaaradaha kala duwan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir goyn kasta sawir-gacmeed keli ah (hal loop xirran mid kasta), ku yaal diyaaradaha asaasiga ah, diyaaradaha tixraaca (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/reference-geometry\" data-topic=\"partcraft/reference-geometry\"\u003EDiyaaradaha tixraaca, dhuruyada iyo barbaarta\u003C/a\u003E) ama wejiyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E. Sawir-gacmeed kasta oo hal loop ah oo aan la isticmaalin wuxuu noqonayaa goyn, taxanaha taariikhda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelku wuxuu liisteeyaa goysyada by order (\u003Cstrong\u003ESare\u003C/strong\u003E wuu dib u habeeyaa, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar\u003C/strong\u003E wuu mid tirtiraa); \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar sawir-gacmeed\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku daraa mid kale, \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro dusha\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku daraa wejig siman oo qaybta ah. \u003Cstrong\u003ERuled\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa wejiyo toosan oo u dhexeeya goysyada halkii isku-dhafka siman. Laba labajibbaaran ee dhexdooda, labaduba waa frustum isku mid ah (labajibbaaran 40 mm ah ilaa labajibbaaran 20 mm ah, 30 mm kor: saxan 28000 mm³).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoysyo leh tiro kala duwan oo geesood ah (labajibbaaran ilaa saddex-geesood) waxaa isu dhigay OpenCascade, taas oo laga yaabo inay leexiso wejiyada dhinacyada; feature-ku wuu digayaa. Goysyada tiro geesood isku mid ah ku sawir, ka bilow geesaha isku mid ah, si natiijada ugu nadiifsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"waddooyinka-hagaha\"\u003EWaddooyinka hagaha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaddooyinka hagaha waa khadadka dhinacyada loft-ka ay raacayaan goyskii ugu horreeyay ilaa kii ugu dambeeyay, bulaac, waaisto ama fidi aad naftaadu sawirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir laba ama ka badan oo waddooyin ah: khadadka furan (xariiqyo, qalooc, spline) oo ka bilaabma goyska ugu horreeya ilaa kan ugu dambeeya oo mar kasta goys kasta jaraya mar keliya. Sawir-gacmeed keli ah wuxuu hayn karaa dhowr waddo: silsilad kasta oo kala go&#039;an waa waddo keli ah. Sawir waddada si ay si dhab ah goys kasta ula kulanto: ku qabo geesaha ay sawirkeedu ku kulmaan dhibcaha goysyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka Loft, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EWaddooyinka hagaha\u003C/strong\u003E, calaamadi sawir-gacmeedyada haysta, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick model edges as rails\u003C/span\u003E oo guji geesaha qaybta (Esc wuu dhammeeyaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELoft-ka leh waddooyin waa dusha Gordon oo ka gudba goysyada iyo waddooyinka (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/gordon-surfaces\" data-topic=\"partcraft/gordon-surfaces\"\u003EDusha ka gudba shabakad khad\u003C/a\u003E), oo lagu xidhay toosan labada dhamaadka oo solid ah. Panelku wuxuu sheegayaa sida ay si dhow ugu raacayso. Goys kasta markaas waa inuu noqdaa sawir-gacmeed (dhibic ama wejig ma qaadan karo waddo), \u003Cstrong\u003ERuled\u003C/strong\u003E ma khuseeyo. Waddo ka maqan goys in ka badan 0.01 mm waa la diidaa, iyada oo farqigu la sheegayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa la hubiyay: laba goobo (20 mm iyo 10 mm oo 40 mm ka dhexeeya) oo leh afar waddo toosan waxay siiyaan mugga frustum-ka koonka ilaa 0.000002 % oo kale; qaansooyin 5 mm ka bararan waxay siiyaan barrel oo raacaya waddo kasta gudaha 0.00001 mm.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"draft\"\u003EDraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDraft wuxuu jiifsadaa wejiyada si qaybtu uga soo baxdo foomka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E (ama marka hore \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji wejiyada). Haddii aan wax la dooran, waxaad ku jirtaa habka dooridda: guji wejig kasta oo aad jiifsanayso, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EAngle (°)\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ENeutral plane\u003C/strong\u003E (meesha wejiyada ay cabbirkooda ku hayaan) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EPull direction\u003C/strong\u003E (caadi ahaan xariiqa diyaaradda dhexe).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAngle positive wuxuu wejiga ku foorarinayaa gudaha jiidista wuxuuna ka saaraa walxo; negative wuu ku daraa. Diyaaradda dhexe waxay ka bilaabataa diyaarada sare. Nooca hadda kaliya wejiyada siman ayaa la qabyeyn karaa: silinda, koon ama wejig qaab xor ah wuxuu leeyahay fariinta &quot;Draft: nooca hadda wejiyada siman oo keliya (kernel-ka mesh ayaa dhisa).&quot; Afarta dhinac ee blokh 100 × 100 × 50 ah oo la qabyeeyey 5° hoostiisa ayaa noqonaya frustum oo saxan h/3·(a² + b² + ab), iyadoo b = a − 2h·tan 5°.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fariimaha\"\u003EFariimaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Diyaarada profile-ka waa inay mari dhamaadka waddada …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaaji sawir-gacmeedka profile-ka bilowga (ama dhamaadka) waddada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Waddada waxay leedahay god: curves-keedu ma isku xidhna dhamaadka ilaa dhamaadka …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku xidh curves-ka waddada; sawir-gacmeedyada kala duwan dhamaadkoodu waa inay si sax ah isu kulmaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Goysa loft-ka wuxuu u baahan yahay hal loop xirran oo keliya&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKala qaybi sawir-gacmeedka, ama ka saar loop dheeraad ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… ma qabyeyn karo diyaaradda dhexe …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejigu waa siman yahay diyaaradda dhexe ama ma gaadho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Draft: nooca hadda wejiyada siman oo keliya (kernel-ka mesh ayaa dhisa).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiga la doortay waa qalooc. Ka saar; qabyee wejiyada siman oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeli lama dhisin: sweep-yada leexda leh, sweep-yada darbiga khafiifka ah iyo kuwa dusha, waddooyinka hagaha ee loft-ka iyo tangency-ka dhamaadka, draft-ka silinda, koonka iyo wejiyada qaabka xor ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Nooca hadda sweep iyo loft lama dhisin: waxay u baahan yihiin kernel joomatari saxda ah, taas oo nooca PartCraft-kan aan lahayn. Waxa aan weli la dhisin wuxuu sheegayaa waxa lagu sameeyo halkeeda; qaybaha Sweep iyo Loft waxay sharxayaan sida ay u shaqeeyaan kernel saxda ah. Draft wuu shaqeeyaa wejiyada siman: kernel-ka mesh ayaa dhisa, natiijadana waa tan uu bixin lahaa kernel saxda ah. Saddexdaba waxay ku jiraan kooxda Features ee menu-ga More (eeg Kernel-ka mesh). Mid kasta wuxuu ku biiri karaa walxaha, wuu ka goyn karaa, ama kaliya wuxuu hayaa isku-dhafka (Isku-dhafka) ama wuxuu sameeyaa Jidh cusub (sweep iyo loft: Hawlgalka ee panelka). Sweep Sweep wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa profile xirran waddo: tuubooyin, gacmo-qabasho, buundooyin silig, rails. Sawir waddada sawir-gacmeed keli ah: xariiqyo iyo qalooc isku xidhan dhamaadka ilaa dhamaadka (ama isticmaal geesaha moodeelka, hoose). Sawir profile-ka sawir-gacmeed kale oo diyaaradeeda ku gudubta mid ka mid ah dhamaadka waddada, tusaale ahaan goobo ku taal diyaarada sare bilowga waddo lagu sawiray diyaarada hore. Dooro sawir-gacmeedka profile-ka oo dooro More, kadibna Sweep. Sawir-gacmeedka kale ee ugu dambeeya wuxuu noqonayaa waddada. Panelka: Dejinta Waxa ay sameyso Path Calaamadi sawir-gacmeedyada samaynaya waddada (dhowr sawir-gacmeed ayaa isku xidha hal waddo 3D ah); Dooro geesaha moodeelka wuxuu ku daraa geesaha qaybta Orientation Raac waddada (caadi), Frenet, Go'an (qaybtu waxay ahaadaan barablan profile-ka), Ilaali jihada, Iyadoo la raacayo khadka hagaha End scale Profile-ku wuxuu kordhaa ama yaraadaa si toos ah ilaa cabbirkan dhamaadka (1 = joogto) Geesaha adag ee waddada waa la jaray (mitred). Goobo radius 5 ah oo lagu dhaqaajiyey xariiq 100 mm ah waa silinda oo saxan 2500π mm³; qaybta qalooca ah ee radius 50 wuxuu noqdaa rubuc torus ah oo 625π² mm³. Loft Loft wuxuu isku dhafaa laba ama ka badan goyn ku yaal diyaaradaha kala duwan. Sawir goyn kasta sawir-gacmeed keli ah (hal loop xirran mid kasta), ku yaal diyaaradaha asaasiga ah, diyaaradaha tixraaca (eeg Diyaaradaha tixraaca, dhuruyada iyo barbaarta) ama wejiyada. Dooro More, kadibna Loft. Sawir-gacmeed kasta oo hal loop ah oo aan la isticmaalin wuxuu noqonayaa goyn, taxanaha taariikhda. Panelku wuxuu liisteeyaa goysyada by order (Sare wuu dib u habeeyaa, Ka saar wuu mid tirtiraa); Ku dar sawir-gacmeed wuxuu ku daraa mid kale, Dooro dusha wuxuu ku daraa wejig siman oo qaybta ah. Ruled wuxuu sameeyaa wejiyo toosan oo u dhexeeya goysyada halkii isku-dhafka siman. Laba labajibbaaran ee dhexdooda, labaduba waa frustum isku mid ah (labajibbaaran 40 mm ah ilaa labajibbaaran 20 mm ah, 30 mm kor: saxan 28000 mm³). Goysyo leh tiro kala duwan oo geesood ah (labajibbaaran ilaa saddex-geesood) waxaa isu dhigay OpenCascade, taas oo laga yaabo inay leexiso wejiyada dhinacyada; feature-ku wuu digayaa. Goysyada tiro geesood isku mid ah ku sawir, ka bilow geesaha isku mid ah, si natiijada ugu nadiifsan. Waddooyinka hagaha Waddooyinka hagaha waa khadadka dhinacyada loft-ka ay raacayaan goyskii ugu horreeyay ilaa kii ugu dambeeyay, bulaac, waaisto ama fidi aad naftaadu sawirto. Sawir laba ama ka badan oo waddooyin ah: khadadka furan (xariiqyo, qalooc, spline) oo ka bilaabma goyska ugu horreeya ilaa kan ugu dambeeya oo mar kasta goys kasta jaraya mar keliya. Sawir-gacmeed keli ah wuxuu hayn karaa dhowr waddo: silsilad kasta oo kala go'an waa waddo keli ah. Sawir waddada si ay si dhab ah goys kasta ula kulanto: ku qabo geesaha ay sawirkeedu ku kulmaan dhibcaha goysyada. Panelka Loft, hoosta Waddooyinka hagaha, calaamadi sawir-gacmeedyada haysta, ama guji Pick model edges as rails oo guji geesaha qaybta (Esc wuu dhammeeyaa). Loft-ka leh waddooyin waa dusha Gordon oo ka gudba goysyada iyo waddooyinka (eeg Dusha ka gudba shabakad khad), oo lagu xidhay toosan labada dhamaadka oo solid ah. Panelku wuxuu sheegayaa sida ay si dhow ugu raacayso. Goys kasta markaas waa inuu noqdaa sawir-gacmeed (dhibic ama wejig ma qaadan karo waddo), Ruled ma khuseeyo. Waddo ka maqan goys in ka badan 0.01 mm waa la diidaa, iyada oo farqigu la sheegayo. Waa la hubiyay: laba goobo (20 mm iyo 10 mm oo 40 mm ka dhexeeya) oo leh afar waddo toosan waxay siiyaan mugga frustum-ka koonka ilaa 0.000002 % oo kale; qaansooyin 5 mm ka bararan waxay siiyaan barrel oo raacaya waddo kasta gudaha 0.00001 mm. Draft Draft wuxuu jiifsadaa wejiyada si qaybtu uga soo baxdo foomka. Dooro More, kadibna Draft (ama marka hore Shift+guji wejiyada). Haddii aan wax la dooran, waxaad ku jirtaa habka dooridda: guji wejig kasta oo aad jiifsanayso, kadibna Done. Deji Angle (°), Neutral plane (meesha wejiyada ay cabbirkooda ku hayaan) iyo Pull direction (caadi ahaan xariiqa diyaaradda dhexe). Angle positive wuxuu wejiga ku foorarinayaa gudaha jiidista wuxuuna ka saaraa walxo; negative wuu ku daraa. Diyaaradda dhexe waxay ka bilaabataa diyaarada sare. Nooca hadda kaliya wejiyada siman ayaa la qabyeyn karaa: silinda, koon ama wejig qaab xor ah wuxuu leeyahay fariinta \"Draft: nooca hadda wejiyada siman oo keliya (kernel-ka mesh ayaa dhisa).\" Afarta dhinac ee blokh 100 × 100 × 50 ah oo la qabyeeyey 5° hoostiisa ayaa noqonaya frustum oo saxan h/3·(a² + b² + ab), iyadoo b = a − 2h·tan 5°. Fariimaha Fariinta Waxa la sameeyo \"Diyaarada profile-ka waa inay mari dhamaadka waddada …\" Dhaqaaji sawir-gacmeedka profile-ka bilowga (ama dhamaadka) waddada \"Waddada waxay leedahay god: curves-keedu ma isku xidhna dhamaadka ilaa dhamaadka …\" Isku xidh curves-ka waddada; sawir-gacmeedyada kala duwan dhamaadkoodu waa inay si sax ah isu kulmaan \"Goysa loft-ka wuxuu u baahan yahay hal loop xirran oo keliya\" Kala qaybi sawir-gacmeedka, ama ka saar loop dheeraad ah \"… ma qabyeyn karo diyaaradda dhexe …\" Wejigu waa siman yahay diyaaradda dhexe ama ma gaadho \"Draft: nooca hadda wejiyada siman oo keliya (kernel-ka mesh ayaa dhisa).\" Wejiga la doortay waa qalooc. Ka saar; qabyee wejiyada siman oo keliya Weli lama dhisin: sweep-yada leexda leh, sweep-yada darbiga khafiifka ah iyo kuwa dusha, waddooyinka hagaha ee loft-ka iyo tangency-ka dhamaadka, draft-ka silinda, koonka iyo wejiyada qaabka xor ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"fillet-chamfer-shell","scope":"partcraft","title":"Wareeg, bevel iyo god-god oo leh Fillet, Chamfer iyo Shell","summary":"Dooro geesaha oo ku dar fillet-yo radius joogto ah ama radius-ka kala duwan, iyo chamfer-yo masaafo siman, laba masaafo ama masaafo-xagal ah; qaybta ku god sameey Shell adigoo dooranaya wejiyada la furayo, beddel geesaha ama wejiyada uu feature-ku isticmaalo, oo hagaaji waxyaabaha caadiga ah ee fashilma.","section":"tasks","order":85,"keywords":["fillet","wareeg","blend","chamfer","bevel","shell","god","darbi","wejiyada","geesaha","dooro geesaha","shift click","wejig furan","kernel saxda ah","mesh kernel","lama dhisin"],"headings":[{"id":"fillet-ama-chamfer-geesaha","text":"Fillet ama chamfer geesaha","level":2},{"id":"marka-hore-geesaha-dooro","text":"Marka hore geesaha dooro","level":3},{"id":"ama-marka-hore-feature-ka-ku-dar","text":"Ama marka hore feature-ka ku dar","level":3},{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":3},{"id":"radius-kala-duwan-iyo-noocyada-chamfer","text":"Radius kala duwan iyo noocyada chamfer","level":3},{"id":"shell-qaybta","text":"Shell qaybta","level":2},{"id":"dalabka-ayaa-muhiim-ah","text":"Dalabka ayaa muhiim ah","level":2},{"id":"marka-fashilmo","text":"Marka fashilmo","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadyada","text":"Xaddidaadyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooca hadda\u003C/strong\u003E PartCraft wuxuu fillet-yada iyo chamfer-yada ku dhisaa mesh kernel-ka, kaliya \u003Cstrong\u003Egeesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejood oo toosan\u003C/strong\u003E: geesaha sanduuqa iyo geesaha toosan ee extrudes iyo cuts, geesaha dibadda ama gudaha (geesta gudaha waxay agab ku daraysaa). Geesaha wareegsan sida geesaha god-ka, iyo radius-ka oo ku beddelma geesta, weli lama dhisin. Halka laba geesood oo wareegsan ay kulmaan geesta, wareegyada waa la gees-jarayaa (waxay kulmaan dhab siman oo kalsoon), ma aha la isku daro. \u003Cstrong\u003EShell\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale shaqeeyaa, waxaa dhisa mesh kernel-ka: wuxuu furaa wejiyada toosan oo keliya, shell-yada oo leh qaro kala duwan oo darbiyada ah weli lama dhisin, waxayna gaabisaa qaybaha leh wejiyo wareegsan badan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geesaha wareejiyaa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bevel sameeyaa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaybta god-geeyaa. Saddexdaba waxay ku shaqeeyaan geesaha iyo wejiyada jidhka, waxaana dhisa mesh kernel-ka. Wareegyadooda waa faceted sida wejiyada wareegsan oo dhan (\u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa go&#039;aaminaya inta ay fiican tahay); wejiyada wareegsan waa silinder aad dooran karto oo cabbiri karto (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel-ka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fillet-ama-chamfer-geesaha\"\u003EFillet ama chamfer geesaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"marka-hore-geesaha-dooro\"\u003EMarka hore geesaha dooro\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesta qaybta. Geesta oo dhan ayaa iftiimaa, panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EEdge\u003C/strong\u003E: nooceeda (Straight, Circle ama arc, Curve), dhererka iyo wejiyada ay u dhexeeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad geesaha dheeraad ah u dartid, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji. Mid kasta waa la calaamadeeyaa; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji geesta calaamadeysan si aad uga saarto. Madaxa panelku wuu tiriyaa (&quot;4 edges&quot;), statusbar-kuna wuxuu tidhi &quot;4 edges picked. Fillet or Chamfer rounds them; Shift+click picks more, Esc clears.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka, ama badhamada isla markaana panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFeature-ka waxaa lagu daraa dhammaan geesaha la doortay: wareeg 2 mm ah, ama chamfer 1 mm ah. Statusbar-ku wuxuu tidhi, tusaale ahaan, &quot;Fillet1 added (4 edges). Change its size on the right; Pick edges changes which.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ama-marka-hore-feature-ka-ku-dar\"\u003EAma marka hore feature-ka ku dar\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIyada oo aan wax la doorannin, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPartCraft wuxuu galaa xaalada dooranta: madaxa panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Fillet1: picking&quot;, qaybtu waxay u muuqataa sidii ay ahayd ka hor fillet-ka (panelku taas ayuu sheegaa), toolbar-kuna wuxuu tusaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaystir\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesta kasta si aad u daartid; mar kale guji si aad uga saarto. Statusbar-ku wuu tiriyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaystir\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E panelka), ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFillet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERadius (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, caadi 2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDistance (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E oo ka fogaansho geesta labada wejig, caadi 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEdges\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImmisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImmisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska hoose wuxuu magacaabaa geesta kasta iyada oo loo eego labada wejig ee ay isku xirto, sida &quot;Edge 1: Extrude1 end face × Extrude1 side&quot;. \u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu mid ka saaraa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro geesaha\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa xaalada dooranta. Laba-jeer guji feature-ka taariikhda wuxuu sameeyaa isla sidaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeesaha waxaa lagu xusaa labada wejig ee ay isku xirto, sidaas darteed way ku sii jiraan geesta saxda ah markaad beddesho cabbir hore taariikhda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"radius-kala-duwan-iyo-noocyada-chamfer\"\u003ERadius kala duwan iyo noocyada chamfer\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVariable radius\u003C/strong\u003E (fillet): weli lama dhisin nooca hadda (&quot;A fillet whose radius changes along the edge: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel). Give it one radius.&quot;). Kernel saxda ah leh: calaamadee oo deji \u003Cstrong\u003EEnd radius (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E. Radius-ku wuxuu si toosan u beddelmaa \u003Cstrong\u003ERadius\u003C/strong\u003E hal dhamaadka geesta ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003EEnd radius\u003C/strong\u003E dhamaadka kale; \u003Cstrong\u003ESwap the ends\u003C/strong\u003E wuu rogaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E (chamfer): \u003Cstrong\u003EEqual distance\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ETwo distances\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Cstrong\u003ESecond distance\u003C/strong\u003E wejiga kale) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDistance and angle\u003C/strong\u003E (masaafada hal wejig, bevel-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EAngle (°)\u003C/strong\u003E wejigaas). \u003Cstrong\u003EFlip sides\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu masaafada koowaad saaraa wejiga kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shell-qaybta\"\u003EShell qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wejiga toosan ee la furayo, tusaale ahaan sare ee sanduuq. Ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji wejigyo dhowr ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell, wejigan oo furan\u003C/span\u003E panelka wejigga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybtu waxay noqotaa darbi 2 mm ah oo wejiyada la doortay ay furan yihiin. Dejinta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWall (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhumucda darbiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalls grow outward (the faces stay inside)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadeysan: darbiyada dibadda ayay ku daraan, sidaas darteed gudaha cabbirka qaybta ayuu hayaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff: darbiyadu gudaha ayay u galaan, dibadduna cabbirkeeda ayay hayaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOpen faces\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImmisa wejig ayaa la saaray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudaha, darbiyadu waa dhumucda darbiga oo saxan: geesaha dibadda ee joogtada ahi way sharaxaaddaan, geesaha gudaha ayaa wareegsan (radius = darbiga), godka qaybta dhex mara wuxuu helaa tuubo darbi ah. Dibadda, darbiyadu waxay ku daraan dibadda dusha asalka ah, kaas oo noqda godka, geesaha dibadda ayaa wareegsan. Wejiyada gudaha waxaa loo magacaabaa wejigyada ay ka soo jeediyeen, sidaas darteed waad dooran kartaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWejiyada wareegsan lama furi karo: haddii la doorto mid wareegsan, waxa la sheegaa &quot;Shell: in this version it opens flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).&quot; Shell-ka qaybaha leh wejiyo wareegsan badan wuu gaabiyaa (dhowr ilbiriqsi kun kasta oo saddex-geesood): isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E qaro weyn inta aad naqshadeynayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro wejiyada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa wejiyada furan, si la mid ah geesaha la doortay. Liiska wuxuu magacaabaa mid kasta, tusaale ahaan &quot;Face 1: Extrude1 end face&quot;. Shell aan wejig furan lahayn lama oggolaan karo: &quot;Pick the faces to remove (open), then shell.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dalabka-ayaa-muhiim-ah\"\u003EDalabka ayaa muhiim ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFeatures-ka waxay u dhismaan sare ilaa hoos. Fillet ka hor shell waxaa lagu shell-gaa qaybta, sidaas darteed dhinaca gudaha sidoo kale wuxuu helaa geesaha wareegsan. Fillet ka dib shell wuxuu wareejiyaa kaliya geesaha aad doorato. Features-ka u dhaqaaji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKor u dhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoos u dhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/edit-history\" data-topic=\"partcraft/edit-history\"\u003EBeddel qaybta taariikhdeeda\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPatterns iyo mirrors ma koobiyeyn karaan fillet, chamfer ama shell: &quot;Fillet1 changes the body&#039;s edges or walls; it cannot be copied. Copy the features that make solids (extrudes, revolves, holes, imports).&quot; Marka hore pattern-garee godadka ama goyaha, kadibna fillet-garee dhammaan geesaha nuqullada hal fillet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-fashilmo\"\u003EMarka fashilmo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;A 5 mm round does not fit here (it is too big for a face next to one of the edges, or the edges meet in a corner the kernel cannot blend).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal radius ka yar, ama fillet geesaha yar mar; dhowr feature oo fillet ah, kan ugu yar dambe\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;An edge it rounds is gone: the edge between Extrude1 and Cut2.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsbeddel hore ayaa geesta saartay. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro geesaha\u003C/span\u003E, ka saar geesta casaan oo dooro mid cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The shell could not be made with this thickness (…).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbiga ayaa ka qaro weyn qayb yar oo moodelka ah, ama radius-ka fillet-ka. Darbiga ka dhig mid yar, ama fillet-yada ka weyn darbiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;That face has no name the history can follow; pick another.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro wejig feature sameeyay (inta badan wejiyada waa sidaas)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fillet: in this version only straight edges between two flat faces (the mesh kernel builds them). Round or bevel curved edges in the sketch.&quot; (sidoo kale Chamfer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesta la doortay waa wareegsan, sida god-ka, ama waxay ku taal wejig wareegsan. Ka saar adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro geesaha\u003C/span\u003E, oo wareeg ama bevel geesta sawir-gacmeedka ku samee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;A fillet whose radius changes along the edge: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel). Give it one radius.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar calaamada \u003Cstrong\u003EVariable radius\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fillet by the mesh kernel: where rounded edges meet they are mitred, not blended.&quot; (⚠ taariikhda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDigniin, khalad ma aha: qaybtu waa la dhisay. Geesaha la doortay waxay kulmaan geesta, wareegyadu halkaas waxay kulmaan dhab siman. Fillet geesaha yar, ama aqbal dhabta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Shell: in this version it opens flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejigga furan wareegsan ayuu yahay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro wejiyada\u003C/span\u003E oo ka saar; furo wejiyada toosan oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadyada\"\u003EXaddidaadyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca hadda fillet-yada iyo chamfer-yada waxay shaqeeyaan kaliya geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejig oo toosan, oo leh hal radius, wareegyada kulmaya geesta waa la gees-jarayaa. Shell-yadu waxay furaan wejiyada toosan oo keliya. Kernel saxda ah leh, fillet kala duwan wuxuu si toosan ugu beddelmaa geesta kasta (hal qaanuun feature kasta; radius lama dejiyo barar dhex geesta). Wejiyada fillet-ka, fillet-ka oo dhan iyo shell-yada oo leh darbiyo kala duwan weli lama dhisin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nooca hadda PartCraft wuxuu fillet-yada iyo chamfer-yada ku dhisaa mesh kernel-ka, kaliya geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejood oo toosan: geesaha sanduuqa iyo geesaha toosan ee extrudes iyo cuts, geesaha dibadda ama gudaha (geesta gudaha waxay agab ku daraysaa). Geesaha wareegsan sida geesaha god-ka, iyo radius-ka oo ku beddelma geesta, weli lama dhisin. Halka laba geesood oo wareegsan ay kulmaan geesta, wareegyada waa la gees-jarayaa (waxay kulmaan dhab siman oo kalsoon), ma aha la isku daro. Shell wuxuu sidoo kale shaqeeyaa, waxaa dhisa mesh kernel-ka: wuxuu furaa wejiyada toosan oo keliya, shell-yada oo leh qaro kala duwan oo darbiyada ah weli lama dhisin, waxayna gaabisaa qaybaha leh wejiyo wareegsan badan. Eeg Waxa weli aan la dhisin. Fillet wuxuu geesaha wareejiyaa, Chamfer wuxuu bevel sameeyaa, Shell wuxuu qaybta god-geeyaa. Saddexdaba waxay ku shaqeeyaan geesaha iyo wejiyada jidhka, waxaana dhisa mesh kernel-ka. Wareegyadooda waa faceted sida wejiyada wareegsan oo dhan (Qalloocyada ayaa go'aaminaya inta ay fiican tahay); wejiyada wareegsan waa silinder aad dooran karto oo cabbiri karto (eeg Mesh kernel-ka). Fillet ama chamfer geesaha Marka hore geesaha dooro Guji geesta qaybta. Geesta oo dhan ayaa iftiimaa, panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay Edge: nooceeda (Straight, Circle ama arc, Curve), dhererka iyo wejiyada ay u dhexeeyaan. Si aad geesaha dheeraad ah u dartid, Shift+guji. Mid kasta waa la calaamadeeyaa; Shift+guji geesta calaamadeysan si aad uga saarto. Madaxa panelku wuu tiriyaa (\"4 edges\"), statusbar-kuna wuxuu tidhi \"4 edges picked. Fillet or Chamfer rounds them; Shift+click picks more, Esc clears.\" Dooro Fillet ama Chamfer toolbar-ka, ama badhamada isla markaana panelka midig. Feature-ka waxaa lagu daraa dhammaan geesaha la doortay: wareeg 2 mm ah, ama chamfer 1 mm ah. Statusbar-ku wuxuu tidhi, tusaale ahaan, \"Fillet1 added (4 edges). Change its size on the right; Pick edges changes which.\" Ama marka hore feature-ka ku dar Iyada oo aan wax la doorannin, dooro Fillet ama Chamfer. PartCraft wuxuu galaa xaalada dooranta: madaxa panelka midig wuxuu leeyahay \"Fillet1: picking\", qaybtu waxay u muuqataa sidii ay ahayd ka hor fillet-ka (panelku taas ayuu sheegaa), toolbar-kuna wuxuu tusaa Dhammaystir. Guji geesta kasta si aad u daartid; mar kale guji si aad uga saarto. Statusbar-ku wuu tiriyaa. Dooro Dhammaystir (ama Done panelka), ama taabo Esc ama Enter. Dejinta Dejinta Fillet Chamfer Cabbirka Radius (mm), caadi 2 Distance (mm) oo ka fogaansho geesta labada wejig, caadi 1 Edges Immisa Immisa Liiska hoose wuxuu magacaabaa geesta kasta iyada oo loo eego labada wejig ee ay isku xirto, sida \"Edge 1: Extrude1 end face × Extrude1 side\". Remove wuxuu mid ka saaraa. Dooro geesaha wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa xaalada dooranta. Laba-jeer guji feature-ka taariikhda wuxuu sameeyaa isla sidaas. Geesaha waxaa lagu xusaa labada wejig ee ay isku xirto, sidaas darteed way ku sii jiraan geesta saxda ah markaad beddesho cabbir hore taariikhda. Radius kala duwan iyo noocyada chamfer Variable radius (fillet): weli lama dhisin nooca hadda (\"A fillet whose radius changes along the edge: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel). Give it one radius.\"). Kernel saxda ah leh: calaamadee oo deji End radius (mm). Radius-ku wuxuu si toosan u beddelmaa Radius hal dhamaadka geesta ilaa End radius dhamaadka kale; Swap the ends wuu rogaa. Type (chamfer): Equal distance, Two distances (Second distance wejiga kale) ama Distance and angle (masaafada hal wejig, bevel-ka Angle (°) wejigaas). Flip sides wuxuu masaafada koowaad saaraa wejiga kale. Shell qaybta Guji wejiga toosan ee la furayo, tusaale ahaan sare ee sanduuq. Ama Shift+guji wejigyo dhowr ah. Dooro Shell toolbar-ka, ama Shell, wejigan oo furan panelka wejigga. Qaybtu waxay noqotaa darbi 2 mm ah oo wejiyada la doortay ay furan yihiin. Dejinta: Dejinta Waxa uu sameeyaa Caadi Wall (mm) Dhumucda darbiga 2 Walls grow outward (the faces stay inside) Calaamadeysan: darbiyada dibadda ayay ku daraan, sidaas darteed gudaha cabbirka qaybta ayuu hayaa Off: darbiyadu gudaha ayay u galaan, dibadduna cabbirkeeda ayay hayaan Open faces Immisa wejig ayaa la saaray Gudaha, darbiyadu waa dhumucda darbiga oo saxan: geesaha dibadda ee joogtada ahi way sharaxaaddaan, geesaha gudaha ayaa wareegsan (radius = darbiga), godka qaybta dhex mara wuxuu helaa tuubo darbi ah. Dibadda, darbiyadu waxay ku daraan dibadda dusha asalka ah, kaas oo noqda godka, geesaha dibadda ayaa wareegsan. Wejiyada gudaha waxaa loo magacaabaa wejigyada ay ka soo jeediyeen, sidaas darteed waad dooran kartaa. Wejiyada wareegsan lama furi karo: haddii la doorto mid wareegsan, waxa la sheegaa \"Shell: in this version it opens flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).\" Shell-ka qaybaha leh wejiyo wareegsan badan wuu gaabiyaa (dhowr ilbiriqsi kun kasta oo saddex-geesood): isticmaal Qalloocyada qaro weyn inta aad naqshadeynayso. Dooro wejiyada wuxuu beddelaa wejiyada furan, si la mid ah geesaha la doortay. Liiska wuxuu magacaabaa mid kasta, tusaale ahaan \"Face 1: Extrude1 end face\". Shell aan wejig furan lahayn lama oggolaan karo: \"Pick the faces to remove (open), then shell.\" Dalabka ayaa muhiim ah Features-ka waxay u dhismaan sare ilaa hoos. Fillet ka hor shell waxaa lagu shell-gaa qaybta, sidaas darteed dhinaca gudaha sidoo kale wuxuu helaa geesaha wareegsan. Fillet ka dib shell wuxuu wareejiyaa kaliya geesaha aad doorato. Features-ka u dhaqaaji Kor u dhaqaaq iyo Hoos u dhaqaaq (eeg Beddel qaybta taariikhdeeda). Patterns iyo mirrors ma koobiyeyn karaan fillet, chamfer ama shell: \"Fillet1 changes the body's edges or walls; it cannot be copied. Copy the features that make solids (extrudes, revolves, holes, imports).\" Marka hore pattern-garee godadka ama goyaha, kadibna fillet-garee dhammaan geesaha nuqullada hal fillet. Marka fashilmo Fariinta Waxa la sameeyo \"A 5 mm round does not fit here (it is too big for a face next to one of the edges, or the edges meet in a corner the kernel cannot blend).\" Isticmaal radius ka yar, ama fillet geesaha yar mar; dhowr feature oo fillet ah, kan ugu yar dambe \"An edge it rounds is gone: the edge between Extrude1 and Cut2.\" Isbeddel hore ayaa geesta saartay. Dooro Dooro geesaha, ka saar geesta casaan oo dooro mid cusub \"The shell could not be made with this thickness (…).\" Darbiga ayaa ka qaro weyn qayb yar oo moodelka ah, ama radius-ka fillet-ka. Darbiga ka dhig mid yar, ama fillet-yada ka weyn darbiga \"That face has no name the history can follow; pick another.\" Dooro wejig feature sameeyay (inta badan wejiyada waa sidaas) \"Fillet: in this version only straight edges between two flat faces (the mesh kernel builds them). Round or bevel curved edges in the sketch.\" (sidoo kale Chamfer) Geesta la doortay waa wareegsan, sida god-ka, ama waxay ku taal wejig wareegsan. Ka saar adigoo isticmaalaya Dooro geesaha, oo wareeg ama bevel geesta sawir-gacmeedka ku samee \"A fillet whose radius changes along the edge: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel). Give it one radius.\" Ka saar calaamada Variable radius \"Fillet by the mesh kernel: where rounded edges meet they are mitred, not blended.\" (⚠ taariikhda) Digniin, khalad ma aha: qaybtu waa la dhisay. Geesaha la doortay waxay kulmaan geesta, wareegyadu halkaas waxay kulmaan dhab siman. Fillet geesaha yar, ama aqbal dhabta \"Shell: in this version it opens flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).\" Wejigga furan wareegsan ayuu yahay. Dooro wejiyada oo ka saar; furo wejiyada toosan oo keliya Xaddidaadyada Nooca hadda fillet-yada iyo chamfer-yada waxay shaqeeyaan kaliya geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejig oo toosan, oo leh hal radius, wareegyada kulmaya geesta waa la gees-jarayaa. Shell-yadu waxay furaan wejiyada toosan oo keliya. Kernel saxda ah leh, fillet kala duwan wuxuu si toosan ugu beddelmaa geesta kasta (hal qaanuun feature kasta; radius lama dejiyo barar dhex geesta). Wejiyada fillet-ka, fillet-ka oo dhan iyo shell-yada oo leh darbiyo kala duwan weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"import-step","scope":"partcraft","title":"Fur fayl STEP oo ku dhis","summary":"Ku keen moodeel STEP oo bixiyaha ama barnaamij CAD kale ka yimid PartCraft sida jidh adag, sida qayb cusub ama lagu daro qaybta hadda jirta, u deji jihada sare, oo ku dar sawir-gacmeedyo iyo astaamo.","section":"tasks","order":87,"keywords":["step","stp","soo geli","fur step","ap203","ap214","ap242","moodeelka bixiyaha","jidh adag la soo geliyay","jihada sare","z sare","y sare","saddexagaal","dhinacyo yaryar","isku-dhisidda tallaabada"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-fayl-step","text":"Fur fayl STEP","level":2},{"id":"step-isku-dhis","text":"STEP isku-dhis","level":2},{"id":"dejinta-jihada-sare","text":"Dejinta jihada sare","level":2},{"id":"ku-dhis","text":"Ku dhis","level":2},{"id":"meesha-lagu-kaydiyo","text":"Meesha lagu kaydiyo","level":2},{"id":"fariimaha","text":"Fariimaha","level":2},{"id":"xuduudaha","text":"Xuduudaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu furaa faylasha STEP (\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E, AP203, AP214 iyo AP242) sida \u003Cstrong\u003Ejidh adag\u003C/strong\u003E oo aad ku sawiri karto sawir-gacmeed, ku gooyi karto, ku qodi karto, oo aad ku dari karto astaamahaaga. Jidhka taariikh gaar ah ma leh: ma beddeli kartid cabbirrada lagu sameeyay; waxaad keliya ku dari kartaa ama ka gooyi kartaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca kanu wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa kernel-ka mesh-ka, sidaas darteed faylka STEP waxa \u003Cstrong\u003Elagu akhriyaa saddexagaalo\u003C/strong\u003E: wejiyada sinaanka ahi sinaan ayay ahaadaan, wejiyada wareegsan (silinadaro, koonooyin, kuraalo, torus-yo, wejiyada B-spline) waxay noqdaan dhinacyo yaryar oo badan. Mugga wuxuu ku dhow yahay qayb boqolkiiba mid oo ka mid ah kan saxda ah. Wejiyada wareegsan si saxda ah loo haysto waxay u baahan tahay kernel saxda ah, taas oo aan nooca hadda ku jirin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-fayl-step\"\u003EFur fayl STEP\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kadibna dooro faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E. Ama dhig faylka muuqaalka 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPartCraft wuxuu akhriyaa faylka wuxuuna muujiyaa waxa helay, tusaale ahaan: &quot;Faylka AP214: 1 jidh adag, 10 wejiyo, waxaa la akhriyay saddexagaalo.&quot; Hoosta waxaa ah tirada saddexagaalada, waxa uu ka tagay ama isku daray, iyo haddii natiijadu xidhmi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi \u003Cstrong\u003ESare ee faylka\u003C/strong\u003E. Faylka STEP wuxuu sheegaa unitkiisa (millimitir, inji, mitir…); PartCraft wuxuu u beddelaa millimitir, sidaas darteed \u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada faylka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa Millimitir, &quot;faylku sidaas ayuu sheegaa&quot;. \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka halkan\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujiyaa inta ay weyn tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen as a body\u003C/span\u003E qayb madhan ah, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to this part\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew part\u003C/span\u003E marka qaybtu horey u leedahay astaamo. Ku darista waxay weydiisaa inuu \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal si\u003C/strong\u003E u sameeyo: ku dar, ka gooy ama hay kaliya isku-dhafanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAstaamaha \u003Cstrong\u003EImported1\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa soo muuqda taariikhda, status bar-kuna wuxuu sheegaa, tusaale ahaan: &quot;plate.step waa jidh adag: 57995.937 mm³, 6 wejiyo sinaan ah oo lagu sawiro.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-isku-dhis\"\u003ESTEP isku-dhis\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhis wuxuu u yimaadaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal jidh\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh qayb kasta meesha faylku ku dhigay (&quot;3 qaybood oo faylka lagu dhigay ayaa u yimaada meelkii ay istaagayeen&quot;). Qayb la isticmaalo laba jeer waxay u imaadaa laba jeer. Magacyada qaybaha iyo geedka isku-dhiska lama hayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta-jihada-sare\"\u003EDejinta jihada sare\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarnaamijyada CAD badankood waxay isticmaalaan Z sare; PartCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa Y sare. Caadi ahaan PartCraft wuu rogaa faylka si Z uu u tilmaamo sare halkan. Haddii qaybtu ku yimaado oo ku jiifta dhinaca, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EImported1\u003C/strong\u003E oo deji \u003Cstrong\u003ESare ee faylka\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah \u003Cstrong\u003EY sare\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada faylka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal si\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa sidoo kale halkaas laga beddeli karaa; beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dhis\"\u003EKu dhis\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wejiga qallafsan ee jidhka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch on this face\u003C/span\u003E. Wejiyada qallafsan ee moodeelka STEP waxay ku sii joogaan meeshooda marka jidhka dib loo dhisayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar goyn, godad, bosses, celin-naqshadeed (patterns) iyo muraayadeyn (mirrors) sida qayb kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi cabbirkiisa sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EQayb\u003C/strong\u003E: mugga, dusha, cabbirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFillet, chamfer iyo shell waxay u baahan yihiin kernel-ka saxda ah, sida qayb kasta oo nooca hadda ah (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EKernel-ka mesh-ka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-lagu-kaydiyo\"\u003EMeesha lagu kaydiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaddexagaalada waxa lagu kaydiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Egudaha\u003C/strong\u003E faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, sidaas darteed faylka qaybtu wuu iska buuxaa: uma baahnid faylka STEP mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fariimaha\"\u003EFariimaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay ka dhigan tahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&#039;&quot;part.stp&quot; ma aha fayl STEP (ma bilaabmo ISO-10303-21).&#039;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku ma aha qoraal STEP caadi ah. Weydii dirayaha fayl STEP oo AP203, AP214 ama AP242 ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylka STEP ma akhrin karo: qaybta xogta ayaa maqan ama waa jabsan.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku waa la jaray ama waa jabay. Dib u koobiyee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylka STEP ma lahan jidh adag ama jidh dusha ah: wax la keeno ma jiro.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku wuxuu kaliya haystaa sawirro, dhibcood ama xog. Weydii jidh adag\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Faylkaas STEP wuu weyn yahay (ka badan 60 MB) si loo soo geliyo halkan.&quot; iyo xadka kale ee akhristaha (galitaanno, wejiyo, saddexagaalo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoodeelka ilaha ka yaree, ama u dir qaybaha mid mid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… sadarro jabsan oo faylka ku jira ayaa la dhaafay.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESadarro qaar ma akhrin karin; kuwa kale way soo galeen. Hubi jidhka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… wejiyo lagama samayn karin saddexagaalo, waana laga tagay.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyadaas waxay ka tagayaan godad, PartCraft wuu isku dayaa inuu buuxiyo; haddii jidhku aanu xidhmin, lama darayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… wejiyo nooc aan la akhriyi karin (…) ayaa la dhaafay.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooc dusha oo aan badnayn. Weydii moodeelka oo leh dusha caadi ah ama B-spline\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ma xidhmo …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyadu ma sameeyaan jidh xidhan (moodeel dusha ah, ama wejiyo la tagay). PartCraft wuxuu muujiyaa furitaanada wuuna darayo waxba\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xuduudaha\"\u003EXuduudaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWejiyada wareegsan waxa lagu muujiyaa oo lagu cabbiraa sida dhinacyo yaryar, sida qayb kasta oo nooca hadda ah. PartCraft wuxuu jidhka la hayaa wejiyada sinaanka ah, silinadarada, koonooyinka, kuraalaha iyo torus-yada ee faylka, sidaas darteed \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib ugu qoraa sida wejiyo runta ah, godadka sida godad, oo ay weheliyaan astaamaha aad ku darto. Wejiyada faylku u muujiyo sida splines, sweeps ama dusha jaangooyada ah waxay sii ahaanayaan dhinacyo yaryar dhoofinta. Qayb la kaydiyay ka hor 0.9.1 ma leh dusha la hayo: dib u fur faylka STEP si aad u hesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF of the sketch or flat face\u003C/span\u003E marka wejiga sinaanka ah la doorto wuxuu qoraa godka wareegsan ee faylka sida goobo runta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMidabbada, magacyada jidhadka, qaab-dhismeedka isku-dhisku iyo PMI (dulqaadka ku jira faylka) lama akhriyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka laga reebo STEP, PartCraft wuxuu furaa mesh-yada STL, OBJ iyo 3MF (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EFur STL, OBJ ama 3MF\u003C/a\u003E) iyo faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003EFur moodeel .3dm\u003C/a\u003E) sida jidh adag. Faylasha IGES iyo kuwa asalka ah ee barnaamijyada kale lama taageero.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayb leh jidh STEP ah oo ay soo geliyeen dhisme leh kernel saxda ah waxay hayn qoraalka STEP; nooca hadda wuu iska tuurayaa astaamahaas (&quot;wali lama dhisin&quot;). Dib u fur faylka STEP si aad jidhka uga soo geliso sida saddexagaalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"PartCraft wuxuu furaa faylasha STEP (.step ama .stp, AP203, AP214 iyo AP242) sida jidh adag oo aad ku sawiri karto sawir-gacmeed, ku gooyi karto, ku qodi karto, oo aad ku dari karto astaamahaaga. Jidhka taariikh gaar ah ma leh: ma beddeli kartid cabbirrada lagu sameeyay; waxaad keliya ku dari kartaa ama ka gooyi kartaa. Nooca kanu wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa kernel-ka mesh-ka, sidaas darteed faylka STEP waxa lagu akhriyaa saddexagaalo: wejiyada sinaanka ahi sinaan ayay ahaadaan, wejiyada wareegsan (silinadaro, koonooyin, kuraalo, torus-yo, wejiyada B-spline) waxay noqdaan dhinacyo yaryar oo badan. Mugga wuxuu ku dhow yahay qayb boqolkiiba mid oo ka mid ah kan saxda ah. Wejiyada wareegsan si saxda ah loo haysto waxay u baahan tahay kernel saxda ah, taas oo aan nooca hadda ku jirin. Fur fayl STEP Dooro Open ama riix Ctrl+O, kadibna dooro faylka .step ama .stp. Ama dhig faylka muuqaalka 3D. PartCraft wuxuu akhriyaa faylka wuxuuna muujiyaa waxa helay, tusaale ahaan: \"Faylka AP214: 1 jidh adag, 10 wejiyo, waxaa la akhriyay saddexagaalo.\" Hoosta waxaa ah tirada saddexagaalada, waxa uu ka tagay ama isku daray, iyo haddii natiijadu xidhmi. Hubi Sare ee faylka. Faylka STEP wuxuu sheegaa unitkiisa (millimitir, inji, mitir…); PartCraft wuxuu u beddelaa millimitir, sidaas darteed Unugyada faylka wuxuu muujiyaa Millimitir, \"faylku sidaas ayuu sheegaa\". Cabbirka halkan wuxuu muujiyaa inta ay weyn tahay. Dooro Open as a body qayb madhan ah, ama Add to this part / New part marka qaybtu horey u leedahay astaamo. Ku darista waxay weydiisaa inuu Isticmaal si u sameeyo: ku dar, ka gooy ama hay kaliya isku-dhafanka. Astaamaha Imported1 ayaa soo muuqda taariikhda, status bar-kuna wuxuu sheegaa, tusaale ahaan: \"plate.step waa jidh adag: 57995.937 mm³, 6 wejiyo sinaan ah oo lagu sawiro.\" STEP isku-dhis Isku-dhis wuxuu u yimaadaa hal jidh oo leh qayb kasta meesha faylku ku dhigay (\"3 qaybood oo faylka lagu dhigay ayaa u yimaada meelkii ay istaagayeen\"). Qayb la isticmaalo laba jeer waxay u imaadaa laba jeer. Magacyada qaybaha iyo geedka isku-dhiska lama hayo. Dejinta jihada sare Barnaamijyada CAD badankood waxay isticmaalaan Z sare; PartCraft wuxuu isticmaalaa Y sare. Caadi ahaan PartCraft wuu rogaa faylka si Z uu u tilmaamo sare halkan. Haddii qaybtu ku yimaado oo ku jiifta dhinaca, dooro Imported1 oo deji Sare ee faylka oo ah Y sare. Unugyada faylka iyo Isticmaal si ayaa sidoo kale halkaas laga beddeli karaa; beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho. Ku dhis Guji wejiga qallafsan ee jidhka oo dooro Sketch on this face. Wejiyada qallafsan ee moodeelka STEP waxay ku sii joogaan meeshooda marka jidhka dib loo dhisayo. Ku dar goyn, godad, bosses, celin-naqshadeed (patterns) iyo muraayadeyn (mirrors) sida qayb kasta. Hubi cabbirkiisa sanduuqa Qayb: mugga, dusha, cabbirka. Fillet, chamfer iyo shell waxay u baahan yihiin kernel-ka saxda ah, sida qayb kasta oo nooca hadda ah (Kernel-ka mesh-ka). Meesha lagu kaydiyo Saddexagaalada waxa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka .partcraft.json, sidaas darteed faylka qaybtu wuu iska buuxaa: uma baahnid faylka STEP mar kale. Fariimaha Fariinta Waxa ay ka dhigan tahay '\"part.stp\" ma aha fayl STEP (ma bilaabmo ISO-10303-21).' Faylku ma aha qoraal STEP caadi ah. Weydii dirayaha fayl STEP oo AP203, AP214 ama AP242 ah \"Faylka STEP ma akhrin karo: qaybta xogta ayaa maqan ama waa jabsan.\" Faylku waa la jaray ama waa jabay. Dib u koobiyee \"Faylka STEP ma lahan jidh adag ama jidh dusha ah: wax la keeno ma jiro.\" Faylku wuxuu kaliya haystaa sawirro, dhibcood ama xog. Weydii jidh adag \"Faylkaas STEP wuu weyn yahay (ka badan 60 MB) si loo soo geliyo halkan.\" iyo xadka kale ee akhristaha (galitaanno, wejiyo, saddexagaalo) Moodeelka ilaha ka yaree, ama u dir qaybaha mid mid \"… sadarro jabsan oo faylka ku jira ayaa la dhaafay.\" Sadarro qaar ma akhrin karin; kuwa kale way soo galeen. Hubi jidhka \"… wejiyo lagama samayn karin saddexagaalo, waana laga tagay.\" Wejiyadaas waxay ka tagayaan godad, PartCraft wuu isku dayaa inuu buuxiyo; haddii jidhku aanu xidhmin, lama darayo \"… wejiyo nooc aan la akhriyi karin (…) ayaa la dhaafay.\" Nooc dusha oo aan badnayn. Weydii moodeelka oo leh dusha caadi ah ama B-spline \"Ma xidhmo …\" Wejiyadu ma sameeyaan jidh xidhan (moodeel dusha ah, ama wejiyo la tagay). PartCraft wuxuu muujiyaa furitaanada wuuna darayo waxba Xuduudaha Wejiyada wareegsan waxa lagu muujiyaa oo lagu cabbiraa sida dhinacyo yaryar, sida qayb kasta oo nooca hadda ah. PartCraft wuxuu jidhka la hayaa wejiyada sinaanka ah, silinadarada, koonooyinka, kuraalaha iyo torus-yada ee faylka, sidaas darteed Export › STEP AP242 (exact solid) wuxuu dib ugu qoraa sida wejiyo runta ah, godadka sida godad, oo ay weheliyaan astaamaha aad ku darto. Wejiyada faylku u muujiyo sida splines, sweeps ama dusha jaangooyada ah waxay sii ahaanayaan dhinacyo yaryar dhoofinta. Qayb la kaydiyay ka hor 0.9.1 ma leh dusha la hayo: dib u fur faylka STEP si aad u hesho. Export › DXF of the sketch or flat face marka wejiga sinaanka ah la doorto wuxuu qoraa godka wareegsan ee faylka sida goobo runta ah. Midabbada, magacyada jidhadka, qaab-dhismeedka isku-dhisku iyo PMI (dulqaadka ku jira faylka) lama akhriyo. Marka laga reebo STEP, PartCraft wuxuu furaa mesh-yada STL, OBJ iyo 3MF (Fur STL, OBJ ama 3MF) iyo faylasha .3dm (Fur moodeel .3dm) sida jidh adag. Faylasha IGES iyo kuwa asalka ah ee barnaamijyada kale lama taageero. Qayb leh jidh STEP ah oo ay soo geliyeen dhisme leh kernel saxda ah waxay hayn qoraalka STEP; nooca hadda wuu iska tuurayaa astaamahaas (\"wali lama dhisin\"). Dib u fur faylka STEP si aad jidhka uga soo geliso sida saddexagaalo.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"open-meshes","scope":"partcraft","title":"Fur STL, OBJ ama 3MF sida jidh adag","summary":"U rog mesh ka yimid scanner, goob daabacaadda 3D ama barnaamij kale jidh adag oo aad jari, ku dari karto oo ku sawiri karto; wixii PartCraft ku saxo habka, iyo wixii aanay samayn karin.","section":"tasks","order":88,"keywords":["stl","obj","3mf","mesh","mesh ilaa jidh adag","beddel mesh","scan","watertight","saxid","god","geeso furan","unitiyada","sare","jidh la soo geliyay","wejiyo siman"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-mesh","text":"Fur mesh","level":2},{"id":"waxa-partcraft-saxa","text":"Waxa PartCraft saxa","level":2},{"id":"marka-mesh-ku-aanay-xirmin","text":"Marka mesh-ku aanay xirmin","level":2},{"id":"sawir-gacmeed-ku-samee-wejiyadiisa-siman","text":"Sawir-gacmeed ku samee wejiyadiisa siman","level":2},{"id":"isbeddel-ka-dib","text":"Isbeddel ka dib","level":2},{"id":"halka-lagu-kaydiyo","text":"Halka lagu kaydiyo","level":2},{"id":"xuduudaha","text":"Xuduudaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu furaa STL, OBJ iyo 3MF mesh-yada sida \u003Cstrong\u003Ejidh adag\u003C/strong\u003E. Jidhku wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida jidh adag kasta: jar, ku dar, god ka sam, qaab sameey, isticmaal isku-dhis ama machining, oo sawir-gacmeed ku samee wejiyadiisa siman. Taariikh u gaar ah ma leh: mesh waa triangles oo keliya, sidaas darteed cabbirradiisa ma beddeli karo, waxaa laga ku dari karaa ama laga jari karaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-mesh\"\u003EFur mesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, oo dooro faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.stl\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E. Ama ku dhig muuqaalka 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPartCraft wuu akhriyaa, wuxuu saxaa wixii si nabad ah u saxi karo, wuxuuna muujinayaa wixii uu helay: inta triangle iyo dhibic, saxid kasta, iyo haddii mesh-ku hadda \u003Cstrong\u003Exirmayo\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi \u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada faylka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESare ee faylka\u003C/strong\u003E. STL iyo OBJ ma sheegaan unitiyadooda, sidaas darteed millimitir ayaa la mala-awaalaa; faylka 3MF wuxuu sheegaa kiisa. Khadka \u003Cstrong\u003ESize here\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka jidhka doorashadaada, sidaas darteed qayb 25.4 jeer oo yar la soo galay way fududaan karta in la ogaado (waxay ahayd inch).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii qaybta shaashadda ku jirta ay madhan tahay, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur sida jidh\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii uu horey u leeyahay astaamo, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal si loo\u003C/strong\u003E (ku dar qaybta, ka jar, ama ku hay kaliya isgoysyada), kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar qaybtan\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQayb cusub\u003C/span\u003E si aad mar kale ugu bilowdo mesh-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAstaamaha \u003Cstrong\u003EImported1\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa ka muuqda taariikhda. Xariiqda xaaladda wuxuu tusaale ahaan leeyahay, &quot;bracket.stl waa jidh adag: 15200.512 mm³, 14 wejiyo siman oo sawir-gacmeed lagu sameeyo.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-partcraft-saxa\"\u003EWaxa PartCraft saxa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESaxid\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMicnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha laba-laab ah ayaa isku xiran\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL wuxuu geesaha kasta ku celiyaa triangle kasta; waa la isku xiraa hal dhibic\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETriangles aan bal lahayn la tirtiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJeexjeexyo geesahoodu hal khad ku yaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETriangles laba jeer la qoray la tirtiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETriangle lagu qoray laba jeer waa lagu hayaa mar; laba jihooyin iska soo horjeedaan (darbi gudaha ah) labadaba waa la tirtiraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodad yar la xiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha ku dhow inay isku kulmaan (dhibcaha ka yar hal kun qaybta cabbirkeeda) waa la isku xiraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodadka la buuxiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGod ay xadkiisu siman yahay waa la buuxiyaa cabbirkiisa midna; mid qallooca ah keliya marka uu yar yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETriangles dibadda loo rogay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETriangles jihada qaldan ah waa la rogaa si ay ula mid noqdaan deriskooda, dusha oo dhan dibadda ayuu u eegaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-mesh-ku-aanay-xirmin\"\u003EMarka mesh-ku aanay xirmin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJidh adag wuxuu u baahan yahay dusha aan godad lahayn. Marka PartCraft uusan xidhi karin, qoraalku wuxuu sheegaa inta god iyo geeso furan ee harsan, jidh lagu daro ma jiro. Godadka ku xir barnaamijka mesh-ka sameeyay, ama mar kale dhoofi mesh xidhan (watertight), kadibna mar kale fur.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu god ka tegaa marka buuxintu khalad ka dhigi karto: god weyn oo qallooca ah, ama laba god oo diyaar isku mid ah (wejig giraangiran oo maqan, halkaasoo buuxinta geesta kasta ay daboolayso godka dhexe). Geesta laga wadaago ka badan saddex triangle ayaa sidoo kale la sheegaa: dusha noocaas ahi ma laha gudaha hal oo cad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-gacmeed-ku-samee-wejiyadiisa-siman\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed ku samee wejiyadiisa siman\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeelaha siman oo ka samaysan triangles badan waxay mid walba isku darmaan \u003Cstrong\u003Eweji siman\u003C/strong\u003E oo keliya, si sawir-gacmeed ugu fadhiisan karo: riix wejiga oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed wejiggan ku yaal\u003C/span\u003E. Weji la jaray ama dib loo daray wuxuu weli yahay weji. Meelaha wareegsan (god, fillet) waxay weli yihiin triangles: ma aha wejiyo aad dooran karto, muuqaalkuna geesahooda wuxuu ka sawiraa xagasha u dhexaysa triangles-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isbeddel-ka-dib\"\u003EIsbeddel ka dib\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EImported1\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u aragto faylka uu ka yimid, inta triangle uu leeyahay iyo wixii la saxay. \u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada faylka\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESare ee faylka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal si loo\u003C/strong\u003E halkaas ayaa lagu beddeli karaa; isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-lagu-kaydiyo\"\u003EHalka lagu kaydiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMesh-ka la saxay waxa lagu kaydiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Egudaha\u003C/strong\u003E faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, sidaas darteed uma baahnid faylka mesh mar kale. Faylka qayb leh jidh mesh ah waa nooca 5: PartCraft-ka hore wuu diidaa adigoo eegaya nooceeda. Mesh 200,000 triangle ah wuxuu ku daraa ku dhawaad 1.2 MB.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xuduudaha\"\u003EXuduudaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUgu badnaan 3 milyan triangle iyo 200 MB hal fayl gudihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJidh mesh ka samaysan waxaa dhisa kernel-ka mesh-ka. Kernel-ka sax ah oo karti (horumariyeyaasha keliya), waa sheegaa taas oo aan la dhisin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAgabka OBJ, texture coordinates iyo qalooca bilaa-qaab waa la reebaa; midabada 3MF, agabka iyo shayada taageerada waa la reebaa (qoraalku wuxuu sheegaa inta shay ee la dhaafay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJidhku wuxuu ka fiican yahay mesh-ka oo kale: STL qallafsan wuxuu siiyaa wejiyo wareeg qallafsan. Godadka aad ku godaysid waxay noqonayaan wareeg sida astaamahaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"PartCraft wuxuu furaa STL, OBJ iyo 3MF mesh-yada sida jidh adag. Jidhku wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida jidh adag kasta: jar, ku dar, god ka sam, qaab sameey, isticmaal isku-dhis ama machining, oo sawir-gacmeed ku samee wejiyadiisa siman. Taariikh u gaar ah ma leh: mesh waa triangles oo keliya, sidaas darteed cabbirradiisa ma beddeli karo, waxaa laga ku dari karaa ama laga jari karaa. Fur mesh Dooro Fur ama riix Ctrl+O, oo dooro faylka .stl, .obj ama .3mf. Ama ku dhig muuqaalka 3D. PartCraft wuu akhriyaa, wuxuu saxaa wixii si nabad ah u saxi karo, wuxuuna muujinayaa wixii uu helay: inta triangle iyo dhibic, saxid kasta, iyo haddii mesh-ku hadda xirmayo. Hubi Unitiyada faylka iyo Sare ee faylka. STL iyo OBJ ma sheegaan unitiyadooda, sidaas darteed millimitir ayaa la mala-awaalaa; faylka 3MF wuxuu sheegaa kiisa. Khadka Size here wuxuu muujinayaa cabbirka jidhka doorashadaada, sidaas darteed qayb 25.4 jeer oo yar la soo galay way fududaan karta in la ogaado (waxay ahayd inch). Haddii qaybta shaashadda ku jirta ay madhan tahay, dooro Fur sida jidh. Haddii uu horey u leeyahay astaamo, dooro Isticmaal si loo (ku dar qaybta, ka jar, ama ku hay kaliya isgoysyada), kadibna Ku dar qaybtan, ama Qayb cusub si aad mar kale ugu bilowdo mesh-ka. Astaamaha Imported1 ayaa ka muuqda taariikhda. Xariiqda xaaladda wuxuu tusaale ahaan leeyahay, \"bracket.stl waa jidh adag: 15200.512 mm³, 14 wejiyo siman oo sawir-gacmeed lagu sameeyo.\" Waxa PartCraft saxa Saxid Micnaha Geesaha laba-laab ah ayaa isku xiran STL wuxuu geesaha kasta ku celiyaa triangle kasta; waa la isku xiraa hal dhibic Triangles aan bal lahayn la tirtiray Jeexjeexyo geesahoodu hal khad ku yaal Triangles laba jeer la qoray la tirtiray Triangle lagu qoray laba jeer waa lagu hayaa mar; laba jihooyin iska soo horjeedaan (darbi gudaha ah) labadaba waa la tirtiraa Godad yar la xiray Geesaha ku dhow inay isku kulmaan (dhibcaha ka yar hal kun qaybta cabbirkeeda) waa la isku xiraa Godadka la buuxiyay God ay xadkiisu siman yahay waa la buuxiyaa cabbirkiisa midna; mid qallooca ah keliya marka uu yar yahay Triangles dibadda loo rogay Triangles jihada qaldan ah waa la rogaa si ay ula mid noqdaan deriskooda, dusha oo dhan dibadda ayuu u eegaa Marka mesh-ku aanay xirmin Jidh adag wuxuu u baahan yahay dusha aan godad lahayn. Marka PartCraft uusan xidhi karin, qoraalku wuxuu sheegaa inta god iyo geeso furan ee harsan, jidh lagu daro ma jiro. Godadka ku xir barnaamijka mesh-ka sameeyay, ama mar kale dhoofi mesh xidhan (watertight), kadibna mar kale fur. PartCraft wuxuu god ka tegaa marka buuxintu khalad ka dhigi karto: god weyn oo qallooca ah, ama laba god oo diyaar isku mid ah (wejig giraangiran oo maqan, halkaasoo buuxinta geesta kasta ay daboolayso godka dhexe). Geesta laga wadaago ka badan saddex triangle ayaa sidoo kale la sheegaa: dusha noocaas ahi ma laha gudaha hal oo cad. Sawir-gacmeed ku samee wejiyadiisa siman Meelaha siman oo ka samaysan triangles badan waxay mid walba isku darmaan weji siman oo keliya, si sawir-gacmeed ugu fadhiisan karo: riix wejiga oo dooro Sawir-gacmeed wejiggan ku yaal. Weji la jaray ama dib loo daray wuxuu weli yahay weji. Meelaha wareegsan (god, fillet) waxay weli yihiin triangles: ma aha wejiyo aad dooran karto, muuqaalkuna geesahooda wuxuu ka sawiraa xagasha u dhexaysa triangles-ka. Isbeddel ka dib Dooro Imported1 si aad u aragto faylka uu ka yimid, inta triangle uu leeyahay iyo wixii la saxay. Unitiyada faylka, Sare ee faylka iyo Isticmaal si loo halkaas ayaa lagu beddeli karaa; isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo. Halka lagu kaydiyo Mesh-ka la saxay waxa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka .partcraft.json, sidaas darteed uma baahnid faylka mesh mar kale. Faylka qayb leh jidh mesh ah waa nooca 5: PartCraft-ka hore wuu diidaa adigoo eegaya nooceeda. Mesh 200,000 triangle ah wuxuu ku daraa ku dhawaad 1.2 MB. Xuduudaha Ugu badnaan 3 milyan triangle iyo 200 MB hal fayl gudihiisa. Jidh mesh ka samaysan waxaa dhisa kernel-ka mesh-ka. Kernel-ka sax ah oo karti (horumariyeyaasha keliya), waa sheegaa taas oo aan la dhisin. Agabka OBJ, texture coordinates iyo qalooca bilaa-qaab waa la reebaa; midabada 3MF, agabka iyo shayada taageerada waa la reebaa (qoraalku wuxuu sheegaa inta shay ee la dhaafay). Jidhku wuxuu ka fiican yahay mesh-ka oo kale: STL qallafsan wuxuu siiyaa wejiyo wareeg qallafsan. Godadka aad ku godaysid waxay noqonayaan wareeg sida astaamahaaga.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"solidworks-exchange","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qaybaha u wareejinta iyo ka soo qaadista moodelayaasha qaybta kale","summary":"U dir qayb moodelayaasha kale macro ah oo dib u dhisa iyada oo leh geedka astaamaha nool. STEP magac leh iyo furidda liiska astaamaha ee moodelka kale qortay weli lama dhisin nooca hadda.","section":"tasks","order":88,"keywords":["macro","weli lama dhisin","swb","vba","geedka astaamaha","dib-u-soo-celin","macro dhoofin","cadcraft-sw.json","STEP magac leh","ap214","doorsoomayaal caalami ah","isla-gelin","qayb asal ah"],"headings":[{"id":"u-dir-qayb-macro-ahaan","text":"U dir qayb macro ahaan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-laga-reebay","text":"Waxa laga reebay","level":3},{"id":"u-dir-step-magac-leh","text":"U dir STEP magac leh","level":2},{"id":"qayb-dib-u-soo-celi","text":"Qayb dib u soo celi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft qaybaha la wada wareejiyaa SolidWorks labada jiho, iyada oo aan lahayn nooc fayl oo aan qof kale akhrin karin:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDibedda:\u003C/strong\u003E macro (\u003Ccode\u003E.swb\u003C/code\u003E, qoraal fudud) oo SolidWorks ku shaqeeyo si uu qaybta isagu u dhiso, astaamo astaamo, oo leh naqshadaheeda, xiriirradeeda, cabbirradeeda, doorsoomayaasha caalami ah iyo isla-gelinteeda. Waxaad heleysaa qayb asal ah oo leh geed astaamo nool, ma aha jir dhintay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDib-u-soo-celin:\u003C/strong\u003E macro aad ku shaqeyso gudaha SolidWorks wuxuu astaamaha iyo isla-gelinta qaybta ku qorayaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.cadcraft-sw.json\u003C/code\u003E. Furidda faylkaas PartCraft-ka weli lama dhisin nooca hadda (wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxba oo ka mid ah tan weli SolidWorks lagama tijaabin. SolidWorks wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa Windows oo kaliya oo leh shatiga, PartCraft-na macro-kan gudaha uma socon. Macro-yada waxaa loo qoray dukumentiga API-ga SolidWorks waxaana halkan loo hubiyay qaab-dhismeedka. Wax dhibaato ah ka war soo deji; logga uu macro-ku qorayo wuxuu sheegayaa tallaabada fashilantay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft ma qori karo fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.sldprt\u003C/code\u003E: nooca waa xidhan. Macro-ku waa habka qayb asal ah loo helo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-dir-qayb-macro-ahaan\"\u003EU dir qayb macro ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacro SolidWorks (.swb)\u003C/span\u003E. PartCraft wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt;.swb\u003C/code\u003E; status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa in la qoray &quot;adigoon kernel saxda ah lahayn&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuq wuxuu sheegayaa macro-ku imisa astaamood, doorsoomayaal caalami ah iyo isla-gelin dhisayo, wuxuuna liistaa wax kasta oo ka reebay. STEP looma soo dhigo macro-ka dhinaciisa nooca hadda: isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh)\u003C/span\u003E haddii aad u baahan tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESolidWorks, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ETools &gt; Macro &gt; Run\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.swb\u003C/code\u003E oo sug. Wuxuu sameeyaa qayb cusub oo ka timid template-kaaga qaybta caadiga ah, wuxuu dejiyaa millimitir, wuxuuna dhisaa astaamo kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaadka fariin ayaa sheegaysa intee tallaabo ah ee la sameeyay, intee fashilantay, iyo intee la mid ahayd jirka PartCraft. Logga oo buuxa, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt; macro log.txt\u003C/code\u003E, waxaa lagu qoraa macro-ka dhinaciisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa macro-ku dhisaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaybta cusub\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad diyaarada hore, sare ama midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad diyaaradaas ku taal, oo leh xariirradeeda, qaansooyinkeeda, goobooyinkeeda, barooyinkeeda, xiriirradeeda iyo cabbirradeeda (magacyo sida PartCraft, sida \u003Ccode\u003Ek7\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad wejig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad wejigii isku mid ah, la doortay bar ku taal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad diyaarad go&#039;an\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiyaarad tixraac oo mara saddex barood, iyo naqshadda dushiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar, goyn (qarsoon, dhammaan, dhexda diyaarada, laba jihood, taper)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss-extrude ama cut-extrude\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg, goyn wareeg\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeg isla khadka dhexe ee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGod (fudud, counterbore, countersink, tapped)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal ama laba goyn oo naqshadahooda gaarka ah (god la tap garay waa tap drill; ma jiro dhuumo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaab toosan iyo wareegsan, muraayad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaab toosan, qaab wareegsan, muraayad (astaamaha ama jirka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet, chamfer, shell\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet, chamfer iyo shell geesaha iyo wejiyada isku mid ah, oo la doortay barooyinka lagu doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalbeegyada iyo isla-gelinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDoorsoomayaal caalami ah iyo isla-gelin cabbirrada magacyada cusub la siiyey\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAstaamaha la joojiyey, bar-ka rollback\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa joojiyey si isku mid ah; bar-ka rollback meesha isku mid ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAstaamo jir kasta ka dib macro-ku wuxuu isbarbar dhigaa mugga iyo cabbirka jirka oo PartCraft-ka la yiraahdo. Markay kala duwan yihiin, wuxuu hal mar rogaa jihada astaamahaas oo mar kale hubiyaa; haddii taasi aan wanaagsanayn, wuu soo celiyaa oo log-ga wuxuu qoraa &quot;Check&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"waxa-laga-reebay\"\u003EWaxa laga reebay\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqa iyo madasha macro-ka waxay liistaan wax kasta aan la qaadin, iyo sababta. Maanta taasi waa: jidhyo la soo dhoofiyay (ku geli STEP halkaas), sweep-yo, loft-yo, draft-yo, dhidibada iyo barooyinka tixraaca, shuruudaha &quot;ilaa&quot; ee dhamaadka, soo saarka qaybo kaliya ee konturrada, iyo wax kasta oo ku tiirsan kuwaas. Splaynada waxay noqdaan qalooc ka tirsan barooyinkooda. Nooca hadda kernel saxda ah ma lahan, sidaas darteed naqshadaha wejiyada iyo astaamaha geesaha ama wejiyada doortaa ayaa sidoo kale laga reebay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-dir-step-magac-leh\"\u003EU dir STEP magac leh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWeli lama dhisin nooca hadda: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP for SolidWorks (magac leh, AP214)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah, doorashadeedana waxay tiraysaa &quot;STEP for SolidWorks: weli lama dhisin. …&quot;. Kernel saxda ah ayaa jirta, faylku wuxuu qaadayaa magaca qaybta, millimitir iyo midabka qaybta, wuxuuna taagayaa Y sida SolidWorks u muujiyo qaybaha (dhoofinta caadiga ah ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (jidh adag oo saxda ah)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu taagayaa Z). Xarfaha leh calaamado waxay ka lumaan magaca, astaamaha kale ee ka baxsan ASCII fudud waxay noqdaan \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qayb-dib-u-soo-celi\"\u003EQayb dib u soo celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFuridda faylka PartCraft-ka (tallaabada 3) weli lama dhisin nooca hadda: wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Furidda dhoofinta SolidWorks: weli lama dhisin. …&quot;. App-ka naqshadaha CadCraft wali wuu furaa faylka wuuna qaadaa naqshadahooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E &gt; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E &gt; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMacro dhoofinta si loo soo celiyo qaybaha (.swb)\u003C/span\u003E si aad u soo dejiso \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraftExport.swb\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna ku dhig qaybahaaga dhinaciisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESolidWorks, fur qaybta, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ETools &gt; Macro &gt; Run\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro \u003Ccode\u003ECadCraftExport.swb\u003C/code\u003E. Wuxuu qoraa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt;.cadcraft-sw.json\u003C/code\u003E dhinaca qaybta wuuna ku beddelin waxba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPartCraft, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylkaas, ama ku riix muuqaalka 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKernel saxda ah ayaa jira, PartCraft wuxuu qaybta dib u dhisaa astaamo astaamo, wuxuuna muujiyaa waxa sameeyay: tusaale &quot;5 ka 5 astaamood ayaa laga soo qaatay SolidWorks (Flange.SLDPRT)&quot;, astaamo kasta oo aan qaadi karin (&quot;Lama qaadin: Sweep1 (Sweep).&quot;) iyo in mugga uu la mid yahay kii SolidWorks qoray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu kaydi qayb PartCraft ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshadaha waxay ku dhacaan diyaarad aasaas marka ay ku taalo, wejiga fidsan ee u dhigma qaybta marka uu jiro (si ay ugu raacaan tafatirka dambe), iyo diyaarad go&#039;an haddii kale. Geesaha iyo wejiyada fillet-yada, chamfer-yada iyo shell-yada waxaa laga helaa barooyin oo waxaa lagu hayaa tixraac magac leh. Doorsoomayaasha caalamiga ah waxay noqdaan halbeegyo (magacyada leh meelo banaan waxay helaan hoosaas: &quot;Bolt count&quot; wuxuu noqdaa \u003Ccode\u003EBolt_count\u003C/code\u003E) isla-gelinna waxay noqdaan isla-gelin cabbirrada isku mid ah. Waxba lama saadaaliyo: wax aan lahayn nidaamka tooda waa la liistaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApp-ka naqshadaha CadCraft isla faylka ayuu furaa wuxuuna qaadaa naqshadahooda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca waa \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft-sw-export\u003C/code\u003E nooca 1, JSON qoraal fudud oo millimitir iyo darajo ah. Fayl ka timid macro cusub, ama oo aan sax ahayn, waa la diidaa sababta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"PartCraft qaybaha la wada wareejiyaa SolidWorks labada jiho, iyada oo aan lahayn nooc fayl oo aan qof kale akhrin karin: Dibedda: macro (.swb, qoraal fudud) oo SolidWorks ku shaqeeyo si uu qaybta isagu u dhiso, astaamo astaamo, oo leh naqshadaheeda, xiriirradeeda, cabbirradeeda, doorsoomayaasha caalami ah iyo isla-gelinteeda. Waxaad heleysaa qayb asal ah oo leh geed astaamo nool, ma aha jir dhintay. Dib-u-soo-celin: macro aad ku shaqeyso gudaha SolidWorks wuxuu astaamaha iyo isla-gelinta qaybta ku qorayaa fayl .cadcraft-sw.json. Furidda faylkaas PartCraft-ka weli lama dhisin nooca hadda (wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah). Waxba oo ka mid ah tan weli SolidWorks lagama tijaabin. SolidWorks wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa Windows oo kaliya oo leh shatiga, PartCraft-na macro-kan gudaha uma socon. Macro-yada waxaa loo qoray dukumentiga API-ga SolidWorks waxaana halkan loo hubiyay qaab-dhismeedka. Wax dhibaato ah ka war soo deji; logga uu macro-ku qorayo wuxuu sheegayaa tallaabada fashilantay. PartCraft ma qori karo fayl .sldprt: nooca waa xidhan. Macro-ku waa habka qayb asal ah loo helo. U dir qayb macro ahaan Fur qaybta. Dooro Dhoofi, kadibna Macro SolidWorks (.swb). PartCraft wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cpart\u003E.swb; status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa in la qoray \"adigoon kernel saxda ah lahayn\". Sanduuq wuxuu sheegayaa macro-ku imisa astaamood, doorsoomayaal caalami ah iyo isla-gelin dhisayo, wuxuuna liistaa wax kasta oo ka reebay. STEP looma soo dhigo macro-ka dhinaciisa nooca hadda: isticmaal Dhoofi, kadibna STEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh) haddii aad u baahan tahay. SolidWorks, dooro Tools \u003E Macro \u003E Run, dooro faylka .swb oo sug. Wuxuu sameeyaa qayb cusub oo ka timid template-kaaga qaybta caadiga ah, wuxuu dejiyaa millimitir, wuxuuna dhisaa astaamo kasta. Dhamaadka fariin ayaa sheegaysa intee tallaabo ah ee la sameeyay, intee fashilantay, iyo intee la mid ahayd jirka PartCraft. Logga oo buuxa, \u003Cpart\u003E macro log.txt, waxaa lagu qoraa macro-ka dhinaciisa. Waxa macro-ku dhisaa: PartCraft Qaybta cusub Naqshad diyaarada hore, sare ama midig Naqshad diyaaradaas ku taal, oo leh xariirradeeda, qaansooyinkeeda, goobooyinkeeda, barooyinkeeda, xiriirradeeda iyo cabbirradeeda (magacyo sida PartCraft, sida k7) Naqshad wejig Naqshad wejigii isku mid ah, la doortay bar ku taal Naqshad diyaarad go'an Diyaarad tixraac oo mara saddex barood, iyo naqshadda dushiisa Soo saar, goyn (qarsoon, dhammaan, dhexda diyaarada, laba jihood, taper) Boss-extrude ama cut-extrude Wareeg, goyn wareeg Wareeg isla khadka dhexe ee God (fudud, counterbore, countersink, tapped) Hal ama laba goyn oo naqshadahooda gaarka ah (god la tap garay waa tap drill; ma jiro dhuumo) Qaab toosan iyo wareegsan, muraayad Qaab toosan, qaab wareegsan, muraayad (astaamaha ama jirka) Fillet, chamfer, shell Fillet, chamfer iyo shell geesaha iyo wejiyada isku mid ah, oo la doortay barooyinka lagu doortay Halbeegyada iyo isla-gelinta Doorsoomayaal caalami ah iyo isla-gelin cabbirrada magacyada cusub la siiyey Astaamaha la joojiyey, bar-ka rollback La joojiyey si isku mid ah; bar-ka rollback meesha isku mid ah Astaamo jir kasta ka dib macro-ku wuxuu isbarbar dhigaa mugga iyo cabbirka jirka oo PartCraft-ka la yiraahdo. Markay kala duwan yihiin, wuxuu hal mar rogaa jihada astaamahaas oo mar kale hubiyaa; haddii taasi aan wanaagsanayn, wuu soo celiyaa oo log-ga wuxuu qoraa \"Check\". Waxa laga reebay Sanduuqa iyo madasha macro-ka waxay liistaan wax kasta aan la qaadin, iyo sababta. Maanta taasi waa: jidhyo la soo dhoofiyay (ku geli STEP halkaas), sweep-yo, loft-yo, draft-yo, dhidibada iyo barooyinka tixraaca, shuruudaha \"ilaa\" ee dhamaadka, soo saarka qaybo kaliya ee konturrada, iyo wax kasta oo ku tiirsan kuwaas. Splaynada waxay noqdaan qalooc ka tirsan barooyinkooda. Nooca hadda kernel saxda ah ma lahan, sidaas darteed naqshadaha wejiyada iyo astaamaha geesaha ama wejiyada doortaa ayaa sidoo kale laga reebay. U dir STEP magac leh Weli lama dhisin nooca hadda: STEP for SolidWorks (magac leh, AP214) wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah, doorashadeedana waxay tiraysaa \"STEP for SolidWorks: weli lama dhisin. …\". Kernel saxda ah ayaa jirta, faylku wuxuu qaadayaa magaca qaybta, millimitir iyo midabka qaybta, wuxuuna taagayaa Y sida SolidWorks u muujiyo qaybaha (dhoofinta caadiga ah ee STEP AP214 (jidh adag oo saxda ah) wuxuu taagayaa Z). Xarfaha leh calaamado waxay ka lumaan magaca, astaamaha kale ee ka baxsan ASCII fudud waxay noqdaan _. Qayb dib u soo celi Furidda faylka PartCraft-ka (tallaabada 3) weli lama dhisin nooca hadda: wuxuu leeyahay \"Furidda dhoofinta SolidWorks: weli lama dhisin. …\". App-ka naqshadaha CadCraft wali wuu furaa faylka wuuna qaadaa naqshadahooda. Dooro Fayl \u003E Dhoofi \u003E Macro dhoofinta si loo soo celiyo qaybaha (.swb) si aad u soo dejiso CadCraftExport.swb, kadibna ku dhig qaybahaaga dhinaciisa. SolidWorks, fur qaybta, dooro Tools \u003E Macro \u003E Run oo dooro CadCraftExport.swb. Wuxuu qoraa \u003Cpart\u003E.cadcraft-sw.json dhinaca qaybta wuuna ku beddelin waxba. PartCraft, dooro Fur oo dooro faylkaas, ama ku riix muuqaalka 3D. Kernel saxda ah ayaa jira, PartCraft wuxuu qaybta dib u dhisaa astaamo astaamo, wuxuuna muujiyaa waxa sameeyay: tusaale \"5 ka 5 astaamood ayaa laga soo qaatay SolidWorks (Flange.SLDPRT)\", astaamo kasta oo aan qaadi karin (\"Lama qaadin: Sweep1 (Sweep).\") iyo in mugga uu la mid yahay kii SolidWorks qoray. Ku kaydi qayb PartCraft ah Kaydi. Naqshadaha waxay ku dhacaan diyaarad aasaas marka ay ku taalo, wejiga fidsan ee u dhigma qaybta marka uu jiro (si ay ugu raacaan tafatirka dambe), iyo diyaarad go'an haddii kale. Geesaha iyo wejiyada fillet-yada, chamfer-yada iyo shell-yada waxaa laga helaa barooyin oo waxaa lagu hayaa tixraac magac leh. Doorsoomayaasha caalamiga ah waxay noqdaan halbeegyo (magacyada leh meelo banaan waxay helaan hoosaas: \"Bolt count\" wuxuu noqdaa Bolt_count) isla-gelinna waxay noqdaan isla-gelin cabbirrada isku mid ah. Waxba lama saadaaliyo: wax aan lahayn nidaamka tooda waa la liistaa. App-ka naqshadaha CadCraft isla faylka ayuu furaa wuxuuna qaadaa naqshadahooda. Nooca waa cadcraft-sw-export nooca 1, JSON qoraal fudud oo millimitir iyo darajo ah. Fayl ka timid macro cusub, ama oo aan sax ahayn, waa la diidaa sababta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"open-3dm-files","scope":"partcraft","title":"Fur moodel .3dm ah sida jidh adag","summary":"Keen meshes, polysurfaces iyo blocks ee faylka .3dm PartCraft-ka sida hal jidh adag oo aad jarayso, ku darto oo ku sawirto; triangles-ka meesha ay ka yimaadaan, iyo wixii laga reebo.","section":"tasks","order":89,"keywords":["3dm","nurbs","polysurface","brep","dusha","render mesh","extrusion","blocks","soo geli","mesh ilaa jidh adag","unitiyada","jidh la soo geliyay"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-faylka","text":"Fur faylka","level":2},{"id":"halka-triangles-ka-ka-yimaadaan","text":"Halka triangles-ka ka yimaadaan","level":2},{"id":"hal-jidh-ayuu-noqdaa-wax-kasta-oo-faylka-ku-jira","text":"Hal jidh ayuu noqdaa wax kasta oo faylka ku jira","level":2},{"id":"waxa-laga-reebo-oo-la-sheegay","text":"Waxa laga reebo oo la sheegay","level":2},{"id":"marka-aanay-xirmin","text":"Marka aanay xirmin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu furaa faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E sida \u003Cstrong\u003Ejidh adag\u003C/strong\u003E, isla siyaabaha uu u furo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003ESTL, OBJ ama 3MF mesh\u003C/a\u003E. Jidhku wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida jidh adag kasta: jar, ku dar, god ka sam, qaab sameey, sawir-gacmeed ku samee wejiyadiisa siman. Taariikh u gaar ah ma leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-faylka\"\u003EFur faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, oo dooro faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E. Ama ku dhig muuqaalka 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPartCraft wuu akhriyaa oo wuxuu muujinayaa wixii uu helay: inta shay oo wejiyo leh ee soo gala, inta wejiyo ka timid meshes-ka lagu kaydiyay faylka iyo inta PartCraft tessellate gareeyay, saxid kasta, iyo haddii natiijadu \u003Cstrong\u003Exirmayso\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi \u003Cstrong\u003EUnitiyada faylka\u003C/strong\u003E (faylku wuxuu sheegaa kiisa; unit aan PartCraft ku qorin, sida yards, waxaa loo beddelaa millimitir) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESare ee faylka\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur sida jidh\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal si loo\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar qaybtan\u003C/span\u003E marka qaybta horey u leedahay astaamo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halka-triangles-ka-ka-yimaadaan\"\u003EHalka triangles-ka ka yimaadaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu jidhadka ka dhisaa triangles nooca tan, sidaas darteed dusha kasta ee faylka wuxuu noqdaa wejiyo yar oo siman. Wejig kasta oo polysurface (iyo extrusion kasta) wuxuu qaataa \u003Cstrong\u003Erender mesh-ka lagu kaydiyay faylka\u003C/strong\u003E haddii uu jiro, haddii kale \u003Cstrong\u003Ewuu tessellate gareeyaa naftiisa\u003C/strong\u003E (diyaarro, dusha NURBS, dusha wareegga, qalooca la extrude gareeyay iyo extrusions-ka, oo geesahooda lagu jaray). Wejiyada hal polysurface waxay wadaagaan dhibcaha geesahooda, sidaas darteed polysurface xidhan ayuu xidhan yimaadaa. Wejig ku yaal nooc dusha ah oo PartCraft weli aan akhrin lama soo geli, qoraalkuna wuu sheegaa inta iyo nooca; natiijadu markaas badanaa ma xirmayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-jidh-ayuu-noqdaa-wax-kasta-oo-faylka-ku-jira\"\u003EHal jidh ayuu noqdaa wax kasta oo faylka ku jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMesh, polysurface iyo extrusion kasta oo muuqda, iyo meel kasta oo block ah, waxay galaan \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal\u003C/strong\u003E jidh meesha faylku ku dhigo. Shayada qarsan, ama lakab damsan, way ka reebmaan. Marka faylku ka kooban yahay dhowr jidh oo kala go&#039;an, jidhku wuxuu leeyahay dhowr qayb: fur mid kasta faylkiisa gaarka ah haddii aad rabto inay jidh kala gaar ah noqdaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-laga-reebo-oo-la-sheegay\"\u003EWaxa laga reebo oo la sheegay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalooca, dhibcaha, point cloud-ka, qoraalka, cabbirrada, hatches iyo iftiinka waa la reebaa: jidhku wuxuu qaataa wejiyada oo keliya. Sidoo kale SubD objects (u beddel meshes ama polysurfaces barnaamijka faylka sameeyay marka hore), blocks laga xidhay faylal kale, iyo midabyada, lakabyada iyo magacyada (jidhadka PartCraft-ka halkan lama leh kuwo u gaar ah).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-aanay-xirmin\"\u003EMarka aanay xirmin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPolysurfaces-ka furan iyo dusha (dusha keli ah oo la jaray, qaab wejig maqan) ma leeyihiin gudaha, sidaas darteed jidh adag ma noqon karaan. Qoraalku wuxuu sheegaa inta god ee harsan, ma darayo waxba. Ku isku xir ama xidh qaabka barnaamijka uu ku sameeyay, kaydi, kadibna mar kale fur. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes#when-a-mesh-does-not-close\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\" data-hash=\"when-a-mesh-does-not-close\"\u003EMarka mesh-ku xirmin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"PartCraft wuxuu furaa faylasha .3dm sida jidh adag, isla siyaabaha uu u furo STL, OBJ ama 3MF mesh. Jidhku wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida jidh adag kasta: jar, ku dar, god ka sam, qaab sameey, sawir-gacmeed ku samee wejiyadiisa siman. Taariikh u gaar ah ma leh. Fur faylka Dooro Fur ama riix Ctrl+O, oo dooro faylka .3dm. Ama ku dhig muuqaalka 3D. PartCraft wuu akhriyaa oo wuxuu muujinayaa wixii uu helay: inta shay oo wejiyo leh ee soo gala, inta wejiyo ka timid meshes-ka lagu kaydiyay faylka iyo inta PartCraft tessellate gareeyay, saxid kasta, iyo haddii natiijadu xirmayso. Hubi Unitiyada faylka (faylku wuxuu sheegaa kiisa; unit aan PartCraft ku qorin, sida yards, waxaa loo beddelaa millimitir) iyo Sare ee faylka. Dooro Fur sida jidh, ama Isticmaal si loo iyo Ku dar qaybtan marka qaybta horey u leedahay astaamo. Halka triangles-ka ka yimaadaan PartCraft wuxuu jidhadka ka dhisaa triangles nooca tan, sidaas darteed dusha kasta ee faylka wuxuu noqdaa wejiyo yar oo siman. Wejig kasta oo polysurface (iyo extrusion kasta) wuxuu qaataa render mesh-ka lagu kaydiyay faylka haddii uu jiro, haddii kale wuu tessellate gareeyaa naftiisa (diyaarro, dusha NURBS, dusha wareegga, qalooca la extrude gareeyay iyo extrusions-ka, oo geesahooda lagu jaray). Wejiyada hal polysurface waxay wadaagaan dhibcaha geesahooda, sidaas darteed polysurface xidhan ayuu xidhan yimaadaa. Wejig ku yaal nooc dusha ah oo PartCraft weli aan akhrin lama soo geli, qoraalkuna wuu sheegaa inta iyo nooca; natiijadu markaas badanaa ma xirmayso. Hal jidh ayuu noqdaa wax kasta oo faylka ku jira Mesh, polysurface iyo extrusion kasta oo muuqda, iyo meel kasta oo block ah, waxay galaan hal jidh meesha faylku ku dhigo. Shayada qarsan, ama lakab damsan, way ka reebmaan. Marka faylku ka kooban yahay dhowr jidh oo kala go'an, jidhku wuxuu leeyahay dhowr qayb: fur mid kasta faylkiisa gaarka ah haddii aad rabto inay jidh kala gaar ah noqdaan. Waxa laga reebo oo la sheegay Qalooca, dhibcaha, point cloud-ka, qoraalka, cabbirrada, hatches iyo iftiinka waa la reebaa: jidhku wuxuu qaataa wejiyada oo keliya. Sidoo kale SubD objects (u beddel meshes ama polysurfaces barnaamijka faylka sameeyay marka hore), blocks laga xidhay faylal kale, iyo midabyada, lakabyada iyo magacyada (jidhadka PartCraft-ka halkan lama leh kuwo u gaar ah). Marka aanay xirmin Polysurfaces-ka furan iyo dusha (dusha keli ah oo la jaray, qaab wejig maqan) ma leeyihiin gudaha, sidaas darteed jidh adag ma noqon karaan. Qoraalku wuxuu sheegaa inta god ee harsan, ma darayo waxba. Ku isku xir ama xidh qaabka barnaamijka uu ku sameeyay, kaydi, kadibna mar kale fur. Eeg Marka mesh-ku xirmin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"edit-history","scope":"partcraft","title":"Beddel qayb taariikhdeeda","summary":"Ka beddel astaamaha iyo sawir-gacmeedyada dambe, joojiso, ku celi, ku dar astaamo hore, dib u habee, magac u bedel oo tirtir, iyo ka noqo mid kasta.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["taariikh","geedka astaamaha","geedka naqshadda","wax ka beddel astaamaha","wax ka beddel sawir-gacmeedka","joojiso","dib u shido","ku celi","dib u hor dhaqaaq","dib u habee","tirtir","magac u bedel","ka noqo","samee mar kale","dib u dhis","dib u soo saar","waalid carruur","qayb weyn","astaamo badan","dib u dhis gaabis","750 astaamood"],"headings":[{"id":"ka-beddel-astaam","text":"Ka beddel astaam","level":2},{"id":"beddel-geesaha-ama-wejiyada-fillet-chamfer-ama-shell-ay-isticmaalaan","text":"Beddel geesaha ama wejiyada fillet, chamfer ama shell ay isticmaalaan","level":2},{"id":"beddel-sawir-gacmeed","text":"Beddel sawir-gacmeed","level":2},{"id":"marka-astaam-fashilmo","text":"Marka astaam fashilmo","level":2},{"id":"joojiso-astaam","text":"Joojiso astaam","level":2},{"id":"ku-celi","text":"Ku celi","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-habee-astaamaha","text":"Dib u habee astaamaha","level":2},{"id":"tirtir-astaam","text":"Tirtir astaam","level":2},{"id":"magac-u-bedel","text":"Magac u bedel","level":2},{"id":"qaybo-leh-boqolaal-astaamood","text":"Qaybo leh boqolaal astaamood","level":2},{"id":"ka-noqo-iyo-samee-mar-kale","text":"Ka noqo iyo samee mar kale","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQayb PartCraft waa taariikhdeeda: liiska dusha, sawir-gacmeedyada iyo astaamaha ee bidix. PartCraft wuxuu solid-ka ka dib u dhisaa xagga sare ee liiskaas mar kasta oo wax isbeddelaan. Beddelka lambar hore ku yaal liiska wuxuu beddelaa wax kasta oo ku dhisan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-beddel-astaam\"\u003EKa beddel astaam\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji astaamaha taariikhda (ama sawir-gacmeedka hoos ugu xiran).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu beddel dejintiisa panelka midig. Beddel kasta mar dhow ayuu dib u dhisaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa jiro Hagaag ama Jooji: beddel kasta waa la dhaqmiyaa. Haddii aanad jeclayn, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-geesaha-ama-wejiyada-fillet-chamfer-ama-shell-ay-isticmaalaan\"\u003EBeddel geesaha ama wejiyada fillet, chamfer ama shell ay isticmaalaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba jeer guji astaamaha taariikhda, ama dooro oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick edges\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick faces\u003C/span\u003E). Guji geesaha ama wejiyada si aad ugu darto ama uga saarto, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003ERound, bevel and hollow\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-sawir-gacmeed\"\u003EBeddel sawir-gacmeed\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer guji sawir-gacmeedka taariikhda, ama dooro oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit sketch\u003C/span\u003E panelka midig (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E qalabka sare).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybtu waxay u noqotaa sida ay ahayd markii sawir-gacmeedka la sameeyay: astaamaha ka dambeeya ayaa la qariyaa inta aad wax beddelayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel geometry-ga, xiriirrada ama cabbirrada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXir sawir-gacmeedka. Qaybta oo dhan ayaa dib loo dhisaa isbeddelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad rabto oo keliya inaad beddesho cabbir, ma u baahnid inaad furto sawir-gacmeedka. Dooro astaamaha ama sawir-gacmeedka oo beddel lambarka hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada sawir-gacmeedka\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada wadista\u003C/strong\u003E) panelka midig. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/change-sizes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/change-sizes\"\u003EChange sizes without opening the sketch\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-astaam-fashilmo\"\u003EMarka astaam fashilmo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii isbeddel ka dhigo astaam mid aan suurtagal ahayn, PartCraft wuxuu dhisaa wax kasta oo kale wuxuuna calaamadiyaa dhibaatada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eastaamuhu taariikhda wuxuu ku muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003E⚠ khalad\u003C/strong\u003E, fariintiisana waxay ku taal xagga sare ee panelka midig (sidoo kale dhig safka si aad u akhrido);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eastaamaha u baahan wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003E⚠ aan la dhisin\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ku qoran &quot;Waxay u baahan tahay Extrude2, kaas oo fashilmaya.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Echip-ka status bar-ka wuxuu leeyahay &quot;1 astaamo oo fashilmaya&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHagaaji sababta (ama ka noqo), qaybtuna mar kale way dhisantaa. Fariimaha caadiga ah iyo waxa lagu sameeyo waxay ku jiraan \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003ETroubleshooting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"joojiso-astaam\"\u003EJoojiso astaam\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoojinta waxay damisaa astaam iyada oo aan la tirtirin: waxtar leh marka aad isku daydo qayb aan god ama pattern lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro astaamaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESuppress\u003C/span\u003E. Safkiisa wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eoff\u003C/strong\u003E. Astaamaha u baahan ayaa sidoo kale aan la dhisin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnsuppress\u003C/span\u003E si aad dib u shido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-celi\"\u003EKu celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu celinta waxay dhisaa qaybta ilaa meel gaar ah, si aad u aragto sida ay ahayd, ama aad astaam ku darto taariikhda hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro astaam oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoll back to here\u003C/span\u003E. Astaamahaas iyo kuwa kasta oo hoosta ka yaal waa midab cawl oo aan la dhisin. Safka \u003Cstrong\u003ERollback bar · roll forward\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu calaamadiyaa meesha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAstaam kasta oo aad hadda ku darto waxay galaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003Exarriiqa ku celinta\u003C/strong\u003E, ka hor kuwa midab cawlka ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003ERollback bar · roll forward\u003C/strong\u003E si wax walba mar kale loo dhiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeesha ku celinta waa la kaydiyaa faylka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-habee-astaamaha\"\u003EDib u habee astaamaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro astaamaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove up\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove down\u003C/span\u003E, ama markaad safka taariikhda diirada saarto, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↑\"\u003E⌥↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↓\"\u003E⌥↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAstaam weligeed kuma dhaqaaqi karo kor wax uu isticmaalo. Badhanku waa midab cawl, oo markaad mouse-ka saarto (ama furaha isku daydo) sababta ayuu sheegayaa, tusaale ahaan &quot;Extrude2 wuxuu isticmaalaa Sketch2, sidaas darteed Sketch2 waa inuu hore u yimaadaa.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa astaamuhu isticmaalo: sawir-gacmeedkiisa; wejiga uu sawir-gacmeedku saaran yahay; astaamaha pattern ama mirror nuqulka ah; xarriiq sawir-gacmeed ama revolve loo isticmaalo jihada ama dhidibka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirtir-astaam\"\u003ETirtir astaam\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro astaamaha oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E panelka midig ama qalabka sare, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii astaamo kale isticmaalaan, PartCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa: &quot;Extrude3, Hole1 waxay isticmaalaan Extrude1 oo sidoo kale waa la tirtiri doonaa.&quot; Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete all\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirtirida astaam ma tirtirto sawir-gacmeedkiisa: sawir-gacmeedku wuxuu dib u soo muuqanayaa aragga sida sawir-gacmeed aan la isticmaalin, oo diyaar u ah astaam kale. Tirtir sawir-gacmeedka si gaar ah haddii aadan u baahnayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"magac-u-bedel\"\u003EMagac u bedel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro astaamaha oo ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EMagac\u003C/strong\u003E cusub hoose panelka midig (ilaa 60 xaraf). Magaca qaybta laftiisa waxa uu ku jiraa panelka midig marka wax aan la dooran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaybo-leh-boqolaal-astaamood\"\u003EQaybo leh boqolaal astaamood\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb leh boqolaal astaamood waxa lagu tijaabiyaa 750. PartCraft waxa uu hayaa solid-ka uu ku lahaa qayb ka mid ah taariikhda, sidaas darteed isbeddel dambe ayaa dib u dhisa astaamaha ka dambeeya oo keliya; isbeddel xagga sare ku dhow ayaa dib u dhisa wax kasta oo ku dhisan, taas oo qaadata waqtiga ugu dheer. Ku celi iyo samee mar kale waxay dib u dhisaan oo keliya meesha laba xaaladood ka duwan yihiin. Si aad qayb weyn si dhaqso ah ugu shaqeysid, ku celi meesha aad ka shaqeynayso (eeg Ku celinta sare) ama joojiso waxa aadan hadda u baahnayn. Dhowr jar iyo boss oo isku taabanin ayaa si wada jir ah loo codsadaa, sidaas darteed qayb ka kooban god iyo boss badan ayaa dhisma dhakhso badan intii tirada astaamaha ay muujineyso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb weyn ayaa gadaal ku dib u dhisma: chip-ka dib u dhiska ee hoose wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EDib-u-dhisaya…\u003C/strong\u003E iyo intii uu gaadhay. Aragga, panelada iyo menyuhyadu way shaqeeyaan inta uu socdo. Qaybta shaashadda ku jirta waa tii ugu dambaysay ee la dhisay ilaa cusubi diyaar yahay. Haddii aad mar kale wax beddesho inta ay dib u dhisanaysay, PartCraft wuxuu dhisaa nooca ugu cusub wuxuuna tirtiraa kii socday. Qayb yar ayaa mar dhow dib u dhisma.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-noqo-iyo-samee-mar-kale\"\u003EKa noqo iyo samee mar kale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka noqdaa isbeddelka ugu dambeeya: astaam, dejin, wax ka beddelka sawir-gacmeedka, jiidasho. Status bar-ka wuxuu sheegayaa waxa, tusaale ahaan &quot;Ka noqday beddelka cabbirka.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E ayaa mar kale samaynaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPartCraft wuxuu hayaa 200 tallaabo ugu dambeeya (qayb aad u weyn oo 200 nuqul ay xasuusta badan qaadan lahayd ayaa hayn doona wax ka yar, laakiin ugu yaraan 20 kii ugu cusub). Isbeddelada xaashida naqshadda (qaybta jarka, jaranjarka GD&amp;T ee la dhaqaajiyey) waxay ku jiraan isla liiskaas. Furista fayl ama bilaabista qayb cusub ayaa tirtira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMac-ka, u isticmaal ⇧⌘Z si aad mar kale u samayso. Safari-ga, ⌘Y waxa laga yaabaa inuu furo taariikhda browser-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E","text":"Qayb PartCraft waa taariikhdeeda: liiska dusha, sawir-gacmeedyada iyo astaamaha ee bidix. PartCraft wuxuu solid-ka ka dib u dhisaa xagga sare ee liiskaas mar kasta oo wax isbeddelaan. Beddelka lambar hore ku yaal liiska wuxuu beddelaa wax kasta oo ku dhisan. Ka beddel astaam Guji astaamaha taariikhda (ama sawir-gacmeedka hoos ugu xiran). Ku beddel dejintiisa panelka midig. Beddel kasta mar dhow ayuu dib u dhisaa. Ma jiro Hagaag ama Jooji: beddel kasta waa la dhaqmiyaa. Haddii aanad jeclayn, riix Ctrl+Z. Beddel geesaha ama wejiyada fillet, chamfer ama shell ay isticmaalaan Laba jeer guji astaamaha taariikhda, ama dooro oo dooro Pick edges (ama Pick faces). Guji geesaha ama wejiyada si aad ugu darto ama uga saarto, kadibna Done ama Esc. Eeg Round, bevel and hollow. Beddel sawir-gacmeed Laba jeer guji sawir-gacmeedka taariikhda, ama dooro oo dooro Edit sketch panelka midig (ama Sketch qalabka sare). Qaybtu waxay u noqotaa sida ay ahayd markii sawir-gacmeedka la sameeyay: astaamaha ka dambeeya ayaa la qariyaa inta aad wax beddelayso. Beddel geometry-ga, xiriirrada ama cabbirrada. Xir sawir-gacmeedka. Qaybta oo dhan ayaa dib loo dhisaa isbeddelka. Haddii aad rabto oo keliya inaad beddesho cabbir, ma u baahnid inaad furto sawir-gacmeedka. Dooro astaamaha ama sawir-gacmeedka oo beddel lambarka hoos Cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedka (ama Cabbirrada wadista) panelka midig. Eeg Change sizes without opening the sketch. Marka astaam fashilmo Haddii isbeddel ka dhigo astaam mid aan suurtagal ahayn, PartCraft wuxuu dhisaa wax kasta oo kale wuxuuna calaamadiyaa dhibaatada: astaamuhu taariikhda wuxuu ku muujinayaa ⚠ khalad, fariintiisana waxay ku taal xagga sare ee panelka midig (sidoo kale dhig safka si aad u akhrido); astaamaha u baahan wuxuu muujinayaa ⚠ aan la dhisin, oo ku qoran \"Waxay u baahan tahay Extrude2, kaas oo fashilmaya.\" chip-ka status bar-ka wuxuu leeyahay \"1 astaamo oo fashilmaya\". Hagaaji sababta (ama ka noqo), qaybtuna mar kale way dhisantaa. Fariimaha caadiga ah iyo waxa lagu sameeyo waxay ku jiraan Troubleshooting. Joojiso astaam Joojinta waxay damisaa astaam iyada oo aan la tirtirin: waxtar leh marka aad isku daydo qayb aan god ama pattern lahayn. Dooro astaamaha. Dooro Suppress. Safkiisa wuxuu muujinayaa off. Astaamaha u baahan ayaa sidoo kale aan la dhisin. Dooro Unsuppress si aad dib u shido. Ku celi Ku celinta waxay dhisaa qaybta ilaa meel gaar ah, si aad u aragto sida ay ahayd, ama aad astaam ku darto taariikhda hore. Dooro astaam oo dooro Roll back to here. Astaamahaas iyo kuwa kasta oo hoosta ka yaal waa midab cawl oo aan la dhisin. Safka Rollback bar · roll forward wuxuu calaamadiyaa meesha. Astaam kasta oo aad hadda ku darto waxay galaysaa xarriiqa ku celinta, ka hor kuwa midab cawlka ah. Guji Rollback bar · roll forward si wax walba mar kale loo dhiso. Meesha ku celinta waa la kaydiyaa faylka. Dib u habee astaamaha Dooro astaamaha. Dooro Move up ama Move down, ama markaad safka taariikhda diirada saarto, riix Alt+↑ ama Alt+↓. Astaam weligeed kuma dhaqaaqi karo kor wax uu isticmaalo. Badhanku waa midab cawl, oo markaad mouse-ka saarto (ama furaha isku daydo) sababta ayuu sheegayaa, tusaale ahaan \"Extrude2 wuxuu isticmaalaa Sketch2, sidaas darteed Sketch2 waa inuu hore u yimaadaa.\" Waxa astaamuhu isticmaalo: sawir-gacmeedkiisa; wejiga uu sawir-gacmeedku saaran yahay; astaamaha pattern ama mirror nuqulka ah; xarriiq sawir-gacmeed ama revolve loo isticmaalo jihada ama dhidibka. Tirtir astaam Dooro astaamaha oo dooro Delete panelka midig ama qalabka sare, ama riix Delete. Haddii astaamo kale isticmaalaan, PartCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa: \"Extrude3, Hole1 waxay isticmaalaan Extrude1 oo sidoo kale waa la tirtiri doonaa.\" Dooro Delete all ama Cancel. Tirtirida astaam ma tirtirto sawir-gacmeedkiisa: sawir-gacmeedku wuxuu dib u soo muuqanayaa aragga sida sawir-gacmeed aan la isticmaalin, oo diyaar u ah astaam kale. Tirtir sawir-gacmeedka si gaar ah haddii aadan u baahnayn. Magac u bedel Dooro astaamaha oo ku qor Magac cusub hoose panelka midig (ilaa 60 xaraf). Magaca qaybta laftiisa waxa uu ku jiraa panelka midig marka wax aan la dooran. Qaybo leh boqolaal astaamood Qayb leh boqolaal astaamood waxa lagu tijaabiyaa 750. PartCraft waxa uu hayaa solid-ka uu ku lahaa qayb ka mid ah taariikhda, sidaas darteed isbeddel dambe ayaa dib u dhisa astaamaha ka dambeeya oo keliya; isbeddel xagga sare ku dhow ayaa dib u dhisa wax kasta oo ku dhisan, taas oo qaadata waqtiga ugu dheer. Ku celi iyo samee mar kale waxay dib u dhisaan oo keliya meesha laba xaaladood ka duwan yihiin. Si aad qayb weyn si dhaqso ah ugu shaqeysid, ku celi meesha aad ka shaqeynayso (eeg Ku celinta sare) ama joojiso waxa aadan hadda u baahnayn. Dhowr jar iyo boss oo isku taabanin ayaa si wada jir ah loo codsadaa, sidaas darteed qayb ka kooban god iyo boss badan ayaa dhisma dhakhso badan intii tirada astaamaha ay muujineyso. Qayb weyn ayaa gadaal ku dib u dhisma: chip-ka dib u dhiska ee hoose wuxuu leeyahay Dib-u-dhisaya… iyo intii uu gaadhay. Aragga, panelada iyo menyuhyadu way shaqeeyaan inta uu socdo. Qaybta shaashadda ku jirta waa tii ugu dambaysay ee la dhisay ilaa cusubi diyaar yahay. Haddii aad mar kale wax beddesho inta ay dib u dhisanaysay, PartCraft wuxuu dhisaa nooca ugu cusub wuxuuna tirtiraa kii socday. Qayb yar ayaa mar dhow dib u dhisma. Ka noqo iyo samee mar kale Ctrl+Z ama Undo wuxuu ka noqdaa isbeddelka ugu dambeeya: astaam, dejin, wax ka beddelka sawir-gacmeedka, jiidasho. Status bar-ka wuxuu sheegayaa waxa, tusaale ahaan \"Ka noqday beddelka cabbirka.\" Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+Shift+Z ama Redo ayaa mar kale samaynaya. PartCraft wuxuu hayaa 200 tallaabo ugu dambeeya (qayb aad u weyn oo 200 nuqul ay xasuusta badan qaadan lahayd ayaa hayn doona wax ka yar, laakiin ugu yaraan 20 kii ugu cusub). Isbeddelada xaashida naqshadda (qaybta jarka, jaranjarka GD&T ee la dhaqaajiyey) waxay ku jiraan isla liiskaas. Furista fayl ama bilaabista qayb cusub ayaa tirtira. Mac-ka, u isticmaal ⇧⌘Z si aad mar kale u samayso. Safari-ga, ⌘Y waxa laga yaabaa inuu furo taariikhda browser-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"live-3dm-link","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ilaali moodeel .3dm oo nool","summary":"Beddel moodeel barnaamijka soo abuuray oo eeg jidhka PartCraft oo raacaya, Rhino 8 ama qeexida Grasshopper, astaamahaaga oo dib loo dhisay qaabka cusub.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["rhino","grasshopper","xiriirka nool","live link","live connection","3dm","nurbs","parametric","xiriir","sync","script","push","jidh la soo geliyay"],"headings":[{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":2},{"id":"rhino-ka","text":"Rhino ka","level":2},{"id":"grasshopper-ka","text":"Grasshopper ka","level":2},{"id":"sidee-u-shaqeysaa-halkan","text":"Sidee u shaqeysaa halkan","level":2},{"id":"haddii-wax-khaldamo","text":"Haddii wax khaldamo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESii wad qaabeynta moodeelka meesha aad ku qaabayso, halkanna mashiinka, hubi oo dukumeenti. Isbeddel kasta oo barnaamijka kale ka dhaca wuxuu beddelaa hal jidh oo la soo geliyay PartCraft, astaamaha ka dambeeya wuxuu dib u dhisaa qaabka cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiriirku wuxuu u baahan yahay \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E isla kombiyuutarka. Tab browser-ka ma qaadi karo xiriirka. Waxba internet-ka ma mareeyo: script-ku wuxuu la hadlaa Studio oo ku jira cinwaanka kombiyuutarkan, oo leh token.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiriirkan waxaa lagu tijaabiyay qoraha faylka script-ka iyo barnaamij kale oo lagu beddelay, weli ma lagu tijaabin Rhino ama Grasshopper gudahooda. Haddii halkaas wax ku guuldareystaan, na sheeg waxa ay yidhi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio gudahiisa, fur PartCraft. Ku \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, calaamee \u003Cstrong\u003EOgolow caawiyaha AI iyo scripts-ka inay isticmaalaan PartCraft\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio gudahiisa, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect an assistant\u003C/span\u003E. Wuxuu muujinayaa cinwaanka iyo token-ka aad ku dhejin doontid hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo deji script-ka: \u003Ca href=\"https://getcadcraft.com/assets/link3dm/cadcraft_link.py\" class=\"hx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rhino-ka\"\u003ERhino ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESocodsii \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/code\u003E script editor-ka Rhino (Python 3 ee Rhino 8).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii ugu horeysay, ku dhaji cinwaanka iyo token-ka. Waxay ku kaydsan yihiin \u003Ccode\u003E.cadcraft-link.json\u003C/code\u003E folder-ka guriga, weligood ma ay ku jiraan moodeelka. Studio wuxuu sameeyaa token cusub mar kasta oo bilaabmo, sidaas darteed script-ku mar kale ayuu weydiinayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad joojiso, mar kale socodsii script-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"grasshopper-ka\"\u003EGrasshopper ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka hore socodsii script-ka hal mar Rhino, si cinwaanka iyo token-ka loo kaydiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar Script component (Python 3) oo ku dhaji \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft_link.py\u003C/code\u003E oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESiiya gelinadan: \u003Ccode\u003EG\u003C/code\u003E (geometry-ga, oo leh list access), \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E (magac, ikhtiyaari), \u003Ccode\u003EOn\u003C/code\u003E (boolean toggle), iyo \u003Ccode\u003ETarget\u003C/code\u003E (ikhtiyaari: \u003Ccode\u003Emodel\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Epart\u003C/code\u003E, haddii labada app ay furan yihiin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHagaaji \u003Ccode\u003EOn\u003C/code\u003E inuu noqdo true.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESolve kasta wuxuu u diraa \u003Ccode\u003EG\u003C/code\u003E, wuxuuna beddelaa waxa component-ku markii hore diray.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sidee-u-shaqeysaa-halkan\"\u003ESidee u shaqeysaa halkan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal jidh.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax kasta oo muuqda moodeelka wuxuu noqdaa hal astaan la soo geliyay, sida markii aad \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003Efurto fayl .3dm\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaa inuu xirmaa.\u003C/strong\u003E PartCraft wuxuu buuxiyaa godadka yaryar iyo furitaanada fidsan, barnaamijka kalena waa la sheegaa tirada. Haddii moodeelku weli aan xirmin, PartCraft wuxuu hayaa jidhkii hore, status bar-kuna wuu sheegaa. Isbeddelka xiga ee xirma ayaa cusboonaysiinaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammee waxa aad sameynayso.\u003C/strong\u003E Sawir ama naqshad gudahooda, cusboonaysiinta waa la diidaa oo mar kale la isku dayaa; way imaan doonaan markaad ku noqoto moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo.\u003C/strong\u003E Isbeddello gudaha laba ilbiriqsi ah waxay wadaagaan hal tallaabo oo ka noqoshada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylka qaybta wuxuu ilaaliyaa xiriirka. Markaad mar kale furto, script-ka mar kale socodsii, astaanta isku midka ahna way cusboonaysiinaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal jid oo keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E Isbeddelada halkan ma soo noqdaan barnaamijka kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"haddii-wax-khaldamo\"\u003EHaddii wax khaldamo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;No ModelCraft or PartCraft window allows it&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E samee tallaabada 1 ee dejinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Studio refused the token&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E Studio dib ayuu u bilaabmay. Koobi token-ka cusub oo mar kale socodsii script-ka. Grasshopper ahaan, marka hore Rhino ku socodsii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Cannot reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E Studio ma socdo, ama cinwaanku waa isbeddelay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Sii wad qaabeynta moodeelka meesha aad ku qaabayso, halkanna mashiinka, hubi oo dukumeenti. Isbeddel kasta oo barnaamijka kale ka dhaca wuxuu beddelaa hal jidh oo la soo geliyay PartCraft, astaamaha ka dambeeya wuxuu dib u dhisaa qaabka cusub. Xiriirku wuxuu u baahan yahay CadCraft Studio isla kombiyuutarka. Tab browser-ka ma qaadi karo xiriirka. Waxba internet-ka ma mareeyo: script-ku wuxuu la hadlaa Studio oo ku jira cinwaanka kombiyuutarkan, oo leh token. Xiriirkan waxaa lagu tijaabiyay qoraha faylka script-ka iyo barnaamij kale oo lagu beddelay, weli ma lagu tijaabin Rhino ama Grasshopper gudahooda. Haddii halkaas wax ku guuldareystaan, na sheeg waxa ay yidhi. Dejinta Studio gudahiisa, fur PartCraft. Ku Settings › PartCraft › Assistants, calaamee Ogolow caawiyaha AI iyo scripts-ka inay isticmaalaan PartCraft, kadibna Edit. Studio gudahiisa, dooro Connect an assistant. Wuxuu muujinayaa cinwaanka iyo token-ka aad ku dhejin doontid hoos. Soo deji script-ka: cadcraft_link.py. Rhino ka Socodsii cadcraft_link.py script editor-ka Rhino (Python 3 ee Rhino 8). Markii ugu horeysay, ku dhaji cinwaanka iyo token-ka. Waxay ku kaydsan yihiin .cadcraft-link.json folder-ka guriga, weligood ma ay ku jiraan moodeelka. Studio wuxuu sameeyaa token cusub mar kasta oo bilaabmo, sidaas darteed script-ku mar kale ayuu weydiinayaa. Si aad joojiso, mar kale socodsii script-ka. Grasshopper ka Marka hore socodsii script-ka hal mar Rhino, si cinwaanka iyo token-ka loo kaydiyo. Ku dar Script component (Python 3) oo ku dhaji cadcraft_link.py oo dhan. Siiya gelinadan: G (geometry-ga, oo leh list access), N (magac, ikhtiyaari), On (boolean toggle), iyo Target (ikhtiyaari: model ama part, haddii labada app ay furan yihiin). Hagaaji On inuu noqdo true. Solve kasta wuxuu u diraa G, wuxuuna beddelaa waxa component-ku markii hore diray. Sidee u shaqeysaa halkan Hal jidh. Wax kasta oo muuqda moodeelka wuxuu noqdaa hal astaan la soo geliyay, sida markii aad furto fayl .3dm. Waa inuu xirmaa. PartCraft wuxuu buuxiyaa godadka yaryar iyo furitaanada fidsan, barnaamijka kalena waa la sheegaa tirada. Haddii moodeelku weli aan xirmin, PartCraft wuxuu hayaa jidhkii hore, status bar-kuna wuu sheegaa. Isbeddelka xiga ee xirma ayaa cusboonaysiinaya. Dhammee waxa aad sameynayso. Sawir ama naqshad gudahooda, cusboonaysiinta waa la diidaa oo mar kale la isku dayaa; way imaan doonaan markaad ku noqoto moodeelka. Ka noqo. Isbeddello gudaha laba ilbiriqsi ah waxay wadaagaan hal tallaabo oo ka noqoshada. Kaydi. Faylka qaybta wuxuu ilaaliyaa xiriirka. Markaad mar kale furto, script-ka mar kale socodsii, astaanta isku midka ahna way cusboonaysiinaysaa. Hal jid oo keliya. Isbeddelada halkan ma soo noqdaan barnaamijka kale. Haddii wax khaldamo \"No ModelCraft or PartCraft window allows it\": samee tallaabada 1 ee dejinta. \"Studio refused the token\": Studio dib ayuu u bilaabmay. Koobi token-ka cusub oo mar kale socodsii script-ka. Grasshopper ahaan, marka hore Rhino ku socodsii. \"Cannot reach CadCraft Studio\": Studio ma socdo, ama cinwaanku waa isbeddelay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"bim-element","scope":"partcraft","title":"Naqshee BIM element oo ku kaydi dib BimCraft","summary":"Qayb laga soo diray BimCraft waxay ku furmaysaa dhismaha agteeda, midab cawl oo aan la beddeli karin. Beddel, kadibna ku kaydi dib si BimCraft u aqbali karo qaabka cusub.","section":"tasks","order":91,"keywords":["bimcraft","bim","element","u dir","ku kaydi dib","xiriir","dhismaha","xidhiidh","deriska","taageer","bracket","ifc","aqbal"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-arki-karto","text":"Waxa aad arki karto","level":2},{"id":"waxa-fiican-in-la-ogaado","text":"Waxa fiican in la ogaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa shaqee qayb ka timid moodeelka BimCraft, meeshiisa dhismaha gudahiisa, kadibna qaabka cusub u dir guriga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft ku dooro element, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPart links\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend to PartCraft\u003C/span\u003E. PartCraft wuxuu ku furayaa qayb cusub. Status bar-ka wuxuu sheegayaa inay tahay BIM element.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EElementyada ku wareegsan (gudaha 3 m) waa midab cawl. Waxay halkaas yaalliin si aad wax ugu naqshadeyso. Ma dooran kartid ama ma beddeli kartid, lamana kaydin faylka qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta u beddel sida caadiga ah: jar, ku dar, god ku sam, mirror. Bartilmaameedkeeda iyo dhidibyadeeda waa kuwa element-ka laftiisa, sidaas darteed qaybtu waxay ku soo noqonaysaa meeshii ay joogtay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave back to BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E. Status bar-ka wuxuu sheegayaa dib-u-eegista aad u dirtay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft element-ku wuxuu muujinayaa inuu isbeddelay ilaa qofka halkaas joogaa uu aqbalo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-arki-karto\"\u003EWaxa aad arki karto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybtu waxay haysaa xiriirkeeda faylka. Markaad mar kale furto, status bar-ka wali wuxuu sheegayaa inay tahay BIM element. Dhismaha midabka cawlka ahi wuu soo noqonayaa inta browser-ku wali hayo xirmada loo diray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMar kale ku kaydi dib wuxuu diraa dib-u-eegis 2, 3 iyo intaas ka dambeysa. BimCraft wuxuu hayaa kan ugu cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-fiican-in-la-ogaado\"\u003EWaxa fiican in la ogaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabka waxa dib loogu celiyaa BimCraft wuxuu u yimaadaa mesh ah millimitir, dhidibyada element-ka laftiisa. Astaamaha waxay ku sii jiraan PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave back to BimCraft\u003C/span\u003E ma samayn wax qayb aan ka imaan BimCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayb aan weli lahayn solid ma leh wax la diro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELabada app waa in ay ku furan yihiin isla browser: wax lama soo rarayo; labada bog ayaa element-ka isaga dhex gudbiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Ka shaqee qayb ka timid moodeelka BimCraft, meeshiisa dhismaha gudahiisa, kadibna qaabka cusub u dir guriga. Tallaabooyinka BimCraft ku dooro element, kadibna dooro Part links › Send to PartCraft. PartCraft wuxuu ku furayaa qayb cusub. Status bar-ka wuxuu sheegayaa inay tahay BIM element. Elementyada ku wareegsan (gudaha 3 m) waa midab cawl. Waxay halkaas yaalliin si aad wax ugu naqshadeyso. Ma dooran kartid ama ma beddeli kartid, lamana kaydin faylka qaybta. Qaybta u beddel sida caadiga ah: jar, ku dar, god ku sam, mirror. Bartilmaameedkeeda iyo dhidibyadeeda waa kuwa element-ka laftiisa, sidaas darteed qaybtu waxay ku soo noqonaysaa meeshii ay joogtay. Dooro File › Export › Save back to BimCraft. Status bar-ka wuxuu sheegayaa dib-u-eegista aad u dirtay. BimCraft element-ku wuxuu muujinayaa inuu isbeddelay ilaa qofka halkaas joogaa uu aqbalo. Waxa aad arki karto Qaybtu waxay haysaa xiriirkeeda faylka. Markaad mar kale furto, status bar-ka wali wuxuu sheegayaa inay tahay BIM element. Dhismaha midabka cawlka ahi wuu soo noqonayaa inta browser-ku wali hayo xirmada loo diray. Mar kale ku kaydi dib wuxuu diraa dib-u-eegis 2, 3 iyo intaas ka dambeysa. BimCraft wuxuu hayaa kan ugu cusub. Waxa fiican in la ogaado Qaabka waxa dib loogu celiyaa BimCraft wuxuu u yimaadaa mesh ah millimitir, dhidibyada element-ka laftiisa. Astaamaha waxay ku sii jiraan PartCraft. Save back to BimCraft ma samayn wax qayb aan ka imaan BimCraft. Qayb aan weli lahayn solid ma leh wax la diro. Labada app waa in ay ku furan yihiin isla browser: wax lama soo rarayo; labada bog ayaa element-ka isaga dhex gudbiya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"rib","scope":"partcraft","title":"Bilaanno iyo gussets","summary":"Adkee qayb adoo isticmaalaya bilaan lagu sawiray hal khad: wuxuu ka buuxiyaa khadka ilaa darbiyada, qaro la doortay oo dhumucdiisu waa gaar ah dusha naqshadda, dhinaca aad dooratay.","section":"tasks","order":92,"keywords":["rib","gusset","web","stiffener","brace","bracket","taageero geeska","darbi khafiif ah","adkee"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-bilaan","text":"Ku dar bilaan","level":2},{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":2},{"id":"fariimaha","text":"Fariimaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeli lama dhisin nooca kan.\u003C/strong\u003E Bilaanku wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel joomitari saxda ah, oo nooca PartCraft-kan ma laha: wuxuu dhisaa qayb kasta adigoo isticmaalaya mesh kernel. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sheegaa waxa la sameeyo halkii. Bogga intiisa kale wuxuu sharraxayaa sida uu u shaqeeyo kernel saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBilaan\u003C/strong\u003E (ama gusset) waa darbi khafiif ah oo adkeeya qayb, sida saddexagalka ku jira geeska L-bracket. Waxaad sawirtaa kaliya geeskiisa xor ah: PartCraft wuxuu buuxiyaa meesha u dhaxaysa khadkaas iyo darbiyada. Wuxuu u baahan yahay \u003Cstrong\u003Ekernel saxda ah\u003C/strong\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-bilaan\"\u003EKu dar bilaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee dusha ku marta bartamaha meesha bilaanku tagayo (bracket L ah oo 40 gudih ah, dusha 20 hore u taagan naqshaddiisa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/reference-geometry\" data-topic=\"partcraft/reference-geometry\"\u003EDusha tixraaca, dhidibyada iyo barodu\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadee dusha \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal khad\u003C/strong\u003E darbi ilaa darbi — ama dhowr khad oo isku xiran dhamaad ilaa dhamaad si uu geeska bilaanku u foororo. Khadku wuu gaaban karaa darbiyada: geesihiisa waa la sii wadaa ilaa ay ku kulmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro naqshadda oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERib\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBilaanku wuxuu ka buuxiyaa khadka ilaa darbiyada dhinaca bartamaha qaybta, sidaas darteed gusset-ku wuxuu ku dhacaa geeska gudaha. Haddii dhinacaas uu furan yahay oo kan kale xidhan yahay, PartCraft wuu rogaa oo wuu sheegaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThickness (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E waa dhumucda bilaanka dhexdeeda naqshadda. Waxaa lagu maamuli karaa parameter.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThickness\u003C/strong\u003E (doorashada hoosteeda): \u003Cstrong\u003ECentred on the sketch plane\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EIn front of the plane\u003C/strong\u003E (jihada caadiga) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EBehind the plane\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlip\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa dhinaca kale ee khadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fariimaha\"\u003EFariimaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhinacaas geesta bilaanku weligeed ma kulanto jidhka\u003C/strong\u003E — wax ma xidhaan dhinacaas: calaamadee ama ka saar \u003Cstrong\u003EFlip\u003C/strong\u003E, ama dhaqdhaqi khadka si uu darbiyo xadeeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBilaanku waa inuu lahaadaa hal silsilad furan oo khadad ah naqshaddiisa\u003C/strong\u003E — naqshaddu waxay leedahay qaab xidhan, qos ama spline, ama khadad aan isku xirmin dhamaad ilaa dhamaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesta bilaanku halkaas ayay jidhka gudihiisa ku socotaa\u003C/strong\u003E — khadku wuxuu ku jiraa jidhka adag; ku sawir meesha furan ee u dhaxaysa darbiyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Weli lama dhisin nooca kan. Bilaanku wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel joomitari saxda ah, oo nooca PartCraft-kan ma laha: wuxuu dhisaa qayb kasta adigoo isticmaalaya mesh kernel. Waxa weli aan la dhisin wuxuu sheegaa waxa la sameeyo halkii. Bogga intiisa kale wuxuu sharraxayaa sida uu u shaqeeyo kernel saxda ah. Bilaan (ama gusset) waa darbi khafiif ah oo adkeeya qayb, sida saddexagalka ku jira geeska L-bracket. Waxaad sawirtaa kaliya geeskiisa xor ah: PartCraft wuxuu buuxiyaa meesha u dhaxaysa khadkaas iyo darbiyada. Wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah (eeg Mesh kernel). Ku dar bilaan Samee dusha ku marta bartamaha meesha bilaanku tagayo (bracket L ah oo 40 gudih ah, dusha 20 hore u taagan naqshaddiisa: eeg Dusha tixraaca, dhidibyada iyo barodu). Naqshadee dusha hal khad darbi ilaa darbi — ama dhowr khad oo isku xiran dhamaad ilaa dhamaad si uu geeska bilaanku u foororo. Khadku wuu gaaban karaa darbiyada: geesihiisa waa la sii wadaa ilaa ay ku kulmaan. Dooro naqshadda oo dooro More › Rib. Bilaanku wuxuu ka buuxiyaa khadka ilaa darbiyada dhinaca bartamaha qaybta, sidaas darteed gusset-ku wuxuu ku dhacaa geeska gudaha. Haddii dhinacaas uu furan yahay oo kan kale xidhan yahay, PartCraft wuu rogaa oo wuu sheegaa. Dejinta Thickness (mm) waa dhumucda bilaanka dhexdeeda naqshadda. Waxaa lagu maamuli karaa parameter. Thickness (doorashada hoosteeda): Centred on the sketch plane, In front of the plane (jihada caadiga) ama Behind the plane. Flip wuxuu buuxiyaa dhinaca kale ee khadka. Fariimaha Dhinacaas geesta bilaanku weligeed ma kulanto jidhka — wax ma xidhaan dhinacaas: calaamadee ama ka saar Flip, ama dhaqdhaqi khadka si uu darbiyo xadeeyaan. Bilaanku waa inuu lahaadaa hal silsilad furan oo khadad ah naqshaddiisa — naqshaddu waxay leedahay qaab xidhan, qos ama spline, ama khadad aan isku xirmin dhamaad ilaa dhamaad. Geesta bilaanku halkaas ayay jidhka gudihiisa ku socotaa — khadku wuxuu ku jiraa jidhka adag; ku sawir meesha furan ee u dhaxaysa darbiyada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"form-surfaces","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qaabab xor ah oo Form ah, iyo astaamaha dusha","summary":"Riix oo jiid kaab xarig siman oo ku jira goobta Form, xardhay geesaha, isticmaal simmetri, hubi oo dhammaystir qayb adag ama dusha saxda ah, kadibna ku daa, loft, stitch, qaro, offset, extend iyo trim dushyada Design-ka. Waxa saxda ah iyo waxa lagu qiyaasay.","section":"tasks","order":92,"keywords":["form","qaab xor ah","t-spline","subdivision","catmull-clark","kaab","quadball","xardh","simmetri","zebra","qallooc","curvature","dusha","ku daa","loft surface","stitch","sew","qaro","offset surface","extend","trim"],"headings":[{"id":"bilow-kaab","text":"Bilow kaab","level":2},{"id":"dooro-oo-dhaqaaqi","text":"Dooro oo dhaqaaqi","level":2},{"id":"beddel-kaabka","text":"Beddel kaabka","level":2},{"id":"geesaha-xiran-simmetri-iyo-muuqaal","text":"Geesaha xiran, simmetri iyo muuqaal","level":2},{"id":"hubi-oo-dhammaystir","text":"Hubi oo dhammaystir","level":2},{"id":"waxa-saxda-ah-iyo-waxa-lagu-qiyaasay","text":"Waxa saxda ah iyo waxa lagu qiyaasay","level":2},{"id":"astaamaha-dusha-ee-design","text":"Astaamaha dusha ee Design","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWali lama dhisin nooca hadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhammaystirka qaabka qaybta gudaheeda, iyo astaamaha dusha, waxay u baahan yihiin kernel joogto saxan, oo nooca PartCraft-ka hadda ma leh: wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan wali la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa waxa lagu sameeyo halkaas. Qaybta kale ee bogga waxay ku tusaysaa sida ay u shaqeeyaan kernel-ka saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobta \u003Cstrong\u003EForm\u003C/strong\u003E waxay samaysaa qaabab dabiici ah. Waxaad tafatirtaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ekaab\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ah mesh qaro ah oo geesood, xarigyo iyo dhinacyo ka kooban. Qaabku waa dusha siman ee kaabku xakameeyo (Catmull–Clark limit surface), sidaas darteed hal geeso oo la jiido ayuu dusha si tartiib ah ugu foorarsadaa. Marka ay u eegto sida ay tahay, \u003Cstrong\u003EFinish\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku daraa taariikhda qaybta sida feature \u003Cem\u003EForm\u003C/em\u003E, kernel-ka saxdana wuxuu u beddelaa B-spline dusho dhab ah. Ka dib waad ku qaroodi kartaa (fillet), gooyn kartaa, ku xidhi kartaa qaybaha kale, oo waad u dhoofin kartaa STEP.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EForm\u003C/strong\u003E liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E ee bidix ee toolbar-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilow-kaab\"\u003EBilow kaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003ESize\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EDivisions\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig. Divisions waa inta dhinac kasta u qaybsanaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhagsii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBox\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuadball\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlane\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka. Panelka waxaa kaloo ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003ECylinder\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ETorus\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EFaces by clicks\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuadball\u003C/strong\u003E waa kaab sanduuq ah oo lagu habeeyey in geesaha ay ku taal goon. Inta u dhaxaysa geesahaas dusha wuxuu ku jiraa wax yar gudaha goonka: qiyaastii 0.4 % mugga ka yar oo leh 2 divisions.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPlane\u003C/strong\u003E waa furan, sidaas darteed waxay noqotaa jidh dusha (eeg &quot;Surface features in Design&quot; hoose).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaces by clicks\u003C/strong\u003E: dhagsii 4 barood korka (dhulka) diyaarada ama geesaha kaabka si aad u samayso hal dhinac. Dhinacyada wadaaga geesaha way isku xidhmaan. Kadib 3 barood riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u samayso saddex-geesood, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u joojiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaabkaaga aan dhammaynin wuxuu lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta, markaa faylka waad xidhi kartaa oo mar dambe sii wadi kartaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-oo-dhaqaaqi\"\u003EDooro oo dhaqaaqi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhagsii geeso, xarig, ama dhinac kaabka. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+dhagsii wuxuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGizmo ayaa ka muuqda bartamaha doorashada. Jiid fallaad si aad ugu dhaqaaqdo jihadeeda, ama jiid labajibbaaran si aad ugu dhaqaaqdo diyaarada. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u guurto, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u wareegto, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u cabbirto, ama isticmaal badhamada panelka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGizmo\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka ayuu u dhex maraa iyaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoft falloff\u003C/strong\u003E (mm) wuxuu sidoo kale jiidaa geesaha ku jira masaafadaas, isagoo si tartiib ah u dhimanaya ilaa eber meesha masaafadu dhammaato.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Y\"\u003E⌃Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sida caadiga ah ayay shaqeeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-kaabka\"\u003EBeddel kaabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhamada \u003Cstrong\u003EModify\u003C/strong\u003E ee panelka waxay shaqeeyaan doorashada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhanka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtrude\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinacyada la doortay waxay u dhaqaaqaan \u003Cstrong\u003EExtrude distance\u003C/strong\u003E masaafada, jihada normal-keeda, iyagoo samaynaya dhinacyo cusub. Xarigyada furan ee la doortay waxay dibadda dhisaan dhinacyo cusub.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdge loop\u003C/span\u003E / Insert edge loop\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu kala qaybiyaa silsiladda dhinacyada afar-geesood ah ee gudbaysa xarigga la doortay, bartamaha. Wareeg badan wuxuu siiyaa qaloocyo adag.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInsert point\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ku daraa geeso bartamaha xarigga la doortay.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESubdivide\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu dhinac kasta oo la doortay u kala qaybiyaa dhinacyo afar-geesood ah oo ku wareegsan bartamaha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBridge\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu isku xidhaa laba dhinac oo la doortay, ama laba fur (dooro hal xarig furan dhinac kasta) tuubo dhinacyo ah. Labaduba waa inay lahaadaan isla tirada xarafyada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFill hole\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu xidhaa furka ku yaal xarigga furan ee la doortay hal dhinac.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeld\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu geesaha la doortay isku dhejiyaa hal geeso, bartamahooda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFlatten\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu geesaha la doortay u guuraa diyaarada ugu fiican ee ku habboon.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu tirtiraa dhinacyada la doortay, xarigyada (laba dhinac ayaa isku biiraya) ama geesaha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geesaha-xiran-simmetri-iyo-muuqaal\"\u003EGeesaha xiran, simmetri iyo muuqaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrease\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geesaha la doortay ka dhigaa kuwo xiran. \u003Cstrong\u003ECrease weight\u003C/strong\u003E 10 waa xiran oo buuxa. Miisaan yar wuxuu xiran yahay tallaabooyin hadda kadib wuu nuugaa, taasoo siisa wareeg adag halkii laga siin lahaa qalab kulul. \u003Cstrong\u003EUncrease\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa siman. \u003Cstrong\u003ESharp vertex\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu geeska xiraa si dusha uga gudbo barta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESymmetry\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaabka ka muujiyaa X, Y ama Z = 0. Wuxuu hayaa dhinaca togan, muujiyaa, oo labada qaybood isku xidhaa. Kadib, tafatirka dhinac kasta labadaba ayuu saameeyaa. Geesaha ku yaal dhinaca muujinta way ku sii jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDisplay\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u beddelaa \u003Cstrong\u003ESmooth\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha uu feature-ku noqonayo) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBox\u003C/strong\u003E (dhinacyada kaabka laftiisa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAnalysis\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EZebra stripes\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka muujiyaa iftiin xariiqyo leh muuqaalka hadda. Si siman ayay dusha siman ugu foorarsadaan, xagga xiranna way jabaan. \u003Cstrong\u003EMean curvature\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu midabeeyaa meelaha qummanaha ah casaan, meelaha qoto dheer buluug, meelaha siman caddaan. Waxaa lagu cabbiraa mesh-ka muuqda iyadoo la adeegsanayo cotangent formula, sidaas darteed waa hage, ma aha cabbir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-oo-dhammaystir\"\u003EHubi oo dhammaystir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck exact\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaabka u beddelaa kernel-ka saxda ah isagoo aan beddelin qaybtaada. Wuxuu sheegaa inta B-spline patch ah ee kaabku sameeyo, inta ka mid ah ee saxda ah, iyo haddii natiijadu tahay jidh adag oo xidhan oo sax ah iyo mugggeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFinish\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu taariikhda ku daraa feature \u003Cem\u003EForm\u003C/em\u003E, ama wuxuu cusboonaysiiyaa qaabka aad tafatirayso, wuxuuna kuugu celinayaa Design. Kaab xidhan wuxuu noqdaa jidh adag. \u003Cstrong\u003EOperation\u003C/strong\u003E ee panelka Design waxay noqon kartaa New body, Join, Cut ama Intersect. Kaab furan wuxuu noqdaa jidh dusha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad qaab ugu beddesho kadib, dooro taariikhda oo riix \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit in Form\u003C/strong\u003E. Jidhka la dhisay wuu qarsoon yahay intaad kaabka tafatirayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDiscard\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tuuraa kaabka isagoo aan taariikhda taabsanin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-saxda-ah-iyo-waxa-lagu-qiyaasay\"\u003EWaxa saxda ah iyo waxa lagu qiyaasay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhinac afar-geesood ah oo kaabka ka mid ah, marka loo baahdo la hagaajiyo, wuxuu noqdaa hal bicubic B-spline patch.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarka geesaha dhinac kasta ay yihiin \u003Cem\u003Eregular\u003C/em\u003E (afar xarig ayaa ku kulma gudaha dusha, ama saddex dusha furan ama qallooc dhexdiisa), patch-ku waa \u003Cstrong\u003Esaxda ah\u003C/strong\u003E dusha subdivision. Tijaabooyinku waxay hubiyaan ilaa 1e-9 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu wareegsan \u003Cstrong\u003Ebarta aan caadiga ahayn\u003C/strong\u003E (saddex, shan ama in ka badan oo xarig ah oo kulma, geesta saddex ama shan dhinac leh, ama dhamaadka qallooc) ma jiro patch polynomial oo saxda ah. Halkaas patch-ku wuxuu qaataa barta saxda ah iyo diyaarada taabashada, iyo khadadka geesaha deriska, si patch-yadu isugu xidhmaan aan wax furan lahayn. Isku-taabashada geesaha ku kulma barta waa qiyaas. Panelka Form iyo panelka feature-ka waxay bixiyaan xagalka ugu weyn, badanaa ka yar 2°. \u003Cstrong\u003ELevel\u003C/strong\u003E sare oo panelka feature-ka ah wuxuu patch-yada ka dhigaa kuwo yar oo u dhow.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQallooca xiran waa xarigyo dhab ah oo jidhka ah, sidaas darteed waad ku qaroodi kartaa (fillet).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPatch kasta waa dusha u gaar ah, sidaas darteed qaabku wuxuu leeyahay dusho badan, khadadkuna waxay u dhaxaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"astaamaha-dusha-ee-design\"\u003EAstaamaha dusha ee Design\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAmarrada dusha waxay ku jiraan menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ee Design, hoos ka feature-yada. Waxay u baahan yihiin kernel-ka saxda ah. Jidhka dushu waxaa lagu muujiyaa buluug see-through ah. Ma aha qayb jidhka adag ilaa aad ku qaroodo ama ku stitch-gareyso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmarka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPatch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu buuxiyaa wareeg xidhan oo xarigyo ah. Marka hore \u003Cstrong\u003EShift\u003C/strong\u003E+dhagsii xarigyada jidhka, ama dooro jidh dusha si aad u buuxiso furkiisa. \u003Cstrong\u003ETangent (G1)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu patch-ka ku dhejiyaa dusha taas si siman.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELoft surface\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha ka dhex mara hal silsilad curve ah sketch kasta (furan ama xidhan), taariikhda kala horreeya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStitch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu isku xidhaa jidhka dusha xarigyada ay wadaagaan. Hadday xirmaan, natiijadu waa jidh adag, Operation ah sida feature-yada kale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThicken\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu jidhka dusha dhumucdo siiyaa: jihada normal-keeda, ka soo horjeedka, ama badhka midkiisa. Natiijadu waa jidh adag.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOffset surface\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul jidhka dusha ah oo loo wareejiyay normal-keeda. Asalku wuu sii jiraa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtend surface\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDusha hal dhinac ah wuxuu ka fidiyaa xarigyada aad doorato.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJar dusha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu gooyaa jidhka dusha meesha uu ka gudbo jidh dusha kale ama jidhka adag. Riix \u003Cstrong\u003EPick a point on the piece\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u doorato qaybta la ilaalinayo, ama ilaali wax kasta oo kale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStitch, Thicken, Extend iyo Jar dusha waxay isticmaalaan jidhka dusha ee ay ka bilaabaan. Feature-yada dambe waxay isticmaalaan midka cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXadka hadda: qaababka leh dhowr qayb oo xidhan oo kala go&#039;an ma u beddelmaan hal jidh adag; meelaha joogtada ah ma isku dhejinayaan dusho weyn; iyo eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan wali la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Wali lama dhisin nooca hadda. Dhammaystirka qaabka qaybta gudaheeda, iyo astaamaha dusha, waxay u baahan yihiin kernel joogto saxan, oo nooca PartCraft-ka hadda ma leh: wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel. Waxa aan wali la dhisin wuxuu sheegayaa waxa lagu sameeyo halkaas. Qaybta kale ee bogga waxay ku tusaysaa sida ay u shaqeeyaan kernel-ka saxda ah. Goobta Form waxay samaysaa qaabab dabiici ah. Waxaad tafatirtaa kaab, oo ah mesh qaro ah oo geesood, xarigyo iyo dhinacyo ka kooban. Qaabku waa dusha siman ee kaabku xakameeyo (Catmull–Clark limit surface), sidaas darteed hal geeso oo la jiido ayuu dusha si tartiib ah ugu foorarsadaa. Marka ay u eegto sida ay tahay, Finish wuxuu ku daraa taariikhda qaybta sida feature Form, kernel-ka saxdana wuxuu u beddelaa B-spline dusho dhab ah. Ka dib waad ku qaroodi kartaa (fillet), gooyn kartaa, ku xidhi kartaa qaybaha kale, oo waad u dhoofin kartaa STEP. Dooro Form liiska Workspace ee bidix ee toolbar-ka. Bilow kaab Deji Size iyo Divisions panelka midig. Divisions waa inta dhinac kasta u qaybsanaysa. Dhagsii Box, Quadball ama Plane toolbar-ka. Panelka waxaa kaloo ku jira Cylinder, Torus iyo Faces by clicks. Quadball waa kaab sanduuq ah oo lagu habeeyey in geesaha ay ku taal goon. Inta u dhaxaysa geesahaas dusha wuxuu ku jiraa wax yar gudaha goonka: qiyaastii 0.4 % mugga ka yar oo leh 2 divisions. Plane waa furan, sidaas darteed waxay noqotaa jidh dusha (eeg \"Surface features in Design\" hoose). Faces by clicks: dhagsii 4 barood korka (dhulka) diyaarada ama geesaha kaabka si aad u samayso hal dhinac. Dhinacyada wadaaga geesaha way isku xidhmaan. Kadib 3 barood riix Enter si aad u samayso saddex-geesood, ama Esc si aad u joojiso. Kaabkaaga aan dhammaynin wuxuu lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta, markaa faylka waad xidhi kartaa oo mar dambe sii wadi kartaa. Dooro oo dhaqaaqi Dhagsii geeso, xarig, ama dhinac kaabka. Shift+dhagsii wuxuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa. Esc wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashada. Gizmo ayaa ka muuqda bartamaha doorashada. Jiid fallaad si aad ugu dhaqaaqdo jihadeeda, ama jiid labajibbaaran si aad ugu dhaqaaqdo diyaarada. Riix W si aad u guurto, E si aad u wareegto, R si aad u cabbirto, ama isticmaal badhamada panelka. Gizmo toolbar-ka ayuu u dhex maraa iyaga. Soft falloff (mm) wuxuu sidoo kale jiidaa geesaha ku jira masaafadaas, isagoo si tartiib ah u dhimanaya ilaa eber meesha masaafadu dhammaato. Jiid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqod ah: Ctrl+Z iyo Ctrl+Y sida caadiga ah ayay shaqeeyaan. Beddel kaabka Badhamada Modify ee panelka waxay shaqeeyaan doorashada: Badhanka Waxa uu sameeyaa Extrude Dhinacyada la doortay waxay u dhaqaaqaan Extrude distance masaafada, jihada normal-keeda, iyagoo samaynaya dhinacyo cusub. Xarigyada furan ee la doortay waxay dibadda dhisaan dhinacyo cusub. Edge loop / Insert edge loop Wuxuu kala qaybiyaa silsiladda dhinacyada afar-geesood ah ee gudbaysa xarigga la doortay, bartamaha. Wareeg badan wuxuu siiyaa qaloocyo adag. Insert point Wuxuu ku daraa geeso bartamaha xarigga la doortay. Subdivide Wuxuu dhinac kasta oo la doortay u kala qaybiyaa dhinacyo afar-geesood ah oo ku wareegsan bartamaha. Bridge Wuxuu isku xidhaa laba dhinac oo la doortay, ama laba fur (dooro hal xarig furan dhinac kasta) tuubo dhinacyo ah. Labaduba waa inay lahaadaan isla tirada xarafyada. Fill hole Wuxuu xidhaa furka ku yaal xarigga furan ee la doortay hal dhinac. Weld Wuxuu geesaha la doortay isku dhejiyaa hal geeso, bartamahooda. Flatten Wuxuu geesaha la doortay u guuraa diyaarada ugu fiican ee ku habboon. Delete Wuxuu tirtiraa dhinacyada la doortay, xarigyada (laba dhinac ayaa isku biiraya) ama geesaha. Geesaha xiran, simmetri iyo muuqaal Crease wuxuu geesaha la doortay ka dhigaa kuwo xiran. Crease weight 10 waa xiran oo buuxa. Miisaan yar wuxuu xiran yahay tallaabooyin hadda kadib wuu nuugaa, taasoo siisa wareeg adag halkii laga siin lahaa qalab kulul. Uncrease wuxuu dib ugu celiyaa siman. Sharp vertex wuxuu geeska xiraa si dusha uga gudbo barta. Symmetry wuxuu kaabka ka muujiyaa X, Y ama Z = 0. Wuxuu hayaa dhinaca togan, muujiyaa, oo labada qaybood isku xidhaa. Kadib, tafatirka dhinac kasta labadaba ayuu saameeyaa. Geesaha ku yaal dhinaca muujinta way ku sii jiraan. Display wuxuu u beddelaa Smooth (dusha uu feature-ku noqonayo) iyo Box (dhinacyada kaabka laftiisa). Analysis: Zebra stripes wuxuu ka muujiyaa iftiin xariiqyo leh muuqaalka hadda. Si siman ayay dusha siman ugu foorarsadaan, xagga xiranna way jabaan. Mean curvature wuxuu midabeeyaa meelaha qummanaha ah casaan, meelaha qoto dheer buluug, meelaha siman caddaan. Waxaa lagu cabbiraa mesh-ka muuqda iyadoo la adeegsanayo cotangent formula, sidaas darteed waa hage, ma aha cabbir. Hubi oo dhammaystir Check exact wuxuu kaabka u beddelaa kernel-ka saxda ah isagoo aan beddelin qaybtaada. Wuxuu sheegaa inta B-spline patch ah ee kaabku sameeyo, inta ka mid ah ee saxda ah, iyo haddii natiijadu tahay jidh adag oo xidhan oo sax ah iyo mugggeeda. Finish wuxuu taariikhda ku daraa feature Form, ama wuxuu cusboonaysiiyaa qaabka aad tafatirayso, wuxuuna kuugu celinayaa Design. Kaab xidhan wuxuu noqdaa jidh adag. Operation ee panelka Design waxay noqon kartaa New body, Join, Cut ama Intersect. Kaab furan wuxuu noqdaa jidh dusha. Si aad qaab ugu beddesho kadib, dooro taariikhda oo riix Edit in Form. Jidhka la dhisay wuu qarsoon yahay intaad kaabka tafatirayso. Discard wuxuu tuuraa kaabka isagoo aan taariikhda taabsanin. Waxa saxda ah iyo waxa lagu qiyaasay Dhinac afar-geesood ah oo kaabka ka mid ah, marka loo baahdo la hagaajiyo, wuxuu noqdaa hal bicubic B-spline patch. Marka geesaha dhinac kasta ay yihiin regular (afar xarig ayaa ku kulma gudaha dusha, ama saddex dusha furan ama qallooc dhexdiisa), patch-ku waa saxda ah dusha subdivision. Tijaabooyinku waxay hubiyaan ilaa 1e-9 mm. Ku wareegsan barta aan caadiga ahayn (saddex, shan ama in ka badan oo xarig ah oo kulma, geesta saddex ama shan dhinac leh, ama dhamaadka qallooc) ma jiro patch polynomial oo saxda ah. Halkaas patch-ku wuxuu qaataa barta saxda ah iyo diyaarada taabashada, iyo khadadka geesaha deriska, si patch-yadu isugu xidhmaan aan wax furan lahayn. Isku-taabashada geesaha ku kulma barta waa qiyaas. Panelka Form iyo panelka feature-ka waxay bixiyaan xagalka ugu weyn, badanaa ka yar 2°. Level sare oo panelka feature-ka ah wuxuu patch-yada ka dhigaa kuwo yar oo u dhow. Qallooca xiran waa xarigyo dhab ah oo jidhka ah, sidaas darteed waad ku qaroodi kartaa (fillet). Patch kasta waa dusha u gaar ah, sidaas darteed qaabku wuxuu leeyahay dusho badan, khadadkuna waxay u dhaxaysaa. Astaamaha dusha ee Design Amarrada dusha waxay ku jiraan menu-ga More ee Design, hoos ka feature-yada. Waxay u baahan yihiin kernel-ka saxda ah. Jidhka dushu waxaa lagu muujiyaa buluug see-through ah. Ma aha qayb jidhka adag ilaa aad ku qaroodo ama ku stitch-gareyso. Amarka Waxa uu sameeyaa Patch Wuxuu buuxiyaa wareeg xidhan oo xarigyo ah. Marka hore Shift+dhagsii xarigyada jidhka, ama dooro jidh dusha si aad u buuxiso furkiisa. Tangent (G1) wuxuu patch-ka ku dhejiyaa dusha taas si siman. Loft surface Dusha ka dhex mara hal silsilad curve ah sketch kasta (furan ama xidhan), taariikhda kala horreeya. Stitch Wuxuu isku xidhaa jidhka dusha xarigyada ay wadaagaan. Hadday xirmaan, natiijadu waa jidh adag, Operation ah sida feature-yada kale. Thicken Wuxuu jidhka dusha dhumucdo siiyaa: jihada normal-keeda, ka soo horjeedka, ama badhka midkiisa. Natiijadu waa jidh adag. Offset surface Nuqul jidhka dusha ah oo loo wareejiyay normal-keeda. Asalku wuu sii jiraa. Extend surface Dusha hal dhinac ah wuxuu ka fidiyaa xarigyada aad doorato. Jar dusha Wuxuu gooyaa jidhka dusha meesha uu ka gudbo jidh dusha kale ama jidhka adag. Riix Pick a point on the piece si aad u doorato qaybta la ilaalinayo, ama ilaali wax kasta oo kale. Stitch, Thicken, Extend iyo Jar dusha waxay isticmaalaan jidhka dusha ee ay ka bilaabaan. Feature-yada dambe waxay isticmaalaan midka cusub. Xadka hadda: qaababka leh dhowr qayb oo xidhan oo kala go'an ma u beddelmaan hal jidh adag; meelaha joogtada ah ma isku dhejinayaan dusho weyn; iyo eeg Waxa aan wali la dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"rollback","scope":"partcraft","title":"Rollback iyo forward taariikhda","summary":"Kor iyo hoos u dhaqaaqo xariiqda rollback hal sifo mar si aad u daawato qaybta oo la dhisayo, geli sifooyin dhexda, oo ku noqo dhammaadka.","section":"tasks","order":92,"keywords":["rollback","roll back","roll forward","xariiqda rollback","u dhaqaaq taariikhda","geli feature","freeze","taariikh"],"headings":[{"id":"hal-sifo-mar","text":"Hal sifo mar","level":2},{"id":"geli-sifo-dhexda","text":"Geli sifo dhexda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EXariiqda rollback waxay go&#039;aamisaa inta taariikhda la dhisayo. Sifooyinka ka hooseeya waa la dhex-dhaaftaa oo lama dhisin; sifooyin cusub waxay gelayaan xariiqda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-sifo-mar\"\u003EHal sifo mar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdigoo qaybta shaashadda ku jirta (aan sawir ama warbixin furnayn):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatiijo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama badhanka fallaadha sare ee ku xiga magaca qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqdu hal sifo bay kor u dhaqaaqdaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama badhanka fallaadha hoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqdu hal sifo bay hoos u dhaqaaqdaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama badhanka xariiqda ilaa dhammaadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifo kasta mar kale waa la dhisayaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStatus bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa meesha xariiqdu joogto, tusaale ahaan &quot;Rollback bar after Sketch1: 1 of 2 features built&quot; (Xariiqda rollback-ka ka dib Sketch1: 1 ka 2 sifo ayaa la dhisay). Badhamada way damaan haddii xariiqdu wax ka dhaqaaqi karin jihadaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoll back to here\u003C/span\u003E sifo kasta, ama guji \u003Cstrong\u003ERollback bar · roll forward\u003C/strong\u003E taariikhda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geli-sifo-dhexda\"\u003EGeli sifo dhexda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiqda dib u celi ilaa ay ku taagan tahay meesha sifada cusub ku habboon tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar sifada: waxay gashaa xariiqda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dhiso taariikhda kale oo dusheeda ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhaqdhaqaaq kasta oo xariiqda ah waa tallaabo aad ku noqon kartaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Meesha xariiqdu joogto waa la kaydiyaa faylka, sidaas darteed qaybta waa la diri karaa iyada oo rollback-tay. Qalabka amarka ayaa sidoo kale dhaqdhaqaaqa: \u003Ccode\u003Epartcraft rollback part.json\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Epartcraft forward part.json --end\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Xariiqda rollback waxay go'aamisaa inta taariikhda la dhisayo. Sifooyinka ka hooseeya waa la dhex-dhaaftaa oo lama dhisin; sifooyin cusub waxay gelayaan xariiqda. Hal sifo mar Adigoo qaybta shaashadda ku jirta (aan sawir ama warbixin furnayn): Samee Natiijo [ ama badhanka fallaadha sare ee ku xiga magaca qaybta Xariiqdu hal sifo bay kor u dhaqaaqdaa ] ama badhanka fallaadha hoose Xariiqdu hal sifo bay hoos u dhaqaaqdaa End ama badhanka xariiqda ilaa dhammaadka Sifo kasta mar kale waa la dhisayaa Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa meesha xariiqdu joogto, tusaale ahaan \"Rollback bar after Sketch1: 1 of 2 features built\" (Xariiqda rollback-ka ka dib Sketch1: 1 ka 2 sifo ayaa la dhisay). Badhamada way damaan haddii xariiqdu wax ka dhaqaaqi karin jihadaas. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa Roll back to here sifo kasta, ama guji Rollback bar · roll forward taariikhda. Geli sifo dhexda Xariiqda dib u celi ilaa ay ku taagan tahay meesha sifada cusub ku habboon tahay. Ku dar sifada: waxay gashaa xariiqda. Riix End si aad u dhiso taariikhda kale oo dusheeda ah. Dhaqdhaqaaq kasta oo xariiqda ah waa tallaabo aad ku noqon kartaa Ctrl+Z. Meesha xariiqdu joogto waa la kaydiyaa faylka, sidaas darteed qaybta waa la diri karaa iyada oo rollback-tay. Qalabka amarka ayaa sidoo kale dhaqdhaqaaqa: partcraft rollback part.json iyo partcraft forward part.json --end.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"gordon-surfaces","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dushyo ka dhex mara shabakad curve ah (Gordon surface)","summary":"Samee hal dusha siman oo ka dhex mara shabakad curve-yo profile ah iyo guide ah oo lagu sameeyay sketch-yada ama laga qaatay geesaha moodelka; ku xidh jidh adag marka profile-yadu xidhan yihiin, iyo waxa saxda ah, waxa lagu qiyaasay, iyo fariimaha marka shabakadu ku habboon tahay.","section":"tasks","order":93,"keywords":["taabasho","tangent","g1","taabasho joogto ah","diyaarada muraayadda","gordon surface","shabakadda curve-yada","dusha xadka","dusha shabakadda","profiles","guides","curve-yada guide","loft oo leh guide","guide rails","skin","transfinite","coons","b-spline dusha","dusha qaab xor ah"],"headings":[{"id":"sawirka-shabakadda","text":"Sawirka shabakadda","level":2},{"id":"samee-dusha","text":"Samee dusha","level":2},{"id":"xir-oo-noqo-jidh-adag","text":"Xir oo noqo jidh adag","level":3},{"id":"taabasho-diyaarad-ku-dhex-jirta-geesta","text":"Taabasho diyaarad ku dhex jirta geesta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-saxda-ah-iyo-waxa-lagu-qiyaasay","text":"Waxa saxda ah iyo waxa lagu qiyaasay","level":2},{"id":"marka-shabakaddu-ku-habboon-tahay","text":"Marka shabakaddu ku habboon tahay","level":2},{"id":"xadadka","text":"Xadadka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWali lama dhisin nooca hadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Gordon surface wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel joogto saxan, oo nooca PartCraft-ka hadda ma leh: wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan wali la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa waxa lagu sameeyo halkaas. Qaybta kale waxay ku tusaysaa sida uu u shaqeeyo kernel-ka saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGordon surface\u003C/strong\u003E waa hal dusha oo mari kara curve kasta oo shabakad ah: set ah \u003Cstrong\u003Eprofiles\u003C/strong\u003E oo u socda hal jihada iyo set ah \u003Cstrong\u003Eguides\u003C/strong\u003E oo u socda jihada kale, isku gudba sida xariijimaha shabakad. Waxaa lagu qaabeeyaa hal haas, hal gacan ama hal qabad curve-yo qaybeed oo kowdood aad si toos ah u xakamaynayso. Wuxuu u baahan yahay \u003Cstrong\u003Ekernel saxda ah\u003C/strong\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EKernel-ka mesh-ka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirka-shabakadda\"\u003ESawirka shabakadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee \u003Cstrong\u003Eprofiles\u003C/strong\u003E: laba curve ama in ka badan oo isku dhinac socda, tusaale ahaan qaybo diyaaradaha isku siman. Xariiqyo, qalooc, goobo iyo splines oo dhan way shaqeeyaan, silsilad curve-yo kuwa isku xidhan jeex-jeex waxay tiraysaa hal curve.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee \u003Cstrong\u003Eguides\u003C/strong\u003E: laba curve ama in ka badan oo isku gudba profiles. Guide kasta waa inuu gudbaa profile kasta mar keliya, profile kastana guide kasta mar keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi in curve-yadu si dhab ah isu kulmaan. Sketch-ka guide-ka u samee si curve-kiisu u gudbo barooyinka profiles (ku dhejiso barooyinka la mala-awaado, ama qor isku-xidhka). Shabakaddu waxay aqbaleysaa farqiyo ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003ETolerance\u003C/strong\u003E (0.01 mm marka hore).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHal sketch wuxuu ku hayn karaa curve-yo badan: silsilad kasta oo kala go&#039;an waa curve gaar ah. Sidaas darteed waad sawiri kartaa guide-yada oo dhan hal sketch oo ku yaal diyaarada korka, tusaale ahaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-dusha\"\u003ESamee dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Features, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGordon surface\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPartCraft wuxuu qaadaa sketch-yada aan wax loo isticmaalin: kuwa diyaarado isu-siman kii hore ayay noqdaan \u003Cstrong\u003Eprofiles\u003C/strong\u003E, kuwa kale \u003Cstrong\u003Eguides\u003C/strong\u003E. Hubi liiska midig oo deji sketch kasta \u003Cstrong\u003EProfiles\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EGuides\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ENot used\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u isticmaasho geesaha qaybta, riix \u003Cstrong\u003EPick edges as profiles\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cstrong\u003Eas guides\u003C/strong\u003E), dhagsii geesaha muuqaalka, kadibna riix Esc.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijadu waa \u003Cstrong\u003Esurface body\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThicken\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u beddelaa jidh adag, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStitch\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isku xidhaa dusho kale, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrim surface\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu gooyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"xir-oo-noqo-jidh-adag\"\u003EXir oo noqo jidh adag\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka profiles-ku yihiin curve-yo xidhan (goobo, splines xidhan, silsilado xidhan) oo profile-ka koowaad iyo kii ugu dambeeya kasta mid ayuu ku jiraa diyaarad fidsan, calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EClose to a solid\u003C/strong\u003E. Dhamaadyadu waxay ku xirmaan wejiyo siman, qaabka xidhanna wuu ku biiraa, gooyaa, isgoyaa ama noqdaa jidh cusub sida feature kasta. Tani waa habka loft ah ee raacaya curve-yada guide-ka. Waxay sidoo kale shaqeysaa guide-yada xidhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taabasho-diyaarad-ku-dhex-jirta-geesta\"\u003ETaabasho diyaarad ku dhex jirta geesta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGordon surface wuxuu mararka qaar mara curve-yadiisa, laakiin isagu keligiis ma waafaqo jiifka wixii uu taabto. Si uu ka tago geeso \u003Cstrong\u003Etangent\u003C/strong\u003E diyaarad (G1), tusaale ahaan diyaarada muraayadda, si nuqulka muraayadda uu ugu biiro si aan qallooc lahayn, ama wejiga siman uu ka koro:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro feature-ka Gordon. Hoos \u003Cstrong\u003ETangent to\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro diyaarad ka mid ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a plane…\u003C/span\u003E (Front, Top, Right ama diyaarad tixraac), ama dooro dusha siman muuqaalka oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the picked flat face\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPartCraft wuxuu helaa curve-ka xadka shabakadda ee ku jira diyaaradaas, dusha wuxuu ka tegaa si tangent ah diyaaradda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii diyaarad ku hayso laba curve oo xadka ah (dhul hoose labada dhamaad), ku dar laba jeer: nuqul kasta wuxuu qaadaa mid xiga. Ilaa afar diyaarad, mid geesta kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWarbixinta waxay sheegaysaa curve-ka uu diyaarad kasta ku sameeyay tangent, iyo xagalka ugu weyn ee dusha uu diyaaraddaas ku kulmay ka hor. Guide-yada hore u ka tegaya curve-kaas si tangent ah diyaaraddu waa la raacaa si sax ah. Guide-yada ka kaca curve-ka waa la foorarsadaa qaybta khafiifka ah ee geesta, iyo lambarka &quot;follows every curve within&quot; ee warbixinta wuxuu sheegayaa inta ay tahay: guide-yada ka tegaya geesta siman ku sawir si aad u hesho habboon sax ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-saxda-ah-iyo-waxa-lagu-qiyaasay\"\u003EWaxa saxda ah iyo waxa lagu qiyaasay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelku wuxuu sheegayaa kan khuseeya, iyo sida dusha uu uga fogaadayo curve-yadaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExact\u003C/strong\u003E: marka curve kasta yahay polynomial (xariiqyo, splines iyo silsiladahoodu) guide-yadu marka ay gudbaan dhammaan profiles-ka ay ku jiraan isla parameters-ka, dusha waa Gordon surface saxda ah ee curve-yadaas. Shabakad iso-curves ah oo laga gooyay dusha bicubic ayaa soo celisa dushaas, afar xariiq toosan waxay siiyaan dusha siman ama patch bilinear ah oo qallooc leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFitted\u003C/strong\u003E: arcs, goobo iyo geesaha qaybta ma aha polynomial, curve-yada gudbaya parameters kala duwan waa in dib loo waqtiyo si ay isgudbiyaan. Curve-yadaas waxaa lagu habeeyaa B-spline-yo sax ah oo ku jira hal tobnaad ee milyan ee cabbirka shabakadda (qiyaastii 0.00001 mm qaybta 100 mm). Patch-ka silinda oo laga sameeyay arcs iyo xariiqyo wuxuu ku sii jiraa 0.00001 mm silinda dhabta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECurve-yada dhexdooda dusha waa waxa habku siiyo: profiles-ka oo ay isku qasaan dhinac-dhinac, iyo guides-ka oo isla sidaas, ka dibna ka jar qasasha barooyinka isgudbinta. Waa siman tahay meel kasta marka laga reebo meesha curve-ku leeyahay geeso xiran. Marka laba Gordon surfaces ay wadaagaan curve xadka, waxay isku xidhmaan geeso ilaa geeso (G0), ma aha tangent.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-shabakaddu-ku-habboon-tahay\"\u003EMarka shabakaddu ku habboon tahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad sameyso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… do not meet: they pass 0.4 mm apart&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee profile-kaas iyo guide-kaas inay gudbaan, ama kor u qaado Tolerance\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;… meets … 2 times&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuide-ku wuxuu gudbi karaa profile kasta mar keliya: kala qaybi curve-ka wareegaya, ama isticmaal profiles yar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;in a different order&quot; ama &quot;folds over itself&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba guide ayaa isgudbaya (ama laba profiles). Qoysaska waa inay u socdaan dhinac-dhinac\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;at least two profiles and two guides&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar curve-yo, ama deji sketch-yo badan Profiles ama Guides\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;mix open and closed curves&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaan profiles-ka ka dhig furan ama xidhan (isla sidaas guide-yada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;An end … is not flat, so it cannot be capped&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProfile-ka koowaad iyo kii ugu dambeeyay xidhan samee hal diyaarad mid kastaa, ama ka tag Close to a solid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xadadka\"\u003EXadadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal B-spline face oo shabakad kasta: ma jiro G1 ama G2 tangency dusaha deriska ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhmada shabakadda xidhan, guide-ka koowaad, waa la isku xidhay geeso ilaa geeso laakiin ma tangent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFeature-ka Loft laftiisu ma leeyahay guide rails; isticmaal Gordon surface oo xir jidh adag.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECurve-yo aad u wareegsan, ama isgudbin aan isku mid ahayn oo ku kala fog curve hal mid kale, waxay u baahan karaan barooyin badan si ay u habboonaadaan; feature-ku markaas ayuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Wali lama dhisin nooca hadda. Gordon surface wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel joogto saxan, oo nooca PartCraft-ka hadda ma leh: wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel. Waxa aan wali la dhisin wuxuu sheegayaa waxa lagu sameeyo halkaas. Qaybta kale waxay ku tusaysaa sida uu u shaqeeyo kernel-ka saxda ah. Gordon surface waa hal dusha oo mari kara curve kasta oo shabakad ah: set ah profiles oo u socda hal jihada iyo set ah guides oo u socda jihada kale, isku gudba sida xariijimaha shabakad. Waxaa lagu qaabeeyaa hal haas, hal gacan ama hal qabad curve-yo qaybeed oo kowdood aad si toos ah u xakamaynayso. Wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel saxda ah (eeg Kernel-ka mesh-ka). Sawirka shabakadda Samee profiles: laba curve ama in ka badan oo isku dhinac socda, tusaale ahaan qaybo diyaaradaha isku siman. Xariiqyo, qalooc, goobo iyo splines oo dhan way shaqeeyaan, silsilad curve-yo kuwa isku xidhan jeex-jeex waxay tiraysaa hal curve. Samee guides: laba curve ama in ka badan oo isku gudba profiles. Guide kasta waa inuu gudbaa profile kasta mar keliya, profile kastana guide kasta mar keliya. Hubi in curve-yadu si dhab ah isu kulmaan. Sketch-ka guide-ka u samee si curve-kiisu u gudbo barooyinka profiles (ku dhejiso barooyinka la mala-awaado, ama qor isku-xidhka). Shabakaddu waxay aqbaleysaa farqiyo ilaa Tolerance (0.01 mm marka hore). Hal sketch wuxuu ku hayn karaa curve-yo badan: silsilad kasta oo kala go'an waa curve gaar ah. Sidaas darteed waad sawiri kartaa guide-yada oo dhan hal sketch oo ku yaal diyaarada korka, tusaale ahaan. Samee dusha Dooro More kooxda Features, kadibna Gordon surface. PartCraft wuxuu qaadaa sketch-yada aan wax loo isticmaalin: kuwa diyaarado isu-siman kii hore ayay noqdaan profiles, kuwa kale guides. Hubi liiska midig oo deji sketch kasta Profiles, Guides ama Not used. Si aad u isticmaasho geesaha qaybta, riix Pick edges as profiles (ama as guides), dhagsii geesaha muuqaalka, kadibna riix Esc. Natiijadu waa surface body. Thicken wuxuu u beddelaa jidh adag, Stitch wuxuu isku xidhaa dusho kale, Trim surface wuxuu gooyaa. Xir oo noqo jidh adag Marka profiles-ku yihiin curve-yo xidhan (goobo, splines xidhan, silsilado xidhan) oo profile-ka koowaad iyo kii ugu dambeeya kasta mid ayuu ku jiraa diyaarad fidsan, calaamadi Close to a solid. Dhamaadyadu waxay ku xirmaan wejiyo siman, qaabka xidhanna wuu ku biiraa, gooyaa, isgoyaa ama noqdaa jidh cusub sida feature kasta. Tani waa habka loft ah ee raacaya curve-yada guide-ka. Waxay sidoo kale shaqeysaa guide-yada xidhan. Taabasho diyaarad ku dhex jirta geesta Gordon surface wuxuu mararka qaar mara curve-yadiisa, laakiin isagu keligiis ma waafaqo jiifka wixii uu taabto. Si uu ka tago geeso tangent diyaarad (G1), tusaale ahaan diyaarada muraayadda, si nuqulka muraayadda uu ugu biiro si aan qallooc lahayn, ama wejiga siman uu ka koro: Dooro feature-ka Gordon. Hoos Tangent to, dooro diyaarad ka mid ah Add a plane… (Front, Top, Right ama diyaarad tixraac), ama dooro dusha siman muuqaalka oo riix Add the picked flat face. PartCraft wuxuu helaa curve-ka xadka shabakadda ee ku jira diyaaradaas, dusha wuxuu ka tegaa si tangent ah diyaaradda. Haddii diyaarad ku hayso laba curve oo xadka ah (dhul hoose labada dhamaad), ku dar laba jeer: nuqul kasta wuxuu qaadaa mid xiga. Ilaa afar diyaarad, mid geesta kasta. Warbixinta waxay sheegaysaa curve-ka uu diyaarad kasta ku sameeyay tangent, iyo xagalka ugu weyn ee dusha uu diyaaraddaas ku kulmay ka hor. Guide-yada hore u ka tegaya curve-kaas si tangent ah diyaaraddu waa la raacaa si sax ah. Guide-yada ka kaca curve-ka waa la foorarsadaa qaybta khafiifka ah ee geesta, iyo lambarka \"follows every curve within\" ee warbixinta wuxuu sheegayaa inta ay tahay: guide-yada ka tegaya geesta siman ku sawir si aad u hesho habboon sax ah. Waxa saxda ah iyo waxa lagu qiyaasay Panelku wuxuu sheegayaa kan khuseeya, iyo sida dusha uu uga fogaadayo curve-yadaada. Exact: marka curve kasta yahay polynomial (xariiqyo, splines iyo silsiladahoodu) guide-yadu marka ay gudbaan dhammaan profiles-ka ay ku jiraan isla parameters-ka, dusha waa Gordon surface saxda ah ee curve-yadaas. Shabakad iso-curves ah oo laga gooyay dusha bicubic ayaa soo celisa dushaas, afar xariiq toosan waxay siiyaan dusha siman ama patch bilinear ah oo qallooc leh. Fitted: arcs, goobo iyo geesaha qaybta ma aha polynomial, curve-yada gudbaya parameters kala duwan waa in dib loo waqtiyo si ay isgudbiyaan. Curve-yadaas waxaa lagu habeeyaa B-spline-yo sax ah oo ku jira hal tobnaad ee milyan ee cabbirka shabakadda (qiyaastii 0.00001 mm qaybta 100 mm). Patch-ka silinda oo laga sameeyay arcs iyo xariiqyo wuxuu ku sii jiraa 0.00001 mm silinda dhabta ah. Curve-yada dhexdooda dusha waa waxa habku siiyo: profiles-ka oo ay isku qasaan dhinac-dhinac, iyo guides-ka oo isla sidaas, ka dibna ka jar qasasha barooyinka isgudbinta. Waa siman tahay meel kasta marka laga reebo meesha curve-ku leeyahay geeso xiran. Marka laba Gordon surfaces ay wadaagaan curve xadka, waxay isku xidhmaan geeso ilaa geeso (G0), ma aha tangent. Marka shabakaddu ku habboon tahay Fariinta Waxa aad sameyso \"… do not meet: they pass 0.4 mm apart\" Samee profile-kaas iyo guide-kaas inay gudbaan, ama kor u qaado Tolerance \"… meets … 2 times\" Guide-ku wuxuu gudbi karaa profile kasta mar keliya: kala qaybi curve-ka wareegaya, ama isticmaal profiles yar \"in a different order\" ama \"folds over itself\" Laba guide ayaa isgudbaya (ama laba profiles). Qoysaska waa inay u socdaan dhinac-dhinac \"at least two profiles and two guides\" Ku dar curve-yo, ama deji sketch-yo badan Profiles ama Guides \"mix open and closed curves\" Dhammaan profiles-ka ka dhig furan ama xidhan (isla sidaas guide-yada) \"An end … is not flat, so it cannot be capped\" Profile-ka koowaad iyo kii ugu dambeeyay xidhan samee hal diyaarad mid kastaa, ama ka tag Close to a solid Xadadka Hal B-spline face oo shabakad kasta: ma jiro G1 ama G2 tangency dusaha deriska ah. Xidhmada shabakadda xidhan, guide-ka koowaad, waa la isku xidhay geeso ilaa geeso laakiin ma tangent. Feature-ka Loft laftiisu ma leeyahay guide rails; isticmaal Gordon surface oo xir jidh adag. Curve-yo aad u wareegsan, ama isgudbin aan isku mid ahayn oo ku kala fog curve hal mid kale, waxay u baahan karaan barooyin badan si ay u habboonaadaan; feature-ku markaas ayuu sheegaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"structural-members","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qaababka laga sameeyo birta qaabka","summary":"Ku dheji qaybaha birta qaabka xariirrada naqshad ama dhowr naqshadood si aad u samayso qaab dhalaalay, geesaha miter ama butt, xubnaha la goyo si ay u qaarmaan meelaha ay ku kulmaan, dabool dhamaadka, gussets iyo liiska jarista oo leh dherer iyo xagalka dhamaadka.","section":"tasks","order":93,"keywords":["weldment","xubin qaab-dhismeed","qaab","birta qaabka","tuubo","tuubo laba-geesle","hss","rhs","shs","pipe","chs","flanj ballaadhan","i-beam","w beam","ipe","hea","heb","kanaal","upn","xagal","miter","mitre","isku-xidh butt","cope","dabool dhamaadka","gusset","liiska jarista"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-qaab","text":"Samee qaab","level":2},{"id":"qaab-3d-ah","text":"Qaab 3D ah","level":3},{"id":"dhig-qaybta-xariirkeeda","text":"Dhig qaybta xariirkeeda","level":2},{"id":"geesaha-iyo-isku-xidhmooyinka","text":"Geesaha iyo isku-xidhmooyinka","level":2},{"id":"dabool-dhamaadka-iyo-gussets","text":"Dabool dhamaadka iyo gussets","level":2},{"id":"liiska-jarista","text":"Liiska jarista","level":2},{"id":"xadadka","text":"Xadadka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXubin qaab-dhismeed\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhigaa qayb bir ah xariir kasta oo naqshadaha aad doorato. Qaabka sawir xariiro ahaan (xariir kasta waa hal xubin), kadibna dooro qaybta: xubnaha waa la dhisaa, geesahooda waa la jaraa oo la ballaadhiyaa, liiska jarista wuxuu sheegayaa inta dherer ee la jarayo qayb kasta iyo xagalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-qaab\"\u003ESamee qaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaabka sawir xariiro naqshad gudaha, tusaale afar-geesle diyaarada sare. Xariirrada loo calaamadeeyay dhismo waa la reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadda la doortay, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXubin qaab-dhismeed\u003C/span\u003E. Xariir kasta oo naqshadda ku jira wuxuu helaa xubin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuddiga, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EQoys\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBaaxad\u003C/strong\u003E qaybta. Qoysasku waa miisaska AISC (W, S, C, L, tuubooyinka HSS, Pipe) iyo EN 10365 (IPE, HEA, HEB, UPN).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"qaab-3d-ah\"\u003EQaab 3D ah\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiro naqshado dhowr ah waxay samaysaa hal qaab: afar-geesle sare oo ku sawiran diyaarad kor ku taal, iyo lugaha oo ku sawiran diyaarado istaag ah, kuwaas oo ku kulma dhamaadyadooda 3D. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EIyada oo raacaya xariirrada\u003C/strong\u003E guddiga, calaamadee naqshad kasta oo xariirradeeda xubnuhu raacaan. Dhamaadyada ku kulma mikromitir gudaha waa la isku xidhaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-qaybta-xariirkeeda\"\u003EDhig qaybta xariirkeeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWareeg (°)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu wareejiyaa qaybta xariirkeeda ku wareegsan. Beam-ku wuxuu istaagaa dhererkiisa istaag (xubin istaag ah, dhererkiisu wuxuu u jeedaa hore).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXariirka dushiisa\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu doortaa barta qaybta ku taal xariirka: dhexe, ama geesta ama dhexda dhinaca qaabka qaybta. &quot;Dhexda hoose&quot; wuxuu qaabka saaraa dusha diyaarada naqshadda halkii uu ku mari lahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geesaha-iyo-isku-xidhmooyinka\"\u003EGeesaha iyo isku-xidhmooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeesha xubnuhu ku kulmaan\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa dhacaya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xubin dhamaad-ilaa-dhamaad, \u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha: Miter\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabadaba waa la goyaa diyaarad ku taal dhexdooda, sida qaabka sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xubin dhamaad-ilaa-dhamaad, \u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha: Butt\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXubinta koowaad waxay ku sii socotaa wejiga fog ee labaad; kan labaad waa la goyaa toosan wejiga xubinta koowaad ee dhow\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXubin dhammaysa dhexda mid kale (T)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaa la goyaa si ay ugu habboon tahay dibada xubinta kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex ama ka badan oo dhamaada barta hal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKii koowaad wuxuu toosan ka sii gudbaa kuwa kale; kuwa kale waa la goyaa si ay ugu habboon yihiin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXubinta koowaad waa midda xariirkeeda ka hor yimaada: xariiradu waxay ilaaliyaan kala-horaynta ay ku sawireen, naqshad naqshad, sida naqshadaha loo calaamadeeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dabool-dhamaadka-iyo-gussets\"\u003EDabool dhamaadka iyo gussets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDabool dhamaadka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu xiraa dhamaad kasta oo xor ah saxan oo ka mid ah konturka qaybta, dhumucdeeda aad dejisay, dibada dhamaadka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGussets\u003C/strong\u003E waxay dhigaan saxan saddex-geesle geesta kasta oo laba xubin xagal ku kulmaan: \u003Cstrong\u003EBaaxadda gusset\u003C/strong\u003E dhinac kasta oo xubin ah geesta ka bilaabmaysa, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhumucda gusset\u003C/strong\u003E dhinacyada, dhexda diyaarada geesta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"liiska-jarista\"\u003ELiiska jarista\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuddiga wuxuu liistaa qayb kasta, qaybaha isku mid ahna waa isugu yimaadaan: qaybta, dhererka (barta dheer ilaa barta dheer, sida loo calaamadeeyo mishaarka), sida dhamaad kasta loo jaray (toosan, xagal ka soo hor-jeedda toosan, ama la goyo si ay ugu habboonaato), iyo xubnaha ay yihiin. Dabool dhamaadka iyo gussets-ka waxaa lagu liistaa baaxadahooda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi liiska jarista (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa spreadsheet-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXubin la goyay si ay ugu habboonaato tuubo geesaha wareegsan leh waxay gashaa xoogaa gudaha radius-ka geeska tuubadaas, sidaas darteed dherer barta dheer waa dhowr millimitir ka badan farqiga u dhexeeya wejiyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xadadka\"\u003EXadadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXubnuhu waxay raacaan xariiro toosan oo keliya; qaansooyinka iyo splaynada naqshadda waa la reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-xidhmooyinka waa la goyaa, ma aha la alxaamay: ma la sawirayo xadhkaha alxanka, qaabkuna waa hal jir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybaha waa la sawiraa cabbirrada miiska: qaabka W oo leh fillet-kiisa aasaasiga ah, S iyo kanaalada oo leh flanj isu-dhigan, tuubooyinka oo leh radius-ka geesaha; godyada, diyaarinta dhamaadka iyo furitaanka alxanka lama samaynayo adiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXubnaha qaab-dhismeedka waxaa dhisa mesh kernel-ku. Kernel saxda ah markuu furan yahay (horumariyayaasha kaliya), way sheegaan taas, ma dhisna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Xubin qaab-dhismeed wuxuu dhigaa qayb bir ah xariir kasta oo naqshadaha aad doorato. Qaabka sawir xariiro ahaan (xariir kasta waa hal xubin), kadibna dooro qaybta: xubnaha waa la dhisaa, geesahooda waa la jaraa oo la ballaadhiyaa, liiska jarista wuxuu sheegayaa inta dherer ee la jarayo qayb kasta iyo xagalka. Samee qaab Qaabka sawir xariiro naqshad gudaha, tusaale afar-geesle diyaarada sare. Xariirrada loo calaamadeeyay dhismo waa la reebay. Naqshadda la doortay, dooro Wax dheeraad ah › Xubin qaab-dhismeed. Xariir kasta oo naqshadda ku jira wuxuu helaa xubin. Guddiga, dooro Qoys iyo Baaxad qaybta. Qoysasku waa miisaska AISC (W, S, C, L, tuubooyinka HSS, Pipe) iyo EN 10365 (IPE, HEA, HEB, UPN). Qaab 3D ah Xariiro naqshado dhowr ah waxay samaysaa hal qaab: afar-geesle sare oo ku sawiran diyaarad kor ku taal, iyo lugaha oo ku sawiran diyaarado istaag ah, kuwaas oo ku kulma dhamaadyadooda 3D. Hoosta Iyada oo raacaya xariirrada guddiga, calaamadee naqshad kasta oo xariirradeeda xubnuhu raacaan. Dhamaadyada ku kulma mikromitir gudaha waa la isku xidhaa. Dhig qaybta xariirkeeda Wareeg (°) wuxuu wareejiyaa qaybta xariirkeeda ku wareegsan. Beam-ku wuxuu istaagaa dhererkiisa istaag (xubin istaag ah, dhererkiisu wuxuu u jeedaa hore). Xariirka dushiisa wuxuu doortaa barta qaybta ku taal xariirka: dhexe, ama geesta ama dhexda dhinaca qaabka qaybta. \"Dhexda hoose\" wuxuu qaabka saaraa dusha diyaarada naqshadda halkii uu ku mari lahaa. Geesaha iyo isku-xidhmooyinka Meesha xubnuhu ku kulmaan Waxa dhacaya Laba xubin dhamaad-ilaa-dhamaad, Geesaha: Miter Labadaba waa la goyaa diyaarad ku taal dhexdooda, sida qaabka sawirka Laba xubin dhamaad-ilaa-dhamaad, Geesaha: Butt Xubinta koowaad waxay ku sii socotaa wejiga fog ee labaad; kan labaad waa la goyaa toosan wejiga xubinta koowaad ee dhow Xubin dhammaysa dhexda mid kale (T) Waa la goyaa si ay ugu habboon tahay dibada xubinta kale Saddex ama ka badan oo dhamaada barta hal Kii koowaad wuxuu toosan ka sii gudbaa kuwa kale; kuwa kale waa la goyaa si ay ugu habboon yihiin Xubinta koowaad waa midda xariirkeeda ka hor yimaada: xariiradu waxay ilaaliyaan kala-horaynta ay ku sawireen, naqshad naqshad, sida naqshadaha loo calaamadeeyay. Dabool dhamaadka iyo gussets Dabool dhamaadka wuxuu xiraa dhamaad kasta oo xor ah saxan oo ka mid ah konturka qaybta, dhumucdeeda aad dejisay, dibada dhamaadka. Gussets waxay dhigaan saxan saddex-geesle geesta kasta oo laba xubin xagal ku kulmaan: Baaxadda gusset dhinac kasta oo xubin ah geesta ka bilaabmaysa, Dhumucda gusset dhinacyada, dhexda diyaarada geesta. Liiska jarista Guddiga wuxuu liistaa qayb kasta, qaybaha isku mid ahna waa isugu yimaadaan: qaybta, dhererka (barta dheer ilaa barta dheer, sida loo calaamadeeyo mishaarka), sida dhamaad kasta loo jaray (toosan, xagal ka soo hor-jeedda toosan, ama la goyo si ay ugu habboonaato), iyo xubnaha ay yihiin. Dabool dhamaadka iyo gussets-ka waxaa lagu liistaa baaxadahooda. Kaydi liiska jarista (CSV) wuxuu kaydiyaa spreadsheet-ka. Xubin la goyay si ay ugu habboonaato tuubo geesaha wareegsan leh waxay gashaa xoogaa gudaha radius-ka geeska tuubadaas, sidaas darteed dherer barta dheer waa dhowr millimitir ka badan farqiga u dhexeeya wejiyada. Xadadka Xubnuhu waxay raacaan xariiro toosan oo keliya; qaansooyinka iyo splaynada naqshadda waa la reebay. Isku-xidhmooyinka waa la goyaa, ma aha la alxaamay: ma la sawirayo xadhkaha alxanka, qaabkuna waa hal jir. Qaybaha waa la sawiraa cabbirrada miiska: qaabka W oo leh fillet-kiisa aasaasiga ah, S iyo kanaalada oo leh flanj isu-dhigan, tuubooyinka oo leh radius-ka geesaha; godyada, diyaarinta dhamaadka iyo furitaanka alxanka lama samaynayo adiga. Xubnaha qaab-dhismeedka waxaa dhisa mesh kernel-ku. Kernel saxda ah markuu furan yahay (horumariyayaasha kaliya), way sheegaan taas, ma dhisna.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"nurbs-surfaces","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dusha bilaa-qaab (NURBS)","summary":"Qalooca iyo dusha qumman oo qayb ag ah — loft, sweep, shabagyada qalooca, patches afar-geesood, blends, trims — oo G0, G1 iyo G2 lagu qiyaaso dusha saxda ah, jidh adag oo leh union, subtract iyo intersect oo lagu dhejiyay qaybta, muuqaalka zebra iyo curvature, wejiyo lagu habeeyay scan oo khaladkoodu la qiyaaso, iyo faylal STEP ama IGES. Qaybta faylka ku jira.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["nurbs","scan","reverse engineering","habee","mesh ilaa dusha","point cloud","stl","trim","trimmed","god","goyn","jidh adag","solids","boolean","union","subtract","intersect","difference","isku-xir","xidhan","bake","bilaa-qaab","free-form","dusha","surfaces","b-spline","bspline","qalooc","spline","loft","sweep","rail","shabagga","coons","patch","blend","match","continuity","g0","g1","g2","tangent","curvature","zebra","control points","knots","degree","step","iges","class a","hull","fairing"],"headings":[{"id":"qalooca","text":"Qalooca","level":2},{"id":"dusha","text":"Dusha","level":2},{"id":"hubinta-tayada","text":"Hubinta tayada","level":2},{"id":"jar-dusha","text":"Jar dusha","level":2},{"id":"jidhka-adag-iyo-boolean-yada","text":"Jidhka adag iyo Boolean-yada","level":2},{"id":"fillets-iyo-qaro-gelin","text":"Fillets iyo qaro-gelin","level":2},{"id":"ku-dubo-jidh-adag-qaybta","text":"Ku dubo jidh adag qaybta","level":2},{"id":"faylasha","text":"Faylasha","level":2},{"id":"khadadka-qolofka-doonta","text":"Khadadka qolofka doonta","level":2},{"id":"dusha-scan-ka-ka-soo-qaad-reverse-engineering","text":"Dusha scan-ka ka soo qaad (reverse engineering)","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWorkspace-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa qalooc iyo dusha siman oo noocan ah oo loo isticmaalo qolofka alaabta, jidhka gaadiidka iyo qolofka doonta: NURBS, isla xisaabta moodelka dusha kale ee isticmaala. Wax walba waxaa lagu cabbiraa dusha saxda ah, weligiis ma aha saddexagallada aad aragto. Cabbirka waa millimitir, sida qaybta PartCraft oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E. Toolbar-ka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQalooc\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatch\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZebra\u003C/span\u003E; amar kasta waxa ku jira panel-ka midig. Amar kasta wuxuu sheegaa wixii uu weli u baahan yahay: riix qalooca ama dusha muuqaalka (geesta ama dhamaadka ku dhow marka ay weyddiiso) ama dooro liiska; qor dhibcaha, ama riix wejiga qaybta (marka ay ka baxdo, waxay ku dhacaan diyaarka dhulka), kadibna riix Enter.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalooca iyo dusha waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta jidhka ag. Ma beddelaan astaamaha qaybta: panel-ka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/strong\u003E gaarka ah, hal tallaabo amar kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalooca\"\u003EQalooca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalooc dhibcaha marayo\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu maraa dhibic kasta oo aad riixdo. \u003Cstrong\u003EQalooc dhibcaha xakameynta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu raacaa qafiska dhibcaha halkii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeli knot\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EKor u qaad darajada\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EHoos u dhig darajada\u003C/strong\u003E waxay beddelaan sida qalooca loo tilmaamo iyada oo aan la dhaqdhaqaajin (hoos u dhigiddu diidaa marka qalooca uu ka dhaqaajiyo dulqaadka ka badan). \u003Cstrong\u003EDib u dhis qalooca\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu siinayaa tiro cusub oo dhibcaha xakameynta ah wuxuuna sheegayaa inta uu dhaqaaqay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMatch curve\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa dhamaadka hal qalooc inuu la kulmo kan kale G0 (taabasho), G1 (isla jihada) ama G2 (isla curvature-ka sidoo kale). \u003Cstrong\u003EBlend curve\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku daraa qalooc cusub laba dhamaad dhexdooda, G1 ama G2.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha\"\u003EDusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELoft\u003C/strong\u003E laba ama ka badan qalooc dhexdooda, \u003Cstrong\u003ERuled surface\u003C/strong\u003E laba dhexdooda, \u003Cstrong\u003EExtrude curve\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ERevolve curve\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESweep along one rail\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaabka u qaadaa jid si aan u leexan; \u003Cstrong\u003ESweep along two rails\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa dhamaadyada qaabka labada rail-ba. Sweep-yadu waa la habeeyay: natiijadu waxay sheegaysaa inta uu ku dhowaaday sweep-ka runta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESurface from a curve network\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu maraa shabakad qalooc (mid kasta midka kale mar keliya ayuu gudbaa). \u003Cstrong\u003EPatch from four edges\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu buuxiyaa afar qalooc oo ku kulma geesahooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMatch surface\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu geesta dusha ka dhigaa inay la kulanto deriskeeda G0, G1 ama G2; \u003Cstrong\u003EBlend surface\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku daraa dusha labo geesood dhexdooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala-raris dusha\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EBallaadhi dusha\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha wuxuu sii socdaa sidii uu u socday), \u003Cstrong\u003EDib u dhis dusha\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta-tayada\"\u003EHubinta tayada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska \u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha la wadaago\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa geesta kasta oo laba dusha la wadaagaan, iyo farqiga (mm), xagasha u dhexaysa (°) iyo kor-u-kaca curvature (1/mm), iyo haddii taas ay ka dhigayso G0, G1 ama G2. Geesta oo ka xun intii aad codsatay waxay ku muuqataa \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh hagaajinta \u003Cstrong\u003EMatch\u003C/strong\u003E. Xariiqyada \u003Cstrong\u003EZebra\u003C/strong\u003E iyo midabada \u003Cstrong\u003Ecurvature\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ka yimaadaan dusha saxda ah: xariiqyada geesta dhexdeeda si aan jabin u socda waxay micnaheedu yahay G1; xariiqyada sidoo kale ballacooda ku sii haya waxay micnaheedu yahay G2.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EG0–G2 waa la cabbiraa, 33 dhibic geesta kasta. \u003Cstrong\u003EG3 iyo tayada &quot;class A&quot; lama cabbiro\u003C/strong\u003E oo lama sheegi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jar-dusha\"\u003EJar dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EJar\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu jaraa dusha isagoo aan beddelin qaabkiisa: dusha wuxuu hayaa dhibcaha xakameynta oo dhan, qaybta gudaha xuduudka keliya ayaa la muujiyaa, la tiriyaa iyo la qoraa. \u003Cstrong\u003EJar rectangle\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJar goobo\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku shaqeeyaan qayb (0 ilaa 1) dusha jihaynta kasta, sidaas darteed ma u baahna doorasho muuqaalka; \u003Cstrong\u003EJar qalooc\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaataa qalooc xidhan oo dusha ku jirta (waxaa lagu soo rogaa dusha, waana la diidaa hadalka marka ay furan tahay ama ka fog dulqaadka ka badan). Calaamee \u003Cstrong\u003EJar god\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u tirtirto gudaha xuduudka; ka daa si aad gudaha keliya u hayso. Dusha wuxuu leeyahay hal xuduud la hayo iyo godad tiro kasta; xuduud kale gooya waa la diidaa. \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar jarka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu mar kale muujiyaa dusha oo dhan. Ka noqo ee panel-ka wuxuu jarka dib u qaadaa sida tallaabo kasta oo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESTEP wuxuu qaadaa jarka xuduudaha wejiga, IGES-na wuxuu qaadaa dusha la jaray (entity 144); labadaba way akhriyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidhka-adag-iyo-boolean-yada\"\u003EJidhka adag iyo Boolean-yada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka adag\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dusha u beddelaa jidh xidhan oo wuu isku geliyaa. Jidh adag halkan waa urur dusha panel-ka gaarka ah oo wada xidha mugga; wejiyadiisu waxay sii joogaan dusha NURBS saxda ah oo jarkooda leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBox solid\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ECylinder solid\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESphere solid\u003C/strong\u003E mid ayey ka sameeyaan cabbirrada la qoray (mm): sanduuq lix wejiyo siman leh, silinda oo geesta wareegga iyo laba dhamaad siman oo lagu jaray wareegga, kubbad oo hal dusha la wareegay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJidh adag dusha ka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isu urursadaa dusha aad naftaadu samaysay. Dooro iyaga, ama midna ha dooran si aad u isticmaasho dusha muuqda oo aan weli jidh adag ku jirin. Waa la isku xiraa dulqaadka gudihiisa: haddii aanay xirmin, wax ma beddelmaan panel-kuna wuxuu sheegayaa inta geesood ee furan ay tahay iyo sida ay u dhowaan inay isku kulmaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnion\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESubtract\u003C/strong\u003E (jidhka labaad waa laga jaraa kan koowaad) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIntersect\u003C/strong\u003E (kaliya wixii labadooda wadaagaan) labo jidh qaadanayaan: riix wejiga mid kasta muuqaalka, ama riix \u003Cstrong\u003EPick\u003C/strong\u003E liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka adag\u003C/strong\u003E. Calaamee \u003Cstrong\u003EHayso labada jidh adag\u003C/strong\u003E si aad labadooda ag ku hayso natiijada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoolean wuxuu wejiga kasta ku hayaa dusha saxda ah oo jarkiisa uu ku jaraa xuduudo jar cusub oo ka dhex-dhaxaysa. Khadka natiijadu wuxuu siinayaa tirooyinka la cabbiray: intee ka dhaqaajiyay dhibcaha engine-ka jidh adag si ay dusha saxda ah ugu fadhiistaan (ma dhaafaan dulqaadka), intee ka dhow dhibcaha isgoysku labada dusha (badanaa kala malayn millimitir), mugga, iyo haddii wejiyada cusub mar kale isku xiraan marka dib loo xidho dusha saxda ah. Mugga waxaa lagu cabbiraa saddexagallo dulqaadka dhexdiisa (0.05 mm haddii aadan dooran mid kale), sidaas darteed mugga sfeerada ama silindarka wuxuu akhrisanayaa wax yar ka hooseeya kan saxda ah: dulqaad yar ayaa dhow. Boolean aan si nadiif ah loo samayn karin (jidhadku midna ma wadaagaan, xuduud isku gooya) waa la diidaa hadal ahaan oo waxba ma beddelo. Hal Boolean waa hal tallaabo oo ka mid ah \u003Cstrong\u003EKa noqo\u003C/strong\u003E panel-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELiiska \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka adag\u003C/strong\u003E dhexdiisa, \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar kooxda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu wejiyada ka dhigaa dusha caadi ah; qashinka wuxuu tirtiraa jidh adag iyo wejiyadiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fillets-iyo-qaro-gelin\"\u003EFillets iyo qaro-gelin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFillet between faces\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu wareejiyaa geesta ay laba wejiyo jidh hal ah isku kulmaan: dooro laba wejiyo (muuqaalka, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EPick\u003C/strong\u003E liiska), qor \u003Cstrong\u003Eradius\u003C/strong\u003E iyo, radius-ka oo geesta dheer ka beddelmaya, \u003Cstrong\u003Eradius dhamaadka\u003C/strong\u003E (0 wuxuu hayaa hal radius). Kubbad radius-kaas ah ayaa lagu wareejiyaa geesta isagoo taabanaya labada weji; fillet-ku waa qoslaha saxda ah ee ay kaga tagto dhibic kasta, oo lagu isku xiray dusha hal ah, labadana weji waa la jaraa meesha kubbaddu taabato. Geesta dibadda waxay lumisaa agab, geeska gudaha waxay helaysaa. Khadka natiijadu wuxuu siinayaa wixii la cabbiray: intee ka fog dusha fillet-ka kubbadda wareejineysa ee u dhexeysa dhibcaha laga dhisay (dhibcaha ayaa lagu daraa ilaa ay ku dhowaato rubuc dulqaadka), xagasha ugu weyn ee u dhexaysa fillet-ka iyo wejiga kasta khadadka taabashada, iyo tirooyinka isku mid ah sida Union. Radius aan ku habboonayn (kubbaddu ka bixi lahayd wejiga, ama wejigu ka qallooci lahaa radius-ka) waa la diidaa, wejigana magacaabaa, wax ma beddelmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFillet several edges\u003C/strong\u003E geesaha badan hal tallaabo ku wareejiyaa: dooro labada weji ee geesta koowaad, kadibna labada weji ee kan xiga, iyo kuwa kale (weji wuxuu ku jiri karaa dhowr lamaane, tusaale ahaan weji sare ee sanduuqa afar ka mid ah); geesaha oo dhammaan waxay helaan radius-ka aad qorto. Wareejinta kasta waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa jidhka sidii uu ahaa, kadibna waa la jaraa mid ka dib mid, sidaas darteed amarku ma muhiim. Meesha laba geesood oo wareegsan ay ku kulmaan geeska geesihii kale ee aan wareegin, labada fillet waxay ku dhacaan midba midka kale khadka isgoysyada (crease). Meesha saddex geesood oo dibadda ah oo wareegsan oo saddex wejiyo siman oo isku xaglaya ay ku kulmaan hal radius, geeska waxa uu noqonayaa hal \u003Cstrong\u003Esphere patch\u003C/strong\u003E taabanaya saddexda fillet (ka saar \u003Cstrong\u003ECorners\u003C/strong\u003E si aad geeska crease-ka leh u hesho); geesta waa inay ahaataa ugu yaraan laba jeer radius-ka dheer marka labada dhamaadkeeda ay yihiin geeso noocan ah. Khadka natiijadu wuxuu sheegaa geesaha intee la wareejiyay iyo sida geeskuna u soo baxay. Geesaha gudaha ayaa sidoo kale la wareegi karaa, laakiin natiijada aan mar kale xirmin waxaa keliya lagu sheegaa (khadku wuu sheegaa), sidaas darteed hubi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThicken into a solid\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dusha siiyaa dhumuc: dooro, qor \u003Cstrong\u003Ethickness\u003C/strong\u003E, oo calaamee \u003Cstrong\u003EOther side\u003C/strong\u003E si ay u koraan dhinaca kale. Wejiga kala-rarid ayaa lagu habeeyay dusha oo lagu cabbiraa (khadka natiijadu wuxuu siinayaa farqiga ugu weyn ee dhumucda ka yimid); darbiyadu waxay raacaan geesta kasta iyo xuduud jar kasta. Haddii dusha dhinacaas uu ka wareego dhumucda, ama qayb kale oo ka mid ah ay ka dhow tahay dhumucda, waa la diidaa, dusha iyo meesha la magacaabayaa, waxna ma beddelmaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dubo-jidh-adag-qaybta\"\u003EKu dubo jidh adag qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBake\u003C/strong\u003E (toolbar-ka Dusha), ama \u003Cstrong\u003EBake into the part\u003C/strong\u003E liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka adag\u003C/strong\u003E, wuxuu jidhka adag ka dhigaa jidh qaybta ah, sida STL la furay u noqdo mid: dooro jidhka, haddii uu \u003Cstrong\u003Elagu daro\u003C/strong\u003E qaybta, \u003Cstrong\u003Elaga jaro\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Elaga goyo\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo dulqaadka (intee ka fog saddexagallada dusha saxda ah). Waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo qaybta waxayna ka muuqataa liiska astaamaha sida import magaciisu yahay jidhka. Qaybtu waxay hayaa saddexagallada, sidaas darteed way furmaysaa oo dib u dhismaa iyada oo aan dusha la&#039;aan; jidhka saxda ahi wuxuu ku sii jiraa Dusha, sidaas darteed mar kale ayaad ku dubi kartaa isbeddel ka dib.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha\"\u003EFaylasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhoofi \u003Cstrong\u003ESTEP\u003C/strong\u003E (AP242) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EIGES\u003C/strong\u003E qalooca iyo dusha sidooda sax ah (qalooca iyo dusha B-spline, wax la beddelin saddexagallo). Dusha kasta waa wejigiisa gaarka ah, jarkiisana leh; jidh adag waxaa loo qoraa hal shell xidhan, geesta kasta oo ay labada wejigeeda wadaagaan sida barnaamijyada CAD kale ay filayaan (khadka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa inta jidh adag ee sidaas u baxday). IGES-ka jidhka isku midka ahi waa hal manifold solid B-rep (entity 186 oo ku saabsan closed shell 514, faces 510, loops 508, hal edge list 504 iyo hal vertex list 502); jidh adag oo wejiyadiisu geesihii ku lammaanaan waa la qoraa wejiyo kala gaar ah, khadkuna wuu sheegaa. \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo geli…\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu akhrisaa jidhka sidaas oo kale jidh adag ahaan, STEP iyo IGES labadaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khadadka-qolofka-doonta\"\u003EKhadadka qolofka doonta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFair\u003C/strong\u003E (toolbar-ka Dusha) wuxuu cabbiraa qalooc kasta qaabkiisa saxda ah — inflections (meesha ay ka beddelanayso bisil hal jihood ka kale), curvature-ka ugu weyn, kor-u-kaca curvature-ka knots-kiisa iyo qallafsanaantiisa — wuxuuna dib u dhisaa kuwa leh inflection ama kor-u-kac dhibcaha xakameynta ugu yar oo ku dhex-jira dulqaadka aad siiso oo aan inflection ku darin. Dhig stations, waterlines iyo buttocks sida qalooc, u sifee, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ELoft\u003C/strong\u003E qolofka stations-ka, oo hubi \u003Cstrong\u003EZebra\u003C/strong\u003E. Qaloocyada aan sifeysneynin waxay sidoo kale ku muuqdaan \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E hagaajinta \u003Cstrong\u003EFair this curve\u003C/strong\u003E. Khadka loo baahan yahay inuu beddelo jihada (qayb S-sheeg ah) wuxuu hayaa inflection keliya. Displacement-ka, dhexda iyo gacmaha dib u celinta qolofka waxay ka yimaadaan qaybta jidhka adag: eeg qalabka hydrostatics.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dusha-scan-ka-ka-soo-qaad-reverse-engineering\"\u003EDusha scan-ka ka soo qaad (reverse engineering)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur qaybta ay ku jirto mesh-ka scan-ka (STL la furay ama jidh la dubay), dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDusha\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E, kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EScan\u003C/strong\u003E dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EFit surfaces to the scan\u003C/strong\u003E; mesh-ka qaybta ee la dhisay waa scan-ka. Qalabku wuxuu raadiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ediyaarro\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Esilindaro\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Ekubbado\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ekoone\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha saxda ah ee qaybta la shiiday ka samaysan; safaf kasta wuxuu muujinayaa radius-ka ama xagasha half-angle ee uu helay), wuxuu helaa \u003Cstrong\u003Efillets\u003C/strong\u003E (geesaha iyo geeska wareegsan: silinda ama kubbad yar oo taabanaysa laba ama ka badan wejiyo kale, lagu muujiyo radius-kiisa iyo wejiyada uu isku xirayo), \u003Cstrong\u003Erim fillets\u003C/strong\u003E (torus: geesta wareegsan meesha weji siman uu kulmo silinda ama koone, lagu muujiyo radius-kiisa iyo radius-ka goobtiisa), iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Evariable fillets\u003C/strong\u003E (geesta wareegsan oo radius-kiisu geesta ka beddelmo, lagu muujiyo radius-ka dhamaad kasta), wuxuu ku habeeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal free-form patch\u003C/strong\u003E qayb siman, si tartiib ah u wareegsan, wuxuuna jaraa weji kasta ilaa qaabka qaybta scan-ka uu ka soo jeeday, sidaas darteed godadka iyo geeska way joogaan. Doorashooyin: \u003Cstrong\u003Edulqaadka\u003C/strong\u003E (intee ka fog mm-ka dhibicda scan-ka ay ka noqon karto diyaar ama silinda oo weli uu u taalla, iyo bartilmaameedka free-form patch-ka), \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybta ugu yar\u003C/strong\u003E (qayb ka mid ah bedka dusha) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ewejiyada ugu badan\u003C/strong\u003E. Scan-ka iyo doorashooyinka isku mid ahi weligood wejiyo isku mid ah ayay siiyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijadu waa miis, hal safaf wejig kasta: nooceeda, inta triangle ka timid, iyo khaladka \u003Cstrong\u003Elaga cabbiray scan-ka wejiga\u003C/strong\u003E (rms, kan ugu weyn, iyo qaybta dhibcaha dulqaadka dhexdiisa). Dhibcaha la cabbiray waa geesaha scan-ka iyo dhexda triangle kasta. Khaladka lama cabbirto habka kale (wejiga ilaa scan-ka), sidaas darteed wejig ka baxa scan-ka muuqan maayo. Qoraalka miiska hoostiisa wuxuu sidoo kale sheegaa inta bedka oo yar ee aan ku habboonayn. Muuqaalka dhexdiisa, dhibcaha scan-ka waxaa midabeeya \u003Cstrong\u003Edeviation map\u003C/strong\u003E-kooda: buluug wejiga, cagaar bartamaha dulqaadka, casaan dulqaadka ama ka badan (ka daa \u003Cstrong\u003EShow the deviation map\u003C/strong\u003E si uu u qariyo). Qaybaha isla dhex-soo-laabanaya (tuubo xidhan oo lagu habeeyay free-form patches, tusaale ahaan) waxay ku qoran yihiin inaan la habeyn, weligood lama qasbo hal dusha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStitch the surfaces to a solid\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isku xiraa dusha muuqda oo aan jidh adag ku jirin hal jidh xidhan. Wejiyada scan-ka waxay isku kulmaan kaliya ilaa khaladka scan-ka laftiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu isku dayaa masaafada ugu yar ee xidhaysa (weligeed kan ka badan \u003Cstrong\u003Estitch distance\u003C/strong\u003E aad dejiso) wuxuuna diidaa hadal ahaan marka wejiyada aanay xirmin. Weligeed ma buuxiyo god. Sanduuq geesaha wareegsan wuu isku xirmaa marka fillets-keeda loo helay wejiyo gaar ah; masaafada xidhaysa ee xirtay ayaa natiijada ku jirta. Jidhka adag kadibna wuxuu la shaqeeyaa Union, Subtract, Intersect iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBake into the part\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWixii aan samaynayn: \u003Cstrong\u003Erim fillet\u003C/strong\u003E (torus) waxaa loo raadiyaa oo keliya dhinaca axis-ka silinda ama koone horey loo helay, \u003Cstrong\u003Evariable fillet\u003C/strong\u003E waxaa loo raadiyaa oo keliya geesta toosan oo ah (qaybahiisu waxay ka jarmaan hal jihood oo toosan); meelaha kale waxay u soo baxaan free-form patches markay dhammaad ahaadaan, haddii kale waa la reebaa; kubbadaha, koone iyo fillets waxaa lagu helaa tirayn random ah, sidaas darteed mid aad u yar (dhowr triangle) ayaa lumi karta; deviation map-ku wuxuu muujinayaa masaafada scan-ka ilaa wejiyada, ma aha dhinaca kale; scan-yo aad u weyn (ka badan 300,000 triangle) halkan waa la diidaa. Wejiyada silinda wareeg oo dhan waxaa laga jaraa godad ku wareegsan, seam-ka waxaa la dhigaa meesha god aan jirin. Hubi wejig kasta scan-kaaga ka hor inta aadan isku halleyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeesaha wareegsan ee isku kulma geesaha wejiyada wareegsan ama radius kala duwan (vertex blend), fillet u dhexeeya wejiyo aan isku kulmin, fillet gudaha oo dhamaada wejiga xagasha ama wareegsan, Boolean-yada iyo fillets-ka lagu xisaabiyo dusha iyada oo aan triangle lahayn (halkan engine-ka jidh adag wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa triangle-yada dulqaadka dhexdiisa, dhibcaha oo dhammaan ayaa markaas dib loogu celiyaa dusha saxda ah), jidh la dubay oo raaca dusha marka ay isbeddelaan, jarka dusha ee dusha kale ee Boolean-ka ka baxsan, buuxinta godad ka badan afar geesood, qalooca ku-saadaalinta dusha.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Workspace-ka Dusha wuxuu sameeyaa qalooc iyo dusha siman oo noocan ah oo loo isticmaalo qolofka alaabta, jidhka gaadiidka iyo qolofka doonta: NURBS, isla xisaabta moodelka dusha kale ee isticmaala. Wax walba waxaa lagu cabbiraa dusha saxda ah, weligiis ma aha saddexagallada aad aragto. Cabbirka waa millimitir, sida qaybta PartCraft oo dhan. Dooro Dusha sanduuqa Workspace. Toolbar-ka wuxuu leeyahay Qalooc, Loft, Sweep, Match iyo Zebra; amar kasta waxa ku jira panel-ka midig. Amar kasta wuxuu sheegaa wixii uu weli u baahan yahay: riix qalooca ama dusha muuqaalka (geesta ama dhamaadka ku dhow marka ay weyddiiso) ama dooro liiska; qor dhibcaha, ama riix wejiga qaybta (marka ay ka baxdo, waxay ku dhacaan diyaarka dhulka), kadibna riix Enter. Qalooca iyo dusha waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta jidhka ag. Ma beddelaan astaamaha qaybta: panel-ka wuxuu leeyahay Ka noqo iyo Samee mar kale gaarka ah, hal tallaabo amar kasta. Qalooca Qalooc dhibcaha marayo wuxuu maraa dhibic kasta oo aad riixdo. Qalooc dhibcaha xakameynta wuxuu raacaa qafiska dhibcaha halkii. Geli knot, Kor u qaad darajada iyo Hoos u dhig darajada waxay beddelaan sida qalooca loo tilmaamo iyada oo aan la dhaqdhaqaajin (hoos u dhigiddu diidaa marka qalooca uu ka dhaqaajiyo dulqaadka ka badan). Dib u dhis qalooca wuxuu siinayaa tiro cusub oo dhibcaha xakameynta ah wuxuuna sheegayaa inta uu dhaqaaqay. Match curve wuxuu ka dhigaa dhamaadka hal qalooc inuu la kulmo kan kale G0 (taabasho), G1 (isla jihada) ama G2 (isla curvature-ka sidoo kale). Blend curve wuxuu ku daraa qalooc cusub laba dhamaad dhexdooda, G1 ama G2. Dusha Loft laba ama ka badan qalooc dhexdooda, Ruled surface laba dhexdooda, Extrude curve, Revolve curve. Sweep along one rail wuxuu qaabka u qaadaa jid si aan u leexan; Sweep along two rails wuxuu hayaa dhamaadyada qaabka labada rail-ba. Sweep-yadu waa la habeeyay: natiijadu waxay sheegaysaa inta uu ku dhowaaday sweep-ka runta ah. Surface from a curve network wuxuu maraa shabakad qalooc (mid kasta midka kale mar keliya ayuu gudbaa). Patch from four edges wuxuu buuxiyaa afar qalooc oo ku kulma geesahooda. Match surface wuxuu geesta dusha ka dhigaa inay la kulanto deriskeeda G0, G1 ama G2; Blend surface wuxuu ku daraa dusha labo geesood dhexdooda. Kala-raris dusha, Ballaadhi dusha (dusha wuxuu sii socdaa sidii uu u socday), Dib u dhis dusha. Hubinta tayada Miiska Geesaha la wadaago wuxuu liistaa geesta kasta oo laba dusha la wadaagaan, iyo farqiga (mm), xagasha u dhexaysa (°) iyo kor-u-kaca curvature (1/mm), iyo haddii taas ay ka dhigayso G0, G1 ama G2. Geesta oo ka xun intii aad codsatay waxay ku muuqataa Dhibaatooyinka oo leh hagaajinta Match. Xariiqyada Zebra iyo midabada curvature waxay ka yimaadaan dusha saxda ah: xariiqyada geesta dhexdeeda si aan jabin u socda waxay micnaheedu yahay G1; xariiqyada sidoo kale ballacooda ku sii haya waxay micnaheedu yahay G2. G0–G2 waa la cabbiraa, 33 dhibic geesta kasta. G3 iyo tayada \"class A\" lama cabbiro oo lama sheegi. Jar dusha Kooxda Jar wuxuu jaraa dusha isagoo aan beddelin qaabkiisa: dusha wuxuu hayaa dhibcaha xakameynta oo dhan, qaybta gudaha xuduudka keliya ayaa la muujiyaa, la tiriyaa iyo la qoraa. Jar rectangle iyo Jar goobo waxay ku shaqeeyaan qayb (0 ilaa 1) dusha jihaynta kasta, sidaas darteed ma u baahna doorasho muuqaalka; Jar qalooc wuxuu qaataa qalooc xidhan oo dusha ku jirta (waxaa lagu soo rogaa dusha, waana la diidaa hadalka marka ay furan tahay ama ka fog dulqaadka ka badan). Calaamee Jar god si aad u tirtirto gudaha xuduudka; ka daa si aad gudaha keliya u hayso. Dusha wuxuu leeyahay hal xuduud la hayo iyo godad tiro kasta; xuduud kale gooya waa la diidaa. Ka saar jarka wuxuu mar kale muujiyaa dusha oo dhan. Ka noqo ee panel-ka wuxuu jarka dib u qaadaa sida tallaabo kasta oo kale. STEP wuxuu qaadaa jarka xuduudaha wejiga, IGES-na wuxuu qaadaa dusha la jaray (entity 144); labadaba way akhriyaan. Jidhka adag iyo Boolean-yada Kooxda Jidhka adag wuxuu dusha u beddelaa jidh xidhan oo wuu isku geliyaa. Jidh adag halkan waa urur dusha panel-ka gaarka ah oo wada xidha mugga; wejiyadiisu waxay sii joogaan dusha NURBS saxda ah oo jarkooda leh. Box solid, Cylinder solid iyo Sphere solid mid ayey ka sameeyaan cabbirrada la qoray (mm): sanduuq lix wejiyo siman leh, silinda oo geesta wareegga iyo laba dhamaad siman oo lagu jaray wareegga, kubbad oo hal dusha la wareegay. Jidh adag dusha ka wuxuu isu urursadaa dusha aad naftaadu samaysay. Dooro iyaga, ama midna ha dooran si aad u isticmaasho dusha muuqda oo aan weli jidh adag ku jirin. Waa la isku xiraa dulqaadka gudihiisa: haddii aanay xirmin, wax ma beddelmaan panel-kuna wuxuu sheegayaa inta geesood ee furan ay tahay iyo sida ay u dhowaan inay isku kulmaan. Union, Subtract (jidhka labaad waa laga jaraa kan koowaad) iyo Intersect (kaliya wixii labadooda wadaagaan) labo jidh qaadanayaan: riix wejiga mid kasta muuqaalka, ama riix Pick liiska Jidhka adag. Calaamee Hayso labada jidh adag si aad labadooda ag ku hayso natiijada. Boolean wuxuu wejiga kasta ku hayaa dusha saxda ah oo jarkiisa uu ku jaraa xuduudo jar cusub oo ka dhex-dhaxaysa. Khadka natiijadu wuxuu siinayaa tirooyinka la cabbiray: intee ka dhaqaajiyay dhibcaha engine-ka jidh adag si ay dusha saxda ah ugu fadhiistaan (ma dhaafaan dulqaadka), intee ka dhow dhibcaha isgoysku labada dusha (badanaa kala malayn millimitir), mugga, iyo haddii wejiyada cusub mar kale isku xiraan marka dib loo xidho dusha saxda ah. Mugga waxaa lagu cabbiraa saddexagallo dulqaadka dhexdiisa (0.05 mm haddii aadan dooran mid kale), sidaas darteed mugga sfeerada ama silindarka wuxuu akhrisanayaa wax yar ka hooseeya kan saxda ah: dulqaad yar ayaa dhow. Boolean aan si nadiif ah loo samayn karin (jidhadku midna ma wadaagaan, xuduud isku gooya) waa la diidaa hadal ahaan oo waxba ma beddelo. Hal Boolean waa hal tallaabo oo ka mid ah Ka noqo panel-ka. Liiska Jidhka adag dhexdiisa, Ka saar kooxda wuxuu wejiyada ka dhigaa dusha caadi ah; qashinka wuxuu tirtiraa jidh adag iyo wejiyadiisa. Fillets iyo qaro-gelin Fillet between faces wuxuu wareejiyaa geesta ay laba wejiyo jidh hal ah isku kulmaan: dooro laba wejiyo (muuqaalka, ama Pick liiska), qor radius iyo, radius-ka oo geesta dheer ka beddelmaya, radius dhamaadka (0 wuxuu hayaa hal radius). Kubbad radius-kaas ah ayaa lagu wareejiyaa geesta isagoo taabanaya labada weji; fillet-ku waa qoslaha saxda ah ee ay kaga tagto dhibic kasta, oo lagu isku xiray dusha hal ah, labadana weji waa la jaraa meesha kubbaddu taabato. Geesta dibadda waxay lumisaa agab, geeska gudaha waxay helaysaa. Khadka natiijadu wuxuu siinayaa wixii la cabbiray: intee ka fog dusha fillet-ka kubbadda wareejineysa ee u dhexeysa dhibcaha laga dhisay (dhibcaha ayaa lagu daraa ilaa ay ku dhowaato rubuc dulqaadka), xagasha ugu weyn ee u dhexaysa fillet-ka iyo wejiga kasta khadadka taabashada, iyo tirooyinka isku mid ah sida Union. Radius aan ku habboonayn (kubbaddu ka bixi lahayd wejiga, ama wejigu ka qallooci lahaa radius-ka) waa la diidaa, wejigana magacaabaa, wax ma beddelmaan. Fillet several edges geesaha badan hal tallaabo ku wareejiyaa: dooro labada weji ee geesta koowaad, kadibna labada weji ee kan xiga, iyo kuwa kale (weji wuxuu ku jiri karaa dhowr lamaane, tusaale ahaan weji sare ee sanduuqa afar ka mid ah); geesaha oo dhammaan waxay helaan radius-ka aad qorto. Wareejinta kasta waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa jidhka sidii uu ahaa, kadibna waa la jaraa mid ka dib mid, sidaas darteed amarku ma muhiim. Meesha laba geesood oo wareegsan ay ku kulmaan geeska geesihii kale ee aan wareegin, labada fillet waxay ku dhacaan midba midka kale khadka isgoysyada (crease). Meesha saddex geesood oo dibadda ah oo wareegsan oo saddex wejiyo siman oo isku xaglaya ay ku kulmaan hal radius, geeska waxa uu noqonayaa hal sphere patch taabanaya saddexda fillet (ka saar Corners si aad geeska crease-ka leh u hesho); geesta waa inay ahaataa ugu yaraan laba jeer radius-ka dheer marka labada dhamaadkeeda ay yihiin geeso noocan ah. Khadka natiijadu wuxuu sheegaa geesaha intee la wareejiyay iyo sida geeskuna u soo baxay. Geesaha gudaha ayaa sidoo kale la wareegi karaa, laakiin natiijada aan mar kale xirmin waxaa keliya lagu sheegaa (khadku wuu sheegaa), sidaas darteed hubi. Thicken into a solid wuxuu dusha siiyaa dhumuc: dooro, qor thickness, oo calaamee Other side si ay u koraan dhinaca kale. Wejiga kala-rarid ayaa lagu habeeyay dusha oo lagu cabbiraa (khadka natiijadu wuxuu siinayaa farqiga ugu weyn ee dhumucda ka yimid); darbiyadu waxay raacaan geesta kasta iyo xuduud jar kasta. Haddii dusha dhinacaas uu ka wareego dhumucda, ama qayb kale oo ka mid ah ay ka dhow tahay dhumucda, waa la diidaa, dusha iyo meesha la magacaabayaa, waxna ma beddelmaan. Ku dubo jidh adag qaybta Bake (toolbar-ka Dusha), ama Bake into the part liiska Jidhka adag, wuxuu jidhka adag ka dhigaa jidh qaybta ah, sida STL la furay u noqdo mid: dooro jidhka, haddii uu lagu daro qaybta, laga jaro ama laga goyo, iyo dulqaadka (intee ka fog saddexagallada dusha saxda ah). Waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo qaybta waxayna ka muuqataa liiska astaamaha sida import magaciisu yahay jidhka. Qaybtu waxay hayaa saddexagallada, sidaas darteed way furmaysaa oo dib u dhismaa iyada oo aan dusha la'aan; jidhka saxda ahi wuxuu ku sii jiraa Dusha, sidaas darteed mar kale ayaad ku dubi kartaa isbeddel ka dib. Faylasha Dhoofi STEP (AP242) ama IGES qalooca iyo dusha sidooda sax ah (qalooca iyo dusha B-spline, wax la beddelin saddexagallo). Dusha kasta waa wejigiisa gaarka ah, jarkiisana leh; jidh adag waxaa loo qoraa hal shell xidhan, geesta kasta oo ay labada wejigeeda wadaagaan sida barnaamijyada CAD kale ay filayaan (khadka xaaladda wuxuu sheegayaa inta jidh adag ee sidaas u baxday). IGES-ka jidhka isku midka ahi waa hal manifold solid B-rep (entity 186 oo ku saabsan closed shell 514, faces 510, loops 508, hal edge list 504 iyo hal vertex list 502); jidh adag oo wejiyadiisu geesihii ku lammaanaan waa la qoraa wejiyo kala gaar ah, khadkuna wuu sheegaa. Soo geli… wuxuu akhrisaa jidhka sidaas oo kale jidh adag ahaan, STEP iyo IGES labadaba. Khadadka qolofka doonta Fair (toolbar-ka Dusha) wuxuu cabbiraa qalooc kasta qaabkiisa saxda ah — inflections (meesha ay ka beddelanayso bisil hal jihood ka kale), curvature-ka ugu weyn, kor-u-kaca curvature-ka knots-kiisa iyo qallafsanaantiisa — wuxuuna dib u dhisaa kuwa leh inflection ama kor-u-kac dhibcaha xakameynta ugu yar oo ku dhex-jira dulqaadka aad siiso oo aan inflection ku darin. Dhig stations, waterlines iyo buttocks sida qalooc, u sifee, kadibna Loft qolofka stations-ka, oo hubi Zebra. Qaloocyada aan sifeysneynin waxay sidoo kale ku muuqdaan Dhibaatooyinka hagaajinta Fair this curve. Khadka loo baahan yahay inuu beddelo jihada (qayb S-sheeg ah) wuxuu hayaa inflection keliya. Displacement-ka, dhexda iyo gacmaha dib u celinta qolofka waxay ka yimaadaan qaybta jidhka adag: eeg qalabka hydrostatics. Dusha scan-ka ka soo qaad (reverse engineering) Fur qaybta ay ku jirto mesh-ka scan-ka (STL la furay ama jidh la dubay), dooro Dusha sanduuqa Workspace, kooxda Scan dooro Fit surfaces to the scan; mesh-ka qaybta ee la dhisay waa scan-ka. Qalabku wuxuu raadiyaa diyaarro, silindaro, kubbado iyo koone (dusha saxda ah ee qaybta la shiiday ka samaysan; safaf kasta wuxuu muujinayaa radius-ka ama xagasha half-angle ee uu helay), wuxuu helaa fillets (geesaha iyo geeska wareegsan: silinda ama kubbad yar oo taabanaysa laba ama ka badan wejiyo kale, lagu muujiyo radius-kiisa iyo wejiyada uu isku xirayo), rim fillets (torus: geesta wareegsan meesha weji siman uu kulmo silinda ama koone, lagu muujiyo radius-kiisa iyo radius-ka goobtiisa), iyo variable fillets (geesta wareegsan oo radius-kiisu geesta ka beddelmo, lagu muujiyo radius-ka dhamaad kasta), wuxuu ku habeeyaa hal free-form patch qayb siman, si tartiib ah u wareegsan, wuxuuna jaraa weji kasta ilaa qaabka qaybta scan-ka uu ka soo jeeday, sidaas darteed godadka iyo geeska way joogaan. Doorashooyin: dulqaadka (intee ka fog mm-ka dhibicda scan-ka ay ka noqon karto diyaar ama silinda oo weli uu u taalla, iyo bartilmaameedka free-form patch-ka), qaybta ugu yar (qayb ka mid ah bedka dusha) iyo wejiyada ugu badan. Scan-ka iyo doorashooyinka isku mid ahi weligood wejiyo isku mid ah ayay siiyaan. Natiijadu waa miis, hal safaf wejig kasta: nooceeda, inta triangle ka timid, iyo khaladka laga cabbiray scan-ka wejiga (rms, kan ugu weyn, iyo qaybta dhibcaha dulqaadka dhexdiisa). Dhibcaha la cabbiray waa geesaha scan-ka iyo dhexda triangle kasta. Khaladka lama cabbirto habka kale (wejiga ilaa scan-ka), sidaas darteed wejig ka baxa scan-ka muuqan maayo. Qoraalka miiska hoostiisa wuxuu sidoo kale sheegaa inta bedka oo yar ee aan ku habboonayn. Muuqaalka dhexdiisa, dhibcaha scan-ka waxaa midabeeya deviation map-kooda: buluug wejiga, cagaar bartamaha dulqaadka, casaan dulqaadka ama ka badan (ka daa Show the deviation map si uu u qariyo). Qaybaha isla dhex-soo-laabanaya (tuubo xidhan oo lagu habeeyay free-form patches, tusaale ahaan) waxay ku qoran yihiin inaan la habeyn, weligood lama qasbo hal dusha. Stitch the surfaces to a solid wuxuu isku xiraa dusha muuqda oo aan jidh adag ku jirin hal jidh xidhan. Wejiyada scan-ka waxay isku kulmaan kaliya ilaa khaladka scan-ka laftiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu isku dayaa masaafada ugu yar ee xidhaysa (weligeed kan ka badan stitch distance aad dejiso) wuxuuna diidaa hadal ahaan marka wejiyada aanay xirmin. Weligeed ma buuxiyo god. Sanduuq geesaha wareegsan wuu isku xirmaa marka fillets-keeda loo helay wejiyo gaar ah; masaafada xidhaysa ee xirtay ayaa natiijada ku jirta. Jidhka adag kadibna wuxuu la shaqeeyaa Union, Subtract, Intersect iyo Bake into the part. Wixii aan samaynayn: rim fillet (torus) waxaa loo raadiyaa oo keliya dhinaca axis-ka silinda ama koone horey loo helay, variable fillet waxaa loo raadiyaa oo keliya geesta toosan oo ah (qaybahiisu waxay ka jarmaan hal jihood oo toosan); meelaha kale waxay u soo baxaan free-form patches markay dhammaad ahaadaan, haddii kale waa la reebaa; kubbadaha, koone iyo fillets waxaa lagu helaa tirayn random ah, sidaas darteed mid aad u yar (dhowr triangle) ayaa lumi karta; deviation map-ku wuxuu muujinayaa masaafada scan-ka ilaa wejiyada, ma aha dhinaca kale; scan-yo aad u weyn (ka badan 300,000 triangle) halkan waa la diidaa. Wejiyada silinda wareeg oo dhan waxaa laga jaraa godad ku wareegsan, seam-ka waxaa la dhigaa meesha god aan jirin. Hubi wejig kasta scan-kaaga ka hor inta aadan isku halleyn. Weli lama dhisin Geesaha wareegsan ee isku kulma geesaha wejiyada wareegsan ama radius kala duwan (vertex blend), fillet u dhexeeya wejiyo aan isku kulmin, fillet gudaha oo dhamaada wejiga xagasha ama wareegsan, Boolean-yada iyo fillets-ka lagu xisaabiyo dusha iyada oo aan triangle lahayn (halkan engine-ka jidh adag wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa triangle-yada dulqaadka dhexdiisa, dhibcaha oo dhammaan ayaa markaas dib loogu celiyaa dusha saxda ah), jidh la dubay oo raaca dusha marka ay isbeddelaan, jarka dusha ee dusha kale ee Boolean-ka ka baxsan, buuxinta godad ka badan afar geesood, qalooca ku-saadaalinta dusha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sheet-metal","scope":"partcraft","title":"Saxanka birta: flanges iyo naqshadda balaadhsan","summary":"Bilow qayb saxanka birta ah sawir-gacmeed (saxan fidsan ama profile qallooc ah), dejiso qaroodkeeda, radiyaska qallooca iyo K-factor mar kaliya, u kor qaad flanges geesaha ka soo baxa oo leh bend reliefs, oo ku dhig fidsan sida DXF si loo gooyo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["naqshad balaadhsan","fidi","balaadhin","dherer balaadhsan","qiyaasta qallooca","khadka qallooca","dxf laser","goynta laser","saxanka birta","flange-ka salka","flange geesta","flange","qallooc","radiyaska qallooca","k-factor","k factor","qaro","gauge","relief","bend relief","kanaal","bracket","qolof","saxan qallooc"],"headings":[{"id":"bilow-flange-salka","text":"Bilow flange salka","level":2},{"id":"qallooc-flange-geesta","text":"Qallooc flange geesta","level":2},{"id":"fidi","text":"Fidi","level":2},{"id":"fariimaha","text":"Fariimaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeli lama dhisin nooca hadda.\u003C/strong\u003E Saxanka birta wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel joomatari saxda ah, taas oo nooca PartCraft-ka hadda aanu lahayn: wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel-ka. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa wali aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sheegaa waxa la sameeyo halkii. Boggu inta kale wuxuu sharraxayaa sida ay u shaqeyso kernel saxda ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha saxanka birta waxay bilaabaan \u003Cstrong\u003Eflange-ka salka\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu dejiyaa saxanka qaybta oo dhan: \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaroodkeeda\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eradiyaska qallooca gudaha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EK-factor\u003C/strong\u003E. Flange-ka geesta kasta ee ka dambeeya wuxuu ku qallooca isla lambarradaas, sidaas darteed qaybtu waxay ahaatay hal saxan oo la fidin karo. Labaduba waxay u baahan yihiin \u003Cstrong\u003Ekernel saxda ah\u003C/strong\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilow-flange-salka\"\u003EBilow flange salka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESamee sawir-gacmeed. Isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003Eprofile xiran\u003C/strong\u003E saxan fidsan (laydh, ama qulqulka xiran oo leh godad). Isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003Ehal silsilad xariiq oo furan\u003C/strong\u003E biro qallooc ah, sida L, U ama Z oo loo sawiro sida geesaha saxanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro sawir-gacmeedka taariikhda sifooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Features oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlange-ka salka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelka midig:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaroodka (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E waa gauge-ka saxanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERadiyaska qallooca (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E waa radiyaska gudaha ee qalloc kasta. 0 wuxuu siinayaa geesi gudaha ah oo qiiqsan; dibaddu weli wuu qallooca radiyaska hal qaroodka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EK-factor\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sheegaa meesha lakabka dhexe ee saxanka ku yaal, 0 (dusha gudaha) ilaa 0.5 (dhexe). Waxa uu go&#039;aaminayaa intee dheer saxanku marka dhul la fido. 0.44 waa caadiga; dukaankaaga ama bixiyaha agabka ayaa siin kara midkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E waa intee in le&#039;eg profile-ka qallooca ah uu uga baxo diyaaradda sawirka. Saxan ma tixgeliyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaroodka dibadda qallooca\u003C/strong\u003E: profile furan waa hal dusha saxanka. Caadi ahaan qaroodku wuxuu gudaha ku yaalaa qalloca koowaad, sidaas darteed xariiqyadii aad sawirtay waa dibadda kanaalka. Calaamadi si aad xariiqyada gudaha ugu dhigto. Jawaabta waa isku mid cidda aad ka bilowday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGeesi kasta oo silsilad furan ah wuxuu noqdaa qallooc. Xariiq aad u gaaban si uu u qabto qalloceeda wuu sheegaa, iyo dhererka uu u baahan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qallooc-flange-geesta\"\u003EQallooc flange geesta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji geesta toosan ee dusha sare ama hoose ee saxanka (geesaha dheer, ma aha kuwa khafiifka ah).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFlange geesta\u003C/span\u003E. Haddii geeso aan la dooran, PartCraft wuu sugaa inaad guujiso mid; Esc wuu joojiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFlange-ka wuxuu ka kor u qalloocaa dusha geeskaas wareegga radiyaska gudaha saxanka, ka dibna wuu toosan yahay. Panelka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXagalka (°)\u003C/strong\u003E waa intee qallooca, 1 ilaa 180. 90 waa flange labajibbaaran.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E waa cagta toosan ee ka dambaysa qalloca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu qallooc dhinac kale\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka qalloocaa dusha kale (hoos halkii kor).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa-saar bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKa-saar dhamaadka\u003C/strong\u003E waxay flange-ka ka gaabiyaan labada dhamaad ee geeska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBend relief\u003C/strong\u003E: marka dhamaad la ka saaro, godka ayaa lagu jaraa saxanka dhinacyadiisa si qalloocu u jebin birta halkaas. \u003Cstrong\u003EBallaca relief\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa ballaca godka; qotodheerkiisu waa radiyaska qalloca + qaroodka. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMidna\u003C/strong\u003E si geeska aan loo jarin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu beddelka geeska mar dambe: taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro\u003C/span\u003E panelka oo guji mid kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal halbeegyada qaroodka iyo radiyaska (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/parameters\" data-topic=\"partcraft/parameters\"\u003EHalbeegyada iyo isle&#039;egyada\u003C/a\u003E) si isbeddelka gauge-ka uu u cusboonaysiiyo dhammaan flanges-ka hal mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fidi\"\u003EFidi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabada panel waxay ku dhammaadaan \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda balaadhsan\u003C/strong\u003E. Taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig dhul\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHordhac ayaa tusaya saxanka la fidiyay, iyadoo khadka dhexe ee qalloc kasta ay tahay mid dhibcood ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirka\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EBalaadhka\u003C/strong\u003E waa kuwa laydhka fidsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQallooc kasta waa la liistaa jihadeeda (\u003Cstrong\u003Ekor\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Ehoos\u003C/strong\u003E, marka laga eego dusha sawirka flange-ka salka), xagalka iyo radiyaska gudaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQallooc kasta wuxuu qaadaa dherer ka mid ah lakabka dhexe ee saxanka marka uu mareyo, \u003Cstrong\u003Eqiyaasta qallooca\u003C/strong\u003E: xagalka (radiyaan) × (radiyaska gudaha + K-factor × qaroodka). Sidaas darteed qallooc 90° oo saxan 2 mm ah, radiyas 2 mm ah iyo K-factor 0.44 waxay ku darsataa 4.52 mm saxan fidsan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaxan fidsan, godadka, goynta iyo reliefs-ka qallooca waxay muuqdaan fidsan halka ay dhab ahaantii yihiin, oo ay ku jiraan godadka flange kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u goyso badan, taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu rari xaashiyada…\u003C/span\u003E hoosta naqshadda balaadhsan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nest-flat-parts\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nest-flat-parts\"\u003EKu rari qaybaha fidsan xaashiyada\u003C/a\u003E. Flange-ka salka ee qallooca wuxuu u fidaa hal laydh: dherer fidsan × qoto, iyo khad qallooc geesta kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave DXF\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa naqshadda balaadhsan ee laser, punch ama waterjet, milimitir:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Egeesaha dhammaadka ah layer \u003Cstrong\u003EOUTLINE\u003C/strong\u003E, sida xariiqyo, qaansooyin iyo goobo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekhadadka qallooca layer \u003Cstrong\u003EBEND\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ah xariiq-jajab;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqoraal qalloc kasta layer \u003Cstrong\u003EBEND_NOTES\u003C/strong\u003E, sida &quot;UP 90° R2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax kasta beddelo, naqshadda balaadhsan ayaa baaba&#039;da; mar kale taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig dhul\u003C/span\u003E mid cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa hubi K-factor-ka dukaankaaga ka hor inta aanad gooyin: dhererka naqshadda ayaa ku xiran, wuxuuna kala duwanaadaa agabka, qaroodka iyo qalabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fariimaha\"\u003EFariimaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaxanka birta wuxuu u baahan yahay flange salka ka hor\u003C/strong\u003E — flange geesta ayaa lagu daray ka hor flange salka. Dhig hoos ka mid ah, ama marka hore ku dar flange salka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlange geesta wuxuu u baahan yahay geesta toosan\u003C/strong\u003E — flanges-ka waxay qallooci karaan khadad kaliya; geesaha qalooca lahaa weli ma aqbalaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeeskaas ma saaran dusha qaroodka saxanka\u003C/strong\u003E — geeska wuxuu ku jiraa dusha aan ahayn dusha sare ama hoose ee saxanka (tusaale ahaan darbiga godka). Dooro geesta dusha sare ama hoose.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa-saarku geeska waxba ka ma tago\u003C/strong\u003E — labada ka-saar wadar ahaan waa geeska oo dhan ama ka badan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlange geesta flange salka qallooca lagu sawiran karin hadda\u003C/strong\u003E — bilow saxan toosan oo qallooc dhammaantiis flange geesaha, kuwaas oo fidi kara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoyn iyo godad ka dib flange salka qallooca lama muujiyo naqshadda balaadhsan hadda\u003C/strong\u003E — naqshadda profile qallooca waa oo kaliya laydhka la fidiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Weli lama dhisin nooca hadda. Saxanka birta wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel joomatari saxda ah, taas oo nooca PartCraft-ka hadda aanu lahayn: wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel-ka. Waxa wali aan la dhisin wuxuu sheegaa waxa la sameeyo halkii. Boggu inta kale wuxuu sharraxayaa sida ay u shaqeyso kernel saxda ah. Qaybaha saxanka birta waxay bilaabaan flange-ka salka. Wuxuu dejiyaa saxanka qaybta oo dhan: qaroodkeeda, radiyaska qallooca gudaha iyo K-factor. Flange-ka geesta kasta ee ka dambeeya wuxuu ku qallooca isla lambarradaas, sidaas darteed qaybtu waxay ahaatay hal saxan oo la fidin karo. Labaduba waxay u baahan yihiin kernel saxda ah (eeg Mesh kernel). Bilow flange salka Samee sawir-gacmeed. Isticmaal profile xiran saxan fidsan (laydh, ama qulqulka xiran oo leh godad). Isticmaal hal silsilad xariiq oo furan biro qallooc ah, sida L, U ama Z oo loo sawiro sida geesaha saxanka. Dooro sawir-gacmeedka taariikhda sifooyinka. Furo Wax dheeraad ah kooxda Features oo dooro Flange-ka salka. Panelka midig: Qaroodka (mm) waa gauge-ka saxanka. Radiyaska qallooca (mm) waa radiyaska gudaha ee qalloc kasta. 0 wuxuu siinayaa geesi gudaha ah oo qiiqsan; dibaddu weli wuu qallooca radiyaska hal qaroodka. K-factor wuxuu sheegaa meesha lakabka dhexe ee saxanka ku yaal, 0 (dusha gudaha) ilaa 0.5 (dhexe). Waxa uu go'aaminayaa intee dheer saxanku marka dhul la fido. 0.44 waa caadiga; dukaankaaga ama bixiyaha agabka ayaa siin kara midkooda. Dhererka (mm) waa intee in le'eg profile-ka qallooca ah uu uga baxo diyaaradda sawirka. Saxan ma tixgeliyo. Qaroodka dibadda qallooca: profile furan waa hal dusha saxanka. Caadi ahaan qaroodku wuxuu gudaha ku yaalaa qalloca koowaad, sidaas darteed xariiqyadii aad sawirtay waa dibadda kanaalka. Calaamadi si aad xariiqyada gudaha ugu dhigto. Jawaabta waa isku mid cidda aad ka bilowday. Geesi kasta oo silsilad furan ah wuxuu noqdaa qallooc. Xariiq aad u gaaban si uu u qabto qalloceeda wuu sheegaa, iyo dhererka uu u baahan yahay. Qallooc flange geesta Guji geesta toosan ee dusha sare ama hoose ee saxanka (geesaha dheer, ma aha kuwa khafiifka ah). Dooro Wax dheeraad ah › Flange geesta. Haddii geeso aan la dooran, PartCraft wuu sugaa inaad guujiso mid; Esc wuu joojiyaa. Flange-ka wuxuu ka kor u qalloocaa dusha geeskaas wareegga radiyaska gudaha saxanka, ka dibna wuu toosan yahay. Panelka: Xagalka (°) waa intee qallooca, 1 ilaa 180. 90 waa flange labajibbaaran. Dhererka (mm) waa cagta toosan ee ka dambaysa qalloca. Ku qallooc dhinac kale wuxuu ka qalloocaa dusha kale (hoos halkii kor). Ka-saar bilowga iyo Ka-saar dhamaadka waxay flange-ka ka gaabiyaan labada dhamaad ee geeska. Bend relief: marka dhamaad la ka saaro, godka ayaa lagu jaraa saxanka dhinacyadiisa si qalloocu u jebin birta halkaas. Ballaca relief wuxuu dejiyaa ballaca godka; qotodheerkiisu waa radiyaska qalloca + qaroodka. Dooro Midna si geeska aan loo jarin. Ku beddelka geeska mar dambe: taabo Dooro panelka oo guji mid kale. Isticmaal halbeegyada qaroodka iyo radiyaska (eeg Halbeegyada iyo isle'egyada) si isbeddelka gauge-ka uu u cusboonaysiiyo dhammaan flanges-ka hal mar. Fidi Labada panel waxay ku dhammaadaan Naqshadda balaadhsan. Taabo Dhig dhul: Hordhac ayaa tusaya saxanka la fidiyay, iyadoo khadka dhexe ee qalloc kasta ay tahay mid dhibcood ah. Cabbirka iyo Balaadhka waa kuwa laydhka fidsan. Qallooc kasta waa la liistaa jihadeeda (kor ama hoos, marka laga eego dusha sawirka flange-ka salka), xagalka iyo radiyaska gudaha. Qallooc kasta wuxuu qaadaa dherer ka mid ah lakabka dhexe ee saxanka marka uu mareyo, qiyaasta qallooca: xagalka (radiyaan) × (radiyaska gudaha + K-factor × qaroodka). Sidaas darteed qallooc 90° oo saxan 2 mm ah, radiyas 2 mm ah iyo K-factor 0.44 waxay ku darsataa 4.52 mm saxan fidsan. Saxan fidsan, godadka, goynta iyo reliefs-ka qallooca waxay muuqdaan fidsan halka ay dhab ahaantii yihiin, oo ay ku jiraan godadka flange kasta. Si aad u goyso badan, taabo Ku rari xaashiyada… hoosta naqshadda balaadhsan: eeg Ku rari qaybaha fidsan xaashiyada. Flange-ka salka ee qallooca wuxuu u fidaa hal laydh: dherer fidsan × qoto, iyo khad qallooc geesta kasta. Save DXF wuxuu kaydiyaa naqshadda balaadhsan ee laser, punch ama waterjet, milimitir: geesaha dhammaadka ah layer OUTLINE, sida xariiqyo, qaansooyin iyo goobo; khadadka qallooca layer BEND, oo ah xariiq-jajab; qoraal qalloc kasta layer BEND_NOTES, sida \"UP 90° R2\". Wax kasta beddelo, naqshadda balaadhsan ayaa baaba'da; mar kale taabo Dhig dhul mid cusub. Ka hubi K-factor-ka dukaankaaga ka hor inta aanad gooyin: dhererka naqshadda ayaa ku xiran, wuxuuna kala duwanaadaa agabka, qaroodka iyo qalabka. Fariimaha Saxanka birta wuxuu u baahan yahay flange salka ka hor — flange geesta ayaa lagu daray ka hor flange salka. Dhig hoos ka mid ah, ama marka hore ku dar flange salka. Flange geesta wuxuu u baahan yahay geesta toosan — flanges-ka waxay qallooci karaan khadad kaliya; geesaha qalooca lahaa weli ma aqbalaan. Geeskaas ma saaran dusha qaroodka saxanka — geeska wuxuu ku jiraa dusha aan ahayn dusha sare ama hoose ee saxanka (tusaale ahaan darbiga godka). Dooro geesta dusha sare ama hoose. Ka-saarku geeska waxba ka ma tago — labada ka-saar wadar ahaan waa geeska oo dhan ama ka badan. Flange geesta flange salka qallooca lagu sawiran karin hadda — bilow saxan toosan oo qallooc dhammaantiis flange geesaha, kuwaas oo fidi kara. Goyn iyo godad ka dib flange salka qallooca lama muujiyo naqshadda balaadhsan hadda — naqshadda profile qallooca waa oo kaliya laydhka la fidiyay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"copy-paste","scope":"partcraft","title":"Koobiyee, dhaji iyo laabid","summary":"Koobiyee geometry sawir-gacmeed, astaamo iyo qaybaha isku-dhiska; dhaji meesha aad riixdo ama meesha ay ku taal; laabid hal tallaabo; iyo waxa nuqulka ku raaca iyo waxa aanu raacin.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["koobiyee","dhaji","jar","laabid","clipboard","dhaji meeshaas","dooro dhammaan","dooro midna","tirtir","ctrl c","ctrl v","ctrl d","instance","component","koobiyee sawir-gacmeed","koobiyee astaamo","koobiyee qayb"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-gacmeed","text":"Sawir-gacmeed","level":2},{"id":"taariikhda","text":"Taariikhda","level":2},{"id":"isku-dhiska","text":"Isku-dhiska","level":2},{"id":"clipboard-ka","text":"Clipboard-ka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/span\u003E ee qalabka qalabka waxay haysaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E iyo menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji meeshaas\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro midna\u003C/span\u003E, mid kastaa furihiisa. Waxa ay koobiyeeyaan wuxuu ku xidhan yahay meesha aad joogto: geometry sawir-gacmeed oo furan, astaamo taariikhda, ama qayb isku-dhiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShay la daahay (grayed) hadda ma shaqayn karo. Hoos u dhig si aad u aragto sababta: farriinta ayaa sheegaysa, tusaale ahaan &quot;Dooro geometry sawir-gacmeed marka hore&quot;, ama &quot;Clipboard-ka wuxuu hayaa Sketch2 iyo Extrude2: astaamuhu waxay galaan taariikhda, sidaas darteed ka bax sawir-gacmeedka marka hore&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuraha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESawir-gacmeedka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETaariikhda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIsku-dhiska\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta iyo khadadka la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeedka, extrude-ka, revolve-ka ama hole-ka la doortay (oo leh sawir-gacmeedkiisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee, kadibna tirtir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee, kadibna tirtir astaamaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee, kadibna ka saar qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqulka wuu raacaa pointer-ka; guji meesha uu aado\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ku daraa nuqulka dhamaadka taariikhda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul cusub dhinaca qaybaha kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji meeshaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla isku-xidhka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla sida Dhaji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla meesha qaybta la koobiyeeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaabid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee oo dhaqaaji hal tallaabo; clipboard-ka way joogtaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul labaad isla markiiba kadib\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul labaad dhinaca qaybaha kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooritaanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAstaamaha (waa weydiiyaa haddii kuwa kale isticmaalaan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta ama joint-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro dhammaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax kasta oo sawir-gacmeedka ku jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama heli karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama heli karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro midna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooritaanka waa la nadiifiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooritaanka iyo doorashooyinka waa la nadiifiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooritaanka waa la nadiifiyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhaji kasta, laabid kasta iyo goo kasta waa hal tallaabo oo liiska ka noqoshada ah: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa soo celiyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa dib u dhigaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-gacmeed\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro waxa aad koobiyeynayso: guji, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji wax dheeraad ah, jiid daaqad, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wax kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoobiyee\u003C/span\u003E. Farriinta xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa wixii la koobiyeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji\u003C/span\u003E. Nuqul qalloocan ayaa raacaya pointer-ka, dhexdiisa lagu hayo. Wuxuu ku dhegaa barta: si aad u dhigto dhexda goobta la koobiyeeyay barta, guji barta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji meesha ay tagayso. Geometry-ga la dhajiyey wuu dooran yahay, si aad u jiidi karto ama u ku darto xidhiidhyo isla markiiba. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu joojiyaa dhajinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWixii raaca:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXariiq, goobo ama qows la koobiyeeyay wuxuu raacaa dhamaadyadiisa iyo dhexdiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXidhiidhyada iyo cabbirada u dhexeeya walxaha la koobiyeeyay\u003C/strong\u003E way raacaan: gaashaan la koobiyeeyay wuu weli yahay gaashaan, cabbirradiisa oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXidhiidhyada walxaha aan la koobiyeyn\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo asalka, way baabbi&#039;aan: farriinta xaaladda ayaa tirinaysa: &quot;2 xidhiidh oo ilaa koobiyada dibadda ah ma raacayaan&quot;. Sidaas darteed nuqulka la dhajiyey waa xor inuu dhaqaado ilaa aad ku xidhto xidhiidhyo ama cabbiro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarta la dhigay waxay ku sii jirtaa meesha cusub.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji meeshaas\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu nuqulka saaraa dhawr-ka-dhawr asalka, sawir-gacmeed kastaa ha ahaadee ama mid kale: wuxuu waxtar u leeyahay in profile la keeno sawir-gacmeed ka mid ah mid kale. Sawir-gacmeedka isku mid, nuqulku wuxuu saaran yahay asalka dusheeda; jiidi si aad u dhaqaajiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabid\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu koobiyeeyaa dooritaanka wuxuuna bilaabaa inuu dhigo isla markiiba, isagoo aan taabanin waxa ku jira clipboard-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u ogaanaysid barta god ama slot dhowr jeer, koobiyee mar, kadibna dhaji dhowr jeer: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kasta wuxuu bilaabaa nuqul cusub oo raacaya pointer-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taariikhda\"\u003ETaariikhda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji sawir-gacmeed, extrude, revolve ama hole taariikhda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu koobiyeeyaa. Astaamaha sawir-gacmeed ku saleysan waxaa lagu koobiyeeyaa sawir-gacmeedkooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ku daraa nuqulka dhamaadka taariikhda (rollback bar-ka marka aad dib u celisay), magacyo cusub sida Sketch3 iyo Extrude2 ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqulku wuxuu saaran yahay diyaarada ama wejiga isku mid ah asalka, sidaas darteed wuxuu ku dhisaa dusheeda oo qaybtu waxay u eeg tahay sida tii hore. Dooro sawir-gacmeedka cusub oo beddel diyaaradiisa panel-ka midig, ama fur oo jiid ama dib u cabbir profile-ka si aad u dhaqaajiso nuqulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaji \u003Cstrong\u003Eqayb kale\u003C/strong\u003E: fur qaybtaas oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Marka sawir-gacmeedka nuqulka uu ku jiray wejig aan qaybtaas lahayn, wuxuu u dhacaa diyaarada hore, farriinta xaaladdana way sheegaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabid\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa oo dhajiyaa hal tallaabo, qayb isku mid gudihiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu koobiyeeyaa astaamaha, kadibna wuu tirtiraa (wuxuu weydiiyaa marka hore haddii astaamo kale isticmaalaan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPattern-yada, mirror-yada, fillet-yada, chamfer-yada, shell-yada iyo jidhadka la soo keenay lama koobiyeyn karo: waxay ku xidhan yihiin geesaha, wejiyada ama astaamaha qaybtan lagu doortay. Koobiyee sawir-gacmeedka ama astaamaha ay ku saleysan yihiin, ama u samee pattern \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToosan\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareegsan\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-dhiska\"\u003EIsku-dhiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji qayb muuqaalka ama liiska bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabid\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqulka cusub waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqayb isku mid ah\u003C/strong\u003E: tafatir mid oo dhammaan nuqullada way isbedelaan. Wuxuu ka soo muuqdaa 20 mm midig wax kasta oo isku-dhiska ku jira, isagoo u rogan sida nuqulka, wuxuuna halkaas ku sii jiri doonaa ilaa joint uu meel dhigo. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhaji meeshaas\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu dhigaa meesha qaybta la koobiyeeyay ku taal; ku xir joint si aad u dhaqaajiso (kala-bixidda joint-ka slider-ka ayaa riixaysa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhajinta qayb laga koobiyeeyay isku-dhis kale waxay keenaysaa qaybta, la mid tan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E faylkeeda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar nuqul\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa wixii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabid\u003C/span\u003E sameeyo, wuxuuna shaqeeyaa xitaa haddii aan wax la dooran (wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qaybtii ugu dambaysay).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"clipboard-ka\"\u003EClipboard-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaa clipboard-ka PartCraft, ma aha kan kumbuyuutarka: ma dhajin kartid geometry PartCraft barnaamij kale, ama qoraal muuqaalada PartCraft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxaa lagu kaydiyaa browser-kan, sidaas darteed tab kale oo PartCraft ah ayaa dhajin kara wixii aad koobiyeeyey. Waa la akhrisan yahay oo la hubiyaa sida fayl la furay; wax khasaaran ama nooc kale waa la diidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayb leh fayl STEP oo la soo keenay oo weyn ayaa laga yaabaa inay ka weyn tahay in browser-ku kaydiyo: markaas oo keliya tab-kan ayay dhajinaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuqa tirada ama raadinta caawinta, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay koobiyeeyaan oo dhajiyaan qoraal sida caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawirka naqshadda, koobiyee iyo dhajinta lama heli karo weli; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro midna\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku shaqeeyaan astaamaha la doortay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Kooxda Wax ka beddel ee qalabka qalabka waxay haysaa Ka noqo, Samee mar kale, Koobiyee, Dhaji iyo menu Wax dheeraad ah oo leh Goo, Koobiyee, Dhaji, Dhaji meeshaas, Laabid, Tirtir, Dooro dhammaan iyo Dooro midna, mid kastaa furihiisa. Waxa ay koobiyeeyaan wuxuu ku xidhan yahay meesha aad joogto: geometry sawir-gacmeed oo furan, astaamo taariikhda, ama qayb isku-dhiska. Shay la daahay (grayed) hadda ma shaqayn karo. Hoos u dhig si aad u aragto sababta: farriinta ayaa sheegaysa, tusaale ahaan \"Dooro geometry sawir-gacmeed marka hore\", ama \"Clipboard-ka wuxuu hayaa Sketch2 iyo Extrude2: astaamuhu waxay galaan taariikhda, sidaas darteed ka bax sawir-gacmeedka marka hore\". Falka Furaha Sawir-gacmeedka Taariikhda Isku-dhiska Koobiyee Ctrl+C Barta iyo khadadka la doortay Sawir-gacmeedka, extrude-ka, revolve-ka ama hole-ka la doortay (oo leh sawir-gacmeedkiisa) Qaybta la doortay Goo Ctrl+X Koobiyee, kadibna tirtir Koobiyee, kadibna tirtir astaamaha Koobiyee, kadibna ka saar qaybta Dhaji Ctrl+V Nuqulka wuu raacaa pointer-ka; guji meesha uu aado Wuxuu ku daraa nuqulka dhamaadka taariikhda Nuqul cusub dhinaca qaybaha kale Dhaji meeshaas Ctrl+Shift+V Isla isku-xidhka Isla sida Dhaji Isla meesha qaybta la koobiyeeyay Laabid Ctrl+D Koobiyee oo dhaqaaji hal tallaabo; clipboard-ka way joogtaa Nuqul labaad isla markiiba kadib Nuqul labaad dhinaca qaybaha kale Tirtir Delete Dooritaanka Astaamaha (waa weydiiyaa haddii kuwa kale isticmaalaan) Qaybta ama joint-ka Dooro dhammaan Ctrl+A Wax kasta oo sawir-gacmeedka ku jira Lama heli karo Lama heli karo Dooro midna Esc Dooritaanka waa la nadiifiyaa Dooritaanka iyo doorashooyinka waa la nadiifiyaa Dooritaanka waa la nadiifiyaa Dhaji kasta, laabid kasta iyo goo kasta waa hal tallaabo oo liiska ka noqoshada ah: Ctrl+Z waa soo celiyaa, Ctrl+Y waa dib u dhigaa. Sawir-gacmeed Dooro waxa aad koobiyeynayso: guji, Shift+guji wax dheeraad ah, jiid daaqad, ama riix Ctrl+A wax kasta. Riix Ctrl+C ama dooro Koobiyee. Farriinta xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa wixii la koobiyeeyay. Riix Ctrl+V ama dooro Dhaji. Nuqul qalloocan ayaa raacaya pointer-ka, dhexdiisa lagu hayo. Wuxuu ku dhegaa barta: si aad u dhigto dhexda goobta la koobiyeeyay barta, guji barta. Guji meesha ay tagayso. Geometry-ga la dhajiyey wuu dooran yahay, si aad u jiidi karto ama u ku darto xidhiidhyo isla markiiba. Esc wuxuu joojiyaa dhajinta. Wixii raaca: Xariiq, goobo ama qows la koobiyeeyay wuxuu raacaa dhamaadyadiisa iyo dhexdiisa. Xidhiidhyada iyo cabbirada u dhexeeya walxaha la koobiyeeyay way raacaan: gaashaan la koobiyeeyay wuu weli yahay gaashaan, cabbirradiisa oo dhan. Xidhiidhyada walxaha aan la koobiyeyn, iyo asalka, way baabbi'aan: farriinta xaaladda ayaa tirinaysa: \"2 xidhiidh oo ilaa koobiyada dibadda ah ma raacayaan\". Sidaas darteed nuqulka la dhajiyey waa xor inuu dhaqaado ilaa aad ku xidhto xidhiidhyo ama cabbiro. Barta la dhigay waxay ku sii jirtaa meesha cusub. Dhaji meeshaas wuxuu nuqulka saaraa dhawr-ka-dhawr asalka, sawir-gacmeed kastaa ha ahaadee ama mid kale: wuxuu waxtar u leeyahay in profile la keeno sawir-gacmeed ka mid ah mid kale. Sawir-gacmeedka isku mid, nuqulku wuxuu saaran yahay asalka dusheeda; jiidi si aad u dhaqaajiso. Laabid (Ctrl+D) wuxuu koobiyeeyaa dooritaanka wuxuuna bilaabaa inuu dhigo isla markiiba, isagoo aan taabanin waxa ku jira clipboard-ka. Si aad u ogaanaysid barta god ama slot dhowr jeer, koobiyee mar, kadibna dhaji dhowr jeer: Ctrl+V kasta wuxuu bilaabaa nuqul cusub oo raacaya pointer-ka. Taariikhda Guji sawir-gacmeed, extrude, revolve ama hole taariikhda. Ctrl+C wuu koobiyeeyaa. Astaamaha sawir-gacmeed ku saleysan waxaa lagu koobiyeeyaa sawir-gacmeedkooda. Ctrl+V wuxuu ku daraa nuqulka dhamaadka taariikhda (rollback bar-ka marka aad dib u celisay), magacyo cusub sida Sketch3 iyo Extrude2 ah. Nuqulku wuxuu saaran yahay diyaarada ama wejiga isku mid ah asalka, sidaas darteed wuxuu ku dhisaa dusheeda oo qaybtu waxay u eeg tahay sida tii hore. Dooro sawir-gacmeedka cusub oo beddel diyaaradiisa panel-ka midig, ama fur oo jiid ama dib u cabbir profile-ka si aad u dhaqaajiso nuqulka. Dhaji qayb kale: fur qaybtaas oo riix Ctrl+V. Marka sawir-gacmeedka nuqulka uu ku jiray wejig aan qaybtaas lahayn, wuxuu u dhacaa diyaarada hore, farriinta xaaladdana way sheegaysa. Laabid wuxuu koobiyeeyaa oo dhajiyaa hal tallaabo, qayb isku mid gudihiisa. Goo wuxuu koobiyeeyaa astaamaha, kadibna wuu tirtiraa (wuxuu weydiiyaa marka hore haddii astaamo kale isticmaalaan). Pattern-yada, mirror-yada, fillet-yada, chamfer-yada, shell-yada iyo jidhadka la soo keenay lama koobiyeyn karo: waxay ku xidhan yihiin geesaha, wejiyada ama astaamaha qaybtan lagu doortay. Koobiyee sawir-gacmeedka ama astaamaha ay ku saleysan yihiin, ama u samee pattern Toosan ama Wareegsan. Isku-dhiska Guji qayb muuqaalka ama liiska bidix. Dooro Laabid (Ctrl+D), ama Ctrl+C kadibna Ctrl+V. Nuqulka cusub waa qayb isku mid ah: tafatir mid oo dhammaan nuqullada way isbedelaan. Wuxuu ka soo muuqdaa 20 mm midig wax kasta oo isku-dhiska ku jira, isagoo u rogan sida nuqulka, wuxuuna halkaas ku sii jiri doonaa ilaa joint uu meel dhigo. Dhaji meeshaas (Ctrl+Shift+V) wuxuu dhigaa meesha qaybta la koobiyeeyay ku taal; ku xir joint si aad u dhaqaajiso (kala-bixidda joint-ka slider-ka ayaa riixaysa). Dhajinta qayb laga koobiyeeyay isku-dhis kale waxay keenaysaa qaybta, la mid tan Geli faylkeeda. Ku dar nuqul wuxuu sameeyaa wixii Laabid sameeyo, wuxuuna shaqeeyaa xitaa haddii aan wax la dooran (wuxuu koobiyeeyaa qaybtii ugu dambaysay). Clipboard-ka Waa clipboard-ka PartCraft, ma aha kan kumbuyuutarka: ma dhajin kartid geometry PartCraft barnaamij kale, ama qoraal muuqaalada PartCraft. Waxaa lagu kaydiyaa browser-kan, sidaas darteed tab kale oo PartCraft ah ayaa dhajin kara wixii aad koobiyeeyey. Waa la akhrisan yahay oo la hubiyaa sida fayl la furay; wax khasaaran ama nooc kale waa la diidaa. Qayb leh fayl STEP oo la soo keenay oo weyn ayaa laga yaabaa inay ka weyn tahay in browser-ku kaydiyo: markaas oo keliya tab-kan ayay dhajinaysaa. Sanduuqa tirada ama raadinta caawinta, Ctrl+C iyo Ctrl+V waxay koobiyeeyaan oo dhajiyaan qoraal sida caadiga ah. Sawirka naqshadda, koobiyee iyo dhajinta lama heli karo weli; Tirtir iyo Dooro midna waxay ku shaqeeyaan astaamaha la doortay. Eeg Waxa weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"nest-flat-parts","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ku rari qaybaha xaashiyada","summary":"Qaybaha fidsan ku dhig saxanka birta ama rooll si qashinka PartCraft uu ka heli karo u yar, marna ha ka dhowaan masaafada aad siiso, oo habaynta ku kaydi DXF laser, plasma, waterjet ama router.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["ku rarista","ku rari","xaashi","saxan","rooll","laser","plasma","waterjet","router","jarista","wax soo saar","isticmaalka agabka","qashin","masaafo","ballac jarista","jihada","jihada duubista","dxf","naqshad fidsan","geesaha"],"headings":[{"id":"fur","text":"Fur","level":2},{"id":"habee","text":"Habee","level":2},{"id":"kaydi","text":"Kaydi","level":2},{"id":"jarista-xaashiyada-g-code","text":"Jarista xaashiyada (G-code)","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-hubinayo","text":"Waxa la hubinayo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu rarista\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu meel dhigaa qaybo badan oo fidsan xaashi ah, si agabka aan la isticmaalin uu u yaraado inta ugu badan. PartCraft wuxuu qaybaha mid mid u dhigaa, qayb walba meel ay ku yaraato dherer xaashiga la isticmaalo, wuxuuna isku dayaa dalabyo kala duwan, wuxuuna ku dhamaystiraa dhowr ilbiriqsi, oo wuxuu hayaa kan ugu wanaagsan. Qaybaha waxay ku jiri karaan godadka midba midka kale iyo qoryaha L ama U.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur\"\u003EFur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu rari qaybaha xaashiyada…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa qaybta leh naqshadda fidsan ee qaybta, ama — isku-dhis gudihiisa — naqshadda fidsan ee birta xaashi kasta oo qayb ah, sida nuqullada ay yihiin oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayb birta xaashi ah, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhig dhul\u003C/span\u003E ka dib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu rari xaashiyada…\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal naqshadda fidsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar geesaha faylka DXF…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa geesaha xirani kasta ee faylka DXF sida qayb: naqshad oo ka timid CadCraft oo loo kaydiyay DXF, ama fayl ka yimid softiweerka jarista. Geesaha ku jira geeso kale waa qoro ku jirta. Khadadka iyo qaansooyinka dhamaad ilaa dhamaad ku xiran waxay tirsan yihiin hal geesood. Faylalka inch, santimitir ama mitir waxaa loo beddelaa millimitir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhigida birta xaashiga ah waxay u baahan tahay kernel joometri oo sax ah (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sheet-metal\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sheet-metal\"\u003EBir xaashi\u003C/a\u003E). Geesaha faylka DXF had iyo jeer way shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habee\"\u003EHabee\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb kasta sii \u003Cstrong\u003Einta aad u baahan tahay\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ejihadeeda\u003C/strong\u003E (grain): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJihada kasta\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiga dhererkiisa (sida la naqshadeeyay)\u003C/span\u003E oo loogu talagalay xaashi la sifeeyey ama la duubay oo u baahan inay hal jihood u socoto, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashiga ballacdiisa\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EXaashiyada\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydka\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaxanka birta\u003C/span\u003E oo dherer iyo ballac la siiyay (iyo inta aad haysato; 0 = inta loo baahan yahay), ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERooll\u003C/span\u003E oo ballac la siiyay, dherer kasta oo loo baahan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadka geeska\u003C/strong\u003E waa bannaan la dhawrayo geeska kasta ee xaashiga (kabsashada, ama geesta aan siman).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafada u dhexaysa qaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E waa masaafada ugu yar ee u dhexaysa laba khadka jarista: ugu yaraan ballaca jarista aad ku jirto, oo ku dar wixii agabku u baahan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERogista\u003C/strong\u003E: heerarka qaybta loo rogi karo, 90° kasta ayaa default ah. Rogis yar ayaa dhaqso u shaqeeya; kuwa badan waxay xaashiga si fiican u isticmaali karaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha la rujin karo\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu oggolaanayaa qayb in loo dhigo hoos-u-foorarsan. Ka daa haddii ay birta xaashiga tahay: naqshad fidsan oo la rujiyey waxay ku foorarsan doontaa jihada kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu rari\u003C/span\u003E. Hordhaca wuxuu muujinayaa xaashi kasta; xogta waxay sheegaysaa inta saxan bir (ama inta rooll-ka ah) ee la isticmaalay iyo inta agabka ay qaybuhu qaadanayaaan. Wax kasta oo aan ku habboonayn waa la magacaabayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu keydi DXF\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa habaynta sidii DXF (R12, millimitir), xaashi walba xaashiga xiga hoos: geesaha xaashiyada lakabka SHEET, qaybaha PARTS (qoryaha loo hayo sida qoryo), magaca qayb kasta lakabka LABELS.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku dhafidda qaybo badan badanaa way ka fiican tahay nuqullo badan oo mid ah: qaybaha yaryar waxay buuxiyaan meelaha u dhexeeya kuwa waaweyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jarista-xaashiyada-g-code\"\u003EJarista xaashiyada (G-code)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi › Xaashiyada lagu rariyay ilaa G-code\u003C/strong\u003E akhrisa DXF lagu rariyay (kan, ama xaashiyada add-on-ka Cabinets ee CadCraft) wuxuuna sameeyaa hal barnaamij xaashi kasta iyada oo loo marayo post-ka aad doorato: godadka iyo cut-outs-ka marka hore, kadibna geesaha, qalab kasta oo radius-kiisu ka baxo qaybta, ilaa xaashiga iyo 1 mm dheer, iyo tabs haddii aad codsato. Liiska post-ka waa kuwa dhexe iyo kuwa Manufacture study-gaaga. Hal barnaamij kasta simulator ku hubi ka hor inta aadan socodsiin: godinta iyo pockets lama sameeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-hubinayo\"\u003EWaxa la hubinayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu mar kale hubiyaa habayn kasta qaabka dhabta ah (ma aha shabagga uu ku raadiyay): ma jiro laba qayb oo ka dhow masaafada la siiyay, wax kasta oo gudaha xadka bannaanta ma jiro. Ma qorsho jarista: hordhaca jarista, dalabka jarista, geesaha la wadaago oo mar keliya la jaro iyo xaashiga hadhaaga ah ee la kaydiyo waa shaqada softiweerka jarista. Hubi DXF-ka halkaas ka hor inta aan la jarin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ku rarista wuxuu meel dhigaa qaybo badan oo fidsan xaashi ah, si agabka aan la isticmaalin uu u yaraado inta ugu badan. PartCraft wuxuu qaybaha mid mid u dhigaa, qayb walba meel ay ku yaraato dherer xaashiga la isticmaalo, wuxuuna isku dayaa dalabyo kala duwan, wuxuuna ku dhamaystiraa dhowr ilbiriqsi, oo wuxuu hayaa kan ugu wanaagsan. Qaybaha waxay ku jiri karaan godadka midba midka kale iyo qoryaha L ama U. Fur Dhoofi › Ku rari qaybaha xaashiyada… wuxuu furaa qaybta leh naqshadda fidsan ee qaybta, ama — isku-dhis gudihiisa — naqshadda fidsan ee birta xaashi kasta oo qayb ah, sida nuqullada ay yihiin oo dhan. Qayb birta xaashi ah, Dhig dhul ka dib Ku rari xaashiyada… oo ku yaal naqshadda fidsan. Ku dar geesaha faylka DXF… wuxuu ku daraa geesaha xirani kasta ee faylka DXF sida qayb: naqshad oo ka timid CadCraft oo loo kaydiyay DXF, ama fayl ka yimid softiweerka jarista. Geesaha ku jira geeso kale waa qoro ku jirta. Khadadka iyo qaansooyinka dhamaad ilaa dhamaad ku xiran waxay tirsan yihiin hal geesood. Faylalka inch, santimitir ama mitir waxaa loo beddelaa millimitir. Dhigida birta xaashiga ah waxay u baahan tahay kernel joometri oo sax ah (eeg Bir xaashi). Geesaha faylka DXF had iyo jeer way shaqeeyaan. Habee Qayb kasta sii inta aad u baahan tahay iyo jihadeeda (grain): Jihada kasta, Xaashiga dhererkiisa (sida la naqshadeeyay) oo loogu talagalay xaashi la sifeeyey ama la duubay oo u baahan inay hal jihood u socoto, ama Xaashiga ballacdiisa. Hoosta Xaashiyada: Kaydka: Saxanka birta oo dherer iyo ballac la siiyay (iyo inta aad haysato; 0 = inta loo baahan yahay), ama Rooll oo ballac la siiyay, dherer kasta oo loo baahan yahay. Xadka geeska waa bannaan la dhawrayo geeska kasta ee xaashiga (kabsashada, ama geesta aan siman). Masaafada u dhexaysa qaybaha waa masaafada ugu yar ee u dhexaysa laba khadka jarista: ugu yaraan ballaca jarista aad ku jirto, oo ku dar wixii agabku u baahan yahay. Rogista: heerarka qaybta loo rogi karo, 90° kasta ayaa default ah. Rogis yar ayaa dhaqso u shaqeeya; kuwa badan waxay xaashiga si fiican u isticmaali karaan. Qaybaha la rujin karo wuxuu oggolaanayaa qayb in loo dhigo hoos-u-foorarsan. Ka daa haddii ay birta xaashiga tahay: naqshad fidsan oo la rujiyey waxay ku foorarsan doontaa jihada kale. Riix Ku rari. Hordhaca wuxuu muujinayaa xaashi kasta; xogta waxay sheegaysaa inta saxan bir (ama inta rooll-ka ah) ee la isticmaalay iyo inta agabka ay qaybuhu qaadanayaaan. Wax kasta oo aan ku habboonayn waa la magacaabayaa. Kaydi Ku keydi DXF wuxuu qoraa habaynta sidii DXF (R12, millimitir), xaashi walba xaashiga xiga hoos: geesaha xaashiyada lakabka SHEET, qaybaha PARTS (qoryaha loo hayo sida qoryo), magaca qayb kasta lakabka LABELS. Isku dhafidda qaybo badan badanaa way ka fiican tahay nuqullo badan oo mid ah: qaybaha yaryar waxay buuxiyaan meelaha u dhexeeya kuwa waaweyn. Jarista xaashiyada (G-code) Dhoofi › Xaashiyada lagu rariyay ilaa G-code akhrisa DXF lagu rariyay (kan, ama xaashiyada add-on-ka Cabinets ee CadCraft) wuxuuna sameeyaa hal barnaamij xaashi kasta iyada oo loo marayo post-ka aad doorato: godadka iyo cut-outs-ka marka hore, kadibna geesaha, qalab kasta oo radius-kiisu ka baxo qaybta, ilaa xaashiga iyo 1 mm dheer, iyo tabs haddii aad codsato. Liiska post-ka waa kuwa dhexe iyo kuwa Manufacture study-gaaga. Hal barnaamij kasta simulator ku hubi ka hor inta aadan socodsiin: godinta iyo pockets lama sameeyo. Waxa la hubinayo PartCraft wuxuu mar kale hubiyaa habayn kasta qaabka dhabta ah (ma aha shabagga uu ku raadiyay): ma jiro laba qayb oo ka dhow masaafada la siiyay, wax kasta oo gudaha xadka bannaanta ma jiro. Ma qorsho jarista: hordhaca jarista, dalabka jarista, geesaha la wadaago oo mar keliya la jaro iyo xaashiga hadhaaga ah ee la kaydiyo waa shaqada softiweerka jarista. Hubi DXF-ka halkaas ka hor inta aan la jarin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"draft-analysis","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hubi qabyada qaabka shubista iyo dhalaanta","summary":"Qaybta midabee iyada oo loo eegayo xagasha qabyada marka loo eego jihada qaalibka la furayo, ka arko dusha la soo bixi karo, kuwa u baahan qabyo dheeraad ah iyo kuwa ka soo bixi kara qaybta kale, oo leh qaybta ay ka qabato dhererka dusha.","section":"tasks","order":96,"keywords":["falanqaynta qabyada","qabyo","taper","qaalib","mold","shubista birta","shubista qaabka","jihada jiidista","xariiqda kala-qaybinta","undercut","soo bixid","hubi qabyada"],"headings":[{"id":"shid","text":"Shid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha lagu sameeyo qaalib, dhalaan ama shubis rimaal ah waxay u baahan yihiin \u003Cstrong\u003Eqabyo\u003C/strong\u003E: derbiyo si yar u janjeeran si qaybtu u siibto. \u003Cstrong\u003EFalanqaynta qabyada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu midabeeyaa dusha kasta iyada oo loo eegayo inta ay janjeerto jihada qaalibku furmayo (\u003Cstrong\u003Ejiidista\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shid\"\u003EShid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaqada Design, fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalada\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFalanqaynta qabyada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EJiidista\u003C/strong\u003E: jihada qaalibku furmayo, oo ah X, Y ama Z labo dhinacba, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EFoorarsan dusha la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E: riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro dusha\u003C/span\u003E oo guji dusha fidsan ee qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EQabyada ugu yar\u003C/strong\u003E, degrees ahaan: janjeerka ugu yar ee habkaagu u baahan yahay (badanaa 1° ilaa 3°).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta waxaa lagu midabeeyaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMidabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECagaar: \u003Cstrong\u003EQabyo togan\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaa lagu janjeeriyay jiidista ugu yaraan qabyada ugu yar: siibta qaybtan qaalibka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOker: \u003Cstrong\u003EWuxuu u baahan yahay qabyo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQabyada ugu yar labo dhinacba gudahood, sida darbi toosan: ku dar qabyo meeshan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECas: \u003Cstrong\u003EQabyo taban\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxaa lagu janjeeriyay jiidista ka soo horjeeda ugu yaraan qabyada ugu yar: wuxuu ka soo bixi karaa qaybta kale ee qaalibka, ama waa undercut haddii qaybta laga soo bixi lahaa mid keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta kasta oo midabka ah ee dusha qaybta ayaa lagu muujiyaa xagteeda. \u003Cstrong\u003EJiidista rogid\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka eegayaa qaybta kale ee qaalibka: cagaar iyo cas ayaa is beddelaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDusha jaangooshan waxaa lagu xukumaa barta barta, sidaas darteed silinder oo jiifa jihada jiidista wuxuu muujinayaa qolof u baahan qabyo dhinacyadiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMidabyada waxay raacaan qaybta markaad beddesho. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu damiyaa falanqaynta; wax kama kaydsanaan qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u dartid qabyo, isticmaal astaanta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQabyo\u003C/span\u003E dusha oker (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\"\u003ESweep, loft and draft\u003C/a\u003E), kadibna mar kale hubi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Qaybaha lagu sameeyo qaalib, dhalaan ama shubis rimaal ah waxay u baahan yihiin qabyo: derbiyo si yar u janjeeran si qaybtu u siibto. Falanqaynta qabyada wuxuu midabeeyaa dusha kasta iyada oo loo eegayo inta ay janjeerto jihada qaalibku furmayo (jiidista). Shid Shaqada Design, fur Muuqaalada oo dooro Falanqaynta qabyada. Deji Jiidista: jihada qaalibku furmayo, oo ah X, Y ama Z labo dhinacba, ama Foorarsan dusha la doortay: riix Dooro dusha oo guji dusha fidsan ee qaybta. Deji Qabyada ugu yar, degrees ahaan: janjeerka ugu yar ee habkaagu u baahan yahay (badanaa 1° ilaa 3°). Qaybta waxaa lagu midabeeyaa: Midabka Macnaha Cagaar: Qabyo togan Waxaa lagu janjeeriyay jiidista ugu yaraan qabyada ugu yar: siibta qaybtan qaalibka Oker: Wuxuu u baahan yahay qabyo Qabyada ugu yar labo dhinacba gudahood, sida darbi toosan: ku dar qabyo meeshan Cas: Qabyo taban Waxaa lagu janjeeriyay jiidista ka soo horjeeda ugu yaraan qabyada ugu yar: wuxuu ka soo bixi karaa qaybta kale ee qaalibka, ama waa undercut haddii qaybta laga soo bixi lahaa mid keliya Qaybta kasta oo midabka ah ee dusha qaybta ayaa lagu muujiyaa xagteeda. Jiidista rogid wuxuu ka eegayaa qaybta kale ee qaalibka: cagaar iyo cas ayaa is beddelaya. Dusha jaangooshan waxaa lagu xukumaa barta barta, sidaas darteed silinder oo jiifa jihada jiidista wuxuu muujinayaa qolof u baahan qabyo dhinacyadiisa. Midabyada waxay raacaan qaybta markaad beddesho. Esc ama Xir wuxuu damiyaa falanqaynta; wax kama kaydsanaan qaybta. Si aad u dartid qabyo, isticmaal astaanta Qabyo dusha oker (eeg Sweep, loft and draft), kadibna mar kale hubi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"surface-analysis","scope":"partcraft","title":"Xariijimaha zebra iyo qalooca","summary":"Hubi sida ay si nabad leh ugu isku xidhan yihiin wejiyada qayb kasta, iyadoo xariijimaha zebra ay raacayaan aragtida ama khariidad midab ah oo qalooca celceliska ah, oo laga helo liiska Muuqaalada.","section":"tasks","order":97,"keywords":["zebra","xariijimaha zebra","khadadka ka muuqda","qalooca","khariidadda qalooca","qalooca celceliska","tayada dusha","sii-socodka","tangent","g1","g2","siman","xarig","khadadka iftiinka"],"headings":[{"id":"xariijimaha-zebra","text":"Xariijimaha zebra","level":2},{"id":"qalooca","text":"Qalooca","level":2},{"id":"kaarka","text":"Kaarka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELaba fiiro oo degdeg ah oo ku saabsan sida wejiyada qayb kasta ay u simanyihiin, qayb kasta oo ku taal goobta Design (goobta Form waxay leedahay tirada u gaarka ah foomka aad wax ka beddelayso: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/form-surfaces\" data-topic=\"partcraft/form-surfaces\"\u003EQaabab bilaa xadka oo leh Form\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xariijimaha-zebra\"\u003EXariijimaha zebra\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZebra stripes\u003C/span\u003E. Qaybtu waxay muujinaysaa muuqaalka iftiin xariijo leh, sida dusha dhalaalaysan u muuqan lahayd:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha laba wejood ay \u003Cstrong\u003Etangentially\u003C/strong\u003E isku xidhan yihiin (fillet ku yaal dusha siman, dusha Gordon ee siman), xariijimaha way sii socdaan oo waxay ku gudbaan xidhiidhka iyagoo leh foorar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha ay ku kulmaan \u003Cstrong\u003Exarig\u003C/strong\u003E, xariijimaha way jabaan oo way bararaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeesha qalooca uu sidoo kale isu dhigmo (G2), xariijimaha waxay socdaan iyagoo aan xitaa foorar lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel aragtida (jiid, ama wejiga view-cube): xariijimaha dib ayaa loo sawiraa jihada cusub. \u003Cstrong\u003EXariijooyinka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa tirada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalooca\"\u003EQalooca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECurvature\u003C/span\u003E isla liiskaas. Qaybta waxaa lagu midabeeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqalooca celceliska\u003C/strong\u003E: buluug meesha ay godan tahay (qoto dheer), cadcad meesha ay siman tahay, casaan meesha ay bararan tahay (kor u kacday). Kaarku wuxuu sheegayaa qalooca midabyadu ay gaaraan xooggooda buuxda, 1/mm iyo sida radius. Geesaha adag waxay u tirsan yihiin qalooca aad u badan, sidaas darteed way muuqdaan si xoog leh; fiiri wejiyada ka dhexeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaarka\"\u003EKaarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabaduba waxay furayaan kaarka falanqaynta ee hoosta bidixda aragtida, oo sidoo kale hayo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/draft-analysis\" data-topic=\"partcraft/draft-analysis\"\u003Efalanqaynta qabyada\u003C/a\u003E. U beddel iyaga adoo isticmaalaya \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji\u003C/strong\u003E. Mar kale dooridda midka furan ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa damisaa. Midabyadu waxay raacaan qaybta markaad wax ka beddesho; wax lama kaydiyo qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Laba fiiro oo degdeg ah oo ku saabsan sida wejiyada qayb kasta ay u simanyihiin, qayb kasta oo ku taal goobta Design (goobta Form waxay leedahay tirada u gaarka ah foomka aad wax ka beddelayso: eeg Qaabab bilaa xadka oo leh Form). Xariijimaha zebra Fur Views oo dooro Zebra stripes. Qaybtu waxay muujinaysaa muuqaalka iftiin xariijo leh, sida dusha dhalaalaysan u muuqan lahayd: Meesha laba wejood ay tangentially isku xidhan yihiin (fillet ku yaal dusha siman, dusha Gordon ee siman), xariijimaha way sii socdaan oo waxay ku gudbaan xidhiidhka iyagoo leh foorar. Meesha ay ku kulmaan xarig, xariijimaha way jabaan oo way bararaan. Meesha qalooca uu sidoo kale isu dhigmo (G2), xariijimaha waxay socdaan iyagoo aan xitaa foorar lahayn. Beddel aragtida (jiid, ama wejiga view-cube): xariijimaha dib ayaa loo sawiraa jihada cusub. Xariijooyinka wuxuu dejiyaa tirada. Qalooca Dooro Curvature isla liiskaas. Qaybta waxaa lagu midabeeyaa qalooca celceliska: buluug meesha ay godan tahay (qoto dheer), cadcad meesha ay siman tahay, casaan meesha ay bararan tahay (kor u kacday). Kaarku wuxuu sheegayaa qalooca midabyadu ay gaaraan xooggooda buuxda, 1/mm iyo sida radius. Geesaha adag waxay u tirsan yihiin qalooca aad u badan, sidaas darteed way muuqdaan si xoog leh; fiiri wejiyada ka dhexeeya. Kaarka Labaduba waxay furayaan kaarka falanqaynta ee hoosta bidixda aragtida, oo sidoo kale hayo falanqaynta qabyada. U beddel iyaga adoo isticmaalaya Muuji. Mar kale dooridda midka furan ee Views, Close ama Esc waa damisaa. Midabyadu waxay raacaan qaybta markaad wax ka beddesho; wax lama kaydiyo qaybta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"change-sizes","scope":"partcraft","title":"Beddel cabbirrada adigoo aan furin sawir-gacmeedka","summary":"Qayb ka wad tirooyinka qaybta midig: cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedka, qotoyaasha, tirooyinka iyo xagalka, sida loo qorsheeyo qayb si tirooyinka saxda ah u wada wadaan, iyo meesha ay cabbirrada iyo isla-siminta ka qaataan.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["cabbirrada","cabbirrada wadista","ujeedka naqshadda","beddel cabbirka","isla-siminta","cabbirrada caalamiga ah","miiska naqshadda","qaababka","dib u cabbir","beddel cabbirka"],"headings":[{"id":"beddel-cabbir-sawir-gacmeed-panel-ka","text":"Beddel cabbir sawir-gacmeed panel-ka","level":2},{"id":"qor-tirada-ugu-muhiimsan-isla-markiiba","text":"Qor tirada ugu muhiimsan isla markiiba","level":2},{"id":"beddel-tirada-taariikhda","text":"Beddel tirada taariikhda","level":2},{"id":"jiid-qaybta-muuqaalka","text":"Jiid qaybta muuqaalka","level":2},{"id":"tirooyinka-wadaya-qayb","text":"Tirooyinka wadaya qayb","level":2},{"id":"qorsheyn-qaybta-si-tirooyinka-saxda-ah-u-wada-wadaan","text":"Qorsheyn qaybta si tirooyinka saxda ah u wada wadaan","level":2},{"id":"ka-sii-baxsan-tiro-mid","text":"Ka sii baxsan tiro mid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECabbir kasta oo qayb PartCraft ah waa tiro aad mar dambe beddeli karto: cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedyadiisa iyo dejimaha astaamaha. Ma u baahnid inaad sawir-gacmeedka furto si aad cabbirradiisa u beddesho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-cabbir-sawir-gacmeed-panel-ka\"\u003EBeddel cabbir sawir-gacmeed panel-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji astaamo taariikhda, tusaale ahaan &quot;Extrude1&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta dejimaha extrude-ka, \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada sawir-gacmeedka (Sketch1)\u003C/strong\u003E waxay liistaa cabbir kasta oo sawir-gacmeedkiisa ku jira: &quot;Masaafo&quot;, &quot;Dhexroor&quot;, &quot;Xagal (°)&quot; iwm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor qiimo cusub sanduuq kasta oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESawir-gacmeedku wuxuu xalliyaa qiimaha cusub, qaybta oo dhan dib ayay u dhisaan. Dooritaanka sawir-gacmeedka laftiisa waxay muujinaysaa isla liiska sidii \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada wadista\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhexroorka ama dhexroorka waa inuu ka weyn yahay eber, xagalkuna waa inuu u dhexeeyo 0 iyo 180 darajo; farriinta xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa haddii aanu sidaas ahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqyadu waa kuwan? Sanduuqyada waxay liistaan cabbirrada sida loo sameeyay. Haddii aadan hubin, fur sawir-gacmeedka (laba jeer guji), laba jeer guji cabbirka muuqaalka, oo halkaas beddel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qor-tirada-ugu-muhiimsan-isla-markiiba\"\u003EQor tirada ugu muhiimsan isla markiiba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro astaamo taariikhda (ama kali ku dar), kadibna qor tiro: waxay gashaa sanduuqa astaamaha ugu weyn, kan aad inta badan beddesho (Extrude-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafada\u003C/strong\u003E, Revolve-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EXagal\u003C/strong\u003E, Hole-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexroor\u003C/strong\u003E, pattern-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ETirada\u003C/strong\u003E, Fillet-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ERadius\u003C/strong\u003E, Shell-ka darbiga). Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u dejiso, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u ilaaliso kii hore. Ku dar Extrude waxay sheegaysaa farriinta xaaladda: &quot;Extrude1 waa la daray. Tirooyinkiisa u beddel midig, ama qor tiro isla markiiba masaafadiisa.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-tirada-taariikhda\"\u003EBeddel tirada taariikhda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafka kasta ee taariikhda wuxuu muujinayaa tirada ugu weyn dhinac magaca: &quot;Extrude1 25 mm&quot;, &quot;Hole1 Ø6.6 thru&quot;, &quot;Fillet1 R2&quot;, &quot;LPattern1 4 × 20 mm&quot;. Laba jeer guji tirada (ama dooro safka oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F2\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) sanduuq ayaa halkaas furmaysa. Qor qiimaha cusub oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa kii hore. Waxay u shaqeysaa sida sanduuqa astaamaha midig: xadadka isku mid, \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E si aad u qorto isle&#039;eg sida \u003Ccode\u003E=width/2\u003C/code\u003E, iyo hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EExtrude, Hole ama pattern, laba jeer guji meel kasta oo safka ah wuxuu furaa sanduuqa. Fillet, Chamfer, Shell, Draft ama Thread, laba jeer guji magaca wuxuu weli u gudbaa dooritaanka geesaha ama wejiyada, sidaas darteed laba jeer guji tirada laftiisa. Sawir-gacmeedyada ma lahan tiro safka; laba jeer guji waxay furaa sawir-gacmeedka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jiid-qaybta-muuqaalka\"\u003EJiid qaybta muuqaalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro Extrude taariikhda (ama guji muuqaalka, kadibna safkiisa) oo fallaadh oranji ah ayaa istaaga wejigiisa dhamaadka, masaafadana sanduuq ayay ku taal. Jiid fallaadha: qaybtu way raacaysaa intaad jiidayso, markaad sii deysaana qiimaha cusub ee qotada ayuu dejiyaa hal tallaabo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa soo celinaya). Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E intaad jiidayso si aad ugu noqoto meeshii aad ka bilowday. Qotada wuxuu u dhaqaajaa tallaabooyin ah tobnaad cabbirkeeda: 1 mm extrude 25 mm ah, 0.1 mm kan 3 mm ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERevolve wuxuu leeyahay fallaadh qalloocan dhamaadka wareegiisa: jiidi wareega dhidibka si aad xagasha u beddesho, darajooyin oo dhan 1° ilaa 360°.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAma guji sanduuqa ku xiga fallaadha, qor qiimo (ama \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E iyo isle&#039;eg), kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Extrude-ka aan lahayn fallaado kan ah \u003Cstrong\u003EIlaa dhammaan\u003C/strong\u003E ama ilaa wejig, ama qiime uu isle&#039;eg wadayo: beddel kuwaas midig.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tirooyinka-wadaya-qayb\"\u003ETirooyinka wadaya qayb\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeesha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad beddeli karto\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeed\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir kasta: dherer, masaafo, dhexroor, radius, xagal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrude iyo Cut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQotada, xaaladda dhamaadka, jihada, boss ama cut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERevolve iyo revolved cut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal, dhidib, boss ama cut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHole\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexroor, qotada, ilaa dhammaan, dhexroorka iyo qotada counterbore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet, Chamfer, Shell\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadius, masaafo, qaro darbiga iyo jihada, iyo geesaha ama wejiyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear iyo Circular\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada, fogaanta ama xagalka, jihada ama dhidibka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECurves (sida wareegyada loo qaabeeyo qaab yar)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeesha ay goys ka gooyso, cabbirka iyo miisaanka faahfaahinta, qiyamada GD&amp;T\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorsheyn-qaybta-si-tirooyinka-saxda-ah-u-wada-wadaan\"\u003EQorsheyn qaybta si tirooyinka saxda ah u wada wadaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirooyinka aad siiso waa kuwa aad beddeli karto. Dhowr dabeecadood ayaa dabadeed u dhaqmaan sida loo rabo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir waxa shaqada u muhiimka ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Haddii god in uu ka fogaado 15 mm geesta, cabbir ka geesta, ma aha asalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESi buuxda u qeex sawir-gacmeedyada.\u003C/strong\u003E Markaas beddel kasta waxay dhaqaajinaysaa oo keliya waxa ay looga baahan yahay (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003ESi buuxda u qeex sawir-gacmeed\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaal xidhiidh niyad.\u003C/strong\u003E Isle dhexroor labo god ah waxay macnaheedu tahay hal dhexroor oo wada wadaya labadaba. Qaabab isle ah: asalka ku dhig khadka dhexe, ama isticmaal Midpoint.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir-gacmeed wejiyo ka sameysan astaamaha.\u003C/strong\u003E Sawir-gacmeed ku yaal wejiga dhamaadka extrude-ka wuu u dhaqaaqaa markii qotadu isbeddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPattern halkii aad nuqli lahayd.\u003C/strong\u003E God hal ah oo pattern-ka siddeed jeer leh hal dhexroor oo beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-sii-baxsan-tiro-mid\"\u003EKa sii baxsan tiro mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal tiro oo wada wadaya dhowr:\u003C/strong\u003E isticmaal cabbirro iyo isle&#039;egyo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/parameters\" data-topic=\"partcraft/parameters\"\u003EWadi qayb cabbirro\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhowr cabbir oo qayb mid ah:\u003C/strong\u003E kaydi mid kasta sida \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/design-tables\" data-topic=\"partcraft/design-tables\"\u003Eqaabab\u003C/a\u003E; waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXisaab sanduuqa tirada:\u003C/strong\u003E qor \u003Ccode\u003E=40/2\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E=width / 2\u003C/code\u003E. Taasi waa isle&#039;eg; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/equations-two-way\" data-topic=\"partcraft/equations-two-way\"\u003EIsle&#039;egyo labo jihood\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnugyada inch:\u003C/strong\u003E qaybtu waxay muujinaysaa millimitir. Sanduuq tiro oo leh \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, ama cabbirro, \u003Ccode\u003E2in\u003C/code\u003E waxaa loo beddelaa 50.8.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Cabbir kasta oo qayb PartCraft ah waa tiro aad mar dambe beddeli karto: cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedyadiisa iyo dejimaha astaamaha. Ma u baahnid inaad sawir-gacmeedka furto si aad cabbirradiisa u beddesho. Beddel cabbir sawir-gacmeed panel-ka Guji astaamo taariikhda, tusaale ahaan \"Extrude1\". Hoosta dejimaha extrude-ka, Cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedka (Sketch1) waxay liistaa cabbir kasta oo sawir-gacmeedkiisa ku jira: \"Masaafo\", \"Dhexroor\", \"Xagal (°)\" iwm. Qor qiimo cusub sanduuq kasta oo riix Enter ama Tab. Sawir-gacmeedku wuxuu xalliyaa qiimaha cusub, qaybta oo dhan dib ayay u dhisaan. Dooritaanka sawir-gacmeedka laftiisa waxay muujinaysaa isla liiska sidii Cabbirrada wadista. Dhexroorka ama dhexroorka waa inuu ka weyn yahay eber, xagalkuna waa inuu u dhexeeyo 0 iyo 180 darajo; farriinta xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa haddii aanu sidaas ahayn. Sanduuqyadu waa kuwan? Sanduuqyada waxay liistaan cabbirrada sida loo sameeyay. Haddii aadan hubin, fur sawir-gacmeedka (laba jeer guji), laba jeer guji cabbirka muuqaalka, oo halkaas beddel. Qor tirada ugu muhiimsan isla markiiba Dooro astaamo taariikhda (ama kali ku dar), kadibna qor tiro: waxay gashaa sanduuqa astaamaha ugu weyn, kan aad inta badan beddesho (Extrude-ka Masaafada, Revolve-ka Xagal, Hole-ka Dhexroor, pattern-ka Tirada, Fillet-ka Radius, Shell-ka darbiga). Riix Enter si aad u dejiso, ama Esc si aad u ilaaliso kii hore. Ku dar Extrude waxay sheegaysaa farriinta xaaladda: \"Extrude1 waa la daray. Tirooyinkiisa u beddel midig, ama qor tiro isla markiiba masaafadiisa.\" Beddel tirada taariikhda Safka kasta ee taariikhda wuxuu muujinayaa tirada ugu weyn dhinac magaca: \"Extrude1 25 mm\", \"Hole1 Ø6.6 thru\", \"Fillet1 R2\", \"LPattern1 4 × 20 mm\". Laba jeer guji tirada (ama dooro safka oo riix F2) sanduuq ayaa halkaas furmaysa. Qor qiimaha cusub oo riix Enter; Esc wuxuu ilaaliyaa kii hore. Waxay u shaqeysaa sida sanduuqa astaamaha midig: xadadka isku mid, = si aad u qorto isle'eg sida =width/2, iyo hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho ah. Extrude, Hole ama pattern, laba jeer guji meel kasta oo safka ah wuxuu furaa sanduuqa. Fillet, Chamfer, Shell, Draft ama Thread, laba jeer guji magaca wuxuu weli u gudbaa dooritaanka geesaha ama wejiyada, sidaas darteed laba jeer guji tirada laftiisa. Sawir-gacmeedyada ma lahan tiro safka; laba jeer guji waxay furaa sawir-gacmeedka. Jiid qaybta muuqaalka Dooro Extrude taariikhda (ama guji muuqaalka, kadibna safkiisa) oo fallaadh oranji ah ayaa istaaga wejigiisa dhamaadka, masaafadana sanduuq ayay ku taal. Jiid fallaadha: qaybtu way raacaysaa intaad jiidayso, markaad sii deysaana qiimaha cusub ee qotada ayuu dejiyaa hal tallaabo (Ctrl+Z ayaa soo celinaya). Riix Esc intaad jiidayso si aad ugu noqoto meeshii aad ka bilowday. Qotada wuxuu u dhaqaajaa tallaabooyin ah tobnaad cabbirkeeda: 1 mm extrude 25 mm ah, 0.1 mm kan 3 mm ah. Revolve wuxuu leeyahay fallaadh qalloocan dhamaadka wareegiisa: jiidi wareega dhidibka si aad xagasha u beddesho, darajooyin oo dhan 1° ilaa 360°. Ama guji sanduuqa ku xiga fallaadha, qor qiimo (ama = iyo isle'eg), kadibna riix Enter. Extrude-ka aan lahayn fallaado kan ah Ilaa dhammaan ama ilaa wejig, ama qiime uu isle'eg wadayo: beddel kuwaas midig. Tirooyinka wadaya qayb Meesha Waxa aad beddeli karto Sawir-gacmeed Cabbir kasta: dherer, masaafo, dhexroor, radius, xagal Extrude iyo Cut Qotada, xaaladda dhamaadka, jihada, boss ama cut Revolve iyo revolved cut Xagal, dhidib, boss ama cut Hole Dhexroor, qotada, ilaa dhammaan, dhexroorka iyo qotada counterbore Fillet, Chamfer, Shell Radius, masaafo, qaro darbiga iyo jihada, iyo geesaha ama wejiyada Linear iyo Circular Tirada, fogaanta ama xagalka, jihada ama dhidibka Qayb Curves (sida wareegyada loo qaabeeyo qaab yar) Naqshad Meesha ay goys ka gooyso, cabbirka iyo miisaanka faahfaahinta, qiyamada GD&T Qorsheyn qaybta si tirooyinka saxda ah u wada wadaan Tirooyinka aad siiso waa kuwa aad beddeli karto. Dhowr dabeecadood ayaa dabadeed u dhaqmaan sida loo rabo: Cabbir waxa shaqada u muhiimka ah. Haddii god in uu ka fogaado 15 mm geesta, cabbir ka geesta, ma aha asalka. Si buuxda u qeex sawir-gacmeedyada. Markaas beddel kasta waxay dhaqaajinaysaa oo keliya waxa ay looga baahan yahay (eeg Si buuxda u qeex sawir-gacmeed). Isticmaal xidhiidh niyad. Isle dhexroor labo god ah waxay macnaheedu tahay hal dhexroor oo wada wadaya labadaba. Qaabab isle ah: asalka ku dhig khadka dhexe, ama isticmaal Midpoint. Sawir-gacmeed wejiyo ka sameysan astaamaha. Sawir-gacmeed ku yaal wejiga dhamaadka extrude-ka wuu u dhaqaaqaa markii qotadu isbeddesho. Pattern halkii aad nuqli lahayd. God hal ah oo pattern-ka siddeed jeer leh hal dhexroor oo beddelo. Ka sii baxsan tiro mid Hal tiro oo wada wadaya dhowr: isticmaal cabbirro iyo isle'egyo: Wadi qayb cabbirro. Dhowr cabbir oo qayb mid ah: kaydi mid kasta sida qaabab; waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta. Xisaab sanduuqa tirada: qor =40/2 ama =width / 2. Taasi waa isle'eg; eeg Isle'egyo labo jihood. Unugyada inch: qaybtu waxay muujinaysaa millimitir. Sanduuq tiro oo leh =, ama cabbirro, 2in waxaa loo beddelaa 50.8. Eeg Waxa weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"parameters","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qaabee qayb halbeegyada","summary":"Magacyo u bixi cabbirrada muhiimka ah (ballac, dhumuc, cabbirka boolt), ku xidh lambar kasta oo astaamo ama cabbir sawir-gacmeed = ah, oo qaybta oo dhan ka beddel miis keliya.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["halbeegyo","meesha la isticmaalo","ku isticmaala","doorsoomayaal","isla'egta","niyada naqshadda","cabbirrada wadaad","xidhid","qaacido","magac u bixi cabbir","qiimayaal xidhan"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-dar-halbeegyo","text":"Ku dar halbeegyo","level":2},{"id":"halbeeg-ku-xidh-lambar","text":"Halbeeg ku xidh lambar","level":2},{"id":"beddel-halbeeg","text":"Beddel halbeeg","level":2},{"id":"eeg-halbeegga-meesha-laga-isticmaalo","text":"Eeg halbeegga meesha laga isticmaalo","level":2},{"id":"ka-fur-magac-u-beddel-tirtir","text":"Ka fur, magac u beddel, tirtir","level":2},{"id":"isla-egyada","text":"Isla'egyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHalbeeg waa lambar magac leh, sida \u003Ccode\u003Ewidth = 120\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Emargin = bolt * 1.5\u003C/code\u003E. Ku xidh dherer, dhexroor god, tirada qaab ama cabbir sawir-gacmeed, oo halbeegga beddelka mid kasta ayuu midkiiba beddelaa hal tallaabo. Tani waa habka aad u hayso ujeedada naqshadda qaybta, halkii aad madaxaaga ku haysan lahayd.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-halbeegyo\"\u003EKu dar halbeegyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanel-ka midig, riix tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDoorsoomayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E, qor magac sanduuqa &quot;name&quot;, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003Ewidth\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor qiimihiisa sanduuqa xiga, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E120\u003C/code\u003E, oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiimuhu wuxuu noqon karaa lambar ama isla&#039;eg halbeegyo kale: \u003Ccode\u003Ebolt * 1.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewidth / 2 - 10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eif(width &gt; 100, 6, 4)\u003C/code\u003E. Tiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EValue\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa waxa uu xisaabiyo. Magacu wuxuu ku bilaabmaa xaraf ama \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E wuxuuna leeyahay oo keliya xarfo, lambarro iyo \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E; magacyada shaqooyinka iyo unitiyada (\u003Ccode\u003Esin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epi\u003C/code\u003E) waa la diidaa, sidoo kale wareeg sida \u003Ccode\u003Ea = b\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eb = a\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"halbeeg-ku-xidh-lambar\"\u003EHalbeeg ku xidh lambar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix astaamaha taariikhda, tusaale ahaan &quot;Extrude1&quot;. Dejinteeda waxay ka muuqdaan tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuq lambar, sida \u003Cstrong\u003EDhererka (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E, qor \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E iyo isla&#039;eg: \u003Ccode\u003E=thick\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E=width / 4\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqa hadda wuxuu muujinayaa natiijada, badhanka \u003Cstrong\u003Eƒ\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa ka soo muuqda calaamaddiisa dhinaceeda. Ku sii mouse-ka si aad isla&#039;egta u aragto. Cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedka sidoo kale way shaqeeyaan, labadaba liiska \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada sawir-gacmeedka\u003C/strong\u003E ee astaamaha iyo sanduuqa cabbirka sawirka furan (laba jeer ku dhufo cabbir, qor \u003Ccode\u003E=width\u003C/code\u003E, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELambarrada aad xidhi karto: dherer extrude, xagasha revolve, dhexroorka godka, cabbirrada godka iyo counterbore, tirada qaabka, masaafada iyo xagasha, radius fillet, masaafada chamfer, dhumucda darbiga shell, cabbir sawir-gacmeed kasta, iyo cabbirrada astaamaha cusub (dherer labaad, taper, countersink, masaafada diyaarka tixraaca, xagasha draft iyo kuwo kale).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-halbeeg\"\u003EBeddel halbeeg\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E, qor qiime cusub ama isla&#039;eg tiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EExpression\u003C/strong\u003E oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Wixii ku xidhan wuu beddelmaa qaybtuna mar kale way dhisaa, hal tallaabo ahaan: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka noqda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad lambar uga beddesho dhinaca kale, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/equations-two-way\" data-topic=\"partcraft/equations-two-way\"\u003EIsla&#039;egyada labada jiho\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eeg-halbeegga-meesha-laga-isticmaalo\"\u003EEeg halbeegga meesha laga isticmaalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHalbeeg kasta hoosteeda tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E, safka ayaa sheegaya waxa isticmaala:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Elambarrada uu wado, sida \u003Cstrong\u003EExtrude1 depth\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ESketch1 D2 (distance)\u003C/strong\u003E. Riix mid si aad astaamihiisa u doorato oo sifooyinkiisa u muujiso;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Elambarrada uu wado \u003Cstrong\u003Edhex mara\u003C/strong\u003E halbeegyo kale, sida \u003Cstrong\u003EHole1 diameter (through h, d)\u003C/strong\u003E marka \u003Ccode\u003Ed = h + 2\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eh = w / 2\u003C/code\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ehalbeegyada\u003C/strong\u003E isla&#039;egtooda ku isticmaala, \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaabeynta\u003C/strong\u003E dejisa, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Escripts-ka\u003C/strong\u003E akhrisa (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EQor oo socodsii scripts\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Weli lama isticmaalin.&quot; waxay micnaheedu tahay ma jiro wax isticmaala: waad tirtiri kartaa adigoo aan la weydiinin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-fur-magac-u-beddel-tirtir\"\u003EKa fur, magac u beddel, tirtir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa fur lambarka:\u003C/strong\u003E riix badhankiisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eƒ\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa furo\u003C/span\u003E liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EIsla&#039;egyada\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu hayaa qiimihiisa hadda, halbeeg midna ma beddelo tan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagac u beddel halbeeg:\u003C/strong\u003E qor magac cusub sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EName\u003C/strong\u003E. Isla&#039;eg kasta oo isticmaasha waa la qoraa mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHalbeeg tirtir:\u003C/strong\u003E riix × safkiisa. Haddii wax isticmaalo, PartCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa in marka hore qiimihiisa hadda loo qoro isla&#039;egyadaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAstaamo tirtirista\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa isla&#039;egyada lambarradiisa; xariiqda xaaladdu wuxuu sheegaa kuwa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHalbeegyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E (nooca faylka 3). Qayb aan halbeeg lahayn waxaa loo kaydiyaa sidii hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isla-egyada\"\u003EIsla&#039;egyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQor\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMicnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E120\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1e3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Elambar (millimitir, ama degree haddii xagal)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2in\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5cm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.2m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edherer unit kale, oo loo beddelo millimitir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E30deg\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.5rad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Exagal, loo beddelo degree\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+ - * / %\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E^\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Exisaab; \u003Ccode\u003E^\u003C/code\u003E waa awood, \u003Ccode\u003E-2^2\u003C/code\u003E waa −4\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esin cos tan asin acos atan atan2\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Etrigonometry degree ahaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esqrt pow exp ln log abs sign\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eshaqooyin kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil floor int round(x, digits) min max\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Egoynta iyo xadka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eif(test, a, b)\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E&lt; &lt;= &gt; &gt;= == !=\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edooro: \u003Ccode\u003Eif(bolt &gt;= 16, 6, 8)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3.14159…\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagacyada xarafka waa kala saaran yihiin: \u003Ccode\u003EWidth\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ewidth\u003C/code\u003E waa laba halbeeg.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/design-tables\" data-topic=\"partcraft/design-tables\"\u003EQaabeynta iyo miisaska naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/scripts-and-cli\" data-topic=\"partcraft/scripts-and-cli\"\u003EScripts iyo command line\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Halbeeg waa lambar magac leh, sida width = 120 ama margin = bolt * 1.5. Ku xidh dherer, dhexroor god, tirada qaab ama cabbir sawir-gacmeed, oo halbeegga beddelka mid kasta ayuu midkiiba beddelaa hal tallaabo. Tani waa habka aad u hayso ujeedada naqshadda qaybta, halkii aad madaxaaga ku haysan lahayd. Ku dar halbeegyo Panel-ka midig, riix tab-ka Halbeegyada. Hoosta Doorsoomayaasha, qor magac sanduuqa \"name\", tusaale ahaan width. Qor qiimihiisa sanduuqa xiga, tusaale ahaan 120, oo riix Enter (ama riix Ku dar). Qiimuhu wuxuu noqon karaa lambar ama isla'eg halbeegyo kale: bolt * 1.5, width / 2 - 10, if(width \u003E 100, 6, 4). Tiirka Value wuxuu muujinayaa waxa uu xisaabiyo. Magacu wuxuu ku bilaabmaa xaraf ama _ wuxuuna leeyahay oo keliya xarfo, lambarro iyo _; magacyada shaqooyinka iyo unitiyada (sin, mm, pi) waa la diidaa, sidoo kale wareeg sida a = b iyo b = a. Halbeeg ku xidh lambar Riix astaamaha taariikhda, tusaale ahaan \"Extrude1\". Dejinteeda waxay ka muuqdaan tab-ka Sifooyinka. Sanduuq lambar, sida Dhererka (mm), qor = iyo isla'eg: =thick ama =width / 4. Riix Enter. Sanduuqa hadda wuxuu muujinayaa natiijada, badhanka ƒ ayaa ka soo muuqda calaamaddiisa dhinaceeda. Ku sii mouse-ka si aad isla'egta u aragto. Cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedka sidoo kale way shaqeeyaan, labadaba liiska Cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedka ee astaamaha iyo sanduuqa cabbirka sawirka furan (laba jeer ku dhufo cabbir, qor =width, riix Enter). Lambarrada aad xidhi karto: dherer extrude, xagasha revolve, dhexroorka godka, cabbirrada godka iyo counterbore, tirada qaabka, masaafada iyo xagasha, radius fillet, masaafada chamfer, dhumucda darbiga shell, cabbir sawir-gacmeed kasta, iyo cabbirrada astaamaha cusub (dherer labaad, taper, countersink, masaafada diyaarka tixraaca, xagasha draft iyo kuwo kale). Beddel halbeeg Tab-ka Halbeegyada, qor qiime cusub ama isla'eg tiirka Expression oo riix Enter. Wixii ku xidhan wuu beddelmaa qaybtuna mar kale way dhisaa, hal tallaabo ahaan: Ctrl+Z ayaa ka noqda. Si aad lambar uga beddesho dhinaca kale, eeg Isla'egyada labada jiho. Eeg halbeegga meesha laga isticmaalo Halbeeg kasta hoosteeda tab-ka Halbeegyada, safka ayaa sheegaya waxa isticmaala: lambarrada uu wado, sida Extrude1 depth ama Sketch1 D2 (distance). Riix mid si aad astaamihiisa u doorato oo sifooyinkiisa u muujiso; lambarrada uu wado dhex mara halbeegyo kale, sida Hole1 diameter (through h, d) marka d = h + 2 iyo h = w / 2; halbeegyada isla'egtooda ku isticmaala, qaabeynta dejisa, iyo scripts-ka akhrisa (eeg Qor oo socodsii scripts). \"Weli lama isticmaalin.\" waxay micnaheedu tahay ma jiro wax isticmaala: waad tirtiri kartaa adigoo aan la weydiinin. Ka fur, magac u beddel, tirtir Ka fur lambarka: riix badhankiisa ƒ, ama Ka furo liiska Isla'egyada. Wuxuu hayaa qiimihiisa hadda, halbeeg midna ma beddelo tan. Magac u beddel halbeeg: qor magac cusub sanduuqa Name. Isla'eg kasta oo isticmaasha waa la qoraa mar kale. Halbeeg tirtir: riix × safkiisa. Haddii wax isticmaalo, PartCraft wuxuu weydiinayaa in marka hore qiimihiisa hadda loo qoro isla'egyadaas. Astaamo tirtirista wuxuu tirtiraa isla'egyada lambarradiisa; xariiqda xaaladdu wuxuu sheegaa kuwa. Halbeegyada waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka .partcraft.json (nooca faylka 3). Qayb aan halbeeg lahayn waxaa loo kaydiyaa sidii hore. Isla'egyada Qor Micnaha 120, 12.5, 1e3 lambar (millimitir, ama degree haddii xagal) 2in, 1ft, 3\", 1.5cm, 0.2m dherer unit kale, oo loo beddelo millimitir 30deg, 0.5rad xagal, loo beddelo degree + - * / % iyo ^ xisaab; ^ waa awood, -2^2 waa −4 sin cos tan asin acos atan atan2 trigonometry degree ahaan sqrt pow exp ln log abs sign shaqooyin kale ceil floor int round(x, digits) min max goynta iyo xadka if(test, a, b) iyo \u003C \u003C= \u003E \u003E= == != dooro: if(bolt \u003E= 16, 6, 8) pi 3.14159… Magacyada xarafka waa kala saaran yihiin: Width iyo width waa laba halbeeg. Eeg sidoo kale Qaabeynta iyo miisaska naqshadda iyo Scripts iyo command line.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"equations-two-way","scope":"partcraft","title":"Isla-siminta labada jihood","summary":"Beddel parameter qaybtuna way raacdaa; ku qor cabbir cusub tirada la wadaago oo PartCraft wuxuu xisaabiyaa parameterka ka dambeeya, isagoo weydiinaya kan ah mid markii dhowr ay beddeli karaan.","section":"tasks","order":104,"keywords":["isla-siminta","xalinta dib u soo","cabbirka wadaagga","labada jihood","dib u soo","goal seek","parameters","qiimayaasha xiriirka","parameterka ee beddelaya"],"headings":[{"id":"hore-beddel-parameterka","text":"Hore: beddel parameterka","level":2},{"id":"dib-beddel-tirada-wadaagga","text":"Dib: beddel tirada wadaagga","level":2},{"id":"marka-aanay-suurtogal-ahayn","text":"Marka aanay suurtogal ahayn","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsla-siminta sida \u003Cstrong\u003EExtrude1 depth = thick + extra\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu shaqeeyaa labada jihood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hore-beddel-parameterka\"\u003EHore: beddel parameterka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E, beddel \u003Ccode\u003Ethick\u003C/code\u003E 20 ilaa 30. Extrude1 depth wuxuu noqonayaa 30 + extra, qaybtuna way dib u dhisaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-beddel-tirada-wadaagga\"\u003EDib: beddel tirada wadaagga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji &quot;Extrude1&quot; taariikhda. Sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EDepth (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eƒ\u003C/strong\u003E: isla-siminta ayaa wadaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor cabbirka aad rabto, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003E40\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu xallinayaa parameterka ka dambeeya isla-siminta, tallaabo kasta oo ay qaadato (\u003Ccode\u003Edepth = hub_h\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehub_h = disc_t + 50\u003C/code\u003E: ku qorida dherer waxay beddeshaa \u003Ccode\u003Edisc_t\u003C/code\u003E). Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa beddelay, tusaale ahaan extra wuxuu ka kacay 5 ilaa 15.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka laba ama in ka badan parameters ay wadaagaan tirada, sanduuq ayaa weydiinaya \u003Cstrong\u003EWhich parameter should change?\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuuna liistaa. Guji mid; kuwa kale qiimayaashooda way joogaan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E waxba ma beddelo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESidaas oo kale ayaa sketch-ka ku shaqeysa: laba jeer guji cabbir wadaagga, ku qor qiime, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Waxay sidoo kale ku shaqeysaa tiirka \u003Cstrong\u003EQiimaha\u003C/strong\u003E ee miiska parameters-ka, parameter-ka oo isagu yahay expression.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-aanay-suurtogal-ahayn\"\u003EMarka aanay suurtogal ahayn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirada ay tahay inay ahaato mid oo dhan (tirada pattern-ka) ama ku jirto xad (kaal ilaa 360°) waa la diidaa ka hor intaan wax la beddelin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsla-simin oo keliya tirooyin go&#039;an (\u003Ccode\u003E=40\u003C/code\u003E) ma leh parameter la beddelo: tirada aad ku qorto ayaa beddelaysa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii ma jiro qiime parameter-ka oo siinaya cabbirka aad qortay, status bar-ku wuu sheegayaa oo wax ma beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir-gacmeed aan lagu xallin karin qiimaha cusub wuxuu ilaaliyaa qiimayaashii hore, status bar-kuna wuxuu magacaabaa sawir-gacmeedka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel kasta, labada jihoodba, waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ah.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isla-siminta sida Extrude1 depth = thick + extra wuxuu shaqeeyaa labada jihood. Hore: beddel parameterka Tab-ka Halbeegyada, beddel thick 20 ilaa 30. Extrude1 depth wuxuu noqonayaa 30 + extra, qaybtuna way dib u dhisaysaa. Dib: beddel tirada wadaagga Guji \"Extrude1\" taariikhda. Sanduuqa Depth (mm) wuxuu muujinayaa ƒ: isla-siminta ayaa wadaaga. Ku qor cabbirka aad rabto, tusaale ahaan 40, kadibna riix Enter. PartCraft wuxuu xallinayaa parameterka ka dambeeya isla-siminta, tallaabo kasta oo ay qaadato (depth = hub_h, hub_h = disc_t + 50: ku qorida dherer waxay beddeshaa disc_t). Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa waxa beddelay, tusaale ahaan extra wuxuu ka kacay 5 ilaa 15. Marka laba ama in ka badan parameters ay wadaagaan tirada, sanduuq ayaa weydiinaya Which parameter should change? wuxuuna liistaa. Guji mid; kuwa kale qiimayaashooda way joogaan. Jooji waxba ma beddelo. Sidaas oo kale ayaa sketch-ka ku shaqeysa: laba jeer guji cabbir wadaagga, ku qor qiime, riix Enter. Waxay sidoo kale ku shaqeysaa tiirka Qiimaha ee miiska parameters-ka, parameter-ka oo isagu yahay expression. Marka aanay suurtogal ahayn Tirada ay tahay inay ahaato mid oo dhan (tirada pattern-ka) ama ku jirto xad (kaal ilaa 360°) waa la diidaa ka hor intaan wax la beddelin. Isla-simin oo keliya tirooyin go'an (=40) ma leh parameter la beddelo: tirada aad ku qorto ayaa beddelaysa. Haddii ma jiro qiime parameter-ka oo siinaya cabbirka aad qortay, status bar-ku wuu sheegayaa oo wax ma beddelo. Sawir-gacmeed aan lagu xallin karin qiimaha cusub wuxuu ilaaliyaa qiimayaashii hore, status bar-kuna wuxuu magacaabaa sawir-gacmeedka. Beddel kasta, labada jihoodba, waa hal tallaabo oo Ctrl+Z iyo Ctrl+Y ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"design-tables","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qaababka iyo miisaska naqshadeynta","summary":"Hay dhowr cabbir iyo nooc oo qayb mid ah oo magac loo bixiyay qaababka lagu kaydiyay faylka qaybta, oo feature-yada ku daminaya ama ku furaya qaab kastaa, ku beddel hal guji, soo geli ama dhoof sida miis naqshadeyn CSV ah, ama dhis dhammaan command line-ka.","section":"tasks","order":106,"keywords":["miis naqshadeyn","design table","qaababka","configurations","qaab","cabbirro","sizes","qoys qaybaha","family of parts","csv","spreadsheet","kala duwanaansho","variants","table driven","qoys qayb","suppress","suppressed","damii feature","turn off a feature","ikhtiyaarro","options","leh ama aan lahayn","with or without","configurator"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi-qaab","text":"Kaydi qaab","level":2},{"id":"beddel-cusboonaysii-magacee-tirtir","text":"Beddel, cusboonaysii, magacee, tirtir","level":2},{"id":"damii-ama-fur-feature-yada-qaab-kasta","text":"Damii ama fur feature-yada qaab kasta","level":2},{"id":"soo-geli-ama-dhoof-miis-naqshadeyn","text":"Soo geli ama dhoof miis naqshadeyn","level":2},{"id":"dhammaan-cabbirrada-hal-mar","text":"Dhammaan cabbirrada hal mar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaabku\u003C/strong\u003E waa hal cabbir oo qaybta ah: set magac leh oo qiyam u gaar ah halbeegyadeeda. Qaybta waxay ku kaydisaa qaababkeeda faylkeeda, sidaas darteed way la socdaan. \u003Cstrong\u003EMiiska naqshadeynta\u003C/strong\u003E waa isla shay oo fayl CSV ah, hal sadar halkii qaab.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaababku waxay dejiyaan \u003Cstrong\u003Ehalbeegyada\u003C/strong\u003E, sidaas darteed marka hore ku dar kuwaas (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/parameters\" data-topic=\"partcraft/parameters\"\u003EQayb ku maamul halbeegyo\u003C/a\u003E). Qaab wuxuu kaydiyaa halbeegyada tirooyinka caadiga ah; halbeegyada laga xisaabiyo kuwa kale (sida \u003Ccode\u003Earea = w * d\u003C/code\u003E) ayay raacaan iyagoon kaliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-qaab\"\u003EKaydi qaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E, deji halbeegyada hal cabbir oo qaybta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EQaababka\u003C/strong\u003E, ku qor magac (tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003ELarge\u003C/code\u003E) oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi qiimayaasha hadda\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabka cusub wuxuu noqdaa \u003Cstrong\u003Efirfircoon\u003C/strong\u003E. Markaad mar dambe beddesho halbeeg, wuxuu dhahayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Efirfircoon, waa la beddelay tan iyo\u003C/strong\u003E, si aad u ogaato in qaybtu aanay mar dambe la mid ahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-cusboonaysii-magacee-tirtir\"\u003EBeddel, cusboonaysii, magacee, tirtir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECodso\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa halbeegyada qiimayaasha qaabkaas, oo dib u dhisaa qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusboonaysii\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa qiimayaasha hadda qaabkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u magacowdo, ku qor magaca cusub sanduuqiisa oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E wuu ka saaraa qaabka. Halbeegyadu waxay ilaaliyaan qiimayaashooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMid kasta oo ka mid ah waa hal tallaabo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u celiya. Haddii aad halbeeg magac u beddesho, qaab kasta wuxuu raacaa magaca cusub; haddii aad mid tirtirto, wuxuu ka baxaa qaababka kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"damii-ama-fur-feature-yada-qaab-kasta\"\u003EDamii ama fur feature-yada qaab kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaab wuxuu sidoo kale hayaa feature-yada la damiyay, sidaas darteed qayb mid ayaa noqon karta nooca \u003Cstrong\u003Eleh\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eaan lahayn\u003C/strong\u003E wax: godadka rakibidda, chamfer, boss.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDamii feature-ka: guji history-ga, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoojiso\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydi qaabka sida caadiga ah, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003ENo holes\u003C/code\u003E. Sadarkiisa wuxuu liistaa waxa uu damiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDib u soo deji feature-ka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u dhis\u003C/span\u003E) oo kaydi qaab kale, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003EWith holes\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka qaab kasta uu feature damiyo, codsashada qaab kasta wuxuu damiyaa feature-yadiisa, oo \u003Cstrong\u003Ewixii kale oo dhan wuu furaa\u003C/strong\u003E, oo ay weheliyaan qiyamaha halbeegyadiisa, hal tallaabo. Qaab la kaydiyay ka hor intaan feature-yada la damin waxaa loo tixgeliyaa &quot;wax walba waa furan&quot;. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusboonaysii\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa feature-yada sida ay hadda yihiin, qiimayaashana.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb ay qaababkeedu feature damiyaan waxa loo kaydiyaa nooc fayl cusub: PartCraft hore wuxuu sheegayaa in faylku ka yimid nooc cusub halkii uu furi lahaa iyaga la&#039;aan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska naqshadeynta ee CSV wuxuu qaadaa qiyamaha halbeegyada oo keliya. Soo dhoofinta miis qaab hore wuxuu beddelaa qiyamaha wuxuuna ilaalinayaa feature-yada uu damiyo; \u003Ccode\u003E--table\u003C/code\u003E ee command line-ka qiyamaha oo keliya ayuu dhisaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta faylkeeda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa qaababka iyo kan firfircoon. Qaybtu waxay furmaa iyadoo la kaydiyay qiyamaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-geli-ama-dhoof-miis-naqshadeyn\"\u003ESoo geli ama dhoof miis naqshadeyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska naqshadeynta waa fayl CSV oo leh tiir kasta halbeeg iyo sadar kasta qaab:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename,width,thick,bolt\nsmall,100,6,6.6\nmedium,140,8,8.5\nlarge,200,12,13\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiirka hore wuxuu noqon karaa \u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Econfig\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Econfiguration\u003C/code\u003E; tiirarka kale oo dhan waa inay ahaadaan magacyo halbeegyada qaybta. Unugyadu waa tirooyin, unit-yadana waad ku dari kartaa haddii aad jeclaato (\u003Ccode\u003E8in\u003C/code\u003E). Unug madhan wuxuu ka tagaa halbeegga sadarkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo dhoofi CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sadar kasta ku daraa qaab. Sadar leh magaca qaab jira ayaa beddela; soo dhoofintu waa hal tallaabo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qaababka u dhoofiyaa. Haddii aanu weli jirin, wuxuu qoraa hal sadar oo qiyamaha hadda ah, oo ah bilow xaashida xisaabinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagaca qaab kasta oo spreadsheet-ku akhriyi karo sidii formula (ka bilaabma \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E) waxaa lagu qoraa \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhammaan-cabbirrada-hal-mar\"\u003EDhammaan cabbirrada hal mar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXirmada kala duwanaanshaha…\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EQaababka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhisaa dhammaan qaababka, ama kuwa la doortay, sida STEP, IFC, DWG iyo preview hal zip gudihiisa, oo leh miis halbeegyadooda: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003ESamee xirmada kala duwanaanshaha qaababkaaga\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka command line-ka wuxuu dhisaa hal fayl sadar kasta oo CSV design table ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enode tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs build bracket.pcscript --table sizes.csv --out-dir sizes --format step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka hore dhoofi qaababka sida CSV, kadibna fayladaas u gudbi \u003Ccode\u003E--table\u003C/code\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/scripts-and-cli\" data-topic=\"partcraft/scripts-and-cli\"\u003EScripts-ka iyo command line-ka\u003C/a\u003E. Qayb loo kaydiyay sida script waxay qaababkeeda ku kaydisaa sadar \u003Ccode\u003Econfigs json …\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaabku waa hal cabbir oo qaybta ah: set magac leh oo qiyam u gaar ah halbeegyadeeda. Qaybta waxay ku kaydisaa qaababkeeda faylkeeda, sidaas darteed way la socdaan. Miiska naqshadeynta waa isla shay oo fayl CSV ah, hal sadar halkii qaab. Qaababku waxay dejiyaan halbeegyada, sidaas darteed marka hore ku dar kuwaas (eeg Qayb ku maamul halbeegyo). Qaab wuxuu kaydiyaa halbeegyada tirooyinka caadiga ah; halbeegyada laga xisaabiyo kuwa kale (sida area = w * d) ayay raacaan iyagoon kaliya. Kaydi qaab Tab-ka Halbeegyada, deji halbeegyada hal cabbir oo qaybta ah. Hoosta Qaababka, ku qor magac (tusaale ahaan Large) oo riix Kaydi qiimayaasha hadda ama Enter. Qaabka cusub wuxuu noqdaa firfircoon. Markaad mar dambe beddesho halbeeg, wuxuu dhahayaa firfircoon, waa la beddelay tan iyo, si aad u ogaato in qaybtu aanay mar dambe la mid ahayn. Beddel, cusboonaysii, magacee, tirtir Codso wuxuu dejiyaa halbeegyada qiimayaasha qaabkaas, oo dib u dhisaa qaybta. Cusboonaysii wuxuu kaydiyaa qiimayaasha hadda qaabkaas. Si aad u magacowdo, ku qor magaca cusub sanduuqiisa oo riix Enter. Tirtir wuu ka saaraa qaabka. Halbeegyadu waxay ilaaliyaan qiimayaashooda. Mid kasta oo ka mid ah waa hal tallaabo: Ctrl+Z ayaa dib u celiya. Haddii aad halbeeg magac u beddesho, qaab kasta wuxuu raacaa magaca cusub; haddii aad mid tirtirto, wuxuu ka baxaa qaababka kale. Damii ama fur feature-yada qaab kasta Qaab wuxuu sidoo kale hayaa feature-yada la damiyay, sidaas darteed qayb mid ayaa noqon karta nooca leh iyo aan lahayn wax: godadka rakibidda, chamfer, boss. Damii feature-ka: guji history-ga, kadibna Joojiso ee Sifooyinka. Kaydi qaabka sida caadiga ah, tusaale ahaan No holes. Sadarkiisa wuxuu liistaa waxa uu damiyo. Dib u soo deji feature-ka (Dib u dhis) oo kaydi qaab kale, tusaale ahaan With holes. Marka qaab kasta uu feature damiyo, codsashada qaab kasta wuxuu damiyaa feature-yadiisa, oo wixii kale oo dhan wuu furaa, oo ay weheliyaan qiyamaha halbeegyadiisa, hal tallaabo. Qaab la kaydiyay ka hor intaan feature-yada la damin waxaa loo tixgeliyaa \"wax walba waa furan\". Cusboonaysii wuxuu kaydiyaa feature-yada sida ay hadda yihiin, qiimayaashana. Qayb ay qaababkeedu feature damiyaan waxa loo kaydiyaa nooc fayl cusub: PartCraft hore wuxuu sheegayaa in faylku ka yimid nooc cusub halkii uu furi lahaa iyaga la'aan. Miiska naqshadeynta ee CSV wuxuu qaadaa qiyamaha halbeegyada oo keliya. Soo dhoofinta miis qaab hore wuxuu beddelaa qiyamaha wuxuuna ilaalinayaa feature-yada uu damiyo; --table ee command line-ka qiyamaha oo keliya ayuu dhisaa. Qaybta faylkeeda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa qaababka iyo kan firfircoon. Qaybtu waxay furmaa iyadoo la kaydiyay qiyamaha. Soo geli ama dhoof miis naqshadeyn Miiska naqshadeynta waa fayl CSV oo leh tiir kasta halbeeg iyo sadar kasta qaab: name,width,thick,bolt small,100,6,6.6 medium,140,8,8.5 large,200,12,13 Tiirka hore wuxuu noqon karaa name, config ama configuration; tiirarka kale oo dhan waa inay ahaadaan magacyo halbeegyada qaybta. Unugyadu waa tirooyin, unit-yadana waad ku dari kartaa haddii aad jeclaato (8in). Unug madhan wuxuu ka tagaa halbeegga sadarkaas. Soo dhoofi CSV wuxuu sadar kasta ku daraa qaab. Sadar leh magaca qaab jira ayaa beddela; soo dhoofintu waa hal tallaabo. Dhoofi CSV wuxuu qaababka u dhoofiyaa. Haddii aanu weli jirin, wuxuu qoraa hal sadar oo qiyamaha hadda ah, oo ah bilow xaashida xisaabinta. Magaca qaab kasta oo spreadsheet-ku akhriyi karo sidii formula (ka bilaabma =, +, - ama @) waxaa lagu qoraa ' hore. Dhammaan cabbirrada hal mar Xirmada kala duwanaanshaha… hoosta Qaababka wuxuu dhisaa dhammaan qaababka, ama kuwa la doortay, sida STEP, IFC, DWG iyo preview hal zip gudihiisa, oo leh miis halbeegyadooda: eeg Samee xirmada kala duwanaanshaha qaababkaaga. Qalabka command line-ka wuxuu dhisaa hal fayl sadar kasta oo CSV design table ah: node tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs build bracket.pcscript --table sizes.csv --out-dir sizes --format step Marka hore dhoofi qaababka sida CSV, kadibna fayladaas u gudbi --table. Eeg Scripts-ka iyo command line-ka. Qayb loo kaydiyay sida script waxay qaababkeeda ku kaydisaa sadar configs json ….","lang":"so"},{"slug":"standard-parts","scope":"partcraft","title":"Fur qayb caadi ah","summary":"Bilow qayb makaanik caadi ah oo ka timid boolt, qanjaruuf, qodxan, daarad, pin, bearing ama fure, oo cabbirka laga qaatay caadigeeda, iyada oo cabbir kasta oo miiska caadiga ah uu yahay habayn.","section":"tasks","order":107,"keywords":["qayb caadi ah","qayb caadi ah","boolt","qanjaruuf","lix-geesle","qodxan","daarad","pin","dowel","bearing","ball bearing","fure","parallel key","fastener","iso 4017","iso 4014","iso 4032","iso 7089","iso 2338","iso 15","din 6885","asme","template","maktabad"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-mid","text":"Fur mid","level":2},{"id":"beddel-cabbirka","text":"Beddel cabbirka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-moodeelay","text":"Waxa la moodeelay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu furaa qaybo makaanik caadi ah oo diyaar ah: cabbirrada waxay ka yimaadaan miisaska caadiga, cabbir kasta oo miiska ku jirna waa habayn aad u beddeli karto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-mid\"\u003EFur mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQayb caadi ah\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Fayl.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybta\u003C/span\u003E dooro nooca, tusaale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQanjaruuf madax lix-geesle (ISO 4017)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBaaxadda\u003C/span\u003E dooro baaxadda, tusaale \u003Ccode\u003EM10 × 40\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybtu waxay furmaa qayb cusub oo aan la kaydin. Kaydi si aad u hayso (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQayb\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQanjaruuf madax lix-geesle, boolt lix-geesle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO 4017, ISO 4014, ASME B18.2.1 (inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ed\u003C/code\u003E baaxadda dhuumada, \u003Ccode\u003Es\u003C/code\u003E ballaca dhinac ilaa dhinac, \u003Ccode\u003Ek\u003C/code\u003E joogga madaxa, \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E dherer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQodxan lix-geesle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO 4032, ASME B18.2.2 (inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ed\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Es\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eheight\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaarad caadi ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO 7089\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ed1\u003C/code\u003E gudaha, \u003Ccode\u003Ed2\u003C/code\u003E dibada, \u003Ccode\u003Eh\u003C/code\u003E dhumuc\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPin isu-dhigan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO 2338\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ed\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBearing kubbad-wareeg qoto dheer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EISO 15\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ed\u003C/code\u003E godka, \u003Ccode\u003ED\u003C/code\u003E dibada, \u003Ccode\u003EB\u003C/code\u003E ballaca\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFure isu-dhigan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDIN 6885-1, qaabka A\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eb\u003C/code\u003E ballaca, \u003Ccode\u003Eh\u003C/code\u003E joogga, \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E dherer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-cabbirka\"\u003EBeddel cabbirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbir kasta waa habayn (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/design-tables\" data-topic=\"partcraft/design-tables\"\u003EHabaynada iyo miisaska naqshadaynta\u003C/a\u003E): fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro mid kale, ama beddel halbeeg, sida \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E qanjaruuf dheer ah, kadibna ku kaydi habayn aad iska leedahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-moodeelay\"\u003EWaxa la moodeelay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQanjaruufyo iyo boolt-yo: madaxa lix-geesle iyo cagaha caadiga ah. Qodxanka: lix-geesle leh god baaxadda dhuumada ee magaca. Dhuumooyinka lama moodeelo; ku dar mid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhuumo\u003C/span\u003E haddii aad u baahan tahay (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/threads\" data-topic=\"partcraft/threads\"\u003EDhuumooyinka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPin-yada: silinder caadi ah; chamfer-yada dhamaadka waa la reebay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBearing-yada: dibada keliya (giraan godka, dhexroorka dibadda iyo ballaca), taasoo ah wixii aad u baahan tahay si aad mid u dhigto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFurayaasha: fure dhamaadkiisu wareegsan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgabka qaybta waa bir, sidaas darteed guddiga cufka wuxuu muujinayaa miisaanka. Gear-ka halkan ma jiraan weli: PartCraft ma lahan astaamo ilkaha, diisku ma aha gear. CadCraft wuxuu gear-ka ku sawiraa heshiiska sawirka, maktabadduna way u hayaan sawiro.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"PartCraft wuxuu furaa qaybo makaanik caadi ah oo diyaar ah: cabbirrada waxay ka yimaadaan miisaska caadiga, cabbir kasta oo miiska ku jirna waa habayn aad u beddeli karto. Fur mid Guji Qayb caadi ah kooxda Fayl. Qaybta dooro nooca, tusaale Qanjaruuf madax lix-geesle (ISO 4017). Baaxadda dooro baaxadda, tusaale M10 × 40. Guji Fur. Qaybtu waxay furmaa qayb cusub oo aan la kaydin. Kaydi si aad u hayso (Ctrl+S). Qayb Caadi Halbeegyada Qanjaruuf madax lix-geesle, boolt lix-geesle ISO 4017, ISO 4014, ASME B18.2.1 (inch) d baaxadda dhuumada, s ballaca dhinac ilaa dhinac, k joogga madaxa, l dherer Qodxan lix-geesle ISO 4032, ASME B18.2.2 (inch) d, s, height Daarad caadi ah ISO 7089 d1 gudaha, d2 dibada, h dhumuc Pin isu-dhigan ISO 2338 d, l Bearing kubbad-wareeg qoto dheer ISO 15 d godka, D dibada, B ballaca Fure isu-dhigan DIN 6885-1, qaabka A b ballaca, h joogga, l dherer Beddel cabbirka Cabbir kasta waa habayn (eeg Habaynada iyo miisaska naqshadaynta): fur Halbeegyada oo dooro mid kale, ama beddel halbeeg, sida l qanjaruuf dheer ah, kadibna ku kaydi habayn aad iska leedahay. Waxa la moodeelay Qanjaruufyo iyo boolt-yo: madaxa lix-geesle iyo cagaha caadiga ah. Qodxanka: lix-geesle leh god baaxadda dhuumada ee magaca. Dhuumooyinka lama moodeelo; ku dar mid Dhuumo haddii aad u baahan tahay (eeg Dhuumooyinka). Pin-yada: silinder caadi ah; chamfer-yada dhamaadka waa la reebay. Bearing-yada: dibada keliya (giraan godka, dhexroorka dibadda iyo ballaca), taasoo ah wixii aad u baahan tahay si aad mid u dhigto. Furayaasha: fure dhamaadkiisu wareegsan yahay. Agabka qaybta waa bir, sidaas darteed guddiga cufka wuxuu muujinayaa miisaanka. Gear-ka halkan ma jiraan weli: PartCraft ma lahan astaamo ilkaha, diisku ma aha gear. CadCraft wuxuu gear-ka ku sawiraa heshiiska sawirka, maktabadduna way u hayaan sawiro.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"variant-pack","scope":"partcraft","title":"Samee xirmada kala duwanaanshaha habaynteeda","summary":"Dhis habayn kasta oo qayb ah, ama kuwa aad doorato oo kaliya, hal mar oo ah STEP, IFC, DWG iyo muuqaal kasta, oo leh miis halbeegyadooda, iyo qaybta oo ah hal shay maktabad oo leh kala duwanaanshaheeda.","section":"tasks","order":107,"keywords":["xirmada kala duwanaanshaha","kala duwanaansho","habayn","qoyska qaybaha","dhoofin batch ah","cabbir kasta","step","ifc","dwg","muuqaal","miis","csv","json","maktabad","habeeye","katalog","item json"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-ku-jira-zip-ka","text":"Waxa ku jira zip-ka","level":2},{"id":"waa-in-la-ogaadaa","text":"Waa in la ogaadaa","level":2},{"id":"dhig-kala-duwanaanshaha-bog-maktabad","text":"Dhig kala duwanaanshaha bog maktabad","level":2},{"id":"sadarka-amarka","text":"Sadarka amarka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudbi \u003Cstrong\u003Ecabbir kasta oo qayb ah hal mar\u003C/strong\u003E: hal fayl STEP, IFC iyo DWG iyo sawir habayn kasta, miis oo sheegaysa waxa mid kasta yahay, iyo shay maktabad oo dhigaysa dhammaantood bog hal ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad u baahan tahay qayb leh \u003Cstrong\u003Ehabayn\u003C/strong\u003E marka hore (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/design-tables\" data-topic=\"partcraft/design-tables\"\u003EHabaynta iyo miisaska naqshadeynta\u003C/a\u003E). Habayn kasta oo astaan damisa, sida dhano leh iyo aan lahayn godad, waxay noqonaysaa kala duwanaanshaheeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur qaybta. Tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E, raadi \u003Cstrong\u003EHabayn\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXirmada kala duwanaanshaha…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi habaynta la dhisayo (dhammaantood waa la calaamadiyay) iyo faylalka la qorayo: STEP, IFC, DWG, muuqaal, iyo shayga maktabadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee xirmada\u003C/span\u003E. Khadka xaaladda wuxuu tirinayaa kala duwanaanshaha markii la dhisayo; qaybtaadu ma beddelmayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal zip ayaa soo dejisa: \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt; variants.zip\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-ku-jira-zip-ka\"\u003EWaxa ku jira zip-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFayl\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaa maxay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHabaynta oo ah jidh STEP ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.ifc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC4, hal walax oo leh jidhka la dhisay iyo halbeegyada qaybta oo ah guryo; qiimaha waa midka habaynta u gaarka ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.dwg\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalada hore, sare, midig iyo isometric oo ah xaashi naqshad oo cabbir buuxa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.svg\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir khad isometric ah oo ka mid ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Evariants.csv\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Evariants.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiiska halbeegyada: aqoonsiga kala duwanaanshaha, magaciisa iyo qiimaha halbeeg kasta, astaamaha uu damiyo, faylalkiisa, mugga iyo cabbirka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt;.item.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta oo ah hal shay maktabad oo leh kala duwanaanshaheeda (eeg hoosta).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EREADME.txt\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa la sameeyay, xusuusta hoose, iyo wax kasta oo aan la dhisin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylalka magacooda waxaa lagu magacaabaa habaynta. Habayn aan la dhisi karin (astaan aan lagu samayn karin qiimahaas) waa laga tagaa faylalka iyo miiska, waxaana lagu taxay README-ga iyo fariin kadib markii zip-ka la kaydiyo; kuwa kale ayaa weli la qoraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waa-in-la-ogaadaa\"\u003EWaa in la ogaadaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTEP\u003C/strong\u003E waa saxda marka exact kernel-ka uu ku shaqeeyo dhismahaaga. Haddii kale STEP-ku waa fasedyo (saddex-geesle fidsan), README-gana wuu sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDWG\u003C/strong\u003E waa xaashi naqshad, ma aha moodel 3D. Khadadkiisu waxay ka imanayaan mesh-ka, sidaas darteed geesta khamiiska ah waa khado gaagaaban oo badan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShayga maktabadda\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sidaas u qaadaa hal jidh iyo hal raad kala duwanaansho kasta, oo ku jira dhidibada maktabadda: Z kor u, hore oo u jeeda −Y, iyo barta gelinta oo ku taal dhexda dhabarka hoose. Qorshuhu waa afar-geesle xuddun kasta. Shayga waxa lagu xaddidaa 8 MB, sidaas darteed kala duwanaansho aad culus waxay noqonaysaa sanduuq cabbirkiisa, README-gana wuu sheegaa inta ay tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabaynta firfircoon ee qaybta waxay noqotaa kala duwanaanshaha caadiga ah ee shayga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPorts (barta xiriirka tuubooyinka iyo tuubooyinka hawada) PartCraft kama dejinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-kala-duwanaanshaha-bog-maktabad\"\u003EDhig kala duwanaanshaha bog maktabad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo rar \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt;.item.json\u003C/code\u003E ee goobta at \u003Cstrong\u003EMaktabad › Soo rar\u003C/strong\u003E. Dooro qaybtiisa, shatiga iyo sharraxaada xaqa aad leedahay, ka dibna waxay noqonaysaa shay Maktabad oo leh kala duwanaanshaheeda. BimCraft, marka la dhigo waxay weydiinaysaa kala duwanaansho ee, Is beddel wuxuu soo bandhigaa kuwa kale. Bogga ay obbiyaashu doortaan ikhtiyaarrada, ay ku arkaan 3D-ga oo ay soo dejiyaan kala duwanaansho waa \u003Cstrong\u003Emuuqaal shaqaalaha\u003C/strong\u003E hadda: looma furin dadweynaha weli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sadarka-amarka\"\u003ESadarka amarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enode tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs variants plate.partcraft.json --out-dir plate-variants\nnode tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs variants plate.partcraft.json --only &quot;Small,Large&quot; --formats step,preview --zip plate.zip\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E--only\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu magacaabaa habaynta, \u003Ccode\u003E--formats\u003C/code\u003E waa wax kasta oo ka mid ah \u003Ccode\u003Estep\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edwg\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epreview\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E--no-item\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu ka tagaa shayga maktabadda. Wuxuu qoraa galka, zip-ka ama labadooda, wuuna baxaa 1 marka kala duwanaansho aan la dhisin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/scripts-and-cli\" data-topic=\"partcraft/scripts-and-cli\"\u003EScripts-ka iyo sadarka amarka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Gudbi cabbir kasta oo qayb ah hal mar: hal fayl STEP, IFC iyo DWG iyo sawir habayn kasta, miis oo sheegaysa waxa mid kasta yahay, iyo shay maktabad oo dhigaysa dhammaantood bog hal ah. Waxaad u baahan tahay qayb leh habayn marka hore (eeg Habaynta iyo miisaska naqshadeynta). Habayn kasta oo astaan damisa, sida dhano leh iyo aan lahayn godad, waxay noqonaysaa kala duwanaanshaheeda. Tallaabooyinka Fur qaybta. Tab-ka Halbeegyada, raadi Habayn. Riix Xirmada kala duwanaanshaha…. Calaamadi habaynta la dhisayo (dhammaantood waa la calaamadiyay) iyo faylalka la qorayo: STEP, IFC, DWG, muuqaal, iyo shayga maktabadda. Riix Samee xirmada. Khadka xaaladda wuxuu tirinayaa kala duwanaanshaha markii la dhisayo; qaybtaadu ma beddelmayso. Hal zip ayaa soo dejisa: \u003Cpart\u003E variants.zip. Waxa ku jira zip-ka Fayl Waa maxay \u003Cname\u003E.step Habaynta oo ah jidh STEP ah. \u003Cname\u003E.ifc IFC4, hal walax oo leh jidhka la dhisay iyo halbeegyada qaybta oo ah guryo; qiimaha waa midka habaynta u gaarka ah. \u003Cname\u003E.dwg Muuqaalada hore, sare, midig iyo isometric oo ah xaashi naqshad oo cabbir buuxa. \u003Cname\u003E.svg Sawir khad isometric ah oo ka mid ah. variants.csv, variants.json Miiska halbeegyada: aqoonsiga kala duwanaanshaha, magaciisa iyo qiimaha halbeeg kasta, astaamaha uu damiyo, faylalkiisa, mugga iyo cabbirka. \u003Cpart\u003E.item.json Qaybta oo ah hal shay maktabad oo leh kala duwanaanshaheeda (eeg hoosta). README.txt Waxa la sameeyay, xusuusta hoose, iyo wax kasta oo aan la dhisin. Faylalka magacooda waxaa lagu magacaabaa habaynta. Habayn aan la dhisi karin (astaan aan lagu samayn karin qiimahaas) waa laga tagaa faylalka iyo miiska, waxaana lagu taxay README-ga iyo fariin kadib markii zip-ka la kaydiyo; kuwa kale ayaa weli la qoraa. Waa in la ogaadaa STEP waa saxda marka exact kernel-ka uu ku shaqeeyo dhismahaaga. Haddii kale STEP-ku waa fasedyo (saddex-geesle fidsan), README-gana wuu sheegaa. DWG waa xaashi naqshad, ma aha moodel 3D. Khadadkiisu waxay ka imanayaan mesh-ka, sidaas darteed geesta khamiiska ah waa khado gaagaaban oo badan. Shayga maktabadda wuxuu sidaas u qaadaa hal jidh iyo hal raad kala duwanaansho kasta, oo ku jira dhidibada maktabadda: Z kor u, hore oo u jeeda −Y, iyo barta gelinta oo ku taal dhexda dhabarka hoose. Qorshuhu waa afar-geesle xuddun kasta. Shayga waxa lagu xaddidaa 8 MB, sidaas darteed kala duwanaansho aad culus waxay noqonaysaa sanduuq cabbirkiisa, README-gana wuu sheegaa inta ay tahay. Habaynta firfircoon ee qaybta waxay noqotaa kala duwanaanshaha caadiga ah ee shayga. Ports (barta xiriirka tuubooyinka iyo tuubooyinka hawada) PartCraft kama dejinayo. Dhig kala duwanaanshaha bog maktabad Soo rar \u003Cpart\u003E.item.json ee goobta at Maktabad › Soo rar. Dooro qaybtiisa, shatiga iyo sharraxaada xaqa aad leedahay, ka dibna waxay noqonaysaa shay Maktabad oo leh kala duwanaanshaheeda. BimCraft, marka la dhigo waxay weydiinaysaa kala duwanaansho ee, Is beddel wuxuu soo bandhigaa kuwa kale. Bogga ay obbiyaashu doortaan ikhtiyaarrada, ay ku arkaan 3D-ga oo ay soo dejiyaan kala duwanaansho waa muuqaal shaqaalaha hadda: looma furin dadweynaha weli. Sadarka amarka node tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs variants plate.partcraft.json --out-dir plate-variants node tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs variants plate.partcraft.json --only \"Small,Large\" --formats step,preview --zip plate.zip --only wuxuu magacaabaa habaynta, --formats waa wax kasta oo ka mid ah step, ifc, dwg, preview, --no-item wuxuu ka tagaa shayga maktabadda. Wuxuu qoraa galka, zip-ka ama labadooda, wuuna baxaa 1 marka kala duwanaansho aan la dhisin. Eeg Scripts-ka iyo sadarka amarka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"nodes","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qanjidhada: dhis moodeel adigoo isku xidha","summary":"Isku xir lambarada qodob, qodobyada qalooc, qaloocyada dusha. Haddii aad lambarka beddasho, wax walba oo ka hooseeya dib ayay u dhisaan. Qanjidh walba waa sidoo kale xariiq CraftScript, jaantuskana faylka ayaa lagu kaydiyaa.","section":"tasks","order":108,"keywords":["qanjidhada","tafatiraha qanjidhada","habaynta muuqaalka","parametric","jaantus","silig","dhibcaha xidhiidhka","bilaa-qaab","nurbs","loft","extrude","revolve","goobo","qalooc","dusha","taxane","kala duwan","random","liis","script","craftscript","grasshopper"],"headings":[{"id":"isku-xidhka","text":"Isku xidhka","level":2},{"id":"noocyada-iyo-unitiyada","text":"Noocyada iyo unitiyada","level":2},{"id":"jidhka-adag-iyo-boolean-yada-qanjidh-ahaan","text":"Jidhka adag iyo Boolean-yada qanjidh ahaan","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad","text":"Khaladaad","level":2},{"id":"qanjidh-walba-waa-xariiq-script","text":"Qanjidh walba waa xariiq script","level":2},{"id":"lagu-kaydiyo-faylka","text":"Lagu kaydiyo faylka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETafatiraha \u003Cstrong\u003EQanjidhada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dhisaa joometriga isagoo isku xidhaya sanduuqyada. Sanduuq kastaa (qanjidh) shaqo yar oo keliya ayuu qabanayaa: samee lambar, qodob, goobo, loft. Natiijada mid waxaad ku xidhaysaa geliska mid kale, moodelkuna wuu raacayaa markaad lambar bilowga ah beddelato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKa fur liiska workspace-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQanjidhada\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay furaysaa daaqadda tafatirka. Qayb horey u leh jaantus ayaa muujinaysa markaad workspace-ka furto. Waa daaqad ku dul taal muuqaalka 3D: jiid cinwaankeeda si aad u dhaqaajiso, jiid geeskeeda si aad u cabbirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-xidhka\"\u003EIsku xidhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qanjidh liiska bidix (ku qor sanduuqa raadinta si aad u yareyso; &lt;kbd&gt;Enter&lt;/kbd&gt; wuxuu ku daraa kii ugu horreeyay ee la helo). Waxay ka soo muuqataa badhka canvas-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid dhibcaha wareegga ah ee \u003Cstrong\u003Eoutput\u003C/strong\u003E ee midig qanjidh kasta ilaa dhibcaha wareegga ah ee \u003Cstrong\u003Einput\u003C/strong\u003E ee bidix qanjidh kale. Dhibcuhu wuu cagaarayaa marka uu ku habboon yahay, wuuna casaysanayaa marka uusan ku habboonayn; kor ugu sii mouse-ka si aad sababta u aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeli oo aan wax lagu xidhin waxay muujinaysaa sanduuq qiime qoran. Qor lambar oo riix &lt;kbd&gt;Tab&lt;/kbd&gt;: natiijadu dib ayay u dhisantaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoobada yar ee cinwaanka qanjidh kasta waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eindhaheeda\u003C/strong\u003E. Qanjidh indhuhu furan yahay ayaa lagu sawiraa muuqaalka 3D, sida khadad qalooc, dusha oo midab lagu buuxiyay, dhibcaha qodobyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQanjidh jiid cinwaankiisa. Jiid asalka si aad u wareejiso, lafo-leexi curiyaha si aad u weyneyso. &lt;kbd&gt;Delete&lt;/kbd&gt; wuxuu tirtiraa qanjidha la doortay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qanjidhada u habeeyaa tiirar, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhammaantood ku keenaa muuqa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/span\u003E waxay kuu dhex maraan wax ka beddelkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"noocyada-iyo-unitiyada\"\u003ENoocyada iyo unitiyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibcaha xidhiidhku noocyo leeyihiin: lambar, haa/maya, bar, vector, qalooc, dusha, mesh, jidh adag, ama &quot;geometry&quot; oo ah mid kasta oo ka mid ah. Bar waxay quudin kartaa geli vector ah, iyo dib. Lambarku unit buu leeyahay: \u003Cstrong\u003Edherer\u003C/strong\u003E waa millimitir, \u003Cstrong\u003Exagal\u003C/strong\u003E waa degree. Dherer ma quudin karo xagal, dherer x dherer (bed) waa la diidaa, sidaas darteed silig khaldan waa la joojinayaa markaad samayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhibic laba geesood ah waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eliis\u003C/strong\u003E. Marka liis gaadho geli qiime keli ah, qanjidhku wuxuu shaqeeyaa mar kasta shay kasta, natiijadiisuna waxay noqotaa liis. Liiska yar wuxuu ku celiyaa shayntiisa ugu dambeysa. Tusaale ahaan, \u003Cstrong\u003ETaxane\u003C/strong\u003E oo joogarrada ah oo lagu geliyo \u003Cstrong\u003EGuuri\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa taxane nuqullo ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidhka-adag-iyo-boolean-yada-qanjidh-ahaan\"\u003EJidhka adag iyo Boolean-yada qanjidh ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka adag\u003C/strong\u003E waxay sameysaa jidh xidhan oo ka yimid isla dusha saxda ah ee panel-ka Dusha: \u003Cstrong\u003EBox solid\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ECylinder solid\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESphere solid\u003C/strong\u003E (cabbirka mm), \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku geyn\u003C/strong\u003E (Union), \u003Cstrong\u003EKa jar\u003C/strong\u003E (Subtract) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku goys\u003C/strong\u003E (Intersect) (jidhka labaad waxaa laga qaadaa kan koowaad; dulqaadku waa inta ay saddexagalada engine-ka jidh adag ka durbaan dusha saxda ah), \u003Cstrong\u003EFillet between faces\u003C/strong\u003E (wejiyada iyada oo lambarkooda ku jira jidhka, 1 kan koowaad; radius, iyo sare 0 ka, radius dhamaadka), \u003Cstrong\u003ESolid volume\u003C/strong\u003E (mm³) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESolid to mesh\u003C/strong\u003E (si loo arko ama loo dubo). Jidh adag noocyo xidhiidh oo gaar ah ayuu leeyahay: bar ama lambar lama xidhi karo geli jidh adag, dhibicna waxay caatoonaysaa. Qanjidhada Boolean iyo Fillet waxay isticmaalaan engine-ka jidh adag ee barnaamijka, kaas oo la soo rarayo marka tafatiraha markii ugu horreysay la furo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad\"\u003EKhaladaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQanjidh aan shaqadiisa qaban karin wuxuu sheegaa sababta cinwaankiisa hoosteeda, midab casaan ah (&quot;Radius-ku waa inuu ka weyn yahay eber.&quot;), qanjidhadii ka dambeeyayna way sugaan. Isla fariintaas waxay ahaan doontaa \u003Cstrong\u003EDhibaato\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku jirta gobolka Dhibaatooyinka (Problems), sidaas darteed halkaas ayaad ka heli kartaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qanjidh-walba-waa-xariiq-script\"\u003EQanjidh walba waa xariiq script\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScript\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto jaantuska CraftScript ahaan: hal xariiq qanjidh kasta, sida \u003Ccode\u003En3 = nd_circle(n2, n1, [0 0 1]);\u003C/code\u003E. Qoraalka wax ka beddel oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa samee jaantuska qoraalkan\u003C/span\u003E si aad jaantuska dib ugu soo celiso. Shaqooyinka \u003Ccode\u003End_\u003C/code\u003E isla markaa waxay ku shaqeeyaan CraftScript ku jira PartCraft, sidaas darteed jaantuska halkaas ayaa la socodsiin karaa, la wareegi karaa ama la tijaabin karaa. Tirooyinka random-ka had iyo jeer waxay qaadaan \u003Cstrong\u003Eseed\u003C/strong\u003E, sidaas darteed isla jaantuska wuxuu siinayaa isla natiijada kombuutar kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lagu-kaydiyo-faylka\"\u003ELagu kaydiyo faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJaantuska waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta (ma aha taariikhda, sidaas darteed Ka noqo ee tafatiraha waa mid u gaar ah). Qanjidhadu waxay sameeyaan qaloocyo, dusha iyo mesh oo ag jidh adag ah: ma beddelayaan astaamaha qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tafatiraha Qanjidhada wuxuu dhisaa joometriga isagoo isku xidhaya sanduuqyada. Sanduuq kastaa (qanjidh) shaqo yar oo keliya ayuu qabanayaa: samee lambar, qodob, goobo, loft. Natiijada mid waxaad ku xidhaysaa geliska mid kale, moodelkuna wuu raacayaa markaad lambar bilowga ah beddelato. Ka fur liiska workspace-ka: Qanjidhada. Waxay furaysaa daaqadda tafatirka. Qayb horey u leh jaantus ayaa muujinaysa markaad workspace-ka furto. Waa daaqad ku dul taal muuqaalka 3D: jiid cinwaankeeda si aad u dhaqaajiso, jiid geeskeeda si aad u cabbirto. Isku xidhka Dooro qanjidh liiska bidix (ku qor sanduuqa raadinta si aad u yareyso; \u003Ckbd\u003EEnter\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ku daraa kii ugu horreeyay ee la helo). Waxay ka soo muuqataa badhka canvas-ka. Jiid dhibcaha wareegga ah ee output ee midig qanjidh kasta ilaa dhibcaha wareegga ah ee input ee bidix qanjidh kale. Dhibcuhu wuu cagaarayaa marka uu ku habboon yahay, wuuna casaysanayaa marka uusan ku habboonayn; kor ugu sii mouse-ka si aad sababta u aragto. Geli oo aan wax lagu xidhin waxay muujinaysaa sanduuq qiime qoran. Qor lambar oo riix \u003Ckbd\u003ETab\u003C/kbd\u003E: natiijadu dib ayay u dhisantaa. Goobada yar ee cinwaanka qanjidh kasta waa indhaheeda. Qanjidh indhuhu furan yahay ayaa lagu sawiraa muuqaalka 3D, sida khadad qalooc, dusha oo midab lagu buuxiyay, dhibcaha qodobyada. Qanjidh jiid cinwaankiisa. Jiid asalka si aad u wareejiso, lafo-leexi curiyaha si aad u weyneyso. \u003Ckbd\u003EDelete\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa qanjidha la doortay. Nadiifi wuxuu qanjidhada u habeeyaa tiirar, Ku habee wuxuu dhammaantood ku keenaa muuqa, Ka noqo iyo Samee mar kale waxay kuu dhex maraan wax ka beddelkaaga. Noocyada iyo unitiyada Dhibcaha xidhiidhku noocyo leeyihiin: lambar, haa/maya, bar, vector, qalooc, dusha, mesh, jidh adag, ama \"geometry\" oo ah mid kasta oo ka mid ah. Bar waxay quudin kartaa geli vector ah, iyo dib. Lambarku unit buu leeyahay: dherer waa millimitir, xagal waa degree. Dherer ma quudin karo xagal, dherer x dherer (bed) waa la diidaa, sidaas darteed silig khaldan waa la joojinayaa markaad samayso. Dhibic laba geesood ah waa liis. Marka liis gaadho geli qiime keli ah, qanjidhku wuxuu shaqeeyaa mar kasta shay kasta, natiijadiisuna waxay noqotaa liis. Liiska yar wuxuu ku celiyaa shayntiisa ugu dambeysa. Tusaale ahaan, Taxane oo joogarrada ah oo lagu geliyo Guuri wuxuu sameeyaa taxane nuqullo ah. Jidhka adag iyo Boolean-yada qanjidh ahaan Kooxda Jidhka adag waxay sameysaa jidh xidhan oo ka yimid isla dusha saxda ah ee panel-ka Dusha: Box solid, Cylinder solid iyo Sphere solid (cabbirka mm), Isku geyn (Union), Ka jar (Subtract) iyo Isku goys (Intersect) (jidhka labaad waxaa laga qaadaa kan koowaad; dulqaadku waa inta ay saddexagalada engine-ka jidh adag ka durbaan dusha saxda ah), Fillet between faces (wejiyada iyada oo lambarkooda ku jira jidhka, 1 kan koowaad; radius, iyo sare 0 ka, radius dhamaadka), Solid volume (mm³) iyo Solid to mesh (si loo arko ama loo dubo). Jidh adag noocyo xidhiidh oo gaar ah ayuu leeyahay: bar ama lambar lama xidhi karo geli jidh adag, dhibicna waxay caatoonaysaa. Qanjidhada Boolean iyo Fillet waxay isticmaalaan engine-ka jidh adag ee barnaamijka, kaas oo la soo rarayo marka tafatiraha markii ugu horreysay la furo. Khaladaad Qanjidh aan shaqadiisa qaban karin wuxuu sheegaa sababta cinwaankiisa hoosteeda, midab casaan ah (\"Radius-ku waa inuu ka weyn yahay eber.\"), qanjidhadii ka dambeeyayna way sugaan. Isla fariintaas waxay ahaan doontaa Dhibaato oo ku jirta gobolka Dhibaatooyinka (Problems), sidaas darteed halkaas ayaad ka heli kartaa. Qanjidh walba waa xariiq script Riix Script si aad u aragto jaantuska CraftScript ahaan: hal xariiq qanjidh kasta, sida n3 = nd_circle(n2, n1, [0 0 1]);. Qoraalka wax ka beddel oo riix Ka samee jaantuska qoraalkan si aad jaantuska dib ugu soo celiso. Shaqooyinka nd_ isla markaa waxay ku shaqeeyaan CraftScript ku jira PartCraft, sidaas darteed jaantuska halkaas ayaa la socodsiin karaa, la wareegi karaa ama la tijaabin karaa. Tirooyinka random-ka had iyo jeer waxay qaadaan seed, sidaas darteed isla jaantuska wuxuu siinayaa isla natiijada kombuutar kasta. Lagu kaydiyo faylka Jaantuska waxa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta (ma aha taariikhda, sidaas darteed Ka noqo ee tafatiraha waa mid u gaar ah). Qanjidhadu waxay sameeyaan qaloocyo, dusha iyo mesh oo ag jidh adag ah: ma beddelayaan astaamaha qaybta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"build-assembly","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dhis isku-dhis oo leh joint-yo","summary":"Bilow isku-dhis qayb ka bilaabaneysa, geli nuqullo iyo faylal qayb kale, ku xir rigid, revolute, slider, cylindrical, planar, ball iyo pin-in-slot joint-yo wejiyada siman, joint-yada dhidibbada dhexe ku dhig, tafatir qayb meeshay, oo kaydi isku-dhiska.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["isku-dhis","mate","mates","joint","loop","closed loop","linkage","four-bar","mechanism","rigid","revolute","slider","cylindrical","planar","ball","ball joint","spherical","pin slot","pin in slot","insert component","grounded","fixed","concentric","coincident","edit part","in context","partcraft-asm"],"headings":[{"id":"bilow-isku-dhis","text":"Bilow isku-dhis","level":2},{"id":"geli-qaybaha","text":"Geli qaybaha","level":2},{"id":"ku-xir-laba-qayb","text":"Ku xir laba qayb","level":2},{"id":"dejinta-joint-ka","text":"Dejinta joint-ka","level":3},{"id":"tusaale-laba-flange-oo-wejig-ilaa-wejig-ku-xidhan","text":"Tusaale: laba flange oo wejig ilaa wejig ku xidhan","level":3},{"id":"silsilado-xidhan-linkages","text":"Silsilado xidhan: linkages","level":2},{"id":"shaqaynta-qaybaha","text":"Shaqaynta qaybaha","level":2},{"id":"tafatir-qayb-meeshay","text":"Tafatir qayb meeshay","level":3},{"id":"ka-noqo-kaydi-iyo-xir","text":"Ka noqo, kaydi iyo xir","level":2},{"id":"isku-dhisyada-waaweyn","text":"Isku-dhisyada waaweyn","level":2},{"id":"dhibaatooyinka-joint-ka","text":"Dhibaatooyinka joint-ka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhis wuxuu isku geeyaa qaybaha. PartCraft gudihiisa, \u003Cstrong\u003Ejoint-yada\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa qaybaha dhigaa: joint kasta wuxuu ku yaal wejiga siman ee laba qaybood kasta, oo wuxuu saarayaa midba midka kale wejiga ka soo horjeeda. Joint revolute wuxuu u ogolaanayaa qayb inay wareegto, slider-ku wuxuu u ogolaanayaa inay siibto, joint rigid-ku wuu hayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilow-isku-dhis\"\u003EBilow isku-dhis\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhis qayb leh jidh (qayb madhan ma gali karto isku-dhis: &quot;Marka hore dhis jidh, kadibna geli isku-dhiska.&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhis\u003C/span\u003E qalabka qalabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFarriinta xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa &quot;Isku-dhis waa la bilaabay, Part1 waa qaybta aasaasan. Geli qaybo dheeraad ah (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar nuqul\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabid\u003C/span\u003E), kadibna ku xir joint-yada.&quot; Bidixda panel-ku hadda wuxuu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EJoint-yada\u003C/strong\u003E, qalabka qalabka ayaa muujinaya qalabka isku-dhiska. Qalabka sawir-gacmeedka iyo astaamaha way qarsoomaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta koowaad waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eaasaasan\u003C/strong\u003E: weligeed ma dhaqaaqdo, waxa kale oo dhan waxaa loo meel dhigaa iyada ku saleysan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"geli-qaybaha\"\u003EGeli qaybaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar nuqul\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geliyaa nuqul kale oo qaybta la doortay (ama qaybtii ugu dambaysay). Nuqullada qayb wadaagaan: tafatir mid oo dhammaan nuqullada way isbedelaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabid\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ee kooxda Wax ka beddel wuxuu sameeyaa sidaas qaybta la doortay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay nuqulaan qayb oo waxay ku dhajiyaan dhinaca kuwa kale, isku-dhiskan ama mid kale; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ku dhajiyaa meeshii isla. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"partcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EKoobiyee, dhaji iyo laabid\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu geliyaa qayb faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E kumbuyuutarkaaga. Qaybta waa la koobiyeeyaa isku-dhiska dhexdiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha cusub waxay ka soo muuqdaan 20 mm midig kuwa hore oo dhan, waxayna halkaas joogi doonaan ilaa joint ku meel dhigo. Qayb aan joint lahayn waxaa gacanta lagu dhaqaajin karaa: qiimayaal la qoray ama fallaadho aad jiidato (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\" data-topic=\"partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\"\u003ELiiska qaybaha, muuqaalada kala fureysan iyo qaybaha la dhaqdhaqaajiyo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-xir-laba-qayb\"\u003EKu xir laba qayb\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoint\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"J\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Panel-ka midig wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EJoint cusub\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wejig siman oo qaybta koowaad. Wuu iftiimaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wejig siman oo qaybta labaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta labaad way boodaysaa si wejigeedu ugu jiifo wejiga qaybta koowaad, oo uu u eego. Joint-ka wuxuu ka soo muuqdaa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EJoint-yada\u003C/strong\u003E, tusaale ahaan &quot;Revolute1&quot;, panel-ka midigna wuxuu muujinayaa dejimahiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii labada wejiba ay ka sameysan yihiin revolve, joint-ku wuxuu ku bilaabmaa \u003Cstrong\u003Erevolute\u003C/strong\u003E; haddii kale \u003Cstrong\u003Erigid\u003C/strong\u003E. Kadib beddel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWejiyada wareegsan lama dooran karo: &quot;Wejigaasi wareegsan yahay. Dooro wejig siman (si aad ugu wareegto god ama dhidibka revolve, dooro joint-ka kadib).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu joojiyaa joint aad bilowday (ama guji qayb liiska bidix).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"dejinta-joint-ka\"\u003EDejinta joint-ka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameysa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENooca\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMid ka mid ah joint-yada shaxda hoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXagal (°)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu qaybta labaad ku wareejiyaa dhidibka joint-ka (xagal toos ah wejiyada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala-bixid (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu qaybta labaad ku siibaa dhidibka, ka fogeeya wejiga (qiyamka taban wuxuu ku riixaa gudaha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac X\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EDhinac Y\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjee X\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJanjee Y\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQolka dhinaca\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EJihada qolka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyamada kale, oo muuqda joint-yada isticmaala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda ku\u003C/strong\u003E (labada dhinac kasta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeesha dhidibka joint-ka ku gudbaa wejiga: &quot;Asalka wejiga&quot;, dhidibka revolve (&quot;Dhidibka Revolve1&quot;) ama dhidibka hal god (&quot;Hole1, god 2&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiime kasta oo joint-ku oggol yahay inuu dhaqaajo waxaa hoosteeda ah slider-ka jiidista; kuwa kale mar ayaa la dejiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJoint\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa dhaqaajiya\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMar mid la dejiyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERigid\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal, Kala-bixid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERevolute\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal (albaab)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKala-bixid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESlider\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKala-bixid (fiyoog)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECylindrical\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal iyo kala-bixid (shaft ku jira dhaqaaq fudud)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPlanar\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinac X, Dhinac Y dhinaca wejiga, iyo Xagal (qayb ku siibta miis)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBall\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal (wareegid) iyo Janjee X iyo Y, dhexda joint-ka (ball joint)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPin in slot\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQolka dhinaca iyo Xagal (pin qolof toosan ku jira)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJihada qolka: xagasha qolka ee X wejiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EX iyo Y ee wejiga waa kuwii qaybta koowaad; dhexda joint-ka waxaa dejinaya \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda ku\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Asalka wejiga&quot; waa asalka qaybta oo lagu soo saaray wejiga, taas oo inta badan aan ahayn meesha aad rabto inay qaybuhu isku qaadaan. Qaybaha wareegsan iyo pin-ka, ku dhig \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda ku\u003C/strong\u003E dhidibka revolve ama god-ka labada dhinac: dhidibyadu markaas waa isku khad, sida concentric mate.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tusaale-laba-flange-oo-wejig-ilaa-wejig-ku-xidhan\"\u003ETusaale: laba flange oo wejig ilaa wejig ku xidhan\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur qaybta flange (revolve oo leh qaab wareeg oo godad ah) oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhis\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar nuqul\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"J\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, guji wejiga siman ee diskka flange-ka koowaad (wejigii godadka boolka ka bilaabma), kadibna isla wejiga flange-ka labaad. Wejigii waxaa sameeyay revolve, sidaas darteed joint-ku waa revolute.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda ku\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Dhidibka Revolve1&quot; labada dhinac. Flange-yadu hadda dhidib isku wadaagaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Ccode\u003E22.5\u003C/code\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EXagal (°)\u003C/strong\u003E si aad godadka boolka isugu geeyso, ama jiid slider-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"silsilado-xidhan-linkages\"\u003ESilsilado xidhan: linkages\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybaha lagu xiro giraan (linkage afar-bar, crank iyo slider, qaab labada dhinac lagu xidho) waxay sameeyaan \u003Cstrong\u003Eloop\u003C/strong\u003E. PartCraft wuu xalliyaa loop kasta si uu u xirmo: joint-yada ku jira waxay qaataan qiyamada giraanta isku xira, iyagoo ugu yar dhaqaajiya meesha ay ka bilaabeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDejin ama jiid\u003C/strong\u003E qiime joint kasta oo loop ku jira, qaybta kale ayaa raacaysa. Linkage afar-bar ah, jiid \u003Cstrong\u003EXagal\u003C/strong\u003E crank-ka, coupler iyo rocker ayaa la socdaa. Qiimaha aad dejisay waa la hayaa; kuwa kale waxaa laga xisaabiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiiska, joint loop ah oo wali dhaqaajin karo waa \u003Cstrong\u003Ebuluug\u003C/strong\u003E: qiime kale weli waa la dejin karaa. Loop aan dhaqaajin karin (frame la xidhay) wuu madow ahaan. Loop aan xirmi karin waa \u003Cstrong\u003Ecasaan\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003ELoops\u003C/strong\u003E: intee ka xiran tahay iyo intee qiyam ah ayaa weli dhaqaajin karta, tusaale ahaan &quot;1 xiran; 1 qiime weli dhaqaajin karta&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi dhaqdhaqaaqa isku-dhacyada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu joint loop ah ka sii dhaadhicinayaa loop-ka oo raacaya, tallaabo tallaabo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/check-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/check-assembly\"\u003EHubi isku-dhiska isku-dhacyada iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELinkage toosan oo laga sameeyay xaashi toosan waa inay isku mid noqdaan qoto dheer: laba qayb oo wejig ilaa wejig ku xidhan labada dhinac giraan ah waxay u baahan yihiin isku heer qotoda labada jihoodba. Isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EKala-bixid\u003C/strong\u003E joint-ka si aad qayb u kor u qaaddo meesha xaashida aan isku darin, ama loop-ku ma xirmi karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaqaynta-qaybaha\"\u003EShaqaynta qaybaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji qayb muuqaalka ama liiska si aad u doorato. Panel-ka midig wuxuu muujinayaa magaca qaybta, intee nuqul oo ay jiraan, mugga, joint-yadeeda, iyo haddii ay aasaasan tahay, ama joint-yada ayaa dejiyay, ama &quot;Lama xidhin: wuxuu ku sii jiraa meesha la geliyay&quot;. Badhamada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel qaybtan\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel qayb\u003C/span\u003E qalabka qalabka, ama laba jeer guji qaybta liiska): wuxuu furaa qaybta si loo tafatiro;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli nuqul\u003C/span\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig qaybta aasaasan\u003C/span\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu sidoo kale tirtiraa joint-yadeeda, kadib weydiinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhisku waa inuu hayaa ugu yaraan hal qayb: &quot;Isku-dhisku wuxuu hayaa ugu yaraan hal qayb. Taas beddelkeeda xidh.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tafatir-qayb-meeshay\"\u003ETafatir qayb meeshay\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qayb oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel qayb\u003C/span\u003E. Qaybtu waxay ka furmaysaa taariikhdeeda; cinwaanka wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Bracket (isku-dhiska Bracket)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu beddel sida qayb kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib\u003C/span\u003E qalabka qalabka. Isku-dhisku waa cusboonaadaa: nuqul kasta oo qaybtaas wuu isbedelaa, joint-yada ku xiran wejiyada laga sameeyay geesaha sawirka way raacaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESoo celinta isbeddelka waa hal tallaabo liiska ka noqoshada isku-dhiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-noqo-kaydi-iyo-xir\"\u003EKa noqo, kaydi iyo xir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-dhiskan wuxuu leeyahay liis ka noqosho gaar ah: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay shaqeeyaan joint-yada, gelinta iyo dejimaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;magaca isku-dhiska&gt;.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E, oo leh qaybaha oo dhan gudaheeda. Mar dambe fur adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu xiraa isku-dhiska oo wuxuu kuu soo celinayaa qaybtii aad ka bilowday. Haddii isku-dhisku aan la kaydin, wuu weydiinayaa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIska tir isku-dhiska\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarka hore kaydi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u magacowdo isku-dhiska, guji meel bannaan si wax aan la dooran, oo beddel \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E panel-ka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-dhisyada-waaweyn\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada waaweyn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhis wuxuu hayn karaa kumanaan nuqullo ah oo qayb yar. Nuqullada hal qayb waa la isku keeneeyaa, joint aad wareejiso wuxuu kaliya meeshiisa ku dhigaa qaybaha ka dambeeya, liiska qaybaha ayaa muujinaya safafkiisa ugu horeeya badhan &quot;Muuji wax dheeraad ah&quot; hoosteeda (qaybta la doortay mar walba way ku jirtaa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkaad wareejiso ama aad weyneyso muuqaalka, isku-dhis ka badan ~300,000 saddex-geesood waxaa lagu muujiyaa sanduuq qayb kasta, kadibna oo dhan markii aad joogsato saamayn yar kadib.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalada\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal fudud\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ilaaliyaa sanduuqyada mar walba. Dooritaanka qayb iyo joint-yada weli waxay isticmaalaan qaybaha dhabta ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXawaaraha wareegidda wuxuu sidoo kale ku xidhan yahay kaarka muuqaalka kumbuyuutarkaaga. Tirooyinka PartCraft-ku cabbiray waxay ku jiraan release notes oo leh kumbuyuutarka ay ka soo jeedaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibaatooyinka-joint-ka\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka joint-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayb aan joint gaadhin ayaa liiska lagu muujiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Ebilaa\u003C/strong\u003E (free) panel-kuna wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Bracket2 lama xidhin qaybta aasaasan, sidaas darteed wuxuu ku sii jiraa meesha la geliyay.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELoop aan xirmi karin (dhererka ma gaadhayo, xad ayaa joogsanaya joint, wejiyada qotoda kuma heshiin): &quot;Revolute3 wuxuu xirayaa loop aan xirmi karin: wuxuu ka baxsan yahay 2.000 mm. Hubi wejiyada, kala-bixidda iyo xadadka joint-yada loop-ka.&quot; Joint-yadiisa waxay casaan noqdaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii wejig ama dhidib uu joint-ku isticmaalo uu baabbi&#039;ay kadib tafatirka qayb: &quot;Wejigan joint-ka isticmaalaa ayaa ka maqan Bracket.&quot; Ka saar joint-ka oo mar kale samee.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiga: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/check-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/check-assembly\"\u003EHubi isku-dhiska isku-dhacyada iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isku-dhis wuxuu isku geeyaa qaybaha. PartCraft gudihiisa, joint-yada ayaa qaybaha dhigaa: joint kasta wuxuu ku yaal wejiga siman ee laba qaybood kasta, oo wuxuu saarayaa midba midka kale wejiga ka soo horjeeda. Joint revolute wuxuu u ogolaanayaa qayb inay wareegto, slider-ku wuxuu u ogolaanayaa inay siibto, joint rigid-ku wuu hayaa. Bilow isku-dhis Dhis qayb leh jidh (qayb madhan ma gali karto isku-dhis: \"Marka hore dhis jidh, kadibna geli isku-dhiska.\"). Dooro Isku-dhis qalabka qalabka. Farriinta xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa \"Isku-dhis waa la bilaabay, Part1 waa qaybta aasaasan. Geli qaybo dheeraad ah (Ku dar nuqul, Geli ama Laabid), kadibna ku xir joint-yada.\" Bidixda panel-ku hadda wuxuu liistaa Qaybaha iyo Joint-yada, qalabka qalabka ayaa muujinaya qalabka isku-dhiska. Qalabka sawir-gacmeedka iyo astaamaha way qarsoomaan. Qaybta koowaad waa aasaasan: weligeed ma dhaqaaqdo, waxa kale oo dhan waxaa loo meel dhigaa iyada ku saleysan. Geli qaybaha Ku dar nuqul wuxuu geliyaa nuqul kale oo qaybta la doortay (ama qaybtii ugu dambaysay). Nuqullada qayb wadaagaan: tafatir mid oo dhammaan nuqullada way isbedelaan. Laabid (Ctrl+D) ee kooxda Wax ka beddel wuxuu sameeyaa sidaas qaybta la doortay. Ctrl+C iyo Ctrl+V waxay nuqulaan qayb oo waxay ku dhajiyaan dhinaca kuwa kale, isku-dhiskan ama mid kale; Ctrl+Shift+V wuxuu ku dhajiyaa meeshii isla. Eeg Koobiyee, dhaji iyo laabid. Geli wuxuu geliyaa qayb faylka .partcraft.json kumbuyuutarkaaga. Qaybta waa la koobiyeeyaa isku-dhiska dhexdiisa. Qaybaha cusub waxay ka soo muuqdaan 20 mm midig kuwa hore oo dhan, waxayna halkaas joogi doonaan ilaa joint ku meel dhigo. Qayb aan joint lahayn waxaa gacanta lagu dhaqaajin karaa: qiimayaal la qoray ama fallaadho aad jiidato (eeg Liiska qaybaha, muuqaalada kala fureysan iyo qaybaha la dhaqdhaqaajiyo). Ku xir laba qayb Dooro Joint ama riix J. Panel-ka midig wuxuu leeyahay Joint cusub. Guji wejig siman oo qaybta koowaad. Wuu iftiimaa. Guji wejig siman oo qaybta labaad. Qaybta labaad way boodaysaa si wejigeedu ugu jiifo wejiga qaybta koowaad, oo uu u eego. Joint-ka wuxuu ka soo muuqdaa hoosta Joint-yada, tusaale ahaan \"Revolute1\", panel-ka midigna wuxuu muujinayaa dejimahiisa. Haddii labada wejiba ay ka sameysan yihiin revolve, joint-ku wuxuu ku bilaabmaa revolute; haddii kale rigid. Kadib beddel. Wejiyada wareegsan lama dooran karo: \"Wejigaasi wareegsan yahay. Dooro wejig siman (si aad ugu wareegto god ama dhidibka revolve, dooro joint-ka kadib).\" Esc wuxuu joojiyaa joint aad bilowday (ama guji qayb liiska bidix). Dejinta joint-ka Dejinta Waxa ay sameysa Nooca Mid ka mid ah joint-yada shaxda hoose Xagal (°) Wuxuu qaybta labaad ku wareejiyaa dhidibka joint-ka (xagal toos ah wejiyada) Kala-bixid (mm) Wuxuu qaybta labaad ku siibaa dhidibka, ka fogeeya wejiga (qiyamka taban wuxuu ku riixaa gudaha) Dhinac X, Dhinac Y, Janjee X, Janjee Y, Qolka dhinaca, Jihada qolka Qiyamada kale, oo muuqda joint-yada isticmaala Dhexda ku (labada dhinac kasta) Meesha dhidibka joint-ka ku gudbaa wejiga: \"Asalka wejiga\", dhidibka revolve (\"Dhidibka Revolve1\") ama dhidibka hal god (\"Hole1, god 2\") Qiime kasta oo joint-ku oggol yahay inuu dhaqaajo waxaa hoosteeda ah slider-ka jiidista; kuwa kale mar ayaa la dejiyaa. Joint Waxa dhaqaajiya Mar mid la dejiyo Rigid Waxba Xagal, Kala-bixid Revolute Xagal (albaab) Kala-bixid Slider Kala-bixid (fiyoog) Xagal Cylindrical Xagal iyo kala-bixid (shaft ku jira dhaqaaq fudud) Planar Dhinac X, Dhinac Y dhinaca wejiga, iyo Xagal (qayb ku siibta miis) Ball Xagal (wareegid) iyo Janjee X iyo Y, dhexda joint-ka (ball joint) Pin in slot Qolka dhinaca iyo Xagal (pin qolof toosan ku jira) Jihada qolka: xagasha qolka ee X wejiga X iyo Y ee wejiga waa kuwii qaybta koowaad; dhexda joint-ka waxaa dejinaya Dhexda ku. \"Asalka wejiga\" waa asalka qaybta oo lagu soo saaray wejiga, taas oo inta badan aan ahayn meesha aad rabto inay qaybuhu isku qaadaan. Qaybaha wareegsan iyo pin-ka, ku dhig Dhexda ku dhidibka revolve ama god-ka labada dhinac: dhidibyadu markaas waa isku khad, sida concentric mate. Tusaale: laba flange oo wejig ilaa wejig ku xidhan Fur qaybta flange (revolve oo leh qaab wareeg oo godad ah) oo dooro Isku-dhis. Dooro Ku dar nuqul. Riix J, guji wejiga siman ee diskka flange-ka koowaad (wejigii godadka boolka ka bilaabma), kadibna isla wejiga flange-ka labaad. Wejigii waxaa sameeyay revolve, sidaas darteed joint-ku waa revolute. Deji Dhexda ku \"Dhidibka Revolve1\" labada dhinac. Flange-yadu hadda dhidib isku wadaagaan. Qor 22.5 Xagal (°) si aad godadka boolka isugu geeyso, ama jiid slider-ka. Silsilado xidhan: linkages Qaybaha lagu xiro giraan (linkage afar-bar, crank iyo slider, qaab labada dhinac lagu xidho) waxay sameeyaan loop. PartCraft wuu xalliyaa loop kasta si uu u xirmo: joint-yada ku jira waxay qaataan qiyamada giraanta isku xira, iyagoo ugu yar dhaqaajiya meesha ay ka bilaabeen. Dejin ama jiid qiime joint kasta oo loop ku jira, qaybta kale ayaa raacaysa. Linkage afar-bar ah, jiid Xagal crank-ka, coupler iyo rocker ayaa la socdaa. Qiimaha aad dejisay waa la hayaa; kuwa kale waxaa laga xisaabiyaa. Liiska, joint loop ah oo wali dhaqaajin karo waa buluug: qiime kale weli waa la dejin karaa. Loop aan dhaqaajin karin (frame la xidhay) wuu madow ahaan. Loop aan xirmi karin waa casaan. Sanduuqa Qaybta wuxuu muujinayaa Loops: intee ka xiran tahay iyo intee qiyam ah ayaa weli dhaqaajin karta, tusaale ahaan \"1 xiran; 1 qiime weli dhaqaajin karta\". Hubi dhaqdhaqaaqa isku-dhacyada wuxuu joint loop ah ka sii dhaadhicinayaa loop-ka oo raacaya, tallaabo tallaabo (eeg Hubi isku-dhiska isku-dhacyada iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa). Linkage toosan oo laga sameeyay xaashi toosan waa inay isku mid noqdaan qoto dheer: laba qayb oo wejig ilaa wejig ku xidhan labada dhinac giraan ah waxay u baahan yihiin isku heer qotoda labada jihoodba. Isticmaal Kala-bixid joint-ka si aad qayb u kor u qaaddo meesha xaashida aan isku darin, ama loop-ku ma xirmi karo. Shaqaynta qaybaha Guji qayb muuqaalka ama liiska si aad u doorato. Panel-ka midig wuxuu muujinayaa magaca qaybta, intee nuqul oo ay jiraan, mugga, joint-yadeeda, iyo haddii ay aasaasan tahay, ama joint-yada ayaa dejiyay, ama \"Lama xidhin: wuxuu ku sii jiraa meesha la geliyay\". Badhamada: Wax ka beddel qaybtan (ama Wax ka beddel qayb qalabka qalabka, ama laba jeer guji qaybta liiska): wuxuu furaa qaybta si loo tafatiro; Geli nuqul; Ka dhig qaybta aasaasan; Ka saar: wuxuu sidoo kale tirtiraa joint-yadeeda, kadib weydiinta. Isku-dhisku waa inuu hayaa ugu yaraan hal qayb: \"Isku-dhisku wuxuu hayaa ugu yaraan hal qayb. Taas beddelkeeda xidh.\" Tafatir qayb meeshay Dooro qayb oo dooro Wax ka beddel qayb. Qaybtu waxay ka furmaysaa taariikhdeeda; cinwaanka wuxuu leeyahay \"Bracket (isku-dhiska Bracket)\". Ku beddel sida qayb kasta. Dooro Dib qalabka qalabka. Isku-dhisku waa cusboonaadaa: nuqul kasta oo qaybtaas wuu isbedelaa, joint-yada ku xiran wejiyada laga sameeyay geesaha sawirka way raacaan. Soo celinta isbeddelka waa hal tallaabo liiska ka noqoshada isku-dhiska. Ka noqo, kaydi iyo xir Isku-dhiskan wuxuu leeyahay liis ka noqosho gaar ah: Ctrl+Z iyo Ctrl+Y waxay shaqeeyaan joint-yada, gelinta iyo dejimaha. Kaydi ama Ctrl+S wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cmagaca isku-dhiska\u003E.partcraft-asm.json, oo leh qaybaha oo dhan gudaheeda. Mar dambe fur adigoo isticmaalaya Fur. Xir wuxuu xiraa isku-dhiska oo wuxuu kuu soo celinayaa qaybtii aad ka bilowday. Haddii isku-dhisku aan la kaydin, wuu weydiinayaa: Jooji, Iska tir isku-dhiska ama Marka hore kaydi. Si aad u magacowdo isku-dhiska, guji meel bannaan si wax aan la dooran, oo beddel Magaca panel-ka midig. Isku-dhisyada waaweyn Isku-dhis wuxuu hayn karaa kumanaan nuqullo ah oo qayb yar. Nuqullada hal qayb waa la isku keeneeyaa, joint aad wareejiso wuxuu kaliya meeshiisa ku dhigaa qaybaha ka dambeeya, liiska qaybaha ayaa muujinaya safafkiisa ugu horeeya badhan \"Muuji wax dheeraad ah\" hoosteeda (qaybta la doortay mar walba way ku jirtaa). Markaad wareejiso ama aad weyneyso muuqaalka, isku-dhis ka badan ~300,000 saddex-geesood waxaa lagu muujiyaa sanduuq qayb kasta, kadibna oo dhan markii aad joogsato saamayn yar kadib. Muuqaalada › Muuqaal fudud wuxuu ilaaliyaa sanduuqyada mar walba. Dooritaanka qayb iyo joint-yada weli waxay isticmaalaan qaybaha dhabta ah. Xawaaraha wareegidda wuxuu sidoo kale ku xidhan yahay kaarka muuqaalka kumbuyuutarkaaga. Tirooyinka PartCraft-ku cabbiray waxay ku jiraan release notes oo leh kumbuyuutarka ay ka soo jeedaan. Dhibaatooyinka joint-ka Qayb aan joint gaadhin ayaa liiska lagu muujiyaa bilaa (free) panel-kuna wuxuu leeyahay \"Bracket2 lama xidhin qaybta aasaasan, sidaas darteed wuxuu ku sii jiraa meesha la geliyay.\" Loop aan xirmi karin (dhererka ma gaadhayo, xad ayaa joogsanaya joint, wejiyada qotoda kuma heshiin): \"Revolute3 wuxuu xirayaa loop aan xirmi karin: wuxuu ka baxsan yahay 2.000 mm. Hubi wejiyada, kala-bixidda iyo xadadka joint-yada loop-ka.\" Joint-yadiisa waxay casaan noqdaan. Haddii wejig ama dhidib uu joint-ku isticmaalo uu baabbi'ay kadib tafatirka qayb: \"Wejigan joint-ka isticmaalaa ayaa ka maqan Bracket.\" Ka saar joint-ka oo mar kale samee. Xiga: Hubi isku-dhiska isku-dhacyada iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"assembly-bom-explode","scope":"partcraft","title":"Liiska qaybaha, muuqaalada kala fureysan iyo qaybaha la dhaqdhaqaajiyo","summary":"Siiso qaybaha isku-dhiska lambar, sharax iyo agab, akhri oo soo deji liiska alaabta (BOM), samee muuqaalo kala fureysan oo talaabo ah ama toos ah, dhaqdhaqaajii qaybaha aan isku xirnayn gacanta, dejiso xadka joint-ka, oo dhoofi isku-dhiska oo dhan STL, 3MF ama liiska alaabta.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["bom","liiska alaabta","liiska qaybaha","lambarka qaybta","agabka","cufnaanta","csv","muuqaal kala fureysan","kala fur","ururi","khadadka raadka","dhaqdhaqaaq qayb","gizmo","wareejin","wareeji","xadka joint-ka","dhoofinta isku-dhiska","talaabada isku-dhiska","sawirka isku-dhiska","balloons"],"headings":[{"id":"sifooyinka-qaybta","text":"Sifooyinka qaybta","level":2},{"id":"liiska-alaabta-bom","text":"Liiska alaabta (BOM)","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalada-kala-fureysan","text":"Muuqaalada kala fureysan","level":2},{"id":"dhaqdhaqaaji-qayb-gacanta","text":"Dhaqdhaqaaji qayb gacanta","level":2},{"id":"xadka-joint-ka","text":"Xadka joint-ka","level":2},{"id":"dhoofi-isku-dhiska-oo-dhan","text":"Dhoofi isku-dhiska oo dhan","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadyo","text":"Xaddidaadyo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQalabkaan waxay ku yaalaan qaybta midig ee isku-dhis (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003EDhis isku-dhis\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sifooyinka-qaybta\"\u003ESifooyinka qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro qayb ku jirta liiska bidix. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ESifooyinka qaybta\u003C/strong\u003E deji:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELambarka qaybta\u003C/strong\u003E (ilaa 40 xaraf) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ESharaxaad\u003C/strong\u003E (ilaa 200).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka\u003C/strong\u003E: agab caadi ah oo leh cufnaantiisa, ama \u003Cstrong\u003ECufnaanta gaarka ah…\u003C/strong\u003E si aad ugu qorto g/cm³. Qaybtu markaas waxay muujinaysaa miisaanka qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESifooyinku waa kuwa qaybta, sidaas darteed nuqul kasta oo ka mid ah wax ayay wadaagaan. Waa la kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"liiska-alaabta-bom\"\u003ELiiska alaabta (BOM)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii wax aan la dooran (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), qaybta waxay muujinaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003ELiiska alaabta\u003C/strong\u003E: hal safar qayb kasta, oo leh lambarkeeda, tirada (intee nuqul), lambarka qaybta, magaca, agabka iyo miisaanka mid kasta. Lambarada waxay raacaan kala horreynta qaybaha ee liiska. Miisaanka wuxuu isticmaalaa mugga qayb kasta (oo ah jir la kala jarjaray oo mesh kernel dhisay, oo ka yar qaybaha goobaha ah), iyo agabkeeda; qayb aan agab lahayn ma leh miisaan, sidaas darteedna ma jiro wadar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo deji CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liiska ku kaydiyaa faylka CSV (sidoo kale \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi › Liiska alaabta (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E). Waxaa lagu furi karaa barnaamij kasta oo miiska ah; qoraalka ku bilaabma = ama + waxaa horteeda ku yimaadda calaamad apostrophe si miiska aan ugu fulin sida qaacido.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalada-kala-fureysan\"\u003EMuuqaalada kala fureysan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaal kala fureysan wuxuu qaybaha kala saaraa sawiro ahaan. Ma beddelo joint-yada ama meesha ay qaybuhu si dhab ah u yihiin: kaydinta, hubinta isku-dhacyada iyo dhoofinta waxay isticmaalaan booska dhabta ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii wax aan la dooran, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaal cusub\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalada kala fureysan\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar tallaabo\u003C/strong\u003E, calaamadee qaybaha talaabadu dhaqaajiso, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EJihada\u003C/strong\u003E (+X … −Z, jihada wejiga aad riixdo, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EJiid fallaadha muuqaalka\u003C/strong\u003E) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafada\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar tallaabo\u003C/span\u003E. Marka \u003Cstrong\u003EJiid\u003C/strong\u003E la doorto, jiid fallaadha oo sii deyso: talaabadu waxay qaadanaysaa jihada iyo masaafada aad jiidday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar talaabooyin kale. Waxay ciyaaraan midba midka kale ka dambeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid soo-jeedinta u dhexaysa \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhisan\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKala fureysan\u003C/strong\u003E si aad muuqaalka u dhaqaajiso. Khadadka dhillaaqa ah ee raadka waxay ka bilaabmaan meesha qayb kasta ku nasashay ilaa meesha ay hadda ku taal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto (xagal)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qayb kasta oo aan aasaasan ahayn ka guuraa dhexda isku-dhiska. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto (isku xirka)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qayb kasta oo ku xiran joint-ka guuraa jihada wejiga joint-kiisa (iyadoo wax kasta oo hoosta ku xiran ay raacayaan). Waxaad haysan kartaa dhowr muuqaal oo magacaysan; dooro mid ka mid ah \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhisan\u003C/strong\u003E si aad qaybaha dib ugu celiso. Muuqaalada waa la kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqdhaqaaji-qayb-gacanta\"\u003EDhaqdhaqaaji qayb gacanta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb kaliya oo aan lahayn joint ilaa qayb aasaasan ayaa gacanta lagu dhaqaajin karaa (qaybta aasaasan waa mid go&#039;an; joint-yadu waxay kuwa kale meesha dhigaan). Dooro, kadibna hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqdhaqaaji gacanta\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor \u003Cstrong\u003EΔX, ΔY, ΔZ\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E, ama dooro dhidib iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EXagal\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeji\u003C/span\u003E (ku wareegsan dhexda qaybta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJiid si aad u guurisid\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa fallaadhaha qaybta saaran: jiid fallaadha si aad ugu guurto dhidibkaas, ama labajibbaaran si aad ugu guurto diyaarad. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJiid si aad u wareejiso\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa giraangiraha si aad ugu wareejiso. Jiid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho ah. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu qarinayaa fallaadhaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xadka-joint-ka\"\u003EXadka joint-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro joint ka dhaqdhaqaaqa, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EXadadka\u003C/strong\u003E, calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EQabso … inta u dhexeysa xadadka\u003C/strong\u003E qiime kasta, kadibna deji \u003Cstrong\u003EUgu yar\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EUgu badan\u003C/strong\u003E. Qiime kasta waa la hayaa gudaheeda xaddiisa, slider-kiisu wuxuu daboolaa xaddiisa oo keliya, \u003Cstrong\u003EHubi dhaqdhaqaaqa isku-dhacyada\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaliya u dhex socdaa xadadkaas. Joint silindar ah wuxuu xadi karaa xagashiisa, kala-bixidiisa ama labadooda. Haddii nooca joint-ka la beddelo, xadadka qiyam aan nooca cusub lahayn waa la tirtiraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofi-isku-dhiska-oo-dhan\"\u003EDhoofi isku-dhiska oo dhan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhis dhexdiisa menu-ga \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qoraa isku-dhiska oo dhan iyada oo qayb kasta meesha ay ku taal:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTEP AP242 / AP214\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshad (PDF)\u003C/strong\u003E nooca hadda lama dhisin: waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah, sidaas darteed waa madow. Dhoofi STEP (jidh sax ah) qayb kasta qaybta laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTL\u003C/strong\u003E: hal mesh oo ah qaybaha oo dhan. \u003Cstrong\u003E3MF\u003C/strong\u003E: qayb kasta mar, meel kasta oo nuqul ah mar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELiiska alaabta (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadyo\"\u003EXaddidaadyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENaqshadda isku-dhiska iyo STEP-ka isku-dhiska nooca hadda lama dhisin (waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah). Muuqaalada kala fureysan waxay u yihiin sawirro shaashadda kaliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Qalabkaan waxay ku yaalaan qaybta midig ee isku-dhis (eeg Dhis isku-dhis). Sifooyinka qaybta Dooro qayb ku jirta liiska bidix. Hoosta Sifooyinka qaybta deji: Lambarka qaybta (ilaa 40 xaraf) iyo Sharaxaad (ilaa 200). Agabka: agab caadi ah oo leh cufnaantiisa, ama Cufnaanta gaarka ah… si aad ugu qorto g/cm³. Qaybtu markaas waxay muujinaysaa miisaanka qaybta. Sifooyinku waa kuwa qaybta, sidaas darteed nuqul kasta oo ka mid ah wax ayay wadaagaan. Waa la kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhiska. Liiska alaabta (BOM) Haddii wax aan la dooran (Esc), qaybta waxay muujinaysaa Liiska alaabta: hal safar qayb kasta, oo leh lambarkeeda, tirada (intee nuqul), lambarka qaybta, magaca, agabka iyo miisaanka mid kasta. Lambarada waxay raacaan kala horreynta qaybaha ee liiska. Miisaanka wuxuu isticmaalaa mugga qayb kasta (oo ah jir la kala jarjaray oo mesh kernel dhisay, oo ka yar qaybaha goobaha ah), iyo agabkeeda; qayb aan agab lahayn ma leh miisaan, sidaas darteedna ma jiro wadar. Soo deji CSV wuxuu liiska ku kaydiyaa faylka CSV (sidoo kale Dhoofi › Liiska alaabta (CSV)). Waxaa lagu furi karaa barnaamij kasta oo miiska ah; qoraalka ku bilaabma = ama + waxaa horteeda ku yimaadda calaamad apostrophe si miiska aan ugu fulin sida qaacido. Muuqaalada kala fureysan Muuqaal kala fureysan wuxuu qaybaha kala saaraa sawiro ahaan. Ma beddelo joint-yada ama meesha ay qaybuhu si dhab ah u yihiin: kaydinta, hubinta isku-dhacyada iyo dhoofinta waxay isticmaalaan booska dhabta ah. Haddii wax aan la dooran, dooro Muuqaal cusub hoosta Muuqaalada kala fureysan. Hoosta Ku dar tallaabo, calaamadee qaybaha talaabadu dhaqaajiso, dooro Jihada (+X … −Z, jihada wejiga aad riixdo, ama Jiid fallaadha muuqaalka) iyo Masaafada, kadibna dooro Ku dar tallaabo. Marka Jiid la doorto, jiid fallaadha oo sii deyso: talaabadu waxay qaadanaysaa jihada iyo masaafada aad jiidday. Ku dar talaabooyin kale. Waxay ciyaaraan midba midka kale ka dambeeya. Jiid soo-jeedinta u dhexaysa Isku-dhisan iyo Kala fureysan si aad muuqaalka u dhaqaajiso. Khadadka dhillaaqa ah ee raadka waxay ka bilaabmaan meesha qayb kasta ku nasashay ilaa meesha ay hadda ku taal. Auto (xagal) wuxuu qayb kasta oo aan aasaasan ahayn ka guuraa dhexda isku-dhiska. Auto (isku xirka) wuxuu qayb kasta oo ku xiran joint-ka guuraa jihada wejiga joint-kiisa (iyadoo wax kasta oo hoosta ku xiran ay raacayaan). Waxaad haysan kartaa dhowr muuqaal oo magacaysan; dooro mid ka mid ah Muuqaal, ama Isku-dhisan si aad qaybaha dib ugu celiso. Muuqaalada waa la kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhiska. Dhaqdhaqaaji qayb gacanta Qayb kaliya oo aan lahayn joint ilaa qayb aasaasan ayaa gacanta lagu dhaqaajin karaa (qaybta aasaasan waa mid go'an; joint-yadu waxay kuwa kale meesha dhigaan). Dooro, kadibna hoosta Dhaqdhaqaaji gacanta: Qor ΔX, ΔY, ΔZ oo dooro Wareeji, ama dooro dhidib iyo Xagal oo dooro Wareeji (ku wareegsan dhexda qaybta). Jiid si aad u guurisid wuxuu muujinayaa fallaadhaha qaybta saaran: jiid fallaadha si aad ugu guurto dhidibkaas, ama labajibbaaran si aad ugu guurto diyaarad. Jiid si aad u wareejiso wuxuu muujinayaa giraangiraha si aad ugu wareejiso. Jiid kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho ah. Esc wuxuu qarinayaa fallaadhaha. Xadka joint-ka Dooro joint ka dhaqdhaqaaqa, hoosta Xadadka, calaamadee Qabso … inta u dhexeysa xadadka qiime kasta, kadibna deji Ugu yar iyo Ugu badan. Qiime kasta waa la hayaa gudaheeda xaddiisa, slider-kiisu wuxuu daboolaa xaddiisa oo keliya, Hubi dhaqdhaqaaqa isku-dhacyada wuxuu kaliya u dhex socdaa xadadkaas. Joint silindar ah wuxuu xadi karaa xagashiisa, kala-bixidiisa ama labadooda. Haddii nooca joint-ka la beddelo, xadadka qiyam aan nooca cusub lahayn waa la tirtiraa. Dhoofi isku-dhiska oo dhan Isku-dhis dhexdiisa menu-ga Dhoofi wuxuu qoraa isku-dhiska oo dhan iyada oo qayb kasta meesha ay ku taal: STEP AP242 / AP214 iyo Naqshad (PDF) nooca hadda lama dhisin: waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah, sidaas darteed waa madow. Dhoofi STEP (jidh sax ah) qayb kasta qaybta laftiisa. STL: hal mesh oo ah qaybaha oo dhan. 3MF: qayb kasta mar, meel kasta oo nuqul ah mar. Liiska alaabta (CSV). Xaddidaadyo Naqshadda isku-dhiska iyo STEP-ka isku-dhiska nooca hadda lama dhisin (waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah). Muuqaalada kala fureysan waxay u yihiin sawirro shaashadda kaliya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"documents-walkthrough","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dokumentiyada iyo dib-u-eegisyada (kaydka)","summary":"Tallaabo-tallaabo ah oo ku saabsan hal shaqo oo dhab ah: geli gal mashruuc oo qaybo iyo isku-dhisyo ah xakameyn hoostooda, qayb soo qaad, ka beddel, dib ugu soo celi fariin, sii daa, eeg waxa isticmaalaya iyo liiska alaabta, waxa qof kale arko intaad faylka haysid, iyo sida ay ula shaqeyso galalka daruuraha.","section":"tasks","order":118,"keywords":["kaydka","dokumentiyada","casharka","tallaabooyinka","soo qaad","soo celi","dib-u-eeg","sii daynta","ansixi","qufulka","taariikhda","meesha la isticmaalo","liiska alaabta","bom","isku-dhis","galka daruuraha","galka mashruuca","laba qof","galka la wadaago"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"1-deji-galka-mashruuca","text":"1. Deji galka mashruuca","level":2},{"id":"2-hoos-u-geli-fayl","text":"2. Hoos u geli fayl","level":2},{"id":"3-soo-qaad-ka-beddel-soo-celi","text":"3. Soo qaad, ka beddel, soo celi","level":2},{"id":"4-dib-u-eeg-oo-sii-daay","text":"4. Dib-u-eeg oo sii daay","level":2},{"id":"5-dib-u-eeg-cusub","text":"5. Dib-u-eeg cusub","level":2},{"id":"6-eeg-waxa-dhacay","text":"6. Eeg waxa dhacay","level":2},{"id":"isku-dhisyo-waxa-ay-isticmaalaan-iyo-liiska-alaabta","text":"Isku-dhisyo: waxa ay isticmaalaan iyo liiska alaabta","level":2},{"id":"7-waxa-ben-arko-intaad-faylka-haysid","text":"7. Waxa Ben arko intaad faylka haysid","level":2},{"id":"8-galalka-daruuraha","text":"8. Galalka daruuraha","level":2},{"id":"isku-day","text":"Isku day","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad tahay Ana, oo ka shaqeysa Riverside Clinic iyo saaxiibkaa Ben. Qaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada mashruuca waxay ku nool yihiin hal gal oo idinkaba labaduba gaari kartaan (darawal la wadaago, gal la isku waafajiyey, ama gal daruuri). Ilaa dhammaadka, hal fayl wuxuu ka soo gudbay nuqulkiisii ugu horreeyay ilaa dib-u-eeg la sii daayay oo ah \u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E, mar kale ayaa la beddelay oo noqday \u003Cstrong\u003EB.1\u003C/strong\u003E, waxaadna aragtay cidda samaysay waxa, waxaadna aragtay waxa Ben arko markaad faylka haysid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax walba waxa lagu kaydiyaa gal qarsoon oo \u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault\u003C/code\u003E ah oo ku yaal faylasha ku dhegan: ma jiro server, ma jiro wax la soo rarayo (galka daruuraha waa ka reeban yahay, eeg tallaabada ugu dambeysa). Badhanka iyo xeer kasta oo meel keliya laga arki karo, eeg mawduuca \u003Cem\u003EDokumentiyada: soo qaadista, dib-u-eegista iyo sii daynta\u003C/em\u003E meesha app-kaaga uu ku yaallo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"1-deji-galka-mashruuca\"\u003E1. Deji galka mashruuca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDokumentiyada…\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EFile\u003C/strong\u003E ee toolbar-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro galka mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro galka ay ku jiraan qaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada mashruuca. (Galalka mashruuca waxay ka shaqeeyaan Studio iyo browser-yada furi kara gal, sida Chrome iyo Edge. Browser-yada kale panelku wuu sheegayaa.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/span\u003E xagga \u003Cstrong\u003EAdiga:\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku qor magacaaga, \u003Ccode\u003EAna\u003C/code\u003E (haddii la weydiiyo, magaca kombiyuutarkan sidoo kale). Panelku wuxuu hadda leeyahay \u003Cem\u003EAdiga: Ana on\u003C/em\u003E iyo kombiyuutarkaaga. Magacaaga ayaa ku dhega wax kasta oo aad samayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydka ku bilow galkan\u003C/span\u003E oo ku qor magaca mashruuca, \u003Ccode\u003ERiverside clinic\u003C/code\u003E. Panelku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cem\u003EKaydka waa la bilaabay Riverside clinic.\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"2-hoos-u-geli-fayl\"\u003E2. Hoos u geli fayl\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylasha aan kaydka ku jirin\u003C/strong\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar\u003C/span\u003E xagga \u003Ccode\u003Eplates/Bracket.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxay ka soo muuqanaysaa hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylasha kaydka ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E dib-u-eeg \u003Cstrong\u003EA.1\u003C/strong\u003E, xaaladda \u003Cstrong\u003EShaqo socota\u003C/strong\u003E. A.1 waa nuqulkiisii ugu horreeyay; kaydku wuxuu hayaa nuqul kasta oo dib-u-eeg ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3-soo-qaad-ka-beddel-soo-celi\"\u003E3. Soo qaad, ka beddel, soo celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E xagga \u003Ccode\u003Eplates/Bracket.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E. Qaybtu waxay ku furmaysaa PartCraft oo panelku wuu xirmaa si aad u aragto. Panelka mar kale ka fur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDokumentiyada…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMar kale fur panelka oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo qaad\u003C/span\u003E. Safka hadda wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxaa soo qaaday adiga\u003C/strong\u003E. Fayl quful ah ayaa lagu sameeyay \u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault/locks\u003C/code\u003E; qof kale ma soo qaadi karo faylkan ilaa aad soo celiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa beddel qaybta: wax ka beddel cabbir, ku dar god. Kaydinta waa la diidayaa haddii faylku aan kuu soo qaadnayn, waana lagu sheegayaa sababta; Kaydi sida ah had iyo jeer waa shaqeynaysaa oo waxay samaysaa nuqul adiga kuu gaar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur panelka, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo celi\u003C/span\u003E oo ku qor waxa la beddelay (\u003Ccode\u003EAlbaabka waa la dhaqaajiyay\u003C/code\u003E). Panelku wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cem\u003Ewaa la soo celiyay sida A.2\u003C/em\u003E. Faylka galka mashruuca hadda waa qaybtii aad furtay, qufulkana wuu baxay. Soo celinta iyada oo aan wax la beddelin waxay hayaa dib-u-eegii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad beddesho go&#039;aankaaga, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo soo qaadista\u003C/span\u003E ayaa faylka dib u celiya iyada oo aan dib-u-eeg cusub la sameynin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"4-dib-u-eeg-oo-sii-daay\"\u003E4. Dib-u-eeg oo sii daay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dir dib-u-eegis\u003C/span\u003E. Xaaladda waxay noqotaa \u003Cstrong\u003EDib-u-eegis ku jira\u003C/strong\u003E faylkana wuxuu noqonayaa mid akhri kaliya ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa hor intaadan ansixin, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E oo liiska ku qor cidda ansixin karta (mid kasta khadka kala gooya), tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003EBen\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003ECarla\u003C/code\u003E, oo calaamee xeerka ah in ansixiyaha uu noqdaa qof aan ahayn qoraha. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi dejinta\u003C/span\u003E. Hadda kaydka laftiisu wuxuu diidayaa qof kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBen (ama Carla) wuxuu dooran karaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnsixi\u003C/span\u003E oo ku qoraa magaca ansixiyaha. Xaaladda waxay noqonaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003ELa sii daayay\u003C/strong\u003E dib-u-eegana waxay noqonaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E, oo leh \u003Cem\u003Eansixiyay\u003C/em\u003E iyo magaca. Fayl la sii daayay wuu akhri kaliya yahay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u celi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dib ugu celin lahaa \u003Cstrong\u003EShaqo socota\u003C/strong\u003E, oo sabab lagu qori lahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagaca ansixiyaha waa magaca lagu qoro panelka; waa diiwaan ah oo ah cidda saxiixday, ma aha caddaynta aqoonsiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"5-dib-u-eeg-cusub\"\u003E5. Dib-u-eeg cusub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylka la sii daayay, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENooc cusub\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad u hayn doontaa xarfta xigta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa beddel, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo celi\u003C/span\u003E. Dib-u-eegu waa \u003Cstrong\u003EB.1\u003C/strong\u003E, shaqo socota. Sii daayso si isku mid ah wuxuu noqonayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EB\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo soo qaadista\u003C/span\u003E ka hor soo celinta koowaad waxay ka dhigaysaa \u003Cstrong\u003EA\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarfaha dib-u-eegga waa A, B … Z, AA, AB. Haddii caddaynta aad raacdo ay xarfo ka reebto, dejinta mashruuca \u003Cem\u003EIsticmaal ASME Y14.35 sequence\u003C/em\u003E wuxuu dhaafayaa I, O, Q, S, X iyo Z dib-u-eegyada xiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"6-eeg-waxa-dhacay\"\u003E6. Eeg waxa dhacay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro magaca faylka si aad u furto faahfaahinteeda:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaariikhda\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: dhacdo kasta, kan ugu dambeeya marka hore, oo leh cidda, kombiyuutarka iyo waqtiga: \u003Cem\u003ESoo celiyay A.2\u003C/em\u003E oo ay samaysay Ana, \u003Cem\u003ELa sii daayay\u003C/em\u003E oo ay samaysay Ben, iwm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib-u-eegisyada\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: miiska dib-u-eegyada: dib-u-eeg kasta oo la hayo, oo leh taariikhdiisa, cidda soo celisay, qorshaha, iyo cidda ansixisay. Kaydku wuxuu hayaa nuqul kasta \u003Ccode\u003E.ccvault/revs\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsticmaalka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: qaybaha isku-dhisku ka kooban yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaxaa isticmaala\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/strong\u003E: Waxaa isticmaala wuxuu liis ka dhigayaa isku-dhis kasta oo kaydka ku jira oo qaybtan ku jirta: beddel bracket waxaad ogaanaysaa isku-dhisyada la hubinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-dhisyo-waxa-ay-isticmaalaan-iyo-liiska-alaabta\"\u003EIsku-dhisyo: waxa ay isticmaalaan iyo liiska alaabta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGal isku-dhis (\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E, oo laga kaydiyay habka Assembly) galka oo ku dar. Dooro magaciisa: \u003Cstrong\u003EIsticmaalka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu liistaa qaybaha uu hayo, oo leh dib-u-eeg kasta iyo xaaladda; \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxaa isticmaala\u003C/strong\u003E qaybta wuxuu liistaa isku-dhis kasta oo hayay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELiiska alaabta (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa liiska qaybaha oo dhan, heer-heer, oo leh tirooyin, dib-u-eeg iyo xaalado, si loo furo spreadsheet. Beddel bracket, \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxaa isticmaala\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kuu sheegayaa isku-dhisyada la eegayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"7-waxa-ben-arko-intaad-faylka-haysid\"\u003E7. Waxa Ben arko intaad faylka haysid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda dib u soo qaad faylka, oo weydii Ben inuu furo galka mashruuca isla kombiyuutarkiisa oo uu furo panelka. Safka faylka wuxuu arkayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EWaxaa soo qaaday Ana\u003C/strong\u003E kombiyuutarkaaga \u003Cstrong\u003Etan iyo\u003C/strong\u003E waqtigaas, badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo qaad\u003C/span\u003E ma jiro. Haddii uu isku dayo, kaydku wuu diidayaa: qufulku waa fayl nidaamku mar labaad ma samayn karo, sidaas darteed laba qof midkoodna ma heysan karaan faylka isla ilbiriqsi, marka galku yahay disk ku jira Studio. (Browser-ka galku wuxuu siiyaa wax ku filan oo keliya, panelkuna wuu sheegayaa taas \u003Cstrong\u003EGalka\u003C/strong\u003E hoosteeda.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii Ana ka maqan tahay Ben uu u baahan yahay faylka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJebi soo qaadista\u003C/span\u003E ayaa sii daya. Waa inuu qoro sabab; waxay gashaa diiwaanka oo leh cidda soo qaadatay. Markii mashruucu liis maamulayaal ku qoro, kaliya iyaga ayaa karta. Soo qaadis da&#039;deedu ka weyn tahay xaddiga joogtaynta (14 maalmood sida caadiga ah) waxaa lagu calaamadeeyaa \u003Cem\u003Emuddo dheer\u003C/em\u003E. Jebinta ka dib, soo celinta dambe ee Ana waa la diidayaa, sidaas darteed midkiinba kan kale ma qori karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"8-galalka-daruuraha\"\u003E8. Galalka daruuraha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGalka daruuraha waa gal mashruuc oo lagu kaydiyo kaydka daruuraha ee kooxdaada, sidaas darteed kooxdu ma u baahna darawal la wadaago. Studio, adigoo ku soo galay akoonkaaga CadCraft, panelku wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur gal daruuri\u003C/span\u003E oo ag yaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro galka mashruuca\u003C/span\u003E. Dooro oo dooro galka, oo lagu liisanayo sida workspace / folder. Mulkiilaha workspace-ka ayaa marka hore galka sameeya, kaydka daruuraha ee kooxdana waa inuu shaqeeyaa. Wax walba oo kor ku qoran ayaa si isku mid ah u shaqeeya; server-ku wuxuu sameeyaa qufulka, kaas oo adkaysta dadka dhexdooda. Haddii aadan soo gelin, panelku wuxuu kugu leeyahay soo gal. Tab browser caadi ah badhanka daruuraha lama siiyo; isticmaal Studio.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-day\"\u003EIsku day\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESamee sideed tallaabo oo kor ku qoran nuqul fayl dhab ah. Tallaabooyinka laba qof u baahan tahay qof kale, ama laba daaqad oo leh laba magac. Haddii aad isku daydo galka la wadaago ee dhab ah, bogga Community testing wuxuu leeyahay hubin la weydiiyo taas oo qaadanaysa natiijooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Waxaad tahay Ana, oo ka shaqeysa Riverside Clinic iyo saaxiibkaa Ben. Qaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada mashruuca waxay ku nool yihiin hal gal oo idinkaba labaduba gaari kartaan (darawal la wadaago, gal la isku waafajiyey, ama gal daruuri). Ilaa dhammaadka, hal fayl wuxuu ka soo gudbay nuqulkiisii ugu horreeyay ilaa dib-u-eeg la sii daayay oo ah A, mar kale ayaa la beddelay oo noqday B.1, waxaadna aragtay cidda samaysay waxa, waxaadna aragtay waxa Ben arko markaad faylka haysid. Wax walba waxa lagu kaydiyaa gal qarsoon oo .ccvault ah oo ku yaal faylasha ku dhegan: ma jiro server, ma jiro wax la soo rarayo (galka daruuraha waa ka reeban yahay, eeg tallaabada ugu dambeysa). Badhanka iyo xeer kasta oo meel keliya laga arki karo, eeg mawduuca Dokumentiyada: soo qaadista, dib-u-eegista iyo sii daynta meesha app-kaaga uu ku yaallo. 1. Deji galka mashruuca Dooro Dokumentiyada… oo ku jira kooxda File ee toolbar-ka. Dooro Dooro galka mashruuca oo dooro galka ay ku jiraan qaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada mashruuca. (Galalka mashruuca waxay ka shaqeeyaan Studio iyo browser-yada furi kara gal, sida Chrome iyo Edge. Browser-yada kale panelku wuu sheegayaa.) Dooro Beddel xagga Adiga: oo ku qor magacaaga, Ana (haddii la weydiiyo, magaca kombiyuutarkan sidoo kale). Panelku wuxuu hadda leeyahay Adiga: Ana on iyo kombiyuutarkaaga. Magacaaga ayaa ku dhega wax kasta oo aad samayso. Dooro Kaydka ku bilow galkan oo ku qor magaca mashruuca, Riverside clinic. Panelku wuxuu leeyahay Kaydka waa la bilaabay Riverside clinic. 2. Hoos u geli fayl Fur Faylasha aan kaydka ku jirin oo dooro Ku dar xagga plates/Bracket.partcraft.json. Waxay ka soo muuqanaysaa hoosta Faylasha kaydka ku jira dib-u-eeg A.1, xaaladda Shaqo socota. A.1 waa nuqulkiisii ugu horreeyay; kaydku wuxuu hayaa nuqul kasta oo dib-u-eeg ah. 3. Soo qaad, ka beddel, soo celi Dooro Fur xagga plates/Bracket.partcraft.json. Qaybtu waxay ku furmaysaa PartCraft oo panelku wuu xirmaa si aad u aragto. Panelka mar kale ka fur Dokumentiyada…. Mar kale fur panelka oo dooro Soo qaad. Safka hadda wuxuu leeyahay Waxaa soo qaaday adiga. Fayl quful ah ayaa lagu sameeyay .ccvault/locks; qof kale ma soo qaadi karo faylkan ilaa aad soo celiso. Ka beddel qaybta: wax ka beddel cabbir, ku dar god. Kaydinta waa la diidayaa haddii faylku aan kuu soo qaadnayn, waana lagu sheegayaa sababta; Kaydi sida ah had iyo jeer waa shaqeynaysaa oo waxay samaysaa nuqul adiga kuu gaar ah. Fur panelka, dooro Soo celi oo ku qor waxa la beddelay (Albaabka waa la dhaqaajiyay). Panelku wuxuu leeyahay waa la soo celiyay sida A.2. Faylka galka mashruuca hadda waa qaybtii aad furtay, qufulkana wuu baxay. Soo celinta iyada oo aan wax la beddelin waxay hayaa dib-u-eegii hore. Haddii aad beddesho go'aankaaga, Ka noqo soo qaadista ayaa faylka dib u celiya iyada oo aan dib-u-eeg cusub la sameynin. 4. Dib-u-eeg oo sii daay Dooro U dir dib-u-eegis. Xaaladda waxay noqotaa Dib-u-eegis ku jira faylkana wuxuu noqonayaa mid akhri kaliya ah. Ka hor intaadan ansixin, dooro Dejinta mashruuca oo liiska ku qor cidda ansixin karta (mid kasta khadka kala gooya), tusaale ahaan Ben iyo Carla, oo calaamee xeerka ah in ansixiyaha uu noqdaa qof aan ahayn qoraha. Dooro Kaydi dejinta. Hadda kaydka laftiisu wuxuu diidayaa qof kale. Ben (ama Carla) wuxuu dooran karaa Ansixi oo ku qoraa magaca ansixiyaha. Xaaladda waxay noqonaysaa La sii daayay dib-u-eegana waxay noqonaysaa A, oo leh ansixiyay iyo magaca. Fayl la sii daayay wuu akhri kaliya yahay. Dib u celi wuxuu dib ugu celin lahaa Shaqo socota, oo sabab lagu qori lahaa. Magaca ansixiyaha waa magaca lagu qoro panelka; waa diiwaan ah oo ah cidda saxiixday, ma aha caddaynta aqoonsiga. 5. Dib-u-eeg cusub Faylka la sii daayay, dooro Nooc cusub. Waxaad u hayn doontaa xarfta xigta. Ka beddel, kadibna Soo celi. Dib-u-eegu waa B.1, shaqo socota. Sii daayso si isku mid ah wuxuu noqonayaa B. Ka noqo soo qaadista ka hor soo celinta koowaad waxay ka dhigaysaa A. Xarfaha dib-u-eegga waa A, B … Z, AA, AB. Haddii caddaynta aad raacdo ay xarfo ka reebto, dejinta mashruuca Isticmaal ASME Y14.35 sequence wuxuu dhaafayaa I, O, Q, S, X iyo Z dib-u-eegyada xiga. 6. Eeg waxa dhacay Dooro magaca faylka si aad u furto faahfaahinteeda: Taariikhda: dhacdo kasta, kan ugu dambeeya marka hore, oo leh cidda, kombiyuutarka iyo waqtiga: Soo celiyay A.2 oo ay samaysay Ana, La sii daayay oo ay samaysay Ben, iwm. Dib-u-eegisyada: miiska dib-u-eegyada: dib-u-eeg kasta oo la hayo, oo leh taariikhdiisa, cidda soo celisay, qorshaha, iyo cidda ansixisay. Kaydku wuxuu hayaa nuqul kasta .ccvault/revs. Isticmaalka: qaybaha isku-dhisku ka kooban yahay. Waxaa isticmaala: Waxaa isticmaala wuxuu liis ka dhigayaa isku-dhis kasta oo kaydka ku jira oo qaybtan ku jirta: beddel bracket waxaad ogaanaysaa isku-dhisyada la hubinayo. Isku-dhisyo: waxa ay isticmaalaan iyo liiska alaabta Gal isku-dhis (.partcraft.json, oo laga kaydiyay habka Assembly) galka oo ku dar. Dooro magaciisa: Isticmaalka wuxuu liistaa qaybaha uu hayo, oo leh dib-u-eeg kasta iyo xaaladda; Waxaa isticmaala qaybta wuxuu liistaa isku-dhis kasta oo hayay. Liiska alaabta (CSV) wuxuu kaydiyaa liiska qaybaha oo dhan, heer-heer, oo leh tirooyin, dib-u-eeg iyo xaalado, si loo furo spreadsheet. Beddel bracket, Waxaa isticmaala wuxuu kuu sheegayaa isku-dhisyada la eegayo. 7. Waxa Ben arko intaad faylka haysid Hadda dib u soo qaad faylka, oo weydii Ben inuu furo galka mashruuca isla kombiyuutarkiisa oo uu furo panelka. Safka faylka wuxuu arkayaa Waxaa soo qaaday Ana kombiyuutarkaaga tan iyo waqtigaas, badhanka Soo qaad ma jiro. Haddii uu isku dayo, kaydku wuu diidayaa: qufulku waa fayl nidaamku mar labaad ma samayn karo, sidaas darteed laba qof midkoodna ma heysan karaan faylka isla ilbiriqsi, marka galku yahay disk ku jira Studio. (Browser-ka galku wuxuu siiyaa wax ku filan oo keliya, panelkuna wuu sheegayaa taas Galka hoosteeda.) Haddii Ana ka maqan tahay Ben uu u baahan yahay faylka, Jebi soo qaadista ayaa sii daya. Waa inuu qoro sabab; waxay gashaa diiwaanka oo leh cidda soo qaadatay. Markii mashruucu liis maamulayaal ku qoro, kaliya iyaga ayaa karta. Soo qaadis da'deedu ka weyn tahay xaddiga joogtaynta (14 maalmood sida caadiga ah) waxaa lagu calaamadeeyaa muddo dheer. Jebinta ka dib, soo celinta dambe ee Ana waa la diidayaa, sidaas darteed midkiinba kan kale ma qori karo. 8. Galalka daruuraha Galka daruuraha waa gal mashruuc oo lagu kaydiyo kaydka daruuraha ee kooxdaada, sidaas darteed kooxdu ma u baahna darawal la wadaago. Studio, adigoo ku soo galay akoonkaaga CadCraft, panelku wuxuu muujinayaa Fur gal daruuri oo ag yaal Dooro galka mashruuca. Dooro oo dooro galka, oo lagu liisanayo sida workspace / folder. Mulkiilaha workspace-ka ayaa marka hore galka sameeya, kaydka daruuraha ee kooxdana waa inuu shaqeeyaa. Wax walba oo kor ku qoran ayaa si isku mid ah u shaqeeya; server-ku wuxuu sameeyaa qufulka, kaas oo adkaysta dadka dhexdooda. Haddii aadan soo gelin, panelku wuxuu kugu leeyahay soo gal. Tab browser caadi ah badhanka daruuraha lama siiyo; isticmaal Studio. Isku day Samee sideed tallaabo oo kor ku qoran nuqul fayl dhab ah. Tallaabooyinka laba qof u baahan tahay qof kale, ama laba daaqad oo leh laba magac. Haddii aad isku daydo galka la wadaago ee dhab ah, bogga Community testing wuxuu leeyahay hubin la weydiiyo taas oo qaadanaysa natiijooyinka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"check-assembly","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hubi isku-dhiska isku-dhacyada iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa","summary":"Hel qaybaha isku dhaca adigoo isticmaalaya {{ui:Isku-dhac}}, jiid qiimaha joint kasta si aad u aragto dhaqdhaqaaqa, oo ku sii dhaadhicin joint hal mar si aad u hesho meelaha qaybuhu ku dhacaan.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["isku-dhac","isku-dhacyo","dhex-galid","ku-dhac","dhacid","isku-dhac dhulka","dhanka khuyuda","qallafsanaan","qoto dheer","qari","shaandh","dhaqdhaqaaq","daraasad dhaqdhaqaaq","sweep","kala-duwanaanshaha dhaqdhaqaaqa","hubi"],"headings":[{"id":"hubi-dhex-galka","text":"Hubi dhex-galka","level":2},{"id":"noocyada-natiijooyinka","text":"Noocyada natiijooyinka","level":3},{"id":"qari-waxaad-aan-u-baahnayn-inaad-aragto","text":"Qari waxaad aan u baahnayn inaad aragto","level":3},{"id":"daawo-dhaqdhaqaaqa","text":"Daawo dhaqdhaqaaqa","level":2},{"id":"hubi-joint-ka-isku-dhacyada","text":"Hubi joint-ka isku-dhacyada","level":2},{"id":"daraasad-dhaqdhaqaaq","text":"Daraasad dhaqdhaqaaq","level":2},{"id":"daraasad-xidhiidh","text":"Daraasad xidhiidh","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELaba hubin ayaa ku shaqeeya qaybaha sida loo meel dhigay: \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhac\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu raadiyaa walxaha isku walaaqa hadda, hubinta dhaqdhaqaaqna wuxuu joint hal mar ku dhaqaajiyaa xadkiisa oo wuxuu raadiyaa walaaq jidka dhexdiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-dhex-galka\"\u003EHubi dhex-galka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur ama dhis isku-dhis (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003EDhis isku-dhis oo leh joint-yo\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhac\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaaladda ayaa sheegaysa natiijada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ma jiro dhex-galid u dhexeeya 3 qayb. (… ms).&quot; Waxba ma isku walaaqin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Dhex-galid: Flange1 iyo Flange2: Walaaq, 2.5 mm³.&quot; Lammaan kasta, nooca natiijada iyo mugga ay wadaagaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhis\u003C/strong\u003E ee bidix wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EDhex-galid\u003C/strong\u003E: &quot;Ma jiro&quot;, &quot;2 natiijo&quot; (kuwa la muujiyey), ama &quot;Lama hubin&quot;. Haddii aan wax la dooran, panel-ka midig wuxuu liistaa natiijo kasta hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDhex-galid\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijada waa la tirtiraa isku-dhiska mar kasta oo uu isbeddelo. Dib u socodsii \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhac\u003C/span\u003E kadib markaad joint dhaqaajisid. Lammaan kasta oo qayb ah waxa lagu hubiyaa lammaan kasta oo kale, sidaas darteed isku-dhisyada waaweyn waxay qaadanayaan waqti dheer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"noocyada-natiijooyinka\"\u003ENoocyada natiijooyinka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalaaq\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybuhu waxay wadaagaan mug: isku-dhac dhab ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoto-dheer khaldan oo xirmo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMugga wadaagga ah wuxuu ku jiraa xirmo qayb mid, laakiin wuxuu ka baxayaa xirmada kale: bolt xirmo ka qoto dheer godkiisa, ama shank sahlan godka xirmada.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXirmo ku fiican (xirmo cosmetic)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMugga wadaagga ah wuxuu ku jiraa labada xirmo qaybood: bolt godka xirmada. Xirmooyinka cosmetic waxaa lagu sawiraa cabbirkooda buuxa, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer way isku dhacaan yar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWejiyo taabanaya\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro mug wadaag ah, laakiin wejiyo isku taabanaya (dhex 0.001 mm).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXirmooyinka la dhaqaajiyey (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/threads\" data-topic=\"partcraft/threads\"\u003EXirmooyinka dhab ah ama la qaabeeyey\u003C/a\u003E) waa geometry dhab ah: waxa ay wadaagaan waa \u003Cstrong\u003EWalaaq\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"qari-waxaad-aan-u-baahnayn-inaad-aragto\"\u003EQari waxaad aan u baahnayn inaad aragto\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji\u003C/strong\u003E, sanduuq kasta oo nooc ah ayaa jira: calaamadee \u003Cstrong\u003EXirmo ku fiican\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EWejiyo taabanaya\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u aragto oo keliya isku-dhacyada muhiimka ah. \u003Cstrong\u003EQari lamaanahan\u003C/strong\u003E dhinaca natiijo kasta wuxuu qarinayaa lammaanahaas qaybood xitaa haddii nooca kasta yahay. Natiijooyinka qarsoon waa la tirinayaa (&quot;2 natiijo ayaa lagu qariyey shaandhayaashan&quot;), \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji lamaanayaasha qarsoonaa mar kale\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa soo celinaya lammaanayaasha. Farriinta xaaladda ayaa sidoo kale tirinaysa natiijooyinka qarsoon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaandhayaashu waa la kaydiyaa isku-dhiska, isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi dhaqdhaqaaqa isku-dhacyada\u003C/span\u003E (hoose) ayaa iyaduna isticmaashaa. Isku-dhisyo leh shaandhayaal waxaa loo kaydiyaa nooca 4, kaas oo nooca PartCraft ee hore diidi doona inay furaan halkii ay shaandhayaasha ka lumin lahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daawo-dhaqdhaqaaqa\"\u003EDaawo dhaqdhaqaaqa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro joint dhaqaajiya (wixii rigid ah) liiska bidix.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid slider-ka hoosta qiime ka mid ah, sida \u003Cstrong\u003EXagal (°)\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EKala-bixid (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E. Qaybtu way dhaqaajaa intaad jiidayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii dayso. Meesha cusub waa la hayaa, waxaana laga soo celin karaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad sidoo kale ku qori kartaa xagal ama kala-bixid sanduuqa oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoint ku jira loop xidhan (linkage) wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa loop-ka oo dhan: qiimaha aad jiidday waa la hayaa, joint-yada kale ee loop-ka waa raacaan (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly#closed-loops-linkages\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\" data-hash=\"closed-loops-linkages\"\u003ELoops xidhan\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-joint-ka-isku-dhacyada\"\u003EHubi joint-ka isku-dhacyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro joint dhaqaajiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJoint leh qiyam dhowr (cylindrical, planar, ball, pin in slot), dooro qiimaha la hubinayo \u003Cstrong\u003EHubi dhaqdhaqaaqa\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi dhaqdhaqaaqa isku-dhacyada\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu qiimaha ku dhaqaajiyaa 25 meelood oo 24 tallaabo oo siman, kuwa kale waxay ku sii joogaan sidoo kale: xagal ka bilaabma −180° ilaa 180° (janjeer ka bilaabma −90° ilaa 90°), dherer ka bilaabma minus ilaa plus cabbirka qaybta ugu weyn. Wuxuu soo celinayaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Ma jiro isku-dhac meel kasta oo loo hubiyey Xagal (°) -180 ilaa 180 (25 meelood la hubiyey).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;6 ka mid ah 25 meelood ayaa isku dhacaya, ugu horreyntii Xagal (°) 45 (12.4 mm³).&quot; Meesha ugu horreysa ee isku dhacda iyo walaaqa halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka wuu madoobaan joint-yada rigid, kuwaas oo aan dhaqaajin. Hubintu waxay hubisaa meelaha oo keliya, ma aha jidka u dhexeeya; qayb dhuuban waxay ku gudbi karaa mid kale ka dhexeeya laba tallaabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXidhiidhka iyo cuf-dhaca weli lama dhisin. Xadad la&#039;aan, hubintu waxay daboolaysaa xadka oo dhan; qiimaha ku sii \u003Cstrong\u003EXadadka\u003C/strong\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\" data-topic=\"partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\"\u003EQayb liiska, muuqaalada kala fureysan iyo qaybaha la dhaqdhaqaajiyo\u003C/a\u003E), hubintuna waxay daboolaysaa xaddiyadaas oo keliya, sidaas darteed albaab ku furmaya 90° waxaa la hubiyaa 90°.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daraasad-dhaqdhaqaaq\"\u003EDaraasad dhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhis › Dhaqdhaqaaq\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qiime joint hal mar ka bilaabaa bilowga ilaa dhamaadka wakhti aad siiso (xawaare joogto ah, siman, sine, ama dib u soo noqo), wuxuuna isku-dhiska meel dhigaa tallaabo kasta oo joint-yada iyo loop-yada xidhan ku jira, wuxuuna sheegaa waxa isku dhaca iyo sida ay qaybuhu u dhowaadaan. \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar barta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu raacaa dhexda qayb ama barta aad riixdo, kaarka wuxuu sawiraa booska, xawaaraha iyo kor u kacida iyo qiimaha joint-ka iyo masaafada wakhtiga; \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi CSV\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi garaafka\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa qoraa. Xawaaraha iyo kor u kacida waxay ka soo baxaan booska la duubay, sidaas darteed dhimasho ayaa la akhrin karaa haddii tallaabooyin badan aan la dhigin: isticmaal tallaabo badan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKadib \u003Cstrong\u003EOrod\u003C/strong\u003E, bar \u003Cstrong\u003ETallaabo ee orodka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isku-dhiska u raraa tallaabo kasta (waqtiga, qiimaha iyo haddii qaybuhu isku dhacaan waa la muujinayaa dhinaceeda); joint-ku wuxuu hayaa qiimihiisa; \u003Cstrong\u003EDib u noqo moodeelka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu isku-dhiska dib u celinayaa. Dejinta daraasadda waa la kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhiska; natiijooyinkeeda waxaa dib u sameeya \u003Cstrong\u003EOrod\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daraasad-xidhiidh\"\u003EDaraasad xidhiidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhis › Xidhiidh\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa sida isku-dhisku u qaado culeyska meelaha qaybaha isku riixaan. Qayb kasta waxay keenaysaa taageeradeeda, culayskeeda iyo agabkeeda daraasadda \u003Cstrong\u003ESimulation\u003C/strong\u003E ee gaarka ah (wejig go&#039;an oo qayb, xoog qayb kale); halkan waxaad dooraneysaa labada. \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar lammaane\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro dhinaca A\u003C/strong\u003E oo guji wejiyada qayb, \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro dhinaca B\u003C/strong\u003E oo guji wejiyada qayb kale oo ka duwan (guji wejig la doortay ayaa ka saaraya; Esc ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDhamee\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa dhamaysiya doorashada). Lammaanuhu waa \u003Cstrong\u003EAan-jiifin\u003C/strong\u003E (qaybuhu way riixaan laakiin way siibtaan) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-xidhan\u003C/strong\u003E (way isku-xidhan yihiin); qiyaaska adkaanta wuxuu dejiyaa sida adag u caabbinayo gudbitaanka (20 waa bilow wanaagsan, 1000 kaarka birta adag).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXalli\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu socodsiiyaa culeyska tallaabo tallaabo, wuxuuna muujinayaa xoogga xidhiidhka, gudbitaanka ugu qoto dheer, dhaqdhaqaaqa ugu weyn iyo cadaadiska ugu weyn. Qayb aan lammaane lahayn waa la dhaafaa, kaarkuna sidaas buu sheegaa. Xidhiidh aan-jiifin ahi ma hayo qayb dhinaca dhinac; qayb kasta ku sii taageero daraasadda Simulation, ama ku isku xir, ama tallaabooyinku ma degi karaan. Lammaanayaasha iyo dejimaha waa la kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhiska.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoofi CalculiX deck\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaabkaas oo kale u qoraa sida faylka CalculiX input (.inp). CalculiX waa barnaamij kale oo aad rakibto oo aad socodsiiso adigu; \u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri natiijooyinka CalculiX (.frd)\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa dib u akhrisa kala-guurka isku-dhiskan, wuxuuna diidaa faylka loo sameeyay mesh kale. Xalinta halkan waa plastic-capable laakiin ma aha explicit dynamics, na ma aha falanqayn la xaqiijiyay: injineer ayaa hubin kara wax kasta oo muhiim ah.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Laba hubin ayaa ku shaqeeya qaybaha sida loo meel dhigay: Isku-dhac wuxuu raadiyaa walxaha isku walaaqa hadda, hubinta dhaqdhaqaaqna wuxuu joint hal mar ku dhaqaajiyaa xadkiisa oo wuxuu raadiyaa walaaq jidka dhexdiisa. Hubi dhex-galka Fur ama dhis isku-dhis (eeg Dhis isku-dhis oo leh joint-yo). Dooro Isku-dhac. Xaaladda ayaa sheegaysa natiijada: \"Ma jiro dhex-galid u dhexeeya 3 qayb. (… ms).\" Waxba ma isku walaaqin. \"Dhex-galid: Flange1 iyo Flange2: Walaaq, 2.5 mm³.\" Lammaan kasta, nooca natiijada iyo mugga ay wadaagaan. Sanduuqa Isku-dhis ee bidix wuxuu muujinayaa Dhex-galid: \"Ma jiro\", \"2 natiijo\" (kuwa la muujiyey), ama \"Lama hubin\". Haddii aan wax la dooran, panel-ka midig wuxuu liistaa natiijo kasta hoosta Dhex-galid. Natiijada waa la tirtiraa isku-dhiska mar kasta oo uu isbeddelo. Dib u socodsii Isku-dhac kadib markaad joint dhaqaajisid. Lammaan kasta oo qayb ah waxa lagu hubiyaa lammaan kasta oo kale, sidaas darteed isku-dhisyada waaweyn waxay qaadanayaan waqti dheer. Noocyada natiijooyinka Nooca Macnaha Walaaq Qaybuhu waxay wadaagaan mug: isku-dhac dhab ah. Qoto-dheer khaldan oo xirmo Mugga wadaagga ah wuxuu ku jiraa xirmo qayb mid, laakiin wuxuu ka baxayaa xirmada kale: bolt xirmo ka qoto dheer godkiisa, ama shank sahlan godka xirmada. Xirmo ku fiican (xirmo cosmetic) Mugga wadaagga ah wuxuu ku jiraa labada xirmo qaybood: bolt godka xirmada. Xirmooyinka cosmetic waxaa lagu sawiraa cabbirkooda buuxa, sidaas darteed had iyo jeer way isku dhacaan yar. Wejiyo taabanaya Ma jiro mug wadaag ah, laakiin wejiyo isku taabanaya (dhex 0.001 mm). Xirmooyinka la dhaqaajiyey (eeg Xirmooyinka dhab ah ama la qaabeeyey) waa geometry dhab ah: waxa ay wadaagaan waa Walaaq. Qari waxaad aan u baahnayn inaad aragto Hoosta Muuji, sanduuq kasta oo nooc ah ayaa jira: calaamadee Xirmo ku fiican iyo Wejiyo taabanaya si aad u aragto oo keliya isku-dhacyada muhiimka ah. Qari lamaanahan dhinaca natiijo kasta wuxuu qarinayaa lammaanahaas qaybood xitaa haddii nooca kasta yahay. Natiijooyinka qarsoon waa la tirinayaa (\"2 natiijo ayaa lagu qariyey shaandhayaashan\"), Muuji lamaanayaasha qarsoonaa mar kale ayaa soo celinaya lammaanayaasha. Farriinta xaaladda ayaa sidoo kale tirinaysa natiijooyinka qarsoon. Shaandhayaashu waa la kaydiyaa isku-dhiska, isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo Ctrl+Z. Hubi dhaqdhaqaaqa isku-dhacyada (hoose) ayaa iyaduna isticmaashaa. Isku-dhisyo leh shaandhayaal waxaa loo kaydiyaa nooca 4, kaas oo nooca PartCraft ee hore diidi doona inay furaan halkii ay shaandhayaasha ka lumin lahaayeen. Daawo dhaqdhaqaaqa Dooro joint dhaqaajiya (wixii rigid ah) liiska bidix. Jiid slider-ka hoosta qiime ka mid ah, sida Xagal (°) ama Kala-bixid (mm). Qaybtu way dhaqaajaa intaad jiidayso. Sii dayso. Meesha cusub waa la hayaa, waxaana laga soo celin karaa Ctrl+Z. Waxaad sidoo kale ku qori kartaa xagal ama kala-bixid sanduuqa oo riix Enter. Joint ku jira loop xidhan (linkage) wuxuu dhaqaajiyaa loop-ka oo dhan: qiimaha aad jiidday waa la hayaa, joint-yada kale ee loop-ka waa raacaan (eeg Loops xidhan). Hubi joint-ka isku-dhacyada Dooro joint dhaqaajiya. Joint leh qiyam dhowr (cylindrical, planar, ball, pin in slot), dooro qiimaha la hubinayo Hubi dhaqdhaqaaqa. Riix Hubi dhaqdhaqaaqa isku-dhacyada. PartCraft wuxuu qiimaha ku dhaqaajiyaa 25 meelood oo 24 tallaabo oo siman, kuwa kale waxay ku sii joogaan sidoo kale: xagal ka bilaabma −180° ilaa 180° (janjeer ka bilaabma −90° ilaa 90°), dherer ka bilaabma minus ilaa plus cabbirka qaybta ugu weyn. Wuxuu soo celinayaa: \"Ma jiro isku-dhac meel kasta oo loo hubiyey Xagal (°) -180 ilaa 180 (25 meelood la hubiyey).\" \"6 ka mid ah 25 meelood ayaa isku dhacaya, ugu horreyntii Xagal (°) 45 (12.4 mm³).\" Meesha ugu horreysa ee isku dhacda iyo walaaqa halkaas. Badhanka wuu madoobaan joint-yada rigid, kuwaas oo aan dhaqaajin. Hubintu waxay hubisaa meelaha oo keliya, ma aha jidka u dhexeeya; qayb dhuuban waxay ku gudbi karaa mid kale ka dhexeeya laba tallaabo. Xidhiidhka iyo cuf-dhaca weli lama dhisin. Xadad la'aan, hubintu waxay daboolaysaa xadka oo dhan; qiimaha ku sii Xadadka (eeg Qayb liiska, muuqaalada kala fureysan iyo qaybaha la dhaqdhaqaajiyo), hubintuna waxay daboolaysaa xaddiyadaas oo keliya, sidaas darteed albaab ku furmaya 90° waxaa la hubiyaa 90°. Daraasad dhaqdhaqaaq Isku-dhis › Dhaqdhaqaaq wuxuu qiime joint hal mar ka bilaabaa bilowga ilaa dhamaadka wakhti aad siiso (xawaare joogto ah, siman, sine, ama dib u soo noqo), wuxuuna isku-dhiska meel dhigaa tallaabo kasta oo joint-yada iyo loop-yada xidhan ku jira, wuxuuna sheegaa waxa isku dhaca iyo sida ay qaybuhu u dhowaadaan. Ku dar barta wuxuu raacaa dhexda qayb ama barta aad riixdo, kaarka wuxuu sawiraa booska, xawaaraha iyo kor u kacida iyo qiimaha joint-ka iyo masaafada wakhtiga; Kaydi CSV iyo Kaydi garaafka ayaa qoraa. Xawaaraha iyo kor u kacida waxay ka soo baxaan booska la duubay, sidaas darteed dhimasho ayaa la akhrin karaa haddii tallaabooyin badan aan la dhigin: isticmaal tallaabo badan. Kadib Orod, bar Tallaabo ee orodka wuxuu isku-dhiska u raraa tallaabo kasta (waqtiga, qiimaha iyo haddii qaybuhu isku dhacaan waa la muujinayaa dhinaceeda); joint-ku wuxuu hayaa qiimihiisa; Dib u noqo moodeelka wuxuu isku-dhiska dib u celinayaa. Dejinta daraasadda waa la kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhiska; natiijooyinkeeda waxaa dib u sameeya Orod. Daraasad xidhiidh Isku-dhis › Xidhiidh wuxuu muujinayaa sida isku-dhisku u qaado culeyska meelaha qaybaha isku riixaan. Qayb kasta waxay keenaysaa taageeradeeda, culayskeeda iyo agabkeeda daraasadda Simulation ee gaarka ah (wejig go'an oo qayb, xoog qayb kale); halkan waxaad dooraneysaa labada. Ku dar lammaane, kadibna Dooro dhinaca A oo guji wejiyada qayb, Dooro dhinaca B oo guji wejiyada qayb kale oo ka duwan (guji wejig la doortay ayaa ka saaraya; Esc ama Dhamee ayaa dhamaysiya doorashada). Lammaanuhu waa Aan-jiifin (qaybuhu way riixaan laakiin way siibtaan) ama Isku-xidhan (way isku-xidhan yihiin); qiyaaska adkaanta wuxuu dejiyaa sida adag u caabbinayo gudbitaanka (20 waa bilow wanaagsan, 1000 kaarka birta adag). Xalli wuxuu socodsiiyaa culeyska tallaabo tallaabo, wuxuuna muujinayaa xoogga xidhiidhka, gudbitaanka ugu qoto dheer, dhaqdhaqaaqa ugu weyn iyo cadaadiska ugu weyn. Qayb aan lammaane lahayn waa la dhaafaa, kaarkuna sidaas buu sheegaa. Xidhiidh aan-jiifin ahi ma hayo qayb dhinaca dhinac; qayb kasta ku sii taageero daraasadda Simulation, ama ku isku xir, ama tallaabooyinku ma degi karaan. Lammaanayaasha iyo dejimaha waa la kaydiyaa faylka isku-dhiska. Dhoofi CalculiX deck wuxuu qaabkaas oo kale u qoraa sida faylka CalculiX input (.inp). CalculiX waa barnaamij kale oo aad rakibto oo aad socodsiiso adigu; Akhri natiijooyinka CalculiX (.frd) ayaa dib u akhrisa kala-guurka isku-dhiskan, wuxuuna diidaa faylka loo sameeyay mesh kale. Xalinta halkan waa plastic-capable laakiin ma aha explicit dynamics, na ma aha falanqayn la xaqiijiyay: injineer ayaa hubin kara wax kasta oo muhiim ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"measure","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qiyaas masaafooyinka, xagalada iyo miisaanka","summary":"Riix laba shay muuqaalka si aad u hesho masaafada ugu yar, xagalka iyo ΔX ΔY ΔZ; akhri dherer geesta, dhexroorka god, aagga wejiga ama kala-xidhiidhka dhibcaha; hel mugga, miisaanka, bartamaha miisaanka iyo inertia-ta qayb ama assembly.","section":"tasks","order":125,"keywords":["qiyaas","masaafo","masaafada ugu yar","xagal","dherer","radius","dhexroor","aag","kala-xidhiidh","delta","hubin","sifooyinka miisaanka","miisaan","culeys","bartamaha miisaanka","centre of mass","inertia","moment of inertia","cufnaan","alaab"],"headings":[{"id":"mid-mid-qiyaas","text":"Mid mid qiyaas","level":2},{"id":"qiyaas-ka-dhexeeya-laba-shay","text":"Qiyaas ka dhexeeya laba shay","level":2},{"id":"sida-ay-u-sax-tahay","text":"Sida ay u sax tahay","level":3},{"id":"sifooyinka-miisaanka","text":"Sifooyinka miisaanka","level":2},{"id":"xadka","text":"Xadka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiyaas\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa moodeelka workspace kasta (Design, Form, Simulation, Generative, Manufacture) iyo assembly. Waa ku jirtaa kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EView\u003C/strong\u003E ee menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Kaar ayaa ka furmaa dhinaca bidix ee sare ee muuqaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mid-mid-qiyaas\"\u003EMid mid qiyaas\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix vertex, geeso ama wejig. Kaartu wuxuu muujinayaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhibic\u003C/strong\u003E (vertex, dhexe geeso, ama bartamaha goobo): X, Y, Z.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeeso\u003C/strong\u003E: toos, goobo ama curve, iyo dherkeeda; goobo ahaan sidoo kale radius, dhexroor iyo bartamaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWejig\u003C/strong\u003E: siman, silinder, cone iwm, iyo aagga; normal-ka wejigga siman; radius iyo dhexroorka silinderka (cabbirka god). Aagyada waa kuwa facets-ka mesh kernel-ku dhisay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJidhka oo dhan\u003C/strong\u003E: hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo riix qaybta. Waxaad heleysaa mugga, aagga, miisaanka iyo inertia-ta (eeg hoose).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPointer-ku wuxuu ku qabsadaa vertices, dhexe geeso iyo bartamaha goobo 10 pixels gudahood; dhibic buluug yar ayaa muujinaysa qabsashada ka hor intaadan riixin. Si aad u doorato bartamaha god, u tilmaam bartamaha godka; si aad u doorato geesta (goobada), u tilmaam geesta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyaas-ka-dhexeeya-laba-shay\"\u003EQiyaas ka dhexeeya laba shay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix shay labaad. Kaartu wuxuu ku daraa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafada ugu yar\u003C/strong\u003E iyo laba dhibic oo ugu dhow, oo lagu sawiro khad u dhexeeya muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EΔX, ΔY, ΔZ\u003C/strong\u003E laga bilaabo dhibcaha ugu dhow ee koowaad ilaa kan labaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXagal\u003C/strong\u003E u dhexeeya laba wejig siman (u dhexeeya normals-ka, 0–180°), u dhexeeya laba geeso toosan ama axes (0–90°), ama u dhexeeya geeso iyo wejig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafada u dhexeysa diyaarado\u003C/strong\u003E laba wejig siman oo isbarbar ah, \u003Cstrong\u003EBartamaha ilaa bartamaha\u003C/strong\u003E laba goobo ama god, \u003Cstrong\u003EAxis ilaa axis\u003C/strong\u003E laba god ama silinder oo isbarbar ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix saddexaad wuxuu bilaabaa lammaan cusub. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashooyinka; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E) wuxuu xiraa Qiyaas. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu natiijooyinka ku dhejiyaa clipboard-ka qoraal tab-ku kala saaran yahay, oo diyaar u ah in lagu dhejiyo spreadsheet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sida-ay-u-sax-tahay\"\u003ESida ay u sax tahay\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu qaybta ka dhisaa mesh kernel-ka, sidaas darteed masaafooyinka waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa facets-ka mesh-ka, kaarduna wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003Eqiyaas: facets\u003C/strong\u003E: waa sax wejiyada siman iyo u dhexeeya vertices, si yar u khaldan wejiyada curved-ka. Dejin \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E oo fiican ayaa dhow geynaysa. Qiyaas sax ah oo ku saabsan wejiyada dhabta ah wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel sax ah: weli lama dhisin nooca hadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sifooyinka-miisaanka\"\u003ESifooyinka miisaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMass properties\u003C/span\u003E kaarta ama menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E. Qayb kasta, dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E kaarta (birta, aluminum, plastics iyo kuwa kale oo leh cufnaanta caadiga ah). Assembly-ga qayb kastaa wuxuu isticmaalaa material-ka ku dejisan sifooyinkeeda (dooro qaybta, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E), natiijadana waa dhammaan qaybaha wada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaarta wuxuu muujinayaa miisaanka, mugga, aagga, bartamaha miisaanka, tensor-ka inertia-ta (Ixx, Iyy, Izz iyo badeecadaha Ixy, Iyz, Ixz, kg·mm² ahaan, bartamaha miisaanka ee axes-ka adduunka) iyo principal moments. Material la&#039;aan wuxuu muujinayaa isla cufnaan kasta (mm⁵) iyo miisaan la&#039;aan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirooyinku waa sax jidhka tessellated ee mesh kernel-ku dhiso (wejiyada curved-ka sida facets), sidaas darteed qayb wareegsan waxay u muuqataa mid yar, kaarduna sidaas buu sheegaa. Cufnaanta alaabta waa qiimaha caadiga ah ee buugga; alloy ama grade dhab ah wuu ka duwan karaa dhowr boqolkiiba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xadka\"\u003EXadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQabsashadu waxay heli kartaa dhibic ku qarsan geometry kale; hubi in kaarduna sheegayo waxa aad ula jeedday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiyaas waa la xiraa marka aad furto sawir ama xaashada naqshadda, ama aad beddesho workspace.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Qiyaas wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa moodeelka workspace kasta (Design, Form, Simulation, Generative, Manufacture) iyo assembly. Waa ku jirtaa kooxda View ee menu-ga Views, ama riix M. Kaar ayaa ka furmaa dhinaca bidix ee sare ee muuqaalka. Mid mid qiyaas Riix vertex, geeso ama wejig. Kaartu wuxuu muujinayaa: Dhibic (vertex, dhexe geeso, ama bartamaha goobo): X, Y, Z. Geeso: toos, goobo ama curve, iyo dherkeeda; goobo ahaan sidoo kale radius, dhexroor iyo bartamaha. Wejig: siman, silinder, cone iwm, iyo aagga; normal-ka wejigga siman; radius iyo dhexroorka silinderka (cabbirka god). Aagyada waa kuwa facets-ka mesh kernel-ku dhisay. Jidhka oo dhan: hay Shift oo riix qaybta. Waxaad heleysaa mugga, aagga, miisaanka iyo inertia-ta (eeg hoose). Pointer-ku wuxuu ku qabsadaa vertices, dhexe geeso iyo bartamaha goobo 10 pixels gudahood; dhibic buluug yar ayaa muujinaysa qabsashada ka hor intaadan riixin. Si aad u doorato bartamaha god, u tilmaam bartamaha godka; si aad u doorato geesta (goobada), u tilmaam geesta. Qiyaas ka dhexeeya laba shay Riix shay labaad. Kaartu wuxuu ku daraa: Masaafada ugu yar iyo laba dhibic oo ugu dhow, oo lagu sawiro khad u dhexeeya muuqaalka. ΔX, ΔY, ΔZ laga bilaabo dhibcaha ugu dhow ee koowaad ilaa kan labaad. Xagal u dhexeeya laba wejig siman (u dhexeeya normals-ka, 0–180°), u dhexeeya laba geeso toosan ama axes (0–90°), ama u dhexeeya geeso iyo wejig. Masaafada u dhexeysa diyaarado laba wejig siman oo isbarbar ah, Bartamaha ilaa bartamaha laba goobo ama god, Axis ilaa axis laba god ama silinder oo isbarbar ah. Riix saddexaad wuxuu bilaabaa lammaan cusub. Esc wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashooyinka; Esc mar kale (ama Close) wuxuu xiraa Qiyaas. Copy wuxuu natiijooyinka ku dhejiyaa clipboard-ka qoraal tab-ku kala saaran yahay, oo diyaar u ah in lagu dhejiyo spreadsheet. Sida ay u sax tahay PartCraft wuxuu qaybta ka dhisaa mesh kernel-ka, sidaas darteed masaafooyinka waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa facets-ka mesh-ka, kaarduna wuxuu leeyahay qiyaas: facets: waa sax wejiyada siman iyo u dhexeeya vertices, si yar u khaldan wejiyada curved-ka. Dejin Curves oo fiican ayaa dhow geynaysa. Qiyaas sax ah oo ku saabsan wejiyada dhabta ah wuxuu u baahan yahay kernel sax ah: weli lama dhisin nooca hadda. Sifooyinka miisaanka Dooro Mass properties kaarta ama menu-ga Views. Qayb kasta, dooro Material kaarta (birta, aluminum, plastics iyo kuwa kale oo leh cufnaanta caadiga ah). Assembly-ga qayb kastaa wuxuu isticmaalaa material-ka ku dejisan sifooyinkeeda (dooro qaybta, kadibna Material), natiijadana waa dhammaan qaybaha wada. Kaarta wuxuu muujinayaa miisaanka, mugga, aagga, bartamaha miisaanka, tensor-ka inertia-ta (Ixx, Iyy, Izz iyo badeecadaha Ixy, Iyz, Ixz, kg·mm² ahaan, bartamaha miisaanka ee axes-ka adduunka) iyo principal moments. Material la'aan wuxuu muujinayaa isla cufnaan kasta (mm⁵) iyo miisaan la'aan. Tirooyinku waa sax jidhka tessellated ee mesh kernel-ku dhiso (wejiyada curved-ka sida facets), sidaas darteed qayb wareegsan waxay u muuqataa mid yar, kaarduna sidaas buu sheegaa. Cufnaanta alaabta waa qiimaha caadiga ah ee buugga; alloy ama grade dhab ah wuu ka duwan karaa dhowr boqolkiiba. Xadka Qabsashadu waxay heli kartaa dhibic ku qarsan geometry kale; hubi in kaarduna sheegayo waxa aad ula jeedday. Qiyaas waa la xiraa marka aad furto sawir ama xaashada naqshadda, ama aad beddesho workspace.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"section-view","scope":"partcraft","title":"Eeg gudaha muuqaalka goynta","summary":"Goy qaybta ama isku-dhisyada dusha si aad gudihiisa u aragto, iyadoo dhinacyada la goyay la buuxiyay. Dusha slider-ka ku dhaqaaqi, ku goy wajiga fiiqan ee aad gujiso, oo ka beddel dhinaca la goynayo.","section":"tasks","order":126,"keywords":["goynta","muuqaalka goynta","goy","goyn ka-tirid","goyn dhinac-dhinac","jarid","gudaha","jeex","dusha","caps","hatch","goyn isku-dhis"],"headings":[{"id":"goy-dhexda","text":"Goy dhexda","level":2},{"id":"goy-wajiga","text":"Goy wajiga","level":2},{"id":"gujyada-iyo-goynta","text":"Gujyada iyo goynta","level":2},{"id":"xir","text":"Xir","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka goynta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu moodeelka ku goyaa dusha si aad gudihiisa u aragto: godad, qodaxyo, qaro-darbiyada, sida qaybaha isku-dhisku ugu jiraan. Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa dhammaan goobaha shaqada iyo isku-dhisyada. Ka fur menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalada\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaal\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalka goynta\u003C/span\u003E, ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Kaarar ayaa ka furmaa geeska hoose ee bidix ee muuqaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka kaliya ayaa la goyaa. Qaybta, mugga, qiyaasaha iyo dhoofinta ayaa oo dhan dhammaantood ah, faylkana wax lagu kaydin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goy-dhexda\"\u003EGoy dhexda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Qaybta waxaa goya dusha hore ee dhexdeeda, dhinacyada la goyay waxaa lagu buuxiyaa midab khafiif ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid slider-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E, ama ku qor masaafo mm, si aad goynta u dhaqaajiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E kale: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHore (XY)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESare (XZ)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMidig (YZ)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa goo dhinaca kale\u003C/span\u003E si aad u hayso midka la goyay halkii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"goy-wajiga\"\u003EGoy wajiga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro dusha\u003C/span\u003E kaarka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wajig fiiqan oo muuqaalka ku jira. Goynta ayaa ka bilaabanta wajigaas, dusha ayaa saaran wajigaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhaqaajiso \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBooska\u003C/span\u003E si aad u gaarto gudaha. Lambarku waa masaafada ku jirta jihada dibadda ee wajiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gujyada-iyo-goynta\"\u003EGujyada iyo goynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGujyada muuqaalka waxay tagaan wixii goynta ka hadha, sidaas darteed waad dooran kartaa wajig ama geesood gudaha qaybta, bilaabi sawir-gacmeed dusha, ama cabbir u dhexeeya. Ka saar calaamadda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuuxi dhinacyada la goyay\u003C/span\u003E si aad goynta uga aragto qaybaha godan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xir\"\u003EXir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale, ama guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E. Furidda sawir-gacmeed ama xaashiga naqshadda ayaa xirta sidoo kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoyn xaashiga naqshadda (xariiqyo hatch leh iyo xariiqda dusha goynta), isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/span\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003ESamee naqshad (PDF)\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Muuqaalka goynta wuxuu moodeelka ku goyaa dusha si aad gudihiisa u aragto: godad, qodaxyo, qaro-darbiyada, sida qaybaha isku-dhisku ugu jiraan. Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa dhammaan goobaha shaqada iyo isku-dhisyada. Ka fur menu-ga Muuqaalada ee kooxda Muuqaal, Muuqaalka goynta, ama taabo X. Kaarar ayaa ka furmaa geeska hoose ee bidix ee muuqaalka. Muuqaalka kaliya ayaa la goyaa. Qaybta, mugga, qiyaasaha iyo dhoofinta ayaa oo dhan dhammaantood ah, faylkana wax lagu kaydin. Goy dhexda Taabo X. Qaybta waxaa goya dusha hore ee dhexdeeda, dhinacyada la goyay waxaa lagu buuxiyaa midab khafiif ah. Jiid slider-ka Booska, ama ku qor masaafo mm, si aad goynta u dhaqaajiso. Dooro Dusha kale: Hore (XY), Sare (XZ) ama Midig (YZ). Calaamadi Ka goo dhinaca kale si aad u hayso midka la goyay halkii. Goy wajiga Guji Dooro dusha kaarka. Guji wajig fiiqan oo muuqaalka ku jira. Goynta ayaa ka bilaabanta wajigaas, dusha ayaa saaran wajigaas. Dhaqaajiso Booska si aad u gaarto gudaha. Lambarku waa masaafada ku jirta jihada dibadda ee wajiga. Gujyada iyo goynta Gujyada muuqaalka waxay tagaan wixii goynta ka hadha, sidaas darteed waad dooran kartaa wajig ama geesood gudaha qaybta, bilaabi sawir-gacmeed dusha, ama cabbir u dhexeeya. Ka saar calaamadda Buuxi dhinacyada la goyay si aad goynta uga aragto qaybaha godan. Xir Taabo Esc, taabo X mar kale, ama guji Xir. Furidda sawir-gacmeed ama xaashiga naqshadda ayaa xirta sidoo kale. Goyn xaashiga naqshadda (xariiqyo hatch leh iyo xariiqda dusha goynta), isticmaal Naqshad: eeg Samee naqshad (PDF).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"export-files","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dhoofinta daabacaadda, STEP iyo DXF","summary":"Qaybta u dhoofi STL ama 3MF daabacaadda 3D, u dhoofi jidh STEP oo saxda ah barnaamijyada CAD iyo CAM kale, iyo naqshad ama wejiga fidsan sida DXF goynta laser iyo waterjet.","section":"tasks","order":130,"keywords":["dhoofi","kaydi sida","ifc","bim","property sets","stl","3mf","daabacaadda 3d","slicer","step","stp","step saxda ah","b-rep","ap242","ap214","cam","dukaanka birta","milling","dxf","laser","waterjet","cnc","flat pattern","profile","mesh","faceted"],"headings":[{"id":"daabacaadda-3d-stl-ama-3mf","text":"Daabacaadda 3D: STL ama 3MF","level":2},{"id":"barnaamijyada-cad-kale-step","text":"Barnaamijyada CAD kale: STEP","level":2},{"id":"barnaamijyada-bim-ifc-oo-leh-dhammaan-sifooyinka","text":"Barnaamijyada BIM: IFC oo leh dhammaan sifooyinka","level":2},{"id":"profiles-ka-laser-waterjet-ama-cnc-dxf","text":"Profiles-ka laser, waterjet ama CNC: DXF","level":2},{"id":"sawir-gacmeed","text":"Sawir-gacmeed","level":3},{"id":"wejiga-toosan-ee-jidhka","text":"Wejiga toosan ee jidhka","level":3},{"id":"naqshad","text":"Naqshad","level":2},{"id":"qaabab-aan-la-heli-karin","text":"Qaabab aan la heli karin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDhoofintu waa nuqul qaab kale ah. Faylka \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E ha ku hayso sidoo kale: waa kaliya faylka PartCraft mar kale furi karto oo tafatiri karto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaan dhoofinta waxay ku shaqeeyaan qaybta shaashadda ku jirta, millimitir ahaan. Isku-dhisnaha, STL, 3MF, STEP iyo Naqshad (PDF) waxay dhoofiyaan isku-dhisnaha oo dhan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\" data-topic=\"partcraft/assembly-bom-explode\"\u003ELiiska qaybaha, muuqaallada kala go&#039; iyo qaybaha dhaqdhaqaaqa\u003C/a\u003E. Haddii weli aanu jirin jidh: &quot;Weli ma jiro jidh la dhoofin karo.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"daabacaadda-3d-stl-ama-3mf\"\u003EDaabacaadda 3D: STL ama 3MF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhtiyaari: wejiyada wareegsan ee siman, guji meel bannaan si waxba aan loo dooran, kadibna deji \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003EFiican (128 wareeg kasta)\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EAad u fiican (256 wareeg kasta)\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig. STL iyo 3MF had iyo jeer waxay ka samaysan yihiin saddex-geesood.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL, daabacaadda 3D\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3MF, daabacaadda 3D\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylku wuu soo degsadaa. Xaaladda xagga hoose waxay tusaysaa, tusaale ahaan, &quot;Exported Part1.stl (binary, mm, Z up, 1536 triangles).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabada qaab waa \u003Cstrong\u003EZ sare\u003C/strong\u003E, sida daabiyayaasha iyo slicer-yada u filan. Jihada PartCraft ee Y sare (wejiga sare ee Top ee ku jaaqsan) waxay ku sarreysaa slicer-ka, qaybta lagu naqshadeeyay wejiga Top ayaa ku fidsan safaxa. Jihada ugu dambeysa ee loo baahan yahay ka deji slicer-ka haddii loo baahdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E3MF waa qaab cusub, yar, oo slicer-yada akhriyaan iyada oo cabbirka ku jira. Isticmaal STL haddii barnaamij aan aqbalin 3MF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad marka hore u hubiso in qaybtu xidhan tahay, ku habboon tahay safaxa daabiyahaaga, oo ku taagan tahay wejiga fidsan, isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/print-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/print-3d\"\u003EDiyaari qaybta daabacaadda 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barnaamijyada-cad-kale-step\"\u003EBarnaamijyada CAD kale: STEP\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (jidh adag oo saxda ah)\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay qaybta u qorTaa jidh adag oo saxda ah, millimitir ahaan, oo loo jiheeyey Z sare. Wejiyada wareegsan waxay u qoran yihiin silinder, koonn, kubbad iyo torus oo run ah, iyo goobo run ah oo geesahooda ah, si barnaamijka kale u aqoonsado godka sida god. Jidh laga furay faylka STEP wuxuu hayaa wejiyadiisa fidsan, silinderyada, koonnada, kubbadaha iyo torusyada faylkaas, sidaas darteed iyagu sidoo kale si saxda ah ayay u baxaan. Wejiyada aan lahayn sidaas oo kale (dhinaca spline, xarka la moodeelay, jidh ka yimid faylka mesh-ka STL, OBJ ama 3MF, spline-ka faylka STEP, wejiyada la jiidey ama la wareejiyey) waxay ku sii jiraan facet fidsan oo isla jidhka ku jira, habka xaaladda xagga hoose ayaa tirada u sheegta. Xaaladda xagga hoose waxay tusaysaa, tusaale ahaan, &quot;Exported Flange.step (AP242, exact solid, mm, Z up): 14 faces on their true surfaces (10 cylindrical, 1 conical, 0 spherical, 0 toroidal), 0 fitted edge curves.&quot; Waxay hayaa jidhka kaliya: ma jiro taariikh, sawir-gacmeed, ama naqshad. Haddii barnaamijka kale akhriyo AP214 oo kaliya, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (jidh adag oo saxda ah)\u003C/span\u003E: isla jidhka qaab schema-ga hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa saxda ah iyo waxa aan saxda ahayn:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWejiyada fidsan, silinderyada (godadka, bossesyada, fillet-yada geesaha toosan), koonnada (countersink-yada, taper-yada), kubbadaha iyo torusyadu waa kuwo saxda ah, sidoo kale geesahooda toosan, wareegsan iyo ellipse-ka. Dejinta \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E ma beddelayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMeeshii laba wejood oo wareegsan isku jaraan (god la qodey shaft dhexdiisa), geesta waa qallooc siman oo lagu habeeyey labada dusha si ka yar 0.00001 mm; &quot;fitted edge curves&quot; ayaa tirinaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaab-god gudaha qaybta ah waxaa loo qoraa sida god ku jira jidhka. Jidho kala go&#039; oo dhowr ah waxaa loo qoraa sida dhowr jidh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-dhisnaha lama qorin STEP saxda ah weli: dhoofi qayb kasta mid mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa la hubiyay adigoo akhrinaya faylalka dib OpenCascade-ka, kaas oo sheegay jidho sax ah oo mugga la xisaabiyey gacanta. Weli laguma furin dhammaan barnaamijyada CAD ama CAM; haddii mid diido fayl, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa isla qaabka sida wejiyo fidsan (asal ahaan PartCraft, Y sare), oo fadlan noo sheeg adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawimaad\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarbixin ka soo deji dhibaato\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShaqada machining-ka, workspace-ka Manufacture wuxuu sidoo kale qoraa jidhka saxda ah ee nidaamka shaqada ee dejinta: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture#exact-step-for-the-shop\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\" data-hash=\"exact-step-for-the-shop\"\u003ESamee jidadka qalabka iyo G-code\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barnaamijyada-bim-ifc-oo-leh-dhammaan-sifooyinka\"\u003EBarnaamijyada BIM: IFC oo leh dhammaan sifooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC 4 (oo leh dhammaan sifooyinka)\u003C/span\u003E. Waxay qaybta u qorTaa unug IFC 4 oo loogu talo galay moodelada dhismaha iyo warshadaha, qaabkeeda oo ah saddex-geesood (Z sare, millimitir), iyo waxa PartCraft ka ogyahay isagoo ah property sets:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProperty set\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu hayaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPartCraft_Part\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca, agabka iyo kaadhigga, habayn-ka firfircoon, tirada jidhadka; isku-dhisnaha dhexdiisa sidoo kale lambarka qaybta iyo sharaxaadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPartCraft_Parameters\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir kasta oo qaybta ah iyo qiimihiisa; muujinta qaacidada iyo qoraalka waxay ku jiraan sharaxaada sifada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPartCraft_TitleBlock\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobaha blokka cinwaanka naqshadda ee aad buuxisay (cinwaanka, lambarka naqshadda, nooca dib u eegista, shirkadda, kuwa sawiray, hubiyay iyo ansixiyay, taariikhda, dhamaystirka, dulqaadka guud) iyo cabbirka xaashida\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQto_BuildingElementProxyQuantities\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EPartCraft_Quantities\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMugga, dusha, miisaanka (agab la xidhiidha) iyo cabbirka guud\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgabka waxaa lagu xidhaa sida agab IFC ah, lambarka naqshadduna waa tag-ka unugga. Isku-dhisnaha, qayb kasta waxaa lagu qoraa mar sida nooc ah oo ku hayn sifooyinkiisa, nuqul kasta waxaa lagu dhigaa meesha isku-dhisnuhu dhigayo oo qiimihiisa gaarka ah wuxuu ku jiraa \u003Cstrong\u003EPartCraft_Instance\u003C/strong\u003E: magaciisa, lambarka walxaha ee bill of materials-ka, iyo haddii uu yahay qaybta aasaasiga ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"profiles-ka-laser-waterjet-ama-cnc-dxf\"\u003EProfiles-ka laser, waterjet ama CNC: DXF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba nooc oo DXF, labadaba nooca R12, oo dhammaan barnaamijyada CAD iyo CAM furi karaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sawir-gacmeed\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro sawir-gacmeedka taariikhda (ama ha furmo).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah\u003C/span\u003E. (Panelka midig ee sawir-gacmeedka sidoo kale wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoofi DXF\u003C/span\u003E.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad heleysaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt; - &lt;sketch&gt;.dxf\u003C/code\u003E oo ku jira isku-xirnaanta sawir-gacmeedka: xariiqyo, qaansooyin iyo goobo run ah ku jira layer-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EPROFILE\u003C/strong\u003E, joomatriga dhismaha ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003ECONSTRUCTION\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo barar kala go&#039; ah ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003EPOINTS\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"wejiga-toosan-ee-jidhka\"\u003EWejiga toosan ee jidhka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji wejiga toosan ee muuqaalka (tusaale ahaan sare ee saxan leh godad).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoofi wejigga DXF\u003C/span\u003E panelka midig, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad heleysaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt; - face.dxf\u003C/code\u003E: qaabka wejiga iyo godad kasta oo ku jira. God wareegsan (wareeg oo buuxa halka silinder ku kulmo wejiga: god la qodey, ama god ka mid ah fayl STEP la furay) waxaa loo qoraa sida goob run ah oo leh xarunta iyo radius-ka godka. Qaab kasta oo kale waa polyline xidhan, geesaha wareegsan ee ku jira (corners-ka fillet-ka, slots, qaansooyinka) waa facets-kooda, sidaas darteed dejri \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003EFiican\u003C/strong\u003E marka hore haddii goyaha si dhow ugu raacayo. Xaaladda xagga hoose waxay tusaysaa inta qaab ah, inta ka mid ah ee goobo run ah, iyo balaadhinta wejiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii sawir-gacmeed ama wejig toosan aan la dooran: &quot;Fur ama dooro sawir-gacmeed, ama dooro wejig toosan, si aad DXF u dhoofiso.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"naqshad\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshadda PDF waxa ay leedahay tilmaan u gaar ah: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/drawing-pdf\" data-topic=\"partcraft/drawing-pdf\"\u003ESamee xaashi naqshad\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabab-aan-la-heli-karin\"\u003EQaabab aan la heli karin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EglTF, OBJ, IGES iyo Parasolid lama dhoofin dhismahan. DWG waxaa qoraa kaliya variant pack-ka, sida xaashi naqshad: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003ESamee variant pack ka habaynta\u003C/a\u003E. Eeg sidoo kale \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/file-formats\" data-topic=\"partcraft/file-formats\"\u003EQaababka faylalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dhoofintu waa nuqul qaab kale ah. Faylka .partcraft.json ha ku hayso sidoo kale: waa kaliya faylka PartCraft mar kale furi karto oo tafatiri karto. Dhammaan dhoofinta waxay ku shaqeeyaan qaybta shaashadda ku jirta, millimitir ahaan. Isku-dhisnaha, STL, 3MF, STEP iyo Naqshad (PDF) waxay dhoofiyaan isku-dhisnaha oo dhan: eeg Liiska qaybaha, muuqaallada kala go' iyo qaybaha dhaqdhaqaaqa. Haddii weli aanu jirin jidh: \"Weli ma jiro jidh la dhoofin karo.\" Daabacaadda 3D: STL ama 3MF Ikhtiyaari: wejiyada wareegsan ee siman, guji meel bannaan si waxba aan loo dooran, kadibna deji Qalloocyada ilaa Fiican (128 wareeg kasta) ama Aad u fiican (256 wareeg kasta) panelka midig. STL iyo 3MF had iyo jeer waxay ka samaysan yihiin saddex-geesood. Dooro Dhoofi, kadibna STL, daabacaadda 3D ama 3MF, daabacaadda 3D. Faylku wuu soo degsadaa. Xaaladda xagga hoose waxay tusaysaa, tusaale ahaan, \"Exported Part1.stl (binary, mm, Z up, 1536 triangles).\" Labada qaab waa Z sare, sida daabiyayaasha iyo slicer-yada u filan. Jihada PartCraft ee Y sare (wejiga sare ee Top ee ku jaaqsan) waxay ku sarreysaa slicer-ka, qaybta lagu naqshadeeyay wejiga Top ayaa ku fidsan safaxa. Jihada ugu dambeysa ee loo baahan yahay ka deji slicer-ka haddii loo baahdo. 3MF waa qaab cusub, yar, oo slicer-yada akhriyaan iyada oo cabbirka ku jira. Isticmaal STL haddii barnaamij aan aqbalin 3MF. Si aad marka hore u hubiso in qaybtu xidhan tahay, ku habboon tahay safaxa daabiyahaaga, oo ku taagan tahay wejiga fidsan, isticmaal Dhoofi › Hubi daabacaadda 3D (STL ama 3MF)…: eeg Diyaari qaybta daabacaadda 3D. Barnaamijyada CAD kale: STEP Dooro Dhoofi, kadibna STEP AP242 (jidh adag oo saxda ah). Waxay qaybta u qorTaa jidh adag oo saxda ah, millimitir ahaan, oo loo jiheeyey Z sare. Wejiyada wareegsan waxay u qoran yihiin silinder, koonn, kubbad iyo torus oo run ah, iyo goobo run ah oo geesahooda ah, si barnaamijka kale u aqoonsado godka sida god. Jidh laga furay faylka STEP wuxuu hayaa wejiyadiisa fidsan, silinderyada, koonnada, kubbadaha iyo torusyada faylkaas, sidaas darteed iyagu sidoo kale si saxda ah ayay u baxaan. Wejiyada aan lahayn sidaas oo kale (dhinaca spline, xarka la moodeelay, jidh ka yimid faylka mesh-ka STL, OBJ ama 3MF, spline-ka faylka STEP, wejiyada la jiidey ama la wareejiyey) waxay ku sii jiraan facet fidsan oo isla jidhka ku jira, habka xaaladda xagga hoose ayaa tirada u sheegta. Xaaladda xagga hoose waxay tusaysaa, tusaale ahaan, \"Exported Flange.step (AP242, exact solid, mm, Z up): 14 faces on their true surfaces (10 cylindrical, 1 conical, 0 spherical, 0 toroidal), 0 fitted edge curves.\" Waxay hayaa jidhka kaliya: ma jiro taariikh, sawir-gacmeed, ama naqshad. Haddii barnaamijka kale akhriyo AP214 oo kaliya, dooro STEP AP214 (jidh adag oo saxda ah): isla jidhka qaab schema-ga hore. Waxa saxda ah iyo waxa aan saxda ahayn: Wejiyada fidsan, silinderyada (godadka, bossesyada, fillet-yada geesaha toosan), koonnada (countersink-yada, taper-yada), kubbadaha iyo torusyadu waa kuwo saxda ah, sidoo kale geesahooda toosan, wareegsan iyo ellipse-ka. Dejinta Qalloocyada ma beddelayso. Meeshii laba wejood oo wareegsan isku jaraan (god la qodey shaft dhexdiisa), geesta waa qallooc siman oo lagu habeeyey labada dusha si ka yar 0.00001 mm; \"fitted edge curves\" ayaa tirinaya. Qaab-god gudaha qaybta ah waxaa loo qoraa sida god ku jira jidhka. Jidho kala go' oo dhowr ah waxaa loo qoraa sida dhowr jidh. Isku-dhisnaha lama qorin STEP saxda ah weli: dhoofi qayb kasta mid mid. Waa la hubiyay adigoo akhrinaya faylalka dib OpenCascade-ka, kaas oo sheegay jidho sax ah oo mugga la xisaabiyey gacanta. Weli laguma furin dhammaan barnaamijyada CAD ama CAM; haddii mid diido fayl, STEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh) wuxuu qoraa isla qaabka sida wejiyo fidsan (asal ahaan PartCraft, Y sare), oo fadlan noo sheeg adigoo isticmaalaya Caawimaad › Warbixin ka soo deji dhibaato. Shaqada machining-ka, workspace-ka Manufacture wuxuu sidoo kale qoraa jidhka saxda ah ee nidaamka shaqada ee dejinta: eeg Samee jidadka qalabka iyo G-code. Barnaamijyada BIM: IFC oo leh dhammaan sifooyinka Dooro Dhoofi, kadibna IFC 4 (oo leh dhammaan sifooyinka). Waxay qaybta u qorTaa unug IFC 4 oo loogu talo galay moodelada dhismaha iyo warshadaha, qaabkeeda oo ah saddex-geesood (Z sare, millimitir), iyo waxa PartCraft ka ogyahay isagoo ah property sets: Property set Wuxuu hayaa PartCraft_Part Magaca, agabka iyo kaadhigga, habayn-ka firfircoon, tirada jidhadka; isku-dhisnaha dhexdiisa sidoo kale lambarka qaybta iyo sharaxaadda PartCraft_Parameters Cabbir kasta oo qaybta ah iyo qiimihiisa; muujinta qaacidada iyo qoraalka waxay ku jiraan sharaxaada sifada PartCraft_TitleBlock Goobaha blokka cinwaanka naqshadda ee aad buuxisay (cinwaanka, lambarka naqshadda, nooca dib u eegista, shirkadda, kuwa sawiray, hubiyay iyo ansixiyay, taariikhda, dhamaystirka, dulqaadka guud) iyo cabbirka xaashida Qto_BuildingElementProxyQuantities, PartCraft_Quantities Mugga, dusha, miisaanka (agab la xidhiidha) iyo cabbirka guud Agabka waxaa lagu xidhaa sida agab IFC ah, lambarka naqshadduna waa tag-ka unugga. Isku-dhisnaha, qayb kasta waxaa lagu qoraa mar sida nooc ah oo ku hayn sifooyinkiisa, nuqul kasta waxaa lagu dhigaa meesha isku-dhisnuhu dhigayo oo qiimihiisa gaarka ah wuxuu ku jiraa PartCraft_Instance: magaciisa, lambarka walxaha ee bill of materials-ka, iyo haddii uu yahay qaybta aasaasiga ah. Profiles-ka laser, waterjet ama CNC: DXF Laba nooc oo DXF, labadaba nooca R12, oo dhammaan barnaamijyada CAD iyo CAM furi karaan: Sawir-gacmeed Dooro sawir-gacmeedka taariikhda (ama ha furmo). Dooro Dhoofi, kadibna DXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah. (Panelka midig ee sawir-gacmeedka sidoo kale wuxuu leeyahay U dhoofi DXF.) Waxaad heleysaa \u003Cpart\u003E - \u003Csketch\u003E.dxf oo ku jira isku-xirnaanta sawir-gacmeedka: xariiqyo, qaansooyin iyo goobo run ah ku jira layer-ka PROFILE, joomatriga dhismaha ku jira CONSTRUCTION, iyo barar kala go' ah ku jira POINTS. Wejiga toosan ee jidhka Guji wejiga toosan ee muuqaalka (tusaale ahaan sare ee saxan leh godad). Dooro U dhoofi wejigga DXF panelka midig, ama Dhoofi, kadibna DXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah. Waxaad heleysaa \u003Cpart\u003E - face.dxf: qaabka wejiga iyo godad kasta oo ku jira. God wareegsan (wareeg oo buuxa halka silinder ku kulmo wejiga: god la qodey, ama god ka mid ah fayl STEP la furay) waxaa loo qoraa sida goob run ah oo leh xarunta iyo radius-ka godka. Qaab kasta oo kale waa polyline xidhan, geesaha wareegsan ee ku jira (corners-ka fillet-ka, slots, qaansooyinka) waa facets-kooda, sidaas darteed dejri Qalloocyada ilaa Fiican marka hore haddii goyaha si dhow ugu raacayo. Xaaladda xagga hoose waxay tusaysaa inta qaab ah, inta ka mid ah ee goobo run ah, iyo balaadhinta wejiga. Haddii sawir-gacmeed ama wejig toosan aan la dooran: \"Fur ama dooro sawir-gacmeed, ama dooro wejig toosan, si aad DXF u dhoofiso.\" Naqshad Naqshadda PDF waxa ay leedahay tilmaan u gaar ah: Samee xaashi naqshad. Qaabab aan la heli karin glTF, OBJ, IGES iyo Parasolid lama dhoofin dhismahan. DWG waxaa qoraa kaliya variant pack-ka, sida xaashi naqshad: eeg Samee variant pack ka habaynta. Eeg sidoo kale Qaababka faylalka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"print-3d","scope":"partcraft","title":"Diyaarinta qayb loo daabacayo 3D","summary":"Hubi in qayb ama isku-dhis xidhan yahay, ku habboon yahay daabacahaaga, oo taagan yahay sal; ka dib soo dejiso STL ama 3MF si aad ugu isticmaasho slicer-kaaga.","section":"tasks","order":131,"keywords":["daabacaadda 3d","3d print","daabacaha","print","slicer","stl","3mf","xidhan","closed","manifold","bed","cabbirka bed-ka","build plate","overhang","supports","sal","millimeter","dhoofin","threads","clearance"],"headings":[{"id":"hubi-oo-soo-deji","text":"Hubi oo soo deji","level":2},{"id":"waxa-wada-hadalku-sheegi-karo","text":"Waxa wada-hadalku sheegi karo","level":2},{"id":"xiiro-oo-daabac","text":"Xiiro oo daabac","level":2},{"id":"wejiyo-wareegsan-oo-siman","text":"Wejiyo wareegsan oo siman","level":2},{"id":"weyn-yar-ama-qaybo","text":"Weyn, yar, ama qaybo","level":2},{"id":"lama-hubin","text":"Lama hubin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESlicer-ku wuxuu u baahan yahay qaab xidhan: aan godad lahayn, wejiyada oo dhan u jeedaan dibadda, aanay wax isaga dhex mari. Qaybaha PartCraft dhisto waa xidhan yihiin dhismaha, sidaas darteed hubintu badanaa waxay kuu sheegtaa cabbirka, in ay ku habboon tahay bed-ka daabacahaaga, in ay ku taagan tahay wajig siman, iyo inta ay ka soo baxdo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-oo-soo-deji\"\u003EHubi oo soo deji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkhtiyaari, mar keliya: deji bed-ka daabacahaaga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › PartCraft › \u003Cstrong\u003E3D printer\u003C/strong\u003E: ballac, qoto iyo joog millimeter-ka. Ka tag faaruq haddii aadan rabin hubintaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, ka dib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck for 3D printing (STL or 3MF)…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWada-hadalku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Ready to print&quot; ama &quot;Not ready to print&quot;, wuxuuna liistaa wax kasta oo khaldan, wuxuuna siinayaa cabbirka bed-ka (X × Y × Z, millimeter), mugga iyo tirada saddexagallada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload 3MF\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload STL\u003C/span\u003E. Faylku waa isku mid kan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3MF, for 3D printing\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL, for 3D printing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhis dhexdiisa, hubinta iyo faylalku waxay qaadaan isku-dhis oo dhan, nuqul kasta meesha lagu meeleeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta waxa lagu hubiyaa sida dhoofintu u qorto, taagan: wixii PartCraft ku sare u tilmaamo (toosan dusha sare) ayaa bed-ka sare u tilmaama. Qayb lagu naqshadeeyay dusha sare waa jiifa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-wada-hadalku-sheegi-karo\"\u003EWaxa wada-hadalku sheegi karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENot ready to print\u003C/strong\u003E (slicer-ku wuu diidi karaa ama wuu si khaldan u daabici karaa): godad (geesaha leh wajig hal dhinac kaliya), geesaha ay wadaagaan saddex wajig ama ka badan, wejiyo u jeeda dhinacyo kala duwan, jidh gudahiisa dibadda loo rogay, ama jidh isku gudba. Qayb ku dhisan PartCraft waa inaysan waligeed soo bandhigin kuwan; haddii ay soo baxdo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\"\u003EXalinta dhibaatada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDigniin\u003C/strong\u003E (wuu daabacaa, laakiin marka hore fiiri):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa weyn bed-ka daabacahaaga\u003C/strong\u003E, xitaa haddii la rogo 90°.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxba ma taagna hoosta\u003C/strong\u003E: rog qaybta slicer-ka si wajig uu bed-ka taageero, haddii kale waxay u baahan doontaa supports ama raft.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa baxa in ka badan 45° toosnaanta\u003C/strong\u003E: wejiyadaas waxay u baahan yihiin taageero sida ay hadda tahay. Hab kale oo sare oo loo rogo ayaa yaree karta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJidhadka kala duwan way isku dhacaan\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Ewejiga ayay isku kulmaan\u003C/strong\u003E: slicer-ku badanaa wuu isku daraa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECombine\u003C/span\u003E ee Features › More ayaa isku xidha hal jidh. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/bodies\" data-topic=\"partcraft/bodies\"\u003EJidhadka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa yar 1 mm dhinac kasta\u003C/strong\u003E: hubi cabbirka qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiiro-oo-daabac\"\u003EXiiro oo daabac\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiiro la moodeelay wuxuu u daabacaa sida xiir dhab ah. Siiso \u003Cstrong\u003EClearance\u003C/strong\u003E si boolt la daabacay ugu gasho qolqol la daabacay: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/threads\" data-topic=\"partcraft/threads\"\u003EXiirashada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wejiyo-wareegsan-oo-siman\"\u003EWejiyo wareegsan oo siman\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESTL iyo 3MF waxay ka samaysan yihiin saddexagallo. Wejiyo wareegsan oo siman, guji meel bannaan si waxba loo dooran, ka dibna deji \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003EFine (128 per turn)\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EVery fine (256 per turn)\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig, ka hor inta aadan dhoofin. Saddexagallo badan ayaa faylal waaweyn samaynaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weyn-yar-ama-qaybo\"\u003EWeyn, yar, ama qaybo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExport › Scale for printing (STL or 3MF)…\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa qaybta oo cabbirkeeda lagu beddelay axis kasta iyada oo aan wax laga beddelin: \u003Cstrong\u003Eogolaanshaha yaraynta\u003C/strong\u003E boqolkiiba (cabbir × (1 + s), ama cabbirka saxda ah ÷ (1 − s)) oo loogu talagalay naqshadda tuurista, ama isugeynta fudud, oo ku salaysan dhexda, geeska ugu hoose, dhexda hoose ama bilowga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EExport › Split for printing (a zip of pieces)…\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu jejebiyaa qayb aad u weyn daabacahaaga, qaybo kasta oo ku habboon bed-ka aad bixiso, oo ay ku xirmaan dhoobo (pegs), furayaal, dovetails, godad dowel ah ama jeebab magnet ah (fogaanta aad dejisay ku jirta), qayb kasta iyo isku-xidhkiisa oo la lambarado, wuxuuna keydiyaa qaybaha STL ama 3MF zip ah oo leh xaashi isku-dhis. Qaybta laftiisu ma beddelmayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lama-hubin\"\u003ELama hubin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhumucda darbiga, faahfaahinta ka yar nozzle-kaaga, iyo sida slicer-ku u dhigayo supports. Slicer-kaaga ayaa tusa kuwaas.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Slicer-ku wuxuu u baahan yahay qaab xidhan: aan godad lahayn, wejiyada oo dhan u jeedaan dibadda, aanay wax isaga dhex mari. Qaybaha PartCraft dhisto waa xidhan yihiin dhismaha, sidaas darteed hubintu badanaa waxay kuu sheegtaa cabbirka, in ay ku habboon tahay bed-ka daabacahaaga, in ay ku taagan tahay wajig siman, iyo inta ay ka soo baxdo. Hubi oo soo deji Ikhtiyaari, mar keliya: deji bed-ka daabacahaaga Settings › PartCraft › 3D printer: ballac, qoto iyo joog millimeter-ka. Ka tag faaruq haddii aadan rabin hubintaas. Dooro Export, ka dib Check for 3D printing (STL or 3MF)…. Wada-hadalku wuxuu leeyahay \"Ready to print\" ama \"Not ready to print\", wuxuuna liistaa wax kasta oo khaldan, wuxuuna siinayaa cabbirka bed-ka (X × Y × Z, millimeter), mugga iyo tirada saddexagallada. Riix Download 3MF ama Download STL. Faylku waa isku mid kan Export › 3MF, for 3D printing ama STL, for 3D printing. Isku-dhis dhexdiisa, hubinta iyo faylalku waxay qaadaan isku-dhis oo dhan, nuqul kasta meesha lagu meeleeyay. Qaybta waxa lagu hubiyaa sida dhoofintu u qorto, taagan: wixii PartCraft ku sare u tilmaamo (toosan dusha sare) ayaa bed-ka sare u tilmaama. Qayb lagu naqshadeeyay dusha sare waa jiifa. Waxa wada-hadalku sheegi karo Not ready to print (slicer-ku wuu diidi karaa ama wuu si khaldan u daabici karaa): godad (geesaha leh wajig hal dhinac kaliya), geesaha ay wadaagaan saddex wajig ama ka badan, wejiyo u jeeda dhinacyo kala duwan, jidh gudahiisa dibadda loo rogay, ama jidh isku gudba. Qayb ku dhisan PartCraft waa inaysan waligeed soo bandhigin kuwan; haddii ay soo baxdo, eeg Xalinta dhibaatada. Digniin (wuu daabacaa, laakiin marka hore fiiri): Ka weyn bed-ka daabacahaaga, xitaa haddii la rogo 90°. Waxba ma taagna hoosta: rog qaybta slicer-ka si wajig uu bed-ka taageero, haddii kale waxay u baahan doontaa supports ama raft. Ka baxa in ka badan 45° toosnaanta: wejiyadaas waxay u baahan yihiin taageero sida ay hadda tahay. Hab kale oo sare oo loo rogo ayaa yaree karta. Jidhadka kala duwan way isku dhacaan ama wejiga ayay isku kulmaan: slicer-ku badanaa wuu isku daraa. Combine ee Features › More ayaa isku xidha hal jidh. Eeg Jidhadka. Ka yar 1 mm dhinac kasta: hubi cabbirka qaybta. Xiiro oo daabac Xiiro la moodeelay wuxuu u daabacaa sida xiir dhab ah. Siiso Clearance si boolt la daabacay ugu gasho qolqol la daabacay: eeg Xiirashada. Wejiyo wareegsan oo siman STL iyo 3MF waxay ka samaysan yihiin saddexagallo. Wejiyo wareegsan oo siman, guji meel bannaan si waxba loo dooran, ka dibna deji Curves ilaa Fine (128 per turn) ama Very fine (256 per turn) panelka midig, ka hor inta aadan dhoofin. Saddexagallo badan ayaa faylal waaweyn samaynaya. Weyn, yar, ama qaybo Export › Scale for printing (STL or 3MF)… wuxuu kaydiyaa qaybta oo cabbirkeeda lagu beddelay axis kasta iyada oo aan wax laga beddelin: ogolaanshaha yaraynta boqolkiiba (cabbir × (1 + s), ama cabbirka saxda ah ÷ (1 − s)) oo loogu talagalay naqshadda tuurista, ama isugeynta fudud, oo ku salaysan dhexda, geeska ugu hoose, dhexda hoose ama bilowga. Export › Split for printing (a zip of pieces)… wuxuu jejebiyaa qayb aad u weyn daabacahaaga, qaybo kasta oo ku habboon bed-ka aad bixiso, oo ay ku xirmaan dhoobo (pegs), furayaal, dovetails, godad dowel ah ama jeebab magnet ah (fogaanta aad dejisay ku jirta), qayb kasta iyo isku-xidhkiisa oo la lambarado, wuxuuna keydiyaa qaybaha STL ama 3MF zip ah oo leh xaashi isku-dhis. Qaybta laftiisu ma beddelmayso. Lama hubin Dhumucda darbiga, faahfaahinta ka yar nozzle-kaaga, iyo sida slicer-ku u dhigayo supports. Slicer-kaaga ayaa tusa kuwaas.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"solid-fem-check","scope":"partcraft","title":"Solid FEM: hubinta xoogga hal qayb","summary":"Shid add-on-ka Solid FEM, qaybta mesh garee, dooro wejiyada go'an iyo culeyska muuqaalka 3D, xal, kadibna akhri barashada iyo xoogga von Mises ee moodelka.","section":"tasks","order":132,"keywords":["solid fem","unugyada xadidan","fea","xoog","von mises","barasho","wejig go'an","culeys","cadaad","xoogga dhulka","soo noqnoqda dabiiciga ah","qaabka hab-dhaqdhaqaaqa","mesh","add-on"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid","level":2},{"id":"tallaabooyinka","text":"Tallaabooyinka","level":2},{"id":"xusuusin","text":"Xusuusin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-samayn-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad samayn doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubi hal qayb jir ah oo culeys hoostiisa: meesha ay ka dhaqaajayso iyo meesha xoogga uu ugu sarreeyo. Daraasaddu waa toos iyo qallooc, sidaas darteed waa caawin hubin; injineerkaaga ayaa dib u eegaya natiijooyinka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tallaabooyinka\"\u003ETallaabooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKordhinno\u003C/span\u003E oo shid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolid FEM\u003C/span\u003E (way damaysaa ilaa aad samayso). Fur tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolid FEM\u003C/span\u003E guddiga midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgab\u003C/span\u003E dooro mid, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGaar ah\u003C/span\u003E oo qor Poisson ratio, kuufta iyo xoogga dhalinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar wejiyada go&#039;an\u003C/span\u003E, guji wejiyada la haysto muuqaalka 3D, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar culeys adigoo isticmaalaya \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar xoog\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar cadaad\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar xoogga dhulka\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna dooro wejigyadeeda sidii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQaybta mesh garee\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXal\u003C/span\u003E. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo noqnoqda dabiiciga ah\u003C/span\u003E hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDaraasad\u003C/span\u003E marka hore haddii aad rabto soo noqnoqyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhri \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENatiijooyinka\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDigniinno\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji moodelka dushiisa\u003C/span\u003E si aad u sawirto xoogga von Mises, barasho ama qaabka hab-dhaqdhaqaaqa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa saar sawirka\u003C/span\u003E wuu ka saaraa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xusuusin\"\u003EXusuusin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBogga wuxuu xalinayaa ilaa tiro go&#039;an oo unugyo ah; sadarka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa marka cabbirka unugga aad u yar yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXoogga wejiyada go&#039;an, barooyinka culeysku iyo geesaha yaraha wuu kordhaa marka mesh-ka la farsameeyo. Farsami oo isbarbar dhig ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaynin heerka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqoshada, dejintuna waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaraasadaha dhalinta iyo xiriirka eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHubi xoogga iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Waxa aad samayn doontid Hubi hal qayb jir ah oo culeys hoostiisa: meesha ay ka dhaqaajayso iyo meesha xoogga uu ugu sarreeyo. Daraasaddu waa toos iyo qallooc, sidaas darteed waa caawin hubin; injineerkaaga ayaa dib u eegaya natiijooyinka. Tallaabooyinka Dooro Dejinta › Kordhinno oo shid Solid FEM (way damaysaa ilaa aad samayso). Fur tab-ka Solid FEM guddiga midig. Hoosta Agab dooro mid, ama Gaar ah oo qor Poisson ratio, kuufta iyo xoogga dhalinta. Riix Ku dar wejiyada go'an, guji wejiyada la haysto muuqaalka 3D, kadibna riix Done. Ku dar culeys adigoo isticmaalaya Ku dar xoog, Ku dar cadaad ama Ku dar xoogga dhulka, kadibna dooro wejigyadeeda sidii hore. Riix Qaybta mesh garee, kadibna Xal. Dooro Soo noqnoqda dabiiciga ah hoosta Daraasad marka hore haddii aad rabto soo noqnoqyada. Akhri Natiijooyinka iyo Digniinno, kadibna riix Muuji moodelka dushiisa si aad u sawirto xoogga von Mises, barasho ama qaabka hab-dhaqdhaqaaqa; Ka saar sawirka wuu ka saaraa. Xusuusin Bogga wuxuu xalinayaa ilaa tiro go'an oo unugyo ah; sadarka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa marka cabbirka unugga aad u yar yahay. Xoogga wejiyada go'an, barooyinka culeysku iyo geesaha yaraha wuu kordhaa marka mesh-ka la farsameeyo. Farsami oo isbarbar dhig ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaynin heerka sare. Beddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqoshada, dejintuna waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta. Daraasadaha dhalinta iyo xiriirka eeg Hubi xoogga iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dhoofi qayb ama isku-dhis oo USD ah","summary":"Qayb, ama isku-dhis oo dhan oo qayb kasta mar keliya lagu qoro oo nuqul kasta meesha isku-dhisku dhigayo, u qor xidhmo USD ah.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usdz","openusd","dhoofin","isku-dhis","xidhmo","rendar","masraxa"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhmada USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayb ahaan, faylku wuxuu hayaa jidhka qaybta oo leh agabkeeda, mugeeda iyo culeyskeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsku-dhis ahaan, qayb kasta waa la qoraa mar keliya, nuqul kasta waxaa lagu dhigaa meesha isku-dhisku dhigayo, sidaas darteed faylku wuu yaraadaa in kasta oo nuqulo badan yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa mm oo Y kor u taagan; faylka USD waa m oo Z kor u taagan, sida inta badan barnaamijyada 3D rajeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dooro Dhoofi › Xidhmada USD (.usdz). Qayb ahaan, faylku wuxuu hayaa jidhka qaybta oo leh agabkeeda, mugeeda iyo culeyskeeda. Isku-dhis ahaan, qayb kasta waa la qoraa mar keliya, nuqul kasta waxaa lagu dhigaa meesha isku-dhisku dhigayo, sidaas darteed faylku wuu yaraadaa in kasta oo nuqulo badan yihiin. PartCraft wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa mm oo Y kor u taagan; faylka USD waa m oo Z kor u taagan, sida inta badan barnaamijyada 3D rajeeyaan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"drawing-pdf","scope":"partcraft","title":"Samee naqshad leh muuqaallo, qayb iyo GD&T","summary":"Fur xaashida naqshadda, ku dar qayb iyo muuqaal faahfaahin, dhig datum-yada, feature control frame-yada iyo calaamadaha dhammaystirka dusha, dooro cabbirka xaashida, buuxi qaybta cinwaanka iyo dib-u-eegyada, oo dhoofi xaashida PDF ahaan.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["miiska godadka","jaantus godadka","booska godadka","tagyada","naqshad","naqshad 2d","xaashi","cabbirka xaashida","a4","a3","a2","a1","a0","ansi","qaybta cinwaanka","dib-u-eeg","qaybta dib-u-eegista","lambarka naqshadda","agabka","pdf","muuqaallo","orthographic","third angle","isometric","muuqaalka qaybta","muuqaalka faahfaahinta","gd&t","datum","feature control frame","dulqaad","booska","flatness","dhammaystirka dusha","roughness","daabacaad"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-xaashida-naqshadda","text":"Fur xaashida naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xaashida-ku-jira","text":"Waxa xaashida ku jira","level":2},{"id":"dooro-cabbirka-xaashida","text":"Dooro cabbirka xaashida","level":2},{"id":"buuxi-qaybta-cinwaanka","text":"Buuxi qaybta cinwaanka","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-dib-u-eegyo","text":"Ku dar dib-u-eegyo","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-muuqaal-qayb","text":"Ku dar muuqaal qayb","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-muuqaal-faahfaahin","text":"Ku dar muuqaal faahfaahin","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-miiska-godadka","text":"Ku dar miiska godadka","level":2},{"id":"dhig-calaamadaha-gd-t-iyo-dhammaystirka-dusha","text":"Dhig calaamadaha GD&T iyo dhammaystirka dusha","level":2},{"id":"datum","text":"Datum","level":3},{"id":"feature-control-frame","text":"Feature control frame","level":3},{"id":"dhammaystirka-dusha","text":"Dhammaystirka dusha","level":3},{"id":"dhoofi-pdf","text":"Dhoofi PDF","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadyo","text":"Xaddidaadyo","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-xaashida-inay-sameyso","text":"Ka dhig xaashida inay sameyso","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu qaybta ka sameeyaa xaashi naqshad: muuqaalka hore, sare iyo midig oo ku salaysan third-angle projection, muuqaal isometric, cabbirada guud iyo qaybta cinwaanka xaashi ka A4 ilaa A0 ama ANSI A ilaa E. Waxaad ku dari kartaa qayb, muuqaal faahfaahin iyo calaamadaha GD&amp;T. Xaashidu waa cusboonaysiiyaa markii qaybta la beddelo, dejinteedana waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-xaashida-naqshadda\"\u003EFur xaashida naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhis qaybta. (Haddii aan wax la dhisin: &quot;Marka hore dhis solid, kadibna samee naqshaddiisa.&quot;)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka 3D waxaa lagu beddelaa xaashida. Toolbar-ka waxaa ku qoran \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatum\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrame\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaystir\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib\u003C/span\u003E, panelka midig waxaa madax u ah \u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshad\u003C/strong\u003E. Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa sida muuqaalladu loo sameeyay: &quot;Naqshad (curves are drawn as facets). Datum, Frame and Finish place GD&amp;T on a view; the panel sets a section and a detail view.&quot; Muuqaalladu waxay ka soo baxaan facets-ka mesh kernel-ka, sidaas darteed geesaha wareegsan waa jajabyo toosan gaagaaban; arcs run ah waxay u baahan yihiin exact kernel, taas oo nooca hadda ma lahan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashida ku wareeg: ku wareeji mishiinka si aad u weyneyso, ku jiid badhanka midig ama dhexe si aad u rarto, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad xaashida u buuxiso. Xaashida xulasho lagu saaray, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa weyneyn-yaryn, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa rarta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib ugu noqo moodeelka\u003C/span\u003E ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (marka wax la xulan waayo oo qalab aan shaqeynin) si aad dib ugu noqoto moodeelka 3D.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xaashida-ku-jira\"\u003EWaxa xaashida ku jira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaashida aad doorato\u003C/strong\u003E, oo jiifta (A3 haddii aadan kale dooran), oo leh xuduud iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybta cinwaanka\u003C/strong\u003E: cinwaanka, shirkadda, lambarka naqshadda, dib-u-eegista, agabka, la sameeyay / la hubiyay / la ansixiyay, taariikhda, miisaanka, cabbirka xaashida, &quot;Units: millimetres · Third-angle projection&quot;, iyo in muuqaalladu yihiin kuwo sax ah ama facet ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta dib-u-eegista\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku taal geeska sare ee midig markaad ku darto dib-u-eeg.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalada hore, sare iyo midig\u003C/strong\u003E: muuqaalka sare ayaa ka sarreeya muuqaalka hore, muuqaalka midig wuxuu ku yaallaa midigtiisa. Geesaha qarsoon waa dashed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaal isometric\u003C/strong\u003E meel u fadhiya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada guud\u003C/strong\u003E: ballac iyo dherer muuqaalka hore, qoto-dheer muuqaalka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaan\u003C/strong\u003E keliya muuqaalada ugu waaweyn oo ka tirsan taxanaha ISO (1:1, 1:2, 1:5 … 2:1, 5:1, 10:1), oo la doortay si ay ugu habboonaadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-cabbirka-xaashida\"\u003EDooro cabbirka xaashida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaashida naqshadda, marka wax la xulan waayo, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXaashi\u003C/span\u003E panelka midig: \u003Cstrong\u003EA4, A3, A2, A1, A0\u003C/strong\u003E (ISO 216) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EANSI A, B, C, D, E\u003C/strong\u003E (11 × 8.5 ilaa 44 × 34 in). Muuqaalada mar kale ayaa la habeeyaa miisaanka ISO ee ugu weyn ee ku habboon, sidaas darteed xaashi weyn ayaa qaybta weyn tusi karta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"buuxi-qaybta-cinwaanka\"\u003EBuuxi qaybta cinwaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobaha \u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta cinwaanka\u003C/strong\u003E ee panelka midig waxay si toos ah xaashida ugu tagaan: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECinwaanka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELambarka naqshadda\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib-u-eeg\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShirkad\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELagu sawiray\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELa hubiyay\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELa ansixiyay\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaariikh\u003C/span\u003E (sanad-bil-maalin), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDulqaadka guud\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaystir\u003C/span\u003E (labadan ugu dambeeya waxay ku daabacmaan kor u dhow qaybta cinwaanka). Ku qor sanduuqa oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji meel kale. Sanduuq madhan wuxuu ka tagaa unugiisa madhan, marka laga reebo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECinwaanka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa magaca qaybta ilaa aad qori.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETaariikh\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa maanta ilaa aad qori.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDib-u-eeg\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa dib-u-eegga ugu dambeeya ee liiska ilaa aad qori.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka imanayaa qaybta: guji meel madhan oo moodeelka ku jira, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgab\u003C/span\u003E qaybta Part. Isla agabka wuxuu siinayaa Measure cufnaanta xisaabinta muuqaalka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-dib-u-eegyo\"\u003EKu dar dib-u-eegyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EDib-u-eegyada\u003C/strong\u003E, guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar dib-u-eeg\u003C/span\u003E. Safka cusub kasta wuxuu qaadanayaa xarfta xigta (A, B, C …, ka dib Z waa AA) iyo taariikhda maanta. Qor waxa la beddelay iyo cidda beddeshay. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa safka. Qaybta dib-u-eegista ee geeska sare ee midig wuxuu liistaa dhammaantood, kii ugu hore marka hore, ilaa 20.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirka xaashida, qaybta cinwaanka, dib-u-eegyada iyo agabka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta, isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa noqo\u003C/span\u003E ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-muuqaal-qayb\"\u003EKu dar muuqaal qayb\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta waxaa jarta dhinac diyaaradeed, jarista waxaa lagu hoosaynayaa hatch. Sida muuqaalada kale, qaybta waxaa laga sameeyaa facets, sidaas darteed geesaha wareegsan waa jajabyo toosan gaagaaban.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelka midig, deji \u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta A-A\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka hore\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka sare\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka midig\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybtu waxay ka soo muuqanaysaa xaashida, oo hoosaysan meelaha jarku gudbo agab, iyada oo xariiqda jarka iyo fallaadhaha &quot;A&quot; ay ku yaallaan muuqaalka laga qaaday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EJar ku dhig (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u beddesho diyaaradda jarka. Waxay ka bilaabataa dhexda qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EQaybta A-A\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003EMidna\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u tirtirto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-muuqaal-faahfaahin\"\u003EKu dar muuqaal faahfaahin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EFaahfaahin B\u003C/strong\u003E muuqaalka aad weyneyneyso (ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji bartilmaameedka aad weyneyneyso, muuqaalkaas dhexdiisa. Goobo ku qoran &quot;B&quot; ayaa calaamadeynaysa, faahfaahinta weyneysay &quot;Detail B&quot; ayaa ka soo muuqanaysa xaashida iyada oo miisaan u gaar ah, tusaale ahaan &quot;Detail B (2:1)&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EGobolka faahfaahinta (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E cabbirka goobada iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EMiisaanka faahfaahinta\u003C/strong\u003E weynaynta: 2, 4, 5 ama 10 × xaashida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaahfaahinta waxaa laga qaadi karaa muuqaalka hore, sare, midig ama jarka, laakiin ma aha muuqaalka isometric. Haddii meel uu ku filan yahay aanu jirin muuqaal kasta, panelku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;No room on the sheet for: detail. Make the detail smaller or drop a view.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-miiska-godadka\"\u003EKu dar miiska godadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska godadka wuxuu liistaa godadka qaybta iyo meelahooda, oo loo baahan yahay daloolinta ama CNC: dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMiiska godadka\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka sare\u003C/strong\u003E (ama hore, ama midig) panelka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGod kasta oo laga arko muuqaalkaas end-on wuxuu helaa tag ag yaal: \u003Cstrong\u003EA1\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EA2\u003C/strong\u003E … cabbirka koowaad, \u003Cstrong\u003EB1\u003C/strong\u003E … cabbirka xiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiiska wuxuu liistaa tag kasta, \u003Cstrong\u003EX\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EY\u003C/strong\u003E mm, iyo cabbirkiisa: &quot;Ø14 THRU&quot;, &quot;Ø6.6 × 10 DEEP&quot;, counterbore ama countersink, ama godka dhagaysan ee thread-kiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EX iyo Y waxaa laga qaadaa geeska hoose ee bidix ee muuqaalka, oo lagu calaamadeeyay \u003Cstrong\u003EX0 Y0\u003C/strong\u003E xaashida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGodadka ay sameeyeen pattern-yada way ku jiraan. Godadka aan ku jajabnayn muuqaalka waa la tirinayaa panelka oo waa laga reebay miiska.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiiska waxaa lagu rakibaa meel bannaan oo xaashida ka mid ah iyo PDF-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhig-calaamadaha-gd-t-iyo-dhammaystirka-dusha\"\u003EDhig calaamadaha GD&amp;T iyo dhammaystirka dusha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDatum\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrame\u003C/span\u003E (feature control frame) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaystir\u003C/span\u003E (calaamadda dhammaystirka dusha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji barta muuqaalka halkaas oo ay ku xirmayso. Waxay ku qabsanaysaa xariiqda la rasmeeyay ee ugu dhow 2.5 mm dhexdeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadda waxay ka soo muuqanaysaa iyada oo leh xariiq hoose, la xulay, panelka midigna wuxuu muujinayaa dejinteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamad jiid si aad u dhaqaajiso; xariiqdeedu waxay ku sii jirtaa barta. Calaamad la xulay, furayaasha fallaadhaha waxay dhaqaajiyaan 1 mm. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E panelka) wuu tirtiraa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaystir\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa ka saaraa xulashada. Isbeddel kasta wuxuu ku jiraa liiska ka noqoshada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"datum\"\u003EDatum\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXarfta\u003C/strong\u003E: A ilaa Z, laakiin ma jiraan I, O iyo Q (waxay u akhrisan karaan 1, 0 iyo O). Datum kasta cusub wuxuu qaadanayaa xarfta xigta ee bannaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"feature-control-frame\"\u003EFeature control frame\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDulqaadka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStraightness, Flatness, Circularity, Cylindricity, Profile of a line, Profile of a surface, Perpendicularity, Angularity, Parallelism, Position, Concentricity iyo Symmetry (labadaba waa laga saaray Y14.5-2018, waana lagu calaamadeeyay), Circular runout, Total runout\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGobolka (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiimaha dulqaadka, caadiga ah 0.1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGobolka dhexroorka (⌀)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifooyinka leh gobol silinder; default ahaan ayaa looga furan yahay Position\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERFS (midna), MMC (Ⓜ), LMC (Ⓛ), halka sifada ay ogolaato\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDatum-ka koowaad / labaad / saddexaad\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlaa saddex xarfood oo datum ah, mid kasta oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003E… modifier\u003C/strong\u003E (MMB, LMB) halka la ogolyahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu hubiyaa frame-ka iyada oo loo eegayo xeerarka ASME Y14.5 wuxuuna sheegaa waxa khaldan dhanka sare ee panelka, tusaale ahaan &quot;Flatness is a form tolerance: it takes no datum references.&quot; ama &quot;Position needs at least one datum reference.&quot; Safka \u003Cstrong\u003EAkhri\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hadal ku sharxayaa frame-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"dhammaystirka-dusha\"\u003EDhammaystirka dusha\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadiga\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERa (µm)\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECelceliska roughness-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1.6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHabka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehabka kasta, machined, aan agab laga qaadin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emachined\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQoraal\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlaa 40 xaraf, sida lay ama habka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka wax la xulin, panelku wuxuu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003EQoraallada xaashida\u003C/strong\u003E, mid kasta oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003EDooro\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhoofi-pdf\"\u003EDhoofi PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi PDF\u003C/span\u003E panelka, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad (PDF): muuqaallada, qaybta, faahfaahinta, GD&amp;T\u003C/span\u003E moodeelka ka. PDF-ka waxaa laga soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part name&gt; - drawing.pdf\u003C/code\u003E, status bar-kuna wuxuu liistaa waxa ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu daabac &quot;Actual size&quot; warqad cabbirkeeda xaashida la mid ah si miisaanka u sax ahaado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadyo\"\u003EXaddidaadyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirro kale oo ka duwan saddexda cabbir ee guud\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar PDF-ka barnaamij markup ah, ama dhoofi sketch ama face DXF ahaan oo cabbir ku dar barnaamij 2D CAD ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa badan hal qayb ama faahfaahin; muuqaallada broken-out, auxiliary iyo projected\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama heli karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirst-angle projection, muuqaallo dhaqaajiya, xaashiyo bortreed ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThird angle, habeynta otomaatiga ah, jiif\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraallo xor ah iyo miisas xaashida (ka soo horreeya qaybta cinwaanka iyo dib-u-eegga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal qoraalka dhammaystirka, ama ku dar qoraal PDF-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshadaha isku-dhisyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama heli karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarfaha ka baxsan kooxda Yurub ee Galbeedka waxay ku daabacmaan &quot;?&quot; (PDF-ku wuxuu isticmaalaa Helvetica ee akhristaha). Calaamadaha GD&amp;T waxaa lagu sawiraa xariiqyo, sidaas darteed waxay ku daabacmaan akhristaha kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-xaashida-inay-sameyso\"\u003EKa dhig xaashida inay sameyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXaashi › Automatic\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu kuu doortaa warqadda: miisaanka caadiga ah ee ugu weyn ilaa 1:1, xaashida A-size ee ugu yar ee muuqaalada ku haysa miisaankaas (liistu wuxuu muujinayaa midda la doortay).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir godadka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu cabbiraa godadka muuqaalka ay ugu badan yihiin end-on: calaamad dhexe mid kasta, hal callout cabbir kasta (&quot;2× Ø6 THRU&quot; oo leh xariiq), iyo meelahooda oo laga qaadayo geeska hoose ee bidix ee muuqaalka. Ballaca guud, dherer iyo qoto-dheer weligood way jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"PartCraft wuxuu qaybta ka sameeyaa xaashi naqshad: muuqaalka hore, sare iyo midig oo ku salaysan third-angle projection, muuqaal isometric, cabbirada guud iyo qaybta cinwaanka xaashi ka A4 ilaa A0 ama ANSI A ilaa E. Waxaad ku dari kartaa qayb, muuqaal faahfaahin iyo calaamadaha GD&T. Xaashidu waa cusboonaysiiyaa markii qaybta la beddelo, dejinteedana waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta. Fur xaashida naqshadda Dhis qaybta. (Haddii aan wax la dhisin: \"Marka hore dhis solid, kadibna samee naqshaddiisa.\") Dooro Naqshad toolbar-ka. Muuqaalka 3D waxaa lagu beddelaa xaashida. Toolbar-ka waxaa ku qoran Datum, Frame, Dhammaystir, Faahfaahin, PDF iyo Dib, panelka midig waxaa madax u ah Naqshad. Status bar-ku wuxuu sheegayaa sida muuqaalladu loo sameeyay: \"Naqshad (curves are drawn as facets). Datum, Frame and Finish place GD&T on a view; the panel sets a section and a detail view.\" Muuqaalladu waxay ka soo baxaan facets-ka mesh kernel-ka, sidaas darteed geesaha wareegsan waa jajabyo toosan gaagaaban; arcs run ah waxay u baahan yihiin exact kernel, taas oo nooca hadda ma lahan. Xaashida ku wareeg: ku wareeji mishiinka si aad u weyneyso, ku jiid badhanka midig ama dhexe si aad u rarto, riix F si aad xaashida u buuxiso. Xaashida xulasho lagu saaray, + iyo − waa weyneyn-yaryn, Shift oo leh furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa rarta. Dooro Dib, Dib ugu noqo moodeelka ama riix Esc (marka wax la xulan waayo oo qalab aan shaqeynin) si aad dib ugu noqoto moodeelka 3D. Waxa xaashida ku jira Xaashida aad doorato, oo jiifta (A3 haddii aadan kale dooran), oo leh xuduud iyo qaybta cinwaanka: cinwaanka, shirkadda, lambarka naqshadda, dib-u-eegista, agabka, la sameeyay / la hubiyay / la ansixiyay, taariikhda, miisaanka, cabbirka xaashida, \"Units: millimetres · Third-angle projection\", iyo in muuqaalladu yihiin kuwo sax ah ama facet ah. Qaybta dib-u-eegista oo ku taal geeska sare ee midig markaad ku darto dib-u-eeg. Muuqaalada hore, sare iyo midig: muuqaalka sare ayaa ka sarreeya muuqaalka hore, muuqaalka midig wuxuu ku yaallaa midigtiisa. Geesaha qarsoon waa dashed. Muuqaal isometric meel u fadhiya. Cabbirrada guud: ballac iyo dherer muuqaalka hore, qoto-dheer muuqaalka sare. Miisaan keliya muuqaalada ugu waaweyn oo ka tirsan taxanaha ISO (1:1, 1:2, 1:5 … 2:1, 5:1, 10:1), oo la doortay si ay ugu habboonaadaan. Dooro cabbirka xaashida Xaashida naqshadda, marka wax la xulan waayo, dooro Xaashi panelka midig: A4, A3, A2, A1, A0 (ISO 216) ama ANSI A, B, C, D, E (11 × 8.5 ilaa 44 × 34 in). Muuqaalada mar kale ayaa la habeeyaa miisaanka ISO ee ugu weyn ee ku habboon, sidaas darteed xaashi weyn ayaa qaybta weyn tusi karta. Buuxi qaybta cinwaanka Goobaha Qaybta cinwaanka ee panelka midig waxay si toos ah xaashida ugu tagaan: Cinwaanka, Lambarka naqshadda, Dib-u-eeg, Shirkad, Lagu sawiray, La hubiyay, La ansixiyay, Taariikh (sanad-bil-maalin), Dulqaadka guud iyo Dhammaystir (labadan ugu dambeeya waxay ku daabacmaan kor u dhow qaybta cinwaanka). Ku qor sanduuqa oo riix Enter ama guji meel kale. Sanduuq madhan wuxuu ka tagaa unugiisa madhan, marka laga reebo: Cinwaanka wuxuu muujinayaa magaca qaybta ilaa aad qori. Taariikh wuxuu muujinayaa maanta ilaa aad qori. Dib-u-eeg wuxuu muujinayaa dib-u-eegga ugu dambeeya ee liiska ilaa aad qori. Agabka wuxuu ka imanayaa qaybta: guji meel madhan oo moodeelka ku jira, kadibna dooro Agab qaybta Part. Isla agabka wuxuu siinayaa Measure cufnaanta xisaabinta muuqaalka. Ku dar dib-u-eegyo Hoosta Dib-u-eegyada, guji Ku dar dib-u-eeg. Safka cusub kasta wuxuu qaadanayaa xarfta xigta (A, B, C …, ka dib Z waa AA) iyo taariikhda maanta. Qor waxa la beddelay iyo cidda beddeshay. Tirtir wuxuu tirtiraa safka. Qaybta dib-u-eegista ee geeska sare ee midig wuxuu liistaa dhammaantood, kii ugu hore marka hore, ilaa 20. Cabbirka xaashida, qaybta cinwaanka, dib-u-eegyada iyo agabka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta, isbeddel kasta waa hal tallaabo oo Ka noqo ah. Ku dar muuqaal qayb Qaybta waxaa jarta dhinac diyaaradeed, jarista waxaa lagu hoosaynayaa hatch. Sida muuqaalada kale, qaybta waxaa laga sameeyaa facets, sidaas darteed geesaha wareegsan waa jajabyo toosan gaagaaban. Panelka midig, deji Qaybta A-A ilaa Muuqaalka hore, Muuqaalka sare ama Muuqaalka midig. Qaybtu waxay ka soo muuqanaysaa xaashida, oo hoosaysan meelaha jarku gudbo agab, iyada oo xariiqda jarka iyo fallaadhaha \"A\" ay ku yaallaan muuqaalka laga qaaday. Deji Jar ku dhig (mm) si aad u beddesho diyaaradda jarka. Waxay ka bilaabataa dhexda qaybta. Deji Qaybta A-A ilaa Midna si aad u tirtirto. Ku dar muuqaal faahfaahin Deji Faahfaahin B muuqaalka aad weyneyneyso (ama dooro Faahfaahin toolbar-ka). Guji bartilmaameedka aad weyneyneyso, muuqaalkaas dhexdiisa. Goobo ku qoran \"B\" ayaa calaamadeynaysa, faahfaahinta weyneysay \"Detail B\" ayaa ka soo muuqanaysa xaashida iyada oo miisaan u gaar ah, tusaale ahaan \"Detail B (2:1)\". Deji Gobolka faahfaahinta (mm) cabbirka goobada iyo Miisaanka faahfaahinta weynaynta: 2, 4, 5 ama 10 × xaashida. Faahfaahinta waxaa laga qaadi karaa muuqaalka hore, sare, midig ama jarka, laakiin ma aha muuqaalka isometric. Haddii meel uu ku filan yahay aanu jirin muuqaal kasta, panelku wuxuu leeyahay \"No room on the sheet for: detail. Make the detail smaller or drop a view.\" Ku dar miiska godadka Miiska godadka wuxuu liistaa godadka qaybta iyo meelahooda, oo loo baahan yahay daloolinta ama CNC: dooro Miiska godadka › Muuqaalka sare (ama hore, ama midig) panelka. God kasta oo laga arko muuqaalkaas end-on wuxuu helaa tag ag yaal: A1, A2 … cabbirka koowaad, B1 … cabbirka xiga. Miiska wuxuu liistaa tag kasta, X iyo Y mm, iyo cabbirkiisa: \"Ø14 THRU\", \"Ø6.6 × 10 DEEP\", counterbore ama countersink, ama godka dhagaysan ee thread-kiisa. X iyo Y waxaa laga qaadaa geeska hoose ee bidix ee muuqaalka, oo lagu calaamadeeyay X0 Y0 xaashida. Godadka ay sameeyeen pattern-yada way ku jiraan. Godadka aan ku jajabnayn muuqaalka waa la tirinayaa panelka oo waa laga reebay miiska. Miiska waxaa lagu rakibaa meel bannaan oo xaashida ka mid ah iyo PDF-ka. Dhig calaamadaha GD&T iyo dhammaystirka dusha Dooro Datum, Frame (feature control frame) ama Dhammaystir (calaamadda dhammaystirka dusha). Guji barta muuqaalka halkaas oo ay ku xirmayso. Waxay ku qabsanaysaa xariiqda la rasmeeyay ee ugu dhow 2.5 mm dhexdeeda. Calaamadda waxay ka soo muuqanaysaa iyada oo leh xariiq hoose, la xulay, panelka midigna wuxuu muujinayaa dejinteeda. Calaamad jiid si aad u dhaqaajiso; xariiqdeedu waxay ku sii jirtaa barta. Calaamad la xulay, furayaasha fallaadhaha waxay dhaqaajiyaan 1 mm. Delete ama Backspace (ama Tirtir panelka) wuu tirtiraa; Dhammaystir ama Esc waa ka saaraa xulashada. Isbeddel kasta wuxuu ku jiraa liiska ka noqoshada. Datum Xarfta: A ilaa Z, laakiin ma jiraan I, O iyo Q (waxay u akhrisan karaan 1, 0 iyo O). Datum kasta cusub wuxuu qaadanayaa xarfta xigta ee bannaan. Feature control frame Dejinta Doorashooyinka Dulqaadka Straightness, Flatness, Circularity, Cylindricity, Profile of a line, Profile of a surface, Perpendicularity, Angularity, Parallelism, Position, Concentricity iyo Symmetry (labadaba waa laga saaray Y14.5-2018, waana lagu calaamadeeyay), Circular runout, Total runout Gobolka (mm) Qiimaha dulqaadka, caadiga ah 0.1 Gobolka dhexroorka (⌀) Sifooyinka leh gobol silinder; default ahaan ayaa looga furan yahay Position Agabka RFS (midna), MMC (Ⓜ), LMC (Ⓛ), halka sifada ay ogolaato Datum-ka koowaad / labaad / saddexaad Ilaa saddex xarfood oo datum ah, mid kasta oo leh … modifier (MMB, LMB) halka la ogolyahay PartCraft wuxuu hubiyaa frame-ka iyada oo loo eegayo xeerarka ASME Y14.5 wuxuuna sheegaa waxa khaldan dhanka sare ee panelka, tusaale ahaan \"Flatness is a form tolerance: it takes no datum references.\" ama \"Position needs at least one datum reference.\" Safka Akhri wuxuu hadal ku sharxayaa frame-ka. Dhammaystirka dusha Dejinta Doorashooyinka Caadiga Ra (µm) Celceliska roughness-ka 1.6 Habka habka kasta, machined, aan agab laga qaadin machined Qoraal Ilaa 40 xaraf, sida lay ama habka Marka wax la xulin, panelku wuxuu liistaa Qoraallada xaashida, mid kasta oo leh Dooro. Dhoofi PDF Dooro PDF toolbar-ka, Dhoofi PDF panelka, ama Dhoofi, kadibna Naqshad (PDF): muuqaallada, qaybta, faahfaahinta, GD&T moodeelka ka. PDF-ka waxaa laga soo dejiyaa \u003Cpart name\u003E - drawing.pdf, status bar-kuna wuxuu liistaa waxa ku jira. Ku daabac \"Actual size\" warqad cabbirkeeda xaashida la mid ah si miisaanka u sax ahaado. Xaddidaadyo Weli lama dhisin Samee maanta Cabbirro kale oo ka duwan saddexda cabbir ee guud Ku dar PDF-ka barnaamij markup ah, ama dhoofi sketch ama face DXF ahaan oo cabbir ku dar barnaamij 2D CAD ah Ka badan hal qayb ama faahfaahin; muuqaallada broken-out, auxiliary iyo projected Lama heli karo First-angle projection, muuqaallo dhaqaajiya, xaashiyo bortreed ah Third angle, habeynta otomaatiga ah, jiif Qoraallo xor ah iyo miisas xaashida (ka soo horreeya qaybta cinwaanka iyo dib-u-eegga) Isticmaal qoraalka dhammaystirka, ama ku dar qoraal PDF-ka Naqshadaha isku-dhisyada Lama heli karo Xarfaha ka baxsan kooxda Yurub ee Galbeedka waxay ku daabacmaan \"?\" (PDF-ku wuxuu isticmaalaa Helvetica ee akhristaha). Calaamadaha GD&T waxaa lagu sawiraa xariiqyo, sidaas darteed waxay ku daabacmaan akhristaha kasta. Ka dhig xaashida inay sameyso Xaashi › Automatic wuxuu kuu doortaa warqadda: miisaanka caadiga ah ee ugu weyn ilaa 1:1, xaashida A-size ee ugu yar ee muuqaalada ku haysa miisaankaas (liistu wuxuu muujinayaa midda la doortay). Cabbir godadka wuxuu cabbiraa godadka muuqaalka ay ugu badan yihiin end-on: calaamad dhexe mid kasta, hal callout cabbir kasta (\"2× Ø6 THRU\" oo leh xariiq), iyo meelahooda oo laga qaadayo geeska hoose ee bidix ee muuqaalka. Ballaca guud, dherer iyo qoto-dheer weligood way jiraan.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"manufacture","scope":"partcraft","title":"Samee toolpath iyo G-code (Manufacture)","summary":"Deji alaabta iyo asalka shaqada, dooro qalabka, ku dar hawlaha wejiga, pocket, contour, drill iyo chamfer adigoo dooranaya wejiyada, dhammee moodeelka oo dhan 3D (parallel, scallop), simulate alaabta ka dhanka ah moodeelka gouges iyo waqtiga wareegga, oo soo deji G-code laga bilaabo mid ka mid ah saddex post-yada la dhisay ama mid aad tafatirto.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["exact step","step-ka dukaanka","kala-xidhiidhka shaqada","cam handoff","parallel","scallop","dhammaystirka 3D","finishing","ball nose","maktabadda qalabka","edit post","custom post","post editor","adaptive","adaptive clearing","constant engagement","trochoidal","hsm","high speed machining","manufacture","CAM","toolpath","G-code","NC","CNC","mill","milling","pocket","contour","profile","facing","drill","peck","G83","G81","G73","chamfer","stock","work offset","G54","post processor","GRBL","LinuxCNC","feeds and speeds","simulation","gouge","cycle time"],"headings":[{"id":"deji","text":"Deji","level":2},{"id":"qalabka","text":"Qalabka","level":2},{"id":"ku-dar-hawlaha","text":"Ku dar hawlaha","level":2},{"id":"simulate","text":"Simulate","level":2},{"id":"post-g-code","text":"Post G-code","level":2},{"id":"exact-step-dukaanka","text":"Exact STEP dukaanka","level":2},{"id":"xadka","text":"Xadka","level":2},{"id":"u-dir-barnaamijka-mashiinka","text":"U dir barnaamijka mashiinka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWorkspace-ka Manufacture wuxuu qaybta u beddelaa toolpaths-yo mashiinka milling-ka 3-axis, wuxuuna u qoraa G-code. Hawlaha badankood waa \u003Cstrong\u003E2.5-axis\u003C/strong\u003E: qalabku wuu istaagaa toosan, derbiyada si toos ah ayaa loo gooyaa, dhulkana si siman. \u003Cstrong\u003EParallel\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EScallop\u003C/strong\u003E waxay dhammeeyaan wejiyada gobolka ah 3D (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003E3D finishing\u003C/a\u003E); qalabku weli wuu istaagaa toosan (saddex axis, ma jiro foorar). Waxay ka shaqeeyaan wejiyada magaca leh ee mesh kernel-ku siiyo qaybta (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel-ka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhismaha lab: hubi barnaamij kasta simulator-ka kontroolkaaga, oo marka hore ku socodsii hawada ka sare alaabta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"deji\"\u003EDeji\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EManufacture\u003C/strong\u003E workspace switcher-ka, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew setup\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ESetup\u003C/strong\u003E dooro:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETool axis (+Z)\u003C/strong\u003E: jihada uu qalabku ugu tilmaamo qaybta. World +Y (sare ee PartCraft) waa caadiga; machine X waxay noqotaa world X, machine Y waa world −Z.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWork origin (G54)\u003C/strong\u003E: geesta alaabta ama bartamaha, sare ama hoose, bartamaha sare ee moodeelka, ama asalka moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStock\u003C/strong\u003E: sanduuq ama silinder, midkood moodeelka oo leh offsets (dhinacyada, sare, hoose) ama cabbir go&#039;an.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E (wuxuu dejiyaa feeds iyo xawaaraha bilowga), \u003Cstrong\u003Epost\u003C/strong\u003E (kontroolka), xawaaraha ugu badan ee spindle-ka mashiinka, rapid rate iyo waqtiga beddelka qalabka, coolant iyo tirada barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka\"\u003EQalabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ETools\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu haystaa maktabada: flat, ball iyo bull nose end mills, drills, chamfer mills iyo face mills, mid kasta oo leh lambar T, dhexroor, flutes iyo dherer flute (iyo corner radius, point ama chamfer angle meelaha ay khuseeyaan).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabkayga waxaa lagu kaydin karaa browser-ka oo lagu wareejin karaa kombiyuutarro kale sida fayl: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/tool-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/tool-library\"\u003EMaktabadda qalabka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXawaaraha spindle-ka iyo feed-ka waxay ka imanayaan alaabta: n = 1000 × cutting speed / (π × dhexroor), feed = n × flutes × chip load (drills: n × feed per rev). Tirooyinkani waa bilow kaxeysan oo laga soo qaatay kala duwanaanshaha la daabacay, ma aha kuwo mashiinkaaga loo habeeyay; ku qor xawaaraha cutting-ka, chip load, rpm ama feed-ka soo saaraha qalabkaaga si aad uga dhaafto. Marka xawaarahu ka dhaafo ugu badnaanta mashiinka, wuu joogsadaa oo feed-ku wuu raacaa, si chip load-ku u joogto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-dar-hawlaha\"\u003EKu dar hawlaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka kasta oo toolbar-ka ku jira wuxuu ku daraa hawl, meelaha u baahan geometry-ga ahna wuxuu bilaabaa doorashada: guji wejiyada ama geesaha muuqaalka (mar kale guji si aad ka saarto), kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone picking\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHawl\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorasho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emidna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarin zig-zag ah oo dhammaan alaabta ka gudub, geesaha ka dhaaf, ilaa sare ee moodeelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPocket\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewejig dhul oo fidsan, god wareegsan, ama silsilad geesaha xidhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu nadiifiyaa gobolka marin offset ah gudaha-ka-dibadda, qoto-dhac kasta; islands (wejiyo kor u taagan oo dhulka ku jira) way ka tagaan; dhul dhinac kasta ka furan (aan waxba ka sarreyn dibaddiisa) waa la nadiifiyaa ilaa geesta alaabta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdaptive\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eisla sida Pocket\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu nadiifiyaa isla gobolka marin mid kasta oo gooyo ballac la dejiyay (\u003Cstrong\u003EEngagement\u003C/strong\u003E, qayb ka mid ah dhexroorka), si gooyaha aanu waligiis u gooyin slot ballac buuxa, xataa geeska; wuxuu galaa helix ah wuxuuna dhammeeyaa darbiyada heer kasta. Gooyo yar ayaa oggolaysa qoto-dhac qoto dheer iyo feed sare\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EContour\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ewejig dhul ah (geesteeda), wejig wareegsan, ama geesaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu raacaa geesta oo offset-ka qalabka radius-ka, dibadda ama gudaha, lead-in iyo lead-out qaansooyin iyo tabs ikhtiyaari ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrill\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Egodad (guji darbiga god ama geesta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ku dhuumaa god kasta cycle canned ah: peck (G83), drill (G81) ama chip break (G73); ama sii dhexroor si aad u dhuumato god kasta oo cabbirkaas ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Egeesta wejig ama geesaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu chamfer mill-ka ku socodsiiyaa geesta si uu u gooyo ballaca aad dejisay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EParallel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emidna (moodeelka oo dhan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaystirka 3D ee xariiqyada parallel ah xagal kasta, adigoo raacaya dusha qalabka ball, bull-nose ama flat. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003E3D finishing\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScallop\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emidna (moodeelka oo dhan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaystirka 3D marin masaafo go&#039;an oo kala fog dusha, si ridge-ka u dhexeeya u yeesho sarreynta aad weydiisay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro hawl liiska si aad u beddesho qalabkeeda, heights (clearance, retract, feed height, top, bottom), step-down, stepover, alaabta la reebayo, dhammaystirka marinka, entry (helix, ramp ama plunge), climb milling, tabs ama cycle. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUp\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDown\u003C/span\u003E dib ayay u habeeyaan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESuppress\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E wuu tirtiraa. Wax kasta waxa ku jira taariikhda ka noqoshada waxaana lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStepover-ka pocket-ka waa ugu badnaan badh dhexroorka qalabka, si barta kasta oo dhulkeeda ah ay ku jirto hal radius qalab marin kasta. Geesaha gudaha waxay ilaaliyaan radius-ka qalabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdaptive clearing\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu hayaa engagement-ka gooyaha qiime u dhow hal qiime. Engagement 0.15 oo dhexroorka ah waa engagement angle ah qiyaastii 46°: qaybta geesta gooyaha ee alaabta ku jirta. Pocket offset ah, bilaabaha ayuu gooyaa ballac buuxa marinka koowaad, wuxuuna ku wareegaa geesaha gudaha kasta. Marinada u dhexeeya qalabku wuxuu sii joogaa hoos meelaha uu ku dhaqaaqo gooyo hawo, wuxuu kor u kacaa oo hoos u degaa gooyo hawo meelaha kale. Marinada waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa grid fiican gobolka (unugyada qiyaastii laba meelood meel radius-ka qalabka), sidaas darteed engagement-ka wuxuu gaari karaa qiyaastii unug ballac dhab ah ka weyn intii la dejiyay; darbiyada si sax ah ayaa loo dhammeeyaa. Gobol furan oo weyn wuxuu samaynayaa barnaamij dheer oo dhaqdhaqaaqyo gaaban badan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"simulate\"\u003ESimulate\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EToolpaths-yada mar kasta dib ayaa loo sameeyaa marka wax la beddelo (qaybtana). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESimulate\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale muujiyaa alaabta ka hadhay barnaamijka oo dhan. Panel-ku wuxuu muujiyaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECycle time\u003C/strong\u003E: dhaqdhaqaaqyada feed-ka xawaarahooda feed-ka, rapids sida khadad toos ah rapid rate-ka setup-ka, oo ku dar waqtiga beddelka qalabka. Mashiinada dhabta ahi way dheereeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGouges\u003C/strong\u003E: meelaha qalabku uu ka hoosaynayo 0.02 mm dusha qaybta. Calaamadaha casaanka ah ayaa muujiya meelahaas muuqaalka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlaabta ku hadhay qaybta\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStock-ku waa height map sare (Z-map), sidaas darteed ma muujin karo undercuts. Jiid \u003Cstrong\u003EPlayback\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u dhaqaajiso qalabka barnaamijka dhexdiisa. Muuqaalka, dhaqdhaqaaqyada feed-ka waa adag yihiin, rapids-ka dashed, midab kasta hal hawl.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuji alaabta la simulay\u003C/strong\u003E la shido, alaabta waxaa lagu midabeeyaa moodeelka ka dhanka ah, unug unug: \u003Cstrong\u003Ecagaar\u003C/strong\u003E meesha ay ku taal moodeelka (dhexdiisa 0.02 mm), \u003Cstrong\u003Ecasaan\u003C/strong\u003E meesha qalabku ku gooyay moodeelka, iyo meesha alaabta lagu hadhay moodeelka \u003Cstrong\u003Ejaalle\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah maqaar khafiif ah, \u003Cstrong\u003Eorange\u003C/strong\u003E oo badan, ilaa \u003Cstrong\u003Emidabka cad\u003C/strong\u003E ee alaabta aan la gooyin marka 1 mm ama ka badan. Midabyada waxaa dib loo sameeyaa marka wax la beddelo, isla height map-ka oo kale ee tirooyinka panel-ka ku jira, sidaas darteed cagaarka iyo casaanku waa isku waafaqsan yihiin Gouges line-ka. Chamfer wuxuu si ula kac ah u gooyaa moodeelka wuxuuna muujiyaa casaan geeskiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"post-g-code\"\u003EPost G-code\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro kontroolka hoos \u003Cstrong\u003EPost\u003C/strong\u003E oo riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload G-code\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPost\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKontroolka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFanuc-style ISO\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E.nc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E%, lambarka O, lambarada khadka, T M6 oo leh G43 H, canned cycles\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGRBL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E.nc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro beddele qalab ama canned cycles: beddelka qalabka wuxuu joogsadaa M0, dhuumashada waxaa loo qoraa sida dhaqdhaqaaq fudud\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinuxCNC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E.ngc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET M6 oo leh G43 H, canned cycles, M2\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaaga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPost aad qortay ama beddeshay: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit post…\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew post…\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport post file…\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFayl kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa faallooyin barnaamijka, alaabta, offset-ka shaqada iyo qalabka. Isku xidhka waxaa lagu qoraa millimitirada 3 meelood. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolpath CSV\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolpath JSON\u003C/span\u003E waxay dhoofiyaan dhaqdhaqaaqyada laftoodba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHubi wax soo saarka simulator-ka mashiinkaaga ka hor inta aadan gooyin, oo marka hore ku socodsii hawada ka sare alaabta.\u003C/strong\u003E Saddexda post ee la dhisay waa bilow kuwa raacaya habdhaqanka kontroolada ee la qoray; ma aha kuwo laga caddeeyay mashiin gaar ah. Post aad beddelto waa mid aad caddeysid. Sida loo qoro: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EPost processors\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"exact-step-dukaanka\"\u003EExact STEP dukaanka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta badhamada G-code ee tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EOperations\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExact STEP (work coordinates)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;part&gt;-work.step\u003C/code\u003E: qaybta sida jidh saxda ah (silinderada dhabta ah ee godadka iyo bosses, wareegyada dhabta ah ee geesahooda) oo asalkeeda ku yaal work origin-ka setup-kan, Z-na raacaya tool axis. Kuwaasi waa kala-xidhiidhka G-code-ku isticmaalo, sidaas darteed barnaamijka CAM ee dukaanka ama checker-ka ayaa moodeelka la jaanqaadaya barnaamijka iyadoon la dhaqaajin. Faylku wuxuu ka kooban yahay qaybta oo keliya, ma aha alaabta ama toolpaths-yada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa isla jidhka meesha qaybta ku taal (Z sare): eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files#for-other-cad-programs-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\" data-hash=\"for-other-cad-programs-step\"\u003EDhoofinta daabacaadda, STEP iyo DXF\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xadka\"\u003EXadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPockets, contours, drilling iyo chamfers waa 2.5-axis. Wejiyada gobolka ah waa la dhammayn karaa 3D (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003Eparallel iyo scallop\u003C/a\u003E) laakiin lama dhigi karo 3D roughing (cone waxaa laga tegaa tallaabo ilaa aad dhammaystirto), ma jirto rest machining. Adaptive clearing waa 2D (dhul siman).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaddex axis oo keliya: ma jiro foorar, ma jiro turning, ma jiro hubin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHolders iyo shanks lama hubiyo collision; digniin ayaa soo baxda marka gooyo ka qoto dheer tahay flute length.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFeeds iyo speeds waa qiyamo bilow. Post waa qoraal aad tafatiri kartid, laakiin wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa oo kaliya sida dhaqdhaqaaqyada loo qoro; ma beddeli karo toolpath-ka, ma ku dari karo axes, ma garanayo mashiinkaaga (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EPost processors\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sheegayaa waxa aanu sameyn karin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-dir-barnaamijka-mashiinka\"\u003EU dir barnaamijka mashiinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDesktop-ka CadCraft Studio, oo leh mashiin lagu dejiyay Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003EU dir mashiin…\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka soo muuqdaa dhinaca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload G-code\u003C/span\u003E, wuxuuna soo gelinayaa isla barnaamijka mashiinka shabakadaada. Looma bilaabo PartCraft-ka: bilow mashiinka marka uu cad yahay. Browser-ka badhanku ma muuqdo (bogga web-ku ma gaari karo mashiin shabakadaada): soo deji barnaamijka halkii.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Workspace-ka Manufacture wuxuu qaybta u beddelaa toolpaths-yo mashiinka milling-ka 3-axis, wuxuuna u qoraa G-code. Hawlaha badankood waa 2.5-axis: qalabku wuu istaagaa toosan, derbiyada si toos ah ayaa loo gooyaa, dhulkana si siman. Parallel iyo Scallop waxay dhammeeyaan wejiyada gobolka ah 3D (eeg 3D finishing); qalabku weli wuu istaagaa toosan (saddex axis, ma jiro foorar). Waxay ka shaqeeyaan wejiyada magaca leh ee mesh kernel-ku siiyo qaybta (eeg Mesh kernel-ka). Dhismaha lab: hubi barnaamij kasta simulator-ka kontroolkaaga, oo marka hore ku socodsii hawada ka sare alaabta. Deji Dooro Manufacture workspace switcher-ka, kadibna New setup. Tab-ka Setup dooro: Tool axis (+Z): jihada uu qalabku ugu tilmaamo qaybta. World +Y (sare ee PartCraft) waa caadiga; machine X waxay noqotaa world X, machine Y waa world −Z. Work origin (G54): geesta alaabta ama bartamaha, sare ama hoose, bartamaha sare ee moodeelka, ama asalka moodeelka. Stock: sanduuq ama silinder, midkood moodeelka oo leh offsets (dhinacyada, sare, hoose) ama cabbir go'an. Material (wuxuu dejiyaa feeds iyo xawaaraha bilowga), post (kontroolka), xawaaraha ugu badan ee spindle-ka mashiinka, rapid rate iyo waqtiga beddelka qalabka, coolant iyo tirada barnaamijka. Qalabka Tab-ka Tools wuxuu haystaa maktabada: flat, ball iyo bull nose end mills, drills, chamfer mills iyo face mills, mid kasta oo leh lambar T, dhexroor, flutes iyo dherer flute (iyo corner radius, point ama chamfer angle meelaha ay khuseeyaan). Qalabkayga waxaa lagu kaydin karaa browser-ka oo lagu wareejin karaa kombiyuutarro kale sida fayl: eeg Maktabadda qalabka. Xawaaraha spindle-ka iyo feed-ka waxay ka imanayaan alaabta: n = 1000 × cutting speed / (π × dhexroor), feed = n × flutes × chip load (drills: n × feed per rev). Tirooyinkani waa bilow kaxeysan oo laga soo qaatay kala duwanaanshaha la daabacay, ma aha kuwo mashiinkaaga loo habeeyay; ku qor xawaaraha cutting-ka, chip load, rpm ama feed-ka soo saaraha qalabkaaga si aad uga dhaafto. Marka xawaarahu ka dhaafo ugu badnaanta mashiinka, wuu joogsadaa oo feed-ku wuu raacaa, si chip load-ku u joogto. Ku dar hawlaha Badhanka kasta oo toolbar-ka ku jira wuxuu ku daraa hawl, meelaha u baahan geometry-ga ahna wuxuu bilaabaa doorashada: guji wejiyada ama geesaha muuqaalka (mar kale guji si aad ka saarto), kadibna Done picking ama Esc. Hawl Doorasho Waxa uu sameeyaa Face midna Marin zig-zag ah oo dhammaan alaabta ka gudub, geesaha ka dhaaf, ilaa sare ee moodeelka Pocket wejig dhul oo fidsan, god wareegsan, ama silsilad geesaha xidhan Wuxuu nadiifiyaa gobolka marin offset ah gudaha-ka-dibadda, qoto-dhac kasta; islands (wejiyo kor u taagan oo dhulka ku jira) way ka tagaan; dhul dhinac kasta ka furan (aan waxba ka sarreyn dibaddiisa) waa la nadiifiyaa ilaa geesta alaabta Adaptive isla sida Pocket Wuxuu nadiifiyaa isla gobolka marin mid kasta oo gooyo ballac la dejiyay (Engagement, qayb ka mid ah dhexroorka), si gooyaha aanu waligiis u gooyin slot ballac buuxa, xataa geeska; wuxuu galaa helix ah wuxuuna dhammeeyaa darbiyada heer kasta. Gooyo yar ayaa oggolaysa qoto-dhac qoto dheer iyo feed sare Contour wejig dhul ah (geesteeda), wejig wareegsan, ama geesaha Wuxuu raacaa geesta oo offset-ka qalabka radius-ka, dibadda ama gudaha, lead-in iyo lead-out qaansooyin iyo tabs ikhtiyaari ah Drill godad (guji darbiga god ama geesta) Wuxuu ku dhuumaa god kasta cycle canned ah: peck (G83), drill (G81) ama chip break (G73); ama sii dhexroor si aad u dhuumato god kasta oo cabbirkaas ah Chamfer geesta wejig ama geesaha Wuxuu chamfer mill-ka ku socodsiiyaa geesta si uu u gooyo ballaca aad dejisay Parallel midna (moodeelka oo dhan) Dhammaystirka 3D ee xariiqyada parallel ah xagal kasta, adigoo raacaya dusha qalabka ball, bull-nose ama flat. Eeg 3D finishing Scallop midna (moodeelka oo dhan) Dhammaystirka 3D marin masaafo go'an oo kala fog dusha, si ridge-ka u dhexeeya u yeesho sarreynta aad weydiisay Dooro hawl liiska si aad u beddesho qalabkeeda, heights (clearance, retract, feed height, top, bottom), step-down, stepover, alaabta la reebayo, dhammaystirka marinka, entry (helix, ramp ama plunge), climb milling, tabs ama cycle. Up iyo Down dib ayay u habeeyaan, Suppress wuxuu ka saaraa, Delete wuu tirtiraa. Wax kasta waxa ku jira taariikhda ka noqoshada waxaana lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta. Stepover-ka pocket-ka waa ugu badnaan badh dhexroorka qalabka, si barta kasta oo dhulkeeda ah ay ku jirto hal radius qalab marin kasta. Geesaha gudaha waxay ilaaliyaan radius-ka qalabka. Adaptive clearing wuxuu hayaa engagement-ka gooyaha qiime u dhow hal qiime. Engagement 0.15 oo dhexroorka ah waa engagement angle ah qiyaastii 46°: qaybta geesta gooyaha ee alaabta ku jirta. Pocket offset ah, bilaabaha ayuu gooyaa ballac buuxa marinka koowaad, wuxuuna ku wareegaa geesaha gudaha kasta. Marinada u dhexeeya qalabku wuxuu sii joogaa hoos meelaha uu ku dhaqaaqo gooyo hawo, wuxuu kor u kacaa oo hoos u degaa gooyo hawo meelaha kale. Marinada waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa grid fiican gobolka (unugyada qiyaastii laba meelood meel radius-ka qalabka), sidaas darteed engagement-ka wuxuu gaari karaa qiyaastii unug ballac dhab ah ka weyn intii la dejiyay; darbiyada si sax ah ayaa loo dhammeeyaa. Gobol furan oo weyn wuxuu samaynayaa barnaamij dheer oo dhaqdhaqaaqyo gaaban badan. Simulate Toolpaths-yada mar kasta dib ayaa loo sameeyaa marka wax la beddelo (qaybtana). Simulate wuxuu sidoo kale muujiyaa alaabta ka hadhay barnaamijka oo dhan. Panel-ku wuxuu muujiyaa: Cycle time: dhaqdhaqaaqyada feed-ka xawaarahooda feed-ka, rapids sida khadad toos ah rapid rate-ka setup-ka, oo ku dar waqtiga beddelka qalabka. Mashiinada dhabta ahi way dheereeyaan. Gouges: meelaha qalabku uu ka hoosaynayo 0.02 mm dusha qaybta. Calaamadaha casaanka ah ayaa muujiya meelahaas muuqaalka. Alaabta ku hadhay qaybta. Stock-ku waa height map sare (Z-map), sidaas darteed ma muujin karo undercuts. Jiid Playback si aad u dhaqaajiso qalabka barnaamijka dhexdiisa. Muuqaalka, dhaqdhaqaaqyada feed-ka waa adag yihiin, rapids-ka dashed, midab kasta hal hawl. Marka Muuji alaabta la simulay la shido, alaabta waxaa lagu midabeeyaa moodeelka ka dhanka ah, unug unug: cagaar meesha ay ku taal moodeelka (dhexdiisa 0.02 mm), casaan meesha qalabku ku gooyay moodeelka, iyo meesha alaabta lagu hadhay moodeelka jaalle oo ah maqaar khafiif ah, orange oo badan, ilaa midabka cad ee alaabta aan la gooyin marka 1 mm ama ka badan. Midabyada waxaa dib loo sameeyaa marka wax la beddelo, isla height map-ka oo kale ee tirooyinka panel-ka ku jira, sidaas darteed cagaarka iyo casaanku waa isku waafaqsan yihiin Gouges line-ka. Chamfer wuxuu si ula kac ah u gooyaa moodeelka wuxuuna muujiyaa casaan geeskiisa. Post G-code Dooro kontroolka hoos Post oo riix Download G-code (ama Post toolbar-ka): Kontroolka Faylka Faahfaahin Fanuc-style ISO .nc %, lambarka O, lambarada khadka, T M6 oo leh G43 H, canned cycles GRBL .nc Ma jiro beddele qalab ama canned cycles: beddelka qalabka wuxuu joogsadaa M0, dhuumashada waxaa loo qoraa sida dhaqdhaqaaq fudud LinuxCNC .ngc T M6 oo leh G43 H, canned cycles, M2 Kaaga kasta Post aad qortay ama beddeshay: Edit post…, New post…, Import post file… Fayl kasta wuxuu ku bilaabmaa faallooyin barnaamijka, alaabta, offset-ka shaqada iyo qalabka. Isku xidhka waxaa lagu qoraa millimitirada 3 meelood. Toolpath CSV iyo Toolpath JSON waxay dhoofiyaan dhaqdhaqaaqyada laftoodba. Hubi wax soo saarka simulator-ka mashiinkaaga ka hor inta aadan gooyin, oo marka hore ku socodsii hawada ka sare alaabta. Saddexda post ee la dhisay waa bilow kuwa raacaya habdhaqanka kontroolada ee la qoray; ma aha kuwo laga caddeeyay mashiin gaar ah. Post aad beddelto waa mid aad caddeysid. Sida loo qoro: Post processors. Exact STEP dukaanka Hoosta badhamada G-code ee tab-ka Operations, Exact STEP (work coordinates) wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cpart\u003E-work.step: qaybta sida jidh saxda ah (silinderada dhabta ah ee godadka iyo bosses, wareegyada dhabta ah ee geesahooda) oo asalkeeda ku yaal work origin-ka setup-kan, Z-na raacaya tool axis. Kuwaasi waa kala-xidhiidhka G-code-ku isticmaalo, sidaas darteed barnaamijka CAM ee dukaanka ama checker-ka ayaa moodeelka la jaanqaadaya barnaamijka iyadoon la dhaqaajin. Faylku wuxuu ka kooban yahay qaybta oo keliya, ma aha alaabta ama toolpaths-yada. Export › STEP AP242 (exact solid) wuxuu qoraa isla jidhka meesha qaybta ku taal (Z sare): eeg Dhoofinta daabacaadda, STEP iyo DXF. Xadka Pockets, contours, drilling iyo chamfers waa 2.5-axis. Wejiyada gobolka ah waa la dhammayn karaa 3D (parallel iyo scallop) laakiin lama dhigi karo 3D roughing (cone waxaa laga tegaa tallaabo ilaa aad dhammaystirto), ma jirto rest machining. Adaptive clearing waa 2D (dhul siman). Saddex axis oo keliya: ma jiro foorar, ma jiro turning, ma jiro hubin. Holders iyo shanks lama hubiyo collision; digniin ayaa soo baxda marka gooyo ka qoto dheer tahay flute length. Feeds iyo speeds waa qiyamo bilow. Post waa qoraal aad tafatiri kartid, laakiin wuxuu go'aaminayaa oo kaliya sida dhaqdhaqaaqyada loo qoro; ma beddeli karo toolpath-ka, ma ku dari karo axes, ma garanayo mashiinkaaga (Post processors wuxuu sheegayaa waxa aanu sameyn karin). U dir barnaamijka mashiinka Desktop-ka CadCraft Studio, oo leh mashiin lagu dejiyay Studio, U dir mashiin… wuxuu ka soo muuqdaa dhinaca Download G-code, wuxuuna soo gelinayaa isla barnaamijka mashiinka shabakadaada. Looma bilaabo PartCraft-ka: bilow mashiinka marka uu cad yahay. Browser-ka badhanku ma muuqdo (bogga web-ku ma gaari karo mashiin shabakadaada): soo deji barnaamijka halkii.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"post-processors","scope":"partcraft","title":"Post processors oo aad tafatiri karto","summary":"Post waa fayl qoraal gaaban oo jaharta waddada qalabka u beddela G-code kontoroolkaaga. Nuqul ka mid ah post-yada dhex-ku-jira, beddel safafka aad u baahan tahay (lambarada safka, beddelka qalabka, dhaqdhaqaaqyada home, koodka dhamaadka), ku arag G-code-ka uu qorayo markaad qorayso, oo ku hay qaybta.","section":"tasks","order":141,"keywords":["post","post processor","postprocessor","G-code","NC","GRBL","LinuxCNC","tafatir post","post caadi ah","cpost","beddelka qalabka","M6","G43","wareeg hore loo qoray","lambarada safka","modal","dhacdo","doorsoomaha"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-mid","text":"Samee mid","level":2},{"id":"post-waxa-uu-u-egyahay","text":"Post waxa uu u egyahay","level":2},{"id":"dhacdooyinka","text":"Dhacdooyinka","level":2},{"id":"warbixinta","text":"Warbixinta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-post-aanu-samayn-karin","text":"Waxa post aanu samayn karin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIsla waddada qalabku waa in loo qoro siday u kala duwan yihiin kontoroolada kala duwan: lambarada safka ama midna, \u003Ccode\u003EM6\u003C/code\u003E ama joojin, \u003Ccode\u003EG28\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EG53\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EM30\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EM2\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EPost\u003C/strong\u003E waa qoraalka gaaban ee sheegaya sida. Saddexda post ee dhex-ku-jira ee PartCraft (Fanuc-style, GRBL iyo LinuxCNC) qaabkan ayay ku qoran yihiin, sidaas darteed post aad leedahay wuxuu ka bilaabi karaa nuqul mid ka mid ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBarnaamijka ku caddee simulator-ka mashiinkaaga ka hor inta aanad jarin, oo marka hore ku orod hawada kor ka agabka. Post-yada dhex-ku-jira waxay qorayaan wixii ay qori jireen ka hor inta qaabkan la abuurin (tijaabooyinka waxa ay isbarbar dhigaan natiijadooda bit-bit barnaamijyo badan), laakiin wax kasta oo halkan ku jira ma caddaysan mashiinkaaga, post aad beddeshay waa mid adiga kuu gaar ah oo adigu caddaynaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-mid\"\u003ESamee mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWax soo saarka, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EPost\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit post…\u003C/span\u003E kontoroolka dhex-ku-jira wuxuu furaa \u003Cstrong\u003Enuqulkaaga adiga kuu gaar ah\u003C/strong\u003E. Post aad leedahay ayuu furaa post-kaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew post…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka bilaabaa post madhan oo yar oo leh dhacdo kasta oo ku jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport post file…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhriyaa fayl qoraal \u003Ccode\u003E.cpost\u003C/code\u003E ah (faylka aad ka heshay \u003Cstrong\u003ESave as a file…\u003C/strong\u003E tafatiraha).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETafatiruhu wuxuu muujiyaa qoraalka, safka sheegaya in la akhrin karo (iyo safka qaldan), iyo G-code-ka post-ku qorayo markaad qorayso. \u003Cstrong\u003EHor-eeg\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dooranayaa barnaamij tusaale yar oo socda dhacdo kasta, ama barnaamijka qaybtan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu post-ka ku kaydiyaa faylka qaybta (ilaa 20 post) wuxuuna doortaa kontoroolka. Post-yadu waxay raacaan qaybta; si aad ugu isticmaasho qayb kale, u kaydi fayl ahaan oo qaybta kale ku soo gali.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"post-waxa-uu-u-egyahay\"\u003EPost waxa uu u egyahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epost mymill\nname Mill-kayga (.nc)\nextension nc\nline-numbers off\ndecimal-point no\ncanned-cycles no\nmodal motion G0 G1 G2 G3\n\non start\n  comment Barnaamij {program}: {name}\n  emit G21 G90 G17\nend\n\non tool-change\n  emit T{tool.number} M6\nend\n\non rapid\n  if moved\n    emit G0~ X{x}~ Y{y}~ Z{z}~\n  end\nend\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafaf bilaabma \u003Ccode\u003E//\u003C/code\u003E iyo safaf madhan ayaa la iska dhegtaa. Sare waxa ku yaala dejimaha; kadibna block \u003Ccode\u003Eon &lt;event&gt;\u003C/code\u003E kasta oo loo baahan yahay, oo lagu xidho \u003Ccode\u003Eend\u003C/code\u003E. Dhacdo aad ka tagto ma qoraa wax.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epost &lt;id&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAqoonsiga post-ka: xarfo, lambar, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ename &lt;text&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa liiska Control muujiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eextension &lt;ext&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKordhinta faylka: nc, ngc, tap …\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eline-numbers 10\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003Eoff\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EN20\u003C/code\u003E … safaf \u003Ccode\u003Eemit\u003C/code\u003E kasta, ama midna\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edecimal-point yes\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003Eno\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10.\u003C/code\u003E halkii \u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E (faallooyinku waligood ma qaataan dhibicda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecanned-cycles yes\u003C/code\u003E / \u003Ccode\u003Eno\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eno\u003C/code\u003E: godyada waxa loo qoraa dhaqdhaqaaqyada G0/G1 ee ay matalaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emodal &lt;group&gt; &lt;words&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EErayada kooxda (\u003Ccode\u003Emodal motion G0 G1 G2 G3\u003C/code\u003E) oo kaliya la qoro markay isbeddelaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhacdooyinka\"\u003EDhacdooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay socdaan amarkan barnaamij kasta: \u003Ccode\u003Estart\u003C/code\u003E; kadibna howlgal kasta \u003Ccode\u003Eoperation\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool-change\u003C/code\u003E (markii qalabku isbeddelo), \u003Ccode\u003Espindle\u003C/code\u003E (markii xawaaruhu isbeddelo), \u003Ccode\u003Eapproach\u003C/code\u003E (dhaqdhaqaaqa ilaa barta koowaad, ka hor rapid-ka koowaad), \u003Ccode\u003Ecoolant-on\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna dhaqdhaqaaqyadiisa sida \u003Ccode\u003Erapid\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeed\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Earc\u003C/code\u003E, iyo wareeg hore loo qoray kasta sida \u003Ccode\u003Ecycle-start\u003C/code\u003E, hal \u003Ccode\u003Ecycle-hole\u003C/code\u003E oo godkasta u gaar ah, iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ecycle-end\u003C/code\u003E; ugu dambeyntii \u003Ccode\u003Eend\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhacdooyin dheeraad ah, oo ah waxa ka baxsan saddex tiir (post-ka aan lahayn dhacdadaas wuu diidaa barnaamijkaas oo wuxuu magacaabaa dhacdada uu ka maqan yahay):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDhacdo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGoorta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorsoomayaashiisa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eindex\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa hor howlgal oo jihada qalabkiisa ka duwan tan ugu dambeysay, iyo ka hor howlgalka koowaad mashiin leh tiirarka wareega\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erot.a\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.c\u003C/code\u003E (booska loo tagayo; madhan tiir kasta oo mashiinku ma lahayn), \u003Ccode\u003Efirst.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efirst.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efirst.z\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erapid-rotary\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeed-rotary\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqdhaqaaqyada howlgal tiirarkiisa wareega ay dhaqaajiyaan intii uu jarayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ex\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ey\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ez\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.a\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.c\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ef\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erot.moved\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einverse\u003C/code\u003E (haa markii quudintu tahay wakhti rogan), \u003Ccode\u003Einvf\u003C/code\u003E (1/daqiiqado)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erotary-end\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa dib howlgal sidaas oo kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eprobe-move\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqdhaqaaq joogsada markii probe-ku taabto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ex\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ey\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ez\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ef\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.n\u003C/code\u003E (1 ilaa 4), \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.axis\u003C/code\u003E (x, y ama z), \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.k\u003C/code\u003E (1, 2 ama 3)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eprobe-set\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa dib taabashooyinka hal wareeg baadhis\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.kind\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;z&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;x&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;y&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Ecentre\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.action\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003Eset\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Emeasure\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.expect\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.cx\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe.cy\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ethread\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqdhaqaaq dhuunto oo kharaad ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ex\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ez\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ethread.lead\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhacdo kasta ayaa sidoo kale isticmaali karta: \u003Ccode\u003Ekin\u003C/code\u003E (none, a, b, ac, bc), \u003Ccode\u003Erotary\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Etcp\u003C/code\u003E (yes ama no, mashiinka Setup-ka ka yimaadda), \u003Ccode\u003Epivot.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epivot.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epivot.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eop.tilt\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eop.turn\u003C/code\u003E howlgalka, iyo kharaadada \u003Ccode\u003Espin.mode\u003C/code\u003E (css ama rpm), \u003Ccode\u003Espin.css\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Espin.max\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Etool.nose\u003C/code\u003E. Erayga xarfaha ah ee qiimihiisu madhan yahay, sida \u003Ccode\u003EA{rot.a}\u003C/code\u003E mashiin aan tiir A lahayn, waa laga tagaa safka. Ku barbar dhig x, y iyo z sida qoraal oo xigmado ku jira (\u003Ccode\u003Eif probe.kind == &quot;z&quot;\u003C/code\u003E): iyaga oo laga reebay, waa isku-xirka dhaqdhaqaaqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba safood oo dheeraad ah sare ee post-ka ayaa ka dhigaya post kharaad: \u003Ccode\u003Emachine lathe\u003C/code\u003E (markaas wuxuu qoraa X iyo Z oo keliya, wuxuuna diidaa waddooyinka jarista sida post jarista uu diido waddooyinka khaaraadda) iyo \u003Ccode\u003Elathe-x diameter\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Elathe-x radius\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhacdo kasta waxay isticmaali kartaa doorsoomayaasha nooca dhaqdhaqaaqyadeeda, oo lagu qoro \u003Ccode\u003E{name}\u003C/code\u003E: barnaamijka (\u003Ccode\u003Ename\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eprogram\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esetup.axis\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esetup.origin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esetup.coolant\u003C/code\u003E), agabka (\u003Ccode\u003Estock.kind\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estock.d\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estock.sx\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estock.sy\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estock.sz\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estock.minx\u003C/code\u003E … \u003Ccode\u003Estock.maxz\u003C/code\u003E), qalabka (\u003Ccode\u003Etool.number\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool.desc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool.kind\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool.d\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool.flutes\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etool.fluteLen\u003C/code\u003E), howlgalka (\u003Ccode\u003Eop.name\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eop.type\u003C/code\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003Erpm\u003C/code\u003E, barta dhaqdhaqaaqa (\u003Ccode\u003Ex\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ey\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ez\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ef\u003C/code\u003E, iyo \u003Ccode\u003Emoved\u003C/code\u003E: run markii tiir uu isbeddelay), qaansooyinka (\u003Ccode\u003Earc.g\u003C/code\u003E 2 ama 3, \u003Ccode\u003Earc.i\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Earc.j\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Earc.cx\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Earc.cy\u003C/code\u003E) iyo godyada (\u003Ccode\u003Ehole.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.r\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.q\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.return\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole.first\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecycle.kind\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecycle.init\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeed\u003C/code\u003E). Liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EDhacdooyinka iyo doorsoomayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E ee tafatiruhu wuxuu muujinayaa dhacdo kasta waxa ay aragto. Gobolka aad akhrin karto oo deji karto: \u003Ccode\u003Ecool\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eoffset\u003C/code\u003E, iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eat.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eat.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eat.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eat.f\u003C/code\u003E (qiimaha ugu dambeeya ee la qoray).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"warbixinta\"\u003EWarbixinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWarbixin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameyso\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eraw TEXT\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafka sida loo qoray (lambar safka la&#039;aan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecomment TEXT\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(TEXT)\u003C/code\u003E oo laga saaray xarfaha aan ASCII ahayn iyo qawsyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eemit WORD WORD …\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafka erayada; erayada madhan waa la reebaa; eray ma jiro, safka ma jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eword WORD …\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar erayada safka la dhisayo; \u003Ccode\u003Eemit\u003C/code\u003E madhan wuu dhammeeyaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eif EXPR\u003C/code\u003E … \u003Ccode\u003Eelse\u003C/code\u003E … \u003Ccode\u003Eend\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShuruudo: \u003Ccode\u003Ea == b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ea != b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enot a\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ea and b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ea or b\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ea??b\u003C/code\u003E (a, haddii kale b)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efor tool in tools\u003C/code\u003E … \u003Ccode\u003Eend\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMar kasta qalab uu barnaamijku isticmaalo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eset NAME EXPR\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXusuuso qiime (\u003Ccode\u003Eset offset tool.number\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ereset NAME …\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIllow erayada modal-ka (kooxda, xarfaha ciwaanka sida \u003Ccode\u003EZ\u003C/code\u003E, ama \u003Ccode\u003Eat.z\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edo rapid X Y Z\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodsii dhacdada \u003Ccode\u003Erapid\u003C/code\u003E barta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEray waa qoraal la qoray oo leh godad \u003Ccode\u003E{variable|filter}\u003C/code\u003E. Filtarrada waa \u003Ccode\u003Eupper\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elower\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epad:N\u003C/code\u003E (buuxinta eber), \u003Ccode\u003Ecut:N\u003C/code\u003E (N xarfood oo horreeya), \u003Ccode\u003Esafe\u003C/code\u003E (ASCII ammaan u ah faallada) iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eint\u003C/code\u003E. Eray dhamaadkiisa \u003Ccode\u003E~\u003C/code\u003E waa \u003Cstrong\u003Emodal\u003C/strong\u003E: waxa lagu qoraa kaliya markii uu ka duwanaado waxa ugu dambeyntii la qoray (\u003Ccode\u003EG1~\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EX{x}~\u003C/code\u003E). Eray dhamaadkiisa \u003Ccode\u003E~!\u003C/code\u003E waxa lagu qoraa mar kasta oo waana la xasuustaa. Magac aan doorsoome ahayn waa qoraal caadi ah (\u003Ccode\u003EG81\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emist\u003C/code\u003E). Tirooyinka waa la wareejiyaa 0.001 mm waxaana lagu qoraa iyada oo aan eber dambe lahayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-post-aanu-samayn-karin\"\u003EWaxa post aanu samayn karin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa uu go&#039;aaminayaa sida dhaqdhaqaaqyada loo qoro, wax ka badan ma samayn karo. Ma beddeli karo waddada qalabka, ma dalbi karo howlgallada, ma jebin karo qaansoo, ma ku dari karo tiir, ma garanayo socodka iyo kinematics-ka mashiinkaaga, ama ma samayn karo xisaab ku saabsan isku-xidhka (ma jiro \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E). Meelaha leexinta qudhooda waxay ka yimaadaan mashiinka lagu sharaxay Setup, ma aha post-ka: post-ku wuxuu beddeli karaa calaamadooda ama xarfahooda, laakiin ma beddeli karo kinematics-ka. Nolosha qalabka iyo barnaamijyada hoosaadka lama dhisin. Fayl post oo nooca \u003Ccode\u003E.cps\u003C/code\u003E ah oo barnaamij kale laga soo qaaday ma soo-saari karo: tani waa qaab kale oo fudud.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Isla waddada qalabku waa in loo qoro siday u kala duwan yihiin kontoroolada kala duwan: lambarada safka ama midna, M6 ama joojin, G28 ama G53, M30 ama M2. Post waa qoraalka gaaban ee sheegaya sida. Saddexda post ee dhex-ku-jira ee PartCraft (Fanuc-style, GRBL iyo LinuxCNC) qaabkan ayay ku qoran yihiin, sidaas darteed post aad leedahay wuxuu ka bilaabi karaa nuqul mid ka mid ah. Barnaamijka ku caddee simulator-ka mashiinkaaga ka hor inta aanad jarin, oo marka hore ku orod hawada kor ka agabka. Post-yada dhex-ku-jira waxay qorayaan wixii ay qori jireen ka hor inta qaabkan la abuurin (tijaabooyinka waxa ay isbarbar dhigaan natiijadooda bit-bit barnaamijyo badan), laakiin wax kasta oo halkan ku jira ma caddaysan mashiinkaaga, post aad beddeshay waa mid adiga kuu gaar ah oo adigu caddaynaysaa. Samee mid Wax soo saarka, hoosta Post: Edit post… kontoroolka dhex-ku-jira wuxuu furaa nuqulkaaga adiga kuu gaar ah. Post aad leedahay ayuu furaa post-kaas. New post… wuxuu ka bilaabaa post madhan oo yar oo leh dhacdo kasta oo ku jirta. Import post file… wuxuu akhriyaa fayl qoraal .cpost ah (faylka aad ka heshay Save as a file… tafatiraha). Tafatiruhu wuxuu muujiyaa qoraalka, safka sheegaya in la akhrin karo (iyo safka qaldan), iyo G-code-ka post-ku qorayo markaad qorayso. Hor-eeg wuxuu dooranayaa barnaamij tusaale yar oo socda dhacdo kasta, ama barnaamijka qaybtan. Save wuxuu post-ka ku kaydiyaa faylka qaybta (ilaa 20 post) wuxuuna doortaa kontoroolka. Post-yadu waxay raacaan qaybta; si aad ugu isticmaasho qayb kale, u kaydi fayl ahaan oo qaybta kale ku soo gali. Post waxa uu u egyahay post mymill name Mill-kayga (.nc) extension nc line-numbers off decimal-point no canned-cycles no modal motion G0 G1 G2 G3 on start comment Barnaamij {program}: {name} emit G21 G90 G17 end on tool-change emit T{tool.number} M6 end on rapid if moved emit G0~ X{x}~ Y{y}~ Z{z}~ end end Safaf bilaabma // iyo safaf madhan ayaa la iska dhegtaa. Sare waxa ku yaala dejimaha; kadibna block on \u003Cevent\u003E kasta oo loo baahan yahay, oo lagu xidho end. Dhacdo aad ka tagto ma qoraa wax. Dejinta Macnaha post \u003Cid\u003E Aqoonsiga post-ka: xarfo, lambar, - iyo _ name \u003Ctext\u003E Waxa liiska Control muujiyo extension \u003Cext\u003E Kordhinta faylka: nc, ngc, tap … line-numbers 10 / off N10, N20 … safaf emit kasta, ama midna decimal-point yes / no 10. halkii 10 (faallooyinku waligood ma qaataan dhibicda) canned-cycles yes / no no: godyada waxa loo qoraa dhaqdhaqaaqyada G0/G1 ee ay matalaan modal \u003Cgroup\u003E \u003Cwords\u003E Erayada kooxda (modal motion G0 G1 G2 G3) oo kaliya la qoro markay isbeddelaan Dhacdooyinka Waxay socdaan amarkan barnaamij kasta: start; kadibna howlgal kasta operation, tool-change (markii qalabku isbeddelo), spindle (markii xawaaruhu isbeddelo), approach (dhaqdhaqaaqa ilaa barta koowaad, ka hor rapid-ka koowaad), coolant-on, kadibna dhaqdhaqaaqyadiisa sida rapid, feed iyo arc, iyo wareeg hore loo qoray kasta sida cycle-start, hal cycle-hole oo godkasta u gaar ah, iyo cycle-end; ugu dambeyntii end. Dhacdooyin dheeraad ah, oo ah waxa ka baxsan saddex tiir (post-ka aan lahayn dhacdadaas wuu diidaa barnaamijkaas oo wuxuu magacaabaa dhacdada uu ka maqan yahay): Dhacdo Goorta Doorsoomayaashiisa index Ka hor howlgal oo jihada qalabkiisa ka duwan tan ugu dambeysay, iyo ka hor howlgalka koowaad mashiin leh tiirarka wareega rot.a, rot.b, rot.c (booska loo tagayo; madhan tiir kasta oo mashiinku ma lahayn), first.x, first.y, first.z rapid-rotary, feed-rotary Dhaqdhaqaaqyada howlgal tiirarkiisa wareega ay dhaqaajiyaan intii uu jarayo x, y, z, rot.a, rot.b, rot.c, f, rot.moved, inverse (haa markii quudintu tahay wakhti rogan), invf (1/daqiiqado) rotary-end Ka dib howlgal sidaas oo kale probe-move Dhaqdhaqaaq joogsada markii probe-ku taabto x, y, z, f, probe.n (1 ilaa 4), probe.axis (x, y ama z), probe.k (1, 2 ama 3) probe-set Ka dib taabashooyinka hal wareeg baadhis probe.kind (\"z\", \"x\", \"y\" ama centre), probe.action (set ama measure), probe.expect, probe.cx, probe.cy thread Dhaqdhaqaaq dhuunto oo kharaad ah x, z, thread.lead Dhacdo kasta ayaa sidoo kale isticmaali karta: kin (none, a, b, ac, bc), rotary iyo tcp (yes ama no, mashiinka Setup-ka ka yimaadda), pivot.x, pivot.y, pivot.z, op.tilt iyo op.turn howlgalka, iyo kharaadada spin.mode (css ama rpm), spin.css, spin.max iyo tool.nose. Erayga xarfaha ah ee qiimihiisu madhan yahay, sida A{rot.a} mashiin aan tiir A lahayn, waa laga tagaa safka. Ku barbar dhig x, y iyo z sida qoraal oo xigmado ku jira (if probe.kind == \"z\"): iyaga oo laga reebay, waa isku-xirka dhaqdhaqaaqa. Laba safood oo dheeraad ah sare ee post-ka ayaa ka dhigaya post kharaad: machine lathe (markaas wuxuu qoraa X iyo Z oo keliya, wuxuuna diidaa waddooyinka jarista sida post jarista uu diido waddooyinka khaaraadda) iyo lathe-x diameter ama lathe-x radius. Dhacdo kasta waxay isticmaali kartaa doorsoomayaasha nooca dhaqdhaqaaqyadeeda, oo lagu qoro {name}: barnaamijka (name, program, setup.axis, setup.origin, setup.coolant), agabka (stock.kind, stock.d, stock.sx, stock.sy, stock.sz, stock.minx … stock.maxz), qalabka (tool.number, tool.desc, tool.kind, tool.d, tool.flutes, tool.fluteLen), howlgalka (op.name, op.type), rpm, barta dhaqdhaqaaqa (x, y, z, f, iyo moved: run markii tiir uu isbeddelay), qaansooyinka (arc.g 2 ama 3, arc.i, arc.j, arc.cx, arc.cy) iyo godyada (hole.x, hole.y, hole.z, hole.r, hole.q, hole.return, hole.first, cycle.kind, cycle.init, feed). Liiska Dhacdooyinka iyo doorsoomayaasha ee tafatiruhu wuxuu muujinayaa dhacdo kasta waxa ay aragto. Gobolka aad akhrin karto oo deji karto: cool, offset, iyo at.x, at.y, at.z, at.f (qiimaha ugu dambeeya ee la qoray). Warbixinta Warbixin Waxa ay sameyso raw TEXT Safka sida loo qoray (lambar safka la'aan) comment TEXT (TEXT) oo laga saaray xarfaha aan ASCII ahayn iyo qawsyada emit WORD WORD … Safka erayada; erayada madhan waa la reebaa; eray ma jiro, safka ma jiro word WORD … Ku dar erayada safka la dhisayo; emit madhan wuu dhammeeyaa if EXPR … else … end Shuruudo: a == b, a != b, not a, a and b, a or b, a??b (a, haddii kale b) for tool in tools … end Mar kasta qalab uu barnaamijku isticmaalo set NAME EXPR Xusuuso qiime (set offset tool.number) reset NAME … Illow erayada modal-ka (kooxda, xarfaha ciwaanka sida Z, ama at.z) do rapid X Y Z Socodsii dhacdada rapid barta Eray waa qoraal la qoray oo leh godad {variable|filter}. Filtarrada waa upper, lower, pad:N (buuxinta eber), cut:N (N xarfood oo horreeya), safe (ASCII ammaan u ah faallada) iyo int. Eray dhamaadkiisa ~ waa modal: waxa lagu qoraa kaliya markii uu ka duwanaado waxa ugu dambeyntii la qoray (G1~, X{x}~). Eray dhamaadkiisa ~! waxa lagu qoraa mar kasta oo waana la xasuustaa. Magac aan doorsoome ahayn waa qoraal caadi ah (G81, mist). Tirooyinka waa la wareejiyaa 0.001 mm waxaana lagu qoraa iyada oo aan eber dambe lahayn. Waxa post aanu samayn karin Waxa uu go'aaminayaa sida dhaqdhaqaaqyada loo qoro, wax ka badan ma samayn karo. Ma beddeli karo waddada qalabka, ma dalbi karo howlgallada, ma jebin karo qaansoo, ma ku dari karo tiir, ma garanayo socodka iyo kinematics-ka mashiinkaaga, ama ma samayn karo xisaab ku saabsan isku-xidhka (ma jiro +). Meelaha leexinta qudhooda waxay ka yimaadaan mashiinka lagu sharaxay Setup, ma aha post-ka: post-ku wuxuu beddeli karaa calaamadooda ama xarfahooda, laakiin ma beddeli karo kinematics-ka. Nolosha qalabka iyo barnaamijyada hoosaadka lama dhisin. Fayl post oo nooca .cps ah oo barnaamij kale laga soo qaaday ma soo-saari karo: tani waa qaab kale oo fudud.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"finish-3d","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dhamaystirka 3D: isbarbar iyo skallop","summary":"Dhammaystir dusha qalloocan ee moodeelka oo dhan adigoo isticmaalaya qalab bar dhamaad, bull-nose ama falaar ah, xariiqyo isbarbar ah oo xagal kasta leh ama marin masaafo la cayimay u dhexeysa si cirifyada ka dhexeeya ay u hayaan dhererka aad codsatay. Waxa waddooyinku dammaanad qaadayaan iyo waxa aysan dammaanad qaadin.","section":"tasks","order":142,"keywords":["dhamaystirka 3d","dhamaystir","isbarbar","raster","skallop","skallop joogto ah","cusp","bar kubbad","bar bull nose","dusha","tolerance","stepover","janjeer","agab la reebo","drop cutter","godan"],"headings":[{"id":"isbarbar","text":"Isbarbar","level":2},{"id":"skallop","text":"Skallop","level":2},{"id":"sida-waddooyinku-u-wanaagsan-yihiin","text":"Sida waddooyinku u wanaagsan yihiin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELaba howlgal oo ku jira Wax soo saarka ayaa jari doona \u003Cstrong\u003Edusha moodeelka oo dhan\u003C/strong\u003E iyadoo qalabka lagu hayo toosan (saddex tiir). Ma qaataan wax xulasho ah: waxay ku shaqeeyaan qaybta moodeelka oo dhan ee laga arki karo kor ka. Marka hore qaybta ku dhow (adaptive ama pocket); marinka dhamaystirka ee agab aan la jarin ku jira wuxuu digniin siinayaa inay jari doonto qoto dheer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isbarbar\"\u003EIsbarbar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiqyo toosan oo dhinac-dhinac ah moodeelka oo ku jira \u003Cstrong\u003Exagasha\u003C/strong\u003E aad dejisay, oo u dhexeeya \u003Cstrong\u003Etallaabo-kala-fogaan\u003C/strong\u003E (qayb ka mid ah dhexroorka qalabka). Xariiq kasta wuxuu raacaa dusha: meesha ay qalabka dhabta ah ku taal waa sare sida loo baahan yahay in aan qayb kasta oo qalabka ah ka hoosreyn moodeelka, xariiqna wuxuu noqdaa mid si fiican loo jaray meel kasta oo dusha ay ku fiiqanto. Marka \u003Cstrong\u003EZig-zag\u003C/strong\u003E la furo, qalabku wuxuu ku sii jiraa xariiqyada dhexdooda meelaha ay ku badbaado tahay (waa la hubiyaa dhaqdhaqaaqa); haddii kale wuu kor u qaadaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDulqaadka\u003C/strong\u003E: intee le&#039;eg qayb toosan oo xariiq ah ayaa ka fogaan karta dhererka saxda ah ee dhabta ah ee qalabka (nus ayaa loo adeegsadaa xadka dhexda qayb kasta). Caadiga ah 0.01 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaliya meelaha dusha ay ka ugu yaraan … ilaa ka badan … (°)\u003C/strong\u003E: dhamaystir meelaha yaryar oo keliya ama kuwa janjeerka badan oo keliya. Meelaha dusha ka baxsan kala-duwanaanshaha ayaa xariiqa laga reebaa oo qalabku kor ayuu u kacaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgab la reebo\u003C/strong\u003E: moodeelka oo laga dhigay masaafadaas (qalabka oo la weyneeyay: saxda qalabyada kubbadda iyo bull-nose; qalab falaar ah wuxuu reebaa ugu yaraan masaafadaas).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHoose\u003C/strong\u003E: wax aan la jari doonin ka hooseeya z-kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skallop\"\u003ESkallop\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarino ku qaadan masaafo joogto ah oo dusha ah, si cirifka (skallop) ka dhexeeya labo marin oo dariska ah uu u yeesho \u003Cstrong\u003Edhererka\u003C/strong\u003E aad codsatay. Masaafada waxay ka soo baxdaa dhererka iyo radius-ka kubbadda: s = 2·√(2·R·h − h²), tusaale ahaan qiyaastii 0.69 mm marinada ka dhexeeya kubbad Ø6 ah iyo cirif 0.02 mm ah. Qalab bull-nose wuxuu isticmaalaa radius-ka geeskiisa. Falaar dhamaad (flat end mill) waa la diidaa: ma leh cirif uu ku cabbiro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarinnada waxay ka bilaabmaan \u003Cstrong\u003Egeesta moodeelka, gudaha u socda\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003Esare ka, hoos u socda\u003C/strong\u003E. Waa xariiqyada masaafada dusha (ma aha kuwa dhererka), marka sagxadaha janjeerka leh waxay ku dhow yihiin qorshaha, sagxadaha sinaanta ahna waxay ku baaxad weyn yihiin. Masaafada waxaa lagu cabbiraa shabakad dusha ka dul taal, waana sax ilaa qiyaastii 1 %; dhererka cirifka waa sax meelaha dusha sinaanta leh ama si tartiib ah u qalloocan, waxaana ku dhow meelaha si degdeg ah u qalloocan. \u003Cstrong\u003EClimb\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu dusha dhinaca sare ku haya midig qalabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-waddooyinku-u-wanaagsan-yihiin\"\u003ESida waddooyinku u wanaagsan yihiin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa tijaabooyinku hubiyaan, iyagoo adeegsanaya qaacido xiran ama baaritaan xoog ah oo madax-bannaan oo ku saabsan dhululubta qalabka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhererka barta qalabka ee hoosta qalabka waa sax bar kubbad, bull-nose iyo qalab sinaan ah oo ku taal wejiyada, geesaha iyo kulmaanta shabakadda, weligiinna kama sarreeyo dhererka dhabta ah; xariiqyada isbarbar ah, waddadu waxay ku jirtaa dulqaadkaas, iyadoo aan godan oo ka qoto dheer dulqaadkaas la arag.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhererka waddooyinka ee dusha sinaanta ah waxay u dhigmaan qaacidada xiran; marinnada skallop ee dusha sinaanta ah waa masaafada la codsaday oo ka fog, cirifka ka dhexeeyana wuxuu yimaadaa dhererka la codsaday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETijaabada agabka ayaa muujisa ma jiro godan ka dib marin, waxayna muujinaysaa cirifyada ka hara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa aan ahayn waddooyinkan: waa marino dhamaystir oo aasaasi ah, ma aha wax kasta oo nidaam wax soo saar casri ah bixiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELama dhisin\u003C/strong\u003E: dhamaystirka waterline (dhererka joogto ah), nadiifinta pencil iyo geesaha, marinnada radial iyo spiral, mashruuca qalooca dusha, ogaanshaha dhulka sinaanta ah, hubinta is-jiidhka qabashada iyo gees-hoosta qalabka. Jarista iyo jiifsashada qayb-qayb ah waa howlgallo gaar ah (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/rough-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/rough-3d\"\u003E3D roughing and rest machining\u003C/a\u003E); qalab leexda waa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/multi-axis#5-axis-finishing\" data-topic=\"partcraft/multi-axis\" data-hash=\"5-axis-finishing\"\u003E5-axis finishing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhexda qalabka waxay sii jirtaa moodeelka dushiisa: waddooyinku waxay joogsadaan geesta moodeelka halkii ay ka baxeen, sidaas darteed darbi toosan oo ku dhow geesta ma dhamaysmo ilaa cagtiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa-hoos-gal lama arko (dusha waa waxa qalabku ka kulmo kor ka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMoodeelka waa mesh-ka kernel-ka, marka waddooyinku raacaan mesh-ka (dulqaadka chord-ka qiyaastii 0.0002 ee dhererka dhererka qaybta), ma aha dusha saxda ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaystirka moodeel weyn oo dulqaad fiican leh wuxuu sameeyaa barnaamij dheer oo leh dhaqdhaqaaqyo gaaban oo badan. Hubi wax-soo-saarka simulator-ka mashiinkaaga ka hor inta aanad jarin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Laba howlgal oo ku jira Wax soo saarka ayaa jari doona dusha moodeelka oo dhan iyadoo qalabka lagu hayo toosan (saddex tiir). Ma qaataan wax xulasho ah: waxay ku shaqeeyaan qaybta moodeelka oo dhan ee laga arki karo kor ka. Marka hore qaybta ku dhow (adaptive ama pocket); marinka dhamaystirka ee agab aan la jarin ku jira wuxuu digniin siinayaa inay jari doonto qoto dheer. Isbarbar Xariiqyo toosan oo dhinac-dhinac ah moodeelka oo ku jira xagasha aad dejisay, oo u dhexeeya tallaabo-kala-fogaan (qayb ka mid ah dhexroorka qalabka). Xariiq kasta wuxuu raacaa dusha: meesha ay qalabka dhabta ah ku taal waa sare sida loo baahan yahay in aan qayb kasta oo qalabka ah ka hoosreyn moodeelka, xariiqna wuxuu noqdaa mid si fiican loo jaray meel kasta oo dusha ay ku fiiqanto. Marka Zig-zag la furo, qalabku wuxuu ku sii jiraa xariiqyada dhexdooda meelaha ay ku badbaado tahay (waa la hubiyaa dhaqdhaqaaqa); haddii kale wuu kor u qaadaa. Dulqaadka: intee le'eg qayb toosan oo xariiq ah ayaa ka fogaan karta dhererka saxda ah ee dhabta ah ee qalabka (nus ayaa loo adeegsadaa xadka dhexda qayb kasta). Caadiga ah 0.01 mm. Kaliya meelaha dusha ay ka ugu yaraan … ilaa ka badan … (°): dhamaystir meelaha yaryar oo keliya ama kuwa janjeerka badan oo keliya. Meelaha dusha ka baxsan kala-duwanaanshaha ayaa xariiqa laga reebaa oo qalabku kor ayuu u kacaa. Agab la reebo: moodeelka oo laga dhigay masaafadaas (qalabka oo la weyneeyay: saxda qalabyada kubbadda iyo bull-nose; qalab falaar ah wuxuu reebaa ugu yaraan masaafadaas). Hoose: wax aan la jari doonin ka hooseeya z-kan. Skallop Marino ku qaadan masaafo joogto ah oo dusha ah, si cirifka (skallop) ka dhexeeya labo marin oo dariska ah uu u yeesho dhererka aad codsatay. Masaafada waxay ka soo baxdaa dhererka iyo radius-ka kubbadda: s = 2·√(2·R·h − h²), tusaale ahaan qiyaastii 0.69 mm marinada ka dhexeeya kubbad Ø6 ah iyo cirif 0.02 mm ah. Qalab bull-nose wuxuu isticmaalaa radius-ka geeskiisa. Falaar dhamaad (flat end mill) waa la diidaa: ma leh cirif uu ku cabbiro. Marinnada waxay ka bilaabmaan geesta moodeelka, gudaha u socda ama sare ka, hoos u socda. Waa xariiqyada masaafada dusha (ma aha kuwa dhererka), marka sagxadaha janjeerka leh waxay ku dhow yihiin qorshaha, sagxadaha sinaanta ahna waxay ku baaxad weyn yihiin. Masaafada waxaa lagu cabbiraa shabakad dusha ka dul taal, waana sax ilaa qiyaastii 1 %; dhererka cirifka waa sax meelaha dusha sinaanta leh ama si tartiib ah u qalloocan, waxaana ku dhow meelaha si degdeg ah u qalloocan. Climb wuxuu dusha dhinaca sare ku haya midig qalabka. Sida waddooyinku u wanaagsan yihiin Waxa tijaabooyinku hubiyaan, iyagoo adeegsanaya qaacido xiran ama baaritaan xoog ah oo madax-bannaan oo ku saabsan dhululubta qalabka: Dhererka barta qalabka ee hoosta qalabka waa sax bar kubbad, bull-nose iyo qalab sinaan ah oo ku taal wejiyada, geesaha iyo kulmaanta shabakadda, weligiinna kama sarreeyo dhererka dhabta ah; xariiqyada isbarbar ah, waddadu waxay ku jirtaa dulqaadkaas, iyadoo aan godan oo ka qoto dheer dulqaadkaas la arag. Dhererka waddooyinka ee dusha sinaanta ah waxay u dhigmaan qaacidada xiran; marinnada skallop ee dusha sinaanta ah waa masaafada la codsaday oo ka fog, cirifka ka dhexeeyana wuxuu yimaadaa dhererka la codsaday. Tijaabada agabka ayaa muujisa ma jiro godan ka dib marin, waxayna muujinaysaa cirifyada ka hara. Waxa aan ahayn waddooyinkan: waa marino dhamaystir oo aasaasi ah, ma aha wax kasta oo nidaam wax soo saar casri ah bixiyo. Lama dhisin: dhamaystirka waterline (dhererka joogto ah), nadiifinta pencil iyo geesaha, marinnada radial iyo spiral, mashruuca qalooca dusha, ogaanshaha dhulka sinaanta ah, hubinta is-jiidhka qabashada iyo gees-hoosta qalabka. Jarista iyo jiifsashada qayb-qayb ah waa howlgallo gaar ah (3D roughing and rest machining); qalab leexda waa 5-axis finishing. Dhexda qalabka waxay sii jirtaa moodeelka dushiisa: waddooyinku waxay joogsadaan geesta moodeelka halkii ay ka baxeen, sidaas darteed darbi toosan oo ku dhow geesta ma dhamaysmo ilaa cagtiisa. Ka-hoos-gal lama arko (dusha waa waxa qalabku ka kulmo kor ka). Moodeelka waa mesh-ka kernel-ka, marka waddooyinku raacaan mesh-ka (dulqaadka chord-ka qiyaastii 0.0002 ee dhererka dhererka qaybta), ma aha dusha saxda ah. Dhamaystirka moodeel weyn oo dulqaad fiican leh wuxuu sameeyaa barnaamij dheer oo leh dhaqdhaqaaqyo gaaban oo badan. Hubi wax-soo-saarka simulator-ka mashiinkaaga ka hor inta aanad jarin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"simulation","scope":"partcraft","title":"Hubi xoogga iyo go'idda (Simulation)","summary":"Dooro birta, go'i dusha, ku dar xoog, cadaadis ama miisaanka qaybta, xal, oo ka akhri von Mises stress, displacement, safety factor, reactions iyo natural frequencies moodeelka, iyo waxa habku sheegi karo iyo waxa uusan sheegi karin.","section":"tasks","order":142,"keywords":["simulation","FEA","falanqaynta toosa","cusboonaysii intaad tafatirto","jebi","maxaa marka hore jebiya","qiimaha culeyska","aan-toosnayn","plastikiyo","dhalinta","istiraan plastik","laba-khadood","taabasho","lamaane taabasho","ciqaab","xidhan","taabasho la'aan xoog-gelin","CalculiX",".inp",".frd","dhammaad-curiye","xoog","istiraan","von Mises","dhaqdhaqaaq","go'id","qiimaha nabad-galyada","dhalin","falcelin","culeys","xoog","cadaadis","culeyska dhulka","miisaan","go'an","taageero","xidhiidh","birta","bir","aluminium","titanium","ABS","PLA","nylon","natural frequency","modal","gariir","mesh","cabbirka elementka","tetrahedral","tetrahedra","tet mesh","voxel","tayada mesh-ka","principal stress","istiraanka isku mid ah","qiyaasta qaladka","dusha wareegsan","godad","fillets","adaptive","nuxurinta otomaatiga ah","h-adaptive","isku-ururin","mesh convergence","dusha saxda ah","sfeer","koon","torus","spline","freeform"],"headings":[{"id":"dejiso-daraasad","text":"Dejiso daraasad","level":2},{"id":"nuxur-si-toos-ah","text":"Nuxur si toos ah","level":3},{"id":"hay-ka-dibna-culeys","text":"Hay ka dibna culeys","level":2},{"id":"xal-oo-akhri-natiijooyinka","text":"Xal oo akhri natiijooyinka","level":2},{"id":"dhalinta-iyo-taabashada-daraasadaha-aan-toosnayn","text":"Dhalinta iyo taabashada (daraasadaha aan-toosnayn)","level":2},{"id":"socodsii-calculix","text":"Socodsii CalculiX","level":2},{"id":"intee-ayay-ku-kalsoonaan-karaa","text":"Intee ayay ku kalsoonaan karaa","level":2},{"id":"cusboonaysii-intaad-tafatirto-live","text":"Cusboonaysii intaad tafatirto (Live)","level":2},{"id":"ogow-waxa-marka-hore-jebiya-break-it","text":"Ogow waxa marka hore jebiya (Break it)","level":2},{"id":"xidhiidh","text":"Xidhiidh","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EGoobta Simulation-ku wuxuu ka jawaabaa su&#039;aasha &quot;ma gooni doonaa ama ma jebi doonaa culeyskan hoosteeda?&quot; qaybta aad moodelayso. Waa daraasad \u003Cstrong\u003Elinear static\u003C/strong\u003E (go&#039;id yar, birtu weli way dhalaalaysaa) ama daraasad \u003Cstrong\u003Enatural frequency\u003C/strong\u003E, oo lagu xalliyo mesh tetrahedra quadratic ah oo raacaya dusha qaybta (ama, haddii aad doorto, kuubbado isku mid ah oo yar). Waxay ku shaqeysaa dusha magacaysan ee mesh kernel-ku siiyo qaybta (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003ESimulation\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E ee bidix ee toolbar-ka. Qaybtaadu ma beddelato; daraasadda waxa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka qaybta, isbeddel kasta oo ku dhacaa waa la ka noqon karaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejiso-daraasad\"\u003EDejiso daraasad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Cstrong\u003ENew study\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E. Panelku wuxuu tusayaa adkaynta (E), Poisson&#039;s ratio, cufnaanta iyo xoogga dhalinta. Qiimayaashu waa tirooyin caadi ah oo buug-gacmeed ah; qiimayaasha la xaqiijiyay ee bixiyahaaga ayaa laga yaabaa inay kala duwanaadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EMesh\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETetrahedral (accurate)\u003C/strong\u003E, caadiga: tetrahedra 10-node ah oo dusheeda dibadda ku yaal dusha qaybta, oo geesaha qallooca ah ee godadka, fillets-ka iyo dusha kale ee wareegsan. Barta dusha falaska, silinda, kooniga, sfeerka iyo toroid, dusha la jaray iyo la soo bixiyay iyo dusha freeform (B-spline) waxay ku sugan yihiin dusha saxda ah; nooc kasta oo kale oo dusha ah wuxuu raacaa display mesh-kiisa, miiskuna wuxuu sheegaa dusha intee ah ee sidaas samaysay. Mesh-ka wuxuu si iskiis ah u noqdaa mid nuxur badan dhinacyada wareegsan, darbiyada khafiifka ah iyo geesaha qalalan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVoxel cubes (fast)\u003C/strong\u003E: qaybta oo lagu buuxiyey kuubbado isku mid ah. Degdeg, laakiin dusha wareegsan waxay noqdaan tallaabo. Daraasadaha la kaydiyay ka hor tetrahedral mesh-ka way sii haysaan kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa tag \u003Cstrong\u003EElement size\u003C/strong\u003E madhan si aad u hesho cabbir otomaatig (qiyaastii 12,000 tetrahedra, ama 20,000 kuub), ama ku qor mm. Panelku wuxuu tusayaa qiyaastii inta elements ee sidaas samaynaysa ka hor inta lagu daro meelaha nuxurka badan. Tetrahedra-dii, \u003Cstrong\u003ESmaller elements on curved faces\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga on) wuxuu nuxurinayaa godadka iyo fillets-ka, halkaas oo xoogga badanaa uu sare u kaco.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"nuxur-si-toos-ah\"\u003ENuxur si toos ah\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETetrahedra, daraasad static ama buckling (aan culeys kulul lahayn), daraasad natural-frequency iyo daraasad thermal joogto ah waxay bixiyaan \u003Cstrong\u003ERefine automatically (adaptive)\u003C/strong\u003E. Calaamadi oo deji:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETarget error (%)\u003C/strong\u003E: xalinta way joogsataa marka qaladka la qiyaasay ka yar yahay (1 % marka hore).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMost passes\u003C/strong\u003E: ugu badan ee xalinta ay samayn karto (5 marka hore, ugu badnaan 10).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMar kasta xalinta wuxuu xalinayaa, wuxuu helayaa elements-ka qaladka qiyaasay ee ugu weyn, wuxuu jebiyaa (iyo sida yar ee xiriiriyayaasha ah ee loo baahan yahay si mesh-ku u sii buuxo), ka dibna mar kale wuu xalinayaa. Nodes cusub dusha wareegsan waxay u gudbaan dusha saxda ah. Natiijooyinka markaa waxay muujinayaan miis iyo chart, oo mar kasta ah elements, unknowns, qaladka la qiyaasay iyo xoogga ugu sarreeya (ama heerkulka) iyo barbaadidda (ama heat flux), iyo khad sabab u sheegaya inta uu joogsaday: yoolka waa la gaadhay, marxaladdii way dhammaadeen, mesh-ka xiga aad buu u weyn doonaa, ama xal mid ayaa fashilmay (kaas oo markaas arkaysaa xalkii ugu dambeeyay ee wanaagsanaa).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiyaasta ku akhri qiyaas. Waxay (Zienkiewicz–Zhu, marka loo barbar dhigo jawaabaha saxda ah waxay akhrisaa 0.6 ilaa 0.95 qaladka runta ah) cabbiraysaa qaladka \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaybta oo dhan\u003C/strong\u003E, sidaas darteed xoogga ugu sarreeya godka ama fillet-ka badanaa wali waa xoog yar ayuu khaldan yahay marka qiyaasuhu yar yahay: xoog-urursiga, yool ka dhig ka yar 1 % oo daawo xoogga oo xasiladaysa marxalad ka marxalad. Geesaha gudaha ee qalalan ama geeska dusha go&#039;an xoogga runta ah waa aan dhammaad lahayn, sidaas darteed qiyaasta weligeed ma gaadho; marxaladdii waxay dhammaadaan halkii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENatural frequencies iyo buckling.\u003C/strong\u003E Daraasadda natural-frequency qiyaasuhu wuxuu daboolayaa mode kasta oo aad codsatay, mid kastaa si isku mid ah loo tiriyaa; miiska iyo chart-ku waxay raacaan laba frequency ee ugu horreeya. Qaybta dusha toosan oo kaliya leh, frequency wuxuu hoos u dhacaa kaliya marxalad ka marxalad (mesh kasta wuxuu hayaa kii hore); dusha wareegsan ayaa sidoo kale u dhowaada qaabkooda runta ah, taas oo frequency-ka wax yar u dhaqaajin karta labada dhinac. Buckling-ka, qiyaasuhu wuxuu daboolayaa pre-stress iyo modes-ka buckling, miiskuna wuxuu raacaa load factors-ka. Waxa la hubiyay bar bir ah 100 × 10 × 10 mm ah: frequency-ka ugu horreeya wuxuu ka xasilay 812.4 ilaa 811.9 Hz afar marxaladood, 0.4 % ka hooseeya Euler–Bernoulli (oo aan tixgelinin shear-ka), iyo load factor-ka tiirka 0.5 % Euler dhexdiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hay-ka-dibna-culeys\"\u003EHay ka dibna culeys\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaraasad kasta waxay u baahan tahay ugu yaraan hal taageero iyo, xoogga ku saabsan, hal culeys.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGo&#039;an\u003C/span\u003E toolbar-ka. Taageerada cusub waa la doortaa oo wuxuu sugayaa dusha: guji dusha la hayo go&#039;an (guji dusha mar kale si aad uga saarto). Taabo \u003Cstrong\u003EDhammee dooritaanka\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka aad dhammayso. Koonyo buluug ah ayaa calaamadinaya dusha la hayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXoog\u003C/span\u003E oo guji dusha uu xoogga saaro. Panelka ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003ETotal force\u003C/strong\u003E newton-ka oo dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDirection\u003C/strong\u003E: gudaha dusha, ama dhinac tiir. Xoogga waxaa lagu wadaagaa dusha la doortay sida ballaca. Fallaadho oranji ah ayaa tusaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadaadis\u003C/span\u003E cadaadis MPa (N/mm²) oo ku riixaya dusha la doortay; cadaadis taban wuxuu jiidaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENoocyo kale waxay ku jiraan liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar\u003C/strong\u003E ee panelka: \u003Cstrong\u003EFrictionless face\u003C/strong\u003E (dusha wuu isku dhaadhaci karaa laakiin kama guuri karo; isticmaal dusha simmetry iyo taageerada siman) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EGravity\u003C/strong\u003E (culeyska dhulka: miisaanka qaybta, 9.81 m/s², jihada aad doorto).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaageero aan qaybta u daayin inay dhaadhacdo ama wareegto waa la diidaa, iyada oo sheegaysa dhaqdhaqaaqa ay ka hadhay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xal-oo-akhri-natiijooyinka\"\u003EXal oo akhri natiijooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXal\u003C/span\u003E. Shaqadu wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa background-ka; \u003Cstrong\u003EStop\u003C/strong\u003E wuu joojiyaa. Markaas:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta waxaa lagu midabeeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Evon Mises stress\u003C/strong\u003E; dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDisplacement\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ESafety factor\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003EShow\u003C/strong\u003E. Legend-ku wuxuu sheegaa miisaanka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu tilmaan qaybta si aad u akhrido qiimayaasha hoosta jiirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EDeformed shape\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u aragto qaybta oo qallooctay (dhaqdhaqaaqa waa la weyneeyaa \u003Cstrong\u003EScale\u003C/strong\u003E-ka; kan runta ahi waa miiska).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiiska wuxuu soo bandhigaa xoogga ugu weyn iyo meesha uu ku yaal, barbaadidda ugu weyn, \u003Cstrong\u003Esafety factor\u003C/strong\u003E ugu yar (xoogga dhalinta ÷ von Mises stress; ka hooseeya 1 birtu way dhalaalaysaa), culeyska la dhaqay iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ereactions\u003C/strong\u003E taageerooyinka (waxay isku miisaamayaan culeyska), iyo mesh-ka la isticmaalay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhoof natiijooyinka ama dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u aragto \u003Cstrong\u003Enatural frequencies\u003C/strong\u003E, dejiso inta \u003Cstrong\u003EModes\u003C/strong\u003E, ka dibna xal. Mode kasta wuxuu muujinayaa frequency-kiisa iyo qaabkiisa (qaababka waxaa loo miisaamaa 1 dhaqdhaqaaqooda ugu weyn).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad qaybta beddesho, natiijooyinka waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa inay hadhay: mar kale xal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhalinta-iyo-taabashada-daraasadaha-aan-toosnayn\"\u003EDhalinta iyo taabashada (daraasadaha aan-toosnayn)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabo nooc oo daraasad oo dheeraad ah ayaa ka gudba &quot;birtu way ku sii jirtaa go&#039;id la&#039;aan&quot;:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENonlinear (material yields)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu raacaa khadka toosan ee birta ilaa xoogga dhalinta, ka dibna nidaam tirtir ah (\u003Cstrong\u003ESlope after yield\u003C/strong\u003E, 1 % ee E marka madhan la eego). Culeysku wuxuu sii socdaa \u003Cstrong\u003ELoad steps\u003C/strong\u003E; tallaabada aan xasilin waxaa lagu dhex-jeexaa isaga. Natiijooyinka waxaa lagu daraa \u003Cstrong\u003EPlastic strain\u003C/strong\u003E plots-ka, waxayna sheegaan inta culeysku ka qaatay. Haddii tallaabo weli aanu xasilin, daraasadu wuxuu joogsadaa tallaabadii ugu dambaysay ee wanaagsanayd, panelka Dhibaatooyinka ⚠ ayaa sheegaya meesha: qaybtu halkaas xoog buu ka dhamaaday (dhac), ama tallaabooyinku waa weyn yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EContact between pieces\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ogolaanayaa qaybaha kala gaarka ah ee qaybta inay isku riixaan. Ku dar \u003Cstrong\u003EContact pair\u003C/strong\u003E, dooro dusha A (dusha riixa) oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro wejiyada\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna dusha B oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro wejiyada dhinaca B\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EFrictionless\u003C/strong\u003E qaybaha way riixaan, dhaadhacaan oo kala baxaan; \u003Cstrong\u003Ebonded\u003C/strong\u003E qaybaha way xidhan yihiin. Qayb kasta waxaa lagu meshaynayaa keligeed, sidaas darteed farqi yar oo u dhexeeya waa wanaagsan. Contact waa habka ciqaabta: qaybaha way isku galaan wax yar (\u003Cstrong\u003Epenalty factor\u003C/strong\u003E × E ÷ element size wuxuu dejiyaa adkaanta taabashada). Miiska wuxuu muujinayaa galka ugu qotada badan, panelka Dhibaatooyinka ayaa digaya marka uu ka badan yahay 1 % ee element size: kor u qaad factor-ka ama isticmaal elements yar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabaduba waxay isticmaalaan tetrahedral mesh. Ilaa hadda halkan ma xallinayno xoog-gelinta, dhaadhac weyn iyo wareeg weyn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socodsii-calculix\"\u003ESocodsii CalculiX\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhoof › CalculiX deck (.inp)\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave a CalculiX deck (.inp)\u003C/span\u003E panelka) wuxuu kaydiyaa daraasadda sida faylka gelinta CalculiX, barnaamij kale oo aad rakibto oo aad shaqeysid adigu: mesh-kii, birtii, taageeradii, culeysyadii iyo lamaanaha taabashada, mm, N iyo MPa. Socodsii, markaas \u003Cstrong\u003EDhoof › CalculiX results (.frd)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa faylka natiijada ee CalculiX kaas oo ku dhigaya isla mesh-ka, wuxuuna muujinayaa barbaadidda (iyo von Mises stress haddii faylku xoogga ku jiro). Haddii aad qaybta ama element size beddesho intaas u dhaxeysa, mesh-ku ma isku mid aha oo PartCraft wuu sheegaa: kaydi deck cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"intee-ayay-ku-kalsoonaan-karaa\"\u003EIntee ayay ku kalsoonaan karaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu hubiyaa xalkiisa marka loo barbar dhigo qaabab gacanta ah (go&#039;id cantilever-ka PL³/3EI oo 1 % dhex jira, dheeraanta bar-ka PL/AE oo saxda ah, frequency-ka ugu horreeya ee cantilever-ka 3 % dhex jira, xoogga godka ku wareegsan dusha dhexdeeda). Hadana, ku hay xaddidaadyadan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMesh-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Tetrahedra: PartCraft wuxuu hubiyaa go&#039;iddiisa cantilever-ka iyo xoogga foorarka (dhex 0.3 %), xoogga godka ku jira dusha (Kt, ku dhow 1 %), tuubo qaro weyn oo cadaadis hoosta (Lamé, 0.3 %) iyo frequency-ka ugu horreeya (0.4 %). Miiska wuxuu tusayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Etayada mesh-ka\u003C/strong\u003E (xagasha ugu yar iyo ugu weyn ee dusha elements-ka; ka hooseeya 10° element-ku waa liita) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaladka xoogga la qiyaasay\u003C/strong\u003E: haddii uu ka badan yahay dhawr boqolley, mar kale xal element size yar, ama ka daa \u003Cstrong\u003ERefine automatically\u003C/strong\u003E inuu sameeyo. Dusha leh god iyo laba notch oo geesood ah, nuxurka otomaatiga ah wuxuu gaadhay 1 % ee Kt-ka buugga dhexdiisa, isagoo isticmaalay qiyaastii lix meelood hal meel unknowns-ka oo ay u baahan tahay mesh-ka oo dhan inuu sii khafiifo. Voxel kuubbado ku, godka ama fillet-ka waa tallaabo ku dhowaad cabbirka kuubka, sidaas darteed xoogga halkaas waa qiyaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha gudaha ee qalalan iyo geesaha dusha go&#039;an ma lahan xoog-sare runta ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Qiimaha halkaas wuu sii korayaa intii elements-ka yaraanaysa. Xoogga ka akhri meel ka fog sidaas oo kale, ama geeska ku wareeg moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENatiijooyinka la akhrin karo.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka laga reebo von Mises stress, barbaadidda iyo safety factor, daraasad tetrahedral wuxuu tusayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Exoogga ugu weyn iyo ugu yar ee principal\u003C/strong\u003E (tension iyo compression) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eequivalent strain\u003C/strong\u003E. Calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EShow mesh\u003C/strong\u003E si aad elements-ka u aragto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDaraasadaha static waa linear iyo elastic.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhalinta iyo taabashada isticmaal noocyada daraasadda aan-toosnayn ee kor ku xusan; go&#039;id weyn iyo fatigue lama xalinayo. Kulaylka, xoogga kulaylka iyo linear buckling waa noocyo daraasad gaar ah: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\" data-topic=\"partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\"\u003EKulaylka, xoogga kulaylka iyo buckling\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBirta kasta ayaa isku mid ah dhinac walba.\u003C/strong\u003E Plastigyada la daabacay 3D waa kuwo ka daran jihada layers-kooda, inta badan ugu yaraan saddex meelood meel ama ka badan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETani waa dhismo tijaabo ah: hubi qaybaha muhiimka ah habka kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cusboonaysii-intaad-tafatirto-live\"\u003ECusboonaysii intaad tafatirto (Live)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EUpdate while I edit\u003C/strong\u003E block-ka Solve, daraasadda Simulation-ku wuxuu raacaa tafatirkaaga. Beddel cabbir, culeys, birta ama deegaanka, \u003Cstrong\u003Ejawaab degdeg ah\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa isla markiiba soo muuqata, oo lagu sameeyay elements afar jeer ka weyn kuwa daraasadda; marka aad ku joogsato wax yar (qiyaastii hal ilbiriqsi), daraasadda \u003Cstrong\u003Ejawaabta la sifeeyay\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa beddelaysa. Natiijooyinku waxay sheegaan midka aad eegayso (&quot;Quick answer&quot; ama &quot;Refined answer&quot;) iyo element size. Jawaabta degdegga ah waa wanaagsan tilmaan iyo cabbir: cantilever bir ah wuxuu ku dhowaa 1 % go&#039;iddiisa iyo ku dhowaad 4 % xoogga ee jawaabta la sifeeyay. Midka la sifeeyay ku kalsoonow tirooyinka aad isticmaali doonto. Daraasadaha static, natural-frequency, thermal iyo buckling waxay u shaqeeyaan sidan; Live waa dejinta muuqaalka oo qaybta kuma kaydsamo. Xal aad adigu riixdo wuxuu sii joogaa sidaas ilaa tafatir xiga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ogow-waxa-marka-hore-jebiya-break-it\"\u003EOgow waxa marka hore jebiya (Break it)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaraasadda static ama buckling, riix \u003Cstrong\u003EWhat breaks first?\u003C/strong\u003E block-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EBreak it\u003C/strong\u003E. PartCraft wuxuu cabbiraa culeyska daraasadda (xoog, cadaadis iyo miisaan wadajir) ilaa qaybtu ay ka hoos dhacdo, wuxuuna liistaa, kan ugu xun marka hore, \u003Cstrong\u003Eload factor to first yield\u003C/strong\u003E (factor-ka culeyska hadda ee xoogga von Mises ee ugu sarreeya gaadho xoogga dhalinta, calaamad cas oo meesha ay ku dhacdo) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eload factor to buckling\u003C/strong\u003E isla taageerooyinka iyo culeysyada. Factor 4.3 waxa uu sheegaa in qaybtu qaadi karto 4.3 jeer culeyskeeda ka hor inta aysan dhalin; \u003Cstrong\u003Efactor ka yar 1 waxa uu sheegayaa inay horay u hoos dhacday sida loo culeysay\u003C/strong\u003E, taas oo ka muuqata liiska Dhibaatooyinka sida khalad (sida ugu yar ee natiijada loo sheego digniin ayaa lagu tusaa xitaa marka wax kasta sax yihiin). Factors-ka waxay ka yimaadaan daraasad toosan oo tetrahedra ah oo ku dhex jira element size-kaaga, sidaas darteed waa wanaagsan sida daraasadda ay tahay: xoogga taageero go&#039;an ama geesaha qalalan ma lahan xoog-sare runta ah (eeg hoos), factor-ka dhalinta wuxuu noqon doonaa dhinaca feejignaanta halkaas. Kaaliyahaagu wuxuu ku shaqayn karaa isla hubinta isagoo adeegsanaya qalabka \u003Ccode\u003Ebreak_run\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xidhiidh\"\u003EXidhiidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\" data-topic=\"partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\"\u003EKulaylka, xoogga kulaylka iyo buckling\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/generative-design\" data-topic=\"partcraft/generative-design\"\u003EKoro qaab culeysyada ka (Generative)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"partcraft/measure\"\u003ECabbir masaafooyinka, xagalka iyo miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa wali aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Goobta Simulation-ku wuxuu ka jawaabaa su'aasha \"ma gooni doonaa ama ma jebi doonaa culeyskan hoosteeda?\" qaybta aad moodelayso. Waa daraasad linear static (go'id yar, birtu weli way dhalaalaysaa) ama daraasad natural frequency, oo lagu xalliyo mesh tetrahedra quadratic ah oo raacaya dusha qaybta (ama, haddii aad doorto, kuubbado isku mid ah oo yar). Waxay ku shaqeysaa dusha magacaysan ee mesh kernel-ku siiyo qaybta (eeg Mesh kernel). Dooro Simulation sanduuqa Workspace ee bidix ee toolbar-ka. Qaybtaadu ma beddelato; daraasadda waxa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka qaybta, isbeddel kasta oo ku dhacaa waa la ka noqon karaa. Dejiso daraasad Taabo New study panelka midig. Dooro Material. Panelku wuxuu tusayaa adkaynta (E), Poisson's ratio, cufnaanta iyo xoogga dhalinta. Qiimayaashu waa tirooyin caadi ah oo buug-gacmeed ah; qiimayaasha la xaqiijiyay ee bixiyahaaga ayaa laga yaabaa inay kala duwanaadaan. Dooro Mesh: Tetrahedral (accurate), caadiga: tetrahedra 10-node ah oo dusheeda dibadda ku yaal dusha qaybta, oo geesaha qallooca ah ee godadka, fillets-ka iyo dusha kale ee wareegsan. Barta dusha falaska, silinda, kooniga, sfeerka iyo toroid, dusha la jaray iyo la soo bixiyay iyo dusha freeform (B-spline) waxay ku sugan yihiin dusha saxda ah; nooc kasta oo kale oo dusha ah wuxuu raacaa display mesh-kiisa, miiskuna wuxuu sheegaa dusha intee ah ee sidaas samaysay. Mesh-ka wuxuu si iskiis ah u noqdaa mid nuxur badan dhinacyada wareegsan, darbiyada khafiifka ah iyo geesaha qalalan. Voxel cubes (fast): qaybta oo lagu buuxiyey kuubbado isku mid ah. Degdeg, laakiin dusha wareegsan waxay noqdaan tallaabo. Daraasadaha la kaydiyay ka hor tetrahedral mesh-ka way sii haysaan kan. Ka tag Element size madhan si aad u hesho cabbir otomaatig (qiyaastii 12,000 tetrahedra, ama 20,000 kuub), ama ku qor mm. Panelku wuxuu tusayaa qiyaastii inta elements ee sidaas samaynaysa ka hor inta lagu daro meelaha nuxurka badan. Tetrahedra-dii, Smaller elements on curved faces (bilowga on) wuxuu nuxurinayaa godadka iyo fillets-ka, halkaas oo xoogga badanaa uu sare u kaco. Nuxur si toos ah Tetrahedra, daraasad static ama buckling (aan culeys kulul lahayn), daraasad natural-frequency iyo daraasad thermal joogto ah waxay bixiyaan Refine automatically (adaptive). Calaamadi oo deji: Target error (%): xalinta way joogsataa marka qaladka la qiyaasay ka yar yahay (1 % marka hore). Most passes: ugu badan ee xalinta ay samayn karto (5 marka hore, ugu badnaan 10). Mar kasta xalinta wuxuu xalinayaa, wuxuu helayaa elements-ka qaladka qiyaasay ee ugu weyn, wuxuu jebiyaa (iyo sida yar ee xiriiriyayaasha ah ee loo baahan yahay si mesh-ku u sii buuxo), ka dibna mar kale wuu xalinayaa. Nodes cusub dusha wareegsan waxay u gudbaan dusha saxda ah. Natiijooyinka markaa waxay muujinayaan miis iyo chart, oo mar kasta ah elements, unknowns, qaladka la qiyaasay iyo xoogga ugu sarreeya (ama heerkulka) iyo barbaadidda (ama heat flux), iyo khad sabab u sheegaya inta uu joogsaday: yoolka waa la gaadhay, marxaladdii way dhammaadeen, mesh-ka xiga aad buu u weyn doonaa, ama xal mid ayaa fashilmay (kaas oo markaas arkaysaa xalkii ugu dambeeyay ee wanaagsanaa). Qiyaasta ku akhri qiyaas. Waxay (Zienkiewicz–Zhu, marka loo barbar dhigo jawaabaha saxda ah waxay akhrisaa 0.6 ilaa 0.95 qaladka runta ah) cabbiraysaa qaladka qaybta oo dhan, sidaas darteed xoogga ugu sarreeya godka ama fillet-ka badanaa wali waa xoog yar ayuu khaldan yahay marka qiyaasuhu yar yahay: xoog-urursiga, yool ka dhig ka yar 1 % oo daawo xoogga oo xasiladaysa marxalad ka marxalad. Geesaha gudaha ee qalalan ama geeska dusha go'an xoogga runta ah waa aan dhammaad lahayn, sidaas darteed qiyaasta weligeed ma gaadho; marxaladdii waxay dhammaadaan halkii. Natural frequencies iyo buckling. Daraasadda natural-frequency qiyaasuhu wuxuu daboolayaa mode kasta oo aad codsatay, mid kastaa si isku mid ah loo tiriyaa; miiska iyo chart-ku waxay raacaan laba frequency ee ugu horreeya. Qaybta dusha toosan oo kaliya leh, frequency wuxuu hoos u dhacaa kaliya marxalad ka marxalad (mesh kasta wuxuu hayaa kii hore); dusha wareegsan ayaa sidoo kale u dhowaada qaabkooda runta ah, taas oo frequency-ka wax yar u dhaqaajin karta labada dhinac. Buckling-ka, qiyaasuhu wuxuu daboolayaa pre-stress iyo modes-ka buckling, miiskuna wuxuu raacaa load factors-ka. Waxa la hubiyay bar bir ah 100 × 10 × 10 mm ah: frequency-ka ugu horreeya wuxuu ka xasilay 812.4 ilaa 811.9 Hz afar marxaladood, 0.4 % ka hooseeya Euler–Bernoulli (oo aan tixgelinin shear-ka), iyo load factor-ka tiirka 0.5 % Euler dhexdiisa. Hay ka dibna culeys Daraasad kasta waxay u baahan tahay ugu yaraan hal taageero iyo, xoogga ku saabsan, hal culeys. Taabo Go'an toolbar-ka. Taageerada cusub waa la doortaa oo wuxuu sugayaa dusha: guji dusha la hayo go'an (guji dusha mar kale si aad uga saarto). Taabo Dhammee dooritaanka ama Esc marka aad dhammayso. Koonyo buluug ah ayaa calaamadinaya dusha la hayo. Taabo Xoog oo guji dusha uu xoogga saaro. Panelka ku qor Total force newton-ka oo dooro Direction: gudaha dusha, ama dhinac tiir. Xoogga waxaa lagu wadaagaa dusha la doortay sida ballaca. Fallaadho oranji ah ayaa tusaya. Taabo Cadaadis cadaadis MPa (N/mm²) oo ku riixaya dusha la doortay; cadaadis taban wuxuu jiidaa. Noocyo kale waxay ku jiraan liiska Ku dar ee panelka: Frictionless face (dusha wuu isku dhaadhaci karaa laakiin kama guuri karo; isticmaal dusha simmetry iyo taageerada siman) iyo Gravity (culeyska dhulka: miisaanka qaybta, 9.81 m/s², jihada aad doorto). Taageero aan qaybta u daayin inay dhaadhacdo ama wareegto waa la diidaa, iyada oo sheegaysa dhaqdhaqaaqa ay ka hadhay. Xal oo akhri natiijooyinka Taabo Xal. Shaqadu wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa background-ka; Stop wuu joojiyaa. Markaas: Qaybta waxaa lagu midabeeyaa von Mises stress; dooro Displacement ama Safety factor ee Show. Legend-ku wuxuu sheegaa miisaanka. Ku tilmaan qaybta si aad u akhrido qiimayaasha hoosta jiirka. Calaamadi Deformed shape si aad u aragto qaybta oo qallooctay (dhaqdhaqaaqa waa la weyneeyaa Scale-ka; kan runta ahi waa miiska). Miiska wuxuu soo bandhigaa xoogga ugu weyn iyo meesha uu ku yaal, barbaadidda ugu weyn, safety factor ugu yar (xoogga dhalinta ÷ von Mises stress; ka hooseeya 1 birtu way dhalaalaysaa), culeyska la dhaqay iyo reactions taageerooyinka (waxay isku miisaamayaan culeyska), iyo mesh-ka la isticmaalay. Dhoof natiijooyinka ama dooro Type si aad u aragto natural frequencies, dejiso inta Modes, ka dibna xal. Mode kasta wuxuu muujinayaa frequency-kiisa iyo qaabkiisa (qaababka waxaa loo miisaamaa 1 dhaqdhaqaaqooda ugu weyn). Haddii aad qaybta beddesho, natiijooyinka waxaa lagu calaamadiyaa inay hadhay: mar kale xal. Dhalinta iyo taabashada (daraasadaha aan-toosnayn) Labo nooc oo daraasad oo dheeraad ah ayaa ka gudba \"birtu way ku sii jirtaa go'id la'aan\": Nonlinear (material yields) wuxuu raacaa khadka toosan ee birta ilaa xoogga dhalinta, ka dibna nidaam tirtir ah (Slope after yield, 1 % ee E marka madhan la eego). Culeysku wuxuu sii socdaa Load steps; tallaabada aan xasilin waxaa lagu dhex-jeexaa isaga. Natiijooyinka waxaa lagu daraa Plastic strain plots-ka, waxayna sheegaan inta culeysku ka qaatay. Haddii tallaabo weli aanu xasilin, daraasadu wuxuu joogsadaa tallaabadii ugu dambaysay ee wanaagsanayd, panelka Dhibaatooyinka ⚠ ayaa sheegaya meesha: qaybtu halkaas xoog buu ka dhamaaday (dhac), ama tallaabooyinku waa weyn yihiin. Contact between pieces wuxuu ogolaanayaa qaybaha kala gaarka ah ee qaybta inay isku riixaan. Ku dar Contact pair, dooro dusha A (dusha riixa) oo leh Dooro wejiyada, ka dibna dusha B oo leh Dooro wejiyada dhinaca B. Frictionless qaybaha way riixaan, dhaadhacaan oo kala baxaan; bonded qaybaha way xidhan yihiin. Qayb kasta waxaa lagu meshaynayaa keligeed, sidaas darteed farqi yar oo u dhexeeya waa wanaagsan. Contact waa habka ciqaabta: qaybaha way isku galaan wax yar (penalty factor × E ÷ element size wuxuu dejiyaa adkaanta taabashada). Miiska wuxuu muujinayaa galka ugu qotada badan, panelka Dhibaatooyinka ayaa digaya marka uu ka badan yahay 1 % ee element size: kor u qaad factor-ka ama isticmaal elements yar. Labaduba waxay isticmaalaan tetrahedral mesh. Ilaa hadda halkan ma xallinayno xoog-gelinta, dhaadhac weyn iyo wareeg weyn. Socodsii CalculiX Dhoof › CalculiX deck (.inp) (ama Save a CalculiX deck (.inp) panelka) wuxuu kaydiyaa daraasadda sida faylka gelinta CalculiX, barnaamij kale oo aad rakibto oo aad shaqeysid adigu: mesh-kii, birtii, taageeradii, culeysyadii iyo lamaanaha taabashada, mm, N iyo MPa. Socodsii, markaas Dhoof › CalculiX results (.frd) wuxuu akhrinayaa faylka natiijada ee CalculiX kaas oo ku dhigaya isla mesh-ka, wuxuuna muujinayaa barbaadidda (iyo von Mises stress haddii faylku xoogga ku jiro). Haddii aad qaybta ama element size beddesho intaas u dhaxeysa, mesh-ku ma isku mid aha oo PartCraft wuu sheegaa: kaydi deck cusub. Intee ayay ku kalsoonaan karaa PartCraft wuxuu hubiyaa xalkiisa marka loo barbar dhigo qaabab gacanta ah (go'id cantilever-ka PL³/3EI oo 1 % dhex jira, dheeraanta bar-ka PL/AE oo saxda ah, frequency-ka ugu horreeya ee cantilever-ka 3 % dhex jira, xoogga godka ku wareegsan dusha dhexdeeda). Hadana, ku hay xaddidaadyadan: Mesh-ka. Tetrahedra: PartCraft wuxuu hubiyaa go'iddiisa cantilever-ka iyo xoogga foorarka (dhex 0.3 %), xoogga godka ku jira dusha (Kt, ku dhow 1 %), tuubo qaro weyn oo cadaadis hoosta (Lamé, 0.3 %) iyo frequency-ka ugu horreeya (0.4 %). Miiska wuxuu tusayaa tayada mesh-ka (xagasha ugu yar iyo ugu weyn ee dusha elements-ka; ka hooseeya 10° element-ku waa liita) iyo qaladka xoogga la qiyaasay: haddii uu ka badan yahay dhawr boqolley, mar kale xal element size yar, ama ka daa Refine automatically inuu sameeyo. Dusha leh god iyo laba notch oo geesood ah, nuxurka otomaatiga ah wuxuu gaadhay 1 % ee Kt-ka buugga dhexdiisa, isagoo isticmaalay qiyaastii lix meelood hal meel unknowns-ka oo ay u baahan tahay mesh-ka oo dhan inuu sii khafiifo. Voxel kuubbado ku, godka ama fillet-ka waa tallaabo ku dhowaad cabbirka kuubka, sidaas darteed xoogga halkaas waa qiyaas. Geesaha gudaha ee qalalan iyo geesaha dusha go'an ma lahan xoog-sare runta ah. Qiimaha halkaas wuu sii korayaa intii elements-ka yaraanaysa. Xoogga ka akhri meel ka fog sidaas oo kale, ama geeska ku wareeg moodeelka. Natiijooyinka la akhrin karo. Marka laga reebo von Mises stress, barbaadidda iyo safety factor, daraasad tetrahedral wuxuu tusayaa xoogga ugu weyn iyo ugu yar ee principal (tension iyo compression) iyo equivalent strain. Calaamadi Show mesh si aad elements-ka u aragto. Daraasadaha static waa linear iyo elastic. Dhalinta iyo taabashada isticmaal noocyada daraasadda aan-toosnayn ee kor ku xusan; go'id weyn iyo fatigue lama xalinayo. Kulaylka, xoogga kulaylka iyo linear buckling waa noocyo daraasad gaar ah: eeg Kulaylka, xoogga kulaylka iyo buckling. Birta kasta ayaa isku mid ah dhinac walba. Plastigyada la daabacay 3D waa kuwo ka daran jihada layers-kooda, inta badan ugu yaraan saddex meelood meel ama ka badan. Tani waa dhismo tijaabo ah: hubi qaybaha muhiimka ah habka kale. Cusboonaysii intaad tafatirto (Live) Calaamadi Update while I edit block-ka Solve, daraasadda Simulation-ku wuxuu raacaa tafatirkaaga. Beddel cabbir, culeys, birta ama deegaanka, jawaab degdeg ah ayaa isla markiiba soo muuqata, oo lagu sameeyay elements afar jeer ka weyn kuwa daraasadda; marka aad ku joogsato wax yar (qiyaastii hal ilbiriqsi), daraasadda jawaabta la sifeeyay ayaa beddelaysa. Natiijooyinku waxay sheegaan midka aad eegayso (\"Quick answer\" ama \"Refined answer\") iyo element size. Jawaabta degdegga ah waa wanaagsan tilmaan iyo cabbir: cantilever bir ah wuxuu ku dhowaa 1 % go'iddiisa iyo ku dhowaad 4 % xoogga ee jawaabta la sifeeyay. Midka la sifeeyay ku kalsoonow tirooyinka aad isticmaali doonto. Daraasadaha static, natural-frequency, thermal iyo buckling waxay u shaqeeyaan sidan; Live waa dejinta muuqaalka oo qaybta kuma kaydsamo. Xal aad adigu riixdo wuxuu sii joogaa sidaas ilaa tafatir xiga. Ogow waxa marka hore jebiya (Break it) Daraasadda static ama buckling, riix What breaks first? block-ka Break it. PartCraft wuxuu cabbiraa culeyska daraasadda (xoog, cadaadis iyo miisaan wadajir) ilaa qaybtu ay ka hoos dhacdo, wuxuuna liistaa, kan ugu xun marka hore, load factor to first yield (factor-ka culeyska hadda ee xoogga von Mises ee ugu sarreeya gaadho xoogga dhalinta, calaamad cas oo meesha ay ku dhacdo) iyo load factor to buckling isla taageerooyinka iyo culeysyada. Factor 4.3 waxa uu sheegaa in qaybtu qaadi karto 4.3 jeer culeyskeeda ka hor inta aysan dhalin; factor ka yar 1 waxa uu sheegayaa inay horay u hoos dhacday sida loo culeysay, taas oo ka muuqata liiska Dhibaatooyinka sida khalad (sida ugu yar ee natiijada loo sheego digniin ayaa lagu tusaa xitaa marka wax kasta sax yihiin). Factors-ka waxay ka yimaadaan daraasad toosan oo tetrahedra ah oo ku dhex jira element size-kaaga, sidaas darteed waa wanaagsan sida daraasadda ay tahay: xoogga taageero go'an ama geesaha qalalan ma lahan xoog-sare runta ah (eeg hoos), factor-ka dhalinta wuxuu noqon doonaa dhinaca feejignaanta halkaas. Kaaliyahaagu wuxuu ku shaqayn karaa isla hubinta isagoo adeegsanaya qalabka break_run. Xidhiidh Kulaylka, xoogga kulaylka iyo buckling Koro qaab culeysyada ka (Generative) Cabbir masaafooyinka, xagalka iyo miisaanka Waxa wali aan la dhisin","lang":"so"},{"slug":"thermal-and-buckling","scope":"partcraft","title":"Kulayl, istiraasta kulaylka iyo bakling","summary":"Hel heerkulka qaybta laga bilaabo heerkul go'an, socodka kulaylka, awoodda kulaylka, konveksiyon iyo shucaac (joogto ama wakhti ku xidhan), culeys istiraas leh oo ay keento kor u kaca heerkulka, iyo culeyska ay qaybta dhuuban ku bakli doonto, iyo waxa mid kasta samayn karo iyo waxa aan samayn karin.","section":"tasks","order":143,"keywords":["kulayl","gudbinta kulaylka","kulayl","heerkul","konveksiyon","isku xidhka h","shucaac","emissivity","socodka kulaylka","awoodda kulaylka","soo saarista kulaylka","heat sink","wakhti","wakhtiga","qaboojin","kululeyn","Crank–Nicolson","implicit Euler","isu dheelitirka kulaylka","istiraasta kulaylka","istiraasta kulaylka wakhtiga","quench","cillad kulayl","taariikhda istiraasta","ballaadhinta heerkulka","bakling Euler","qiimaha culeyska","culeyska dhuuban","tiir","dhuuban","eigenvalue"],"headings":[{"id":"kulayl-halkee-kulaylku-u-tagaa","text":"Kulayl: halkee kulaylku u tagaa?","level":2},{"id":"wakhtiga-ku-xidhan-transient","text":"Wakhtiga ku xidhan (transient)","level":3},{"id":"istiraasta-kulaylka-waa-maxay-isbeddelka-heerkulka-uu-qaybta-ku-sameeyo","text":"Istiraasta kulaylka: waa maxay isbeddelka heerkulka uu qaybta ku sameeyo?","level":2},{"id":"bakling-goorma-qaybta-dhuuban-ayaa-jabta","text":"Bakling: goorma qaybta dhuuban ayaa jabta?","level":2},{"id":"sida-loo-isku-kalsoonaan-karo","text":"Sida loo isku kalsoonaan karo","level":2},{"id":"wax-la-xiriira","text":"Wax la xiriira","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDaraasaddan waxay ku nool yihiin goobta Simulation oo ay ag yihiin istiraasta istaatikada iyo jeedinta dabiiciga ah (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHubi istiraasta iyo foororsiga\u003C/a\u003E). Ka dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E ee panelka. Waxay isticmaalaan isla meshka kaabooyinka yaryar iyo isla liiska walxaha; walxo kasta oo maktabada ah waxay leeyihiin conductivity kulayl, specific heat iyo expansion coefficient (qiimo handbook caadi ah, lagu muujiyey \u003Cstrong\u003EProperties\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kulayl-halkee-kulaylku-u-tagaa\"\u003EKulayl: halkee kulaylku u tagaa?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EThermal (heat transfer)\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar shuruudaha kulaylka liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd\u003C/strong\u003E ee panelka, kadibna guji wejigooda (sida lagu sameeyo taageerada iyo culeysyada):\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFixed temperature\u003C/strong\u003E: wejigu waxaa lagu hayaa heerkul, bilicsanaanta °C.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeat flux\u003C/strong\u003E: W/m² oo galaya wejiga (negative waa baxa). Waxay ku dhacdaa dusha dhabta ah ee wejiga, xitaa meesha kaabooyinka ay sameeyaan qaab derbi ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeat power\u003C/strong\u003E: wadar oo watt ah, loo qaybiyo wejiyada la doortay iyadoo laga eegayo balaadhka. Isticmaal kulaylka kulaylkeed ama shiv korontada la yaqaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EConvection\u003C/strong\u003E: hawo ama dareere heerkul leh ayaa kulaylka ka qaada oo ku dhaqaaqa h W/(m²·K). Qiimaha h caadiga ah: hawo joogsan 5–10, fan 25–100, biyo 500–10,000. PartCraft ma xisaabiyo h: study-kan ma jiro socodka dareeraha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERadiation\u003C/strong\u003E: wejigu wuxuu shucaaciyaa deriska heerkul, oo leh emissivity ka 0 ilaa 1. Waa \u003Cstrong\u003Elinearised\u003C/strong\u003E (shucaaca waxaa loo qoraa sida coefficient oo kuxiran heerkulka, oo dib loo xalliyaa ilaa uu xasilo), wuxuuna u gaadhaa deriska oo keliya: wejiyadu ma isweydaarsadaan kulayl.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeat generation\u003C/strong\u003E (W/m³) wuxuu kulaysiyaa qaybta oo dhan gudahooda, tusaale ahaan qayb iska caabta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cstrong\u003EXalli\u003C/strong\u003E. Qaybta waxaa lagu midabeeyaa heerkulka; dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EHeat flux\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003EShow\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u aragto meesha kulaylku socdo. Taabo qaybta si aad labadaba u akhrido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESocodka kulaylka joogtada ah wuxuu u baahan yahay meel uu kulaylku u tago: ugu yaraan hal heerkul go&#039;an, konveksiyon ama shucaac. Qayb kaliya oo kulayl gashaa ma leh xaalad joogto ah; sidaas darteed ka dhig wakhti ku xidhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJadwalku wuxuu muujinayaa heerkulka ugu hooseeya iyo ugu sarreeya iyo meesha ay ku yaalaan, socodka kulaylka ugu weyn, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eisu-dheelitirka kulaylka\u003C/strong\u003E: kulaylka galaya ama ka baxaya shuruud kasta (heerkul go&#039;an wuxuu tirinayaa waxa uu bixin ama nuugi lahaa), kulaylka la soo saaray, wadarta galaya iyo baxaya, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eimbalance\u003C/strong\u003E. Imbalance-ku waa inuu noqdaa qayb yar oo kulaylka galaya; haddii uu weyn yahay, natiijada lama aamini karo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"wakhtiga-ku-xidhan-transient\"\u003EWakhtiga ku xidhan (transient)\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003ETransient\u003C/strong\u003E oo bixi \u003Cstrong\u003EStart temperature\u003C/strong\u003E (qaybta oo dhan halkaas ayay ka bilaabataa), \u003Cstrong\u003ETime span\u003C/strong\u003E iyo tirada \u003Cstrong\u003ETime steps\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EImplicit Euler\u003C/strong\u003E waa adag; \u003Cstrong\u003ECrank–Nicolson\u003C/strong\u003E waa saxsan badan tallaabooyin isku mid ah, laakiin wuu wareegi karaa isbeddel degdeg ah. Kadib xalinta, jiid slider-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ETime\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u aragto heerkulka mid kasta oo wakhti ah (skaalka midabka wuxuu isku mid yahay wakhti kasta). Isu-dheelitirka kulaylka markaas wuxuu ku daraa kulaylka la kaydiyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"istiraasta-kulaylka-waa-maxay-isbeddelka-heerkulka-uu-qaybta-ku-sameeyo\"\u003EIstiraasta kulaylka: waa maxay isbeddelka heerkulka uu qaybta ku sameeyo?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaraasad \u003Cstrong\u003EStatic stress\u003C/strong\u003E (ama \u003Cstrong\u003EBuckling\u003C/strong\u003E) dhexdeeda, deji \u003Cstrong\u003EThermal load\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUniform temperature change\u003C/strong\u003E: qaybta oo dhan waa kululaanaysaa (ama qaboojinaysaa, tiro negative ah ku jirta) tiradaas kelvin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETemperatures from thermal conditions\u003C/strong\u003E: ku dar shuruudaha kulaylka daraasadda isku mid ah; heerkulada joogtada ah waa la xalliyaa marka hore isla meshka, kadibna qaybtu waa ballaadhaysaa α·(T − \u003Cstrong\u003Estress-free temperature\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETemperatures over time (transient run)\u003C/strong\u003E: ku dar shuruudaha kulaylka, kadibna bixi \u003Cstrong\u003EStart temperature\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ETime span\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ETime steps\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ETime stepping\u003C/strong\u003E sida daraasadda kulaylka ee wakhti ku xidhan. Heerkulada waxaa lagu xalliyaa wakhti isla meshka (kaabooyin ama tetrahedra), xalin istaatik oo ku saabsan heerkulka mid kasta wuxuu siiyaa istiraasta wakhtigaas. \u003Cstrong\u003EStress at\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWakhtiga ugu xun\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga): \u003Cstrong\u003EXalinta istiraasta\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu xalinayaa wakhtiyo si siman loo kala qaybiyey socodka, oo bilowga ku jira (21 haddii aadan bedelin, ugu badnaan 51). Natiijooyinku waxay ku furmaan wakhtiga leh istiraasta von Mises ee ugu weyn; jadwalku wuxuu muujinayaa magaca wakhtigaas, jaantus yar ayaa muujinaya istiraasta ugu sarreysa iyo wakhtiga, slider-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ETime\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu muujinayaa istiraasta wakhti kasta oo la xalliyay (skaalka midabka wuxuu ahaadaa kii wakhtiga ugu xun).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHal wakhti oo la doortay\u003C/strong\u003E: hal wakhti, tallaabada wakhtiga ee u dhow \u003Cstrong\u003ETime (s)\u003C/strong\u003E aad bixiso. Daraasadda bakling mar walba wakhti la doortay buu qaataa (dhamaadka socodka ama mid aad dejiso).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb la qaboojiyay (ka kulushay ilaa qabow) ama si degdeg ah u kululaysay ayaa ugu istiraasta badan inta u dhaxaysa gudaha iyo dusha ay ku kala duwan yihiin: badanaa bilowga. Heerkul la hayo wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa isagoo bilaabaya daqiiqadda koowaad, sida isbeddel degdeg ah, sidaas darteed istiraasta bilowga ah wuxuu kuxirantahay cabbirka elementa (elementaha yar oo kaliya ayaa arka isbeddelka). Akhri sidii &quot;aad u sarreeya&quot;, oo eeg wakhtiyada xiga ee slider-ka oo qiyam ay meshku xalliyo. Istiraasku waa quasi-static: lama jiro inertia, lama jiro gariir ka yimaada isbeddelka degdega ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayb xor u ah inay koraan ma leh istiraas kulayl: hayso ilaa uu dhaqdhaqaaqi karin (tusaale, saddex wejood oo aan cadaalad lahayn oo xagal xaq ah). Haddii ay dhex ku jirto laba derbi, waa la cadaadiyaa: bir cusub oo kululaysan 50 K oo u dhexeeya derbiyo adag wuxuu qaadaa qiyaastii 117 MPa. Culeysyada kulaylka naftooda ayay isu dheelitiraan, sidaas darteed falcelinta weli waxay isu dheelitirtaa culeysyada farsamada oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bakling-goorma-qaybta-dhuuban-ayaa-jabta\"\u003EBakling: goorma qaybta dhuuban ayaa jabta?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EBuckling (linear)\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E, kuna dar taageerooyin iyo culeysyo sida daraasadda istaatikada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003ELoad factors to find\u003C/strong\u003E (inta buckling mode ah).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cstrong\u003EXalli\u003C/strong\u003E. Mode kasta wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cstrong\u003Eload factor\u003C/strong\u003E: tirada culeyskaaga ee qaybta ideal ah ku bakli doonto. Load factor 3 macnaheedu waa saddex jeer culeyskaaga; \u003Cstrong\u003Eload factor ka yar 1 macnaheedu waa inuu ku bakli doono culeysyada aad dabaqday\u003C/strong\u003E. Jadwalku wuxuu sidoo kale siinayaa wadarta culeyska mid kasta. Qaabka mode-ka wuxuu muujinayaa sida uu u bakli doono (cabbirkiisu waxba ma ahan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuckling-ka linear wuxuu ka weyn yahay culeyska bakling ee dhabta ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Wuxuu u qaadanayaa qayb kaamil ah: toosan sida ugu fiican, aan istiraas hadhaa lahayn, iyo mid dhabeeya. Qaybaha dhabta ahi waxay leeyihiin qalad yar, waxayna soo gaadhi karaan ka hor, shaxda dhuuban ayaa bakli karta qiimo ka hooseeya qiimaha linear. Isticmaal margin ballaaran, oo load factor ku dhow ama ka hooseeya 3 qolofta dhuuban waa digniin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loo-isku-kalsoonaan-karo\"\u003ESida loo isku kalsoonaan karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu hubiyaa xalinta nidaamkan iyada oo lagu barbardhigayo qaacidooyin gacanta ah: bar u dhexeeya laba heerkul (saxan), fin qabow (dhexdeeda 0.3 K), balaadh kulaylka isaga (saxan), kaabo qabowsada wakhtiga ku xidhan (dhexdeeda 0.1 % oo Crank–Nicolson), bar si degdeg ah loo kululeeyey hal dhamaad, bar xor ah oo kululaysan (istiraas la&#039;aan, ΔL = αLΔT), bar u dhexeeya derbiyo (σ = −EαΔT), dhal quenched ah oo wakhti ku xidhan oo lagu barbardhigay xalka series-ka caadiga ah (dhexdeeda 1% kaabooyinka, 2.1% tetrahedra bartamaha dhalada; 0.5% dusheeda), wakhtiga ugu dambeeya ee socod dheer oo lagu barbardhigay istiraasta kulaylka joogtada (isku mid ilaa hal milyan), iyo tiirarka Euler (dhexdeeda 1% fixed–free, 1.5% pinned–pinned). Ka fiirso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiimaha walxaha joogto ah.\u003C/strong\u003E Conductivity, specific heat iyo expansion ma isbeddelaan heerkulka; heerkulada qaarkood ee boqolaad darajo ayay isbeddeli karaan 10–30 %. Adkaanta ma isbeddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIstiraasta wakhtiga waa quasi-static iyo elastic\u003C/strong\u003E: wakhti kasta waa xal istaatik (aan inertia lahayn), aanna wax yield lahayn, sidaas darteed quench oo dusha yield ku geli lahayd wuxuu tusayaa istiraas ka sarreeya yield.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiimaha convection waa geli kaaga\u003C/strong\u003E, lama xisaabiyo socodka hawo ama biyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro iska caabin xiriir\u003C/strong\u003E: qaybtu waa hal jidh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBakling linear oo keliya\u003C/strong\u003E: ma jiro imperfections, ma jiro yielding, ma jiro dabeecad ka dib bakling.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStaircase-ka kaabooyinka iyo geesaha gudaha ee adag waxay saameeyaan istiraasta kulaylka sida istiraasyada kale (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHubi istiraasta iyo foororsiga\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETani waa dhismo shaybaar: hubi qaybaha muhiimka ah habka kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-la-xiriira\"\u003EWax la xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHubi istiraasta iyo foororsiga (Simulation)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan weli la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Daraasaddan waxay ku nool yihiin goobta Simulation oo ay ag yihiin istiraasta istaatikada iyo jeedinta dabiiciga ah (eeg Hubi istiraasta iyo foororsiga). Ka dooro Type ee panelka. Waxay isticmaalaan isla meshka kaabooyinka yaryar iyo isla liiska walxaha; walxo kasta oo maktabada ah waxay leeyihiin conductivity kulayl, specific heat iyo expansion coefficient (qiimo handbook caadi ah, lagu muujiyey Properties hoosta). Kulayl: halkee kulaylku u tagaa? Dooro Thermal (heat transfer) oo ah Type. Ku dar shuruudaha kulaylka liiska Add ee panelka, kadibna guji wejigooda (sida lagu sameeyo taageerada iyo culeysyada): Fixed temperature: wejigu waxaa lagu hayaa heerkul, bilicsanaanta °C. Heat flux: W/m² oo galaya wejiga (negative waa baxa). Waxay ku dhacdaa dusha dhabta ah ee wejiga, xitaa meesha kaabooyinka ay sameeyaan qaab derbi ah. Heat power: wadar oo watt ah, loo qaybiyo wejiyada la doortay iyadoo laga eegayo balaadhka. Isticmaal kulaylka kulaylkeed ama shiv korontada la yaqaan. Convection: hawo ama dareere heerkul leh ayaa kulaylka ka qaada oo ku dhaqaaqa h W/(m²·K). Qiimaha h caadiga ah: hawo joogsan 5–10, fan 25–100, biyo 500–10,000. PartCraft ma xisaabiyo h: study-kan ma jiro socodka dareeraha. Radiation: wejigu wuxuu shucaaciyaa deriska heerkul, oo leh emissivity ka 0 ilaa 1. Waa linearised (shucaaca waxaa loo qoraa sida coefficient oo kuxiran heerkulka, oo dib loo xalliyaa ilaa uu xasilo), wuxuuna u gaadhaa deriska oo keliya: wejiyadu ma isweydaarsadaan kulayl. Heat generation (W/m³) wuxuu kulaysiyaa qaybta oo dhan gudahooda, tusaale ahaan qayb iska caabta. Riix Xalli. Qaybta waxaa lagu midabeeyaa heerkulka; dooro Heat flux ee Show si aad u aragto meesha kulaylku socdo. Taabo qaybta si aad labadaba u akhrido. Socodka kulaylka joogtada ah wuxuu u baahan yahay meel uu kulaylku u tago: ugu yaraan hal heerkul go'an, konveksiyon ama shucaac. Qayb kaliya oo kulayl gashaa ma leh xaalad joogto ah; sidaas darteed ka dhig wakhti ku xidhan. Jadwalku wuxuu muujinayaa heerkulka ugu hooseeya iyo ugu sarreeya iyo meesha ay ku yaalaan, socodka kulaylka ugu weyn, iyo isu-dheelitirka kulaylka: kulaylka galaya ama ka baxaya shuruud kasta (heerkul go'an wuxuu tirinayaa waxa uu bixin ama nuugi lahaa), kulaylka la soo saaray, wadarta galaya iyo baxaya, iyo imbalance. Imbalance-ku waa inuu noqdaa qayb yar oo kulaylka galaya; haddii uu weyn yahay, natiijada lama aamini karo. Wakhtiga ku xidhan (transient) Calaamadi Transient oo bixi Start temperature (qaybta oo dhan halkaas ayay ka bilaabataa), Time span iyo tirada Time steps. Implicit Euler waa adag; Crank–Nicolson waa saxsan badan tallaabooyin isku mid ah, laakiin wuu wareegi karaa isbeddel degdeg ah. Kadib xalinta, jiid slider-ka Time si aad u aragto heerkulka mid kasta oo wakhti ah (skaalka midabka wuxuu isku mid yahay wakhti kasta). Isu-dheelitirka kulaylka markaas wuxuu ku daraa kulaylka la kaydiyay. Istiraasta kulaylka: waa maxay isbeddelka heerkulka uu qaybta ku sameeyo? Daraasad Static stress (ama Buckling) dhexdeeda, deji Thermal load: Uniform temperature change: qaybta oo dhan waa kululaanaysaa (ama qaboojinaysaa, tiro negative ah ku jirta) tiradaas kelvin. Temperatures from thermal conditions: ku dar shuruudaha kulaylka daraasadda isku mid ah; heerkulada joogtada ah waa la xalliyaa marka hore isla meshka, kadibna qaybtu waa ballaadhaysaa α·(T − stress-free temperature). Temperatures over time (transient run): ku dar shuruudaha kulaylka, kadibna bixi Start temperature, Time span, Time steps iyo Time stepping sida daraasadda kulaylka ee wakhti ku xidhan. Heerkulada waxaa lagu xalliyaa wakhti isla meshka (kaabooyin ama tetrahedra), xalin istaatik oo ku saabsan heerkulka mid kasta wuxuu siiyaa istiraasta wakhtigaas. Stress at: Wakhtiga ugu xun (bilowga): Xalinta istiraasta wuxuu xalinayaa wakhtiyo si siman loo kala qaybiyey socodka, oo bilowga ku jira (21 haddii aadan bedelin, ugu badnaan 51). Natiijooyinku waxay ku furmaan wakhtiga leh istiraasta von Mises ee ugu weyn; jadwalku wuxuu muujinayaa magaca wakhtigaas, jaantus yar ayaa muujinaya istiraasta ugu sarreysa iyo wakhtiga, slider-ka Time wuxuu muujinayaa istiraasta wakhti kasta oo la xalliyay (skaalka midabka wuxuu ahaadaa kii wakhtiga ugu xun). Hal wakhti oo la doortay: hal wakhti, tallaabada wakhtiga ee u dhow Time (s) aad bixiso. Daraasadda bakling mar walba wakhti la doortay buu qaataa (dhamaadka socodka ama mid aad dejiso). Qayb la qaboojiyay (ka kulushay ilaa qabow) ama si degdeg ah u kululaysay ayaa ugu istiraasta badan inta u dhaxaysa gudaha iyo dusha ay ku kala duwan yihiin: badanaa bilowga. Heerkul la hayo wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa isagoo bilaabaya daqiiqadda koowaad, sida isbeddel degdeg ah, sidaas darteed istiraasta bilowga ah wuxuu kuxirantahay cabbirka elementa (elementaha yar oo kaliya ayaa arka isbeddelka). Akhri sidii \"aad u sarreeya\", oo eeg wakhtiyada xiga ee slider-ka oo qiyam ay meshku xalliyo. Istiraasku waa quasi-static: lama jiro inertia, lama jiro gariir ka yimaada isbeddelka degdega ah. Qayb xor u ah inay koraan ma leh istiraas kulayl: hayso ilaa uu dhaqdhaqaaqi karin (tusaale, saddex wejood oo aan cadaalad lahayn oo xagal xaq ah). Haddii ay dhex ku jirto laba derbi, waa la cadaadiyaa: bir cusub oo kululaysan 50 K oo u dhexeeya derbiyo adag wuxuu qaadaa qiyaastii 117 MPa. Culeysyada kulaylka naftooda ayay isu dheelitiraan, sidaas darteed falcelinta weli waxay isu dheelitirtaa culeysyada farsamada oo keliya. Bakling: goorma qaybta dhuuban ayaa jabta? Dooro Buckling (linear) oo ah Type, kuna dar taageerooyin iyo culeysyo sida daraasadda istaatikada. Deji Load factors to find (inta buckling mode ah). Riix Xalli. Mode kasta wuxuu leeyahay load factor: tirada culeyskaaga ee qaybta ideal ah ku bakli doonto. Load factor 3 macnaheedu waa saddex jeer culeyskaaga; load factor ka yar 1 macnaheedu waa inuu ku bakli doono culeysyada aad dabaqday. Jadwalku wuxuu sidoo kale siinayaa wadarta culeyska mid kasta. Qaabka mode-ka wuxuu muujinayaa sida uu u bakli doono (cabbirkiisu waxba ma ahan). Buckling-ka linear wuxuu ka weyn yahay culeyska bakling ee dhabta ah. Wuxuu u qaadanayaa qayb kaamil ah: toosan sida ugu fiican, aan istiraas hadhaa lahayn, iyo mid dhabeeya. Qaybaha dhabta ahi waxay leeyihiin qalad yar, waxayna soo gaadhi karaan ka hor, shaxda dhuuban ayaa bakli karta qiimo ka hooseeya qiimaha linear. Isticmaal margin ballaaran, oo load factor ku dhow ama ka hooseeya 3 qolofta dhuuban waa digniin. Sida loo isku kalsoonaan karo PartCraft wuxuu hubiyaa xalinta nidaamkan iyada oo lagu barbardhigayo qaacidooyin gacanta ah: bar u dhexeeya laba heerkul (saxan), fin qabow (dhexdeeda 0.3 K), balaadh kulaylka isaga (saxan), kaabo qabowsada wakhtiga ku xidhan (dhexdeeda 0.1 % oo Crank–Nicolson), bar si degdeg ah loo kululeeyey hal dhamaad, bar xor ah oo kululaysan (istiraas la'aan, ΔL = αLΔT), bar u dhexeeya derbiyo (σ = −EαΔT), dhal quenched ah oo wakhti ku xidhan oo lagu barbardhigay xalka series-ka caadiga ah (dhexdeeda 1% kaabooyinka, 2.1% tetrahedra bartamaha dhalada; 0.5% dusheeda), wakhtiga ugu dambeeya ee socod dheer oo lagu barbardhigay istiraasta kulaylka joogtada (isku mid ilaa hal milyan), iyo tiirarka Euler (dhexdeeda 1% fixed–free, 1.5% pinned–pinned). Ka fiirso: Qiimaha walxaha joogto ah. Conductivity, specific heat iyo expansion ma isbeddelaan heerkulka; heerkulada qaarkood ee boqolaad darajo ayay isbeddeli karaan 10–30 %. Adkaanta ma isbeddesho. Istiraasta wakhtiga waa quasi-static iyo elastic: wakhti kasta waa xal istaatik (aan inertia lahayn), aanna wax yield lahayn, sidaas darteed quench oo dusha yield ku geli lahayd wuxuu tusayaa istiraas ka sarreeya yield. Qiimaha convection waa geli kaaga, lama xisaabiyo socodka hawo ama biyo. Ma jiro iska caabin xiriir: qaybtu waa hal jidh. Bakling linear oo keliya: ma jiro imperfections, ma jiro yielding, ma jiro dabeecad ka dib bakling. Staircase-ka kaabooyinka iyo geesaha gudaha ee adag waxay saameeyaan istiraasta kulaylka sida istiraasyada kale (eeg Hubi istiraasta iyo foororsiga). Tani waa dhismo shaybaar: hubi qaybaha muhiimka ah habka kale. Wax la xiriira Hubi istiraasta iyo foororsiga (Simulation) Waxa aan weli la dhisin","lang":"so"},{"slug":"tool-library","scope":"partcraft","title":"Maktabadda qalabka","summary":"Kaydi qalabyada aad isticmaasho browser-ka si qayb kasta u heli karto, oo u wareeji maktabadaha qalabka kombiyuutarro kale faylka JSON ahaan.","section":"tasks","order":143,"keywords":["maktabadda qalabka","qalabyada","dhoofin","soo gelin","JSON","kaydi qalabyada","lambarka T","end mill","qalabka dukaanka"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ETools\u003C/strong\u003E ee Manufacture wuxuu liisteeyaa qalabyada qaybta. Hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ETool library\u003C/strong\u003E waxaad haysan kartaa qalabyadaada oo ka baxsan qayb keli ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave this tool\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa qalabka la doortay \u003Cstrong\u003EMy saved tools\u003C/strong\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave all of this part&#039;s tools\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa dhammaantood. My saved tools waxay ku kaydsan yihiin browser-kan, waxayna jiraan qayb kasta. Qalab aad hore u kaydisay (isku nooc, cabbir, flutes iyo overrides) lama kaydiyo labo jeer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to this part\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qalabka la kaydiyay ku geliyaa qaybta. Haddii lambarka T uu hore u isticmaalayo qalab kale oo qaybta ku jira, wuxuu helaa lambarka xorta ah ee xiga, panelkuna wuu sheegaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from my library\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa liiska la kaydiyay (ma aha qaybaha hore u haysta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport tools…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa qalabyada qaybta file \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E ah; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport tools…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa qalabyada file-kaas qaybta, iyadoo la raacayo isla xeerarka (qalab hore u jiray waa la dhaafaa, lambar T la qabsaday waa la rarayaa). File-ku wuxuu haystaa cabbirrada, flutes, walxaha iyo feed iyo speed overrides aad qortay; ma laha ids. Isticmaal si aad qalabka dukaanka ugu wareejiso kombiyuutar kale ama colleague-kaaga u siiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii browser-ku aanu kaydin maktabadda (storage waa damin ama buuxa), kaydintu way sheegtaa, \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka u dhoofi\u003C/strong\u003E waa habka faylka lagu kaydiyo. File-ku waa inuu noqdaa PartCraft tool library oo nooca hadda ama ka hore, oo ugu badnaan 500 qalab oo cabbir sax ah; wax kale waa la diidaa iyadoo sababta la sheegayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXawaaraha goynta iyo chip loads ee la socda qalab kasta waa qiyamo bilow ah; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\"\u003ESamee toolpaths iyo G-code\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tab-ka Tools ee Manufacture wuxuu liisteeyaa qalabyada qaybta. Hoosta Tool library waxaad haysan kartaa qalabyadaada oo ka baxsan qayb keli ah: Save this tool wuxuu ku daraa qalabka la doortay My saved tools; Save all of this part's tools wuxuu ku daraa dhammaantood. My saved tools waxay ku kaydsan yihiin browser-kan, waxayna jiraan qayb kasta. Qalab aad hore u kaydisay (isku nooc, cabbir, flutes iyo overrides) lama kaydiyo labo jeer. Add to this part wuxuu qalabka la kaydiyay ku geliyaa qaybta. Haddii lambarka T uu hore u isticmaalayo qalab kale oo qaybta ku jira, wuxuu helaa lambarka xorta ah ee xiga, panelkuna wuu sheegaa. Remove from my library wuxuu ka saaraa liiska la kaydiyay (ma aha qaybaha hore u haysta). Export tools… wuxuu qoraa qalabyada qaybta file .json ah; Import tools… wuxuu ku daraa qalabyada file-kaas qaybta, iyadoo la raacayo isla xeerarka (qalab hore u jiray waa la dhaafaa, lambar T la qabsaday waa la rarayaa). File-ku wuxuu haystaa cabbirrada, flutes, walxaha iyo feed iyo speed overrides aad qortay; ma laha ids. Isticmaal si aad qalabka dukaanka ugu wareejiso kombiyuutar kale ama colleague-kaaga u siiso. Haddii browser-ku aanu kaydin maktabadda (storage waa damin ama buuxa), kaydintu way sheegtaa, Qalabka u dhoofi waa habka faylka lagu kaydiyo. File-ku waa inuu noqdaa PartCraft tool library oo nooca hadda ama ka hore, oo ugu badnaan 500 qalab oo cabbir sax ah; wax kale waa la diidaa iyadoo sababta la sheegayo. Xawaaraha goynta iyo chip loads ee la socda qalab kasta waa qiyamo bilow ah; eeg Samee toolpaths iyo G-code.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"generative-design","scope":"partcraft","title":"Samee qaab ka soo baxa culeysyada (Generative)","summary":"Dooro wejiyada la haysto oo culeysan, gobollada la ilaalinayo iyo kuwa la nadiifiyo, mugga bartilmaameedka iyo agabka, kadibna soo saar natiijooyinka: qaababka ugu adag ee mugga kasta, dib loo hubiyay sida jidh adag, lagu barbardhigay miis, lagana soo dejiyay sida STL, STEP ama qayb cusub.","section":"tasks","order":144,"keywords":["naqshadeynta soo saarka","topology optimisation","SIMP","fudud","lattice","qaab dabiici ah","natiijooyin","barbardhig","miisaan","qaybta mugga","ilaali","keep-in","caqabad","keep-out","goobta naqshadeynta","dherer ugu yar ee xubinta","STL","daabacaadda 3D"],"headings":[{"id":"deji-daraasad","text":"Deji daraasad","level":2},{"id":"ujeedooyin","text":"Ujeedooyin","level":2},{"id":"soo-saar-oo-barbardhig","text":"Soo saar oo barbardhig","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-natiijo","text":"Isticmaal natiijo","level":2},{"id":"sida-loogu-kalsoonaan-karo","text":"Sida loogu kalsoonaan karo","level":2},{"id":"la-xiriira","text":"La xiriira","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWorkspace-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EGenerative\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa agabka culeysyada u baahnayn. Waxaad sheegtaa halka qaybtu la hayo oo culeysan tahay, iyo waxa inuu ahaado iyo waxa uu ka madhnaado; PartCraft wuxuu helaa qaabka ugu adag mugga bartilmaameedka kasta (\u003Cstrong\u003Etopology optimisation\u003C/strong\u003E), mar kale mid kasta wuu hubiyaa sida jidh adag oo leh agabka dhabta ah, wuxuuna natiijooyinka side by side u soo bandhigaa. Waxay ka shaqeysaa dusha magacaysan ee mesh kernel-ku siiyay qaybta (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EKernel-ka mesh-ka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EGenerative\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E. Qaybtaadu ma beddelmayso; daraasadda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"deji-daraasad\"\u003EDeji daraasad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cstrong\u003ENew study\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESpace\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cem\u003EThe part as it is\u003C/em\u003E wuxuu agab ka saaraa qaybtaada; \u003Cem\u003EA box around the part\u003C/em\u003E wuxuu qaab ku koraa sanduuq ka weyn qaybta, \u003Cstrong\u003EBox margin\u003C/strong\u003E masaafada dhinac kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EElement size\u003C/strong\u003E: ka tag madhan cabbir toos ah (qiyaastii 8,000 kaabyo), ama qor mid. Cabbirro yar waxay siiyaan qaabab fiican laakiin wakhti dheer ayay qaadan doonaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMinimum member\u003C/strong\u003E: xubnaha ka yar qiyaastii laba jeer tan ma samaysmaan. Madhan waxay ahaatay hal iyo badh kaabyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi mid ilaa lix \u003Cstrong\u003ETarget volumes\u003C/strong\u003E (qaybta goobta naqshadeynta ee qaabku buuxin karo) iyo mid ilaa afar \u003Cstrong\u003EMaterials\u003C/strong\u003E. Mugga kasta mar ayaa la abuuraa; agab kasta qaabkaas ayaa lagu hubiyaa (qaabka ugu adag ma ku xidhna agabka, laakiin miisaankiisa, cadaadiskiisa iyo factor-ka badbaadada way ku xidhan yihiin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ujeedooyin\"\u003EUjeedooyin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFixed\u003C/span\u003E: riix wejiyada la haysto. \u003Cstrong\u003EFrictionless face\u003C/strong\u003E oo ka mid ah liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd\u003C/strong\u003E ee panelka wuxuu haystaa wejiga oo keliya dhinac dhinaca (u isticmaal diyaarada simmetriga).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForce\u003C/span\u003E: riix wejiyada culeysan, kadibna qor xoogga guud oo dooro jihadiisa panelka. \u003Cstrong\u003EPressure\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu ku jiraa liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreserve\u003C/span\u003E: riix wejiyada u baahan inay ahaadaan adag ku wareegsan, oo deji sida qoto dheer (\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep solid within\u003C/strong\u003E), tusaale ahaan meelaha ku wareegsan godadka boolalka. Wejiyada aad haysato ama culeysato had iyo jeer waa la ilaalinayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EObstacle\u003C/span\u003E: riix wejiyada u baahan inay ahaadaan madhan ku wareegsan, oo deji inta fog (\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep empty within\u003C/strong\u003E), tusaale ahaan meel loogu talagalay shaft ama qalab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cstrong\u003EDone picking\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kadib riixidda wejiyada. Midabka cagaaran iyo casaanka ayaa muujinaya gobollada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-saar-oo-barbardhig\"\u003ESoo saar oo barbardhig\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGenerate\u003C/span\u003E. Panelku wuxuu muujinayaa horumarka iyo wakhtiga ka hadhay; \u003Cstrong\u003EStop\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa joojinaya. Natiijo kasta waxay ka muuqataa miiska \u003Cstrong\u003EOutcomes\u003C/strong\u003E: mugga bartilmaameedka, agabka, \u003Cstrong\u003Emass\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Elargest stress\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Elargest displacement\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Esafety factor\u003C/strong\u003E (yield ÷ stress), dhammaantood waxaa laga helay markii qaabka dhammaystiran dib loo xalliyay sida unugyo adag oo leh agabka dhabta ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro natiijo si aad muuqaalka ugu aragto (qaybta waa la qariyaa; calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EShow the part through it\u003C/strong\u003E si aad labadaba u aragto). Miiska hoose: inta iteration ay qaadatay iyo haddii ay degsatay, adkaantiisa sida jidh adag marka loo barbardhigo tirada optimiser-ka, iyo dusheeda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-natiijo\"\u003EIsticmaal natiijo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTL\u003C/strong\u003E: mesh saddex-geesood xidhan, oo diyaar u ah daabacaadda 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESTEP (faceted)\u003C/strong\u003E: isla dusha sida jidh STEP ah oo dhinacyo siman ka kooban.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENew part file\u003C/strong\u003E: fayl qayb PartCraft ah oo feature-kiisa keliya uu yahay natiijada sida jidh la soo dhoofiyay. Fur si aad ugu sketch-gareyso, godad ugu gooyso ama Simulation-ka uga hubiso. Waa faceted (kun dhinac siman), ma aha qaab la tafatiri karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAdd to this part\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu natiijada ku daraa qaybta; wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya naqshadeynta sanduuqa (qaybta laftiisu goob ahaan, natiijadu qaybta gudaheeda way ku jirtaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENew part file\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EAdd to this part\u003C/strong\u003E wali lama dhisin nooca hadda: natiijadu waxay noqotaa jidh la soo dhoofiyay, taasoo u baahan kernel saxda ah. Soo dejinta STL iyo STEP (faceted) way shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-loogu-kalsoonaan-karo\"\u003ESida loogu kalsoonaan karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWuxuu wanaajiyaa \u003Cstrong\u003Estiffness\u003C/strong\u003E mugga la siiyay. Ma jiraan xadka cadaadiska iyo xeerarka soo saarka (dhanka hoose, jihooyinka jaranjarada, cabbirrada godka ugu yar) wali: hubi natiijada la doortay ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003ESimulation\u003C/a\u003E oo hagaaji.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXubnaha khafiifka ah ee hal ama laba kaabyo ballac ah waa qiyaas: u isticmaal cabbir yar qaybaha dheer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabku waa SIMP oo leh density filter, threshold projection iyo cusboonaysiin optimality-criteria; cadaadiska la sheegay iyo go&#039;naanta waa natiijada qaabka sida kaabyo, taas oo run ah laakiin qallafsan geesaha adag.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"la-xiriira\"\u003ELa xiriira\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003EHubi cadaadiska iyo go&#039;naanta (Simulation)\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\"\u003EDhoofinta daabacaadda, STEP iyo DXF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan wali la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Workspace-ka Generative wuxuu ka saaraa agabka culeysyada u baahnayn. Waxaad sheegtaa halka qaybtu la hayo oo culeysan tahay, iyo waxa inuu ahaado iyo waxa uu ka madhnaado; PartCraft wuxuu helaa qaabka ugu adag mugga bartilmaameedka kasta (topology optimisation), mar kale mid kasta wuu hubiyaa sida jidh adag oo leh agabka dhabta ah, wuxuuna natiijooyinka side by side u soo bandhigaa. Waxay ka shaqeysaa dusha magacaysan ee mesh kernel-ku siiyay qaybta (eeg Kernel-ka mesh-ka). Dooro Generative sanduuqa Workspace. Qaybtaadu ma beddelmayso; daraasadda waxaa lagu kaydiyaa gudaha faylka qaybta. Deji daraasad Riix New study panelka midig. Space: The part as it is wuxuu agab ka saaraa qaybtaada; A box around the part wuxuu qaab ku koraa sanduuq ka weyn qaybta, Box margin masaafada dhinac kasta. Element size: ka tag madhan cabbir toos ah (qiyaastii 8,000 kaabyo), ama qor mid. Cabbirro yar waxay siiyaan qaabab fiican laakiin wakhti dheer ayay qaadan doonaan. Minimum member: xubnaha ka yar qiyaastii laba jeer tan ma samaysmaan. Madhan waxay ahaatay hal iyo badh kaabyo. Calaamadi mid ilaa lix Target volumes (qaybta goobta naqshadeynta ee qaabku buuxin karo) iyo mid ilaa afar Materials. Mugga kasta mar ayaa la abuuraa; agab kasta qaabkaas ayaa lagu hubiyaa (qaabka ugu adag ma ku xidhna agabka, laakiin miisaankiisa, cadaadiskiisa iyo factor-ka badbaadada way ku xidhan yihiin). Ujeedooyin Fixed: riix wejiyada la haysto. Frictionless face oo ka mid ah liiska Add ee panelka wuxuu haystaa wejiga oo keliya dhinac dhinaca (u isticmaal diyaarada simmetriga). Force: riix wejiyada culeysan, kadibna qor xoogga guud oo dooro jihadiisa panelka. Pressure wuxuu ku jiraa liiska Add. Preserve: riix wejiyada u baahan inay ahaadaan adag ku wareegsan, oo deji sida qoto dheer (Keep solid within), tusaale ahaan meelaha ku wareegsan godadka boolalka. Wejiyada aad haysato ama culeysato had iyo jeer waa la ilaalinayaa. Obstacle: riix wejiyada u baahan inay ahaadaan madhan ku wareegsan, oo deji inta fog (Keep empty within), tusaale ahaan meel loogu talagalay shaft ama qalab. Riix Done picking ama Esc kadib riixidda wejiyada. Midabka cagaaran iyo casaanka ayaa muujinaya gobollada. Soo saar oo barbardhig Riix Generate. Panelku wuxuu muujinayaa horumarka iyo wakhtiga ka hadhay; Stop ayaa joojinaya. Natiijo kasta waxay ka muuqataa miiska Outcomes: mugga bartilmaameedka, agabka, mass, largest stress, largest displacement iyo safety factor (yield ÷ stress), dhammaantood waxaa laga helay markii qaabka dhammaystiran dib loo xalliyay sida unugyo adag oo leh agabka dhabta ah. Dooro natiijo si aad muuqaalka ugu aragto (qaybta waa la qariyaa; calaamadi Show the part through it si aad labadaba u aragto). Miiska hoose: inta iteration ay qaadatay iyo haddii ay degsatay, adkaantiisa sida jidh adag marka loo barbardhigo tirada optimiser-ka, iyo dusheeda. Isticmaal natiijo STL: mesh saddex-geesood xidhan, oo diyaar u ah daabacaadda 3D. STEP (faceted): isla dusha sida jidh STEP ah oo dhinacyo siman ka kooban. New part file: fayl qayb PartCraft ah oo feature-kiisa keliya uu yahay natiijada sida jidh la soo dhoofiyay. Fur si aad ugu sketch-gareyso, godad ugu gooyso ama Simulation-ka uga hubiso. Waa faceted (kun dhinac siman), ma aha qaab la tafatiri karo. Add to this part wuxuu natiijada ku daraa qaybta; wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya naqshadeynta sanduuqa (qaybta laftiisu goob ahaan, natiijadu qaybta gudaheeda way ku jirtaa). New part file iyo Add to this part wali lama dhisin nooca hadda: natiijadu waxay noqotaa jidh la soo dhoofiyay, taasoo u baahan kernel saxda ah. Soo dejinta STL iyo STEP (faceted) way shaqeeyaan. Sida loogu kalsoonaan karo Wuxuu wanaajiyaa stiffness mugga la siiyay. Ma jiraan xadka cadaadiska iyo xeerarka soo saarka (dhanka hoose, jihooyinka jaranjarada, cabbirrada godka ugu yar) wali: hubi natiijada la doortay ee Simulation oo hagaaji. Xubnaha khafiifka ah ee hal ama laba kaabyo ballac ah waa qiyaas: u isticmaal cabbir yar qaybaha dheer. Habku waa SIMP oo leh density filter, threshold projection iyo cusboonaysiin optimality-criteria; cadaadiska la sheegay iyo go'naanta waa natiijada qaabka sida kaabyo, taas oo run ah laakiin qallafsan geesaha adag. La xiriira Hubi cadaadiska iyo go'naanta (Simulation) Dhoofinta daabacaadda, STEP iyo DXF Waxa aan wali la dhisin","lang":"so"},{"slug":"flow-simulation","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ku dayso socodka dareeraha (Flow study)","summary":"Socodka dareeraha marinnada ku jira qayb ama ku wareegsan qaybta sanduuq gudihiisa: gelin, bixin, hawo, biyo ama dareere aad keento, kadibna xawaaraha iyo cadaadiska diyaarad goys oo la dhaqaajin karo, xariiqyada socodka, cadaadiska dusha, hoos u dhaca cadaadiska, isku-dheelitirka cufka, jiidista iyo kor u qaadista, iyo waxa habka laminar-ku sheegi karo iyo waxa uusan sheegi karin.","section":"tasks","order":145,"keywords":["socod","CFD","dareere","ku dayso socodka","hawo","biyo","cufnaan","qallajin","lambarka Reynolds","laminar","turbulent","hoos u dhaca cadaadiska","lumista madaxa","gelin","bixin","dabool","xawaaraha","socodka xaddiga","socodka mugga","litir daqiiqadii","cadaadiska istaatiga","xariiqyada socodka","diyaarada goynta","diyaarada qaybinta","jiid","kor u qaadid","isku-dheelitir","tuubo","marin","dhuumo","afka","lattice Boltzmann","hadhaag","isku-soo-dhowaansho"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro-dareeraha-iyo-unugyada","text":"Dooro dareeraha iyo unugyada","level":2},{"id":"socodka-gudaha-qaybta","text":"Socodka gudaha qaybta","level":2},{"id":"socodka-ku-wareegsan-qaybta","text":"Socodka ku wareegsan qaybta","level":2},{"id":"xalli-oo-akhri-natiijooyinka","text":"Xalli oo akhri natiijooyinka","level":2},{"id":"socodka-turbulent-ka-experimental","text":"Socodka turbulent-ka (experimental)","level":2},{"id":"waxa-uu-sheegi-karo-iyo-waxa-uusan-sheegi-karin","text":"Waxa uu sheegi karo iyo waxa uusan sheegi karin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDaraasad \u003Cstrong\u003EFlow\u003C/strong\u003E waxay xisaabisaa sida dareeruhu u socdo marinnada gudaha qaybtaada (\u003Cstrong\u003Einternal\u003C/strong\u003E) ama ku wareegsan (\u003Cstrong\u003Eexternal\u003C/strong\u003E). Caadiyan waa \u003Cstrong\u003Elaminar, incompressible, isothermal iyo Newtonian\u003C/strong\u003E: socod nalalan oo dareere cufnaanteeda iyo qallajintiisu go&#039;an yihiin, aan kulayl, shuruud iyo xoog dhul lahayn. Waxaa kaloo jira model \u003Cstrong\u003Eexperimental\u003C/strong\u003E oo turbulent ah, oo loogu talagalay dhaxanta sifada ah oo keliya (eeg hoos). Waxay ka shaqeysaa dusha magacaysan ee mesh kernel-ku siiyay qaybta (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EKernel-ka mesh-ka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003ESimulation\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E, riix \u003Cstrong\u003ENew study\u003C/strong\u003E haddii aan jirin mid, oo deji \u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E ka ah \u003Cstrong\u003EFlow (CFD)\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EFlow model\u003C/strong\u003E waa \u003Cstrong\u003ELaminar\u003C/strong\u003E (caadiga) ama \u003Cstrong\u003ETurbulent (Spalart–Allmaras, experimental)\u003C/strong\u003E: eeg \u003Cstrong\u003ETurbulent flow (experimental)\u003C/strong\u003E hoose. Dejinta qaab-dhismeedka daraasadda way ilaaliyaan, sidaas darteed waad dib ugu noqon kartaa. Dejinta socodka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta, isbeddel kasta waa la ka noqon karaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-dareeraha-iyo-unugyada\"\u003EDooro dareeraha iyo unugyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFluid\u003C/strong\u003E: hawo ama biyo 20 °C, ama \u003Cstrong\u003ECustom\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh cufnaantaada (kg/m³) iyo qallajintaada (Pa·s). Hawadu waxay isticmaashaa sharciga gaaska ee alxanka iyo sharciga Sutherland (1.204 kg/m³, 1.813 × 10⁻⁵ Pa·s); biyuhu waxay isticmaalaan qiimaha IAPWS (998.21 kg/m³, 1.0016 mPa·s).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECell size\u003C/strong\u003E: meesha dareeraha ku jirta waxaa lagu buuxiyaa kaabyo isku mid ah. Ka tag madhan si loo helo cabbir toos ah; panelku wuxuu muujinayaa grid-ka. Fur kasta iyo marin kasta waa inay ahaadaan \u003Cstrong\u003Eugu yaraan 8 ilaa 10 unug\u003C/strong\u003E ballac; unugyada yaryar waxay siiyaan natiijo sax badan laakiin way gaabiyaan (laba jeer ka yar waa ku dhowaad 16 jeer shaqo badan).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWalls\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EInterpolated\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu raacaa derbiyada qalloocan ee u dhexeeya unugyada (caadiga); \u003Cstrong\u003EBounce-back\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu derbiyada u qaataa sida jaranjarada kaabyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socodka-gudaha-qaybta\"\u003ESocodka gudaha qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeesha dareeraha ku jirta waa inay ahaataa mid xidhan. Ku dar \u003Cstrong\u003EInlet\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EOutlet\u003C/strong\u003E panelka, kadibna dhagsii dushooda muuqaalka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha siman ee ku wareegsan fur\u003C/strong\u003E — geeska tuubada, dusha dekedda. PartCraft halkaas ayuu godka furka ku xidhaa dabool. Godka kasta ee dusha ahaanshaha wuxuu isagu u dhow yahay furkaas, sidaas darteed marka gelin iyo bixin isku dusha ku furmaan, waxaad ku qaadan kartaa dabool khafiif ah mid ka mid ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDusha gudaha daboolka\u003C/strong\u003E — sida qalabyada CAD kale: samee lakab khafiif ah (extrude) furka dul dhig oo dooro dusha taabta dareeraha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGelinta deji \u003Cstrong\u003Evelocity\u003C/strong\u003E (m/s, isku mid furka oo dhan, gudaha qaybta) ama \u003Cstrong\u003Evolume flow\u003C/strong\u003E (L/min). Bixinta deji \u003Cstrong\u003Estatic pressure\u003C/strong\u003E (Pa, gauge). Haddii fur la furan yahay, ama derbi ka khafiifsan unug, dhinaca gudaha wuxuu ku biiraa dibada oo xallinta way joogsanaysaa, wuxuuna soo bandhigaa &quot;Ma jiro meel dareere xidhan&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socodka-ku-wareegsan-qaybta\"\u003ESocodka ku wareegsan qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EFlow\u003C/strong\u003E ah \u003Cstrong\u003EExternal\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESpeed\u003C/strong\u003E, jihada uu dareeru ku socdo, iyo intee ayuu sanduuqu u gaadhayaa hore, dambe iyo dhinacyada (madhan: 1, 3 iyo 1 jeer cabbirka ugu weyn ee qaybta). Dusha sanduuqa ee dareeru ku galo waa inflow, dusha uu ka baxo waa outflow oo ah 0 Pa, dusha ku socda dhinacyada waa siman yihiin. Sanduuq aad u yar ayaa socodka ku riixa qaybta, taasna waxay kor u qaadaa jiidista. \u003Cstrong\u003EReference area\u003C/strong\u003E waa baadhiga ay xisaabta jiidista iyo kor u qaadista isticmaalaan (madhan: baadhiga hore ee qaybta oo loo arko socodka); kor u qaadistu waxay ku cabbirmaysaa +Y, mooyee haddii aad jihada kale doorato.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xalli-oo-akhri-natiijooyinka\"\u003EXalli oo akhri natiijooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cstrong\u003ESolve\u003C/strong\u003E. Xallinta waxay ku shaqeysaa asal ahaan, waxayna muujinaysaa tirada tallaabooyinka, hadhaagga iyo garaaf hadhaag. \u003Cstrong\u003EStop\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa joojiya. Waxay dhammaanaysaa marka hadhaagga (intee le&#039;eg ayuu xawaaraha dareeruhu isu beddelayo tallaabo kasta) uu ka hooseeyo beegga, oo hoos u dhaca cadaadiska ama jiidista uu degsado. Haddii marka hore ay gaarto xadka tallaabooyinka, panelku wuxuu cas ku qoraa \u003Cstrong\u003ENot converged\u003C/strong\u003E: tirooyinku waa xaaladii ugu dambeysay, ma aha jawaab joogto ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECut plane\u003C/strong\u003E: xawaaraha ama cadaadiska istaatiga diyaarad ku marta moodelka; dooro jihadeeda (X, Y ama Z) oo jiid slider-ka si aad u dhaqaajiso. Ku dul sii si aad qiimayaasha u akhrido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStreamlines\u003C/strong\u003E: gelinta (gudaha) ama shabakad ka soo baxda dhinaca gelinta sanduuqa ee diyaarada goynta (dibada).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPart\u003C/strong\u003E: adag, muuqaal dhaadheer (si aad diyaarada gudaha u aragto), cadaadiska dusha, ama qarsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETable\u003C/strong\u003E: tirada Reynolds, hoos u dhaca cadaadiska (celceliska cadaadiska istaatiga gelinta ka dhigan bixinta), socodka iyo celceliska cadaadiska fur kasta, xoogga qaybta, jiidista iyo kor u qaadista oo leh isku-dheelitirkooda iyo baadhiga tixraaca (dibada), isku-dheelitirka cufka (gelin ka dhigan bixinta), shabakadda iyo xallaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socodka-turbulent-ka-experimental\"\u003ESocodka turbulent-ka (experimental)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlow model › Turbulent (Spalart–Allmaras, experimental)\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu xalliyaa socodka turbulent-ka ee celceliska wakhtiga (steady RANS): habka Spalart–Allmaras wuxuu siiyaa eddy viscosity unug kasta, unugyada derbiyada ku xiga waxay isticmaalaan sharciga derbiga ee Spalding halkii ay ka xallin lahaayeen lakabka khafiifka ah. Waa turbulent meel kasta (ma jiro goobo laminar ah, ma jiro wareejin).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa gudbin hubinteedii saxnaanta.\u003C/strong\u003E Panelka, natiijooyinka iyo miiska ayaa taas sheegaya daraasad turbulent kasta, digniintana ma xidhi karto. Isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003Edhaxanta socodka sifada ah\u003C/strong\u003E — meelaha socodku ka kala go&#039;o, ka wareego ama ku degdego — \u003Cstrong\u003Ema aha tirooyin naqshadeed\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHubin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETixraac\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatiijo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarin siman, xoogga, unugga koowaad y⁺ 49 / 98\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDean&#039;s correlation\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+3.3 % / +4.7 %\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarin derbiyada la xalliyay (y⁺ ≈ 3), Re_τ 180: xawaaraha celceliska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoser, Kim &amp; Mansour DNS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E−1 %\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarin siman, y⁺ 7–15 ama 190–380\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDean&#039;s correlation\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E+9 ilaa +22 %\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXoogga tuubada ee unugyada kaabyada, si buuxda u horumarsan, 10–30 unug ballac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EColebrook\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 ilaa 34 % oo sare\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u xidhmidda ka dib dhabarka tallaabo gadaal u socota, 6–14 unug tallaabo kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDriver &amp; Seegmiller, 6.26 tallaabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E21 ilaa 39 % oo gaaban\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijooyinku si tartiib ah ayay u wanaagsanaadaan marka unugyada la yareeyo. Xallinta ka dib, miiska wuxuu muujinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eunugga koowaad y⁺\u003C/strong\u003E (ugu yar, celceliska iyo ugu badan unugyada derbiga) wuxuuna digayaa ka baxsan xadka la hubiyay ee 1 ilaa 400; ku dadaal inta u dhexaysa 30 ilaa 300. \u003Cstrong\u003EWaqtiga shaqada:\u003C/strong\u003E unugyada toosan waxay u qaadan doonaan dhowr daqiiqo oo ku shaqeeya hal core oo laptop ah ugu badnaan; tuubo yar ayaa ka xasilloonaata wax ka yar 20 ilbiriqsi. Unugga oo la kala badhiyo wuxuu qaadaa ku dhowaad 16 jeer waqti dheer. Jiidista qaybta waxay ka timaadaa isku-dheelitirka momentum-ka fur-ka ama sanduuqa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWixii laga shaqeeyay hadda:\u003C/strong\u003E unugyada derbiga hadda waxay isku qiimeeyaan shiddadooda wadajirka ah iyo sharciga derbiga, taas oo hoos u dhigtay khaladaadka tuubada iyo tallaabada qiyamka kor ku qoran, iyada oo aan wax ka beddelin natiijooyinka marinka siman. Taasi ma kafiyin tirooyinka naqshadeynta. Tallaabada xigta waa unugyo fiican oo u dhow derbiyada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-uu-sheegi-karo-iyo-waxa-uusan-sheegi-karin\"\u003EWaxa uu sheegi karo iyo waxa uusan sheegi karin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel-ka laminar-ka\u003C/strong\u003E waa laminar keliya. Tuubooyinka socodku wuu turbulent-ka noqdaa ka dib lambarka Reynolds ee ku dhow 2,000 ilaa 4,000; jidhka dhabarka ka dambeeya, dabada wuxuu bilaabaa inuu tuurto kuwa ka dhigaya ka sarreeya 50 qiyaas. Panelku wuxuu digayaa meelahaas. Natiijada laminar ee socod turbulent ah waxay ka hoosaysiisaa hoos u dhaca cadaadiska waxayna khaldaa jiidista. Model-ka turbulent-ka ee experimental-ka (kor) wuxuu daboolaa socodka turbulent-ka sifada ahaan; tirooyinkiisu weli ma aha kuwo la isku halayn karo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHabka:\u003C/strong\u003E habka lattice Boltzmann (D3Q19, ururinta laba wakhtiga-dhaca) oo lagu socodsiiyo xaalad joogto ah. Gudaha wuu yar yahay isbeddelka cufnaanta; PartCraft wuxuu isbeddelka cufnaanta ku hayaa dhowr boqolkiiba. Haddii socodku unugyada u dhaqso badan yahay, ma bilaabi doono wuxuuna sheegaa inta ay unugyadu ka yaraan inay tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELa barbardhigay:\u003C/strong\u003E socodka Hagen–Poiseuille tuubada qaybta gudaheeda (gradient-ka cadaadiska ilaa 1 % gudaha, 20 unug ballac), kaabka lid-driven ee Ghia et al. (ilaa 0.75 % xawaaraha dabada), iyo tijaabada silinda Schäfer–Turek (jiidista ilaa 1 % gudaha, 10 unug dhexroor kasta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELama soo saaro: gudbinta kulaylka, turbulence-ka oo naqshadeyn saxnaan leh (model-ka turbulent wuu experimental yahay), dusha xor ah, cavitation, xoogga dhulka, qaybo dhaqaaqa, dareere aan Newtonian ahayn, derbiyo qallafsan. Dhismaha shaybaarka: hubi natiijooyinka muhiimka ah siyaabo kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Daraasad Flow waxay xisaabisaa sida dareeruhu u socdo marinnada gudaha qaybtaada (internal) ama ku wareegsan (external). Caadiyan waa laminar, incompressible, isothermal iyo Newtonian: socod nalalan oo dareere cufnaanteeda iyo qallajintiisu go'an yihiin, aan kulayl, shuruud iyo xoog dhul lahayn. Waxaa kaloo jira model experimental oo turbulent ah, oo loogu talagalay dhaxanta sifada ah oo keliya (eeg hoos). Waxay ka shaqeysaa dusha magacaysan ee mesh kernel-ku siiyay qaybta (eeg Kernel-ka mesh-ka). Dooro Simulation sanduuqa Workspace, riix New study haddii aan jirin mid, oo deji Type ka ah Flow (CFD). Flow model waa Laminar (caadiga) ama Turbulent (Spalart–Allmaras, experimental): eeg Turbulent flow (experimental) hoose. Dejinta qaab-dhismeedka daraasadda way ilaaliyaan, sidaas darteed waad dib ugu noqon kartaa. Dejinta socodka waxaa lagu kaydiyaa faylka qaybta, isbeddel kasta waa la ka noqon karaa. Dooro dareeraha iyo unugyada Fluid: hawo ama biyo 20 °C, ama Custom oo leh cufnaantaada (kg/m³) iyo qallajintaada (Pa·s). Hawadu waxay isticmaashaa sharciga gaaska ee alxanka iyo sharciga Sutherland (1.204 kg/m³, 1.813 × 10⁻⁵ Pa·s); biyuhu waxay isticmaalaan qiimaha IAPWS (998.21 kg/m³, 1.0016 mPa·s). Cell size: meesha dareeraha ku jirta waxaa lagu buuxiyaa kaabyo isku mid ah. Ka tag madhan si loo helo cabbir toos ah; panelku wuxuu muujinayaa grid-ka. Fur kasta iyo marin kasta waa inay ahaadaan ugu yaraan 8 ilaa 10 unug ballac; unugyada yaryar waxay siiyaan natiijo sax badan laakiin way gaabiyaan (laba jeer ka yar waa ku dhowaad 16 jeer shaqo badan). Walls: Interpolated wuxuu raacaa derbiyada qalloocan ee u dhexeeya unugyada (caadiga); Bounce-back wuxuu derbiyada u qaataa sida jaranjarada kaabyada. Socodka gudaha qaybta Meesha dareeraha ku jirta waa inay ahaataa mid xidhan. Ku dar Inlet iyo Outlet panelka, kadibna dhagsii dushooda muuqaalka: Dusha siman ee ku wareegsan fur — geeska tuubada, dusha dekedda. PartCraft halkaas ayuu godka furka ku xidhaa dabool. Godka kasta ee dusha ahaanshaha wuxuu isagu u dhow yahay furkaas, sidaas darteed marka gelin iyo bixin isku dusha ku furmaan, waxaad ku qaadan kartaa dabool khafiif ah mid ka mid ah. Dusha gudaha daboolka — sida qalabyada CAD kale: samee lakab khafiif ah (extrude) furka dul dhig oo dooro dusha taabta dareeraha. Gelinta deji velocity (m/s, isku mid furka oo dhan, gudaha qaybta) ama volume flow (L/min). Bixinta deji static pressure (Pa, gauge). Haddii fur la furan yahay, ama derbi ka khafiifsan unug, dhinaca gudaha wuxuu ku biiraa dibada oo xallinta way joogsanaysaa, wuxuuna soo bandhigaa \"Ma jiro meel dareere xidhan\". Socodka ku wareegsan qaybta Deji Flow ah External, Speed, jihada uu dareeru ku socdo, iyo intee ayuu sanduuqu u gaadhayaa hore, dambe iyo dhinacyada (madhan: 1, 3 iyo 1 jeer cabbirka ugu weyn ee qaybta). Dusha sanduuqa ee dareeru ku galo waa inflow, dusha uu ka baxo waa outflow oo ah 0 Pa, dusha ku socda dhinacyada waa siman yihiin. Sanduuq aad u yar ayaa socodka ku riixa qaybta, taasna waxay kor u qaadaa jiidista. Reference area waa baadhiga ay xisaabta jiidista iyo kor u qaadista isticmaalaan (madhan: baadhiga hore ee qaybta oo loo arko socodka); kor u qaadistu waxay ku cabbirmaysaa +Y, mooyee haddii aad jihada kale doorato. Xalli oo akhri natiijooyinka Riix Solve. Xallinta waxay ku shaqeysaa asal ahaan, waxayna muujinaysaa tirada tallaabooyinka, hadhaagga iyo garaaf hadhaag. Stop ayaa joojiya. Waxay dhammaanaysaa marka hadhaagga (intee le'eg ayuu xawaaraha dareeruhu isu beddelayo tallaabo kasta) uu ka hooseeyo beegga, oo hoos u dhaca cadaadiska ama jiidista uu degsado. Haddii marka hore ay gaarto xadka tallaabooyinka, panelku wuxuu cas ku qoraa Not converged: tirooyinku waa xaaladii ugu dambeysay, ma aha jawaab joogto ah. Cut plane: xawaaraha ama cadaadiska istaatiga diyaarad ku marta moodelka; dooro jihadeeda (X, Y ama Z) oo jiid slider-ka si aad u dhaqaajiso. Ku dul sii si aad qiimayaasha u akhrido. Streamlines: gelinta (gudaha) ama shabakad ka soo baxda dhinaca gelinta sanduuqa ee diyaarada goynta (dibada). Part: adag, muuqaal dhaadheer (si aad diyaarada gudaha u aragto), cadaadiska dusha, ama qarsan. Table: tirada Reynolds, hoos u dhaca cadaadiska (celceliska cadaadiska istaatiga gelinta ka dhigan bixinta), socodka iyo celceliska cadaadiska fur kasta, xoogga qaybta, jiidista iyo kor u qaadista oo leh isku-dheelitirkooda iyo baadhiga tixraaca (dibada), isku-dheelitirka cufka (gelin ka dhigan bixinta), shabakadda iyo xallaaga. Socodka turbulent-ka (experimental) Flow model › Turbulent (Spalart–Allmaras, experimental) wuxuu xalliyaa socodka turbulent-ka ee celceliska wakhtiga (steady RANS): habka Spalart–Allmaras wuxuu siiyaa eddy viscosity unug kasta, unugyada derbiyada ku xiga waxay isticmaalaan sharciga derbiga ee Spalding halkii ay ka xallin lahaayeen lakabka khafiifka ah. Waa turbulent meel kasta (ma jiro goobo laminar ah, ma jiro wareejin). Ma gudbin hubinteedii saxnaanta. Panelka, natiijooyinka iyo miiska ayaa taas sheegaya daraasad turbulent kasta, digniintana ma xidhi karto. Isticmaal dhaxanta socodka sifada ah — meelaha socodku ka kala go'o, ka wareego ama ku degdego — ma aha tirooyin naqshadeed. Hubin Tixraac Natiijo Marin siman, xoogga, unugga koowaad y⁺ 49 / 98 Dean's correlation +3.3 % / +4.7 % Marin derbiyada la xalliyay (y⁺ ≈ 3), Re_τ 180: xawaaraha celceliska Moser, Kim & Mansour DNS −1 % Marin siman, y⁺ 7–15 ama 190–380 Dean's correlation +9 ilaa +22 % Xoogga tuubada ee unugyada kaabyada, si buuxda u horumarsan, 10–30 unug ballac Colebrook 30 ilaa 34 % oo sare Dib u xidhmidda ka dib dhabarka tallaabo gadaal u socota, 6–14 unug tallaabo kasta Driver & Seegmiller, 6.26 tallaabo 21 ilaa 39 % oo gaaban Natiijooyinku si tartiib ah ayay u wanaagsanaadaan marka unugyada la yareeyo. Xallinta ka dib, miiska wuxuu muujinayaa unugga koowaad y⁺ (ugu yar, celceliska iyo ugu badan unugyada derbiga) wuxuuna digayaa ka baxsan xadka la hubiyay ee 1 ilaa 400; ku dadaal inta u dhexaysa 30 ilaa 300. Waqtiga shaqada: unugyada toosan waxay u qaadan doonaan dhowr daqiiqo oo ku shaqeeya hal core oo laptop ah ugu badnaan; tuubo yar ayaa ka xasilloonaata wax ka yar 20 ilbiriqsi. Unugga oo la kala badhiyo wuxuu qaadaa ku dhowaad 16 jeer waqti dheer. Jiidista qaybta waxay ka timaadaa isku-dheelitirka momentum-ka fur-ka ama sanduuqa. Wixii laga shaqeeyay hadda: unugyada derbiga hadda waxay isku qiimeeyaan shiddadooda wadajirka ah iyo sharciga derbiga, taas oo hoos u dhigtay khaladaadka tuubada iyo tallaabada qiyamka kor ku qoran, iyada oo aan wax ka beddelin natiijooyinka marinka siman. Taasi ma kafiyin tirooyinka naqshadeynta. Tallaabada xigta waa unugyo fiican oo u dhow derbiyada. Waxa uu sheegi karo iyo waxa uusan sheegi karin Model-ka laminar-ka waa laminar keliya. Tuubooyinka socodku wuu turbulent-ka noqdaa ka dib lambarka Reynolds ee ku dhow 2,000 ilaa 4,000; jidhka dhabarka ka dambeeya, dabada wuxuu bilaabaa inuu tuurto kuwa ka dhigaya ka sarreeya 50 qiyaas. Panelku wuxuu digayaa meelahaas. Natiijada laminar ee socod turbulent ah waxay ka hoosaysiisaa hoos u dhaca cadaadiska waxayna khaldaa jiidista. Model-ka turbulent-ka ee experimental-ka (kor) wuxuu daboolaa socodka turbulent-ka sifada ahaan; tirooyinkiisu weli ma aha kuwo la isku halayn karo. Habka: habka lattice Boltzmann (D3Q19, ururinta laba wakhtiga-dhaca) oo lagu socodsiiyo xaalad joogto ah. Gudaha wuu yar yahay isbeddelka cufnaanta; PartCraft wuxuu isbeddelka cufnaanta ku hayaa dhowr boqolkiiba. Haddii socodku unugyada u dhaqso badan yahay, ma bilaabi doono wuxuuna sheegaa inta ay unugyadu ka yaraan inay tahay. La barbardhigay: socodka Hagen–Poiseuille tuubada qaybta gudaheeda (gradient-ka cadaadiska ilaa 1 % gudaha, 20 unug ballac), kaabka lid-driven ee Ghia et al. (ilaa 0.75 % xawaaraha dabada), iyo tijaabada silinda Schäfer–Turek (jiidista ilaa 1 % gudaha, 10 unug dhexroor kasta). Lama soo saaro: gudbinta kulaylka, turbulence-ka oo naqshadeyn saxnaan leh (model-ka turbulent wuu experimental yahay), dusha xor ah, cavitation, xoogga dhulka, qaybo dhaqaaqa, dareere aan Newtonian ahayn, derbiyo qallafsan. Dhismaha shaybaarka: hubi natiijooyinka muhiimka ah siyaabo kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"craftscript","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qor oo socodsii scripts-ka (Goobta Script)","summary":"Goobta Script tallaabo-tallaabo: qor script CraftScript ama Lua, socodsii F5, akhri console-ka, kaydi natiijooyinka doorsoomayaasha script xiga, muuji meshes, fields iyo plots, jooji socodka, iyo kaydi scripts-ka qaybta.","section":"tasks","order":145,"keywords":["script","scripting","qorista script","muuqaal iyo naqshadeyn","pop out","shaashad labaad","second monitor","param","params","halbeegyada scripts-ka","CraftScript","Lua","code","program","editor","console","REPL","command line","run","F5","run selection","stop","doorsoomayaal","workspace","plot","field","mesh","legend","sub-display","falanqayn","analysis","otomaatig","matrikis","xisaab"],"headings":[{"id":"script-inta-aad-moodelinayso","text":"Script inta aad moodelinayso","level":2},{"id":"socodsii-scriptkaaga-ee-ugu-horreeya","text":"Socodsii scriptkaaga ee ugu horreeya","level":2},{"id":"raadi-xidh-iyo-dhammaystir","text":"Raadi, xidh iyo dhammaystir","level":2},{"id":"marka-wax-khaldamo","text":"Marka wax khaldamo","level":2},{"id":"doorsoomayaashu-waxay-ka-soo-wareegaan-script-ilaa-script","text":"Doorsoomayaashu waxay ka soo wareegaan script ilaa script","level":2},{"id":"meshes-fields-iyo-plots","text":"Meshes, fields iyo plots","level":2},{"id":"faylal","text":"Faylal","level":2},{"id":"akhri-halbeegyada-qaybta","text":"Akhri halbeegyada qaybta","level":2},{"id":"scripts-ka-waxa-lagu-kaydiyaa-qaybta","text":"Scripts-ka waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta","level":2},{"id":"xiriir","text":"Xiriir","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHorumar.\u003C/strong\u003E Scripting waa cusub PartCraft 0.3 waana horumar (preview): luqadda, maktabadda iyo habka scripts-ka loo kaydiyo ayaa wali isbeddeli kara, scripts-ka hadda la qorayo waxa laga yaabaa in ay u baahdaan wax yar oo wax ka beddelid mustaqbalka. Noo sheeg wixii jabay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGoobta Script waxay socodsiisaa xisaabtaada adigu naftaadu qortay dhinaca qaybta: xisaabo yar yar, falanqayn oo dhan, ama scripts-ka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-library\"\u003Emaktabadda falanqaynta\u003C/a\u003E. Scripts-ka waxa lagu qori karaa \u003Cstrong\u003ECraftScript\u003C/strong\u003E (luqad matrikis ah oo u eg MATLAB, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-language\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-language\"\u003ELuqadda CraftScript\u003C/a\u003E) ama \u003Cstrong\u003ELua\u003C/strong\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-lua\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-lua\"\u003EScripts-ka Lua\u003C/a\u003E) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EPython\u003C/strong\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-python\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-python\"\u003EScripts-ka Python\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EScript\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EGoobta shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E ee bidix ee toolbar-ka. Qaybta lama beddelo. Panel-ka midig wuxuu noqdaa panel script (ka ballaaran caadiga; jiid geeskiisa si aad u beddesho, ama u dhaqaaq shaashad labaad menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabaynta panels-ka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"script-inta-aad-moodelinayso\"\u003EScript inta aad moodelinayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMa aha inaad ka baxdo goobta Design si aad script u qorto. Design, tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScript\u003C/span\u003E ee panel-ka midig wuxuu haystaa isla editor-ka, console-ka, doorsoomayaasha iyo maktabadda, isla scripts-ka. Feature tree-ga iyo muuqaalku way sii shaqeeyaan: guji feature si aad u doorato, laba jeer guji sketch si aad u tafatirto, rari muuqaalka, kadibna ku noqo tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScript\u003C/span\u003E oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa script-ku \u003Cstrong\u003Emuujiyo\u003C/strong\u003E (meshes, fields, plots, miisaska) lama sawirayo moodelkaaga Design: console-ku wuu sheegaa taas, goobta Script ayaa wax walba haysa markaad u beddesho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa soo bax\u003C/span\u003E, oo ku taal dhinaca \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocodsii\u003C/span\u003E, wuxuu panel-ka oo dhan u raraa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad, si editor-ka iyo muuqaalka buuxa ay isku dhinac ugu jiraan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu celi\u003C/span\u003E wuu dib u dhigaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socodsii-scriptkaaga-ee-ugu-horreeya\"\u003ESocodsii scriptkaaga ee ugu horreeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor editor-ka, tusaale ahaan:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E``\u003Ccode\u003E x = linspace(0, 2*pi, 50); y = sin(x); plot(x, y, &#039;title&#039;, &#039;A sine&#039;) disp(max(y)) \u003C/code\u003E``\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocodsii\u003C/span\u003E). Console-ka hoos ku yaal editor-ka wuxuu muujinayaa waxa script-ku daabacay, iyo &quot;Done in … s&quot;. Plot-ka wuxuu ka muuqdaa \u003Cstrong\u003Esub-displays\u003C/strong\u003E ee hoose ee muuqaalka 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESadar aan semicolon lahayn ayaa qiimihiisa daabacda, sida MATLAB: \u003Ccode\u003Ea = 3\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu daabacaa \u003Ccode\u003Ea = 3\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003Ea = 3;\u003C/code\u003E ma daabacayo wax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u socodsiiso qayb keliya script-ka, xulo sadarada oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Return\"\u003E⌘ Return\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Enter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXulashada\u003C/span\u003E). Haddii wax aan la xulan, wuxuu socodsiiyaa sadarka uu cursor-ku ku yaal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESadarka hoose ee console-ka (ka dib \u003Ccode\u003E&gt;&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) wuxuu socodsiiyaa hal bayaan markaad riixdo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay soo celinayaan sadarro hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-xidh-iyo-dhammaystir\"\u003ERaadi, xidh iyo dhammaystir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERaadi oo beddel.\u003C/strong\u003E Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command F\"\u003E⌘F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command H\"\u003E⌘H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u beddesho). Bar ayaa furmaa kor ku yaal code-ka: ku qor waxa aad raadinayso; isku-mid-ka ayaa iftiimaya, tiradu waxay sheegaysaa halka aad joogto. Badhamada sanduuqa ag ku yaal waxay isku-xarafka (\u003Cstrong\u003EAa\u003C/strong\u003E) u dhigan yihiin, kelmadaha oo keliya (\u003Cstrong\u003EW\u003C/strong\u003E) raadiyaan, iyo regular expression (\u003Cstrong\u003E.\\\u003C/strong\u003E*; beddelka, \u003Ccode\u003E$1\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa waxa kooxda koowaad ay ku dhigtay). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa isku-mid-ka hadda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhammaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa isku-mid kasta hal tallaabo oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXidhid.\u003C/strong\u003E Guji ▾ ee ku dhow lambarka sadarka, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command [\"\u003E⇧⌘[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka cursor-ku ku yaal sadarka \u003Ccode\u003Efunction\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eif\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewhile\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eswitch\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Etry\u003C/code\u003E (Lua: \u003Ccode\u003Efunction\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edo\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eif\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erepeat\u003C/code\u003E), si ay u xidhaan sadarradooda gudaha; sadarku wuxuu sheegayaa inta sadar ah. ▸ ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command ]\"\u003E⇧⌘]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dib u furaa. Xidhidku wuxuu kaliya qariyaa sadarrada: Run, Save, koobiyeynta iyo lambarada sadarrada weli way tiraan dhammaanba, iyo qorista sadar xidhan ayaa marka hore furta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhammaystir.\u003C/strong\u003E Qor laba xaraf oo magac ah, ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Space\"\u003E⌘ Space\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Space\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: liis ayaa soo bixi doorsoomayaasha aad leedahay, functions-ka luqadda (oo leh argumentsyadooda), ereyada furaha, iyo magacyada horey loogu qoray script-ka. Dooro fallaadhaha, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-wax-khaldamo\"\u003EMarka wax khaldamo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhalad wuxuu magacaabaa dhibaatada iyo sadarkeeda: sadarka wuxuu ku yaal midab cas editor-ka, \u003Cstrong\u003ELine n\u003C/strong\u003E console-ka wuxuu kugu geynayaa halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWareeg aan dhammaadka lahayn: riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E (toolbar ama panel). Script-ku isla markiiba wuu joogsadaa; doorsoomayaashu waxay ilaaliyaan qiimihii ay lahaayeen socodkii ka horreeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESocod kasta wuxuu sidoo kale leeyahay miisaaniyad tallaabooyin (2 bilyan tallaabo caadi ahaan; beddel \u003Cstrong\u003ERun options\u003C/strong\u003E panel-ka). Socod gudbiya miisaaniyadda wuu joogsadaa oo fariin ayuu soo bandhigaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"doorsoomayaashu-waxay-ka-soo-wareegaan-script-ilaa-script\"\u003EDoorsoomayaashu waxay ka soo wareegaan script ilaa script\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScript kasta oo doorsoome sare sameeyo wuxuu ku dhacaa tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EDoorsoomayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E (magac, nooc, cabbir, qiimaha ugu yar iyo ugu weyn) wuxuuna halkaas ku sii jiraa script-ka xiga, luqad kasta. Taasi waa sida hal script u sameeyo mesh, kan xiga uu xalliyo, kan saddexaad uu plot sameeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji doorsoome si aad u muujiso: meshes, fields iyo models muuqaalka 3D, arrays miis ahaan (iyo plot xariiq ah vector-ka ama colour map matrikiska) sub-displays-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida JSON\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida CSV\u003C/span\u003E (miis tirooyin) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi sida HDF5\u003C/span\u003E waxay soo dejiyaan; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E wuu ka saaraa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu banaanaynayaa workspace-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi doorsoomayaasha qaybta\u003C/strong\u003E si aad u kaydiso qaybta (ilaa 32 MB; kuwa ka weyn ayaa ku sii jira booqashadan keliya). Marka aad furto qayb noocaas ah, panel-ku wuxuu kugu soo bandhigaa inaad soo rarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meshes-fields-iyo-plots\"\u003EMeshes, fields iyo plots\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eshow(m)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sawiraa mesh; \u003Ccode\u003Eshow(f)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu midabeeyaa field mesh-kiisa legend-ka. Liiska \u003Cstrong\u003ELa muujiyay\u003C/strong\u003E ee kor-bidix ee muuqaalka ayaa qariya (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Eindhaha\u003C/span\u003E) ama ka saara shay kasta, iyo qarinta ama muujinta qaybta laftiisa. Hoosta legend-ka, ku qor xadka (\u003Cstrong\u003ELaga bilaabo\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eilaa\u003C/strong\u003E) ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtomaatig\u003C/span\u003E; vector ama field stress-ka ayaa sidoo kale bixiya component-ka la muujinayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eshow(f, &#039;deform&#039;, u, &#039;scale&#039;, 50)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sawiraa mesh-ka lagu rarey field-ka barakaynta \u003Ccode\u003Eu\u003C/code\u003E, oo weyneeya 50 jeer (haddii \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E la&#039;aan, qiyaastii 8 % cabbirka moodelka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji mesh la muujiyay: node-ka ugu dhow, element-ka iyo qiimaha field-ka halkaas ayaa ka muuqda sub-displays-ka (\u003Cstrong\u003EPicked\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eplot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eimagesc\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Etable\u003C/code\u003E waxay dhigaan plot xariiq ah, colour map ee array 2-D ah, ama miis sub-displays-ka. Plot leh isla \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;id&#039;\u003C/code\u003E (ama magac) sida mid hore u jiray wuu beddelaa, sidaas darteed wareeg wuxuu cusboonaysiin karaa hal plot isu-soo-dhowaanshaha; \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;append&#039;, true\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu curve ku daraa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENadiifi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu banaanaynayaa sub-displays-ka; fallaadhadu waa wax ka qariya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba plot ama in ka badan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhinac\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo bandhigaa dhammaantood hal mar (kuwa ugu dambeeya lix); guji tab-ka miis ama sawir si aad mid kaliya u aragto mar kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlot kasta wuxuu hoosta leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESVG\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E. PNG iyo SVG waxay daabacaan cadaan dusha ah midabkii waraaqda, mawduuc kasta ha ahaadeen (PNG 1600 × 1000 pixels; SVG wuu weynaadaa iyada oo aan muuqaalka lumin); CSV wuxuu hayaa tirooyinkiisa oo dhan digit kasta: hal tiir oo x iyo tiir kasta curve, haddii curves-ku wadaagaan x, haddii kale hal sadar halkii point, oo magaca curve-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu muuqaalka ku habeeyaa waxa la muujiyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylal\"\u003EFaylal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Script (ama ka tuur faylal muuqaalka ama panel-ka): \u003Ccode\u003E.craft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.lua\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.py\u003C/code\u003E waxay u furmaan scripts cusub (ma socodsiiyaan); faylasha xogta (STL, OBJ, CSV, JSON, NPY, HDF5) waxay u soo galaan doorsoomayaasha magaca faylka ku yaal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Script wuxuu soo dejiyaa script-ka hadda jira sida fayl.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Script (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E ee tabs-ka) wuxuu bilaabaa script kale. Laba jeer guji tab si aad magac u beddesho; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E wuu ka saaraa (waad dib u noqon kartaa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-halbeegyada-qaybta\"\u003EAkhri halbeegyada qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScript wuxuu akhriyaa halbeegyada qaybta (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/parameters\" data-topic=\"partcraft/parameters\"\u003EQayb ku maamul halbeegyo\u003C/a\u003E) magac ahaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ew = param(&#039;width&#039;);     % qiimaha hal halbeeg, mm (ama darajo, ama tiro caadi ah)\np = params();           % dhammaantood, sida struct: p.width, p.height\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELua iyo Python waxay yihiin \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.param(&#039;width&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.params()\u003C/code\u003E. Scripts-ku kaliya halbeegyada akhriyaan: beddelkooda tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E. Hoosta tab-ka script-ka, sadar ayaa liistaa halbeegyada uu akhrinayo \u003Ccode\u003Eparam(&#039;…&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E, oo calaamadinaya kuwa qaybtu aanu lahayn; tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu liistaa script-ka hoos ugu qoraa halbeeg kasta. Magac la dhisay socodka script-ka, sida \u003Ccode\u003Eparam(name)\u003C/code\u003E, lama liisto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"scripts-ka-waxa-lagu-kaydiyaa-qaybta\"\u003EScripts-ka waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScript kasta oo tabs-ka ku jira waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta, sidaas darteed \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E kooxda File wuxuu kaydiyaa iyaga oo wata, isbeddelladooduna way dib u celin karaan. Furidda qayb \u003Cstrong\u003Ema socodsiiso scripts-keeda\u003C/strong\u003E: console-ku wuxuu sheegaa inta ay leedahay, waxay socodaan kaliya markaad riixdo Run. Qayb ka timid qof kale wuxuu hayn karaa script kasta: akhri ka hor inta aadan socodsiin. Scripts-ku waxay ku socdaan background-ka kombiyuutarkan iyagoo aan shabakad lahayn, ma taabtaan bogga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiriir\"\u003EXiriir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-language\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-language\"\u003ELuqadda CraftScript\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-lua\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-lua\"\u003EScripts-ka Lua\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-python\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-python\"\u003EScripts-ka Python\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-library\"\u003EMaktabadda falanqaynta\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-own-analysis\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-own-analysis\"\u003EFalanqayn adigu naftaadu samayso\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Horumar. Scripting waa cusub PartCraft 0.3 waana horumar (preview): luqadda, maktabadda iyo habka scripts-ka loo kaydiyo ayaa wali isbeddeli kara, scripts-ka hadda la qorayo waxa laga yaabaa in ay u baahdaan wax yar oo wax ka beddelid mustaqbalka. Noo sheeg wixii jabay. Goobta Script waxay socodsiisaa xisaabtaada adigu naftaadu qortay dhinaca qaybta: xisaabo yar yar, falanqayn oo dhan, ama scripts-ka maktabadda falanqaynta. Scripts-ka waxa lagu qori karaa CraftScript (luqad matrikis ah oo u eg MATLAB, eeg Luqadda CraftScript) ama Lua (eeg Scripts-ka Lua) ama Python (eeg Scripts-ka Python). Dooro Script sanduuqa Goobta shaqada ee bidix ee toolbar-ka. Qaybta lama beddelo. Panel-ka midig wuxuu noqdaa panel script (ka ballaaran caadiga; jiid geeskiisa si aad u beddesho, ama u dhaqaaq shaashad labaad menu-ga ⋯, eeg Habaynta panels-ka). Script inta aad moodelinayso Ma aha inaad ka baxdo goobta Design si aad script u qorto. Design, tab-ka Script ee panel-ka midig wuxuu haystaa isla editor-ka, console-ka, doorsoomayaasha iyo maktabadda, isla scripts-ka. Feature tree-ga iyo muuqaalku way sii shaqeeyaan: guji feature si aad u doorato, laba jeer guji sketch si aad u tafatirto, rari muuqaalka, kadibna ku noqo tab-ka Script oo riix F5. Waxa script-ku muujiyo (meshes, fields, plots, miisaska) lama sawirayo moodelkaaga Design: console-ku wuu sheegaa taas, goobta Script ayaa wax walba haysa markaad u beddesho. Ka soo bax, oo ku taal dhinaca Socodsii, wuxuu panel-ka oo dhan u raraa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad, si editor-ka iyo muuqaalka buuxa ay isku dhinac ugu jiraan. Ku celi wuu dib u dhigaa. Socodsii scriptkaaga ee ugu horreeya Ku qor editor-ka, tusaale ahaan: `` x = linspace(0, 2*pi, 50); y = sin(x); plot(x, y, 'title', 'A sine') disp(max(y)) `` Riix F5 (ama Socodsii). Console-ka hoos ku yaal editor-ka wuxuu muujinayaa waxa script-ku daabacay, iyo \"Done in … s\". Plot-ka wuxuu ka muuqdaa sub-displays ee hoose ee muuqaalka 3D. Sadar aan semicolon lahayn ayaa qiimihiisa daabacda, sida MATLAB: a = 3 wuxuu daabacaa a = 3; a = 3; ma daabacayo wax. Si aad u socodsiiso qayb keliya script-ka, xulo sadarada oo riix Ctrl+Enter (Xulashada). Haddii wax aan la xulan, wuxuu socodsiiyaa sadarka uu cursor-ku ku yaal. Sadarka hoose ee console-ka (ka dib \u003E\u003E) wuxuu socodsiiyaa hal bayaan markaad riixdo Enter. ↑ iyo ↓ waxay soo celinayaan sadarro hore. Raadi, xidh iyo dhammaystir Raadi oo beddel. Riix Ctrl+F (ama Ctrl+H si aad u beddesho). Bar ayaa furmaa kor ku yaal code-ka: ku qor waxa aad raadinayso; isku-mid-ka ayaa iftiimaya, tiradu waxay sheegaysaa halka aad joogto. Badhamada sanduuqa ag ku yaal waxay isku-xarafka (Aa) u dhigan yihiin, kelmadaha oo keliya (W) raadiyaan, iyo regular expression (.\\*; beddelka, $1 wuxuu soo celinayaa waxa kooxda koowaad ay ku dhigtay). Beddel wuxuu beddelaa isku-mid-ka hadda, Dhammaan wuxuu beddelaa isku-mid kasta hal tallaabo oo Ctrl+Z. Xidhid. Guji ▾ ee ku dhow lambarka sadarka, ama riix Ctrl+Shift+[ marka cursor-ku ku yaal sadarka function, if, for, while, switch ama try (Lua: function, do, if, repeat), si ay u xidhaan sadarradooda gudaha; sadarku wuxuu sheegayaa inta sadar ah. ▸ ama Ctrl+Shift+] ayaa dib u furaa. Xidhidku wuxuu kaliya qariyaa sadarrada: Run, Save, koobiyeynta iyo lambarada sadarrada weli way tiraan dhammaanba, iyo qorista sadar xidhan ayaa marka hore furta. Dhammaystir. Qor laba xaraf oo magac ah, ama riix Ctrl+Space: liis ayaa soo bixi doorsoomayaasha aad leedahay, functions-ka luqadda (oo leh argumentsyadooda), ereyada furaha, iyo magacyada horey loogu qoray script-ka. Dooro fallaadhaha, kadibna riix Enter ama Tab. Marka wax khaldamo Khalad wuxuu magacaabaa dhibaatada iyo sadarkeeda: sadarka wuxuu ku yaal midab cas editor-ka, Line n console-ka wuxuu kugu geynayaa halkaas. Wareeg aan dhammaadka lahayn: riix Jooji (toolbar ama panel). Script-ku isla markiiba wuu joogsadaa; doorsoomayaashu waxay ilaaliyaan qiimihii ay lahaayeen socodkii ka horreeyay. Socod kasta wuxuu sidoo kale leeyahay miisaaniyad tallaabooyin (2 bilyan tallaabo caadi ahaan; beddel Run options panel-ka). Socod gudbiya miisaaniyadda wuu joogsadaa oo fariin ayuu soo bandhigaa. Doorsoomayaashu waxay ka soo wareegaan script ilaa script Script kasta oo doorsoome sare sameeyo wuxuu ku dhacaa tab-ka Doorsoomayaasha (magac, nooc, cabbir, qiimaha ugu yar iyo ugu weyn) wuxuuna halkaas ku sii jiraa script-ka xiga, luqad kasta. Taasi waa sida hal script u sameeyo mesh, kan xiga uu xalliyo, kan saddexaad uu plot sameeyo. Guji doorsoome si aad u muujiso: meshes, fields iyo models muuqaalka 3D, arrays miis ahaan (iyo plot xariiq ah vector-ka ama colour map matrikiska) sub-displays-ka. Kaydi sida JSON, Kaydi sida CSV (miis tirooyin) iyo Kaydi sida HDF5 waxay soo dejiyaan; Tirtir wuu ka saaraa; Nadiifi dhammaan wuxuu banaanaynayaa workspace-ka. Calaamadi Kaydi doorsoomayaasha qaybta si aad u kaydiso qaybta (ilaa 32 MB; kuwa ka weyn ayaa ku sii jira booqashadan keliya). Marka aad furto qayb noocaas ah, panel-ku wuxuu kugu soo bandhigaa inaad soo rarto. Meshes, fields iyo plots show(m) wuxuu sawiraa mesh; show(f) wuxuu midabeeyaa field mesh-kiisa legend-ka. Liiska La muujiyay ee kor-bidix ee muuqaalka ayaa qariya (indhaha) ama ka saara shay kasta, iyo qarinta ama muujinta qaybta laftiisa. Hoosta legend-ka, ku qor xadka (Laga bilaabo, ilaa) ama riix Otomaatig; vector ama field stress-ka ayaa sidoo kale bixiya component-ka la muujinayo. show(f, 'deform', u, 'scale', 50) wuxuu sawiraa mesh-ka lagu rarey field-ka barakaynta u, oo weyneeya 50 jeer (haddii scale la'aan, qiyaastii 8 % cabbirka moodelka). Guji mesh la muujiyay: node-ka ugu dhow, element-ka iyo qiimaha field-ka halkaas ayaa ka muuqda sub-displays-ka (Picked). plot, imagesc iyo table waxay dhigaan plot xariiq ah, colour map ee array 2-D ah, ama miis sub-displays-ka. Plot leh isla 'id' (ama magac) sida mid hore u jiray wuu beddelaa, sidaas darteed wareeg wuxuu cusboonaysiin karaa hal plot isu-soo-dhowaanshaha; 'append', true wuxuu curve ku daraa. Nadiifi wuxuu banaanaynayaa sub-displays-ka; fallaadhadu waa wax ka qariya. Laba plot ama in ka badan, Isku-dhinac wuxuu soo bandhigaa dhammaantood hal mar (kuwa ugu dambeeya lix); guji tab-ka miis ama sawir si aad mid kaliya u aragto mar kale. Plot kasta wuxuu hoosta leeyahay PNG, SVG iyo CSV. PNG iyo SVG waxay daabacaan cadaan dusha ah midabkii waraaqda, mawduuc kasta ha ahaadeen (PNG 1600 × 1000 pixels; SVG wuu weynaadaa iyada oo aan muuqaalka lumin); CSV wuxuu hayaa tirooyinkiisa oo dhan digit kasta: hal tiir oo x iyo tiir kasta curve, haddii curves-ku wadaagaan x, haddii kale hal sadar halkii point, oo magaca curve-ka. F ama Ku habee wuxuu muuqaalka ku habeeyaa waxa la muujiyay. Faylal Fur kooxda Script (ama ka tuur faylal muuqaalka ama panel-ka): .craft, .lua iyo .py waxay u furmaan scripts cusub (ma socodsiiyaan); faylasha xogta (STL, OBJ, CSV, JSON, NPY, HDF5) waxay u soo galaan doorsoomayaasha magaca faylka ku yaal. Kaydi kooxda Script wuxuu soo dejiyaa script-ka hadda jira sida fayl. Cusub kooxda Script (ama + ee tabs-ka) wuxuu bilaabaa script kale. Laba jeer guji tab si aad magac u beddesho; × wuu ka saaraa (waad dib u noqon kartaa). Akhri halbeegyada qaybta Script wuxuu akhriyaa halbeegyada qaybta (eeg Qayb ku maamul halbeegyo) magac ahaan: w = param('width'); % qiimaha hal halbeeg, mm (ama darajo, ama tiro caadi ah) p = params(); % dhammaantood, sida struct: p.width, p.height Lua iyo Python waxay yihiin cs.param('width') iyo cs.params(). Scripts-ku kaliya halbeegyada akhriyaan: beddelkooda tab-ka Halbeegyada. Hoosta tab-ka script-ka, sadar ayaa liistaa halbeegyada uu akhrinayo param('…'), oo calaamadinaya kuwa qaybtu aanu lahayn; tab-ka Halbeegyada wuxuu liistaa script-ka hoos ugu qoraa halbeeg kasta. Magac la dhisay socodka script-ka, sida param(name), lama liisto. Scripts-ka waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta Script kasta oo tabs-ka ku jira waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta, sidaas darteed Kaydi kooxda File wuxuu kaydiyaa iyaga oo wata, isbeddelladooduna way dib u celin karaan. Furidda qayb ma socodsiiso scripts-keeda: console-ku wuxuu sheegaa inta ay leedahay, waxay socodaan kaliya markaad riixdo Run. Qayb ka timid qof kale wuxuu hayn karaa script kasta: akhri ka hor inta aadan socodsiin. Scripts-ku waxay ku socdaan background-ka kombiyuutarkan iyagoo aan shabakad lahayn, ma taabtaan bogga. Xiriir Luqadda CraftScript Scripts-ka Lua Scripts-ka Python Maktabadda falanqaynta Falanqayn adigu naftaadu samayso","lang":"so"},{"slug":"craftscript-library","scope":"partcraft","title":"Maktabadda falanqaynta","summary":"Maktabadda script-yada falanqaynta ee la akhrin karo ee Goobta Script: waxa ku jira kooxaha, furidda function akhri kaliya, madasheeda habka, tixraacyada iyo hubinta, samaynta nuqulkaaga, iyo sida nuqulku u qaato meesha function-ka maktabadda.","section":"tasks","order":146,"keywords":["maktabad","craftlib","falanqayn","electromagnet","static","modal","thermal","topology optimization","top88","SIMP","electromagnetics","electrostatics","magnetostatics","fluid","lattice Boltzmann","LBM","mesh","voxel","tetrahedra","tixraacyo","hubin","xaqiijin","nuqul","shadow"],"headings":[{"id":"ku-bilow-tusaale","text":"Ku bilow tusaale","level":2},{"id":"kooxaha","text":"Kooxaha","level":2},{"id":"sida-maktabadda-loo-hubiyo","text":"Sida maktabadda loo hubiyo","level":2},{"id":"akhri-function","text":"Akhri function","level":2},{"id":"beddel-mid","text":"Beddel mid","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-mid","text":"Isticmaal mid","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMaktabadda falanqaynta waa set scripts ah, mid kastaa yahay function aad ka akhrisan karto kor ilaa hoos: sida matrikiska adkaysiga loo dhiso, halka shuruudaha xadka lagu dhigo, solver-ka oo socda, sida natiijooyinka loo xisaabiyo. Waxba ka mid ah ma qarsan tahay sanduuq madow; kaliya qaybaha degdega ah ee gudaha (unugyada matrikiska, solver-ada sparse, meshing) ayaa lagu dhisay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-bilow-tusaale\"\u003EKu bilow tusaale\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKooxda \u003Cstrong\u003EExamples\u003C/strong\u003E waxay leedahay shan script oo gaaban oo isticmaala maktabadda bilow ilaa dhammaad. Guji mid, riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur (akhri kaliya)\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: mid kastaa wuxuu nadiifiyaa muuqaalka, wuxuuna muujinayaa natiijo canvas-ka iyo plot sub-displays-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETusaale\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu muujinayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECantilever stress\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar bir ah 100 × 10 × 10 mm oo culeys 100 N ah ku yaal madaxa: stress von Mises ee bar-ka foorfoorsan, iyo go&#039;a madaxa marka loo barbar dhigo aragtida biimta afar cabbir oo unug ah (plot)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMBB beam topology\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHabaynta topology-ga caadiga ah 60 × 20: naqshadeynta oo samaysma, compliance-ka oo hoosaysa, habaynta ugu dambeysa (94 soo noqnoq, compliance 203.19)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECapacitor field\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba taxane 4 mm ballac ah, 1 mm kala fogaan: potential iyo field, capacitance-ka oo fringing-ka leh oo lagu barbar dhigo qiimaha ideal-ka iyo qaacidada Palmer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChannel flow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodka Lattice Boltzmann oo dhex mara tiir ku yaal kanaal: goobta xawaaraha iyo taariikhda isu-soo-dhowaanshaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElectromagnet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECore bir ah oo C-qaab leh oo leh gab hawo ah iyo koil: flux density, field-ka gabka oo lagu barbar dhigo qaacidada magnetic-circuit-ka, inductance iyo jiidista gabka dhexdiisa. Lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\"\u003EGoobaha magnetic-ka 2-D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPermanent magnet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla core-ka oo leh magnet joogto ah halkii koil: barta shaqada ee magnet-ka, field-ka gabka oo lagu barbar dhigo magnetic circuit-ka, inta flux ah ee baxda, jiidista. Ku jira \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d#permanent-magnets\" data-topic=\"partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\" data-hash=\"permanent-magnets\"\u003EGoobaha magnetic-ka 2-D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kooxaha\"\u003EKooxaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKooxda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFunctions\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa ay sameeyaan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeshing\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebox_mesh\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecylinder_mesh\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Evoxel_mesh\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etet_mesh\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emesh_quality\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enodes_at\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eface_nodes\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanduuqyo iyo silsilado sida hexahedra, cubes ama tetrahedra; cubes ama tetrahedra ee moodel kasta (qaybta, jidh, STL la soo rartay); mugga unugyada iyo tayada; doorashada nodes-ka diyaarad ama dhinac\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStatic stress\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Estatic_voxel\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estatic_tet\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStress-ka joogtada ah ee cubes ama 10-node tetrahedra: displacements, stresses, von Mises, reactions\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFrames\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eframe3d\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFrames 3D oo ka kooban beams, columns iyo braces oo lagu xisaabinayo habka adkaysiga toos ah: furitaanka dhamaadka, taageerooyinka iyo springs, culeysyada xubnaha dhexdooda; displacements, reactions, cutubka dhamaadka xubnaha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport as CraftScript\u003C/span\u003E ee DetailCraft iyo BimCraft wuxuu qorayaa moodel oo dhan oo loogu talagalay. Caawiye falanqayn, ma aha hubin koodka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVibration\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emodal_tet\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo noqnoqyada dabiiciga ah iyo qaababka habaynta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eheat_steady\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eheat_transient\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eheat_system\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKuleyli-gudbinta joogtada ah iyo ku-meelgaarka, oo leh heerkul go&#039;an, gelinta kulaylka, abuurista, flux iyo convection\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETopology optimization\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etop88\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etop99\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etopopt3d\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECodadka 2-D ee 88 iyo 99 sadar ee la daabacay, iyo isla habka 3-D ee cubes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElectromagnetics\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epoisson2d\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emagnetostatic2d\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElectrostatics 2-D (potential, field, capacitance, charge) iyo magnetostatics (vector potential, flux density, magnets joogto ah)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFluid flow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elbm2d\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elbm3d\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodka Lattice Boltzmann: 2-D oo lagu qoray script-ka, 3-D oo ku saleysan kernel-ka socodka PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeader-ka function kasta wuxuu siinayaa doodihiisa saxda ah. Unugyadu waa kuwa studies-ka PartCraft ilaa header-ku si kale u sheegin: millimeters, newtons, megapascals, tonnes per cubic millimetre for density, watts iyo kelvin for heat. Functions-ka electromagnetic iyo lattice Boltzmann waxay shaqeeyaan unug kasta oo isku mid ah; headers-keeda ayaa sheegaya sida.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-maktabadda-loo-hubiyo\"\u003ESida maktabadda loo hubiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeader-ka function kasta wuxuu ku dhammaadaa \u003Cstrong\u003Echeck\u003C/strong\u003E: kiis yar oo jawaabta la yaqaan. Tijaabooyinka PartCraft waxay socodsiiyaan mid kasta, halka PartCraft uu leeyo study u gaar ah isla shaqadaas, jawaabta script-ka waxaa lagu barbar dhigaa studyga ku saabsan isla mesh-ka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ego&#039;a madaxa cantilever-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo aragtida biimta (dhexdeeda 0.2 % cubes-ka, 0.05 % tetrahedra), iyo solver-ada workspace-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ESimulation\u003C/strong\u003E isla mesh-ka (isku mid ilaa tiro badan);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esoo noqnoqda ugu horreysa ee cantilever-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo aragtida biimta (0.24 % ka hooseeya, sida la filayo biim gaaban), iyo modal solver-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ESimulation\u003C/strong\u003E;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ekulaylka: derbi kulul oo taagan oo si sax ah, jidh yar oo qaboojinaya sida qaacidada lumped-capacity tilmaamayo, heerkulka dhagax oo dhinta sida aragtidu tilmaamayo;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etopology optimization: \u003Ccode\u003Etop88\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa 94 soo noqnoq iyo compliance 203.1925 (iyo 218.8032 oo leh density filter); \u003Ccode\u003Etopopt3d\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu ku dhammaadaa compliance isku mid ah sida workspace-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EGenerative\u003C/strong\u003E oo leh isla settings-ka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ecapacitance-ka capacitor-ka iyo field-ka solenoid dheer oo lagu barbar dhigo qiimayaasha buugaagta, field-ka gabka electromagnet-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo qaacidada magnetic-circuit-ka, magnets joogto ah oo lagu barbar dhigo magnet wareegsan oo hawada ku jira iyo magnet ay xidho iron keeper;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esocodka channel-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo profile-ka parabolic-ka saxda ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-function\"\u003EAkhri function\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ELibrary\u003C/strong\u003E ee panel-ka script-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji function. Header-keeda wuxuu muujinayaa: waxa uu xisaabinayo, habka, unugyada, mala-awaalka iyo xadadka, \u003Cstrong\u003Ereferences\u003C/strong\u003E (buug ama warqad, leh lambarada isla&#039;egta) iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Echeck\u003C/strong\u003E: kiis yar oo jawaab la yaqaan oo tijaabooyinka PartCraft ay socodsiiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur (akhri kaliya)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa script-ka oo dhan tab xariiq jajab ah ku leh. Waad socodsiin kartaa, qayb ka mid ah dooran kartaa oo socodsiin kartaa, laakiin ma beddeli kartid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-mid\"\u003EBeddel mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESamee nuqul\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Cstrong\u003ESamee nuqul si loo tafatiro\u003C/strong\u003E kor ku yaal tab akhri kaliya). Nuqulku waa script qaybtaada ku jira oo leh isla magaca, sidaas darteed waxaa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta, \u003Cstrong\u003Efunction kasta oo wicitaan ah hadda wuxuu isticmaalayaa nuqulkaaga\u003C/strong\u003E; editor-ka ayaa taas kor ugu sheegaya script-ka. Dib u magacow nuqulka si aad labadaba u hayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-mid\"\u003EIsticmaal mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWac function maktabad kasta script kasta adigoo u isticmaalaya magiciisa, sida built-in function:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ExPhys = top88(60, 20, 0.5, 3.0, 1.5, 1);\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijooyinku waxay ku soo laabtaan qiyam workspace-ka ku jira; plots-ka iyo fields-ka ay muujiso waxay ka muuqdaan muuqaalka iyo sub-displays-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFalanqayn go&#039;an oo qaybta furan, tusaale ahaan, waxay qaadataa dhowr sadar:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ev = voxel_mesh(part(), 2);                   % kubbado 2 mm ah\nX = meshNodes(v);\nbc = struct(&#039;fixed&#039;, nodes_at(v, 2, min(X(:, 2))));   % hay hoosta\ntop = nodes_at(v, 2, max(X(:, 2)));\nbc.loads = {struct(&#039;nodes&#039;, top, &#039;force&#039;, [0 -500 0])};   % 500 N hoos ee sare\nr = static_voxel(v, 210000, 0.3, bc);       % bir\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Er\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu hayaa displacements, stresses iyo reactions; von Mises stress-ka ayaa lagu sawiraa qaybta foorfoorsan. Qaybaha qalloocan isticmaal \u003Ccode\u003Etet_mesh\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Estatic_tet\u003C/code\u003E, kuwaas oo sidoo kale culeysi kara oo hayn kara dusha oo dhan (\u003Ccode\u003Eface_nodes\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFunctions-ka maktabadda waxaa lagu qoray CraftScript, script Lua waxa uu \u003Ccode\u003Ecs\u003C/code\u003E ku wacaa sida built-in functions-ka: \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.static_tet(t, 200000, 0.3, bc)\u003C/code\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-lua\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-lua\"\u003EScripts-ka Lua\u003C/a\u003E). Function kasta wuxuu xallinayaa hal walax iyo hal kiis culeys; headers-ku waxay sheegayaan waxa kale ee aan la daboolin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Maktabadda falanqaynta waa set scripts ah, mid kastaa yahay function aad ka akhrisan karto kor ilaa hoos: sida matrikiska adkaysiga loo dhiso, halka shuruudaha xadka lagu dhigo, solver-ka oo socda, sida natiijooyinka loo xisaabiyo. Waxba ka mid ah ma qarsan tahay sanduuq madow; kaliya qaybaha degdega ah ee gudaha (unugyada matrikiska, solver-ada sparse, meshing) ayaa lagu dhisay. Ku bilow tusaale Kooxda Examples waxay leedahay shan script oo gaaban oo isticmaala maktabadda bilow ilaa dhammaad. Guji mid, riix Fur (akhri kaliya), kadibna F5: mid kastaa wuxuu nadiifiyaa muuqaalka, wuxuuna muujinayaa natiijo canvas-ka iyo plot sub-displays-ka. Tusaale Waxa uu muujinayo Cantilever stress Bar bir ah 100 × 10 × 10 mm oo culeys 100 N ah ku yaal madaxa: stress von Mises ee bar-ka foorfoorsan, iyo go'a madaxa marka loo barbar dhigo aragtida biimta afar cabbir oo unug ah (plot) MBB beam topology Habaynta topology-ga caadiga ah 60 × 20: naqshadeynta oo samaysma, compliance-ka oo hoosaysa, habaynta ugu dambeysa (94 soo noqnoq, compliance 203.19) Capacitor field Laba taxane 4 mm ballac ah, 1 mm kala fogaan: potential iyo field, capacitance-ka oo fringing-ka leh oo lagu barbar dhigo qiimaha ideal-ka iyo qaacidada Palmer Channel flow Socodka Lattice Boltzmann oo dhex mara tiir ku yaal kanaal: goobta xawaaraha iyo taariikhda isu-soo-dhowaanshaha Electromagnet Core bir ah oo C-qaab leh oo leh gab hawo ah iyo koil: flux density, field-ka gabka oo lagu barbar dhigo qaacidada magnetic-circuit-ka, inductance iyo jiidista gabka dhexdiisa. Lagu sharaxay Goobaha magnetic-ka 2-D Permanent magnet Isla core-ka oo leh magnet joogto ah halkii koil: barta shaqada ee magnet-ka, field-ka gabka oo lagu barbar dhigo magnetic circuit-ka, inta flux ah ee baxda, jiidista. Ku jira Goobaha magnetic-ka 2-D Kooxaha Kooxda Functions Waxa ay sameeyaan Meshing box_mesh, cylinder_mesh, voxel_mesh, tet_mesh, mesh_quality, nodes_at, face_nodes Sanduuqyo iyo silsilado sida hexahedra, cubes ama tetrahedra; cubes ama tetrahedra ee moodel kasta (qaybta, jidh, STL la soo rartay); mugga unugyada iyo tayada; doorashada nodes-ka diyaarad ama dhinac Static stress static_voxel, static_tet Stress-ka joogtada ah ee cubes ama 10-node tetrahedra: displacements, stresses, von Mises, reactions Frames frame3d Frames 3D oo ka kooban beams, columns iyo braces oo lagu xisaabinayo habka adkaysiga toos ah: furitaanka dhamaadka, taageerooyinka iyo springs, culeysyada xubnaha dhexdooda; displacements, reactions, cutubka dhamaadka xubnaha. Export as CraftScript ee DetailCraft iyo BimCraft wuxuu qorayaa moodel oo dhan oo loogu talagalay. Caawiye falanqayn, ma aha hubin koodka Vibration modal_tet Soo noqnoqyada dabiiciga ah iyo qaababka habaynta Heat heat_steady, heat_transient, heat_system Kuleyli-gudbinta joogtada ah iyo ku-meelgaarka, oo leh heerkul go'an, gelinta kulaylka, abuurista, flux iyo convection Topology optimization top88, top99, topopt3d Codadka 2-D ee 88 iyo 99 sadar ee la daabacay, iyo isla habka 3-D ee cubes Electromagnetics poisson2d, magnetostatic2d Electrostatics 2-D (potential, field, capacitance, charge) iyo magnetostatics (vector potential, flux density, magnets joogto ah) Fluid flow lbm2d, lbm3d Socodka Lattice Boltzmann: 2-D oo lagu qoray script-ka, 3-D oo ku saleysan kernel-ka socodka PartCraft Header-ka function kasta wuxuu siinayaa doodihiisa saxda ah. Unugyadu waa kuwa studies-ka PartCraft ilaa header-ku si kale u sheegin: millimeters, newtons, megapascals, tonnes per cubic millimetre for density, watts iyo kelvin for heat. Functions-ka electromagnetic iyo lattice Boltzmann waxay shaqeeyaan unug kasta oo isku mid ah; headers-keeda ayaa sheegaya sida. Sida maktabadda loo hubiyo Header-ka function kasta wuxuu ku dhammaadaa check: kiis yar oo jawaabta la yaqaan. Tijaabooyinka PartCraft waxay socodsiiyaan mid kasta, halka PartCraft uu leeyo study u gaar ah isla shaqadaas, jawaabta script-ka waxaa lagu barbar dhigaa studyga ku saabsan isla mesh-ka: go'a madaxa cantilever-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo aragtida biimta (dhexdeeda 0.2 % cubes-ka, 0.05 % tetrahedra), iyo solver-ada workspace-ka Simulation isla mesh-ka (isku mid ilaa tiro badan); soo noqnoqda ugu horreysa ee cantilever-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo aragtida biimta (0.24 % ka hooseeya, sida la filayo biim gaaban), iyo modal solver-ka Simulation; kulaylka: derbi kulul oo taagan oo si sax ah, jidh yar oo qaboojinaya sida qaacidada lumped-capacity tilmaamayo, heerkulka dhagax oo dhinta sida aragtidu tilmaamayo; topology optimization: top88 wuxuu soo celinayaa 94 soo noqnoq iyo compliance 203.1925 (iyo 218.8032 oo leh density filter); topopt3d wuxuu ku dhammaadaa compliance isku mid ah sida workspace-ka Generative oo leh isla settings-ka; capacitance-ka capacitor-ka iyo field-ka solenoid dheer oo lagu barbar dhigo qiimayaasha buugaagta, field-ka gabka electromagnet-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo qaacidada magnetic-circuit-ka, magnets joogto ah oo lagu barbar dhigo magnet wareegsan oo hawada ku jira iyo magnet ay xidho iron keeper; socodka channel-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo profile-ka parabolic-ka saxda ah. Akhri function Fur tab-ka Library ee panel-ka script-ka. Guji function. Header-keeda wuxuu muujinayaa: waxa uu xisaabinayo, habka, unugyada, mala-awaalka iyo xadadka, references (buug ama warqad, leh lambarada isla'egta) iyo check: kiis yar oo jawaab la yaqaan oo tijaabooyinka PartCraft ay socodsiiyaan. Fur (akhri kaliya) wuxuu furaa script-ka oo dhan tab xariiq jajab ah ku leh. Waad socodsiin kartaa, qayb ka mid ah dooran kartaa oo socodsiin kartaa, laakiin ma beddeli kartid. Beddel mid Riix Samee nuqul (ama Samee nuqul si loo tafatiro kor ku yaal tab akhri kaliya). Nuqulku waa script qaybtaada ku jira oo leh isla magaca, sidaas darteed waxaa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta, function kasta oo wicitaan ah hadda wuxuu isticmaalayaa nuqulkaaga; editor-ka ayaa taas kor ugu sheegaya script-ka. Dib u magacow nuqulka si aad labadaba u hayso. Isticmaal mid Wac function maktabad kasta script kasta adigoo u isticmaalaya magiciisa, sida built-in function: xPhys = top88(60, 20, 0.5, 3.0, 1.5, 1); Natiijooyinku waxay ku soo laabtaan qiyam workspace-ka ku jira; plots-ka iyo fields-ka ay muujiso waxay ka muuqdaan muuqaalka iyo sub-displays-ka. Falanqayn go'an oo qaybta furan, tusaale ahaan, waxay qaadataa dhowr sadar: v = voxel_mesh(part(), 2); % kubbado 2 mm ah X = meshNodes(v); bc = struct('fixed', nodes_at(v, 2, min(X(:, 2)))); % hay hoosta top = nodes_at(v, 2, max(X(:, 2))); bc.loads = {struct('nodes', top, 'force', [0 -500 0])}; % 500 N hoos ee sare r = static_voxel(v, 210000, 0.3, bc); % bir r wuxuu hayaa displacements, stresses iyo reactions; von Mises stress-ka ayaa lagu sawiraa qaybta foorfoorsan. Qaybaha qalloocan isticmaal tet_mesh iyo static_tet, kuwaas oo sidoo kale culeysi kara oo hayn kara dusha oo dhan (face_nodes). Functions-ka maktabadda waxaa lagu qoray CraftScript, script Lua waxa uu cs ku wacaa sida built-in functions-ka: cs.static_tet(t, 200000, 0.3, bc) (eeg Scripts-ka Lua). Function kasta wuxuu xallinayaa hal walax iyo hal kiis culeys; headers-ku waxay sheegayaan waxa kale ee aan la daboolin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"craftscript-own-analysis","scope":"partcraft","title":"Falanqayn adigu naftaadu samayso","summary":"Dhis falanqayn script-yo ah Goobta Script: mesh qaybta, isku-dhufo oo xalli, muuji field-ka iyo plot isu-soo-dhowaanshaha, hubi natiijada xisaab gacanta ah, oo ku hay tallaabooyinka script-yo kala duwan oo wadaaga doorsoomayaal.","section":"tasks","order":147,"keywords":["falanqayn adigu samayso","falanqayn gaar ah","FEA script","finite element","isku-dhufo","assemble","stiffness","shuruudaha xadka","boundary conditions","xalli","solve","pcg","sparse","field","post-process","isu-soo-dhowaanshaha","convergence","xaqiijin","verification","xisaab gacanta","hand calculation","check","workflow"],"headings":[{"id":"1-mesh","text":"1. Mesh","level":2},{"id":"2-isku-dhufo-oo-xalli","text":"2. Isku-dhufo oo xalli","level":2},{"id":"3-muuji-natiijada","text":"3. Muuji natiijada","level":2},{"id":"4-hubi","text":"4. Hubi","level":2},{"id":"5-kaydi","text":"5. Kaydi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFalanqaynta Goobta Script waa dhowr script oo gaaban oo isu gudbiya doorsoomayaal. Ka bilow \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-library\"\u003Emaktabad\u003C/a\u003E function ku dhow waxa aad u baahan tahay, samee nuqul, kadibna beddel; ama dhis mid adiga oo sida hoose ku socda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"1-mesh\"\u003E1. Mesh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emodel = part();                  % qaybta aad ku moodelayso, sida moodel\nm = tetmesh(model, 4);           % tetrahedra qiyaastii 4 mm ballac\nshow(m)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHubi mesh-ka muuqaalka ka hor inta aadan sii socon: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ku habeeyaa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003Eindhaha\u003C/span\u003E ee \u003Cstrong\u003ELa muujiyay\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa qariya qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"2-isku-dhufo-oo-xalli\"\u003E2. Isku-dhufo oo xalli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQor wareegga unugyada script-ka (wuxuu u eg yahay sida buugga xisaabta), oo qaybta culus u daa built-in functions-ka: matrikisyada unugyada, isku-dhufashada sparse ee saddex-geesaha, iyo solver-ka gradient-ka isku-dhafan oo leh preconditioner. Function maktabad sida \u003Ccode\u003Estatic_tet\u003C/code\u003E (marka maktabadda ay leedahay) waa tusaale dhammaystiran oo aad ka koobiyayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3-muuji-natiijada\"\u003E3. Muuji natiijada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ef = field(m, vm, &#039;node&#039;, &#039;von Mises&#039;, &#039;MPa&#039;);  % hal qiime halkii node\nshow(f, &#039;deform&#039;, u, &#039;scale&#039;, 100)\nplot(residuals, &#039;title&#039;, &#039;Solver residual&#039;, &#039;id&#039;, &#039;conv&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXadka legend-ka waa la ku qori karaa ama dib loogu celin karaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOtomaatig\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji mesh-ka si aad u akhrido qiimaha unug.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlot-ka leh isla \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;id&#039;\u003C/code\u003E wuu cusboonaysiiyaa isla meeshiisa, sidaas darteed daabac oo plot ku sameey wareegga si aad u aragto isu-soo-dhowaanshaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"4-hubi\"\u003E4. Hubi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKala barbar dhig wax aad taqaanno: go&#039;a madaxa cantilever-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo PL³/3EI, lo&#039;ga oo god leh oo lagu barbar dhigo stress concentration factor-keeda, reactions-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo culeysyada. Qor hubinta script u gaar ah si ay mar kale u socoto kadib marka wax la beddelo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etip = max(abs(u(:)));\nexpected = P * L^3 / (3 * E * I);\nfprintf(&#039;tip %g mm, beam theory %g mm (%.1f %%)\\n&#039;, tip, expected, 100 * (tip / expected - 1))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"5-kaydi\"\u003E5. Kaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETallaabo kasta wuxuu noqon karaa tab script u gaar ah: waxay wadaagaan doorsoomayaasha, sidaas darteed socodsii mid kadib mid kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EScripts-ka waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta. Calaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi doorsoomayaasha qaybta\u003C/strong\u003E tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EDoorsoomayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E si aad natiijooyinka u kaydiso (ilaa 32 MB).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Script wuxuu soo dejiyaa script si aad u wadaagto; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo geliyaa mid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Falanqaynta Goobta Script waa dhowr script oo gaaban oo isu gudbiya doorsoomayaal. Ka bilow maktabad function ku dhow waxa aad u baahan tahay, samee nuqul, kadibna beddel; ama dhis mid adiga oo sida hoose ku socda. 1. Mesh model = part(); % qaybta aad ku moodelayso, sida moodel m = tetmesh(model, 4); % tetrahedra qiyaastii 4 mm ballac show(m) Hubi mesh-ka muuqaalka ka hor inta aadan sii socon: F wuxuu ku habeeyaa, indhaha ee La muujiyay ayaa qariya qaybta. 2. Isku-dhufo oo xalli Qor wareegga unugyada script-ka (wuxuu u eg yahay sida buugga xisaabta), oo qaybta culus u daa built-in functions-ka: matrikisyada unugyada, isku-dhufashada sparse ee saddex-geesaha, iyo solver-ka gradient-ka isku-dhafan oo leh preconditioner. Function maktabad sida static_tet (marka maktabadda ay leedahay) waa tusaale dhammaystiran oo aad ka koobiyayso. 3. Muuji natiijada f = field(m, vm, 'node', 'von Mises', 'MPa'); % hal qiime halkii node show(f, 'deform', u, 'scale', 100) plot(residuals, 'title', 'Solver residual', 'id', 'conv') Xadka legend-ka waa la ku qori karaa ama dib loogu celin karaa Otomaatig. Guji mesh-ka si aad u akhrido qiimaha unug. Plot-ka leh isla 'id' wuu cusboonaysiiyaa isla meeshiisa, sidaas darteed daabac oo plot ku sameey wareegga si aad u aragto isu-soo-dhowaanshaha. 4. Hubi Kala barbar dhig wax aad taqaanno: go'a madaxa cantilever-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo PL³/3EI, lo'ga oo god leh oo lagu barbar dhigo stress concentration factor-keeda, reactions-ka oo lagu barbar dhigo culeysyada. Qor hubinta script u gaar ah si ay mar kale u socoto kadib marka wax la beddelo: tip = max(abs(u(:))); expected = P * L^3 / (3 * E * I); fprintf('tip %g mm, beam theory %g mm (%.1f %%)\\n', tip, expected, 100 * (tip / expected - 1)) 5. Kaydi Tallaabo kasta wuxuu noqon karaa tab script u gaar ah: waxay wadaagaan doorsoomayaasha, sidaas darteed socodsii mid kadib mid kale. Scripts-ka waxa lagu kaydiyaa qaybta. Calaamadi Kaydi doorsoomayaasha qaybta tab-ka Doorsoomayaasha si aad natiijooyinka u kaydiso (ilaa 32 MB). Kaydi kooxda Script wuxuu soo dejiyaa script si aad u wadaagto; Fur wuxuu soo geliyaa mid.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"magnetic-fields-2d","scope":"partcraft","title":"Goobaha magnetic-ka 2-D (casharka)","summary":"Xisaabi goobta magnetic-ka ee electromagnet ama magnet joogto ah maktabada falanqaynta: socodsii tusaalooyinka, akhri flux density-ga, goobta farqiga, inductance-ka iyo jiidista, beddel naqshadda, oo dhis moodeelkaaga coil-ka, magnet-ka iyo birta.","section":"tasks","order":147,"keywords":["magnetic","magnetostatics","goobta magnetic-ka","flux density","tesla","electromagnet","solenoid","coil","ampere-turns","core bir","farqiga hawada","permeability","inductance","xoogga magnetic-ka","reluctance","magnetic circuit","vector potential","electromagnetics","finite element","fem","motor","actuator","transformer","magnetostatic2d","permanent magnet","neodymium","ndfeb","ferrite","remanence","working point","recoil","leakage","holding magnet"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-la-moodelayo","text":"Waxa la moodelayo","level":2},{"id":"tusaalaha-socodsii","text":"Tusaalaha socodsii","level":2},{"id":"akhri-natiijooyinka","text":"Akhri natiijooyinka","level":2},{"id":"beddel-naqshadda","text":"Beddel naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"qaabkaaga-moodeel","text":"Qaabkaaga moodeel","level":2},{"id":"magnets-joogto-ah","text":"Magnets joogto ah","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aanu-weli-sameynin","text":"Waxa aanu weli sameynin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMaktabada falanqaynta PartCraft waxay xisaabin kartaa goobta magnetic-ka ee coil-ka iyo birta 2-D: qaybta gudaheeda oo dheer oo isku mid ah dhererkeeda, sida electromagnet, core-ka transformer-ka, busbar-ka ama qaybta motor-ka. Casharkan wuxuu socodsiinayaa tusaalaha electromagnet-ka ee maktabada, wuxuu akhrinayaa waxa uu sheegayo, wuxuu beddelayaa, wuxuu tusayaa sida moodeel naftaada loo dhiso, kadibna wuxuu ku daraa magnet joogto ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWuxuu isticmaalaa Script workspace iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-library\"\u003Emaktabada falanqaynta\u003C/a\u003E. Ma u baahnid inaad garanayso luuqadda CraftScript si aad u raacdo; tusaalaha ayaa sheegaya waxa khad kasta sameeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-moodelayo\"\u003EWaxa la moodelayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECore bir ah oo C-shaped ah, 100 × 80 mm dibadda, 20 mm qaro. Farqi hawo oo 2 mm ah lugta midig. Coil 100 turns ah oo qaada 10 A (1000 ampere-turns) oo lagu duubay lugta bidix. Wax kasta dherer ayay ku leeyihiin oo dhanka shaashadda ka baxaya, sidaas darteed jawaabaha waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqoto dheer mitir kasta\u003C/strong\u003E: ku dhufo qoto dheerida dhabta ah si aad magnet dhab ah u hesho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaktabada \u003Ccode\u003Emagnetostatic2d\u003C/code\u003E waxay xallisaa vector potential-ka magnetic-ka grid-ka 1 mm oo labajibbaaran oo ku jira sanduuq hawo ah oo ku wareegsan magnet-ka, kadibna waxay xisaabisaa flux density \u003Cstrong\u003EB\u003C/strong\u003E (tesla) laga bilaabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tusaalaha-socodsii\"\u003ETusaalaha socodsii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cstrong\u003EScript\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa \u003Cstrong\u003EWorkspace\u003C/strong\u003E ee bidix toolbar-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ELibrary\u003C/strong\u003E ee panel-ka script-ka, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EExamples\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EElectromagnet: field, gap, inductance\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen (read-only)\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlbiriqsi ama laba gudahood, canvas-ku wuxuu muujinayaa flux density-ga, console-kuna wuxuu daabacaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EB in the gap 0.5427 T; magnetic circuit 0.5516 T (-1.6 %: fringing and leakage)\ninductance 0.1539 H per metre of depth; the circuit gives 0.1103 H/m, missing the flux that leaks past the gap\nstored energy 7.694 J/m; |B| peaks at 1.97 T in the window&#039;s inner corners (real steel would saturate there)\npull across the gap about 2343 N per metre of depth (117.2 N for 50 mm deep)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlot-ka hoose canvas-ka waa flux density-ga B_y oo ku jira khadka dhexe ee core-ka, bidix ilaa midig: qiyaastii −0.55 T lugta bidix (flux-ku wuxuu ku socdaa hoos), wax yar daaqadda, iyo +0.55 T lugta midig iyo farqiga (flux-ku wuu soo noqdaa). Flux-ka isku mid ah wuxuu maraa birta iyo farqiga, sidaas darteed labada lug iyo farqigu waxay muujiyaan qiime isku dhow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"akhri-natiijooyinka\"\u003EAkhri natiijooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGoobta farqiga\u003C/strong\u003E waa 0.543 T. Xisaabta gacanta waxay u qaadaa core-ka sidii hal magnetic circuit, B = μ0 N I / (g + l / μr), halkaas oo g yahay farqiga, l dhererka jidka birta, μr permeability-ga birta; waxay siinaysaa 0.552 T. Goobtu way ka hooseysaa xisaabta gacanta sababtoo ah flux-ku wuu fidsan yahay ku wareegsan farqiga (fringing) iyo qaarkood wuxuu kicinayaa jid gaaban oo daaqadda ku maraya (leakage). Farqi yar ama grid fiican, labadaba way isu dhowaadaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EInductance-ka\u003C/strong\u003E coil-ka 100-turn waa 0.154 H mitir kasta oo qoto dheer, tamarta lagu kaydiyay goobta ka soo qaadaneysa. Qaabka circuit-ku wuu ka yar yahay (0.110 H/m) sababtoo ah wuxuu tiriyaa oo kaliya flux-ka farqiga maraya, ma aha kan ka leakaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidista\u003C/strong\u003E ee xidhaysa farqiga waa B² w / (2 μ0) oo w yahay ballaca wajiga farqiga: qiyaastii 2300 N mitir kasta, ama 117 N magnet 50 mm qoto dheer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiimaha sare\u003C/strong\u003E 1.97 T wuxuu ku yaal geeska gudaha ee daaqadda, meesha flux-ku si xagal ah u leexdo. Moodeelku wuxuu u qaadaa birta inay tahay toos; biraha dhabta ah ee koronka ah waxay buuxaan qiyaastii 1.5 ilaa 2 T, sidaas darteed qiimaha ka weyn ahaan digniin, ma aha jawaab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETijaabooyinka maktabada laftoodu waxay socodsiiyaan tusaalahan oo waxay hubiyaan goobta farqiga marka loo barbardhigo qaacidada magnetic-circuit mar kasta oo PartCraft la beddelo. Habka, tixraacyadiisa iyo hubinta kale (solenoid dheer, solenoid bir-core ah) waxay ku jiraan madasha \u003Ccode\u003Emagnetostatic2d\u003C/code\u003E: guji oo maktabada ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel-naqshadda\"\u003EBeddel naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMake a copy\u003C/span\u003E kor script-ka akhrinta-keliya. Nuqulka wuxuu la kaydinayaa qaybtaada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBeddel qiime u dhow sare oo mar kale riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Isku day:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eg = 0.001;\u003C/code\u003E — nus farqi: goobta farqiga way labanlaabmaysaa, jiidista sidaas oo kale (wuxuu raacaa B²).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emur = 200;\u003C/code\u003E — core liita: ampere-turns badan ayaa birta lagu baabi&#039;iyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN = 200;\u003C/code\u003E — labo turns: labo jeer goobta, afar jeer inductance.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eh = 0.0005;\u003C/code\u003E — grid fiican: jawaabo dhow, qiyaastii afar jeer waqti.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMid kasta oo socodsiin ah wuxuu bedelaa canvas-ka. Doorsoomayaasha script-ka sameeyay (sida \u003Ccode\u003EBgap\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EF\u003C/code\u003E) waxay ku sii jiraan liiska \u003Cstrong\u003EVariables\u003C/strong\u003E xisaabtaada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabkaaga-moodeel\"\u003EQaabkaaga moodeel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETusaalaha wuxuu dhisayaa wax kasta laga bilaabo saddex liis, mid qiimo ah grid square kasta, oo laga samayn karo qaab kasta oo khadad toos ah ku dhisan grid-ka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeesha birta ku taal:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003Eiron\u003C/code\u003E waa run squares-ka ku jira core-ka. Tusaalaha wuxuu ka dhisay sanduuqyo: \u003Ccode\u003Eframe &amp; ~window &amp; ~gap\u003C/code\u003E macnaheedu waa &quot;frame-ka ku jira, daaqadda kuma jirto, farqiga kuma jirto&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPermeability:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E1 + (mur - 1) * iron\u003C/code\u003E waa 1 hawada iyo \u003Ccode\u003Emur\u003C/code\u003E birta. Sidaas oo kale u sii qiimo gaar ah dhowr alaab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShidaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ccode\u003EJ\u003C/code\u003E waa current density oo ah amperes mitir labajibbaaran kasta, togan marka ka baxayo shaashadda, taban marka ku soo gasha. Coil-ku wuxuu leeyahay laba dhinac oo calaamado ka soo horjeeda; tusaalaha wuxuu xisaabiyaa \u003Ccode\u003EJ0\u003C/code\u003E si dhinac kasta u qaado N I.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKadibna \u003Ccode\u003Er = magnetostatic2d(m, permeability, J)\u003C/code\u003E ayaa xallisa. \u003Ccode\u003Er.B\u003C/code\u003E waa flux density square kasta (laba tiir: x iyo y), \u003Ccode\u003Er.Bmag\u003C/code\u003E cabbirkiisa, \u003Ccode\u003Er.energy\u003C/code\u003E tamarta la kaydiyay mitir kasta. \u003Ccode\u003Eplot(x, y)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sawiraa khad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaktabada waxay ka shaqeysaa mitirada, muuqaalkana millimitirada, sidaas darteed goob la muujiyay sida ay tahay waxay ahaan lahayd kun jeer oo yar. Tusaalaha wuxuu ku muujiyaa nuqul grid-ka millimitirada ah (\u003Ccode\u003Emm = quadGrid(…)\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna \u003Ccode\u003Eshow(field(mm, …))\u003C/code\u003E): koobi laba saftarkaas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaadiyan geesta sanduuqa ayaa goobta ku hayn: flux-ku ma baxo. Sanduuqa ka dhig ugu yaraan laba ama saddex jeer cabbirka magnet-ka si aan goobta loo riixin. Magnet isku mid ah waxaad moodeeli kartaa half; madasha \u003Ccode\u003Emagnetostatic2d\u003C/code\u003E waxay sheegaysaa geesta loo isticmaalo khadka symmetry-ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"magnets-joogto-ah\"\u003EMagnets joogto ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETusaalaha labaad, \u003Cstrong\u003EExamples\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EPermanent magnet in an iron core: working point, leakage, pull\u003C/strong\u003E, waa isla core-ka oo coil-ka laga qaaday, 10 mm ka mid ah lugta bidix waxaa lagu beddelay magnet, oo sare loo magnetized. Ku socodsii \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Wuxuu daabacayaa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ethe magnet works at B = 1.036 T, H = -124 kA/m (on its recoil line B = Br + μ0 μr H)\nB in the gap 0.6778 T; the magnetic circuit without leakage 0.9692 T (-30.1 %)\nleakage factor 1.53: of the flux leaving the magnet, 65 % crosses the gap between the pole faces\npull across the gap about 3656 N per metre of depth (182.8 N for 50 mm deep)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWorking point.\u003C/strong\u003E Magnet-ka waxaa lagu tilmaamaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eremanence\u003C/strong\u003E Br (goobta uu hayo markii birta lagu gaabiyo: qiyaastii 1.2 T magnet NdFeB ah oo sintered, 0.4 T ferrite) iyo recoil permeability (qiyaastii 1.05 iyo 1.1). Furidda farqi wuxuu ku riixaa khadka recoil-keeda hoos: halkan ilaa 1.04 T, H wuxuu ku tilmaamaa gudaha magnet-ka ka soo horjeeda B.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELeakage.\u003C/strong\u003E Xisaabta gacanta oo aan leakage lahayn waxay siineysaa 0.97 T farqiga; moodeelku wuxuu siinayaa 0.68 T. Magnet-ku flux-keeda wuxuu u riixaa xoog xoog leh masaafo gaaban, sidaas darteed qaybta badan waxay si toos ah dib ugu noqotaa daaqadda halkii ay farqiga mari lahayd. Leakage factor-ku wuxuu sheegaa inta ay tahay: 1.53 halkan. Dhig \u003Ccode\u003Eg = 0;\u003C/code\u003E keeper xidhan: magnet-ku wuxuu markaas ku shaqeeyaa wax ka yar nus boqolkiiba oo xisaabta gacanta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMagnets moodeelkaaga.\u003C/strong\u003E Siiyo \u003Ccode\u003Emagnetostatic2d\u003C/code\u003E magnet-yada sida \u003Ccode\u003Estruct(&#039;Br&#039;, Br)\u003C/code\u003E, halkaas oo \u003Ccode\u003EBr\u003C/code\u003E uu leeyahay hal safaf grid square kasta oo remanence-ka x iyo y ku jira tesla (eber dibadda magnet-yada), oo siiyo magnet squares-ka recoil permeability-kooda liiska permeability-ka:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E``\u003Ccode\u003E Brem = [zeros(numel(mag), 1), 1.2 * mag];     % 1.2 T sare meelaha mag ay run tahay r = magnetostatic2d(m, 1 + (mur - 1) * iron + 0.05 * mag, 0, struct(), struct(&#039;Br&#039;, Brem)); \u003C/code\u003E``\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagnet loo magnetized xagal, dhig \u003Ccode\u003EBr·cos(angle)\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003EBr·sin(angle)\u003C/code\u003E labada tiir; magnet ring ah oo dibadda loo magnetized, xisaabi jihada square kasta meeshiisa. \u003Ccode\u003Er.H\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu siinayaa xoogga goobta H square kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMoodeelku wuxuu magnet-ka ku hayaa khadkiisa recoil toosan xataa hadii si adag loo riixo. Magnet dhab ah oo laga riixo ka dhaafa jilibkiisa (farqi weyn, coil xoogle ah ama kulayl) qayb ka mid ah xooggiisa si joogto ah ayuu lumiyaa; hubi working point-ka marka loo barbardhigo curve-ka soo saaraha darajada iyo heerkulka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETijaabooyinka maktabada waxay hubiyaan magnets laba natiijo gacmeed: magnet goobo ah hawada furan (gudaheeda B = Br / (1 + μr)) iyo magnet lagu xidhay keeper bir ah (magnetic circuit), labadaba 1% gudahood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aanu-weli-sameynin\"\u003EWaxa aanu weli sameynin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaturation.\u003C/strong\u003E Birtu waa toosan tahay: laba jeer shidaal, laba jeer goobta, aan xad lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDemagnetisation.\u003C/strong\u003E Magnets waxay ku sii jiraan khadkooda recoil toosan (eeg kor).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEddy currents\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Elosses\u003C/strong\u003E (iron loss, copper loss).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha dhaqdhaqaaqa iyo torque.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiro rotor wareegaya stator gudihiisa, ma jiro torque xagal ka soo horjeeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaababka wareegsan.\u003C/strong\u003E Grid-ku wuxuu ka kooban yahay labajibbaaran isku mid ah, sidaas darteed geesaha goobaha waxay u muuqdaan kuwo tallaabo leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E3-D.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax kasta waa qayb-jarka wax dheer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENaqshadda motor-ka (rotor wareegaya, torque iyo losses 2-D) waxaa loo fiirinayaa nooca soo socda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Maktabada falanqaynta PartCraft waxay xisaabin kartaa goobta magnetic-ka ee coil-ka iyo birta 2-D: qaybta gudaheeda oo dheer oo isku mid ah dhererkeeda, sida electromagnet, core-ka transformer-ka, busbar-ka ama qaybta motor-ka. Casharkan wuxuu socodsiinayaa tusaalaha electromagnet-ka ee maktabada, wuxuu akhrinayaa waxa uu sheegayo, wuxuu beddelayaa, wuxuu tusayaa sida moodeel naftaada loo dhiso, kadibna wuxuu ku daraa magnet joogto ah. Wuxuu isticmaalaa Script workspace iyo maktabada falanqaynta. Ma u baahnid inaad garanayso luuqadda CraftScript si aad u raacdo; tusaalaha ayaa sheegaya waxa khad kasta sameeyo. Waxa la moodelayo Core bir ah oo C-shaped ah, 100 × 80 mm dibadda, 20 mm qaro. Farqi hawo oo 2 mm ah lugta midig. Coil 100 turns ah oo qaada 10 A (1000 ampere-turns) oo lagu duubay lugta bidix. Wax kasta dherer ayay ku leeyihiin oo dhanka shaashadda ka baxaya, sidaas darteed jawaabaha waa qoto dheer mitir kasta: ku dhufo qoto dheerida dhabta ah si aad magnet dhab ah u hesho. Maktabada magnetostatic2d waxay xallisaa vector potential-ka magnetic-ka grid-ka 1 mm oo labajibbaaran oo ku jira sanduuq hawo ah oo ku wareegsan magnet-ka, kadibna waxay xisaabisaa flux density B (tesla) laga bilaabo. Tusaalaha socodsii Dooro Script sanduuqa Workspace ee bidix toolbar-ka. Fur tab-ka Library ee panel-ka script-ka, kadibna Examples › Electromagnet: field, gap, inductance. Guji Open (read-only), kadibna riix F5. Ilbiriqsi ama laba gudahood, canvas-ku wuxuu muujinayaa flux density-ga, console-kuna wuxuu daabacaa: B in the gap 0.5427 T; magnetic circuit 0.5516 T (-1.6 %: fringing and leakage) inductance 0.1539 H per metre of depth; the circuit gives 0.1103 H/m, missing the flux that leaks past the gap stored energy 7.694 J/m; |B| peaks at 1.97 T in the window's inner corners (real steel would saturate there) pull across the gap about 2343 N per metre of depth (117.2 N for 50 mm deep) Plot-ka hoose canvas-ka waa flux density-ga B_y oo ku jira khadka dhexe ee core-ka, bidix ilaa midig: qiyaastii −0.55 T lugta bidix (flux-ku wuxuu ku socdaa hoos), wax yar daaqadda, iyo +0.55 T lugta midig iyo farqiga (flux-ku wuu soo noqdaa). Flux-ka isku mid ah wuxuu maraa birta iyo farqiga, sidaas darteed labada lug iyo farqigu waxay muujiyaan qiime isku dhow. Akhri natiijooyinka Goobta farqiga waa 0.543 T. Xisaabta gacanta waxay u qaadaa core-ka sidii hal magnetic circuit, B = μ0 N I / (g + l / μr), halkaas oo g yahay farqiga, l dhererka jidka birta, μr permeability-ga birta; waxay siinaysaa 0.552 T. Goobtu way ka hooseysaa xisaabta gacanta sababtoo ah flux-ku wuu fidsan yahay ku wareegsan farqiga (fringing) iyo qaarkood wuxuu kicinayaa jid gaaban oo daaqadda ku maraya (leakage). Farqi yar ama grid fiican, labadaba way isu dhowaadaan. Inductance-ka coil-ka 100-turn waa 0.154 H mitir kasta oo qoto dheer, tamarta lagu kaydiyay goobta ka soo qaadaneysa. Qaabka circuit-ku wuu ka yar yahay (0.110 H/m) sababtoo ah wuxuu tiriyaa oo kaliya flux-ka farqiga maraya, ma aha kan ka leakaya. Jiidista ee xidhaysa farqiga waa B² w / (2 μ0) oo w yahay ballaca wajiga farqiga: qiyaastii 2300 N mitir kasta, ama 117 N magnet 50 mm qoto dheer. Qiimaha sare 1.97 T wuxuu ku yaal geeska gudaha ee daaqadda, meesha flux-ku si xagal ah u leexdo. Moodeelku wuxuu u qaadaa birta inay tahay toos; biraha dhabta ah ee koronka ah waxay buuxaan qiyaastii 1.5 ilaa 2 T, sidaas darteed qiimaha ka weyn ahaan digniin, ma aha jawaab. Tijaabooyinka maktabada laftoodu waxay socodsiiyaan tusaalahan oo waxay hubiyaan goobta farqiga marka loo barbardhigo qaacidada magnetic-circuit mar kasta oo PartCraft la beddelo. Habka, tixraacyadiisa iyo hubinta kale (solenoid dheer, solenoid bir-core ah) waxay ku jiraan madasha magnetostatic2d: guji oo maktabada ku jira. Beddel naqshadda Guji Make a copy kor script-ka akhrinta-keliya. Nuqulka wuxuu la kaydinayaa qaybtaada. Beddel qiime u dhow sare oo mar kale riix F5. Isku day: g = 0.001; — nus farqi: goobta farqiga way labanlaabmaysaa, jiidista sidaas oo kale (wuxuu raacaa B²). mur = 200; — core liita: ampere-turns badan ayaa birta lagu baabi'iyaa. N = 200; — labo turns: labo jeer goobta, afar jeer inductance. h = 0.0005; — grid fiican: jawaabo dhow, qiyaastii afar jeer waqti. Mid kasta oo socodsiin ah wuxuu bedelaa canvas-ka. Doorsoomayaasha script-ka sameeyay (sida Bgap, L, F) waxay ku sii jiraan liiska Variables xisaabtaada. Qaabkaaga moodeel Tusaalaha wuxuu dhisayaa wax kasta laga bilaabo saddex liis, mid qiimo ah grid square kasta, oo laga samayn karo qaab kasta oo khadad toos ah ku dhisan grid-ka: Meesha birta ku taal: iron waa run squares-ka ku jira core-ka. Tusaalaha wuxuu ka dhisay sanduuqyo: frame & ~window & ~gap macnaheedu waa \"frame-ka ku jira, daaqadda kuma jirto, farqiga kuma jirto\". Permeability: 1 + (mur - 1) * iron waa 1 hawada iyo mur birta. Sidaas oo kale u sii qiimo gaar ah dhowr alaab. Shidaalka: J waa current density oo ah amperes mitir labajibbaaran kasta, togan marka ka baxayo shaashadda, taban marka ku soo gasha. Coil-ku wuxuu leeyahay laba dhinac oo calaamado ka soo horjeeda; tusaalaha wuxuu xisaabiyaa J0 si dhinac kasta u qaado N I. Kadibna r = magnetostatic2d(m, permeability, J) ayaa xallisa. r.B waa flux density square kasta (laba tiir: x iyo y), r.Bmag cabbirkiisa, r.energy tamarta la kaydiyay mitir kasta. plot(x, y) wuxuu sawiraa khad. Maktabada waxay ka shaqeysaa mitirada, muuqaalkana millimitirada, sidaas darteed goob la muujiyay sida ay tahay waxay ahaan lahayd kun jeer oo yar. Tusaalaha wuxuu ku muujiyaa nuqul grid-ka millimitirada ah (mm = quadGrid(…), kadibna show(field(mm, …))): koobi laba saftarkaas. Caadiyan geesta sanduuqa ayaa goobta ku hayn: flux-ku ma baxo. Sanduuqa ka dhig ugu yaraan laba ama saddex jeer cabbirka magnet-ka si aan goobta loo riixin. Magnet isku mid ah waxaad moodeeli kartaa half; madasha magnetostatic2d waxay sheegaysaa geesta loo isticmaalo khadka symmetry-ga. Magnets joogto ah Tusaalaha labaad, Examples › Permanent magnet in an iron core: working point, leakage, pull, waa isla core-ka oo coil-ka laga qaaday, 10 mm ka mid ah lugta bidix waxaa lagu beddelay magnet, oo sare loo magnetized. Ku socodsii F5. Wuxuu daabacayaa: the magnet works at B = 1.036 T, H = -124 kA/m (on its recoil line B = Br + μ0 μr H) B in the gap 0.6778 T; the magnetic circuit without leakage 0.9692 T (-30.1 %) leakage factor 1.53: of the flux leaving the magnet, 65 % crosses the gap between the pole faces pull across the gap about 3656 N per metre of depth (182.8 N for 50 mm deep) Working point. Magnet-ka waxaa lagu tilmaamaa remanence Br (goobta uu hayo markii birta lagu gaabiyo: qiyaastii 1.2 T magnet NdFeB ah oo sintered, 0.4 T ferrite) iyo recoil permeability (qiyaastii 1.05 iyo 1.1). Furidda farqi wuxuu ku riixaa khadka recoil-keeda hoos: halkan ilaa 1.04 T, H wuxuu ku tilmaamaa gudaha magnet-ka ka soo horjeeda B. Leakage. Xisaabta gacanta oo aan leakage lahayn waxay siineysaa 0.97 T farqiga; moodeelku wuxuu siinayaa 0.68 T. Magnet-ku flux-keeda wuxuu u riixaa xoog xoog leh masaafo gaaban, sidaas darteed qaybta badan waxay si toos ah dib ugu noqotaa daaqadda halkii ay farqiga mari lahayd. Leakage factor-ku wuxuu sheegaa inta ay tahay: 1.53 halkan. Dhig g = 0; keeper xidhan: magnet-ku wuxuu markaas ku shaqeeyaa wax ka yar nus boqolkiiba oo xisaabta gacanta. Magnets moodeelkaaga. Siiyo magnetostatic2d magnet-yada sida struct('Br', Br), halkaas oo Br uu leeyahay hal safaf grid square kasta oo remanence-ka x iyo y ku jira tesla (eber dibadda magnet-yada), oo siiyo magnet squares-ka recoil permeability-kooda liiska permeability-ka: `` Brem = [zeros(numel(mag), 1), 1.2 * mag]; % 1.2 T sare meelaha mag ay run tahay r = magnetostatic2d(m, 1 + (mur - 1) * iron + 0.05 * mag, 0, struct(), struct('Br', Brem)); `` Magnet loo magnetized xagal, dhig Br·cos(angle) iyo Br·sin(angle) labada tiir; magnet ring ah oo dibadda loo magnetized, xisaabi jihada square kasta meeshiisa. r.H wuxuu siinayaa xoogga goobta H square kasta. Moodeelku wuxuu magnet-ka ku hayaa khadkiisa recoil toosan xataa hadii si adag loo riixo. Magnet dhab ah oo laga riixo ka dhaafa jilibkiisa (farqi weyn, coil xoogle ah ama kulayl) qayb ka mid ah xooggiisa si joogto ah ayuu lumiyaa; hubi working point-ka marka loo barbardhigo curve-ka soo saaraha darajada iyo heerkulka. Tijaabooyinka maktabada waxay hubiyaan magnets laba natiijo gacmeed: magnet goobo ah hawada furan (gudaheeda B = Br / (1 + μr)) iyo magnet lagu xidhay keeper bir ah (magnetic circuit), labadaba 1% gudahood. Waxa aanu weli sameynin Saturation. Birtu waa toosan tahay: laba jeer shidaal, laba jeer goobta, aan xad lahayn. Demagnetisation. Magnets waxay ku sii jiraan khadkooda recoil toosan (eeg kor). Eddy currents iyo losses (iron loss, copper loss). Qaybaha dhaqdhaqaaqa iyo torque. Ma jiro rotor wareegaya stator gudihiisa, ma jiro torque xagal ka soo horjeeda. Qaababka wareegsan. Grid-ku wuxuu ka kooban yahay labajibbaaran isku mid ah, sidaas darteed geesaha goobaha waxay u muuqdaan kuwo tallaabo leh. 3-D. Wax kasta waa qayb-jarka wax dheer. Naqshadda motor-ka (rotor wareegaya, torque iyo losses 2-D) waxaa loo fiirinayaa nooca soo socda. Eeg Weli lama dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"rough-3d","scope":"partcraft","title":"Jarista 3D ku dhow iyo jarista hadhaaga","summary":"Ka jar agabka wareega moodeelka oo dhan heer-heer adigoo isticmaalaya qalab falaar, bull-nose ama kubbad bar dhamaad, oo dhererka dhamaystirka ka tag, kadibna qalab yar ha ka jaro meelaha qalabka weyn ka dhigay agab hadhay. Waxa waddooyinku dammaanad qaadayaan iyo waxa aysan dammaanad qaadin.","section":"tasks","order":147,"keywords":["jarista 3d","ku dhow","ku dhow","jarista hadhaaga","rest machining","rest roughing","agabka hadhay","agab la reebo","stepdown","heerarka","z level","waterline","ramp","plunge","godan","qalab yar"],"headings":[{"id":"3d-roughing","text":"3D roughing","level":2},{"id":"rest-machining","text":"Rest machining","level":2},{"id":"sida-waddooyinku-u-wanaagsan-yihiin","text":"Sida waddooyinku u wanaagsan yihiin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELaba howlgal oo ku jira Wax soo saarka, oo ku hoos jira \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E qalab-sanduuqiisa, ayaa agabka ka jaraya \u003Cstrong\u003Emoodeelka oo dhan\u003C/strong\u003E 3D, iyadoo qalabka toosan la hayo (ama sida howlgalka \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/multi-axis#a-tilted-tool-for-an-ordinary-operation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/multi-axis\" data-hash=\"a-tilted-tool-for-an-ordinary-operation\"\u003Etool direction\u003C/a\u003E uu yahay). Ma qaadan doonaan wax xulasho ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-roughing\"\u003E3D roughing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D rough\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa sare ee agabka, hal \u003Cstrong\u003Etallaabo-hoosaad\u003C/strong\u003E mar. Heer kasta wuxuu jaraa wixii qalabku gaari karo iyada oo aan taabanin moodeelka: xariiqyo toosan oo ku dhow \u003Cstrong\u003Etallaabo-kala-fogaan\u003C/strong\u003E (qayb ka mid ah dhexroorka qalabka), kadibna hal jeer ayuu ku wareegaa geesta waxa uu gaari karo, sidaas darteed derbiyada waa la raacaa halkii ay ka ahaan lahaayeen safka tallaabooyin ee qorshaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka la reebo\u003C/strong\u003E: intee le&#039;eg ayuu qalabku uga fogaanayaa moodeelka meel kasta, marinka dhamaystirka ah (caadiga ah 0.5 mm).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHeer kasta oo ah sagxad toos ah\u003C/strong\u003E: heer dheeraad ah oo ku sarreeya dhererka wejig toosan kasta oo moodeelka ah (iyo agabka la reebo), si sagxadda aan u hadhin ilaa hal tallaabo-hoosaad oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa tag agab dhuuban ka\u003C/strong\u003E: agab ka khafiif ah intan, sare ama dhinac, ma leh qiime marin; (0.05 mm jarista ku dhowsan, 0.5 mm jarista hadhaaga, si timir dhererka derbiga la hadhay aanu qalabka yar u dirin derbi kasta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHoose\u003C/strong\u003E: wax aan la jari doonin ka hooseeya dhererkan. Madhan waxa uu ka dhigan yahay hoose moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay ka bilaabataa agabka \u003Cstrong\u003Esida howlgallada ka hor ay uga tageen\u003C/strong\u003E: ka dib marinka wejiga ma jari doono hawada uu qalabka wejiga weyn ka dhaqaaqay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoos u degisto: meesha qalabku ku kulmi lahaa agabka marka uu hoos u socdo, wuxuu u socdaa marinkiisa \u003Cstrong\u003Eheerka ramp-ka\u003C/strong\u003E, dib iyo dib u socda ilaa ugu badnaan laba dhexroor oo qalab. Marin aad u gaaban oo taas aan u habboonayn ayaa si toosan hoos loogu riixaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eplunge feed\u003C/strong\u003E-ka; howlgalku wuu tiriyaa oo digaa, sababtoo ah qalab aan jarin dhexdiisa ma samayn lahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rest-machining\"\u003ERest machining\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERest\u003C/span\u003E waa isla istaraatijiyadda \u003Cstrong\u003Eqalab yar oo ka dambeeya qalab weyn\u003C/strong\u003E. Wuxuu akhriyaa simulasho agabka wuxuuna jaraa meelaha agabku weli taagan yahay oo keliya: geesaha gudaha ee qalabka weyn ma geli karin, godyada aanu ku habboonayn, tallaabooyinka uu ka tagay janjeerada. Meelaha kale wax ma sameyo, sidaas darteed marinkiisu waa qayb yar oo ka mid ah wixii isla qalabkaas uu jari lahaa agab cusub.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhig ka dib howlgalka roughing-ka oo dooro qalabka yar. Wuxuu u baahan yahay simulasho agabka howlgallada ka hor, taas oo sanduuqa Wax soo saarka had iyo jeer maamusho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-waddooyinku-u-wanaagsan-yihiin\"\u003ESida waddooyinku u wanaagsan yihiin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiro godan.\u003C/strong\u003E Qalabka meelaha waa la xisaabiyaa shabakad, qalabka oo la weyneeyay yar (1.4 unug shabakad ee dhinacyada, iyo agabka la reebo), si meel kasta oo uu taago uu uga fogaado moodeelka. Tijaabooyinku meel kasta oo jarid ah waxay ku hubiyaan qalabka saxda ah ee mesh-ka saxda ah, iyo simulasho agabka kadib kasta: ma jiro godan, ma jiro dhaqdhaqaaq degdeg ah oo agab ku dhex maraya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQiimaha taas\u003C/strong\u003E: derbiyadu waxay haystaan wax ka badan agabka la reebo, ilaa qadarka lagu muujiyay &quot;Extra stock on walls&quot; howlgalka (qiyaastii 0.5 mm qalab Ø6, wax ka yar qalab yar). Marinka dhamaystirka ayaa qaadaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa aan ahayn waddooyinkan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafafku waa xariiqyo toosan, ma aha offset-yo qaabka qaybta ama khadadka engagement-ka joogtada ah. Waxay leeyihiin dhaqdhaqaaq kor u kac iyo dhaqdhaqaaq hawo badan oo ka badan istaraatijiyadda offset ama adaptive, safka koowaad ee heer kasta wuxuu jaraa ballaca qalabka oo dhan. Pocket-yada sagxadaha siman, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\"\u003EAdaptive\u003C/a\u003E waa roughing ka wanaagsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGees-hoosta qalabka iyo holder-ka lama hubin. Digniin ayaa muuqata markii jarista ay ka qoto dheer tahay dherer-fiilada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa jiro undercuts: moodeelka waa wixii qalabku ku kulmo isagoo ka soo hoos degaya tiirkiisa. Si aad jaftid dhinac u jartid, siiyo howlgal labaad \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/multi-axis#a-tilted-tool-for-an-ordinary-operation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/multi-axis\" data-hash=\"a-tilted-tool-for-an-ordinary-operation\"\u003Etilted tool direction\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERest machining waxa uu og yahay agabka sida uu u og yahay shabakadda simulasho (unugyo 0.1 ilaa 2 mm, iyada oo ku xidhan cabbirka qaybta).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta weyn barnaamijku waa dheer yahay (in ka badan 100,000 dhaqdhaqaaq flange 200 mm ah oo qalab Ø6 ah) wuxuuna qaadaa qiyaastii daqiiqad si loo xisaabiyo, isbeddel kasta oo ku jira qalab-sanduuqa mar kasta wuxuu dib u xisaabiyaa barnaamijka oo dhan. Isticmaal qalabka ugu weyn ee ku habboonaada roughing-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHubi wax-soo-saarka simulator-ka mashiinkaaga ka hor inta aanad jarin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Laba howlgal oo ku jira Wax soo saarka, oo ku hoos jira More qalab-sanduuqiisa, ayaa agabka ka jaraya moodeelka oo dhan 3D, iyadoo qalabka toosan la hayo (ama sida howlgalka tool direction uu yahay). Ma qaadan doonaan wax xulasho ah. 3D roughing 3D rough wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa sare ee agabka, hal tallaabo-hoosaad mar. Heer kasta wuxuu jaraa wixii qalabku gaari karo iyada oo aan taabanin moodeelka: xariiqyo toosan oo ku dhow tallaabo-kala-fogaan (qayb ka mid ah dhexroorka qalabka), kadibna hal jeer ayuu ku wareegaa geesta waxa uu gaari karo, sidaas darteed derbiyada waa la raacaa halkii ay ka ahaan lahaayeen safka tallaabooyin ee qorshaha. Agabka la reebo: intee le'eg ayuu qalabku uga fogaanayaa moodeelka meel kasta, marinka dhamaystirka ah (caadiga ah 0.5 mm). Heer kasta oo ah sagxad toos ah: heer dheeraad ah oo ku sarreeya dhererka wejig toosan kasta oo moodeelka ah (iyo agabka la reebo), si sagxadda aan u hadhin ilaa hal tallaabo-hoosaad oo dhan. Ka tag agab dhuuban ka: agab ka khafiif ah intan, sare ama dhinac, ma leh qiime marin; (0.05 mm jarista ku dhowsan, 0.5 mm jarista hadhaaga, si timir dhererka derbiga la hadhay aanu qalabka yar u dirin derbi kasta). Hoose: wax aan la jari doonin ka hooseeya dhererkan. Madhan waxa uu ka dhigan yahay hoose moodeelka. Waxay ka bilaabataa agabka sida howlgallada ka hor ay uga tageen: ka dib marinka wejiga ma jari doono hawada uu qalabka wejiga weyn ka dhaqaaqay. Hoos u degisto: meesha qalabku ku kulmi lahaa agabka marka uu hoos u socdo, wuxuu u socdaa marinkiisa heerka ramp-ka, dib iyo dib u socda ilaa ugu badnaan laba dhexroor oo qalab. Marin aad u gaaban oo taas aan u habboonayn ayaa si toosan hoos loogu riixaa plunge feed-ka; howlgalku wuu tiriyaa oo digaa, sababtoo ah qalab aan jarin dhexdiisa ma samayn lahaa. Rest machining Rest waa isla istaraatijiyadda qalab yar oo ka dambeeya qalab weyn. Wuxuu akhriyaa simulasho agabka wuxuuna jaraa meelaha agabku weli taagan yahay oo keliya: geesaha gudaha ee qalabka weyn ma geli karin, godyada aanu ku habboonayn, tallaabooyinka uu ka tagay janjeerada. Meelaha kale wax ma sameyo, sidaas darteed marinkiisu waa qayb yar oo ka mid ah wixii isla qalabkaas uu jari lahaa agab cusub. Dhig ka dib howlgalka roughing-ka oo dooro qalabka yar. Wuxuu u baahan yahay simulasho agabka howlgallada ka hor, taas oo sanduuqa Wax soo saarka had iyo jeer maamusho. Sida waddooyinku u wanaagsan yihiin Ma jiro godan. Qalabka meelaha waa la xisaabiyaa shabakad, qalabka oo la weyneeyay yar (1.4 unug shabakad ee dhinacyada, iyo agabka la reebo), si meel kasta oo uu taago uu uga fogaado moodeelka. Tijaabooyinku meel kasta oo jarid ah waxay ku hubiyaan qalabka saxda ah ee mesh-ka saxda ah, iyo simulasho agabka kadib kasta: ma jiro godan, ma jiro dhaqdhaqaaq degdeg ah oo agab ku dhex maraya. Qiimaha taas: derbiyadu waxay haystaan wax ka badan agabka la reebo, ilaa qadarka lagu muujiyay \"Extra stock on walls\" howlgalka (qiyaastii 0.5 mm qalab Ø6, wax ka yar qalab yar). Marinka dhamaystirka ayaa qaadaa. Waxa aan ahayn waddooyinkan: Safafku waa xariiqyo toosan, ma aha offset-yo qaabka qaybta ama khadadka engagement-ka joogtada ah. Waxay leeyihiin dhaqdhaqaaq kor u kac iyo dhaqdhaqaaq hawo badan oo ka badan istaraatijiyadda offset ama adaptive, safka koowaad ee heer kasta wuxuu jaraa ballaca qalabka oo dhan. Pocket-yada sagxadaha siman, Adaptive waa roughing ka wanaagsan. Gees-hoosta qalabka iyo holder-ka lama hubin. Digniin ayaa muuqata markii jarista ay ka qoto dheer tahay dherer-fiilada. Ma jiro undercuts: moodeelka waa wixii qalabku ku kulmo isagoo ka soo hoos degaya tiirkiisa. Si aad jaftid dhinac u jartid, siiyo howlgal labaad tilted tool direction. Rest machining waxa uu og yahay agabka sida uu u og yahay shabakadda simulasho (unugyo 0.1 ilaa 2 mm, iyada oo ku xidhan cabbirka qaybta). Qaybta weyn barnaamijku waa dheer yahay (in ka badan 100,000 dhaqdhaqaaq flange 200 mm ah oo qalab Ø6 ah) wuxuuna qaadaa qiyaastii daqiiqad si loo xisaabiyo, isbeddel kasta oo ku jira qalab-sanduuqa mar kasta wuxuu dib u xisaabiyaa barnaamijka oo dhan. Isticmaal qalabka ugu weyn ee ku habboonaada roughing-ka. Hubi wax-soo-saarka simulator-ka mashiinkaaga ka hor inta aanad jarin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"multi-axis","scope":"partcraft","title":"Jarista 4- iyo 5-tiir","summary":"U sheeg PartCraft tiirarka wareega ee mashiinka, leexi qalabka howl kasta oo caadi ah, dhamaystir dusha adigoo isticmaalaya kubbad bar dhamaad oo leexata markii la jarayo, ama ka wareeg qaybta qalabka hoosteeda tiirka 4-aad. Waxa lagu qoro G-code-ka, iyo waxa aan wali la caddeynin.","section":"tasks","order":148,"keywords":["5 axis","five axis","4 axis","fourth axis","multi axis","multiaxis","3+2","indexed","positional","tilt","tilted tool","rotary","trunnion","table","head","a axis","b axis","c axis","tcp","rtcp","tool centre point","g43.4","inverse time","g93","kinematics","pivot","swarf","lead angle"],"headings":[{"id":"tiirarka-wareega-ee-mashiinka","text":"Tiirarka wareega ee mashiinka","level":2},{"id":"qalab-leexan-oo-howl-caadi-ah","text":"Qalab leexan oo howl caadi ah","level":2},{"id":"dhamaystirka-5-tiir","text":"Dhamaystirka 5-tiir","level":2},{"id":"dhamaystirka-wareega-tiirka-4-aad","text":"Dhamaystirka wareega (tiirka 4-aad)","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadaha","text":"Xaddidaadaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWax soo saarka wuxuu qalabka ku hayn karaa xagal, wuxuuna tiirarka wareega ku dhaqaajin karaa intii la jarayo. Saddex waxyaabood ayaa sidaas sameeya, oo ka soo bilaabma kan ugu fudud.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxan lama wada wareegin mashiin.\u003C/strong\u003E Waddooyinka waxaa lagu hubiyaa joomatariga tijaabooyinka, G-code-na waa la akhriyaa, laakiin post-yada dhex-ku-jira waxay raacaan koodhadhka dukumintiga ee xakameeyayaasha, ma aha mashiin kasta oo nagu hor jira. Barnaamijka ku caddee simulator-ka xakameeyahaaga iyo hawada ka hor inta aanu taabanin birta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tiirarka-wareega-ee-mashiinka\"\u003ETiirarka wareega ee mashiinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EDejin\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotary axes\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu sheegaa waxa mashiinku leeyahay:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorasho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMashiinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMidna (3 tiir)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMill caadi ah. Howlgal kasta oo u baahan in qalabka la leexiyo wuu digayaa, post-ka ma qori doono.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA (wareega X-ka agtiisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal tiir wareeg oo X ku dhex jira: miis 4-aad ama indexer. Qalabku wuxuu leexan karaa diyaarada Y–Z oo keliya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EB (wareega Y-ka agtiisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal tiir wareeg oo Y ku dhex jira. Qalabku wuxuu leexan karaa diyaarada X–Z oo keliya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA iyo C\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiir leexin oo X ku dhex jira oo ku xambaaysan, ama xambaaysiya, wareeg Z ku dhex jira: miis trunnion, ama madax.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EB iyo C\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla sida oo leexinta ku dhex jirta Y.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaas:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu xambaaysan\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe table (the part turns)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe head (the tool turns)\u003C/span\u003E. Miiska wuxuu wareegaa jihada ka soo horjeedda si uu usoo keeno isla wejigii qalabka hoosteeda, sidaas darteed calaamada xagal kasta waxay ka timaadaa tan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKontoroolku wuxuu ilaaliyaa barta qalabka ee waddada (TCP)\u003C/strong\u003E: markuu on yahay, X Y Z ee barnaamijka waa barta qalabka oo ku jirta isku-xidhka qaybta, kontoroolku wuu sameeyaa kuwa kale (post-yada Fanuc-style iyo LinuxCNC ee caadiga ah waxay qoraan \u003Ccode\u003EG43.4\u003C/code\u003E dhererka qalabka). Markuu off yahay, mashiinka miiska, PartCraft wuxuu qoraa X Y Z sida miiska wareegaya uu qaybta u qaado, oo ku saabsan \u003Cstrong\u003Edhexda wareega\u003C/strong\u003E aad bixisay (kala-saarka shaqada; 0, 0, 0 markii asalka shaqada uu ku yaal dhexda). Mashiin madax ah wuxuu u baahan yahay TCP on: haddii kale barnaamijku wuxuu u baahan doonaa dherer pivot-ka mashiinka, PartCraft-na ma garto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXadka leexinta\u003C/strong\u003E: intee le&#039;eg ayuu tiirka leexinta u socdaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMashiinadu way kala duwan yihiin jihada ay ugu tiriyaan inay togan yihiin. Haddii tiir kuu wareego jihada qaldan mashiinkaaga, beddel calaamada nuqul post ah (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EPost processors you can edit\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalab-leexan-oo-howl-caadi-ah\"\u003EQalab leexan oo howl caadi ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHowl kasta oo jarid (face, pocket, adaptive, contour, drill, chamfer, parallel, scallop, 3D rough, rest) waxay leedahay \u003Cstrong\u003ETool tilt\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ETilt towards\u003C/strong\u003E: jihada qalabka howlgaladaas oo keliya, oo la cabbiro tiirka qalabka ee setup-ka. Tani waa 3+2 machining: tiirarka wareega waxay u gudbaan booska oo sii joogaan intii saddex tiir ay jarayaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor laba xagal, ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETool square to a face\u003C/span\u003E oo guji wejig sinaan ah: qalabku wuxuu si toos ah ugu tilmaamayaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro wejiyada iyo geesaha howlgalka sida caadiga ah. Waxa loo tiriyo sagxad ama godyo waxa lagu xukumaa iyada oo la eegayo qalabka leexan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAgabka jihadaas waa sanduuqa ku hayaa agabka la wareegay, sidaas darteed dherer iyo masaafooyinku way ammaan yihiin dhinacaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoodka G-code-ka, howlgalka ka hor qalabku wuu kor u kacaa, tiirarka wareega ayaa leexdaan, qalabkuna wuxuu hoos ugu imaa barta uu marka hore ku bilaabayo. Miis mashiin ah oo aan TCP lahayn, qoysaska waxay ahaan doonaan qoysas, godinta caadiga ahna waxay ahaan doontaa godinta caadiga ah (frame-ka la qoray wuxuu kaliya ku leexan yahay Z). Markuu TCP yahay diyaarad leexan, qoysaska waxay noqdaan dhaqdhaqaaqyo gaagaaban oo toos ah, wareegyadana dhaqdhaqaaqyada ay matalaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESimulasho agabka waxay ku shaqeysaa jihada leexan \u003Cstrong\u003Ekeligeed\u003C/strong\u003E: wuxuu muujiyaa waxa howlgalkaas ka jarayo agabka oo dhan oo laga arko dhinaceeda, wuxuuna ka helaa godanka halkaas, laakiin jarista laga sameeyay jihooyin kale lama qaado.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhamaystirka-5-tiir\"\u003EDhamaystirka 5-tiir\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E qalab-sanduuqa Wax soo saarka wuxuu liistaa howlgalkaan iyo kan xiga sare tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EHowlgallada\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E5-axis\u003C/span\u003E waa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003Emarinka isbarbar ee dhamaystirka\u003C/a\u003E oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003Ekubbad bar dhamaad oo leexata markay socoto\u003C/strong\u003E. Kubbadda waxay jaraa iyadoo adeegsanaysa kubbad, kubbaduna waa isku mid xagaaga oo kasta oo qalabku ku leexdo barta dhexe, sidaas darteed kubbaddu waxay raacaysaa waddada uu marin 3-tiir ah siin lahaa, oo kaliya jihada qalabka ayaa isbedela:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu wajahan dusha\u003C/strong\u003E: 1 = toosan dusha, 0 = sare, wax u dhexeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHore u leex\u003C/strong\u003E: darajooyin dhinaca jarista, si dhexda kubbadda ee taagan aysan u tahay wixii jarista sameeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELeexinta ugu badan\u003C/strong\u003E: qalabku waligiis kama leexan doono ka badan tan tiirka setup-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMeelaha qolka qalabka ku dhaqan karta moodeelka leexinta waa la jari doonaa ilaa uu nadiifo, howlgaluna wuxuu sheegaa meelaha ay tahay intee le&#039;eg. Marin kasta waxaa lagu soo galaa oo laga baxaa kor u kac toosan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhamaystirka-wareega-tiirka-4-aad\"\u003EDhamaystirka wareega (tiirka 4-aad)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERotary\u003C/span\u003E waa qaybta lagu hayo \u003Cstrong\u003Ework X\u003C/strong\u003E tiir wareeg. Qaybtu way wareegaysaa, kubbad bar dhamaad ah oo had iyo jeer tiirka u tilmaamaysa ayaa raacaysa dusheeda:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMarinnada\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlong the axis\u003C/span\u003E (xariiqyo X ku dhex jira, hal tallaabo oo leexin oo kala fog) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERound the part\u003C/span\u003E (giraanta, hal tallaabo oo X ah oo kala fog).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiirka ku yaal Y / Z\u003C/strong\u003E: meesha tiirku ku yaallo. Madhan waxa uu ka dhigan yahay dhexda agabka. Mashiinka miiska oo aan TCP lahayn, tani waa in ay noqotaa dhexda wareega ee Dejinta; howlgalku wuu digayaa haddii aanu taasi ahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa / Ilaa X\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKa / Ilaa xagal\u003C/strong\u003E: qaybta dhererka iyo wareegga ee la jarayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhererka kubbadda ka sarreeya tiirka barta kasta waa dhererka saxda ah ee kubbad ku dhacday mesh-ka qaybta, jihada aad ka eegayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadaha\"\u003EXaddidaadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E5-tiir iyo dhamaystirka wareega waxay qaataan \u003Cstrong\u003Ekubbad bar dhamaad\u003C/strong\u003E oo keliya. Ma jiro jarista swarf (dhinaca qalabka ee derbi toosan), ma jiro xariiqyada socodka ee jihooyinka wejiga gaarka ah, ma jiro roughing multi-axis, ma jiro doorashada otomaatiga ah ee leexinta si looga fogaado isku dhac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaddooyinka 5-tiir iyo kuwa wareega \u003Cstrong\u003Elama socodsiiyo simulasho agabka\u003C/strong\u003E, kaas oo ah khariidad dhererka oo aan qori karin jar leexan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGees-hoosta waxaa lagu hubiyaa dhamaystirka 5-tiir marka loo eego moodeelka dushiisa; holder-ka, spindle-ka iyo mashiinka qudhiisa meel kasta lama hubin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaystirka wareega wuxuu jaraa oo keliya wixii qalabku arki karo oo ka eegaya tiirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhamaystirka 5-tiir wuxuu qaadan karaa daqiiqad ama ka badan si uu u xisaabiyo qaybta weyn: gees-hoosta waa la hubiyaa barta kasta oo marin kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii tiirarka wareega ay la socdaan tiirarka toosan oo TCP lahayn off yahay, post-yada caadiga ah waxay quudinta u qoraan wakhti rogan (\u003Ccode\u003EG93\u003C/code\u003E), kadibna waxay ku noqdaan \u003Ccode\u003EG94\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa qorayo koodka diyaarada shaqada leexan (\u003Ccode\u003EG68.2\u003C/code\u003E iyo kuwa la mid ah), ma garanayo xuduudo gaar mashiin ah, unwinding ama aagag isku dhac.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Wax soo saarka wuxuu qalabka ku hayn karaa xagal, wuxuuna tiirarka wareega ku dhaqaajin karaa intii la jarayo. Saddex waxyaabood ayaa sidaas sameeya, oo ka soo bilaabma kan ugu fudud. Waxan lama wada wareegin mashiin. Waddooyinka waxaa lagu hubiyaa joomatariga tijaabooyinka, G-code-na waa la akhriyaa, laakiin post-yada dhex-ku-jira waxay raacaan koodhadhka dukumintiga ee xakameeyayaasha, ma aha mashiin kasta oo nagu hor jira. Barnaamijka ku caddee simulator-ka xakameeyahaaga iyo hawada ka hor inta aanu taabanin birta. Tiirarka wareega ee mashiinka Tab-ka Dejin, Rotary axes wuxuu sheegaa waxa mashiinku leeyahay: Doorasho Mashiinka Midna (3 tiir) Mill caadi ah. Howlgal kasta oo u baahan in qalabka la leexiyo wuu digayaa, post-ka ma qori doono. A (wareega X-ka agtiisa) Hal tiir wareeg oo X ku dhex jira: miis 4-aad ama indexer. Qalabku wuxuu leexan karaa diyaarada Y–Z oo keliya. B (wareega Y-ka agtiisa) Hal tiir wareeg oo Y ku dhex jira. Qalabku wuxuu leexan karaa diyaarada X–Z oo keliya. A iyo C Tiir leexin oo X ku dhex jira oo ku xambaaysan, ama xambaaysiya, wareeg Z ku dhex jira: miis trunnion, ama madax. B iyo C Isla sida oo leexinta ku dhex jirta Y. Markaas: Ku xambaaysan: The table (the part turns) ama The head (the tool turns). Miiska wuxuu wareegaa jihada ka soo horjeedda si uu usoo keeno isla wejigii qalabka hoosteeda, sidaas darteed calaamada xagal kasta waxay ka timaadaa tan. Kontoroolku wuxuu ilaaliyaa barta qalabka ee waddada (TCP): markuu on yahay, X Y Z ee barnaamijka waa barta qalabka oo ku jirta isku-xidhka qaybta, kontoroolku wuu sameeyaa kuwa kale (post-yada Fanuc-style iyo LinuxCNC ee caadiga ah waxay qoraan G43.4 dhererka qalabka). Markuu off yahay, mashiinka miiska, PartCraft wuxuu qoraa X Y Z sida miiska wareegaya uu qaybta u qaado, oo ku saabsan dhexda wareega aad bixisay (kala-saarka shaqada; 0, 0, 0 markii asalka shaqada uu ku yaal dhexda). Mashiin madax ah wuxuu u baahan yahay TCP on: haddii kale barnaamijku wuxuu u baahan doonaa dherer pivot-ka mashiinka, PartCraft-na ma garto. Xadka leexinta: intee le'eg ayuu tiirka leexinta u socdaa. Mashiinadu way kala duwan yihiin jihada ay ugu tiriyaan inay togan yihiin. Haddii tiir kuu wareego jihada qaldan mashiinkaaga, beddel calaamada nuqul post ah (Post processors you can edit). Qalab leexan oo howl caadi ah Howl kasta oo jarid (face, pocket, adaptive, contour, drill, chamfer, parallel, scallop, 3D rough, rest) waxay leedahay Tool tilt iyo Tilt towards: jihada qalabka howlgaladaas oo keliya, oo la cabbiro tiirka qalabka ee setup-ka. Tani waa 3+2 machining: tiirarka wareega waxay u gudbaan booska oo sii joogaan intii saddex tiir ay jarayaan. Ku qor laba xagal, ama riix Tool square to a face oo guji wejig sinaan ah: qalabku wuxuu si toos ah ugu tilmaamayaa. Dooro wejiyada iyo geesaha howlgalka sida caadiga ah. Waxa loo tiriyo sagxad ama godyo waxa lagu xukumaa iyada oo la eegayo qalabka leexan. Agabka jihadaas waa sanduuqa ku hayaa agabka la wareegay, sidaas darteed dherer iyo masaafooyinku way ammaan yihiin dhinacaas. Koodka G-code-ka, howlgalka ka hor qalabku wuu kor u kacaa, tiirarka wareega ayaa leexdaan, qalabkuna wuxuu hoos ugu imaa barta uu marka hore ku bilaabayo. Miis mashiin ah oo aan TCP lahayn, qoysaska waxay ahaan doonaan qoysas, godinta caadiga ahna waxay ahaan doontaa godinta caadiga ah (frame-ka la qoray wuxuu kaliya ku leexan yahay Z). Markuu TCP yahay diyaarad leexan, qoysaska waxay noqdaan dhaqdhaqaaqyo gaagaaban oo toos ah, wareegyadana dhaqdhaqaaqyada ay matalaan. Simulasho agabka waxay ku shaqeysaa jihada leexan keligeed: wuxuu muujiyaa waxa howlgalkaas ka jarayo agabka oo dhan oo laga arko dhinaceeda, wuxuuna ka helaa godanka halkaas, laakiin jarista laga sameeyay jihooyin kale lama qaado. Dhamaystirka 5-tiir More qalab-sanduuqa Wax soo saarka wuxuu liistaa howlgalkaan iyo kan xiga sare tab-ka Howlgallada. 5-axis waa marinka isbarbar ee dhamaystirka oo leh kubbad bar dhamaad oo leexata markay socoto. Kubbadda waxay jaraa iyadoo adeegsanaysa kubbad, kubbaduna waa isku mid xagaaga oo kasta oo qalabku ku leexdo barta dhexe, sidaas darteed kubbaddu waxay raacaysaa waddada uu marin 3-tiir ah siin lahaa, oo kaliya jihada qalabka ayaa isbedela: Ku wajahan dusha: 1 = toosan dusha, 0 = sare, wax u dhexeeya. Hore u leex: darajooyin dhinaca jarista, si dhexda kubbadda ee taagan aysan u tahay wixii jarista sameeya. Leexinta ugu badan: qalabku waligiis kama leexan doono ka badan tan tiirka setup-ka. Meelaha qolka qalabka ku dhaqan karta moodeelka leexinta waa la jari doonaa ilaa uu nadiifo, howlgaluna wuxuu sheegaa meelaha ay tahay intee le'eg. Marin kasta waxaa lagu soo galaa oo laga baxaa kor u kac toosan. Dhamaystirka wareega (tiirka 4-aad) Rotary waa qaybta lagu hayo work X tiir wareeg. Qaybtu way wareegaysaa, kubbad bar dhamaad ah oo had iyo jeer tiirka u tilmaamaysa ayaa raacaysa dusheeda: Marinnada: Along the axis (xariiqyo X ku dhex jira, hal tallaabo oo leexin oo kala fog) ama Round the part (giraanta, hal tallaabo oo X ah oo kala fog). Tiirka ku yaal Y / Z: meesha tiirku ku yaallo. Madhan waxa uu ka dhigan yahay dhexda agabka. Mashiinka miiska oo aan TCP lahayn, tani waa in ay noqotaa dhexda wareega ee Dejinta; howlgalku wuu digayaa haddii aanu taasi ahayn. Ka / Ilaa X iyo Ka / Ilaa xagal: qaybta dhererka iyo wareegga ee la jarayo. Dhererka kubbadda ka sarreeya tiirka barta kasta waa dhererka saxda ah ee kubbad ku dhacday mesh-ka qaybta, jihada aad ka eegayso. Xaddidaadaha 5-tiir iyo dhamaystirka wareega waxay qaataan kubbad bar dhamaad oo keliya. Ma jiro jarista swarf (dhinaca qalabka ee derbi toosan), ma jiro xariiqyada socodka ee jihooyinka wejiga gaarka ah, ma jiro roughing multi-axis, ma jiro doorashada otomaatiga ah ee leexinta si looga fogaado isku dhac. Waddooyinka 5-tiir iyo kuwa wareega lama socodsiiyo simulasho agabka, kaas oo ah khariidad dhererka oo aan qori karin jar leexan. Gees-hoosta waxaa lagu hubiyaa dhamaystirka 5-tiir marka loo eego moodeelka dushiisa; holder-ka, spindle-ka iyo mashiinka qudhiisa meel kasta lama hubin. Dhamaystirka wareega wuxuu jaraa oo keliya wixii qalabku arki karo oo ka eegaya tiirka. Dhamaystirka 5-tiir wuxuu qaadan karaa daqiiqad ama ka badan si uu u xisaabiyo qaybta weyn: gees-hoosta waa la hubiyaa barta kasta oo marin kasta. Markii tiirarka wareega ay la socdaan tiirarka toosan oo TCP lahayn off yahay, post-yada caadiga ah waxay quudinta u qoraan wakhti rogan (G93), kadibna waxay ku noqdaan G94. Ma qorayo koodka diyaarada shaqada leexan (G68.2 iyo kuwa la mid ah), ma garanayo xuduudo gaar mashiin ah, unwinding ama aagag isku dhac.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"turning","scope":"partcraft","title":"Jaridka kharaadada","summary":"Wejig, ku dhow, dhamaystir, godka, ka jar, dhuunto iyo godin qayb wareegaysa, adigoo ka bilaabaya qaabka qaybtu samayso markii ay wareegayso. Qalabka kharaadada, quudinta halka wareeg kasta, post-yada kharaadada, iyo waxa aan wali la caddeynin.","section":"tasks","order":149,"keywords":["turning","lathe","kharaad","jarid kharaad","wejig","ku dhow","dhamaystir","godka","grooving","ka jar","parting","cut off","dhuunto","threading","g32","g33","g96","xawaaraha dusha joogto ah","css","nose radius","insert","bar","chuck","dhexroor","quudinta halka wareeg kasta","feed per revolution","g71","g76"],"headings":[{"id":"dejinta","text":"Dejinta","level":2},{"id":"howlgallada","text":"Howlgallada","level":2},{"id":"sida-qalabka-loo-ilaaliyo-qaybta","text":"Sida qalabka loo ilaaliyo qaybta","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadaha","text":"Xaddidaadaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWax soo saarka wuxuu leeyahay toddobo howlgal oo kharaad ah. Waxay shaqeeyaan qayb kasta: waxa la jarayo waa \u003Cstrong\u003Eqaabka qaybtu samayso markay wareegayso\u003C/strong\u003E dhexda agabka, sidaas darteed qayb aan wareeg ahayn waa la jarayaa ilaa qaabka wareega ah ee haya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxan lama wada wareegin kharaad.\u003C/strong\u003E Waddooyinka waxaa lagu hubiyaa joomatariga tijaabooyinka; labada post ee kharaadada waxay raacaan koodhadhka dukumintiga xakameeyayaasha. Marka hore barnaamijka ku caddee simulator-ka xakameeyahaaga iyo hawada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EDejin\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETiirka qalabka\u003C/strong\u003E waa tiirka spindle-ka, Z ee kharaadada. Qaybta hore waxay ku taal +Z; chuck-ka ayaa haya dhinaca kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAgabka bilowga\u003C/strong\u003E: dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECylinder\u003C/span\u003E, oo ah bar. Sare-ka ee ka-saaran wuxuu yahay wixii wejig-jarista ka saaro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsalka shaqada\u003C/strong\u003E: dhexda sare ee agabka ama moodeelka ayaa Z0 dhig wejiga hore, taas oo meesha caadiga ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXakameeye\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFanuc-style lathe (.nc)\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinuxCNC lathe (.ngc)\u003C/span\u003E. Post jarista ah wuu diidaa barnaamijka kharaadada wuuna sheegaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXawaaraha ugu badan ee bilaca\u003C/strong\u003E: xadka xawaaraha dusha ee la hayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E qalab-sanduuqa Wax soo saarka wuxuu liistaa toddobada howlgal kharaadada sare tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EHowlgallada\u003C/strong\u003E. Howlgalka ugu horreeya ee aad ku darto wuxuu keenaa qalabkiisa: \u003Cstrong\u003Eturning insert\u003C/strong\u003E (nose radius, insert angle, cutting edge angle) ama \u003Cstrong\u003Egrooving blade\u003C/strong\u003E (ballac, corner radius, sida uu u gaaro). Ka beddel tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka\u003C/strong\u003E. Quudintu waa halka wareeg kasta, xawaarahana waa xawaare dusha oo m/min ah oo kontoroolku hayo intii dhexroorku isbedelo; qalab siiyo rpm gaar ah si aad xawaaraha u hagaajiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"howlgallada\"\u003EHowlgallada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHowlgal\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiga hore ee bar-ka u jara qaybta, hal tallaabo-hoos mar, laga bilaabo dibadda ilaa wax ka dhaadhaca dhexda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERough\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarin dhererka Z ka fogaanta \u003Cstrong\u003Eqoto-dheer jarista\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa qaabka iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eagabka la reebo\u003C/strong\u003E; kadibna hal jeer qaabka dhanka si looga saaro tallaabooyinka. Dooxada u dhexaysa labo xiid waxa lagu galaa plunge ah hal qoto-dheer jarista.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFinish\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal marin qaabka dhanka, oo ah qayb ka mid ah quudinta qalabka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGroove\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu ku riixaa qalabka dhinac-dhinac meel kasta oo uu ka qaadan karo wax ka badan xadka agabka ee weli taagan: godyada uu insert-ka kharaadadu gaari waayay. \u003Cstrong\u003EFrom / To Z\u003C/strong\u003E ayaa yareeya.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPart off\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta ka jaraa dib-u-daba ee dhabarkeeda dambe, ilaa dhexda ka dhaadhacda, oo leh pecks haddii aad dejiso mid.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThread\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhuunto dibadda: dhexroorka weyn, pitch, dherer, tirada marinnada. Qoto-dheer 0 waxa uu ka dhigan yahay 0.6134 × pitch (dhuunto 60°). Marin kasta wuxuu qaadaa isla ballaca chip-ka; marinnada springka waxay ku celinayaan midka dambe.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrill\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodin ku taal khadka dhexe ilaa qoto-dheer, oo leh pecks.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-qalabka-loo-ilaaliyo-qaybta\"\u003ESida qalabka loo ilaaliyo qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInsert-ka waxa loo tixgeliyaa sida uu yahay: wareeggiisa nose, iyo dabadiisa geesta dambe, oo ah xariiq toosan oo xagaagiisu yahay 180° ka yar cutting edge angle iyo insert angle. Qaabkaas waxa laga soo dhigaa qaabka dhibic kasta oo Z ah, jidka waxa uu ku dhamaadaa meesha uu ku nasto. Sidaas darteed:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERadius-ka nose-ka horey buu waddada ugu jiraa.\u003C/strong\u003E Post-yadu ma qoraan \u003Ccode\u003EG41\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EG42\u003C/code\u003E; koordinaatyada waa barta barnaamijka qalabka (geesta laba-geesoodka ah ee ku wareegsan nose-ka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EInsert-ka \u003Cstrong\u003Ema raaci karo derbi ka adkaa geesta dambe\u003C/strong\u003E. Godka ka dambeeya garaad ayaa la iska daayaa, howlgalka dhamaystirka ayaa sheegaya inta uu aanu gaari karin qaybta. Howlgalka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGroove\u003C/span\u003E ayaa qaadaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAgabka waxa lagu raaciyaa Z kadib jar kasta, sidaas darteed roughing ma jaro hawada, grooving wuxuu helaa wixii hadhay, howlgal kasta wuxuu muujiyaa mugga uu ka saaray iyo haddii uu ku jaray qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadaha\"\u003EXaddidaadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJarista dibadda oo keliya\u003C/strong\u003E: ma jiro bar godin, ma jiro godyo gudaha ah ama dhuunto gudaha, ma jiro godyo wejiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal spindle, qaybta lagu hayo −Z. Ma jiro sub-spindle, ma jiro qalab nool, ma jiro C ama Y axis, ma jiro steady rest ama dhaqdhaqaaqyada tailstock.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaddooyinka waa dhaqdhaqaaqyo toosan: qaybaha qalloocan waa xariiqyo gaagaaban oo ku jira tolerance-ka (ma jiro \u003Ccode\u003EG2\u003C/code\u003E/\u003Ccode\u003EG3\u003C/code\u003E), roughing-ka iyo dhuuntada waxa loo qoraa marin marin (ma jiro cycles \u003Ccode\u003EG71\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003EG76\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDhuuntadu waa marino toosan oo leh jiidista toosan ee dhammaadka; dhuuntada ku sii godka fur-ka. Dhuuntada lama muujiyo agabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGodinta dhexda ma beddesho moodeelka agabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHolder-ka, turret-ka iyo chuck-ka lama hubin. Deji \u003Cstrong\u003EStop at Z\u003C/strong\u003E si aad qalabka uga ilaaliso jawiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQuudinta iyo xawaaraha waa qiyaas bilow, sida jarista birta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Wax soo saarka wuxuu leeyahay toddobo howlgal oo kharaad ah. Waxay shaqeeyaan qayb kasta: waxa la jarayo waa qaabka qaybtu samayso markay wareegayso dhexda agabka, sidaas darteed qayb aan wareeg ahayn waa la jarayaa ilaa qaabka wareega ah ee haya. Waxan lama wada wareegin kharaad. Waddooyinka waxaa lagu hubiyaa joomatariga tijaabooyinka; labada post ee kharaadada waxay raacaan koodhadhka dukumintiga xakameeyayaasha. Marka hore barnaamijka ku caddee simulator-ka xakameeyahaaga iyo hawada. Dejinta Tab-ka Dejin: Tiirka qalabka waa tiirka spindle-ka, Z ee kharaadada. Qaybta hore waxay ku taal +Z; chuck-ka ayaa haya dhinaca kale. Agabka bilowga: dooro Cylinder, oo ah bar. Sare-ka ee ka-saaran wuxuu yahay wixii wejig-jarista ka saaro. Asalka shaqada: dhexda sare ee agabka ama moodeelka ayaa Z0 dhig wejiga hore, taas oo meesha caadiga ah. Xakameeye: Fanuc-style lathe (.nc) ama LinuxCNC lathe (.ngc). Post jarista ah wuu diidaa barnaamijka kharaadada wuuna sheegaa. Xawaaraha ugu badan ee bilaca: xadka xawaaraha dusha ee la hayo. More qalab-sanduuqa Wax soo saarka wuxuu liistaa toddobada howlgal kharaadada sare tab-ka Howlgallada. Howlgalka ugu horreeya ee aad ku darto wuxuu keenaa qalabkiisa: turning insert (nose radius, insert angle, cutting edge angle) ama grooving blade (ballac, corner radius, sida uu u gaaro). Ka beddel tab-ka Qalabka. Quudintu waa halka wareeg kasta, xawaarahana waa xawaare dusha oo m/min ah oo kontoroolku hayo intii dhexroorku isbedelo; qalab siiyo rpm gaar ah si aad xawaaraha u hagaajiso. Howlgallada Howlgal Waxa uu sameeyo Face Wejiga hore ee bar-ka u jara qaybta, hal tallaabo-hoos mar, laga bilaabo dibadda ilaa wax ka dhaadhaca dhexda. Rough Marin dhererka Z ka fogaanta qoto-dheer jarista ilaa qaabka iyo agabka la reebo; kadibna hal jeer qaabka dhanka si looga saaro tallaabooyinka. Dooxada u dhexaysa labo xiid waxa lagu galaa plunge ah hal qoto-dheer jarista. Finish Hal marin qaabka dhanka, oo ah qayb ka mid ah quudinta qalabka. Groove Wuxuu ku riixaa qalabka dhinac-dhinac meel kasta oo uu ka qaadan karo wax ka badan xadka agabka ee weli taagan: godyada uu insert-ka kharaadadu gaari waayay. From / To Z ayaa yareeya. Part off Qaybta ka jaraa dib-u-daba ee dhabarkeeda dambe, ilaa dhexda ka dhaadhacda, oo leh pecks haddii aad dejiso mid. Thread Dhuunto dibadda: dhexroorka weyn, pitch, dherer, tirada marinnada. Qoto-dheer 0 waxa uu ka dhigan yahay 0.6134 × pitch (dhuunto 60°). Marin kasta wuxuu qaadaa isla ballaca chip-ka; marinnada springka waxay ku celinayaan midka dambe. Drill Godin ku taal khadka dhexe ilaa qoto-dheer, oo leh pecks. Sida qalabka loo ilaaliyo qaybta Insert-ka waxa loo tixgeliyaa sida uu yahay: wareeggiisa nose, iyo dabadiisa geesta dambe, oo ah xariiq toosan oo xagaagiisu yahay 180° ka yar cutting edge angle iyo insert angle. Qaabkaas waxa laga soo dhigaa qaabka dhibic kasta oo Z ah, jidka waxa uu ku dhamaadaa meesha uu ku nasto. Sidaas darteed: Radius-ka nose-ka horey buu waddada ugu jiraa. Post-yadu ma qoraan G41 ama G42; koordinaatyada waa barta barnaamijka qalabka (geesta laba-geesoodka ah ee ku wareegsan nose-ka). Insert-ka ma raaci karo derbi ka adkaa geesta dambe. Godka ka dambeeya garaad ayaa la iska daayaa, howlgalka dhamaystirka ayaa sheegaya inta uu aanu gaari karin qaybta. Howlgalka Groove ayaa qaadaa. Agabka waxa lagu raaciyaa Z kadib jar kasta, sidaas darteed roughing ma jaro hawada, grooving wuxuu helaa wixii hadhay, howlgal kasta wuxuu muujiyaa mugga uu ka saaray iyo haddii uu ku jaray qaybta. Xaddidaadaha Jarista dibadda oo keliya: ma jiro bar godin, ma jiro godyo gudaha ah ama dhuunto gudaha, ma jiro godyo wejiga. Hal spindle, qaybta lagu hayo −Z. Ma jiro sub-spindle, ma jiro qalab nool, ma jiro C ama Y axis, ma jiro steady rest ama dhaqdhaqaaqyada tailstock. Waddooyinka waa dhaqdhaqaaqyo toosan: qaybaha qalloocan waa xariiqyo gaagaaban oo ku jira tolerance-ka (ma jiro G2/G3), roughing-ka iyo dhuuntada waxa loo qoraa marin marin (ma jiro cycles G71 ama G76). Dhuuntadu waa marino toosan oo leh jiidista toosan ee dhammaadka; dhuuntada ku sii godka fur-ka. Dhuuntada lama muujiyo agabka. Godinta dhexda ma beddesho moodeelka agabka. Holder-ka, turret-ka iyo chuck-ka lama hubin. Deji Stop at Z si aad qalabka uga ilaaliso jawiga. Quudinta iyo xawaaraha waa qiyaas bilow, sida jarista birta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"probing","scope":"partcraft","title":"Baadhis: hel qaybta oo deji kala-saarka shaqada","summary":"Taabo wejig sare, dhinac, god ama boss oo leh probe, oo u ogolow kontoroolka inuu u wareejiyo kala-saarka shaqada meesha qaybtu si dhab ah u taal, ama kaliya cabbir. Waxa kontoroolkasta uu samayn karo, iyo waxa aan wali la caddeynin.","section":"tasks","order":150,"keywords":["probe","probing","touch probe","touch off","work offset","g54","g31","g38.2","skip","datum","find centre","bore","boss","edge","set zero","measure","inspection","g10"],"headings":[{"id":"adeegso","text":"Adeegso","level":2},{"id":"waxa-kontoroolkasta-qoro","text":"Waxa kontoroolkasta qoro","level":2},{"id":"xaddidaadaha","text":"Xaddidaadaha","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProbe\u003C/span\u003E oo ku jira Wax soo saarka wuxuu barnaamijka ku qoraa wareeg baadhis: probe-ku qaybta taabta, kontoroolkuna wuxuu wareejiyaa kala-saarka shaqada (G54) farqiga u dhexeeya meesha dusha laga helay iyo meesha uu moodeelku yiraahdo waa. Howlgallada dambe waxay jari doonaan meesha qaybtu si dhab ah u taal.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxan lama wada wareegin mashiin.\u003C/strong\u003E Dhaqdhaqaaqyada ka hor taabashada waa dhaqdhaqaaqyo caadi ah: probe-ka lama eegin ilaa dhaqdhaqaaqa baadhista laftiisa. Si tartiib ah u socodsii, hawada marka hore, gacantaaguna ha ku taalo feed hold.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"adeegso\"\u003EAdeegso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003ETools\u003C/strong\u003E howlgalka baadhista ee koowaad wuxuu ku daraa \u003Cstrong\u003Etouch probe\u003C/strong\u003E: dhexroorka kubbadda iyo quudinta baadhista (100 mm/min haddii aadan dejin mid).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E qalab-sanduuqa Wax soo saarka, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProbe\u003C/span\u003E, oo guji waxa la taabanayo. Mid kasta oo doorasho ah waa hal wareeg, marka ay tahay dalabka aad guujisay:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDooro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWareegga\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa la dejiyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejig sinaan ah oo u eeg tiirka qalabka sare\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal taabasho oo hoos u socota\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhinac sinaan ah oo toosan X ama Y\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal taabasho oo ku socota wejiga, shay yar oo ka hooseeya sareeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EX ama Y\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGod ama boss oo u socda tiirka qalabka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAfar taabasho (+X, −X, +Y, −Y)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EX iyo Y ee dhexda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENatiijada\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESet the work offset\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure only\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa bilow fogaanshahan\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EKa raadi fogaanshahan dhinaca ka dambeeya\u003C/strong\u003E waa intee le&#039;eg ayuu dhaqdhaqaaqa baadhistu uga bilaabmayo wejigii la filayay, iyo intee le&#039;eg ayuu probe-ku u socon karaa ka dib markii uu ka gudbo, ka hor intaysan kontoroolku dhicin. \u003Cstrong\u003EQoto-dheer\u003C/strong\u003E waa intee le&#039;eg ayuu kubbaddu ka hooseeyaa sareeda godka, boss-ka ama dhinaca wejiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHowlgalka baadhista hore u dhig, ka hor inta aan wax la jarin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-kontoroolkasta-qoro\"\u003EWaxa kontoroolkasta qoro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKontoroolka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETaabasho\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatiijada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFanuc-style\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EG31\u003C/code\u003E, booska lagu hayo \u003Ccode\u003E#101\u003C/code\u003E ilaa \u003Ccode\u003E#104\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDoorsoomayaasha offset-ka (\u003Ccode\u003E#5221\u003C/code\u003E ilaa \u003Ccode\u003E#5223\u003C/code\u003E) waa la wareejiyaa farqiga laga helay − la filayay. Cabbir oo keliya: farqiga waxa lagu hayaa \u003Ccode\u003E#110\u003C/code\u003E (iyo \u003Ccode\u003E#111\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinuxCNC\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EG38.2\u003C/code\u003E, booska lagu hayo halbeegyo magac leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EG10 L2 P1\u003C/code\u003E oo leh offset-ka cusub. Cabbir oo keliya: fariin \u003Ccode\u003E(DEBUG, …)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGRBL\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EG38.2\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal taabasho ayaa tiirka dejisa oo leh \u003Ccode\u003EG10 L20 P1\u003C/code\u003E. GRBL ma leh doorsoomayaal, sidaas darteed \u003Cstrong\u003Ema xisaabin karo dhexda\u003C/strong\u003E: faylku wuxuu sheegaa taas hal faallo ah, wax ma dejiyo.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXisaabta waa tan post-ka, sidaas darteed waad beddeli kartaa: dhacdooyinka ah \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe-move\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eprobe-set\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EPost processors you can edit\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaddidaadaha\"\u003EXaddidaadaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal kala-saar shaqo (G54). Wejiyada toosan tiirarka oo keliya: ma jiro xagal, ma jiro wareeg geeska, ma jiro leexin shaqada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa jiro tool setter, ma jiro ogaanshaha qalabka jabay, ma jiro cabbir cabbirka tolerance-ka, ma jiro warbixin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpindle-ka looma bilaabo probe-ka, coolant-ku wuu damaan yahay; ma jiro wax hubinaya in qalabka spindle-ka ku jira uu yahay probe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESimulasho agabka ma socodsiiso waddada baadhista.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECalibration-ka probe-ka (kubbadda offset, stylus deflection, jihada trigger) waa kan kontoroolka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Probe oo ku jira Wax soo saarka wuxuu barnaamijka ku qoraa wareeg baadhis: probe-ku qaybta taabta, kontoroolkuna wuxuu wareejiyaa kala-saarka shaqada (G54) farqiga u dhexeeya meesha dusha laga helay iyo meesha uu moodeelku yiraahdo waa. Howlgallada dambe waxay jari doonaan meesha qaybtu si dhab ah u taal. Waxan lama wada wareegin mashiin. Dhaqdhaqaaqyada ka hor taabashada waa dhaqdhaqaaqyo caadi ah: probe-ka lama eegin ilaa dhaqdhaqaaqa baadhista laftiisa. Si tartiib ah u socodsii, hawada marka hore, gacantaaguna ha ku taalo feed hold. Adeegso Tab-ka Tools howlgalka baadhista ee koowaad wuxuu ku daraa touch probe: dhexroorka kubbadda iyo quudinta baadhista (100 mm/min haddii aadan dejin mid). Riix More qalab-sanduuqa Wax soo saarka, kadibna Probe, oo guji waxa la taabanayo. Mid kasta oo doorasho ah waa hal wareeg, marka ay tahay dalabka aad guujisay: Dooro Wareegga Waxa la dejiyo Wejig sinaan ah oo u eeg tiirka qalabka sare Hal taabasho oo hoos u socota Z Dhinac sinaan ah oo toosan X ama Y Hal taabasho oo ku socota wejiga, shay yar oo ka hooseeya sareeda X ama Y God ama boss oo u socda tiirka qalabka Afar taabasho (+X, −X, +Y, −Y) X iyo Y ee dhexda Natiijada: Set the work offset ama Measure only. Ka bilow fogaanshahan iyo Ka raadi fogaanshahan dhinaca ka dambeeya waa intee le'eg ayuu dhaqdhaqaaqa baadhistu uga bilaabmayo wejigii la filayay, iyo intee le'eg ayuu probe-ku u socon karaa ka dib markii uu ka gudbo, ka hor intaysan kontoroolku dhicin. Qoto-dheer waa intee le'eg ayuu kubbaddu ka hooseeyaa sareeda godka, boss-ka ama dhinaca wejiga. Howlgalka baadhista hore u dhig, ka hor inta aan wax la jarin. Waxa kontoroolkasta qoro Kontoroolka Taabasho Natiijada Fanuc-style G31, booska lagu hayo #101 ilaa #104 Doorsoomayaasha offset-ka (#5221 ilaa #5223) waa la wareejiyaa farqiga laga helay − la filayay. Cabbir oo keliya: farqiga waxa lagu hayaa #110 (iyo #111). LinuxCNC G38.2, booska lagu hayo halbeegyo magac leh G10 L2 P1 oo leh offset-ka cusub. Cabbir oo keliya: fariin (DEBUG, …). GRBL G38.2 Hal taabasho ayaa tiirka dejisa oo leh G10 L20 P1. GRBL ma leh doorsoomayaal, sidaas darteed ma xisaabin karo dhexda: faylku wuxuu sheegaa taas hal faallo ah, wax ma dejiyo. Xisaabta waa tan post-ka, sidaas darteed waad beddeli kartaa: dhacdooyinka ah probe-move iyo probe-set (Post processors you can edit). Xaddidaadaha Hal kala-saar shaqo (G54). Wejiyada toosan tiirarka oo keliya: ma jiro xagal, ma jiro wareeg geeska, ma jiro leexin shaqada. Ma jiro tool setter, ma jiro ogaanshaha qalabka jabay, ma jiro cabbir cabbirka tolerance-ka, ma jiro warbixin. Spindle-ka looma bilaabo probe-ka, coolant-ku wuu damaan yahay; ma jiro wax hubinaya in qalabka spindle-ka ku jira uu yahay probe. Simulasho agabka ma socodsiiso waddada baadhista. Calibration-ka probe-ka (kubbadda offset, stylus deflection, jihada trigger) waa kan kontoroolka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"save-reopen","scope":"partcraft","title":"Kaydi, dib u fur oo sii wad shaqada","summary":"Kaydi qaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada kombiyuutarkaaga, magacee, dib ugu fur badhanka, furaha ama jiidasho, hay noocyada, oo ka fogow lumitaanka shaqada tab-ka browser-ka.","section":"tasks","order":150,"keywords":["kaydi","fur","dib u fur","soo gali","soo-dejin","noocyo","backup","magac beddel","magaca faylka","shaqo lumay","ka bax goobta","partcraft.json","partcraft-asm.json","qayb cusub"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi-qayb","text":"Kaydi qayb","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-isku-dhis","text":"Kaydi isku-dhis","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-fur","text":"Dib u fur","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-bilow","text":"Dib u bilow","level":2},{"id":"hay-noocyada","text":"Hay noocyada","level":2},{"id":"ha-lumin-shaqada","text":"Ha lumin shaqada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wax ma kaydiyo intaa u dhexeysa booqasho iyo booqasho. Qaybtaadu waxay ku nooshahay tab-ka browser-ka ilaa aad u kaydiso fayl, oo markaas ayay soo noqotaa markaad faylkaas furto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-qayb\"\u003EKaydi qayb\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagaca qaybta sii: guji meel bannaan oo muuqaalka ku jirta si wax aan la dooran, ka dibna ku qor \u003Cstrong\u003EMagaca\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig oo taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Madasha taariikhda waxay isbeddeli doontaa si ay u waafaqdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrowser-ku wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E. Status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Waa la kaydiyay Bracket.partcraft.json (taariikhda oo dhan; dib halkan u fur si aad u sii wadato tafatirka).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii sawir-gacmeed furan tahay, kaydintu marka hore way xirtaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylku wuxuu hayaa sawir-gacmeed kasta, xidhiidh, cabbir iyo sifo kasta, oo ay ku jiraan sifooyinka la joojiyay, booska bar-ka rollback-ka, dejinta xaashiga naqshadda iyo qoraallada GD&amp;T, iyo qoraalka oo dhan ee jidh solid STEP ah oo la soo dejiyay. Liiska ka noqo ma kaydsamo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-isku-dhis\"\u003EKaydi isku-dhis\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhis gudihiisa, isla \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;assembly name&gt;.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E. Qayb kasta ayaa ku jirta gudihiisa: ma u baahnid faylalka qaybaha kala gaarka ah si aad dib ugu furto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad qayb ka tafatirayso gudaha isku-dhis, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu qaybtaas keligeed u kaydiyaa sida \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E. Marka hore dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib\u003C/span\u003E, ka dibna kaydi, si aad isku-dhiska oo dhan u kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-fur\"\u003EDib u fur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMid kasta oo kuwan ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Edooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E ama taabo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ka dibna dooro faylka;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ejiid faylka \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Emaamulaha faylalkaaga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E oo ku dhig muuqaalka 3D (&quot;Ku deji qayb PartCraft si aad u furto&quot; ayaa soo muuqda).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu kala sooca qaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada waxa ku jira, sidaas darteed labaduba isla siyaabo ayay u furmaan. Fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu u furmaa jidh solid la soo dejiyay: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EFur faylka STEP oo ku dhis\u003C/a\u003E. Status bar-ku wuxuu xaqiijiyaa: &quot;Waa la furay Bracket.partcraft.json: 7 sifo.&quot; ama &quot;Waa la furay Hinge.partcraft-asm.json: 3 qayb, 2 isku-xidh.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii qaybta shaashadda ku jirta ay leedahay isbeddello aan la kaydin, PartCraft marka hore wuu weydiiyaa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIska tir isbeddellada\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarka hore kaydi\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXir isku-dhiska (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E) ka hor inta aadan fur fayl qayb. Haddii aad qayb furto isku-dhisku shaashadda yuu ku jiro, qaybtu waxay ku soo dhacaa hoosta isku-dhiska waxaadna arkaysaa kaliya ka dib markaad isku-dhiska xirto. Furitaanka fayl isku-dhis ayaa sidoo kale beddelaya isku-dhis aan la kaydin iyada oo aan weydiin, sidaas darteed marka hore kaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-bilow\"\u003EDib u bilow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu bilaabaa &quot;Part1&quot; madhan. Marka hore wuu weydiiyaa haddii isbeddello aan la kaydin jiraan, wuxuuna xiraa isku-dhis furan (isagoo weydiinaya haddii uu aan la kaydin yahay).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hay-noocyada\"\u003EHay noocyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydin kasta waa soo-dejin cusub, sidaas darteed waxaad noocyada ku hayn kartaa faylalka oo keliya:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar nooc ama taariikh magaca ka hor inta aanad kaydin: &quot;Bracket rev B&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrowser-kaagu wuxuu ku dari karaa &quot; (1)&quot;, &quot; (2)&quot; marka fayl isku magac ah horey u jiro folder-ka soo-dejinta. Kan ugu cusub waa midka lambarkiisu sare yahay, ama hubi taariikhda \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Emaamulaha faylalkaaga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylalka dhammaystiran ka saar folder-ka soo-dejinta oo geli folder-ka mashruucaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EMeesha ay faylashaadu tagaan\u003C/a\u003E si aad u aragto meesha soo-dejinta ku tagto nidaam kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ha-lumin-shaqada\"\u003EHa lumin shaqada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydi ka hor inta aanad xirin tab-ka, dib u rarin, ama inta kombiyuutarka aad sakhman ku tagto. Browser-ku wuxuu weydiin doonaa &quot;Leave site?&quot; haddii aad isku daydo inaad xirto isbeddello aan la kaydin, laakiin jab ama laptop la xiray ma siiso digniin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadaha gaarka ah ama incognito way shaqeeyaan, laakiin wax kale ma kala duwana: faylka weli waa nuqulka keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta daruuraha iyo taariikhda noocyada weli ma diyaar aha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"PartCraft wax ma kaydiyo intaa u dhexeysa booqasho iyo booqasho. Qaybtaadu waxay ku nooshahay tab-ka browser-ka ilaa aad u kaydiso fayl, oo markaas ayay soo noqotaa markaad faylkaas furto. Kaydi qayb Magaca qaybta sii: guji meel bannaan oo muuqaalka ku jirta si wax aan la dooran, ka dibna ku qor Magaca panelka midig oo taabo Enter. Madasha taariikhda waxay isbeddeli doontaa si ay u waafaqdo. Taabo Ctrl+S ama dooro Kaydi. Browser-ku wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cname\u003E.partcraft.json. Status bar-ku wuxuu leeyahay \"Waa la kaydiyay Bracket.partcraft.json (taariikhda oo dhan; dib halkan u fur si aad u sii wadato tafatirka).\" Haddii sawir-gacmeed furan tahay, kaydintu marka hore way xirtaa. Faylku wuxuu hayaa sawir-gacmeed kasta, xidhiidh, cabbir iyo sifo kasta, oo ay ku jiraan sifooyinka la joojiyay, booska bar-ka rollback-ka, dejinta xaashiga naqshadda iyo qoraallada GD&T, iyo qoraalka oo dhan ee jidh solid STEP ah oo la soo dejiyay. Liiska ka noqo ma kaydsamo. Kaydi isku-dhis Isku-dhis gudihiisa, isla Kaydi ama Ctrl+S wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Cassembly name\u003E.partcraft-asm.json. Qayb kasta ayaa ku jirta gudihiisa: ma u baahnid faylalka qaybaha kala gaarka ah si aad dib ugu furto. Markaad qayb ka tafatirayso gudaha isku-dhis, Ctrl+S wuxuu qaybtaas keligeed u kaydiyaa sida .partcraft.json. Marka hore dooro Dib, ka dibna kaydi, si aad isku-dhiska oo dhan u kaydiso. Dib u fur Mid kasta oo kuwan ah: dooro Fur ama taabo Ctrl+O, ka dibna dooro faylka; jiid faylka Finder / File Explorer / maamulaha faylalkaaga oo ku dhig muuqaalka 3D (\"Ku deji qayb PartCraft si aad u furto\" ayaa soo muuqda). PartCraft wuxuu kala sooca qaybaha iyo isku-dhisyada waxa ku jira, sidaas darteed labaduba isla siyaabo ayay u furmaan. Fayl .step ama .stp wuxuu u furmaa jidh solid la soo dejiyay: eeg Fur faylka STEP oo ku dhis. Status bar-ku wuxuu xaqiijiyaa: \"Waa la furay Bracket.partcraft.json: 7 sifo.\" ama \"Waa la furay Hinge.partcraft-asm.json: 3 qayb, 2 isku-xidh.\" Haddii qaybta shaashadda ku jirta ay leedahay isbeddello aan la kaydin, PartCraft marka hore wuu weydiiyaa: Jooji, Iska tir isbeddellada ama Marka hore kaydi. Xir isku-dhiska (Xir) ka hor inta aadan fur fayl qayb. Haddii aad qayb furto isku-dhisku shaashadda yuu ku jiro, qaybtu waxay ku soo dhacaa hoosta isku-dhiska waxaadna arkaysaa kaliya ka dib markaad isku-dhiska xirto. Furitaanka fayl isku-dhis ayaa sidoo kale beddelaya isku-dhis aan la kaydin iyada oo aan weydiin, sidaas darteed marka hore kaydi. Dib u bilow Cusub wuxuu bilaabaa \"Part1\" madhan. Marka hore wuu weydiiyaa haddii isbeddello aan la kaydin jiraan, wuxuuna xiraa isku-dhis furan (isagoo weydiinaya haddii uu aan la kaydin yahay). Hay noocyada Kaydin kasta waa soo-dejin cusub, sidaas darteed waxaad noocyada ku hayn kartaa faylalka oo keliya: Ku dar nooc ama taariikh magaca ka hor inta aanad kaydin: \"Bracket rev B\". Browser-kaagu wuxuu ku dari karaa \" (1)\", \" (2)\" marka fayl isku magac ah horey u jiro folder-ka soo-dejinta. Kan ugu cusub waa midka lambarkiisu sare yahay, ama hubi taariikhda Finder / File Explorer / maamulaha faylalkaaga. Faylalka dhammaystiran ka saar folder-ka soo-dejinta oo geli folder-ka mashruucaaga. Eeg Meesha ay faylashaadu tagaan si aad u aragto meesha soo-dejinta ku tagto nidaam kasta. Ha lumin shaqada Kaydi ka hor inta aanad xirin tab-ka, dib u rarin, ama inta kombiyuutarka aad sakhman ku tagto. Browser-ku wuxuu weydiin doonaa \"Leave site?\" haddii aad isku daydo inaad xirto isbeddello aan la kaydin, laakiin jab ama laptop la xiray ma siiso digniin. Daaqadaha gaarka ah ama incognito way shaqeeyaan, laakiin wax kale ma kala duwana: faylka weli waa nuqulka keliya. Kaydinta daruuraha iyo taariikhda noocyada weli ma diyaar aha.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"engineer-generators","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qaybaha fiisigiska: generators","summary":"Workspace-ka Engineer iyo astaanta Generated body: dooro generator, deji gelinta (socod, cadaad, heer kulayl, agab, printer), oo hel qayb cabbirkeeda laga qaaday qaacidooyinka buugaagta, oo leh xog-xaashideeda, hubinteeda habka soo saarka iyo faylasha loo baahan yahay qalabka falanqaynta. Gelin isku mid had iyo jeer wuxuu bixiyaa qayb isku mid ah.","section":"tasks","order":150,"keywords":["engineer","generator","jidh la sameeyay","fiisigiska","xeerar","isbeddelka kulaylka","manifold","nozzle","lattice","gyroid","xog-xaashi","gelinta","go'aan-qaadasho","gelin isku mid natiijo isku mid","hubinta soo saarka","daabacaadda 3D","powder bed"],"headings":[{"id":"samee-jidh","text":"Samee jidh","level":2},{"id":"beddel","text":"Beddel","level":2},{"id":"xog-xaashida","text":"Xog-xaashida","level":2},{"id":"hubinta","text":"Hubinta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-shubay","text":"Waxa la shubay","level":2},{"id":"xakameynta-dhoofinta","text":"Xakameynta dhoofinta","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGenerator\u003C/strong\u003E waa script wuxuu qaybta ka cabbiraa shuruudahaaga oo dhisaa. Generator-ka isbeddelka kulaylka wuxuu qaadaa kulaylka la wareegayo, labada socod iyo heerkulkooda, cadaadiska iyo agabka; wuxuu xisaabiyaa inta ay weynaan karto cores-ku iyo inta ay dhumuc u leedahay derbigiisa, wuxuu dhisaa, wuxuuna kuu sheegaa tirooyinka uu isticmaalay iyo meesha ay ka yimaadeen. Beddel gelin, qaybtuna way raacaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENatiijadu waa jidh caadi ah oo qaybta ku jira: waxay ku jirtaa liiska astaannada, waa daabacmaa, waa dhoofaa. Generator-ka laftiisa qaybta ayaa lagu hayaa, sidaas darteed faylku wuxuu ku furmaa kombiyuutar kasta oo aan generator-ka lagu rakibin, \u003Cstrong\u003Efuridda qayb ma socodsiiso script\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"samee-jidh\"\u003ESamee jidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro workspace-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngineer\u003C/span\u003E beddelaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro generator liiska ka mid ah (kuwa PartCraft la socda, kadibna kuwa aad ka furtay fayl), kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECusub\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EScript-ka waa socodsiiyaa. Marka uu dhammeeyo, jidhku wuxuu ku jiraa aragtida, panelkuna wuxuu muujinayaa gelintiisa, \u003Cstrong\u003Exog-xaashideeda\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ehubinteeda\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad ka dhigi kartaa Design: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAstaanno\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJidh la sameeyay\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"beddel\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeddel gelin kasta, jidhka mar kale ayaa la sameeyaa wakhti yar kadib markaad joojiso qorista. Panelku wuxuu sheegayaa mid ka mid ah saddex xaalood oo run ah:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECusboonaysiinta\u003C/strong\u003E: jidhku wuxuu la mid yahay script-ka iyo gelintiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGelintu way beddeshay\u003C/strong\u003E: jidhka qaybta ka yimid gelinta hore; hadda ayaa mar kale la sameeynayaa, ama riix \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESocodsii\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWali lama socodsiin\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ESocodkii ugu dambeeyay wuu fashilmay\u003C/strong\u003E: khaladka script-ka ayaa lagu muujiyaa iyada oo ay ku jirto safka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dhammeeyaa socod aad u qaado waqti dheer. Ka noqo wuxuu kuu noqdaa tallaabo mar mar ah: socodku waa hal tallaabo, gelintuna waa hal tallaabo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xog-xaashida\"\u003EXog-xaashida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETiro kasta oo generator-ku xisaabiyey waxa lagu liistaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eunit\u003C/strong\u003E ka dhigan iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Emeesha ay ka timid\u003C/strong\u003E (qaacido buugga caadiga ah, heer, xog-xaashi). Waxba ma jiro oo qarsoon. Xog-xaashidu waa qayb faylka ah, sidaas darteed ayay ku isku mid tahay kombiyuutarka xiga. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/data-out\" data-topic=\"partcraft/data-out\"\u003EData out\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sharraxayaa sida loo kaydiyo JSON ama PDF.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta\"\u003EHubinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGenerator-ku wuxuu hubin karaa qaybtiisa iyada oo loo eegayo habka daabacaadda: darbiyada iyo furaha ka yar waxa habku hayn karo, xabbadaha xoogaa, godad ay qabsan karaan budada ama resin-ka, godad aad u yar oo aan la gelin karin, iyo dul-socod u baahan taageero. Natiijooyinka waxay ku jiraan panelka iyo liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhibaatooyin\u003C/span\u003E (badhanka ⚠), waxaana lagu kaydiyaa qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirooyinka habka waa tirooyin xiga oo ay bixiyaan hage naqshadeed oo guud oo dadweyne ah habka guud (FDM, SLA, SLS, metal powder bed). \u003Cstrong\u003EMa aha\u003C/strong\u003E specification-ka mishiinkaaga: ka beddel tirooyinka dukaankaaga ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan hubinta. Hubintu waxay ku shaqeysaa shabakad voxels ah, sidaas darteed waa saxan tahay ilaa hal voxel dhexdiisa: derab waxaa la sheegaa oo keliya marka ay ka yartahay xadka in ka badan hal voxel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-shubay\"\u003EWaxa la shubay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGenerator\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGyroid block\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBlock gyroid, Schwarz P ama diamond sheet ku buuxsan: shabakadda ugu fudud\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGyroid heat exchanger\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECores-ka isdhaafsiga labada dareere, cabbirka laga qaaday waxqabadka iyo habka effectiveness-NTU, derabkiisa cadaadiska; wuxuu hubin karaa hoos u dhaca cadaadiska iyada oo la sameynayo daraasad socodka hal unug\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDistribution manifold\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadhan iyo laamo, tuubo kasta oo cabbirkeeda laga qaaday socodka uu qaado\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGraded lattice beam\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShabakad derabkeedu kor u kacaa meesha topology optimisation sheegayo in agab loo baahan yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaantood waa qiyaasaad koowaad oo ku salaysan qaacidooyinka buugaagta caadiga ah. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/engineering-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/engineering-library\"\u003EThe engineering library\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu liistaa qaacidooyinka iyo xuduudahooda. Run Simulation, Thermal ama Flow natiijada ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xakameynta-dhoofinta\"\u003EXakameynta dhoofinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGenerator-yada Engineer iyo xog-xaashidoodu waxay leeyihiin ogeysiis ku saabsan xakameynta dhoofinta iyo cunaqabateynta. Akhri \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/engineer-export-notice\" data-topic=\"partcraft/engineer-export-notice\"\u003EEngineer and export controls\u003C/a\u003E; waxaa sidoo kale hoosta xog-xaashi kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMadhan, afaf iyo fittings ee core-ka isdhaafsiga kulaylka: waa core keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalooca heerkulka ee xoogga agabka: agabyadu waxay ku jiraan heerkulka qolka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhasaaraha tee iyo qaybinta socodka ee bixiyeyaasha manifold-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dar generator-yo directory-ga add-on-ka hal riix; furidda fayl waxay ku dartaa mid browser-kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGenerator-yo app kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Generator waa script wuxuu qaybta ka cabbiraa shuruudahaaga oo dhisaa. Generator-ka isbeddelka kulaylka wuxuu qaadaa kulaylka la wareegayo, labada socod iyo heerkulkooda, cadaadiska iyo agabka; wuxuu xisaabiyaa inta ay weynaan karto cores-ku iyo inta ay dhumuc u leedahay derbigiisa, wuxuu dhisaa, wuxuuna kuu sheegaa tirooyinka uu isticmaalay iyo meesha ay ka yimaadeen. Beddel gelin, qaybtuna way raacaysaa. Natiijadu waa jidh caadi ah oo qaybta ku jira: waxay ku jirtaa liiska astaannada, waa daabacmaa, waa dhoofaa. Generator-ka laftiisa qaybta ayaa lagu hayaa, sidaas darteed faylku wuxuu ku furmaa kombiyuutar kasta oo aan generator-ka lagu rakibin, furidda qayb ma socodsiiso script. Samee jidh Dooro workspace-ka Engineer beddelaha. Dooro generator liiska ka mid ah (kuwa PartCraft la socda, kadibna kuwa aad ka furtay fayl), kadibna guji Cusub. Script-ka waa socodsiiyaa. Marka uu dhammeeyo, jidhku wuxuu ku jiraa aragtida, panelkuna wuxuu muujinayaa gelintiisa, xog-xaashideeda iyo hubinteeda. Waxaad ka dhigi kartaa Design: Astaanno › Wax dheeraad ah › Jidh la sameeyay. Beddel Beddel gelin kasta, jidhka mar kale ayaa la sameeyaa wakhti yar kadib markaad joojiso qorista. Panelku wuxuu sheegayaa mid ka mid ah saddex xaalood oo run ah: Cusboonaysiinta: jidhku wuxuu la mid yahay script-ka iyo gelintiisa. Gelintu way beddeshay: jidhka qaybta ka yimid gelinta hore; hadda ayaa mar kale la sameeynayaa, ama riix Socodsii. Wali lama socodsiin ama Socodkii ugu dambeeyay wuu fashilmay: khaladka script-ka ayaa lagu muujiyaa iyada oo ay ku jirto safka. Jooji wuxuu dhammeeyaa socod aad u qaado waqti dheer. Ka noqo wuxuu kuu noqdaa tallaabo mar mar ah: socodku waa hal tallaabo, gelintuna waa hal tallaabo. Xog-xaashida Tiro kasta oo generator-ku xisaabiyey waxa lagu liistaa unit ka dhigan iyo meesha ay ka timid (qaacido buugga caadiga ah, heer, xog-xaashi). Waxba ma jiro oo qarsoon. Xog-xaashidu waa qayb faylka ah, sidaas darteed ayay ku isku mid tahay kombiyuutarka xiga. Data out wuxuu sharraxayaa sida loo kaydiyo JSON ama PDF. Hubinta Generator-ku wuxuu hubin karaa qaybtiisa iyada oo loo eegayo habka daabacaadda: darbiyada iyo furaha ka yar waxa habku hayn karo, xabbadaha xoogaa, godad ay qabsan karaan budada ama resin-ka, godad aad u yar oo aan la gelin karin, iyo dul-socod u baahan taageero. Natiijooyinka waxay ku jiraan panelka iyo liiska Dhibaatooyin (badhanka ⚠), waxaana lagu kaydiyaa qaybta. Tirooyinka habka waa tirooyin xiga oo ay bixiyaan hage naqshadeed oo guud oo dadweyne ah habka guud (FDM, SLA, SLS, metal powder bed). Ma aha specification-ka mishiinkaaga: ka beddel tirooyinka dukaankaaga ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan hubinta. Hubintu waxay ku shaqeysaa shabakad voxels ah, sidaas darteed waa saxan tahay ilaa hal voxel dhexdiisa: derab waxaa la sheegaa oo keliya marka ay ka yartahay xadka in ka badan hal voxel. Waxa la shubay Generator Waxa uu sameeyaa Gyroid block Block gyroid, Schwarz P ama diamond sheet ku buuxsan: shabakadda ugu fudud Gyroid heat exchanger Cores-ka isdhaafsiga labada dareere, cabbirka laga qaaday waxqabadka iyo habka effectiveness-NTU, derabkiisa cadaadiska; wuxuu hubin karaa hoos u dhaca cadaadiska iyada oo la sameynayo daraasad socodka hal unug Distribution manifold Madhan iyo laamo, tuubo kasta oo cabbirkeeda laga qaaday socodka uu qaado Graded lattice beam Shabakad derabkeedu kor u kacaa meesha topology optimisation sheegayo in agab loo baahan yahay Dhammaantood waa qiyaasaad koowaad oo ku salaysan qaacidooyinka buugaagta caadiga ah. The engineering library wuxuu liistaa qaacidooyinka iyo xuduudahooda. Run Simulation, Thermal ama Flow natiijada ka hor intaadan ku tiirsanaan. Xakameynta dhoofinta Generator-yada Engineer iyo xog-xaashidoodu waxay leeyihiin ogeysiis ku saabsan xakameynta dhoofinta iyo cunaqabateynta. Akhri Engineer and export controls; waxaa sidoo kale hoosta xog-xaashi kasta. Weli lama dhisin Madhan, afaf iyo fittings ee core-ka isdhaafsiga kulaylka: waa core keliya. Qalooca heerkulka ee xoogga agabka: agabyadu waxay ku jiraan heerkulka qolka. Khasaaraha tee iyo qaybinta socodka ee bixiyeyaasha manifold-ka. Ku dar generator-yo directory-ga add-on-ka hal riix; furidda fayl waxay ku dartaa mid browser-kan. Generator-yo app kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"write-a-generator","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qor soo saare","summary":"Soo saare waa CraftScript, Lua ama Python qoraal leh dhowr sadar faallo ah oo sheegaya gelinteeda. Sida gelintu foom ugu noqoto, waxa qoraalku ka tagayaa (jidh, xaashi, dhibaatooyin), tusaale yar oo dhammaystiran, iyo sida qoraalkaaga loogu furo soo saare.","section":"tasks","order":151,"keywords":["soo saare","qor","qoraal","craftscript","madal","gelin","@input","@generator","jidh","xaashi","dhibaatooyin","to_body","mfg_check","xaashiga xogta","tusaale","lattice","field"],"headings":[{"id":"madasha","text":"Madasha","level":2},{"id":"waxa-qoraalku-ka-tagayaa","text":"Waxa qoraalku ka tagayaa","level":2},{"id":"tusaale-yar-oo-dhammaystiran","text":"Tusaale yar oo dhammaystiran","level":2},{"id":"fields","text":"Fields","level":2},{"id":"soo-saareskaaga-ka-furo-soo-saare","text":"Soo saareskaaga ka furo soo saare","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESoo saare waa qoraal caadi ah (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003ECraftScript\u003C/a\u003E, Lua ama Python) oo leh dhowr sadar faallo ah oo sare. PartCraft wuxuu akhriyaa faallooyinka wuuna sameeyaa foomka; qoraalkaagu wuxuu akhriyaa gelinta sida doomaha horay loo dejiyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"madasha\"\u003EMadasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu qor sadarrada faallada ah (\u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E CraftScript, \u003Ccode\u003E--\u003C/code\u003E Lua, \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E Python):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E% @generator Dhaliyaha kulaylka\n% @input mdot: kg/s = 0.2 [0.01 .. 10] &quot;Socodka cadceedda&quot;\n% @input kind: = gyroid {gyroid, schwarzp, diamond} &quot;Dusha&quot;\n% @input solid: = true\n% @input note: = &quot;text&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGelinta waa \u003Ccode\u003Emagac: halbeeg = default\u003C/code\u003E, kadibna ikhtiyaar ahaan kala-duwanaansho \u003Ccode\u003E[min .. max]\u003C/code\u003E (tirooyinka ayaa ku jira), liiska doorashooyinka \u003Ccode\u003E{a, b, c}\u003C/code\u003E iyo calaamad xigta ku jirta. Halbeegga waa calaamad keliya foomka u; \u003Cstrong\u003Eqiimaha wuxuu imanayaa halbeegaas\u003C/strong\u003E, sidaas darteed qoraalka oo doonaya SI wuu beddelaa, \u003Ccode\u003Eto_si(value, &#039;kg/s&#039;, &#039;kg/s&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E na wuxuu hubiyaa in halbeeggu ula jeedo waxa aad u malaynayso. Magaca waa xarfo, lambarro iyo underscore; \u003Ccode\u003Ebody\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheet\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eproblems\u003C/code\u003E horeba loo qabsaday.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-qoraalku-ka-tagayaa\"\u003EWaxa qoraalku ka tagayaa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoomaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu yahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebody\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaa lagama maarmaan.\u003C/strong\u003E Jidh mesh dusha ah, badiyaa laga helo \u003Ccode\u003E[body, info] = to_body(field, h)\u003C/code\u003E. Waa la hagaajiyaa oo la hubiyaa marka socodka dhammaado.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esheet\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhtiyaari. Qaab struct ah: field kasta waa tiro ama qoraal, ama struct leh \u003Ccode\u003Evalue\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eunit\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eref\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Enote\u003C/code\u003E. Waxay noqotaa xaashiga xogta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eproblems\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkhtiyaari. Unugga \u003Ccode\u003Eproblems\u003C/code\u003E ee \u003Ccode\u003Emfg_check(field, &#039;sls&#039;, struct(), h)\u003C/code\u003E, ama galkaaga. Waxay u gudbaan hubinta iyo liiska Dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tusaale-yar-oo-dhammaystiran\"\u003ETusaale yar oo dhammaystiran\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E% Kuub godan oo leh derbi.\n% @generator Kuub godan\n% @input side: mm = 12 [4 .. 40] &quot;Dhinac&quot;\n% @input wall: mm = 1.5 [0.5 .. 5] &quot;Derbi&quot;\n% @input h: mm = 0.5 [0.25 .. 2] &quot;Cabbirka voxel&quot;\nf = field_subtract(field_box([0 0 0], [side/2 side/2 side/2]), ...\n                   field_box([0 0 0], [side/2-wall side/2-wall side/2-wall]));\nfb = field_bake(f, h);\n[body, info] = to_body(fb, h);\nchk = mfg_check(fb, &#039;sls&#039;, struct(), h);\nproblems = chk.problems;\nsheet = struct();\nsheet.volume = struct(&#039;value&#039;, info.volume, &#039;unit&#039;, &#039;mm3&#039;, &#039;ref&#039;, &#039;ee mesh-ka&#039;);\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay sameeyaa sanduuq xidhan, hubintuna wuxuu u sheegaa gudaha xidhan inuu khalad yahay habka budada. Ka dhig cabbirka voxel \u003Ccode\u003Eh\u003C/code\u003E ugu badnaan saddex meelood meel derbiga ugu khafiifka ah ee aad rabto: ka hooseeya qiyaastii saddex voxel, derbi kama aamino.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fields\"\u003EFields\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efield_sphere\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_box\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_capsule\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_cylinder\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_torus\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_revolve\u003C/code\u003E (jidh wareeg ah oo ka yimid profile), \u003Ccode\u003Etpms\u003C/code\u003E (dusha gyroid, Schwarz P iyo diamond, oo leh cabbir unug iyo derbi ka beddeli kara qaybta oo dhan), \u003Ccode\u003Elattice\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Elattice_beams\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ealong\u003C/code\u003E (marin wareeg ah oo jid ku dhex socota), isku-darka \u003Ccode\u003Efield_union\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_intersect\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_subtract\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_blend\u003C/code\u003E oo siman, iyo \u003Ccode\u003Efield_offset\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_shell\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_move\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_rotate\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efield_scale\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003Esample(f, points)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu siiyaa masaafada calaamadaysan ee dhibcaha (taban gudaha), \u003Ccode\u003Efield_voxel\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu siiyaa voxels xallinta. \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fields\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fields\"\u003EFields\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu sharraxayaa waxa ay yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXaddidaadyo lagu xusayo: derbi xaashi ah oo ka weyn meel meel unugga ayaa xidha jidadka; astaan ka yar qiyaastii saddex voxel ayaa laga yaabaa inay ku xidhmo; \u003Ccode\u003Ealong\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu isku xirayaa koonniyo wareeg ah, sidaas darteed radius si degdeg ah u beddelan karaa wuxuu ka tagaa dhuumo (isticmaal \u003Ccode\u003Efield_revolve\u003C/code\u003E profile ah).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-saareskaaga-ka-furo-soo-saare\"\u003ESoo saareskaaga ka furo soo saare\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWorkspace-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEngineer\u003C/span\u003E guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro faylka. Qoraal aan lahayn sadar \u003Ccode\u003E@generator\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E@input\u003C/code\u003E waa la diidaa: ma jiro wax la dejin karo. Soo saaraha ayaa lagu hayaa browser-kan (ilaa 20) \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu tirtiraa. Jidh laga bilaabo wuxuu sii haysaa nuqul qoraalka, sidaas darteed qaybtu uma baahna qoraalka asalka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFayl wuxuu sidoo kale haysan karaa dhowr soo saare: JSON bundle \u003Ccode\u003E{&quot;format&quot;: &quot;cadcraft-generators&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: 1, &quot;generators&quot;: [{&quot;title&quot;: &quot;…&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;…&quot;}]}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Soo saare waa qoraal caadi ah (CraftScript, Lua ama Python) oo leh dhowr sadar faallo ah oo sare. PartCraft wuxuu akhriyaa faallooyinka wuuna sameeyaa foomka; qoraalkaagu wuxuu akhriyaa gelinta sida doomaha horay loo dejiyay. Madasha Ku qor sadarrada faallada ah (% CraftScript, -- Lua, # Python): % @generator Dhaliyaha kulaylka % @input mdot: kg/s = 0.2 [0.01 .. 10] \"Socodka cadceedda\" % @input kind: = gyroid {gyroid, schwarzp, diamond} \"Dusha\" % @input solid: = true % @input note: = \"text\" Gelinta waa magac: halbeeg = default, kadibna ikhtiyaar ahaan kala-duwanaansho [min .. max] (tirooyinka ayaa ku jira), liiska doorashooyinka {a, b, c} iyo calaamad xigta ku jirta. Halbeegga waa calaamad keliya foomka u; qiimaha wuxuu imanayaa halbeegaas, sidaas darteed qoraalka oo doonaya SI wuu beddelaa, to_si(value, 'kg/s', 'kg/s') na wuxuu hubiyaa in halbeeggu ula jeedo waxa aad u malaynayso. Magaca waa xarfo, lambarro iyo underscore; body, sheet iyo problems horeba loo qabsaday. Waxa qoraalku ka tagayaa Doomaha Waxa uu yahay body Waa lagama maarmaan. Jidh mesh dusha ah, badiyaa laga helo [body, info] = to_body(field, h). Waa la hagaajiyaa oo la hubiyaa marka socodka dhammaado. sheet Ikhtiyaari. Qaab struct ah: field kasta waa tiro ama qoraal, ama struct leh value, unit, ref iyo note. Waxay noqotaa xaashiga xogta. problems Ikhtiyaari. Unugga problems ee mfg_check(field, 'sls', struct(), h), ama galkaaga. Waxay u gudbaan hubinta iyo liiska Dhibaatooyinka. Tusaale yar oo dhammaystiran % Kuub godan oo leh derbi. % @generator Kuub godan % @input side: mm = 12 [4 .. 40] \"Dhinac\" % @input wall: mm = 1.5 [0.5 .. 5] \"Derbi\" % @input h: mm = 0.5 [0.25 .. 2] \"Cabbirka voxel\" f = field_subtract(field_box([0 0 0], [side/2 side/2 side/2]), ... field_box([0 0 0], [side/2-wall side/2-wall side/2-wall])); fb = field_bake(f, h); [body, info] = to_body(fb, h); chk = mfg_check(fb, 'sls', struct(), h); problems = chk.problems; sheet = struct(); sheet.volume = struct('value', info.volume, 'unit', 'mm3', 'ref', 'ee mesh-ka'); Waxay sameeyaa sanduuq xidhan, hubintuna wuxuu u sheegaa gudaha xidhan inuu khalad yahay habka budada. Ka dhig cabbirka voxel h ugu badnaan saddex meelood meel derbiga ugu khafiifka ah ee aad rabto: ka hooseeya qiyaastii saddex voxel, derbi kama aamino. Fields field_sphere, field_box, field_capsule, field_cylinder, field_torus, field_revolve (jidh wareeg ah oo ka yimid profile), tpms (dusha gyroid, Schwarz P iyo diamond, oo leh cabbir unug iyo derbi ka beddeli kara qaybta oo dhan), lattice iyo lattice_beams, along (marin wareeg ah oo jid ku dhex socota), isku-darka field_union, field_intersect, field_subtract, field_blend oo siman, iyo field_offset, field_shell, field_move, field_rotate, field_scale. sample(f, points) wuxuu siiyaa masaafada calaamadaysan ee dhibcaha (taban gudaha), field_voxel wuxuu siiyaa voxels xallinta. Fields wuxuu sharraxayaa waxa ay yihiin. Xaddidaadyo lagu xusayo: derbi xaashi ah oo ka weyn meel meel unugga ayaa xidha jidadka; astaan ka yar qiyaastii saddex voxel ayaa laga yaabaa inay ku xidhmo; along wuxuu isku xirayaa koonniyo wareeg ah, sidaas darteed radius si degdeg ah u beddelan karaa wuxuu ka tagaa dhuumo (isticmaal field_revolve profile ah). Soo saareskaaga ka furo soo saare Workspace-ka Engineer guji Open oo dooro faylka. Qoraal aan lahayn sadar @generator ama @input waa la diidaa: ma jiro wax la dejin karo. Soo saaraha ayaa lagu hayaa browser-kan (ilaa 20) Remove wuxuu tirtiraa. Jidh laga bilaabo wuxuu sii haysaa nuqul qoraalka, sidaas darteed qaybtu uma baahna qoraalka asalka ah. Fayl wuxuu sidoo kale haysan karaa dhowr soo saare: JSON bundle {\"format\": \"cadcraft-generators\", \"version\": 1, \"generators\": [{\"title\": \"…\", \"text\": \"…\"}]}.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"engineering-library","scope":"partcraft","title":"Maktabadda injineernimada","summary":"Qaacidooyinka buugaagta caadiga ah ee loo akhrin karo sida script-yo, unitiyada SI, natiija kasta leh isha ay ka timid: socodka biibaha iyo kanaalka, kulaylka iyo isdhaafsiga kulaylka, qaybaha cadaadiska, gaaska, sifooyinka biyaha iyo hawada, agabka, iyo unitiyo la hubiyo. Waa maxay ay wax u tahay iyo halka ay ku dhammaato.","section":"tasks","order":152,"keywords":["injineernimada","maktabadda","unitiyada","Darcy-Weisbach","Colebrook","Reynolds","friction factor","Dittus-Boelter","Gnielinski","NTU","effectiveness","LMTD","fin","Barlow","Lame","nozzle","isentropic","Mach","choked flow","biyaha","hawada","sifooyinka","agabka","ilaha"],"headings":[{"id":"unitiyo-la-hubiyo","text":"Unitiyo la hubiyo","level":2},{"id":"sifooyinka","text":"Sifooyinka","level":2},{"id":"socodka-biibaha-iyo-kanaalada","text":"Socodka biibaha iyo kanaalada","level":2},{"id":"kulaylka-isgaadhsiinta","text":"Kulaylka isgaadhsiinta","level":2},{"id":"qaybaha-cadaadiska","text":"Qaybaha cadaadiska","level":2},{"id":"dynamics-ka-gaaska","text":"Dynamics-ka gaaska","level":2},{"id":"hubi-natiijada","text":"Hubi natiijada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMaktabadda injineernimada waa dhowr script oo ku jira maktabadda workspace-ka Script (\u003Ccode\u003Ecraftlib/eng\u003C/code\u003E). Mid kasta waa function aad ka akhrin karto laga bilaabo sare ilaa hoose, oo leh madax ku bixiya \u003Cstrong\u003Ehabkiisa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Eunitiyadiisa\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Exuduudahooda\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003Etixraacyadooda\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ehubin\u003C/strong\u003E leh tiro shaqeysan. Dhammaan waxay isticmaalaan unitiyada SI, waxayna soo celiyaan tirooyin leh \u003Cstrong\u003Eunit\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Eisha\u003C/strong\u003E, sidaas darteed xog-xaashi wuu daabici karaa meesha lambar kasta ka timid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"unitiyo-la-hubiyo\"\u003EUnitiyo la hubiyo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eto_si(10, &#039;bar&#039;, &#039;Pa&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu beddelaa qiimaha wuxuuna diidaa unit uu wax kale cabbiro (dherer halka cadaadis la filayo). \u003Ccode\u003Efrom_si\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eunit_convert(1, &#039;bar&#039;, &#039;psi&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eunit_kind(&#039;W/(m K)&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E (&quot;thermal conductivity&quot;) waxay isku mid u shaqeeyaan. \u003Ccode\u003Etemp_k(25, &#039;C&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Etemp_from_k\u003C/code\u003E waxay beddelaan heerkulka, kaas oo leh kala-geddisi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sifooyinka\"\u003ESifooyinka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efluid(&#039;water&#039;, T)\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Efluid(&#039;air&#039;, T, p)\u003C/code\u003E: cufnaanta, viscosity, conductivity, specific heat, Prandtl number. Biyaha 0 ilaa 100 °C, hawada 250 ilaa 600 K; wixii ka baxsan way joogsataa halkii ay dheeri ka sameyn lahayd.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ematerial(&#039;ss304&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E: Young&#039;s modulus, Poisson&#039;s ratio, cufnaanta, yield, conductivity, specific heat, expansion: qiyamka heerka qolka oo ka yimid xog-xaashiyada isku mid ah ee Simulation. Naqshad dhab ah waxay isticmaashaa tirooyinka la xaqiijiyay ee bixiyaha. Heerkulka qalooca lama dhisin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"socodka-biibaha-iyo-kanaalada\"\u003ESocodka biibaha iyo kanaalada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ereynolds\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehydraulic_diameter\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efriction_factor\u003C/code\u003E (laminar, kadibna Colebrook equation ee socodka turbulent; kala-duwanaanta 2300 ilaa 4000 ma leh qaacido la isku halayn karo oo waa sheegtaa), \u003Ccode\u003Edarcy_weisbach\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eminor_loss\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epipe_flow\u003C/code\u003E (biib wareegsan, wax kasta mar keliya) iyo \u003Ccode\u003Erect_channel\u003C/code\u003E (duct-yada rectangular-ka laminar oo ku salaysan Shah iyo London fit).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kulaylka-isgaadhsiinta\"\u003EKulaylka isgaadhsiinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enusselt_dittus_boelter\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enusselt_gnielinski\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enusselt_tube\u003C/code\u003E (wuxuu doortaa laminar ama turbulent oo magacaabaa correlation-ka), \u003Ccode\u003Ehtc\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efin_efficiency\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elmtd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eeffectiveness\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Entu_for\u003C/code\u003E (xidhiidhka effectiveness-NTU ee counterflow, parallel, shell-and-tube, crossflow iyo hal socod oo isbeddelaya) iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ehx_size\u003C/code\u003E (cabbirka UA ee uu u baahan yahay shaqada; wuxuu sheegaa inta suurtagal tahay marka shaqada aan la gaadhi karin).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaybaha-cadaadiska\"\u003EQaybaha cadaadiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eallowable_stress\u003C/code\u003E (yield oo loo qaybiyay safety factor), \u003Ccode\u003Ewall_thin_cylinder\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ebarlow\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ewall_thick_cylinder\u003C/code\u003E (Lamé, oo ku saabsan hoop ama shear criterion) iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ewall_sphere\u003C/code\u003E. Kuwani waa xadka buugaagta caadiga ah, \u003Cstrong\u003Ema aha xisaab koodka savaa-cadaadiska\u003C/strong\u003E: ma jiro xad daxal oo lagu daro, joint efficiency, ama factors-ka koodka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dynamics-ka-gaaska\"\u003EDynamics-ka gaaska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eisentropic\u003C/code\u003E (saamiyada lambarka Mach), \u003Ccode\u003Emach_from_area\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Echoked_flow\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ethroat_area\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Eexit_mach\u003C/code\u003E, gaas kaamil ah oo aan lahayn cadaymo, kulayl ama shock.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubi-natiijada\"\u003EHubi natiijada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Echeck_stress\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Echeck_thermal\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Echeck_flow\u003C/code\u003E waxay socodsiiyaan xalliyayaasha PartCraft ee xoogga, kuleylka iyo socodka qaybta la dhisay script-ka, kadibna waxay soo akhrisaa xoogga ugu badan iyo barashada, heerkulada iyo socodka kulaylka, iyo waxtarka shabakad biibaha. Ma beddelaan xalliyayaasha. Hubinta xoogga iyo heerkulka waxay isticmaalaan voxels, sidaas darteed dusha wareegsan waa jajabyo, xoogga geeska gudaha ee fiiqan ama hoos u dhigga barta gaar ahi wuxuu ku xidhan yahay cabbirka voxel-ka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Maktabadda injineernimada waa dhowr script oo ku jira maktabadda workspace-ka Script (craftlib/eng). Mid kasta waa function aad ka akhrin karto laga bilaabo sare ilaa hoose, oo leh madax ku bixiya habkiisa, unitiyadiisa, xuduudahooda, tixraacyadooda iyo hubin leh tiro shaqeysan. Dhammaan waxay isticmaalaan unitiyada SI, waxayna soo celiyaan tirooyin leh unit iyo isha, sidaas darteed xog-xaashi wuu daabici karaa meesha lambar kasta ka timid. Unitiyo la hubiyo to_si(10, 'bar', 'Pa') wuxuu beddelaa qiimaha wuxuuna diidaa unit uu wax kale cabbiro (dherer halka cadaadis la filayo). from_si, unit_convert(1, 'bar', 'psi') iyo unit_kind('W/(m K)') (\"thermal conductivity\") waxay isku mid u shaqeeyaan. temp_k(25, 'C') iyo temp_from_k waxay beddelaan heerkulka, kaas oo leh kala-geddisi. Sifooyinka fluid('water', T) iyo fluid('air', T, p): cufnaanta, viscosity, conductivity, specific heat, Prandtl number. Biyaha 0 ilaa 100 °C, hawada 250 ilaa 600 K; wixii ka baxsan way joogsataa halkii ay dheeri ka sameyn lahayd. material('ss304'): Young's modulus, Poisson's ratio, cufnaanta, yield, conductivity, specific heat, expansion: qiyamka heerka qolka oo ka yimid xog-xaashiyada isku mid ah ee Simulation. Naqshad dhab ah waxay isticmaashaa tirooyinka la xaqiijiyay ee bixiyaha. Heerkulka qalooca lama dhisin. Socodka biibaha iyo kanaalada reynolds, hydraulic_diameter, friction_factor (laminar, kadibna Colebrook equation ee socodka turbulent; kala-duwanaanta 2300 ilaa 4000 ma leh qaacido la isku halayn karo oo waa sheegtaa), darcy_weisbach, minor_loss, pipe_flow (biib wareegsan, wax kasta mar keliya) iyo rect_channel (duct-yada rectangular-ka laminar oo ku salaysan Shah iyo London fit). Kulaylka isgaadhsiinta nusselt_dittus_boelter, nusselt_gnielinski, nusselt_tube (wuxuu doortaa laminar ama turbulent oo magacaabaa correlation-ka), htc, fin_efficiency, lmtd, effectiveness iyo ntu_for (xidhiidhka effectiveness-NTU ee counterflow, parallel, shell-and-tube, crossflow iyo hal socod oo isbeddelaya) iyo hx_size (cabbirka UA ee uu u baahan yahay shaqada; wuxuu sheegaa inta suurtagal tahay marka shaqada aan la gaadhi karin). Qaybaha cadaadiska allowable_stress (yield oo loo qaybiyay safety factor), wall_thin_cylinder, barlow, wall_thick_cylinder (Lamé, oo ku saabsan hoop ama shear criterion) iyo wall_sphere. Kuwani waa xadka buugaagta caadiga ah, ma aha xisaab koodka savaa-cadaadiska: ma jiro xad daxal oo lagu daro, joint efficiency, ama factors-ka koodka. Dynamics-ka gaaska isentropic (saamiyada lambarka Mach), mach_from_area, choked_flow, throat_area iyo exit_mach, gaas kaamil ah oo aan lahayn cadaymo, kulayl ama shock. Hubi natiijada check_stress, check_thermal iyo check_flow waxay socodsiiyaan xalliyayaasha PartCraft ee xoogga, kuleylka iyo socodka qaybta la dhisay script-ka, kadibna waxay soo akhrisaa xoogga ugu badan iyo barashada, heerkulada iyo socodka kulaylka, iyo waxtarka shabakad biibaha. Ma beddelaan xalliyayaasha. Hubinta xoogga iyo heerkulka waxay isticmaalaan voxels, sidaas darteed dusha wareegsan waa jajabyo, xoogga geeska gudaha ee fiiqan ama hoos u dhigga barta gaar ahi wuxuu ku xidhan yahay cabbirka voxel-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"data-out","scope":"partcraft","title":"Soo-saarka xogta: xaashida xogta, fields iyo meshes","summary":"Kaydi xaashida xogta jidh la sameeyay sida JSON ama PDF, field-kiisa sida sawir VTK (.vti) ama OpenVDB level set (.vdb), dusha sida VTK mesh (.vtu) ParaView iyo qalabka falanqaynta kale, iyo mesh-ka sida 3MF oo ku jira xogta generator-ka. Qaybta isku mid ah had iyo jeer wuxuu bixiyaa faylal isku mid ah.","section":"tasks","order":153,"keywords":["soo dhoofin (export)","xaashida xogta","json","pdf","vti","vtu","vtk","paraview","3mf","field","masaafada calaamadaysan (signed distance)","fea","cfd","metadata","openvdb"],"headings":[{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EGoobta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInjineer\u003C/span\u003E, ama properties-ka jidh la sameeyay, fur \u003Cstrong\u003ESoo-saarka xogta\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhanka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaylka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa loo isticmaalo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashida xogta (JSON)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaan gelinta, tiro kasta oo unitkeeda iyo isheeda, hubinta, fingerprint-ka mesh-ka. La kala soociyay, ma leh waqtiyo: qaybta isku mid ahi wuxuu bixiyaa fayl isku mid ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashida xogta (PDF)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla waxaas warqad ahaan, oo ku faafa boqollo bog haddii ay u baahato.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EField (.vti)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.vti\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta sida masaafada calaamadaysan (taban gudaha) iyo maaska gudaha ee grid-ka barta: fayl sawir VTK ah oo ParaView iyo qalabka ku saleysan VTK. Waxa laga dhisaa dusha jidhka ee voxel size-ka gelinta generator-ka, sidaas darteed wuxuu qaadaa wakhti yar; jidh ka weyn 400 000 triangles waa wax weyn bogga: ku keydi field-ka script-ka (\u003Ccode\u003Efield_bake\u003C/code\u003E) halkii.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELevel set (.vdb)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.vdb\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EField isku mid ah sida OpenVDB level set: geed firfircoon oo kaliya kaydiya xadka khafiifka ah ee voxels-ka ku wareegsan dusha, loogu talagalay qalabka akhrin kara OpenVDB (renderers, simulation iyo barnaamijyada 3D). Voxel size iyo units waa kuwa generator-ka (millimeters), xadka khafiifka waa qaybta firfircoon, gudaha waa taban. Waxa laga dhisaa dusha sida \u003Ccode\u003E.vti\u003C/code\u003E, oo leh isla xadka 400 000 triangles; fayl ka weyn 1.5 GB waa la diidaa (isticmaal voxel size weyn). Faylku waa OpenVDB format 224, aan la cadaynin marka laga reebo qaabeynta qiimaha firfircoon ee OpenVDB, sidaas darteed akhriste OpenVDB kasta ayaa furi kara.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESurface (.vtu)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.vtu\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETriangles-ka, oo leh area iyo normal kasta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3MF oo leh xogta generator-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMesh-ka millimeters-ka slicer-ka, oo leh generator-ka, inputs-keeda iyo (graded lattice ahaan) wall range-keeda sida metadata faylka dhexdiisa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxba ka mid ah faylashan ma ka imanayo saacadda ama kombiyuutarka, sidaas darteed waad isbarbardhigi kartaa laba fayl byte-ka byte: byte isbeddelay macnaheedu waa qayb isbeddeshay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.vti\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E.vdb\u003C/code\u003E ee field-ka voxel size aan ahayn kan generator-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAkhrinta faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.vdb\u003C/code\u003E (waxa la dhisay oo keliya qorista).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Goobta Injineer, ama properties-ka jidh la sameeyay, fur Soo-saarka xogta: Badhanka Faylka Waxa loo isticmaalo Xaashida xogta (JSON) .json Dhammaan gelinta, tiro kasta oo unitkeeda iyo isheeda, hubinta, fingerprint-ka mesh-ka. La kala soociyay, ma leh waqtiyo: qaybta isku mid ahi wuxuu bixiyaa fayl isku mid ah. Xaashida xogta (PDF) .pdf Isla waxaas warqad ahaan, oo ku faafa boqollo bog haddii ay u baahato. Field (.vti) .vti Qaybta sida masaafada calaamadaysan (taban gudaha) iyo maaska gudaha ee grid-ka barta: fayl sawir VTK ah oo ParaView iyo qalabka ku saleysan VTK. Waxa laga dhisaa dusha jidhka ee voxel size-ka gelinta generator-ka, sidaas darteed wuxuu qaadaa wakhti yar; jidh ka weyn 400 000 triangles waa wax weyn bogga: ku keydi field-ka script-ka (field_bake) halkii. Level set (.vdb) .vdb Field isku mid ah sida OpenVDB level set: geed firfircoon oo kaliya kaydiya xadka khafiifka ah ee voxels-ka ku wareegsan dusha, loogu talagalay qalabka akhrin kara OpenVDB (renderers, simulation iyo barnaamijyada 3D). Voxel size iyo units waa kuwa generator-ka (millimeters), xadka khafiifka waa qaybta firfircoon, gudaha waa taban. Waxa laga dhisaa dusha sida .vti, oo leh isla xadka 400 000 triangles; fayl ka weyn 1.5 GB waa la diidaa (isticmaal voxel size weyn). Faylku waa OpenVDB format 224, aan la cadaynin marka laga reebo qaabeynta qiimaha firfircoon ee OpenVDB, sidaas darteed akhriste OpenVDB kasta ayaa furi kara. Surface (.vtu) .vtu Triangles-ka, oo leh area iyo normal kasta. 3MF oo leh xogta generator-ka .3mf Mesh-ka millimeters-ka slicer-ka, oo leh generator-ka, inputs-keeda iyo (graded lattice ahaan) wall range-keeda sida metadata faylka dhexdiisa. Waxba ka mid ah faylashan ma ka imanayo saacadda ama kombiyuutarka, sidaas darteed waad isbarbardhigi kartaa laba fayl byte-ka byte: byte isbeddelay macnaheedu waa qayb isbeddeshay. Weli lama dhisin .vti ama .vdb ee field-ka voxel size aan ahayn kan generator-ka. Akhrinta faylasha .vdb (waxa la dhisay oo keliya qorista).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"run-from-usb","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ku shaqee USB-ga","summary":"Waxa ay qalabka injineernimada qorto iyo meesha ay ku qortaan, si CadCraft Studio uga shaqayn karto usb ama fool kasta oo aan rakibid lahayn iyo aan xuquuqda maamulaha lahayn: dejinta, soo-saareyaasha, kaydka meel-dhowr iyo faylalka qaybaha, iyo waxa ku sii jira usb-ga.","section":"tasks","order":154,"keywords":["usb","qaab-qaado","aan rakibid lahayn","maamule","admin","dejinta","gal xogta","soo-saareyaasha","meesha faylalka lagu qoro","khadka ka baxsan","sirta","gelitaanka kombiyuutarka"],"headings":[{"id":"zip-ka-qaabka-qaadashada-ee-windows-iyo-linux","text":"Zip-ka qaabka qaadashada ee Windows iyo Linux","level":2},{"id":"gelitaanka-kombiyuutarka","text":"Gelitaanka kombiyuutarka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQalabka injineernimada (soo-saareyaasha, maktabadda injineernimada, hubinta iyo faylalka xogta) \u003Cstrong\u003Ema u baahna xuquuq maamule\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Erakibid\u003C/strong\u003E. Waxay qoraan oo keliya waxa halkan lagu sheegay, midna ma kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeesha lagu hayo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybahaaga, oo leh jidhadooda la soo saaray, xogta xaashiyada iyo hubinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka qaybta aad kaydiso (\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E), meesha aad ku kaydiso.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo-saareyaasha aad ka furtay faylal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydka barnaamijka laftiisa: kaydka local ee browser-ka bogga shabakadda, iyo gal \u003Ccode\u003Edata\u003C/code\u003E oo barnaamijka ku dhow ee Studio-ga la qaadi karo. Ugu badnaan 20.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDejinta (cabbirrada voxel-ka aad dejisay, tirada threads-ka xalinta, qaabeynta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla kaydka barnaamijka.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashiyada xogta, goobaha, meshes\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya meesha aad kaydiso: soo-dejinta waxay tagtaa meesha aad doorato.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabyadu \u003Cstrong\u003Ema sameeyaan wicitaan shabakad oo gaar ah\u003C/strong\u003E: soo-saareyaasha la socdaalo waa faylal ku jira folder-ka barnaamijka, maktabadda iyo hubinta waxay ku shaqeeyaan kombiyuutarkaaga gudaha worker aan shabakada garayn karin, xogta injineernimada (sifooyinka biyaha iyo hawada, agabka) waxay ku jirtaa barnaamijka. Soo-saare aad ka furto fayl ayaa lagu akhriyaa kombiyuutarkaaga oo ma baxo meel kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zip-ka-qaabka-qaadashada-ee-windows-iyo-linux\"\u003EZip-ka qaabka qaadashada ee Windows iyo Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStudio-ga qaabka qaadashada ee Windows wuxuu dejinta, kaydka meel-dhowr iyo add-ons-ka ku hayaa folder \u003Ccode\u003Edata\u003C/code\u003E oo barnaamijka ku dhow. Linux AppImage-ka wuxuu hayaa isla meeshaas marka fayl la yiraahdo \u003Ccode\u003Eportable\u003C/code\u003E uu ku dhow yahay; haddii faylkaas aanu jirin, wuxuu isticmaalaa gal-guriyeedka. Mac-ga ma jiro qaab qaadasho: nidaamku ma oggolaado in app la soo dejiyay uu ku qoro meeshiisa. Qoraallada qaabka qaadashada ee qolofka (kaalmada \u003Ccode\u003EStudio\u003C/code\u003E) waxay liistaan waxa barnaamijku qoro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gelitaanka-kombiyuutarka\"\u003EGelitaanka kombiyuutarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHalkan waxba ma weydiinayo gelitaan kombiyuutarka. Daabacayaasha, mashiinnada serial-ka iyo qalabka USB waa kuwo kala duwan: way weydiiyaan marka shaqadu ubaahdo, mar kasta qalab kasta, mana taabtaan soo-saareyaasha ama hubinta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qalabka injineernimada (soo-saareyaasha, maktabadda injineernimada, hubinta iyo faylalka xogta) ma u baahna xuquuq maamule iyo rakibid. Waxay qoraan oo keliya waxa halkan lagu sheegay, midna ma kale. Waxa Meesha lagu hayo Qaybahaaga, oo leh jidhadooda la soo saaray, xogta xaashiyada iyo hubinta Faylka qaybta aad kaydiso (.partcraft.json), meesha aad ku kaydiso. Soo-saareyaasha aad ka furtay faylal Kaydka barnaamijka laftiisa: kaydka local ee browser-ka bogga shabakadda, iyo gal data oo barnaamijka ku dhow ee Studio-ga la qaadi karo. Ugu badnaan 20. Dejinta (cabbirrada voxel-ka aad dejisay, tirada threads-ka xalinta, qaabeynta) Isla kaydka barnaamijka. Xaashiyada xogta, goobaha, meshes Kaliya meesha aad kaydiso: soo-dejinta waxay tagtaa meesha aad doorato. Qalabyadu ma sameeyaan wicitaan shabakad oo gaar ah: soo-saareyaasha la socdaalo waa faylal ku jira folder-ka barnaamijka, maktabadda iyo hubinta waxay ku shaqeeyaan kombiyuutarkaaga gudaha worker aan shabakada garayn karin, xogta injineernimada (sifooyinka biyaha iyo hawada, agabka) waxay ku jirtaa barnaamijka. Soo-saare aad ka furto fayl ayaa lagu akhriyaa kombiyuutarkaaga oo ma baxo meel kale. Zip-ka qaabka qaadashada ee Windows iyo Linux Studio-ga qaabka qaadashada ee Windows wuxuu dejinta, kaydka meel-dhowr iyo add-ons-ka ku hayaa folder data oo barnaamijka ku dhow. Linux AppImage-ka wuxuu hayaa isla meeshaas marka fayl la yiraahdo portable uu ku dhow yahay; haddii faylkaas aanu jirin, wuxuu isticmaalaa gal-guriyeedka. Mac-ga ma jiro qaab qaadasho: nidaamku ma oggolaado in app la soo dejiyay uu ku qoro meeshiisa. Qoraallada qaabka qaadashada ee qolofka (kaalmada Studio) waxay liistaan waxa barnaamijku qoro. Gelitaanka kombiyuutarka Halkan waxba ma weydiinayo gelitaan kombiyuutarka. Daabacayaasha, mashiinnada serial-ka iyo qalabka USB waa kuwo kala duwan: way weydiiyaan marka shaqadu ubaahdo, mar kasta qalab kasta, mana taabtaan soo-saareyaasha ama hubinta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"engineer-export-notice","scope":"partcraft","title":"Xakameynta dhoofinta iyo Engineer","summary":"Ogeysiiska xakameynta dhoofinta ee la socda Engineer: waxaa lagu muujiyaa halkan, hoosta xog-xaashida kasta iyo dhinaca generator-yada ee sida loo qaado.","section":"tasks","order":155,"keywords":["engineer","xakameynta dhoofinta","xakameynta","cunaqabateynta","ogeysiis","xog-xaashi","nozzle","generator"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXakameynta dhoofinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Engineer iyo generator-yadiisu waa qalab naqshadeed oo guud ah oo laga sameeyay injineernimada buugaagta caadiga ah ee la daabacay. Ma aynu sheegi karno in generator, naqshad, xog-xaashi ama fayl la dhoofiyay uu ka xor yahay xakameynta dhoofinta ama cunaqabateynta, ama in la dhoofin karo, dib loo dhoofin karo, la wareejin karo ama loo isticmaali karo waddan kasta ama qof kasta si sharci ah. Waxaad mas&#039;uul tahay in aad kala saarto waxa aad naqshadeysid iyo in aad raacdo sharciyada xakameynta dhoofinta iyo cunaqabateynta ee kugu khuseeya. Tan waa ogeysiis aasaasi ah: waxaan filaynaa inaan beddelno xakamayntan si ay ula jaanqaadato xeerarka xakameynta dhoofinta ee dalka asalka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsla erayadaas ayaa ku qoran hoosta xog-xaashi kasta (panelka, PDF-ka iyo faylka JSON) iyo dhinaca generator kasta oo giraanta u qaada, sida nozzle.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEngineer ma aha app gaar ah: waa qayb la wadaago oo ah app kasta oo CadCraft ah oo ku rakibta, ogeysiiskuna waa isku mid kasta. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/engineer-generators\" data-topic=\"partcraft/engineer-generators\"\u003EParts from physics: generators\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Xakameynta dhoofinta. Engineer iyo generator-yadiisu waa qalab naqshadeed oo guud ah oo laga sameeyay injineernimada buugaagta caadiga ah ee la daabacay. Ma aynu sheegi karno in generator, naqshad, xog-xaashi ama fayl la dhoofiyay uu ka xor yahay xakameynta dhoofinta ama cunaqabateynta, ama in la dhoofin karo, dib loo dhoofin karo, la wareejin karo ama loo isticmaali karo waddan kasta ama qof kasta si sharci ah. Waxaad mas'uul tahay in aad kala saarto waxa aad naqshadeysid iyo in aad raacdo sharciyada xakameynta dhoofinta iyo cunaqabateynta ee kugu khuseeya. Tan waa ogeysiis aasaasi ah: waxaan filaynaa inaan beddelno xakamayntan si ay ula jaanqaadato xeerarka xakameynta dhoofinta ee dalka asalka ah. Isla erayadaas ayaa ku qoran hoosta xog-xaashi kasta (panelka, PDF-ka iyo faylka JSON) iyo dhinaca generator kasta oo giraanta u qaada, sida nozzle. Engineer ma aha app gaar ah: waa qayb la wadaago oo ah app kasta oo CadCraft ah oo ku rakibta, ogeysiiskuna waa isku mid kasta. Eeg Parts from physics: generators.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"illustrate","scope":"partcraft","title":"Bilaw buug Illustrate-ka","summary":"Workspace-ka Illustrate wuxuu naqshadaha ka dhigaa buugag: muuqaalo, xarriiq-fan kala firdhisan oo leh baloonyo iyo liis qaybaha, tilmaamo tallaabo-tallaabo ah, dhaqdhaqaaq iyo fayl 3D oo macmiil CAD la'aan furi karo. Buugga waa fayl gaar ah oo laftiisa.","section":"tasks","order":160,"keywords":["illustrate","buug","sawirka farsamada","dukumeenti","kala firdhisan","liiska qaybaha","tilmaamaha","partcraft-manual"],"headings":[{"id":"bilow-mid","text":"Bilow mid","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-iyo-fur","text":"Kaydi iyo fur","level":2},{"id":"wali-lama-dhisin","text":"Wali lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIllustrate\u003C/strong\u003E waa workspace-ka dukumeentiyada loo baahan yahay naqshadda ku wareegsan: muuqaalo kala firdhisan oo leh baloonyo iyo liis qaybaha, sawirro xarriiq-fan ah oo buugaagta loogu talagalay, tilmaamo tallaabo-tallaabo ah, dhaqdhaqaaq, iyo fayl 3D oo macmiilku furi karo iyada oo aan CAD lahayn. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIllustrate\u003C/span\u003E gudaha beddelka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E ee bilowga toolbar-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBuugga\u003C/strong\u003E waa fayl gaar ah (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.partcraft-manual.json\u003C/code\u003E). Wuxuu hayaa nuqul qaabka qayb kasta, geedka alaabta iyo sifooyinka qaybaha, iyo xidhiidh dib ugu celinaya meesha ay ka yimaadeen, si aad buugga uga shaqayn karto intii naqshaddu sii socoto. Marka naqshaddu isbedesho, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-update\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-update\"\u003ECusboonaysii buugga naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E ayaa isbeddelada soo geliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilow-mid\"\u003EBilow mid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E gudaha kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EManual\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom the open part\u003C/span\u003E: qaybta furan ee Naqshadda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom the open assembly\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu soo bixiyaa halkii uu muuqan lahaa marka isku-dhis furan yahay; qaybahiisa, meelahooda, lambarrada qaybaha, agabka iyo muuqaalada kala firdhisan ayaa la soo qaadaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom an assembly file…\u003C/span\u003E: fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E oo la kaydiyay; PartCraft marka hore qaybahiisa ayuu dhisaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom another file…\u003C/span\u003E: glTF (.glb, .gltf), OBJ, STL ama 3MF. Geedka faylka iyo magacyada ayaa la hayaa, nuqullada hal qayb (isla qaabka oo laba jeer la dhigay) waxay noqdaan hal qayb oo tiro leh. Faylasha STL iyo OBJ ma sheegaan unitkooda, sidaas darteed waa la weydiin doonaa. Faylasha STL waxa lagu akhriyaa Z sare; glTF iyo 3MF waxay sheegaan kuwooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInta buugga furan yahay, Illustrate wuxuu muujiyaa nuqulka buugga laftiisa ee qaybaha; qaybta ama isku-dhiska furan ee Naqshadda waa la qariyaa ilaa aad ku noqoto Naqshadda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-iyo-fur\"\u003EKaydi iyo fur\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E gudaha kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EManual\u003C/span\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu kaydiyaa buugga; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa mid. Isbeddel kasta oo Illustrate ah waa hal tallaabo oo taariikhda buugga laftiisa: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E waxay saameeyaan buugga inta Illustrate uu furan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylasha STEP ma furmaan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom another file…\u003C/span\u003E wali. Fur STEP-ka Naqshadda (wuxuu u yimaadaa sida jidh adag; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EFur fayl STEP\u003C/a\u003E), kadibna bilow buugga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom the open part\u003C/span\u003E, ama u kaydi glTF, 3MF, OBJ ama STL.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EModelCraft iyo BimCraft weli ma geyn karaan moodeel toos ah Illustrate: u kaydi glTF (.glb) oo isticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom another file…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiga: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-views\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-views\"\u003EMuuqaalada iyo qaabka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Illustrate waa workspace-ka dukumeentiyada loo baahan yahay naqshadda ku wareegsan: muuqaalo kala firdhisan oo leh baloonyo iyo liis qaybaha, sawirro xarriiq-fan ah oo buugaagta loogu talagalay, tilmaamo tallaabo-tallaabo ah, dhaqdhaqaaq, iyo fayl 3D oo macmiilku furi karo iyada oo aan CAD lahayn. Dooro Illustrate gudaha beddelka Workspace ee bilowga toolbar-ka. Buugga waa fayl gaar ah (\u003Cname\u003E.partcraft-manual.json). Wuxuu hayaa nuqul qaabka qayb kasta, geedka alaabta iyo sifooyinka qaybaha, iyo xidhiidh dib ugu celinaya meesha ay ka yimaadeen, si aad buugga uga shaqayn karto intii naqshaddu sii socoto. Marka naqshaddu isbedesho, Cusboonaysii buugga naqshadda ayaa isbeddelada soo geliya. Bilow mid Guji New gudaha kooxda Manual, kadibna: From the open part: qaybta furan ee Naqshadda. From the open assembly: wuxuu soo bixiyaa halkii uu muuqan lahaa marka isku-dhis furan yahay; qaybahiisa, meelahooda, lambarrada qaybaha, agabka iyo muuqaalada kala firdhisan ayaa la soo qaadaa. From an assembly file…: fayl .partcraft-asm.json oo la kaydiyay; PartCraft marka hore qaybahiisa ayuu dhisaa. From another file…: glTF (.glb, .gltf), OBJ, STL ama 3MF. Geedka faylka iyo magacyada ayaa la hayaa, nuqullada hal qayb (isla qaabka oo laba jeer la dhigay) waxay noqdaan hal qayb oo tiro leh. Faylasha STL iyo OBJ ma sheegaan unitkooda, sidaas darteed waa la weydiin doonaa. Faylasha STL waxa lagu akhriyaa Z sare; glTF iyo 3MF waxay sheegaan kuwooda. Inta buugga furan yahay, Illustrate wuxuu muujiyaa nuqulka buugga laftiisa ee qaybaha; qaybta ama isku-dhiska furan ee Naqshadda waa la qariyaa ilaa aad ku noqoto Naqshadda. Kaydi iyo fur Save gudaha kooxda Manual (ama Ctrl+S) wuxuu kaydiyaa buugga; Open wuxuu furaa mid. Isbeddel kasta oo Illustrate ah waa hal tallaabo oo taariikhda buugga laftiisa: Undo iyo Redo waxay saameeyaan buugga inta Illustrate uu furan yahay. Wali lama dhisin Faylasha STEP ma furmaan From another file… wali. Fur STEP-ka Naqshadda (wuxuu u yimaadaa sida jidh adag; eeg Fur fayl STEP), kadibna bilow buugga From the open part, ama u kaydi glTF, 3MF, OBJ ama STL. ModelCraft iyo BimCraft weli ma geyn karaan moodeel toos ah Illustrate: u kaydi glTF (.glb) oo isticmaal From another file…. Xiga: Muuqaalada iyo qaabka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"illustrate-views","scope":"partcraft","title":"Muuqaalada, qaabka, goynta iyo indha-weyneeyaha","summary":"Buugga waxa uu haystaa liis tiro-ah oo muuqaalo ah. Muuqaal kasta wuxuu kaydiyaa kaamarada, xaaladda kala firdhisan, iyo qayb kasta haddii la muujiyo, la shabeeg-ayo, caddaynta iyo midabkeeda, iyo sidoo kale qaabka, goynta sanduuqa ama qaybta, iyo indha-weyneeyaha.","section":"tasks","order":161,"keywords":["illustrate","muuqaal","kaamara","qari","shabeeg","kala saar","caddayn","midab","goyn","goynta sanduuqa","indha-weyneeye","x-ray","qaabka xarriiq-fanka"],"headings":[{"id":"muuqaalka-iyo-muuqaalladiisa","text":"Muuqaalka iyo muuqaalladiisa","level":2},{"id":"qaabka","text":"Qaabka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-iyo-muuqaalladiisa\"\u003EMuuqaalka iyo muuqaalladiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa aad aragto waa \u003Cstrong\u003Emuuqaalka hadda\u003C/strong\u003E. Moodeelka rogo sida Naqshadda, kadibna beddel sida qaybaha u muuqdaan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji qayb si aad u doorato; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji wuxuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa mid. Safafka geedka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EParts\u003C/span\u003E waxay doortaan sidoo kale (safka koox wuxuu doortaa wax kasta oo gudihiisa ku jira). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect same part\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa nuqul kasta oo qaybtaas ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGhost\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"G\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EG\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: dhalaalaya iyo midab cawsle) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsolate\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E: kuwan oo kaliya) waxay saameeyaan xulashada; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wax kasta soo celinayaa. Panel-ku wuxuu dejiyaa caddaynta iyo midabka qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExploded view\u003C/span\u003E gudaha panel-ka wuxuu doortaa mid ka mid ah muuqaalada kala firdhisan ee naqshadda, iyo inta uu u socdo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd view\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka hadda sida muuqaal cusub oo leh sawir yar. Guji muuqaal ku jira liiska \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E si aad ugu soo noqoto; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdate view\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka hadda muuqaalka aad ugu noqotay. Muuqaalada waa la magacdaraan karaa (laba jeer guji), sare iyo hoos ayaa loo dhaqaajin karaa, waa la koobiyeyn karaa, waana la tirtiri karaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabka\"\u003EQaabka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELook\u003C/span\u003E waxay dejinaysaa muuqaalka hadda, sidaas darteed muuqaal kasta oo aad kaydiso:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStyle\u003C/span\u003E: iftiin-hoosaysan, iftiin-hoosaysan oo leh xuduudo, midab sinaan ah, xarriiq-fan keliya, ama x-ray.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection plane\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu goyn-ayaa hal dhinac oo ka soo jeeda X, Y ama Z; wejiyada goynta waa la buuxiyaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep the other side\u003C/span\u003E wuu rogaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBox cut-away\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu ka gooyaa geeska moodeelka si uu dhex u muujiyo. Muuqaalka 3D wejiyada goynta waxay ahaadaan kuwo furan; xarriiq-fanka (Export) waa la xariiqeeyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMagnifier\u003C/span\u003E: muraayad wareeg ah oo muujisa faahfaahin weyn, ama gudaha oo leh geesaha oo dhan. Muraayadda jiid si aad u dhaqaajiso; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAim the lens\u003C/span\u003E oo guji barta ay u eegi lahayd.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuuqaalka tooska ah had iyo jeer wuxuu muujiyaa kaamarada si toosan (orthographic). Muuqaal waxaa wali lagu kaydin karaa sida perspective; sawirradiisa iyo xarriiq-fankiisa ayaa isticmaala.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Muuqaalka iyo muuqaalladiisa Waxa aad aragto waa muuqaalka hadda. Moodeelka rogo sida Naqshadda, kadibna beddel sida qaybaha u muuqdaan: Guji qayb si aad u doorato; Shift+guji wuxuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa mid. Safafka geedka Parts waxay doortaan sidoo kale (safka koox wuxuu doortaa wax kasta oo gudihiisa ku jira). Select same part wuxuu ku daraa nuqul kasta oo qaybtaas ah. Hide (H), Ghost (G: dhalaalaya iyo midab cawsle) iyo Isolate (I: kuwan oo kaliya) waxay saameeyaan xulashada; Show all wuxuu wax kasta soo celinayaa. Panel-ku wuxuu dejiyaa caddaynta iyo midabka qaybta. Exploded view gudaha panel-ka wuxuu doortaa mid ka mid ah muuqaalada kala firdhisan ee naqshadda, iyo inta uu u socdo. Add view wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka hadda sida muuqaal cusub oo leh sawir yar. Guji muuqaal ku jira liiska Views si aad ugu soo noqoto; Update view wuxuu kaydiyaa muuqaalka hadda muuqaalka aad ugu noqotay. Muuqaalada waa la magacdaraan karaa (laba jeer guji), sare iyo hoos ayaa loo dhaqaajin karaa, waa la koobiyeyn karaa, waana la tirtiri karaa. Qaabka Qaybta Look waxay dejinaysaa muuqaalka hadda, sidaas darteed muuqaal kasta oo aad kaydiso: Style: iftiin-hoosaysan, iftiin-hoosaysan oo leh xuduudo, midab sinaan ah, xarriiq-fan keliya, ama x-ray. Section plane: wuxuu goyn-ayaa hal dhinac oo ka soo jeeda X, Y ama Z; wejiyada goynta waa la buuxiyaa. Keep the other side wuu rogaa. Box cut-away: wuxuu ka gooyaa geeska moodeelka si uu dhex u muujiyo. Muuqaalka 3D wejiyada goynta waxay ahaadaan kuwo furan; xarriiq-fanka (Export) waa la xariiqeeyaa. Magnifier: muraayad wareeg ah oo muujisa faahfaahin weyn, ama gudaha oo leh geesaha oo dhan. Muraayadda jiid si aad u dhaqaajiso; Aim the lens oo guji barta ay u eegi lahayd. Muuqaalka tooska ah had iyo jeer wuxuu muujiyaa kaamarada si toosan (orthographic). Muuqaal waxaa wali lagu kaydin karaa sida perspective; sawirradiisa iyo xarriiq-fankiisa ayaa isticmaala.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"illustrate-annotations","scope":"partcraft","title":"Faallooyin ku xiran","summary":"Calaamado, callout-yo, fallaadho, cabbirro, qaababka iyo sawirro. Faallooyinka qaybta waxaa lagu xidhaa barta qaybta, waxayna la socdaan qaybta markay kala firdhto; qoraalkooda waxa ka buuxin kara lambarka qaybta, magaca, agabka iyo tirada.","section":"tasks","order":162,"keywords":["illustrate","faallo","calaamad","label","callout","leader","fallaadh","fallaadhka wareegga","cabbir","dimension","radius","xagal","qaab","sawir","goobo"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDooro qalab qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnnotate\u003C/span\u003E ee panelka, kadibna dhagsii:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELabel\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003Ecallout\u003C/strong\u003E: dhagsii barta qaybta. Qoraalku wuxuu ku yaalaa dhinacaa, leader ayaa u gaadha barta; jiid qoraalka si aad u dhigto meeshii. Qoraalkiisa waxaa lagu tafatiraa panelka, wuxuuna isticmaali karaa goobo: \u003Ccode\u003E{number}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{name}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{material}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{description}\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E{qty}\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E{item}\u003C/code\u003E (lambarka balloon-ka) oo qaybta ka buuxmaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFallaadho\u003C/strong\u003E: dhagsii wejiga; fallaadhdu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa meeshaas wuxuuna u tilmaamaa dibadda wejiga. Toos, qalloocan, ama \u003Cstrong\u003Eturn arrow\u003C/strong\u003E oo ku wareegsan normal-ka wejiga (&quot;halkan rogo&quot;). Dherer, qaab iyo jihadooda waxay panelka ku jiraan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbiro\u003C/strong\u003E: masaafo (laba barood), xagal (saddex barood, kan labaad waa geeska), ama radius (saddex barood oo ku yaal geesta wareegsan). Qiimaha waxaa laga qaataa meesha qaybaha lagu isku xidhay, sidaas darteed kala firdhintu ma beddelayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaababka iyo sawirrada\u003C/strong\u003E: rectangle, ellipse, line ama arrow oo lagu xidhay sawirka (laba dhagsi), ama sawir PNG ama JPEG ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaallooyinka qaybta ku xiran waxay la socdaan markay kala firdhiyaan ama markay muuqaalka ku dhaqaaqaan, ma muuqdaan markay qarsoon yihiin. Muuqaal kastaa wuxuu muujinayaa faallooyinka liistigiisa: badhanka indhaha ee panelka wuxuu muujiyaa ama qariyaa mid muuqaalkan; qashinka wuxuu tirtiraa buugga gacmeedka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Dooro qalab qaybta Annotate ee panelka, kadibna dhagsii: Label iyo callout: dhagsii barta qaybta. Qoraalku wuxuu ku yaalaa dhinacaa, leader ayaa u gaadha barta; jiid qoraalka si aad u dhigto meeshii. Qoraalkiisa waxaa lagu tafatiraa panelka, wuxuuna isticmaali karaa goobo: {number}, {name}, {material}, {description}, {qty} iyo {item} (lambarka balloon-ka) oo qaybta ka buuxmaya. Fallaadho: dhagsii wejiga; fallaadhdu wuxuu ka bilaabmaa meeshaas wuxuuna u tilmaamaa dibadda wejiga. Toos, qalloocan, ama turn arrow oo ku wareegsan normal-ka wejiga (\"halkan rogo\"). Dherer, qaab iyo jihadooda waxay panelka ku jiraan. Cabbiro: masaafo (laba barood), xagal (saddex barood, kan labaad waa geeska), ama radius (saddex barood oo ku yaal geesta wareegsan). Qiimaha waxaa laga qaataa meesha qaybaha lagu isku xidhay, sidaas darteed kala firdhintu ma beddelayso. Qaababka iyo sawirrada: rectangle, ellipse, line ama arrow oo lagu xidhay sawirka (laba dhagsi), ama sawir PNG ama JPEG ah. Faallooyinka qaybta ku xiran waxay la socdaan markay kala firdhiyaan ama markay muuqaalka ku dhaqaaqaan, ma muuqdaan markay qarsoon yihiin. Muuqaal kastaa wuxuu muujinayaa faallooyinka liistigiisa: badhanka indhaha ee panelka wuxuu muujiyaa ama qariyaa mid muuqaalkan; qashinka wuxuu tirtiraa buugga gacmeedka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"illustrate-parts-list","scope":"partcraft","title":"Liiska qaybaha iyo baloonyada","summary":"Lambarrada baloonada mar keliya ayaa la siiyaa mana loo isticmaalo mar kale. Hal riix ku baloon ka dhig qayb kasta oo muuqaal muujiyo, ku muuji liiska qaybaha muuqaal qaybahiisa ku xiran, dooro tiirarkiisa, oo u kaydi sida CSV.","section":"tasks","order":163,"keywords":["illustrate","bom","liiska agabka","liiska qaybaha","baloon","lambarka walxaha","tiro","csv","miis"],"headings":[{"id":"baloonyada","text":"Baloonyada","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-gudihiisa-iyo-csv-ahaan","text":"Muuqaalka gudihiisa, iyo CSV ahaan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EQaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EParts list\u003C/span\u003E waxay liisanaysaa qaybaha: hal safka qayb kasta oo leh tirada (nuqullada hal qayb, iyo qaybaha leh isla lambarka qaybta iyo isla qaabka, waa hal safka). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EList\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dooranayaa qaybaha la muujinayo muuqaalkan (aan la qarin, aan shabeeg lahayn) ama dhammaan qaybaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"baloonyada\"\u003EBaloonyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBalloon the shown parts\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu safka kasta siiyaa lambar (mid xor ah oo ku xiga), wuxuuna dhigaa hal baloon nuqulka kuugu dhow, oo ku yaal goobo wareegsan moodeelka. Jiid baloon si aad u guurisid. Lambarku wuxuu sii joogaa qaybtiisa: marka qaybo dambe la daro waxay helaan lambar cusub, lambarka lama siiyo qayb kale, xitaa ka dib markii qaybtaas la saaro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-gudihiisa-iyo-csv-ahaan\"\u003EMuuqaalka gudihiisa, iyo CSV ahaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadee \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the parts list in this view\u003C/span\u003E si miiska loogu dhigo sawirka (jiid geeska si aad u dhigto). Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColumns\u003C/span\u003E (sifooyinka qaybta laftiisa ayaa sidoo kale la bixiyaa) iyo inuu liisanayo qaybaha muuqaalkan ama dhammaan qaybaha. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as CSV\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u qoraa liiska spreadsheet-ka; qoraal u bilowda sida formula-ha waa la qoraa si spreadsheet-ku uusan u fulin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaybta Parts list waxay liisanaysaa qaybaha: hal safka qayb kasta oo leh tirada (nuqullada hal qayb, iyo qaybaha leh isla lambarka qaybta iyo isla qaabka, waa hal safka). List wuxuu dooranayaa qaybaha la muujinayo muuqaalkan (aan la qarin, aan shabeeg lahayn) ama dhammaan qaybaha. Baloonyada Balloon the shown parts wuxuu safka kasta siiyaa lambar (mid xor ah oo ku xiga), wuxuuna dhigaa hal baloon nuqulka kuugu dhow, oo ku yaal goobo wareegsan moodeelka. Jiid baloon si aad u guurisid. Lambarku wuxuu sii joogaa qaybtiisa: marka qaybo dambe la daro waxay helaan lambar cusub, lambarka lama siiyo qayb kale, xitaa ka dib markii qaybtaas la saaro. Muuqaalka gudihiisa, iyo CSV ahaan Calaamadee Show the parts list in this view si miiska loogu dhigo sawirka (jiid geeska si aad u dhigto). Dooro Columns (sifooyinka qaybta laftiisa ayaa sidoo kale la bixiyaa) iyo inuu liisanayo qaybaha muuqaalkan ama dhammaan qaybaha. Save as CSV wuxuu u qoraa liiska spreadsheet-ka; qoraal u bilowda sida formula-ha waa la qoraa si spreadsheet-ku uusan u fulin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"illustrate-line-art","scope":"partcraft","title":"Sawirada farsamada: xarriiq-fan, sawirro iyo xaashiyo","summary":"Muuqaal kasta u dhoofi xarriiq-fan vector ah (SVG ama PDF) oo leh saddex cabbir oo xariiq, xarriiqyada qarsoon oo laga dhigay dashed ama laga tago, wejiyada goynta oo xariiqeysan, iyo midab ikhtiyaari ah; ama PNG. Dhowr muuqaal ku dhig hal xaashi.","section":"tasks","order":164,"keywords":["illustrate","xarriiq-fan","sawir farsamo","svg","pdf","png","xarriiqyada qarsoon","silhouette","hatch","xaashi","dhoofin"],"headings":[{"id":"wali-lama-dhisin","text":"Wali lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E gudaha kooxda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOut\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa wada-hadalka dhoofinta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat\u003C/span\u003E: muuqaalka sida hadda yahay, hal muuqaal, ama dhammaan muuqaalada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAs\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003EPDF\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003ESVG\u003C/strong\u003E (xarriiq-fan vector; labadaba waxa laga sameeyaa isla naqshad), \u003Cstrong\u003EPNG oo xarriiq-fan ah\u003C/strong\u003E, ama \u003Cstrong\u003Esawir PNG oo muuqaalka 3D ah\u003C/strong\u003E (ilaa 4096 pixel ballac), iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate-interactive\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate-interactive\"\u003Efaylka wada-falgalka 3D\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPages\u003C/span\u003E: hal muuqaal bog kasta, ama dhammaan muuqaalada hal xaashi oo magacooda hoosta ku qoran. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E: A4, A3, Letter ama Tabloid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHidden lines\u003C/span\u003E: dashed ama laga tago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFills\u003C/span\u003E: sida muuqaalku u eego, midna, midab sinaan ah ama iftiin-hoosaysan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso draw soft edges\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa xarriiqyada faahfaahinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarriiq-fanku wuxuu leeyahay saddex cabbir: xuduudaha (silhouette-yada iyo geesaha furan, iyo xuduudaha goynta), geesaha adag, iyo xarriiqyada faahfaahinta. Wejiyada goynta ee goynta qeybta ama goynta sanduuqa waa la xariiqeeyaa. Muuqaalada kala firdhisan waxay helaan raad xariiq-silsilad ah oo ka bilaabma meesha qayb kasta ku taal; baloonyada, faallooyinka, liiska qaybaha iyo indha-weyneeyaha ayaa sidoo kale la sawiraa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXarriiq-fanka waxa lagu xisaabiyaa qaabka qaybaha habka mesh-ka (isla kii uu xaashida sawirka PartCraft isticmaalo marka aan kernel-ka saxda ah la isticmaalin), sidaas darteed wejiyada wareegsan waxa lagu sawiraa dhinacyadooda yaryar, sida moodeelku u hayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wali-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWali lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawirada tayada path tracer-ka (renderer-ka ModelCraft) halkan lama bixin; sawirada PNG waa muuqaalka 3D laftiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Export gudaha kooxda Out wuxuu furaa wada-hadalka dhoofinta: What: muuqaalka sida hadda yahay, hal muuqaal, ama dhammaan muuqaalada. As: PDF ama SVG (xarriiq-fan vector; labadaba waxa laga sameeyaa isla naqshad), PNG oo xarriiq-fan ah, ama sawir PNG oo muuqaalka 3D ah (ilaa 4096 pixel ballac), iyo faylka wada-falgalka 3D. Pages: hal muuqaal bog kasta, ama dhammaan muuqaalada hal xaashi oo magacooda hoosta ku qoran. Paper: A4, A3, Letter ama Tabloid. Hidden lines: dashed ama laga tago. Fills: sida muuqaalku u eego, midna, midab sinaan ah ama iftiin-hoosaysan. Also draw soft edges wuxuu ku daraa xarriiqyada faahfaahinta. Xarriiq-fanku wuxuu leeyahay saddex cabbir: xuduudaha (silhouette-yada iyo geesaha furan, iyo xuduudaha goynta), geesaha adag, iyo xarriiqyada faahfaahinta. Wejiyada goynta ee goynta qeybta ama goynta sanduuqa waa la xariiqeeyaa. Muuqaalada kala firdhisan waxay helaan raad xariiq-silsilad ah oo ka bilaabma meesha qayb kasta ku taal; baloonyada, faallooyinka, liiska qaybaha iyo indha-weyneeyaha ayaa sidoo kale la sawiraa. Xarriiq-fanka waxa lagu xisaabiyaa qaabka qaybaha habka mesh-ka (isla kii uu xaashida sawirka PartCraft isticmaalo marka aan kernel-ka saxda ah la isticmaalin), sidaas darteed wejiyada wareegsan waxa lagu sawiraa dhinacyadooda yaryar, sida moodeelku u hayo. Wali lama dhisin Sawirada tayada path tracer-ka (renderer-ka ModelCraft) halkan lama bixin; sawirada PNG waa muuqaalka 3D laftiisa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"illustrate-instructions","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dukumeentiyada tilmaamaha","summary":"Muuqaalada ka dhig tilmaamo tallaabo-tallaabo ah: bog hordhac ah, hal bog tallaabo kasta oo leh sawirkeeda, qaybaha uu muujiyo, xusuusin, digniino iyo qalab, iyo liis qaybaha; waxaa loo kaydiyaa PDF ama hal bog HTML oo si wanaagsan loo daabacayo. Nidaamyadu waa faylal.","section":"tasks","order":165,"keywords":["illustrate","tilmaamaha","tilmaamaha isku-dhisidda","buugga adeegga","tallaabooyin","digniin","qalabka","nidaam","logo","pdf","html"],"headings":[{"id":"nidaamyada","text":"Nidaamyada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInstructions\u003C/span\u003E oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStart instructions from the views\u003C/span\u003E: muuqaal kasta wuxuu noqonayaa tallaabo, iyada oo raacaysa dalabka muuqaalada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETallaabo kasta dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETitle\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPicture\u003C/span\u003E (sida muuqaalku u eego: xarriiq-fan, midab sinaan ah ama iftiin-hoosaysan), iyo inaad rabto in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EList the parts this step shows\u003C/span\u003E ama aan rabin, kadibna qor \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENotes\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWarnings\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E (mid mid sadar kasta). Tallaabooyinka waa la kor u qaadi karaa iyo hoos u dhigi karaa; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd step\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid ku dari karaa muuqaal kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA cover page\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA parts-list page at the end\u003C/span\u003E sida caadiga ah way shidan yihiin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as PDF\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa bogagga; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave as HTML\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa hal bog oo lagu akhrin karo shaashadda, oo mid kasta tallaabo gaar ah ayuu siiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nidaamyada\"\u003ENidaamyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETemplate\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu dejiyaa warqadda, toosinta bogga (dhererka ama ballaaca), logo (PNG ama JPEG), midabka cinwaanka iyo xariiqda hoose ee bogga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave template\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u qoraa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-template.json\u003C/code\u003E si loo isticmaalo buugaag kale oo leh \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse a template…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur qaybta Instructions oo guji Start instructions from the views: muuqaal kasta wuxuu noqonayaa tallaabo, iyada oo raacaysa dalabka muuqaalada. Tallaabo kasta dooro View, Title, Picture (sida muuqaalku u eego: xarriiq-fan, midab sinaan ah ama iftiin-hoosaysan), iyo inaad rabto in List the parts this step shows ama aan rabin, kadibna qor Notes, Warnings iyo Tools (mid mid sadar kasta). Tallaabooyinka waa la kor u qaadi karaa iyo hoos u dhigi karaa; Add step wuxuu mid ku dari karaa muuqaal kasta. A cover page iyo A parts-list page at the end sida caadiga ah way shidan yihiin. Save as PDF wuxuu qoraa bogagga; Save as HTML wuxuu qoraa hal bog oo lagu akhrin karo shaashadda, oo mid kasta tallaabo gaar ah ayuu siiyaa. Nidaamyada Template wuxuu dejiyaa warqadda, toosinta bogga (dhererka ama ballaaca), logo (PNG ama JPEG), midabka cinwaanka iyo xariiqda hoose ee bogga. Save template wuxuu u qoraa fayl .partcraft-template.json si loo isticmaalo buugaag kale oo leh Use a template….","lang":"so"},{"slug":"illustrate-interactive","scope":"partcraft","title":"Faylka 3D ee wada-falgalka ah","summary":"Buugga ku dhoofi hal fayl HTML oo khadka la'aan u furmaa browser kasta, iyada oo aan rakib, akoon ama raad-raac lahayn: moodeelka, muuqaalada, liiska qaybaha (oo labo jihood isku xiran), dhaqdhaqaaqa iyo indha-weyneeyaha.","section":"tasks","order":166,"keywords":["illustrate","wada-falgal","fayl 3d","html","khadka la'aan","muujiye","wadaag","macmiil","dhulka warshadda"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAs\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInteractive 3D file (HTML, opens offline)\u003C/span\u003E, wuxuu kaydiyaa hal fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.html\u003C/code\u003E. U dir email, ku dhig USB ama folder la wadaago: wuxuu ku furmaa browser kasta oo leh WebGL 2, kombuyuutar, tablet ama telefoon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylka gudihiisa:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid si aad moodeelka u wareejiso; jiid midig ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+jiid si aad muuqaalka u guurisid; wheel ama pinch si aad u weynayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji muuqaal liiska ku jira: kaamarada ayaa u guurta, qaybaha waxay qaataan booska, muuqaalka, goynta iyo indha-weyneeyaha muuqaalkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuji safka liiska qaybaha si qaybahiisa u iftiimaan; guji qayb si safkeeda u iftiimaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii buugga leeyahay dhaqdhaqaaq, xariiq ku yaal moodeelka hoostiisa ayaa ciyaarta, joojisa, oo u dhex dhaqaajinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylku wuxuu qaadaa wax kasta oo uu u baahan yahay (moodeelka, muujiyaha iyo three.js, oo ku hoos jira shatiga MIT), wuxuuna diidaa codsi kasta: ma gaari karo internetka, ma leh akoon ama raad-raac.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWada-falgalka 3D ee gudaha PDF lama bixin: browser-yada iyo akhristayaasha PDF badankood ma muujin karaan, akhristaha awoodda leh wuxuu damiyaa sida caadiga ah. Faylka HTML waa jawaabta wada-falgalka.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Export, kadibna As Interactive 3D file (HTML, opens offline), wuxuu kaydiyaa hal fayl .html. U dir email, ku dhig USB ama folder la wadaago: wuxuu ku furmaa browser kasta oo leh WebGL 2, kombuyuutar, tablet ama telefoon. Faylka gudihiisa: Jiid si aad moodeelka u wareejiso; jiid midig ama Shift+jiid si aad muuqaalka u guurisid; wheel ama pinch si aad u weynayso. Guji muuqaal liiska ku jira: kaamarada ayaa u guurta, qaybaha waxay qaataan booska, muuqaalka, goynta iyo indha-weyneeyaha muuqaalkaas. Guji safka liiska qaybaha si qaybahiisa u iftiimaan; guji qayb si safkeeda u iftiimaan. Haddii buugga leeyahay dhaqdhaqaaq, xariiq ku yaal moodeelka hoostiisa ayaa ciyaarta, joojisa, oo u dhex dhaqaajinta. Faylku wuxuu qaadaa wax kasta oo uu u baahan yahay (moodeelka, muujiyaha iyo three.js, oo ku hoos jira shatiga MIT), wuxuuna diidaa codsi kasta: ma gaari karo internetka, ma leh akoon ama raad-raac. Wada-falgalka 3D ee gudaha PDF lama bixin: browser-yada iyo akhristayaasha PDF badankood ma muujin karaan, akhristaha awoodda leh wuxuu damiyaa sida caadiga ah. Faylka HTML waa jawaabta wada-falgalka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"illustrate-animation","scope":"partcraft","title":"Animeeri buug-gacmeedka","summary":"Qaybaha (meel, muuqda ama qarsan, daahsoonaan, midab) iyo kamarada waqti ku fur, tallaabooyinka muuqaalka kala firdhay duub, muuqaalada mid-mid ka dib ciyaar, kadibna halkan ku ciyaar ama fiidiyo kaydi.","section":"tasks","order":167,"keywords":["illustrate","animation","keyframe","timeline","animation kala firdhin","kamara","fiidiyo","webm","mp4","ciyaar"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFur qaybta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAnimation\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey everything\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey the selected parts\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKey the camera\u003C/span\u003E waxay kaydiyaan sida waxyaalaha hadda yihiin waqtiga hadda: meel kasta oo qayb ah, inuu muuqdo ama qarsoon yahay, daahsoonaantiisa iyo midabkiisa, iyo kamarada. Beddel muuqaalka, dhaqaaji slider-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETime\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna mar kale fur: animation-ku wuxuu ka gudbaa furaha hore ilaa furaha xiga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecord the exploded view\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa hal furaha tallaabo kasta oo muuqaalka kala firdhay ee muuqaalka, ilbiriqsi tallaabo kasta, kadib waxa hadda jira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews as camera stops\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ciyaaraa muuqaalada dalbashada: kamaradu waxay u dhaqaaqdaa mid kasta, joogsataa, qaybuna waxay qaataan qaabka muuqaal kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlay\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPause\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoop\u003C/span\u003E waxay ku ciyaaraan muuqaalka; furayaasha qayb kasta iyo kamarada way liiskaan (dhagsii furaha si aad waqtigiisa u gasho). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave video\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa WebM ama MP4 (meel browser-ku ku qori karo) ama sawirrada PNG gudaha ZIP.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAnimation-ku wuxuu ku jiraa qaab la mid ah kan uu isticmaalo goobta Animate ee ModelCraft. Tafatiraha curve-ka iyo clips-ka hadda waa kuwa ModelCraft.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fur qaybta Animation: Key everything, Key the selected parts iyo Key the camera waxay kaydiyaan sida waxyaalaha hadda yihiin waqtiga hadda: meel kasta oo qayb ah, inuu muuqdo ama qarsoon yahay, daahsoonaantiisa iyo midabkiisa, iyo kamarada. Beddel muuqaalka, dhaqaaji slider-ka Time, kadibna mar kale fur: animation-ku wuxuu ka gudbaa furaha hore ilaa furaha xiga. Record the exploded view wuxuu ku daraa hal furaha tallaabo kasta oo muuqaalka kala firdhay ee muuqaalka, ilbiriqsi tallaabo kasta, kadib waxa hadda jira. Views as camera stops wuxuu ciyaaraa muuqaalada dalbashada: kamaradu waxay u dhaqaaqdaa mid kasta, joogsataa, qaybuna waxay qaataan qaabka muuqaal kasta. Play, Pause, Stop iyo Loop waxay ku ciyaaraan muuqaalka; furayaasha qayb kasta iyo kamarada way liiskaan (dhagsii furaha si aad waqtigiisa u gasho). Save video wuxuu qoraa WebM ama MP4 (meel browser-ku ku qori karo) ama sawirrada PNG gudaha ZIP. Animation-ku wuxuu ku jiraa qaab la mid ah kan uu isticmaalo goobta Animate ee ModelCraft. Tafatiraha curve-ka iyo clips-ka hadda waa kuwa ModelCraft.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"illustrate-update","scope":"partcraft","title":"Cusboonaysii buugga naqshadda","summary":"Marka naqshaddu isbedesho, Cusboonaysii wuxuu soo geliyaa qaabab iyo meelo cusub, wuxuuna ilaaliyaa muuqaalada, faallooyinka, lambarrada baloonada iyo furayaasha dhaqdhaqaaqa. Waxa isbedela waad arkaysaa, waxa cusub iyo waxa la saaray ka hor intaan wax la beddelin; waa hal tallaabo oo ka noqosho.","section":"tasks","order":168,"keywords":["illustrate","cusboonaysii","isbedelka naqshadda","nuqul-cusub","isku-waafaqsan","isku-dhis la beddelay","warbixin"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdate from the design…\u003C/span\u003E hoosta magaca buugga, kadibna dooro qaybta furan ama isku-dhiska furan, ama fayl (isla nooca buugga laga sameeyay).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWarbixin ayaa liisanaysa waxa isbedeli doona:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybo la dhaqaajiyay\u003C/strong\u003E, iyo inta ay u dhaqaaqeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaab la beddelay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybo cusub\u003C/strong\u003E: lagu muujinayaa muuqaal kasta, iyadoo aan wali lambar baloon lahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybo la saaray\u003C/strong\u003E, oo leh faallooyinka iyo furayaasha dhaqdhaqaaqa ee u tilmaamayay: iyaguna way baxaan, oo halkan waa la magacaabayaa si aan wax si aan la ogeyn looga tagin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybo magac cusub la siiyay\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdate\u003C/span\u003E si aad u dhaqan geliso. Qaybaha waxa lagu isku xidhaa aqoonsigooda naqshadda, sidaas darteed muuqaalada, faallooyinka, lambarrada baloonada iyo furayaasha way ku sii jiraan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUpdate\u003C/span\u003E waa hal tallaabo: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu buugga sidii hore ugu soo celinayaa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Guji Update from the design… hoosta magaca buugga, kadibna dooro qaybta furan ama isku-dhiska furan, ama fayl (isla nooca buugga laga sameeyay). Warbixin ayaa liisanaysa waxa isbedeli doona: Qaybo la dhaqaajiyay, iyo inta ay u dhaqaaqeen. Qaab la beddelay. Qaybo cusub: lagu muujinayaa muuqaal kasta, iyadoo aan wali lambar baloon lahayn. Qaybo la saaray, oo leh faallooyinka iyo furayaasha dhaqdhaqaaqa ee u tilmaamayay: iyaguna way baxaan, oo halkan waa la magacaabayaa si aan wax si aan la ogeyn looga tagin. Qaybo magac cusub la siiyay. Guji Update si aad u dhaqan geliso. Qaybaha waxa lagu isku xidhaa aqoonsigooda naqshadda, sidaas darteed muuqaalada, faallooyinka, lambarrada baloonada iyo furayaasha way ku sii jiraan. Update waa hal tallaabo: Undo wuxuu buugga sidii hore ugu soo celinayaa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"work-live","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qayb mid ah oo wada samee Live TeamWork","summary":"Waxa ka beddelmaya PartCraft intaad ku jirto fadhi Live TeamWork oo ka timid CadCraft Studio: geedka astaamaha oo keliya, daaqad kasta oo dhisaya isla jidhka, undo-gaaga, iyo ku biirida browser isku shabakad.","section":"tasks","order":199,"keywords":["live","live teamwork","studio live","wada","wada-shaqeyn","fadhi","la wadaag nool","ku biir","geedka astaamaha","taariikhda","dib u dhis","cursor","tilmaame","isku arag","magacyada","midab","xulasho","undo","martiqaade"],"headings":[{"id":"waxa-aad-baran-doontid","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid","level":2},{"id":"dhammaantood-isla-markaa-moodeelaan","text":"Dhammaantood isla markaa moodeelaan","level":2},{"id":"isku-arag","text":"Isku arag","level":2},{"id":"undo-wuxuu-ka-noqdaa-shaqadaada","text":"Undo wuxuu ka noqdaa shaqadaada","level":2},{"id":"ku-biir-browser-ka","text":"Ku biir browser-ka","level":2},{"id":"marka-fadhiga-dhammaado","text":"Marka fadhiga dhammaado","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-baran-doontid\"\u003EWaxa aad baran doontid\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa dhaca qayb intii dad dhowr ah ay wada moodeelayaan isla waqtiga. CadCraft Studio wuxuu bilaabaa oo ku biiraa fadhiga Live TeamWork (La wadaag, Ku biir); bogan wuxuu ku saabsan yahay qaybta laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhammaantood-isla-markaa-moodeelaan\"\u003EDhammaantood isla markaa moodeelaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQof walba wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa isla geedka astaamaha: sawir-gacmeedyo, soo saarka, godad, pattern-no, fillets, halbeegyo. Wax beddelkaaga ayaa isla markiiba muuqda; kuwa kale waxay soo muuqdaan wakhti yar kadib markay sameeyaan. Geedka oo keliya ayaa safra: daaqad kasta ayaa dhisaysa jidhka laftiisa, kernel-ka PartCraft wuxuu dhisaa isla jidhka isla geedkaas daaqad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaba qof oo beddela hal astaan:\u003C/strong\u003E dejin kala duwan (mid qoto dheer, kan kale xaalada dhamaadka) labaduba way hayaan; dejinta isku mid ah waxay u gudubtaa isbeddelka dambe.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir-gacmeedka\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu safraa oo dhan: marka laba qof wax ka beddelaan hal sawir-gacmeed isla waqtiga, wax-beddelka dambe ayaa guuleysta. Ku heshiiya qofka sawir-gacmeed kasta sawira.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAstaan lagu dhisay mid qof kasta markiiba tirtiray\u003C/strong\u003E (soo saar sawir-gacmeed la saaray, god wejiga la saaray) waa la soo celiyaa, khadka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa sababta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDib u habaynta geedka\u003C/strong\u003E waa la hubiyaa: haddii laba qof astaamaha ay jiidaan isla markiiba, dhaqdhaqaaqa labaad waa la soo celiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-arag\"\u003EIsku arag\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQof kasta fadhiga ku jira midab u gaar ah ayuu leeyahay. Waxaad aragtaa tilmaame qof kasta sida fallaadh midabkiisa leh oo magaciisu dhinacdiisa yaal, wejiga uu tilmaameyo. Marka ay astaan ku doortay geedka, magaciisa ayaa ka dambeeya magaciisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETilmaameyaasha, magacyada iyo xulashooyinka waxay u gaar yihiin fadhiga oo keliya: marna faylka lagama kaydiyo mana galaan undo-ga qofna. Waxay u dhaqaaqaan meesha qof kasta joogo, sidaas darteed way siman yihiin xitaa xiriir gaabis ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-wuxuu-ka-noqdaa-shaqadaada\"\u003EUndo wuxuu ka noqdaa shaqadaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu ka noqdaa wax-beddelkaaga ugu dambeeya wuxuuna kuwa kale ka tagaa sidaas oo kale. Marka qof kale isla shay beddelay tan iyo markaas, wax ma ka noqdo dhici mana sheegto qofka khadka xaaladda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-biir-browser-ka\"\u003EKu biir browser-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaaxiib aan Studio lahayn wuxuu iska scan-garayn karaa sawirka hoos code-ka martiqaadaha telefoon, taabletka ama kombiyuutar isku shabakad. PartCraft wuxuu ku furmaa browser-ka, wuxuuna ku buuxmaa qaybta martiqaadaha markii uu martiqaadaha oggolaado oo wuu dhisaa. Xiriirka casuumada wuxuu u oggolaanayaa qof inuu ka biiro shabakad kale: martiqaadaha waxaa loo baahan yahay kursi Team Cloud Plan oo app-ka ah, qof kasta kale wuu ku biiraa bilaash, xiriirkuna wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya intii fadhiga martiqaadaha uu furan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-fadhiga-dhammaado\"\u003EMarka fadhiga dhammaado\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMartiqaadaha kaliya ayaa qaybta kaydiya. Qof kasta kale wuxuu hayaa nuqul aan la kaydin: kaydi haddii aad rabto inaad hayso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsku-dhisyada weli fadhiga lama wadaago: fur qaybta laftiisa si aad wada shaqaysid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Waxa aad baran doontid Waxa dhaca qayb intii dad dhowr ah ay wada moodeelayaan isla waqtiga. CadCraft Studio wuxuu bilaabaa oo ku biiraa fadhiga Live TeamWork (La wadaag, Ku biir); bogan wuxuu ku saabsan yahay qaybta laftiisa. Dhammaantood isla markaa moodeelaan Qof walba wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa isla geedka astaamaha: sawir-gacmeedyo, soo saarka, godad, pattern-no, fillets, halbeegyo. Wax beddelkaaga ayaa isla markiiba muuqda; kuwa kale waxay soo muuqdaan wakhti yar kadib markay sameeyaan. Geedka oo keliya ayaa safra: daaqad kasta ayaa dhisaysa jidhka laftiisa, kernel-ka PartCraft wuxuu dhisaa isla jidhka isla geedkaas daaqad kasta. Laba qof oo beddela hal astaan: dejin kala duwan (mid qoto dheer, kan kale xaalada dhamaadka) labaduba way hayaan; dejinta isku mid ah waxay u gudubtaa isbeddelka dambe. Sawir-gacmeedka wuxuu safraa oo dhan: marka laba qof wax ka beddelaan hal sawir-gacmeed isla waqtiga, wax-beddelka dambe ayaa guuleysta. Ku heshiiya qofka sawir-gacmeed kasta sawira. Astaan lagu dhisay mid qof kasta markiiba tirtiray (soo saar sawir-gacmeed la saaray, god wejiga la saaray) waa la soo celiyaa, khadka xaaladda wuxuu sheegaa sababta. Dib u habaynta geedka waa la hubiyaa: haddii laba qof astaamaha ay jiidaan isla markiiba, dhaqdhaqaaqa labaad waa la soo celiyaa. Isku arag Qof kasta fadhiga ku jira midab u gaar ah ayuu leeyahay. Waxaad aragtaa tilmaame qof kasta sida fallaadh midabkiisa leh oo magaciisu dhinacdiisa yaal, wejiga uu tilmaameyo. Marka ay astaan ku doortay geedka, magaciisa ayaa ka dambeeya magaciisa. Tilmaameyaasha, magacyada iyo xulashooyinka waxay u gaar yihiin fadhiga oo keliya: marna faylka lagama kaydiyo mana galaan undo-ga qofna. Waxay u dhaqaaqaan meesha qof kasta joogo, sidaas darteed way siman yihiin xitaa xiriir gaabis ah. Undo wuxuu ka noqdaa shaqadaada Ctrl+Z wuxuu ka noqdaa wax-beddelkaaga ugu dambeeya wuxuuna kuwa kale ka tagaa sidaas oo kale. Marka qof kale isla shay beddelay tan iyo markaas, wax ma ka noqdo dhici mana sheegto qofka khadka xaaladda. Ku biir browser-ka Saaxiib aan Studio lahayn wuxuu iska scan-garayn karaa sawirka hoos code-ka martiqaadaha telefoon, taabletka ama kombiyuutar isku shabakad. PartCraft wuxuu ku furmaa browser-ka, wuxuuna ku buuxmaa qaybta martiqaadaha markii uu martiqaadaha oggolaado oo wuu dhisaa. Xiriirka casuumada wuxuu u oggolaanayaa qof inuu ka biiro shabakad kale: martiqaadaha waxaa loo baahan yahay kursi Team Cloud Plan oo app-ka ah, qof kasta kale wuu ku biiraa bilaash, xiriirkuna wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya intii fadhiga martiqaadaha uu furan yahay. Marka fadhiga dhammaado Martiqaadaha kaliya ayaa qaybta kaydiya. Qof kasta kale wuxuu hayaa nuqul aan la kaydin: kaydi haddii aad rabto inaad hayso. Isku-dhisyada weli fadhiga lama wadaago: fur qaybta laftiisa si aad wada shaqaysid.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"partcraft","title":"Ka timid qalab parametric oo kale","summary":"Sida caadooyinka qalabyada parametric-ka ee desktop-ka loo qaabeeyo ugu gudbaan PartCraft, iyo kala duwanaanshaha khibradda leh ee ku dhaca saacadda ugu horreysa.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["u wareejin","u guuri","caadi","geedka naqshadda","smart dimension","boss extrude","cut extrude","hole wizard","mates","ogaanshaha isku-dhacyada","rollback bar","property manager","mouse","kala duwanaansho"],"headings":[{"id":"caadooyinka-la-beddelay","text":"Caadooyinka, la beddelay","level":2},{"id":"kala-duwanaansho-dadka-ku-dhaca","text":"Kala duwanaansho dadka ku dhaca","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad qaybaha ku naqshadeyso SolidWorks, inta badan fikradaha PartCraft way kuu caadiyoobi doonaan: sawir-gacmeedyo ku yaal dusha Front, Top iyo Right, xidhiidh iyo cabbirro caqli leh, taariikh astaamo leh oo leh rollback bar, iyo isku-dhisyo lagu meel dhigo mates. Habka aad wax ugu gaadhayo qaarkood way kala duwan yihiin, nooca hadda wax yar ayuu sameeyaa. Bogani wuxuu u beddelayaa caadooyinkaaga wuxuuna liistaa wixii yaabka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caadooyinka-la-beddelay\"\u003ECaadooyinka, la beddelay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad caadi ku tahay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPartCraft-ka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeedka naqshadda bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaariikhda bidix: diyaaradaha, kadibna astaamaha, sawir-gacmeedyada oo hoos ku yaal astaamaha isticmaala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiyaaradaha Front, Top iyo Right\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddexdaas oo kale, asalka marka loo maro. Front waa dusha XY, Top waa XZ, Right waa YZ; Y wuxuu u kacaa sare\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeed dusha ama wejiga, kadibna geesta xaqiijinta si aad uga baxdo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) qayb la doortay ama wejig siman; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa bax\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa ay xirmo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir caqli leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbir\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Guji hal ama laba shay, kadibna meesha tirada ku dhigto. Meesha aad dhigto waxay go&#039;aamisaa tooska, toosan ama isku-xirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXidhiidh ku dar panel-ka hareeraha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro shayada, kadibna badhamada xidhiidhka ee panel-ka midig (Isku-meel, Jiif, Dhinac, Taabasho, Isle iwm.)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXidhiidhyada toos ah inta aad sawirayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESnaps waxay ku daraan xidhiidhyo isku-meel, dhex-kor ah, jiif iyo istaag\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuluug / madow / casaan midabka sawir-gacmeedka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla fikradda: buluug waa aan si buuxda loo qeexin, madow waa si buuxda loo qeexay, casaan waa dhaqso u badan. Chip-ku wuxuu muujinayaa darajooyinka xorta ah ee hadhay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhadka dhexe ee revolve-yada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKhadka dhexe\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu isticmaalaa khadka dhexe ee ugu horreeya ilaa aad dooratid dhidib kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQowsyada sawir-gacmeedka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) sawir-gacmeed: guji geesta, qor radius-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhismaha geometry-ga, beddelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhismaha\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtruded boss\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E: Blind, Mid-plane, Ilaa wejig / kan xiga / vertex, Offset from face, jihada labaad, taper, hal kontuur (Dooro gobollada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtruded cut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoo\u003C/span\u003E: wuxuu bilaabaa Ilaa dhammaan; u beddel Blind si aad u sameyso pocket\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERevolved boss / cut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar wareeg\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiyaarad / dhidib / barta tixraaca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDusha\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhidibka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBar\u003C/span\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/reference-geometry\" data-topic=\"partcraft/reference-geometry\"\u003EDiyaaradaha tixraaca, dhidibyada iyo barta\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss ama cut la qaabeeyey / la wareegiyay, draft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQabyo\u003C/span\u003E wejiyada siman (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\"\u003ESweep, loft iyo draft\u003C/a\u003E). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E nooca hadda lama dhisin (waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHole Wizard\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E barta sawir-gacmeed kasta oo furan: fudud, counterbore, countersink (90° / 82°) ama tapped ISO metric M2–M24, ilaa dhammaan ama blind\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear / circular pattern, mirror\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToosan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareegsan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuraayad\u003C/span\u003E (astaamaha ama jidhka oo dhan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet iyo chamfer geesaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E: guji geeska, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji mid kale, kadibna badhanka. Hal radius; chamfer siman, laba-masaafo ama masaafo-xagal. Nooca hadda waxay shaqeysaa oo keliya geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejig siman, geedaha wareegsan ee isku kulma kulan waa la jarayaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShell\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E: guji wejiyada siman si aad u furto, kadibna badhanka. Hal qaro darbi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur faylka STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur\u003C/span\u003E: waa la akhrisaa sida saddex-geesood, jidh adag oo lagu dhiso (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EFur faylka STEP\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir astaam, kadibna OK\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji astaamaha; beddel tirooyinka midig; wuu dib u dhisaa intaad qorayso. Ma jiro OK, ma jiro Cancel: isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir sawir-gacmeed\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba jeer guji sawir-gacmeedka taariikhda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u dhis\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESi toos ah kadib isbeddel kasta. Ma jiro furaha dib u dhiska\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoogso / sii daayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoojiso\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u dhis\u003C/span\u003E panel-ka midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid rollback bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu celi halkan\u003C/span\u003E astaamo kasta; guji &quot;Rollback bar · roll forward&quot; si aad ugu noqoto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid astaamo taariikhda gudahooda si aad dib ugu dalbo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKor u dhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoos u dhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↑\"\u003E⌥↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↓\"\u003E⌥↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; waa la diidaa sababta markay jebinayso xiriirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir cabbirrada laba jeer guji moodeelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro astaamaha: cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedkiisa waxay ku liistaan panel-ka midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMates: isku-meel, concentric, masaafo, xagal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoint\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"J\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): dooro wejig siman qayb kasta; joint-ku wuxuu saaraa wejig ka soo horjeeda. \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda ku\u003C/strong\u003E dhidib wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida concentric; \u003Cstrong\u003EKala-bixid\u003C/strong\u003E sida masaafada; \u003Cstrong\u003EXagal\u003C/strong\u003E sida xagal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb go&#039;an\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta koowaad waa aasaasan; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKa dhig qaybta aasaasan\u003C/span\u003E ayaa beddelaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeli qayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu dar nuqul\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELaabid\u003C/span\u003E (nuqul kale) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeli\u003C/span\u003E (faylka qaybta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatir qayb isku-dhiska dhexdiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel qayb\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOgaanshaha isku-dhacyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsku-dhac\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqaajinta qayb si aad u aragto dhaqdhaqaaqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid slider-ka xagasha ama kala-bixidda joint revolute ama slider; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHubi dhaqdhaqaaqa isku-dhacyada\u003C/span\u003E ayaa hubisa. Qayb aan joint lahayn: \u003Cstrong\u003EWareeji gacanta\u003C/strong\u003E (fallaadho aad jiidato, ama qiimayaal la qoray)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir / Baadho\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalada\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECabbir\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): masaafooyin, xagal, radius, aagag; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESifooyinka miisaanka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaal kala fureysan, BOM\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-dhis oo aan wax la dooran: \u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalada kala fureysan\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003ELiiska alaabta\u003C/strong\u003E panel-ka midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifooyinka miisaanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPanel-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EQayb\u003C/strong\u003E: mugga, meesha wejiga, cabbirka, ee joogtaha ku saleysan (waxay yar tahay qaybaha goobaha). Miisaan ma jiro: agab weli ma jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi, Kaydi sida STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhoofi\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu leeyahay STL, 3MF, STEP sax ah (AP242 ama AP214), STEP joogta, DXF iyo naqshad PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshad ka samee qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad\u003C/span\u003E: waraaq A3 oo toos ah oo leh saddex muuqaal, isometric, hal qayb, hal faahfaahin, datums, feature control frames iyo finish symbols. Cabbirrada guud ayaa keliya la cabbiraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhex-jiid si aad u wareegto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELeft-drag\u003C/strong\u003E halkan wuu wareegaa. Dhex- ama midig-jiid wuu fadhiisiyaa. Gurigu wuu waaweynaa meesha taabanaysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJihada muuqaalka, Normal To\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMenu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuqaalada\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJihada u jeedso\u003C/span\u003E qayb la doortay, diyaarad ama sawir-gacmeed\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu waaweyn si buuxda (F)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu habee\u003C/span\u003E (sawir-gacmeed ku jira, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa qalabka Fillet)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMenu-yada midig-guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiraan. Midig-jiid wuu fadhiisiyaa; sawir-gacmeed, midig-guji wuxuu dhammeeyaa silsiladda xariiqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii gacmahaagu yaqaanaan SolidWorks, dooro habka menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeedka astaamaha\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/span\u003E: ribbon oo leh tabs-ka Features, Sketch, Surfaces, Evaluate, Drawing, Assembly iyo View; badhanka dhexe wuu orbit-ka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo badhanka dhexe wuu pan-ka, badhanka bidix wuu dooro oo keliya. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"partcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kala-duwanaansho-dadka-ku-dhaca\"\u003EKala duwanaansho dadka ku dhaca\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir-gacmeedka oo dhan waa profile-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Extrude iyo Revolve waxay isticmaalaan dhammaan wareegyada xidhan ee sawir-gacmeedka ku jira. Ma dooran kartid hal gobol ama hal kontuur sawir-gacmeedka astaamo kasta. Isticmaal hal sawir-gacmeed astaamo kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir-gacmeedka astaamuhu qaadanayo.\u003C/strong\u003E Astaamuhu waxay isticmaalaan sawir-gacmeedka aad hadda xidhay ama kan taariikhda laga doortay. Waxba ma dooranayn, waxay qaadataa sawir-gacmeedka ugu cusub ee aan astaam lagu isticmaalin. Haddii aad qaadatid mid khaldan, dooro sawir-gacmeedka saxda ah oo mar kale dooro astaamaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsbeddelada waxay dabaqmaan markaad qorayso.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiro sanduuq astaamaha leh OK iyo Cancel. Tiro kasta waa dib u dhisaa isla markiiba, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa jidka dib loo noqdo. Liiska ka noqoshada wuxuu daboolaa tafatirka sawir-gacmeedka, astaamaha iyo dejimaha labaduba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqan xad-dhaaf ah looma oggolaan karo inuu aamuso.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiraan cabbirro darbiyada (tixraac). Cabbir ay xidhiidhyadu horey u go&#039;aamiyeen waxay la sheegtaa in ay xad-dhaaf tahay (&quot;waa horey loogu qeexay. Tirtir.&quot;). Cabbir isku khilaafa ma beddelo joomatriga waana casaan. Tirtir mid, ama ka noqo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawiro iyo dhaqdhaqaaqyada waa kuwa aan weli la dhisin; astaamaha fillet, chamfer, shell iyo draft waxay leeyihiin xaddidaad.\u003C/strong\u003E Nooca PartCraft-kan qayb kasta wuxuu dhisaa mesh kernel; chip-ka xaaladda wuxuu had iyo jeer leeyahay &quot;Mesh kernel&quot;. Fillet iyo chamfer waxay shaqeeyaan geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejig siman, geesaha wareegsan ee isku kulma kulan waa la jarayaa, lama isku-dhaafo. Shells way furmaan, draft-ku wuu foorarsadaa wejiyada siman oo keliya. Astaamaha u baahan kernel sax ah way la dooran karaan, laakiin markii la doorto waxay leeyihiin &quot;weli lama dhisin&quot;. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel-ka\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELaba badhan oo magacaysan Fillet.\u003C/strong\u003E Sawir-gacmeed gudihiisa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuxuu wareejiyaa geeska sawir-gacmeedka. Qaybta, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda Features wuxuu wareejiyaa geesaha jidhka adag (geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya wejiyada siman nooca hadda). Ma jiro sweep ama loft nooca hadda: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli lama dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGodad waxay u baahan yihiin barta xor.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGod\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaga qodaa barta laga sameeyay qalabka Point. Dhexda goobaha iyo dhamaadka khadadka ma tirinaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThrough all waa cuts oo keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E Boss wuxuu u baahan yahay qoto. Ma jiraan wax dhamaad ah sida &quot;ilaa vertex / surface / next&quot; weli.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJidhku waa mesh.\u003C/strong\u003E Mesh kernel-ku wuxuu wejiyada wareegsan ka dhisaa wejiyo siman, sidaas darteed muuqaalka, mugga, dhoofinta STL iyo 3MF oo dhan waa kuwaas: \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E panel-ka qaybta ayaa ka dhigaa mid aad u fiican. STEP sax ah ma aha: wuxuu qoraa wejiyada wareegsan dusheeda dhabta ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMillimitir oo keliya.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiro dejin inch weli. Ku dhufo 25.4 si aad inch-ka u geliso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EY waa sare.\u003C/strong\u003E Diyaarada Front waa kan kugu eegaya, Top wuxuu ka eegaa qaybta, sida aad filaysay, laakiin dhidibka sare ee adduunka waa Y. Dhoofinta STL, 3MF iyo STEP sax ah waxaa loo wareejiyaa Z sare; STEP-ka joogta ayaa Y sare hayaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMates waa wejiyo, ma aha jooji geometry.\u003C/strong\u003E Joint kasta wuxuu ka bilowdaa laba wejig siman oo isku dhigan. God ee pin, dooro wejig siman oo ku wareegsan godka iyo shoulder-ka pin-ka, kadibna deji \u003Cstrong\u003EDhexda ku\u003C/strong\u003E dhidibka godka iyo dhidibka revolve-ka pin-ka. Qaybaha aan joint-yada gaarin waxay ku sii jiraan meeshii laga geliyey; ma jiido karaysid. Joint-yada loop-ka lama xallin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta waa soo dejin.\u003C/strong\u003E Ma jiro fayl aad dib u qorayso. Kaydin kasta waa fayl cusub oo ku jira foolderka soo dejinta. Marka hore magacow qaybta, faylashaadana ku hay foolder mashruuc.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa jiraan menu-yo xidhan, ma jiraan tabs-ka amarka.\u003C/strong\u003E Wax kasta waxaa ku yaal qalabka qalabka iyo panel-ka midig, qalabka qalabka wuu isbeddelaa siday shaqadu tahay: qalabka sawir-gacmeedka wuxuu soo muuqdaa sawir-gacmeed gudahiisa oo keliya, qalabka isku-dhiska isku-dhis gudahiisa oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFurayaasha waa xarfo keliya sawir-gacmeed gudihiisa.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qalabyada dooran iyada oo aan wax isbeddel lahayn. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"partcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Haddii aad qaybaha ku naqshadeyso SolidWorks, inta badan fikradaha PartCraft way kuu caadiyoobi doonaan: sawir-gacmeedyo ku yaal dusha Front, Top iyo Right, xidhiidh iyo cabbirro caqli leh, taariikh astaamo leh oo leh rollback bar, iyo isku-dhisyo lagu meel dhigo mates. Habka aad wax ugu gaadhayo qaarkood way kala duwan yihiin, nooca hadda wax yar ayuu sameeyaa. Bogani wuxuu u beddelayaa caadooyinkaaga wuxuuna liistaa wixii yaabka ah. Caadooyinka, la beddelay Waxa aad caadi ku tahay PartCraft-ka Geedka naqshadda bidix Taariikhda bidix: diyaaradaha, kadibna astaamaha, sawir-gacmeedyada oo hoos ku yaal astaamaha isticmaala Diyaaradaha Front, Top iyo Right Saddexdaas oo kale, asalka marka loo maro. Front waa dusha XY, Top waa XZ, Right waa YZ; Y wuxuu u kacaa sare Sawir-gacmeed dusha ama wejiga, kadibna geesta xaqiijinta si aad uga baxdo Sketch (S) qayb la doortay ama wejig siman; Ka bax ama Esc ilaa ay xirmo Cabbir caqli leh Cabbir (D). Guji hal ama laba shay, kadibna meesha tirada ku dhigto. Meesha aad dhigto waxay go'aamisaa tooska, toosan ama isku-xirka Xidhiidh ku dar panel-ka hareeraha Dooro shayada, kadibna badhamada xidhiidhka ee panel-ka midig (Isku-meel, Jiif, Dhinac, Taabasho, Isle iwm.) Xidhiidhyada toos ah inta aad sawirayso Snaps waxay ku daraan xidhiidhyo isku-meel, dhex-kor ah, jiif iyo istaag Buluug / madow / casaan midabka sawir-gacmeedka Isla fikradda: buluug waa aan si buuxda loo qeexin, madow waa si buuxda loo qeexay, casaan waa dhaqso u badan. Chip-ku wuxuu muujinayaa darajooyinka xorta ah ee hadhay Khadka dhexe ee revolve-yada Khadka dhexe (N); Wareeg wuxuu isticmaalaa khadka dhexe ee ugu horreeya ilaa aad dooratid dhidib kale Qowsyada sawir-gacmeedka Fillet (F) sawir-gacmeed: guji geesta, qor radius-ka Dhismaha geometry-ga, beddelka Dhismaha (Q) Extruded boss Soo saar: Blind, Mid-plane, Ilaa wejig / kan xiga / vertex, Offset from face, jihada labaad, taper, hal kontuur (Dooro gobollada) Extruded cut Goo: wuxuu bilaabaa Ilaa dhammaan; u beddel Blind si aad u sameyso pocket Revolved boss / cut Wareeg / Wax dheeraad ah › Jar wareeg Diyaarad / dhidib / barta tixraaca Wax dheeraad ah › Dusha, Dhidibka, Bar (eeg Diyaaradaha tixraaca, dhidibyada iyo barta) Boss ama cut la qaabeeyey / la wareegiyay, draft Wax dheeraad ah › Qabyo wejiyada siman (eeg Sweep, loft iyo draft). Sweep iyo Loft nooca hadda lama dhisin (waxay u baahan yihiin kernel sax ah) Hole Wizard God barta sawir-gacmeed kasta oo furan: fudud, counterbore, countersink (90° / 82°) ama tapped ISO metric M2–M24, ilaa dhammaan ama blind Linear / circular pattern, mirror Toosan, Wareegsan, Muraayad (astaamaha ama jidhka oo dhan) Fillet iyo chamfer geesaha Fillet / Chamfer: guji geeska, Shift+guji mid kale, kadibna badhanka. Hal radius; chamfer siman, laba-masaafo ama masaafo-xagal. Nooca hadda waxay shaqeysaa oo keliya geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejig siman, geedaha wareegsan ee isku kulma kulan waa la jarayaa Shell Shell: guji wejiyada siman si aad u furto, kadibna badhanka. Hal qaro darbi Fur faylka STEP Fur: waa la akhrisaa sida saddex-geesood, jidh adag oo lagu dhiso (Fur faylka STEP) Tafatir astaam, kadibna OK Guji astaamaha; beddel tirooyinka midig; wuu dib u dhisaa intaad qorayso. Ma jiro OK, ma jiro Cancel: isticmaal Ctrl+Z Tafatir sawir-gacmeed Laba jeer guji sawir-gacmeedka taariikhda Dib u dhis Si toos ah kadib isbeddel kasta. Ma jiro furaha dib u dhiska Joogso / sii daayo Joojiso / Dib u dhis panel-ka midig Jiid rollback bar Ku celi halkan astaamo kasta; guji \"Rollback bar · roll forward\" si aad ugu noqoto Jiid astaamo taariikhda gudahooda si aad dib ugu dalbo Kor u dhaqaaq / Hoos u dhaqaaq ama Alt+↑ / Alt+↓; waa la diidaa sababta markay jebinayso xiriirka Tafatir cabbirrada laba jeer guji moodeelka Dooro astaamaha: cabbirrada sawir-gacmeedkiisa waxay ku liistaan panel-ka midig Mates: isku-meel, concentric, masaafo, xagal Joint (J): dooro wejig siman qayb kasta; joint-ku wuxuu saaraa wejig ka soo horjeeda. Dhexda ku dhidib wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida concentric; Kala-bixid sida masaafada; Xagal sida xagal Qayb go'an Qaybta koowaad waa aasaasan; Ka dhig qaybta aasaasan ayaa beddelaa Geli qayb Ku dar nuqul ama Laabid (nuqul kale) ama Geli (faylka qaybta) Tafatir qayb isku-dhiska dhexdiisa Wax ka beddel qayb, kadibna Dib Ogaanshaha isku-dhacyada Isku-dhac Dhaqaajinta qayb si aad u aragto dhaqdhaqaaqa Jiid slider-ka xagasha ama kala-bixidda joint revolute ama slider; Hubi dhaqdhaqaaqa isku-dhacyada ayaa hubisa. Qayb aan joint lahayn: Wareeji gacanta (fallaadho aad jiidato, ama qiimayaal la qoray) Cabbir / Baadho Muuqaalada, kadibna Cabbir (M): masaafooyin, xagal, radius, aagag; Sifooyinka miisaanka Muuqaal kala fureysan, BOM Isku-dhis oo aan wax la dooran: Muuqaalada kala fureysan iyo Liiska alaabta panel-ka midig Sifooyinka miisaanka Panel-ka Qayb: mugga, meesha wejiga, cabbirka, ee joogtaha ku saleysan (waxay yar tahay qaybaha goobaha). Miisaan ma jiro: agab weli ma jiro Kaydi, Kaydi sida STEP Kaydi wuxuu soo dejiyaa .partcraft.json; Dhoofi wuxuu leeyahay STL, 3MF, STEP sax ah (AP242 ama AP214), STEP joogta, DXF iyo naqshad PDF Naqshad ka samee qaybta Naqshad: waraaq A3 oo toos ah oo leh saddex muuqaal, isometric, hal qayb, hal faahfaahin, datums, feature control frames iyo finish symbols. Cabbirrada guud ayaa keliya la cabbiraa Dhex-jiid si aad u wareegto Left-drag halkan wuu wareegaa. Dhex- ama midig-jiid wuu fadhiisiyaa. Gurigu wuu waaweynaa meesha taabanaysa Jihada muuqaalka, Normal To Menu-ga Muuqaalada; Jihada u jeedso qayb la doortay, diyaarad ama sawir-gacmeed Ku waaweyn si buuxda (F) F, ama Ku habee (sawir-gacmeed ku jira, F waa qalabka Fillet) Menu-yada midig-guji Ma jiraan. Midig-jiid wuu fadhiisiyaa; sawir-gacmeed, midig-guji wuxuu dhammeeyaa silsiladda xariiqa Haddii gacmahaagu yaqaanaan SolidWorks, dooro habka menu-ga Geedka astaamaha Dejinta › PartCraft › Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka: ribbon oo leh tabs-ka Features, Sketch, Surfaces, Evaluate, Drawing, Assembly iyo View; badhanka dhexe wuu orbit-ka, Shift iyo badhanka dhexe wuu pan-ka, badhanka bidix wuu dooro oo keliya. Eeg Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka. Kala duwanaansho dadka ku dhaca Sawir-gacmeedka oo dhan waa profile-ka. Extrude iyo Revolve waxay isticmaalaan dhammaan wareegyada xidhan ee sawir-gacmeedka ku jira. Ma dooran kartid hal gobol ama hal kontuur sawir-gacmeedka astaamo kasta. Isticmaal hal sawir-gacmeed astaamo kasta. Sawir-gacmeedka astaamuhu qaadanayo. Astaamuhu waxay isticmaalaan sawir-gacmeedka aad hadda xidhay ama kan taariikhda laga doortay. Waxba ma dooranayn, waxay qaadataa sawir-gacmeedka ugu cusub ee aan astaam lagu isticmaalin. Haddii aad qaadatid mid khaldan, dooro sawir-gacmeedka saxda ah oo mar kale dooro astaamaha. Isbeddelada waxay dabaqmaan markaad qorayso. Ma jiro sanduuq astaamaha leh OK iyo Cancel. Tiro kasta waa dib u dhisaa isla markiiba, Ctrl+Z waa jidka dib loo noqdo. Liiska ka noqoshada wuxuu daboolaa tafatirka sawir-gacmeedka, astaamaha iyo dejimaha labaduba. Dhaqan xad-dhaaf ah looma oggolaan karo inuu aamuso. Ma jiraan cabbirro darbiyada (tixraac). Cabbir ay xidhiidhyadu horey u go'aamiyeen waxay la sheegtaa in ay xad-dhaaf tahay (\"waa horey loogu qeexay. Tirtir.\"). Cabbir isku khilaafa ma beddelo joomatriga waana casaan. Tirtir mid, ama ka noqo. Sawiro iyo dhaqdhaqaaqyada waa kuwa aan weli la dhisin; astaamaha fillet, chamfer, shell iyo draft waxay leeyihiin xaddidaad. Nooca PartCraft-kan qayb kasta wuxuu dhisaa mesh kernel; chip-ka xaaladda wuxuu had iyo jeer leeyahay \"Mesh kernel\". Fillet iyo chamfer waxay shaqeeyaan geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejig siman, geesaha wareegsan ee isku kulma kulan waa la jarayaa, lama isku-dhaafo. Shells way furmaan, draft-ku wuu foorarsadaa wejiyada siman oo keliya. Astaamaha u baahan kernel sax ah way la dooran karaan, laakiin markii la doorto waxay leeyihiin \"weli lama dhisin\". Eeg Mesh kernel-ka iyo Waxa weli lama dhisin. Laba badhan oo magacaysan Fillet. Sawir-gacmeed gudihiisa, Fillet (F) wuxuu wareejiyaa geeska sawir-gacmeedka. Qaybta, Fillet ee kooxda Features wuxuu wareejiyaa geesaha jidhka adag (geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya wejiyada siman nooca hadda). Ma jiro sweep ama loft nooca hadda: eeg Waxa weli lama dhisin. Godad waxay u baahan yihiin barta xor. God wuxuu kaga qodaa barta laga sameeyay qalabka Point. Dhexda goobaha iyo dhamaadka khadadka ma tirinaan. Through all waa cuts oo keliya. Boss wuxuu u baahan yahay qoto. Ma jiraan wax dhamaad ah sida \"ilaa vertex / surface / next\" weli. Jidhku waa mesh. Mesh kernel-ku wuxuu wejiyada wareegsan ka dhisaa wejiyo siman, sidaas darteed muuqaalka, mugga, dhoofinta STL iyo 3MF oo dhan waa kuwaas: Curves panel-ka qaybta ayaa ka dhigaa mid aad u fiican. STEP sax ah ma aha: wuxuu qoraa wejiyada wareegsan dusheeda dhabta ah. Millimitir oo keliya. Ma jiro dejin inch weli. Ku dhufo 25.4 si aad inch-ka u geliso. Y waa sare. Diyaarada Front waa kan kugu eegaya, Top wuxuu ka eegaa qaybta, sida aad filaysay, laakiin dhidibka sare ee adduunka waa Y. Dhoofinta STL, 3MF iyo STEP sax ah waxaa loo wareejiyaa Z sare; STEP-ka joogta ayaa Y sare hayaa. Mates waa wejiyo, ma aha jooji geometry. Joint kasta wuxuu ka bilowdaa laba wejig siman oo isku dhigan. God ee pin, dooro wejig siman oo ku wareegsan godka iyo shoulder-ka pin-ka, kadibna deji Dhexda ku dhidibka godka iyo dhidibka revolve-ka pin-ka. Qaybaha aan joint-yada gaarin waxay ku sii jiraan meeshii laga geliyey; ma jiido karaysid. Joint-yada loop-ka lama xallin. Kaydinta waa soo dejin. Ma jiro fayl aad dib u qorayso. Kaydin kasta waa fayl cusub oo ku jira foolderka soo dejinta. Marka hore magacow qaybta, faylashaadana ku hay foolder mashruuc. Ma jiraan menu-yo xidhan, ma jiraan tabs-ka amarka. Wax kasta waxaa ku yaal qalabka qalabka iyo panel-ka midig, qalabka qalabka wuu isbeddelaa siday shaqadu tahay: qalabka sawir-gacmeedka wuxuu soo muuqdaa sawir-gacmeed gudahiisa oo keliya, qalabka isku-dhiska isku-dhis gudahiisa oo keliya. Furayaasha waa xarfo keliya sawir-gacmeed gudihiisa. L, R, C, A, P, N, F, D, Q iyo S qalabyada dooran iyada oo aan wax isbeddel lahayn. Eeg Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"partcraft","title":"Menyuyaasha, furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","summary":"Dooro qaab menu ah oo ku habboon sida aad hadda u shaqeyso, siiyo amar kasta fur gaar ah, u wareeji amarada ribbon tabs-ka kala duwan, oo dejiso waxa wheel-ku iyo badhan kasta mouse-ka ku sameeyaan muuqaalka 3D.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["qaabka menu-ga","menus","ribbon","toolbar","geedka astaamaha","keyboard shortcuts","hotkeys","keys","customize","remap","rebind","mouse","wheel","invert","jihada weynaynta","badhanka dhexe","orbit","pan","export","import","beddelid","caadi ah"],"headings":[{"id":"laba-qaab","text":"Laba qaab","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-mid-kaaga","text":"Ka dhig mid kaaga","level":2},{"id":"mouse","text":"Mouse","level":2},{"id":"qaadashada","text":"Qaadashada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAmarrada PartCraft waxay isku mid yihiin si kasta oo aad ugu gasho. \u003Cstrong\u003EQaabka menu-ga\u003C/strong\u003E kaliya wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa meesha ay ku taalaan shaashadda, magacyada ay ku leeyihiin, iyo furayaasha ay ku shaqeeyaan. Dooro ah \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E; isbeddelku wuu dhaqso u dhacaa, browser-kanna wuu xusuustaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"laba-qaab\"\u003ELaba qaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa aad heleysaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToolbar-ka PartCraft ee u gaar ah: beddelaha workspace-ka, File, Sketch, Features, Drawing, Assembly, Edit iyo View. Furayaasha \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sawir, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku habee, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qiyaas, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E muuqaal qaybeed. Bilowga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFeature tree\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERibbon loo habeeyay sida barnaamijyada CAD-ka ee qaybaha ku salaysan ay u habeeyaan: menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E (oo leh dhoofin kasta), badhamo degdeg ah, iyo tabs-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFeatures\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESurfaces\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvaluate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStudies\u003C/span\u003E (workspace-yada iyo qalabkooda), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIllustrate\u003C/span\u003E (qalabka manual-ka ee Illustrate workspace-ka; qalabkiisu marka hore wuu u beddelaa Illustrate) iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFeatures\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku bilaabmaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E, sababtoo ah qayb wuxuu ka bilaabmaa sawir. Furayaasha dheeraadka ah: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E extrude, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"H\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EH\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hole, iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kadibna xaraf muuqaal ah: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E front, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E back, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E top, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bottom, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E right, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E left, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"I\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EI\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isometric, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E normal to. Muuqaalka 3D badhanka dhexe wuu leexiyaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo badhanka dhexe ayaa guuraa, badhanka midig wuu guuraa, badhanka bidix wuxuu kaliya doortaa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaab kasta wuxuu hayaa \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab workspace kale oo la doortay wuxuu marka hore u beddelaa; qalab Design ah oo workspace kale laga doortay wuxuu marka hore dib ugu noqdaa Design. Qalabyada sawirku waxay sugaan sawir, qalabyada xaashada naqshadda xaashada naqshadda, qalabyada assembly-gana assembly-ga; status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa waxa marka hore la sameeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGudaha sawir, xaashada naqshadda, assembly-ga iyo workspace-yada kale, xarfuhu macnahooda ayay haystaan (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E xariiq, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E afar-geesle, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"J\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E isku-xidh …) qaab kasta. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo fallaadhaha had iyo jeer waxay haystaan kuwooda. Furaha layout-ka PartCraft ee qaabkaaga loo siiyay amar kale wuu waxba sameynayaa, status bar-kuna wuu sheegaa meesha amarkiisu u gudbay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-mid-kaaga\"\u003EKa dhig mid kaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro qaabka ugu dhow waxa aad rabto, kadibna guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECustomize…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys and menus\u003C/span\u003E, hel amar (sanduuqa raadinta ayaa caawiya). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a key\u003C/span\u003E oo riix furaha, ama laba fur oo isku xigta. Guji fur si aad uga saarto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERibbon-ka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhere it sits\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu amarka u wareejiyaa tab iyo panel kale, menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys only\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMouse\u003C/span\u003E, dheji wheel-ka, badhamada ku guuraya sawirka, iyo waxa badhan kasta sameeyo muuqaalka 3D.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMagac sii oo guji \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta qaab dhismaha ah waxay sameysaa nuqul kaaga (&quot;My Feature tree&quot;); kii dhismaha ahaa weligiis ma beddelmo. Fur loo siiyay labo amar, ama kan horay u dhici lahaa labo xaraf furaha ka hor, wuxuu muuqdaa casaan oo waa in la saxo ka hor intaanad kaydin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse\"\u003EMouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMouse wheel\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScroll up zooms in\u003C/span\u003E (bilowga) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScroll up zooms out\u003C/span\u003E, iyo sida dhaqsaha. Trackpad pinch wuxuu weyneeyaa dhanka faraha ay u dhaqaajiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawirka guuri\u003C/strong\u003E: badhanka dhexe, badhanka midig, ama labaduba. Guji midig sawirka wuxuu wali dhamaysaa tallaabada qalabka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiid muuqaalka 3D\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach view&#039;s own\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa dejinta PartCraft (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E: bidix wuu leexiyaa, ama dhexe wuu leexiyaa). Ama dhig badhan kasta inuu leexiyo, guuro, weyneeyo ama waxba; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh badhanka leexinta wuu guuraa. Guji aan jiidin wuxuu wali doortaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaadashada\"\u003EQaadashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa qaabka la isticmaalayo fayl yar oo \u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ku daraa mid, kombiyuutar kale ama saaxiib. Fayl la soo geliyay wuxuu tilmaami karaa oo kaliya amarada PartCraft; wax kale oo ku jira waa la reebaa oo status bar-ka ayaa tirinaya. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete this style\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka saaraa mid aad leedahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejintan waxay ku sii jirtaa browser-kan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this style in every app\u003C/span\u003E hoosta kaararka qaabka wuxuu ka dhigayaa app kasta inuu ku furmo qaabka ku habboon (toolbar-kiisa, ama ribbon), isbeddellada aad samaysay app kasta. Qaab kale oo app hal mid ah laga doorto wuxuu bedelaa app-kaas oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWixii la xiriira: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"partcraft/keyboard\"\u003EFurayaasha iyo mouse-ka\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"partcraft/coming-from\"\u003EKa yimid modeler parametric kale\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Amarrada PartCraft waxay isku mid yihiin si kasta oo aad ugu gasho. Qaabka menu-ga kaliya wuxuu go'aaminayaa meesha ay ku taalaan shaashadda, magacyada ay ku leeyihiin, iyo furayaasha ay ku shaqeeyaan. Dooro ah Settings (Ctrl+,) › PartCraft › Menus, keys and mouse; isbeddelku wuu dhaqso u dhacaa, browser-kanna wuu xusuustaa. Laba qaab Qaab Waxa aad heleysaa PartCraft Toolbar-ka PartCraft ee u gaar ah: beddelaha workspace-ka, File, Sketch, Features, Drawing, Assembly, Edit iyo View. Furayaasha S sawir, F ku habee, M qiyaas, X muuqaal qaybeed. Bilowga. Feature tree Ribbon loo habeeyay sida barnaamijyada CAD-ka ee qaybaha ku salaysan ay u habeeyaan: menu File (oo leh dhoofin kasta), badhamo degdeg ah, iyo tabs-ka Features, Sketch, Surfaces, Evaluate, Drawing, Assembly, Studies (workspace-yada iyo qalabkooda), Illustrate (qalabka manual-ka ee Illustrate workspace-ka; qalabkiisu marka hore wuu u beddelaa Illustrate) iyo View. Features wuxuu ku bilaabmaa Sketch, sababtoo ah qayb wuxuu ka bilaabmaa sawir. Furayaasha dheeraadka ah: E extrude, H hole, iyo V kadibna xaraf muuqaal ah: V F front, V B back, V T top, V O bottom, V R right, V L left, V I isometric, V N normal to. Muuqaalka 3D badhanka dhexe wuu leexiyaa, Shift iyo badhanka dhexe ayaa guuraa, badhanka midig wuu guuraa, badhanka bidix wuxuu kaliya doortaa. Qaab kasta wuxuu hayaa Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D iyo Ctrl+A. Qalab workspace kale oo la doortay wuxuu marka hore u beddelaa; qalab Design ah oo workspace kale laga doortay wuxuu marka hore dib ugu noqdaa Design. Qalabyada sawirku waxay sugaan sawir, qalabyada xaashada naqshadda xaashada naqshadda, qalabyada assembly-gana assembly-ga; status bar-ku wuxuu sheegaa waxa marka hore la sameeyo. Gudaha sawir, xaashada naqshadda, assembly-ga iyo workspace-yada kale, xarfuhu macnahooda ayay haystaan (L xariiq, R afar-geesle, J isku-xidh …) qaab kasta. Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space iyo fallaadhaha had iyo jeer waxay haystaan kuwooda. Furaha layout-ka PartCraft ee qaabkaaga loo siiyay amar kale wuu waxba sameynayaa, status bar-kuna wuu sheegaa meesha amarkiisu u gudbay. Ka dhig mid kaaga Dooro qaabka ugu dhow waxa aad rabto, kadibna guji Customize…. Ku Keys and menus, hel amar (sanduuqa raadinta ayaa caawiya). Add a key oo riix furaha, ama laba fur oo isku xigta. Guji fur si aad uga saarto. Ribbon-ka, Where it sits wuxuu amarka u wareejiyaa tab iyo panel kale, menu-ga File, ama Keys only. Ku Mouse, dheji wheel-ka, badhamada ku guuraya sawirka, iyo waxa badhan kasta sameeyo muuqaalka 3D. Magac sii oo guji Save. Kaydinta qaab dhismaha ah waxay sameysaa nuqul kaaga (\"My Feature tree\"); kii dhismaha ahaa weligiis ma beddelmo. Fur loo siiyay labo amar, ama kan horay u dhici lahaa labo xaraf furaha ka hor, wuxuu muuqdaa casaan oo waa in la saxo ka hor intaanad kaydin. Mouse Mouse wheel: Scroll up zooms in (bilowga) ama Scroll up zooms out, iyo sida dhaqsaha. Trackpad pinch wuxuu weyneeyaa dhanka faraha ay u dhaqaajiyaan. Sawirka guuri: badhanka dhexe, badhanka midig, ama labaduba. Guji midig sawirka wuxuu wali dhamaysaa tallaabada qalabka. Jiid muuqaalka 3D: Each view's own wuxuu hayaa dejinta PartCraft (Settings › PartCraft: bidix wuu leexiyaa, ama dhexe wuu leexiyaa). Ama dhig badhan kasta inuu leexiyo, guuro, weyneeyo ama waxba; Shift oo leh badhanka leexinta wuu guuraa. Guji aan jiidin wuxuu wali doortaa. Qaadashada Export wuxuu kaydiyaa qaabka la isticmaalayo fayl yar oo .ccinput.json; Import… wuxuu ku daraa mid, kombiyuutar kale ama saaxiib. Fayl la soo geliyay wuxuu tilmaami karaa oo kaliya amarada PartCraft; wax kale oo ku jira waa la reebaa oo status bar-ka ayaa tirinaya. Delete this style wuxuu ka saaraa mid aad leedahay. Dejintan waxay ku sii jirtaa browser-kan. Use this style in every app hoosta kaararka qaabka wuxuu ka dhigayaa app kasta inuu ku furmo qaabka ku habboon (toolbar-kiisa, ama ribbon), isbeddellada aad samaysay app kasta. Qaab kale oo app hal mid ah laga doorto wuxuu bedelaa app-kaas oo keliya. Wixii la xiriira: Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka · Dejinta PartCraft · Ka yimid modeler parametric kale","lang":"so"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"partcraft","title":"Furayaasha iyo mouse-ka","summary":"Dhammaan gaabiyeyaasha furayaasha iyo falalka mouse-ka ee PartCraft, oo lagu kooxeeyay meesha ay ka shaqeeyaan: meel walba, nuqul iyo dhaji, qaybta, muuqaalka 3D, sawirka, taariikhda iyo isku-dhiska.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["furayaasha","gaabiyeyaasha","mouse","orbit","rotate","pan","zoom","wheel","midig-guji","ka noqo","samee mar kale","kaydi","fur","escape","tirtir","alt arrow","koobiyee","dhaji","nuqul labanlaab","dooro dhammaan","badhanka dhexe"],"headings":[{"id":"meel-walba","text":"Meel walba","level":2},{"id":"nuqul-dhaji-iyo-nuqul-labanlaab","text":"Nuqul, dhaji iyo nuqul labanlaab","level":2},{"id":"qaybta-sawir-aan-furnayn","text":"Qaybta (sawir aan furnayn)","level":2},{"id":"muuqaalka-3d","text":"Muuqaalka 3D","level":2},{"id":"marka-geesaha-ama-wejiyada-la-doortayo-fillet-chamfer-ama-shell","text":"Marka geesaha ama wejiyada la doortayo fillet, chamfer ama shell","level":2},{"id":"xaashada-naqshadda","text":"Xaashada naqshadda","level":2},{"id":"sawir-gacmeedka","text":"Sawir-gacmeedka","level":2},{"id":"sanduuqa-lambarka","text":"Sanduuqa lambarka","level":3},{"id":"taariikhda-liiska","text":"Taariikhda liiska","level":2},{"id":"assembly-ga","text":"Assembly-ga","level":2},{"id":"workspace-ka-script","text":"Workspace-ka Script","level":2},{"id":"shortcuts-ka-browser-ku-qaadi-karo","text":"Shortcuts-ka browser-ku qaadi karo","level":2},{"id":"meesha-ay-guuri-ku-taal","text":"Meesha ay Guuri ku taal","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha uma shaqeeyaan intaad ku qorayso sanduuq ku jira panel, marka laga reebo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kuwaas oo had iyo jeer shaqeeya. Furayaasha xarfaha ah waxay shaqeeyaan iyada oo aan furaha wax kale la isticmaalin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMacluumaad guud oo ku saabsan furayaasha browser-ka, iyo kiiboodhadda aan lahayn furayaasha function: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meel-walba\"\u003EMeel walba\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydi qaybta (assembly-ga: assembly-ga). Marka hore wuxuu xiraa sawirka furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur fayl qayb ama assembly ah (wuxuu marka hore weydiin doonaa haddii isbeddello aan la kaydin ay jiraan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee mar kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur ama xir caawimaadan (sidoo kale \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E ee bar-ka app-ka). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa xidha sidoo kale. Laptop-yada badan iyo kiiboodhadda Mac-ka, qabo Fn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHabka shaashadda: caadi, shaashad buuxa, shaashad buuxa oo jiifka laga qariyay. Control ayaa Mac-ka sidoo kale, ma aha ⌘\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa bax shaashad buuxa (marka aad shaashad buuxa ku jirto)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDejinta, oo ku jirta tab-ka PartCraft (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqa lambarka ee panel-ka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa ka noqoshada qoraalka browser-ka. Sanduuqa lambarka ee ku dul yaal cabbirka sawirka, wuxuu ka noqdaa PartCraft.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuqul-dhaji-iyo-nuqul-labanlaab\"\u003ENuqul, dhaji iyo nuqul labanlaab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxay wax ka qabtaan waxa aad ku shaqeyso: geometry-ga la doortay sawir furan, astaanta la doortay taariikhda, ama qaybta la doortay assembly-ga. Faahfaahin ku jirta \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"partcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ENuqul, dhaji iyo nuqul labanlaab\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee wax la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJar: koobiyee, kadibna tirtir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji. Sawir ku jira nuqulku wuxuu raacaa mouse-ka: guji meesha uu tagayo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji meeshiisa: isla isku-xidhka (assembly-ga, isla meeshii)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul labanlaab: koobiyee iyo dhaji hal tallaabo, iyadoo clipboard-ka aan laga taaban\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro dhammaan (sawir ku jira)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa doorato wax (iyo jooji dhajinta ku raacda mouse-ka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanduuqa lambarka, furayaashan waxay koobiyeeyaan oo dhajiyaan qoraalka sida caadiga ah. Qoraalka la doortay ee panel-ka browser-ka ayaa koobiyeeya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaybta-sawir-aan-furnayn\"\u003EQaybta (sawir aan furnayn)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir ku yaal dusha ama wejiga fidsan ee la doortay; haddii aan wax la dooran, dooro meesha adigoo guujinaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu habee qaybta muuqaalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaas, dhammaan meelaha shaqada iyo assembly-ga; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashooyinka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E mar kale wuu xiraa (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/measure\" data-topic=\"partcraft/measure\"\u003EQiyaas masaafooyinka, xagalada iyo miisaanka\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka qaybta gudaha (section view) wuu shaqeeyaa ama wuu joogsadaa, dhammaan meelaha shaqada iyo assembly-ga; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu xiraa (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/section-view\" data-topic=\"partcraft/section-view\"\u003EEeg gudaha muuqaal qaybeed\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir astaanta la doortay (weydiin baa haddii kuwa kale isticmaalaan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"0\"\u003E0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E … \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"9\"\u003E9\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E9\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\".\"\u003E.\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAstaan la doortay: qor lambarkeeda ugu muhiimsan (qoto dheerida Extrude, dhexroorka Hole, tirada pattern-ka, radius-ka fillet-ka …), kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu hayaa midka hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir astaanta la doortay, marka mid la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJooji doorashada sawir-dusha, ama nadiifi doorashada (oo ay ku jiraan geesaha ama wejiyada lagu doortay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muuqaalka-3d\"\u003EMuuqaalka 3D\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka hore guji muuqaalka si uu u helo xulashada kiiboodhka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeff u rog muuqaalka 15 darajo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift ←\"\u003E⇧←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo fallaadhaha kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee gudaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYareey\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMouse\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeff u rog muuqaalka (orbit)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka midig ama dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama ⌘ la haysto intaad jiidayso badhanka bidix\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu rogo wheel-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee meesha mouse-ku ku yaal (dhanka kaa fogaanaya wuu weynaynayaa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabo farood oo trackpad ah ku siib\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeff u rog muuqaalka; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku jiro, guuri. Qaadi wuu weynaynayaa. Waxaa dejiya \u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka \u003Cstrong\u003ETurning the view: Middle button\u003C/strong\u003E ku jiro \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EDejinta PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E, badhanka dhexe ayaa leexiya muuqaalka, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh badhanka dhexe ama badhanka midig ayaa guuraa, badhanka bidix wuxuu kaliya doortaa. | Guji | Dooro wejig (wuxuu si buuxda u iftiimaa), geeso ama diyaare | | \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji geeso ama wejig | Ururi geeso ama wejiyo dhowr ah | | Guji meel bannaan | Ka saar doorashada |\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marka-geesaha-ama-wejiyada-la-doortayo-fillet-chamfer-ama-shell\"\u003EMarka geesaha ama wejiyada la doortayo fillet, chamfer ama shell\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur ama mouse\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji geeso ama wejig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar, ama ka saar haddii horey uu u jiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammee doorashada (isku mid \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu habee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFurayaasha fallaadhaha, muuqaalku xulan yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeff u rog; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku jiro, guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaashada-naqshadda\"\u003EXaashada naqshadda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu habee xaashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee / yareey (xaashadu xulan tahay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift ←\"\u003E⇧←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo fallaadhaha kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri (xaashadu xulan tahay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaqdhaqi astaanta GD&amp;T ee la doortay 1 mm\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir astaanta la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJooji dhigidda astaanta; haddii kale ka saar doorashada; haddii kale ku noqo moodeelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMouse\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji muuqaal, marka Datum, Frame, Finish ama Detail la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalkaas ku dhig (wuxuu ku qabsadaa xariiqda ugu dhow)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji astaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid astaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri (xarigga wuxuu ku sii jiraa barkiisa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu rogo wheel-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee meesha mouse-ku ku yaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka midig ama dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-gacmeedka\"\u003ESawir-gacmeedka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiq\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAfar-geesle (rectangle)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaanso (bartamaha, bilowga, dhammaadka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqda dhexe (centerline)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu xidh geesta fillet\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESpline (dhibcaha ku habboon)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"T\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ET\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrim\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtend\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOffset (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka offset-ka lagu sameynayo: labada dhinac)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"M\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EM\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMirror\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU beddel khadadka la doortay dhismaha iyo dib ugu soo celi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammee silsiladda xariiqda ama spline\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir doorashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro wax kasta oo sawirka ku jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee, jar, dhaji geometry-ga (dhajinta waxay raacdaa mouse-ka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhaji isla isku-xidhka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul labanlaab doorashada oo meel ku dhig guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u noqo: jooji sanduuqa lambarka ama dhajinta, dhammee silsiladda xariiqda, ku noqo Dooro, nadiifi doorashada, kadibna xir sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMouse\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhig dhibcaha qalabka sawirka; dooro Dooro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar ama ka qaado doorashada (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji Windows iyo Linux, ⌘+guji Mac, isku mid ah)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid meel bannaan (Dooro)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaaqad: wax kasta oo gebi ahaanba ku jira ayaa la doortaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid dhibic, xariiq ama geesta goobo (Dooro)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri; xiriirrada way hayaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid lambarka cabbirka (Dooro)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuuri calaamadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabo jeer guji ama midig-guji intaad xariiqyo sawirayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammee silsiladda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJiid badhanka midig ama dhexe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka guuri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu rogo wheel-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeynee meesha mouse-ku ku yaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sanduuqa-lambarka\"\u003ESanduuqa lambarka\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dabaq qiimaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXir adigoon wax beddelin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji meel kale ayaa sidoo kale ku dabaqaa qiimaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taariikhda-liiska\"\u003ETaariikhda liiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGaar liiska\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EU guur safafka dhexdooda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro safka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↑\"\u003E⌥↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ↓\"\u003E⌥↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAstaanta la doortay kor ama hoos ugu guuri, meesha taariikhdu oggolaanayso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F2\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF2\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBeddel lambarka ugu muhiimsan ee astaanta safkeeda; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa dejisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu hayaa midka hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMouse\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro sawir-dus ama astaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabo jeer guji sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabo jeer guji lambarka astaanta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu beddel safka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assembly-ga\"\u003EAssembly-ga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"J\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EJ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBilow isku-xidh: kadibna guji wejig fidsan oo qayb kasta oo ka mid ah laba qayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu habee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJooji isku-xidhka aad bilowday, ama nadiifi doorashada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar qaybta ama isku-xidhka la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar qaybta ama isku-xidhka la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo iyo samee mar kale liiska assembly-ga gaarka ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul labanlaab qaybta la doortay (isla qaybta, dhinaca kuwa kale)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoobiyee qayb, dhaji dhinaca kuwa kale ama isla meeshii\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMouse-ka muuqaalka: sida muuqaalka 3D kor ku jira. Guji qayb si aad u doorato. Labo jeer guji qayb liiska ku jirta si aad u wax beddesho.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"workspace-ka-script\"\u003EWorkspace-ka Script\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFur\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F5\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF5\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodsii script-ka (tafatiraha, panel-ka ama muuqaalka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Return\"\u003E⌘ Return\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Enter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodsii khadadka la doortay, ama khadka cursor-ku ku yaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Tab\"\u003E⇧ Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Tab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhex-gal / ka bax khadadka la doortay. Si aad tafatiraha uga baxdo kiiboodhka, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kadibna \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command /\"\u003E⌘/\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+/\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa dhig khadadka la doortay faallo, ama dib u soo celi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command F\"\u003E⌘F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command H\"\u003E⌘H\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+H\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERaadi / raadi oo beddel script-ka; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa kii xiga, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Return\"\u003E⇧ Return\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+Enter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F3\"\u003E⇧ F3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kii hore, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu xiraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command [\"\u003E⇧⌘[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command ]\"\u003E⇧⌘]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu xidh / fur xannaanka cursor-ku ku yaal (function, if, for, while … end)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Space\"\u003E⌘ Space\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Space\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiis dhammaystir magaca aad qorayso (wuxuu sidoo kale furmaa marka labo xaraf la qoro); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa doortaa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa qaadaa mid, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuu xiraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E khadka hoose ee console-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodsii bayaan keliya; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↑\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"↓\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kuwii hore ayay soo celiyaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu habee muuqaalka wixii scripts-ku muujiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EQor oo socodsii scripts\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shortcuts-ka-browser-ku-qaadi-karo\"\u003EShortcuts-ka browser-ku qaadi karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Safari-ga ayaa laga yaabaa inuu furo taariikhda: isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad mar kale u samayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa furaha bookmark-ka browser-ka: PartCraft wuu qaadaa intii app-ku xulan yahay, wuuna iska daayaa markaad sanduuq ku qorayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F11\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa shaashad buuxa iyo weynaynta bogga ee browser-ka, ma aha kuwa PartCraft. Isticmaal \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E shaashad buuxa, wheel-ka moodeelka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFurayaasha function laptop-yada iyo Mac-yada badan waxay u baahan yihiin furaha Fn: riix Fn+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E caawimaad, ama isticmaal badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGacmaha taabashada iyo trackpad-ka: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\" data-topic=\"partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\"\u003ETrackpad, taabasho iyo shaashado yaryar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-ay-guuri-ku-taal\"\u003EMeesha ay Guuri ku taal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuuri waxay ku taal menu-ga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E ee kooxda Astaanno, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove body\u003C/span\u003E, sanduuqa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E halkaas oo aad ku qorto ΔX, ΔY iyo ΔZ, iyo sida jiifka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrag to move\u003C/span\u003E ee qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Furayaasha uma shaqeeyaan intaad ku qorayso sanduuq ku jira panel, marka laga reebo Ctrl+S iyo Ctrl+O, kuwaas oo had iyo jeer shaqeeya. Furayaasha xarfaha ah waxay shaqeeyaan iyada oo aan furaha wax kale la isticmaalin. Macluumaad guud oo ku saabsan furayaasha browser-ka, iyo kiiboodhadda aan lahayn furayaasha function: Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada. Meel walba Fur Falka Ctrl+S Kaydi qaybta (assembly-ga: assembly-ga). Marka hore wuxuu xiraa sawirka furan Ctrl+O Fur fayl qayb ama assembly ah (wuxuu marka hore weydiin doonaa haddii isbeddello aan la kaydin ay jiraan) Ctrl+Z Ka noqo Ctrl+Y ama Ctrl+Shift+Z Samee mar kale F1 Fur ama xir caawimaadan (sidoo kale Help ee bar-ka app-ka). Esc ayaa xidha sidoo kale. Laptop-yada badan iyo kiiboodhadda Mac-ka, qabo Fn Ctrl+Shift+F Habka shaashadda: caadi, shaashad buuxa, shaashad buuxa oo jiifka laga qariyay. Control ayaa Mac-ka sidoo kale, ma aha ⌘ Esc Ka bax shaashad buuxa (marka aad shaashad buuxa ku jirto) Ctrl+, Dejinta, oo ku jirta tab-ka PartCraft (eeg Dejinta PartCraft) Sanduuqa lambarka ee panel-ka, Ctrl+Z waa ka noqoshada qoraalka browser-ka. Sanduuqa lambarka ee ku dul yaal cabbirka sawirka, wuxuu ka noqdaa PartCraft. Nuqul, dhaji iyo nuqul labanlaab Waxay wax ka qabtaan waxa aad ku shaqeyso: geometry-ga la doortay sawir furan, astaanta la doortay taariikhda, ama qaybta la doortay assembly-ga. Faahfaahin ku jirta Nuqul, dhaji iyo nuqul labanlaab. Fur Falka Ctrl+C Koobiyee wax la doortay Ctrl+X Jar: koobiyee, kadibna tirtir Ctrl+V Dhaji. Sawir ku jira nuqulku wuxuu raacaa mouse-ka: guji meesha uu tagayo Ctrl+Shift+V Dhaji meeshiisa: isla isku-xidhka (assembly-ga, isla meeshii) Ctrl+D Nuqul labanlaab: koobiyee iyo dhaji hal tallaabo, iyadoo clipboard-ka aan laga taaban Ctrl+A Dooro dhammaan (sawir ku jira) Esc Ma doorato wax (iyo jooji dhajinta ku raacda mouse-ka) Sanduuqa lambarka, furayaashan waxay koobiyeeyaan oo dhajiyaan qoraalka sida caadiga ah. Qoraalka la doortay ee panel-ka browser-ka ayaa koobiyeeya. Qaybta (sawir aan furnayn) Fur Falka S Sawir ku yaal dusha ama wejiga fidsan ee la doortay; haddii aan wax la dooran, dooro meesha adigoo guujinaya F Ku habee qaybta muuqaalka M Qiyaas, dhammaan meelaha shaqada iyo assembly-ga; Esc wuxuu nadiifiyaa doorashooyinka, Esc mar kale wuu xiraa (eeg Qiyaas masaafooyinka, xagalada iyo miisaanka) X Muuqaalka qaybta gudaha (section view) wuu shaqeeyaa ama wuu joogsadaa, dhammaan meelaha shaqada iyo assembly-ga; Esc wuu xiraa (eeg Eeg gudaha muuqaal qaybeed) Delete Tirtir astaanta la doortay (weydiin baa haddii kuwa kale isticmaalaan) 0 … 9, . Astaan la doortay: qor lambarkeeda ugu muhiimsan (qoto dheerida Extrude, dhexroorka Hole, tirada pattern-ka, radius-ka fillet-ka …), kadibna Enter. Esc wuxuu hayaa midka hore Backspace Tirtir astaanta la doortay, marka mid la doortay Esc Jooji doorashada sawir-dusha, ama nadiifi doorashada (oo ay ku jiraan geesaha ama wejiyada lagu doortay Shift) Muuqaalka 3D Marka hore guji muuqaalka si uu u helo xulashada kiiboodhka. Fur Falka ← → ↑ ↓ Leff u rog muuqaalka 15 darajo Shift+← iyo fallaadhaha kale Muuqaalka guuri + ama = Weynee gudaha − Yareey Mouse Falka Jiid badhanka bidix Leff u rog muuqaalka (orbit) Jiid badhanka midig ama dhexe Muuqaalka guuri Shift, Ctrl ama ⌘ la haysto intaad jiidayso badhanka bidix Muuqaalka guuri Ku rogo wheel-ka Weynee meesha mouse-ku ku yaal (dhanka kaa fogaanaya wuu weynaynayaa) Labo farood oo trackpad ah ku siib Leff u rog muuqaalka; Shift ku jiro, guuri. Qaadi wuu weynaynayaa. Waxaa dejiya Scrolling ee Dejinta PartCraft Marka Turning the view: Middle button ku jiro Dejinta PartCraft, badhanka dhexe ayaa leexiya muuqaalka, Shift oo leh badhanka dhexe ama badhanka midig ayaa guuraa, badhanka bidix wuxuu kaliya doortaa. | Guji | Dooro wejig (wuxuu si buuxda u iftiimaa), geeso ama diyaare | | Shift+guji geeso ama wejig | Ururi geeso ama wejiyo dhowr ah | | Guji meel bannaan | Ka saar doorashada | Marka geesaha ama wejiyada la doortayo fillet, chamfer ama shell Fur ama mouse Falka Guji geeso ama wejig Ku dar, ama ka saar haddii horey uu u jiray Esc ama Enter Dhammee doorashada (isku mid Done) F Ku habee Furayaasha fallaadhaha, muuqaalku xulan yahay Leff u rog; Shift ku jiro, guuri Xaashada naqshadda Fur Falka F Ku habee xaashada + / − Weynee / yareey (xaashadu xulan tahay) Shift+← iyo fallaadhaha kale Muuqaalka guuri (xaashadu xulan tahay) ← → ↑ ↓ Dhaqdhaqi astaanta GD&T ee la doortay 1 mm Delete ama Backspace Tirtir astaanta la doortay Esc Jooji dhigidda astaanta; haddii kale ka saar doorashada; haddii kale ku noqo moodeelka Mouse Falka Guji muuqaal, marka Datum, Frame, Finish ama Detail la doortay Halkaas ku dhig (wuxuu ku qabsadaa xariiqda ugu dhow) Guji astaan Dooro Jiid astaan Guuri (xarigga wuxuu ku sii jiraa barkiisa) Ku rogo wheel-ka Weynee meesha mouse-ku ku yaal Jiid badhanka midig ama dhexe Muuqaalka guuri Sawir-gacmeedka Fur Falka L Xariiq R Afar-geesle (rectangle) C Goobo A Qaanso (bartamaha, bilowga, dhammaadka) P Bar N Xariiqda dhexe (centerline) F Ku xidh geesta fillet D Cabbir B Spline (dhibcaha ku habboon) T Trim E Extend O Offset (B marka offset-ka lagu sameynayo: labada dhinac) M Mirror S Dooro Q U beddel khadadka la doortay dhismaha iyo dib ugu soo celi Enter Dhammee silsiladda xariiqda ama spline Delete ama Backspace Tirtir doorashada Ctrl+A Dooro wax kasta oo sawirka ku jira Ctrl+C / Ctrl+X / Ctrl+V Koobiyee, jar, dhaji geometry-ga (dhajinta waxay raacdaa mouse-ka) Ctrl+Shift+V Dhaji isla isku-xidhka Ctrl+D Nuqul labanlaab doorashada oo meel ku dhig guji Esc Dib u noqo: jooji sanduuqa lambarka ama dhajinta, dhammee silsiladda xariiqda, ku noqo Dooro, nadiifi doorashada, kadibna xir sawirka Mouse Falka Guji Dhig dhibcaha qalabka sawirka; dooro Dooro Shift+guji Ku dar ama ka qaado doorashada (Ctrl+guji Windows iyo Linux, ⌘+guji Mac, isku mid ah) Jiid meel bannaan (Dooro) Daaqad: wax kasta oo gebi ahaanba ku jira ayaa la doortaa Jiid dhibic, xariiq ama geesta goobo (Dooro) Guuri; xiriirrada way hayaan Jiid lambarka cabbirka (Dooro) Guuri calaamadda Labo jeer guji ama midig-guji intaad xariiqyo sawirayso Dhammee silsiladda Jiid badhanka midig ama dhexe Muuqaalka guuri Ku rogo wheel-ka Weynee meesha mouse-ku ku yaal Sanduuqa lambarka Fur Falka Enter Ku dabaq qiimaha Esc Xir adigoon wax beddelin Guji meel kale ayaa sidoo kale ku dabaqaa qiimaha. Taariikhda liiska Fur Falka Tab Gaar liiska ↑ / ↓ U guur safafka dhexdooda Enter ama Space Dooro safka Alt+↑ / Alt+↓ Astaanta la doortay kor ama hoos ugu guuri, meesha taariikhdu oggolaanayso F2 Beddel lambarka ugu muhiimsan ee astaanta safkeeda; Enter ayaa dejisa, Esc wuxuu hayaa midka hore Mouse Falka Guji Dooro sawir-dus ama astaan Labo jeer guji sawir Fur Labo jeer guji lambarka astaanta Ku beddel safka Assembly-ga Fur Falka J Bilow isku-xidh: kadibna guji wejig fidsan oo qayb kasta oo ka mid ah laba qayb F Ku habee Esc Jooji isku-xidhka aad bilowday, ama nadiifi doorashada Delete Ka saar qaybta ama isku-xidhka la doortay Backspace Ka saar qaybta ama isku-xidhka la doortay Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y Ka noqo iyo samee mar kale liiska assembly-ga gaarka ah Ctrl+D Nuqul labanlaab qaybta la doortay (isla qaybta, dhinaca kuwa kale) Ctrl+C, kadibna Ctrl+V ama Ctrl+Shift+V Koobiyee qayb, dhaji dhinaca kuwa kale ama isla meeshii Mouse-ka muuqaalka: sida muuqaalka 3D kor ku jira. Guji qayb si aad u doorato. Labo jeer guji qayb liiska ku jirta si aad u wax beddesho. Workspace-ka Script Fur Falka F5 Socodsii script-ka (tafatiraha, panel-ka ama muuqaalka) Ctrl+Enter Socodsii khadadka la doortay, ama khadka cursor-ku ku yaal Tab / Shift+Tab Dhex-gal / ka bax khadadka la doortay. Si aad tafatiraha uga baxdo kiiboodhka, riix Esc, kadibna Tab Ctrl+/ Ka dhig khadadka la doortay faallo, ama dib u soo celi Ctrl+F / Ctrl+H Raadi / raadi oo beddel script-ka; Enter ama F3 waa kii xiga, Shift+Enter ama Shift+F3 kii hore, Esc wuu xiraa Ctrl+Shift+[ / Ctrl+Shift+] Ku xidh / fur xannaanka cursor-ku ku yaal (function, if, for, while … end) Ctrl+Space Liis dhammaystir magaca aad qorayso (wuxuu sidoo kale furmaa marka labo xaraf la qoro); ↑ / ↓ ayaa doortaa, Enter ama Tab ayaa qaadaa mid, Esc wuu xiraa Enter khadka hoose ee console-ka Socodsii bayaan keliya; ↑ iyo ↓ kuwii hore ayay soo celiyaan F Ku habee muuqaalka wixii scripts-ku muujiyo Eeg Qor oo socodsii scripts. Shortcuts-ka browser-ku qaadi karo Ctrl+Y Safari-ga ayaa laga yaabaa inuu furo taariikhda: isticmaal Ctrl+Shift+Z si aad mar kale u samayso. Ctrl+D waa furaha bookmark-ka browser-ka: PartCraft wuu qaadaa intii app-ku xulan yahay, wuuna iska daayaa markaad sanduuq ku qorayso. F11 iyo Ctrl++ / Ctrl+− waa shaashad buuxa iyo weynaynta bogga ee browser-ka, ma aha kuwa PartCraft. Isticmaal Ctrl+Shift+F shaashad buuxa, wheel-ka moodeelka. Furayaasha function laptop-yada iyo Mac-yada badan waxay u baahan yihiin furaha Fn: riix Fn+F1 caawimaad, ama isticmaal badhanka Help. Gacmaha taabashada iyo trackpad-ka: Trackpad, taabasho iyo shaashado yaryar. Meesha ay Guuri ku taal Guuri waxay ku taal menu-ga More ee kooxda Astaanno, sida Move body, sanduuqa Move halkaas oo aad ku qorto ΔX, ΔY iyo ΔZ, iyo sida jiifka Drag to move ee qaybta.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dejinta PartCraft","summary":"Dooro badhanka jiirka ee wareejiya muuqaalka, ka dhig jiidista trackpad-ka inay wareejiso oo ka dhaqaajiso qaybta, damee ama deji xidhiidhada otomaatiga ah marka aad sawirayso, iyo dooro tirada threads-ka ee xalinta simulation-ka.","section":"reference","order":15,"keywords":["dejinta","doorashooyin","options","jiirka","badhanka dhexe","badhanka wheel","wareejin","orbit","rotate","wareeji","trackpad","touchpad","scroll","swipe","pinch","xidhiidhada","constraints","xidhiidhada otomaatiga ah","snap","coincident","threads","solver threads","cores","processors","multi-threaded","xal dhakhso","parallel"],"headings":[{"id":"wareejinta-muuqaalka","text":"Wareejinta muuqaalka","level":2},{"id":"scroll-mouse-wheel-ama-trackpad","text":"Scroll: mouse wheel ama trackpad","level":2},{"id":"sawir-gacmeed-ku-dar-xidhiidhada-intaad-sawirayso","text":"Sawir-gacmeed: ku dar xidhiidhada intaad sawirayso","level":2},{"id":"sawir-gacmeed-cabbir-intaad-sawirayso","text":"Sawir-gacmeed: cabbir intaad sawirayso","level":2},{"id":"kaarka-geeska","text":"Kaarka geeska","level":2},{"id":"xalinta-threads-ka","text":"Xalinta threads-ka","level":2},{"id":"server-kaaga-gaarka-ah","text":"Server-kaaga gaarka ah","level":3}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFuro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E gear-ka ku jira app bar-ka ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Tabka koowaad, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPartCraft\u003C/span\u003E, wuxuu hayaa dejinta barnaamijkan; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuud\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu hayaa midka dhammaan barnaamijyada CadCraft wadaagaan (mawduuca, toolbar-ka, panelka). Dejinta PartCraft waxay ku jirtaa barnaamijka oo keliya: halkan ayaad ka beddeshaa, browser-kanna wuu xasuustaa. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u deji dejinta PartCraft\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu wax walba dib u celinayaa bilowgii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wareejinta-muuqaalka\"\u003EWareejinta muuqaalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadhanka bidix\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga): jiid badhanka bidix si aad qaybta u wareejiso; jiid badhanka midig ama dhexe si aad u dhaqaajiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBadhanka dhexe\u003C/strong\u003E: riix wheel-ka oo jiid si aad qaybta u wareejiso; hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama ⌘) oo badhanka dhexe, ama jiid badhanka midig, si aad u dhaqaajiso. Badhanka bidix wuxuu kaliya doortaa wejiyada, geesaha iyo dusha, sidaas darteed gujis yar oo dhaqaajiya qaybta ma wareejiyo. Barnaamijyo CAD badan sidan ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWheel-ka wuxuu u weyneeyaa jiirka meeshiisa labadaba. Sawir-gacmeed, badhanka midig iyo dhexe ayaa dhaqaajiya sida hore.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"scroll-mouse-wheel-ama-trackpad\"\u003EScroll: mouse wheel ama trackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOgow\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga): PartCraft wuu ilaaliyaa scroll-ka. Scroll-ka dhinaca ama nuxur-yar, sida trackpad-ku diro, qaybta wuu wareejiyaa; gacmaha wheel-ka oo buuxa waxay weyneeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMouse wheel\u003C/strong\u003E: scroll kasta wuxuu had iyo jeer ku weynaadaa jiirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E: laba farood ku dhaqdhaqaaq si aad qaybta u wareejiso, hay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo dhaqaaji si aad u dhaqaajiso, pinch si aad u weyneeyso. Sawir-gacmeed, laba faroodka ayaa dhaqaajinaya sawirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPinch wuxuu weyneeyaa doorasho kasta. Haddii &quot;Ogow&quot; khaldo mouse-kaaga ama trackpad-kaaga, dooro midka aad haysato. Wax dheeraad ah ka akhri \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\" data-topic=\"partcraft/trackpad-and-touch\"\u003ETrackpad, taabasho iyo shaashado yar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-gacmeed-ku-dar-xidhiidhada-intaad-sawirayso\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed: ku dar xidhiidhada intaad sawirayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKu dar xidhiidhada intaad sawirayso\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowgii waa on): gujis oo ku soo dhex dhufo barta wuxuu bartaas ka dhigaa mid isku-dhaca; gujis xariiq ama qalooc wuxuu barta ku dhigaa xariiqdaas ama qaloocaas; xariiq la sawiro oo u dhow sinaha ama toosinta wuxuu noqdaa mid sinaha ama toosan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003EXidhiidhada iyo cabbirrada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDemi markaad rabto inaad geesaha ku dhig goobo ku dhow goobo kale oo aanad isku xidhin. Jiirku weli wuu soo dhex dhufaa barta iyo qalooca, laakiin waxba ma isku xidhmo: xariiqyada la sawiro silsiladda isku xidh ma wadaagaan geesahooda, sidaas darteed jiidis ayaa kala tagi kara. Xidhiidhada aad rabto ku dar adigu panelka midig. Profile xiran wuu weli soo bixi karaa marka dhamaadkeeda ay isku taabtaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejintu waxay beddeshaa kaliya waxa ku dara sawirka cusub. Xidhiidhada hore ee sawirka way ahaadaan, qalabka Fillet-ka wuxuu weli sameynayaa qaansadiisa taabta iyo radiyaskiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-gacmeed-cabbir-intaad-sawirayso\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed: cabbir intaad sawirayso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECabbir intaad sawirayso\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowgii waa on): intaad xariiq, leydh, goobo ama qaanso sawirayso, qor lambar wuxuu buuxiyaa sanduuqa cabbirka ee jiirka ku xiga (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu gudbaa sanduuqa xiga) iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu sawirayaa qaabka cabbirkaas, oo cabbir wadane u dhigan cabbir kasta aad qortay. Dami: qorista lambar intaad sawirayso waa wax aan wax samayn, qaababka waxaa lagu sawiraa gujis kaliya. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-basics#type-the-size-as-you-draw\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-basics\" data-hash=\"type-the-size-as-you-draw\"\u003EQor cabbirka intaad sawirayso\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaarka-geeska\"\u003EKaarka geeska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa ku muuqda geeska muuqaalka 3D: \u003Cstrong\u003EKaarka muuqaalka\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga; geeska sare ee midig — guji wejiga, geesaha ama geeska si aad uga eegto, jiid si aad u wareejiso, jiid giraangiraha compass-ka si aad moodeelka u wareejiso), \u003Cstrong\u003EAstaanta tiirka\u003C/strong\u003E (calaamad yar oo X, Y, Z ah oo geeska hoose ee bidix, oo wareegta muuqaalka: X casaan, Y cagaar, Z buluug) ama \u003Cstrong\u003EMidna\u003C/strong\u003E. Midna ma muuqdo marka aad sawirayso ama xaashiga naqshadda. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/view-cube\" data-topic=\"partcraft/view-cube\"\u003EKaarka muuqaalka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xalinta-threads-ka\"\u003EXalinta threads-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETirada threads-ka ee xalinta simulation-ka isticmaali karo. \u003Cstrong\u003EAutomatic\u003C/strong\u003E (bilowga) wuxuu isticmaalaa hal ka yar tirada processor-ka kombiyuutarka (ugu badnaan 16), si bogga u jawaabo intuu xalinayo simulation; ama dooro lambar. Xalinta weyn ee voxel, buckling, stress waqti kasta iyo flow waxay si dhakhso ah ugu xalliyaan threads badan (qiyaastii 2× ee 4 threads ee 80,000 kuub, sida cabbirkeenna ay muujinayaan; wax badan kombiyuutar firaaqo ah). Moodeelada ka yar 20,000 aan la garanayn waxay ku sii jiraan hal thread, sababtoo ah bilaabidda threads-ka waxay ka qaadataa wixii ay badbaadin lahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXalka thread-ka leh wuxuu siinayaa isla jawaabta sida hal thread (ilaa xisaabinta: wadarta waxaa lagu daraa siyaabo kala duwan). Natiijo kasta oo simulation ah wuxuu tusayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EN threads\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003E1 thread\u003C/strong\u003E iyo sababta hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003ESolver\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThreads-ka waxay u baahan yihiin in bogga noqdo \u003Cstrong\u003Ecross-origin isolated\u003C/strong\u003E (browser-ku wuxuu oggolaanayaa workers inay xusuus wadaagaan markaas kaliya). Bogga lab-ka waa taas; meelaha aanu noqon, dejintu way sheegtaa (&quot;Bogga ma ahan cross-origin isolated, sidaas darteed solver-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan hal thread, wax kasta oo halkan la doorto aan ahayn.&quot;), xalkana wuxuu isticmaalaa hal thread. Waxa kale oo shaqeeya siduu u shaqeeyo, jawaabahana isku mid bay yihiin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaraasadaha socodka laminar-ka ayaa sidoo kale isticmaala threads (qiyaastii 2.5× ee 4 threads ee 54,000 unug fluid), isla jawaab ilaa lambarka ugu dambeeya. Quadratic-tetrahedron solver iyo heat transfer waxay ku shaqeeyaan hal thread: threading-kooda waxaa la cabbiray inay ka daahan yihiin kombiyuutarka tijaabada (xalinteeda waxaa xaddidaya xawaaraha xusuusta iyo tallaabo aan la kala qaybin karin).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"server-kaaga-gaarka-ah\"\u003EServer-kaaga gaarka ah\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii aad PartCraft ka socodsiiso server-kaaga, wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida la adeego. Solver threads-ka, u oggolow server-ka inuu bogga PartCraft-ka u diro laba header:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003ECross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin\nCross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApache-ka, folder-ka \u003Ccode\u003E.htaccess\u003C/code\u003E (waxay u baahan tahay mod_headers):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EHeader set Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy &quot;same-origin&quot;\nHeader set Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy &quot;require-corp&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003Enginx-ka, \u003Ccode\u003Elocation\u003C/code\u003E-ka ee adeega PartCraft:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eadd_header Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy &quot;same-origin&quot; always;\nadd_header Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy &quot;require-corp&quot; always;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDib u rarso bogga: Dejinta › Solver threads wuxuu bixinayaa \u003Cstrong\u003EAutomatic\u003C/strong\u003E oo tirada kombiyuutarkaaga ah. Header-ka labaad wuxuu browser-ka ka dhigaa inuu diido wax kasta oo bogga ka soo dega goob kale oo aan ogolaan, taas oo wanaagsan PartCraft keligiis (wuxuu wax kasta ka soo dejiyaa folder-kiisa).\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Furo Dejinta gear-ka ku jira app bar-ka ama Ctrl+,. Tabka koowaad, PartCraft, wuxuu hayaa dejinta barnaamijkan; Guud wuxuu hayaa midka dhammaan barnaamijyada CadCraft wadaagaan (mawduuca, toolbar-ka, panelka). Dejinta PartCraft waxay ku jirtaa barnaamijka oo keliya: halkan ayaad ka beddeshaa, browser-kanna wuu xasuustaa. Dib u deji dejinta PartCraft wuxuu wax walba dib u celinayaa bilowgii. Wareejinta muuqaalka Badhanka bidix (bilowga): jiid badhanka bidix si aad qaybta u wareejiso; jiid badhanka midig ama dhexe si aad u dhaqaajiso. Badhanka dhexe: riix wheel-ka oo jiid si aad qaybta u wareejiso; hay Shift (ama Ctrl, ama ⌘) oo badhanka dhexe, ama jiid badhanka midig, si aad u dhaqaajiso. Badhanka bidix wuxuu kaliya doortaa wejiyada, geesaha iyo dusha, sidaas darteed gujis yar oo dhaqaajiya qaybta ma wareejiyo. Barnaamijyo CAD badan sidan ayay u shaqeeyaan. Wheel-ka wuxuu u weyneeyaa jiirka meeshiisa labadaba. Sawir-gacmeed, badhanka midig iyo dhexe ayaa dhaqaajiya sida hore. Scroll: mouse wheel ama trackpad Ogow (bilowga): PartCraft wuu ilaaliyaa scroll-ka. Scroll-ka dhinaca ama nuxur-yar, sida trackpad-ku diro, qaybta wuu wareejiyaa; gacmaha wheel-ka oo buuxa waxay weyneeyaan. Mouse wheel: scroll kasta wuxuu had iyo jeer ku weynaadaa jiirka. Trackpad: laba farood ku dhaqdhaqaaq si aad qaybta u wareejiso, hay Shift oo dhaqaaji si aad u dhaqaajiso, pinch si aad u weyneeyso. Sawir-gacmeed, laba faroodka ayaa dhaqaajinaya sawirka. Pinch wuxuu weyneeyaa doorasho kasta. Haddii \"Ogow\" khaldo mouse-kaaga ama trackpad-kaaga, dooro midka aad haysato. Wax dheeraad ah ka akhri Trackpad, taabasho iyo shaashado yar. Sawir-gacmeed: ku dar xidhiidhada intaad sawirayso Ku dar xidhiidhada intaad sawirayso (bilowgii waa on): gujis oo ku soo dhex dhufo barta wuxuu bartaas ka dhigaa mid isku-dhaca; gujis xariiq ama qalooc wuxuu barta ku dhigaa xariiqdaas ama qaloocaas; xariiq la sawiro oo u dhow sinaha ama toosinta wuxuu noqdaa mid sinaha ama toosan. Eeg Xidhiidhada iyo cabbirrada. Demi markaad rabto inaad geesaha ku dhig goobo ku dhow goobo kale oo aanad isku xidhin. Jiirku weli wuu soo dhex dhufaa barta iyo qalooca, laakiin waxba ma isku xidhmo: xariiqyada la sawiro silsiladda isku xidh ma wadaagaan geesahooda, sidaas darteed jiidis ayaa kala tagi kara. Xidhiidhada aad rabto ku dar adigu panelka midig. Profile xiran wuu weli soo bixi karaa marka dhamaadkeeda ay isku taabtaan. Dejintu waxay beddeshaa kaliya waxa ku dara sawirka cusub. Xidhiidhada hore ee sawirka way ahaadaan, qalabka Fillet-ka wuxuu weli sameynayaa qaansadiisa taabta iyo radiyaskiisa. Sawir-gacmeed: cabbir intaad sawirayso Cabbir intaad sawirayso (bilowgii waa on): intaad xariiq, leydh, goobo ama qaanso sawirayso, qor lambar wuxuu buuxiyaa sanduuqa cabbirka ee jiirka ku xiga (Tab wuxuu gudbaa sanduuqa xiga) iyo Enter wuxuu sawirayaa qaabka cabbirkaas, oo cabbir wadane u dhigan cabbir kasta aad qortay. Dami: qorista lambar intaad sawirayso waa wax aan wax samayn, qaababka waxaa lagu sawiraa gujis kaliya. Eeg Qor cabbirka intaad sawirayso. Kaarka geeska Waxa ku muuqda geeska muuqaalka 3D: Kaarka muuqaalka (bilowga; geeska sare ee midig — guji wejiga, geesaha ama geeska si aad uga eegto, jiid si aad u wareejiso, jiid giraangiraha compass-ka si aad moodeelka u wareejiso), Astaanta tiirka (calaamad yar oo X, Y, Z ah oo geeska hoose ee bidix, oo wareegta muuqaalka: X casaan, Y cagaar, Z buluug) ama Midna. Midna ma muuqdo marka aad sawirayso ama xaashiga naqshadda. Eeg Kaarka muuqaalka. Xalinta threads-ka Tirada threads-ka ee xalinta simulation-ka isticmaali karo. Automatic (bilowga) wuxuu isticmaalaa hal ka yar tirada processor-ka kombiyuutarka (ugu badnaan 16), si bogga u jawaabo intuu xalinayo simulation; ama dooro lambar. Xalinta weyn ee voxel, buckling, stress waqti kasta iyo flow waxay si dhakhso ah ugu xalliyaan threads badan (qiyaastii 2× ee 4 threads ee 80,000 kuub, sida cabbirkeenna ay muujinayaan; wax badan kombiyuutar firaaqo ah). Moodeelada ka yar 20,000 aan la garanayn waxay ku sii jiraan hal thread, sababtoo ah bilaabidda threads-ka waxay ka qaadataa wixii ay badbaadin lahaayeen. Xalka thread-ka leh wuxuu siinayaa isla jawaabta sida hal thread (ilaa xisaabinta: wadarta waxaa lagu daraa siyaabo kala duwan). Natiijo kasta oo simulation ah wuxuu tusayaa N threads ama 1 thread iyo sababta hoosta Solver. Threads-ka waxay u baahan yihiin in bogga noqdo cross-origin isolated (browser-ku wuxuu oggolaanayaa workers inay xusuus wadaagaan markaas kaliya). Bogga lab-ka waa taas; meelaha aanu noqon, dejintu way sheegtaa (\"Bogga ma ahan cross-origin isolated, sidaas darteed solver-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan hal thread, wax kasta oo halkan la doorto aan ahayn.\"), xalkana wuxuu isticmaalaa hal thread. Waxa kale oo shaqeeya siduu u shaqeeyo, jawaabahana isku mid bay yihiin. Daraasadaha socodka laminar-ka ayaa sidoo kale isticmaala threads (qiyaastii 2.5× ee 4 threads ee 54,000 unug fluid), isla jawaab ilaa lambarka ugu dambeeya. Quadratic-tetrahedron solver iyo heat transfer waxay ku shaqeeyaan hal thread: threading-kooda waxaa la cabbiray inay ka daahan yihiin kombiyuutarka tijaabada (xalinteeda waxaa xaddidaya xawaaraha xusuusta iyo tallaabo aan la kala qaybin karin). Server-kaaga gaarka ah Haddii aad PartCraft ka socodsiiso server-kaaga, wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida la adeego. Solver threads-ka, u oggolow server-ka inuu bogga PartCraft-ka u diro laba header: Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp Apache-ka, folder-ka .htaccess (waxay u baahan tahay mod_headers): Header set Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy \"same-origin\" Header set Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy \"require-corp\" nginx-ka, location-ka ee adeega PartCraft: add_header Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy \"same-origin\" always; add_header Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy \"require-corp\" always; Dib u rarso bogga: Dejinta › Solver threads wuxuu bixinayaa Automatic oo tirada kombiyuutarkaaga ah. Header-ka labaad wuxuu browser-ka ka dhigaa inuu diido wax kasta oo bogga ka soo dega goob kale oo aan ogolaan, taas oo wanaagsan PartCraft keligiis (wuxuu wax kasta ka soo dejiyaa folder-kiisa).","lang":"so"},{"slug":"sketch-relations","scope":"partcraft","title":"Xiriirrada iyo cabbirrada naqshadda","summary":"Xiriir kasta iyo cabbir kasta ee naqshadda PartCraft ay leedahay, waxa la doortaa mid kasta, calaamaddiisa, iyo sida uu u dhaqmo markuu xalinayo.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["xiriirro","xannibaado","isku meel","fidsan","istaag","isu-dhigan","xagal-toosan","taabasho","siman","isku-dhexe","bar dhexe","go'aan","masaafo","masaafada aagga","masaafada dhidibka","radius","dhexroor","xagal","calaamado","astaamo"],"headings":[{"id":"xiriirrada","text":"Xiriirrada","level":2},{"id":"cabbirrada","text":"Cabbirrada","level":2},{"id":"sida-xallinta-u-dhaqanto","text":"Sida xallinta u dhaqanto","level":2},{"id":"weli-lama-heli-karo","text":"Weli lama heli karo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EXiriirradu waxay hagaajiyaan sida joomatariga uu ula jiro joomatari kale. Cabbirradu waxay hagaajiyaan baaxadaha. Si aad xiriir u darto, dooro waxyaabaha qalabka Dooro (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oo dooro badhankiisa guddiga midig; si aad cabbir u darto, isticmaal qalabka Cabbirka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ama badhamada cabbirka ee guddiga midig. Sida loo shaqeeyo: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/relations-dimensions\" data-topic=\"partcraft/relations-dimensions\"\u003ENaqshad si buuxda loogu qeexo\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Qalooc&quot; hoosta waxa uu ula jeedaa goobo ama qaanso. Dhibcaha asalka ayaa loo tiriyaa barta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xiriirrada\"\u003EXiriirrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhanka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECalaamadda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDooro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatiijada\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Isku meel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E• (wuxuu muuqdaa kaliya marka la doorto ama dhibaato jirto)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba barood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyinku waa isku kulmaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Isku meel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E•\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar iyo xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta waxay ku taal xariirka (ama dheereynta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E• Isku meel\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E•\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar iyo qalooc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta waxay ku taal goobada ama qaansada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EH Fidsan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EH\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariir, ama laba barood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariirku waa fidsan yahay, ama laba barood waxay isku sarre yihiin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EV Istaag\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EV\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariir, ama laba barood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariirku waa istaag, ama barood mid ka sarreeya kan kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E∥ Isu-dhigan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E∥\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiradu waxay u socdaan isla jihada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⊥ Xagal-toosan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⊥\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiradu waxay isku kulmaan xagal toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ET Taabasho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariir iyo qalooc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariirku wuxuu taabanayaa qalooca isagoo aan gudbin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ET Taabasho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba qalooc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay taabanayaan, dibada ama gudaha, sida la sawiray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ET Taabasho\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ET\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESplayn iyo xariir, qaanso ama splayn ku kulma hal dhamaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESplaynku wuxuu ka baxayaa dhamaadkaas isagoo u socda jihada qalooca kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E= Siman\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E=\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDherer isku mid ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E= Siman\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E=\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba qalooc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadius isku mid ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E◎ Isku-dhexe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E◎\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba qalooc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexe isku mid ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E◎ Isku-dhexe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E◎\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar iyo qalooc\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta waxay ku taal dhexda goobada ama qaansada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EM Bar dhexe\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EM\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar iyo xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarta waxay ku taal bartii dhexe ee xariirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E↔ Isku-ekaan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E↔\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba barood iyo xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBarooyinku waa sawirro isku mid ah oo ku dhegan xariirka (Muraayad ayaa kuwan ku darta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⚓ Hagaaji\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚓\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar, xariir, qalooc ama splayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay hagaajinaysaa meesha ay ku taal hadda (splayn: barooyinkeeda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXariiradda halkan waxaa ku jira khadka dhexe. Sawirku wuxuu kuu darsadaa xiriir qaarkood: isku dhejinta barta wuxuu samaynayaa isku meel, isku dhejinta qalooca wuxuu barta saarayaa qalooca, xariiradda ku dhow fidsan ama istaagga waxay helaan H ama V, afar-geeslaha wuxuu yimaadaa afartiisa geesood oo isku xidhan, laba H iyo laba V.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHagaaji\u003C/strong\u003E waa hab degdeg ah oo lagu joojiyo wax dhaqaaqaya, laakiin qaybtu markaas ma raacayso isbedelka cabbir meel kale. Ku dooro cabbirrada asalka ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cabbirrada\"\u003ECabbirrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhanka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDooro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECabbiraya\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELagu muujiyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFogaanta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhererkiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFogaanta 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFogaanta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba barood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada toosan ee u dhaxaysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFogaanta 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFogaanta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar iyo xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada barta ilaa xariirka, toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFogaanta 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFogaanta\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xariir oo isu-dhigan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexda u dhaxaysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFogaanta 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafada aagga\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba barood, ama xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada jihada bidix-midig oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada aagga 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasaafada dhidibka\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba barood, ama xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada kor-hoos oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada dhidibka 40\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERadius\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobo ama qaanso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadius-keeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadius R10\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDhexroor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobo ama qaanso\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexroorkeeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexroor ⌀20\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXagal\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xariir oo aan isu-dhigan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagasha u dhexaysa, 0 ilaa 180 darajo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal 30°\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka Cabbirka, PartCraft wuxuu doortaa nooca marka aad gujiso iyo meesha aad lambarka dhigto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxaad gujisay\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxaad heleysaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariir keli ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhererkiisa; xariir qiiqsan: fidsan haddii lambarku sare ama hoos uu ka yahay, istaag haddii dhinaca uu ku yaal\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobo keli ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexroor\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaanso keli ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERadius\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba barood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFogaanta; fidsan ama istaag sida xariir qiiqsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar iyo xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFogaanta barta ilaa xariirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xariir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal, ama fogaanta haddii ay isu-dhigan yihiin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBar iyo goobo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba: &quot;Waxyaabahan lama cabbiri karo wada.&quot; Ku cabbir barta dhexe ee goobada halkii\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKala-raris\u003C/strong\u003E (oo lagu muujiyo sida fogaanta) waxaa samaynaya qalabka Kala-raris: wuxuu hayaa xariir la koobiyeeyey oo isu-dhigan masaafadaas, ama qaanso ama goobo la koobiyeeyey oo isku-dhexe, radius-kiisu sidaas u weyn ama yar yahay. Qaybaha kale ee kala-rarista isku mid ah waxay leeyihiin xiriir \u003Cstrong\u003EO\u003C/strong\u003E waxayna raacaan cabbirka Kala-raris keliya. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-tools\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-tools\"\u003ESplaynada, jarista, kala-raris iyo qalabyada kale ee naqshadda\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiimayaasha cabbirka waa millimitir (ama darajo), marna ma noqon karaan kuwo taban. Radius-ka iyo dhexroorku waa inay ka weyn yihiin eber. Qiimaha 0 waa la oggol yahay masaafooyinka: laba barood oo 0 u dhaxeeya waa isku meel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-xallinta-u-dhaqanto\"\u003ESida xallinta u dhaqanto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDhaqdhaqaaq ugu yar.\u003C/strong\u003E Marka qiime la beddelo, xallinta waxay joomatariga u dhaqaajisaa wax ugu yar ee suurtogal ah. Xariir oo dherereeda la beddelo wuxuu kor u kacaa labada dhamaadba isle&#039;eg haddii aan labada dhamaad midkoodna la hayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMa rogmaa.\u003C/strong\u003E Fogaanta barta ilaa xariirka, masaafooyinka fidsan iyo istaagga, xagallada iyo taabashada waxay xasuustaan dhinaca ay ku sameysteen. Beddelka qiime ma rogo joomatariga dhinac kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIsku-dhaca waxba ma beddelo.\u003C/strong\u003E Haddii xiriirradu isku diidaan, naqshaddu waxay ku sii jirtaa sidii ay ahayd, xiriirrada isku-dhaca ahna waxay noqdaan casaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXiriirrada xad-dhaafka ah\u003C/strong\u003E (kuwa laga fahmo kuwa kale) waxaa laga sheegaa status bar-ka (&quot;horey ayaa loo fahmay. Tirtir.&quot;) hadana qaabku wuu dhisaa, digniin ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXidhmooyinka taabashada.\u003C/strong\u003E Meesha qaanso fillet ay xariirradeeda ku kulanto barta dhamaadka wadaagan, taabashada waxaa lagu xallinayaa qaab ka dhigaya mid cad halkaas, sidaas darteed fillet-yada naqshadda ma akhrisan karaan inay xad-dhaaf ku qeexan yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-heli-karo\"\u003EWeli lama heli karo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXiriirrada isku-jir (collinear), isku-dhexe-radius (coradial) iyo godka (pierce); bar ku taal splayn; cabbirrada wadada (tixraac); cabbirrada ordinate iyo dherer qaansada; isla-gelinta u dhaxaysa cabbirrada. Isticmaal Isu-dhigan iyo masaafo 0 xariiro isku-jir ah.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Xiriirradu waxay hagaajiyaan sida joomatariga uu ula jiro joomatari kale. Cabbirradu waxay hagaajiyaan baaxadaha. Si aad xiriir u darto, dooro waxyaabaha qalabka Dooro (S) oo dooro badhankiisa guddiga midig; si aad cabbir u darto, isticmaal qalabka Cabbirka (D) ama badhamada cabbirka ee guddiga midig. Sida loo shaqeeyo: Naqshad si buuxda loogu qeexo. \"Qalooc\" hoosta waxa uu ula jeedaa goobo ama qaanso. Dhibcaha asalka ayaa loo tiriyaa barta. Xiriirrada Badhanka Calaamadda Dooro Natiijada • Isku meel • (wuxuu muuqdaa kaliya marka la doorto ama dhibaato jirto) Laba barood Barooyinku waa isku kulmaan • Isku meel • Bar iyo xariir Barta waxay ku taal xariirka (ama dheereynta) • Isku meel • Bar iyo qalooc Barta waxay ku taal goobada ama qaansada H Fidsan H Xariir, ama laba barood Xariirku waa fidsan yahay, ama laba barood waxay isku sarre yihiin V Istaag V Xariir, ama laba barood Xariirku waa istaag, ama barood mid ka sarreeya kan kale ∥ Isu-dhigan ∥ Laba xariir Xariiradu waxay u socdaan isla jihada ⊥ Xagal-toosan ⊥ Laba xariir Xariiradu waxay isku kulmaan xagal toosan T Taabasho T Xariir iyo qalooc Xariirku wuxuu taabanayaa qalooca isagoo aan gudbin T Taabasho T Laba qalooc Way taabanayaan, dibada ama gudaha, sida la sawiray T Taabasho T Splayn iyo xariir, qaanso ama splayn ku kulma hal dhamaad Splaynku wuxuu ka baxayaa dhamaadkaas isagoo u socda jihada qalooca kale = Siman = Laba xariir Dherer isku mid ah = Siman = Laba qalooc Radius isku mid ah ◎ Isku-dhexe ◎ Laba qalooc Dhexe isku mid ah ◎ Isku-dhexe ◎ Bar iyo qalooc Barta waxay ku taal dhexda goobada ama qaansada M Bar dhexe M Bar iyo xariir Barta waxay ku taal bartii dhexe ee xariirka ↔ Isku-ekaan ↔ Laba barood iyo xariir Barooyinku waa sawirro isku mid ah oo ku dhegan xariirka (Muraayad ayaa kuwan ku darta) ⚓ Hagaaji ⚓ Bar, xariir, qalooc ama splayn Waxay hagaajinaysaa meesha ay ku taal hadda (splayn: barooyinkeeda) Xariiradda halkan waxaa ku jira khadka dhexe. Sawirku wuxuu kuu darsadaa xiriir qaarkood: isku dhejinta barta wuxuu samaynayaa isku meel, isku dhejinta qalooca wuxuu barta saarayaa qalooca, xariiradda ku dhow fidsan ama istaagga waxay helaan H ama V, afar-geeslaha wuxuu yimaadaa afartiisa geesood oo isku xidhan, laba H iyo laba V. Hagaaji waa hab degdeg ah oo lagu joojiyo wax dhaqaaqaya, laakiin qaybtu markaas ma raacayso isbedelka cabbir meel kale. Ku dooro cabbirrada asalka ah. Cabbirrada Badhanka Dooro Cabbiraya Lagu muujiyo Fogaanta Xariir Dhererkiisa Fogaanta 40 Fogaanta Laba barood Masaafada toosan ee u dhaxaysa Fogaanta 40 Fogaanta Bar iyo xariir Masaafada barta ilaa xariirka, toosan Fogaanta 40 Fogaanta Laba xariir oo isu-dhigan Dhexda u dhaxaysa Fogaanta 40 Masaafada aagga Laba barood, ama xariir Masaafada jihada bidix-midig oo keliya Masaafada aagga 40 Masaafada dhidibka Laba barood, ama xariir Masaafada kor-hoos oo keliya Masaafada dhidibka 40 Radius Goobo ama qaanso Radius-keeda Radius R10 Dhexroor Goobo ama qaanso Dhexroorkeeda Dhexroor ⌀20 Xagal Laba xariir oo aan isu-dhigan Xagasha u dhexaysa, 0 ilaa 180 darajo Xagal 30° Qalabka Cabbirka, PartCraft wuxuu doortaa nooca marka aad gujiso iyo meesha aad lambarka dhigto: Waxaad gujisay Waxaad heleysaa Xariir keli ah Dhererkiisa; xariir qiiqsan: fidsan haddii lambarku sare ama hoos uu ka yahay, istaag haddii dhinaca uu ku yaal Goobo keli ah Dhexroor Qaanso keli ah Radius Laba barood Fogaanta; fidsan ama istaag sida xariir qiiqsan Bar iyo xariir Fogaanta barta ilaa xariirka Laba xariir Xagal, ama fogaanta haddii ay isu-dhigan yihiin Bar iyo goobo Waxba: \"Waxyaabahan lama cabbiri karo wada.\" Ku cabbir barta dhexe ee goobada halkii Kala-raris (oo lagu muujiyo sida fogaanta) waxaa samaynaya qalabka Kala-raris: wuxuu hayaa xariir la koobiyeeyey oo isu-dhigan masaafadaas, ama qaanso ama goobo la koobiyeeyey oo isku-dhexe, radius-kiisu sidaas u weyn ama yar yahay. Qaybaha kale ee kala-rarista isku mid ah waxay leeyihiin xiriir O waxayna raacaan cabbirka Kala-raris keliya. Eeg Splaynada, jarista, kala-raris iyo qalabyada kale ee naqshadda. Qiimayaasha cabbirka waa millimitir (ama darajo), marna ma noqon karaan kuwo taban. Radius-ka iyo dhexroorku waa inay ka weyn yihiin eber. Qiimaha 0 waa la oggol yahay masaafooyinka: laba barood oo 0 u dhaxeeya waa isku meel. Sida xallinta u dhaqanto Dhaqdhaqaaq ugu yar. Marka qiime la beddelo, xallinta waxay joomatariga u dhaqaajisaa wax ugu yar ee suurtogal ah. Xariir oo dherereeda la beddelo wuxuu kor u kacaa labada dhamaadba isle'eg haddii aan labada dhamaad midkoodna la hayn. Ma rogmaa. Fogaanta barta ilaa xariirka, masaafooyinka fidsan iyo istaagga, xagallada iyo taabashada waxay xasuustaan dhinaca ay ku sameysteen. Beddelka qiime ma rogo joomatariga dhinac kale. Isku-dhaca waxba ma beddelo. Haddii xiriirradu isku diidaan, naqshaddu waxay ku sii jirtaa sidii ay ahayd, xiriirrada isku-dhaca ahna waxay noqdaan casaan. Xiriirrada xad-dhaafka ah (kuwa laga fahmo kuwa kale) waxaa laga sheegaa status bar-ka (\"horey ayaa loo fahmay. Tirtir.\") hadana qaabku wuu dhisaa, digniin ah. Xidhmooyinka taabashada. Meesha qaanso fillet ay xariirradeeda ku kulanto barta dhamaadka wadaagan, taabashada waxaa lagu xallinayaa qaab ka dhigaya mid cad halkaas, sidaas darteed fillet-yada naqshadda ma akhrisan karaan inay xad-dhaaf ku qeexan yihiin. Weli lama heli karo Xiriirrada isku-jir (collinear), isku-dhexe-radius (coradial) iyo godka (pierce); bar ku taal splayn; cabbirrada wadada (tixraac); cabbirrada ordinate iyo dherer qaansada; isla-gelinta u dhaxaysa cabbirrada. Isticmaal Isu-dhigan iyo masaafo 0 xariiro isku-jir ah.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"features","scope":"partcraft","title":"Feature-yada iyo doorashooyinkooda","summary":"Feature kasta oo ku jira toolbar-ka oo leh dejinteeda, caadiyaadkeeda iyo xaddidaadyadiisa, laga bilaabo extrude ilaa fillet, shell iyo jidhadka STEP ee la soo dhoofiyay, falalka ay wada leeyihiin dhammaan feature-yada, iyo dejinta qaybta.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["features","lama dhisin","extrude","cut","revolve","revolved cut","hole","counterbore","linear pattern","circular pattern","mirror","fillet","chamfer","shell","import","options","defaults","settings","resolution","curves","facets","suppress","rollback"],"headings":[{"id":"sawir-gacmeed","text":"Sawir-gacmeed","level":2},{"id":"extrude-iyo-cut","text":"Extrude iyo Cut","level":2},{"id":"revolve-iyo-revolved-cut","text":"Revolve iyo revolved cut","level":2},{"id":"hole","text":"Hole","level":2},{"id":"linear-pattern","text":"Linear pattern","level":2},{"id":"circular-pattern","text":"Circular pattern","level":2},{"id":"mirror","text":"Mirror","level":2},{"id":"fillet-iyo-chamfer","text":"Fillet iyo Chamfer","level":2},{"id":"shell","text":"Shell","level":2},{"id":"jidh-la-soo-dhoofiyay","text":"Jidh la soo dhoofiyay","level":2},{"id":"falalka-ay-leedahay-feature-kasta","text":"Falalka ay leedahay feature kasta","level":2},{"id":"xaaladaha-taariikhda","text":"Xaaladaha taariikhda","level":2},{"id":"dejinta-qaybta","text":"Dejinta qaybta","level":2},{"id":"go-aaminta-qalloocyada","text":"Go'aaminta qalloocyada","level":3},{"id":"weli-lama-dhisin","text":"Weli lama dhisin","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EFeatures-ka waxay ku liisan yihiin taariikhda by sida loo sameeyay, waxayna u dhismaan sare ilaa hoos. Mid kasta waxaa loo magacaabaa nooceeda iyo lambar: Sketch1, Extrude1, Revolve1, Hole1, LPattern1, CirPattern1, Mirror1, Fillet1, Chamfer1, Shell1, Imported1.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu feature kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel-ka. Fillet iyo Chamfer waxay ku shaqeeyaan geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejood oo toosan, Shell wuxuu furaa wejiyada toosan. Jidhadka la soo dhoofiyay waxay u baahan yihiin kernel saxda ah, kaas oo nooca hadda aanu lahayn: lama dhisin weli, qaybtooda hoose waxay tilmaamaan qayb ka dhisan nooc hore oo ka sii hadhay. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EMesh kernel-ka\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawir-gacmeed\"\u003ESawir-gacmeed\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoraal\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPlane\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFront, Top ama Right plane, ama wejig toosan. Waa la muujiyaa, lama beddelo: si aad u dhaqaajiso sawir-gacmeed, samee mid cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EState\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFully defined, Under defined (oo leh degrees of freedom), Over defined, ama Empty\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeometry, Relations\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImmisa qallooc, barta iyo xiriirka ayaa jira\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDriving dimensions\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir kasta oo sawir-gacmeedka ah, oo la tafatiri karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhamada: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax ka beddel sawir-gacmeedka\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EU dhoofi DXF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"extrude-iyo-cut\"\u003EExtrude iyo Cut\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoo saar\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGoo\u003C/span\u003E waxay sameeyaan isla feature-ka, oo ka bilaabma dejin kala duwan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EExtrude wuxuu ka bilaabmaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECut wuxuu ka bilaabmaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHawlgal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss (ku dar agab), Cut (ka saar agab), Intersect (hay&#039;ad isku dhafan), New body (weli lama dhisin nooca hadda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhamaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeer ah (qoto), Dhexda naqshadda (labada dhinac), Dhammaan oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeer ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhammaan oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoto (mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa weyn 0, ilaa 1,000,000\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERogi jihada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff / on\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProfile: loop kasta oo xidhan oo xariiqyo adag, goobo iyo qaansooyin ku jira sawir-gacmeedka. Loop-yada gudaha loop-yada kale waa godad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThrough all wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya goynta. Wuxuu gaadhaa qaybta oo dhan dhinaca la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGoynta waxay gashaa agabka, ka fogaato dhinaca dibadda ee qorshaha sawir-gacmeedka; Reverse wuu rogaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"revolve-iyo-revolved-cut\"\u003ERevolve iyo revolved cut\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHawlgal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss, Cut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWareeg\u003C/span\u003E), Cut (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWax dheeraad ah\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJar wareeg\u003C/span\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal (°)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa weyn 0, ilaa 360\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E360\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqa dhexe ee ugu horreysa, xariiq ama xariiqa dhexe ee sawir-gacmeedka, ama feature tiir ah oo ku jirta qorshaha sawir-gacmeedka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqa dhexe ee ugu horreysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProfile-ku wuxuu ku sii jiraa hal dhinac oo tiirka ah. Wuu taaban karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiirka revolve-ka waxaa isticmaali kara Circular patterns iyo xidhka isku-dhisnaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hole\"\u003EHole\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENooca\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESimple, Counterbore\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESimple\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhexroor (mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa weyn 0\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThrough all\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOn / off\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoto (mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkii Through all uu off yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECounterbore ⌀\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa ballaadhan godka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E11\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQotada counterbore-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa hooseeya godka heer ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERogi jihada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff / on\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGod kasta barta barar kala go&#039; ah ee sawir-gacmeedka (barta lagu sameeyay qalabka Point). Panelku wuxuu tusaa tirada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGodadku waxay dhex galaan agabka, toosan sawir-gacmeedka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiirka god kasta waxaa isticmaali kara xidhka isku-dhisnaha (&quot;Hole1, hole 2&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"linear-pattern\"\u003ELinear pattern\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeatures to copy\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeature-yada jidhka ah ee ka sarreeya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeature-ka la doortay, haddii kale feature-ka jidhka ah ee ugu dambeeya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJihada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EX axis, Y axis, Z axis; xariiq sawir-gacmeed hore; tiirka revolve; geesta la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EX axis (ama geesta la doortay markii lagu daray)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasaafada (mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELambar kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ilaa 1000, oo ku jira kii asalka ahaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERogi jihada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff / on\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"circular-pattern\"\u003ECircular pattern\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeatures to copy\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida Linear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida Linear\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESida Jihada kor ku taxan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiirka revolve-ka ugu dambeeya, haddii kale tiirka Y (ama geesta la doortay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXagal (°)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa weyn 0, ilaa 360. 360 wuxuu nuqullada u kala fogeeyaa si siman meel walba; ka yar wuxuu ku kala firdhiyaa xagalkaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E360\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 ilaa 1000, oo ku jira kii asalka ahaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERogi jihada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff / on\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mirror\"\u003EMirror\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMirror\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidhka oo dhan (sida hadda loo dhisay), ama feature la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeature-ka la doortay, haddii kale jidhka oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorshaha muraayadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFront, Top ama Right plane; wejig toosan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight plane, ama wejigii toosan ee la doortay markii lagu daray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fillet-iyo-chamfer\"\u003EFillet iyo Chamfer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca hadda, mesh kernel-ka wuxuu ku dhisaa geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejood oo toosan (geesaha dibadda ama gudaha), oo leh hal radius. Geesta wareegsan waxay tidhi &quot;Fillet: in this version only straight edges between two flat faces (the mesh kernel builds them). Round or bevel curved edges in the sketch.&quot;; halka geesaha wareegsan ay kulmaan geesta, waa la gees-jarayaa, feature-kuna waa digaa &quot;Fillet by the mesh kernel: where rounded edges meet they are mitred, not blended.&quot; Noocyada chamfer-ka oo dhan (masaafo siman, laba masaafo, masaafo iyo xagal, iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EFlip sides\u003C/strong\u003E) way shaqeeyaan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EWareeg, bevel iyo god\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFillet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERadius (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E (Fillet), caadi 2\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMasaafada (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E (Chamfer), caadi 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGeesaha\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImmisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImmisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro geesaha ka hor intaadan doorannin badhanka (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+guji geesaha dhowr), ama dooro isagoo aan wax la doorannin, kadibna guji geesaha ka dib.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro geesaha\u003C/span\u003E (ama laba-jeer guji feature-ka) wuxuu beddelaa geesaha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesaha waxaa lagu xusaa laba wejiga ay isku xirayaan, sidaas darteed waxay ku sii jiraan marka cabbirrada hore loo beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shell\"\u003EShell\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMesh kernel-ka ayaa dhisa. Kaliya wejiyada toosan ayaa la furi karaa (&quot;Shell: in this version it opens flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).&quot;); qaro kala duwan oo darbiyada ah weli lama dhisin. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\" data-topic=\"partcraft/fillet-chamfer-shell\"\u003EWareeg, bevel iyo god\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbiga (mm)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa weyn 0\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbiyadu dibadda ayay ka korayaan (wejiyadu gudaha ayay ku sii jiraan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff: darbiyadu gudaha ayay u galaan. On: dibadda ayay u baxaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOff\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada la saaray, ugu yaraan hal, oo leh \u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada la doortay markii lagu daray\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDooro wejiyada\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu beddelaa wejiyada furan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"jidh-la-soo-dhoofiyay\"\u003EJidh la soo dhoofiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaa la sameeyay isagoo furaya faylka STEP, STL, OBJ ama 3MF: jidh adag oo ka kooban saddex-geesood aan taariikh u lahayn (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EFur faylka STEP\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EFur STL, OBJ ama 3MF\u003C/a\u003E). Wuxuu tusaa faylka uu ka yimid iyo waxa ay import-ku hagaajiyay; \u003Cstrong\u003EUnits in the file\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EUp in the file\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EUse it to\u003C/strong\u003E waxay ku sii jiraan tafatir. Jidh STEP ah oo lagu soo dhoofiyay dhisme hore oo leh kernel saxda ah wuxuu ku sii jiraa taariikhda oo lagu calaamadiyay inaan la dhisin; fur faylka STEP mar kale si aad ugu soo dhoofiso saddex-geesood.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDoorashooyinka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECaadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUp in the file\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ sare (CAD badan), Y sare\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ sare\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPatterns iyo mirror waxay koobiyeyn karaan jidh la soo dhoofiyay, laakiin ma koobiyeyn karaan fillet, chamfer ama shell.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"falalka-ay-leedahay-feature-kasta\"\u003EFalalka ay leedahay feature kasta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHoosta panelka feature kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBadhanka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoojiso\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u dhis\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDemi ama fur. Features-ka u baahan ayaa lama dhisin marka uu demay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu celi halkan\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dhis kaliya features-ka ka sarreeya kan; features cusub waxay galaan rollback bar-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKor u dhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHoos u dhaqaaq\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u habee, marka wax ay isticmaalayo aanay hoos ugu dhicin. Haddii kale waa madow sababta lagu sheegay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETirtir\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir, iyo (kadib su&#039;aal) feature kasta oo isticmaala\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagaca beddel (ilaa 60 xaraf)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFeatures-ka leh sawir-gacmeed sidoo kale waxay liistaan \u003Cstrong\u003ECabbirrada naqshadda\u003C/strong\u003E, oo lagu tafatiri karo meesha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xaaladaha-taariikhda\"\u003EXaaladaha taariikhda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXaaladda\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELagu muujiyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMacnaha\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuilt\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECaadi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWax walba waa fiican\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWarning\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa dhisay, laakiin wax la hubiyo: &quot;Over defined: 1 relation is not needed.&quot; ama &quot;Nothing is left of the part after this.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EError\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠ error, casaan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama dhisi karo; fariintu waxay sheegaysaa sababta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot built\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E⚠ not built\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu u baahan yahay feature fashilmay, la demay ama dib loo celiyay, ama kernel saxda ah oo nooca hadda aanu lahayn (&quot;Sweep: not built yet. …&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESuppressed\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELa demay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERolled back\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emadow, ka hooseeya rollback bar-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama dhisin ilaa aad dib u socon\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dejinta-qaybta\"\u003EDejinta qaybta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji meel bannaan si waxba aan loo dooran. Panelka midig wuxuu tusaa \u003Cstrong\u003EPart\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EName\u003C/strong\u003E: magaca qaybta, oo loo isticmaalo magacyada faylalka iyo blokka cinwaanka naqshadda (ilaa 120 xaraf).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E: eeg hoos.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"go-aaminta-qalloocyada\"\u003EGo&#039;aaminta qalloocyada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMesh kernel-ka wuxuu dhisaa jidhka isagu wejiyo toosan oo yar, sidaas darteed muuqaalka, STL, 3MF, STEP-ka wejiyo, mugga iyo muuqaalada naqshadda oo dhan waxay raacaan \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E: immisa facet ayaa wareeg buuxa ku jira.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFacets wareeg kasta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMugga qaab wareegsan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaro weyn (32 wareeg kasta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E32\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaastii 0.64 % ka hooseeya qiimaha run ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECaadi (64 wareeg kasta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E64\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaastii 0.16 % ka hooseeya (caadi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFiican (128 wareeg kasta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E128\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaastii 0.04 % ka hooseeya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAad u fiican (256 wareeg kasta)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E256\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiyaastii 0.01 % ka hooseeya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalloocyada fiican waxay bixiyaan dhoofin iyo muuqaal siman, laakiin dib u dhisku wuu gaabinayaa. Dejintu waxay ku kaydsan tahay faylka qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-lama-dhisin\"\u003EWeli lama dhisin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFillet-yada radius-ka kala duwan, fillet-yada iyo chamfer-yada geesaha wareegsan, shell-yada ee furaya wejiyada wareegsan, draft-ka wejiyada wareegsan, sweep, loft, rib, jidhadka STEP ee leh wejiyo wareegsan oo saxda ah, jidhad cusub, taper-yada, &quot;ilaa&quot; wejig ama geesta, iyo tixraacyada wejiyada iyo geesaha jidhka oo dhan waxay u baahan yihiin kernel saxda ah, oo nooca hadda ma leh. Sidoo kale weli lama dhisin: godadka la xaqiijiyay iyo kuwa countersink-ka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Features-ka waxay ku liisan yihiin taariikhda by sida loo sameeyay, waxayna u dhismaan sare ilaa hoos. Mid kasta waxaa loo magacaabaa nooceeda iyo lambar: Sketch1, Extrude1, Revolve1, Hole1, LPattern1, CirPattern1, Mirror1, Fillet1, Chamfer1, Shell1, Imported1. PartCraft wuxuu feature kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel-ka. Fillet iyo Chamfer waxay ku shaqeeyaan geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejood oo toosan, Shell wuxuu furaa wejiyada toosan. Jidhadka la soo dhoofiyay waxay u baahan yihiin kernel saxda ah, kaas oo nooca hadda aanu lahayn: lama dhisin weli, qaybtooda hoose waxay tilmaamaan qayb ka dhisan nooc hore oo ka sii hadhay. Eeg Mesh kernel-ka iyo Waxa weli aan la dhisin. Sawir-gacmeed Dejinta Qoraal Plane Front, Top ama Right plane, ama wejig toosan. Waa la muujiyaa, lama beddelo: si aad u dhaqaajiso sawir-gacmeed, samee mid cusub State Fully defined, Under defined (oo leh degrees of freedom), Over defined, ama Empty Geometry, Relations Immisa qallooc, barta iyo xiriirka ayaa jira Driving dimensions Cabbir kasta oo sawir-gacmeedka ah, oo la tafatiri karo Badhamada: Wax ka beddel sawir-gacmeedka, U dhoofi DXF. Extrude iyo Cut Soo saar iyo Goo waxay sameeyaan isla feature-ka, oo ka bilaabma dejin kala duwan. Dejinta Doorashooyinka Extrude wuxuu ka bilaabmaa Cut wuxuu ka bilaabmaa Hawlgal Boss (ku dar agab), Cut (ka saar agab), Intersect (hay'ad isku dhafan), New body (weli lama dhisin nooca hadda) Boss Cut Dhamaad Heer ah (qoto), Dhexda naqshadda (labada dhinac), Dhammaan oo dhan Heer ah Dhammaan oo dhan Qoto (mm) Ka weyn 0, ilaa 1,000,000 10 10 Rogi jihada Off / on Off Off Profile: loop kasta oo xidhan oo xariiqyo adag, goobo iyo qaansooyin ku jira sawir-gacmeedka. Loop-yada gudaha loop-yada kale waa godad. Through all wuxuu shaqeeyaa kaliya goynta. Wuxuu gaadhaa qaybta oo dhan dhinaca la doortay. Goynta waxay gashaa agabka, ka fogaato dhinaca dibadda ee qorshaha sawir-gacmeedka; Reverse wuu rogaa. Revolve iyo revolved cut Dejinta Doorashooyinka Caadi Hawlgal Boss, Cut Boss (Wareeg), Cut (Wax dheeraad ah › Jar wareeg) Xagal (°) Ka weyn 0, ilaa 360 360 Tiir Xariiqa dhexe ee ugu horreysa, xariiq ama xariiqa dhexe ee sawir-gacmeedka, ama feature tiir ah oo ku jirta qorshaha sawir-gacmeedka Xariiqa dhexe ee ugu horreysa Profile-ku wuxuu ku sii jiraa hal dhinac oo tiirka ah. Wuu taaban karaa. Tiirka revolve-ka waxaa isticmaali kara Circular patterns iyo xidhka isku-dhisnaha. Hole Dejinta Doorashooyinka Caadi Nooca Simple, Counterbore Simple Dhexroor (mm) Ka weyn 0 6 Through all On / off On Qoto (mm) Markii Through all uu off yahay 10 Counterbore ⌀ Ka ballaadhan godka 11 Qotada counterbore-ka Ka hooseeya godka heer ah 6 Rogi jihada Off / on Off God kasta barta barar kala go' ah ee sawir-gacmeedka (barta lagu sameeyay qalabka Point). Panelku wuxuu tusaa tirada. Godadku waxay dhex galaan agabka, toosan sawir-gacmeedka. Tiirka god kasta waxaa isticmaali kara xidhka isku-dhisnaha (\"Hole1, hole 2\"). Linear pattern Dejinta Doorashooyinka Caadi Features to copy Feature-yada jidhka ah ee ka sarreeya Feature-ka la doortay, haddii kale feature-ka jidhka ah ee ugu dambeeya Jihada X axis, Y axis, Z axis; xariiq sawir-gacmeed hore; tiirka revolve; geesta la doortay X axis (ama geesta la doortay markii lagu daray) Masaafada (mm) Lambar kasta 20 Tirada 1 ilaa 1000, oo ku jira kii asalka ahaa 3 Rogi jihada Off / on Off Circular pattern Dejinta Doorashooyinka Caadi Features to copy Sida Linear Sida Linear Tiir Sida Jihada kor ku taxan Tiirka revolve-ka ugu dambeeya, haddii kale tiirka Y (ama geesta la doortay) Xagal (°) Ka weyn 0, ilaa 360. 360 wuxuu nuqullada u kala fogeeyaa si siman meel walba; ka yar wuxuu ku kala firdhiyaa xagalkaas 360 Tirada 1 ilaa 1000, oo ku jira kii asalka ahaa 6 Rogi jihada Off / on Off Mirror Dejinta Doorashooyinka Caadi Mirror Jidhka oo dhan (sida hadda loo dhisay), ama feature la doortay Feature-ka la doortay, haddii kale jidhka oo dhan Qorshaha muraayadda Front, Top ama Right plane; wejig toosan Right plane, ama wejigii toosan ee la doortay markii lagu daray Fillet iyo Chamfer Nooca hadda, mesh kernel-ka wuxuu ku dhisaa geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya laba wejood oo toosan (geesaha dibadda ama gudaha), oo leh hal radius. Geesta wareegsan waxay tidhi \"Fillet: in this version only straight edges between two flat faces (the mesh kernel builds them). Round or bevel curved edges in the sketch.\"; halka geesaha wareegsan ay kulmaan geesta, waa la gees-jarayaa, feature-kuna waa digaa \"Fillet by the mesh kernel: where rounded edges meet they are mitred, not blended.\" Noocyada chamfer-ka oo dhan (masaafo siman, laba masaafo, masaafo iyo xagal, iyo Flip sides) way shaqeeyaan. Eeg Wareeg, bevel iyo god. Dejinta Fillet Chamfer Cabbirka Radius (mm) (Fillet), caadi 2 Masaafada (mm) (Chamfer), caadi 1 Geesaha Immisa Immisa Dooro geesaha ka hor intaadan doorannin badhanka (Shift+guji geesaha dhowr), ama dooro isagoo aan wax la doorannin, kadibna guji geesaha ka dib. Dooro geesaha (ama laba-jeer guji feature-ka) wuxuu beddelaa geesaha. Geesaha waxaa lagu xusaa laba wejiga ay isku xirayaan, sidaas darteed waxay ku sii jiraan marka cabbirrada hore loo beddelo. Shell Mesh kernel-ka ayaa dhisa. Kaliya wejiyada toosan ayaa la furi karaa (\"Shell: in this version it opens flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).\"); qaro kala duwan oo darbiyada ah weli lama dhisin. Eeg Wareeg, bevel iyo god. Dejinta Doorashooyinka Caadi Darbiga (mm) Ka weyn 0 2 Darbiyadu dibadda ayay ka korayaan (wejiyadu gudaha ayay ku sii jiraan) Off: darbiyadu gudaha ayay u galaan. On: dibadda ayay u baxaan Off Wejiyada furan Wejiyada la saaray, ugu yaraan hal, oo leh Ka saar Wejiyada la doortay markii lagu daray Dooro wejiyada wuxuu beddelaa wejiyada furan. Jidh la soo dhoofiyay Waxaa la sameeyay isagoo furaya faylka STEP, STL, OBJ ama 3MF: jidh adag oo ka kooban saddex-geesood aan taariikh u lahayn (Fur faylka STEP, Fur STL, OBJ ama 3MF). Wuxuu tusaa faylka uu ka yimid iyo waxa ay import-ku hagaajiyay; Units in the file, Up in the file iyo Use it to waxay ku sii jiraan tafatir. Jidh STEP ah oo lagu soo dhoofiyay dhisme hore oo leh kernel saxda ah wuxuu ku sii jiraa taariikhda oo lagu calaamadiyay inaan la dhisin; fur faylka STEP mar kale si aad ugu soo dhoofiso saddex-geesood. Dejinta Doorashooyinka Caadi Up in the file Z sare (CAD badan), Y sare Z sare Patterns iyo mirror waxay koobiyeyn karaan jidh la soo dhoofiyay, laakiin ma koobiyeyn karaan fillet, chamfer ama shell. Falalka ay leedahay feature kasta Hoosta panelka feature kasta: Badhanka Waxa uu sameeyaa Joojiso / Dib u dhis Demi ama fur. Features-ka u baahan ayaa lama dhisin marka uu demay Ku celi halkan Ku dhis kaliya features-ka ka sarreeya kan; features cusub waxay galaan rollback bar-ka Kor u dhaqaaq / Hoos u dhaqaaq Dib u habee, marka wax ay isticmaalayo aanay hoos ugu dhicin. Haddii kale waa madow sababta lagu sheegay Tirtir Tirtir, iyo (kadib su'aal) feature kasta oo isticmaala Magac Magaca beddel (ilaa 60 xaraf) Features-ka leh sawir-gacmeed sidoo kale waxay liistaan Cabbirrada naqshadda, oo lagu tafatiri karo meesha. Xaaladaha taariikhda Xaaladda Lagu muujiyo Macnaha Built Caadi Wax walba waa fiican Warning ⚠ La dhisay, laakiin wax la hubiyo: \"Over defined: 1 relation is not needed.\" ama \"Nothing is left of the part after this.\" Error ⚠ error, casaan Lama dhisi karo; fariintu waxay sheegaysaa sababta Not built ⚠ not built Wuxuu u baahan yahay feature fashilmay, la demay ama dib loo celiyay, ama kernel saxda ah oo nooca hadda aanu lahayn (\"Sweep: not built yet. …\") Suppressed off La demay Rolled back madow, ka hooseeya rollback bar-ka Lama dhisin ilaa aad dib u socon Dejinta qaybta Guji meel bannaan si waxba aan loo dooran. Panelka midig wuxuu tusaa Part: Name: magaca qaybta, oo loo isticmaalo magacyada faylalka iyo blokka cinwaanka naqshadda (ilaa 120 xaraf). Curves: eeg hoos. Go'aaminta qalloocyada Mesh kernel-ka wuxuu dhisaa jidhka isagu wejiyo toosan oo yar, sidaas darteed muuqaalka, STL, 3MF, STEP-ka wejiyo, mugga iyo muuqaalada naqshadda oo dhan waxay raacaan Qalloocyada: immisa facet ayaa wareeg buuxa ku jira. Dejinta Facets wareeg kasta Mugga qaab wareegsan Qaro weyn (32 wareeg kasta) 32 Qiyaastii 0.64 % ka hooseeya qiimaha run ah Caadi (64 wareeg kasta) 64 Qiyaastii 0.16 % ka hooseeya (caadi) Fiican (128 wareeg kasta) 128 Qiyaastii 0.04 % ka hooseeya Aad u fiican (256 wareeg kasta) 256 Qiyaastii 0.01 % ka hooseeya Qalloocyada fiican waxay bixiyaan dhoofin iyo muuqaal siman, laakiin dib u dhisku wuu gaabinayaa. Dejintu waxay ku kaydsan tahay faylka qaybta. Weli lama dhisin Fillet-yada radius-ka kala duwan, fillet-yada iyo chamfer-yada geesaha wareegsan, shell-yada ee furaya wejiyada wareegsan, draft-ka wejiyada wareegsan, sweep, loft, rib, jidhadka STEP ee leh wejiyo wareegsan oo saxda ah, jidhad cusub, taper-yada, \"ilaa\" wejig ama geesta, iyo tixraacyada wejiyada iyo geesaha jidhka oo dhan waxay u baahan yihiin kernel saxda ah, oo nooca hadda ma leh. Sidoo kale weli lama dhisin: godadka la xaqiijiyay iyo kuwa countersink-ka. Eeg Waxa weli aan la dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"file-formats","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qaababka faylalka","summary":"Dhammaan faylalka PartCraft akhriyo oo qoro, oo leh kordhinta, cabbirrada, jihooyinka iyo waxa mid kasta hayo ama lumiyo.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["qaababka","noocyada faylalka","kordhinta","usd","usdz","3dm","ifc","bim","partcraft.json","partcraft-asm.json","stl","3mf","obj","mesh","step","stp","ap242","dxf","r12","pdf","gltf","obj","iges","units","z up"],"headings":[{"id":"faylalka-partcraft","text":"Faylalka PartCraft","level":2},{"id":"facets-iyo-saxnaanta","text":"Facets iyo saxnaanta","level":2},{"id":"lama-taageero-dhismahan","text":"Lama taageero dhismahan","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKordhinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFuro\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKaydi ama dhoofi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECabbirka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EJihada sare\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWuxuu hayaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaariikhda oo dhan: sawir-gacmeedyada, xiriirada, cabbirrada, features, demidda, rollback, dejinta qalloocyada, dejinta naqshadda iyo GD&amp;T, qoraalka STEP ee la soo dhoofiyay dhisme hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-dhisnaha PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft-asm.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi\u003C/span\u003E isku-dhisnaha dhexdiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb kasta (ku jirta), nuqullada iyo meelahooda, xidhka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL (binary ama text)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.stl\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa, sida jidh saddex-geesood: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EFur STL, OBJ ama 3MF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTL, daabacaadda 3D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm (la weydiiyo markii la furo)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya saddex-geesoodka jidhka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3MF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa, sida jidh adag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3MF, daabacaadda 3D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm (faylka ku sheegan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidhka sida hal mesh object\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOBJ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.obj\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa, sida jidh adag (wejiyo kaliya)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ela weydiiyo markii la furo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ ama Y\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP (AP203, AP214, AP242)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stp\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa, sida jidh adag oo loo akhriyo saddex-geesood (wejiyada wareegsan waxay u muuqdaan facets; wejiyada toosan, silinderyada, koonnada, kubbadaha iyo torusyada faylka ayaa la hayaa dhoofinta saxda ah): \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EFur faylka STEP\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm (cabbirka faylka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ, ama Y haddii aad sheegto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidhadka iyo jidhadka dusha, isku-dhisnaha oo qayb kasta ku jirta meesheeda; midab, magac, geed isku-dhisnaha ama PMI ma jiraan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHaa, sida jidh adag oo ka yimid meshes-kiisa iyo dusha (meshes la kaydiyay, ama tessellated): \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003EFur moodel .3dm\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirka faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ, ama Y haddii aad sheegto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeshes, polysurfaces, extrusions iyo meelaynta block-yada oo jidh keliya; curves, midab, layers ama magac ma jiraan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP AP242, saxda ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (jidh adag oo saxda ah)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidh adag oo saxda ah: wejiyo toosan, silinderyo, koonno, kubbado iyo torusyo wejigooda run ah, wareegyo run ah iyo geesaha toosan sida edges; dhinacyada spline-ka, xarka la moodeelay, jidhadka mesh-ka iyo wejiyada spline-ka STEP waxay ku sii jiraan facets. STEP-ka loo isticmaalo barnaamijyada CAD iyo CAM kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP AP214, saxda ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (jidh adag oo saxda ah)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla jidhka saxda ah ee schema-ga hore AP214, barnaamijyada kaliya akhriya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP AP242, faceted\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidh xidhan oo wejiyo toosan: dusha wareegsan facets. Barnaamij diida faylka saxda ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP AP214, faceted\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (xabbado, kernel-ka mesh)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsla jidhka schema-ga hore AP214, barnaamijyada kaliya akhriya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXidhmada USD\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXidhmada USD (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidhka agabkiisa, mugga iyo miisaanka; isku-dhisnaha qayb kasta mar, iyo nuqul kasta oo la meeleeyay: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"partcraft/usd\"\u003EDhoofi sida USD\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIFC 4\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.ifc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIFC 4 (oo leh dhammaan sifooyinka)\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka saddex-geesood, agabka, cabbir kasta, blokka cinwaanka, tirooyinka; qaybaha isku-dhisnaha nooc ahaan iyo nuqullada la meeleeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDXF R12, sawir-gacmeed\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah\u003C/span\u003E markii sawir-gacmeed la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeedka x, y gudaheeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXariiqyo, qaansooyin run ah iyo goobo, barar; layers PROFILE, CONSTRUCTION, POINTS\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDXF R12, wejig\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.dxf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah\u003C/span\u003E markii wejig toosan la doortay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejigga x, y gudaheeda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka wejiga: godadka wareegsan sida goobo run ah, inta kale sida polyline xidhan (geesaha wareegsan sida facets)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshadda PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENaqshad (PDF): muuqaallada, qaybta, faahfaahinta, GD&amp;T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emm xaashi A3 ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHore, sare, midig, isometric, muuqaallada qaybta iyo faahfaahinta oo laga sameeyay facets, khadadka qarsan, cabbirrada guud, calaamadaha GD&amp;T, blokka cinwaanka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalka-partcraft\"\u003EFaylalka PartCraft\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELabaduba waa qoraal caadi ah (JSON). Jidhka ma kaydsana: PartCraft wuu dib u dhisaa taariikhda, sidaas darteed faylalku waa yaryar oo had iyo jeer waxay la mid yihiin taariikhda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFayl kasta wuxuu leeyahay lambar nooc. Dhismahan wuxuu qoraa fayl kasta nooca ugu hooseeya ee hayo waxa uu isticmaalo (2 ilaa 5; jidh ka yimid mesh wuxuu u baahan yahay 5) wuxuuna furaa noocyada hore oo dhan. Fayl ka yimid PartCraft cusub waa la diidaa, fariinta oo magacaabaysa labada nooc.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQiime kasta waa la hubiyaa markii fayl la furayo. Magacyada waxay lumiyaan xarfaha xakamaynta; tirooyinka aan xadka ku jirin, tixraacyada features-ka maqan iyo noocyada feature-ka aan la aqoonsan karin waa la diidaa, sabab fudud oo lagu sheegay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHa tafatirin faylalkan gacanta haddii aanad ogayn qaabka. Faylka aan ku guuldareysan hubinta ma furmi doono.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaybta leh STEP solid oo weyn oo la soo dhoofiyay dhisme hore wuxuu dhaafi karaa 50 MB, taas oo ah inta PartCraft furi karo sida fayl qayb (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/troubleshooting#file-problems\" data-topic=\"partcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"file-problems\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"facets-iyo-saxnaanta\"\u003EFacets iyo saxnaanta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESTL iyo 3MF had iyo jeer waxay ka samaysan yihiin facets, dejinta \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E ku salaysan, oo sidaas oo kale ayuu yahay face DXF marka laga reebo godadka wareegsan, oo ah goobo run ah. Sawir-gacmeedka DXF wuxuu leeyahay qaansooyin iyo goobo run ah, sababtoo ah wuxuu si toos ah uga yimid sawir-gacmeedka. Dhismahan wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel-ka, sidaas darteed muuqaallada naqshadda (oo ay ku jiraan qaybaha) sidoo kale waa facets. Dhoofinta STEP ee saxda ah waa kaliya ka reebsan: kernel-ku wuxuu ka yaqaanaa wejig kasta dhabta ah sawir-gacmeedka (ama faylka STEP ee jidhka laga furay), sidaas darteed wejiyada wareegsan waxay u qoran yihiin silinder, koonn, kubbad iyo torus oo run ah, si kasta oo \u003Cstrong\u003EQalloocyada\u003C/strong\u003E loo dejiyey (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files#for-other-cad-programs-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\" data-hash=\"for-other-cad-programs-step\"\u003EDhoofinta daabacaadda, STEP iyo DXF\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lama-taageero-dhismahan\"\u003ELama taageero dhismahan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQaabka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXaaladda\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EglTF, IGES, Parasolid, ACIS (gelin ama dhoofin); OBJ dhoofin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama dhisin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDWG\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003Evariant pack-ka\u003C/a\u003E ayaa qoraa, sida xaashi naqshad oo qaab kasta. Lama akhrin, dhoofin kale ma jiro. Dhoofi DXF; dhammaan barnaamijyada CAD waxay furaan DXF R12\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP isku-dhisnaha iyo naqshadda isku-dhisnaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeli lama dhisin. Dhoofi qayb kasta sida STEP saxda ah; STL, 3MF iyo liiska walxaha ayaa laga dhoofin karaa isku-dhisnaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaababka asalka ah ee barnaamijyada kale ee qaybaha iyo isku-dhisnaha (marka laga reebo \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E, oo furma sida hal jidh)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama dhisin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa weli aan la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Qaabka Kordhinta Furo Kaydi ama dhoofi Cabbirka Jihada sare Wuxuu hayaa Qaybta PartCraft .partcraft.json Haa Kaydi mm Y Taariikhda oo dhan: sawir-gacmeedyada, xiriirada, cabbirrada, features, demidda, rollback, dejinta qalloocyada, dejinta naqshadda iyo GD&T, qoraalka STEP ee la soo dhoofiyay dhisme hore Isku-dhisnaha PartCraft .partcraft-asm.json Haa Kaydi isku-dhisnaha dhexdiisa mm Y Qayb kasta (ku jirta), nuqullada iyo meelahooda, xidhka STL (binary ama text) .stl Haa, sida jidh saddex-geesood: Fur STL, OBJ ama 3MF STL, daabacaadda 3D mm (la weydiiyo markii la furo) Z Kaliya saddex-geesoodka jidhka 3MF .3mf Haa, sida jidh adag 3MF, daabacaadda 3D mm (faylka ku sheegan) Z Jidhka sida hal mesh object OBJ .obj Haa, sida jidh adag (wejiyo kaliya) Maya la weydiiyo markii la furo Z ama Y STEP (AP203, AP214, AP242) .step, .stp Haa, sida jidh adag oo loo akhriyo saddex-geesood (wejiyada wareegsan waxay u muuqdaan facets; wejiyada toosan, silinderyada, koonnada, kubbadaha iyo torusyada faylka ayaa la hayaa dhoofinta saxda ah): Fur faylka STEP mm (cabbirka faylka) Z, ama Y haddii aad sheegto Jidhadka iyo jidhadka dusha, isku-dhisnaha oo qayb kasta ku jirta meesheeda; midab, magac, geed isku-dhisnaha ama PMI ma jiraan .3dm .3dm Haa, sida jidh adag oo ka yimid meshes-kiisa iyo dusha (meshes la kaydiyay, ama tessellated): Fur moodel .3dm Cabbirka faylka Z, ama Y haddii aad sheegto Meshes, polysurfaces, extrusions iyo meelaynta block-yada oo jidh keliya; curves, midab, layers ama magac ma jiraan STEP AP242, saxda ah .step STEP AP242 (jidh adag oo saxda ah) mm Z Jidh adag oo saxda ah: wejiyo toosan, silinderyo, koonno, kubbado iyo torusyo wejigooda run ah, wareegyo run ah iyo geesaha toosan sida edges; dhinacyada spline-ka, xarka la moodeelay, jidhadka mesh-ka iyo wejiyada spline-ka STEP waxay ku sii jiraan facets. STEP-ka loo isticmaalo barnaamijyada CAD iyo CAM kale STEP AP214, saxda ah .step STEP AP214 (jidh adag oo saxda ah) mm Z Isla jidhka saxda ah ee schema-ga hore AP214, barnaamijyada kaliya akhriya STEP AP242, faceted .step STEP (fasedyo, kernel-ka mesh) mm Y Jidh xidhan oo wejiyo toosan: dusha wareegsan facets. Barnaamij diida faylka saxda ah STEP AP214, faceted .step STEP AP214 (xabbado, kernel-ka mesh) mm Y Isla jidhka schema-ga hore AP214, barnaamijyada kaliya akhriya Xidhmada USD .usdz Maya Xidhmada USD (.usdz) m Z Jidhka agabkiisa, mugga iyo miisaanka; isku-dhisnaha qayb kasta mar, iyo nuqul kasta oo la meeleeyay: Dhoofi sida USD IFC 4 .ifc Maya IFC 4 (oo leh dhammaan sifooyinka) mm Z Qaabka saddex-geesood, agabka, cabbir kasta, blokka cinwaanka, tirooyinka; qaybaha isku-dhisnaha nooc ahaan iyo nuqullada la meeleeyay DXF R12, sawir-gacmeed .dxf Maya DXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah markii sawir-gacmeed la doortay mm Sawir-gacmeedka x, y gudaheeda Xariiqyo, qaansooyin run ah iyo goobo, barar; layers PROFILE, CONSTRUCTION, POINTS DXF R12, wejig .dxf Maya DXF oo sawir-gacmeedka ama dhinac sinaan ah markii wejig toosan la doortay mm Wejigga x, y gudaheeda Qaabka wejiga: godadka wareegsan sida goobo run ah, inta kale sida polyline xidhan (geesaha wareegsan sida facets) Naqshadda PDF .pdf Maya Naqshad (PDF): muuqaallada, qaybta, faahfaahinta, GD&T mm xaashi A3 ah Hore, sare, midig, isometric, muuqaallada qaybta iyo faahfaahinta oo laga sameeyay facets, khadadka qarsan, cabbirrada guud, calaamadaha GD&T, blokka cinwaanka Faylalka PartCraft Labaduba waa qoraal caadi ah (JSON). Jidhka ma kaydsana: PartCraft wuu dib u dhisaa taariikhda, sidaas darteed faylalku waa yaryar oo had iyo jeer waxay la mid yihiin taariikhda. Fayl kasta wuxuu leeyahay lambar nooc. Dhismahan wuxuu qoraa fayl kasta nooca ugu hooseeya ee hayo waxa uu isticmaalo (2 ilaa 5; jidh ka yimid mesh wuxuu u baahan yahay 5) wuxuuna furaa noocyada hore oo dhan. Fayl ka yimid PartCraft cusub waa la diidaa, fariinta oo magacaabaysa labada nooc. Qiime kasta waa la hubiyaa markii fayl la furayo. Magacyada waxay lumiyaan xarfaha xakamaynta; tirooyinka aan xadka ku jirin, tixraacyada features-ka maqan iyo noocyada feature-ka aan la aqoonsan karin waa la diidaa, sabab fudud oo lagu sheegay. Ha tafatirin faylalkan gacanta haddii aanad ogayn qaabka. Faylka aan ku guuldareysan hubinta ma furmi doono. Qaybta leh STEP solid oo weyn oo la soo dhoofiyay dhisme hore wuxuu dhaafi karaa 50 MB, taas oo ah inta PartCraft furi karo sida fayl qayb (eeg Dhibaatooyinka). Facets iyo saxnaanta STL iyo 3MF had iyo jeer waxay ka samaysan yihiin facets, dejinta Qalloocyada ku salaysan, oo sidaas oo kale ayuu yahay face DXF marka laga reebo godadka wareegsan, oo ah goobo run ah. Sawir-gacmeedka DXF wuxuu leeyahay qaansooyin iyo goobo run ah, sababtoo ah wuxuu si toos ah uga yimid sawir-gacmeedka. Dhismahan wuxuu qayb kasta ku dhisaa mesh kernel-ka, sidaas darteed muuqaallada naqshadda (oo ay ku jiraan qaybaha) sidoo kale waa facets. Dhoofinta STEP ee saxda ah waa kaliya ka reebsan: kernel-ku wuxuu ka yaqaanaa wejig kasta dhabta ah sawir-gacmeedka (ama faylka STEP ee jidhka laga furay), sidaas darteed wejiyada wareegsan waxay u qoran yihiin silinder, koonn, kubbad iyo torus oo run ah, si kasta oo Qalloocyada loo dejiyey (eeg Dhoofinta daabacaadda, STEP iyo DXF). Lama taageero dhismahan Qaabka Xaaladda glTF, IGES, Parasolid, ACIS (gelin ama dhoofin); OBJ dhoofin Lama dhisin DWG Kaliya variant pack-ka ayaa qoraa, sida xaashi naqshad oo qaab kasta. Lama akhrin, dhoofin kale ma jiro. Dhoofi DXF; dhammaan barnaamijyada CAD waxay furaan DXF R12 STEP isku-dhisnaha iyo naqshadda isku-dhisnaha Weli lama dhisin. Dhoofi qayb kasta sida STEP saxda ah; STL, 3MF iyo liiska walxaha ayaa laga dhoofin karaa isku-dhisnaha Qaababka asalka ah ee barnaamijyada kale ee qaybaha iyo isku-dhisnaha (marka laga reebo .3dm, oo furma sida hal jidh) Lama dhisin Eeg Waxa weli aan la dhisin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"trackpad-and-touch","scope":"partcraft","title":"Trackpad, taabashada iyo shaashadaha yaryar","summary":"Sida loo wareejiyo, loo pan-garaynayo iyo loo zoom-garaynayo Mac ama laptop trackpad, waxa shaqeeya shaashadda taabashada iyo waxa weli u baahan keyboard, iyo sida shaashaddu u habaysanto telefoonka ama daaqadda cidhiidhiga ah.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","magic mouse","mac","taabasho","tablet","ipad","telefoon","pinch","labo farood","midig-riix","secondary click","gestures","shaashad yar","mobile"],"headings":[{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"shaashadaha-taabashada","text":"Shaashadaha taabashada","level":2},{"id":"shaashadaha-yaryar-iyo-telefoonada","text":"Shaashadaha yaryar iyo telefoonada","level":2},{"id":"browser-ada","text":"Browser-ada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft waxaa loo sameeyay mouse leh wheel iyo badhanka dhexe, laakiin trackpad-ku si fiican ayuu u shaqeeyaa marka aad garanayso gestures-ka; shaashadda taabashada waxay u shaqeysaa aragtida qaybaha iyo sawirka fudud.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi aad u\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji qaybta (3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix oo jiid hal farood (ama jiid saddex farood haddii aad awood u leedahay jiidista saddex-farood)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPan (3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ama ⌘) oo riix-jiid, ama riix-jiid labo farood la riixay (jiidista click-ka labaad)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji qaybta, swipe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESwipe labo farood; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku, swipe-ku wuu pan-yaa. Waxay u baahan tahay \u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E oo loo dejiyay &quot;Work it out&quot; (bilowga) ama &quot;Trackpad&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZoom (3D iyo sketch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPinch. Zoom wuxuu u socdaa xagga pointer-ka. Haddii \u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E loo dejiyay &quot;Mouse wheel&quot;, labo farood scroll waa zoom\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix labo farood, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+click\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPan sketch-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESwipe labo farood (&quot;Work it out&quot; ama &quot;Trackpad&quot;), ama riix-jiid labo farood la riixay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+jiid kuma pan-yo sketch-ka (wuxuu sameeyaa daaqada xulashada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar xulashada sketch-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+click ama ⌘+click\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShid secondary click ee \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings, Trackpad, Point &amp; Click\u003C/strong\u003E haddii riix labo farood aanu wax samayn.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESi aad u\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESamee tan\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji qaybta (3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERiix touchpad-ka (ama taabo oo hay) oo jiid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPan (3D)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHay \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo jiid, ama jiid iyadoo dhinaca badhanka midig la riixay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji qaybta, swipe\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESwipe labo farood; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku, swipe-ku wuu pan-yaa. Waxay u baahan tahay \u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E oo loo dejiyay &quot;Work it out&quot; (bilowga) ama &quot;Trackpad&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EZoom (3D iyo sketch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPinch meesha touchpad-ku taageero. Zoom wuxuu u socdaa xagga pointer-ka. Haddii \u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E loo dejiyay &quot;Mouse wheel&quot;, labo farood scroll waa zoom\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETaabo labo farood, ama geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPan sketch-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESwipe labo farood (&quot;Work it out&quot; ama &quot;Trackpad&quot;), ama jiid iyadoo dhinaca badhanka midig la riixay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+jiid kuma pan-yo sketch-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar xulashada sketch-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+click ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+click\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScrolling\u003C/strong\u003E waa ku jirta \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003Edejinta PartCraft\u003C/a\u003E: &quot;Work it out&quot; (bilowga) wuxuu u qaadaa scrolling-ka dhinacyada ama kan fine-grained ah sida trackpad, &quot;Trackpad&quot; had iyo jeer wuu sidaas yahay, &quot;Mouse wheel&quot; weligiis ma aha. Pinch wuxuu zoom-garaynayaa saddexdaba.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa wareejiya aragtida 3D, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo leh furayaasha fallaadhaha wuu pan-yaa, marka aad riixdo aragtida: waa wax wanaagsan trackpad-ka. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa zoom-garaynayaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashadaha-taabashada\"\u003EShaashadaha taabashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft wuxuu akhriyaa taabashada, marka tablet-yada, laptop-yada taabashada leh iyo telefoonada way shaqeeyaan, xadadaan leh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFurayaasha taabashada\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka aad taabato shaashadda, bar yar ayaa soo muuqda hoosta midig ee aragtida oo furayaasha ay farsamada yaraanayso. Wuu baxaa markaad isticmaasho mouse.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E: furaha Esc. Wuxuu joojiyaa wax aad bilowday ama wuu dib u qaadaa, siday furuhu sameeyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E (sketch-ka dhexdiisa, oo leh Select): markuu shidan yahay, taabo kasta wuxuu ku daraa shay xulashada, ama wuu ka saaraa, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+click. Mar kale taabo si aad ugu noqoto shay mid kasta hal mar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E (markaad xariiq silsilad, spline ama polygon ah sawirayso): wuu dhammeeyaa, sida right-click.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGacanta oo aad hakad u haysay qiyaastii nus ilbiriqsi wuxuu samaynayaa isla sidaas taabo keli ah: qalab sawir leh wuxuu dhammeeyaa wixii aad sawirtay, Select-ka wuxuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa shayga ka hooseeya gacantaada xulashada. Dhibcaha iyo xariiqyada way fudud yihiin in gacanta lagu taabto: PartCraft wuxuu eegaa qiyaastii laba jeer ka fog taabashada marka loo eego riix.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAragtida 3D\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHal farood: wareeji qaybta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELabo farood: pinch si aad u zoom-garayso, isku-wada dhaqaaq si aad u pan-garayso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo: dooro wejig, geesi ama diyaarad. Ma jiro hover highlight ka hor taabashada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESketch-ka\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaabo qalab sawir leh si aad u dhigto dhibic kasta: taabo bilowga, kadibna taabo dhamaadka. Snapping wuxuu dhacaa meesha aad gacanta ka qaaddo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELabo farood pinch iyo pan. Farood labaad oo la dhigo waxay joojisaa jiidista farooda kowaad ee bilowday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u dhammeeyso silsiladda xariiqa, taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E, hakad gacanta, ama taabo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E mar kale (ama qalab kale) toolbar-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESelect: taabo si aad u dooratid; jiid dhibic ama xariiq si aad u dhaqaajiso; jiid meel bannaan si aad u samayso daaqad. Taabo labaad wuxuu beddelaa xulashada inta aan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E shidnayn (ama haddii gacanta hakad ku hayso shayga labaad).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESi aad u beddesho cabbir, isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003EWax ka beddel\u003C/strong\u003E ee u dhow panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESawir-xaashiyada\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaabo si aad u dhigto oo aad u doorato calaamadaha, oo jiid calaamad si aad u dhaqaajiso. Pinch wuu zoom-garaynayaa, labo farood wuu pan-garaynayaa, ama jiid hal farood warqadda bannaan. Farood labaad wuxuu joojiyaa calaamad aad jiidaysay, waana ay dib u noqotaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWaxa weli u baahan keyboard\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQorista lambarada: keyboard-ka shaashadda ayaa soo muuqda sanduuqyada lambarka iyo meelaha cabbirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFurayaasha gaagaaban ee qalabka: isticmaal toolbar-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shaashadaha-yaryar-iyo-telefoonada\"\u003EShaashadaha yaryar iyo telefoonada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E1280 pixel ama ballaadhka, toolbar-ku wuxuu ku jiraa hal safka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlaa 760 ilaa 1100 pixel, panelada dhinacyada way cidhiidhaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKa hooseeya 760 pixel (telefoon, ama daaqad cidhiidh), shaashaddu waa la kala saaraa: toolbar (swipe sideways si aad u hesho badhanno dheeraad ah), aragtida 3D, status bar, kadibna properties panel iyo history. Scroll bogga si aad u gaadho panelada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenus-ka (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E) waxay furmaan ballaadhka shaashadda oo dhan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIphone-ka ma leh mood buuxa oo browser-ka ah; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo badhanka mood-ka shaashadda waxay u beddelaan oo kaliya caadi iyo bararka la qariyey.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETelefoonku waa fiican yahay si aad u furto qayb, aad u rogto oo aad u hubiso xaqiiqooyinkeeda. Moodeel dhab ah wuxuu u baahan yahay shaashad weyn iyo mouse ama trackpad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ada\"\u003EBrowser-ada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari ee hadda jira waxay ku shaqeeyaan PartCraft Windows, macOS iyo Linux, iyo tablet-yada iyo telefoonada, ilaa WebGL iyo WebAssembly ay jiraan. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowser-ada iyo kombiyuutarrada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"PartCraft waxaa loo sameeyay mouse leh wheel iyo badhanka dhexe, laakiin trackpad-ku si fiican ayuu u shaqeeyaa marka aad garanayso gestures-ka; shaashadda taabashada waxay u shaqeysaa aragtida qaybaha iyo sawirka fudud. Trackpad Si aad u Samee tan Wareeji qaybta (3D) Riix oo jiid hal farood (ama jiid saddex farood haddii aad awood u leedahay jiidista saddex-farood) Pan (3D) Hay Shift (ama ⌘) oo riix-jiid, ama riix-jiid labo farood la riixay (jiidista click-ka labaad) Wareeji qaybta, swipe Swipe labo farood; Shift ku, swipe-ku wuu pan-yaa. Waxay u baahan tahay Scrolling oo loo dejiyay \"Work it out\" (bilowga) ama \"Trackpad\" Zoom (3D iyo sketch) Pinch. Zoom wuxuu u socdaa xagga pointer-ka. Haddii Scrolling loo dejiyay \"Mouse wheel\", labo farood scroll waa zoom Right-click Riix labo farood, ama Ctrl+click Pan sketch-ka Swipe labo farood (\"Work it out\" ama \"Trackpad\"), ama riix-jiid labo farood la riixay. Shift+jiid kuma pan-yo sketch-ka (wuxuu sameeyaa daaqada xulashada) Ku dar xulashada sketch-ka Shift+click ama ⌘+click Shid secondary click ee System Settings, Trackpad, Point & Click haddii riix labo farood aanu wax samayn. Si aad u Samee tan Wareeji qaybta (3D) Riix touchpad-ka (ama taabo oo hay) oo jiid Pan (3D) Hay Shift ama Ctrl oo jiid, ama jiid iyadoo dhinaca badhanka midig la riixay Wareeji qaybta, swipe Swipe labo farood; Shift ku, swipe-ku wuu pan-yaa. Waxay u baahan tahay Scrolling oo loo dejiyay \"Work it out\" (bilowga) ama \"Trackpad\" Zoom (3D iyo sketch) Pinch meesha touchpad-ku taageero. Zoom wuxuu u socdaa xagga pointer-ka. Haddii Scrolling loo dejiyay \"Mouse wheel\", labo farood scroll waa zoom Right-click Taabo labo farood, ama geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka Pan sketch-ka Swipe labo farood (\"Work it out\" ama \"Trackpad\"), ama jiid iyadoo dhinaca badhanka midig la riixay. Shift+jiid kuma pan-yo sketch-ka Ku dar xulashada sketch-ka Shift+click ama Ctrl+click Scrolling waa ku jirta dejinta PartCraft: \"Work it out\" (bilowga) wuxuu u qaadaa scrolling-ka dhinacyada ama kan fine-grained ah sida trackpad, \"Trackpad\" had iyo jeer wuu sidaas yahay, \"Mouse wheel\" weligiis ma aha. Pinch wuxuu zoom-garaynayaa saddexdaba. Furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa wareejiya aragtida 3D, Shift oo leh furayaasha fallaadhaha wuu pan-yaa, marka aad riixdo aragtida: waa wax wanaagsan trackpad-ka. + iyo − waa zoom-garaynayaan. Shaashadaha taabashada PartCraft wuxuu akhriyaa taabashada, marka tablet-yada, laptop-yada taabashada leh iyo telefoonada way shaqeeyaan, xadadaan leh. Furayaasha taabashada Marka aad taabato shaashadda, bar yar ayaa soo muuqda hoosta midig ee aragtida oo furayaasha ay farsamada yaraanayso. Wuu baxaa markaad isticmaasho mouse. Esc: furaha Esc. Wuxuu joojiyaa wax aad bilowday ama wuu dib u qaadaa, siday furuhu sameeyaan. Add (sketch-ka dhexdiisa, oo leh Select): markuu shidan yahay, taabo kasta wuxuu ku daraa shay xulashada, ama wuu ka saaraa, sida Shift+click. Mar kale taabo si aad ugu noqoto shay mid kasta hal mar. Done (markaad xariiq silsilad, spline ama polygon ah sawirayso): wuu dhammeeyaa, sida right-click. Gacanta oo aad hakad u haysay qiyaastii nus ilbiriqsi wuxuu samaynayaa isla sidaas taabo keli ah: qalab sawir leh wuxuu dhammeeyaa wixii aad sawirtay, Select-ka wuxuu ku daraa ama ka saaraa shayga ka hooseeya gacantaada xulashada. Dhibcaha iyo xariiqyada way fudud yihiin in gacanta lagu taabto: PartCraft wuxuu eegaa qiyaastii laba jeer ka fog taabashada marka loo eego riix. Aragtida 3D Hal farood: wareeji qaybta. Labo farood: pinch si aad u zoom-garayso, isku-wada dhaqaaq si aad u pan-garayso. Taabo: dooro wejig, geesi ama diyaarad. Ma jiro hover highlight ka hor taabashada. Sketch-ka Taabo qalab sawir leh si aad u dhigto dhibic kasta: taabo bilowga, kadibna taabo dhamaadka. Snapping wuxuu dhacaa meesha aad gacanta ka qaaddo. Labo farood pinch iyo pan. Farood labaad oo la dhigo waxay joojisaa jiidista farooda kowaad ee bilowday. Si aad u dhammeeyso silsiladda xariiqa, taabo Done, hakad gacanta, ama taabo Line mar kale (ama qalab kale) toolbar-ka. Select: taabo si aad u dooratid; jiid dhibic ama xariiq si aad u dhaqaajiso; jiid meel bannaan si aad u samayso daaqad. Taabo labaad wuxuu beddelaa xulashada inta aan Add shidnayn (ama haddii gacanta hakad ku hayso shayga labaad). Si aad u beddesho cabbir, isticmaal Wax ka beddel ee u dhow panelka midig. Sawir-xaashiyada Taabo si aad u dhigto oo aad u doorato calaamadaha, oo jiid calaamad si aad u dhaqaajiso. Pinch wuu zoom-garaynayaa, labo farood wuu pan-garaynayaa, ama jiid hal farood warqadda bannaan. Farood labaad wuxuu joojiyaa calaamad aad jiidaysay, waana ay dib u noqotaa. Waxa weli u baahan keyboard Qorista lambarada: keyboard-ka shaashadda ayaa soo muuqda sanduuqyada lambarka iyo meelaha cabbirka. Furayaasha gaagaaban ee qalabka: isticmaal toolbar-ka. Shaashadaha yaryar iyo telefoonada 1280 pixel ama ballaadhka, toolbar-ku wuxuu ku jiraa hal safka. Ilaa 760 ilaa 1100 pixel, panelada dhinacyada way cidhiidhaan. Ka hooseeya 760 pixel (telefoon, ama daaqad cidhiidh), shaashaddu waa la kala saaraa: toolbar (swipe sideways si aad u hesho badhanno dheeraad ah), aragtida 3D, status bar, kadibna properties panel iyo history. Scroll bogga si aad u gaadho panelada. Menus-ka (Export, Views) waxay furmaan ballaadhka shaashadda oo dhan. Iphone-ka ma leh mood buuxa oo browser-ka ah; Ctrl+Shift+F iyo badhanka mood-ka shaashadda waxay u beddelaan oo kaliya caadi iyo bararka la qariyey. Telefoonku waa fiican yahay si aad u furto qayb, aad u rogto oo aad u hubiso xaqiiqooyinkeeda. Moodeel dhab ah wuxuu u baahan yahay shaashad weyn iyo mouse ama trackpad. Browser-ada Chrome, Edge, Firefox iyo Safari ee hadda jira waxay ku shaqeeyaan PartCraft Windows, macOS iyo Linux, iyo tablet-yada iyo telefoonada, ilaa WebGL iyo WebAssembly ay jiraan. Eeg Browser-ada iyo kombiyuutarrada.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"scripts-and-cli","scope":"partcraft","title":"Qoraallada iyo amarka command-ka","summary":"Qaabka qoraalka PartCraft (.pcscript) kaas oo qayb oo dhan u qoro qoraal la akhrin karo, iyo qalabka amarka partcraft ee dhisa, beddela, dib u celiya oo hubiya qaybaha iyada oo aan shaashad la isticmaalin.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["qoraal","pcscript","qoraal-qoraal","amar","command line","cli","terminal","kooxeed","otomaatig","hubin","lint","dhis","dhoof","maareynta noocyada","diff","qoraal parametric"],"headings":[{"id":"barnaamijka-gudihiisa","text":"Barnaamijka gudihiisa","level":2},{"id":"qaabka-qoraalka","text":"Qaabka qoraalka","level":2},{"id":"qalabka-amarka-command-ka","text":"Qalabka amarka command-ka","level":2},{"id":"hubinta","text":"Hubinta","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMoodelka taxaddarka leh wuxuu ka badan yahay nidaam ka badan badhamo. Qayb loo qoray qoraal waa la akhrin karaa, la eegi karaa, si toosa ugu barbar dhigi karaa, oo script ayaa dib u dhisi karaa. PartCraft labada jihoodba wuu shaqeeyaa: qayb kasta waxa lagu qori karaa script, script-na wuxuu dhisi karaa qaybta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"barnaamijka-gudihiisa\"\u003EBarnaamijka gudihiisa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETabka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHalbeegyada\u003C/span\u003E, hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EScript\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi qoraal ahaan\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu soo dejiyaa qaybta furan sida \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;name&gt;.pcscript\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFur qoraal\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qayb ka dhisaa fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.pcscript\u003C/code\u003E. Khalad waxa lagu sheegaa lambarka sadarka, wixna lama beddelo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaabka-qoraalka\"\u003EQaabka qoraalka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epcscript 1\npart &quot;Bracket&quot;\n  resolution 64\n\nparam width = 120\n  note Plate width\nparam thick = 8\nparam bolt = 8.5\nparam margin = bolt * 1.5\n\nsketch Plate\n  on top\n  point a 0, 0\n  point b 120, 0\n  point c 120, 60\n  point d 0, 60\n  line bottom a b\n  line right b c\n  line top c d\n  line left d a\n  coincident a O\n  horizontal bottom\n  horizontal top\n  vertical left\n  vertical right\n  distance bottom = width\n  distance left 60\n\nextrude Base\n  sketch Plate\n  depth = thick\n\nsketch HoleCentres\n  on face Base end\n  point h1 12, 12\n  hdistance O h1 = margin\n  vdistance O h1 = margin\n\nhole Bolts\n  sketch HoleCentres\n  d = bolt\n  through\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXeerarka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESadarka bidix ee xarfaha wuxuu bilaabaa tilmaam: \u003Ccode\u003Epcscript\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epart\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eparam\u003C/code\u003E, nooca sifada (\u003Ccode\u003Esketch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eextrude\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erevolve\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehole\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elpattern\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecpattern\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emirror\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efillet\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Echamfer\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eshell\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eimport\u003C/code\u003E iyo noocyada cusub) oo ay ku xigto magaceeda, ama \u003Ccode\u003Erollback &lt;feature&gt;\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESadar-gelinta (indented) lines waa habeynta tilmaamka sare. Habeyn keligiis (\u003Ccode\u003Ethrough\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ereverse\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esuppressed\u003C/code\u003E) macnaheedu waa haa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabeynta lambar waa lambar, ama \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E iyo hadal-qaab, taas oo samaysa isle&#039;eg: \u003Ccode\u003Edepth = thick\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESawir-gacmeed dhexdiisa: \u003Ccode\u003Eon\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu magacaabaa diyaaradda (\u003Ccode\u003Efront\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etop\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eright\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eface Base end\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eface Revolve1 side l3\u003C/code\u003E); joogitaanka waa \u003Ccode\u003Epoint &lt;name&gt; x, y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eline &lt;name&gt; &lt;point&gt; &lt;point&gt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecircle &lt;name&gt; &lt;centre&gt; &lt;radius&gt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Earc &lt;name&gt; &lt;centre&gt; &lt;start&gt; &lt;end&gt;\u003C/code\u003E (wareeg ka soo horjeeda saacadda) ama \u003Ccode\u003Espline &lt;name&gt; fit|control &lt;points&gt;\u003C/code\u003E; xidhiidhadu waa nooceeda iyo magacyada ay isku xidhaan (\u003Ccode\u003EO\u003C/code\u003E waa asalka); cabbirku wuxuu ku dhammaadaa qiimaha ama \u003Ccode\u003E= expression\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabeynta ikhtiyaarka ah ee joogitaanka ama xidhiidhka waxay gelaan qaansada cad ee dhamaadka, kala kala saaran \u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E[construction]\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E[side -1; label 5, 3]\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu bilaabaa faallo (bilowga sadarka ama ka dib meel bannaan). Magacyada leh meel bannaan waxay gelaan xigasho laba jeer (&quot;...&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAqoonsiga sifooyinka waxa loo tiriyaa laga bilaabo f1 by marka loo qoro. Tixraacyada geesaha iyo dusha waxay isticmaalaan, tusaale ahaan \u003Ccode\u003Eedge f2.side:l3 f2.end [at 50, 0, 10]\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHabeyn aan ereyo u lahayn qaabka waxa lagu qoraa \u003Ccode\u003Ejson\u003C/code\u003E iyo qiime; waxaa loo akhrin doonaa sida ay yihiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka barnaamijka laga kaydiyo, qoraalku wuxuu ku jiraa habeyn kasta, sidaas darteed wuxuu furmaa isla qaybtaas. Jidh solid STEP oo la soo dejiyay ayaa lagu qoraa script-ka barnaamijka, iyo fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E oo gaar ah oo magacyadiisa \u003Ccode\u003Estep-file\u003C/code\u003E ku bixiyo amarka command-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalabka-amarka-command-ka\"\u003EQalabka amarka command-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalabka wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa kombiyuutar leh Node.js 24, isagoo ka shaqeeya nuqul ka mid ah isha CadCraft: \u003Ccode\u003Enode tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs &lt;command&gt;\u003C/code\u003E. Waa qalab injineer horumariye ah oo isticmaala isla moduleyada barnaamijka. Qaybaha waa faylal \u003Ccode\u003E.partcraft.json\u003C/code\u003E ama qoraallo \u003Ccode\u003E.pcscript\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAmarka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa uu sameeyo\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Einfo &lt;part&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifooyinka, halbeegyada, bar-ka rollback-ka, mugga iyo cabbirka jidhka la dhisay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eparams &lt;part&gt;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalbeeg kasta iyo isle&#039;eg kasta oo qiimihiisa leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eset &lt;part&gt; width=150 Base.depth==thick\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHore: beddel halbeegyada, xidh lambarrada (\u003Ccode\u003E==\u003C/code\u003E ama hadal-qaab), dej lambarro fudud\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrive &lt;part&gt; Base.depth=12\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u noqo: xallii halbeegga ku jira lambar la wadayo (\u003Ccode\u003E--prefer width\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu mid dooran)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebuild &lt;part&gt; --out x.step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWuxuu qoraa \u003Ccode\u003E.step\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.stl\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.3mf\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.json\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.pcscript\u003C/code\u003E ama macro (\u003Ccode\u003E.swb\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebuild &lt;part&gt; --table sizes.csv --out-dir sizes\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal fayl oo kasta safka miiska naqshadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Evariants &lt;part&gt; --out-dir d\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003E--zip f.zip\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabeyn kasta sida STEP, IFC, DWG iyo muuqaal, miiska kala duwanaanta iyo walax maktabad (\u003Ccode\u003E--only &quot;A,B&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E--formats step,ifc,dwg,preview\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E--no-item\u003C/code\u003E); eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003ESamee xirmo kala duwanaan\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Escript &lt;in.pcscript&gt; -o part.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScript ka qayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eto-script &lt;part&gt; -o part.pcscript\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb ka script\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Erollback &lt;part&gt; [&lt;feature&gt;]\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eforward &lt;part&gt; [--end]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWareeji bar-ka rollback-ka ee faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Echeck &lt;part&gt; [--strict]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHubinta nidaamka (hoos)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ebuild\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sidoo kale qaadaa \u003Ccode\u003E--set name=value\u003C/code\u003E (dhisidda hal mar kaliya) iyo \u003Ccode\u003E--upto &lt;feature&gt;\u003C/code\u003E. Amar kasta wuxuu qaadaa \u003Ccode\u003E--json\u003C/code\u003E. Koodhka dhamaadka: 0 waa fiican, 1 waa dhibaato la helay, 2 waa amarka si khaldan loo qoray. Script-ka meeshiisa looma beddelo: bixi \u003Ccode\u003E-o\u003C/code\u003E si aad u kaydiso nuqul la beddelay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hubinta\"\u003EHubinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Echeck\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sheegaa waxa qaybta ka dhigaya mid adag in dambe la beddelo:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatiijo\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWaxa loo tiriyaa\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeed aad uga badan qeexan (xidhiidh isku dhaca ama soo noqnoqda)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekhalad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifo aan dhisin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekhalad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalbeeg ama isle&#039;eg khalad leh, ama halbeegyo isticmaalaya midba kan kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekhalad\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir-gacmeed aan dhammaystirnayn, oo leh darajooyinka xorriyadda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edigniin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELambarro si toos ah loogu qoray sifooyinka iyo cabbirrada oo aan halbeeg wadin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edigniin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHalbeeg aan wax isticmaalin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edigniin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESifo la joojiyay; bar-ka rollback-ka aan dhamaadka ku jirin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Edigniin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E--strict\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa digniin kasta khalad, sidaas darteed script dhis wuxuu diidi karaa qayb aan si buuxda loo wadin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMacro-ka \u003Ccode\u003E.swb\u003C/code\u003E waa kan qaybta moodeelka ee dukaamada badan ay isticmaalaan: marka lagu shaqeeyo barnaamijkaas, halkaas ayuu qaybta ka dhisaa. Halkan lama shaqeysiin barnaamijkaas (ma heli karo server-keenna), sidaas darteed u qaado inaysan la tijaabin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Moodelka taxaddarka leh wuxuu ka badan yahay nidaam ka badan badhamo. Qayb loo qoray qoraal waa la akhrin karaa, la eegi karaa, si toosa ugu barbar dhigi karaa, oo script ayaa dib u dhisi karaa. PartCraft labada jihoodba wuu shaqeeyaa: qayb kasta waxa lagu qori karaa script, script-na wuxuu dhisi karaa qaybta. Barnaamijka gudihiisa Tabka Halbeegyada, hoosta Script: Kaydi qoraal ahaan wuxuu soo dejiyaa qaybta furan sida \u003Cname\u003E.pcscript. Fur qoraal wuxuu qayb ka dhisaa fayl .pcscript. Khalad waxa lagu sheegaa lambarka sadarka, wixna lama beddelo. Qaabka qoraalka pcscript 1 part \"Bracket\" resolution 64 param width = 120 note Plate width param thick = 8 param bolt = 8.5 param margin = bolt * 1.5 sketch Plate on top point a 0, 0 point b 120, 0 point c 120, 60 point d 0, 60 line bottom a b line right b c line top c d line left d a coincident a O horizontal bottom horizontal top vertical left vertical right distance bottom = width distance left 60 extrude Base sketch Plate depth = thick sketch HoleCentres on face Base end point h1 12, 12 hdistance O h1 = margin vdistance O h1 = margin hole Bolts sketch HoleCentres d = bolt through Xeerarka: Sadarka bidix ee xarfaha wuxuu bilaabaa tilmaam: pcscript, part, param, nooca sifada (sketch, extrude, revolve, hole, lpattern, cpattern, mirror, fillet, chamfer, shell, import iyo noocyada cusub) oo ay ku xigto magaceeda, ama rollback \u003Cfeature\u003E. Sadar-gelinta (indented) lines waa habeynta tilmaamka sare. Habeyn keligiis (through, reverse, suppressed) macnaheedu waa haa. Habeynta lambar waa lambar, ama = iyo hadal-qaab, taas oo samaysa isle'eg: depth = thick. Sawir-gacmeed dhexdiisa: on wuxuu magacaabaa diyaaradda (front, top, right, face Base end, face Revolve1 side l3); joogitaanka waa point \u003Cname\u003E x, y, line \u003Cname\u003E \u003Cpoint\u003E \u003Cpoint\u003E, circle \u003Cname\u003E \u003Ccentre\u003E \u003Cradius\u003E, arc \u003Cname\u003E \u003Ccentre\u003E \u003Cstart\u003E \u003Cend\u003E (wareeg ka soo horjeeda saacadda) ama spline \u003Cname\u003E fit|control \u003Cpoints\u003E; xidhiidhadu waa nooceeda iyo magacyada ay isku xidhaan (O waa asalka); cabbirku wuxuu ku dhammaadaa qiimaha ama = expression. Habeynta ikhtiyaarka ah ee joogitaanka ama xidhiidhka waxay gelaan qaansada cad ee dhamaadka, kala kala saaran ;: [construction], [side -1; label 5, 3]. # wuxuu bilaabaa faallo (bilowga sadarka ama ka dib meel bannaan). Magacyada leh meel bannaan waxay gelaan xigasho laba jeer (\"...\"). Aqoonsiga sifooyinka waxa loo tiriyaa laga bilaabo f1 by marka loo qoro. Tixraacyada geesaha iyo dusha waxay isticmaalaan, tusaale ahaan edge f2.side:l3 f2.end [at 50, 0, 10]. Habeyn aan ereyo u lahayn qaabka waxa lagu qoraa json iyo qiime; waxaa loo akhrin doonaa sida ay yihiin. Marka barnaamijka laga kaydiyo, qoraalku wuxuu ku jiraa habeyn kasta, sidaas darteed wuxuu furmaa isla qaybtaas. Jidh solid STEP oo la soo dejiyay ayaa lagu qoraa script-ka barnaamijka, iyo fayl .step oo gaar ah oo magacyadiisa step-file ku bixiyo amarka command-ka. Qalabka amarka command-ka Qalabka wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa kombiyuutar leh Node.js 24, isagoo ka shaqeeya nuqul ka mid ah isha CadCraft: node tools/partcraft-cli/partcraft.mjs \u003Ccommand\u003E. Waa qalab injineer horumariye ah oo isticmaala isla moduleyada barnaamijka. Qaybaha waa faylal .partcraft.json ama qoraallo .pcscript. Amarka Waxa uu sameeyo info \u003Cpart\u003E Sifooyinka, halbeegyada, bar-ka rollback-ka, mugga iyo cabbirka jidhka la dhisay params \u003Cpart\u003E Halbeeg kasta iyo isle'eg kasta oo qiimihiisa leh set \u003Cpart\u003E width=150 Base.depth==thick Hore: beddel halbeegyada, xidh lambarrada (== ama hadal-qaab), dej lambarro fudud drive \u003Cpart\u003E Base.depth=12 Dib u noqo: xallii halbeegga ku jira lambar la wadayo (--prefer width wuxuu mid dooran) build \u003Cpart\u003E --out x.step Wuxuu qoraa .step, .stl, .3mf, .json, .pcscript ama macro (.swb) build \u003Cpart\u003E --table sizes.csv --out-dir sizes Hal fayl oo kasta safka miiska naqshadda variants \u003Cpart\u003E --out-dir d ama --zip f.zip Qaabeyn kasta sida STEP, IFC, DWG iyo muuqaal, miiska kala duwanaanta iyo walax maktabad (--only \"A,B\", --formats step,ifc,dwg,preview, --no-item); eeg Samee xirmo kala duwanaan script \u003Cin.pcscript\u003E -o part.json Script ka qayb to-script \u003Cpart\u003E -o part.pcscript Qayb ka script rollback \u003Cpart\u003E [\u003Cfeature\u003E], forward \u003Cpart\u003E [--end] Wareeji bar-ka rollback-ka ee faylka check \u003Cpart\u003E [--strict] Hubinta nidaamka (hoos) build wuxuu sidoo kale qaadaa --set name=value (dhisidda hal mar kaliya) iyo --upto \u003Cfeature\u003E. Amar kasta wuxuu qaadaa --json. Koodhka dhamaadka: 0 waa fiican, 1 waa dhibaato la helay, 2 waa amarka si khaldan loo qoray. Script-ka meeshiisa looma beddelo: bixi -o si aad u kaydiso nuqul la beddelay. Hubinta check wuxuu sheegaa waxa qaybta ka dhigaya mid adag in dambe la beddelo: Natiijo Waxa loo tiriyaa Sawir-gacmeed aad uga badan qeexan (xidhiidh isku dhaca ama soo noqnoqda) khalad Sifo aan dhisin khalad Halbeeg ama isle'eg khalad leh, ama halbeegyo isticmaalaya midba kan kale khalad Sawir-gacmeed aan dhammaystirnayn, oo leh darajooyinka xorriyadda digniin Lambarro si toos ah loogu qoray sifooyinka iyo cabbirrada oo aan halbeeg wadin digniin Halbeeg aan wax isticmaalin digniin Sifo la joojiyay; bar-ka rollback-ka aan dhamaadka ku jirin digniin --strict wuxuu ka dhigaa digniin kasta khalad, sidaas darteed script dhis wuxuu diidi karaa qayb aan si buuxda loo wadin. Macro-ka .swb waa kan qaybta moodeelka ee dukaamada badan ay isticmaalaan: marka lagu shaqeeyo barnaamijkaas, halkaas ayuu qaybta ka dhisaa. Halkan lama shaqeysiin barnaamijkaas (ma heli karo server-keenna), sidaas darteed u qaado inaysan la tijaabin.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"craftscript-language","scope":"partcraft","title":"Luqadda CraftScript","summary":"CraftScript hal bog: matrikisyo, kala-dhexaadyo iyo tusmeynta, hawlgallada, xakameynta socodka, functions, struct iyo cell, faallooyin, soo celin, khaladaad iyo miisaaniyadda tallaabooyinka, iyo sida uga duwan tahay MATLAB.","section":"reference","order":61,"keywords":["CraftScript","luqad","syntax","matrikis","array","vector","tensor","tusmo","end","colon","kala-dhexaad","operator","element-wise","transpose","if","for","while","switch","try","catch","function","anonymous function","struct","cell","faallo","echo","semicolon","MATLAB","Octave","port"],"headings":[{"id":"qiyamaha","text":"Qiyamaha","level":2},{"id":"arrays-iyo-tusmeynta","text":"Arrays iyo tusmeynta","level":2},{"id":"hawlgallada","text":"Hawlgallada","level":2},{"id":"xakameynta-socodka-iyo-functions-ka","text":"Xakameynta socodka iyo functions-ka","level":2},{"id":"soo-celin-faallooyin-wax-soo-saar","text":"Soo celin, faallooyin, wax soo saar","level":2},{"id":"khaladaad-iyo-xaddidaad","text":"Khaladaad iyo xaddidaad","level":2},{"id":"ma-aha-sida-matlab","text":"Ma aha sida MATLAB","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ECraftScript waa luqad matrikis ah oo loo qoray si ay u akhrisanayso sida MATLAB, sidaas darteed inta badan codadka tirada ee caadiga ah (tusaale ahaan codka habaynta topology-ga ee 88 sadar) waxay ku shaqeeyaan isbeddello yar oo keliya. Waxay ku socotaa \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EGoobta Script\u003C/a\u003E iyo amarka command line-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyamaha\"\u003EQiyamaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETusaale\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXusuus\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro, array\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ea = 3\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ev = [1 2 3]\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EA = [1 2; 3 4]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETiro kasta waa array (1×1). Arrays-ka waxa lagu kaydiyaa tiir-tiir, ilaa 8 cabbir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMacquul\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA &gt; 2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etrue\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArrays oo true/false ah; waa la isticmaali karaa tusmooyin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E&#039;beam&#039;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;beam&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMatrikis sparse\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esparse(i, j, v, n, n)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMatrikisyada adkaysiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMesh, field, model\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EhexGrid(…)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Epart()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eload(&#039;part.stl&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxa \u003Ccode\u003Eshow\u003C/code\u003E sawiraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStruct\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Es.E = 210e3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobo magac leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECell\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ec = {1, &#039;two&#039;, [3 4]}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiis qiyam kasta ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunction handle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ef = @(x) x.^2\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrays-iyo-tusmeynta\"\u003EArrays iyo tusmeynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKala-dhexaadyo: \u003Ccode\u003E1:5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0:0.1:1\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003Elinspace(a, b, n)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ezeros(n, m)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eones\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eeye\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Erand\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETusmeyntu waxay ka bilaabataa 1: \u003Ccode\u003EA(2, 3)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ev(end)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EA(:, 1)\u003C/code\u003E (tiir oo dhan), \u003Ccode\u003EA(:)\u003C/code\u003E (wax walba hal tiir), \u003Ccode\u003Ev(v &gt; 0)\u003C/code\u003E (tusmeyn macquul ah).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoristu ka baxsan dhammaadka waxay array-ga ballaarisaa, sida MATLAB: \u003Ccode\u003Ev(10) = 1\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hawlgallada\"\u003EHawlgallada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+ - * / \\ ^\u003C/code\u003E waa hawlgallo matrikis (\u003Ccode\u003EA \\ b\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu xalliyaa); \u003Ccode\u003E.* ./ .^\u003C/code\u003E waxay shaqeeyaan unug-unug. \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu beddelaa safka iyo tiirka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsbarbardhigga \u003Ccode\u003E== ~= &lt; &lt;= &gt; &gt;=\u003C/code\u003E; macquulka \u003Ccode\u003E&amp; | ~\u003C/code\u003E (unug-unug) iyo \u003Ccode\u003E&amp;&amp; ||\u003C/code\u003E (gaabin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xakameynta-socodka-iyo-functions-ka\"\u003EXakameynta socodka iyo functions-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efor k = 1:10\n  if mod(k, 2) == 0\n    continue\n  elseif k &gt; 7\n    break\n  end\nend\nwhile err &gt; 1e-6, … end\nswitch kind\n  case &#039;steel&#039;\n    E = 210e3;\n  otherwise\n    E = 70e3;\nend\ntry\n  x = A \\ b;\ncatch e\n  disp(e.message)\nend\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFunctions-ka waxay ku jiraan script-ka amarradiisa ka dib, ama tab script u gaar ah oo loogu magac daray function-ka:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efunction [k, m] = beam(E, I, L)\n  k = 3 * E * I / L^3;\n  m = 0;\nend\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMagaca waxaa lagu raadiyaa amarkan: doorsoome, script qaybtan ku jira oo leh magacaas, function maktabad, function dhismay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"soo-celin-faallooyin-wax-soo-saar\"\u003ESoo celin, faallooyin, wax soo saar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBayaan aan \u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E lahayn ayaa qiimihiisa daabacda; \u003Ccode\u003E;\u003C/code\u003E ayaa ku hayaa aamusnaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu bilaabaa faallo; \u003Ccode\u003E%{\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003E%}\u003C/code\u003E oo ku yaal sadar kaliya ayaa faallaynaya sadarrada ka dhexeeya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edisp(x)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efprintf(&#039;%g\\n&#039;, x)\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Edisplay(x)\u003C/code\u003E waxay daabacaan console-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"khaladaad-iyo-xaddidaad\"\u003EKhaladaad iyo xaddidaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKhaladaadu waxay si fudud u sheegaan waxa khaldan iyo sadarka (iyo silsiladda wicitaanka functions-ka).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESocod kasta wuxuu leeyahay miisaaniyad tallaabooyin (Run options ee panel-ka); wareeg aan dhammaadka lahayn wuxuu joogsadaa fariin, ama riix Stop.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArray kasta wuxuu ilaa 134 milyan oo qiyam hayn karaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ma-aha-sida-matlab\"\u003EMa aha sida MATLAB\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAmarrada plot-ka waxay dhigaan xulashooyinkooda wicitaanka: \u003Ccode\u003Eplot(x, y, &#039;title&#039;, &#039;Error&#039;, &#039;xlabel&#039;, &#039;Step&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003Efigure\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ehold\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eaxis\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etitle(…)\u003C/code\u003E iyo kuwa la mid ah waa la aqbalaa, ma sameeyaan wax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Einput\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ekeyboard\u003C/code\u003E lama taageero: script-ku ma istaagi karo si uu su&#039;aal u weyddiiyo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMa jiraan toolboxes; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-library\"\u003Emaktabadda falanqaynta\u003C/a\u003E iyo built-in functions-ka ayaa jira oo keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"CraftScript waa luqad matrikis ah oo loo qoray si ay u akhrisanayso sida MATLAB, sidaas darteed inta badan codadka tirada ee caadiga ah (tusaale ahaan codka habaynta topology-ga ee 88 sadar) waxay ku shaqeeyaan isbeddello yar oo keliya. Waxay ku socotaa Goobta Script iyo amarka command line-ka. Qiyamaha Nooca Tusaale Xusuus Tiro, array a = 3, v = [1 2 3], A = [1 2; 3 4] Tiro kasta waa array (1×1). Arrays-ka waxa lagu kaydiyaa tiir-tiir, ilaa 8 cabbir Macquul A \u003E 2, true Arrays oo true/false ah; waa la isticmaali karaa tusmooyin Qoraal 'beam', \"beam\" Matrikis sparse sparse(i, j, v, n, n) Matrikisyada adkaysiga Mesh, field, model hexGrid(…), part(), load('part.stl') Waxa show sawiraa Struct s.E = 210e3 Goobo magac leh Cell c = {1, 'two', [3 4]} Liis qiyam kasta ah Function handle f = @(x) x.^2 Arrays iyo tusmeynta Kala-dhexaadyo: 1:5, 0:0.1:1. linspace(a, b, n), zeros(n, m), ones, eye, rand. Tusmeyntu waxay ka bilaabataa 1: A(2, 3), v(end), A(:, 1) (tiir oo dhan), A(:) (wax walba hal tiir), v(v \u003E 0) (tusmeyn macquul ah). Qoristu ka baxsan dhammaadka waxay array-ga ballaarisaa, sida MATLAB: v(10) = 1. Hawlgallada + - * / \\ ^ waa hawlgallo matrikis (A \\ b wuxuu xalliyaa); .* ./ .^ waxay shaqeeyaan unug-unug. ' wuxuu beddelaa safka iyo tiirka. Isbarbardhigga == ~= \u003C \u003C= \u003E \u003E=; macquulka & | ~ (unug-unug) iyo && || (gaabin). Xakameynta socodka iyo functions-ka for k = 1:10 if mod(k, 2) == 0 continue elseif k \u003E 7 break end end while err \u003E 1e-6, … end switch kind case 'steel' E = 210e3; otherwise E = 70e3; end try x = A \\ b; catch e disp(e.message) end Functions-ka waxay ku jiraan script-ka amarradiisa ka dib, ama tab script u gaar ah oo loogu magac daray function-ka: function [k, m] = beam(E, I, L) k = 3 * E * I / L^3; m = 0; end Magaca waxaa lagu raadiyaa amarkan: doorsoome, script qaybtan ku jira oo leh magacaas, function maktabad, function dhismay. Soo celin, faallooyin, wax soo saar Bayaan aan ; lahayn ayaa qiimihiisa daabacda; ; ayaa ku hayaa aamusnaan. % wuxuu bilaabaa faallo; %{ iyo %} oo ku yaal sadar kaliya ayaa faallaynaya sadarrada ka dhexeeya. disp(x), fprintf('%g\\n', x) iyo display(x) waxay daabacaan console-ka. Khaladaad iyo xaddidaad Khaladaadu waxay si fudud u sheegaan waxa khaldan iyo sadarka (iyo silsiladda wicitaanka functions-ka). Socod kasta wuxuu leeyahay miisaaniyad tallaabooyin (Run options ee panel-ka); wareeg aan dhammaadka lahayn wuxuu joogsadaa fariin, ama riix Stop. Array kasta wuxuu ilaa 134 milyan oo qiyam hayn karaa. Ma aha sida MATLAB Amarrada plot-ka waxay dhigaan xulashooyinkooda wicitaanka: plot(x, y, 'title', 'Error', 'xlabel', 'Step'). figure, hold, axis, title(…) iyo kuwa la mid ah waa la aqbalaa, ma sameeyaan wax. input iyo keyboard lama taageero: script-ku ma istaagi karo si uu su'aal u weyddiiyo. Ma jiraan toolboxes; maktabadda falanqaynta iyo built-in functions-ka ayaa jira oo keliya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"craftscript-lua","scope":"partcraft","title":"Scripts-ka Lua","summary":"Qor scripts-ka Goobta Script ee Lua 5.4: miiska cs ee built-in functions-ka, arrays oo ah qiyam leh tusmeyn iyo xisaab, workspace-ka wadaagga ah ws, daabacaadda iyo muujinta natiijooyinka, iyo waxa la damiyay.","section":"reference","order":62,"keywords":["Lua","Lua 5.4","script","luqad","miiska cs","cs table","ws","workspace","userdata","tensor","array","matrikis","print","display","sandbox"],"headings":[{"id":"aasaasiyaadka","text":"Aasaasiyaadka","level":2},{"id":"wac-maktabadda-falanqaynta","text":"Wac maktabadda falanqaynta","level":2},{"id":"waxa-la-damiyay","text":"Waxa la damiyay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ELua waa luqadda labaad ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EGoobta Script\u003C/a\u003E. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003ELua\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa luqadda ee kor ku yaal editor-ka (fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.lua\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu si toos ah ugu furmaa Lua). Lua iyo CraftScript waxay wadaagaan isla doorsoomayaasha iyo isla built-in functions-ka, sidaas darteed script Lua wuxuu isticmaali karaa waxa script CraftScript sameeyay, iyo sidii kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aasaasiyaadka\"\u003EAasaasiyaadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E-- built-in function kasta waxay ku jirtaa miiska cs\nlocal K = cs.zeros(3, 3)\nK:set(1, 1, 4)                 -- 1 ka bilaabo, sida CraftScript\nprint(K(1, 1), #K)             -- hal unug; tirada unugyada\n-- workspace-ka: isla doorsoomayaasha script kasta arka\nws.total = K(1, 1) * 2\nprint(ws.total)\n-- natiijooyin badan oo hal function ka soo baxa\nlocal V, D = cs.call(&#039;eig&#039;, 2, cs.tensor({{2, 1}, {1, 2}}))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecs.&lt;name&gt;(…)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu wacaa built-in function kasta oo soo celinaya natiijadiisa koowaad; \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.call(name, n, …)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu soo celinayaa \u003Ccode\u003En\u003C/code\u003E natiijo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecs.tensor({1, 2, 3})\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa safka, \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.tensor({{1, 2}, {3, 4}})\u003C/code\u003E matrikis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrays, matrikisyada sparse, meshes iyo fields waa qiyam leh habab: \u003Ccode\u003Et(i, j)\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Et:get(i, j)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Et:set(i, j, v)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Et:shape()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E#t\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Et:T()\u003C/code\u003E (transpose), \u003Ccode\u003Et:totable()\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * / ^\u003C/code\u003E waxay ka dhigan yihiin waxa ay CraftScript ka dhigan yihiin (\u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E waa wax-soo-saarka matrikiska); \u003Ccode\u003Et:times(u)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sii dhufanayaa unug-unug.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETiro ah oo array 1×1 ah wuxuu u yimaadaa sida tiro Lua oo fudud.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ews.name\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa oo qoraa workspace-ka wadaagga ah. Doorsoomayaasha caalamiga ah ee script-ku ka tago ayaa halkaas u galaya marka uu dhammaado.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eprint(…)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu daabacaa console-ka; \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.show(f)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.plot(y)\u003C/code\u003E iyo habab kale oo muujinta ah waxay u shaqeeyaan sida CraftScript.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wac-maktabadda-falanqaynta\"\u003EWac maktabadda falanqaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFunctions-ka maktabadda falanqaynta (tab-ka Library) iyo functions-ka CraftScript ee scripts-ka qaybtaada qeexaan ayaa sidoo kale lagu gaadhaa \u003Ccode\u003Ecs\u003C/code\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Elocal t = cs.box_mesh(100, 10, 10, 5, &#039;tet10&#039;)\nlocal bc = cs.struct({ fixedFaces = 5, loads = { cs.struct({ face = 6, force = cs.tensor({ 0, -100, 0 }) }) } })\nlocal r = cs.static_tet(t, 200000, 0.3, bc)\nprint(r.maxDisp)\nlocal nodes, tris = cs.call(&#039;face_nodes&#039;, 2, t, 6)   -- laba natiijo\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaa la helaa ka hor inta script-ku bilaabanin, sidaas darteed magaca ku qor script-ka: \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.static_tet(\u003C/code\u003E ama \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.call(&#039;static_tet&#039;, …)\u003C/code\u003E. Magac la dhisay socodka script-ka wuxuu gaadhaa built-in functions-ka oo keliya. Struct la dhisay \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.struct({ … })\u003C/code\u003E waa struct CraftScript, liiska Lua ee ka kooban (\u003Ccode\u003E{ cs.struct(…), … }\u003C/code\u003E) waa cell, taasoo ah waxa dejinta maktabadda rabto. Haddii wax khaldamo ku dhaco function maktabad gudihiisa, fariintu waxay magacaabaysaa function-ka iyo sadarkiisa, waxayna tilmaamaysaa sadarkaaga ee wicitaanka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-la-damiyay\"\u003EWaxa la damiyay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScripts-ku ma gaadhi karaan faylal, shabakad ama bogga: \u003Ccode\u003Eio\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eos\u003C/code\u003E (marka laga reebo saacadda), \u003Ccode\u003Erequire\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edofile\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eloadfile\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Edebug\u003C/code\u003E waa la ka saaray. Isticmaal Fur ee Goobta Script iyo doorsoomayaasha si xogta loo keeno. Miisaaniyadda tallaabooyinka iyo Stop waxay u shaqeeyaan sida CraftScript.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lua waa luqadda labaad ee Goobta Script. Dooro Lua sanduuqa luqadda ee kor ku yaal editor-ka (fayl .lua wuxuu si toos ah ugu furmaa Lua). Lua iyo CraftScript waxay wadaagaan isla doorsoomayaasha iyo isla built-in functions-ka, sidaas darteed script Lua wuxuu isticmaali karaa waxa script CraftScript sameeyay, iyo sidii kale. Aasaasiyaadka -- built-in function kasta waxay ku jirtaa miiska cs local K = cs.zeros(3, 3) K:set(1, 1, 4) -- 1 ka bilaabo, sida CraftScript print(K(1, 1), #K) -- hal unug; tirada unugyada -- workspace-ka: isla doorsoomayaasha script kasta arka ws.total = K(1, 1) * 2 print(ws.total) -- natiijooyin badan oo hal function ka soo baxa local V, D = cs.call('eig', 2, cs.tensor({{2, 1}, {1, 2}})) cs.\u003Cname\u003E(…) wuxuu wacaa built-in function kasta oo soo celinaya natiijadiisa koowaad; cs.call(name, n, …) wuxuu soo celinayaa n natiijo. cs.tensor({1, 2, 3}) wuxuu sameeyaa safka, cs.tensor({{1, 2}, {3, 4}}) matrikis. Arrays, matrikisyada sparse, meshes iyo fields waa qiyam leh habab: t(i, j) ama t:get(i, j), t:set(i, j, v), t:shape(), #t, t:T() (transpose), t:totable(). + - * / ^ waxay ka dhigan yihiin waxa ay CraftScript ka dhigan yihiin (* waa wax-soo-saarka matrikiska); t:times(u) wuxuu sii dhufanayaa unug-unug. Tiro ah oo array 1×1 ah wuxuu u yimaadaa sida tiro Lua oo fudud. ws.name wuxuu akhrinayaa oo qoraa workspace-ka wadaagga ah. Doorsoomayaasha caalamiga ah ee script-ku ka tago ayaa halkaas u galaya marka uu dhammaado. print(…) wuxuu daabacaa console-ka; cs.show(f), cs.plot(y) iyo habab kale oo muujinta ah waxay u shaqeeyaan sida CraftScript. Wac maktabadda falanqaynta Functions-ka maktabadda falanqaynta (tab-ka Library) iyo functions-ka CraftScript ee scripts-ka qaybtaada qeexaan ayaa sidoo kale lagu gaadhaa cs: local t = cs.box_mesh(100, 10, 10, 5, 'tet10') local bc = cs.struct({ fixedFaces = 5, loads = { cs.struct({ face = 6, force = cs.tensor({ 0, -100, 0 }) }) } }) local r = cs.static_tet(t, 200000, 0.3, bc) print(r.maxDisp) local nodes, tris = cs.call('face_nodes', 2, t, 6) -- laba natiijo Waa la helaa ka hor inta script-ku bilaabanin, sidaas darteed magaca ku qor script-ka: cs.static_tet( ama cs.call('static_tet', …). Magac la dhisay socodka script-ka wuxuu gaadhaa built-in functions-ka oo keliya. Struct la dhisay cs.struct({ … }) waa struct CraftScript, liiska Lua ee ka kooban ({ cs.struct(…), … }) waa cell, taasoo ah waxa dejinta maktabadda rabto. Haddii wax khaldamo ku dhaco function maktabad gudihiisa, fariintu waxay magacaabaysaa function-ka iyo sadarkiisa, waxayna tilmaamaysaa sadarkaaga ee wicitaanka. Waxa la damiyay Scripts-ku ma gaadhi karaan faylal, shabakad ama bogga: io, os (marka laga reebo saacadda), require, dofile, loadfile iyo debug waa la ka saaray. Isticmaal Fur ee Goobta Script iyo doorsoomayaasha si xogta loo keeno. Miisaaniyadda tallaabooyinka iyo Stop waxay u shaqeeyaan sida CraftScript.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"craftscript-python","scope":"partcraft","title":"Scripts-ka Python","summary":"Qor scripts-ka Goobta Script ee Python 3: object-ka cs ee built-in functions-ka, arrays oo u eg numpy oo tusmeyn 0 ka bilaabanaya, workspace-ka wadaagga ah, daabacaadda, waxa aan weli jirin, iyo sida Python loo xidho sida CraftScript iyo Lua.","section":"reference","order":63,"keywords":["Python","Python 3","CPython","WebAssembly","xidhan","amaan","sealed","safe","script","luqad","cs","ws","workspace","numpy","array","matrikis","tusmeyn","indexing","print","display","kalsoonaan","trust"],"headings":[{"id":"python-waa-la-xidhay","text":"Python waa la xidhay","level":2},{"id":"aasaasiyaadka","text":"Aasaasiyaadka","level":2},{"id":"wac-maktabadda-falanqaynta","text":"Wac maktabadda falanqaynta","level":2},{"id":"weli-ma-jiro","text":"Weli ma jiro","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPython waa luqadda saddexaad ee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EGoobta Script\u003C/a\u003E. Dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EPython\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa luqadda ee kor ku yaal editor-ka (fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.py\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu si toos ah ugu furmaa Python). Python, Lua iyo CraftScript waxay wadaagaan isla doorsoomayaasha iyo isla built-in functions-ka, sidaas darteed script Python wuxuu isticmaali karaa waxa script CraftScript sameeyay, iyo sidii kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESocodka Python ee ugu horreeya booqasho kasta wuxuu soo rarayaa Python laftiisa (CPython 3.14, qiyaastii 7 MB) bogga, taas oo qaadata dhowr ilbiriqsi. Python weli ma ku jirto \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E: socodsii hal script Python marka hore khadka xiran.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"python-waa-la-xidhay\"\u003EPython waa la xidhay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScripts-ka Python waa la xidhay sida scripts-ka CraftScript iyo Lua: waxay gaadhaan qaybta, doorsoomayaasha iyo built-in functions-ka, iyo waxba kale. Socod kasta waa Python cusub oo ku jira sandbox u gaar ah, oo leh geed fayl yar oo xusuus ku jira (maktabadda caadiga ah iyo folder \u003Ccode\u003E/tmp\u003C/code\u003E oo socodka dhamaadkiisa ka baxa). Ma gaadhi karo shabakadda, faylashaada ama bogga kale, ha ahaadeen browser-ka ama command line-ka. Script ka timid qof kale wuxuu weli isticmaali karaa waqti ama xusuus badan: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJooji\u003C/span\u003E ayaa joojiya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aasaasiyaadka\"\u003EAasaasiyaadka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA = cs.magic(3)              # built-in function kasta waa cs.&lt;name&gt;\nB = A @ A.T                  # @ waa wax-soo-saarka matrikiska, .T waa transpose\nC = A * 2 + 1                # + - * / ** waa unug-unug, sida numpy\nprint(A[0, 1], A[-1, -1])    # 0 ka bilaabo; tirada taban ka bilaabata dhamaadka\nrow = A[1]                   # hal tusmeyn matrikis: safka\nbig = A[A &gt; 4]               # maaskada macquulka ah ayaa unugyada xulata\nA[0, 0] = -5                 # qoris array gudihiisa\nV, D = cs.call(&#039;eig&#039;, 2, A)  # natiijooyin badan: cs.call(name, inta, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArray 1 × 1 wuxuu u yimaadaa sida tiro caadi ah; arrays kale, matrikisyada sparse, meshes, fields iyo models waa \u003Cstrong\u003EValues\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EValue wuxuu leeyahay \u003Ccode\u003Eshape\u003C/code\u003E (tuple), \u003Ccode\u003ET\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etype\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Enumel()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecopy()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Etolist()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Elen()\u003C/code\u003E (safkiisa), iyo \u003Ccode\u003Efloat()\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eint()\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Ebool()\u003C/code\u003E unug keliya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIsbarbardhigga (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E==\u003C/code\u003E, …) waa unug-unug, sida numpy: waxay bixiyaan Value macquul ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELiisaska tirooyinka ee loo gudbiyo built-in function wuxuu noqdaa arrays: \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.sum([1, 2, 3])\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.tensor([[1, 2], [3, 4]])\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu sameeyaa matrikis.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDict wuxuu noqdaa struct, liis khaldan oo waxyaabo kala duwan wuxuu noqdaa cell, iyo dib.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGlobal kasta oo script-kaagu sameeyo (tiro, Value, dict, liis…) wuxuu ku dhacaa tab-ka \u003Cstrong\u003EDoorsoomayaasha\u003C/strong\u003E marka socodku dhammaado, xitaa khalad ka dib. Magacyada bilaabma \u003Ccode\u003E_\u003C/code\u003E, functions, classes iyo modules waxay ku sii jiraan Python. \u003Ccode\u003Ews.name\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa ama dejinayaa doorsoome toos ah, \u003Ccode\u003Ews_names()\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu liistaa them.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eprint(…)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu daabacaa console-ka. \u003Ccode\u003Edisplay(…)\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.display\u003C/code\u003E) wuxuu muujiyaa mesh, field ama plot, sida CraftScript.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wac-maktabadda-falanqaynta\"\u003EWac maktabadda falanqaynta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFunctions-ka maktabadda waxaa loo wacaa sida built-ins: \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.box_mesh(20, 10, 10, 5, &#039;hex&#039;)\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecs.call(&#039;modal_tet&#039;, 2, …)\u003C/code\u003E. Magaca ku qor script-ka sida uu yahay: PartCraft wuxuu helaa functions-ka maktabadda ee script-ku isticmaalo ka hor inta uusan socon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-ma-jiro\"\u003EWeli ma jiro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Enumpy, scipy iyo xirmooyin kale: waxa jira oo keliya maktabadda caadiga ah ee Python (\u003Ccode\u003Emath\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ejson\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eitertools\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Edecimal\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Estatistics\u003C/code\u003E…), oo aan qaybaha daaqadaha, terminal-ka iyo database-ka lahayn (\u003Ccode\u003Etkinter\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecurses\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esqlite3\u003C/code\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESockets iyo wax kasta oo ka baxsan: Python ma leh shabakad halkan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etime.sleep\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu soo laabtaa isla markiiba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiritaanka editor-ka, iyo wicitaanka function Python ka script CraftScript.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESocodku wuxuu hubiyaa miisaaniyadda amarrada iyo Stop 1000 sadar kasta; xisaab dheer oo gudaha hal built-in function ah ayaa marka hore dhammaanaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Python waa luqadda saddexaad ee Goobta Script. Dooro Python sanduuqa luqadda ee kor ku yaal editor-ka (fayl .py wuxuu si toos ah ugu furmaa Python). Python, Lua iyo CraftScript waxay wadaagaan isla doorsoomayaasha iyo isla built-in functions-ka, sidaas darteed script Python wuxuu isticmaali karaa waxa script CraftScript sameeyay, iyo sidii kale. Socodka Python ee ugu horreeya booqasho kasta wuxuu soo rarayaa Python laftiisa (CPython 3.14, qiyaastii 7 MB) bogga, taas oo qaadata dhowr ilbiriqsi. Python weli ma ku jirto Kaydi khadka ka baxsan: socodsii hal script Python marka hore khadka xiran. Python waa la xidhay Scripts-ka Python waa la xidhay sida scripts-ka CraftScript iyo Lua: waxay gaadhaan qaybta, doorsoomayaasha iyo built-in functions-ka, iyo waxba kale. Socod kasta waa Python cusub oo ku jira sandbox u gaar ah, oo leh geed fayl yar oo xusuus ku jira (maktabadda caadiga ah iyo folder /tmp oo socodka dhamaadkiisa ka baxa). Ma gaadhi karo shabakadda, faylashaada ama bogga kale, ha ahaadeen browser-ka ama command line-ka. Script ka timid qof kale wuxuu weli isticmaali karaa waqti ama xusuus badan: Jooji ayaa joojiya. Aasaasiyaadka A = cs.magic(3) # built-in function kasta waa cs.\u003Cname\u003E B = A @ A.T # @ waa wax-soo-saarka matrikiska, .T waa transpose C = A * 2 + 1 # + - * / ** waa unug-unug, sida numpy print(A[0, 1], A[-1, -1]) # 0 ka bilaabo; tirada taban ka bilaabata dhamaadka row = A[1] # hal tusmeyn matrikis: safka big = A[A \u003E 4] # maaskada macquulka ah ayaa unugyada xulata A[0, 0] = -5 # qoris array gudihiisa V, D = cs.call('eig', 2, A) # natiijooyin badan: cs.call(name, inta, …) Array 1 × 1 wuxuu u yimaadaa sida tiro caadi ah; arrays kale, matrikisyada sparse, meshes, fields iyo models waa Values. Value wuxuu leeyahay shape (tuple), T, type, numel(), copy(), tolist(), len() (safkiisa), iyo float(), int() iyo bool() unug keliya. Isbarbardhigga (\u003C, ==, …) waa unug-unug, sida numpy: waxay bixiyaan Value macquul ah. Liisaska tirooyinka ee loo gudbiyo built-in function wuxuu noqdaa arrays: cs.sum([1, 2, 3]). cs.tensor([[1, 2], [3, 4]]) wuxuu sameeyaa matrikis. Dict wuxuu noqdaa struct, liis khaldan oo waxyaabo kala duwan wuxuu noqdaa cell, iyo dib. Global kasta oo script-kaagu sameeyo (tiro, Value, dict, liis…) wuxuu ku dhacaa tab-ka Doorsoomayaasha marka socodku dhammaado, xitaa khalad ka dib. Magacyada bilaabma _, functions, classes iyo modules waxay ku sii jiraan Python. ws.name wuxuu akhrinayaa ama dejinayaa doorsoome toos ah, ws_names() wuxuu liistaa them. print(…) wuxuu daabacaa console-ka. display(…) (ama cs.display) wuxuu muujiyaa mesh, field ama plot, sida CraftScript. Wac maktabadda falanqaynta Functions-ka maktabadda waxaa loo wacaa sida built-ins: cs.box_mesh(20, 10, 10, 5, 'hex'), cs.call('modal_tet', 2, …). Magaca ku qor script-ka sida uu yahay: PartCraft wuxuu helaa functions-ka maktabadda ee script-ku isticmaalo ka hor inta uusan socon. Weli ma jiro numpy, scipy iyo xirmooyin kale: waxa jira oo keliya maktabadda caadiga ah ee Python (math, json, itertools, decimal, statistics…), oo aan qaybaha daaqadaha, terminal-ka iyo database-ka lahayn (tkinter, curses, sqlite3). Sockets iyo wax kasta oo ka baxsan: Python ma leh shabakad halkan. time.sleep wuxuu soo laabtaa isla markiiba. Xiritaanka editor-ka, iyo wicitaanka function Python ka script CraftScript. Socodku wuxuu hubiyaa miisaaniyadda amarrada iyo Stop 1000 sadar kasta; xisaab dheer oo gudaha hal built-in function ah ayaa marka hore dhammaanaya.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"fields","scope":"partcraft","title":"Fields: qaabab ahaan masaafooyin","summary":"Waa maxay field (qaab loo kaydiyo sida masaafada ilaa wejigiisa), sida loo dhiso mid laga bilaabo primitives-ka, booleans, lattices iyo minimal surfaces script ah, sida ay u noqoto jidh, iyo sababta script isku mid ah had iyo jeer u bixiyo byte isku mid ah.","section":"reference","order":95,"keywords":["field","signed distance","sdf","voxel","gyroid","tpms","lattice","boolean","offset","shell","blend","dual contouring","deterministic","watertight","manifold","brick"],"headings":[{"id":"field-ilaa-jidh","text":"Field ilaa jidh","level":2},{"id":"had-iyo-jeer-byte-isku-mid-ah","text":"Had iyo jeer byte isku mid ah","level":2},{"id":"meesha-aad-u-tagi-karto","text":"Meesha aad u tagi karto","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EField\u003C/strong\u003E wuxuu qaabka ku sharaxaa masaafada ka dhex dhaxaysa barta kasta iyo wejigiisa: taban gudaha, eber wejiga dushiisa, mid togan dibadda. Silinder-ka radius 5 ah waa &quot;masaafada ilaa dhexda ka dhimo 5&quot;. Isku-darka qaababka waa xisaab masaafooyinka: isku-darka waa midka ka yar labada, isgoyska midka ka weyn, iyo ka jaridda mid kale waa midka ugu weyn ee hore iyo kan labaad oo taban. Qaabka oo 1 mm loo weyneeyo waxay ka jaraa 1 masaafada; darbiga god ah waa masaafada oo la rogay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaasi waa sababta fields-ku u wanaagsan yihiin lattices, kanaallada iyo darbiyada heerka ah: wejiga gyroid-ka waa &quot;isku-darka sine-ka waa eber&quot;, darbi ka qaro-weyn 1 mm ilaa 3 mm qaybta oo dhan waa lambar kaas oo qaybta oo dhan ku beddela.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"field-ilaa-jidh\"\u003EField ilaa jidh\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eto_body(field, h)\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu field-ka ku sampleeyaa grid ah barar \u003Ccode\u003Eh\u003C/code\u003E mm ka fogaan, isagoo kaliya hayaa barar u dhow wejiga (grid sparse ah oo 8 × 8 × 8 bricks), oo wejiga wuxuu dhisaa \u003Cstrong\u003Edual contouring\u003C/strong\u003E ka: hal vertex unug wejig kasta, meesha ay diyaarado wejiga kulmaan, sidaas darteed geesta adag waxay adag tahay ilaa hal voxel. Wejigu waa xidhan, geesta kasta waxaa wadaaga saddex-geesood gaar ah; warbixinta waa sheegtaa. Qaabka ka dhuuban ~saddex voxel ayaa laga yaabaa inuu gacan-kabo, markaas warbixinta waxay sheegtaa jidhka inuusan ahayn jidh xidhan iyo inaanay qarin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECabbirka voxel-ka waa saxnaanta: mugga kuraha 25 voxel ballaadhka ah wuxuu ku dhex jiraa dhowr boqolkiiba ee kun, darbi waa run sida voxels-keeda oo kale. Grid-ka sii weyn ayaa sii dhakhso badan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"had-iyo-jeer-byte-isku-mid-ah\"\u003EHad iyo jeer byte isku mid ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EField-ku ma leh saac ama lambar random. Sine iyo cosine-ka gyroid-ka, iyo exponential, logarithm iyo power kasta maktabadda, waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa xisaab fudud si Node, Chrome, Firefox iyo Safari ay u siiyaan bitisa isku mid ah; grid-ka waxaa lagu soo maraa nidaam go&#039;an, sidaas darteed script isku mid ah oo leh gelin isku mid ah wuxuu soo saaraa mesh-yo iyo xog-xaashiyo byte-ka isku mid ah, kombiyuutar kasta oo kasta, iyo threads-ka worker-ka oo kasta. Taasi waa la tijaabiyey, oo ay ku jirto browser iyo Node.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"meesha-aad-u-tagi-karto\"\u003EMeesha aad u tagi karto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/write-a-generator\" data-topic=\"partcraft/write-a-generator\"\u003EQor generator\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu dhisaa qayb adigoo isticmaalaya fields; \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/engineering-library\" data-topic=\"partcraft/engineering-library\"\u003EMaktabadda injineeriyadda\u003C/a\u003E wuxuu cabbiraa.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Field wuxuu qaabka ku sharaxaa masaafada ka dhex dhaxaysa barta kasta iyo wejigiisa: taban gudaha, eber wejiga dushiisa, mid togan dibadda. Silinder-ka radius 5 ah waa \"masaafada ilaa dhexda ka dhimo 5\". Isku-darka qaababka waa xisaab masaafooyinka: isku-darka waa midka ka yar labada, isgoyska midka ka weyn, iyo ka jaridda mid kale waa midka ugu weyn ee hore iyo kan labaad oo taban. Qaabka oo 1 mm loo weyneeyo waxay ka jaraa 1 masaafada; darbiga god ah waa masaafada oo la rogay. Taasi waa sababta fields-ku u wanaagsan yihiin lattices, kanaallada iyo darbiyada heerka ah: wejiga gyroid-ka waa \"isku-darka sine-ka waa eber\", darbi ka qaro-weyn 1 mm ilaa 3 mm qaybta oo dhan waa lambar kaas oo qaybta oo dhan ku beddela. Field ilaa jidh to_body(field, h) wuxuu field-ka ku sampleeyaa grid ah barar h mm ka fogaan, isagoo kaliya hayaa barar u dhow wejiga (grid sparse ah oo 8 × 8 × 8 bricks), oo wejiga wuxuu dhisaa dual contouring ka: hal vertex unug wejig kasta, meesha ay diyaarado wejiga kulmaan, sidaas darteed geesta adag waxay adag tahay ilaa hal voxel. Wejigu waa xidhan, geesta kasta waxaa wadaaga saddex-geesood gaar ah; warbixinta waa sheegtaa. Qaabka ka dhuuban ~saddex voxel ayaa laga yaabaa inuu gacan-kabo, markaas warbixinta waxay sheegtaa jidhka inuusan ahayn jidh xidhan iyo inaanay qarin. Cabbirka voxel-ka waa saxnaanta: mugga kuraha 25 voxel ballaadhka ah wuxuu ku dhex jiraa dhowr boqolkiiba ee kun, darbi waa run sida voxels-keeda oo kale. Grid-ka sii weyn ayaa sii dhakhso badan. Had iyo jeer byte isku mid ah Field-ku ma leh saac ama lambar random. Sine iyo cosine-ka gyroid-ka, iyo exponential, logarithm iyo power kasta maktabadda, waxaa lagu xisaabiyaa xisaab fudud si Node, Chrome, Firefox iyo Safari ay u siiyaan bitisa isku mid ah; grid-ka waxaa lagu soo maraa nidaam go'an, sidaas darteed script isku mid ah oo leh gelin isku mid ah wuxuu soo saaraa mesh-yo iyo xog-xaashiyo byte-ka isku mid ah, kombiyuutar kasta oo kasta, iyo threads-ka worker-ka oo kasta. Taasi waa la tijaabiyey, oo ay ku jirto browser iyo Node. Meesha aad u tagi karto Qor generator wuxuu dhisaa qayb adigoo isticmaalaya fields; Maktabadda injineeriyadda wuxuu cabbiraa.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"partcraft","title":"Dhibaatooyinka iyo xalinta","summary":"Dhibaatooyinka aad la kulmi karto PartCraft, laga bilaabo app-ka oo aan bilaabmin ilaa feature-yada fashilmaya, sketch-yada aan xallan karin, faylalka aan furmin iyo joints-ka khaldan, iyo fariinta aad aragto iyo xalka.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["dhibaato","khalad","caawimaad","ma shaqeynayo","fashil","fashilaya","crash","bannaan","webgl","webassembly","kernel","aan la dhisin","over defined","profile furan","ma furi karo","wax ma dhacaan","jihada khaldan","gaabis"],"headings":[{"id":"app-ku-ma-bilaabmo","text":"App-ku ma bilaabmo","level":2},{"id":"browser-kan-ma-muuqan-karo-3d-webgl-waa-damaysan-yahay-ama-ma-jiro-marka-partcraft-halkan-ma-shaqeyn-karo","text":"\"Browser-kan ma muuqan karo 3D (WebGL waa damaysan yahay ama ma jiro), marka PartCraft halkan ma shaqeyn karo.\"","level":3},{"id":"kernel-ka-solid-ka-ma-soo-dejin","text":"\"Kernel-ka solid-ka ma soo dejin: …\"","level":3},{"id":"badhanka-offline-wuxuu-leeyahay-lama-kaydin-karin-ama-offline-lama-heli-karo","text":"Badhanka offline wuxuu leeyahay \"Lama kaydin karin\" ama \"Offline lama heli karo\"","level":3},{"id":"partcraft-waa-offline-laakiin-waa-duugoobay","text":"PartCraft waa offline laakiin waa duugoobay","level":3},{"id":"sweep-not-built-yet-it-needs-an-exact-kernel","text":"\"Sweep: not built yet. It needs an exact kernel, …\"","level":3},{"id":"kernel-ka-solid-ka-waa-la-soo-dejinayaa-aan-waligiis-dhammaan","text":"Kernel-ka solid-ka waa la soo dejinayaa… aan waligiis dhammaan","level":3},{"id":"wax-ma-dhacaan-markaan-furayo-fure","text":"Wax ma dhacaan markaan furayo fure","level":2},{"id":"badhanka-toolbar-ka-ayaa-midabka-cad-grayed","text":"Badhanka toolbar-ka ayaa midabka cad (grayed)","level":2},{"id":"dhibaatooyinka-sketch-ka","text":"Dhibaatooyinka sketch-ka","level":2},{"id":"sketch-ku-ma-oggolaanayo-inaan-ku-daro-isku-xidh","text":"Sketch-ku ma oggolaanayo inaan ku daro isku xidh","level":3},{"id":"over-defined-ma-dhammaan-karaan-ka-noqo-ama-tirtir-mid-ka-mid-ah","text":"\"Over defined: … ma dhammaan karaan. Ka noqo, ama tirtir mid ka mid ah.\"","level":3},{"id":"over-defined-horey-ayaa-loo-gartay-tirtir","text":"\"Over defined: … horey ayaa loo gartay. Tirtir.\"","level":3},{"id":"shaygaas-ma-cabbiri-karaan-wada","text":"\"Shaygaas ma cabbiri karaan wada.\"","level":3},{"id":"fillet-wuxuu-u-baahan-yahay-geesta-uu-laba-xariiq-kulmaan-radius-kaas-wuu-ka-weyn-yahay-xariiqyadan","text":"\"Fillet wuxuu u baahan yahay geesta uu laba xariiq kulmaan.\" / \"Radius-kaas wuu ka weyn yahay xariiqyadan.\"","level":3},{"id":"joomatriga-wuu-dib-ugu-noqdaa-markaan-jiido","text":"Joomatriga wuu dib ugu noqdaa markaan jiido","level":3},{"id":"sketch-kan-ma-furi-karo-wuxuu-u-baahan-yahay-extrude2-oo-fashilanaysa","text":"\"Sketch-kan ma furi karo: wuxuu u baahan yahay Extrude2, oo fashilanaysa.\"","level":3},{"id":"dhibaatooyinka-feature-ka","text":"Dhibaatooyinka feature-ka","level":2},{"id":"dhibaatooyinka-xulashada","text":"Dhibaatooyinka xulashada","level":2},{"id":"dhibaatooyinka-faylka","text":"Dhibaatooyinka faylka","level":2},{"id":"dhibaatooyinka-sawirka","text":"Dhibaatooyinka sawirka","level":2},{"id":"dhibaatooyinka-isku-dhiska","text":"Dhibaatooyinka isku-dhiska","level":2},{"id":"waa-gaabis","text":"Waa gaabis","level":2},{"id":"weli-waad-ku-jirtaa-dhibaato","text":"Weli waad ku jirtaa dhibaato","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka wax aan shaqeynin, akhri \u003Cstrong\u003Estatus bar\u003C/strong\u003E ee hoose marka hore: PartCraft wuxuu halkaas kuugu sheegayaa sababta uu diiday ama waxa uu sugayo xiga. Feature-ka fashilaya wuxuu sidoo kale muujinayaa fariintiisa panelka midig sare iyo marka aad ku dul ridayso safkiisa history-ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"app-ku-ma-bilaabmo\"\u003EApp-ku ma bilaabmo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"browser-kan-ma-muuqan-karo-3d-webgl-waa-damaysan-yahay-ama-ma-jiro-marka-partcraft-halkan-ma-shaqeyn-karo\"\u003E&quot;Browser-kan ma muuqan karo 3D (WebGL waa damaysan yahay ama ma jiro), marka PartCraft halkan ma shaqeyn karo.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESababta:\u003C/strong\u003E browser-ka wuxuu damiyay ama xannibay 3D graphics (WebGL), ama graphics driver-ka ma taageero.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXalka:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Ccode\u003Echrome://settings/system\u003C/code\u003E (ama \u003Ccode\u003Eedge://settings/system\u003C/code\u003E Edge-ka) oo shid &quot;Use graphics acceleration when available&quot;, kadibna dib u bilow browser-ka. Haddii uu shidan yahay, hubi \u003Ccode\u003Echrome://gpu\u003C/code\u003E si aad u aragto xaaladda WebGL, oo cusboonaysii graphics driver-ka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Ccode\u003Eabout:support\u003C/code\u003E oo fiiri Graphics, WebGL. Haddii la xannibay, cusboonaysii graphics driver-ka. \u003Ccode\u003Eabout:config\u003C/code\u003E dhexdeeda, \u003Ccode\u003Ewebgl.disabled\u003C/code\u003E waa inuu noqdaa \u003Ccode\u003Efalse\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWebGL waa had iyo jeer furan tahay Safari-ga hadda jira. Cusboonaysii macOS (Safari waa la cusboonaysiiyaa isaga). Haddii weli fashilanto, isku day Chrome ama Firefox isla Mac-ka si aad u joojiso in hardware-ka graphics-ku sababa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKombiyuutarrada fog (remote desktops) iyo qaar ka mid ah virtual machines-ka ma leeyihiin WebGL. Isku day kombiyuutarka laftiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kernel-ka-solid-ka-ma-soo-dejin\"\u003E&quot;Kernel-ka solid-ka ma soo dejin: …&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESababta:\u003C/strong\u003E geometry kernel (barnaamij WebAssembly ah) lama soo qaadi karin ama lama bilaabi karin. Inta badan xiriirku wuu go&#039;ay intii app-ku soo dejinayay, WebAssembly waxaa damiyay siyaasad shirkad ama habka amniga browser-ka, ama browser-ku aad bay u duuban yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXalka:\u003C/strong\u003E dib u soo rar bogga intaad online tahay. Haddii ay sii fashilanto, isku day browser kale oo casri ah. Firefox-ka, \u003Ccode\u003Ejavascript.options.wasm\u003C/code\u003E ee \u003Ccode\u003Eabout:config\u003C/code\u003E waa inuu noqdaa \u003Ccode\u003Etrue\u003C/code\u003E. Offline ahaan, app-ka iyo kernel-ka kaliya ayay soo dejiyaan haddii app bar-ku yiri \u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaar offline\u003C/strong\u003E ka hor intaadan xiriirka lumin (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E intaad online tahay; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EShaqaynta offline\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"badhanka-offline-wuxuu-leeyahay-lama-kaydin-karin-ama-offline-lama-heli-karo\"\u003EBadhanka offline wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Lama kaydin karin&quot; ama &quot;Offline lama heli karo&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELama kaydin karin\u003C/strong\u003E: qaar ka mid ah faylalka lama soo dejin. Guji mar kale intaad online tahay; xiriir gaabis ama lacag lagu qiyaasaa wuxuu u baahan karaa isku day labaad. \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline lama heli karo\u003C/strong\u003E: daaqadan browser-ku ma kaydin karto nuqul offline ah (daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kombiyuutarrada la maamulo qaar ayaa xannibaya). Isticmaal daaqad caadi ah, ama ilaali tab-ka furan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"partcraft-waa-offline-laakiin-waa-duugoobay\"\u003EPartCraft waa offline laakiin waa duugoobay\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji \u003Cstrong\u003EDiyaar offline\u003C/strong\u003E intaad online tahay, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave again (get the newest version)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sweep-not-built-yet-it-needs-an-exact-kernel\"\u003E&quot;Sweep: not built yet. It needs an exact kernel, …&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFariinta oo buuxa waa &quot;&lt;Name&gt;: weli lama dhisin. Waxay u baahan tahay kernel saxda ah, oo nooca PartCraft-kan ma haysto. Caawimaad › Waxa aan weli la dhisin wuxuu sheegayaa waxa lagu sameeyo halkeeda.&quot; Waad aragtaa markaad doorato Sweep, Loft, Rib, sheet metal flange, feature wejig, Combine, Move body, Scale body ama Path pattern, iyo waxyaabaha kale oo kernel saxda ah keliya u baahan. Wax khalad ah ma jiro browser-kaaga ama qaybtaada: nooca PartCraft-kan qayb kasta wuxuu ku dhisaa kernel-ka mesh. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan weli la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E waxa lagu sameeyo halkeeda, iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EKernel-ka mesh\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"kernel-ka-solid-ka-waa-la-soo-dejinayaa-aan-waligiis-dhammaan\"\u003EKernel-ka solid-ka waa la soo dejinayaa… aan waligiis dhammaan\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESug yar xiriir gaabis: kernel-ka iyo maktabadda 3D waa la soo dejiyaa markii ugu horreysay. Kadibna dib u rar. Haddii bogga qudhiisu khalad muujiyo, eeg kor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-ma-dhacaan-markaan-furayo-fure\"\u003EWax ma dhacaan markaan furayo fure\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFurayaasha ma shaqeeyaan markaad cursor-ku ku jiro sanduuq panel gudaha. Guji aragtida 3D ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ka dib qorista (ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ka bax).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFurayaasha fallaadhaha iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E/\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay wareejiyaan kaliya aragtida ka dib markaad gujisay aragtida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDialog ayaa furan: ka jawaab kii hore.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESketch-ka dhexdiisa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waa qalabka Fillet, ma aha Fit. Isticmaal badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badhanka-toolbar-ka-ayaa-midabka-cad-grayed\"\u003EBadhanka toolbar-ka ayaa midabka cad (grayed)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhamada feature-ka waa grayed markaad sketch furan tahay. Marka hore sketch-ka xir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada sketch-ka waxay shaqeeyaan oo keliya gudaha sketch-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E waa grayed markaad wax dib u qaadi ama dib u samayn karin aysan jirin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u baahan yahay qayb leh solid. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoint\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u baahan yahay laba qayb isku-dhiska ku jira. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit part\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u baahan yahay qayb la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E waa grayed isku-dhiska: dhoofi qayb kasta. Barnaamij kale wuu diidaa faylka saxda ah: isku day \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP214 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP (faceted, mesh kernel)\u003C/span\u003E, oo nagu soo sheeg \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E iyo feature-yada kale ee u baahan kernel saxda ah ma ahan grayed: waa la guji karaa, tooltip-kooda wuxuu ku dhamaadaa &quot;weli lama dhisin (wuxuu u baahan yahay exact kernel)&quot;, gujintu mid kastaa waxay sheegtaa status bar-ka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan weli la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu u baahan yahay qayb leh solid, waana grayed inta sketch furan tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E waa grayed isku-dhiska: isku-dhisyada weli lama dhoofin karo. Xir, ama wax ka beddel qayb si aad u dhoofiso.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibaatooyinka-sketch-ka\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka sketch-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sketch-ku-ma-oggolaanayo-inaan-ku-daro-isku-xidh\"\u003ESketch-ku ma oggolaanayo inaan ku daro isku xidh\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Isku xidhku ma waafaqsana doorashadan. Dooro hal ama laba shay (Shift+click ayaa ku daraa).&quot; Isku xidhku wuxuu u baahan yahay doorasho kale. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sketch-relations\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sketch-relations\"\u003EIsku xidhka iyo cabbirrada sketch-ka\u003C/a\u003E si aad u ogaato waxa mid kasta u baahan yahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"over-defined-ma-dhammaan-karaan-ka-noqo-ama-tirtir-mid-ka-mid-ah\"\u003E&quot;Over defined: … ma dhammaan karaan. Ka noqo, ama tirtir mid ka mid ah.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESababta:\u003C/strong\u003E isku xidhka ama cabbirka cusub ayaa ka soo horjeeda kuwii hore. Sketch-ku ma dhaqaaqin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXalka:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama tirtir mid ka mid ah shayada casaanka ah ee liiska panelka midig (dooro \u003Cstrong\u003EDelete\u003C/strong\u003E ee u dhow).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"over-defined-horey-ayaa-loo-gartay-tirtir\"\u003E&quot;Over defined: … horey ayaa loo gartay. Tirtir.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESababta:\u003C/strong\u003E isku xidhku ma darayo wax cusub: kuwa kale horey ayay u qasbeen (tusaale Parallel labada dhinac ee rectangle, ama cabbir horay u go&#039;an). Dhismaha kan ma jiro cabbir la wadaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXalka:\u003C/strong\u003E tirtir. Feature-ku wuu sidaas ku dhisaa, digniin ku jirta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"shaygaas-ma-cabbiri-karaan-wada\"\u003E&quot;Shaygaas ma cabbiri karaan wada.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad gujisay, tusaale, dhibic iyo goobo. Taas beddelkeed cabbir u qaado dhibcaha dhexe ee goobada.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fillet-wuxuu-u-baahan-yahay-geesta-uu-laba-xariiq-kulmaan-radius-kaas-wuu-ka-weyn-yahay-xariiqyadan\"\u003E&quot;Fillet wuxuu u baahan yahay geesta uu laba xariiq kulmaan.&quot; / &quot;Radius-kaas wuu ka weyn yahay xariiqyadan.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuji si sax ah dhibcaha geeska laba xariiq adag. Isticmaal radius ka yar kan xariiqa ugu gaaban ee u ogolaanayo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"joomatriga-wuu-dib-ugu-noqdaa-markaan-jiido\"\u003EJoomatriga wuu dib ugu noqdaa markaan jiido\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJiidista waxay jebin lahayd isku xidh ama cabbir, sidaas darteed PartCraft wuu dib u celiyaa. Kaliya joomatriga buluugga ah (qeexan qaybta) ayaa dhaqaaqi kara.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sketch-kan-ma-furi-karo-wuxuu-u-baahan-yahay-extrude2-oo-fashilanaysa\"\u003E&quot;Sketch-kan ma furi karo: wuxuu u baahan yahay Extrude2, oo fashilanaysa.&quot;\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESketch-ku wuxuu ku yaal wejig feature aan la dhisin. Marka hore feature-kaas saxa, ama ka furo (unsuppress), ama roll forward.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibaatooyinka-feature-ka\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka feature-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESababta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Marka hore samee sketch: dooro diyaarad, Sketch, sawir profile xirran, Exit.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro sketch aan isticmaal lahayn oo leh curves, lamana dooran\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESamee sketch, ama dooro sketch-ka history-ga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The sketch has no closed profile to extrude.&quot; (ama &quot;to revolve&quot;)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro loop xirran oo xariiqyo adag\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXidh kala-go&#039;aanka; dib u beddel xariiqyada dhismaha \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Q\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EQ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The profile is open: an end at (x, y) is not joined to anything.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKala-go&#039;aan dhibcaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur sketch-ka, jiid dhamaadka ku dhow xaaska si uu u snap-gareeyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The profile branches at (x, y): more than two ends meet there.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaddex ama ka badan xariiq ayaa kulma dhibic\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETirtir xariiqa dheeraadka ah, ama dhismaha ka beddel\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;A closed loop needs at least three sides or a curve.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELaba xariiq dib-u-dhac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u sawir loop-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Through all is for cuts. Use a depth for a boss.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoss oo loo dejiyay Through all\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003EEnd\u003C/strong\u003E oo ah Blind ama Mid-plane\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;There is nothing to cut on that side of the sketch. Try the other direction.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoynta waxay u jeedaa dhinac ka baxsan walxaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadi \u003Cstrong\u003EReverse direction\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;There is nothing to cut yet.&quot; / &quot;There is nothing to drill yet.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro solid ka hor feature-kan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarka hore samee boss, ama feature-ka hoos u dhaqaaji\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Draw a centerline (a construction line) in the sketch to revolve about.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERevolve oo aan axis lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar centerline, ama dooro xariiq ee \u003Cstrong\u003EAxis\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The profile crosses the axis. Keep it on one side of the centerline.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EProfile-ku dhinac labaad ayuu axis-ka ka gudbaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDib u sawir nus profile-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Put sketch points where the holes go (Point tool), then make the hole.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMa jiro dhibic sketch-ka dhexdiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar dhibic \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The counterbore must be wider than the hole.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECounterbore ⌀ kuma weyn Diameter\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa dhig counterbore-ka mid ballaadhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The counterbore must be shallower than the hole.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECounterbore ka qoto dheer godka blind\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa dhig mid ka yar, ama godka ka dhig mid qoto dheer\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Choose the features to copy.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPattern ama mirror oo aan wax la calaamadin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadi feature hoosta \u003Cstrong\u003EFeature-yada la nuqulayo\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Extrude2 has no solid to copy.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeature-kii la nuqulayay wuu fashilmay ama damaysan yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHagaaji ama ka furo (unsuppress)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Needs Sketch3, which is failing.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeature uu ku tiirsan yahay weli ma dhisna\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHagaaji feature-ka uu magacaabo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The face it sits on is gone (Extrude1 is not built).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejigii sketch-ka ma jiro\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHagaaji feature-kaas, ama tirtir sketch-ka oo mar kale sawir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Nothing is left of the part after this.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoynta ayaa ka saartay walxaha oo dhan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHubi cabbirka goynta iyo jihada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The solid kernel could not build this (…).&quot; ama &quot;The solid kernel could not combine this with the body.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKernel-ku wuu diiday joomatriga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo, ama beddel cabbirrada yar; wejiyada si sax ah isu taabanaya ayaa keeni kara\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Sweep: not built yet. It needs an exact kernel, which this version of PartCraft does not have.&quot; (sidoo kale Loft, Rib iyo kuwa kale)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeature la sameeyay nooc hore oo kernel saxda ah keliya dhisi karta. Waa ku jirtaa history-ga oo waxaa dib loo kaydiyaa sidii ay ahayd\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESuppress ama tirtir; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"partcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWaxa aan weli la dhisin\u003C/a\u003E waxa lagu sameeyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;A 5 mm round does not fit here (…).&quot; / &quot;A 2 mm chamfer …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirku waa ka weyn wejiga ka dhow geesta, ama geeska lama isku qasi karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbir yar, ama geesood yar feature kasta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fillet: in this version only straight edges between two flat faces (the mesh kernel builds them). Round or bevel curved edges in the sketch.&quot; (sidoo kale Chamfer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeeska la doortay waa wareeg, sida afka godka, ama wuxuu ku yaal wejig qalloocan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick edges\u003C/span\u003E oo ka saar; ama wareeji ama bevel geeskaas sketch-ka dhexdiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;A fillet whose radius changes along the edge: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel). Give it one radius.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVariable radius\u003C/strong\u003E waa la calaamadiyey\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar calaamadda oo cabbir keliya sii\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fillet by the mesh kernel: where rounded edges meet they are mitred, not blended.&quot; (⚠, digniin)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGeesaha la doortay waxay kulmaan geesta; wareegyadu halkaas ku kulmaan waxay samaynayaan geesood adag, ma aha isku-dhafan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxba ma hagaajin: qaybtu waa la dhisay. Fillet geesaha yar haddii ay muhiim tahay geeska\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;An edge it rounds is gone: the edge between Extrude1 and Cut2.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsbeddel hore ayaa geeska ka saaray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick edges\u003C/span\u003E, ka saar geeska casaanka ah, dooro mid cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Pick the edges in the view, then add them.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet ama chamfer ma leh geesood\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick edges\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Pick the faces to remove (open), then shell.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShell-ka ma leh wejiyo furan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick faces\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The shell could not be made with this thickness (…).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbiga ayaa ka weyn qayb khafiif ah ama radius fillet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDarbi khafiif, ama fillet-yo waaweyn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Shell: in this version it opens flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejig furan wuu qalloocan yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick faces\u003C/span\u003E ka saar; fur wejiyada siman oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Draft: in this version flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiga draft-ka ah waa silinda, koon ama wejig qaab xor ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar; draft wejiyada siman oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;A face it opens is gone (…).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsbeddel hore ayaa wejiga ka saaray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick faces\u003C/span\u003E mar kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Fillet1 changes the body&#039;s edges or walls; it cannot be copied. …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPattern ama mirror wuxuu nuqulaa fillet, chamfer ama shell\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa saar calaamada; pattern goynta marka hore, kadibna fillet\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;It sits on a face only an exact kernel can find: not built yet in this version.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESketch ku yaal wejig kernel-ka mesh aan heli karin, sida mid nooc hore lagu sameeyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawir diyaarada asaasiga ah ama wejig siman oo extrude ah, oo cabbir ku dhig\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;It uses a face or edge of the solid, which only an exact kernel can find: not built yet in this version.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDiyaarad tixraac, dhuur ama dhibic ku taal wejig ama geesta solid-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa samee diyaaradaha asaasiga ah, sketch dhibcaha, ama isku xidhka cabbirro\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Extruding up to a face, the next face or a vertex: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel).&quot; / &quot;A taper: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadka ama taper-ka oo kernel saxda ah keliya dhisi karta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal Blind ama Mid-plane cabbir aad qiyaasto; ka dhig Taper 0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibaatooyinka-xulashada\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka xulashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Wejigaas wuu qalloocan yahay. Dooro wejig siman ama diyaarad si aad u sawirto.&quot; Sketch-yadu waxay u baahan yihiin wejig siman. Sawir diyaarada asaasiga ah oo dhig sketch-ka cabbirro.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWejig wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Fixed where picked&quot;: ma uusan ka samayn geesta sketch (tusaale, wejig nuqul pattern ah), sidaas darteed sketch-ka saaran way joogtaa markii qaybtu isbeddesho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGeesaha way adag yihiin in la gaadho: ku dhowow (zoom in). Geeska ayaa ka guuleysta wejiga ku dhow marka pointer-ku saxda ku yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibaatooyinka-faylka\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka faylka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&#039;PartCraft wuxuu furaa faylalkiisa .partcraft.json, wuxuu ka dhoofiyaa CadCraft macro-ka SolidWorks (.cadcraft-sw.json) iyo faylalka STEP. &quot;bracket.igs&quot; midkoodna ma aha.&#039;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya kuwaas ayaa la aqoonsadaa (iyo STL, OBJ, 3MF meshes iyo \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E files)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&#039;&quot;part.stp&quot; ma aha fayl STEP ah (kuma bilaabmo ISO-10303-21).&#039;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku ma aha STEP text\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;That STEP file is too big (over 60 MB) to import here.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFududee isha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;That file is too big to be a PartCraft part.&quot; oo ah qaybtaada aad keydisay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP solid weyn oo la soo geliyay nooc hore ayaa faylka qaybta ka dhigay in ka badan 50 MB. Isticmaal nuqul hore oo aan lahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;That file is too big to be a PartCraft part.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku wuxuu ka badan yahay 50 MB; ma aha fayl PartCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;This is not a PartCraft file (it is not JSON).&quot; ama &quot;This is not a PartCraft file.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylku waa damaan, ama barnaamij kale ayuu leeyahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;This file was saved by a newer PartCraft (file version …); this one reads version …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu fur PartCraft-ka cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Extrude2: the depth is bad.&quot; (ama qiime kale)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka gacanta ayaa lagu wax ka beddelay ama damaan. Isticmaal nuqul hore\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInsert isku-dhiska ku jira wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Part1.partcraft.json has no solid to insert.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka qaybta ma leh solid. Fur, samee solid, kaydi, oo mar kale gali\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFaylkii aan kaydiyay ma joogo meesha aan filayay.\u003C/strong\u003E Kaydintu waa download: eeg folder-ka downloads ee browser-kaaga, ama fur liiska downloads-ka toolbar-ka browser-ka. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EHalkee faylalkaagu ku tagaan\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQayb ayaan furay laakiin isku-dhiskii weli shaashadda ayuu ku jiraa.\u003C/strong\u003E Qaybtu waxay ku furmatay gadaasha isku-dhiska. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E si aad u xirto isku-dhiska oo aad u aragto qaybta. Xir isku-dhisyada ka hor inta aadan furin faylalka qaybaha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibaatooyinka-sawirka\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka sawirka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Marka hore samee solid, kadibna sawirkeeda samee.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta marka hore dhis\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;No room on the sheet for: detail. Make the detail smaller or drop a view.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXaashida ma leh meel. Yaree \u003Cstrong\u003EDetail radius\u003C/strong\u003E ama \u003Cstrong\u003EDetail scale\u003C/strong\u003E, ama ka saar goyn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;A detail is taken from the front, top, right or section view.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuji mid ka mid ah aragtidaas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Click on one of the views.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGujintu waxay ku dhacday warqad bannaan. Guji mid ka mid ah aragtiyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Position needs at least one datum reference.&quot; iyo fariimo kale oo frame ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDejiso datums uu panelku weydiiyo, ama dooro tilmaame kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The drawing views could not be made: …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKa noqo isbeddelkii ugu dambeeyay. Haddii ay sii socoto, kaydi, dib u rar, oo mar kale fur qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhibaatooyinka-isku-dhiska\"\u003EDhibaatooyinka isku-dhiska\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFariinta\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXalka\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Marka hore samee solid, kadibna geli isku-dhiska.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybtu weli ma leh solid\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Marka hore geli qayb labaad (Ku dar nuqul, Geli, ama Wax ka beddel › Duplicate).&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoint wuxuu u baahan yahay laba qayb\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Dooro wejig qayb kale.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabada wejig ee joint-ka waa inay ku jiraan qaybo kala duwan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;That face is curved. Pick a flat face …&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoints-ku wejiyada siman ayay ka bilaabmaan. Kadibna isticmaal \u003Cstrong\u003ECentre on\u003C/strong\u003E godka ama axis-ka revolve\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Bracket2 is not joined to the grounded part, so it stays where it was put.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar joint ka qayb ilaa qayb la dhigay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Revolute3 closes a loop that cannot close: it is off by 2.000 mm. Check the faces, offsets and limits of the loop&#039;s joints.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybaha ma isku gaadhi karaan: hubi dhererka, wejiyada joint kasta, offsets (qaybaha la isugu rakibay wejig-ku-wejig waa inay ku heshiiyaan qoto dheerka) iyo limits; ama ka saar hal joint oo loop-ka ka mid ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The face this joint uses is gone from Bracket.&quot; / &quot;The axis this joint uses is gone from Bracket.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybtu waa la wax ka beddelay. Ka saar joint-ka oo mar kale samee\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;The axis runs along the face, so it cannot set the joint&#039;s centre.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooro axis ku gudba wejiga, ama &quot;The face&#039;s own origin&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;An assembly keeps at least one part. Close it instead.&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQaybaha way isku xidhan yihiin laakiin meel khaldan.\u003C/strong\u003E Deji \u003Cstrong\u003ECentre on\u003C/strong\u003E labada dhinac ee joint-ka oo ah godka ama axis-ka revolve ee la rabo inay isku khadka saaraan, kadibna hagaaji \u003Cstrong\u003EAngle (°)\u003C/strong\u003E iyo \u003Cstrong\u003EOffset (mm)\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waa-gaabis\"\u003EWaa gaabis\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDeji \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E ilaa Normal ama Coarse intaad modelaynayso; ka dibna Fine ka hor dhoofinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETirooyin pattern oo waaweyn (boqolaad nuqul) wakhti ayay qaataan mar kasta oo isbeddel. Pattern-ka suppress samee intaad ka shaqaynayso feature-yada kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClash iyo motion check waxay isbarbardhigaan qaybaha kala laba; isku-dhisyada waaweyn wakhti dheer ayay qaataan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXir tabs-ka kale ee culus. PartCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa processor-ka kombiyuutarkaaga iyo graphics-kiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"weli-waad-ku-jirtaa-dhibaato\"\u003EWeli waad ku jirtaa dhibaato\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarka hore kaydi faylkaaga (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), kadibna dib u rar bogga oo mar kale fur. Haddii feature-ku weli fashilanto, dooro, akhri fariintiisa, oo isku day \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa gadaashii heerkii ugu dambeeyay ee fiican.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Marka wax aan shaqeynin, akhri status bar ee hoose marka hore: PartCraft wuxuu halkaas kuugu sheegayaa sababta uu diiday ama waxa uu sugayo xiga. Feature-ka fashilaya wuxuu sidoo kale muujinayaa fariintiisa panelka midig sare iyo marka aad ku dul ridayso safkiisa history-ga. App-ku ma bilaabmo \"Browser-kan ma muuqan karo 3D (WebGL waa damaysan yahay ama ma jiro), marka PartCraft halkan ma shaqeyn karo.\" Sababta: browser-ka wuxuu damiyay ama xannibay 3D graphics (WebGL), ama graphics driver-ka ma taageero. Xalka: Fur chrome://settings/system (ama edge://settings/system Edge-ka) oo shid \"Use graphics acceleration when available\", kadibna dib u bilow browser-ka. Haddii uu shidan yahay, hubi chrome://gpu si aad u aragto xaaladda WebGL, oo cusboonaysii graphics driver-ka. Fur about:support oo fiiri Graphics, WebGL. Haddii la xannibay, cusboonaysii graphics driver-ka. about:config dhexdeeda, webgl.disabled waa inuu noqdaa false. WebGL waa had iyo jeer furan tahay Safari-ga hadda jira. Cusboonaysii macOS (Safari waa la cusboonaysiiyaa isaga). Haddii weli fashilanto, isku day Chrome ama Firefox isla Mac-ka si aad u joojiso in hardware-ka graphics-ku sababa. Kombiyuutarrada fog (remote desktops) iyo qaar ka mid ah virtual machines-ka ma leeyihiin WebGL. Isku day kombiyuutarka laftiisa. \"Kernel-ka solid-ka ma soo dejin: …\" Sababta: geometry kernel (barnaamij WebAssembly ah) lama soo qaadi karin ama lama bilaabi karin. Inta badan xiriirku wuu go'ay intii app-ku soo dejinayay, WebAssembly waxaa damiyay siyaasad shirkad ama habka amniga browser-ka, ama browser-ku aad bay u duuban yahay. Xalka: dib u soo rar bogga intaad online tahay. Haddii ay sii fashilanto, isku day browser kale oo casri ah. Firefox-ka, javascript.options.wasm ee about:config waa inuu noqdaa true. Offline ahaan, app-ka iyo kernel-ka kaliya ayay soo dejiyaan haddii app bar-ku yiri Diyaar offline ka hor intaadan xiriirka lumin (Save for offline intaad online tahay; eeg Shaqaynta offline). Badhanka offline wuxuu leeyahay \"Lama kaydin karin\" ama \"Offline lama heli karo\" Lama kaydin karin: qaar ka mid ah faylalka lama soo dejin. Guji mar kale intaad online tahay; xiriir gaabis ama lacag lagu qiyaasaa wuxuu u baahan karaa isku day labaad. Offline lama heli karo: daaqadan browser-ku ma kaydin karto nuqul offline ah (daaqadaha gaarka ah iyo kombiyuutarrada la maamulo qaar ayaa xannibaya). Isticmaal daaqad caadi ah, ama ilaali tab-ka furan. PartCraft waa offline laakiin waa duugoobay Guji Diyaar offline intaad online tahay, kadibna dooro Save again (get the newest version). \"Sweep: not built yet. It needs an exact kernel, …\" Fariinta oo buuxa waa \"\u003CName\u003E: weli lama dhisin. Waxay u baahan tahay kernel saxda ah, oo nooca PartCraft-kan ma haysto. Caawimaad › Waxa aan weli la dhisin wuxuu sheegayaa waxa lagu sameeyo halkeeda.\" Waad aragtaa markaad doorato Sweep, Loft, Rib, sheet metal flange, feature wejig, Combine, Move body, Scale body ama Path pattern, iyo waxyaabaha kale oo kernel saxda ah keliya u baahan. Wax khalad ah ma jiro browser-kaaga ama qaybtaada: nooca PartCraft-kan qayb kasta wuxuu ku dhisaa kernel-ka mesh. Eeg Waxa aan weli la dhisin waxa lagu sameeyo halkeeda, iyo Kernel-ka mesh. Kernel-ka solid-ka waa la soo dejinayaa… aan waligiis dhammaan Sug yar xiriir gaabis: kernel-ka iyo maktabadda 3D waa la soo dejiyaa markii ugu horreysay. Kadibna dib u rar. Haddii bogga qudhiisu khalad muujiyo, eeg kor. Wax ma dhacaan markaan furayo fure Furayaasha ma shaqeeyaan markaad cursor-ku ku jiro sanduuq panel gudaha. Guji aragtida 3D ama riix Esc ka dib qorista (ama Tab ka bax). Furayaasha fallaadhaha iyo +/− waxay wareejiyaan kaliya aragtida ka dib markaad gujisay aragtida. Dialog ayaa furan: ka jawaab kii hore. Sketch-ka dhexdiisa, F waa qalabka Fillet, ma aha Fit. Isticmaal badhanka Fit. Badhanka toolbar-ka ayaa midabka cad (grayed) Badhamada feature-ka waa grayed markaad sketch furan tahay. Marka hore sketch-ka xir. Qalabyada sketch-ka waxay shaqeeyaan oo keliya gudaha sketch-ka. Undo iyo Redo waa grayed markaad wax dib u qaadi ama dib u samayn karin aysan jirin. Assembly wuxuu u baahan yahay qayb leh solid. Joint wuxuu u baahan yahay laba qayb isku-dhiska ku jira. Edit part wuxuu u baahan yahay qayb la doortay. STEP AP242 (exact solid) iyo STEP AP214 (exact solid) waa grayed isku-dhiska: dhoofi qayb kasta. Barnaamij kale wuu diidaa faylka saxda ah: isku day STEP AP214 (exact solid), kadibna STEP (faceted, mesh kernel), oo nagu soo sheeg Help › Report a problem. Sweep, Loft iyo feature-yada kale ee u baahan kernel saxda ah ma ahan grayed: waa la guji karaa, tooltip-kooda wuxuu ku dhamaadaa \"weli lama dhisin (wuxuu u baahan yahay exact kernel)\", gujintu mid kastaa waxay sheegtaa status bar-ka. Eeg Waxa aan weli la dhisin. Drawing wuxuu u baahan yahay qayb leh solid, waana grayed inta sketch furan tahay. Export waa grayed isku-dhiska: isku-dhisyada weli lama dhoofin karo. Xir, ama wax ka beddel qayb si aad u dhoofiso. Dhibaatooyinka sketch-ka Sketch-ku ma oggolaanayo inaan ku daro isku xidh \"Isku xidhku ma waafaqsana doorashadan. Dooro hal ama laba shay (Shift+click ayaa ku daraa).\" Isku xidhku wuxuu u baahan yahay doorasho kale. Eeg Isku xidhka iyo cabbirrada sketch-ka si aad u ogaato waxa mid kasta u baahan yahay. \"Over defined: … ma dhammaan karaan. Ka noqo, ama tirtir mid ka mid ah.\" Sababta: isku xidhka ama cabbirka cusub ayaa ka soo horjeeda kuwii hore. Sketch-ku ma dhaqaaqin. Xalka: Ctrl+Z, ama tirtir mid ka mid ah shayada casaanka ah ee liiska panelka midig (dooro Delete ee u dhow). \"Over defined: … horey ayaa loo gartay. Tirtir.\" Sababta: isku xidhku ma darayo wax cusub: kuwa kale horey ayay u qasbeen (tusaale Parallel labada dhinac ee rectangle, ama cabbir horay u go'an). Dhismaha kan ma jiro cabbir la wadaa. Xalka: tirtir. Feature-ku wuu sidaas ku dhisaa, digniin ku jirta. \"Shaygaas ma cabbiri karaan wada.\" Waxaad gujisay, tusaale, dhibic iyo goobo. Taas beddelkeed cabbir u qaado dhibcaha dhexe ee goobada. \"Fillet wuxuu u baahan yahay geesta uu laba xariiq kulmaan.\" / \"Radius-kaas wuu ka weyn yahay xariiqyadan.\" Guji si sax ah dhibcaha geeska laba xariiq adag. Isticmaal radius ka yar kan xariiqa ugu gaaban ee u ogolaanayo. Joomatriga wuu dib ugu noqdaa markaan jiido Jiidista waxay jebin lahayd isku xidh ama cabbir, sidaas darteed PartCraft wuu dib u celiyaa. Kaliya joomatriga buluugga ah (qeexan qaybta) ayaa dhaqaaqi kara. \"Sketch-kan ma furi karo: wuxuu u baahan yahay Extrude2, oo fashilanaysa.\" Sketch-ku wuxuu ku yaal wejig feature aan la dhisin. Marka hore feature-kaas saxa, ama ka furo (unsuppress), ama roll forward. Dhibaatooyinka feature-ka Fariinta Sababta Xalka \"Marka hore samee sketch: dooro diyaarad, Sketch, sawir profile xirran, Exit.\" Ma jiro sketch aan isticmaal lahayn oo leh curves, lamana dooran Samee sketch, ama dooro sketch-ka history-ga \"The sketch has no closed profile to extrude.\" (ama \"to revolve\") Ma jiro loop xirran oo xariiqyo adag Xidh kala-go'aanka; dib u beddel xariiqyada dhismaha Q \"The profile is open: an end at (x, y) is not joined to anything.\" Kala-go'aan dhibcaas Fur sketch-ka, jiid dhamaadka ku dhow xaaska si uu u snap-gareeyo \"The profile branches at (x, y): more than two ends meet there.\" Saddex ama ka badan xariiq ayaa kulma dhibic Tirtir xariiqa dheeraadka ah, ama dhismaha ka beddel \"A closed loop needs at least three sides or a curve.\" Laba xariiq dib-u-dhac Dib u sawir loop-ka \"Through all is for cuts. Use a depth for a boss.\" Boss oo loo dejiyay Through all Deji End oo ah Blind ama Mid-plane \"There is nothing to cut on that side of the sketch. Try the other direction.\" Goynta waxay u jeedaa dhinac ka baxsan walxaha Calaamadi Reverse direction \"There is nothing to cut yet.\" / \"There is nothing to drill yet.\" Ma jiro solid ka hor feature-kan Marka hore samee boss, ama feature-ka hoos u dhaqaaji \"Draw a centerline (a construction line) in the sketch to revolve about.\" Revolve oo aan axis lahayn Ku dar centerline, ama dooro xariiq ee Axis \"The profile crosses the axis. Keep it on one side of the centerline.\" Profile-ku dhinac labaad ayuu axis-ka ka gudbaa Dib u sawir nus profile-ka \"Put sketch points where the holes go (Point tool), then make the hole.\" Ma jiro dhibic sketch-ka dhexdiisa Ku dar dhibic P \"The counterbore must be wider than the hole.\" Counterbore ⌀ kuma weyn Diameter Ka dhig counterbore-ka mid ballaadhan \"The counterbore must be shallower than the hole.\" Counterbore ka qoto dheer godka blind Ka dhig mid ka yar, ama godka ka dhig mid qoto dheer \"Choose the features to copy.\" Pattern ama mirror oo aan wax la calaamadin Calaamadi feature hoosta Feature-yada la nuqulayo \"Extrude2 has no solid to copy.\" Feature-kii la nuqulayay wuu fashilmay ama damaysan yahay Hagaaji ama ka furo (unsuppress) \"Needs Sketch3, which is failing.\" Feature uu ku tiirsan yahay weli ma dhisna Hagaaji feature-ka uu magacaabo \"The face it sits on is gone (Extrude1 is not built).\" Wejigii sketch-ka ma jiro Hagaaji feature-kaas, ama tirtir sketch-ka oo mar kale sawir \"Nothing is left of the part after this.\" Goynta ayaa ka saartay walxaha oo dhan Hubi cabbirka goynta iyo jihada \"The solid kernel could not build this (…).\" ama \"The solid kernel could not combine this with the body.\" Kernel-ku wuu diiday joomatriga Ka noqo, ama beddel cabbirrada yar; wejiyada si sax ah isu taabanaya ayaa keeni kara \"Sweep: not built yet. It needs an exact kernel, which this version of PartCraft does not have.\" (sidoo kale Loft, Rib iyo kuwa kale) Feature la sameeyay nooc hore oo kernel saxda ah keliya dhisi karta. Waa ku jirtaa history-ga oo waxaa dib loo kaydiyaa sidii ay ahayd Suppress ama tirtir; eeg Waxa aan weli la dhisin waxa lagu sameeyo \"A 5 mm round does not fit here (…).\" / \"A 2 mm chamfer …\" Cabbirku waa ka weyn wejiga ka dhow geesta, ama geeska lama isku qasi karo Cabbir yar, ama geesood yar feature kasta \"Fillet: in this version only straight edges between two flat faces (the mesh kernel builds them). Round or bevel curved edges in the sketch.\" (sidoo kale Chamfer) Geeska la doortay waa wareeg, sida afka godka, ama wuxuu ku yaal wejig qalloocan Pick edges oo ka saar; ama wareeji ama bevel geeskaas sketch-ka dhexdiisa \"A fillet whose radius changes along the edge: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel). Give it one radius.\" Variable radius waa la calaamadiyey Ka saar calaamadda oo cabbir keliya sii \"Fillet by the mesh kernel: where rounded edges meet they are mitred, not blended.\" (⚠, digniin) Geesaha la doortay waxay kulmaan geesta; wareegyadu halkaas ku kulmaan waxay samaynayaan geesood adag, ma aha isku-dhafan Waxba ma hagaajin: qaybtu waa la dhisay. Fillet geesaha yar haddii ay muhiim tahay geeska \"An edge it rounds is gone: the edge between Extrude1 and Cut2.\" Isbeddel hore ayaa geeska ka saaray Pick edges, ka saar geeska casaanka ah, dooro mid cusub \"Pick the edges in the view, then add them.\" Fillet ama chamfer ma leh geesood Pick edges \"Pick the faces to remove (open), then shell.\" Shell-ka ma leh wejiyo furan Pick faces \"The shell could not be made with this thickness (…).\" Darbiga ayaa ka weyn qayb khafiif ah ama radius fillet Darbi khafiif, ama fillet-yo waaweyn \"Shell: in this version it opens flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).\" Wejig furan wuu qalloocan yahay Pick faces ka saar; fur wejiyada siman oo keliya \"Draft: in this version flat faces only (the mesh kernel builds it).\" Wejiga draft-ka ah waa silinda, koon ama wejig qaab xor ah Ka saar; draft wejiyada siman oo keliya \"A face it opens is gone (…).\" Isbeddel hore ayaa wejiga ka saaray Pick faces mar kale \"Fillet1 changes the body's edges or walls; it cannot be copied. …\" Pattern ama mirror wuxuu nuqulaa fillet, chamfer ama shell Ka saar calaamada; pattern goynta marka hore, kadibna fillet \"It sits on a face only an exact kernel can find: not built yet in this version.\" Sketch ku yaal wejig kernel-ka mesh aan heli karin, sida mid nooc hore lagu sameeyay Sawir diyaarada asaasiga ah ama wejig siman oo extrude ah, oo cabbir ku dhig \"It uses a face or edge of the solid, which only an exact kernel can find: not built yet in this version.\" Diyaarad tixraac, dhuur ama dhibic ku taal wejig ama geesta solid-ka Ka samee diyaaradaha asaasiga ah, sketch dhibcaha, ama isku xidhka cabbirro \"Extruding up to a face, the next face or a vertex: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel).\" / \"A taper: not built yet (it needs an exact kernel).\" Xadka ama taper-ka oo kernel saxda ah keliya dhisi karta Isticmaal Blind ama Mid-plane cabbir aad qiyaasto; ka dhig Taper 0 Dhibaatooyinka xulashada \"Wejigaas wuu qalloocan yahay. Dooro wejig siman ama diyaarad si aad u sawirto.\" Sketch-yadu waxay u baahan yihiin wejig siman. Sawir diyaarada asaasiga ah oo dhig sketch-ka cabbirro. Wejig wuxuu leeyahay \"Fixed where picked\": ma uusan ka samayn geesta sketch (tusaale, wejig nuqul pattern ah), sidaas darteed sketch-ka saaran way joogtaa markii qaybtu isbeddesho. Geesaha way adag yihiin in la gaadho: ku dhowow (zoom in). Geeska ayaa ka guuleysta wejiga ku dhow marka pointer-ku saxda ku yahay. Dhibaatooyinka faylka Fariinta Xalka 'PartCraft wuxuu furaa faylalkiisa .partcraft.json, wuxuu ka dhoofiyaa CadCraft macro-ka SolidWorks (.cadcraft-sw.json) iyo faylalka STEP. \"bracket.igs\" midkoodna ma aha.' Kaliya kuwaas ayaa la aqoonsadaa (iyo STL, OBJ, 3MF meshes iyo .3dm files) '\"part.stp\" ma aha fayl STEP ah (kuma bilaabmo ISO-10303-21).' Faylku ma aha STEP text \"That STEP file is too big (over 60 MB) to import here.\" Fududee isha \"That file is too big to be a PartCraft part.\" oo ah qaybtaada aad keydisay STEP solid weyn oo la soo geliyay nooc hore ayaa faylka qaybta ka dhigay in ka badan 50 MB. Isticmaal nuqul hore oo aan lahayn \"That file is too big to be a PartCraft part.\" Faylku wuxuu ka badan yahay 50 MB; ma aha fayl PartCraft \"This is not a PartCraft file (it is not JSON).\" ama \"This is not a PartCraft file.\" Faylku waa damaan, ama barnaamij kale ayuu leeyahay \"This file was saved by a newer PartCraft (file version …); this one reads version …\" Ku fur PartCraft-ka cusub \"Extrude2: the depth is bad.\" (ama qiime kale) Faylka gacanta ayaa lagu wax ka beddelay ama damaan. Isticmaal nuqul hore Insert isku-dhiska ku jira wuxuu leeyahay \"Part1.partcraft.json has no solid to insert.\" Faylka qaybta ma leh solid. Fur, samee solid, kaydi, oo mar kale gali Faylkii aan kaydiyay ma joogo meesha aan filayay. Kaydintu waa download: eeg folder-ka downloads ee browser-kaaga, ama fur liiska downloads-ka toolbar-ka browser-ka. Eeg Halkee faylalkaagu ku tagaan. Qayb ayaan furay laakiin isku-dhiskii weli shaashadda ayuu ku jiraa. Qaybtu waxay ku furmatay gadaasha isku-dhiska. Dooro Close si aad u xirto isku-dhiska oo aad u aragto qaybta. Xir isku-dhisyada ka hor inta aadan furin faylalka qaybaha. Dhibaatooyinka sawirka Fariinta Xalka \"Marka hore samee solid, kadibna sawirkeeda samee.\" Qaybta marka hore dhis \"No room on the sheet for: detail. Make the detail smaller or drop a view.\" Xaashida ma leh meel. Yaree Detail radius ama Detail scale, ama ka saar goyn \"A detail is taken from the front, top, right or section view.\" Guji mid ka mid ah aragtidaas \"Click on one of the views.\" Gujintu waxay ku dhacday warqad bannaan. Guji mid ka mid ah aragtiyada \"Position needs at least one datum reference.\" iyo fariimo kale oo frame ah Dejiso datums uu panelku weydiiyo, ama dooro tilmaame kale \"The drawing views could not be made: …\" Ka noqo isbeddelkii ugu dambeeyay. Haddii ay sii socoto, kaydi, dib u rar, oo mar kale fur qaybta Dhibaatooyinka isku-dhiska Fariinta Xalka \"Marka hore samee solid, kadibna geli isku-dhiska.\" Qaybtu weli ma leh solid \"Marka hore geli qayb labaad (Ku dar nuqul, Geli, ama Wax ka beddel › Duplicate).\" Joint wuxuu u baahan yahay laba qayb \"Dooro wejig qayb kale.\" Labada wejig ee joint-ka waa inay ku jiraan qaybo kala duwan \"That face is curved. Pick a flat face …\" Joints-ku wejiyada siman ayay ka bilaabmaan. Kadibna isticmaal Centre on godka ama axis-ka revolve \"Bracket2 is not joined to the grounded part, so it stays where it was put.\" Ku dar joint ka qayb ilaa qayb la dhigay \"Revolute3 closes a loop that cannot close: it is off by 2.000 mm. Check the faces, offsets and limits of the loop's joints.\" Qaybaha ma isku gaadhi karaan: hubi dhererka, wejiyada joint kasta, offsets (qaybaha la isugu rakibay wejig-ku-wejig waa inay ku heshiiyaan qoto dheerka) iyo limits; ama ka saar hal joint oo loop-ka ka mid ah \"The face this joint uses is gone from Bracket.\" / \"The axis this joint uses is gone from Bracket.\" Qaybtu waa la wax ka beddelay. Ka saar joint-ka oo mar kale samee \"The axis runs along the face, so it cannot set the joint's centre.\" Dooro axis ku gudba wejiga, ama \"The face's own origin\" \"An assembly keeps at least one part. Close it instead.\" Isticmaal Close Qaybaha way isku xidhan yihiin laakiin meel khaldan. Deji Centre on labada dhinac ee joint-ka oo ah godka ama axis-ka revolve ee la rabo inay isku khadka saaraan, kadibna hagaaji Angle (°) iyo Offset (mm). Waa gaabis Deji Curves ilaa Normal ama Coarse intaad modelaynayso; ka dibna Fine ka hor dhoofinta. Tirooyin pattern oo waaweyn (boqolaad nuqul) wakhti ayay qaataan mar kasta oo isbeddel. Pattern-ka suppress samee intaad ka shaqaynayso feature-yada kale. Clash iyo motion check waxay isbarbardhigaan qaybaha kala laba; isku-dhisyada waaweyn wakhti dheer ayay qaataan. Xir tabs-ka kale ee culus. PartCraft wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa processor-ka kombiyuutarkaaga iyo graphics-kiisa. Weli waad ku jirtaa dhibaato Marka hore kaydi faylkaaga (Ctrl+S), kadibna dib u rar bogga oo mar kale fur. Haddii feature-ku weli fashilanto, dooro, akhri fariintiisa, oo isku day Ctrl+Z ilaa gadaashii heerkii ugu dambeeyay ee fiican.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"partcraft","title":"Wax aan wali la dhisin","summary":"Wax kasta oo dhisme PartCraft-kan aanu wali samaynin, laga bilaabo sweep-yada laffaadka ah ilaa muuqaalka inch-ka, sawirrada cabbirrada iyo isku-dhisyada hoosaadka, oo leh waxa lagu sameyn karo maanta halkii.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["maqan","wali ma jiro","xaddidaad","xaddidaadyo","roadmap","kernel saxda ah","fillet","chamfer","shell","sweep","loft","step import","simulasho","wax soo saarka","twist sweep","loft end tangency","face fillet","isleegyada","inches","cabbirrada sawirka","isku-dhisyo hoosaad","cloud","tablet","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"waxay-u-baahan-tahay-kernel-joomatari-saxda-ah","text":"Waxay u baahan tahay kernel joomatari saxda ah","level":2},{"id":"astaamaha","text":"Astaamaha","level":2},{"id":"sketches","text":"Sketches","level":2},{"id":"waxyaabaha-iyo-unugyada","text":"Waxyaabaha iyo unugyada","level":2},{"id":"faylasha","text":"Faylasha","level":2},{"id":"sawirrada","text":"Sawirrada","level":2},{"id":"isku-dhisyada","text":"Isku-dhisyada","level":2},{"id":"wax-soo-saarka","text":"Wax soo saarka","level":2},{"id":"simulasho-iyo-naqshad-abuurka","text":"Simulasho iyo naqshad-abuurka","level":2},{"id":"scripts","text":"Scripts","level":2},{"id":"the-app","text":"The app","level":2},{"id":"engineer-generators-iyo-fields","text":"Engineer (generators iyo fields)","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPartCraft waa dhisme hore. Bogan waxa uu liistaa waxa aanu wali samayn, si aadan u raadin, iyo waxa lagu sameyn karo maanta halkii. Waxa halkan ku jira ma leh taariikh.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxay-u-baahan-tahay-kernel-joomatari-saxda-ah\"\u003EWaxay u baahan tahay kernel joomatari saxda ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENooca tan wuxuu qaybta oo dhan ka dhisaa mesh kernel-ka (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/solid-kernels\" data-topic=\"partcraft/solid-kernels\"\u003EThe mesh kernel\u003C/a\u003E). Waxa hoos ku jira oo dhan waxay u baahan tahay kernel joomatari saxda ah, nooca tan oo wali uusan lahayn. Qaybaha lagu kaydiyay astaamahan ayay wali furmaan: astaamuhu wuxuu ku sii jiraa taariikhda, isagoo lagu calaamadeeyay inuusan la dhisin, waana la ilaaliyaa marka aad kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChamfer\u003C/span\u003E geesaha wareegsan; fillets oo radius-kooda ku beddelma geeska dhererkiisa; wareegyo isku-dhafan oo si siman ugu xidhma meelaha ay isku kulmaan (mesh kernel-ku wuu jaraa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFillet iyo Chamfer waxay ku shaqeeyaan geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya sagxadaha sinaanta leh; geesaha kale ee wareegsan ku wareeg sawirka ka hor inta aadan extrude-ga samayn (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E sawir gudaha, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E oo furaya wejiyada qalloocan; darbiyo cabbirro kala duwan leh\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu fur wejiyada sinaanta leh; ku dar alaab extrude-yada meelaha darbigu uu ka qaro weyn yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E wejiyada qalloocan; extrude ilaa wejiga, wejiga xiga ama geesta; extrude-yada tapered ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrude ama revolve, marxalado meelaha loo baahan yahay; extrude ilaa qoto-dheer aad cabbirtay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERib\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBase flange\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdge flange\u003C/span\u003E iyo flat patterns\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrude-ka saxanka ama profile-ka rib-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada: dhamaystirka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForm\u003C/span\u003E gudaha qaybta, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPatch\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELoft surface\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGordon surface\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStitch\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThicken\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffset surface\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtend surface\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETrim surface\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama heli karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJidho badan: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECombine\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove body\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale body\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath pattern\u003C/span\u003E, astaamo jidh cusub abuuraya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal jidh adag; qaababka iyo nuqul-sawirka astaamaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESketch-yada, diyaaradaha, tiirarka iyo dhibcaha wejiyada ee kaliya kernel saxda ah ayaa heli karta (wejiga ay samaysay fillet, derbiga godka, wejiga jidh STEP ah oo la soo dhoofiyay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESketch ku saabsan saldhigyada, diyaaradaha tixraaca iyo wejiyada toosan ee extrude-yada iyo revolve-yada\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENatiijada naqshad-abuurka oo loo furay qayb ama lagu daray (waxay noqotaa jidh STEP ah oo la soo dhoofiyay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo dejiso natiijada STL ama STEP\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatirka wejiyada qalloocan ee faylka STEP ee la furay sida wejiyo saxda ah; STEP saxda ah ee wejiyada spline, la xoqay iyo revolve-ka faylka STEP; geesaha spline; boolooyinka la soo dhisay; jidhadka STL / OBJ / 3MF iyo isku-dhisyada; STEP loogu talagalay moodel-qaabeeyeyaasha kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu akhrinayaa STEP sida saddexagallo, wuxuuna ilaalinayaa wejiyada toosan, silindarrada, koonyada, kubbadaha iyo torus-ka faylka dhoofinta (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/import-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/import-step\"\u003EOpen a STEP file\u003C/a\u003E); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESTEP AP242 (exact solid)\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qoraa wejiyada joomatari kasta oo saxda ah wuxuuna ilaalinayaa kuwaas sida facets (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/export-files#for-other-cad-programs-step\" data-topic=\"partcraft/export-files\" data-hash=\"for-other-cad-programs-step\"\u003EExport\u003C/a\u003E); macro-ka moodel-qaabeeyeyaha kale weli wuu qoraa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalada jadwalka qalloocan (saxda ah)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalada iyo muuqaalada goynta waxaa laga sameeyaa facets\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMugga, dusha iyo masaafooyinka saxda ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu siinayaa tirooyinka jidhka faceted-ka, wuxuu yar yahay qaybaha wareegsan; dejinta \u003Cstrong\u003ECurves\u003C/strong\u003E oo sare ayaa u dhowaynaysa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah safafka miisaska hoose waxay soo jeedinayaan mid ka mid ah astaamahan sida habka kale ee wax loo sameeyo. Soo jeedintaas waxay shaqeeyaan marka kernel saxda ah soo noqoto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"astaamaha\"\u003EAstaamaha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWejiyada fillet-ka, fillet-ka wareegga oo dhan, fillets oo radius-ka lagu dejiyay meelo geeska dhexdiisa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFillet\u003C/span\u003E joogto ah ama mid kala duwan oo toosan; astaamo fillet oo badan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShells oo leh cabbirrada darbiyada kala duwan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal thickness oo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShell\u003C/span\u003E; ku dar alaab extrude-yada meelaha darbigu uu ka qaro weyn yahay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDraft ee wejiyada freeform (spline)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa wejiyada toosan, silindarka iyo koonka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESweep-yada laffaadka ah, sweep-ka darbiga khafiifka ah iyo sweep-ka wejiga; end tangency astaamaha Loft; loft oo leh hal guri oo hagid ah; waddooyinka spline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESweep\u003C/span\u003E oo leh jihayn go&#039;an ama tallaabo dhamaad; loft oo leh laba guri hagid ama ka badan: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sweep-loft-draft\"\u003ESweep, loft and draft\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERibs ka soo baxa qaansooyin ama splines; ribs la koray laba-geesood sida sketch-ka (muuqaal sare ka); draft ee ribs; ribs dhowr ah oo ka soo baxa sketch hal ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERib\u003C/span\u003E oo ka soo baxa hal silsilad toosan oo ku taal diyaarada rib-ka: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/rib\" data-topic=\"partcraft/rib\"\u003ERibs and gussets\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Ilaa&quot; wejiga qalloocan, &quot;ilaa xiga&quot; oo joogsanaya wejiga qalloocan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlaa wejiga sinaanta leh ama diyaaraha tixraaca\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodyo dhaqso leh oo la gooyay, dhuunto inch ama tuubo, dhuunto koonka, dhamaadka dhuunta ee la dhaadhacay iyo bilowga dhuunta ee geesta la jaray\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECounterbore oo leh qoto-dheer yar; dhuunto ISO metric iyo trapezoidal, cosmetic ama moodel: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/threads\" data-topic=\"partcraft/threads\"\u003EThreads on shafts and bores, drawn or modelled\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExtrude-yada darbiga khafiifka ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu sawir labada darbi ee profile-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul-qaababka oo mid mid la dhaafo, qaababka wejiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal astaamo kala duwan; qaababka dhinaca qow: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath pattern\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul-qaababka, mirrors, fillets, chamfers, shells iyo jidhadka la soo dhoofiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul sketch-ka ama astaamaha ay ku dhisan yihiin, ama qaabeeyso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETangency saxda ah (G1) meelaha gaarka ah ee form-ka; isku-darka paches-ka form-ka wejiyada waaweyn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKor u qaad Level-ka form-ka: paches-ka qiyaasta ah way yaraadaan; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/form-surfaces\" data-topic=\"partcraft/form-surfaces\"\u003EFreeform shapes with Form\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EForm oo ka kooban dhowr qayb oo xidhan oo kala go&#039;an hal astaamo ku jira; xidhiidh u dhexeeya form-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal qayb oo xidhan oo mid kasta Form astaamo; isku xidh Join\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooridda jidhadka dusha ee muuqaalka (marka laga reebo barta jar-ka iyo patch-ka); surface fillets; untrim; G2 patches; Gordon surfaces oo tangent u ah geesaha qalloocan (tangent u ah diyaaraha iyo wejiyada sinaanta leh waa la dhisay)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dooro magacooda panel-ka astaamaha; marka hore thicken, ka dibna fillet u samee jidhka adag\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELiis jidhadka taariikhda; ka reebista jidhadka qarsoon ee dhoofinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagacow oo qari jidhadka liiska jidhka panel-ka qaybta; tirtir ama joog astaamaha samaysay jidhka si aad uga reebto\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiisaan aan isku mid ahayn oo ilaalinaya silindarrada iyo koonada sida xisaab; miisaanka aan isku mid ahayn ee wejiyada kala-raris\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale body\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu ka dhigaa wejiyada qalloocan B-splines xidhan (dhex-gal 0.0000004 mm); miisaan isku mid ah ayaa weli saxda ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-darka jidhadka dusha; isku-darka Minkowski\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStitch\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThicken\u003C/span\u003E marka hore, ka dibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECombine\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFalanqaynta tolerance-ka: stack-ups oo leh geesood (wareegyo vector ah 2D iyo 3D), dareenka laga xisaabiyay joomatariga, Monte Carlo oo leh qaybinta kale, tolerance-ka cabbirrada sketch-ka, tolerance-ka dheeraadka ah ee material condition-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStack-up\u003C/span\u003E isku-dhisyada: hal jihe, xaaladda ugu xun iyo RSS, tolerances-ka la qoro, laga bilaabo tolerance-ka guud ee title block-ka ama GD&amp;T frames: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/tolerance-stackup\" data-topic=\"partcraft/tolerance-stackup\"\u003ETolerance stack-ups\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENesting: amarka goynta iyo lead-ins, geesaha la wadaago oo mar keliya la jaro, qaybaha waa in la wada hayo; hadhaaga rolls-ka, agabka la wadaago mashruucyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENest flat parts on sheets…\u003C/span\u003E oo leh bannaan, xad, leexin iyo jihada: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nest-flat-parts\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nest-flat-parts\"\u003ENest flat parts on sheets\u003C/a\u003E; saxanka hadhay waa la kaydiyaa oo horta waa la isticmaalaa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/nest-offcuts\" data-topic=\"partcraft/nest-offcuts\"\u003EKeep and reuse offcuts\u003C/a\u003E; qorshee goynta barnaamijka goynta kaaga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet metal: hems, jogs, miter iyo contour flanges; flanges ee geesaha qalloocan ama wejiyada base flange-ka la foorariyay; bends la sawiray; xidhidhka geesaha; qalabka qaabeynta; jidh loo beddelo sheet metal; flat-ka base flange-ka la foorariyay oo wax laga gooyay; miisaska foorarinta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBase flange\u003C/span\u003E (saxan ama profile foorarsan), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdge flange\u003C/span\u003E geesaha toosan ee saxanka oo leh bend reliefs, iyo flat pattern oo leh K-factor: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/sheet-metal\" data-topic=\"partcraft/sheet-metal\"\u003ESheet metal\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft analysis\u003C/span\u003E isku-dhisyada; helitaanka parting line; falanqaynta qaro darbiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraft analysis\u003C/span\u003E qaybta Design: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/draft-analysis\" data-topic=\"partcraft/draft-analysis\"\u003ECheck draft for moulding and casting\u003C/a\u003E; fur qayb kasta oo isku-dhis si aad u hubiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sketches\"\u003ESketches\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEllipses, tangent arcs, conics, splines oo leh darajo go&#039;an ama miisaan (NURBS)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESplines (cubic), qaansooyin iyo goobo oo leh Tangent relations\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibic ku taal spline (xidhiidh), xidhiidhka curvature (G2)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhibcaha spline-ka ku dhig meesha uu tegi lahaa\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul offset ah oo spline-yada oo raacaya isbeddelada dambe; offsets-ka silsiladaha oo leh geesaha spline-ka ee jilicsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMar kale offset-garee ka dib isbeddelka; marka hore geeska wareeg\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul-qaababka oo ku xiran asalka; qaababka dhinaca qow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMar kale qaab-garee ka dib isbeddelka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMashruucyada geesaha wareegsan ama ka jeedsan ee la soo saaray, joomatari la soo saaray oo raacaya qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoo saar geesaha wareegsan oo toosan oo isbarbar ah, ka dibna cabbir\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirrada darawalka (tixraaca)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhri cabbirrada panel-ka ama macluumaadka qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXidhiidhka collinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EParallel oo leh masaafo 0 ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGelinta barnaamij kale (clipboard-ka nidaamka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofi DXF, STEP, STL ama 3MF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQorista qaansooyinka, koordinaatyada xaaladda ama qudhoobka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor khadadka iyo goobaha; qor qaansooyinka qalabka Arc\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDooridda joomatariga iyada oo aan lagu dhejin xulaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay u baahan tahay riix ama taabasho\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxyaabaha-iyo-unugyada\"\u003EWaxyaabaha iyo unugyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabeyn oo beddela agabka; miis naqshadeed CSV ah oo damiya astaamaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabeyn waxay dejisaa halbeegyada oo astaamaha wuu damiyaa oo furaa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/design-tables\" data-topic=\"partcraft/design-tables\"\u003EConfigurations and design tables\u003C/a\u003E; \u003Ccode\u003Epartcraft variants\u003C/code\u003E wuxuu dhisaa qaabeynta la kaydiyay magacyo, astaamaha damiyay oo ku jira: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/variant-pack\" data-topic=\"partcraft/variant-pack\"\u003EMake a variant pack from your configurations\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsleegyada lambarada panel-ka astaamaha ugu dambeeyay (diyaarad, sweep, draft iyo kuwa kale)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu qor script-ka ama \u003Ccode\u003Epartcraft set\u003C/code\u003E (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/scripts-and-cli\" data-topic=\"partcraft/scripts-and-cli\"\u003EScripts and the command line\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayb lagu muujiyo inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirada waxay muujiyaan millimitir; ku qor \u003Ccode\u003E2in\u003C/code\u003E sanduuqa lambarka ama isla&#039;egta wuxuuna noqonayaa 50.8\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylasha\"\u003EFaylasha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETafatirka astaamaha jidhka STEP ee la soo dhoofiyay (wuxuu yimaadaa isagoon taariikh lahayn)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar ama jar agabka adigoo isticmaalaya astaamahaaga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAkhrinta midabbada, magacyada, qaab-dhismeedka isku-dhisyada iyo PMI-ga STEP-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama heli karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhoofinta glTF, OBJ, IGES, Parasolid; DWG ee qayb 3D ah (kaliya qaabeynta pack-ka wuxuu qoraa DWG: xaashida sawirka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL ama 3MF meshes-ka; STEP jidhadka adag; DXF 2D-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFurista IGES, DXF ama faylasha barnaamijyada kale (faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.3dm\u003C/code\u003E waxay furmaan sida hal jidh: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-3dm-files\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-3dm-files\"\u003EOpen a .3dm model as a solid body\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeydii STEP, ama mesh STL, OBJ ama 3MF oo xidhan: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/open-meshes\" data-topic=\"partcraft/open-meshes\"\u003EOpen an STL, OBJ or 3MF\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaab-dhismeedka isku-dhisyada (geed leh magacyada qaybaha) ee STEP-ka la dhoofiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTEP isku-dhis waa hal compound oo jidhadka la dejiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydinta fool la doortay adigoo aan browser-ka lagu soo dejin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu shid &quot;ask where to save&quot; dejinta soo dejinta browser-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sawirrada\"\u003ESawirrada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECabbirro ka badan saddexda cabbir ee guud (cabbirada godyada, meelaha, tolerances-ka cabbirrada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECalaamadee PDF-ka, ama dhoofi DXF oo cabbiri barnaamij CAD 2D ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal ama ka badan goynta ama faahfaahinta; muuqaalada isku-hadhaa, kuwa jeexan iyo kuwa dhinac-hoose\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal goyn iyo hal faahfaahin mid kasta sawirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoraal xor ah, qoraallo iyo miisas xaashida (marka laga reebo blocks-ka cinwaanka iyo nooca)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinish note, ama qoraal lagu daro PDF-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-xidhka xagalka koowaad (first-angle), muuqaalada dhaqaajiya, xaashida qaabka bortiga\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThird angle, habayn toos ah, xaashida dhererka A4–A0 iyo ANSI A–E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalka goynta oo toos ah: diyaaro dhowr ah ama sanduuq goynta isla mar, xadka goynta, kaydinta goynta faylka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal diyaarad mar kasta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EViews\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESection view\u003C/span\u003E; eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/section-view\" data-topic=\"partcraft/section-view\"\u003ELook inside with a section view\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMuuqaalada isku-dhisyada oo leh muuqaalo dheeraad ah, cabbirro ama balloons aad dhaqaajin karto\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal isometric (ama exploded) muuqaal oo leh balloons toosan iyo liiska qaybaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqul iyo dhejinta calaamadaha GD&amp;T iyo dhamaystirka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMid kasta ku dhig Datum, Frame ama Finish\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBuugaagta: STEP-yada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom another file…\u003C/span\u003E ee Illustrate, moodeel si toos ah loo soo qaado ModelCraft ama BimCraft, sawirro tayada path tracer-ka, 3D fal-celin gudaha PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFur STEP-ka Design oo bilow buugga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom the open part\u003C/span\u003E; kaydi moodeelka sida glTF (.glb); sawirro PNG ah oo muuqaalka 3D; faylka 3D ee fal-celinta: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/illustrate\" data-topic=\"partcraft/illustrate\"\u003EStart a manual in Illustrate\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-dhisyada\"\u003EIsku-dhisyada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-xirka gear, rack, cam iyo screw; isku-xirka kubbadda oo ku xaddidan koon; isku-xirka meelaha qalloocan ama dhibcaha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-xirka adag, revolute, slider, cylindrical, planar, ball iyo pin-in-slot ee wejiyada sinaanta leh, qiimo kasta oo leh xaddiddiisa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/build-assembly\" data-topic=\"partcraft/build-assembly\"\u003EBuild an assembly\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETallaabooyinka exploded ee leexiya qaybaha, iyo jiidista qaybaha ay isku-xirku dejiyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETallaabooyin exploded toosan; ka saar isku-xir si aad qayb gacanta ugu dhaqaajiso\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsku-dhisyo hoosaad\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal heer oo qaybaha kaliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGears, cams, xiriir\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELama heli karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"wax-soo-saarka\"\u003EWax soo saarka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJarista adaptive 3D iyo jarista offset 3D; dhamaystirka waterline, pencil, radial iyo spiral; marinnada adaptive ee loo qoro qaansooyin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJarista 3D xariiqyo toosan, iyo jarista hadhaaga: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/rough-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/rough-3d\"\u003E3D roughing and rest machining\u003C/a\u003E; dhamaystirka Parallel iyo Scallop: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/finish-3d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/finish-3d\"\u003E3D finishing\u003C/a\u003E; 2.5-tiir face, pocket, 2D adaptive, contour, drill iyo chamfer: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/manufacture\" data-topic=\"partcraft/manufacture\"\u003EMake toolpaths and G-code\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJarista swarf, waddooyinka flow-line iyo multi-axis, koodhadhka shaqada leexan (G68.2) iyo hubinta is-dhaca ee holder-ka iyo mashiinka; simulasho ee jarista 5-tiir iyo wareega\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalab leexan howlgal kasta, dhamaystir 5-tiir oo leh kubbad bar dhamaad iyo dhamaystirka wareega ee tiirka 4-aad: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/multi-axis\" data-topic=\"partcraft/multi-axis\"\u003E4- and 5-axis machining\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGodinta iyo dhuunta gudaha khaaraadda, cycles G71/G76, qaansooyin waddooyinka khaaraadda, qalabyo nool, sub-spindle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKhaaraadda dibadda: wejiga, ku-dhow, dhamaystir, godka, ka-jar, dhuunto, godin dhexda: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/turning\" data-topic=\"partcraft/turning\"\u003ETurning on a lathe\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBaadhista xagal ama geesi, qalab-kuwe, cabbirka cabbir ee tolerance-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBaadhista wejiga, dhinaca, godka ama boss-ka si loo dejiyo kala-saarka shaqada: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/probing\" data-topic=\"partcraft/probing\"\u003EProbing\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHubinta is-dhaca holder-ka iyo gees-hoosta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEeg digniinta dherer-fiilada ka dibna hubi simulator-ka xakameeyahaaga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENolosha qalabka iyo wareegyada hoosaadka ee post-ka; soo-raridda faylasha post-ka barnaamijyada kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor ama beddel post qaabka PartCraft-ka: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/post-processors\" data-topic=\"partcraft/post-processors\"\u003EPost processors you can edit\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EG-code oo inch ah (G20)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMillimitir (G21) oo keliya\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"simulasho-iyo-naqshad-abuurka\"\u003ESimulasho iyo naqshad-abuurka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaraasadaha aan isku mid ahayn: wax soo-saar, ka-weyneyn weyn, is-dhacyada qaybaha, daalka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXoogga iyo wejiyada toosan, wejiyada ilaalinta iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003ECheck stress and deflection\u003C/a\u003E; ilaali isku-dhafka xoogga oo ka sarreeya 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlaalinta buckling-ka aan isku mid ahayn (dhererka, post-buckling, snap-through)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaybta buckling-ka toosan oo leh xadka ballaaran: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\" data-topic=\"partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\"\u003EHeat, thermal stress and buckling\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiin ka dhex-maraya wejiyada (view factors), ka-hortagga xiriirka, maaddooyinka heerkulka ku xiran, daalka heerkulka (mawjadaha daalka kulaylka)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIftiin hareeraha ah, xoog kulaylka oo joogto ah ama quasi-static oo waqti ku xiran, hantida joogta ah: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\" data-topic=\"partcraft/thermal-and-buckling\"\u003EHeat, thermal stress and buckling\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHagaajinta otomaatiga ah ee kulaylka transient-ka iyo daraasadaha culeyska kulaylka; mesh-ka oo lagu weyneeyo meelaha khaladku yar yahay; bartilmaameed ku saabsan tiro maxalli ah (xoogga ugu sarreeya meel gaar ah)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERefine automatically\u003C/strong\u003E daraasadaha static, buckling, natural-frequency iyo kulaylka joogta ah, khaladka oo dhan qaybta: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/simulation\"\u003ECheck stress and deflection\u003C/a\u003E; haddii kale yaree cabbirka element-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECuleysyada bearing-ka iyo boolta, xoogag fog, moment-ada, springs, dhaqdhaqaaqyada la qeexay\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXoogag iyo cadaadis dusha, cuf; dusha go&#039;an iyo kuwa aan is-diidin\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaraasadaha isku-dhisyada; agabka kala duwan jihada (layers-ka la daabacay, composites)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHal qayb, hal agab isotropic\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDhowr xarun oo furmaan ah daraasadaha tetrahedral, gudbinta kulaylka iyo naqshad-abuurka; xarun kasta bogga aan cross-origin isolated ahayn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDaraasadaha voxel, buckling, xoogga waqtiga iyo socodka laminar waxay adeegsadaan xarumaha halka bogga ogolaado: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"partcraft/settings\"\u003EPartCraft settings\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocodka turbulent ee nuxurka naqshadda (moodelka Spalart–Allmaras waxa uu ku jiraa sida tijaabo: xoogga biibilka 30 ilaa 34 % sare, dib-u-xidhidhka dhabarka-tallaabada 21 ilaa 39 % gaaban; la qorsheeyay: unugyo fiican oo derbiyada ag ah); kulaylka socodka, socod aan joogto ahayn (waqti-saxda ah), dusha xor ah, dareemayaasha aan Newtonian ahayn, qaybaha wareegaya\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESocod laminar, joogto ah, isothermal oo fluid Newtonian ah, ama moodelka turbulent ee tijaabada qaab-ka tayada: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/flow-simulation\" data-topic=\"partcraft/flow-simulation\"\u003ESimulate fluid flow\u003C/a\u003E; panel-ku wuxuu digayaa marka Reynolds number-ku gabi ka dhaafo laminar-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXadka xoogga iyo xeerarka wax-soo-saarka (overhangs, jihooyinka jarista) ee naqshad-abuurka; agabyo badan oo mid qaab ah\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaabka ugu adag mugga; hubi natiijada Simulation: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/generative-design\" data-topic=\"partcraft/generative-design\"\u003EGrow a shape from loads\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENatiijo naqshad-abuur oo ah jidh la wax-beddeli karo (qaab siman, parametric)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESTL, STEP faceted ah ama qayb leh natiijada jidh faceted la soo dhoofiyay\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaqshadda mashiinka korontada: rotor oo wareegaya stator gudaha, torque-ka iyo xaglaha, biraha la kaaga kulmiyo, magnets oo lumiya xoog ka dib knee-kooda, eddy currents iyo khasaaraha bir iyo naxaas; goobaha birta 3-D ama meshes-ka wareegsan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMagnetostatics 2-D oo toosan oo ku saleysan shabakad maktabadda falanqaynta: coils, bir, magnets joogto ah oo ku jira recoil line, fogaanshaha, inductance iyo jiid: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\" data-topic=\"partcraft/magnetic-fields-2d\"\u003EMagnetic fields in 2-D\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"scripts\"\u003EScripts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECaawinta hover ee tafatirka script-ka, breakpoints iyo tallaabooyinka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFind, fold iyo complete way jiraan (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EWrite and run scripts\u003C/a\u003E); wixii kale, tafatirkaaga: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E kooxda Script ayaa geliya oo baxa scripts-ka; shaqeyaasha dhismaha ku jira waxa lagu liistay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-language\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-language\"\u003EThe CraftScript language\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBreakpoints iyo tallaabooyinka script-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edisp\u003C/code\u003E iyo \u003Ccode\u003Efprintf\u003C/code\u003E jidka; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Return\"\u003E⌘ Return\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Enter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu socodsiiyaa dhowr safka la doortay mar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGoobaha iyo qorshayaasha uu script-ku muujiyo oo lagu sawiro shaqada Design; scripts-ka beddelaya halbeegyada qaybta\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaxay ku muuqdaan shaqada Script; scripts-ku wuxuu akhriyaa halbeegyada \u003Ccode\u003Eparam\u003C/code\u003E (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript\"\u003EWrite and run scripts\u003C/a\u003E), beddelaa tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EParameters\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESawirro iyo miisas oo ku taal qorshayaasha; tafatirka qorshe (zoom, xadka tiirarka) ka hor inta aan la kaydin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESide by side wuxuu muujiyaa qorshayaasha; kaydi qorshe PNG, SVG ama CSV ah oo dhammeeyo meel kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enumpy iyo xirmooyinka Python kale; Python oo ka baxsan xidhiidhka; Python oo tafatirka lagu soo xidhayo; Pascal Script\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaktabadda caadiga ah ee Python, CraftScript iyo Lua: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/partcraft/craftscript-python\" data-topic=\"partcraft/craftscript-python\"\u003EScripts in Python\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShaqeyaasha Lua oo loo gudbiyo shaqeyaasha dhismaha; wicitaanka shaqada maktabadda Lua-ka magac lagu dhisay intii script-ku socday\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQor magaca shaqada maktabadda script-ka (\u003Ccode\u003Ecs.static_tet(…)\u003C/code\u003E), ama wac CraftScript script-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-app\"\u003EThe app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaydinta duubka, wadaagga iyo taariikhda noocyada\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWeli lama heli karo. Keydi faylasha kombiyuutarkaaga oo noocyada ku kaydi magacyo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPartCraft sida app la rakibay oo iPad iyo iPhone\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsticmaal PartCraft browser-ka aaladda; Android iyo desktop-ka waxa kale oo uu ku shaqeeyaa CadCraft Studio (getcadcraft.com/download)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMenu-yada xaashida xiga (right-click)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQalab-sanduuqa iyo panel-ka midig\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShaqada oo dhan oo aan internet lahayn xagga bilowga cusub\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya marka app-ka loo kaydiyay isticmaalka aan internet lahayn: eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EWorking offline\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESheeg waxa aad ugu jirto gunaanad bogga taageerada ee goobta: waxay qaabeynaysaa waxa soo socda.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"engineer-generators-iyo-fields\"\u003EEngineer (generators iyo fields)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWali ma la dhisin\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHalkii, maanta\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMadaxyada, dekedaha iyo fittings-ka ee exchanger-ka kulaylka ee la soo saaray; qalloocanka kulaylka ee xoogga agabka; khasaaraha tee ee manifold-ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGenerators-ku wuxuu dhisaa corka iyo tuubooyinka; ku dar fittings Design; isticmaal tirooyinka heerkulka qolka ee agabka oo leh factor badbaado\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKu dar generators-ka add-on directory-ga hal guji\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen\u003C/span\u003E shaqada Engineer wuxuu ku daraa generator fayl ka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylka goobta oo ka dhaqsan voxel-size-ka generator-ka; akhrinta faylasha \u003Ccode\u003E.vdb\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKeydi goob ka dhaqsan script-ka; \u003Ccode\u003E.vdb\u003C/code\u003E waa la qoraa, lama akhrin karo\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXisaabaadka koodka weelka cadaadiska\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQaacidooyinka buugga ee darbiga khafiifka ah iyo darbiga qaro weyn, iyada oo leh factor badbaado aad doorato; ma aha margin koodka\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGenerators-ka app-yada kale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKaliya PartCraft nooca tan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E","text":"PartCraft waa dhisme hore. Bogan waxa uu liistaa waxa aanu wali samayn, si aadan u raadin, iyo waxa lagu sameyn karo maanta halkii. Waxa halkan ku jira ma leh taariikh. Waxay u baahan tahay kernel joomatari saxda ah Nooca tan wuxuu qaybta oo dhan ka dhisaa mesh kernel-ka (eeg The mesh kernel). Waxa hoos ku jira oo dhan waxay u baahan tahay kernel joomatari saxda ah, nooca tan oo wali uusan lahayn. Qaybaha lagu kaydiyay astaamahan ayay wali furmaan: astaamuhu wuxuu ku sii jiraa taariikhda, isagoo lagu calaamadeeyay inuusan la dhisin, waana la ilaaliyaa marka aad kaydiso. Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Fillet iyo Chamfer geesaha wareegsan; fillets oo radius-kooda ku beddelma geeska dhererkiisa; wareegyo isku-dhafan oo si siman ugu xidhma meelaha ay isku kulmaan (mesh kernel-ku wuu jaraa) Fillet iyo Chamfer waxay ku shaqeeyaan geesaha toosan ee u dhexeeya sagxadaha sinaanta leh; geesaha kale ee wareegsan ku wareeg sawirka ka hor inta aadan extrude-ga samayn (Fillet sawir gudaha, F) Shell oo furaya wejiyada qalloocan; darbiyo cabbirro kala duwan leh Ku fur wejiyada sinaanta leh; ku dar alaab extrude-yada meelaha darbigu uu ka qaro weyn yahay Sweep, Loft, Draft wejiyada qalloocan; extrude ilaa wejiga, wejiga xiga ama geesta; extrude-yada tapered ah Extrude ama revolve, marxalado meelaha loo baahan yahay; extrude ilaa qoto-dheer aad cabbirtay Rib, Base flange, Edge flange iyo flat patterns Extrude-ka saxanka ama profile-ka rib-ka Wejiyada: dhamaystirka Form gudaha qaybta, Patch, Loft surface, Gordon surface, Stitch, Thicken, Offset surface, Extend surface, Trim surface Lama heli karo Jidho badan: Combine, Move body, Scale body, Path pattern, astaamo jidh cusub abuuraya Hal jidh adag; qaababka iyo nuqul-sawirka astaamaha Sketch-yada, diyaaradaha, tiirarka iyo dhibcaha wejiyada ee kaliya kernel saxda ah ayaa heli karta (wejiga ay samaysay fillet, derbiga godka, wejiga jidh STEP ah oo la soo dhoofiyay) Sketch ku saabsan saldhigyada, diyaaradaha tixraaca iyo wejiyada toosan ee extrude-yada iyo revolve-yada Natiijada naqshad-abuurka oo loo furay qayb ama lagu daray (waxay noqotaa jidh STEP ah oo la soo dhoofiyay) Soo dejiso natiijada STL ama STEP Tafatirka wejiyada qalloocan ee faylka STEP ee la furay sida wejiyo saxda ah; STEP saxda ah ee wejiyada spline, la xoqay iyo revolve-ka faylka STEP; geesaha spline; boolooyinka la soo dhisay; jidhadka STL / OBJ / 3MF iyo isku-dhisyada; STEP loogu talagalay moodel-qaabeeyeyaasha kale Open wuxuu akhrinayaa STEP sida saddexagallo, wuxuuna ilaalinayaa wejiyada toosan, silindarrada, koonyada, kubbadaha iyo torus-ka faylka dhoofinta (Open a STEP file); Export › STEP AP242 (exact solid) wuxuu qoraa wejiyada joomatari kasta oo saxda ah wuxuuna ilaalinayaa kuwaas sida facets (Export); macro-ka moodel-qaabeeyeyaha kale weli wuu qoraa Muuqaalada jadwalka qalloocan (saxda ah) Muuqaalada iyo muuqaalada goynta waxaa laga sameeyaa facets Mugga, dusha iyo masaafooyinka saxda ah Measure wuxuu siinayaa tirooyinka jidhka faceted-ka, wuxuu yar yahay qaybaha wareegsan; dejinta Curves oo sare ayaa u dhowaynaysa Qaar ka mid ah safafka miisaska hoose waxay soo jeedinayaan mid ka mid ah astaamahan sida habka kale ee wax loo sameeyo. Soo jeedintaas waxay shaqeeyaan marka kernel saxda ah soo noqoto. Astaamaha Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Wejiyada fillet-ka, fillet-ka wareegga oo dhan, fillets oo radius-ka lagu dejiyay meelo geeska dhexdiisa Fillet joogto ah ama mid kala duwan oo toosan; astaamo fillet oo badan Shells oo leh cabbirrada darbiyada kala duwan Hal thickness oo Shell; ku dar alaab extrude-yada meelaha darbigu uu ka qaro weyn yahay Draft ee wejiyada freeform (spline) Draft wuxuu ka shaqeeyaa wejiyada toosan, silindarka iyo koonka Sweep-yada laffaadka ah, sweep-ka darbiga khafiifka ah iyo sweep-ka wejiga; end tangency astaamaha Loft; loft oo leh hal guri oo hagid ah; waddooyinka spline Sweep oo leh jihayn go'an ama tallaabo dhamaad; loft oo leh laba guri hagid ama ka badan: eeg Sweep, loft and draft Ribs ka soo baxa qaansooyin ama splines; ribs la koray laba-geesood sida sketch-ka (muuqaal sare ka); draft ee ribs; ribs dhowr ah oo ka soo baxa sketch hal ah Rib oo ka soo baxa hal silsilad toosan oo ku taal diyaarada rib-ka: eeg Ribs and gussets \"Ilaa\" wejiga qalloocan, \"ilaa xiga\" oo joogsanaya wejiga qalloocan Ilaa wejiga sinaanta leh ama diyaaraha tixraaca Godyo dhaqso leh oo la gooyay, dhuunto inch ama tuubo, dhuunto koonka, dhamaadka dhuunta ee la dhaadhacay iyo bilowga dhuunta ee geesta la jaray Counterbore oo leh qoto-dheer yar; dhuunto ISO metric iyo trapezoidal, cosmetic ama moodel: eeg Threads on shafts and bores, drawn or modelled Extrude-yada darbiga khafiifka ah Ku sawir labada darbi ee profile-ka Nuqul-qaababka oo mid mid la dhaafo, qaababka wejiga Isticmaal astaamo kala duwan; qaababka dhinaca qow: Path pattern Nuqul-qaababka, mirrors, fillets, chamfers, shells iyo jidhadka la soo dhoofiyay Nuqul sketch-ka ama astaamaha ay ku dhisan yihiin, ama qaabeeyso Tangency saxda ah (G1) meelaha gaarka ah ee form-ka; isku-darka paches-ka form-ka wejiyada waaweyn Kor u qaad Level-ka form-ka: paches-ka qiyaasta ah way yaraadaan; eeg Freeform shapes with Form Form oo ka kooban dhowr qayb oo xidhan oo kala go'an hal astaamo ku jira; xidhiidh u dhexeeya form-ka Hal qayb oo xidhan oo mid kasta Form astaamo; isku xidh Join Dooridda jidhadka dusha ee muuqaalka (marka laga reebo barta jar-ka iyo patch-ka); surface fillets; untrim; G2 patches; Gordon surfaces oo tangent u ah geesaha qalloocan (tangent u ah diyaaraha iyo wejiyada sinaanta leh waa la dhisay) Ku dooro magacooda panel-ka astaamaha; marka hore thicken, ka dibna fillet u samee jidhka adag Liis jidhadka taariikhda; ka reebista jidhadka qarsoon ee dhoofinta Magacow oo qari jidhadka liiska jidhka panel-ka qaybta; tirtir ama joog astaamaha samaysay jidhka si aad uga reebto Miisaan aan isku mid ahayn oo ilaalinaya silindarrada iyo koonada sida xisaab; miisaanka aan isku mid ahayn ee wejiyada kala-raris Scale body wuxuu ka dhigaa wejiyada qalloocan B-splines xidhan (dhex-gal 0.0000004 mm); miisaan isku mid ah ayaa weli saxda ah Isku-darka jidhadka dusha; isku-darka Minkowski Stitch ama Thicken marka hore, ka dibna Combine Falanqaynta tolerance-ka: stack-ups oo leh geesood (wareegyo vector ah 2D iyo 3D), dareenka laga xisaabiyay joomatariga, Monte Carlo oo leh qaybinta kale, tolerance-ka cabbirrada sketch-ka, tolerance-ka dheeraadka ah ee material condition-ka Stack-up isku-dhisyada: hal jihe, xaaladda ugu xun iyo RSS, tolerances-ka la qoro, laga bilaabo tolerance-ka guud ee title block-ka ama GD&T frames: eeg Tolerance stack-ups Nesting: amarka goynta iyo lead-ins, geesaha la wadaago oo mar keliya la jaro, qaybaha waa in la wada hayo; hadhaaga rolls-ka, agabka la wadaago mashruucyada Nest flat parts on sheets… oo leh bannaan, xad, leexin iyo jihada: eeg Nest flat parts on sheets; saxanka hadhay waa la kaydiyaa oo horta waa la isticmaalaa: eeg Keep and reuse offcuts; qorshee goynta barnaamijka goynta kaaga Sheet metal: hems, jogs, miter iyo contour flanges; flanges ee geesaha qalloocan ama wejiyada base flange-ka la foorariyay; bends la sawiray; xidhidhka geesaha; qalabka qaabeynta; jidh loo beddelo sheet metal; flat-ka base flange-ka la foorariyay oo wax laga gooyay; miisaska foorarinta Base flange (saxan ama profile foorarsan), Edge flange geesaha toosan ee saxanka oo leh bend reliefs, iyo flat pattern oo leh K-factor: eeg Sheet metal Draft analysis isku-dhisyada; helitaanka parting line; falanqaynta qaro darbiga Draft analysis qaybta Design: eeg Check draft for moulding and casting; fur qayb kasta oo isku-dhis si aad u hubiso Sketches Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Ellipses, tangent arcs, conics, splines oo leh darajo go'an ama miisaan (NURBS) Splines (cubic), qaansooyin iyo goobo oo leh Tangent relations Dhibic ku taal spline (xidhiidh), xidhiidhka curvature (G2) Dhibcaha spline-ka ku dhig meesha uu tegi lahaa Nuqul offset ah oo spline-yada oo raacaya isbeddelada dambe; offsets-ka silsiladaha oo leh geesaha spline-ka ee jilicsan Mar kale offset-garee ka dib isbeddelka; marka hore geeska wareeg Nuqul-qaababka oo ku xiran asalka; qaababka dhinaca qow Mar kale qaab-garee ka dib isbeddelka Mashruucyada geesaha wareegsan ama ka jeedsan ee la soo saaray, joomatari la soo saaray oo raacaya qaybta Soo saar geesaha wareegsan oo toosan oo isbarbar ah, ka dibna cabbir Cabbirrada darawalka (tixraaca) Akhri cabbirrada panel-ka ama macluumaadka qaybta Xidhiidhka collinear Parallel oo leh masaafo 0 ah Gelinta barnaamij kale (clipboard-ka nidaamka) Dhoofi DXF, STEP, STL ama 3MF Qorista qaansooyinka, koordinaatyada xaaladda ama qudhoobka Qor khadadka iyo goobaha; qor qaansooyinka qalabka Arc Dooridda joomatariga iyada oo aan lagu dhejin xulaha Waxay u baahan tahay riix ama taabasho Waxyaabaha iyo unugyada Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Qaabeyn oo beddela agabka; miis naqshadeed CSV ah oo damiya astaamaha Qaabeyn waxay dejisaa halbeegyada oo astaamaha wuu damiyaa oo furaa: eeg Configurations and design tables; partcraft variants wuxuu dhisaa qaabeynta la kaydiyay magacyo, astaamaha damiyay oo ku jira: eeg Make a variant pack from your configurations Isleegyada lambarada panel-ka astaamaha ugu dambeeyay (diyaarad, sweep, draft iyo kuwa kale) Ku qor script-ka ama partcraft set (Scripts and the command line) Qayb lagu muujiyo inch Cabbirada waxay muujiyaan millimitir; ku qor 2in sanduuqa lambarka ama isla'egta wuxuuna noqonayaa 50.8 Faylasha Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Tafatirka astaamaha jidhka STEP ee la soo dhoofiyay (wuxuu yimaadaa isagoon taariikh lahayn) Ku dar ama jar agabka adigoo isticmaalaya astaamahaaga Akhrinta midabbada, magacyada, qaab-dhismeedka isku-dhisyada iyo PMI-ga STEP-ka Lama heli karo Dhoofinta glTF, OBJ, IGES, Parasolid; DWG ee qayb 3D ah (kaliya qaabeynta pack-ka wuxuu qoraa DWG: xaashida sawirka) STL ama 3MF meshes-ka; STEP jidhadka adag; DXF 2D-ka Furista IGES, DXF ama faylasha barnaamijyada kale (faylasha .3dm waxay furmaan sida hal jidh: Open a .3dm model as a solid body) Weydii STEP, ama mesh STL, OBJ ama 3MF oo xidhan: Open an STL, OBJ or 3MF Qaab-dhismeedka isku-dhisyada (geed leh magacyada qaybaha) ee STEP-ka la dhoofiyay STEP isku-dhis waa hal compound oo jidhadka la dejiyay Kaydinta fool la doortay adigoo aan browser-ka lagu soo dejin Ku shid \"ask where to save\" dejinta soo dejinta browser-ka Sawirrada Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Cabbirro ka badan saddexda cabbir ee guud (cabbirada godyada, meelaha, tolerances-ka cabbirrada) Calaamadee PDF-ka, ama dhoofi DXF oo cabbiri barnaamij CAD 2D ah Hal ama ka badan goynta ama faahfaahinta; muuqaalada isku-hadhaa, kuwa jeexan iyo kuwa dhinac-hoose Hal goyn iyo hal faahfaahin mid kasta sawirka Qoraal xor ah, qoraallo iyo miisas xaashida (marka laga reebo blocks-ka cinwaanka iyo nooca) Finish note, ama qoraal lagu daro PDF-ka Isku-xidhka xagalka koowaad (first-angle), muuqaalada dhaqaajiya, xaashida qaabka bortiga Third angle, habayn toos ah, xaashida dhererka A4–A0 iyo ANSI A–E Muuqaalka goynta oo toos ah: diyaaro dhowr ah ama sanduuq goynta isla mar, xadka goynta, kaydinta goynta faylka Hal diyaarad mar kasta Views › Section view; eeg Look inside with a section view Muuqaalada isku-dhisyada oo leh muuqaalo dheeraad ah, cabbirro ama balloons aad dhaqaajin karto Hal isometric (ama exploded) muuqaal oo leh balloons toosan iyo liiska qaybaha Nuqul iyo dhejinta calaamadaha GD&T iyo dhamaystirka Mid kasta ku dhig Datum, Frame ama Finish Buugaagta: STEP-yada From another file… ee Illustrate, moodeel si toos ah loo soo qaado ModelCraft ama BimCraft, sawirro tayada path tracer-ka, 3D fal-celin gudaha PDF Fur STEP-ka Design oo bilow buugga From the open part; kaydi moodeelka sida glTF (.glb); sawirro PNG ah oo muuqaalka 3D; faylka 3D ee fal-celinta: eeg Start a manual in Illustrate Isku-dhisyada Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Isku-xirka gear, rack, cam iyo screw; isku-xirka kubbadda oo ku xaddidan koon; isku-xirka meelaha qalloocan ama dhibcaha Isku-xirka adag, revolute, slider, cylindrical, planar, ball iyo pin-in-slot ee wejiyada sinaanta leh, qiimo kasta oo leh xaddiddiisa: eeg Build an assembly Tallaabooyinka exploded ee leexiya qaybaha, iyo jiidista qaybaha ay isku-xirku dejiyo Tallaabooyin exploded toosan; ka saar isku-xir si aad qayb gacanta ugu dhaqaajiso Isku-dhisyo hoosaad Hal heer oo qaybaha kaliya Gears, cams, xiriir Lama heli karo Wax soo saarka Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Jarista adaptive 3D iyo jarista offset 3D; dhamaystirka waterline, pencil, radial iyo spiral; marinnada adaptive ee loo qoro qaansooyin Jarista 3D xariiqyo toosan, iyo jarista hadhaaga: eeg 3D roughing and rest machining; dhamaystirka Parallel iyo Scallop: eeg 3D finishing; 2.5-tiir face, pocket, 2D adaptive, contour, drill iyo chamfer: eeg Make toolpaths and G-code Jarista swarf, waddooyinka flow-line iyo multi-axis, koodhadhka shaqada leexan (G68.2) iyo hubinta is-dhaca ee holder-ka iyo mashiinka; simulasho ee jarista 5-tiir iyo wareega Qalab leexan howlgal kasta, dhamaystir 5-tiir oo leh kubbad bar dhamaad iyo dhamaystirka wareega ee tiirka 4-aad: eeg 4- and 5-axis machining Godinta iyo dhuunta gudaha khaaraadda, cycles G71/G76, qaansooyin waddooyinka khaaraadda, qalabyo nool, sub-spindle Khaaraadda dibadda: wejiga, ku-dhow, dhamaystir, godka, ka-jar, dhuunto, godin dhexda: eeg Turning on a lathe Baadhista xagal ama geesi, qalab-kuwe, cabbirka cabbir ee tolerance-ka Baadhista wejiga, dhinaca, godka ama boss-ka si loo dejiyo kala-saarka shaqada: eeg Probing Hubinta is-dhaca holder-ka iyo gees-hoosta Eeg digniinta dherer-fiilada ka dibna hubi simulator-ka xakameeyahaaga Nolosha qalabka iyo wareegyada hoosaadka ee post-ka; soo-raridda faylasha post-ka barnaamijyada kale Qor ama beddel post qaabka PartCraft-ka: eeg Post processors you can edit G-code oo inch ah (G20) Millimitir (G21) oo keliya Simulasho iyo naqshad-abuurka Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Daraasadaha aan isku mid ahayn: wax soo-saar, ka-weyneyn weyn, is-dhacyada qaybaha, daalka Xoogga iyo wejiyada toosan, wejiyada ilaalinta iyo dhaqdhaqaaqa: eeg Check stress and deflection; ilaali isku-dhafka xoogga oo ka sarreeya 1 Ilaalinta buckling-ka aan isku mid ahayn (dhererka, post-buckling, snap-through) Qaybta buckling-ka toosan oo leh xadka ballaaran: eeg Heat, thermal stress and buckling Iftiin ka dhex-maraya wejiyada (view factors), ka-hortagga xiriirka, maaddooyinka heerkulka ku xiran, daalka heerkulka (mawjadaha daalka kulaylka) Iftiin hareeraha ah, xoog kulaylka oo joogto ah ama quasi-static oo waqti ku xiran, hantida joogta ah: eeg Heat, thermal stress and buckling Hagaajinta otomaatiga ah ee kulaylka transient-ka iyo daraasadaha culeyska kulaylka; mesh-ka oo lagu weyneeyo meelaha khaladku yar yahay; bartilmaameed ku saabsan tiro maxalli ah (xoogga ugu sarreeya meel gaar ah) Refine automatically daraasadaha static, buckling, natural-frequency iyo kulaylka joogta ah, khaladka oo dhan qaybta: eeg Check stress and deflection; haddii kale yaree cabbirka element-ka Culeysyada bearing-ka iyo boolta, xoogag fog, moment-ada, springs, dhaqdhaqaaqyada la qeexay Xoogag iyo cadaadis dusha, cuf; dusha go'an iyo kuwa aan is-diidin Daraasadaha isku-dhisyada; agabka kala duwan jihada (layers-ka la daabacay, composites) Hal qayb, hal agab isotropic Dhowr xarun oo furmaan ah daraasadaha tetrahedral, gudbinta kulaylka iyo naqshad-abuurka; xarun kasta bogga aan cross-origin isolated ahayn Daraasadaha voxel, buckling, xoogga waqtiga iyo socodka laminar waxay adeegsadaan xarumaha halka bogga ogolaado: eeg PartCraft settings Socodka turbulent ee nuxurka naqshadda (moodelka Spalart–Allmaras waxa uu ku jiraa sida tijaabo: xoogga biibilka 30 ilaa 34 % sare, dib-u-xidhidhka dhabarka-tallaabada 21 ilaa 39 % gaaban; la qorsheeyay: unugyo fiican oo derbiyada ag ah); kulaylka socodka, socod aan joogto ahayn (waqti-saxda ah), dusha xor ah, dareemayaasha aan Newtonian ahayn, qaybaha wareegaya Socod laminar, joogto ah, isothermal oo fluid Newtonian ah, ama moodelka turbulent ee tijaabada qaab-ka tayada: eeg Simulate fluid flow; panel-ku wuxuu digayaa marka Reynolds number-ku gabi ka dhaafo laminar-ka Xadka xoogga iyo xeerarka wax-soo-saarka (overhangs, jihooyinka jarista) ee naqshad-abuurka; agabyo badan oo mid qaab ah Qaabka ugu adag mugga; hubi natiijada Simulation: eeg Grow a shape from loads Natiijo naqshad-abuur oo ah jidh la wax-beddeli karo (qaab siman, parametric) STL, STEP faceted ah ama qayb leh natiijada jidh faceted la soo dhoofiyay Naqshadda mashiinka korontada: rotor oo wareegaya stator gudaha, torque-ka iyo xaglaha, biraha la kaaga kulmiyo, magnets oo lumiya xoog ka dib knee-kooda, eddy currents iyo khasaaraha bir iyo naxaas; goobaha birta 3-D ama meshes-ka wareegsan Magnetostatics 2-D oo toosan oo ku saleysan shabakad maktabadda falanqaynta: coils, bir, magnets joogto ah oo ku jira recoil line, fogaanshaha, inductance iyo jiid: eeg Magnetic fields in 2-D Scripts Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Caawinta hover ee tafatirka script-ka, breakpoints iyo tallaabooyinka Find, fold iyo complete way jiraan (eeg Write and run scripts); wixii kale, tafatirkaaga: Save iyo Open kooxda Script ayaa geliya oo baxa scripts-ka; shaqeyaasha dhismaha ku jira waxa lagu liistay The CraftScript language Breakpoints iyo tallaabooyinka script-ka disp iyo fprintf jidka; Ctrl+Enter wuxuu socodsiiyaa dhowr safka la doortay mar Goobaha iyo qorshayaasha uu script-ku muujiyo oo lagu sawiro shaqada Design; scripts-ka beddelaya halbeegyada qaybta Waxay ku muuqdaan shaqada Script; scripts-ku wuxuu akhriyaa halbeegyada param (eeg Write and run scripts), beddelaa tab-ka Parameters Sawirro iyo miisas oo ku taal qorshayaasha; tafatirka qorshe (zoom, xadka tiirarka) ka hor inta aan la kaydin Side by side wuxuu muujiyaa qorshayaasha; kaydi qorshe PNG, SVG ama CSV ah oo dhammeeyo meel kale numpy iyo xirmooyinka Python kale; Python oo ka baxsan xidhiidhka; Python oo tafatirka lagu soo xidhayo; Pascal Script Maktabadda caadiga ah ee Python, CraftScript iyo Lua: eeg Scripts in Python Shaqeyaasha Lua oo loo gudbiyo shaqeyaasha dhismaha; wicitaanka shaqada maktabadda Lua-ka magac lagu dhisay intii script-ku socday Qor magaca shaqada maktabadda script-ka (cs.static_tet(…)), ama wac CraftScript script-ka The app Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Kaydinta duubka, wadaagga iyo taariikhda noocyada Weli lama heli karo. Keydi faylasha kombiyuutarkaaga oo noocyada ku kaydi magacyo PartCraft sida app la rakibay oo iPad iyo iPhone Isticmaal PartCraft browser-ka aaladda; Android iyo desktop-ka waxa kale oo uu ku shaqeeyaa CadCraft Studio (getcadcraft.com/download) Menu-yada xaashida xiga (right-click) Qalab-sanduuqa iyo panel-ka midig Shaqada oo dhan oo aan internet lahayn xagga bilowga cusub Kaliya marka app-ka loo kaydiyay isticmaalka aan internet lahayn: eeg Working offline Sheeg waxa aad ugu jirto gunaanad bogga taageerada ee goobta: waxay qaabeynaysaa waxa soo socda. Engineer (generators iyo fields) Wali ma la dhisin Halkii, maanta Madaxyada, dekedaha iyo fittings-ka ee exchanger-ka kulaylka ee la soo saaray; qalloocanka kulaylka ee xoogga agabka; khasaaraha tee ee manifold-ka Generators-ku wuxuu dhisaa corka iyo tuubooyinka; ku dar fittings Design; isticmaal tirooyinka heerkulka qolka ee agabka oo leh factor badbaado Ku dar generators-ka add-on directory-ga hal guji Open shaqada Engineer wuxuu ku daraa generator fayl ka Faylka goobta oo ka dhaqsan voxel-size-ka generator-ka; akhrinta faylasha .vdb Keydi goob ka dhaqsan script-ka; .vdb waa la qoraa, lama akhrin karo Xisaabaadka koodka weelka cadaadiska Qaacidooyinka buugga ee darbiga khafiifka ah iyo darbiga qaro weyn, iyada oo leh factor badbaado aad doorato; ma aha margin koodka Generators-ka app-yada kale Kaliya PartCraft nooca tan","lang":"so"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Isticmaalka caawintan","summary":"Fur caawinta, baadh, oo arag tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["caawin","f1","baadh","casharro","buug"],"headings":[{"id":"fur-caawinta","text":"Fur caawinta","level":2},{"id":"raadi-mawduuc","text":"Raadi mawduuc","level":2},{"id":"tillaabooyinka-kombiyuutarkaaga","text":"Tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga","level":2},{"id":"caawintaas-oo-kale-websaydhka","text":"Caawintaas oo kale websaydhka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp kasta waxa uu leeyahay caawintiisa. Waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka, sidaas darteed xidhiidh la&#039;aan ayuu furmaa, had iyo jeerna nooca aad isticmaalayso ayuu sharxaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fur-caawinta\"\u003EFur caawinta\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawin\u003C/span\u003E barka sare ee app-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXir\u003C/span\u003E si aad u ridto. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa sida ay ahayd.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare ayaa maamula iftiinka iyo codka. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oo la socda furaha \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ama furaha globe-ka), ama isticmaal badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECaawin\u003C/span\u003E. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EFurayaasha Mac-ka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-mawduuc\"\u003ERaadi mawduuc\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu qor sanduuqa baadhista ee caawinta sare. Natiijooyinku waa cusboonaadaan intaad qorayso, waxayna ku jiraan magacyada amarada barnaamijyada kale, sidaas darteed waxa aad meel kale qori lahayd inta badan bogga saxda ah ayaa la helaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMawduucyada waxa loo kooxeeyaa siyaabo isku mid ah app kasta: bilaabidda, tilmaamaha tallaabo-tallaabo, kuwa laga soo guuray barnaamij kale, tixraacyada, iyo dhibaatooyinka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirrada mawduuc gudihiisa waxay furaan mawduuca xiga isla panelka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDib u noqo\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kuu celinayaa meeshii aad ka timid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tillaabooyinka-kombiyuutarkaaga\"\u003ETillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah tillaabooyinka way kala duwan yihiin Mac, Windows iyo Linux, browserada dhexdooda, iyo marka aad online tahay iyo marka aad offline tahay. Caawintu waxay go&#039;aamisaa kan kugu khuseeya oo waxay tusaysaa tillaabooyinkaas. Sadarka sare ee mawduuca waxa uu sheegayaa waxa uu dooray, tusaale ahaan &quot;Showing steps for Mac, Chrome or Edge, online&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBeddel\u003C/span\u003E sadarkaas si aad kombiyuutar ama browser kale u doorato, tusaale ahaan si aad u caawiso shaqaale kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuuji dhammaan\u003C/span\u003E si aad u aragto nooc kasta oo tillaabo kasta, mid kastaa calaamad leh.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadhka furayaasha kiiboodhka waxa loo qoraa siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E wuxuu Mac-ka ku akhrisanayaa ⌘S, Windows iyo Linux-na Ctrl+S.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"caawintaas-oo-kale-websaydhka\"\u003ECaawintaas oo kale websaydhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWebsaydhku wuxuu tusaa isla mawduucyada getcadcraft.com/tutorials, tillaabooyinka nidaam kasta. App-ka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu fur website-ka\u003C/span\u003E oo ku yaal hoosta mawduuca wuxuu furaa bogaas markaad online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"App kasta waxa uu leeyahay caawintiisa. Waa qayb ka mid ah app-ka, sidaas darteed xidhiidh la'aan ayuu furmaa, had iyo jeerna nooca aad isticmaalayso ayuu sharxaa. Fur caawinta Riix F1, ama dooro Caawin barka sare ee app-ka. Riix Esc ama dooro Xir si aad u ridto. Naqshaddaadu waxay ku sii jirtaa sida ay ahayd. Kiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare ayaa maamula iftiinka iyo codka. Riix F1 oo la socda furaha fn (ama furaha globe-ka), ama isticmaal badhanka Caawin. Eeg Furayaasha Mac-ka. Raadi mawduuc Ku qor sanduuqa baadhista ee caawinta sare. Natiijooyinku waa cusboonaadaan intaad qorayso, waxayna ku jiraan magacyada amarada barnaamijyada kale, sidaas darteed waxa aad meel kale qori lahayd inta badan bogga saxda ah ayaa la helaa. Mawduucyada waxa loo kooxeeyaa siyaabo isku mid ah app kasta: bilaabidda, tilmaamaha tallaabo-tallaabo, kuwa laga soo guuray barnaamij kale, tixraacyada, iyo dhibaatooyinka. Xiriirrada mawduuc gudihiisa waxay furaan mawduuca xiga isla panelka. Dib u noqo wuxuu kuu celinayaa meeshii aad ka timid. Tillaabooyinka kombiyuutarkaaga Qaar ka mid ah tillaabooyinka way kala duwan yihiin Mac, Windows iyo Linux, browserada dhexdooda, iyo marka aad online tahay iyo marka aad offline tahay. Caawintu waxay go'aamisaa kan kugu khuseeya oo waxay tusaysaa tillaabooyinkaas. Sadarka sare ee mawduuca waxa uu sheegayaa waxa uu dooray, tusaale ahaan \"Showing steps for Mac, Chrome or Edge, online\". Dooro Beddel sadarkaas si aad kombiyuutar ama browser kale u doorato, tusaale ahaan si aad u caawiso shaqaale kale. Dooro Muuji dhammaan si aad u aragto nooc kasta oo tillaabo kasta, mid kastaa calaamad leh. Gaadhka furayaasha kiiboodhka waxa loo qoraa siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo: Ctrl+S wuxuu Mac-ka ku akhrisanayaa ⌘S, Windows iyo Linux-na Ctrl+S. Caawintaas oo kale websaydhka Websaydhku wuxuu tusaa isla mawduucyada getcadcraft.com/tutorials, tillaabooyinka nidaam kasta. App-ka, Ku fur website-ka oo ku yaal hoosta mawduuca wuxuu furaa bogaas markaad online tahay.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Browserrada iyo kombiyuutarada","summary":"Browserrada app-yadu ku shaqeeyaan, waxa ka duwan dhexdooda, iyo waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","browser","mac","windows","linux","ipad","tablet","webgl","shuruudaha","xusuusta"],"headings":[{"id":"browserka","text":"Browserka","level":2},{"id":"waxa-browserada-ku-kala-duwan","text":"Waxa browserada ku kala duwan","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-iyo-linux","text":"Mac, Windows iyo Linux","level":2},{"id":"taabletyada-iyo-shaashadaha-taabashada","text":"Taabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada","level":2},{"id":"browserka-iyo-nidaamka-ugu-duqsan","text":"Browserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-kombiyuutarkaagu-u-baahan-yahay","text":"Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan browser web. Shaqada kombiyuutarkaaga ayey ku sameeyaan: faylalkaagu halkaas ayaa la furaa oo weligood ma nala soo dirin (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EMeesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserka\"\u003EBrowserka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsticmaal nooca cusub ee mid ka mid ah kuwan:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBrowser\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EEngine\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFaahfaahin\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKan ugu buuxsamaya: doorashada folder-ka, kaydinta offline-ka, maaraynta faylasha.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay shaqeysaa. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Kaydinta offline-ka waxa laga yaabaa inaysan ku shaqeynin daaqadaha gaarka ah.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWay shaqeysaa Mac iyo iPad. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Safari waxay tirtiri kartaa nuqul offline ah oo aanad isticmaalin dhowr toddobaad.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDhammaan saddexdan engine way wanaagsan yihiin shaqada maalinlaha ah. Meel app uu wax ku kala duwan sameeyo mid ka mid ah, caawinta uu ku leeyahay waxay tusinaysaa tillaabooyinka browserkaaga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-browserada-ku-kala-duwan\"\u003EWaxa browserada ku kala duwan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFuridda folder-ka.\u003C/strong\u003E Browserada Chromium waxay tusaan doorashada folder-ka dhabta ah, folder-kana si toos ah ayey u akhriyaan. Firefox iyo Safari waxay kugu weydiinayaan inaad folder dooratid kadibna mid kasta oo ku jira way akhriyaan, taas oo qaadanaysa waqti dheer folderada mashruucyada waaweyn; folder-ka app-ka ku jiid waxay ku shaqeysaa saddexdaba.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydinta.\u003C/strong\u003E Apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo fayl soo dejinaya. Browserkaagu wuxuu go&#039;aaminayaa meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo inuu hore u weydiiyo mise uusan weydiin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome ama Edge, shid &quot;Ask where to save each file before downloading&quot; (Settings gudaheeda, hoosta Downloads) si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFirefox, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna Downloads, kadibna dooro &quot;Always ask you where to save files&quot; si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna deji &quot;File download location&quot; &quot;Ask for each download&quot; si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-iyo-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows iyo Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu kombiyuutar kasta waa isku mid. Waxa isbedela waa kiiboodhka: gaadhka furayaasha si toos ah ayaa loogu qoraa kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EFurayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taabletyada-iyo-shaashadaha-taabashada\"\u003ETaabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay aqbalaan taabashada (hal farta ayaa sawirta ama doortaa, labo farood ayaa weynaysa oo dhaqaajiya). Caawinta app kasta ayaa sheegaysa inay taasi jirto. iPad-ka, isticmaal Safari ama Chrome. Kiiboodhku wuxuu caawiyaa apps-yada isticmaala amarro la qoro.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browserka-iyo-nidaamka-ugu-duqsan\"\u003EBrowserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaan kuwan ka akhrinnay koodka apps-yada 0.7, ma aha malo-malo: fayl kasta waa la falanqeeyay, astaamo kasta oo luqadda ah oo ay isticmaalaan waxaa laga eegay xogta isku-habaynta ee browserrada ee la daabacay. Nooca ka hooseeya kuwan, apps-yadu ma bilaabi karaan, sababtoo ah browserku koodka ma fahmo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENooca ugu duqsan ee apps-yada bilaabi kara\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio waxa uu Windows-ka ku leeyahay engine web-kiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay Windows 10 ama 11; Mac-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa kan nidaamka, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay macOS 13.3 ama ka cusub. Dejinta › Cusboonaysiinta ee Studio waxa ay muujinaysaa nidaamka nuqulkaagu ku shaqeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETanu waa nooca ugu duqsan ee \u003Cem\u003Ebilaabmo\u003C/em\u003E, laga akhriyay koodka. Ma aha liis browserro duq ah oo aan apps-yada ku shaqeynay, sidaas darteed browser duq ah oo bilaabmi kara ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weli maqan yahay astaamo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-kombiyuutarkaagu-u-baahan-yahay\"\u003EWaxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKuwani waa qadarka ugu yar ee la qorsheeyay apps-yada, ma aha shuruudo la cabbiray:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E8 GB oo xusuus ah (16 GB ayaa lagu talinayaa moodallada isku-dhafan ee waaweyn).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChip garaafyada oo leh WebGL 2 apps-yada 3D-ga. Haddii muuqaalka 3D-ga madhan yahay, hubi in hardware acceleration uu shaqeynayo dejinta browserkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballaadhka leh si qalabyada oo dhan u buuxaan; shaashadaha yar safaf badan ayay u qaybiyaan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaylal aad u waaweyn (qorshe-tiro waaweyn, moodallo waaweyn) xusuus badan ayey ku isticmaalaan tab-ka browserka. Haddii app-ku gaabiyo, xir tab-yada kale ee culus.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"App-yadu waxay ku shaqeeyaan browser web. Shaqada kombiyuutarkaaga ayey ku sameeyaan: faylalkaagu halkaas ayaa la furaa oo weligood ma nala soo dirin (eeg Meesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan). Browserka Isticmaal nooca cusub ee mid ka mid ah kuwan: Browser Engine Faahfaahin Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Kan ugu buuxsamaya: doorashada folder-ka, kaydinta offline-ka, maaraynta faylasha. Firefox Gecko Way shaqeysaa. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Kaydinta offline-ka waxa laga yaabaa inaysan ku shaqeynin daaqadaha gaarka ah. Safari WebKit Way shaqeysaa Mac iyo iPad. Furidda folder oo dhan waxay isticmaashaa doorasho fudud. Safari waxay tirtiri kartaa nuqul offline ah oo aanad isticmaalin dhowr toddobaad. Dhammaan saddexdan engine way wanaagsan yihiin shaqada maalinlaha ah. Meel app uu wax ku kala duwan sameeyo mid ka mid ah, caawinta uu ku leeyahay waxay tusinaysaa tillaabooyinka browserkaaga. Waxa browserada ku kala duwan Furidda folder-ka. Browserada Chromium waxay tusaan doorashada folder-ka dhabta ah, folder-kana si toos ah ayey u akhriyaan. Firefox iyo Safari waxay kugu weydiinayaan inaad folder dooratid kadibna mid kasta oo ku jira way akhriyaan, taas oo qaadanaysa waqti dheer folderada mashruucyada waaweyn; folder-ka app-ka ku jiid waxay ku shaqeysaa saddexdaba. Kaydinta. Apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo fayl soo dejinaya. Browserkaagu wuxuu go'aaminayaa meesha soo dejintu tagto iyo inuu hore u weydiiyo mise uusan weydiin. Chrome ama Edge, shid \"Ask where to save each file before downloading\" (Settings gudaheeda, hoosta Downloads) si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Firefox, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna Downloads, kadibna dooro \"Always ask you where to save files\" si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Safari, fur Settings, kadibna General, kadibna deji \"File download location\" \"Ask for each download\" si aad mar kasta folder u dooratid. Mac, Windows iyo Linux Apps-yadu kombiyuutar kasta waa isku mid. Waxa isbedela waa kiiboodhka: gaadhka furayaasha si toos ah ayaa loogu qoraa kombiyuutarkaaga. Eeg Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada. Taabletyada iyo shaashadaha taabashada Qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay aqbalaan taabashada (hal farta ayaa sawirta ama doortaa, labo farood ayaa weynaysa oo dhaqaajiya). Caawinta app kasta ayaa sheegaysa inay taasi jirto. iPad-ka, isticmaal Safari ama Chrome. Kiiboodhku wuxuu caawiyaa apps-yada isticmaala amarro la qoro. Browserka iyo nidaamka ugu duqsan Waxaan kuwan ka akhrinnay koodka apps-yada 0.7, ma aha malo-malo: fayl kasta waa la falanqeeyay, astaamo kasta oo luqadda ah oo ay isticmaalaan waxaa laga eegay xogta isku-habaynta ee browserrada ee la daabacay. Nooca ka hooseeya kuwan, apps-yadu ma bilaabi karaan, sababtoo ah browserku koodka ma fahmo. Nooca ugu duqsan ee apps-yada bilaabi kara Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS and iOS 16.4) CadCraft Studio waxa uu Windows-ka ku leeyahay engine web-kiisa, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay Windows 10 ama 11; Mac-ka wuxuu isticmaalaa kan nidaamka, sidaas darteed wuxuu u baahan yahay macOS 13.3 ama ka cusub. Dejinta › Cusboonaysiinta ee Studio waxa ay muujinaysaa nidaamka nuqulkaagu ku shaqeeyo. Tanu waa nooca ugu duqsan ee bilaabmo, laga akhriyay koodka. Ma aha liis browserro duq ah oo aan apps-yada ku shaqeynay, sidaas darteed browser duq ah oo bilaabmi kara ayaa laga yaabaa inuu weli maqan yahay astaamo. Waxa kombiyuutarkaagu u baahan yahay Kuwani waa qadarka ugu yar ee la qorsheeyay apps-yada, ma aha shuruudo la cabbiray: 8 GB oo xusuus ah (16 GB ayaa lagu talinayaa moodallada isku-dhafan ee waaweyn). Chip garaafyada oo leh WebGL 2 apps-yada 3D-ga. Haddii muuqaalka 3D-ga madhan yahay, hubi in hardware acceleration uu shaqeynayo dejinta browserkaaga. Shaashad ugu yaraan 1280 pixel ballaadhka leh si qalabyada oo dhan u buuxaan; shaashadaha yar safaf badan ayay u qaybiyaan. Faylal aad u waaweyn (qorshe-tiro waaweyn, moodallo waaweyn) xusuus badan ayey ku isticmaalaan tab-ka browserka. Haddii app-ku gaabiyo, xir tab-yada kale ee culus.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Furayaasha, mouse-yada iyo trackpad-yada","summary":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro, furayaasha function ee Mac-ka, riix midig iyo panning la'aan mouse.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["kiiboodh","gaadh","shortcut","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","furayaasha function","trackpad","riix midig","badhanka dhexe","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"sida-gaadhka-furayaasha-loo-qoro","text":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro","level":2},{"id":"furayaasha-function-ee-mac-ka","text":"Furayaasha function ee Mac-ka","level":2},{"id":"gaadhka-browserku-hayo","text":"Gaadhka browserku hayo","level":2},{"id":"badhamada-mouse-ka-ee-trackpad-ka","text":"Badhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka","level":2},{"id":"qorista-sanduuq-qoraal","text":"Qorista sanduuq qoraal","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-gaadhka-furayaasha-loo-qoro\"\u003ESida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECaawintu gaadh kasta waxa ay u qorta siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQoran\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMac-ka\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWindows iyo Linux\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) iyo S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl iyo S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) iyo F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift iyo F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) iyo ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt iyo ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efuraha Delete\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn iyo Delete (tirtirka hore)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalaamadda plus waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in furayaasha si wada jir ah loo hayo. &quot;Kadib&quot; waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in mid mid ka dib la riixo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGaadhka apps-yada badankiisa Mac-ka waxa ay aqbalaan Command ama Control, sidaas darteed \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E labada siyaabood ayuu shaqeeyaa. Yar oo ka mid ah, sida shaashadda buuxda (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), furaha Control ayey kombiyuutar kasta isticmaalaan; caawintu waxa ay sheegtaa meesha ay khuseyso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"furayaasha-function-ee-mac-ka\"\u003EFurayaasha function ee Mac-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare wuxuu beddelaa iftiinka, codka iyo warbaahinta. Si aad F1 ilaa F12 u dirto:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehay \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (ama furaha globe-ka) intaad furaha riixayso, ama\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Efur \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EKeyboard Shortcuts\u003C/strong\u003E, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003EFunction Keys\u003C/strong\u003E, oo shid &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah furayaasha F-ka macOS-ku lafteeda ayuu leeyahay (tusaale ahaan Mission Control). Haddii furaha app-ka aan wax samaynin, ku isku day fn, ama isticmaal badhanka qalabka halkii.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"gaadhka-browserku-hayo\"\u003EGaadhka browserku hayo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog web ah ma qaadi karo qaar ka mid ah gaadhka browserka, wax kasta oo ay samaysa. App kasta:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E had iyo jeer daaqadaha iyo tab-yada browserka ayey furaan ama xiraan. Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhamo ah Cusub iyo Xir halkaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Mac-ka iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Windows-ka browserka way xiraan. Haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysato, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (&quot;Leave site?&quot;); dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShaashadda buuxda ee browserka (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F, ama badhanka cagaaran ee daaqadda\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) weli way shaqeysaa. Apps-yadu waxay leeyihiin qaabab shaashad oo gaar ah oo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ku, kuwaas oo sidoo kale barrada app-ka qarin kara.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"badhamada-mouse-ka-ee-trackpad-ka\"\u003EBadhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhanka midig iyo badhanka dhexe. Haddii aadan mouse saddex-badhan ah lahayn:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix midig:\u003C/strong\u003E guji labo farood. Shid &quot;Secondary click&quot; \u003Cstrong\u003ESystem Settings\u003C/strong\u003E gudaha, kadibna \u003Cstrong\u003ETrackpad\u003C/strong\u003E, haddii guji labo farood aan waxba samaynin. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo markaad gujinayso waxay furaysaa menu-ga browserka, laakiin naqshadda gudaheeda qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay u akhriyaan guji caadi ah (Control la hayo), sidaas darteed guji labo farood ayaa ka wanaagsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidida badhanka dhexe (pan):\u003C/strong\u003E app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta wheel-ka:\u003C/strong\u003E kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo trackpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Labo farood oo isku soo dhowaynaya ayaa sidoo kale weynayn meesha app-ku taageero.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERiix midig:\u003C/strong\u003E guji labo farood, ama guji geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay dejinta touchpad-kaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJiidida badhanka dhexe (pan):\u003C/strong\u003E app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWeynaynta wheel-ka:\u003C/strong\u003E kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo touchpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qorista-sanduuq-qoraal\"\u003EQorista sanduuq qoraal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIntaad sanduuq ku qorayso (magac, faallo, baadhis), gaadhka app-ka ee xarfo keliya ahi way damaan, sidaas darteed qorista &quot;L&quot; waxay qortaa L. Riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ama guji naqshadda si aad furayaasha app-ka dib ugu celiso.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sida gaadhka furayaasha loo qoro Caawintu gaadh kasta waxa ay u qorta siyaabta kiiboodhkaagu u calaamadeeyo. Qoran Mac-ka Windows iyo Linux Ctrl+S Command (⌘) iyo S Ctrl iyo S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) iyo F Ctrl, Shift iyo F Alt+← Option (⌥) iyo ← Alt iyo ← Backspace furaha Delete Backspace Delete fn iyo Delete (tirtirka hore) Delete Enter Return Enter Calaamadda plus waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in furayaasha si wada jir ah loo hayo. \"Kadib\" waxa ay ka dhigan tahay in mid mid ka dib la riixo. Gaadhka apps-yada badankiisa Mac-ka waxa ay aqbalaan Command ama Control, sidaas darteed Ctrl+Z labada siyaabood ayuu shaqeeyaa. Yar oo ka mid ah, sida shaashadda buuxda (Ctrl+Shift+F), furaha Control ayey kombiyuutar kasta isticmaalaan; caawintu waxa ay sheegtaa meesha ay khuseyso. Furayaasha function ee Mac-ka Kiiboodhka Mac-ka badankiisa safka sare wuxuu beddelaa iftiinka, codka iyo warbaahinta. Si aad F1 ilaa F12 u dirto: hay fn (ama furaha globe-ka) intaad furaha riixayso, ama fur System Settings, kadibna Keyboard, kadibna Keyboard Shortcuts, kadibna Function Keys, oo shid \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\". Qaar ka mid ah furayaasha F-ka macOS-ku lafteeda ayuu leeyahay (tusaale ahaan Mission Control). Haddii furaha app-ka aan wax samaynin, ku isku day fn, ama isticmaal badhanka qalabka halkii. Gaadhka browserku hayo Bog web ah ma qaadi karo qaar ka mid ah gaadhka browserka, wax kasta oo ay samaysa. App kasta: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T iyo Ctrl+W had iyo jeer daaqadaha iyo tab-yada browserka ayey furaan ama xiraan. Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhamo ah Cusub iyo Xir halkaas. Ctrl+Q Mac-ka iyo Alt+F4 Windows-ka browserka way xiraan. Haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysato, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (\"Leave site?\"); dooro inaad joogto, kadibna kaydi. Shaashadda buuxda ee browserka (Control-Command-F, ama badhanka cagaaran ee daaqadda / F11) weli way shaqeysaa. Apps-yadu waxay leeyihiin qaabab shaashad oo gaar ah oo Ctrl+Shift+F ku, kuwaas oo sidoo kale barrada app-ka qarin kara. Badhamada mouse-ka ee trackpad-ka Apps-yadu waxay isticmaalaan badhanka midig iyo badhanka dhexe. Haddii aadan mouse saddex-badhan ah lahayn: Riix midig: guji labo farood. Shid \"Secondary click\" System Settings gudaha, kadibna Trackpad, haddii guji labo farood aan waxba samaynin. Ctrl la hayo markaad gujinayso waxay furaysaa menu-ga browserka, laakiin naqshadda gudaheeda qaar ka mid ah apps-yada waxay u akhriyaan guji caadi ah (Control la hayo), sidaas darteed guji labo farood ayaa ka wanaagsan. Jiidida badhanka dhexe (pan): app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida Space la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan. Weynaynta wheel-ka: kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo trackpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Labo farood oo isku soo dhowaynaya ayaa sidoo kale weynayn meesha app-ku taageero. Riix midig: guji labo farood, ama guji geeska hoose ee midig ee touchpad-ka. Tani waxay ku xiran tahay dejinta touchpad-kaaga. Jiidida badhanka dhexe (pan): app kasta wuxuu bixiyaa siyaabo kale oo loo dhaqaajiyo, sida Space la hayo intaad jiidayso ama jiidida badhanka midig. Bogga kiiboodhka app-ka ayaa sheegaya kan. Weynaynta wheel-ka: kor-u-dhaaf labo farood oo touchpad-ka ku sawiran badankiisa apps-yada ayey weynaysaa. Qorista sanduuq qoraal Intaad sanduuq ku qorayso (magac, faallo, baadhis), gaadhka app-ka ee xarfo keliya ahi way damaan, sidaas darteed qorista \"L\" waxay qortaa L. Riix Esc ama guji naqshadda si aad furayaasha app-ka dib ugu celiso.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Hel qalab ama dejin","summary":"Riix Ctrl+K oo qor xarfo yar si aad u wada fuliso qalab kasta, u beddesho dejin ama furto mawduuc caawin.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["raadi","baadh","palet amarka","furid degdeg","fuli amar","qalab","dejin","gaadh","ctrl k","cmd k"],"headings":[{"id":"raadi-oo-fuli","text":"Raadi oo fuli","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApp kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq baadhis oo qalabkiisa, dejimihiisa iyo caawintan ku jira. Ma u baahnid inaad ogaato qalabku meeshuu ku yaal qalabka.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raadi-oo-fuli\"\u003ERaadi oo fuli\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERaadi\u003C/span\u003E barka sare ku jirta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQor xarfo yar oo waxa aad rabtid: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;panel text&quot;, &quot;units&quot;. Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqo, sidaas darteed erey labaad ku dar si liiska u yaraysid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERiix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad u fuliso natiijada ugu horreysa, ama marka hore furayaasha fallaadhka u dhaqaaji. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa sanduuqa xidha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida haddii aad qalabka ku guntay qalabka. Dejin wuxuu furaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDejinta\u003C/span\u003E oo dejintaas ku jirta. Mawduuc caawin wuxuu halkan ku furmaa, panelka caawinta gudihiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWaxa aad ugu dambeyn isticmaashay ayaa mar xiga horta ku jiri doona, sidaas darteed qalab aad inta badan isticmaasho hal riix oo furaha ah ayuu kaa dhow yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada aan hadda shaqayn karin, tusaale ahaan ka hor inta fayl la furin, waa la liistaa laakiin waa la madoobeeyay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQalabyada add-on-ka ayaa sidoo kale liiska ku jira, marka add-on-ka la shido.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"App kasta wuxuu leeyahay sanduuq baadhis oo qalabkiisa, dejimihiisa iyo caawintan ku jira. Ma u baahnid inaad ogaato qalabku meeshuu ku yaal qalabka. Raadi oo fuli Riix Ctrl+K, ama dooro Raadi barka sare ku jirta. Qor xarfo yar oo waxa aad rabtid: \"fillet\", \"panel text\", \"units\". Erey kasta oo aad qorto waa inuu iswaafaqo, sidaas darteed erey labaad ku dar si liiska u yaraysid. Riix Enter si aad u fuliso natiijada ugu horreysa, ama marka hore furayaasha fallaadhka u dhaqaaji. Esc ayaa sanduuqa xidha. Qalab wuxuu u shaqeeyaa sida haddii aad qalabka ku guntay qalabka. Dejin wuxuu furaa Dejinta oo dejintaas ku jirta. Mawduuc caawin wuxuu halkan ku furmaa, panelka caawinta gudihiisa. Waxa aad ogaataa Waxa aad ugu dambeyn isticmaashay ayaa mar xiga horta ku jiri doona, sidaas darteed qalab aad inta badan isticmaasho hal riix oo furaha ah ayuu kaa dhow yahay. Qalabyada aan hadda shaqayn karin, tusaale ahaan ka hor inta fayl la furin, waa la liistaa laakiin waa la madoobeeyay. Qalabyada add-on-ka ayaa sidoo kale liiska ku jira, marka add-on-ka la shido.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Habee panelada oo isticmaal shaashad labaad","summary":"Ku xidh panelada dhinaca bidix, midig ama hoosta, isku rari, u kooxee sida tab-yo, ku hay ama qari, ku dhaaf naqshadda, ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow, dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo, ama u wareeji daaqad gaar ah shaashad kale.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["panelada","ku xidh","ku dhaaf","wareeji panel","jiid","qaabeynta","tab-yada","kooxda tab-ka","isku rari","ku hay","auto-hide","qari panel","xir panel","kooban","cabbirka qaabeynta","dhow","safafka qalabka","lafmeyso","1 safka","2 safka","khadka qalabka","shaashad labaad","laba shaashad","shaashado badan","daaqad","daaqad kor u soo booda","dib u deji qaabka"],"headings":[{"id":"dhaqaaji-panel-daaqadda-gudaheeda","text":"Dhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda","level":2},{"id":"u-kooxee-panelada-sida-tab-yo","text":"U kooxee panelada sida tab-yo","level":2},{"id":"pin-qari-oo-soo-celi","text":"Pin, qari oo soo celi","level":2},{"id":"ka-dhig-qaabeynta-mid-dhow","text":"Ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow","level":2},{"id":"dooro-inta-safka-qalabku-isticmaalo","text":"Dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo","level":2},{"id":"isticmaal-kiiboodhka","text":"Isticmaal kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-dhig-panelada-shaashad-labaad","text":"Dib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad","level":2},{"id":"hal-daaqad-oo-panelo-ka-badan","text":"Hal daaqad oo panelo ka badan","level":2},{"id":"isku-mid-qaab-kasta-oo-qaabeyn-ah","text":"Isku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah","level":2},{"id":"dhaqaaji-wada-hadal","text":"Dhaqaaji wada-hadal","level":2},{"id":"dib-u-dhig-panelada","text":"Dib u dhig panelada","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EPanelada ku yaal dhinaca naqshadda way dhaqaaqi karaan. Ku dhig meesha ku habboon, ama u sii daaqad u gaar ah shaashad labaad si naqshaddu u qaadato shaashadda koowaad oo dhan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kasta wuxuu leeyahay safka magacyada: xariiq khafiif ah oo leh magaca panelka, menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E, pin iyo badhanka xidhka ee sare ee panelka. Noocyada ka hor 0.7 waxay leeyihiin magaca iyo menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E oo keliya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaji-panel-daaqadda-gudaheeda\"\u003EDhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid panelka adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIntaad jiidayso, meelo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo muuqda dhinaca bidix, midig iyo hoosta naqshadda. Ku dhig panelka mid ka mid ah si uu halkaas ugu xirmo. Meeshii aad ku jirtid way madowtaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu dhig meel kasta oo kale naqshadda dushiisa si uu u noqdo mid kor u kaca.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada wadaag hal dhinac: way isku rarmaan, xariiq kasta oo u dhexeeya laba panel ayaa la jiidi karaa si ay booska u wadaagaan (marka xariiqda uu xiran yahay, furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa dhaqaajiya, laba jeer riixista ayaana booska si siman u wadaagta). Jiid geeska gudaha dhinac xidhan si aad uga dhigto mid ballac weyn ama mid yar; laba jeer riix geeska si aad u celiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kor u kaca wuxuu ku sii jiraa naqshadda dushiisa. Dhaqaaji adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa, cabbirka beddel adigoo jiidayo geeska hoose ee midigta (ama u gudub geeska adigoo isticmaalaya furaha Tab oo furayaasha fallaadhaha isticmaal). Laba jeer riix magiciisa si uu dib ugu xirmo meeshii uu ka ahaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu jiid hal farta adigoo ku qabanaya magaca panelka. Geeska hoose ee midigta ee panelka kor u kaca ku jiid hal farta si aad u beddesho cabbirka, iyo xuduudaha u dhexeeya panelada xidhan si isku mid ah. Si aad u kor u kacdo ama u xidho adigoon jiidin, isticmaal menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"u-kooxee-panelada-sida-tab-yo\"\u003EU kooxee panelada sida tab-yo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELaba panel waxay wadaagi karaan hal qaab oo mid mid ayay tusi karaan. Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa oo ku dhig safka magaca panel kale (safka waa jaranjaro intaad korkiisa taagan tahay), kadibna sii dayn: qaabku wuxuu hadda leeyahay tab kasta panel kasta, safka magaciisa. Riix tab si aad panelkaas u muujiso. Markaad tab-ka xulan tahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa beddela tab-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad panel uga saarto kooxda, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove out of the tab group\u003C/span\u003E menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E-ka, ama jiid meel kale. Dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETab with\u003C/span\u003E iyo magaca panel si aad u kooxeyso adigoon jiidin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin-qari-oo-soo-celi\"\u003EPin, qari oo soo celi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPin-ka safka magaca panelka wuxuu ka dhigaa \u003Cstrong\u003Eauto-hide\u003C/strong\u003E: panelka wuu ka baxaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu noqdaa tab yar oo dhinaca ku yaal. Ku tilmaam tab-ka, xulo ama riix, panelka ayaa ku sii dhacaa naqshadda dushiisa; ka fogow (ama riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) wuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa. Mar kale riix pin-ka, ama dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnpin\u003C/span\u003E, si aad u xidho si joogto ah.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBadhanka xidhka, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide this panel\u003C/span\u003E menu-ga, ayaa qari panelka oo xidha dhinaciisa. Tab dhinaca ku jira oo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo celinaya: riix, ama xulo oo riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-dhig-qaabeynta-mid-dhow\"\u003EKa dhig qaabeynta mid dhow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout density\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay laba doorasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EComfortable\u003C/span\u003E waa caadiga. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompact\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kooban gareeyaa dhererka safafka, dhexdhexaadinta panelka, badhanada qalabka iyo qoraalka panelka ee barnaamijkaas si wax badan u dhacaan shaashadda. Waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho waxay haysaa badhamada weyn labadaba, taleefankuna qaabeynta gaarka ah. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E ma beddelo cabbirka sida aad dooratay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro-inta-safka-qalabku-isticmaalo\"\u003EDooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar rows\u003C/span\u003E waxay leedahay saddex doorasho. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWrap\u003C/span\u003E waa caadiga: koox kasta oo qalab ayaa muuqda, sidii ay u qaadanayso safar badan. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu qalabka ku haya laba safka, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E1 row\u003C/span\u003E hal safka, si naqshaddu u heli dhererka; kooxaha aan mugga u filnayn ayaa dhinac u jeeda gudaha qalabka (isticmaal tuubbada mouse-ka, jiidista labada farood, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ilaa qalab). Qalab horay u mugga u ah laba safka wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidiisa hoos \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 rows\u003C/span\u003E, sababtoo ah shabakad kaliya way dheereyn lahayd. Doorashadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho iyo taleefanku qaabeynta gaarka ah ayay haystaan. CadCraft waxay leedahay dejintiisa qalabkeeda, hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isticmaal-kiiboodhka\"\u003EIsticmaal kiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ee panel kasta wuxuu furaa menu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock on the left\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock on the right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDock at the bottom\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFloat over the drawing\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin to the edge\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHide this panel\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETab with\u003C/span\u003E panel kale, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/span\u003E. Tab ilaa badhanka, riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, u dhaqaaji furayaasha fallaadhaha, kadibna mar kale riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa xidha menu-ga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-dhig-panelada-shaashad-labaad\"\u003EDib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panel, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove all panels to a new window\u003C/span\u003E. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove panels to a new window\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E gudahiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqad yar ayaa furmaysa oo panelada ku jira. Jiid shaashadda kale ee aad leedahay oo ka dhig mid weyn sidii aad rabto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESii shaqada: panelada ayaa sida hore u shaqeeya naqshadda, naqshaddana waxay buuxinaysaa daaqadda koowaad.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurayaasha wali way shaqeeyaan intaan daaqadda panelada hore u jirto: furayaasha aad halkaas riixdo, marka aan qoraal sanduuq ah lagu qorin, waxay u gudbaan naqshadda. Su&#039;aalaha iyo wada-hadallada barnaamijku weydiiyo waxay ku furmaan daaqadda koowaad, sidaas darteed halkaas ka eeg marka ay soo muuqdaan. Midabka iyo cabbirka qoraalka panelka way raacaan daaqadda koowaad.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome iyo Edge waxay daaqadda ku dhigi karaan shaashadda kale adiga ayagu. Shaashad labaad oo xidhan, dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it on my other screen\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda panelada (ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels on my other screen\u003C/span\u003E menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E panel). Browser-ka mar ayuu weydiiyaa in goobtan la oggolaado inay aragto shaashadahaaga; markaad oggolaatid, daaqadda panelada mar kasta shaashadaas ayay ku furmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDaaqadda panelada adigu ku jiid shaashadda kale. Xiligii xiga way isla meeshii iyo cabbirkii isla ahaa ku furmaysaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hal-daaqad-oo-panelo-ka-badan\"\u003EHal daaqad oo panelo ka badan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanel kasta wuxuu leeyahay daaqad u gaar ah: ilaa afar daaqadood oo panelo ah, tusaale ahaan mid shaashad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ee panel, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu furaa daaqad kale panelkaas, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to panels window 2\u003C/span\u003E (iyo kuwa kale) wuxuu u wareejiyaa mid furan. Daaqadda labaad waxa lagu magacaabaa &quot;panels 2&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa daaqad ka tegi daaqad kale: ku sii dayn daaqadda koowaad si aad ugu xidho halkaas (jaranjarooyinku waa muuqdaan intaad korkiisa taagan tahay) ama si kor u kaco. Ku sii dayn daaqadda panelada kale si aad ugu wareejiso halkaas. Meel kasta oo kale ku sii dayn, wuu ku sii jiraa meeshii uu ka ahaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadda panelada oo aan panel ku harin waxay isku xidhaa iyada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad dib u soo rartid, barnaamijku wuxuu dib kuu soo bandhigaa daaqadaha panelada. Browser-ku daaqad kaliya mar kasta riix, sidaas darteed dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen the next one\u003C/span\u003E mar kasta daaqad kasta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"isku-mid-qaab-kasta-oo-qaabeyn-ah\"\u003EIsku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaybta amarrada, sanduuqa qalabka, safafka qalabka iyo safka xaaladda ayaa daaqad gaar ah u dhaqaaqa si isku mid ah sida panel: fur menu \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E qaybtaas oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/span\u003E (ama xidhida daaqadda) ayaa soo celinaya. Furayaasha aad daaqadaas ku riixdo waxay gaaraan barnaamijka, sida ay ka gaaraan daaqadda panelada. Qayb kasta wuxuu leeyaa hal menu oo sidaas ah.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dhaqaaji-wada-hadal\"\u003EDhaqaaji wada-hadal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWada-hadal kasta waa la dhaqaajin karaa si uu u baxo naqshadda dariiqeeda: riix oo jiid magaca sare. Wada-hadalku wuxuu xasuustaa meesha aad ka tagtay, wada-hadal kasta gaar ahaan, oo markii dambe ee la furo isla meeshaas ayuu ku soo laabanayaa. Laba jeer riix magaca sare si aad dib ugu dhexdhexaadiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKiiboodhka, adigoo wada-hadalka gudihiisa ku jira riix \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+furaha fallaadha si aad u dhaqaajiso 16 pixel mar kasta; ku dar \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad 64 u dhaqaajiso. Wada-hadal dhacaya shaashadda ka baxsan (kadib daaqad ama shaashad yar) ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan kasta, wada-hadalku waa xaashi buuxda oo aan la dhaqaajin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKu dhex jira CadCraft Studio, wada-hadalka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPlot to PDF\u003C/span\u003E ee CadCraft, kaas oo aad furan u hayn kartid intaad shaqaynayso, wuxuu badhan ku leeyahay magaca sare, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen in its own window\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu galaa daaqad gaar ah oo aad shaashad kale ku dhigi karto. Wada-hadalka xidhida daaqadda ayaa xidha, daaqadda xidhidana wada-hadalka ayaa xidha.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dib-u-dhig-panelada\"\u003EDib u dhig panelada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E daaqadda panelada, ama si fudud xidh. Panelada waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXidhida ama dib-u-rartida daaqadda koowaad ayaa sidoo kale xidha daaqadda panelada. Marka barnaamijku mar kale furmo wuxuu sheegayaa in paneladaadu daaqad gaar ah ku jireen; dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen it\u003C/span\u003E si aad daaqadda dib ugu soo celiso, ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep them here\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu panel kasta ku celinayaa meeshii ay ka bilaabeen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHaddii waxba aanu furmin markaad panelada u wareejinayso daaqad cusub, browser-ku wuu xannibay pop-up-ka. Barnaamijku taas ayuu sheegayaa oo panelada meeshii ay ku jireen ayuu ku hayaa. Oggolow pop-up-yada getcadcraft.com, kadibna isku day mar kale.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeyntu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan, oo wayn dejintaada kale.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Panelada ku yaal dhinaca naqshadda way dhaqaaqi karaan. Ku dhig meesha ku habboon, ama u sii daaqad u gaar ah shaashad labaad si naqshaddu u qaadato shaashadda koowaad oo dhan. Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay safka magacyada: xariiq khafiif ah oo leh magaca panelka, menu ⋯, pin iyo badhanka xidhka ee sare ee panelka. Noocyada ka hor 0.7 waxay leeyihiin magaca iyo menu ⋯ oo keliya. Dhaqaaji panel daaqadda gudaheeda Jiid panelka adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa sare. Intaad jiidayso, meelo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo muuqda dhinaca bidix, midig iyo hoosta naqshadda. Ku dhig panelka mid ka mid ah si uu halkaas ugu xirmo. Meeshii aad ku jirtid way madowtaa. Ku dhig meel kasta oo kale naqshadda dushiisa si uu u noqdo mid kor u kaca. Panelada wadaag hal dhinac: way isku rarmaan, xariiq kasta oo u dhexeeya laba panel ayaa la jiidi karaa si ay booska u wadaagaan (marka xariiqda uu xiran yahay, furayaasha fallaadhaha ayaa dhaqaajiya, laba jeer riixista ayaana booska si siman u wadaagta). Jiid geeska gudaha dhinac xidhan si aad uga dhigto mid ballac weyn ama mid yar; laba jeer riix geeska si aad u celiso. Panel kor u kaca wuxuu ku sii jiraa naqshadda dushiisa. Dhaqaaji adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa, cabbirka beddel adigoo jiidayo geeska hoose ee midigta (ama u gudub geeska adigoo isticmaalaya furaha Tab oo furayaasha fallaadhaha isticmaal). Laba jeer riix magiciisa si uu dib ugu xirmo meeshii uu ka ahaa. Ku jiid hal farta adigoo ku qabanaya magaca panelka. Geeska hoose ee midigta ee panelka kor u kaca ku jiid hal farta si aad u beddesho cabbirka, iyo xuduudaha u dhexeeya panelada xidhan si isku mid ah. Si aad u kor u kacdo ama u xidho adigoon jiidin, isticmaal menu ⋯. U kooxee panelada sida tab-yo Laba panel waxay wadaagi karaan hal qaab oo mid mid ayay tusi karaan. Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa oo ku dhig safka magaca panel kale (safka waa jaranjaro intaad korkiisa taagan tahay), kadibna sii dayn: qaabku wuxuu hadda leeyahay tab kasta panel kasta, safka magaciisa. Riix tab si aad panelkaas u muujiso. Markaad tab-ka xulan tahay, ← iyo → ayaa beddela tab-yada, Home iyo End waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. Si aad panel uga saarto kooxda, dooro Move out of the tab group menu ⋯-ka, ama jiid meel kale. Dooro Tab with iyo magaca panel si aad u kooxeyso adigoon jiidin. Pin, qari oo soo celi Pin-ka safka magaca panelka wuxuu ka dhigaa auto-hide: panelka wuu ka baxaa dhinacaas oo wuxuu noqdaa tab yar oo dhinaca ku yaal. Ku tilmaam tab-ka, xulo ama riix, panelka ayaa ku sii dhacaa naqshadda dushiisa; ka fogow (ama riix Esc) wuu dib ugu soo laabanayaa. Mar kale riix pin-ka, ama dooro Unpin, si aad u xidho si joogto ah. Badhanka xidhka, ama Hide this panel menu-ga, ayaa qari panelka oo xidha dhinaciisa. Tab dhinaca ku jira oo jaranjaro ah ayaa soo celinaya: riix, ama xulo oo riix Enter. Ka dhig qaabeynta mid dhow Settings › General › Layout density waxay leedahay laba doorasho. Comfortable waa caadiga. Compact wuxuu kooban gareeyaa dhererka safafka, dhexdhexaadinta panelka, badhanada qalabka iyo qoraalka panelka ee barnaamijkaas si wax badan u dhacaan shaashadda. Waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho waxay haysaa badhamada weyn labadaba, taleefankuna qaabeynta gaarka ah. Reset layout ma beddelo cabbirka sida aad dooratay. Dooro inta safka qalabku isticmaalo Settings › General › Toolbar rows waxay leedahay saddex doorasho. Wrap waa caadiga: koox kasta oo qalab ayaa muuqda, sidii ay u qaadanayso safar badan. 2 rows wuxuu qalabka ku haya laba safka, 1 row hal safka, si naqshaddu u heli dhererka; kooxaha aan mugga u filnayn ayaa dhinac u jeeda gudaha qalabka (isticmaal tuubbada mouse-ka, jiidista labada farood, ama Tab ilaa qalab). Qalab horay u mugga u ah laba safka wuxuu ku sii jiraa sidiisa hoos 2 rows, sababtoo ah shabakad kaliya way dheereyn lahayd. Doorashadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta. Shaashad taabasho iyo taleefanku qaabeynta gaarka ah ayay haystaan. CadCraft waxay leedahay dejintiisa qalabkeeda, hoosta Settings › CadCraft. Isticmaal kiiboodhka Badhanka ⋯ ee panel kasta wuxuu furaa menu: Dock on the left, Dock on the right, Dock at the bottom, Float over the drawing, Pin to the edge, Hide this panel, Tab with panel kale, Move to a new window iyo Put it back. Tab ilaa badhanka, riix Enter, u dhaqaaji furayaasha fallaadhaha, kadibna mar kale riix Enter. Esc ayaa xidha menu-ga. Dib u dhig panelada shaashad labaad Dooro ⋯ panel, kadibna Move all panels to a new window. Waxaad sidoo kale dooran kartaa Move panels to a new window Settings gudahiisa. Daaqad yar ayaa furmaysa oo panelada ku jira. Jiid shaashadda kale ee aad leedahay oo ka dhig mid weyn sidii aad rabto. Sii shaqada: panelada ayaa sida hore u shaqeeya naqshadda, naqshaddana waxay buuxinaysaa daaqadda koowaad. Furayaasha wali way shaqeeyaan intaan daaqadda panelada hore u jirto: furayaasha aad halkaas riixdo, marka aan qoraal sanduuq ah lagu qorin, waxay u gudbaan naqshadda. Su'aalaha iyo wada-hadallada barnaamijku weydiiyo waxay ku furmaan daaqadda koowaad, sidaas darteed halkaas ka eeg marka ay soo muuqdaan. Midabka iyo cabbirka qoraalka panelka way raacaan daaqadda koowaad. Chrome iyo Edge waxay daaqadda ku dhigi karaan shaashadda kale adiga ayagu. Shaashad labaad oo xidhan, dooro Put it on my other screen daaqadda panelada (ama Put the panels on my other screen menu ⋯ panel). Browser-ka mar ayuu weydiiyaa in goobtan la oggolaado inay aragto shaashadahaaga; markaad oggolaatid, daaqadda panelada mar kasta shaashadaas ayay ku furmaysaa. Daaqadda panelada adigu ku jiid shaashadda kale. Xiligii xiga way isla meeshii iyo cabbirkii isla ahaa ku furmaysaa. Hal daaqad oo panelo ka badan Panel kasta wuxuu leeyahay daaqad u gaar ah: ilaa afar daaqadood oo panelo ah, tusaale ahaan mid shaashad kasta. Menu ⋯ ee panel, Move to a new window wuxuu furaa daaqad kale panelkaas, Move to panels window 2 (iyo kuwa kale) wuxuu u wareejiyaa mid furan. Daaqadda labaad waxa lagu magacaabaa \"panels 2\". Jiid panel adigoo ku qabanaya magiciisa daaqad ka tegi daaqad kale: ku sii dayn daaqadda koowaad si aad ugu xidho halkaas (jaranjarooyinku waa muuqdaan intaad korkiisa taagan tahay) ama si kor u kaco. Ku sii dayn daaqadda panelada kale si aad ugu wareejiso halkaas. Meel kasta oo kale ku sii dayn, wuu ku sii jiraa meeshii uu ka ahaa. Daaqadda panelada oo aan panel ku harin waxay isku xidhaa iyada. Markaad dib u soo rartid, barnaamijku wuxuu dib kuu soo bandhigaa daaqadaha panelada. Browser-ku daaqad kaliya mar kasta riix, sidaas darteed dooro Open the next one mar kasta daaqad kasta. Isku mid qaab kasta oo qaabeyn ah Qaybta amarrada, sanduuqa qalabka, safafka qalabka iyo safka xaaladda ayaa daaqad gaar ah u dhaqaaqa si isku mid ah sida panel: fur menu ⋯ qaybtaas oo dooro Move to a new window; Put it back (ama xidhida daaqadda) ayaa soo celinaya. Furayaasha aad daaqadaas ku riixdo waxay gaaraan barnaamijka, sida ay ka gaaraan daaqadda panelada. Qayb kasta wuxuu leeyaa hal menu oo sidaas ah. Dhaqaaji wada-hadal Wada-hadal kasta waa la dhaqaajin karaa si uu u baxo naqshadda dariiqeeda: riix oo jiid magaca sare. Wada-hadalku wuxuu xasuustaa meesha aad ka tagtay, wada-hadal kasta gaar ahaan, oo markii dambe ee la furo isla meeshaas ayuu ku soo laabanayaa. Laba jeer riix magaca sare si aad dib ugu dhexdhexaadiso. Kiiboodhka, adigoo wada-hadalka gudihiisa ku jira riix Alt+Shift+furaha fallaadha si aad u dhaqaajiso 16 pixel mar kasta; ku dar Ctrl si aad 64 u dhaqaajiso. Wada-hadal dhacaya shaashadda ka baxsan (kadib daaqad ama shaashad yar) ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa. Taleefan kasta, wada-hadalku waa xaashi buuxda oo aan la dhaqaajin. Ku dhex jira CadCraft Studio, wada-hadalka Plot to PDF ee CadCraft, kaas oo aad furan u hayn kartid intaad shaqaynayso, wuxuu badhan ku leeyahay magaca sare, Open in its own window. Wada-hadalku wuxuu galaa daaqad gaar ah oo aad shaashad kale ku dhigi karto. Wada-hadalka xidhida daaqadda ayaa xidha, daaqadda xidhidana wada-hadalka ayaa xidha. Dib u dhig panelada Dooro Put the panels back daaqadda panelada, ama si fudud xidh. Panelada waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Xidhida ama dib-u-rartida daaqadda koowaad ayaa sidoo kale xidha daaqadda panelada. Marka barnaamijku mar kale furmo wuxuu sheegayaa in paneladaadu daaqad gaar ah ku jireen; dooro Open it si aad daaqadda dib ugu soo celiso, ama Keep them here. Settings › General › Reset layout wuxuu panel kasta ku celinayaa meeshii ay ka bilaabeen. Haddii waxba aanu furmin markaad panelada u wareejinayso daaqad cusub, browser-ku wuu xannibay pop-up-ka. Barnaamijku taas ayuu sheegayaa oo panelada meeshii ay ku jireen ayuu ku hayaa. Oggolow pop-up-yada getcadcraft.com, kadibna isku day mar kale. Qaabeyntu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan, oo wayn dejintaada kale.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"float-a-group-over-the-drawing","text":"Float a group over the drawing","level":2},{"id":"pin","text":"Pin","level":2},{"id":"close-a-group","text":"Close a group","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Drag a group&#039;s grip onto one: it becomes a palette there, and a second group dropped on the same place joins it as a tab.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"float-a-group-over-the-drawing\"\u003EFloat a group over the drawing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPick \u003Cstrong\u003EFloat on the drawing\u003C/strong\u003E in a group&#039;s grip menu, or drag the grip onto the drawing where no place is outlined. The palette floats there; drag its grip to move it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin\"\u003EPin\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPin\u003C/strong\u003E in a grip menu keeps that bar or palette where it is: it cannot be dragged, closed or hidden, and a pinned ribbon stays unfolded. \u003Cstrong\u003EUnpin\u003C/strong\u003E gives it all back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"close-a-group\"\u003EClose a group\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach ribbon group has a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the right of its name, and every group&#039;s grip menu has \u003Cstrong\u003EClose\u003C/strong\u003E. The group leaves its bar; the bar&#039;s own grip menu lists it as \u003Cstrong\u003EShow … again\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Drag a group's grip onto one: it becomes a palette there, and a second group dropped on the same place joins it as a tab. Float a group over the drawing Pick Float on the drawing in a group's grip menu, or drag the grip onto the drawing where no place is outlined. The palette floats there; drag its grip to move it. Pin Pin in a grip menu keeps that bar or palette where it is: it cannot be dragged, closed or hidden, and a pinned ribbon stays unfolded. Unpin gives it all back. Close a group Each ribbon group has a × at the right of its name, and every group's grip menu has Close. The group leaves its bar; the bar's own grip menu lists it as Show … again. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Ka shaqee qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca","summary":"Beddel barnaamijka ribbon tab-yo ah oo naqshadda dushiisa ku jira, oo leh Properties iyo baadhe mashruuc dhinaca bidix iyo tab kasta muuqaal furan, oo mar kasta ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","ribbon","tab-yada ribbon","baadhaha mashruuca","baadhe","palet-yada","palet properties","tab-yada muuqaalka","safka xaaladda","degdeg fur","xidh ribbon","qaabka caadiga ah","beddel qaabeyn","beddel","dhigan"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal","text":"Waxa meel kasta ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"ka-isticmaal-ribbon-ka-kiiboodhka","text":"Ka isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka","level":2},{"id":"ribbon-ka-qabo-ama-daaqad-u-gaar-ah-sii","text":"Ribbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii","level":2},{"id":"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan","text":"Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan","level":2},{"id":"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah","text":"Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Ribbon tab-yo ah ayaa u dhex maraya sare, Properties iyo baadhaha mashruuca ayaa wadaagaan panelka bidix, muuqaal kasta oo aad furto wuxuu helaa tab naqshadda dushiisa, safka xaaladdana wuxuu ku sugan yahay hoose. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna gali \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal\"\u003EWaxa meel kasta ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka magaca:\u003C/strong\u003E magaca barnaamijka, badhamada degdega ah ee furidda, kaydinta, dib-u-noqoshada iyo dib-u-samaynta, magaca faylka furan, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat each tool does here\u003C/span\u003E (liis dhammaan qalabka oo leh sanduuq raadin, oo sheegaysa kuwa hadda diyaar u ah iyo sababta kuwa kale aan u diyaarin), shaashad buuxda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E. Qaabeyntan, safka magaca wuxuu meesha ka qaadaa safka barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka tab-yada, tab kasta kooxo ku jira. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E bidixda ayaa furaysa, kaydinaysa iyo waxa kale. Barnaamijyada qaarkood tab gaar ah ayay ku daraan markaad ku shaqeyso habka ama meel shaqo gaar ah; wuu iftiimaa intuu khusaysan yahay, kadibna wuu baxaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka xulashada:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta ribbon-ka, waxa qalabka socda uu kaa rabo ama waxa la doortay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPanelka bidix:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E sare, hoosteeda palet-yada (baadhaha mashruuca iyo waxa panelka u gaar ah) sida tab-yo. Jiid xariiqa u dhexeeya si aad booska u wadaagto.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-yada muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E hal tab muuqaal kasta oo aad furtay (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...). Ku xidh badhanka xidhka; faylku wuu furan yahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka muuqaalka iyo safka xaaladda:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta naqshadda, dejinta muuqaalka (cabbir, zoom); hoose, fariimaha barnaamijka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, qalabkeeda sharaxaad ayaa sababta sheegta (tusaale &quot;Marka hore fur fayl&quot;, ama in barnaamijku weli qalabkaas ma laha). Riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ka-isticmaal-ribbon-ka-kiiboodhka\"\u003EKa isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad tab ribbon-ka xulan tahay, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa u dhaqaaqa tab-yada, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ribbon-ka-qabo-ama-daaqad-u-gaar-ah-sii\"\u003ERibbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELaba jeer riix tab ribbon-ka si ribbon-ka u qabsado tab-yadiisa; riix tab wuxuu markaas tusaa qalabkiisa ilaa aad ka guurto. Mar kale laba jeer riix si aad u furan u hayso. Badhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E ee dhinaca midig ee ribbon-ka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E sidoo kale. Barnaamij kasta ayaa xasuusta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E ribbon-ka wuxuu geynayaa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the ribbon back\u003C/span\u003E, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa ribbon-ka: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons only\u003C/span\u003E (ribbon-ka wuxuu markaas muujinayaa laba safood oo calaamado yaryar oo kooxda kasta ku jira) ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabels only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow group names (File, Draw, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan\"\u003EPanelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKu noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eqaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Ribbon tab-yo ah ayaa u dhex maraya sare, Properties iyo baadhaha mashruuca ayaa wadaagaan panelka bidix, muuqaal kasta oo aad furto wuxuu helaa tab naqshadda dushiisa, safka xaaladdana wuxuu ku sugan yahay hoose. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan. Dooro Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,). Dooro tab-ka Global, kadibna gali Layout › Workspace. Dooro Ribbon and project browser. Qaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar. Waxa meel kasta ku yaal Safka magaca: magaca barnaamijka, badhamada degdega ah ee furidda, kaydinta, dib-u-noqoshada iyo dib-u-samaynta, magaca faylka furan, What each tool does here (liis dhammaan qalabka oo leh sanduuq raadin, oo sheegaysa kuwa hadda diyaar u ah iyo sababta kuwa kale aan u diyaarin), shaashad buuxda, Help iyo Settings. Qaabeyntan, safka magaca wuxuu meesha ka qaadaa safka barnaamijka. Ribbon: qalabka barnaamijka tab-yada, tab kasta kooxo ku jira. File bidixda ayaa furaysa, kaydinaysa iyo waxa kale. Barnaamijyada qaarkood tab gaar ah ayay ku daraan markaad ku shaqeyso habka ama meel shaqo gaar ah; wuu iftiimaa intuu khusaysan yahay, kadibna wuu baxaa. Safka xulashada: hoosta ribbon-ka, waxa qalabka socda uu kaa rabo ama waxa la doortay. Panelka bidix: Properties sare, hoosteeda palet-yada (baadhaha mashruuca iyo waxa panelka u gaar ah) sida tab-yo. Jiid xariiqa u dhexeeya si aad booska u wadaagto. Tab-yada muuqaalka: hal tab muuqaal kasta oo aad furtay (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...). Ku xidh badhanka xidhka; faylku wuu furan yahay. Safka muuqaalka iyo safka xaaladda: hoosta naqshadda, dejinta muuqaalka (cabbir, zoom); hoose, fariimaha barnaamijka. Qalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, qalabkeeda sharaxaad ayaa sababta sheegta (tusaale \"Marka hore fur fayl\", ama in barnaamijku weli qalabkaas ma laha). Riix ama Enter si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq. Ka isticmaal ribbon-ka kiiboodhka Markaad tab ribbon-ka xulan tahay, ← iyo → ayaa u dhaqaaqa tab-yada, Home iyo End waxay tagaan kii ugu horreeyay iyo kii ugu dambeeyay. Esc marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo Ctrl+Shift+F (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan. Ribbon-ka qabo ama daaqad u gaar ah sii Laba jeer riix tab ribbon-ka si ribbon-ka u qabsado tab-yadiisa; riix tab wuxuu markaas tusaa qalabkiisa ilaa aad ka guurto. Mar kale laba jeer riix si aad u furan u hayso. Badhanka Move the ribbon ee dhinaca midig ee ribbon-ka wuxuu leeyahay Collapse the ribbon iyo Keep the ribbon open sidoo kale. Barnaamij kasta ayaa xasuusta. Move the ribbon › Move to a new window ribbon-ka wuxuu geynayaa daaqad gaar ah, tusaale ahaan shaashad labaad. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. Put the ribbon back, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya. Dejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa ribbon-ka: Settings › Global › Toolbar › Icons and labels, Icons only (ribbon-ka wuxuu markaas muujinayaa laba safood oo calaamado yaryar oo kooxda kasta ku jira) ama Labels only, iyo Show group names (File, Draw, …). Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan Panelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay Habee panelada: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, Move to a new window iyo Reset layout. Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah Fur Settings › Global › Layout › Workspace oo dooro CadCraft classic. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Taleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa. Si aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka. Si aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"interface-styles","scope":"basics","title":"Pick an interface style","summary":"Choose how the toolbar, panels and tabs are arranged, see what a style leaves out in your app, keep one style for every app or one for a single app, and export or import a style file.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["interface style","style","layout","workspace","ribbon","toolbox","drafting","multi-view","sketch","vector","duncan","classic","per app","import","export","ccworkspace","arrange","my tools","settings"],"headings":[{"id":"pick-a-style","text":"Pick a style","level":2},{"id":"see-what-a-style-leaves-out","text":"See what a style leaves out","level":2},{"id":"one-style-for-every-app-or-one-for-this-app","text":"One style for every app, or one for this app","level":2},{"id":"arrange-your-own","text":"Arrange your own","level":2},{"id":"export-and-import-a-style","text":"Export and import a style","level":2},{"id":"if-a-style-does-not-work","text":"If a style does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAn interface style is one arrangement of the toolbar, the panels, the tabs and the command line. Pick the one you are used to and the app opens in it. Your tools, menus and keys do not change; only where they sit does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pick-a-style\"\u003EPick a style\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and choose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface style\u003C/span\u003E choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPick a style\u003C/span\u003E. The list shows each style with a line that says how it is arranged.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose one. The window changes at once. The first choice, the app&#039;s classic style, is the arrangement the app started with.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe styles are \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMulti-view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVector\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuncan\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAutoRev\u003C/span\u003E and the four \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad1 Ribbon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad2 Workbench\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad3 Review\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPRO-cad4 Studio\u003C/span\u003E styles. Styles that come from an add-on or from a file you imported are listed under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. Which of these you see depends on the app and on the build: a style the app cannot use is not offered.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis page describes the picker as it stands in the lab build. Some of the styles are still being finished; a style that looks incomplete in your build is one of those.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-what-a-style-leaves-out\"\u003ESee what a style leaves out\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn app is not the same as every other app. A style may ask for a ribbon, a tool column, view tabs, several views side by side or a 3D view cube, and your app may have none of those. Under the picker \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E says what the chosen style leaves out in this app, for example: &quot;In this app this style leaves out: the ribbon (this app has none).&quot; It also counts tools and commands the style names that the app does not have. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMulti-view\u003C/span\u003E splits the drawing area into Top, Front, Right and Perspective views, which needs an app with a 3D model; in an app with one view at a time it keeps that one view.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"one-style-for-every-app-or-one-for-this-app\"\u003EOne style for every app, or one for this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe style you pick is used in every app that has it; an app that does not have it keeps its own layout. To give just this app a different style, tick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse a different interface style for\u003C/span\u003E this app. Unticked, the app follows your choice for all apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn the lab (the version for testing) the choice under the picker reads \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E is the start: the style you pick is kept for the app you are in, and the other apps keep theirs. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E to make this app follow the style you pick for every app; choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis app\u003C/span\u003E again and the style in use becomes this app&#039;s own. Each app opens in its own style straight away, before the page draws.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-your-own\"\u003EArrange your own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own interface style…\u003C/span\u003E opens a list of choices for where each part goes: the commands as a ribbon or the app&#039;s toolbar, what is on the left and the right, the tabs, a status bar, an info box or quick bar, the edit palette by the pointer and the look of tabs and button outlines. Only parts the app has are offered. The result is saved as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy layout\u003C/span\u003E (or the name you type), works in every app that has layouts, and its panels still dock, float and move to their own window (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a style that has the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E slots, right-click a tool and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to My tools\u003C/span\u003E, or drag it to an empty slot. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEmpty this slot\u003C/span\u003E clears one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"export-and-import-a-style\"\u003EExport and import a style\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this interface style\u003C/span\u003E saves the style as a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccworkspace.json\u003C/code\u003E file. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport an interface style…\u003C/span\u003E reads one, or drop the file on the box. The file holds layout data only and is read as untrusted: it can arrange the app&#039;s own blocks and cannot run anything. A file that is larger than 64 kB, made for a newer version, or has no name or blocks is refused, and the message says why. Up to eight imported styles are kept; remove one before adding a ninth. An imported style appears under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E; pick it there.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-style-does-not-work\"\u003EIf a style does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf a style cannot be used in this app, the app shows its classic layout and says so.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFinish or cancel the running command first: a style cannot change while a tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo go back at any time, choose the classic style again in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"An interface style is one arrangement of the toolbar, the panels, the tabs and the command line. Pick the one you are used to and the app opens in it. Your tools, menus and keys do not change; only where they sit does. Pick a style Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,) and choose the Global tab. Under Interface style choose Pick a style. The list shows each style with a line that says how it is arranged. Choose one. The window changes at once. The first choice, the app's classic style, is the arrangement the app started with. The styles are Drafting, Multi-view, Sketch, Vector, Duncan, Ribbon and project browser, Toolbox and info box, AutoRev and the four PRO-cad1 Ribbon, PRO-cad2 Workbench, PRO-cad3 Review and PRO-cad4 Studio styles. Styles that come from an add-on or from a file you imported are listed under From add-ons and files. Which of these you see depends on the app and on the build: a style the app cannot use is not offered. This page describes the picker as it stands in the lab build. Some of the styles are still being finished; a style that looks incomplete in your build is one of those. See what a style leaves out An app is not the same as every other app. A style may ask for a ribbon, a tool column, view tabs, several views side by side or a 3D view cube, and your app may have none of those. Under the picker Settings says what the chosen style leaves out in this app, for example: \"In this app this style leaves out: the ribbon (this app has none).\" It also counts tools and commands the style names that the app does not have. Multi-view splits the drawing area into Top, Front, Right and Perspective views, which needs an app with a 3D model; in an app with one view at a time it keeps that one view. One style for every app, or one for this app The style you pick is used in every app that has it; an app that does not have it keeps its own layout. To give just this app a different style, tick Use a different interface style for this app. Unticked, the app follows your choice for all apps. In the lab (the version for testing) the choice under the picker reads This app or Every app, and This app is the start: the style you pick is kept for the app you are in, and the other apps keep theirs. Choose Every app to make this app follow the style you pick for every app; choose This app again and the style in use becomes this app's own. Each app opens in its own style straight away, before the page draws. Arrange your own Arrange your own interface style… opens a list of choices for where each part goes: the commands as a ribbon or the app's toolbar, what is on the left and the right, the tabs, a status bar, an info box or quick bar, the edit palette by the pointer and the look of tabs and button outlines. Only parts the app has are offered. The result is saved as My layout (or the name you type), works in every app that has layouts, and its panels still dock, float and move to their own window (Arrange the panels). In a style that has the My tools slots, right-click a tool and choose Add to My tools, or drag it to an empty slot. Empty this slot clears one. Export and import a style Export this interface style saves the style as a .ccworkspace.json file. Import an interface style… reads one, or drop the file on the box. The file holds layout data only and is read as untrusted: it can arrange the app's own blocks and cannot run anything. A file that is larger than 64 kB, made for a newer version, or has no name or blocks is refused, and the message says why. Up to eight imported styles are kept; remove one before adding a ninth. An imported style appears under From add-ons and files; pick it there. If a style does not work If a style cannot be used in this app, the app shows its classic layout and says so. Finish or cancel the running command first: a style cannot change while a tool is running. To go back at any time, choose the classic style again in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Ka shaqee qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka","summary":"Beddel barnaamijka tiir qalab ah oo dhinaca bidix ku jira, oo leh meel aad ku kaydiso qalabkaaga, sanduuq macluumaad oo naqshadda sare ku socda oo raacaya qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, socodsiiye dhinaca midig, tab muuqaal kasta, degdeg dooro iyo palet wax-beddel, oo mar kasta ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","sanduuqa qalabka","tiirka qalabka","sanduuqa macluumaadka","macluumaad","socodsiiye","khariidadda mashruuca","safka degdega ah","degdeg dooro","palet wax-beddel","palet pet","my tools","qalabkayga","tab-yada muuqaalka","daaqadda sanduuqa qalabka","qaabeynta caadiga ah","beddel qaabeyn"],"headings":[{"id":"dooro","text":"Dooro","level":2},{"id":"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal","text":"Waxa meel kasta ku yaal","level":2},{"id":"sanduuqa-qalabka-u-gaar-daaqad-sii","text":"Sanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii","level":2},{"id":"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan","text":"Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan","level":2},{"id":"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah","text":"Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka\u003C/strong\u003E waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Qalabka naqshaddu waxay taagan yihiin tiir dhinaca bidix, sanduuq macluumaad oo u dhex maraya sare ayaa muujinaya waxa qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, muuqaal kasta wuxuu leeyahay tab, safka degdega ah ayaa hoosta naqshadda ku yaal oo wuxuu haya doorashooyin maalin walba loo isticmaalo. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dooro\"\u003EDooro\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro tab-ka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna gali \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-meel-kasta-ku-yaal\"\u003EWaxa meel kasta ku yaal\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQalabka:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka oo sare ku sugan naqshadda, menu-yadiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa macluumaadka:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta qalabka. Intii qalabku socdo wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka iyo waxa uu kaa rabo. Markaad wax dooratid wuxuu muujiyaa dejintooda ugu muhiimsan (darbi ahaan: noociisa, cabbirka, dherer, khadka meesha iyo joogga), oo halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa: beddelka halkaas waa isku mid sida Properties, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayaa ka soo celinaya. Wax la dooran waayo wuxuu leeyahay &quot;Nothing selected&quot;. Barnaamij kasta wuxuu halkaan ku darayaa sanduuqyadiisa, sida layer-ka ama heerka hadda, ama dukumeentiga furan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanduuqa qalabka:\u003C/strong\u003E tiirka bidix, qalabka barnaamijka kooxo ku jira. Riix magaca kooxda si aad u qabsato ama dib u furto. Qalabka socda wuu iftiimaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMy tools:\u003C/strong\u003E kooxda ugu horeysa ee sanduuqa qalabka, siddeed godad madhan oo qalabka aad ugu badan isticmaashid. Riix godka madhan si aad u doorato qalab ama amar kasta oo barnaamijka ah; ama midig-riix qalab sanduuqa qalabka kuna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to My tools\u003C/span\u003E; ama jiid qalab godka. Midig-riix godka si aad u beddesho ama u faaruq. Godyadaadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESocodsiiyaha:\u003C/strong\u003E panelka midig. Baadhaha mashruuca barnaamijka ayaa sare (xaashiyada, qorshayaasha, muuqaalka dhinacyada, muuqaalka 3D, jadwalada, xaashiyada, sida barnaamijku leeyahay): riix mid si aad u furto. Hoosteeda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E iyo tab leh waxyaabaha kale ee panelka midig.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETab-yada muuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E tab muuqaal kasta oo faylka furan (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...), naqshadda dushiisa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESafka degdega ah:\u003C/strong\u003E hoosta naqshadda, doorashooyinka muuqaalka iyo kuwa maalin walba loo isticmaalo ee barnaamijka, sida miisaanka, heerka faahfaahinta, kala duwanaanshaha muuqaalka, fit, plan, split ama 3D, snaps iyo unit-yada.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPalet-ka wax-beddelka:\u003C/strong\u003E riix wax naqshadda ku jira, palet yar ayaa imanaya oo ku dhow mu&#039;aashaaraha, leh amarrada wax-beddelka barnaamijka sida dhaqaajinta, koobiyeynta, jeedinta, muraayadda, koobiyada, iyo tirtirka, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, tuubbada mouse-ka, riix kale ama badhanka xidhka ayaa dhigaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, sharaxaaddiisa ayaa sababta sheegta. Riix ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanduuqa-qalabka-u-gaar-daaqad-sii\"\u003ESanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBadhanka \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove the toolbox\u003C/span\u003E ee sare ee sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu leeyahay \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E: sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu furmaa daaqad yar oo gaar ah oo aad dhinaca barnaamijka ama shaashad labaad ku dhigi karto. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the toolbox back\u003C/span\u003E, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa sanduuqa qalabka sidoo kale: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons and labels\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons only\u003C/span\u003E ama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabels only\u003C/span\u003E, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow group names (File, Draw, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panelada-aad-leedahay-way-sii-haysaan\"\u003EPanelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove to a new window\u003C/span\u003E iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ku-noqo-qaabeynta-caadiga-ah\"\u003EKu noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWorkspace\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft classic\u003C/span\u003E. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eqaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sanduuqa qalabka iyo sanduuqa macluumaadka waa mid ka mid ah saddexda qaabeyn ee meel shaqo ee barnaamijka. Qalabka naqshaddu waxay taagan yihiin tiir dhinaca bidix, sanduuq macluumaad oo u dhex maraya sare ayaa muujinaya waxa qalabka socda ama waxa aad dooratay, muuqaal kasta wuxuu leeyahay tab, safka degdega ah ayaa hoosta naqshadda ku yaal oo wuxuu haya doorashooyin maalin walba loo isticmaalo. Qalabka waa kuwa barnaamijka laftiisa: wax kasta oo aad ku samayn karto qaabeynta caadiga ah halkaan ayay ku shaqeeyaan, naqshaddaadu, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha aad ayay sidaas ku sii jiraan. Dooro Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,). Dooro tab-ka Global, kadibna gali Layout › Workspace. Dooro Toolbox and info box. Qaabeynta waa isla markiiba beddelmaysa. Doorashadu waa mid barnaamij kasta browser-kan: barnaamij kasta wuxuu ka furmaa marka xiga, waxayna ku jirtaa ka hor inta bogga aan la sawirin, sidaas darteed qaabeynta caadiga ah ma aragto mar. Waxa meel kasta ku yaal Qalabka: qalabka barnaamijka oo sare ku sugan naqshadda, menu-yadiisa. Sanduuqa macluumaadka: hoosta qalabka. Intii qalabku socdo wuxuu muujiyaa qalabka iyo waxa uu kaa rabo. Markaad wax dooratid wuxuu muujiyaa dejintooda ugu muhiimsan (darbi ahaan: noociisa, cabbirka, dherer, khadka meesha iyo joogga), oo halkaas ayaad ka beddeli kartaa: beddelka halkaas waa isku mid sida Properties, Ctrl+Z ayaa ka soo celinaya. Wax la dooran waayo wuxuu leeyahay \"Nothing selected\". Barnaamij kasta wuxuu halkaan ku darayaa sanduuqyadiisa, sida layer-ka ama heerka hadda, ama dukumeentiga furan. Sanduuqa qalabka: tiirka bidix, qalabka barnaamijka kooxo ku jira. Riix magaca kooxda si aad u qabsato ama dib u furto. Qalabka socda wuu iftiimaa. My tools: kooxda ugu horeysa ee sanduuqa qalabka, siddeed godad madhan oo qalabka aad ugu badan isticmaashid. Riix godka madhan si aad u doorato qalab ama amar kasta oo barnaamijka ah; ama midig-riix qalab sanduuqa qalabka kuna dooro Add to My tools; ama jiid qalab godka. Midig-riix godka si aad u beddesho ama u faaruq. Godyadaadu waa la kaydiyaa barnaamij kasta browser-kan. Socodsiiyaha: panelka midig. Baadhaha mashruuca barnaamijka ayaa sare (xaashiyada, qorshayaasha, muuqaalka dhinacyada, muuqaalka 3D, jadwalada, xaashiyada, sida barnaamijku leeyahay): riix mid si aad u furto. Hoosteeda, Properties iyo tab leh waxyaabaha kale ee panelka midig. Tab-yada muuqaalka: tab muuqaal kasta oo faylka furan (xaashi, qorshe, muuqaal saddex-geesood...), naqshadda dushiisa. Safka degdega ah: hoosta naqshadda, doorashooyinka muuqaalka iyo kuwa maalin walba loo isticmaalo ee barnaamijka, sida miisaanka, heerka faahfaahinta, kala duwanaanshaha muuqaalka, fit, plan, split ama 3D, snaps iyo unit-yada. Palet-ka wax-beddelka: riix wax naqshadda ku jira, palet yar ayaa imanaya oo ku dhow mu'aashaaraha, leh amarrada wax-beddelka barnaamijka sida dhaqaajinta, koobiyeynta, jeedinta, muraayadda, koobiyada, iyo tirtirka, iyo Properties. Esc, tuubbada mouse-ka, riix kale ama badhanka xidhka ayaa dhigaya. Qalab aan hadda shaqayn karin ayaa lagu madoobeeyaa, sharaxaaddiisa ayaa sababta sheegta. Riix ama Enter si aad sababta uga akhrido sanduuq. Esc marka hore wuxuu joojiyaa qalabka socda, sida qaabeynta caadiga ah, dhammaan gaabinta iyo Ctrl+Shift+F (hababka shaashadda) sidii hore ayay u shaqeeyaan. Sanduuqa qalabka u gaar daaqad sii Badhanka Move the toolbox ee sare ee sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu leeyahay Move to a new window: sanduuqa qalabka wuxuu furmaa daaqad yar oo gaar ah oo aad dhinaca barnaamijka ama shaashad labaad ku dhigi karto. Furayaasha lagu riixo halkaas waxay gaaraan barnaamijka. Put the toolbox back, ama xidhida daaqadda, ayaa soo celinaya. Dejinta qalabka waxay ku dhacaysaa sanduuqa qalabka sidoo kale: Settings › Global › Toolbar › Icons and labels, Icons only ama Labels only, iyo Show group names (File, Draw, …). Panelada aad leedahay way sii haysaan Panelada bidix iyo midig waxay haystaan wax kasta oo lagu sharaxay Habee panelada: xirid, dhaqaaq, pin, qari, tab-yo, Move to a new window iyo Reset layout. Ku noqo qaabeynta caadiga ah Fur Settings › Global › Layout › Workspace oo dooro CadCraft classic. Safaf kasta, tab kasta iyo panel kasta waxay ku noqonayaan meeshii ay ka ahaayeen. Taleefan ama daaqad 760 pixel ama ka yar ballaadhka ah, barnaamijku wuxuu isticmaalaa qaabeynta taleefanka ima doorateen. Daaqad ballaaran ayaa qaabeyntaada soo celinaysa. Si aad qaabeyn kale isku daydo, eeg qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca. Si aad u beddesho waxa qaabeyntani muujinayso, eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda; habka madow, menu-bar iyo ribbon, eeg qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Habee qaabeyntaada oo kaydi habayntaada","summary":"Dooro panelka ku muujinaya baadhaha mashruuca, Properties ama waxa panelka u gaar ah, meesha sanduuqa qalabka ku jiro iyo waxa safafka ku jiro, kaydi sida qaabeyntaada, oo kaydi habayn oo dhan magac hoose oo aad ku beddesho.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["qaabeyn","meel shaqo","habee","u habee","qaabeyntayda","qaabeyntayda gaarka ah","panelada","tafatirayaasha","baadhaha mashruuca","properties","sanduuqa qalabka","safka degdega","sanduuqa macluumaadka","deegaanka shaqada","habayn","profile","kaydi habayn","beddel habayn","dhoofi habayn","soo deji habayn","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"habee-qaabeyntaada","text":"Habee qaabeyntaada","level":2},{"id":"kaydi-dejintaada-sida-deegaan-shaqo","text":"Kaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMarka laga reebo qaabeynta dhisan ee saddexda ah, waxaad habaysan kartaa midkaaga, habaynta oo dhanna waad kaydin kartaa magac hoose si aad hal tallaabo ugu noqoto.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habee-qaabeyntaada\"\u003EHabee qaabeyntaada\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (gear-ka, ama \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, kadibna \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. Wada-hadalku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaabeynta aad hadda isticmaasho.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKu sii magac, kadibna dooro:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dushiisa:\u003C/strong\u003E qalabka barnaamijka, ribbon ama midna; safka magaca; sanduuq macluumaad iyo gacan-ka-hayaasha uu hayo.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENaqshadda dhinaceeda:\u003C/strong\u003E sanduuqa qalabka dhinaca bidix, midig ama midna, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E oo la socda ama aan la socon; panelka hayaa palet-yada, kan kor ku jira (baadhaha mashruuca ama Properties, tusaale ahaan), iyo kuwa ka mid ah tab-yada hoosteeda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMeel naqshaddu:\u003C/strong\u003E tab-yada muuqaalka, safka degdega ah iyo safka muuqaalka oo leh gacan-ka-hayaasha aad calaamadiso, palet-ka wax-beddelka, safka xaaladda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMuuqaalka:\u003C/strong\u003E cabbirka, geesaha badhanada iyo qaabka tab-ka.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this layout\u003C/span\u003E. Barnaamijku waa u beddelaa isla markiiba, barnaamij kasta oo leh qaabeyn ayaa sidoo kale isticmaalaya.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxa barnaamijkan haysta oo keliya ayaa la soo bandhigaa. Qaabeyntaada waxay ku jirtaa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa sida fayl aad saaxiibkaaga siin karto, badhanka ka saarista ayaa ka saaraa. Panelada ay buuxinayso wali way ku xirmaan, ku sabaan, u dhaqaaqaan daaqadahooda, sida ku qoran \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EHabee panelada\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-dejintaada-sida-deegaan-shaqo\"\u003EKaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDeegaanka shaqada waa dejintaada oo dhan barnaamij kasta browser-kan: qaabeynta, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha, qaabka safka qalabka, panelada iyo cabbirkooda, iyo \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy tools\u003C/span\u003E. Muuqaalka iyo luuqadu ma qaybo ka mid ahan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKaydi:\u003C/strong\u003E qor magac hoosta \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWork environments\u003C/span\u003E oo dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave my setup\u003C/span\u003E. Kaydinta magac jira ayaa beddelaysa dejintaas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBeddel:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dejinta liiska, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESwitch to it\u003C/span\u003E. Barnaamijku wuu dib u furmaa dejintaas; haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysid, barnaamijku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa, sida uu ku sameeyo dib-u-furasho kasta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWadaag:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu kaydiyaa dejinta la doortay sida fayl \u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport a setup…\u003C/span\u003E wuxuu mid ka soo ceyn karaa fayl. Faylku wuxuu kaliya dejimaha kuwan dejin karaa, wax kale midna.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKa saar:\u003C/strong\u003E dooro dejin, kadibna dooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaxaad haysan kartaa ilaa laba iyo toban dejin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESi aad qaabeyn u beddesho adigoon wada-hadalka furin (jiid block, midig-riix qalab), eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EBeddel qaabeynta shaashadda\u003C/a\u003E. Si aad marka hore u tijaabiso qaabeynada dhisan, eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Eqaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Eqaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca\u003C/a\u003E iyo \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003Eqaabeynta Drafting\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Marka laga reebo qaabeynta dhisan ee saddexda ah, waxaad habaysan kartaa midkaaga, habaynta oo dhanna waad kaydin kartaa magac hoose si aad hal tallaabo ugu noqoto. Habee qaabeyntaada Fur Settings (gear-ka, ama Ctrl+,), dooro Global, kadibna Layout. Dooro Arrange your own layout…. Wada-hadalku wuxuu ka bilaabmaa qaabeynta aad hadda isticmaasho. Ku sii magac, kadibna dooro: Naqshadda dushiisa: qalabka barnaamijka, ribbon ama midna; safka magaca; sanduuq macluumaad iyo gacan-ka-hayaasha uu hayo. Naqshadda dhinaceeda: sanduuqa qalabka dhinaca bidix, midig ama midna, iyo My tools oo la socda ama aan la socon; panelka hayaa palet-yada, kan kor ku jira (baadhaha mashruuca ama Properties, tusaale ahaan), iyo kuwa ka mid ah tab-yada hoosteeda. Meel naqshaddu: tab-yada muuqaalka, safka degdega ah iyo safka muuqaalka oo leh gacan-ka-hayaasha aad calaamadiso, palet-ka wax-beddelka, safka xaaladda. Muuqaalka: cabbirka, geesaha badhanada iyo qaabka tab-ka. Dooro Use this layout. Barnaamijku waa u beddelaa isla markiiba, barnaamij kasta oo leh qaabeyn ayaa sidoo kale isticmaalaya. Waxa barnaamijkan haysta oo keliya ayaa la soo bandhigaa. Qaabeyntaada waxay ku jirtaa From add-ons and files; Export this layout wuxuu kaydiyaa sida fayl aad saaxiibkaaga siin karto, badhanka ka saarista ayaa ka saaraa. Panelada ay buuxinayso wali way ku xirmaan, ku sabaan, u dhaqaaqaan daaqadahooda, sida ku qoran Habee panelada. Kaydi dejintaada sida deegaan shaqo Deegaanka shaqada waa dejintaada oo dhan barnaamij kasta browser-kan: qaabeynta, habka menu-ga iyo furayaasha, qaabka safka qalabka, panelada iyo cabbirkooda, iyo My tools. Muuqaalka iyo luuqadu ma qaybo ka mid ahan. Kaydi: qor magac hoosta Work environments oo dooro Save my setup. Kaydinta magac jira ayaa beddelaysa dejintaas. Beddel: dooro dejinta liiska, kadibna dooro Switch to it. Barnaamijku wuu dib u furmaa dejintaas; haddii aad shaqo aan la kaydin haysid, barnaamijku marka hore wuu weydiiyaa, sida uu ku sameeyo dib-u-furasho kasta. Wadaag: Export wuxuu kaydiyaa dejinta la doortay sida fayl .ccenv.json; Import a setup… wuxuu mid ka soo ceyn karaa fayl. Faylku wuxuu kaliya dejimaha kuwan dejin karaa, wax kale midna. Ka saar: dooro dejin, kadibna dooro Remove. Waxaad haysan kartaa ilaa laba iyo toban dejin. Si aad qaabeyn u beddesho adigoon wada-hadalka furin (jiid block, midig-riix qalab), eeg Beddel qaabeynta shaashadda. Si aad marka hore u tijaabiso qaabeynada dhisan, eeg qaabeynta sanduuqa qalabka iyo macluumaadka, qaabeynta ribbon iyo baadhaha mashruuca iyo qaabeynta Drafting.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox","window","palette stack","large tools","small tools","more tools"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"a-block-in-a-window-of-its-own","text":"A block in a window of its own","level":2},{"id":"palettes-in-two-stacks","text":"Palettes in two stacks","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow the first … tools\u003C/span\u003E keeps that many tools of the group in view; the rest wait under the group&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E▾\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow all its tools\u003C/span\u003E undoes it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the ribbon, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELarge tools\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmall tools\u003C/span\u003E draw every tool of the group one size; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESizes as the app draws them\u003C/span\u003E goes back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-block-in-a-window-of-its-own\"\u003EA block in a window of its own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn Arrange mode the map of places also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn a window\u003C/span\u003E for the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox and the status bar. The block stays in its place until you click \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen in windows\u003C/span\u003E in the note at the bottom: a browser opens a window only when you click. A layout file can ask for the same with the place \u003Ccode\u003Ewindow\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"palettes-in-two-stacks\"\u003EPalettes in two stacks\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe panel&#039;s palettes can stand in two stacks, one over the other, each with its own tabs. Drag a palette by its tab (or use the grip at the left of its stack&#039;s tabs) to the other stack, to a stack of its own, or to the other panel. Each move is one step of \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E. The panel&#039;s own content always stays in its panel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Show the first … tools keeps that many tools of the group in view; the rest wait under the group's ▾. Show all its tools undoes it. In the ribbon, Large tools and Small tools draw every tool of the group one size; Sizes as the app draws them goes back. A block in a window of its own In Arrange mode the map of places also has In a window for the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox and the status bar. The block stays in its place until you click Open in windows in the note at the bottom: a browser opens a window only when you click. A layout file can ask for the same with the place window. Palettes in two stacks The panel's palettes can stand in two stacks, one over the other, each with its own tabs. Drag a palette by its tab (or use the grip at the left of its stack's tabs) to the other stack, to a stack of its own, or to the other panel. Each move is one step of Undo. The panel's own content always stays in its panel. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Shaqada khadka ka baxsan","summary":"Kaydi app si aad ugu shaqeyso khadka ka baxsan, waxa ku shaqeeya xidhiidh la'aan, iyo waxa u baahan xidhiidh.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["offline","internet la'aan","diyaarad","booqasho goob","cache","service worker","rakib","soo deji","xidhiidh"],"headings":[{"id":"kaydi-app-si-loo-isticmaalo-khadka-ka-baxsan","text":"Kaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-khadka-ka-baxsan-ku-shaqeeya","text":"Waxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya","level":2},{"id":"waxa-xidhiidh-u-baahan","text":"Waxa xidhiidh u baahan","level":2},{"id":"waxa-aad-ogaataa","text":"Waxa aad ogaataa","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EApps-yadu shaqadooda kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sameeyaan, sidaas darteed inta badan way shaqeysaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan. Browserku wuxuu kaliya u baahan yahay in fayllada app-ka marka hore la kaydiyo.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydi-app-si-loo-isticmaalo-khadka-ka-baxsan\"\u003EKaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFur app-ka intaad online tahay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDooro \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E barka sare.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESug &quot;Offline ready&quot;. Fayllada app-ka, akhrinta faylashiisa iyo caawintan hadda waxa lagu kaydiyay browserkaaga. Apps-yada akhrinta faylasha DWG ama PDF akhrinta ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya, sidaas darteed markii ugu horreysay daqiiqad ayaa qaadan kartaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETan mar keliya ayaa lagu sameeyaa app kasta, browser kasta oo aad isticmaashid. Si aad dib ugu noqoto app-ka markii dambe xidhiidh la&#039;aan, fur isla cinwaankii hore ee aad isticmaali jirtay, ama bookmark-kiisa.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHadda offline baad tahay. Haddii app-kan loo kaydiyay isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan, wax kasta oo hoos ku qoran way shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanu kaydin, weli waxaad isticmaali kartaa waxa horeyba tab-kan ugu soo rogmay, laakiin ha dib u cusboonaysiin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-khadka-ka-baxsan-ku-shaqeeya\"\u003EWaxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFuridda faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ka soo jeeda, naqshadeynta, tafatirka, cabbirka iyo hubinta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta iyo dhoofinta: kaydin kasta waa soo dejin kombiyuutarkaaga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECaawintan, oo ay ku jiraan baadhistooda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-xidhiidh-u-baahan\"\u003EWaxa xidhiidh u baahan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkii ugu horreysay app-ka oo la furo, iyo markii la kaydinayo isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHelidda nooca cusub ee app-ka. Markaad online tahay, app-ku wuxuu soo qaadaa nooca ugu cusub markii xigta la furo, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKaydi khadka ka baxsan\u003C/span\u003E nuqulkii la kaydiyay wuu cusboonaysiiyaa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXiriirrada websaydhka, sida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKu fur website-ka\u003C/span\u003E iyo xiriirrada bogagga kale.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarrada, oo weli diyaar aan ahayn.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-aad-ogaataa\"\u003EWaxa aad ogaataa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu u gaar yahay hal browser oo hal kombiyuutar. Haddii aad tirtirto xogta websaydhka browserkaaga, way baabi&#039;ax.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDaaqadaha gaarka ah ee browser-ka qaarkood, iyo kombiyuutarada shaqada ee xidhan qaarkood, kaydinta offline ma oggolaan. Badhanku wuu kuu sheegaa marka aanu kaydin karin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari waxay tirtirtaa xogta websaydhka la kaydiyay ee websaydhyada aadan booqan dhowr toddobaad. Mararka qaar app-ka fur intaad online tahay, ama mar kale kaydi ka hor safar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka ah oo leh sideed apps oo hal rakibid ku jira, waxa uu ku yaal getcadcraft.com/download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Apps-yadu shaqadooda kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sameeyaan, sidaas darteed inta badan way shaqeysaa xidhiidh la'aan. Browserku wuxuu kaliya u baahan yahay in fayllada app-ka marka hore la kaydiyo. Kaydi app si loo isticmaalo khadka ka baxsan Fur app-ka intaad online tahay. Dooro Kaydi khadka ka baxsan barka sare. Sug \"Offline ready\". Fayllada app-ka, akhrinta faylashiisa iyo caawintan hadda waxa lagu kaydiyay browserkaaga. Apps-yada akhrinta faylasha DWG ama PDF akhrinta ayaa sidoo kale kaydiya, sidaas darteed markii ugu horreysay daqiiqad ayaa qaadan kartaa. Tan mar keliya ayaa lagu sameeyaa app kasta, browser kasta oo aad isticmaashid. Si aad dib ugu noqoto app-ka markii dambe xidhiidh la'aan, fur isla cinwaankii hore ee aad isticmaali jirtay, ama bookmark-kiisa. Hadda offline baad tahay. Haddii app-kan loo kaydiyay isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan, wax kasta oo hoos ku qoran way shaqeeyaan. Haddii aanu kaydin, weli waxaad isticmaali kartaa waxa horeyba tab-kan ugu soo rogmay, laakiin ha dib u cusboonaysiin ilaa aad mar kale online tahay. Waxa khadka ka baxsan ku shaqeeya Furidda faylal kombiyuutarkaaga ka soo jeeda, naqshadeynta, tafatirka, cabbirka iyo hubinta. Kaydinta iyo dhoofinta: kaydin kasta waa soo dejin kombiyuutarkaaga. Caawintan, oo ay ku jiraan baadhistooda. Waxa xidhiidh u baahan Markii ugu horreysay app-ka oo la furo, iyo markii la kaydinayo isticmaalka khadka ka baxsan. Helidda nooca cusub ee app-ka. Markaad online tahay, app-ku wuxuu soo qaadaa nooca ugu cusub markii xigta la furo, Kaydi khadka ka baxsan nuqulkii la kaydiyay wuu cusboonaysiiyaa. Xiriirrada websaydhka, sida Ku fur website-ka iyo xiriirrada bogagga kale. Kaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarrada, oo weli diyaar aan ahayn. Waxa aad ogaataa Nuqulka la kaydiyay wuxuu u gaar yahay hal browser oo hal kombiyuutar. Haddii aad tirtirto xogta websaydhka browserkaaga, way baabi'ax. Daaqadaha gaarka ah ee browser-ka qaarkood, iyo kombiyuutarada shaqada ee xidhan qaarkood, kaydinta offline ma oggolaan. Badhanku wuu kuu sheegaa marka aanu kaydin karin. Safari waxay tirtirtaa xogta websaydhka la kaydiyay ee websaydhyada aadan booqan dhowr toddobaad. Mararka qaar app-ka fur intaad online tahay, ama mar kale kaydi ka hor safar. CadCraft Studio, app-ka desktop-ka ah oo leh sideed apps oo hal rakibid ku jira, waxa uu ku yaal getcadcraft.com/download.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself yet. To hide the interface and show only the drawing, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/present\" data-topic=\"basics/present\"\u003EPresent a drawing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself yet. To hide the interface and show only the drawing, see Present a drawing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"theme-light-dark","scope":"basics","title":"Light and dark: the sun and the moon","summary":"Switch every app and the site between the light and the dark theme with the sun and the moon in the top bar, or pick one in Settings, or let your system decide.","section":"start","order":44,"keywords":["theme","light","dark","sun","moon","dark mode","light mode","night","paper","model","colours","contrast","match the system","appearance"],"headings":[{"id":"switch-it-in-the-top-bar","text":"Switch it in the top bar","level":2},{"id":"choose-it-in-settings","text":"Choose it in Settings","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery CadCraft app and the website share one theme: light or dark. Change it in one app and the others and the site follow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-it-in-the-top-bar\"\u003ESwitch it in the top bar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the right of the top bar there are two small buttons:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ethe \u003Cstrong\u003Esun\u003C/strong\u003E is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELight theme\u003C/span\u003E: a light page with dark lines;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ethe \u003Cstrong\u003Emoon\u003C/strong\u003E is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDark theme\u003C/span\u003E: a dark page with light lines.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe one in use is lit. Hover over a button to see its name. On a phone the two buttons are in the top bar&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E menu.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the sun and the moon are not there yet, the same two buttons carry the words \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E (light) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E (dark). They do the same thing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it-in-settings\"\u003EChoose it in Settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETheme\u003C/span\u003E offers the light theme (the sun), the dark theme (the moon) and a third choice that matches your system. With that one the apps follow your computer&#039;s light or dark setting and change when it changes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe theme is kept in this browser. It is not part of a \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003Ework environment\u003C/a\u003E and it does not change your drawing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe drawing&#039;s own spaces are a different thing: in CadCraft, model space and paper space (the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E tab and the sheet tabs) are where you draw and where you lay out sheets. The theme only changes the colours of the interface.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELogos and icons follow the theme by themselves.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Every CadCraft app and the website share one theme: light or dark. Change it in one app and the others and the site follow. Switch it in the top bar At the right of the top bar there are two small buttons: the sun is the Light theme: a light page with dark lines; the moon is the Dark theme: a dark page with light lines. The one in use is lit. Hover over a button to see its name. On a phone the two buttons are in the top bar's More menu. Where the sun and the moon are not there yet, the same two buttons carry the words Paper (light) and Model (dark). They do the same thing. Choose it in Settings Settings › Global › Theme offers the light theme (the sun), the dark theme (the moon) and a third choice that matches your system. With that one the apps follow your computer's light or dark setting and change when it changes. Good to know The theme is kept in this browser. It is not part of a work environment and it does not change your drawing. The drawing's own spaces are a different thing: in CadCraft, model space and paper space (the Model tab and the sheet tabs) are where you draw and where you lay out sheets. The theme only changes the colours of the interface. Logos and icons follow the theme by themselves.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"craft-menu","scope":"basics","title":"The CadCraft menu: settings, help, presenting and your account in one place","summary":"In the Drafting layout, the app mark and name at the top left open one menu with Settings, Full screen, Help, About, Save for offline, Present, the theme switch and your account. Pin what you use often to the top row.","section":"start","order":44,"keywords":["craft menu","cadcraft menu","app menu","settings","full screen","help","about","offline","present","presentation","account","sign in","sign out","theme","light","dark","sun","moon","pin","add-ons","alt+o","find"],"headings":[{"id":"what-the-menu-holds","text":"What the menu holds","level":2},{"id":"pin-what-you-use-often","text":"Pin what you use often","level":2},{"id":"add-ons-and-find","text":"Add-ons and Find","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe buttons that belong to the site rather than to your drawing sit in one menu. Click the app mark and name at the very top left, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option O\"\u003E⌥O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-the-menu-holds\"\u003EWhat the menu holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E, when the app can be kept on this computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPresent\u003C/span\u003E: hides the interface so only the drawing shows. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/present\" data-topic=\"basics/present\"\u003EPresent a drawing\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVisit GetCadCraft.com\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA row of two icons for the theme: the sun is the light theme, the moon is the dark theme.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAccount\u003C/span\u003E with \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign out\u003C/span\u003E under it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign in\u003C/span\u003E when you are not signed in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pin-what-you-use-often\"\u003EPin what you use often\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach option has a small dot at its right. Click the dot to pin that option as a button in the top row, and click it again to unpin it. Up to six options can be pinned. A number on a pinned button, or on the app mark, is something waiting for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-ons-and-find\"\u003EAdd-ons and Find\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E in the top row lists the add-ons and panels; a tick means one is open, and picking it opens or closes it. At the right of the top row, the search box finds commands and help topics.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe menu is part of the Drafting layout (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E). The other layouts keep these buttons in the app bar. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003EThe Drafting layout\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The buttons that belong to the site rather than to your drawing sit in one menu. Click the app mark and name at the very top left, or press Alt+O. What the menu holds Settings (Ctrl+,), Full screen, Help (F1) and About. Save for offline, when the app can be kept on this computer. Present: hides the interface so only the drawing shows. See Present a drawing. Visit GetCadCraft.com. A row of two icons for the theme: the sun is the light theme, the moon is the dark theme. Account with Sign out under it, or Sign in when you are not signed in. Pin what you use often Each option has a small dot at its right. Click the dot to pin that option as a button in the top row, and click it again to unpin it. Up to six options can be pinned. A number on a pinned button, or on the app mark, is something waiting for you. Add-ons and Find Add-ons in the top row lists the add-ons and panels; a tick means one is open, and picking it opens or closes it. At the right of the top row, the search box finds commands and help topics. Good to know The menu is part of the Drafting layout (Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting). The other layouts keep these buttons in the app bar. See The Drafting layout. This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"present","scope":"basics","title":"Present a drawing: hide the interface","summary":"Present hides the bars, ribbon and palettes so a client sees only the drawing. Nothing closes; Esc or Exit presentation brings everything back.","section":"start","order":45,"keywords":["present","presentation","presentation mode","show client","hide interface","clean view","hide toolbars","hide panels","meeting","exit presentation","escape"],"headings":[{"id":"start-presenting","text":"Start presenting","level":2},{"id":"stop-presenting","text":"Stop presenting","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhen you show a drawing to someone across a table or on a shared screen, the interface gets in the way. Present hides it and leaves the drawing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"start-presenting\"\u003EStart presenting\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen the CadCraft menu (click the app mark and name at the top left, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option O\"\u003E⌥O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and pick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPresent\u003C/span\u003E. To have it one click away, pin it to the top row with the dot beside it (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/craft-menu\" data-topic=\"basics/craft-menu\"\u003EThe CadCraft menu\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe title bar, menu bar, ribbon, palettes, status bar and the marks over the drawing are hidden. The view cube stays, so you can still turn a 3D view.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stop-presenting\"\u003EStop presenting\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, or click \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExit presentation\u003C/span\u003E at the top right corner. Everything comes back where it was: nothing was closed and nothing in the drawing changed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPresent is in the Drafting layout, where the CadCraft menu is.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"When you show a drawing to someone across a table or on a shared screen, the interface gets in the way. Present hides it and leaves the drawing. Start presenting Open the CadCraft menu (click the app mark and name at the top left, or press Alt+O) and pick Present. To have it one click away, pin it to the top row with the dot beside it (see The CadCraft menu). The title bar, menu bar, ribbon, palettes, status bar and the marks over the drawing are hidden. The view cube stays, so you can still turn a 3D view. Stop presenting Press Esc, or click Exit presentation at the top right corner. Everything comes back where it was: nothing was closed and nothing in the drawing changed. Good to know Present is in the Drafting layout, where the CadCraft menu is. This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Meesha ay faylalkaagu aadaan","summary":"Faylalku kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan, sida kaydintu u shaqeyso, iyo waxa browserku xasuusto.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["asturnaan","upload","cloud","kaydi","soo dejin","kaydin","maxalli","amni","sirta"],"headings":[{"id":"faylalkaagu-kombiyuutarkaaga-ayay-ku-sii-jiraan","text":"Faylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan","level":2},{"id":"sida-kaydintu-u-shaqeyso","text":"Sida kaydintu u shaqeyso","level":2},{"id":"waxa-browserku-xasuusto","text":"Waxa browserku xasuusto","level":2},{"id":"kaydinta-cloud-ka","text":"Kaydinta cloud-ka","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"faylalkaagu-kombiyuutarkaaga-ayay-ku-sii-jiraan\"\u003EFaylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMarkaad naqshad, moodel ama PDF furto, app-ku browserkaaga gudihiisa ayuu akhriyaa. \u003Cstrong\u003EFaylka lama soo dirin.\u003C/strong\u003E Weligeed ma aragno, waxaana uu sidoo kale u shaqeeyaa xidhiidh la&#039;aan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sida-kaydintu-u-shaqeyso\"\u003ESida kaydintu u shaqeyso\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBog browser ah ma beddeli karo fayllada kombiyuutarkaaga isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo \u003Cstrong\u003Esoo dejinaya\u003C/strong\u003E fayl cusub:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoo dejintu waxay tagtaa meesha browserku ku dhigo soo dejinta, badiyaa folder-ka Downloads, marka laga reebo haddii aad browserka u dejisay inuu mar kasta weydiiyo (eeg \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EBrowserrada iyo kombiyuutarrada\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EApps-yada beddela fayl waxay kaydiyaan nuqul magac cusub leh, sida &quot;(edited)&quot; ama &quot;(marked up)&quot;, si asalkaagu u sii jiro sidiisii.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHaddii aad tab-ka xirto shaqo aan la kaydin, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (&quot;Leave site?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waxa-browserku-xasuusto\"\u003EWaxa browserku xasuusto\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQaar ka mid ah apps-yadu browserkaaga ayay ku xasuustaan dejimo yar, sida magaca qoraha ama qaabka qalabka. Waxay ku sii jiraan browserkaas kombiyuutarkaas, xogta websaydhka oo la tirtiro ayaa tirtira. Caawinta app kasta waxay sheegtaa waxa ay kaydiso.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kaydinta-cloud-ka\"\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarada waa qayb ka mid ah ruqsadda ganacsiga. Weli ma diyaar aha. Ilaa markaas, faylalkaaga ku hay meesha aad ku haysid faylalka mashruucyadaaga kale, oo caadi ahaan ku kaydi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Faylalkaagu kombiyuutarkaaga ayay ku sii jiraan Markaad naqshad, moodel ama PDF furto, app-ku browserkaaga gudihiisa ayuu akhriyaa. Faylka lama soo dirin. Weligeed ma aragno, waxaana uu sidoo kale u shaqeeyaa xidhiidh la'aan. Sida kaydintu u shaqeyso Bog browser ah ma beddeli karo fayllada kombiyuutarkaaga isaga keligiis, sidaas darteed apps-yadu waxay kaydiyaan iyagoo soo dejinaya fayl cusub: Soo dejintu waxay tagtaa meesha browserku ku dhigo soo dejinta, badiyaa folder-ka Downloads, marka laga reebo haddii aad browserka u dejisay inuu mar kasta weydiiyo (eeg Browserrada iyo kombiyuutarrada). Apps-yada beddela fayl waxay kaydiyaan nuqul magac cusub leh, sida \"(edited)\" ama \"(marked up)\", si asalkaagu u sii jiro sidiisii. Haddii aad tab-ka xirto shaqo aan la kaydin, browserku marka hore wuu weydiin doonaa (\"Leave site?\"). Waxa browserku xasuusto Qaar ka mid ah apps-yadu browserkaaga ayay ku xasuustaan dejimo yar, sida magaca qoraha ama qaabka qalabka. Waxay ku sii jiraan browserkaas kombiyuutarkaas, xogta websaydhka oo la tirtiro ayaa tirtira. Caawinta app kasta waxay sheegtaa waxa ay kaydiso. Kaydinta cloud-ka Kaydinta cloud-ka iyo isku-waafajinta kombiyuutarada waa qayb ka mid ah ruqsadda ganacsiga. Weli ma diyaar aha. Ilaa markaas, faylalkaaga ku hay meesha aad ku haysid faylalka mashruucyadaaga kale, oo caadi ahaan ku kaydi.","lang":"so"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"recipes-you-can-run","text":"Recipes you can run","level":2},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes-you-can-run\"\u003ERecipes you can run\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/getcadcraft/examples\" class=\"hx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003Egithub.com/getcadcraft/examples\u003C/a\u003E has recipes as files you can run yourself: \u003Ccode\u003Emcp-tidy-a-drawing\u003C/code\u003E makes an assistant&#039;s calls step by step (check a drawing against office standards, fix it with a LISP routine, save and plot), and \u003Ccode\u003Ecli-check-standards\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003Ecli-convert-and-plot\u003C/code\u003E do the same jobs with the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Recipes you can run github.com/getcadcraft/examples has recipes as files you can run yourself: mcp-tidy-a-drawing makes an assistant's calls step by step (check a drawing against office standards, fix it with a LISP routine, save and plot), and cli-check-standards and cli-convert-and-plot do the same jobs with the cadcraft command line. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the pen is turned on for the apps (Settings › Global › Input devices › Pen), CadCraft&#039;s sketch tools take a stroke&#039;s pressure as its lineweight and BimCraft&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESketch stair\u003C/span\u003E takes one pen stroke as the walking line; the other apps don&#039;t use pressure yet. No app uses the pen&#039;s tilt yet, and no app has a handwriting tool.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Where the pen is turned on for the apps (Settings › Global › Input devices › Pen), CadCraft's sketch tools take a stroke's pressure as its lineweight and BimCraft's Sketch stair takes one pen stroke as the walking line; the other apps don't use pressure yet. No app uses the pen's tilt yet, and no app has a handwriting tool.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffCraft, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffCraft\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffCraft by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffCraft The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"so","chain":["so","en"]};
